y\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792187374,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today, Oct. 16: Apple Edges Higher on iPhone Duo Preorder Surge\",\"id\":142950783,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On Oct. 16, 2026, preorders for the new iPhone Duo sold out quickly, stretching delivery estimates into January.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8760fa2b760ec495891c243172b61d8880f629c24c105b7efeb44c945884b3b7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792184820,\"headline\":\"This is the Cheapest Mag 7 Stock Right Now\",\"id\":142951517,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Mag 7 is back. Several of the stocks are hitting new highs but there are still deals.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d47c4473ccaa3d5c01009cab96d98d9228e66494094fd44fe3410b0702fd9bb9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792180146,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Tech Stocks Fall Late Afternoon\",\"id\":142950013,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech stocks were lower late Friday afternoon, with the State Street Technology Select Sector SPDR ET\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1229d4787c40b7b8f11a55216fdc1bf6ac0d2db8b66023404a67249f422305a0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179932,\"headline\":\"Can Apple's Duo hype offset soft iPhone 18 demand?\",\"id\":142950006,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Preorders for Apple's (AAPL) foldable iPhone Duo sold out within minutes on Friday. Creative Strategies president and principal analyst Carolina Milanesi sits down with Ines Ferré to talk about what the demand for the Duo model means for the iPhone 18 lineup.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b4c5f229f006c0df5387b67c3da6c8cfdbf80359c9a1dd7ecdd2a8172420a8a1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179794,\"headline\":\"9 Dow Jones Stocks Make Bullish Moves In A Defensive Market Rotation\",\"id\":142950007,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A week that tested the financial markets showed the resilience of Dow Jones stocks. Apple and Coca-Cola were among nine standouts.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=af9cc9e28f3a10ea2145e9aa2ce346b5f10ea949ca6edd0654727a5baaf6a007\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179277,\"headline\":\"iPhone Duo already backordered until 2027 as pre-order sales soar\",\"id\":142950008,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Consumer demand for Apple's first foldable phone is strong despite the device's hefty $1,999 price tag.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=16603b60e699bd57c649c912acc2158f422bfb4534474401ad98179157cdc37b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179266,\"headline\":\"Apple is Now the Top-Performing Magnificent 7 Stock in 2026. Here’s why it’s Beating NVIDIA, Tesla, and Amazon\",\"id\":142949982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple (NASDAQ: AAPL) has emerged as the best-performing Magnificent Seven stock of 2026, outperforming NVIDIA (NVDA), Microsoft (MSFT), Amazon (AMZN), Alphabet (GOOGL), Meta Platforms (META), and Tesla (TSLA). But what's driving Apple's surprising rally while other AI stocks struggle? In this episode, 24/7 Wall St.'s Eric Bleeker examines why Apple shares have surged more than 27% in 2026, even as concerns about artificial intelligence spending are weighing on some of the market's biggest technology companies. While competitors are committing hundreds of billions of dollars to AI data centers, Apple is taking a different approach. Its strategy emphasizes on-device artificial intelligence, privacy, and integrating AI directly into its ecosystem, avoiding much of the enormous infrastructure spending burden facing its rivals. Eric breaks down Apple's latest earnings, its massive share repurchase program, and why investors are increasingly rewarding the company's capital-efficient AI strategy. He also compares the Magnificent Seven's performance in 2026 against their remarkable returns since the beginning of 2023, revealing a very different picture of the AI investment boom. Has Apple become the market's ultimate AI safe-haven stock? And could its strategy continue outperforming NVIDIA and the rest of Big Tech?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f831231eaab13eb8aeb433db1cbbdbf1fe067161173a318013a30dfc63d8ee53\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792174800,\"headline\":\"From 2009 to 2026 and Beyond, Apple Has Remained 1 of the Most Valuable Companies in the World: Here's the Most Important Takeaway for Investors\",\"id\":142949992,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"At a market capitalization of $5 trillion right now, Apple trails only Nvidia.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d557ff6507f195ad47983bbf2a3abc6d8c98c53f6ba49967408044cb766e201a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792174412,\"headline\":\"iPhone Duo preorder frenzy pushes waits into 2027, and Apple won’t say if stores will have stock next week\",\"id\":142962390,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108422013-1792188930047-1792188598-49045092209-hd.jpg?v=1792188928\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC’s MacKenzie Sigalos reports on the early rush for Apple’s $1,999 foldable and the unanswered question around launch-day supply.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=84d5ee674a008cf5b600596d38d85e84e02483a0f8d6a1ac58a110b85e7fc72d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173180,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola, Visa and Mastercard Hit Records as Investors Rotate Out of Chip Stocks\",\"id\":142950011,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola, Visa and Mastercard are among the stocks hitting records as investors look beyond the AI trade. Earnings could help broaden the rally.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4ad8f758684d92953fbd2de585f964a4e73e883937172f558367ac5c9e40beba\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792171448,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Nasdaq Stung As ServiceNow Dives After Breakout; Tesla Comes Back To Earth (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142949018,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Friday while the Nasdaq struggles with tech losses.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d5cd786ad165f12d775928099bab942a363ca5a483bbbb360408b685c51b9c92\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170388,\"headline\":\"The Next Stock Market Crash Could Start With Just 3 Companies\",\"id\":142948989,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Just three companies now account for approximately 21% of the S\\u0026P 500's total market capitalization. NVIDIA (NVDA), Apple (AAPL), and Microsoft (MSFT) have become so dominant that their performance could determine the direction of the entire stock market. But what happens if these technology giants stumble? In this episode, 24/7 Wall St. co-founder Doug McIntyre and senior writer Lee Jackson discuss the extraordinary concentration of the S\\u0026P 500 and why millions of investors may be taking on more risk than they realize. Much of today's market enthusiasm is driven by artificial intelligence. Companies like NVIDIA, Microsoft, Alphabet (GOOGL), Amazon (AMZN), and Meta Platforms (META) have benefited from enormous expectations for AI growth. But Doug and Lee identify several potential threats to that optimism. They explore how cheaper open-source AI models could challenge industry leaders, why opposition to AI data center construction threatens expansion plans, and how growing electricity demand is driving renewed interest in nuclear power. Most importantly, they discuss what could happen to popular index funds like the SPDR S\\u0026P 500 ETF (SPY) if the market's largest technology stocks suffer a major sell-off. They also examine whether equal-weight S\\u0026P 500 funds could provide investors with better diversification. Is your S\\u0026P 500 investment more vulnerable than you think?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ab98f35bc89dbdfbba2d5bb3c55f635e436e1332b1ab7a49092a897f1a8ae3f7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170383,\"headline\":\"Nvidia and Apple Each Gave $25 Million to Trump’s White House Ballroom\",\"id\":142948990,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Confidential documents reveal that two of the world's most valuable tech companies quietly wrote identical checks to fund a new White House ballroom, and neither one sent out a press release. The real question is what each company expects to get back.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d21c891d39bf5dd2d3275dffe290c7ddcf2c56f5c8b90274001eb50985dd3df5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170029,\"headline\":\"Apple Is Up Nearly 12X in 10 Years. Can It Repeat That Run?\",\"id\":142949011,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple turned $10,000 into $127,753 over the last decade, but a $5 trillion market cap changes the math in ways most investors overlook. Here is what the model says your money could realistically become by 2031, and which risks could derail even the bull case.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3dd0e7396d09a0088c52ac9bc78c86c60d50e0a1a77e3456da2d7d95080b9d55\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170000,\"headline\":\"How Does Apple’s Siri Compete in an Agentic World?\",\"id\":142950012,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Is Apple’s dedication to privacy holding Siri AI back? Cybersecurity reporter Bob McMillan, personal tech columnist Nicole Nguyen and Apple reporter Rolfe Winkler debate the tradeoffs of giving agents access to your personal accounts and information.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=092262d3aea6d79fbe832625a21270b393c26f141de42a87d112dad0f2252310\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169688,\"headline\":\"CNBC TechCheck Evening Edition: October 16, 2026\",\"id\":142962391,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108421623-TC-Clean-101626.jpg?v=1792183926\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC's TechCheck brings you the latest in tech news from CNBC's 1 Market in the heart of San Francisco.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=530a6bac4cd931436f37191c2cf18170a5e7650170c8f36af8cbb7fd96f70b9f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169127,\"headline\":\"Apple and Alphabet Are Especially Scared of a Blue Wave\",\"id\":142949012,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple and Alphabet just posted record quarters, but a single election outcome could gut the profit streams funding their biggest bets. Here is why the political calendar may matter more than the earnings beat.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=072f9363aa886b1e7ccf544f8191da043de475f755afc301fa8ac3716b61d897\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168465,\"headline\":\"AAPL Stock Adds 1% As It Prepares To Tackle UK Regulators Over Apple Pay Dominance\",\"id\":142949013,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The U.K.’s Competition and Markets Authority is set to push Apple to open its contact-free payment infrastructure to third-party providers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=84a9d6ecbc556a3dbf3dee6390e000c2054c7eafa69a85eaace773b2aec8403b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168200,\"headline\":\"Tesla, SpaceX, CoreWeave, Lam Research, Netflix, Strategy, and More Stocks That Explain Today’s Market\",\"id\":142949020,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla stock falls after the electric-vehicle maker unveils its new Roadster sports car. It can fly.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9535931db153ab9e8b897789d427320a83395b88da07124f45f2f8902ba66be5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168020,\"headline\":\"Apple faces growing iPhone demand concerns as delivery wait times shrink, UBS warns\",\"id\":142949014,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UBS has warned that shortening delivery times for Apple Inc (NASDAQ:AAPL, XETRA:APC)’s latest iPhones could signal weaker demand and put its revenue forecasts at risk, despite resilient sales across key markets. The bank found that average waiting times for the iPhone 18 Pro fell by about...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5284d83acfab055117cb5c08fe542f94bcccc90459a7f3c8e7230d6b04d698bb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167910,\"headline\":\"iPhone Duo in Short Supply After Shipments Slip Into 2027\",\"id\":142949015,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shipping estimates for Apple Inc.'s first folding phone slipped into January within minutes of the company taking preorders on Friday, suggesting that strong demand and short supply will make the $1,999 device challenging to purchase on its Oct. 23 release date or in the near future. Bloomberg's Anurag Rana joins Bloomberg Intelligence to discuss.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0611cb57202bfe4bbfaf025c950c14bccaed8fe3cfec6075f3d9413cbe88cb2a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167660,\"headline\":\"Why Fox Can Finally Breathe a Sigh of Relief With the Roku Deal—and Why the NFL Can’t\",\"id\":142949021,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Fox’s acquisition gives the media titan a way to deliver its programming directly to views, a huge plus for its Sunday NFL games.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f80eb47cadd807f125a1b361bc27f5c5a5d8a15516c88adc9c5e5172f66b1199\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167490,\"headline\":\"We are Only 'Third Inning Relative to this AI Game,' Says Dan Ives\",\"id\":142949024,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Three CoreWeave Inc. co-founders have sold $3.3 billion in company shares since last year's initial public offering, taking money off the table as rising credit risks and investor wariness around AI spending spark volatility in the stock. Dan Ives, Partner at Yorkville \\u0026 Ives, discusses volatility relative to the AI trade and the outlook for stocks like Coreweave and Apple in particular.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=205aaef6621a0b3549418a80043887764e8070b786e87486f719f6b3f4c1c10f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167480,\"headline\":\"Big Tech Earnings Suddenly Matter for the Bond Market\",\"id\":142949022,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Falling Treasury yields suggest growing concern about the AI boom, putting pressure on Big Tech’s coming earnings reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5f18c901a76fa366ab22d6cd3ce50431f7996cafba44d6ba35446f24bc6e76c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167019,\"headline\":\"Apple and Samsung Are Nearly Tied as Global Phone Shipments Collapse\",\"id\":142949016,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A memory shortage has sent smartphone shipments into historic freefall, but Apple and Samsung are locked in a near-dead heat at the top while smaller rivals collapse. The question is whether Apple's premium armor can hold as costs keep climbing into 2027.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=95579c740ea0ecd8c33a7a73c916ed6c7b69373bfa178010ee293b6fe36442d1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166361,\"headline\":\"Apple calls iPhone Duo demand ‘nothing short of extraordinary’\",\"id\":142962392,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108421483-1792181764314-1792180547-49043015263-hd.jpg?v=1792181761\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC’s MacKenzie Sigalos reports on Apple’s claim of extraordinary preorder demand as launch-day inventory disappears and delivery dates slip into late January.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4ac0d664169347135d8b07d4ac5ff51a6ba8a4977b13a1f96b05f553a27b6940\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166251,\"headline\":\"Apple Could Face Downside Risk From Declining Wait Times for New iPhone Models, UBS Says\",\"id\":142949017,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple (AAPL) could face downside risk from shorter wait times for its new iPhone models, UBS Securit\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=40e41acd93245959764b3ed06807baf566c52de6c72174c3c5c979211836dbe8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792165614,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Dow Up, Nasdaq Slammed; This Fund Is Beating Semiconductors (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142947903,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Friday while the Nasdaq struggles with tech losses.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cb803c3f115ec71398c92a8d9aa26dfab9377a0a41ce8805f25238959da8b5bb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792165407,\"headline\":\"What Is The Biggest Threat To Microsoft Stock?\",\"id\":142949023,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Buyers are paying for growth, and Microsoft (MSFT) is delivering it. The stock returned 37.2% between July 17 and October 15, 2026, against 4.1% for the S\\u0026P 500. Revenue climbed 17.7% in fiscal Q4 2026 from a year earlier. Yet on a July 29 earnings call, executives described a cost to that growth that is still rising. What is that cost, and who is raising it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=42d7abc2a9bb8e2f782d69ddbea13cf4f72d18dd4d868def556145e1f6ea4c86\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792164423,\"headline\":\"Meta launches new ‘open’ AI model – and it comes with a big surprise\",\"id\":142947900,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Powerful ‘Muse Spark Open’ system represents a departure from many other AI systems, and from Meta’s long-running feud with Apple\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7239abde67e4e