 stocks plunge, Apple is riding high\",\"id\":142919153,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple is avoiding the worst of the AI sell off.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77b679a321f12d215e49147206dd889d827dc9103a60ee38a30cf50be01887f1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792075914,\"headline\":\"Robinhood, Cboe Expand Prediction Market Offerings After SEC Win\",\"id\":142919164,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Robinhood, Cboe to launch options contracts betting on certain company metrics after SEC approval. HOOD stock falls below key level.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0a4e87b0dbfda97d97ed9d3bff5f86986277d693b933aa6bb862f0a91bce0b7c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792075578,\"headline\":\"Japan Is Putting Up to $21 Billion Into New GlobalFoundries Chip Plants in New York\",\"id\":142919159,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Japan is writing a multibillion-dollar check to build chip factories on American soil, but GlobalFoundries gets to run them without paying for them. The catch is buried in fees the company has not disclosed and a government equity stake that could shrink what shareholders actually own.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=56a4e9bf2335359d9bd2e4e997f7e62f9b47774ce1da0181c469a113dc447e56\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792075136,\"headline\":\"Apple's New 'Home' Run\",\"id\":142920966,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e958e7ed0bf620bdccbf6f6e4b6e5f4adf1ad5b1d27e045afda63b312ece637e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792074836,\"headline\":\"Anthropic Needs Nearly $2.7B in Additional Monthly Revenue to Reach $100B Run Rate by Year-End\",\"id\":142945152,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Anthropic-Logo.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\\n\\n\\n\\nPPI Spikes\\n\\n\\n\\nPlease click here for an enlarged chart of Taiwan Semiconductor Mfg. Co. Ltd. (NYSE:TSM).\\n\\n\\n\\nNote the following:\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nThis article is about the big picture, not an individual stock.  The chart of TSM\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=22d4ea568110010a6f3fba0ccff8bcf1917cf3ec643f6a86d8f964fd285417a0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792074016,\"headline\":\"iPhone Duo: Damaging Apple’s new folding phone could cost you $1,499\",\"id\":142919160,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Soon-to-be-released device is easily the most expensive iPhone ever sold\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=584c61f9a839c81a0bddbb7e9e4dfb90eed6836dc93d4158107ba2d5f060905d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792074000,\"headline\":\"Meta's Muse Agent Is a Massive Hit. I'm Still Not Sold on Meta Stock.\",\"id\":142919165,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The gap between Meta's AI spending and Muse's subscriptions is far too great.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1c2b6c370754e26d7aecf796f759976f7745dfce959772523de7fc4748cf21f5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792073071,\"headline\":\"Michael Burry's 'Red October' Warning: Why QQQ and SMH Could Face More Pain\",\"id\":142945153,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/xrdDAE9HpS4rJc10535-j6448429399417680500.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Michael Burry warns of a potential market top as falling bond yields fail to lif