ck ETFs that offer Canadians the ability to increase their investment exposure to individual companies they believe in for the long term, without the need for margin. Units of the ETFs begin trading today on the Toronto Stock Exchange (\\\"TSX\\\").\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1826b5352a9dd69f76e30899a61c17ad6a98efdbf5e75879e1ecc0a59909865e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791979115,\"headline\":\"Apple Has a $299 Smart-Home Bet: The Real Money May Be in Subscriptions\",\"id\":142916160,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Basel--Switzerland---December-23--2024-A.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan sees Apple\\u0026#39;s HomeView and smart-home cameras creating opportunities for iCloud+ subscriptions and recurring Services revenue.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b25373cf6752cdf6498bb7e6ddcad34544078c5d9ffd5ff22acbbd4da7057bc2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791978000,\"headline\":\"The S\\u0026P 500 Is Dangerously Concentrated in 5 Tech Giants. Are They Still Buys?\",\"id\":142880923,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia, Apple, Microsoft, Alphabet, and Amazon make up nearly 30% of the S\\u0026P 500's holdings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f5bc56b8af9fba13877c9de385db378b3a73f293dd588365f352721d6c7f9ef3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791977994,\"headline\":\"Nasdaq 100 Drops 1% on Hot CPI, SOXX Falls 7th Day: Stock Market Today\",\"id\":142915760,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Nasdaq-100-way-down.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The Nasdaq 100 fell 1% by midday Wednesday after September CPI topped forecasts, pushing Treasury yields and rate-hike bets higher.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=96ad35f5ef177e04917a658689de84478274bbf6edf6e6f298c9a08636fefbf6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791977705,\"headline\":\"Apple Has Found No Evidence To Support OpenAI's Allegations; Says Apple Has Searched For The One File That OpenAI Has Identified, But Has Not Found It On Any Apple System; Co Has Strict Policies \\u0026 Procedures In Place To Help Ensure That New Employees Don't Use Any Confidential Information From Prior Employer; Says OpenAI Has Failed To Respond To Apple’s Request For More Information That Would Aid In Its Investigation\",\"id\":142916162,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"- Reuters\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=584a9179b71e565acf2c8d6d58bb44de4f63056b63bc98472131259126f66e89\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791976858,\"headline\":\"OpenAI Brief In Apple Vs OpenAI Lawsuit Say Files Leaked Include Detailed Unreleased Device Images, Engineering Data, Supplier Info; Says Apple Has Not Assured It Is Not In Possession Of \\u0026 Has Not Used OpenAI Confidential Data; Files Leaked By Employee Also Include Manufacturing Data About Devices\",\"id\":142916163,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"- Reuters\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=393c570a034f1bff7ded6845c27d3a9832f27631725c146bcea05519d4f0941b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791976537,\"headline\":\"Qualcomm at $175: The Narrative Shift Sending Capital Out The Door\",\"id\":142880292,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Qualcomm is betting its future on AI and data center chips while its smartphone business bleeds, and the December quarter will prove whether that bet pays off or exposes a company caught between two worlds.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=08714d8106490160a7244c7a21ec26acc30f2912cc96dde1e0a366424123e8fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791976473,\"headline\":\"OpenAI Brief In Apple Vs OpenAI Lawsuit Say OpenAI Employee Who Left For Apple Sent Over 100 Files About Unrelased OpenAI Product To Personal Accounts; Employee Who Left For Apple Gave Senior Apple Leaders Presentation About Unreleased OpenAI Product\",\"id\":142916164,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"- Reuters \",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4a5953e0e6c85fbd0d299c466d267275951fa2104a060c5a6a93a0ad011936f8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791975613,\"headline\":\"OMAH: High-Yield Income From A Buffett-Like Core Equity ETF\",\"id\":142884845,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1162604480/image_1162604480.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Discover OMAH ETF: a high-yield, value-focused strategy using covered calls on Berkshire-style blue chips to target 15% annual payouts. Read the full analysis here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9e47c9bff6f982246b05d92a5862f3808601cf5b5544e031d583129e28222b98\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791975240,\"headline\":\"AST SpaceMobile Is the New Battleground Stock\",\"id\":142881864,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street is no help when thinking about what to do with AST stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b26b4130602e53cc2933f11741733279aa8a7b84287f1509d086d4a8a8f2522c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791974531,\"headline\":\"Apple Stock Hits 52-Week High — What's Going On?\",\"id\":142916166,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Pune--India---February-19--2024--Apple-i.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Apple Inc. (NASDAQ: AAPL) hits a 52-week high as analysts weigh iPhone 18 demand, smart-home potential, and valuation risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4dec8b5b5720f7e9056d00404af5ebee7f0305f36229ce5fdd892bc8f42ff9dc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791973683,\"headline\":\"Jamie Dimon Warns Of Forces That “Continue To Shift Under The Surface,” As Half Of Russell 3000 Stocks Sit In A Bear Market With The S\\u0026P 500 Near Records\",\"id\":142877705,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Jamie Dimon says dangerous forces are shifting beneath a seemingly calm surface, and the stock market tells a strikingly similar story. The index near record highs conceals a hidden collapse spreading quietly across hundreds of stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30e0f2baff4fab7928045e56b1a5a768cbb6b86bebe30ac8154d0a2fb211212e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791973390,\"headline\":\"Apple makes its biggest smart-home push yet under CEO John Ternus\",\"id\":142886024,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108408831-1791987349281-1791985578392-davidlivingstonesocials.jpg?v=1791987347\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC’s MacKenzie Sigalos reports on Apple’s new HomeView display, expanded home hardware lineup, and why the launch is a major test of its rebuilt Siri AI.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=09d559d8c994fa92754bd4bfa4c4adf2a80a325822ba67fa81cf2371330b3432\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791972000,\"headline\":\"Apple's new hardware strategy capitalizes on trust — just in time for the AI era\",\"id\":142881633,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple's smart home strategy is about selling more hardware. But it's also about more tightly binding iPhone customers to its ecosystem.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=16dadb061ad8534d1d06dd8d04f1703ec51312c7435878e4aca78a336ae4f574\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791971893,\"headline\":\"Mexico President Says She Will Sign Decree On Wednesday To Order Digital Platforms To Protect Minors From Violent And Sexual Content; Mexico To Give Platforms One Month To Come Into Compliance With Decree\",\"id\":142883670,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"- Reuters \",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4545724b67107e0883f11d5bfa3f292fac112b677671629d5973a0afd32f476b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791969032,\"headline\":\"Micron: China Just Broke The Memory Supercycle Story\",\"id\":142882179,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2236033593/image_2236033593.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Micron faces rising China DRAM competition, cyclical memory pricing, rich valuation, and AI demand risks. Click for more on MU stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ecd4d7dd3938859ecf6f9116d464f66415b1c1c7f6edef4c6849204228e92b9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791968899,\"headline\":\"Wall Street’s ‘Last Men Standing’: The Mag 7 Are Propping Up the S\\u0026P 500, Then Why Are Your ETFs at Risk?\",\"id\":142882440,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Los-Angeles--California---21-April-2024-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The Mag 7 are propping up the S\\u0026amp;P 500 as market breadth weakens. Here’s why SPY and QQQ investors may face hidden concentration risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=60c43cae72d440860589299178050fac116d435b1f33204fe618c9f650dac9fc\"}]"
