      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792392731,\"headline\":\"Microsoft Walks Away From Nscale’s UK Data Center as the Grid Runs Out of Power\",\"id\":142997609,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft (MSFT:NASDAQ) has pulled out of a planned AI data center in Loughton, Essex, that British cloud provider Nscale was building for it, Reuters reported on October 18, citing the Telegraph. Microsoft is one of Nscale’s two largest customers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77d9d8bfb9bee72de133f0d26ae9f7d6aa81123f76e39ea4a330dd955bb47c59\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792390194,\"headline\":\"The Bet Behind Tieto's Rally\",\"id\":142994906,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"One concrete shift for Tieto in this period was its deepening AI partnership with Microsoft, aimed at integrating new tools into long standing client contracts rather than chasing one off projects. For Tieto shareholders, the return over the past year was 20.4%, including dividends. If you had been deciding on 16 October 2025 whether to buy, what would you have needed to believe about those AI efforts and cost cuts before the later earnings headlines arrived? The easy part of this move is...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9270c233430bc08500f18b366a067338ce46e76dc7533200b4d27d2c32a53bdc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792380611,\"headline\":\"Trump’s $330 Million White House Ballroom Donor List Reveals Nvidia, Apple and Google Among Top Tech Contributors: Report (UPDATED)\",\"id\":142992629,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Editor’s note: The story has been updated to include a comment from Nvidia. President Donald Trump’s White House ballroom project donor list reportedly reveals companies and individuals linked to federal contracts, policy decisions, and a presidential pardon. NVIDIA Corp. and...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=833bc80d9748fdde323eb686e9f8065372b20c6efd59e1202148bb04a26a5e57\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792374806,\"headline\":\"What Would Stop The AI Selloff\",\"id\":142994131,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f81e56ca69a5fcfaacd77d3a9630d96359897268651205c32cb90015cce769d2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792357500,\"headline\":\"Some Investors Are Questioning the AI Trade. Microsoft Is Bucking the Trend\",\"id\":142989167,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Azure's growth and Copilot's position in enterprise AI make Microsoft a smart AI play.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ff35a4a3386611f185444efefec578170d0e502541a8bd27f6b93751b1fc61b7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792330080,\"headline\":\"Own VGT? Here's How Much of It Is Really Nvidia, Apple, Microsoft, and Broadcom.\",\"id\":142986890,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"This Vanguard tech ETF has beaten the Nasdaq-100 for the past 10 years -- but its portfolio is surprisingly top-heavy with just four big names.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=997c82bec29b639e1cac57a3bdc3156b75a04e58d14b2b935bca4a0e3da0bab0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792329011,\"headline\":\"Top 3 British Penny Stocks To Watch In October 2026\",\"id\":142986902,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UK investors are watching the AI boom run into funding roadblocks, as seen with Microsoft walking away from a major British data centre deal. Big projects can stall when debt markets get tougher. Yet smaller listed businesses with cleaner balance sheets still have room to move. This article picks out three financially solid low priced UK stocks that aim to give you exposure without relying on heavy borrowing. The three stocks highlighted here offer a compelling starting point if you want...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a01205eafd5fba1b3d6846ac6bd3d4e6f1b040800b43ca7cbf9bfdd804e7f01f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792318285,\"headline\":\"3 UK Grid Stocks Retail Investors Are Watching for AI Data Centre Power\",\"id\":142984629,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft’s decision to pull the plug on its anchor AI data centre deal with Nscale has thrown fresh light on a less glamorous but critical piece of the story: the UK’s power grid. While neocloud operators fight for funding and contracts, electricity networks and equipment providers still control the literal on switch for AI. This piece walks through three UK Power and Grid Infrastructure Enablers exposed to that shift and why they deserve a closer look right now. The stocks covered below are...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6b6c1704734a29d752cd6a9c72ca62e5bfcc3f298beb11af374bd4a1f9263af3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792317173,\"headline\":\"Microsoft pulls out of UK data centre deal with Nscale, Telegraph reports\",\"id\":142984198,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Microsoft (NASDAQ) has withdrawn from a planned UK data centre agreement with artificial intelligence infrastructure provider Nscale, potentially complicating the British company’s initial public offering plans, according to the Telegraph.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=853494d3498dd63d09406def43814b44a1cf00dada6b2eac44b47d63a106b801\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792312981,\"headline\":\"Where Will Microsoft Stock Be in 2030?\",\"id\":142983253,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Earnings rose 22% last fiscal year. What's the stock worth if growth cools to 13%?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2c6fb008f942f29ba72f6dac65494eff81cf93c36b5ffc0bf565ea99ee4ba5c8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792312270,\"headline\":\"Microsoft Scraps UK Data Center Deal With Nscale, Telegraph Says\",\"id\":142986229,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft Corp. has pulled out of a UK data center deal with British neocloud Nscale at a critical time for the startup’s initial public offering hopes, the Telegraph reported.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0404698d37ae0470876a3d08c806c15c45ff75be24b431f9bcc70a82954b7a1c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792310940,\"headline\":\"Haleon And 2 British AI Healthcare Stocks To Watch\",\"id\":142979144,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"America’s vast AI infrastructure build is starting to look more fragile, and that matters for UK investors watching where the real value sits in artificial intelligence. Hardware projects can stall when financing or public support weakens. Software that helps doctors work faster and make better calls in hospitals can keep scaling with fewer physical bottlenecks. This article highlights three UK listed AI driven healthcare stocks from our screener. The three stocks in this article are just a...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9c6c08bc21ed5f9f3b22c3198b90eb8a49e3377212afc05a513811f2a382a344\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792303801,\"headline\":\"3 Quality Stocks With ROE Over 30%\",\"id\":142975766,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Interest payments on US government debt now cost about US$3b a day, which concentrates attention on balance sheet strength wherever you invest. When public finances look stretched, investors often care more about companies that generate solid returns on shareholder capital and keep their own debt under control. This article highlights three stocks that combine high return on equity, resilient historic execution and clean finances from our strong balance sheet screen. The three examples in...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bad6913cf1ee0c0dabbae09aebd6a4f7f5bef9d8366b58aaa1a1b83c2fe7700c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792303200,\"headline\":\"AI Investment Impact Understated In U.S. 'It' Market: Texas Reveals\",\"id\":142984221,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/913582626/image_913582626.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Texas leads the AI infrastructure boom with data centers and chips boosting GDP and jobs. Check out this look at the tech sector and its prospects.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=03fd4bc2999d901f5bc2e52183f24910137f24e6e0bdaed3e6c5c60e0fd0eeab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792275791,\"headline\":\"Chamath Palihapitiya Says 6% Treasury Yield Could ‘Run Over’ AI Businesses\",\"id\":142987113,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/18/A-hand-holding-a-glowing-futuristic-AI-t.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Chamath Palihapitiya warns that rising bond yields could threaten debt-dependent businesses and force Big Tech to step in.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bc29b41dde8b8f074f12e0bc0e0e7460c693a9dc12849c365a556442b523aad8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792264284,\"headline\":\"Microsoft (MSFT) Is Facing Fresh Regulatory Pressure\",\"id\":142963203,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft (NasdaqGS:MSFT) agreed a 1,100 MW, 20 year power supply deal with NiSource to serve its expanding AI data centers. The UK Competition and Markets Authority is preparing to label parts of Microsoft's business software as having strategic market status. Microsoft, Apple and Palantir are preparing for potential new US Congressional oversight and hearings on their partnerships and operations. Beyond the NiSource power agreement, UK market status review and potential hearings, Microsoft...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2b566dbbc0522f8a0edae255100bcfa6d0fbc745f623c43c289e3eb8a1c74d25\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792251027,\"headline\":\"Riot Platforms, IREN, and MARA Drop Further as Bitcoin Miners Wrestle With the AI Headwinds\",\"id\":142987110,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/IREN.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Top Bitcoin mining companies pivoting to the AI industry are facing substantial challenges as investors warn about the AI bubble.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=469c2bcbc7124246588ad6174c8dcf1b254f376ed52f38bac567d57d298bd5b1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792249200,\"headline\":\"Apple, Nvidia each gave $25M to Trump's White House ballroom — but the president's own name is nowhere on the donor list\",\"id\":142961930,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The controversial ballroom faces fresh scrutiny over potential conflicts of interest with big money ballroom donors and how much Trump has personally contributed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0101be04f4d3d00f158af9390b8fde359db489ad795d52554e6754356b35fa4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792247820,\"headline\":\"UBS resets Microsoft stock price target for investors\",\"id\":142961945,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The biggest question about Microsoft may not be what investors expect.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fcf9012d7a22606465f07017e6a04f8ec3f45d0d1dc571ffe242d562be5bb359\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792247760,\"headline\":\"Here's How Microsoft's $175 Billion in Capital Expenditures Is Hurting Its Business\",\"id\":142961936,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft cloud computing business may not be as profitable as its other segments.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d4d83602fd58cd6a1fe8f8cc93aa5c2b25ec00d9348ffbe67cb17b8903d01078\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792240221,\"headline\":\"Nebius Stock Falls After Key Gartner Warning as Short Interest Nears 20%\",\"id\":142987118,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Konskie--Poland---May-03--2025-Nebius-Gr.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Nebius Group extended its steep sell-off as investors dumped neocloud stocks amid ongoing jitters in the artificial intelligence industry.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=962b1fb2eb09bc2a10ec30640faa64f4de052377e1810be8dd8ae416714fdc55\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792237451,\"headline\":\"BofA Warns AI Investors Could Lose Even If the Technology Works\",\"id\":142959982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America just invoked the ghost of the 1990s fiber optic collapse to explain why AI's biggest winners could still leave investors with nothing, even if the technology reshapes the world exactly as promised.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a4b2445fe3477280ba24144fe07b88715c87dc437e74e18d377a33b9c0cd50d6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792219587,\"headline\":\"AI Stocks Are The Next Dividend Growers\",\"id\":142959766,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5722824035d1917292ff4d4e40f7308d3a403a43dc80ec4cb139fb94982c7c30\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792213774,\"headline\":\"What would superintelligence look and feel like?\",\"id\":142958772,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Superintelligent AI could outperform human experts across virtually every cognitive task by 2030, potentially transforming business competition and the global economy, according to Deutsche Bank Research.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e9b36ad7b535c38963db1ffb3ab69538562babd642d313766cbe2ccfb3b252fc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792206600,\"headline\":\"GAMR Video Game ETF Momentum Continues Into Q4\",\"id\":142959020,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2186585249/image_2186585249.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The VettaFi Video Game Leaders Index gained nearly 1% in early October (through October 14), following a 10.7% return in Q3 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5bf14f22f7439c0096d4cf9d989b75e465c8148c4175d6d47c398090318ebbde\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792205436,\"headline\":\"Why You Should Think About Palantir Differently Now\",\"id\":142957833,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Palantir Technologies (PLTR) stock trades at 78.2 times sales, compared to 3.1 for the S\\u0026P 500. Investors paying that premium need to know exactly what they are buying, and the case Palantir makes has evolved. During the fiscal Q3 2024 earnings call, executives highlighted the fast-growing number of U.S. businesses signing on as customers. By the latest call in fiscal Q2 2026, the focus had shifted. So what does management talk up now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8955bf2fa5497edc3de33641e5dbc142262fc3cc80628d15432815560870baa4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792205205,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk’s Roadster, Nvidia’s Space AI Push, Nadella’s Security Warning: Mag 7 Voices This Week\",\"id\":142957830,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Elon Musk said Tesla’s long-awaited Roadster will enter production in 2028, though he has acknowledged that the car is unlikely to materially affect the company’s revenue.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a6168d913bbf8963671ca3b4041506abaf86c19aad935a92b69cdcc5e92c9e2e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792201800,\"headline\":\"ClearBridge Large Cap Growth ESG Strategy Q3 2026 Portfolio Update\",\"id\":142958805,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2228443483/image_2228443483.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft, a holding in several ClearBridge portfolios, offers a good example of how hyperscalers are responding. Read more here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4263c4d4f9a2b1ba91f9c7a8164e61cee7c7a448eafee5c99b9dee3175b7bcec\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792199406,\"headline\":\"UK Watchdog Proposes Strategic Market Tag for Microsoft, Puts Excel and Copilot AI Under Competition Scrutiny\",\"id\":142960644,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Madrid--Spain-05-15-2025-Close-up-Of-Lap.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The U.K.\\u0026#39;s competition regulator has proposed designating Microsoft as having a Strategic Market Status (SMS).\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2db6e325d956f17f2ea32e7621fce9621ab539e987f5dfdcb065e87bb93b602a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792187374,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today, Oct. 16: Apple Edges Higher on iPhone Duo Preorder Surge\",\"id\":142950783,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On Oct. 16, 2026, preorders for the new iPhone Duo sold out quickly, stretching delivery estimates into January.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8760fa2b760ec495891c243172b61d8880f629c24c105b7efeb44c945884b3b7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792186980,\"headline\":\"Not Alphabet. Not Microsoft. This Is the Cloud Stock I'd Buy With $5,000 Right Now.\",\"id\":142950771,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle's cloud backlog has swelled to $664 billion, and the stock has pulled back. Here's why long-term investors may want to take a closer look.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4973c9150d7ec782eb02c031b24fa855ea2e437ec9c65b2ec3d74d4711f5faa8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792184095,\"headline\":\"Update: Nasdaq Falls to End Four-Week Winning Streak Amid Tech Sell-Off\",\"id\":142950775,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"(Updates with market moves at the end of the day, and other changes, if any.) The Nasdaq Composit\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b61eb09fa533acc7c06e9bdfac5f27f1a4c0545ec3b68e4d3c126ea59190d8c7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792180854,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Energy Stocks Gain Late Afternoon\",\"id\":142950787,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Energy stocks were higher late Friday afternoon, with the NYSE Energy Sector Index rising 1.9% and t\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=abbdf924b4db0700f27a835fb20a4b692a29f19d5209f0cab9d93df43881a159\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179266,\"headline\":\"Apple is Now the Top-Performing Magnificent 7 Stock in 2026. Here’s why it’s Beating NVIDIA, Tesla, and Amazon\",\"id\":142949982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple (NASDAQ: AAPL) has emerged as the best-performing Magnificent Seven stock of 2026, outperforming NVIDIA (NVDA), Microsoft (MSFT), Amazon (AMZN), Alphabet (GOOGL), Meta Platforms (META), and Tesla (TSLA). But what's driving Apple's surprising rally while other AI stocks struggle? In this episode, 24/7 Wall St.'s Eric Bleeker examines why Apple shares have surged more than 27% in 2026, even as concerns about artificial intelligence spending are weighing on some of the market's biggest technology companies. While competitors are committing hundreds of billions of dollars to AI data centers, Apple is taking a different approach. Its strategy emphasizes on-device artificial intelligence, privacy, and integrating AI directly into its ecosystem, avoiding much of the enormous infrastructure spending burden facing its rivals. Eric breaks down Apple's latest earnings, its massive share repurchase program, and why investors are increasingly rewarding the company's capital-efficient AI strategy. He also compares the Magnificent Seven's performance in 2026 against their remarkable returns since the beginning of 2023, revealing a very different picture of the AI investment boom. Has Apple become the market's ultimate AI safe-haven stock? And could its strategy continue outperforming NVIDIA and the rest of Big Tech?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f831231eaab13eb8aeb433db1cbbdbf1fe067161173a318013a30dfc63d8ee53\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792177878,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Losers: GOOGL, CRM, MSFT, AMZN, CSCO in Today's US Session\",\"id\":142959213,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Dow Jones decliners in today's US session: Alphabet, Salesforce, Microsoft, Amazon, and Cisco fell, with GOOGL down 2.76% and CRM down 2.59%.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9bf954ed3d68f0415a8a21c3fb37453861ad6deccaac5526628104a7171ae838\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173976,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Energy Stocks Rise Friday Afternoon\",\"id\":142950015,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Energy stocks were higher Friday afternoon, with the NYSE Energy Sector Index rising 2.2% and the St\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9d3a150c56a1d3e8016810293a0ac11d51f5b40d4d909e4eaca1cfc1b3d8668d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173466,\"headline\":\"'Anthropic quietly pitches its own AI safety bill to lawmakers'- Politico\",\"id\":142960645,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/16/anthropic-ai-safety-01124654\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9ada1028a5500b528478b7f4287eb30b696512ff26cd3fb3c8acb3be05bb3ffc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173460,\"headline\":\"Equity Indexes Slide Intraday Amid Tech Sell-Off\",\"id\":142950016,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"US benchmark equity indexes slid intraday as several major technology names sold off. The Nasdaq\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=29d4097f4b5eaad4bf8a0f925ae3ffff98d666fc8bfa96a7a4e407a5cf701c06\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170689,\"headline\":\"AI Bubble Just Became The Fed's Inflation Problem\",\"id\":142950625,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2238010796/image_2238010796.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"AI boom is fueling persistent inflation, compelling the Fed to maintain a hawkish stance and likely hike rates into 2027. Read full analysis here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f93e49345d4ef1569067ef7a30f1c16baab90a45bdf30e4247783f56dcf9296e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170388,\"headline\":\"The Next Stock Market Crash Could Start With Just 3 Companies\",\"id\":142948989,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Just three companies now account for approximately 21% of the S\\u0026P 500's total market capitalization. NVIDIA (NVDA), Apple (AAPL), and Microsoft (MSFT) have become so dominant that their performance could determine the direction of the entire stock market. But what happens if these technology giants stumble? In this episode, 24/7 Wall St. co-founder Doug McIntyre and senior writer Lee Jackson discuss the extraordinary concentration of the S\\u0026P 500 and why millions of investors may be taking on more risk than they realize. Much of today's market enthusiasm is driven by artificial intelligence. Companies like NVIDIA, Microsoft, Alphabet (GOOGL), Amazon (AMZN), and Meta Platforms (META) have benefited from enormous expectations for AI growth. But Doug and Lee identify several potential threats to that optimism. They explore how cheaper open-source AI models could challenge industry leaders, why opposition to AI data center construction threatens expansion plans, and how growing electricity demand is driving renewed interest in nuclear power. Most importantly, they discuss what could happen to popular index funds like the SPDR S\\u0026P 500 ETF (SPY) if the market's largest technology stocks suffer a major sell-off. They also examine whether equal-weight S\\u0026P 500 funds could provide investors with better diversification. Is your S\\u0026P 500 investment more vulnerable than you think?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ab98f35bc89dbdfbba2d5bb3c55f635e436e1332b1ab7a49092a897f1a8ae3f7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170383,\"headline\":\"Nvidia and Apple Each Gave $25 Million to Trump’s White House Ballroom\",\"id\":142948990,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Confidential documents reveal that two of the world's most valuable tech companies quietly wrote identical checks to fund a new White House ballroom, and neither one sent out a press release. The real question is what each company expects to get back.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d21c891d39bf5dd2d3275dffe290c7ddcf2c56f5c8b90274001eb50985dd3df5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169134,\"headline\":\"Alphabet’s Cloud Surge and AI Dominance Overshadow Capex Fears and Keep Me Buying\",\"id\":142949033,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street keeps punishing Alphabet for its spending, but the cloud and AI numbers tell a completely different story about where this company is heading.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=79cadcad1debcd1a0fe7cc7742f24db86c41242792616e0b2e9e41dbea4fea74\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169118,\"headline\":\"The Next $5 Trillion Dollar Company: Alphabet or Microsoft?\",\"id\":142949031,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Alphabet is growing its cloud faster, but Microsoft is funding its AI buildout from its own cash while Alphabet sells stock to keep pace. The race to $5 trillion turns on which strategy survives contact with a $175 billion spending plan.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b2b7e333f74a91f7507db61ea61e28405e7b9576046edb29551b11fef03a8a65\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169027,\"headline\":\"The Tech Trade Needs a Life Raft. Mag 7 Earnings Can’t Come Soon Enough.\",\"id\":142949034,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The stock market isn’t done selling technology stocks, and support can't come soon enough.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e29a8590369372071a38aae8573acc6c3b0d2d0e2c44adadd5c295d5ed2b24e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168579,\"headline\":\"Microsoft Signs 1,100 MW Power Deal With NiSource Until 2048 as AI Spending Outruns the Grid\",\"id\":142949025,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft (MSFT:NASDAQ) just locked in electricity for an Indiana data-center campus two years before the power arrives. On Friday, NiSource (NI:NYSE) announced a 20-year energy agreement with Microsoft that starts in 2028 and adds about 1,100 MW to NiSource’s generation pool.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=997a59f6eed07f3030dcbc74ece74ef55c66e3e0cd797324c480167b927178a9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168112,\"headline\":\"Microsoft (MSFT) Remains a High-Quality AI Leader\",\"id\":142949026,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wedgewood Partners, an investment management company, released its third-quarter 2026 investor letter. The letter can be downloaded here. Wedgewood Composite delivered a net return of 2.5% in the quarter, compared to 2.3% for the Standard \\u0026 Poor’s 500 Index, 0.9% for the Russell 1000 Growth Index, and 2.6% for the Russell 1000 Value Index. Surging […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=19d1e5e5552fe419652df8f0e81b2df75f7cd753ff5dc1a091701632f719ea82\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167218,\"headline\":\"Top 3 British Undervalued Tech Stocks To Watch In October 2026\",\"id\":142949032,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Global markets are reassessing inflation risks after fresh regulatory changes, which is pulling attention back to dependable cash flows and realistic price tags. That backdrop makes undervalued UK technology stocks particularly interesting, as some high quality businesses have been marked down alongside the wider sector. This article breaks down three promising candidates from our value focused tech screener to help you decide whether they deserve a spot on your watchlist. The three stocks...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=58e9eb035bac9d4e9b52c190bc6159aa9e2231b887a7d35fd7539a2d8f93be37\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166811,\"headline\":\"Strong Azure Results Powered Microsoft Corporation’s (MSFT) Rally\",\"id\":142949027,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Diamond Hill Capital, a First Eagle Investment Management company, issued its Q3 2026 investor letter for its “Large Cap Strategy”. The letter can be downloaded here. The Strategy returned 3.18% (net of fees) in the quarter, outperforming the 2.61% return of the Russell 1000 Value Index. Key positive contributors included stock selection in information technology, an underweight in […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7b39714a15f33bc629f7386c81797b0b1bff3da64201132e43231ed099583b2b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166529,\"headline\":\"Is Adobe A Better Way Than Salesforce To Own AI Software Growth?\",\"id\":142949035,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors hold Salesforce (CRM) and Adobe (ADBE) on the same premise: artificial intelligence will make their subscription software grow faster again. The two companies part ways on how they charge for it. Salesforce gets 60% to 80% more for its premium editions than for its lower ones, and it wants customers to upgrade. Adobe has held off on price rises to win users. So which approach is paying off so far.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8292d4dd142df40aadb9a9d0927d6b91c10d3fd10116b52d9a52556a582a98f2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166047,\"headline\":\"Does The Move In Snowflake Stock Change Anything?\",\"id\":142949036,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Snowflake (SNOW) stock rose 59.3% from January 18 to October 15, 2026, against 12.5% for the S\\u0026P 500. The company reported quarterly results three times along the way, on February 25, May 27 and September 2. Buyers appear to be betting that customers using AI on Snowflake's data platform will keep its sales growth climbing while its losses shrink. So how much faster is Snowflake growing than it was in January.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fbd14ade6214cff0bbe86e260a9fd8d09e3391e0aa545d56f49dfb17e0b1f19f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792165407,\"headline\":\"What Is The Biggest Threat To Microsoft Stock?\",\"id\":142949023,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Buyers are paying for growth, and Microsoft (MSFT) is delivering it. The stock returned 37.2% between July 17 and October 15, 2026, against 4.1% for the S\\u0026P 500. Revenue climbed 17.7% in fiscal Q4 2026 from a year earlier. Yet on a July 29 earnings call, executives described a cost to that growth that is still rising. What is that cost, and who is raising it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=42d7abc2a9bb8e2f782d69ddbea13cf4f72d18dd4d868def556145e1f6ea4c86\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792164723,\"headline\":\"High Switching Costs Protect Microsoft Corporation (MSFT) in the AI Era\",\"id\":142947907,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Emerald Wealth Partners, an independent asset and wealth management firm based in Zurich, released its Q3 2026 investor letter for the “Focused Equity Strategy.” The letter can be downloaded here. The Focused Equity Strategy returned 8.9% gross and 8.7% net in Q3, amid a dynamic investment environment driven by AI infrastructure development. Following an initial […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=947f8a439e406fcd4ab4bb745a1ebddb67fe1434f3875722aa49fdeaf41f6b1a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792164498,\"headline\":\"The AI Sell-Off, Just A Wobble Or Something More Serious?\",\"id\":142949892,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2232813513/image_2232813513.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"SOXXâs 15% correction resets AI-driven gains. Learn which AI stocks look strongest vs riskiest, and what MSFT/NVDA earnings \\u0026 capex signalâread now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cbaaa5e6084c5710493bf8f817ba55e2b9f97ff42c521bf42faeea7c67973fad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792160543,\"headline\":\"If AI Crumbles, Microsoft Wins\",\"id\":142949544,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1176838131/image_1176838131.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft is rated a Buy, with a preference for gradual position building due to current record highs and potential AI-driven volatility. Read more on MSFT.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d14a1756d9be14ad0cb07797f099f6cb6361d830b2971d6a8fe88d91692670e4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792158945,\"headline\":\"Nvidia and Apple Donate Millions for Planned White House Project\",\"id\":142947906,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Nvidia StockPrice change for Nvidia stock in last 6 months: 10%$NVDA Stock Price as of Oct. 15: $21752-Week High: $243$NVDA Stock Price Target: $329What Happened?Nvidia (NVDA:NASDAQ) and Apple each committed $25 million to President Donald Trump’s planned White House ballroom, according to a Washington Post report on Thursday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b354df6406bed59454b8c60d549dd4ff5a50db9b2ac5ce94b2024da871d1a657\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792158600,\"headline\":\"Anthropic Might Be Worth ‘Only’ $1.5 Trillion. Why It Isn’t a Disaster for the AI Trade.\",\"id\":142947908,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI stocks have been hit by worries about Anthropic's IPO but it isn't all bad news.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c5435f7f9da4f120c0ff2d4dda20ce408c7d56366267155164de5fdf368b1781\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792157901,\"headline\":\"How Much Of Apple Stock Rides On One Product?\",\"id\":142945981,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors in Apple (AAPL) know the iPhone drives the business, but its sheer scale remains striking. The company generated $54.3 billion from iPhone sales during fiscal Q3 2026, the June quarter. That figure accounted for roughly half of its total $109.4 billion in revenue. Furthermore, iPhone sales climbed 22% from a year earlier. This outpaced the overall company, which grew 16%. So what has been pushing iPhone sales up this fast.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9c6a7b93cb149358c00aabc16ed9037ecde38c812d559b4bd8e623985fce2ee4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792157707,\"headline\":\"10 Information Technology Stocks Whale Activity In Today’s Session\",\"id\":142960610,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/11/06/aggregated_options_3.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"This whale alert can help traders discover the next big trading opportunities.\\nWhales are entities with large sums of money and we track their transactions here at Benzinga on our options activity scanner.\\nTraders will\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f23b8a8c3151a4a27b490571809625d7b27df19fdaa85dca3dd0a73e2f165c43\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792157589,\"headline\":\"Cathie Wood Bought CoreWeave Two Days in a Row as Its Bonds Cratered\",\"id\":142945513,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ARK Invest loaded up on CoreWeave stock two sessions in a row while the company's bondholders were sending a very different signal about the AI cloud provider's future.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=01026f5daffa3360128bfbe8b5ef587b4072dd972dbed26517b50eab72f19699\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792157134,\"headline\":\"How Bad Would Outspending Its Cash Flow Be For Meta Stock?\",\"id\":142945514,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms (META) expects capital spending of $130 billion to $145 billion in 2026. The company raised the bottom of that range from $125 billion in July. Executives plan to secure as much capacity as possible across 2026 and 2027, though they have not yet provided a spending figure for 2027. They also noted that strong operating cash flow puts Meta in a position to fund the build. So how close is Meta to spending more than it brings in.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e573bdbff52651c287e6afec73c96903be3dec5dc783f99261c1d11a62406b87\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155449,\"headline\":\"Microsoft’s AI Chief Says It Built a Better Model Than OpenAI’s With a Quarter of the Computing Power\",\"id\":142945510,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft's AI chief told staff the company quietly trained a model that outperforms a key partner's flagship system at a fraction of the cost, but the market barely flinched, and the reasons why reveal a complicated bet hiding inside the headline.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f5840933939106575967893d93f5651325722113442ca2c0e2abb728fc51ec5d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155060,\"headline\":\"NiSource Expands Microsoft Power Deal, Projects $1.75B In Customer Savings\",\"id\":142945511,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NiSource’s new 20-year power agreement with Microsoft is expected to lift projected savings for NIPSCO electric customers to $1.75 billion across data-center contracts, alongside plans to add generation and battery-storage capacity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eef1721a26acaa11ffa2b4a1ba1020dc353d6efb0ac5a29c1e13aa511bc14973\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154611,\"headline\":\"NiSource Signs 20-Year Microsoft Power Agreement for 1,100 MW Indiana Data Centre Campus\",\"id\":142945512,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NiSource Inc. (NYSE:NI) has entered into a 20-year energy agreement with Microsoft Corporation (NASDAQ:MSFT) to supply approximately 1,100 megawatts (MW) of generation resources to a data centre campus in northwest Indiana.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=107768aef7b8645a9782b9c73428a039629523b349cf7283b86920e80fd0445c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154272,\"headline\":\"This Week In Cloud AI - Akamai Technologies Boosts Global Cloud Service Adoption\",\"id\":142945515,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Akamai Technologies has observed a significant increase in customer adoption of its cloud computing services, largely driven by the growing demand for high-performance computing across AI and enterprise SaaS workloads. The company reported that this trend is evident from model training to low-latency inference, with enterprise clients utilizing its services for a range of applications, including cloud disaster recovery and core-to-edge application hosting. Akamai's momentum is supported by...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9bb9cbf4a984087c6b956308e6aff4aa9a3123c06789c31aa94718359a9b82a7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792153440,\"headline\":\"Is Amazon Stock Poised to Gain as AI Boosts Cash Flow Prospects?\",\"id\":142945516,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AMZN's AI products, surging AWS sales and multibillion-dollar chip commitments can boost future cash flow, but rising capex and capacity constraints pose challenges.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30f94ee678b0fd2b24e116088be02237c338a2dc350167dbce779e6ed40aa09f\"},{\"category\":\