,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tucuvi, an AI care management company, today announced it is joining the Microsoft for Startups Pegasus Program, which connects companies to Microsoft's enterprise customer ecosystem and go-to-market channels.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7b29f2fdacf6314f687bb87a12826cf03770fab766bf590253c756eb4676db18\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792088681,\"headline\":\"Meta Just Climbed 12% in a Month: Take Profits, or Hold On for the Ride?\",\"id\":142921337,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms stock has surged past Microsoft, Alphabet, and the major tech funds over the past month, all on the back of a single AI catalyst. Whether that move signals the start of something bigger or a peak worth cashing in depends on one critical revenue equation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ec9a00a67fe37f48f259730138042cae52bbc94fd98fedc68bc962fa31dfa96d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792087334,\"headline\":\"UBS Maintains Buy on Microsoft, Raises Price Target to $675\",\"id\":142946863,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"UBS  analyst Karl Keirstead   maintains Microsoft (NASDAQ:MSFT) with a Buy and raises the price target from $525 to $675.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=42a3445c5678b0d86f8a81e15e6d33b8aafd5f49cbf2aba76f2f19b8999da346\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792087200,\"headline\":\"XCENA Showcases CXL Memory Innovations for AI Inference at OCP Global Summit 2026\",\"id\":142921338,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SAN JOSE, Calif., October 15, 2026--XCENA, a fabless semiconductor company developing next-generation memory infrastructure for the AI era, demonstrated its CXL-based memory solutions for AI inference demonstrations at OCP Global Summit 2026, addressing AI inference’s growing memory requirements and data-movement burden. The event was held Oct. 12–15 at the San Jose McEnery Convention Center. The demonstrations address two of the biggest constraints on AI inference: growing memory requirements a\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=317b3ab0c76a79dd52581860f8c5eea82e5ad744fe1a7b89bc8ce0ca8481f41c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792085100,\"headline\":\"Microsoft can justify higher valuation as AI demand drives Azure growth, UBS says\",\"id\":142921336,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UBS has raised its price target for Microsoft Corp (NASDAQ:MSFT), the software and cloud computing company, to $675 from $525, arguing that strong demand for artificial intelligence services supports higher growth expectations ahead of its 28 October results. The bank reiterated its 'buy'...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d3a1d454782b1179f785ed9a6d7c679ccfcb279fd9b4a3d172471c131c2e3c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792084260,\"headline\":\"Meet the Low-Cost Vanguard ETF With Taiwan Semiconductor, Samsung Electronics, SK Hynix, and ASML as Its 4 Largest Holdings\",\"id\":142920268,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"International stock ETFs offer superior diversification, lower valuations, and higher yields than S\\u0026P 500 ETFs like VOO.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=010de4eb3a54db10cda6f8a002844349d6a8c49d46426cd57de9ccd4bd93423a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792084027,\"headline\":\"'Investors temper Anthropic IPO valuation expectations over revenue growth slowdown, sources say'- Reuters Exclusive\",\"id\":142945239,\"im