datetime\":1792082829,\"headline\":\"Will see huge wave of bankruptcy when neocloud over-investment ultimately implodes: Dan Niles\",\"id\":142948682,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108416155-17920968411792096839-49022495987-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792096840\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Dan Niles, Niles Investment Management founder, joins 'Closing Bell Overtime' to talk the state of the AI trade as a wave of AI debt fears hits neocloud stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=36aa2477abd96a72d18a967b8fa7b4dc11af72601e54e1a952182a8902079312\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792082499,\"headline\":\"AI Isn’t Coming for American Jobs Someday. The Fed Says It’s Already Happening.\",\"id\":142920307,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Federal Reserve's latest economic assessment reveals something investors and workers were not supposed to see this soon: AI is already reshaping who gets hired and who never does, and the consequences for household spending could unravel the very profits Wall Street is counting on.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d12c6a5373722ea9eb0b70890ed59432648231a1d6ec46f1fdb59210f52dce0a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792081138,\"headline\":\"MAGS: The Magnificent 7 Could Still Deliver 20% A Year\",\"id\":142921801,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2259148968/image_2259148968.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"MAGS ETF gives equal-weight exposure to the Magnificent Seven with AI tailwinds and high return potential.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5ae6debb122f58e43cfc1e5fa7dfa52e05b608b711543a3776fc5c9eaf6ffae2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792079635,\"headline\":\"Citigroup Maintains Buy on Microsoft, Raises Price Target to $636\",\"id\":142946865,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Citigroup  analyst Tyler Radke   maintains Microsoft (NASDAQ:MSFT) with a Buy and raises the price target from $600 to $636.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a54a0d286d00c9787328807f7e5123e185ffa00edc65a9af6254a8400c6faed1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792079160,\"headline\":\"Proofpoint MSP Platform Introduces New Capabilities to Support Secure AI Adoption for Organizations Using Microsoft 365\",\"id\":142919174,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"New capabilities help organizations and Managed Service Providers (MSPs) strengthen the security foundations needed for AI adoption.Updates improve visibility into permission and sharing risks, make AI-powered email assessments easier to understand and extend adaptive security awareness training to Microsoft Teams.A new AI Cyber Assistant in the Control Panel supports centralized security management, product guidance and customer consultation. SUNNYVALE, Calif., Oct. 15, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) --\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=99774692da3a68dd0087891b16d002173f0da9bdb707f6128288f6641f3586ef\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792078956,\"headline\":\"Nvidia and Cisco confirm multimillion-dollar donations to Trump's White House ballroom\",\"id\":142948645,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108356675-1788207196062-gettyimages-2291330125-ah704060.jpeg?v=1792096861\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Big Tech gave millions to Trump's White House ballroom, documents show\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=33af40d9d1bf1197ba10bcb2d3eb5dc6fab26d1eaa07dbe7aa24ad70a1564b35\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792078181,\"headline\":\"ServiceNow vs. Palantir Technologies: Which Technology Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142919149,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Palantir posted explosive U.S. commercial revenue growth in Q2 2026 and raised guidance for the second straight quarter. ServiceNow is compounding steadily with AI workflows gaining enterprise traction.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9420d5e1b3f41d4bb1e37d9475eb2e5af89fa3ac0834818b094b7b475a183d31\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792078041,\"headline\":\"Microsoft’s Azure Grew 40% and Is Still Reportedly Hunting for 20% Cost Cuts\",\"id\":142919167,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Azure is booking revenue faster than almost any cloud business in history, yet its leadership reportedly just told team heads to slash costs by a fifth. Something about the math behind that explosive growth is not adding up.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=749030d25e398d0b6b368c83af4ad980c1348315333021e274ea23bf7f0e5119\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792077840,\"headline\":\"MongoDB's Enterprise Customer Base Grows: Can Atlas Sustain Momentum?\",\"id\":142920311,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"MDB's growing large-enterprise customer base is driving Atlas consumption, higher recurring revenues and broader adoption of AI-powered database capabilities.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=11ebe40f8603c2964e9c035d9b9916ec766ae0cd86a18f90625a7cb85fae6838\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792077731,\"headline\":\"Anthropic Is Growing 50%, Microsoft Isn’t\",\"id\":142919155,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Anthropic's explosive growth is exposing a painful gap between AI hype and reality for some of the biggest names in tech, and their investors may not yet grasp how serious the valuation problem has become.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a76c7a7b86e1fc9f28ef86af5e68986817a272e7ba268c19e6581ac9d1e4f156\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792077212,\"headline\":\"MSFT Stock Gets Slew Of Price Target Hikes Ahead Of Earnings – TD Cowen Sees ‘Higher Than Normal’ Azure Beat Potential\",\"id\":142919169,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"According to the Fly, Mizuho raised its target to $600 from $510, citing healthy channel checks, strong cloud and consumption data, and robust AI adoption.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e17a563438cf7b5f0b7dcbfe4771738f303dd95b20d7ffb90a0d969c62fbb8fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792077000,\"headline\":\"Why OKX And NYSE Are Going All-In on 24/7 Stock Trading\",\"id\":142919147,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"OKX teaming up with NYSE's parent company to tokenize stocks was inevitable, says GM Lennix Lai\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fcd3866d9c36a7e36c4fb54c200ddee3d5b497e62ec7e66ca3493ca442049f3e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792076899,\"headline\":\"Oracle Fell Nearly 9% as CoreWeave’s Bond Scare Spread\",\"id\":142919173,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave's bond market flashed a warning that spread far beyond one AI startup, and Oracle shareholders absorbed a nearly 9% loss before the trading day even ended. What happens to Oracle's $664 billion backlog if the cost of AI debt keeps climbing?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bc629b477d002cfda898bf225d9dcc6969b476f0e3ed118c418bc68551d0aad2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792076580,\"headline\":\"Why Wall Street Is Comfortable With Microsoft Stock Even as AI Trade Pressured\",\"id\":142920308,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft stock is looked upon by Wall Street as a winner in artificial intelligence.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=84037101345409d0b0e479b82795fb2b0f0a2a7de534d75113e80126b0b3e9aa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792076226,\"headline\":\"Microsoft’s CEO is still haunted by staying silent in a meeting with Bill Gates—years later, his boss Steve Ballmer taught him how to speak up\",\"id\":142920309,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Satya Nadella still regrets staying silent in a meeting with Bill Gates around 2008-2009—but says the experience shaped his approach to career success.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=32ff153ee664fe0c85d5c50d72f52d40bdad36819884fff2eceb3f7afdf67fdb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792075502,\"headline\":\"From Search Destruction to Efficiency, I Have Faith in Alphabet’s Abilities\",\"id\":142919176,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street once bet that AI chatbots would destroy Google Search, and investors who bought through that fear were rewarded. Now Alphabet faces a far bigger test, one measured in hundreds of billions of capex dollars with no guarantee of return.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4f143854c2785446409ce8a06780abf4a86dd97b280736b8a8313ebb9cfd8df7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792074836,\"headline\":\"Anthropic Needs Nearly $2.7B in Additional Monthly Revenue to Reach $100B Run Rate by Year-End\",\"id\":142945152,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10