95/image_2234860695.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"AGD offers a 12.74% yield from global dividend stocks but faces risks from rising bond yields \\u0026 IPO lockups.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0a80664ba56022699bca1103f57af63c35f633a2358a98137e034ac2c2462e97\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792048696,\"headline\":\"Will Yum! Brands' (YUM) AI-Driven Operations and Supplier Strategy Shift Its Post-Pizza Hut Narrative?\",\"id\":142903378,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In recent days, Yum! Brands highlighted deeper long-term supplier partnerships, expanding AI deployment such as Taco Bell’s automated drive-thru ordering, and a unified global supply chain, while analysts updated views on its growth prospects following the Pizza Hut divestiture and softer Taco Bell trends. Together, these moves suggest Yum! Brands is tightening operational control around its strongest brands and digital initiatives, aiming to improve restaurant-level efficiency and menu...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ef1b9d3a5d6e2b5d49339c473935e9bc8bdda805654a03e76971a0408ef9ce78\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792047995,\"headline\":\"Politico Reported Microsoft President Warned White House Against Crackdown On Skilled Immigration\",\"id\":142918070,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/15/microsofts-president-warns-white-house-against-skilled-immigration-crackdown-01119727\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f06993934b96c71be5cca1dedd60d9658a355d7aa963be40d29955da9a85f9e9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792046761,\"headline\":\"Alibaba: Enough Fuel To Power The Trillion-RMB Cloud Machine\",\"id\":142910421,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1020075066/image_1020075066.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Alibaba Group Holding Limited is down 41% from its 2025 peak as earnings recovery lags and capex expectations rise. Learn why BABA stock is a buy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7b76a6437764f701eac44a615f1dfb115a11df4be5e3d33508ba1b4486a7af69\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792045740,\"headline\":\"Wedgewood Partners Q3 2026 Portfolio Activity\",\"id\":142910113,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2266615986/image_2266615986.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft grew operating income by about 18%, and we estimate its average gross asset base grew in the low 20s, leading to continued healthy returns on invested capital of almost 30%.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1620ad1d41f10c6eaf2a974c9853a8a0b1016575da7407c915252c3b46627dad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792044900,\"headline\":\"Polen Focus Growth Portfolio Q3 2026 Portfolio Update\",\"id\":142909257,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/649278778/image_649278778.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"In Q3 2026, we initiated new positions in Adyen, ASML, Quanta Services, and Seagate Technology, while selling MSCI and Rollins. Read more here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8ef5653b5295604d783fe54d49e184a527f62574a75821de06ae2f4c1087851\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792040509,\"headline\":\"Will OpenAI Go Public? One VC Says ‘Not Really Sure They Mean It’ But Bets On ‘Blockbuster’ Anthropic Listing\",\"id\":142898778,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Anthropic’s Q3 financials disappointed some investors and contributed to Nasdaq’s drag, CNBC’s Jim Cramer said.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d9d23e8fb75c742dbdf30fb46afdd3876f5d648219b5b2f22a6af8159e4f402\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792029137,\"headline\":\"Why Is Everyone Ignoring Zoom Stock's High Cash Yield?\",\"id\":142896510,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the last twelve months, Zoom Communications (ZM) generated free cash flow equal to 6.7% of its market value. The median S\\u0026P 500 company sits at 4.4%. A yield that high means one of two things: a heavily discounted business or a company the market expects to shrink. So why are investors paying so little for Zoom's cash.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4b35211b634c7acc9c12cc2bd291c8e8600f923cd94d7f999b55d858ae279399\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792026041,\"headline\":\"Home improvement stocks offer an AI hedge: CIO\",\"id\":142919968,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108411489-17920226401792022637-49004324711-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792022639\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Bill Stone, Glenview Trust CIO, says that home improvement stocks like Lowe's, Home Depot, and Sherwin Williams are long-term value bets if the AI cycle cools. Meanwhile, AI memory stocks like Micron are worth watching closely for signs of outsized profits.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=91a26661a5791d957f861b657ffcb2e6eece49e932e3674bddc9d657db013ccf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792019898,\"headline\":\"Is Xero’s (ASX:XRO) Google Gemini Integration Quietly Rewiring Its AI Platform Ambitions?\",\"id\":142889213,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Earlier this week, Xero announced a new integration with Google Gemini that brings live Xero financial data and workflow automation directly into Gemini conversations, allowing small businesses and advisors to generate financial reports, manage receivables and payables, and build time-based tasks without leaving the chat interface. This move not only extends Xero’s AI reach across major platforms like Microsoft 365, Claude, ChatGPT and now Gemini, it also deepens its role as a central...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c1e4700880b7faa6084fd2bc29221c32abcd005e83e2e524a660548a58f568af\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792012626,\"headline\":\"Microsoft Just Unveiled a Brand-New AI Chip. Could It Be the \\\"Nvidia Killer\\\" Everyone's Been Looking For?\",\"id\":142888320,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"It could, but not in the way you might think.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3b21b8ed43d6146ab7b78d71ad16ec2e608f7d35e23693f96d04aea5cfd49889\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792011807,\"headline\":\"Should You Be Worried About Take-Two Stock?\",\"id\":142888327,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Take-Two Interactive Software (TTWO) have fallen 21% over the past twelve months, trailing the S\\u0026P 500 and its 21% return. Company executives still expect net bookings to grow about 20% in fiscal 2027, aided by the November release of Grand Theft Auto VI. During an August 7 earnings call, however, leadership hesitated to bank on the enthusiasm surrounding the new title. What is management unsure about.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e6df1db319fd338cd3284ab59c8f83508198dcfe296612cfd0f9a66c310ae4e7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792010100,\"headline\":\"3 Trillion-Dollar Giants That Could Be the Next Big Stock-Split Plays\",\"id\":142888340,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\