\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"When a CNBC anchor made the case for American AI dominance on a comedy show, she got the national security argument exactly right and the investment argument exactly backwards. Here is what the hyperscalers spending nearly two trillion dollars over two years are not telling you.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b8c4098f7628dfe40bd722d986d9fe0608b5abd8a51b21e2929b918f19bbcfbe\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792006805,\"headline\":\"IonQ vs. Nebius Group: Which Technology Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142887399,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nebius is growing at an extraordinary pace with demand outpacing supply. IonQ has a diversified quantum backlog but a longer road to commercial scale.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ac37d2f420ed8a1958c8705720887c4bcc79e46407cdc8ad40ca2319873d6f24\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792005600,\"headline\":\"Amazon Is the Most Crowded Stock for Hedge Funds. Tesla, Not So Much.\",\"id\":142888338,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon.com stock was the most owned name among hedge funds in September, trading data shows.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c82d51d050d75b339d5b6cb22b92d108447b3179d53542a04ed86a5439602e7e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792005349,\"headline\":\"Open Cloud Security And Testing Partnerships Could Be A Game Changer For Oracle (ORCL)\",\"id\":142887397,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In recent days, Marvell Technology, Microsoft and Oracle, working through the Open Compute Project, formed a new security working group to define open NIST FIPS 140-3 Level 3 integrated HSM specifications for cloud and hyperscale data centers, while UiPath Test Cloud also became available on Oracle Marketplace for AI-powered testing of Oracle applications. This combination of open-standards security collaboration and expanded partner solutions highlights Oracle’s push to enhance the...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d6eac8efc98beb843e9a60d3152ddbb0873cdff79ff9ba9b9df3ff87a45f597\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792005015,\"headline\":\"Discover which dow jones stocks are making waves on Wednesday.\",\"id\":142887223,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Uncover the latest developments among dow jones stocks in today's session. Stay tuned to the dow jones index's top gainers and losers on Wednesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0da62e5b5741f2c815f6c9d71ebb7308149769088a6488e233b3825b4510e5a1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792004402,\"headline\":\"Hold, Roll, or Close? The Options Chart Too Many Traders Ignore.\",\"id\":142892308,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Learn how volatility term structure can help options traders manage positions long after the initial order gets filled.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=74b47f5378e9a7530541b897ba91a407c77454f2dc8de1a68980e13ad2cdccd2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792003691,\"headline\":\"Citi Says the S\\u0026P 500 Hits 8,100. Half the Market Has to Cooperate First.\",\"id\":142887377,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Citi's strategist set a bold year-end price target for the S\\u0026P 500, but the math only works if a beaten-down slice of the market stops bleeding while Treasury yields are still climbing against it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e402caca7390f2b01d7bf10159f468d2948818a646e3348ab5269ca1cb99c945\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792003612,\"headline\":\"Microsoft (MSFT) Built a $100B Azure. Can It Outrun Its Own Spending?\",\"id\":142887395,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"When Microsoft (NASDAQ:MSFT) reports again later this month, one line will draw more attention than the rest: how fast Azure grew. That’s a lot of weight for a single business inside a company that also sells Windows, Office, Xbox, and LinkedIn. But Azure has earned the spotlight. Azure is Microsoft’s cloud platform. Businesses rent its […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9c583b9ea3f08dfed3942d17a673f1a3c5fff4d015cd940fc743dd65465a0fd3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792002640,\"headline\":\"Innodata vs. IONQ: A Look at Revenue Trends Between Artificial Intelligence and Quantum Computing Innovators\",\"id\":142887400,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"IONQ's revenue has surged sevenfold in two years, while Innodata's growth remains steady — but the gap between them is closing faster than most investors realize.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=67d3ab65eefb934e639f6bde67b4761320b96ff28dfeb602092270365d6334ef\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792001973,\"headline\":\"Should Microsoft Stock's New High Stop You From Buying?\",\"id\":142887396,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Most investors apply one rule to a stock like Microsoft (MSFT): buy low and never at the top. Microsoft stock closed near its 52-week high on October 13, 2026, making it the wrong time to buy under that logic. Rather than asking whether the price is too high, market participants should examine the historical performance of Microsoft's earlier highs. Does that rule hold for Microsoft.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=227448a3752798293dc05cb3f6cdf9ed618f58d5c26e768bb50c9f97bcb8672e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792001863,\"headline\":\"Marvell Technology (MRVL) Forms Security Group And Unveils Six Channel AI Memory\",\"id\":142887398,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Marvell Technology (NasdaqGS:MRVL) formed an Open Compute Project working group with Microsoft and Oracle to define server-level silicon security standards. The collaboration targets a common hardware security model for data center servers, aiming to align chip vendors and major cloud operators. Marvell introduced industry-first six-channel CXL-based memory expansion solutions designed to feed data hungry AI accelerators in large-scale data centers. The firm also announced new 224G per lane...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f57e3468d6bdb9381b4627b1985f42085e33dc0e61140d779083d3aae0877217\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792000200,\"headline\":\"Liberty All-Star® Equity Fund September 2026 Monthly Update\",\"id\":142886356,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BOSTON, October 14, 2026--Liberty All-Star® Equity Fund September 2026 Monthly Update\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2093733503ba38e5acb28367b5efa2fab0d59af01d9e7999ea00606697588c6f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792000200,\"headline\":\"Liberty All-Star® Growth Fund, Inc. September 2026 Monthly Update\",\"id\":142886349,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BOSTON, October 14, 2026--Liberty All-Star® Growth Fund, Inc. September 2026 Monthly Update\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b6275f90ccaed1d768e7b9b0b6759e778d3a83e60dd01e9ef842c1700e2c259f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791997787,\"headline\":\"What Could Microsoft (MSFT) Gain From Its Maia 300 AI Chip Rollout?\",\"id\":142886359,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft (NasdaqGS:MSFT) introduced its Maia 300 AI chip, the firm's largest in house silicon rollout to date. The Maia 300 is slated for multi gigawatt scale deployment across Azure data centers to support AI inference workloads. Management plans to use Maia 300 to lessen reliance on Nvidia and AMD hardware and open collaboration with external AI partners. The Maia 300 launch reshapes Microsoft's AI hardware approach, which is only one piece of the full investment picture. We have also...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=10dda3df1699ea7f66ef7cb196fb638228aacc9857542a407464328fa6ab8ac0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791996018,\"headline\":\"These dow jones stocks are moving in today's session\",\"id\":142885917,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Curious about the top performers within the dow jones index in the middle of the day on Wednesday? Dive into the list of today's session's top gainers and losers for a comprehensive overview.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0e4a0f899d47f594522938c4a59506903cbb4ca15d3de14660f12bd82568ba62\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791993639,\"headline\":\"Apple Just Passed $5 Trillion. Here’s What Comes Next.\",\"id\":142886377,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple just crossed a threshold no company has reached before, but the real debate is whether its loftiest valuation