both ways when the next report lands on November 2.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b9a48edbe1b1c1bdb0124ef0fbeea19b5464098e4019073f95084e31cc6cdb4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791982800,\"headline\":\"Rising Rates and Energy-Driven Inflation Impact Global Hedge Funds in September, Data Insights Reports\",\"id\":142882531,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NEW YORK \\u0026 LONDON, October 14, 2026--Rising interest rates and inflation emerged as key themes impacting global hedge funds in September, driven in part by higher energy prices. Following a 25-basis-point Federal Reserve rate hike, global bond markets experienced a selloff, while long-term Treasury yields climbed. Meanwhile, equity market gains were concentrated in a narrow group of AI-linked mega-cap technology stocks, according to Data Insights, the institutional hedge fund market intelligence\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ca98c81d2984ff568ec79f30ad3f825b0eb92daeda7c5fb2d7e3ecfc0a57ee35\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791982680,\"headline\":\"IBM Stock Before Q3 Earnings Release: To Buy or Not to Buy?\",\"id\":142883250,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"IBM faces a crucial Q3 earnings test as AI and hybrid cloud growth opportunities clash with mounting competition, margin pressures and premium valuation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9553b16bbaba1b18a6056582f1672c87c23581d54b8e3ef7fe0fb43b38f53cbb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791981544,\"headline\":\"ASML Earnings Signal Strong AI Demand Yet Stock Falls, Emphasizing Market Character Shift—CPI Squashes Hopium\",\"id\":142915711,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/ASML.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\\n\\n\\n\\nMarket Character Shift\\n\\n\\n\\nPlease click here for an enlarged chart of ASML Holding NV (NASDAQ:ASML).\\n\\n\\n\\nNote the following:\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nThis article is about the big picture, not an individual stock.  The chart of ASML stock\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3bed8dbef292c2b3c7e23e3a55356ea6ad3da8d91a50dae9355485255305aab4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791981221,\"headline\":\"Every Yield Trap Has a Tell. This $7,750-a-Month Portfolio Avoids All of Them\",\"id\":142882542,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Not every fat dividend survives long enough to matter, and the gap between a yield that compounds your wealth and one that quietly drains it comes down to a handful of signals most investors never check.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cf05ec4113fa6418e79457a51bd9d2b6c350517bef53b2ab543202ba7d390761\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791979851,\"headline\":\"How Investors May Respond To Enbridge (TSX:ENB) Sunrise Expansion And Reaffirmed 2026 Dividend Outlook\",\"id\":142882543,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Enbridge recently began construction on its C$4.00 billion Sunrise Expansion in British Columbia, adding roughly 87 miles of pipeline and 300 million cubic feet per day of capacity to its Westcoast natural gas system, while also reaffirming its 2026 guidance and dividend outlook. This combination of a large, secured growth project and confirmation of continued dividend coverage highlights how Enbridge is leaning on contracted gas infrastructure to underpin future cash flow visibility. Next,...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2b0b55067cb168bd4016e40cbe2b68fc34d0fa323440d9dca57f07b167d15325\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791979200,\"headline\":\"PRG Partners with Devsinc to Build the Digital Foundation for Scalable Growth with Microsoft Dynamics 365\",\"id\":142882538,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Multi-phase transformation unifies sales, service, finance, and client experience on a single enterprise platform across PRG and its family of companies DOWNERS GROVE, Ill., Oct. 14, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Physicians Revenue Group, Inc. (“PRG”), a healthcare revenue cycle management and practice services organization headquartered in Downers Grove, Illinois, has selected Devsinc as its implementation partner for a multi-phase enterprise platform program built on Microsoft Dynamics 365, includi\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6378d4e4e6b0212b487b4e267ae7d8138dc7e83393e23dc0f4e17386e3d7915b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791979200,\"headline\":\"KnowBe4 Defend Ranks First in Microsoft's Real-World Email Security Benchmark\",\"id\":142882537,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"TAMPA BAY, Fla., October 14, 2026--KnowBe4, the global leader in digital workforce security, securing both humans and AI agents, today announced that KnowBe4 Defend ranked first across all three incremental detection metrics reported by Microsoft in its latest email security benchmark, which measured seven integrated cloud email security (ICES) solutions on live Defender customer data.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=32a451f1e3f0cb75f67230192eee4753a5e206b4a429f66f2131c2ccd050ef77\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791979048,\"headline\":\"'OpenAI Names Uday Ruddarraju to Lead Data Center, Computing Unit' - Bloomberg\",\"id\":142918073,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-14/openai-names-uday-ruddarraju-to-lead-data-ce