io Manager Justin Bergner and NYSE Senior Market Strategist Michael Reinking break down how rapidly spiking bond yields and heavy AI spending are impacting the stock market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e538b1b662459f84c79826f418e50d9db776530a2df2f5e5b0e9d1c3b057208d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791973683,\"headline\":\"Jamie Dimon Warns Of Forces That “Continue To Shift Under The Surface,” As Half Of Russell 3000 Stocks Sit In A Bear Market With The S\\u0026P 500 Near Records\",\"id\":142877705,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Jamie Dimon says dangerous forces are shifting beneath a seemingly calm surface, and the stock market tells a strikingly similar story. The index near record highs conceals a hidden collapse spreading quietly across hundreds of stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30e0f2baff4fab7928045e56b1a5a768cbb6b86bebe30ac8154d0a2fb211212e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791973494,\"headline\":\"U.S. Diplomat In Riyadh, Microsoft Arabia President Ayman Al-Ghamdi Discussion Expansion Of U.S.-Saudi Partnership In Super Intelligence, Cloud Computing\",\"id\":142883861,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://x.com/USAinKSA/status/2110370705527165226?s=20\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2f4063dfb8781cc21721eb2184553bca71f7421d78cebfcb91c6ce0dc7bee960\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791973332,\"headline\":\"Google DeepMind’s Demis Hassabis Calls AI Hacking Incidents ‘Early Warning Shots,’ Warns of More Major Threats Ahead Without Stronger Safeguards\",\"id\":142883862,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Mountain-View--Ca--Usa---May-1--2022-Goo.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Google DeepMind\\u0026#39;s Demis Hassabis warns AI hacking incidents could become major threats by 2027 without stronger security safeguards.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=39e778ffce0c677d67fc9f368d5fef91888e3d8a05d2a30240787734c18a8b47\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791971893,\"headline\":\"Mexico President Says She Will Sign Decree On Wednesday To Order Digital Platforms To Protect Minors From Violent And Sexual Content; Mexico To Give Platforms One Month To Come Into Compliance With Decree\",\"id\":142883670,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"- Reuters \",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4545724b67107e0883f11d5bfa3f292fac112b677671629d5973a0afd32f476b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791971695,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures Rise With Meta, AMD In Buy Areas; ASML Earnings Mixed, CPI Inflation Due\",\"id\":142876322,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Dow futures rose with yields falling. Chip-gear giant ASML beat on earnings with the CPI inflation report due.. Meta and AMD are buys.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=16fe8c80e416684d20688e6cdbef46696b2794b1e50a04e962bf1254b85b0226\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791968899,\"headline\":\"Wall Street’s ‘Last Men Standing’: The Mag 7 Are Propping Up the S\\u0026P 500, Then Why Are Your ETFs at Risk?\",\"id\":142882440,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Los-Angeles--California---21-April-2024-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The Mag 7 are propping up the S\\u0026amp;P 500 as market breadth weakens. Here’s why SPY and QQQ investors may face hidden concentration risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=60c43cae72d440860589299178050fac116d435b1f33204fe618c9f650dac9fc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791968400,\"headline\":\"Conga Expands AI Across the Commerce Lifecycle with New MCP Server and AiMe Capabilities\",\"id\":142876321,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AMSTERDAM, October 14, 2026--Conga Connection -- Conga, the company lining up commerce, today announced a wave of AI-first product innovations at Conga Connection in Amsterdam, headlined by the launch of the Conga Model Context Protocol (MCP) Server. By bringing live Conga data directly into AI assistants such as Claude and Microsoft Copilot, teams get real answers about their contracts, quotes and obligations without leaving the tools they already use. Conga also expanded AiMe, its native AI in\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e288ed4dc8f7a2c07b6c456f53dca9802dc958f96d31652b3a6753b75f0d5da3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791968316,\"headline\":\"'OpenAI CFO Says Firms Using Chinese AI Models Are Risking Safety' - Bloomberg Exclusive\",\"id\":142883865,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-14/openai-cfo-says-firms-using-chinese-ai-models-are-risking-safety\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=665d967b3a67802e4b728c120ddd8bc6b83e59294ee0b1252cab4ac51db6385c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791968253,\"headline\":\"AI Breaches Cost $6 Million: 3 Security Markets Investors Should Watch\",\"id\":142882796,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/IBM.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Higher breach costs give companies a reason to improve security. For investors, however, the useful question is which improvements customers will pay for and which suppliers can deliver them profitably. Answering that\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=430e29c7851e2dbae0e3823e793e6d15a510391734071b9f7d833cfb8f101256\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791967133,\"headline\":\"Three Weeks Before The Midterms, Donald Trump Has A Stock Market Problem Hiding In Plain Sight. The Stealth Bear Market Is Already Here\",\"id\":142874942,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The S\\u0026P 500 sits near record highs, but that headline number may be hiding a very different reality for the stocks most Americans actually own, and the timing could not be more awkward for the White House.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ca3f94e5b8850dc9c392e0c7e1c9649744695954aebb6cf7977a1016f23d7f36\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791965280,\"headline\":\"Life Science Analytics Market Report 2026: Size, Share, Trends, and Forecast to 2030 | Capitalize on 15.6% CAGR as Oracle, SAS, IBM, IQVIA, and Microsoft Accelerate AI Adoption\",\"id\":142872884,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Life Science Analytics Market to Reach $64.51 Billion by 2030 as AI Adoption and Precision Medicine Accelerate GrowthDublin, Oct. 14, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \\\"Life Science Analytics Market Report 2026\\\" has been added to ResearchAndMarkets.com's offering. The global life science analytics market is experiencing rapid expansion as pharmaceutical, biotechnology, healthcare, and medical device organizations increasingly rely on data-driven insights to improve research, clinical development, regulat\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cec419f962eb402361684ccae78a2335aaf1c62b3396e0445add85b7c3673535\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791964873,\"headline\":\"Microsoft: Bears Are Making Noise About AI Spending, You Should Ignore It - Buy\",\"id\":142881871,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1509310377/image_1509310377.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft (MSFT) continues to defy skeptics regarding its infrastructure investments, consistently proving critics wrong.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=43b99c970e11b854215e453fec060f474a569d91666dcc38d5dc5e1cfedc32dd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791964800,\"headline\":\"SHOC: Nvidia's Comeback Meets A Memory Boom\",\"id\":142881882,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2186449988/image_2186449988.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"SHOC ETF still a high-conviction buy as Nvidia results and hyperscaler capex lift AI semis.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e1d4e8bc6e9894f89d5c977a5a1ef34beec09c77c1df019bf725c1920c1be63d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791962082,\"headline\":\"'Apple, OpenAI Head to Court in High-Stakes AI Trade Secret Fight' - Bloomberg\",\"id\":142883120,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-14/apple-openai-head-to-court-in-high-stakes-ai-trade-secret-fight\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5ad1786e00d7b49611cac0e2bdbac9f7d91ae18d21260d556dc071ec3e297113\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791961201,\"headline\":\"Tech giants race to get AI gadgets on shelves for holiday rush\",\"id\":142886026,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108403953-17919074702026-10-13t143107z_543638718_rc2d2oauh86b_rtrmadp_0_ai-apple-products.jpeg?v=1791907529\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"With the holidays just a couple months away, tech companies are betting this is finally the year that AI gadgets make the shopping list.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3f50123324ddfa20bfc98b7cf31834c92dcdb7d1b7fa71280c14ed1843bde6f8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791956992,\"headline\":\"Forget NVIDIA: Jim Cramer Says US Chip Stocks Are 'Joined at the Hip' With SK hynix\",\"id\":142882307,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/West-Bangal--India---July-5--2024-Sk-Hyn.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"SK hynix slides amid a global tech selloff. Jim Cramer and top analysts assess China competition, AI demand, and market trends.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3cfdfef74a64fb05b07986682f4af9477ddbe50af0d2dc4ff3d05573e35ec4f5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791955958,\"headline\":\"Micron Stock Gets Hammered Over China Fears — Jim Cramer Calls the Selloff 'Nonsense'\",\"id\":142882308,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Image-Of-A-Micron-High-Bandwidth-Memory-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Micron stock drops amid chip selloff, but Cramer and analysts dismiss China risks, citing strong AI demand and long-term supply deals.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=834f7d7c1e303b59b55ade2877466147e550ba714defeaafea33bc78ae83be29\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791952896,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk Says ‘Yikes’ As CoreWeave Bond Yield Hits 15% Amid Chamath Palihapitiya’s ‘Private Credit Bubble’ Warning\",\"id\":142882309,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/In-This-Photo-Illustration--The-Coreweav.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Elon Musk replies \\u0026#39;Yikes\\u0026#39; to CoreWeave\\u0026#39;s 15% bond yield as Chamath Palihapitiya warns of looming AI \\u0026#39;private credit bubble\\u0026#39; in tech lending.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=226820f414cd7fe88b2b33fdf5c5a234b7f7d345130b7f06c74c005c8ebe42a7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791948000,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Industrial Average Monitor Update - A Look At 30 U.S. Large-Caps\",\"id\":142869843,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1196086989/image_1196086989.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Visible Alpha consensus expects the Dow Jones Industrial Average to deliver an 18.7% weighted price return in the medium term. Read more here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=310ef25895cc39730bc02d53261c2e29cfcc1b7eb4f0498474d0e9c56b8614e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791947660,\"headline\":\"QQA Vs. QQQI: One For Total Return, One For Retirement Income\",\"id\":142869423,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/959325392/image_959325392.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Both QQA and QQQI receive buy ratings, but suitability depends on investor income needs and risk tolerance. Read more on QQA and QQQI ETFs here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d57bea2bc46f467626ddb09cc276dfbfba7412f3fc344aa76fd87f060f7370f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791947161,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures: Techs Rise After Meta, AMD Lead Buys; ASML, CPI Inflation Due\",\"id\":142862160,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The stock market edged lower Tuesday but Meta and AMD led five buys. AI chip giant ASML and the CPI inflation report loom.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=79511163cac5e104f71c0e982a149c0e835dd2aab06cdc032fc1c312c342dc54\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791945000,\"headline\":\"MIT dropout’s two startups announce shutdown weeks apart\",\"id\":142863144,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Gen-Z engineer who dropped out of MIT built major startups but they are now shutting down.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8dc4f87fba8bb288425b10da20ce0a159a14f43c7c19f6f6a50193e1a6f99d58\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791939627,\"headline\":\"His Silicon Valley Pay Will Jump Above $184,500. Social Security Won’t Credit Every Extra Dollar Toward His Future Benefit\",\"id\":142860886,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A $70,000 raise sounds like a retirement game-changer, but most of that money vanishes before Social Security ever sees it, and the piece that does get through may surprise you.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=897b54fce6f98203ec443c14d9d0220c000606956437050ff6d46e1a135df309\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791937620,\"headline\":\"GreenCore Solutions Corp. (GSC) Releases gtinfetch.ai -- the GTIN Resolver for AI Agents\",\"id\":142857715,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GreenCore Solutions Corp. (GSC) today releases its new retail grocery agentic lead product, gtinfetch.ai — the GTIN resolver for AI agents. Any barcode, one call, in milliseconds: 84 million barcodes answering, the biggest open resolver on the Model Context Protocol (MCP), on Microsoft Azure and the Cloudflare edge, answered from wherever the agent is. Built for retail grocery agentic commerce transactions at scale in 20 countries.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3d00fb569754ba46cf43bde5435421ec95d614f7274a626086bd8e8cddb94d35\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791934848,\"headline\":\"Microsoft Weighs 20% Cost Cuts In Azure Vertical Amid Soaring AI Data Center Spending: Report\",\"id\":142855325,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft Azure is exploring potential cost reductions of at least 20% in its software development unit to offset heavy infrastructure investments and rising talent retention costs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=06259daa8c151882c5e4e07bc8de9c5407fcee4a3ddae08331510c2640ac4466\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791934433,\"headline\":\"If You Own SPY, This Lower-Cost Fund Tracks Identical Holdings for Less Than Half the Fee\",\"id\":142855309,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SPY built its reputation as the default S\\u0026P 500 fund, but a structural quirk in how it was originally designed quietly costs long-term holders money every single year compared to a fund holding the exact same stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8286ecf0d7f8fdcf36763076b84789e585f1f2e8480cb3ef54ae7172c68f02fd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791933897,\"headline\":\"How much MSFT stock does Microsoft founder Bill Gates actually own?\",\"id\":142855326,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bill Gates has spent decades giving away his Microsoft fortune; we examine how much MSFT stock he still owns in 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f60355464b85e4e7a7619f723903dcd60344cf118ae798f590536360261e114d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791930780,\"headline\":\"Franklin Templeton CEO says AI is hiding a bigger tech story\",\"id\":142855327,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The $1.8 trillion money manager’s boss thinks investors may be crediting the wrong technology for today’s gains.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d7ed3bee94c38a60709d4e669c0ec386c32df9defc21054c492309d8c002a485\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791928168,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures: Stock Market Holds Up As Meta, AMD Lead Buys; ASML, CPI Inflation Due\",\"id\":142854337,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The stock market edged lower Tuesday but Meta and AMD led five buys. AI chip giant ASML and the CPI inflation report loom.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=28a1858c5f1ece6af8b138f7dc018780fdf80aaf62e87e999f8a25e3d9334cf0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791925835,\"headline\":\"How Early Taltz and Zepbound Biomarker Synergies At Eli Lilly (LLY) Have Changed Its Investment Story\",\"id\":142854308,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Eli Lilly recently reported exploratory Phase 3b data from the TOGETHER-PsO trial showing that combining Taltz with Zepbound in adults with moderate-to-severe plaque psoriasis and obesity or overweight altered far more immune and metabolic biomarkers than Taltz alone, with broader responses emerging as early as Week 12. The findings highlight a potential immunometabolic link between psoriasis and obesity, suggesting Lilly could unlock new treatment approaches by pairing its immunology and...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8f910a8d322aaff83d4aec5635894f4b73792284154ceb571de12260593cb0b6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791925257,\"headline\":\"Microsoft Reports $130 Billion in Data Center Leases\",\"id\":142854334,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft Corp. reported more than $130 billion in new data center leases in the past quarter, signaling an accelerating pace of spending on artificial intelligence infrastructure.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5d5e9ea24379bf4bd18c73f90458e93adf7ba5f60b937dfaa4c94379a9604126\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791924960,\"headline\":\"Microsoft Stock Reaches a Record High. How It Suddenly Became an AI Winner.\",\"id\":142855328,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street firms believe Microsoft is well positioned to boost revenue through its Azure cloud platform and its Copilot artificial-intelligence tool.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=681ced9367f092d9446beb09e43be1cf7b4cebb3080d4866f3d4b1a17c5ed9aa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791923706,\"headline\":\"Has IBM Stock Become A Different Bet?\",\"id\":142854339,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of IBM (IBM) currently trade at 19.9 times earnings, while the S\\u0026P 500 sits at 21.9. Investors buying at that multiple need to understand the underlying assets, and the company has recently changed its messaging. During the fiscal Q2 2025 call, executives focused on a running total of generative AI business that they defined as their book of business. The most recent presentation offered a different focal point. So what is management talking up instead.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7a60e94db7d4232b90f6724f2239f5bf44333ccb2643e04f5658315d3100a673\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791923368,\"headline\":\"What Is Adobe No Longer Telling You?\",\"id\":142854340,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Adobe (ADBE) stock is priced at 12.9 times earnings, compared to a 21.9 multiple for the S\\u0026P 500. Yet even at that valuation, investors need to understand exactly what they hold as corporate priorities shift. Just a year ago, executives highlighted how much of the company's subscription revenue was influenced by AI. They no longer emphasize that measure. So what does Adobe point to now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eeb6f4dde5f6817b278bc483feb73404e64ec1d7408c6466c4f0a1540a54379e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791920357,\"headline\":\"If Palantir Stock Looks Expensive, You Need To Read This\",\"id\":142854341,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Palantir Technologies (PLTR) currently trade at 137.7 times its adjusted earnings over the past twelve months, a metric that adds stock-based pay back after tax. Paying that multiple for a single year of profit appears steep, yet the valuation shifts when measured against the next two years. The following breakdown highlights what investors are actually paying for the profit Palantir is expected to generate over those two years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=06ea8f5a6ee2238f68a839074dcb871f45f01cc435ea7e418d6dd185a1b245ab\"}]"
     },
