      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792397221,\"headline\":\"Nebius Stock Has Fallen About 40% From Its Record. Here's Why I'm Still Waiting to Buy.\",\"id\":142998094,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Has the AI cloud specialist's stock finally fallen far enough to buy?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=38b918beea7024a41bab623d73682ac17b3196b4f310bf4b22e775b99ee40d89\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792396800,\"headline\":\"Reply Earns \\\"NVIDIA Physical AI Specialization\\\" for Production-Ready Robotics and Digital Twins\",\"id\":142998081,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"TURIN, Italy, October 19, 2026--Reply [EXM, STAR: REY] is among the first NVIDIA partners in the world to achieve the \\\"Physical AI Specialization\\\" within the NVIDIA Partner Network (NPN), in recognition of its expertise in developing and deploying AI-driven robotics and digital twin solutions for real-world operating environments. The specialization was awarded following a technical assessment covering a customer implementation, solution architecture, certified OpenUSD expertise and Reply’s deve\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6942a4981582beab86293c51e5392e9bf3775ff3d1afa76104e7e151c4b74f32\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792395961,\"headline\":\"A Micron Union in Taiwan Voted 99% to Authorize a Strike. Should You Sell the Stock?\",\"id\":142997610,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Workers at one of the memory maker's Taiwan sites voted 99% for a strike. How much supply might a walkout cost?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3f9f18b50e7823c23f0c687a982533777fbae77831ea9209d74a1c9cd11261cb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792392731,\"headline\":\"Microsoft Walks Away From Nscale’s UK Data Center as the Grid Runs Out of Power\",\"id\":142997609,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft (MSFT:NASDAQ) has pulled out of a planned AI data center in Loughton, Essex, that British cloud provider Nscale was building for it, Reuters reported on October 18, citing the Telegraph. Microsoft is one of Nscale’s two largest customers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77d9d8bfb9bee72de133f0d26ae9f7d6aa81123f76e39ea4a330dd955bb47c59\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792391363,\"headline\":\"Stocktwits Tech Watch: Netflix And Meta Report Earnings As Nvidia, Oracle Product Events Loom\",\"id\":142994993,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors are bracing for a busy week as Q3 earnings season enters key period.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1274b49925fcbd514117dddc5e4b133bcf658a84a1802f7b4e0a68cd5e6c68f0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792390800,\"headline\":\"If I Were Starting Over in the Stock Market, I'd Put $1,000 in Each of These 4 ETFs\",\"id\":142997611,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Start with a core portfolio tentpole and then build around it with above-average return potential.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5c9cf797dde9d166fab850229f77f6aa64b242f9794016bab5e1d7aa56f5b8fd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792387200,\"headline\":\"If I Could Only Own 1 Artificial Intelligence (AI) Stock Through the Next Bubble Scare, It Would Be This One\",\"id\":142993304,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Iren has multiple bullish catalysts, and most of the bearish concerns are actually bullish on a closer look.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4d9a938a09a81f7e6ee1a99cc4d0b52c833ca0e75c0927569809bc92ed67f522\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792385400,\"headline\":\"Warren Buffett Warned About Stock Valuations. So Why Is Berkshire Still Buying Stocks?\",\"id\":142993305,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Buffett warned about stock valuations in May, but Berkshire has been investing more aggressively since then.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0ca87ffce4abd4a8acf50ba996a0d0f2c2f502afd4bdc216d4e0983659994c47\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792384119,\"headline\":\"What Does BlackRock (BLK) Joining A $500 Billion AI Funding Push Mean?\",\"id\":142993306,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BlackRock (NYSE: BLK) is teaming up with Nvidia and other major financiers to build AI infrastructure financing platforms targeting over US$500b. The consortium plans to treat high end AI compute capacity as a distinct asset class aimed at large institutional investors. Credit desks at BlackRock and its peers are expected to play a central role in structuring these AI infrastructure funding vehicles. BlackRock’s move to co create US$500b AI infrastructure financing platforms with Nvidia is...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ad6b7bc20bcba49aeeb9e51f1b075ed96da868764e5bf187c7ffe2a75a58b7e1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792383600,\"headline\":\"Prediction: Amazon Stock Will Soar After Oct. 29\",\"id\":142993307,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon jumped after its Q2 report, and I expect a similar performance for the third quarter.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8b69def7e68853c334725234bf7dd16b9393022b4dee0bbda9f2dbd52e29a622\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792380611,\"headline\":\"Trump’s $330 Million White House Ballroom Donor List Reveals Nvidia, Apple and Google Among Top Tech Contributors: Report (UPDATED)\",\"id\":142992629,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Editor’s note: The story has been updated to include a comment from Nvidia. President Donald Trump’s White House ballroom project donor list reportedly reveals companies and individuals linked to federal contracts, policy decisions, and a presidential pardon. NVIDIA Corp. and...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=833bc80d9748fdde323eb686e9f8065372b20c6efd59e1202148bb04a26a5e57\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792380600,\"headline\":\"Intelligent Scopes Unveils the ISC 100: The Solution Enabling Urology AI to Work Beside Any Cystoscopy Tower — No Replacement, No Rewiring, No Cloud\",\"id\":142992143,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Compact edge platform brings ISC’s AI software to the point of care on NVIDIA Jetson; first software device, CystoSmart™, cleared in Brazil and SingaporeISC 100 by Intelligent Scopes Corp CystoSmart running on the ISC 100: Urology Al that works beside any cystoscopy tower SINGAPORE and SÃO PAULO and LONDON, Oct. 18, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Intelligent Scopes Corp (ISC), a subsidiary of Claritas HealthTech Ltd., today unveiled the ISC 100, a self-contained high-performance edge computing applian\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=76cfefcb87663a60888e8e94e22c4d8dd395bd4fb20dd8bea6c4d97f9731a106\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792378020,\"headline\":\"Asian stocks start week on back foot, tracking tech-led Wall St losses\",\"id\":142992144,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Asian stocks mostly fell Monday as traders tracked a tech-heavy selloff on Wall Street that was fuelled by growing worries over the AI investment boom.\\\"The US equity sell-off reflected a reassessment of the economics underpinning the AI investment boom rather than a simple downgrade to end-demand,\\\" said National Australia Bank's Rodrigo Catril.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=15eb4bff5e4b1922666d2fe714d2248a58af2c93c734cc56e336294fac9402e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792377084,\"headline\":\"CRWV, NBIS, IREN Bounce Overnight After Brutal Week — But Industry Execs Reportedly See Only A Few Neocloud Survivors\",\"id\":142992145,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Neocloud stocks rebound as investors weigh debt risks against AI infrastructure demand.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=63e2fab6b7c9cf8d1af845458ed51d196c8334cb64c1380fcec398905ab59c25\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792376400,\"headline\":\"If I Could Own Only 1 \\\"Magnificent Seven\\\" Stock for the Next 10 Years, It Would Be This One.\",\"id\":142992146,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"This business has so many dominant segments that support ongoing success.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c714e58b46a058386f6f5c8c805844025cea2e06fe584c7b8e932f7b5442f609\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792374806,\"headline\":\"What Would Stop The AI Selloff\",\"id\":142994131,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f81e56ca69a5fcfaacd77d3a9630d96359897268651205c32cb90015cce769d2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":179237