tage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave is pushing ahead with a large AI cloud buildout funded by heavy borrowing, including distressed bonds and complex insurance-linked capital, while also adding 240 MW of high-density capacity in India through AdaniConneX and NVIDIA Vera Rubin hardware. The combination of a US$50b debt load, rising credit default swap pricing and take or pay customer contracts is turning CoreWeave into a real time case study of how far debt funded AI infrastructure can stretch before lenders push...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=921d8b737a0500d6c08272bf2965287642ae8fa285e2ac8da73637d282fd8fda\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792214222,\"headline\":\"Could Shopify Stock Repeat Amazon's Run Since 2007?\",\"id\":142958771,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The e-commerce platform is about as big now as Amazon was in 2007. But does the stock give buyers the same room to grow?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c9f7a1c8769542a541064afb4f98d1f48eabb8436fc7d220dfdba49982660a8b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792210800,\"headline\":\"As AI Supercharges Hackers, Cybersecurity Stocks Split Into Platforms and Point Solutions\",\"id\":142958169,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI-powered hacking is forcing cybersecurity companies to pick a side.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=586407c273f5374ba783bf9d029a96354cd95f39a83f394b2d7f39310d815f4e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792207021,\"headline\":\"TSMC Says AI Chip Demand Is Still Far Above What It Can Supply. That's Why I'd Buy Nvidia Stock.\",\"id\":142957829,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The AI chip leader's stock trades around 9% under its record, even after its chipmaker boosted its forecast again.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=52ffab929266c3934842b1d4f87a7e7db87c12c528772c8b8bffd6e21d542aa9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792206600,\"headline\":\"GAMR Video Game ETF Momentum Continues Into Q4\",\"id\":142959020,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2186585249/image_2186585249.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The VettaFi Video Game Leaders Index gained nearly 1% in early October (through October 14), following a 10.7% return in Q3 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5bf14f22f7439c0096d4cf9d989b75e465c8148c4175d6d47c398090318ebbde\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792206181,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy Qualcomm Stock For Its Cash?\",\"id\":142957831,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the last twelve months, Qualcomm (QCOM) generated free cash flow equal to 5.5% of its market value. That outpaces the 4.4% yield for the median S\\u0026P 500 company. A yield above the median can mean a business that is either on sale or expected to shrink. Qualcomm's revenue fell in each of its last two quarters. So is that cash the sign of a business on sale, or of one that is shrinking.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5d97d563f196004769529b8a8a462a6f30d90e791071af12927b2fe71d204873\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792205205,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk’s Roadster, Nvidia’s Space AI Push, Nadella’s Security Warning: Mag 7 Voices This Week\",\"id\":142957830,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Elon Musk said Tesla’s long-awaited Roadster will enter production in 2028, though he has acknowledged that the car is unlikely to materially affect the company’s revenue.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a6168d913bbf8963671ca3b4041506abaf86c19aad935a92b69cdcc5e92c9e2e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792201139,\"headline\":\"Robotics Remains In Its ‘Lego Era,’ Says Former Nvidia Leader Turned VC as Physical AI Awaits Its ChatGPT Moment\",\"id\":142961093,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Humanoid-Robot-With-Visible-Ai-Neural-Ne.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Robotics remains in its Lego era as developers work to improve simulation, safety standards and hardware despite rising investment.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5912a49943b41eb68f736af61e6d3bd3094ccd83f6da90fdc287a3017191919d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792200301,\"headline\":\"Tesla’s Flying Roadster Has Wall Street Talking About SpaceX, Not Cars\",\"id\":142955135,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yes, it's a flying car, but it's really not for sale.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9f5169f7693b1947d49aa05f1f9411be43939a651f40ec2105a9e2c659aef0d5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792197000,\"headline\":\"The AI Supercycle, Asia, And Why This Time Is Different\",\"id\":142958070,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2209095196/image_2209095196.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The AI race is about more than who builds the best model. Click here to read more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=38742d1d5916af83c5350ce68f0ddd46c425ebcdfad5d8e9debba1de9eaf54f6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792195081,\"headline\":\"Warren Buffett Paid About $1.3 Billion for Berkshire's Coca-Cola Shares. They're Now Worth About $37 Billion.\",\"id\":142954171,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Can a buyer near today's record high expect anything like Berkshire's result?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b4f263143251f43bc18fc7ab3991e19b839212ccde0dece216f8d12ad0d67bba\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792193400,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave's not-so-secret weapons: Price hikes and an Nvidia trump card\",\"id\":142951496,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Michael Intrator, co-founder and CEO of CoreWeave SOPA Images/LightRocket via Getty Over the past week, neoclouds came under immense pressure driven by CoreWeave’s bond selloff. But the panic over CoreWeave will most likely prove premature: Neoclouds are well positioned to increase prices through at least 2028, and Nvidia’s support can calm investors in CoreWeave and potentially other neoclouds. Rising prices signal demand remains strong. They also mean that CoreWeave and other cloud operators c\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f67354cf9db7e6bd4f5b6e1e8f2639dafa21b1a2a6fd010326a140ad18aed526\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792193340,\"headline\":\"Prediction: Alphabet Will Be a Larger Company Than Apple by the End of 2027\",\"id\":142951497,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"If Alphabet keeps doing what it has been doing, it could claim the title of the world's second-largest company.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dff21cdd71a1021e2d7bbc55f3d41fe78fdffb41bda1c9e790f30bb28163a3e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792192695,\"headline\":\"Applied Materials (AMAT) Opened Its $5 Billion EPIC Center\",\"id\":142951498,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Applied Materials (NasdaqGS:AMAT) has expanded work with NVIDIA and other chipmakers to use AI tools in chip design and fabrication. The company has activated its EPIC Center, a US$5b process innovation facility focused on next generation semiconductor manufacturing. EPIC is intended as a hub for deeper partnerships between Applied Materials, industry peers and academic groups around AI era chip R\\u0026D. The NVIDIA collaboration and EPIC Center rollout sit alongside other shifts in Applied...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=68906b9d90c8ef0f0b81eac0678a513ec95de96b86bc1923eec6d1cd4054ab44\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792191840,\"headline\":\"1 Obvious Metric That Makes Nvidia a Top Stock to Buy Now\",\"id\":142951495,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The data center chipmaker is set to explode higher in the coming year.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c48d9b3eb1b8060eb167f5af5a0f65bf5d843bb5f719260e16246c1e35dcbeb2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792190367,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave stock plunges 12%, but Wall Street analyst says buy the dip\",\"id\":142951499,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave shares are headed for steep weekly losses as concerns over AI financing grow, but Wall Street sees an opportunity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c646944eb3aff79ae105151e1d180f2925f2e08dcb086cef56a956534cf3da87\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792190160,\"headline\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor Posts Record Q3 Results: Time to Buy the Dip?\",\"id\":142951501,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"With strong earnings momentum and a favorable growth outlook, TSM may be an attractive stock to consider following the recent market pullback.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=05c0647d23b323f4b13b3204299f611d6eb57e324c0e9a18dd0b9382e33ed6c9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792189500,\"headline\":\"Micron and Sandisk Have a History of Cyclicality. Is This Time Different?\",\"id\":142951500,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Micron and Sandisk are resetting the paradigm for the memory chip industry.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=24f91e14ff99b2eb07c3bb3df1e60d89fce058de923e0f5a2ebc476f217542c7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792188901,\"headline\":\"AI Debt Warning Signs Are Piling Up: Why Bond Markets Are Getting Nervous About AI Infrastructure Spending\",\"id\":142951502,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The AI build-out needs enormous amounts of borrowed money. Bond investors are getting more nervous about who will pay it back.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=453cedf1a424bc3023295f51dca97f0b003680102f54ff746b0e7709d5cefa61\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792187299,\"headline\":\"Here's How Many Shares of AbbVie You'd Need for $5,000 in Yearly Dividends\",\"id\":142950770,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"You'd need to invest over $200,000 in the pharma leader at its current price.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=05c78a41cc2ccbc2a2cc73d7aa3eb79ef51dfdb81223cb04b0ceaa6a9ff2e35f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792186980,\"headline\":\"Not Alphabet. Not Microsoft. This Is the Cloud Stock I'd Buy With $5,000 Right Now.\",\"id\":142950771,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle's cloud backlog has swelled to $664 billion, and the stock has pulled back. Here's why long-term investors may want to take a closer look.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4973c9150d7ec782eb02c031b24fa855ea2e437ec9c65b2ec3d74d4711f5faa8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792185900,\"headline\":\"Prediction: $1,000 Invested in Taiwan Semi (TSMC) Today Will Be Worth This Much by 2030.\",\"id\":142950766,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"An investment in TSMC today could easily triple in value over the next four years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=45cf95aa85b6bf142a5da067c064ed5cf2ee71ff367ca6787f927b9e9fe1301d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792185520,\"headline\":\"The Moment Jensen Huang Realized Nvidia 'Won't Have to Die' Came After a Call From This CEO: 'For the Whole Time, 30 Years…'\",\"id\":142961094,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Jensen-Huang-Nvidias-Founder--President-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang reveals how repeated calls and a personal letter to TSMC founder Morris Chang forged a decades-long partnership.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1e10cf403c338f6294260d60b1a647984d82a7730fee804a746bc89a7908f5c7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792184822,\"headline\":\"Inflation Rose to 3.7% in September. Is It Time to Sell the S\\u0026P 500?\",\"id\":142950767,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Should S\\u0026P 500 index fund owners change anything with inflation so hot?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0e3db50c8bfe554d4df38cc8081947513144cd5f7caee0cea9a0277efbbbfd6b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792184400,\"headline\":\"Airbnb's Brian Chesky barely writes one email a week — while Uber's CEO expects weekend replies\",\"id\":142950774,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"59% of workers contacted daily after hours report constant stress. Here's how top CEOs communicate.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=38f5c9872a364a79faec4fe07c7d27e3d5ba40ed2e4a9e73ce8594ad9b5cc876\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792184095,\"headline\":\"Update: Nasdaq Falls to End Four-Week Winning Streak Amid Tech Sell-Off\",\"id\":142950775,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"(Updates with market moves at the end of the day, and other changes, if any.) The Nasdaq Composit\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b61eb09fa533acc7c06e9bdfac5f27f1a4c0545ec3b68e4d3c126ea59190d8c7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792183785,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave Sharp Sell-Off About Cost of Funding, Not Demand, Analysts Say\",\"id\":142950772,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave's (CRWV) steep sell-off this week reflects investors repricing the cost of funding its AI\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=55f8f11365607c4d3584aed9d60f35afe371d2c905d24c92f97600543f10f542\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792183714,\"headline\":\"Ladder Capital Corp Q3 2026 Earnings Call Summary\",\"id\":142950768,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Moby summary of Ladder Capital Corp's Q3 2026 earnings call\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2f10a3f971be6663cde4f83f264601c240797a519ed3841bbc87f2c326fe7850\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792182000,\"headline\":\"Tough Trading Leaves Indices In The Red\",\"id\":142952846,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2191725662/image_2191725662.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Nasdaq loses 4% on the week. WTI crude settles over $101 per barrel. Inflation worries climb but FedWatch tool stays steady\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5922d94a3abed12c8a3406d8ca67edcda453c5c0dbf98dc4e8c91e66fad73146\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792181557,\"headline\":\"Dell Technologies (DELL) Lands Core AI Infrastructure Role In New Industrial Platform\",\"id\":142950776,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Dell Technologies (NYSE:DELL) has been selected as a core AI infrastructure partner for Honeywell's new Forge Cognition platform. Honeywell is working with Dell and NVIDIA to power Forge Cognition for building and industrial automation across data center and edge locations. Early pilots of Forge Cognition are running at major global facilities to apply agentic AI and digital twin tools to physical operations. Dell's role in Forge Cognition ties into broader themes our research has surfaced...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=89c5e0fd42aee585e520ba031ecf445dab130e7946791bbb7f5a2dbf84d9d829\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792181100,\"headline\":\"Prediction: Micron Could Turn $10,000 Into a Fortune by 2030\",\"id\":142950773,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The memory-chip maker has plenty of upside potential.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=460bf7a61972b9a9af68fbc5422e81da493095121488cc60cd874414ac4e71bf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179875,\"headline\":\"Crypto’s Gucci Tracksuit Era Is Giving Way to Suits and Stablecoins\",\"id\":142950769,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Heart's arrest is a signal the wild west of crypto may be coming to an end.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=95643254b112e33e14d43ada99917e5b65e9c03a4e554d15064eff0a60ee0874\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179840,\"headline\":\"Q3 Earnings Season Preview: Revenue Beats Lag, Multi-Sector Momentum Holds\",\"id\":142950777,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Q3 earnings season has started off a bit mixed, with the growth pace and the revenue-beat percentage tracking lower relative to the recent past. Results so far are heavily weighted to Finance, and these initial mixed trends may shift as we head into the heart of the earnings cycle.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=50cdc27926803ec58ffe2156658a02fb65fb3a3b752854e7091b5f8f65807dc7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179780,\"headline\":\"Warren Buffett's Berkshire Compounded at 19.7% a Year Between 1965 and 2025, Nearly Double the S\\u0026P 500's 10.5% Annual Return. Can Investors Still Apply That Playbook Today?\",\"id\":142949988,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"It's a tough act to follow for Greg Abel.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5d0ce1c95e471bd1fffad26403c4cf9a5a7818132a63ae3186971e3988af22f6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179435,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave, Nebius, and Neoclouds Sink as Market Fear Index Closes in on ‘Extreme Fear’\",\"id\":142949993,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave (CRWV) and Nebius Group (NBIS) are plunging as fears of an AI financing crisis spread across Wall Street. With CNN's Fear \\u0026 Greed Index approaching \\\"Extreme Fear,\\\" investors are questioning whether the neocloud business model can survive rising borrowing costs. In this episode, 24/7 Wall St.'s Eric Bleeker breaks down why CoreWeave and Nebius have fallen more than 20% since October 8, and whether the sell-off represents a buying opportunity or a warning of deeper problems ahead. CoreWeave's unsecured bonds recently reached a 15% yield, raising concerns about its massive debt burden and ability to finance future expansion. Investor Chamath Palihapitiya has warned of a potential AI private credit bubble, while Elon Musk responded with a simple \\\"Yikes.\\\" Despite these concerns, CoreWeave maintains a $104 billion revenue backlog, and NVIDIA (NVDA) CEO Jensen Huang has defended the company. Meanwhile, Cathie Wood's ARK Invest and Cantor Fitzgerald see opportunity in the sell-off. Eric examines Nebius' financing strategy, CoreWeave's soaring interest expenses, and why declining Treasury yields haven't stopped the bleeding. Are CoreWeave and Nebius bargain-priced AI investments, or is Wall Street uncovering a fundamental weakness in the neocloud business model?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3e1dd7d5aa52dad50d8ae42da26c552ed208b0e542829709be3fcb1896f6a8ef\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179266,\"headline\":\"Apple is Now the Top-Performing Magnificent 7 Stock in 2026. Here’s why it’s Beating NVIDIA, Tesla, and Amazon\",\"id\":142949982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple (NASDAQ: AAPL) has emerged as the best-performing Magnificent Seven stock of 2026, outperforming NVIDIA (NVDA), Microsoft (MSFT), Amazon (AMZN), Alphabet (GOOGL), Meta Platforms (META), and Tesla (TSLA). But what's driving Apple's surprising rally while other AI stocks struggle? In this episode, 24/7 Wall St.'s Eric Bleeker examines why Apple shares have surged more than 27% in 2026, even as concerns about artificial intelligence spending are weighing on some of the market's biggest technology companies. While competitors are committing hundreds of billions of dollars to AI data centers, Apple is taking a different approach. Its strategy emphasizes on-device artificial intelligence, privacy, and integrating AI directly into its ecosystem, avoiding much of the enormous infrastructure spending burden facing its rivals. Eric breaks down Apple's latest earnings, its massive share repurchase program, and why investors are increasingly rewarding the company's capital-efficient AI strategy. He also compares the Magnificent Seven's performance in 2026 against their remarkable returns since the beginning of 2023, revealing a very different picture of the AI investment boom. Has Apple become the market's ultimate AI safe-haven stock? And could its strategy continue outperforming NVIDIA and the rest of Big Tech?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f831231eaab13eb8aeb433db1cbbdbf1fe067161173a318013a30dfc63d8ee53\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792178150,\"headline\":\"Danaher (DHR) Teams Up To Bring AI Into Scientific Research Workflows\",\"id\":142949989,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NVDA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Danaher (NYSE:DHR) announced a new collaboration with NVIDIA to apply AI and accelerated computing across its scientific tools and workflows. The partnership focuses on embedding NVIDIA AI platforms into research instrumentation to support automation and data rich experimental processes. This move extends Danaher's recent push into AI enabled science, following its autonomous lab initiative at Abcam. The NVIDIA collaboration on AI enabled research sits against broader themes our work on...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6466d6491b083c5061bd3f30374e0548e88146a43ab68b01188d444967ffcb03\"}]"
     },
