     "cookies": [],
     "content": {
      "size": 147879,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792393788,\"headline\":\"Amazon.com And 2 Other Undervalued Stocks\",\"id\":142997133,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"China’s 4.5% third quarter growth, driven largely by exports tied to the AI boom, underlines how quickly capital can chase clear cash generators while leaving other solid businesses in the shadows. That gap between what a stock earns in hard cash and what the market is willing to pay can create rare bargains. This article highlights three companies where cash flows suggest more value than current prices imply. The three stocks below are just a small sample, with the full idea screen surfacing...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e7a17dae73f5c96c60a7a65f8969b572409d5f7aa5f34c163e9ab8ee978c34c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792383600,\"headline\":\"Prediction: Amazon Stock Will Soar After Oct. 29\",\"id\":142993307,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon jumped after its Q2 report, and I expect a similar performance for the third quarter.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8b69def7e68853c334725234bf7dd16b9393022b4dee0bbda9f2dbd52e29a622\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792380002,\"headline\":\"Amazon.com vs. Walmart: Which Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142992150,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon operates more as a tech company, while Walmart is more of a traditional retailer.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8b19d1717a0d909f6363222d686863c3f4fb2b1cff6f51dc036eeabdb9f7537c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792378020,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave, Oracle have an interest rate problem\",\"id\":142992151,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave and Oracle are borrowing billions for AI just as rates rise. See what the interest bills, bond yields and credit ratings reveal about the risk.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c17003935bf1124cabd573194be1f91c91ed2b180d26b06a704951188042e8b6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792374806,\"headline\":\"What Would Stop The AI Selloff\",\"id\":142994131,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f81e56ca69a5fcfaacd77d3a9630d96359897268651205c32cb90015cce769d2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792372140,\"headline\":\"How much Amazon stock does CEO Andy Jassy actually own?\",\"id\":142991217,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Andy Jassy rose through the ranks of Amazon to become CEO in 2021. Here’s how many shares he owns and how he accumulated the stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3d6ba59891643845fa7ec14cc904b4de3ad3adfc7ced63aefc992c6713d4c52e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792360102,\"headline\":\"Bonds Already Discounted A 3rd Hike, Stocks Have Followed, Stay Long\",\"id\":142991440,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2298720448/image_2298720448.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Stocks sold off sharply after inflation data and a delayed reaction to Social Security COLA news. Read more on the market here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f639953768fbbd69bdc4fa4baffb34746c56adb4a5f8894e3effe2572f294a4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792337515,\"headline\":\"UTES Vs. UTG: Why I Prefer The ETF As Rates Rise.\",\"id\":142988446,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1423987752/image_1423987752.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"UTES vs. UTG: compare total returns, rate resilience, and fees.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e61831d34030ae481e8eb85df48f4bd2c7200c325497ba845f3bc118b4a43bab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792334301,\"headline\":\"Amazon (AMZN) Is A Proven Capital Allocator. But Can it Pass Its $220 Billion Test?\",\"id\":142987424,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon.com, Inc. (NASDAQ:AMZN) has been flat during the last six months, as of October 15. This compares to a 21.5% return for the Insider Monkey Billionaire Index and 15.74% for the State Street SPDR S\\u0026P 500 ETF Trust. Amazon has a history of building businesses that eventually become valuable in their own right. AWS started […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6d5512142e8f774ce7ec04d0a2c6b5309839367273e6287db8788cd1370ab948\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792319941,\"headline\":\"2 Retail Stocks to Buy Before the Holiday Shopping Season\",\"id\":142986220,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Black Friday is around six weeks away. Which two retailers look worth owning before the rush?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1e2270f61245e1a5dee919fd217d62d610790904193d657283a334cb8bfcd1c8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792318307,\"headline\":\"3 Cash Flow Stocks To Watch In October 2026\",\"id\":142985479,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Inflation in the US just hit 3.7% in September, driven hard by energy costs, and that puts reliable cash generation in the spotlight. When prices for essentials feel jumpy, investors tend to care more about what money actually comes in the door rather than just headline stories. This article walks through three stocks that screen as attractively priced on future cash flows and explains why that matters for you now. The three stocks below are just a sample. The full cash flow screen surfaced...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4426b4cfdc3e8ca9cab9314c511bda73d20d05614c496b90d220e747bd179ab4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792310401,\"headline\":\"Always on, always listening: New AI devices are pushing legal limits and could put users in jeopardy\",\"id\":142987859,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108359190-1788549720120-gettyimages-2293551294-6k4a4846_8nlxjv2u.jpeg?v=1788549853\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"AI always-listening wearables from Apple, Amazon, Meta and other startups are getting creative with privacy rules and fueling concerns about covert recordings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7e2b0937b27bee019f942ad8c025e6800b66f24381cab2d9911dcc1076244abd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792303200,\"headline\":\"AI Investment Impact Understated In U.S. 'It' Market: Texas Reveals\",\"id\":142984221,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/913582626/image_913582626.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Texas leads the AI infrastructure boom with data centers and chips boosting GDP and jobs. Check out this look at the tech sector and its prospects.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=03fd4bc2999d901f5bc2e52183f24910137f24e6e0bdaed3e6c5c60e0fd0eeab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792278819,\"headline\":\"Amazon.com (AMZN) Received An FDA Warning Over Unapproved STI Drug Listings\",\"id\":142964296,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On 15 October 2026, Amazon.com (NasdaqGS:AMZN) received an FDA warning letter over unapproved drug products for sexually transmitted infections. The FDA cited multiple marketplace listings that it says were marketed as treatments or cures without required drug approvals. Regulators warned that continued sale of these items could trigger product seizures or injunctions if Amazon does not correct the issues. The FDA warning over unapproved STI treatments is important, but should sit alongside...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4fab5b29e55cda6db90ed65aa2008bf7eca391442a5226e0c97ac8719b586924\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792262820,\"headline\":\"Should you Buy Amazon Stock Before October 29? History Has a Clear Answer.\",\"id\":142963193,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon releases its third-quarter 2026 earnings on that day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c98b0b0deb299418c06b083375294a1579ee705dab2a479bc07d7b5c9ce840f2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792259814,\"headline\":\"Discount grocery chain closing all stores as bargain grocers struggle\",\"id\":142962600,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Best Bargains has entered a Chapter-7 bankruptcy style receivership and its not alone in closing locations.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c92b0ec586b198d340fba90990d47fcae50d8995f1f9da9129b96e5b8b147a62\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792258298,\"headline\":\"Level Up Your Life In 2026 | Shaan Puri\",\"id\":142963205,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"*Want the 4 money rules that changed my life? Get it here:* https://clickhubspot.com/rfjEpisode 783: Shaan Puri ( ⁠https://x.com/ShaanVP⁠ ) gets interviewed by his former intern about quitting a $120K/yr job in his 20s to become strategically broke and the other counter-intuitive decisions that made him successful. Show Notes:(0:00) Intro(1:56) Quitting a $120k job to be broke and live with 3 friends (Don’t linger on bad decisions)(10:26) Fear is what holds people back more so than anything else(13:17) How to get what you (actually) want.(16:37) Most people are not serious(28:21) Who is the most important voice in your life?(34:05) Why I decided to sell my company to Twitch \\u0026 Amazon.(40:18) The biggest waste of time is doing something that needn’t been done at all (Elon)(41:52) “You can’t run an A/B test on life” (Act Accordingly)(52:37) There are no bonus points for making things harder for yourself (location)(58:23) The best people are 'down' (Buffett)—Links:• The Biography Podcast - https://www.youtube.com/@thebiographypod —Check Out Sam's Stuff:• Hampton (joinhampton.com): My community for founders. Average member does $25m/year. Many of the guests are members. Get after it...apply: http://joinhampton.com/mfm—Check Out Shaan's Stuff:• Shaan's weekly email - https://www.shaanpuri.com • Visit https://www.somewhere.com/mfm to hire worldwide talent like Shaan and get $500 off for being an MFM listener. Hire developers, assistants, marketing pros, sales teams and more for 80% less than US equivalents.• Mercury - Need a bank for your company? Go check out Mercury (mercury.com). Shaan uses it for all of his companies!Mercury is a financial technology company, not an FDIC-insured bank. Banking services provided by Choice Financial Group, Column, N.A., and Evolve Bank \\u0026 Trust, Members FDIC• I run all my newsletters on Beehiiv and you should too + we're giving away $10k to our favorite newsletter, check it out:beehiiv.com/mfm-challengeMy First Million is a HubSpot Original Podcast // Brought to you by HubSpot Media // Production by Arie Desormeaux // Editing by Ezra Bakker Trupiano /\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3a61d239e11e7d14344bc867f216691d1879c37b9804870835f1272570407bec\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792257771,\"headline\":\"Twenty Hours a Week at an Amazon Warehouse for Health Insurance at 60? Here Is the Math a Retired Paralegal Will Run\",\"id\":142962599,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A 60-year-old paralegal with $350,000 saved and five years until Medicare faces a decision that could quietly reshape her entire retirement, and the answer turns on a warehouse job that pays less than half what she used to earn.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3d1f74d7ccf641e5a3f0aba92111c3e3f91685f7431a8066e41d96d90670ff8a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792255923,\"headline\":\"Pinterest Stock Is Down 18% This Year. Buy, Sell or Hold?\",\"id\":142983604,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysPinterest stock is down 17. 5% this year at $21.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=309b2394259d7824f2a14eda87adab35f8282ac3261b2d748795b3ecb3ff381d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792247498,\"headline\":\"Ring founder Jamie Siminoff: 'I still have my email on every box' — here's why\",\"id\":142961948,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ring's Jamie Siminoff says not having his email on the box isn't an option.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d6657391624f36ac4713a719210890a5bfcca85bca325939620d08e333b65c4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792237451,\"headline\":\"BofA Warns AI Investors Could Lose Even If the Technology Works\",\"id\":142959982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America just invoked the ghost of the 1990s fiber optic collapse to explain why AI's biggest winners could still leave investors with nothing, even if the technology reshapes the world exactly as promised.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a4b2445fe3477280ba24144fe07b88715c87dc437e74e18d377a33b9c0cd50d6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792234800,\"headline\":\"MarketBeat Week in Review – 10/12 - 10/16\",\"id\":142986233,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech stocks fell on inflation fears and AI infrastructure concerns while the Dow rose, as MarketBeat analysts review earnings outlooks, sector rotation, and stock picks from the week's top stories.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=568e63e4c6d4bd104d2b5f3477ca384696dd07bd8f515a2913346504239748cc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792226700,\"headline\":\"The Correction Is Healthy; The Next Move Is Yours\",\"id\":142960363,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2291479836/image_2291479836.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The article analyzes recent corrections in AI and suggests being highly selective on U.S. equities amid macro uncertainty. Click to read more details.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=17bd471ebe532927fd54ba02b3174315468a676bb8365e8c83c5e1ee26657da6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792214222,\"headline\":\"Could Shopify Stock Repeat Amazon's Run Since 2007?\",\"id\":142958771,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The e-commerce platform is about as big now as Amazon was in 2007. But does the stock give buyers the same room to grow?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c9f7a1c8769542a541064afb4f98d1f48eabb8436fc7d220dfdba49982660a8b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792205436,\"headline\":\"Why You Should Think About Palantir Differently Now\",\"id\":142957833,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Palantir Technologies (PLTR) stock trades at 78.2 times sales, compared to 3.1 for the S\\u0026P 500. Investors paying that premium need to know exactly what they are buying, and the case Palantir makes has evolved. During the fiscal Q3 2024 earnings call, executives highlighted the fast-growing number of U.S. businesses signing on as customers. By the latest call in fiscal Q2 2026, the focus had shifted. So what does management talk up now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8955bf2fa5497edc3de33641e5dbc142262fc3cc80628d15432815560870baa4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792205205,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk’s Roadster, Nvidia’s Space AI Push, Nadella’s Security Warning: Mag 7 Voices This Week\",\"id\":142957830,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Elon Musk said Tesla’s long-awaited Roadster will enter production in 2028, though he has acknowledged that the car is unlikely to materially affect the company’s revenue.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a6168d913bbf8963671ca3b4041506abaf86c19aad935a92b69cdcc5e92c9e2e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792203588,\"headline\":\"Can Trade Desk Stock Bounce Off Its Old Support Again?\",\"id\":142957837,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors holding Trade Desk (TTD) have seen the stock lose 74.1% of its value over the past year, compared with a 17.9% return for the S\\u0026P 500. The immediate question is how much further shares might drop. One certainty is the current level: at $13.13 on October 15, the stock sits above the prices where it turned and rallied three times in 2018. How did the stock fare at this price then, and how has it fared in 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=71cf5d711ba3ba1bcbbf6c79f1f0a241d3a628524717e03107fe3ae492d959bc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792199406,\"headline\":\"UK Watchdog Proposes Strategic Market Tag for Microsoft, Puts Excel and Copilot AI Under Competition Scrutiny\",\"id\":142960644,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Madrid--Spain-05-15-2025-Close-up-Of-Lap.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The U.K.\\u0026#39;s competition regulator has proposed designating Microsoft as having a Strategic Market Status (SMS).\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2db6e325d956f17f2ea32e7621fce9621ab539e987f5dfdcb065e87bb93b602a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792197000,\"headline\":\"The AI Supercycle, Asia, And Why This Time Is Different\",\"id\":142958070,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2209095196/image_2209095196.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The AI race is about more than who builds the best model. Click here to read more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=38742d1d5916af83c5350ce68f0ddd46c425ebcdfad5d8e9debba1de9eaf54f6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792196489,\"headline\":\"Should You Pick Walmart Stock Over Its Competitors?\",\"id\":142953914,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart (WMT) stock trades at 42.5 times earnings. Among the six retailers in its peer group, only Costco Wholesale is priced higher. Walmart ranks lower on business performance than on price. Over the latest four fiscal quarters, Walmart sits third out of six on revenue growth and fourth on operating margin. So how does Walmart's price look beside the rival that grows fastest.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=328d5a8c17fd1df2c3c22ac9ef81688ac17e27d6e362a1d20b16def1d23772d9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792195200,\"headline\":\"AI Is Now the Top Reason for Layoffs. For Some Workers, It’s Also a Path to Starting a Business.\",\"id\":142958774,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The tools taking jobs may also be the best way to build a business of your own.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bf5b818af2e9b3f9f7030f8302f8228b420816276a605f34f96395cae56e2229\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792187050,\"headline\":\"The Dealmaking 3: DoorDash \\u0026 Australian Open, AEG \\u0026 NFL/AWS\",\"id\":142951519,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"This week of The Dealmaking 3 with “The Sports Professor” Rick Horrow features DoorDash, Inc. (Nasdaq: DASH) partnering with the Australian Open starting in 2027 and combining venue branding with food delivery at the Golden Hour Bar, AEG bringing Fundamental’s AI technology to LA Galaxy and L.A. LIVE pairing enterprise AI adoption with sponsorship rights, and […] The post The Dealmaking 3: DoorDash \\u0026 Australian Open, AEG \\u0026 NFL/AWS appeared first on CorpGov.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ef1c627ae2d556c5ebd12ad2c650bf8211be83b38ac38cac6ca12745822893ad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792184820,\"headline\":\"This is the Cheapest Mag 7 Stock Right Now\",\"id\":142951517,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Mag 7 is back. Several of the stocks are hitting new highs but there are still deals.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d47c4473ccaa3d5c01009cab96d98d9228e66494094fd44fe3410b0702fd9bb9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792184095,\"headline\":\"Update: Nasdaq Falls to End Four-Week Winning Streak Amid Tech Sell-Off\",\"id\":142950775,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"(Updates with market moves at the end of the day, and other changes, if any.) The Nasdaq Composit\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b61eb09fa533acc7c06e9bdfac5f27f1a4c0545ec3b68e4d3c126ea59190d8c7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792182180,\"headline\":\"Blue Origin’s Latest Move Shows How It’s Quietly Taking On SpaceX\",\"id\":142950789,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Jeff Bezos’ Blue Origin is expanding rocket production in Florida as it works to challenge SpaceX’s launch business.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=524b93a2d6ecf7bf17ce181b8b1c0e7dd9b6f80f7f7a582a209b2121fdfb0164\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179266,\"headline\":\"Apple is Now the Top-Performing Magnificent 7 Stock in 2026. Here’s why it’s Beating NVIDIA, Tesla, and Amazon\",\"id\":142949982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple (NASDAQ: AAPL) has emerged as the best-performing Magnificent Seven stock of 2026, outperforming NVIDIA (NVDA), Microsoft (MSFT), Amazon (AMZN), Alphabet (GOOGL), Meta Platforms (META), and Tesla (TSLA). But what's driving Apple's surprising rally while other AI stocks struggle? In this episode, 24/7 Wall St.'s Eric Bleeker examines why Apple shares have surged more than 27% in 2026, even as concerns about artificial intelligence spending are weighing on some of the market's biggest technology companies. While competitors are committing hundreds of billions of dollars to AI data centers, Apple is taking a different approach. Its strategy emphasizes on-device artificial intelligence, privacy, and integrating AI directly into its ecosystem, avoiding much of the enormous infrastructure spending burden facing its rivals. Eric breaks down Apple's latest earnings, its massive share repurchase program, and why investors are increasingly rewarding the company's capital-efficient AI strategy. He also compares the Magnificent Seven's performance in 2026 against their remarkable returns since the beginning of 2023, revealing a very different picture of the AI investment boom. Has Apple become the market's ultimate AI safe-haven stock? And could its strategy continue outperforming NVIDIA and the rest of Big Tech?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f831231eaab13eb8aeb433db1cbbdbf1fe067161173a318013a30dfc63d8ee53\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792177878,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Losers: GOOGL, CRM, MSFT, AMZN, CSCO in Today's US Session\",\"id\":142959213,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Dow Jones decliners in today's US session: Alphabet, Salesforce, Microsoft, Amazon, and Cisco fell, with GOOGL down 2.76% and CRM down 2.59%.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9bf954ed3d68f0415a8a21c3fb37453861ad6deccaac5526628104a7171ae838\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173466,\"headline\":\"'Anthropic quietly pitches its own AI safety bill to lawmakers'- Politico\",\"id\":142960645,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/16/anthropic-ai-safety-01124654\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9ada1028a5500b528478b7f4287eb30b696512ff26cd3fb3c8acb3be05bb3ffc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173460,\"headline\":\"Equity Indexes Slide Intraday Amid Tech Sell-Off\",\"id\":142950016,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"US benchmark equity indexes slid intraday as several major technology names sold off. The Nasdaq\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=29d4097f4b5eaad4bf8a0f925ae3ffff98d666fc8bfa96a7a4e407a5cf701c06\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792172700,\"headline\":\"Amazon's $70 screenless fitness band improves physical and mental health\",\"id\":142949037,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"It can track your heart rate, sleep, and other health goals.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8eb3835791e6667a1f395ff16824ec1e4035548c2cc856928a516267c8ff4958\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792172535,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Tech Stocks Fall Friday Afternoon\",\"id\":142949038,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech stocks were lower Friday afternoon, with the State Street Technology Select Sector SPDR ETF (XL\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=081334083fa9581ad9c3e3843e1d046f909af74b34f8b26e693d69ee3fb5c8ea\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792171800,\"headline\":\"Amazon Is 11% Below Its High Heading Into Earnings on Oct. 29. Here's the 1 Number That Will Decide What Happens Next.\",\"id\":142948998,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"All eyes will be on AWS' year-over-year growth rate.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0496b424b4fd84863059aaa1d83f771a4bbac12a08c379f71b528b6d7c4e2059\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792171020,\"headline\":\"Pet store chain closures grow, as PetSmart shutters locations\",\"id\":142949041,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The pet store chain adjusts to the growth of e-commerce, autoship, and same-day delivery platforms.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2a8a260b825566160fd7353a790214ba8ee2dad5745af27ba4a02bb6a6b43aca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170959,\"headline\":\"Meta: What You Need To Know Before Earnings\",\"id\":142950624,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2188389148/image_2188389148.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms (META) earnings next Wednesday: growth outlook vs heavy investment spending and slim free cash flow. Read the latest analysis on the stock here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a4040a1400e6e16fd5855c297de9a90465442ee86871d4ebfc3f80d55ad30862\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170388,\"headline\":\"The Next Stock Market Crash Could Start With Just 3 Companies\",\"id\":142948989,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Just three companies now account for approximately 21% of the S\\u0026P 500's total market capitalization. NVIDIA (NVDA), Apple (AAPL), and Microsoft (MSFT) have become so dominant that their performance could determine the direction of the entire stock market. But what happens if these technology giants stumble? In this episode, 24/7 Wall St. co-founder Doug McIntyre and senior writer Lee Jackson discuss the extraordinary concentration of the S\\u0026P 500 and why millions of investors may be taking on more risk than they realize. Much of today's market enthusiasm is driven by artificial intelligence. Companies like NVIDIA, Microsoft, Alphabet (GOOGL), Amazon (AMZN), and Meta Platforms (META) have benefited from enormous expectations for AI growth. But Doug and Lee identify several potential threats to that optimism. They explore how cheaper open-source AI models could challenge industry leaders, why opposition to AI data center construction threatens expansion plans, and how growing electricity demand is driving renewed interest in nuclear power. Most importantly, they discuss what could happen to popular index funds like the SPDR S\\u0026P 500 ETF (SPY) if the market's largest technology stocks suffer a major sell-off. They also examine whether equal-weight S\\u0026P 500 funds could provide investors with better diversification. Is your S\\u0026P 500 investment more vulnerable than you think?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ab98f35bc89dbdfbba2d5bb3c55f635e436e1332b1ab7a49092a897f1a8ae3f7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169134,\"headline\":\"Alphabet’s Cloud Surge and AI Dominance Overshadow Capex Fears and Keep Me Buying\",\"id\":142949033,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street keeps punishing Alphabet for its spending, but the cloud and AI numbers tell a completely different story about where this company is heading.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=79cadcad1debcd1a0fe7cc7742f24db86c41242792616e0b2e9e41dbea4fea74\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168316,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave Rides Rollercoaster Despite ARK's Wood, Nvidia Support\",\"id\":142948996,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave stock fell again Friday despite Cathie Wood's ARK Investment Management buying shares in the under-pressure, AI stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e5b5d69ddeb9872541281741702b2cde858a543b5e4fdb569f3b65ab592c9769\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167660,\"headline\":\"Why Fox Can Finally Breathe a Sigh of Relief With the Roku Deal—and Why the NFL Can’t\",\"id\":142949021,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Fox’s acquisition gives the media titan a way to deliver its programming directly to views, a huge plus for its Sunday NFL games.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f80eb47cadd807f125a1b361bc27f5c5a5d8a15516c88adc9c5e5172f66b1199\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167480,\"headline\":\"Big Tech Earnings Suddenly Matter for the Bond Market\",\"id\":142949022,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Falling Treasury yields suggest growing concern about the AI boom, putting pressure on Big Tech’s coming earnings reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5f18c901a76fa366ab22d6cd3ce50431f7996cafba44d6ba35446f24bc6e76c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166047,\"headline\":\"Does The Move In Snowflake Stock Change Anything?\",\"id\":142949036,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Snowflake (SNOW) stock rose 59.3% from January 18 to October 15, 2026, against 12.5% for the S\\u0026P 500. The company reported quarterly results three times along the way, on February 25, May 27 and September 2. Buyers appear to be betting that customers using AI on Snowflake's data platform will keep its sales growth climbing while its losses shrink. So how much faster is Snowflake growing than it was in January.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fbd14ade6214cff0bbe86e260a9fd8d09e3391e0aa545d56f49dfb17e0b1f19f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792165407,\"headline\":\"What Is The Biggest Threat To Microsoft Stock?\",\"id\":142949023,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Buyers are paying for growth, and Microsoft (MSFT) is delivering it. The stock returned 37.2% between July 17 and October 15, 2026, against 4.1% for the S\\u0026P 500. Revenue climbed 17.7% in fiscal Q4 2026 from a year earlier. Yet on a July 29 earnings call, executives described a cost to that growth that is still rising. What is that cost, and who is raising it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=42d7abc2a9bb8e2f782d69ddbea13cf4f72d18dd4d868def556145e1f6ea4c86\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792165020,\"headline\":\"2 Tech Stocks to Buy Now and Hold for a Decade (Hint: 1 Isn't in the AI Trade)\",\"id\":142947887,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech is the driving force behind these two e-commerce conglomerates, but only one can be called an AI company.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0e68e83d98f1f8fd80fd1e3b052decd172e6e660a942e22d4358c9723b2c98fb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792164817,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave Stock Rally Fizzles Despite ARK's Wood, Nvidia Support\",\"id\":142947879,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave stock fell again Friday despite Cathie Wood's ARK Investment Management buying shares in the under-pressure, AI stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1619562f1180873593fbb3717a13b0494287cca8f86fcfccbdc7f16f04169617\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161792,\"headline\":\"AI infrastructure stocks sell off, but the data center boom rolls on\",\"id\":142947892,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi and EMJ Capital Founder and President Eric Jackson examine the disconnect between Wall Street's sell-off in AI infrastructure stocks and the construction boom unfolding on the ground. Using Hut 8's (HUT) Louisiana data center project as an example.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0356c9838bfa23e5845467709f9a7a09e80f4789f51573bce5343a0ea2ff55af\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792160010,\"headline\":\"Tesla Roadster Debut, Tech Sell-Off, and a college alternative for entrepreneurship\",\"id\":142947913,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi digs in to the Tesla (TSLA) Roadster debut and all the \\\"cool\\\" tricks from the SpaceX (SPCX) event Thursday. Sozzi sits down with Eric Jackson, EMJ Capital Founder and President, plus Gagan Biyani, CEO of The Horowitz Andreessen Academy to discuss alternatives to college.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=375d5eeb022588101a13b427d3212e43fbadf939a397e45738e79232bea867f4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159222,\"headline\":\"Amazon Unveils Two Bee-Branded Hardware Devices Powered by AI\",\"id\":142947912,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Amazon StockPrice change for Amazon stock in last 6 months: 2%$AMZN Stock Price as of Oct. 15: $25552-Week High: $287$AMZN Stock Price Target: $331What Happened?Amazon (AMZN:NASDAQ) unveiled two new AI devices on Thursday under the Bee brand it bought last year.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=251a203fa168b1dc0d605d7d1f858984d327014fa543286844a386564c365727\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792158600,\"headline\":\"Anthropic Might Be Worth ‘Only’ $1.5 Trillion. Why It Isn’t a Disaster for the AI Trade.\",\"id\":142947908,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI stocks have been hit by worries about Anthropic's IPO but it isn't all bad news.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c5435f7f9da4f120c0ff2d4dda20ce408c7d56366267155164de5fdf368b1781\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792157901,\"headline\":\"How Much Of Apple Stock Rides On One Product?\",\"id\":142945981,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors in Apple (AAPL) know the iPhone drives the business, but its sheer scale remains striking. The company generated $54.3 billion from iPhone sales during fiscal Q3 2026, the June quarter. That figure accounted for roughly half of its total $109.4 billion in revenue. Furthermore, iPhone sales climbed 22% from a year earlier. This outpaced the overall company, which grew 16%. So what has been pushing iPhone sales up this fast.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9c6a7b93cb149358c00aabc16ed9037ecde38c812d559b4bd8e623985fce2ee4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792157134,\"headline\":\"How Bad Would Outspending Its Cash Flow Be For Meta Stock?\",\"id\":142945514,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms (META) expects capital spending of $130 billion to $145 billion in 2026. The company raised the bottom of that range from $125 billion in July. Executives plan to secure as much capacity as possible across 2026 and 2027, though they have not yet provided a spending figure for 2027. They also noted that strong operating cash flow puts Meta in a position to fund the build. So how close is Meta to spending more than it brings in.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e573bdbff52651c287e6afec73c96903be3dec5dc783f99261c1d11a62406b87\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792156103,\"headline\":\"Nancy Pelosi and Trump Like This Top AI Stock\",\"id\":142945520,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon.com (NASDAQ:AMZN) ranks second on our list of President Trump and Nancy Pelosi Portfolio: Top 4 Picks. Many elite money managers and billionaires were also piling into the stock earlier this year. Bill Ackman’s Pershing Square wrote about Amazon in its second-quarter letter, and we covered the two stocks that Nancy Pelosi and Bill Ackman […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=44bb21b87ed9eddc603f9cf4188551fe8c033bda8174cab9242ba1846d857213\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155050,\"headline\":\"Who’s Really Paying for the AI Boom? The Bond Market Is Starting to Ask\",\"id\":142945453,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bond investors are quietly repricing the debt that funds AI's massive buildout, and some of the numbers coming out of quarterly filings suggest the easy money phase may already be over.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d4e8b305896f41e46b077238a45a75a2d3062a91e2fa8fd9a96e90766f50b89e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154756,\"headline\":\"Amazon Ads: The E-Commerce Search Monolith vs. Walmart Connect: The In-Store Data Goldmine\",\"id\":142945521,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon and Walmart both run booming ad businesses, but they are selling completely different things to advertisers and the gap between them is widening fast. Which model survives the next wave of retail competition?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=85c41d04f1047b34a444a903bc516b01f848b6209e37d3690882465d16442eb6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154736,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Agrees on Amazon and Can’t Agree on Tesla. The Targets Show Why\",\"id\":142945522,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Analysts have nearly united behind one mega-cap while remaining deeply split on the other, and the price targets reveal exactly why these two stocks belong in completely different conversations.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eb960e8c6c8b91492bb10227fe4b1968c39fa9b979da23fc86c5705d9721b807\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154690,\"headline\":\"Why Is U.S. Bancorp Stock Gaining Friday?\",\"id\":142960682,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Richfield--Mnusa---June-21--2014-Us-Bank.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"D.A. Davidson analyst Peter J. Winter expects U.S. Bancorp’s net interest income to grow 6% in 2026 and maintains a Buy rating with a $73 price target.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ac70ded998415ccd767cb4745cf1462bad2020ace92a6976b834c9747d4906c7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792153447,\"headline\":\"Some Anthropic Investors Now See a $1.5 Trillion IPO, Not $2 Trillion\",\"id\":142945527,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Anthropic's November IPO is reshaping what Amazon and Alphabet investors expect to see on their balance sheets, and the gap between what investors hoped for and what they now discuss hints at a bigger story about whether AI growth is living up to its hype.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77328aacba9df70654ea6f10806f5f8a349535e5d6818048a5bb9994d77f04b5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792153440,\"headline\":\"Is Amazon Stock Poised to Gain as AI Boosts Cash Flow Prospects?\",\"id\":142945516,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AMZN's AI products, surging AWS sales and multibillion-dollar chip commitments can boost future cash flow, but rising capex and capacity constraints pose challenges.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30f94ee678b0fd2b24e116088be02237c338a2dc350167dbce779e6ed40aa09f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":