Which entry turned $1,000 into nearly $6,000, and which one left buyers underwater despite years of patience?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=54a53e9510795e2a973309a0803f7e1069c6bd7c4224bacf48edc3e4332453c4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792151220,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy, Sell or Hold MELI Stock at a P/S Valuation of 1.83X?\",\"id\":142945524,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"MercadoLibre trades at a 1.83 P/S multiple, below its historical median, as strong e-commerce and fintech growth faces margin pressures and credit risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f88dce39709209b3d1cbbf0cc59c52a306bbc5f54659e8ed7261449694dcf650\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792148400,\"headline\":\"As Robotaxis Spread, Carmakers Must Choose Between Owning the Customer and Selling the Car\",\"id\":142944193,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Will robotaxis dominate transportation in the future, or will individual consumers demand to own their own vehicles?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=23101597e7efe01bec4486085545076f9ef68de290b5ee64da708c6763f5a741\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792147998,\"headline\":\"Amazon’s New Bee Wearables Come With a $12 Subscription. Here’s Why the Fee Barely Matters\",\"id\":142944194,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon. com (AMZN:NASDAQ) started selling its $75 Bee Frontier bracelet on Thursday, October 15, and showed a $100 Bee Eclipse that snaps magnetically onto the back of a smartphone.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5962ef65cc06e70562a216da9e7a2eacd0e8de244c53dcdf945db9d32ea22d70\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792146511,\"headline\":\"The way our