 15, 'DeepSeek offers user refunds after suffering another major outage' - SCMP\",\"id\":142945939,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.scmp.com/tech/big-tech/article/3371047/deepseek-offers-user-refunds-after-suffering-another-major-outage\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5a5b0654d480179a2428e4a5d44e4a6e000243f741690cb0455bc91036ed5847\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792140554,\"headline\":\"Nvidia: Jensen Can't Spend His Way Out Of This One\",\"id\":142944971,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1472301119/image_1472301119.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia stock faces rising AI chip competition as Microsoft Maia 300 and Huawei gain share; Gartner warns neocloud risks. Click for this NVDA update.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=81e929aab30faae972416ea164cc0066ca65de4b6c25a80c3e467825e0cf1254\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792134800,\"headline\":\"What Amazon.com (AMZN)'s AI Shopping Bot Block Means For Shareholders\",\"id\":142936006,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon.com has blocked AI shopping agents such as Elon Musk's Grok Bot and Meta's Muse from placing orders, citing violations of its platform terms and reinforcing its control over automated access to its marketplace. This clampdown highlights a core business trade off for Amazon.com between protecting data, fees and customer relationships and allowing third party AI agents to automate shopping on top of its retail infrastructure. This section now looks at how Amazon.com's broader investment...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=10bab8120524eef79ec7a1efd18b715c8ae77fc8fb01e22785c5c991e05f331a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792130813,\"headline\":\"Blue Origin SVP Says Company Is Targeting Multiple