img.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Corning is expanding rapidly into AI infrastructure and solar while targeting $40 billion in revenue by 2030. Honeywell Technologies is a newly focused automation company executing steadily after its aerospace spinoff.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9fe679cd4faf8c56dad27389c5671cb0c4ed58db9400c9aee95b28336db92160\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792095420,\"headline\":\"Amazon’s Reinvestment Model Is Dave Ellison’s Market Playbook\",\"id\":142922222,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Hennessy Funds portfolio manager Dave Ellison sees healthy bank credit as support for the economy, but his stock-selection test centers on whether companies are spending profits to build their next business.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=052474783cdb442cd2189363ff454d33ccadf1e6cd524479ee5c35f37e4365b3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792093920,\"headline\":\"Amazon’s New Devices Show Push to Avoid Getting Shut Out of Personal AI\",\"id\":142922223,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon is launching two new personal AI products alongside Bee, an AI hardware company it acquired in June 2025.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6f20c1bff68155561ba030183cda07ea5ce12ba5884349deb96fa08e99d1a712\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792093698,\"headline\":\"These Consumer Stocks Are Getting a Lift as Investors Rotate Out of Tech\",\"id\":142922224,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Some beaten-down consumer names are getting a boost as investors pull back from tech stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1b90389409d496dcbfedd82b3f1231a66ec9b755d2ebe8e5724fc573338f0b54\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792092841,\"headline\":\"These 2 Stocks Have Run Circles Around the Magnificent Seven This Year, and Wall Street Says There Is More Upside Ahead\",\"id\":142921306,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Innovation pays off.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=423a910da1e18e0cf9ae9a1bda7a373012ba8db302e228d6a9de79a43f79a63b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792092669,\"headline\":\"Michael Dell Loses Title of World’s Fourth Richest Person After $36 Billion Drop in Net Worth in Two Days\",\"id\":142921341,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CEO of Dell Technologies Michael Dell is no longer the fourth richest person in the world, dropping two whole spots after a massive dip in his net worth this week. The decline started on Wednesday, October 15, after a Barclays analyst downgraded Dell company stock from overweight to equal-weight, per Forbes. The $20 billion drop […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f3e9b2fbcf581226f98e9929692d04c6337386d847a4ff806c26b26480751a9a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792092273,\"headline\":\"What Changed In eBay's Story?\",\"id\":142921342,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors are paying a premium for eBay (EBAY). The stock currently trades at 4.3 times its sales over the past twelve months, compared to 3.1 for the S\\u0026P 500. Justifying that valuation requires tracking a recent shift in corporate messaging. Back in April 2025, during the fiscal Q1 2025 call, management emphasized the uncertainty that tariffs and trade policy changes created for eBay's sellers and buyers. That rhetoric has faded. So what has management been talking up instead.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5e02a069dcd2f702eb8b64b54a9f0fb855b4d5cd1bae221b430d595d2a8d7907\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792092240,\"headline\":\"Why This Downtrodden Paper Maker Is a Top S\\u0026P 500 Stock Today\",\"id\":142921571,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Good news has been in short supply lately for the packaging industry, but investors are enthused by this possible deal.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a14a6e5a9f57bbc7e0394830a7cff3f9005797461995e7d8058fedbd8ff61a01\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792091412,\"headline\":\"Discover which dow jones stocks are making waves on Thursday.\",\"id\":142921152,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Let's have a look at the top dow jones gainers and losers one hour before the close of the markets of today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=545db4733871e90a22820d700146d007479454afeb887e72faa3fb5e27048e68\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792090080,\"headline\":\"Why This Analyst Thinks Walmart Stock Is a Buy After Its Worst Day in 5 Years\",\"id\":142921711,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart’s growing marketplace, advertising, and membership businesses could lift margins and help drive shares higher, Deutsche Bank says.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d6892f6b11ac6a383a9c610ff1d1c1bf320db0f0e66966ee1613f5dd8e29b7c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792088403,\"headline\":\"What Would Flat Store Sales Do To Home Depot Stock?\",\"id\":142921343,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors who own Home Depot (HD) worry that sales at existing stores will stop growing. That worry is hardly far-fetched. On August 18, the home improvement retailer reported that comparable sales, its measure for existing stores, rose 1.7% in the quarter, with just 1.3% growth in its U.S. stores. That same day, management reaffirmed its forecast for fiscal 2026, which puts comparable sales growth at 0% to 2%. A flat year sits at the bottom of that range. What would a flat year actually cost Ho\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5ef9ec66c096a85b44a196db67c47c3acc1e3d73958a0e2051d5c11a7be81835\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792086480,\"headline\":\"Alphabet Stock Can Soar 22%, J.P. Morgan Says. Why Google Can Defy AI Fears.\",\"id\":142921344,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Megacap earnings are always a blockbuster event for the market, but there will be even more than usual riding on them this quarter.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f13afcb72c54f6474aff823a69949ff9553cc7ab9a8396003d5dcf5b0e168fde\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792086092,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Tech Stocks Fall Thursday Afternoon\",\"id\":142920312,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech stocks were lower Thursday afternoon, with the State Street Technology Select Sector SPDR ETF (\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3823bf760e5c56b5f7792c90a9ed4ce057dd30247fc381a8fbbed90d1cc13c07\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792084905,\"headline\":\"SpaceX CEO Elon Musk Teases ‘X Shop’ After Amazon Shuts Out Grok Agents\",\"id\":142920313,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The post comes on the heels of Musk highlighting Grok Bot’s ability to handle purchases.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=52535b9a35ee0bd6fd9194f184b5a9f722568eea7bb616a01d4b2bf7f1c7d30b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792084342,\"headline\":\"Is Costco Stock Increasing Your Market Risk?\",\"id\":142920315,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Costco Wholesale (COST) is a $436 billion retailer. Anyone buying the stock likely already holds a portfolio built around the S\\u0026P 500. A share that sinks alongside the broader market only multiplies a bad day, while one charting its own course can cushion the blow. So when the market has a bad day, what does Costco do to your money.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a1918d073e8b505ffa9b6d42a676dfc52dcc9e9787e1af5f0ed47670d51eb07d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792084260,\"headline\":\"Meet the Low-Cost Vanguard ETF With Taiwan Semiconductor, Samsung Electronics, SK Hynix, and ASML as Its 4 Largest Holdings\",\"id\":142920268,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"International stock ETFs offer superior diversification, lower valuations, and higher yields than S\\u0026P 500 ETFs like VOO.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=010de4eb3a54db10cda6f8a002844349d6a8c49d46426cd57de9ccd4bd93423a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792084027,\"headline\":\"'Investors temper Anthropic IPO valuation expectations over revenue growth slowdown, sources say'- Reuters Exclusive\",\"id\":142945239,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.reuters.com/business/finance/investors-temper-anthropic-ipo-valuation-expectations-over-revenue-growth-2026-10-15/\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1915d4be0b8bc64fe3cc974408aa7c491ea9bf320ad7c93c090fc1ddec6b7f7c\"},{\"catego