 Q3 Revenue; CoreWeave's Credit Risk Hits Intraday High\",\"id\":142919179,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose in late-morning trading Thursday, while the S\\u0026P 500 edged high\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8b3031fca6665b25bb2e1944c27be762335b7b150269dff16785a34925cba74\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792078956,\"headline\":\"Nvidia and Cisco confirm multimillion-dollar donations to Trump's White House ballroom\",\"id\":142948645,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108356675-1788207196062-gettyimages-2291330125-ah704060.jpeg?v=1792096861\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Big Tech gave millions to Trump's White House ballroom, documents show\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=33af40d9d1bf1197ba10bcb2d3eb5dc6fab26d1eaa07dbe7aa24ad70a1564b35\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792078200,\"headline\":\"Amazon sells smart thermostats, towel warmers, heated gloves, and more starting at $14\",\"id\":142919180,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Prep for winter and shop these must-have deals.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=254b58518001c4e7f0ad2465695faab3eb4d49d501f3771028e75544073c0fef\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792077900,\"headline\":\"5 Growth Stocks With Home Run Potential\",\"id\":142919150,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Each of these aspiring players has big potential in a massive market, but each has some clear weak spots, too.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fa7b30f21fc963252d5369c738f69fe8d823bea1e9c9496c0dc29b89f6d5f547\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792077856,\"headl