oo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi takes a look at the biggest stories as the trading day kicks off, weighing in on CoreWeave's (CRWV) stock rout and more. Sozzi also previews his Power Players interview with legendary actor Sylvester Stallone, in which the two discuss what's wrong with Hollywood.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7fef7a6bb5986fa9af5179e104001fe2fb345e6aca0267847d52acaaabc13d5e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792073100,\"headline\":\"The Stock Market Will Look Completely Different by 2030. This Is the Stock I'm Buying Before It Does.\",\"id\":142919191,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Synopsys could emerge as a major winner from the next phase of AI growth, but its ambitious 2030 targets come with important valuation risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c5f9244e9c878eb1e19f6c9ee3cc1a0c58add75abb00acccbb52a8f1d519c2da\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792073071,\"headline\":\"Michael Burry's 'Red October' Warning: Why QQQ and SMH Could Face More Pain\",\"id\":142945153,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/xrdDAE9HpS4rJc10535-j6448429399417680500.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Michael Burry warns of a potential market top as falling bond yields fail to lift tech stocks. Here\\u0026#39;s why QQQ and SMH ETFs face growing risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=56376ae382f8e4214ceded6eef4b27f1089b62fba75f5f38ee0cfdf9212cab82\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792072816,\"headline\":\"Amazon launches new Bee 'Personal AI' devices that listen to conversations\",\"id\":142948691,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108415346-17920870631792087061-49020024977-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792087062\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Amazon is releasing two new Bee listening devices as it moves further into the AI hardware market. CNBC's Kate Rooney reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e72c7f04f0cbbed8de0ec31be1595892dc91acc608dddfb46a77ae947677b5db\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792072080,\"headline\":\"Alphabet Stock Can Soar 24%, JPMorgan Says. Why Google Can Defy AI Fears.\",\"id\":142919192,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Megacap earnings are always a blockbuster event for the market—but there will be even more than usual riding on them this quarter.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=178a0e139a1f9863d3d9ecc2c1fd777330dad6463d38003a5581eb55ea7cd76e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792071698,\"headline\":\"Amazon (AMZN): Who Captures the Savings From its Custom AI Chips?\",\"id\":142916249,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon.com, Inc. (NASDAQ:AMZN) earns money from retail sales, marketplace fees, advertising, subscriptions, and cloud computing. Amazon Web Services, or AWS, rents computing capacity to businesses and developers and generated about 60% of second-quarter 2026 operating profit. Its AI expansion makes it a company to examine in 10 Most Active Blue Chip Stocks to Buy Right […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=73bfe4679d1a80bf7c7c747aafe16eb34b1ab804b1824f413eca4a8d0182b216\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792071626,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Dow Rises, Nasdaq Tumbles As AI Worries Hit Major Players (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142913914,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Thursday ahead of more inflation data. Nvidia, Micron and AMD sell off on AI fears.\",\"url\":\"https: