t CoreWeave Stock Lower?\",\"id\":142914144,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of CoreWeave (CRWV) fell 15.5% on October 14, 2026, during a session where the S\\u0026P 500 lost 1.1%. The drop came as yields on CoreWeave's unsecured bonds rose toward 15%. A venture capitalist had drawn attention to them on X late on Tuesday, October 13. Reports tied the stock decline to concern about the company's debt burden. Investors have reason to share that worry if borrowing at the company has outrun its business. So how big has CoreWeave's debt become next to what it sells.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ee4e4ea01aeeadc75abfee7118509e3d0a5d47a52ab98a08e915fe890e98ceb7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792066534,\"headline\":\"Anthropic Says It Turned an Adjusted Profit Ahead of Its Expected IPO\",\"id\":142914616,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Anthropic is closing in on an IPO, and the two tech giants holding stakes in the AI startup stand to gain very differently when shares finally hit the market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1007ffbbab3020a8aaa788bc37a14cdeb81991bf12d262eec7c71bcc236ce8b0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792065649,\"headline\":\"Why This AI Play — An Nvidia, Amazon Supplier — Is Outpacing The S\\u0026P\",\"id\":142913915,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Keysight Technologies has outpaced the S\\u0026P 500 this year as a key services provider for AI and data center players like Nvidia, Amazon.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0b7e875e308e1db3355c7cf3d8b69a008736dd80f4e14127bf3fb39cf16b6373\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792064400,\"headline\":\"Here's What a $10,000 Investment