every quarter.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2be0d259fb0d49569199c6a7aa2e531239b725e659359bec8ad9da2f3f0d82e3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062919,\"headline\":\"If I Can Only Own Alphabet or Amazon for The Next 5 Years, I’m Choosing This One\",\"id\":142912836,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Both Alphabet and Amazon just posted accelerating cloud growth and are pouring tens of billions into AI infrastructure, but only one of them trades at a bargain multiple while controlling every layer of its own stack.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4dfacc9a1a506a908aae17a4433aeb1d4969727f6160af5c188fb0f3e9ce571e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792059014,\"headline\":\"AWS, Anthropic race to deploy army of specialized engineers key to proving AI spending will pay off\",\"id\":142919972,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108403731-1791905392135-gettyimages-2276547281-UK_ANTHROPIC.jpeg?v=1792072965\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"AWS, Anthropic, OpenAI and Google are racing to build forward deployed engineering teams as companies seek returns on their AI investments.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=41498215616dd3bc606653a34a8c8a54c46d1dd857cb8403d532535f2d4130de\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792055841,\"headline\":\"What is it like running a Fortune 500 business? HP’s regional CTO on adopting AI safely and motivating tech teams\",\"id\":142914046,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the past few months, Fortune has spoken with senior HP leaders to understand how the company is evolving—from innovation and culture to customer engagement and the future of work.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9b7d99245e508e30759836b22f4e8865