c To Pause Its IPO Until Co Addresses AI Safety, Governance And Pace Concerns\",\"id\":142915719,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"-CNBC. \",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bcef12d11fc2d9a3d9db6dfe385258935be6b91a8ea1dca1eb2c9516bf323f1f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792047600,\"headline\":\"The Biggest ‘Schumps:’ From SpaceX to IMAX, We Scored the Disruptors\",\"id\":142903580,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Corporate insurgencies hit a fever pitch this month—and October is only half over. We break down, and size up, five of the biggest dramas.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=84acc18f7b658829f82aa2f2fd0bfed792596fca9c5f66ec363b7350770a9c6c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792046761,\"headline\":\"Alibaba: Enough Fuel To Power The Trillion-RMB Cloud Machine\",\"id\":142910421,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1020075066/image_1020075066.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Alibaba Group Holding Limited is down 41% from its 2025 peak as earnings recovery lags and capex expectations rise. Learn why BABA stock is a buy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7b76a6437764f701eac44a615f1dfb115a11df4be5e3d33508ba1b4486a7af69\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792045740,\"headline\":\"Wedgewood Partners Q3 2026 Portfolio Activity\",\"id\":142910113,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2266615986/image_2266615986.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft grew operating income by about 18%, and we estimate its average gross asset base grew in the low 20s, leading to continued healthy returns on invested capital of almost 30%.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1620ad1d41f10c6eaf2a974c9853a8a0b1016575da7407c915252c3b46627dad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792040509,\"headline\":\"Will OpenAI Go Public? One VC Says ‘Not Really Sure They Mean It’ But Bets On ‘Blockbuster’ Anthropic Listing\",\"id\":142898778,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Anthropic’s Q3 financials disappointed some investors and contributed to Nasdaq’s drag, CNBC’s Jim Cramer said.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d9d23e8fb75c742dbdf30fb46afdd3876f5d648219b5b2f22a6af8159e4f402\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792027800,\"headline\":\"Payoneer Checkout Launches in Singapore, Helping Businesses Turn Global Demand into Revenue\",\"id\":142894500,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Payoneer (NASDAQ: PAYO), the global financial technology company powering business growth across borders, today announced that Payoneer Checkout is available to eligible Singapore-registered businesses. Powered by Stripe, the enhanced solution enables merchants to accept payments from international customers through their own online stores, supporting multiple payment methods including cards and digital wallets, while helping businesses manage proceeds across markets through Payoneer's global fi\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ae7b31fa79818555c3bf345d67fd6389affa446512eb6bd0333c78eabceefb7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792027427,\"headline\":\"What Would It Take For Synopsys Stock To Move Higher?\",\"id\":142893851,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Synopsys (SNPS) rose 30% over the past month, compared with a 2.5% gain for the S\\u0026P 500. This climb followed the company's Investor Day on September 30 alongside new deals with OpenAI and Amazon. The climb offers a sign that buyers may be betting on AI. One part of that bet involves Design IP, the business that licenses ready-made pieces of chips. That division shrank last fiscal year. So is Design IP growing again.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8f762a8306459a24a257c5534be88658124ffe19f36e8b593d7ab47dab16af17\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792027150,\"headline\":\"Is Netflix Stock Worth More Than Its Competitors?\",\"id\":142894495,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the past twelve months, Netflix (NFLX) increased its revenue faster than Disney, Amazon, Comcast, or Apple. Within that group, only Apple produced a wider operating margin. Yet Netflix shares lost 42.2% over the past year, marking the steepest decline among the five companies. The stock now trades in the middle of the pack at an earnings multiple near Disney's. So what does Netflix give you, for about the same price, that Disney does not.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1df829088dd1a95746f0b9036b58cd0b8019971d8aa73e19df8926f164f7ed8a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792026669,\"headline\":\"Anthropic's Q3 Revenue Surged 45% to $16.8 Billion, Profitable on Adjusted Basis as Dario Amodei Courts Investors: Report\",\"id\":142915721,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Anthropic-Logo-Is-Displayed-On-A-Smartph.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Anthropic’s revenue surged 45% sequentially to $16.8 billion in the third quarter, bolstering its potential $2 trillion IPO ambitions.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b62887e5f3d3262563d73ab376be0d070a74d992af17a0d1a372026b23f9f98d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792021020,\"headline\":\"Kroger makes a pivotal decision as customers turn to rivals\",\"id\":142889215,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Kroger is making a major workforce change to lower prices for customers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=abdad729e584aecee3ddae4ee8b285ea2c2e8005d2a860df6a6325b59e340543\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792016165,\"headline\":\"Amazon.com (AMZN) Could See Blue Origin Go Public\",\"id\":142889214,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon.com (NasdaqGS:AMZN) founder Jeff Bezos has signalled plans to list his space venture Blue Origin through an IPO in the coming years. The proposed IPO would give Blue Origin its own access to public capital markets instead of relying mainly on Bezos' Amazon shareholdings. A public listing could reshape how Blue Origin structures commercial contracts with Amazon, including future satellite and launch services. Beyond Jeff Bezos' plan to take Blue Origin public, Amazon's wider business...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=15f66a0d7d8ea6d1802e24d2a8cb1ba89d3dee44ff243008d2e16ab344e6aea7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792012500,\"headline\":\"Global X Investments Canada Inc. Closes the Market\",\"id\":142888325,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Toronto, Ontario--(Newsfile Corp. - October 14, 2026) - Rohit Mehta, President and Chief Executive Officer, Global X Investments Canada Inc. (\\\"Global X\\\") joined Graham MacKenzie, Managing Director, Exchange Traded Products, Toronto Stock Exchange (\\\"TSX\\\"), to close the market and celebrate the launch of their six PowerStock ETFs:Global X Alphabet PowerStock ETF (TSX: GOOP)Global X Amazon PowerStock ETF (TSX: AMZP)Global X Apple PowerStock ETF (TSX: AAPP)Global X NVIDIA PowerStock ETF (TSX:...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=485974371363c4f246ad64396587f5693e16cd313c619b26d9a546c34671e965\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792011807,\"headline\":\"Should You Be Worried About Take-Two Stock?\",\"id\":142888327,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Take-Two Interactive Software (TTWO) have fallen 21% over the past twelve months, trailing the S\\u0026P 500 and its 21% return. Company executives still expect net bookings to grow about 20% in fiscal 2027, aided by the November release of Grand Theft Auto VI. During an August 7 earnings call, however, leadership hesitated to bank on the enthusiasm surrounding the new title. What is management unsure about.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e6df1db319fd338cd3284ab59c8f83508198dcfe296612cfd0f9a66c310ae4e7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792009860,\"headline\":\"3 Cloud Leaders That Will Make a Fortune From AI\",\"id\":142888343,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The cloud computing industry is primed to benefit from the growing use of AI.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d373067e244068a599017f05842f127e94943bfc8a6f76ec972edfdfd4d1ab02\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792008600,\"headline\":\"CPI Pressures Markets And Fed Reserve's Move On Interest Rates\",\"id\":142890140,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2257930603/image_2257930603.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Hot CPI report upends markets. Fears of rising interest rates heightened. Tech stocks pull back again.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=993d967118512ac3fe089d9f9f810948e65b6fce4f6a2aca69c2f93d4869e367\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792007410,\"headline\":\"Sara Eisen Went on Bill Maher and Said What Wall Street Will Not About the AI Race\",\"id\":142887393,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"When a CNBC anchor made the case for American AI dominance on a comedy show, she got the national security argument exactly right and the investment argument exactly backwards. Here is what the hyperscalers spending nearly two trillion dollars over two years are not telling you.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b8c4098f7628dfe40bd722d986d9fe0608b5abd8a51b21e2929b918f19bbcfbe\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792006805,\"headline\":\"IonQ vs. Nebius Group: Which Technology Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142887399,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nebius is growing at an extraordinary pace with demand outpacing supply. IonQ has a diversified quantum backlog but a longer road to commercial scale.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ac37d2f420ed8a1958c8705720887c4bcc79e46407cdc8ad40ca2319873d6f24\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792005600,\"headline\":\"Amazon Is the Most Crowded Stock for Hedge Funds. Tesla, Not So Much.\",\"id\":142888338,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon.com stock was the most owned name among hedge funds in September, trading data shows.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c82d51d050d75b339d5b6cb22b92d108447b3179d53542a04ed86a5439602e7e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792005178,\"headline\":\"Better High-Yield Dividend Stock: Pfizer vs. UPS\",\"id\":142887404,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysPfizer yields 6. 3% and UPS yields 7.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6749c3c62359b0a0c47f0e