:\"company\",\"datetime\":1792003577,\"headline\":\"Amazon (AMZN) Has a $25B Chip Business. Is the Cash Burn Worth It?\",\"id\":142887401,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Most people think of Amazon (NASDAQ:AMZN) as the place their packages come from. The part of the company drawing the most attention right now sells something far less visible: custom AI chips. In the second quarter of 2026, Amazon Web Services (AWS) said its chips business and its AI business had each passed a $25 […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a74f0d8dce6c1f5995c5d52cdd099f4cf2f864b9ec79975b15099c88de355a1d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792002565,\"headline\":\"'Anthropic Q3 Revenue Hit $16.8B, According To People Familiar With The Matter' - Bloomberg News\",\"id\":142915722,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-14/anthropic-revenue-jumps-to-16-8-billion-in-quarter-before-ipo\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b86aab7dd5c8379d01ffd865bdf8ff999925691e1ca4adfd7505e72662007d4f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792001712,\"headline\":\"Synopsys (SNPS) Adopts AI Chipmaking Libraries For Semiconductor Workflows\",\"id\":142887407,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Synopsys (NasdaqGS:SNPS) is adopting NVIDIA CUDA-X libraries and the cuPotential library for AI-driven semiconductor manufacturing workflows. The collaboration focuses on using NVIDIA's AI platform to help automate and optimize chip design and fabrication processes. Synopsys is adding NVIDIA to a growing list of AI partners, alongside recent agreements involving OpenAI and Amazon. Synopsys' move to CUDA-X and cuPotential fits into a broader AI-defined fab trend that deeper research helps...\",\"url\":\"https://f