Reportedly Cutting 1,000 Jobs – Co-CEOs Say Company Must Be ‘Disciplined’ With Resources\",\"id\":142886394,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix is reportedly cutting 1,000 jobs in its largest round of layoffs in four years, according to a Wall Street Journal report.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=54b16b066ed4ccddb4e107df052d1275e7a87a52806258eb119fe35b6901f34c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791995465,\"headline\":\"Shopify: Wait For The Next Golden Buying Opportunity (Downgrade)\",\"id\":142887899,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2267426723/image_2267426723.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Shopify has decisively dispelled AI-driven bear concerns, regaining bullish momentum and closing in on all-time highs. Read more on SHOP stock here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b2dc377d000c0191520fc422a304c169f828a0a1f9716d12cf5e207b99ef6438\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791995100,\"headline\":\"Rhino USA Closes $15 Million Asset-Backed Facility with Texas Capital to Accelerate Growth and Expand Retail Dominance\",\"id\":142886395,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AUSTIN, Texas, October 14, 2026--Rhino USA, a family-built authority in truck, towing and off-road adventure gear, today announced the closing of a $15 million asset-backed loan facility with Texas Capital. The financing will be deployed to accelerate strategic inventory investment and optimize working capital as the company continues its rapid national expansion across big-box retail, e-commerce and international markets.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2202d8cfa51648e29c182536b20d34b6f5d0ed8e76867494716b7486804c722c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\"