f1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791991680,\"headline\":\"Nectar Launches Customer Atlas, Extending Amazon Marketing Cloud Audience Targeting From Display Into Search Bidding\",\"id\":142885097,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NEW YORK, October 14, 2026--Nectar, an Amazon Advanced Advertising Partner managing more than $2.5 billion in annual client sales, launched today Customer Atlas, an Amazon Marketing Cloud capability that changes the unit of targeting in Amazon search advertising from the keyword to the shopper.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b3ce9a793f70f3b3dfd1b9355c0995caa496f56e9711ca51cb876db74c53c2c4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791989152,\"headline\":\"Qualcomm Vs. Intel: The Market is Refuting Both AI Rebrand Attempts\",\"id\":142885091,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel and Qualcomm both showed up to earnings with a fresh AI identity, but investors have been voting with their feet ever since. One company is already cashing AI checks while the other is asking you to fund a roadmap that has yet to book its first dollar.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4d2b4c06379e3ead5f76623ada846e19b84e347076c89ef1ce3dc79a77342f8b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791988773,\"headline\":\"Amazon to close grocery partner storefronts\",\"id\":142885098,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The company will shutter an unspecified number of retailer-specific storefronts on Amazon.com as it focuses on new services and simplifying its online grocery experience.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d0491ad2e3175d343c67e299dbdf6922216c72098f98979d954101ae179b573a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791985800,\"headline\":\"AWS Backlog Hits $496 Billion While Cloud Margins Surge to 39% Making Amazon a Must-Own Growth Stock\",\"id\":142882519,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"This a great opportunity to buy Amazon stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fb4a20a6636f12c4e8e604d555b5b303ea09c9b85a2eab570c4ac366f5441249\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791984623,\"headline\":\"Amazon Is Up More Than 2,200% in 10 Years. What’s Next?\",\"id\":142882546,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon has rewarded patient investors for a decade, but the next five years look nothing like the last, with a $200 billion spending bet that could either cement its dominance or drag returns into bear territory.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8c239ea6d06c3df31856108f407e2c48f0d0b28a221d86a53ee013795800eccf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791984289,\"headline\":\"Apple is finally taking the smart home seriously\",\"id\":142882532,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple is finally revamping its smart home strategy and taking the market more seriously this time.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=273ff761cb0358ea43017789d3af5e600f69536fdf2011d1b6249f44824594c7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791984239,\"headline\":\"Is UPS parcel pivot a strategic winner or a ‘Trojan horse’?\",\"id\":142885100,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UPS is focusing on premium service over parcel volume with a potential Teamsters union strike on the horizon. The post Is UPS parcel pivot a strategic winner or a ‘Trojan horse’? appeared first o