Industrial Average Monitor Update - A Look At 30 U.S. Large-Caps\",\"id\":142869843,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1196086989/image_1196086989.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Visible Alpha consensus expects the Dow Jones Industrial Average to deliver an 18.7% weighted price return in the medium term. Read more here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=310ef25895cc39730bc02d53261c2e29cfcc1b7eb4f0498474d0e9c56b8614e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791934206,\"headline\":\"Charles Gasparino Defends Jeff Bezos, Elon Musk — Says America Needs ‘More Bezos’ and a Tax System That Rewards Risk-Taking\",\"id\":142860888,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Fox News host Charles Gasparino argued that the U.S. tax system should encourage entrepreneurs to take risks, reacting to Amazon.com Inc.’s founder Jeff Bezos’ defense of business success and wealthy entrepreneurs. In a FOX Business segment published Sunday, Gasparino responded...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3c05e2254902d243f382bcdc4dd4b5a7cb51427f470ef34e3f5c64523ad6db05\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791930780,\"headline\":\"Franklin Templeton CEO says AI is hiding a bigger tech story\",\"id\":142855327,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The $1.8 trillion money manager’s boss thinks investors may be crediting the wrong technology for today’s gains.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d7ed3bee94c38a60709d4e669c0ec386c32df9defc21054c492309d8c002a485\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791929404,\"headline\":\"What Could Go Wrong At UPS From Here?\",\"id\":142855332,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of United Parcel Service (UPS) have fallen 14.8% over the past three months, trailing the 3.8% gain for the S\\u0026P 500. The logistics company completed an 18-month plan to scale back its Amazon delivery work and target more profitable customers. That strategy operates as a bet that UPS can win those accounts. So who else is going after them.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0a23d75df8d1009aaf10408d89802f56f9e9e656a7d92ba6562c3851bf069b1d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791926700,\"headline\":\"Former Berkshire Manager Combs Has Made $5 Billion of Investments at JP Morgan\",\"id\":142854631,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Combs said that his group has made about 10 investments averaging about $500 million each using the bank’s own capital.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b453b374bb988eb0c876795a1ed93a86a8de67236577a99e1fcb7060f65195b2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791926017,\"headline\":\"Jeff Bezos Aims for the Moon But Advises Retirees to Stick With Index Funds\",\"id\":142855330,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Amazon founder says he ‘would usually tell a retiree to buy the S\\u0026P 500’\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d9116dc3707f7af1fb965e18360e707d7cb314a3fd431203fce7d4c2ae829a3a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791924752,\"headline\":\"Are consumer budgets in for a fright this Halloween season?\",\"id\":142854344,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"American consumers are expected to spend a total of $13.5 billion — or $115.14 per person — on Halloween this year, according to the National Retail Federation (NRF). That includes the candy, costumes, decorations, and more. NRF vice president of industry and consumer insights Allison Zeller dives into the choiceful spending that consumers are engaging in this spooky season.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=92e5ef642b3e01604898f87669531d0f7ee8f00bb861284347287fa0fed7f058\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791923706,\"headline\":\"Has IBM Stock Become A Different Bet?\",\"id\":142854339,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of IBM (IBM) currently trade at 19.9 times earnings, while the S\\u0026P 500 sits at 21.9. Investors buying at that multiple need to understand the underlying assets, and the company has recently changed its messaging. During the fiscal Q2 2025 call, executives focused on a running total of generative AI business that they defined as their book of business. The most recent presentation offered a different focal point. So what is management talking up instead.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7a60e94db7d4232b90f6724f2239f5bf44333ccb2643e04f5658315d3100a673\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791922339,\"headline\":\"Data Reveals Next Big AI Robotics Stock Investments\",\"id\":142854342,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"If you're looking for a smart, lower-risk way to invest in the booming robotics and AI infrastructure sector, Eric Bleeker, the co-host of The AI Investor Podcast, may have the perfect pick. Eric recently discussed how industrial powerhouses like Regal Rexnord (RRX) offer investors a powerful \\\"call option\\\" on robotics growth without necessarily risking the farm. Among the benefits discussed was the company's diversified operations across power transmission, automation, and high-efficiency motors. Eric also analyzed  the company's rapid e-pod order growth and why precision motion control hardware is vital for humanoid robotics.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ac16810eee766376c7b99fe73d6bc4b25bc151644337d4557392f19999c3228e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791921675,\"headline\":\"Investors Are Paying More for Walmart Than Amazon. Here’s Why That Doesn’t Add Up.\",\"id\":142854343,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart Inc. (NASDAQ:WMT) has opened a fulfillment center of more than 900,000 square feet in Stockton, California. The site uses automation and machine learning to cut the usual 12-step order process down to five. It will also employ about 1,000 people. The company says its next-generation fulfillment centers, of which Stockton is the fifth, will […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d5833004d7cd7aaa4733e999550228cc1b8c3aff811ae6827d3ad5c5a30297d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791921359,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Consumer Stocks Mixed Late Afternoon\",\"id\":142853805,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Consumer stocks were mixed late Tuesday afternoon with the State Street Consumer Staples Select Sect\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9facc16aee4d077951240eb797c85956524cc928ec51e653db637ddf317b746d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791920990,\"headline\":\"Can You Make Money Off Netflix Stock Now?\",\"id\":142854333,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix (NFLX) stock has dropped 12% since mid-September, retreating from a recent high of $80.32. When a familiar company discounts this quickly, investors often look for an entry point before the price rebounds. Yet this selloff has a reason behind it, and Netflix has navigated sharp declines before. So what pushed the stock down, and has buying Netflix after its sharp falls paid before.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0d0badd83ba3f3a760eb27dcfc404b41c82c4cd93009b793044fd870a4b7496a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791920812,\"headline\":\"Apple may have a way to dominate the smart home space\",\"id\":142853372,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Technology Editor Dan Howley joins Market Domination host Brooke DiPalma to discuss the latest round of Apple (AAPL) smart home products and the company's edge in competing with Google (GOOG) and Amazon (AMZN).\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c0b714d07ac3ac243ef9849e9a95fc14d7ba5989951f0209a8ec4188790e057c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791920357,\"headline\":\"If Palantir Stock Looks Expensive, You Need To Read This\",\"id\":142854341,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Palantir Technologies (PLTR) currently trade at 137.7 times its adjusted earnings over the past twelve months, a metric that adds stock-based pay back after tax. Paying that multiple for a single year of profit appears steep, yet the valuation shifts when measured against the next two years. The following breakdown highlights what investors are actually paying for the profit Palantir is expected to generate over those two years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=06ea8f5a6ee2238f68a839074dcb871f45f01cc435ea7e418d6dd185a1b245ab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791918746,\"headline\":\"Is Snowflake Stock Riskier Than It Looks?\",\"id\":142853214,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Snowflake (SNOW) stock has returned 169% over the past six months, against 14.0% for the S\\u0026P 500. Investors appear to believe artificial intelligence has put the company on a faster growth track, and the latest quarter supports that view. Yet on the most recent earnings call, executives pointed out a catch in the AI business. So what is the catch.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8cbac5682ddf94c74e3bb1ed5204b3fba5b0e217fbc754b361211c319b8f7e5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791918616,\"headline\":\"Explore the top gainers and losers within the dow jones index in today's session.\",\"id\":142853114,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Uncover the latest developments among dow jones stocks in today's session. Stay tuned to the dow jones index's top gainers and losers on Tuesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=239f1ec0bd6003c75b83346777ebb77ec584c75f68f4c78fd3f43f5a7e2d2574\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791918000,\"headline\":\"The Five Largest Holdings in the RANK ETF After Its Latest Rebalance\",\"id\":142853215,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Defiance KSM TipRanks Analyst ETF (RANK) has completed its latest quarterly reconstitution and rebalance, which took effect after the close on September 21, 2026 with notable changes among its largest holdings. RANK seeks to track the performance, before fees and expenses, of the TipRanks US Momentum Analysts iNDEX. The index is calculated and administered by VettaFi LLC (a TMX Group company) or its affiliates and is constructed utilizing proprietary data provided by TipRanks Ltd. The index\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=567de157dc5959bc72fbaf24453fcb5b90c56837a4b89a235c014dfebf7272d6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791917220,\"headline\":\"Apple Takes on Amazon With New Smart Home Gadgets. The Launch Adds Up to a $5 Trillion Valuation.\",\"id\":142854332,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple stock crosses the $5 trillion market-capitalization threshold after the company releases its new smart home lineup.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ab3679684d3720e857387f70654da5d6ed1d66823fac28d23aac58f6dcb4fa48\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791916480,\"headline\":\"What Would Weak iPhone Demand Do To Apple Stock?\",\"id\":142853216,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple (AAPL) shareholders are facing concerns that the iPhone 18 Pro is falling short of sales expectations. On October 9, Nikkei Asia reported that Apple instructed certain suppliers to scale back component production due to soft demand. This development matters to investors, as the iPhone remains the largest business segment for the company. So how much is actually known about demand for the new phone.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=143da93740e1bfd14960f73e897a2d8c288256a01ff3cbce8ff207d71a36a19c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791914094,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Tech Stocks Fall Tuesday Afternoon\",\"id\":142853386,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMZN\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech stocks were lower Tuesday afternoon, with the State Street Technology Select Sector SPDR ETF (X\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0681dcc8a28f3bf36d10478580df4b09ef1a9f7aca10fb09e6b1832a05606fe5\"}]"
     },
