      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792380611,\"headline\":\"Trump’s $330 Million White House Ballroom Donor List Reveals Nvidia, Apple and Google Among Top Tech Contributors: Report (UPDATED)\",\"id\":142992629,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Editor’s note: The story has been updated to include a comment from Nvidia. President Donald Trump’s White House ballroom project donor list reportedly reveals companies and individuals linked to federal contracts, policy decisions, and a presidential pardon. NVIDIA Corp. and...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=833bc80d9748fdde323eb686e9f8065372b20c6efd59e1202148bb04a26a5e57\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792378020,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave, Oracle have an interest rate problem\",\"id\":142992151,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave and Oracle are borrowing billions for AI just as rates rise. See what the interest bills, bond yields and credit ratings reveal about the risk.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c17003935bf1124cabd573194be1f91c91ed2b180d26b06a704951188042e8b6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792377013,\"headline\":\"OpenAI, Anthropic’s AI Lead Is ‘Very Perishable,’ IMD Professor Says: ‘You Don’t Need to Drive a Ferrari to Go to Walmart’\",\"id\":142992153,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"OpenAI and Anthropic may remain ahead of Chinese rivals in artificial intelligence and still find that technological lead worth less than expected, according to Howard Yu, LEGO Professor of Management and Innovation at IMD Business School. Asked about a roughly...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f3c21b9b15ab6d2c2155514d5e7ca74b19ec648f08be4dc979726c2bf9a4b8bb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792375678,\"headline\":\"Fuel Cell Deal Could Be A Game Changer For American Electric Power Company (AEP)\",\"id\":142992154,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"American Electric Power Company plans to invest about US$4b in a 702 megawatt Bloom Energy fuel cell plant near Cheyenne, Wyoming, under a 20 year PPA supplying Google's local power demand. The planned near zero emissions fuel cell project positions American Electric Power Company to serve large tech clients that are demanding reliable, lower carbon, on demand power. We will look at how American Electric Power Company's investment narrative could be affected by this large fuel cell...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c5647d89df41724e7fdb44d0e98dda508a25a5a1ac089641ce84a4f8b1bc489a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792375380,\"headline\":\"Cramer points to rare Reddit buy opportunity amid Google AI threat\",\"id\":142991679,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Cramer sees Reddit shares as a bargain, just as Google’s AI search raises real traffic risks for the social platform.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=56d8e598e38b92dda34f2221b45a9a9d361384e91308cb11daf5a3b36ca53d9a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792372169,\"headline\":\"American Electric Power (AEP) Stock Could Be 11% Overvalued Following Generator Deal\",\"id\":142991443,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"American Electric Power Company has ridden a strong multi year share price run, and the current level raises a simple question for income focused investors who care most about the durability and pricing of its dividend stream. With the stock now reflecting years of optimism around regulated earnings and grid investments, the issue is whether the cash the company returns to shareholders still lines up with what buyers are paying today. Over the past 3 years, American Electric Power stock has...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9954d59922b7a5b9055c09535481d710f0ba54fe8cfd0dfb394ea03a20f34819\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792365218,\"headline\":\"American Electric Power Company (AEP) Faces A 12% Fair Value Gap As Google Deal Lands\",\"id\":142989724,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"American Electric Power Company (AEP) is committing about $4 billion to a 702-megawatt fuel cell project near Cheyenne, Wyoming, backed by a 20-year power purchase agreement with Google. Recent trading suggests interest in American Electric Power Company has been firming, with a 1-day share price return of 2.29% and a 30-day share price return of 5.95%. The year-to-date share price return of 9.78% sits alongside a 1-year total shareholder return of 11.53% and a very large 3-year total...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ba5a15822e0e0ecf46ad52e7233e37d32d9255dc44beba69f635ede55c57081\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792360102,\"headline\":\"Bonds Already Discounted A 3rd Hike, Stocks Have Followed, Stay Long\",\"id\":142991440,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2298720448/image_2298720448.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Stocks sold off sharply after inflation data and a delayed reaction to Social Security COLA news. Read more on the market here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f639953768fbbd69bdc4fa4baffb34746c56adb4a5f8894e3effe2572f294a4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792346416,\"headline\":\"Zohran Mamdani Says Quantum Is Poised to Become a ‘Multi-Trillion Dollar Industry’ and New Yorkers Should ‘Share in That Profit’\",\"id\":142988563,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"New York City Mayor Zohran Mamdani said Thursday that the city will receive a 15% share of the intellectual property proceeds from a new quantum facility, adding that New Yorkers should benefit from an industry he expects to be worth...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8426fe3a8dd0c3452ce45b52eb9928d0a7f1a9453eb125acb64a983263322e7f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792341300,\"headline\":\"1 Analyst Thinks Alphabet Stock Could Jump 20% on AI Chip Demand. Is He Right?\",\"id\":142987944,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"There's a good reason to be optimistic about Alphabet's chip opportunities.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=80d29ab300b81a73b4c0c3361668af1e85d4de8994c9fd48d45a49d22e13135f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792337580,\"headline\":\"Verizon launches generous customer perks after raising prices\",\"id\":142987425,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Verizon is offering customers new benefits that extend beyond its core service as wireless competition intensifies.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d5ae848f6317f89a74e9831a13be514ef02e6d4f447d230f5092a6f02b3ff018\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792334690,\"headline\":\"Berkshire Hathaway (BRK.B) After Buffett: Can Its Capital Allocation Machine Keep Compounding?\",\"id\":142987426,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Berkshire Hathaway Inc. (NYSE:BRK.B) returned 10.56% during the last six months, as of October 15. This compares to a 21.5% return for the Insider Monkey Billionaire Index and 15.74% for the State Street SPDR S\\u0026P 500 ETF Trust. Berkshire Hathaway was never just Warren Buffett’s investment portfolio. It was a collection of businesses that generated […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=343a8280b97ee2beb305a37aaf5d5e4c490fd1015eb7a8ba8b6f108526c1474a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792334348,\"headline\":\"Alphabet’s (GOOGL) Low P/E Is Misleading, but the AI Opportunity Is Real\",\"id\":142987427,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Alphabet Inc. (NASDAQ:GOOGL) has surged 3.43% over the last six months, as of October 15. This compares to a 21.5% return for the Insider Monkey Billionaire Index and 15.74% for the State Street SPDR S\\u0026P 500 ETF Trust. Alphabet’s business is growing, but the stock’s valuation needs a closer look. Google Search is still generating […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d5410d27a5c388affec84b6dc135d9690205e35718a016773b86c19991aa0743\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792325100,\"headline\":\"Prediction: Alphabet Will Report Google Cloud Revenue Growth Exceeding 100% on Oct. 28.\",\"id\":142986894,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Google Cloud is quickly becoming the biggest source of operating income growth for Alphabet.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=64b2f1d7bfd5a1883444e989aef4e1cd76e381fb854de4004b425c6b26331531\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792321707,\"headline\":\"Mastercard’s New Agent Detection Score Asks a Question No Card Network Has Asked Before\",\"id\":142986234,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Can a payment network actually distinguish between a human shopper and a piece of autonomous software? Mastercard is attempting to answer this with a new intelligence layer in its Agent Pay Trust Framework, which introduces an AI-agent initiation probability score. While the industry has spent the last year obsessing over the Chain of Trust and […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5b747c632b1a670299f078c78779a1b4e5080c8980bd5f369e857539c8ca7082\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792321209,\"headline\":\"Will Meta's earnings restore confidence in the AI boom?\",\"id\":142986892,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investor confidence in the companies driving the AI boom has taken a significant hit over the past week, with markets spooked by concerns that...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7e045a599b83b64314150a7c567123dc6c926fcb0c97ebf5434887831a4167aa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792318307,\"headline\":\"3 Cash Flow Stocks To Watch In October 2026\",\"id\":142985479,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Inflation in the US just hit 3.7% in September, driven hard by energy costs, and that puts reliable cash generation in the spotlight. When prices for essentials feel jumpy, investors tend to care more about what money actually comes in the door rather than just headline stories. This article walks through three stocks that screen as attractively priced on future cash flows and explains why that matters for you now. The three stocks below are just a sample. The full cash flow screen surfaced...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4426b4cfdc3e8ca9cab9314c511bda73d20d05614c496b90d220e747bd179ab4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792317000,\"headline\":\"Can Alphabet Stock Double By 2030?\",\"id\":142983551,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Alphabet has a long history of crushing the stock market, and it looks ready to continue that trend.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=18df35bcc0aa4377e01a31faeefff54f886da52e850d32cb24658b577848939d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792314000,\"headline\":\"What to Expect in Markets This Week: Meta, Tesla Report; Airlines, Streaming Giants’ Results Due\",\"id\":142985480,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The tech giants’ results could set the tone for other Magnificent 7 members as third-quarter earnings season picks up speed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8522880567ed0bba6d5d8b0f3acb9b39a3e40fb07418a5a1d7341721efa72a22\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792310400,\"headline\":\"The Data Center Doomsday Scenario\",\"id\":142986379,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d733269d580b8f457fbc381c431850ac865267f6f47bd6dfb7175a21c0285369\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792289780,\"headline\":\"Unity Stock In Focus After Google AI Game Creation Partnership\",\"id\":142967234,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Google and Unity Software previously announced a partnership to build an AI-powered game creation platform called Unity Spark, combining Google’s AI research, large consumer ecosystem, and Unity’s engine technology into accessible tools that support both simple text-prompt projects and higher-end 3D experiences. The arrangement directly ties Unity Software’s creation pipeline to Google’s distribution reach and community features, which could influence user acquisition costs, creator...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9efd3ce470a9d0a0a34895898fa7012f32f387d7585c5ae09c3fb20fdd311198\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792277400,\"headline\":\"Greg Abel Made Major Additions to Alphabet and Delta Last Quarter While Berkshire Bought Back $4.4 Billion of Its Own Stock. Is This a Buying Signal Investors Should Watch?\",\"id\":142964288,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Berkshire's new CEO is putting the company's cash to work.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=397e53539d11d5d4bca705e1a7c57555ab0061c7f5f441a4dd5b9c27d0e6748a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792275900,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy NuScale at $6 After the Google Rally? Here's the Next Catalyst That Could Send It Higher.\",\"id\":142964289,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NuScale Power stock has plunged, but it could soar if the company secures a deal for the largest small modular reactor deployment in U.S. history.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c00c5b128a85d4a8bba1c6d76255c6653cbf0226bed4cbd96c8a5b6fc67a8001\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792275791,\"headline\":\"Chamath Palihapitiya Says 6% Treasury Yield Could ‘Run Over’ AI Businesses\",\"id\":142987113,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/18/A-hand-holding-a-glowing-futuristic-AI-t.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Chamath Palihapitiya warns that rising bond yields could threaten debt-dependent businesses and force Big Tech to step in.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bc29b41dde8b8f074f12e0bc0e0e7460c693a9dc12849c365a556442b523aad8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792261802,\"headline\":\"How to Play NFLX Stock as Netflix Wipes Out Another 1,000 Jobs in Its Latest Round of Layoffs\",\"id\":142965233,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix trims 6% of its workforce, its biggest cut in four years, as viewer attention drifts elsewhere.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=732d7d3b452efce4bb66a23e47fa339856ae11e4b25e73417cf870206e9a28b9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792249822,\"headline\":\"Tesla Just Won in Court: Self-Driving Buyers Can’t Sue as a Class\",\"id\":142961949,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A federal appeals court just stripped away the legal structure that made a massive self-driving lawsuit dangerous for Tesla, but the stock fell anyway, and the real threat to its trillion-dollar valuation has nothing to do with this courtroom.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=87f6c9c3acdc63de9770a8e0619c0f687738ce8914f6b603eb4f0aed3466922e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792249200,\"headline\":\"Apple, Nvidia each gave $25M to Trump's White House ballroom — but the president's own name is nowhere on the donor list\",\"id\":142961930,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The controversial ballroom faces fresh scrutiny over potential conflicts of interest with big money ballroom donors and how much Trump has personally contributed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0101be04f4d3d00f158af9390b8fde359db489ad795d52554e6754356b35fa4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792245900,\"headline\":\"Does the AI Selloff Put Alphabet's Breakout in Doubt?\",\"id\":142987012,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"An AI sell-off pulled Alphabet stock back toward its 200-day moving average near $340, testing a breakout setup built on the strong reception of its Gemini 4 Argon model.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cfd1a67788fb523ba1fcf2b37a6d7f8c93b18887fb3dce1be1689bf5cbda0503\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792237451,\"headline\":\"BofA Warns AI Investors Could Lose Even If the Technology Works\",\"id\":142959982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America just invoked the ghost of the 1990s fiber optic collapse to explain why AI's biggest winners could still leave investors with nothing, even if the technology reshapes the world exactly as promised.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a4b2445fe3477280ba24144fe07b88715c87dc437e74e18d377a33b9c0cd50d6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792231320,\"headline\":\"Meet Warren Buffett Successor Greg Abel's Newest Investment: Bending Spoons. Should Investors Follow Suit and Buy the Stock?\",\"id\":142959994,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Greg Abel and Berkshire have been scooping up shares of the digital technology holding company.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a6ede7841f528ce1823d33414b2fe9d908b85683eb4481a07274f8a399836b70\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792231219,\"headline\":\"The Next Hollywood Trailer May Talk Back: Tech CEO Predicts Interactive Technology Could Change How Audiences Experience Movies\",\"id\":142961246,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Shourya-4-1.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Flam CEO Shourya Agarwal expects nearly every Hollywood studio to adopt interactive trailers, allowing viewers to engage in real time.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=79442cecd6ebd350ab3016cb19e24b57f6248849eff6f973ccabf793ba9b2c3f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792226700,\"headline\":\"The Correction Is Healthy; The Next Move Is Yours\",\"id\":142960363,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2291479836/image_2291479836.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The article analyzes recent corrections in AI and suggests being highly selective on U.S. equities amid macro uncertainty. Click to read more details.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=17bd471ebe532927fd54ba02b3174315468a676bb8365e8c83c5e1ee26657da6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792225727,\"headline\":\"Google Puts Gemini in Geely’s Overseas Cars: Why the Export Numbers Matter\",\"id\":142959576,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Alphabet (GOOGL:NASDAQ) just landed a new way to put Gemini in front of people without a phone or a browser. On October 16, Geely Holding Group, the parent of Geely Automobile (GELHY), announced a global partnership with Google to build Gemini, Google Maps and Google Play into eligible overseas models from Geely, Lynk \\u0026 Co, Proton, Riddara and smart.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=838e890795fef5097a83b31c3a032e3e034e4819f311da49ba5b93d123c68935\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792219587,\"headline\":\"AI Stocks Are The Next Dividend Growers\",\"id\":142959766,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5722824035d1917292ff4d4e40f7308d3a403a43dc80ec4cb139fb94982c7c30\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792215217,\"headline\":\"Disney to Spend $60 Million a Year on Character.AI Talent After Its Own Layoffs as AI Startup Faces Bankruptcy\",\"id\":142960643,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Dhaka-bangladesh-02-July-2024smartphone-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Disney plans to spend $60 million annually on 66 Character.AI employees despite recent layoffs as its AI strategy expands.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2e9875559648ee0b4286af7a1686cdc4caa144e82596c4ecbc3e34b14a8a9570\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792213774,\"headline\":\"What would superintelligence look and feel like?\",\"id\":142958772,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Superintelligent AI could outperform human experts across virtually every cognitive task by 2030, potentially transforming business competition and the global economy, according to Deutsche Bank Research.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e9b36ad7b535c38963db1ffb3ab69538562babd642d313766cbe2ccfb3b252fc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792205436,\"headline\":\"Why You Should Think About Palantir Differently Now\",\"id\":142957833,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Palantir Technologies (PLTR) stock trades at 78.2 times sales, compared to 3.1 for the S\\u0026P 500. Investors paying that premium need to know exactly what they are buying, and the case Palantir makes has evolved. During the fiscal Q3 2024 earnings call, executives highlighted the fast-growing number of U.S. businesses signing on as customers. By the latest call in fiscal Q2 2026, the focus had shifted. So what does management talk up now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8955bf2fa5497edc3de33641e5dbc142262fc3cc80628d15432815560870baa4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792203588,\"headline\":\"Can Trade Desk Stock Bounce Off Its Old Support Again?\",\"id\":142957837,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors holding Trade Desk (TTD) have seen the stock lose 74.1% of its value over the past year, compared with a 17.9% return for the S\\u0026P 500. The immediate question is how much further shares might drop. One certainty is the current level: at $13.13 on October 15, the stock sits above the prices where it turned and rallied three times in 2018. How did the stock fare at this price then, and how has it fared in 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=71cf5d711ba3ba1bcbbf6c79f1f0a241d3a628524717e03107fe3ae492d959bc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792199406,\"headline\":\"UK Watchdog Proposes Strategic Market Tag for Microsoft, Puts Excel and Copilot AI Under Competition Scrutiny\",\"id\":142960644,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Madrid--Spain-05-15-2025-Close-up-Of-Lap.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The U.K.\\u0026#39;s competition regulator has proposed designating Microsoft as having a Strategic Market Status (SMS).\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2db6e325d956f17f2ea32e7621fce9621ab539e987f5dfdcb065e87bb93b602a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792197000,\"headline\":\"The AI Supercycle, Asia, And Why This Time Is Different\",\"id\":142958070,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2209095196/image_2209095196.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The AI race is about more than who builds the best model. Click here to read more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=38742d1d5916af83c5350ce68f0ddd46c425ebcdfad5d8e9debba1de9eaf54f6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792193340,\"headline\":\"Prediction: Alphabet Will Be a Larger Company Than Apple by the End of 2027\",\"id\":142951497,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"If Alphabet keeps doing what it has been doing, it could claim the title of the world's second-largest company.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dff21cdd71a1021e2d7bbc55f3d41fe78fdffb41bda1c9e790f30bb28163a3e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792187374,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today, Oct. 16: Apple Edges Higher on iPhone Duo Preorder Surge\",\"id\":142950783,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On Oct. 16, 2026, preorders for the new iPhone Duo sold out quickly, stretching delivery estimates into January.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8760fa2b760ec495891c243172b61d8880f629c24c105b7efeb44c945884b3b7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792186980,\"headline\":\"Not Alphabet. Not Microsoft. This Is the Cloud Stock I'd Buy With $5,000 Right Now.\",\"id\":142950771,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle's cloud backlog has swelled to $664 billion, and the stock has pulled back. Here's why long-term investors may want to take a closer look.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4973c9150d7ec782eb02c031b24fa855ea2e437ec9c65b2ec3d74d4711f5faa8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792184820,\"headline\":\"This is the Cheapest Mag 7 Stock Right Now\",\"id\":142951517,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Mag 7 is back. Several of the stocks are hitting new highs but there are still deals.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d47c4473ccaa3d5c01009cab96d98d9228e66494094fd44fe3410b0702fd9bb9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792184095,\"headline\":\"Update: Nasdaq Falls to End Four-Week Winning Streak Amid Tech Sell-Off\",\"id\":142950775,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"(Updates with market moves at the end of the day, and other changes, if any.) The Nasdaq Composit\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b61eb09fa533acc7c06e9bdfac5f27f1a4c0545ec3b68e4d3c126ea59190d8c7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792183920,\"headline\":\"Google Partner Novacore Labs and AIBotics Complete Acquisition of Assets, Expanding AI, Drone, Mapping and Automation Platform in Jamaica\",\"id\":142950794,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Asset acquisition adds the NovaCore brand, intellectual property, software, customer data, contracts, drone and mapping assets, and operating capabilities positioned for growth across Jamaica and the broader Caribbean NovaCore intends to expand institutional programs with the University of the West Indies Global Campus and the University of Technology through its relationship with PlayJamaica Limited MIAMI and KINGSTON, Jamaica, Oct. 16, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AIBotics, Inc. (OTCID: AIBT) (\\\"AI\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=249fb0f2a0dd3a1cb019622778149a16a57cb0624cf0a9d20912ba64208b9b92\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179840,\"headline\":\"Q3 Earnings Season Preview: Revenue Beats Lag, Multi-Sector Momentum Holds\",\"id\":142950777,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Q3 earnings season has started off a bit mixed, with the growth pace and the revenue-beat percentage tracking lower relative to the recent past. Results so far are heavily weighted to Finance, and these initial mixed trends may shift as we head into the heart of the earnings cycle.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=50cdc27926803ec58ffe2156658a02fb65fb3a3b752854e7091b5f8f65807dc7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179266,\"headline\":\"Apple is Now the Top-Performing Magnificent 7 Stock in 2026. Here’s why it’s Beating NVIDIA, Tesla, and Amazon\",\"id\":142949982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple (NASDAQ: AAPL) has emerged as the best-performing Magnificent Seven stock of 2026, outperforming NVIDIA (NVDA), Microsoft (MSFT), Amazon (AMZN), Alphabet (GOOGL), Meta Platforms (META), and Tesla (TSLA). But what's driving Apple's surprising rally while other AI stocks struggle? In this episode, 24/7 Wall St.'s Eric Bleeker examines why Apple shares have surged more than 27% in 2026, even as concerns about artificial intelligence spending are weighing on some of the market's biggest technology companies. While competitors are committing hundreds of billions of dollars to AI data centers, Apple is taking a different approach. Its strategy emphasizes on-device artificial intelligence, privacy, and integrating AI directly into its ecosystem, avoiding much of the enormous infrastructure spending burden facing its rivals. Eric breaks down Apple's latest earnings, its massive share repurchase program, and why investors are increasingly rewarding the company's capital-efficient AI strategy. He also compares the Magnificent Seven's performance in 2026 against their remarkable returns since the beginning of 2023, revealing a very different picture of the AI investment boom. Has Apple become the market's ultimate AI safe-haven stock? And could its strategy continue outperforming NVIDIA and the rest of Big Tech?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f831231eaab13eb8aeb433db1cbbdbf1fe067161173a318013a30dfc63d8ee53\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792177909,\"headline\":\"Why Is Alphabet (GOOGL) Pushing Gemini 4 Argon Into Enterprise Workflows Worldwide?\",\"id\":142950020,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Alphabet (NasdaqGS:GOOGL) has rolled out its Gemini 4 Argon AI model globally, targeting coding, science and accounting workloads. Google reports that Gemini 4 Argon reaches benchmark leading accuracy in several scientific domains and finance automation tasks. The release focuses on enterprise users that rely on consistent AI outputs for software development, research workflows and complex financial processes. Gemini 4 Argon’s global launch gives only a partial view of Alphabet’s position in...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=de0836e571a870e13a1acb10fbfe8650a7da4047df3e8dba18b05c8757b36896\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792177878,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Losers: GOOGL, CRM, MSFT, AMZN, CSCO in Today's US Session\",\"id\":142959213,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Dow Jones decliners in today's US session: Alphabet, Salesforce, Microsoft, Amazon, and Cisco fell, with GOOGL down 2.76% and CRM down 2.59%.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9bf954ed3d68f0415a8a21c3fb37453861ad6deccaac5526628104a7171ae838\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173466,\"headline\":\"'Anthropic quietly pitches its own AI safety bill to lawmakers'- Politico\",\"id\":142960645,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/16/anthropic-ai-safety-01124654\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9ada1028a5500b528478b7f4287eb30b696512ff26cd3fb3c8acb3be05bb3ffc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173460,\"headline\":\"Equity Indexes Slide Intraday Amid Tech Sell-Off\",\"id\":142950016,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"US benchmark equity indexes slid intraday as several major technology names sold off. The Nasdaq\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=29d4097f4b5eaad4bf8a0f925ae3ffff98d666fc8bfa96a7a4e407a5cf701c06\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170959,\"headline\":\"Meta: What You Need To Know Before Earnings\",\"id\":142950624,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2188389148/image_2188389148.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms (META) earnings next Wednesday: growth outlook vs heavy investment spending and slim free cash flow. Read the latest analysis on the stock here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a4040a1400e6e16fd5855c297de9a90465442ee86871d4ebfc3f80d55ad30862\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170689,\"headline\":\"AI Bubble Just Became The Fed's Inflation Problem\",\"id\":142950625,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2238010796/image_2238010796.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"AI boom is fueling persistent inflation, compelling the Fed to maintain a hawkish stance and likely hike rates into 2027. Read full analysis here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f93e49345d4ef1569067ef7a30f1c16baab90a45bdf30e4247783f56dcf9296e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170388,\"headline\":\"The Next Stock Market Crash Could Start With Just 3 Companies\",\"id\":142948989,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Just three companies now account for approximately 21% of the S\\u0026P 500's total market capitalization. NVIDIA (NVDA), Apple (AAPL), and Microsoft (MSFT) have become so dominant that their performance could determine the direction of the entire stock market. But what happens if these technology giants stumble? In this episode, 24/7 Wall St. co-founder Doug McIntyre and senior writer Lee Jackson discuss the extraordinary concentration of the S\\u0026P 500 and why millions of investors may be taking on more risk than they realize. Much of today's market enthusiasm is driven by artificial intelligence. Companies like NVIDIA, Microsoft, Alphabet (GOOGL), Amazon (AMZN), and Meta Platforms (META) have benefited from enormous expectations for AI growth. But Doug and Lee identify several potential threats to that optimism. They explore how cheaper open-source AI models could challenge industry leaders, why opposition to AI data center construction threatens expansion plans, and how growing electricity demand is driving renewed interest in nuclear power. Most importantly, they discuss what could happen to popular index funds like the SPDR S\\u0026P 500 ETF (SPY) if the market's largest technology stocks suffer a major sell-off. They also examine whether equal-weight S\\u0026P 500 funds could provide investors with better diversification. Is your S\\u0026P 500 investment more vulnerable than you think?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ab98f35bc89dbdfbba2d5bb3c55f635e436e1332b1ab7a49092a897f1a8ae3f7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170383,\"headline\":\"Nvidia and Apple Each Gave $25 Million to Trump’s White House Ballroom\",\"id\":142948990,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Confidential documents reveal that two of the world's most valuable tech companies quietly wrote identical checks to fund a new White House ballroom, and neither one sent out a press release. The real question is what each company expects to get back.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d21c891d39bf5dd2d3275dffe290c7ddcf2c56f5c8b90274001eb50985dd3df5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170000,\"headline\":\"Quantum could end bitcoin — or not. Here's why not to panic.\",\"id\":142949050,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Scott Melker discusses Google's latest quantum computing breakthrough that could pose new threats to bitcoin (BTC-USD). \\\"The Daily Wolf with Scott Melker\\\" airs every day at 12:00 p.m. Tune in for your daily dose of all things crypto. Make sure to also check out Yahoo Finance's new crypto hub to find the latest crypto-related news.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=51a1dec9f7f009de7c9b36bde9e22cd9b5a44683f425e2f3e2e1e9804641b243\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169134,\"headline\":\"Alphabet’s Cloud Surge and AI Dominance Overshadow Capex Fears and Keep Me Buying\",\"id\":142949033,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street keeps punishing Alphabet for its spending, but the cloud and AI numbers tell a completely different story about where this company is heading.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=79cadcad1debcd1a0fe7cc7742f24db86c41242792616e0b2e9e41dbea4fea74\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169127,\"headline\":\"Apple and Alphabet Are Especially Scared of a Blue Wave\",\"id\":142949012,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple and Alphabet just posted record quarters, but a single election outcome could gut the profit streams funding their biggest bets. Here is why the political calendar may matter more than the earnings beat.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=072f9363aa886b1e7ccf544f8191da043de475f755afc301fa8ac3716b61d897\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169118,\"headline\":\"The Next $5 Trillion Dollar Company: Alphabet or Microsoft?\",\"id\":142949031,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Alphabet is growing its cloud faster, but Microsoft is funding its AI buildout from its own cash while Alphabet sells stock to keep pace. The race to $5 trillion turns on which strategy survives contact with a $175 billion spending plan.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b2b7e333f74a91f7507db61ea61e28405e7b9576046edb29551b11fef03a8a65\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168645,\"headline\":\"Chase Tower Renovation Costs JPMorgan Over $800M in Chicago\",\"id\":142949054,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan's Chicago Chase Tower overhaul now carries a price tag above $800M, with completion expected in mid- to late 2027.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=65314451b3dfac0dd5ff6efc1425e1614cf1e043482759bef6cdb8e89e270782\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168220,\"headline\":\"If Google Grows At 10% a Year, Here’s What $1,000 Becomes By 2030\",\"id\":142949055,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Alphabet just posted 24% revenue growth and an 82% surge in Cloud, but the real question is what that momentum does to a simple $1,000 stake by the end of the decade, and the answer depends on three growth engines that most investors are overlooking.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c7a97486e3b3acee3c8a61c4c5117b6044c3fd2a7327a58a01fb98e38cc39d50\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167900,\"headline\":\"Frontier Climate buyers ink deal to store CO2 as solid rock\",\"id\":142949056,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Carbon removal company 44.01 will remove over 20,000 tons of carbon dioxide through a process called in-situ mineralization for the collection of carbon removal buyers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=608883b0970bba98a6a21256594d27d8786edf600a2253209840f677a572548f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167480,\"headline\":\"Big Tech Earnings Suddenly Matter for the Bond Market\",\"id\":142949022,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Falling Treasury yields suggest growing concern about the AI boom, putting pressure on Big Tech’s coming earnings reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5f18c901a76fa366ab22d6cd3ce50431f7996cafba44d6ba35446f24bc6e76c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166798,\"headline\":\"Waymo’s robotaxis are headed to Canada\",\"id\":142949058,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The company will start off by testing its self-driving vehicles on Toronto's streets.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=45b399907eec6bfff620189c591b645602b4cabdfd743d24c0f241a1b7c32cc2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166451,\"headline\":\"The Next AI Stock Wall Street Is Starting to Pay Attention To\",\"id\":142949059,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Arm Holdings has surged over 120% this year while building a chip empire that stretches from smartphones into AI data centers, but a brutal recent selloff and a valuation that makes even NVIDIA look cheap raise a pointed question about how much further this story can run.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=711bce0ba02ea1c180cd24443ef2c6336a2becc4b65ba2e12d58b434036ffb05\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166160,\"headline\":\"Hot PPI report throws cold water on rate cuts\",\"id\":142949060,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Scott Melker discusses MSCI's latest decision, which could remove Strategy (MSTR) and other bitcoin (BTC-USD) treasury companies from the index, Google's (GOOG, GOOGL) latest quantum computing breakthrough, and why the hot PPI report may put the Fed's rate cut decision on hold. \\\"The Daily Wolf with Scott Melker\\\" airs every day at 12:00 p.m. Tune in for your daily dose of all things crypto. Make sure to also check out Yahoo Finance's new crypto hub to find the latest crypto-related news.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c7b6c7025bb4bddd8ea17be9b0b6d277d9e8a2d90d3264965b9c57000eaabfbd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166047,\"headline\":\"Does The Move In Snowflake Stock Change Anything?\",\"id\":142949036,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Snowflake (SNOW) stock rose 59.3% from January 18 to October 15, 2026, against 12.5% for the S\\u0026P 500. The company reported quarterly results three times along the way, on February 25, May 27 and September 2. Buyers appear to be betting that customers using AI on Snowflake's data platform will keep its sales growth climbing while its losses shrink. So how much faster is Snowflake growing than it was in January.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fbd14ade6214cff0bbe86e260a9fd8d09e3391e0aa545d56f49dfb17e0b1f19f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792165407,\"headline\":\"What Is The Biggest Threat To Microsoft Stock?\",\"id\":142949023,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Buyers are paying for growth, and Microsoft (MSFT) is delivering it. The stock returned 37.2% between July 17 and October 15, 2026, against 4.1% for the S\\u0026P 500. Revenue climbed 17.7% in fiscal Q4 2026 from a year earlier. Yet on a July 29 earnings call, executives described a cost to that growth that is still rising. What is that cost, and who is raising it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=42d7abc2a9bb8e2f782d69ddbea13cf4f72d18dd4d868def556145e1f6ea4c86\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792163976,\"headline\":\"Tesla Gets Competition From Nvidia In Self Driving Cars\",\"id\":142947882,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia is quietly signing deals with some of the world's biggest automakers, and its self-driving platform looks remarkably like Tesla's most prized technology. The question now is whether Tesla's brand can hold off a rival that plays for the entire industry rather than just one car company.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3fe3fa0ff7478756f442147c3c87a14116f33db1eaae3dea19a96fca55c333e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792163340,\"headline\":\"Compass (COMP) Jumped, But What Is Drawing Attention Now?\",\"id\":142947920,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Compass (COMP) has been reshaping its boardroom this month, highlighted by the appointment of former Google executive Sissie Hsiao as director, even as fresh securities litigation and MLS-related legal disputes gather around the business. Compass shares closed at US$9.62 after a 1-day share price return of 9.82%, although the 30-day and 90-day share price returns are down 7.14% and 19.83% as the board reshuffle, securities lawsuit and MLS dispute reshape how investors weigh Compass’s...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8928c546be343c85996a01db4be8bf5359d5301b085abb9c28300c4663c1cdf3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792163100,\"headline\":\"Waymo targets Toronto robotaxi launch in 2028\",\"id\":142947918,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Waymo is preparing to bring its autonomous ride-hailing service to Toronto, with the Alphabet Inc (NASDAQ:GOOG)-owned company targeting its first passenger trips in Canada in 2028. The California-based company said Ontario has approved its participation in the province’s Automated Vehicle...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9d73499a0fca19ed3bc7950df84acf71fd88ce339e585bd64f8a9bc3707e0feb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161900,\"headline\":\"How the AI Gods Plan to Give Their Money Away\",\"id\":142947921,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Many of the new generation of billionaires are turning to philanthropic organizations tied to the sometimes controversial philosophy known as effective altruism.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=24eff3fa639a2d16bce21a255f84e96f1e9b39d3239bc7e9a186bab2af00bd39\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161792,\"headline\":\"AI infrastructure stocks sell off, but the data center boom rolls on\",\"id\":142947892,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi and EMJ Capital Founder and President Eric Jackson examine the disconnect between Wall Street's sell-off in AI infrastructure stocks and the construction boom unfolding on the ground. Using Hut 8's (HUT) Louisiana data center project as an example.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0356c9838bfa23e5845467709f9a7a09e80f4789f51573bce5343a0ea2ff55af\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792160010,\"headline\":\"Tesla Roadster Debut, Tech Sell-Off, and a college alternative for entrepreneurship\",\"id\":142947913,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi digs in to the Tesla (TSLA) Roadster debut and all the \\\"cool\\\" tricks from the SpaceX (SPCX) event Thursday. Sozzi sits down with Eric Jackson, EMJ Capital Founder and President, plus Gagan Biyani, CEO of The Horowitz Andreessen Academy to discuss alternatives to college.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=375d5eeb022588101a13b427d3212e43fbadf939a397e45738e79232bea867f4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159020,\"headline\":\"From AI laggard to $5 Trillion: Apple's winning strategy\",\"id\":142947895,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Just weeks ago, Apple (AAPL) faced criticism for lagging behind Big Tech rivals in AI infrastructure spending. Now, the company has reportedly surpassed a $5 trillion market valuation. The 8:30 panel examines how CEO Tim Cook helped drive Apple's rise through its booming services business, disciplined capital spending, and relationships with political and global leaders, even as questions remain about its AI strategy. Bullseye American Ingenuity Fund portfolio manager Adam Johnson sits down with The 8:30 Hosts, Julie Hyman and Jake Conley, to discuss the details.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2ed0835ed96c0bed8345f4af77b00a13a5dd5f3787744fdaa3b2ad94d55acb7c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792158600,\"headline\":\"Anthropic Might Be Worth ‘Only’ $1.5 Trillion. Why It Isn’t a Disaster for the AI Trade.\",\"id\":142947908,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI stocks have been hit by worries about Anthropic's IPO but it isn't all bad news.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c5435f7f9da4f120c0ff2d4dda20ce408c7d56366267155164de5fdf368b1781\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792157901,\"headline\":\"How Much Of Apple Stock Rides On One Product?\",\"id\":142945981,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors in Apple (AAPL) know the iPhone drives the business, but its sheer scale remains striking. The company generated $54.3 billion from iPhone sales during fiscal Q3 2026, the June quarter. That figure accounted for roughly half of its total $109.4 billion in revenue. Furthermore, iPhone sales climbed 22% from a year earlier. This outpaced the overall company, which grew 16%. So what has been pushing iPhone sales up this fast.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9c6a7b93cb149358c00aabc16ed9037ecde38c812d559b4bd8e623985fce2ee4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792157134,\"headline\":\"How Bad Would Outspending Its Cash Flow Be For Meta Stock?\",\"id\":142945514,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms (META) expects capital spending of $130 billion to $145 billion in 2026. The company raised the bottom of that range from $125 billion in July. Executives plan to secure as much capacity as possible across 2026 and 2027, though they have not yet provided a spending figure for 2027. They also noted that strong operating cash flow puts Meta in a position to fund the build. So how close is Meta to spending more than it brings in.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e573bdbff52651c287e6afec73c96903be3dec5dc783f99261c1d11a62406b87\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792156742,\"headline\":\"We're in pullback for AI again, but fundamentals are strong: Silvant's Sansoterra\",\"id\":142948704,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108420670-17921705601792170557-49040498716-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792170559\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC’s Kelly Evans discusses the tech trade amid the market rotation out of tech and artificial intelligence-related names with Michael Sansoterra of Silvant Capital Management.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=05e9a18f9c68e2752d3d48e459c9f93f3225c4a15d2400d2ecce884c5e2f9fef\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154280,\"headline\":\"Netflix Hires Former Disney Exec to Fix Content Problem. Why the Stock Is Falling.\",\"id\":142945534,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The streamer is changing up its leadership team—but that’s only drawing more attention to its biggest problem.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=74eaafc10b9f4274a899acceb1131230ca328826317f6be7f32e3bc32d925d47\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154272,\"headline\":\"This Week In Cloud AI - Akamai Technologies Boosts Global Cloud Service Adoption\",\"id\":142945515,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Akamai Technologies has observed a significant increase in customer adoption of its cloud computing services, largely driven by the growing demand for high-performance computing across AI and enterprise SaaS workloads. The company reported that this trend is evident from model training to low-latency inference, with enterprise clients utilizing its services for a range of applications, including cloud disaster recovery and core-to-edge application hosting. Akamai's momentum is supported by...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9bb9cbf4a984087c6b956308e6aff4aa9a3123c06789c31aa94718359a9b82a7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792153447,\"headline\":\"Some Anthropic Investors Now See a $1.5 Trillion IPO, Not $2 Trillion\",\"id\":142945527,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Anthropic's November IPO is reshaping what Amazon and Alphabet investors expect to see on their balance sheets, and the gap between what investors hoped for and what they now discuss hints at a bigger story about whether AI growth is living up to its hype.\",\"url\":