s Show Push to Avoid Getting Shut Out of Personal AI\",\"id\":142922223,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon is launching two new personal AI products alongside Bee, an AI hardware company it acquired in June 2025.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6f20c1bff68155561ba030183cda07ea5ce12ba5884349deb96fa08e99d1a712\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792093826,\"headline\":\"New York City Wants a Cut of the Next Quantum Breakthrough\",\"id\":142922234,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"New York City is putting $30 million into an NYU quantum computing lab in exchange for 15% of proceeds from its intellectual property, borrowing from Trump’s playbook.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9a093052b225d976f5743733d72ca75a44268d6695e47afbbfb4559dcd4121ce\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792093618,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Consumer Stocks Rise Late Afternoon\",\"id\":142921345,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Consumer stocks were higher late Thursday afternoon, with the State Street Consumer Staples Select S\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3536f526109ba12a4ccf7b83337ec76650a6d4b2550ea5e6078899fe3e8c37fd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792093392,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Tech Stocks Fall Late Afternoon\",\"id\":142921346,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech stocks were lower late Thursday afternoon, with the State Street Technology Select Sector SPDR\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6dd9d49c06d28794204651ad043cdb55ee1870a13fd8efbac99af53aad77bb0a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\