. Why Google Can Defy AI Fears.\",\"id\":142921344,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Megacap earnings are always a blockbuster event for the market, but there will be even more than usual riding on them this quarter.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f13afcb72c54f6474aff823a69949ff9553cc7ab9a8396003d5dcf5b0e168fde\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792084260,\"headline\":\"Meet the Low-Cost Vanguard ETF With Taiwan Semiconductor, Samsung Electronics, SK Hynix, and ASML as Its 4 Largest Holdings\",\"id\":142920268,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"International stock ETFs offer superior diversification, lower valuations, and higher yields than S\\u0026P 500 ETFs like VOO.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=010de4eb3a54db10cda6f8a002844349d6a8c49d46426cd57de9ccd4bd93423a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792084027,\"headline\":\"'Investors temper Anthropic IPO valuation expectations over revenue growth slowdown, sources say'- Reuters Exclusive\",\"id\":142945239,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.reuters.com/business/finance/investors-temper-anthropic-ipo-valuation-expectations-over-revenue-growth-2026-10-15/\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1915d4be0b8bc64fe3cc974408aa7c491ea9bf320ad7c93c090fc1ddec6b7f7c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792083617,\"headline\":\"DTE Energy Is Becoming More Interesting as America’s Power Needs Soar\",\"id\":142920321,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Data centers are reshaping which utility stocks deserve a second look, and one Michigan company just signed agreements with Oracle and Google that could quietly supercharge it