uct Creator Allegra Jacchia Posts \\\"We’re doubling down on video on 𝕏. Today, we're piloting Video Kickstart Bonus, an invite-only program that rewards creators for posting their video content here...\\\"\",\"id\":142945241,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://x.com/allegrajacchia/status/2110821237517959503\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c3ce1a8926937cfb18ffa3739d0d71ecc24807db9f8d3b34dcf0835ddba5df34\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792082413,\"headline\":\"These dow jones stocks are moving in today's session\",\"id\":142919827,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay updated with the movements of the dow jones index in the middle of the day on Thursday. Discover which stocks are leading as top gainers and losers in today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=18dc9eae377f70c9060ce92d31795980c6c5b9529453a1aa557a7ac15259d50c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792081130,\"headline\":\"Blackstone’s $200B Data Center Empire Anchors Its AI Bet\",\"id\":142920323,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Blackstone's data center investments reached $200B in July, up from $55B in June 2024, as the firm extends its AI push into chips and cloud.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1a6833ddcc72c770b7fe8cac205dc010507d9c3f33b7352e5cf24cf7d1f4772b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792079977,\"headline\":\"Apple sets preorder date for its ambitious and expensive iPhone Duo\",\"id\":142921331,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple's iPhone Duo is available for preorder Friday, Oct. 16.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=96303d28dd9fa67e3725af8224