etime\":1792078041,\"headline\":\"Microsoft’s Azure Grew 40% and Is Still Reportedly Hunting for 20% Cost Cuts\",\"id\":142919167,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Azure is booking revenue faster than almost any cloud business in history, yet its leadership reportedly just told team heads to slash costs by a fifth. Something about the math behind that explosive growth is not adding up.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=749030d25e398d0b6b368c83af4ad980c1348315333021e274ea23bf7f0e5119\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792077731,\"headline\":\"Anthropic Is Growing 50%, Microsoft Isn’t\",\"id\":142919155,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Anthropic's explosive growth is exposing a painful gap between AI hype and reality for some of the biggest names in tech, and their investors may not yet grasp how serious the valuation problem has become.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a76c7a7b86e1fc9f28ef86af5e68986817a272e7ba268c19e6581ac9d1e4f156\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792077480,\"headline\":\"Here's What $5,000 Invested in Nvidia Stock Could Be Worth by the End of 2030\",\"id\":142919144,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"If all goes right, an investment in Nvidia could more than triple over the next four years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ecfdf0bf21af06b1e7359f1bc6f00258f690b54e866e2f97633f2a7976237751\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792076947,\"headline\":\"Collect Monthly Income From The AI Copper Trade\",\"id\":142921126,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2221878799/image_2221878799.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Copper demand is rising on AI data centers and EVs as supply stays tight. Click for an updated market outlook.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b9436b307f7b224365f7edc38cff5f633f0aa2fb0ce56428ddcded988756b6cc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792076419,\"headline\":\"Meta’s AI Spending Is Massive. The Payoff Could Be Even Bigger\",\"id\":142919198,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta is pouring over $130 billion into AI while free cash flow craters and Reality Labs keeps bleeding billions. Whether that spending is a catastrophic overhang or the setup for a massive payoff depends on one number that most investors are overlooking.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=186d87d88f05055c4081a2ff6e8581010935958aa8d80211389bb4ba9f9779f4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792075914,\"headline\":\"Robinhood, Cboe Expand Prediction Market Offerings After SEC Win\",\"id\":142919164,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Robinhood, Cboe to launch options contracts betting on certain company metrics after SEC approval. HOOD stock falls below key level.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0a4e87b0dbfda97d97ed9d3bff5f86986277d693b933aa6bb862f0a91bce0b7c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792075680,\"headline\":\"Consumer goods giants step up ad intensity as other big spenders pull back: report\",\"id\":142919200,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GOOGL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Divergent paths for tech firms and categories like CPG and beauty and cosmetics underpin what WARC calls a “two-speed marketplace.”\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9bea8cd26184fae1b1e96387d2e08c3f41a9a1adae6b4dc4e807c34ed9a70677\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetim