      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792391363,\"headline\":\"Stocktwits Tech Watch: Netflix And Meta Report Earnings As Nvidia, Oracle Product Events Loom\",\"id\":142994993,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors are bracing for a busy week as Q3 earnings season enters key period.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1274b49925fcbd514117dddc5e4b133bcf658a84a1802f7b4e0a68cd5e6c68f0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792385682,\"headline\":\"INTC, AMD, MU, SNDK: US Chip Stocks Rebound After Worst Week Since March\",\"id\":142992690,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chipmakers recover as investors brace for major earnings reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=39a3e45fe00cb49aa7b5fb6765d12adce7a0d00e6d079aa5a6ef77cfab9f604b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792382876,\"headline\":\"No ‘Black Monday’? Nasdaq, S\\u0026P 500, Dow Futures Spike As Big Tech Earnings Loom This Week — Retail Stays Cautious\",\"id\":142992351,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"U.S. stock futures rebound after the Nasdaq’s worst week since early June, as investors look ahead to earnings from Netflix, Tesla and Meta.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1a2e701a4b533b333f361b3a63e36f7840c645ceaa6ad5ec7dd99a649e6795af\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792378020,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave, Oracle have an interest rate problem\",\"id\":142992151,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave and Oracle are borrowing billions for AI just as rates rise. See what the interest bills, bond yields and credit ratings reveal about the risk.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c17003935bf1124cabd573194be1f91c91ed2b180d26b06a704951188042e8b6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792378020,\"headline\":\"Asian stocks start week on back foot, tracking tech-led Wall St losses\",\"id\":142992144,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Asian stocks mostly fell Monday as traders tracked a tech-heavy selloff on Wall Street that was fuelled by growing worries over the AI investment boom.\\\"The US equity sell-off reflected a reassessment of the economics underpinning the AI investment boom rather than a simple downgrade to end-demand,\\\" said National Australia Bank's Rodrigo Catril.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=15eb4bff5e4b1922666d2fe714d2248a58af2c93c734cc56e336294fac9402e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792374806,\"headline\":\"What Would Stop The AI Selloff\",\"id\":142994131,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f81e56ca69a5fcfaacd77d3a9630d96359897268651205c32cb90015cce769d2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792372620,\"headline\":\"Meta, Tesla Q3 earnings will be fighting rising AI skepticism\",\"id\":142991445,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The tech giants’ results will be the week’s biggest in a volatile market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fc1c7783b3805d0c84a9fc0df7acd5d0d866570cb349f636026adfe06d7d51a8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792366274,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures Rebound After AI Sell-Off; Meta, SpaceX, Tesla Earnings Key\",\"id\":142989726,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Futures rise after the S\\u0026P 500, Nasdaq and leading stocks broke key support. Can Meta, Tesla, SpaceX earnings and capex revive the AI sector?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7ccf03be8481c9a0b30bc0679d5ff5912cb567bac2d203c032f6082fd7495c79\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792364400,\"headline\":\"Top 4 Earnings Reports This Week: What Tesla, Meta, SpaceX, Netflix Must Show\",\"id\":142989727,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla, Meta, SpaceX, and Netflix earnings land this week. See why forecasts, not profits, could move each stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=088a6f07274d5ef19dcc93ad1ad7eb4642a3200a6147fa16c50c76411525e650\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792361245,\"headline\":\"US Stock Futures Rise Ahead of Busy Earnings Week: Markets Wrap\",\"id\":142990448,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"US stock futures rose and oil edged lower as traders prepared for a packed week of corporate earnings and Chinese economic data against a backdrop of heightened geopolitical risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5cf55b503c7ce5c1e66ee6cf6e09653df6b5904c808a2eb72d5e4278f1ed7149\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792361160,\"headline\":\"Stock Futures Rise Ahead of Another Busy Earnings Week\",\"id\":142989729,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ukraine launched a drone attack and struck a major oil terminal in Russia, according to reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b7d86d63b4bdb699a2c21477c6b3ab457e6dea6d5b7f51a5d0657d89ad03abc7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792360102,\"headline\":\"Bonds Already Discounted A 3rd Hike, Stocks Have Followed, Stay Long\",\"id\":142991440,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2298720448/image_2298720448.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Stocks sold off sharply after inflation data and a delayed reaction to Social Security COLA news. Read more on the market here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f639953768fbbd69bdc4fa4baffb34746c56adb4a5f8894e3effe2572f294a4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792354307,\"headline\":\"Meta Earnings Puts Adobe Stock And AI Ad Software Names In Focus\",\"id\":142989170,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI hype is colliding with earnings season, and Meta’s upcoming report has suddenly become a live stress test for the whole trade. After the sharp pullback in Nvidia and the Nasdaq 100, investors are asking which digital ad and social platforms look ready to handle heavier AI spending and tougher expectations. This article breaks down three stocks that appear positioned to benefit if confidence in AI-driven monetization holds up. The three stocks discussed below are just a starting sample. The...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=370bf879c132dd8ac54bd65574fb82a73e36aa843c0f3e84c24c7e4f793369b9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792349940,\"headline\":\"Oil Futures Likely to React to Ukraine’s Attack on Russian Oil, Lifting of Diesel Sanctions\",\"id\":142989177,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ukraine launched a drone attack and struck a major oil terminal in Russia, according to reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2de825ae32f2e49eeca1610625dd9f49b37f02df626b6cda3d0494161957390c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792346400,\"headline\":\"Tesla, Meta, GE Aerospace, GM,  IBM, and More Stocks to Watch This Week\",\"id\":142988565,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"It’s a heavy week for earnings, with reports also coming from Lockheed Martin, Spotify, Abbott, and many more. This week will also bring data on manufacturing, services, and new homes.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3b9b65ee48be8769aa35d4a77ac8d2b59e32c0318a3ffda6a015e232e33f52ae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792344746,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures: More AI Pain After Nasdaq Sell-Off? Meta, SpaceX, Tesla Earnings Key\",\"id\":142987953,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The S\\u0026P 500, Nasdaq and leading stocks broke key support. Can Meta, Tesla, SpaceX earnings and capex revive the AI sector?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4850df8f4a080ebe53120b2937b9c2cb3baeadb35e92705c5c6d9b119de30643\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792343792,\"headline\":\"Beeks Financial Cloud Group And 2 British AI Stocks To Watch\",\"id\":142987954,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investor focus on Meta’s upcoming earnings and what they signal for global enthusiasm around artificial intelligence has pushed AI from hype to hard questions. For UK small caps working on machine learning, automation and data intelligence, that scrutiny can create mispricing and opportunity. This piece looks at three UK-listed AI-focused smaller companies from our screener that could merit a closer look if you want targeted exposure to this theme. The stocks covered below are just a first...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e965e622c367f57664bbcf7139511fc3d41a0df04fecf34a5f37c51817d3582d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792342802,\"headline\":\"AI Sector Pressure, Earnings and Other Key Things to Watch this Week\",\"id\":142989728,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Markets enter a heavy earnings week with Meta Platforms, Tesla, Netflix and Texas Instruments reporting alongside Wednesday’s crude oil inventories. Semiconductor pressure and AI spending doubts remain front and center.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=97f569da24cbabd679aaa41027d29565b5480a13aa3e0116c143f1eaf038b236\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792337700,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Brunch: SpaceX, Tesla, Meta On The Earnings Card\",\"id\":142988445,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2262209650/image_2262209650.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX, Tesla and Meta earnings put AI spending in focus. Anthropicâs AI oversight plan. Elon Musk promises a âsentientâ Roadster.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=94735cc9488b6d03b181b6d9b142678f324e171f33ae8a31f1c1a4def85acc55\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792337515,\"headline\":\"UTES Vs. UTG: Why I Prefer The ETF As Rates Rise.\",\"id\":142988446,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1423987752/image_1423987752.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"UTES vs. UTG: compare total returns, rate resilience, and fees.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e61831d34030ae481e8eb85df48f4bd2c7200c325497ba845f3bc118b4a43bab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792334220,\"headline\":\"Meta's $18 billion teen-safety deal is about to hit earnings\",\"id\":142987433,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta’s ad machine is still humming, but Bank of America says a one-time legal bill and a $205 billion AI budget will reshape the numbers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=97636b18c