36\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Nebius Group extended its steep sell-off as investors dumped neocloud stocks amid ongoing jitters in the artificial intelligence industry.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=962b1fb2eb09bc2a10ec30640faa64f4de052377e1810be8dd8ae416714fdc55\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792237451,\"headline\":\"BofA Warns AI Investors Could Lose Even If the Technology Works\",\"id\":142959982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America just invoked the ghost of the 1990s fiber optic collapse to explain why AI's biggest winners could still leave investors with nothing, even if the technology reshapes the world exactly as promised.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a4b2445fe3477280ba24144fe07b88715c87dc437e74e18d377a33b9c0cd50d6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792237260,\"headline\":\"JPMorgan Expects Q3 Earnings Growth to Broaden Beyond AI Across US and European Equities\",\"id\":142960700,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan strategists expect third-quarter corporate earnings to provide support for equity markets, citing indications that profit growth is expanding beyond artificial intelligence-related companies and across a wider range of sectors. A team led by Mislav Matejka said earnings expectations remain elevated at the index level but become more moderate when the contribution from individual companies is excluded.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=22e2d29e91ae91d19a8bc953b6d0308b628f2cbbc855615be577ed1b56a7d017\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792234800,\"headline\":\"Meta, Tesla Headline Earnings In Busy Week For Markets\",\"id\":142961762,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/assets/og_image_1200-29b2bfe1a595477db6826bd2126c63ac209