g a 10.7% return in Q3 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5bf14f22f7439c0096d4cf9d989b75e465c8148c4175d6d47c398090318ebbde\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792206503,\"headline\":\"BlackRock: 3 Key Takeaways for Long-Term Investors\",\"id\":142957843,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Private markets and active ETFs are reshaping how BlackRock captures recurring fees across market cycles.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9901abd32e36a1844058477a791bf42b81e1dd1034fa2c1359237bfa73f7e4e7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792205205,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk’s Roadster, Nvidia’s Space AI Push, Nadella’s Security Warning: Mag 7 Voices This Week\",\"id\":142957830,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Elon Musk said Tesla’s long-awaited Roadster will enter production in 2028, though he has acknowledged that the car is unlikely to materially affect the company’s revenue.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a6168d913bbf8963671ca3b4041506abaf86c19aad935a92b69cdcc5e92c9e2e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792204599,\"headline\":\"Are You Overpaying For AppLovin Stock Versus Its Rivals?\",\"id\":142957845,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the past year, AppLovin (APP) stock has lost more than half its value. The shares now trade at 20.0 times earnings. That valuation sits below Meta Platforms and Magnite, two of the three competitors in its peer group. Yet the company leads all four businesses on both revenue growth and operating margin. So what do you get for your money at AppLovin, set against its rivals.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=03b2e385dd3efe19a6b6a91ede2ee0de4f4bd18117ee09c406b61b7f315b1035\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792203588,\"headline\":\"Can Trade Desk Stock Bounce Off Its Old Support Again?\",\"id\":142957837,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors holding Trade Desk (TTD) have seen the stock lose 74.1% of its value over the past year, compared with a 17.9% return for the S\\u0026P 500. The immediate question is how much further shares might drop. One certainty is the current level: at $13.13 on October 15, the stock sits above the prices where it turned and rallied three times in 2018. How did the stock fare at this price then, and how has it fared in 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=71cf5d711ba3ba1bcbbf6c79f1f0a241d3a628524717e03107fe3ae492d959bc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792200711,\"headline\":\"$13k MRR founder reveals why Meta crushes TikTok for app marketing...\",\"id\":142955696,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Max built Maxed.ai, a lifting app, with zero coding experience.Here’s where he says to put your effort right now:Early on, skip hiring UGC creators until you know which angles actually drive downloadsGo with Meta over TikTok: “the views are more valuable... higher intent buyers... they just have a higher willingness to pay”Clipping has “really exploded” and it’s still early enough on the wave to make real moneyIt’s a great way to get international exposure and organic downloadsBonus: he started tweeting 3 months ago and now roughly a third of his revenue comes from people on X.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a57061d60512487ba016fee4504fa30006566f20da1918faeb944432a0b8d119\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792195200,\"headline\":\"AI Is Now the Top Reason for Layoffs. For Some Workers, It’s Also a Path to Starting a Business.\",\"id\":142958774,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The tools taking jobs may also be the best way to build a business of your own.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bf5b818af2e9b3f9f7030f8302f8228b420816276a605f34f96395cae56e2229\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792189791,\"headline\":\"Meta Denies Political Bias in Brazil Elections After Staff Flagged Instagram Restrictions Affecting President Lula's Accounts: Report\",\"id\":142960631,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Menlo-Park--Ca--Usa--June-7--2026-Meta-H.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Meta faces election interference allegations in Brazil over restrictions affecting Lula’s accounts while promoting Bolsonaro’s profile.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=25caa8b1022ac8dbe93ee23acac4871ac160fff752e177257abda9e6bb365021\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792185989,\"headline\":\"Here’s How Much Meta Stock Is Expected to Move After Earnings\",\"id\":142951524,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms’ next earnings are slated to be released Wednesday afternoon, and options pricing indicates the stock could make big moves following the report.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d7745abdb42549f5985d560da137dad5152dfbc9682bee097b8df148dcb4e40a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792184887,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures: S\\u0026P 500, Nasdaq Break Key Levels As CoreWeave, Dell Dive; Tesla, SpaceX, Meta Loom\",\"id\":142950801,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The S\\u0026P 500 and Nasdaq knifed below their 50-day lines as CoreWeave led a broad tech sell-off. Tesla, SpaceX, Meta earnings loom.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ee156952ef7059ac64685a0da859b784eb19aa7d52ebe0fff3f734fbc8a111e9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179840,\"headline\":\"Q3 Earnings Season Preview: Revenue Beats Lag, Multi-Sector Momentum Holds\",\"id\":142950777,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Q3 earnings season has started off a bit mixed, with the growth pace and the revenue-beat percentage tracking lower relative to the recent past. Results so far are heavily weighted to Finance, and these initial mixed trends may shift as we head into the heart of the earnings cycle.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=50cdc27926803ec58ffe2156658a02fb65fb3a3b752854e7091b5f8f65807dc7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179266,\"headline\":\"Apple is Now the Top-Performing Magnificent 7 Stock in 2026. Here’s why it’s Beating NVIDIA, Tesla, and Amazon\",\"id\":142949982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple (NASDAQ: AAPL) has emerged as the best-performing Magnificent Seven stock of 2026, outperforming NVIDIA (NVDA), Microsoft (MSFT), Amazon (AMZN), Alphabet (GOOGL), Meta Platforms (META), and Tesla (TSLA). But what's driving Apple's surprising rally while other AI stocks struggle? In this episode, 24/7 Wall St.'s Eric Bleeker examines why Apple shares have surged more than 27% in 2026, even as concerns about artificial intelligence spending are weighing on some of the market's biggest technology companies. While competitors are committing hundreds of billions of dollars to AI data centers, Apple is taking a different approach. Its strategy emphasizes on-device artificial intelligence, privacy, and integrating AI directly into its ecosystem, avoiding much of the enormous infrastructure spending burden facing its rivals. Eric breaks down Apple's latest earnings, its massive share repurchase program, and why investors are increasingly rewarding the company's capital-efficient AI strategy. He also compares the Magnificent Seven's performance in 2026 against their remarkable returns since the beginning of 2023, revealing a very different picture of the AI investment boom. Has Apple become the market's ultimate AI safe-haven stock? And could its strategy continue outperforming NVIDIA and the rest of Big Tech?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f831231eaab13eb8aeb433db1cbbdbf1fe067161173a318013a30dfc63d8ee53\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792175026,\"headline\":\"Netflix, Tesla Headline Busy Earnings Calendar; Spending Plans Key To Meta's Report\",\"id\":142950029,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix stock continues to trend lower ahead of its quarterly earnings report amid slowing growth and customer engagement.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2be5562f384d7ba43520a2aae43b1760ae444d2b601bd191268fc3e6c405c2e7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170959,\"headline\":\"Meta: What You Need To Know Before Earnings\",\"id\":142950624,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2188389148/image_2188389148.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms (META) earnings next Wednesday: growth outlook vs heavy investment spending and slim free cash flow. Read the latest analysis on the stock here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a4040a1400e6e16fd5855c297de9a90465442ee86871d4ebfc3f80d55ad30862\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170840,\"headline\":\"Twilio Stock Plummets to Become the S\\u0026P 500’s Top Loser Today\",\"id\":142950031,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of the cloud communications company dropped below their current 50-day moving average.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f10108ae17262b11979d8eb65ad0be1ddaddeec6bed0cfa15f2490f012e77f2d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170388,\"headline\":\"The Next Stock Market Crash Could Start With Just 3 Companies\",\"id\":142948989,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Just three companies now account for approximately 21% of the S\\u0026P 500's total market capitalization. NVIDIA (NVDA), Apple (AAPL), and Microsoft (MSFT) have become so dominant that their performance could determine the direction of the entire stock market. But what happens if these technology giants stumble? In this episode, 24/7 Wall St. co-founder Doug McIntyre and senior writer Lee Jackson discuss the extraordinary concentration of the S\\u0026P 500 and why millions of investors may be taking on more risk than they realize. Much of today's market enthusiasm is driven by artificial intelligence. Companies like NVIDIA, Microsoft, Alphabet (GOOGL), Amazon (AMZN), and Meta Platforms (META) have benefited from enormous expectations for AI growth. But Doug and Lee identify several potential threats to that optimism. They explore how cheaper open-source AI models could challenge industry leaders, why opposition to AI data center construction threatens expansion plans, and how growing electricity demand is driving renewed interest in nuclear power. Most importantly, they discuss what could happen to popular index funds like the SPDR S\\u0026P 500 ETF (SPY) if the market's largest technology stocks suffer a major sell-off. They also examine whether equal-weight S\\u0026P 500 funds could provide investors with better diversification. Is your S\\u0026P 500 investment more vulnerable than you think?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ab98f35bc89dbdfbba2d5bb3c55f635e436e1332b1ab7a49092a897f1a8ae3f7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170240,\"headline\":\"What Can’t Be Denied About the AI Trade. CoreWeave and Anthropic Are Clues.\",\"id\":142950032,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Worries over ballooning debt, slowing growth, and risks of commodification wreaked havoc on AI and chip stocks this week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0fd5c3555f29ecf5107d96ff8153e8ddf1abee256f387bca3da29566f32574ce\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169688,\"headline\":\"CNBC TechCheck Evening Edition: October 16, 2026\",\"id\":142962391,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108421623-TC-Clean-101626.jpg?v=1792183926\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC's TechCheck brings you the latest in tech news from CNBC's 1 Market in the heart of San Francisco.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=530a6bac4cd931436f37191c2cf18170a5e7650170c8f36af8cbb7fd96f70b9f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169027,\"headline\":\"The Tech Trade Needs a Life Raft. Mag 7 Earnings Can’t Come Soon Enough.\",\"id\":142949034,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The stock market isn’t done selling technology stocks, and support can't come soon enough.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e29a8590369372071a38aae8573acc6c3b0d2d0e2c44adadd5c295d5ed2b24e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168871,\"headline\":\"Meta's AI Spending Could Hit $205 Billion in 2027: Why Magnificent 7 ETFs Face a Crucial Test\",\"id\":142960632,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/New-York--Usa---14-December-2024-Meta-Pl.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Meta’s earnings could test whether AI-driven ad growth justifies rising spending, putting QQQ, MAGS and FDN ETFs in focus as 2027 investment costs loom.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=42df08d2e16df385a72b9ae4e442fda569140b09e2dfc0c4943e29632f7905e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168390,\"headline\":\"Strong Top-Line Growth and AI Innovation Lifted Meta Platforms (META) Higher\",\"id\":142949081,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wedgewood Partners, an investment management company, released its third-quarter 2026 investor letter. The letter can be downloaded here. Wedgewood Composite delivered a net return of 2.5% in the quarter, compared to 2.3% for the Standard \\u0026 Poor’s 500 Index, 0.9% for the Russell 1000 Growth Index, and 2.6% for the Russell 1000 Value Index. Surging […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ad5725c29ddb00e16e159b0aab3f873024c1c30035a7ac68a13f1dc6e8660e4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167849,\"headline\":\"RBC raises Shopify price target to $200 on sustained growth outlook\",\"id\":142949083,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- RBC Capital Markets raised its price target on Shopify to $200 from $180, citing strong growth momentum and the potential for the e-commerce platform to exceed market expectations for third-quarter results and fourth-quarter guidance.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7b862155969fa775288828ec0d24c3cbc16b9df512d4fe72e09563741d75b664\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167480,\"headline\":\"Big Tech Earnings Suddenly Matter for the Bond Market\",\"id\":142949022,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Falling Treasury yields suggest growing concern about the AI boom, putting pressure on Big Tech’s coming earnings reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5f18c901a76fa366ab22d6cd3ce50431f7996cafba44d6ba35446f24bc6e76c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792165020,\"headline\":\"Meta expected to beat revenue forecasts as AI boosts advertising, says Bank of America\",\"id\":142949082,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms Inc (NASDAQ:META, XETRA:FB2A, SIX:FB) is expected to beat third-quarter revenue forecasts as artificial intelligence (AI) supports advertising growth, Bank of America has said. The bank forecasts revenue of $63.8 billion for the three months to September, above the $63.3...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=74eaa20fcb6a73fde60bb51a31b4f3e7492ddeb1f530fc076db878540a8ca95e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792164511,\"headline\":\"The Week That Was: October 16, 2026\",\"id\":142962414,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108421199-6ED5-WTW-101626-2.jpg?v=1792177316\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC's Dom Chu looks ahead to what are likely to be next week's top business and financial stories.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c6b4a5f7a77d25d06e2b0b19bbdcded876a50a18314e392d7b69390c8fa42903\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792164423,\"headline\":\"Meta launches new ‘open’ AI model – and it comes with a big surprise\",\"id\":142947900,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Powerful ‘Muse Spark Open’ system represents a departure from many other AI systems, and from Meta’s long-running feud with Apple\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7239abde67e4ec4c6cfcfac6e8b022a429fb46a1e411aca1f24c12b2433695b9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792163802,\"headline\":\"Meta Platforms (META) Unveiled Muse Spark Open For Developers\",\"id\":142947901,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms (NasdaqGS:META) introduced Muse Spark Open, a new open AI model for developers, alongside its closed Muse Wonder system. The business confirmed a dual-track approach that keeps Muse Wonder proprietary while releasing Muse Spark Open for community and commercial use. Meta agreed an AI partnership with Apple to bring Muse Spark Open tooling to Mac devices, linking its models with Apple's hardware and software. Meta's decision to open Muse Spark Open while holding back Muse...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=465d249bc96c65f71680f1b9289971b17f0063252cddbeec11545e7a1c1ca68c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792162851,\"headline\":\"If You Invest $1,000 in AMD Each Month Starting Now, This is What You’d Have in 5 Years\",\"id\":142947944,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AMD's data center revenue just doubled and gigawatt-scale AI deals keep piling up, but a trailing P/E of 228 and a beta above 2.4 mean the stock can hurt as fast as it can reward. Here is what a disciplined monthly buying plan actually looks like across three very different futures.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9713b280b6bc06cb495a52e4be4508789a99d68eab85badbb199b6a18ceec6c8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161792,\"headline\":\"AI infrastructure stocks sell off, but the data center boom rolls on\",\"id\":142947892,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi and EMJ Capital Founder and President Eric Jackson examine the disconnect between Wall Street's sell-off in AI infrastructure stocks and the construction boom unfolding on the ground. Using Hut 8's (HUT) Louisiana data center project as an example.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0356c9838bfa23e5845467709f9a7a09e80f4789f51573bce5343a0ea2ff55af\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161077,\"headline\":\"Meta, Tesla, SpaceX Take Center Stage As Earnings Season Kicks Into High Gear. Everything You Need To Know.\",\"id\":142947905,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms and Tesla earnings will highlight a big week of reports, including Netflix, defense, software and chip names.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bf9fb1c0ef4952970ca4ae5b0c80f0c329f2c12d5608dbaae940002f0252e004\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792160445,\"headline\":\"CEO Of Tech Titan States AI Investors Have 'No Clue'\",\"id\":142949546,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2200385265/image_2200385265.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave plunges 60%, bonds yield 15%, and Gartner warns of a neocloud shakeout. Get the latest on AI infrastructure stock \\u0026 know if the AI bubble is popping.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6e767829c6621edd41547bb7bd27973d7b2724be8bc9d9223c7702f1e35db519\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792160444,\"headline\":\"Shopify Price Hikes Signal Pricing Power as JPMorgan Keeps $200 Bullish Target\",\"id\":142960633,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/The-Shopify-Trade.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Shopify raises Grow and Advanced prices, potentially adding $40M in annual revenue; analysts remain bullish despite AI cost headwinds.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c71bf642f16e6fd887d429bebd978f11014c8dc8869ca284331f742d75bbd91b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792160010,\"headline