 Benchmark and outperformed all tested OpenAI and Google models on accounting tasks, while also launching related enterprise tools aimed at customer engagement and workflow automation. The leap from Muse Spark 1.1's 61.4% score to Muse Wonder's 83.2% on accounting benchmarks highlights the pace at which Meta is improving model quality for practical, revenue linked use cases such as business...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=782364e5e07928eaecbc7535b61f829229fe143b05ac9fc6581780ec2ef35f71\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792136830,\"headline\":\"Meta Releases Muse Spark Open With an Unlikely Assist From Apple: Why It Can Afford to Give It Away\",\"id\":142938358,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms (META:NASDAQ) released Muse Spark Open on Thursday, October 15. It’s an open-weight AI model built for coding and AI agents.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=be910910a177b99e6d81858eb871e43d9a8fb7e9fe56e0f454aed63b472af4e9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792135092,\"headline\":\"Dan Ives Says Apple-Meta AI Partnership Could Help Unlock $75 Per Share in AI Value for AAPL Stock — 'Start of What Could Be Just a Massive Collaboration'\",\"id\":142945148,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Logos-of-Apple-and-Meta.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Yorkville\\u0026#39;s Dan Ives predicts Apple\\u0026#39;s AI monetization and Meta partnership will add a $75 per share incremental value to AAPL stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d35fddd2a9d0e6e41a4f1ad159388a30d2e6ef79bc275f111ddcbbd7f2be68e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792134800,\"headline\":\"What Amazon.com (AMZN)'s AI Shopping Bot Block Means For Shareholders\",\"id\":142936006,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon.com has blocked AI shopping agents such as Elon Musk's Grok Bot and Meta's Muse from placing orders, citing violations of its platform terms and reinforcing its control over automated access to its marketplace. This clampdown highlights a core business trade off for Amazon.com between protecting data, fees and customer relationships and allowing third party AI agents to automate shopping on top of its retail infrastructure. This section now looks at how Amazon.com's broader investment...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=10bab8120524eef79ec7a1efd18b715c8ae77fc8fb01e22785c5c991e05f331a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792134001,\"headline\":\"I watched Nvidia's Jensen Huang work the room in London. He brought big checks — and a blunt message\",\"id\":142948641,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108416313-1792099132044-gettyimages-2299644955-AFP_D3B329K.jpeg?v=1792099225\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia has a near monopoly over the most powerful AI chips and Huang courts tech execs and world leaders with ease.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3fad70c169461a69aff0493d654375d38a8dc80e2b675f5a0398a071d249b4de\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792134000,\"headline\":\"Look How Much Money the AI Gods Are Giving Away\",\"id\":142939544,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Many of the new generation of billionaires are turning to philanthropic organizations tied to the sometimes controversial philosophy known as effective altruism.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=83f25f420cd730a87af99d81cff8b74394e84fdaac3538812b615ed46d038c7c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792131806,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave Stock Gets Hammered by Debt Fears, Analyst Says There's More to the Story\",\"id\":142946608,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/CoreWeave-New-York-City--New-York---July.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Is CoreWeave a buy? Rising debt costs spark stock selloff, but BNP Paribas \\u0026amp; BofA predict massive upside from AI GPU capacity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=40855736f2e0592319609488dd79fe298ee2fbcbb80e3ed0b7ffff58488dd455\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792127171,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk Floats Amazon Rival After Grok AI Bots Hit Shopping Roadblocks: ‘X Shop’ or ‘Grokazon’?\",\"id\":142945870,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Magnified-View-Of-Tech-Mogul-Elon-Musk-I.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Elon Musk floats an Amazon rival after users raise concerns over restrictions on AI shopping agents, including Grok bots.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d1586cb68da804fa4ea17c61bd5ef250d21bff687e28ed704fe3ac58ea57e011\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792126506,\"headline\":\"Anthropic’s $2 Trillion IPO Dream Meets a $1.5 Trillion Reality Check\",\"id\":142931233,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Anthropic IPO investors weigh a $1.5 trillion valuation after Q3 revenue growth slowed to 45%. See what it means for AI stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=81e99b6d6af6fd8f1db21c2a19f072cebd474c1ad0f1ed701b72abe22811dc43\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792120995,\"headline\":\"AI's Credit Scare Is Sorting The Strong From The Borrowed\",\"id\":142934849,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2247451196/image_2247451196.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Wednesdayâs selloff differentiated AI stocks by how they pay for their buildout, and the ones leaning hardest on debt. Read more here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cc582dc588d77ba745ed9e84bb3ef3f6a31bb26326c16f2ef27ef44dfad08b06\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792117310,\"headline\":\"Mark Zuckerberg Opens Meta's Massive Muse Spark AI Model, Says It Runs Great on Apple's New Mac Studios Thanks to John Ternus\",\"id\":142945151,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Bukovel--Ukraine--October-13--2022-Wax-F.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Zuckerberg released Muse Spark AI model as open-weight, highlighting its ability to run locally on two Apple M5 Ultra Mac Studios.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5ba39db4f1132b2bb386a24af5124763d4cf43508465ca6f2735dd9c00750b70\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792116180,\"headline\":\"Samsung’s AI glasses make a bold bet against Meta\",\"id\":142927539,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Samsung is bringing Gemini into Meta’s back yard\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fe53d404751ff87063d198f644e97dfcba92a40df8b1ba376ae84499751c82b9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792113651,\"headline\":\"Big Tech expansion keeps equity optimism alive: Barclays\",\"id\":142948696,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108417292-17921153451792115342-49027157085-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792115344\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Ajay Rajadhyaksha, Barclays' Global Chairman of Research, says Eurozone risks are not a problem for next week, while the AI capex cycle remains in good shape supported by hyperscaler expansion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4d027ccd5bb453bc78e574ebe96620c938e9d09f78953d0368a6b2bf6cda176d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792109225,\"headline\":\"Apple, Meta find new common ground as AI reshapes Silicon Valley alliances\",\"id\":142948655,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108417787-1792123586339-1792123319370-oct153p.jpg?v=1792123585\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC’s MacKenzie Sigalos reports on an unlikely new AI alliance between Apple and Meta, with Mark Zuckerberg publicly praising Apple CEO John Ternus as the longtime rivals align around open-weight models and on-device AI.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8d9017b7019db1d995f7c2477546872a8c1c2814a15763678fca56558e2152e1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792108500,\"headline\":\"Review \\u0026 Preview: Bounce Back\",\"id\":142926433,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Indexes clawed back from early losses to end higher after a volatile day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6482f046f5f9faf95bfdd2ef7884d8f7d218425ea8ce354a3506abd15a69790e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792108383,\"headline\":\"Dow Sees Best Day In Over A Month As Investors Rotate Out Of AI Trade On Overspending Concerns — CRWV, META, SPCX, PEP In Focus\",\"id\":142922964,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"U.S. producer prices came in hot, growing at 6.3% in September, the highest since 2022, following heightened CPI data in the previous session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d6c6b903fe0eda3749e591b2e495d2395c52b212a3cf0e044cd6bc577fb18337\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792101660,\"headline\":\"Here Are the 3 Magnificent Seven Stocks I'd Buy Today\",\"id\":142922943,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The AI build-out is shifting the leaders in the Magnificent Seven.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=816e187e4a0bf51322ce7f442885bd26ddd1a669648d8506dd56e5233d17de30\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792098063,\"headline\":\"3 Chip Stocks to Buy Before Big Tech Reports Its Spending Plans\",\"id\":142922200,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Four of the largest data center spenders have budgeted over $700 billion for 2026. Microsoft's update comes Oct. 28.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aed5d3110786b7e996da57c15fc87811bf6a8e3a6f32ccdae11b8dd53979632d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792096027,\"headline\":\"AppLovin Stock Has One Thing Left To Prove\",\"id\":142922237,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AppLovin (APP) stock has lost 55.6% over the past year, trailing a 17.3% return for the S\\u0026P 500. Following that decline, shareholders may be counting on a newer line of business: selling web ads to online sellers, rather than just placing them in mobile games. The catch is that AppLovin has yet to show these sellers will actually spend money on a platform best known for games.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=429ca0309bd836f49dd7315fca5419b1c5ccaae90c90354744345e165fa71cc2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792093320,\"headline\":\"Why This Market Washout Will Spark a Year-End Rally\",\"id\":142922238,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"After this weeks washout, the stage is set for bulls to regain control.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ca49237ab740f594cd4681a2c74d5f68710b833956e0da45dceb162ae64d9eb0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792093260,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave’s Freakout Hurt Constellation and NRG Stocks. It Shouldn’t Have.\",\"id\":142921681,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Those electricity-providers look insulated from the data center owner’s problems.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=beb8d2850532538241f4ebeb3ec985ce318fe855ef5d2048647f108216b149c5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792092870,\"headline\":\"Meta offers enhanced ad campaign exposure\",\"id\":142922963,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"At its brand building summit the company announced a trio of ad updates, which included a new First Impressions option and expanded Reels services.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=260c65bd6c51171baeac93a1d342f2c06de494ad2d71a25b54dd9bbad168afa1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792092841,\"headline\":\"These 2 Stocks Have Run Circles Around the Magnificent Seven This Year, and Wall Street Says There Is More Upside Ahead\",\"id\":142921306,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Innovation pays off.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=423a910da1e18e0cf9ae9a1bda7a373012ba8db302e228d6a9de79a43f79a63b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792092282,\"headline\":\"10-15-2026: Hot CPI and PPI, Yield Reversal, AI Angst + Staples Rally\",\"id\":142922240,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Eric Criscuolo, Market Strategist at the NYSE, reviews a choppy week in which the S\\u0026P 500 slipped about 1% after a hot core CPI print sent yields sharply higher, only for a full reversal to offer equities no relief. Tech led the retreat, down roughly 4% with memory names hit hardest, as AI spending doubts and slowing growth at Anthropic fueled the bear case. A hotter PPI and a core retail sales miss then pushed 10 and 30-year yields down 15-20 basis points. Strong breadth lifted the equal-weight index as investors rotated into Staples and Healthcare, both up about 4%. Looking ahead, Meta, Tesla, IBM, SAP, and Blackstone headline a very busy earnings slate.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=44793e894e62b97e893c764872c6cda53ff27508860eef9e3183b0f3a71a8d05\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792089180,\"headline\":\"Meta's new teen limits have a loophole parents can't ignore\",\"id\":142921357,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Family groups are pressing YouTube, TikTok, and Snapchat to copy the rules Meta accepted in its $18 billion deal with 52 attorneys general.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4d9fc7eb33c7e11cd314a69ef513851b1211e929d58e0082ae3859eedc5ad36e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792089131,\"headline\":\"$50k/month founder nearly killed his app by spending thousands on UGC 😊\",\"id\":142921362,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bro spent thousands on UGC with zero winning format and nearly killed the business.Lino went straight to big fitness influencers before he had any proof of what actually converts. Thousands per video, margins at 5-10%, barely scraping $3-4K in revenue.The fix: he partnered with one big fitness creator for equity instead of chasing deal after deal. Suddenly the content was free, the creator had skin in the game, and AbMaxx took off.From there he cut every other UGC deal, doubled down on Meta ads at 2-2.5X ROAS, then moved the same creatives to TikTok and hit 4-5X ROAS targeting a younger audience.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3a70570eb6abddf25b141a1ca26bd026c851ddda0d43dbb26314d8680e8845f0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792088681,\"headline\":\"Meta Just Climbed 12% in a Month: Take Profits, or Hold On for the Ride?\",\"id\":142921337,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms stock has surged past Microsoft, Alphabet, and the major tech funds over the past month, all on the back of a single AI catalyst. Whether that move signals the start of something bigger or a peak worth cashing in depends on one critical revenue equation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ec9a00a67fe37f48f259730138042cae52bbc94fd98fedc68bc962fa31dfa96d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792087214,\"headline\":\"Tesla Roadster hype, the Meta-Apple AI deal, and how AI spending is saving the economy\",\"id\":142921330,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Market Hang's panel discusses excitement over the revamped Tesla (TSLA) Roaster event, Meta (META) and Apple (AAPL) announcing a new AI partnership to produce an open-source AI, and whether the economy would be on the verge of a recession amid high inflation if not for AI spendingToday's Market Hang panel consists of Gerber Kawasaki Wealth and Investment Management CEO Ross Gerber, TMX Wall Street Horizon Head of Corporate Event Research Christine Short, Roundhill Investments Chief Investment Strategist Drew Pettit, and Futurum Chief Market Strategist Shay Boloor.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=70c105bd72616bf7985e59189df78a588f898b79cc66520955edcdfb74a5516a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792087200,\"headline\":\"XCENA Showcases CXL Memory Innovations for AI Inference at OCP Global Summit 2026\",\"id\":142921338,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SAN JOSE, Calif., October 15, 2026--XCENA, a fabless semiconductor company developing next-generation memory infrastructure for the AI era, demonstrated its CXL-based memory solutions for AI inference demonstrations at OCP Global Summit 2026, addressing AI inference’s growing memory requirements and data-movement burden. The event was held Oct. 12–15 at the San Jose McEnery Convention Center. The demonstrations address two of the biggest constraints on AI inference: growing memory requirements a\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=317b3ab0c76a79dd52581860f8c5eea82e5ad744fe1a7b89bc8ce0ca8481f41c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792086596,\"headline\":\"Apple and Meta need each other, says Yorkville Ives' Dan Ives\",\"id\":142948656,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108416446-17921007471792100743-49023467952-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792100746\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Dan Ives, Yorkville Ives and Co. partner, joins 'Fast Money' to talk Meta and Apple's recently announced partnership.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ee47925228e6d198c96a2a5c348a2a62a42d045cdf0c65f7cade4efcb2df4258\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792086480,\"headline\":\"Alphabet Stock Can Soar 22%, J.P. Morgan Says. Why Google Can Defy AI Fears.\",\"id\":142921344,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Megacap earnings are always a blockbuster event for the market, but there will be even more than usual riding on them this quarter.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f13afcb72c54f6474aff823a69949ff9553cc7ab9a8396003d5dcf5b0e168fde\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792086015,\"headline\":\"Could a Meta-Apple AI team-up restart the iPhone upgrade cycle?\",\"id\":142920294,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms (META) and Apple (AAPL) have announced a new partnership to produce an open-source AI with plans to run the new Muse Spark Open model on Mac products. Gerber Kawasaki Wealth and Investment Management CEO Ross Gerber leads an expert panel to weigh in on what a sophisticated AI model could mean for Apple's iPhone refresh cycle. Today's Market Hang panel consists of TMX Wall Street Horizon head of corporate event research Christine Short, Roundhill Investments chief investment strategist Drew Pettit, and Futurum chief market strategist Shay Boloor.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=29b8d6968c7007ecb829d7ba4a01d4e6073fdc1a4f6870a9d38ca6f76b8d33d7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792083600,\"headline\":\"Meta Releases Open AI Model While Keeping Its Best Tech Closed\",\"id\":142921359,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms Inc. made one of its new artificial intelligence models available for developers to download and modify, while keeping its most advanced technology closed in an effort to convert its AI investments into revenue.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5613423a6065726fda43202bd21c7d1705fd6f9d46143ca5236fbb624d086509\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792082499,\"headline\":\"AI Isn’t Coming for American Jobs Someday. The Fed Says It’s Already Happening.\",\"id\":142920307,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Federal Reserve's latest economic assessment reveals something investors and workers were not supposed to see this soon: AI is already reshaping who gets hired and who never does, and the consequences for household spending could unravel the very profits Wall Street is counting on.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d12c6a5373722ea9eb0b70890ed59432648231a1d6ec46f1fdb59210f52dce0a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792081834,\"headline\":\"The Real AMD Catalyst Investors Are Sleeping On Isn’t What You Think\",\"id\":142920333,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Everyone is watching AMD's GPU ramp, but a quieter force inside the data center may be the one that actually drives the stock through 2027. Here is why most investors have their eyes on the wrong product line.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2bc79d7392b75c577716d8fabce0cb52de56c6f534efd2787c189ff04d371ae0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792081138,\"headline\":\"MAGS: The Magnificent 7 Could Still Deliver 20% A Year\",\"id\":142921801,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2259148968/image_2259148968.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"MAGS ETF gives equal-weight exposure to the Magnificent Seven with AI tailwinds and high return potential.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5ae6debb122f58e43cfc1e5fa7dfa52e05b608b711543a3776fc5c9eaf6ffae2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792079547,\"headline\":\"Senators Want to Know Why Meta Claimed $6.6 Billion in Research Tax Credits for AI Data Centers\",\"id\":142919216,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Seven Senate Democrats want Mark Zuckerberg to explain how building AI data centers qualifies as frontier research, and the answer could reshape the tax math behind every major technology company's infrastructure ambitions.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b9bfb23340b71ac1b1d59f823451ef463141343775491f8b5c905071d8fb7d98\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792079372,\"headline\":\"Citigroup Maintains Buy on Meta Platforms, Raises Price Target to $895\",\"id\":142947033,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Citigroup  analyst Ronald Josey   maintains Meta Platforms (NASDAQ:META) with a Buy and raises the price target from $800 to $895.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3ccf1d223a924d12a39a80c57281ef6c3eb0749092a18499438c9cb62f703641\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792079043,\"headline\":\"Meta Platforms Investors Look Forward to Understanding AI Assistant Muse's ROI, Oppenheimer Says\",\"id\":142919217,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms' (META) advanced personal artificial intelligence assistant Muse has seen positive re\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a938e7dc0f2d1ab39d027d2eb7d512893480d81da735230eada6038fd689fd73\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792078956,\"headline\":\"Nvidia and Cisco confirm multimillion-dollar donations to Trump's White House ballroom\",\"id\":142948645,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108356675-1788207196062-gettyimages-2291330125-ah704060.jpeg?v=1792096861\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Big Tech gave millions to Trump's White House ballroom, documents show\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=33af40d9d1bf1197ba10bcb2d3eb5dc6fab26d1eaa07dbe7aa24ad70a1564b35\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792078560,\"headline\":\"Stripe agentic commerce revs up\",\"id\":142920331,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The digital payment juggernaut’s agentic commerce activity went “vertical” last month, President John Collison said this week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=85a217738284bbf3c990cb5259801a7c57258ced83c52e4ab0ff78118bee4034\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792077731,\"headline\":\"Anthropic Is Growing 50%, Microsoft Isn’t\",\"id\":142919155,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Anthropic's explosive growth is exposing a painful gap between AI hype and reality for some of the biggest names in tech, and their investors may not yet grasp how serious the valuation problem has become.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a76c7a7b86e1fc9f28ef86af5e68986817a272e7ba268c19e6581ac9d1e4f156\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792077060,\"headline\":\"Robots \\u0026 Pencils Acquires Tiger Pistol to Scale Reusable Agentic Patterns into Products\",\"id\":142919185,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Robots \\u0026 Pencils, an applied AI engineering partner known for high-velocity delivery and measurable business outcomes, today announced the acquisition of Tiger Pistol, a marketing automation platform that helps enterprises, franchises, and resellers manage and scale digital advertising campaigns across Meta, TikTok, Amazon, and other channels. Tiger Pistol joins Robots \\u0026 Pencils as its customer experience transformation studio practice, bringing a proven platform, a product development team, and\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fb89826086274586f9e099b02296c149b0bdc828398620961d05914941eb401c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792076419,\"headline\":\"Meta’s AI Spending Is Massive. The Payoff Could Be Even Bigger\",\"id\":142919198,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta is pouring over $130 billion into AI while free cash flow craters and Reality Labs keeps bleeding billions. Whether that spending is a catastrophic overhang or the setup for a massive payoff depends on one number that most investors are overlooking.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=186d87d88f05055c4081a2ff6e8581010935958aa8d80211389bb4ba9f9779f4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792075680,\"headline\":\"Consumer goods giants step up ad intensity as other big spenders pull back: report\",\"id\":142919200,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Divergent paths for tech firms and categories like CPG and beauty and cosmetics underpin what WARC calls a “two-speed marketplace.”\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9bea8cd26184fae1b1e96387d2e08c3f41a9a1adae6b4dc4e807c34ed9a70677\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792075502,\"headline\":\"From Search Destruction to Efficiency, I Have Faith in Alphabet’s Abilities\",\"id\":142919176,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street once bet that AI chatbots would destroy Google Search, and investors who bought through that fear were rewarded. Now Alphabet faces a far bigger test, one measured in hundreds of billions of capex dollars with no guarantee of return.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4f143854c2785446409ce8a06780abf4a86dd97b280736b8a8313ebb9cfd8df7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792074836,\"headline\":\"Anthropic Needs Nearly $2.7B in Additional Monthly Revenue to Reach $100B Run Rate by Year-End\",\"id\":142945152,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Anthropic-Logo.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\\n\\n\\n\\nPPI Spikes\\n\\n\\n\\nPlease click here for an enlarged chart of Taiwan Semiconductor Mfg. Co. Ltd. (NYSE:TSM).\\n\\n\\n\\nNote the following:\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nThis article is about the big picture, not an individual stock.  The chart of TSM\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=22d4ea568110010a6f3fba0ccff8bcf1917cf3ec643f6a86d8f964fd285417a0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792074811,\"headline\":\"Why Is Lightspeed Commerce Stock Gaining Thursday?\",\"id\":142947035,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/LightspeedMunich--Bavaria--Germany---Mar.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Lightspeed Commerce (LSPD) stock jumped as it unveiled new agentic AI tools to automate retail operations, inventory, and purchase orders.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=22107b21b977df30537bd54661faf96c91b068b26a3e535eb7cb20872dc96c56\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792074766,\"headline\":\"'OpenAI’s Accelerates Ad Sprint With Meta Hires, Slashed Prices' - The Information\",\"id\":142946867,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/openais-accelerates-ad-sprint-meta-hires-slashed-prices\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=09f8d94ce215842e68c6cd5d1dce16f505e2ae0ff1bb34ad8f39c2f6ff7960db\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792074600,\"headline\":\"Unum Group Declares Quarterly Dividend of $0.505 Per Share of Its Common Stock\",\"id\":142919228,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CHATTANOOGA, Tenn., October 15, 2026--Effective October 15, 2026, the Unum Group (NYSE: UNM) Board of Directors declared a quarterly dividend of $0.505 per share on its common stock to be paid November 20, 2026, to stockholders of record as of October 30, 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=83e552bd7febda65a7f1071b6fc0e2cd9cfc581ed98f7b657dbb7376c6580a5e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792074000,\"headline\":\"Meta's Muse Agent Is a Massive Hit. I'm Still Not Sold on Meta Stock.\",\"id\":142919165,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The gap between Meta's AI spending and Muse's subscriptions is far too great.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/a