mage\":\"\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Goldman Sachs analyst Eric Sheridan maintained Meta Platforms (NASDAQ:META) with a Buy rating and $860 price target on October 14, 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aa9a45ec0c1e6bdd01d5aa3164751bb66d15406186e233a0c2846567494e864c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792037222,\"headline\":\"Meta Reports on Oct. 21. I'd Consider Buying the Stock Before It Does.\",\"id\":142899074,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Earnings are expected to rise more than sixfold. Why is that the wrong figure to watch?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=67b7df78939e491695be1ff8e5ccb0aaad3730683e1b6c9f2a094fa518ae6d2b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792034220,\"headline\":\"MongoDB lets apps pay only for what they use\",\"id\":142896516,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The impact of executive departures remains an open question, along with whether customers’ overall spending will dip.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d97384798bbc292b802110ee2003d991dbc98ddcb1c369473474b42a4bab2016\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792024620,\"headline\":\"BofA sees ChatGPT taking aim at Google’s next ad dollar\",\"id\":142891670,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America finds an awkward new threat to Google’s ad machine.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1e5c7fddec10335484593a74578060b662c8260e0bc522f91d4bafb8dba82d93\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792019742,\"headline\":\"Meta: The Muse Rally Has Priced In The Good News Before Q3\",\"id\":142896329,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1353816577/image_1353816577.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms (META) Hold rating: $760 target. Ad growth is strong, but AI capex and legal risks pressure FCF and buybacks. See more details here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f78de2f1fd1d249d578edb957fc06e1ef50b336b7dc85ecbc655220444258fc1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792019476,\"headline\":\"What Does AppLovin Offer That Omnicom Does Not?\",\"id\":142889223,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Two distinct approaches define how Omnicom (OMC) and AppLovin capture what brands spend on advertising. Omnicom sells the work of its agencies across media, advertising, and public relations. By contrast, AppLovin runs an ad platform built on its own models, focused mostly on games. Investors have treated the two differently over the past year. AppLovin stock lost 52% over that period, while Omnicom returned 6.9%, even though AppLovin recorded faster revenue growth. So what is each company actua\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=53053681e99deaf2d264770b456e6a372a93f4bf90e7ce1b549ff8e82f7321af\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792014904,\"headline\":\"Cathie Wood Buys $12.4 Million Of CoreWeave Stock As Analyst Warns Of Equity Wipeout, Ark Sells Palantir Shares\",\"id\":142915778,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Germany--Mannheim-January-29--2025--Sign.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Cathie Wood’s Ark bought CoreWeave, Cerebras and Meta shares and sold Palantir shares on Wednesday, Oct. 14, 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=95858d047c98ed1349977fce54c3134ee8a9f7698d85ff2222de50aeeab87216\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792014500,\"headline\":\"Ambani’s Jio seeks to raise $3.2B in what could be India’s biggest IPO\",\"id\":142888347,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Jio plans to use most of its IPO proceeds to repay debt as it expands beyond telecom.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1cee901db1323bf3a65e4d3604fde4df548a395ae4e56b0fd6b20a4fdb389328\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792013639,\"headline\":\"Gene Munster Flags Meta’s Muse As A Bigger Risk To Google Search Than ChatGPT\",\"id\":142888348,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Conversational tools like ChatGPT primarily fielded questions that search engines had not heavily monetized, according to Munster and his co-managing partner Doug Clinton.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ddffb5481b1b0ae8fb15c87dc6bb06573d3b001877a8059cf0e53218a67ddf66\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792010100,\"headline\":\"3 Trillion-Dollar Giants That Could Be the Next Big Stock-Split Plays\",\"id\":142888340,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Micron, Microsoft, and Meta Platforms could soon split their shares, and investors have different reasons to keep watching each of them.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9d1b7840e9fdaeb6f0fa10727807cae1ab43b4eaf29b4c5e9182076bbca8c48b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792009388,\"headline\":\"JPMorgan CEO sends blunt warning on 'rogue' AI agents\",\"id\":142888367,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan Chase CEO Jamie Dimon is against AI agents taking a call on behalf of customers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=09337df0541eafa890d1393d5779f77abc35027afd7461243dfcbb44e543971d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792008600,\"headline\":\"CPI Pressures Markets And Fed Reserve's Move On Interest Rates\",\"id\":142890140,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2257930603/image_2257930603.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Hot CPI report upends markets. Fears of rising interest rates heightened. Tech stocks pull back again.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=993d967118512ac3fe089d9f9f810948e65b6fce4f6a2aca69c2f93d4869e367\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792004948,\"headline\":\"What Changed For Trade Desk Stock, And What Did Not?\",\"id\":142887405,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Trade Desk (TTD) shares fell 76.3% in the year to October 13, 2026, while the S\\u0026P 500 returned about 18%. The advertising technology company reported slower revenue growth in each of the past four quarters. In the August 6, 2026 report, growth had fallen short of management's own expectations. How far did Trade Desk's growth fall, and what reasons did management give.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=de2b34e86f818a07f93565eda570064b6b7df5d237c15fa3cbdb5bb51fe185ce\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792001747,\"headline\":\"ARM Stock Is Up 123% This Year. Is It Too Late to Get In?\",\"id\":142908378,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysArm stock has gained 123% since early January to close at $255 on October 13, but it sits 28% below its June 30 close of $355. On the July 29 earnings call, CEO Rene Haas said demand for the Arm AGI CPU now exceeds $2B.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0687a65c56fff5b4762edecb5b7c06e5ba75b6c311c6604d43ea83e1d1f47afc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792001197,\"headline\":\"What AOL can tell us about the evolution of AI pricing\",\"id\":142886766,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Market Hang's panel debate how the AI infrastructure build-out will pay off and how AI pricing will change as usage grows. Today's Market Hang panel consists of Gerber Kawasaki Wealth \\u0026 Investment Management CEO Ross Gerber, Yahoo Finance's Julie Hyman, Business Insider Today executive editor Dan DeFrancesco, Baird investment strategist Ross Mayfield, and SlateStone Wealth partner and chief market strategist Kenny Polcari.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a4924e10f0e62a82061c97335c095a0f4c717672bc678d4f56aa09ef59ede80c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792000826,\"headline\":\"Gene Munster Warns Apple Can Sell Millions of iPhones and Still Lose the AI Game as Users Could Lock Into Muse and Grok\",\"id\":142887389,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple Inc. can keep selling iPhones by the million and still lose the artificial intelligence game, according to investor Gene Munster, who warned that Siri could be shut out of the money if users settle into Meta Platforms Inc.’s Muse...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0caffb44b6e40afa160212fe715e6567577d9c33a5d5aacd1d8c2f3f42443562\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792000200,\"headline\":\"Liberty All-Star® Equity Fund September 2026 Monthly Update\",\"id\":142886356,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BOSTON, October 14, 2026--Liberty All-Star® Equity Fund September 2026 Monthly Update\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2093733503ba38e5acb28367b5efa2fab0d59af01d9e7999ea00606697588c6f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792000200,\"headline\":\"Liberty All-Star® Growth Fund, Inc. September 2026 Monthly Update\",\"id\":142886349,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BOSTON, October 14, 2026--Liberty All-Star® Growth Fund, Inc. September 2026 Monthly Update\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b6275f90ccaed1d768e7b9b0b6759e778d3a83e60dd01e9ef842c1700e2c259f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791999156,\"headline\":\"How I Used Reddit To Build a $25K/Month Business\",\"id\":142886427,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meet Avneesh, he grew his app to $25K/month using Reddit \\u0026 Facebook, without spending any money on ads.🛠️ Want to start building with AI? Check out Starter Story Build → https://build.starterstory.com/build/ai-build-accelerator?utm_source=youtube\\u0026utm_campaign=abhishekFollow Avneesh's journey: https://x.com/avneeshk91🔔 Follow the Second Channel: ‪@StarterStoryBuild‬ 🏁 We're hiring: starterstory.com/jobsChapters:0:00 - Intro1:03 - Who is Avneesh1:28 - Idea for Savewise2:26 - Trying to find customers3:32 - The 2 platforms that worked4:07 - 5-Step Marketing Playbook7:55 - Build YOUR app with AI in 12 days8:35 - Getting 1500 visitors from one post9:51 - The post that changed everything11:10 - Numbers behind Savewise11:57 - Tech stack12:53 - Understand your customer13:50 - The final wordThis video is an educational case study of one founder’s experience. It is not financial advice and does not guarantee any income or results. Every business is different and your results may vary.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c836ac95dd835bb1ababb9beb7b51cba567164778d87461f2d679bdaed3d07f4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791999015,\"headline\":\"Mark Zuckerberg Defends Meta's AI CapEx, Ready to 'Write This Check' for up to '$200 Billion' to Dominate 'Decades to Come'\",\"id\":142887416,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms Inc. CEO Mark Zuckerberg said the company was prepared to write a $100 billion to $200 billion check for its AI ambitions. During a recent podcast appearance, Zuckerberg detailed the financial commitments and strategic rationale behind Meta Superintelligence...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ba244cfa6312d0c812a97b6e04060129fe55a5b9a5a79c664bf12aaba27c44e0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791998160,\"headline\":\"Meta’s new AI models strengthen Bank of America’s bullish outlook\",\"id\":142887417,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms Inc (NASDAQ:META, XETRA:FB2A, SIX:FB) has strengthened its artificial intelligence credentials with two new models, prompting Bank of America to reiterate its 'buy' rating and $810 price target. The bank said Muse Wonder and Muse Wonder Full demonstrate progress by Meta...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ba9f0b685c17a344f5034fe93cf34d15919e9410c578c2134b4eab9e59287476\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791998059,\"headline\":\"How Qualcomm’s Legal Win Over Arm Could Reshape the Long-Term Thesis for QCOM Investors\",\"id\":142886428,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Earlier this month, a federal jury in Delaware found that Arm Holdings breached a key architectural licensing agreement with Qualcomm and interfered with its business relationship with Meta Platforms, awarding Qualcomm nominal damages of US$2 but confirming its right to continue custom CPU development under the license. The verdict primarily strengthened Qualcomm’s legal footing and business flexibility as Arm shifts its business model, clarifying Qualcomm’s ability to pursue its Oryon CPU...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8c5726d2abcd5f675441efc052e0c9c078000edbf7bbe311e6bb0ca40e3fe037\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791996420,\"headline\":\"Cathie Wood buys $17.3 million of surging AI stock\",\"id\":142886429,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Here are Cathie Wood’s latest moves.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=696d712216ba09fb313002c5aa6b41dec0ed57bf9e61e288285b23e7487e45ee\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791996335,\"headline\":\"Broadcom is The Steady Hand The Market Keeps Discounting\",\"id\":142886363,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Broadcom's revenue exploded while its stock sat nearly flat for a year, and that gap keeps widening every quarter. Before dismissing this as a broken trade, consider what the market may be missing about where this cash machine is actually headed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=71268d67dfa2714a9ef00b773b27546cde22038d6528d1ffda49d1979f7e024e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791995465,\"headline\":\"Shopify: Wait For The Next Golden Buying Opportunity (Downgrade)\",\"id\":142887899,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2267426723/image_2267426723.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Shopify has decisively dispelled AI-driven bear concerns, regaining bullish momentum and closing in on all-time highs. Read more on SHOP stock here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b2dc377d000c0191520fc422a304c169f828a0a1f9716d12cf5e207b99ef6438\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791995421,\"headline\":\"Truist Says $1,000 for Meta. Our Bull Case Goes Higher\",\"id\":142886407,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Truist just slapped a $1,000 price target on Meta, but our proprietary model pushes the bull case even further while flagging a bear scenario that could leave the stock with almost no upside from here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e68db85331312f103b6f1d162cefd1ca7bfdb3434ceec19be0c25515bc0d311b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791993570,\"headline\":\"Meta expands WhatsApp utility with non-account guest calling features\",\"id\":142886426,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Meta Platforms Inc (NASDAQ:META) has expanded WhatsApp’s business utility by enabling guest calling capabilities, allowing non-account holders to join end-to-end encrypted voice and video calls at no cost. The strategic update directly targets competitive friction points in the digital communications market by eliminating time limits, account registration requirements, and software download barriers for invitees.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=578670470ee9710393d809c51b67d474dc8b5715f930b5c419926e5335a71aab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791992280,\"headline\":\"Meta’s Muse and Stock Conquer AI Spending Fears—for Now\",\"id\":142885128,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta stock is riding the wave of excitement over Muse. But capital spending could increase dramatically.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=641f4851b4539ff55d8cdbd477d26e8b1954d9a6daa794ae5496a436b54458af\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791990900,\"headline\":\"As Personal AI Agents Take Off, DeepLumen Helps Merchants Turn AI into a New Sales Channel\",\"id\":142885129,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Agentic Page has now been installed by nearly 2,000 Shopify merchants as AI-driven product discovery increasingly translates into attributable sales. The rapid rise of personal AI agents is beginning to change how consumers shop. Meta's recently launched Muse is one of the clearest examples of this shift. Muse is designed to take action on behalf of users and can make purchases with user approval. Meta has also expanded Muse's commerce connections, including access to Shopify's catalog and suppo\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4dbc653e326fb9eb2c39f4ea5019aa783c7a5e73749f29d8852ee36ea91f38ff\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791989141,\"headline\":\"Muse Got Meta to Consumer-Scale Agentic Execution First And That Matters\",\"id\":142885109,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta shipped an agentic AI model to 3.6 billion daily users before most labs even found their audience, and that gap in distribution could reshape which AI investments actually compound over the next decade.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b4150a019384d749b1a4132b2b0e2d954f389d04da06963e27373fb607a4a805\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791988227,\"headline\":\"Alexandr Wang Brought Elon Musk’s Lean-Team Playbook to Mark Zuckerberg — It’s Now One of the ‘Tentpoles’ of Meta’s AI Strategy\",\"id\":142885131,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Alexandr Wang, Chief AI Officer at Meta Platforms Inc., has been taking notes on Space Exploration Technologies Corp. CEO Elon Musk, and one lesson made it all the way to Mark Zuckerberg and into the center of the company’s artificial...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=55053460cd571e98590bd2dd6156fef3bbb3a398c98c3c4253a256f8bb5796e1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791988141,\"headline\":\"BlackRock Expects Strong Fourth Quarter as AI Investment, Fundraising Grow\",\"id\":142917857,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Konskie--Poland---November-12--2024-Blac.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"BlackRock expects momentum to continue in the seasonally strong fourth quarter, supported by iShares activity, private markets fundraising and progress toward long-term targets.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cbdf1354adfa4a94156edc47d71c8c6485bb39f3756953d590f4592c57d42acc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791987155,\"headline\":\"What a $1.3 Billion Bumble Deal Says About Where AI Leaves Human Connection\",\"id\":142885132,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The $1.3 billion Bumble acquisition by Ithaca Holdings rests on one bet: as AI makes intelligence cheap, real human connection gains value.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e14a589879b7bbe20e3801ebbe68756fc609fd3b450c9338b2a11c1fc876f642\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791986286,\"headline\":\"Goldman Sachs Maintains Buy on Meta Platforms, Lowers Price Target to $762\",\"id\":142917858,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Goldman Sachs  analyst Eric Sheridan   maintains Meta Platforms (NASDAQ:META) with a Buy and lowers the price target from $860 to $762.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=26caf2790437a23b0357a256b938f82177672f4cc83d8700eb92e15d6097d7cc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791985488,\"headline\":\"FBI arrests OpenAI employee for planting listening device in office\",\"id\":142882592,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The 8:30 Hosts Julie Hyman, Pras Subramanian, and Jake Conley discuss reporting that the FBI arrested an OpenAI (OPAI.PVT) employee after a hidden recording device was found in a company conference room.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=15ad7789a845bc2208a1660ab9adbf19c8c2cb36161772afe1b707e9ae84baa2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791985168,\"headline\":\"Why Meta's AI bet could be mispriced\",\"id\":142882585,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In the Loop Host Ejaaz Ahamadeen examines how Meta's (META) latest AI bet could compete with other artificial intelligence players, such as OpenAI (OPAI.PVT) and SpaceX (SPCX).\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e025de8310d3d838517ca92b0f6eb8418a87f10cb4b97ae66395b04db583bc6a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791984911,\"headline\":\"10 Communication Services Stocks Whale Activity In Today’s Session\",\"id\":142916151,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/11/06/aggregated_options_1.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"This whale alert can help traders discover the next big trading opportunities.\\nWhales are entities with large sums of money and we track their transactions here at Benzinga on our options activity scanner.\\nTraders often\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6e9d2b6a3cbdcb8645a9ca27188f8e62a61b3f8c345da2e7edfc07976436e2c6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791984756,\"headline\":\"Meta Gains on Anthropic in AI Race: Guggenheim\",\"id\":142917860,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Blue-Illuminated-Meta-Logo-On-Electronic.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Guggenheim raises Meta’s target to $850, citing AI progress and Muse’s potential, but warns monetization and heavy AI spending remain risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cfea3ca596e758f4a11e75d3a06ea99b410006d75252aa84316b2f4a8089e2ab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791984532,\"headline\":\"Guggenheim lifts Meta target as Muse usage builds\",\"id\":142882588,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Guggenheim raised its price target on Meta Platforms to $850 from $700 in a note to clients on Wednesday, pointing to higher 2027 estimates and early traction for the company’s Muse AI agent.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2e710c8af83d4236d2e862e5bb942f3b2df15513f10a309a31b7b6488cb0034b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791984107,\"headline\":\"Meta's AI Push Draws Fresh Street Calls – Goldman Flags Higher Costs, UBS Sees Monetization Potential\",\"id\":142882589,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The analyst calls follow Meta's October 12 introduction of Muse Wonder and Muse Wonder Full, which the company described as its most capable AI models to date.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d50675142a5d697b74149212d7346ace2db8e16d6e8f5ff5b199610434f71ada\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791983879,\"headline\":\"The winner of the AI race won't win by appealing only to AI nerds\",\"id\":142882586,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In The Loop host Ejaaz Ahamadeen looks at how Meta (META) CEO Mark Zuckerberg keyed in on building a personal AI for everyday users and why that insight could win the AI race.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=40021fc104e3a1f6c474d2929644299bb1f8f82c04f0aa59b9b44b80e7811c05\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791983504,\"headline\":\"META, TTD, SNAP, GOOGL, BMBL, WDAY Stocks Get New UBS Targets Amid AI And Ad Shifts\",\"id\":142882549,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UBS raised its price targets on Meta, Snap, Alphabet and Bumble while cutting its targets on Trade Desk and Workday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4d4a1aa15690fcdc9a961ca8e8f0eb2253fcffa8bbb2163c8a7be4bcc6d13442\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791982800,\"headline\":\"Rising Rates and Energy-Driven Inflation Impact Global Hedge Funds in September, Data Insights Reports\",\"id\":142882531,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NEW YORK \\u0026 LONDON, October 14, 2026--Rising interest rates and inflation emerged as key themes impacting global hedge funds in September, driven in part by higher energy prices. Following a 25-basis-point Federal Reserve rate hike, global bond markets experienced a selloff, while long-term Treasury yields climbed. Meanwhile, equity market gains were concentrated in a narrow group of AI-linked mega-cap technology stocks, according to Data Insights, the institutional hedge fund market intelligence\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ca98c81d2984ff568ec79f30ad3f825b0eb92daeda7c5fb2d7e3ecfc0a57ee35\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791982800,\"headline\":\"Leverage Shares by Themes to Launch MANGOS ETF (MGOL) on Nasdaq October 14, Providing Exposure to Six Leading Technology and AI Companies\",\"id\":142882529,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Leverage Shares by Themes is pleased to announce the upcoming launch of the Leverage Shares MANGOS ETF (Nasdaq: MGOL), an actively managed exchange-traded fund expected to begin trading on October 14, 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ae5ff7e6f291fbe8620de75d737df67da6b9648753d0a53d7d2512469de3a737\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791982140,\"headline\":\"Meta's AI comeback: From missteps to Muse AI\",\"id\":142882587,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In the Loop Host Ejaaz Ahamadeen breaks down Meta's (META) Muse Wonder and how the social media giant is looking to regain its footing in the artificial intelligence race after a series of setbacks. Ahamadeen explores Meta's shift toward personal AI agents, what sets Muse apart from its competitors, and whether the company's latest AI push could help it reclaim its position as a leader in artificial intelligence.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dc92ba1ca9b6cc832019d3259818f16e14b85e7c012fae1282560041a7e04ccc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791981930,\"headline\":\"One Stock Could Benefit as AI Spending Moves Beyond Nvidia\",\"id\":142882515,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia dominated the AI chip conversation for two years, but a quiet shift toward custom accelerators is reshaping where the real money flows, and one semiconductor company is booking orders deep into 2028 to prove it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=104ee6ca431256bfc0caa6a8678116f9ed9af46ddb47caed70fe19ab89c3b661\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791981544,\"headline\":\"ASML Earnings Signal Strong AI Demand Yet Stock Falls, Emphasizing Market Character Shift—CPI Squashes Hopium\",\"id\":142915711,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/ASML.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\\n\\n\\n\\nMarket Character Shift\\n\\n\\n\\nPlease click here for an enlarged chart of ASML Holding NV (NASDAQ:ASML).\\n\\n\\n\\nNote the following:\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nThis article is about the big picture, not an individual stock.  The chart of ASML stock\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3bed8dbef292c2b3c7e23e3a55356ea6ad3da8d91a50dae9355485255305aab4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791981060,\"headline\":\"The Operation That Cost the GOP New Hampshire Now Runs 45 AI-Made Ads in Eight Senate Races\",\"id\":142882595,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"StarkFreedom PAC, a super PAC built and run in-house with artificial intelligence, added 18 more ads overnight, bringing its total to 45 ads live on X and Facebook across all eight Senate races. The same AI system behind every ad also beat New Hampshire's Secretary of State in federal court, 76 days from complaint to preliminary injunction, with founder Aaron Day representing himself. Details: https://starkfreedom.org/operations/.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=006c72bc4fa692b5de45ffb4fe7dfb05e7f667b188cb0913cee0507e02382329\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791981023,\"headline\":\"Nvidia Is 'Too Big to Fail,' Semafor Editor Warns: 'The Government Would Step In'\",\"id\":142882518,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The U.S. government would rescue Nvidia Corp. in a crisis, but might let Google or Meta fail, according to Liz Hoffman, business editor at Semafor. “I do not think the government would step in to save Meta or Google. I...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1e850914a5e06917255f58fa5f84c4f8ce3162779c514d1912aad24794e498db\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791978999,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures Rise, Techs Fall With ASML, BofA, Dell, HPE Early Movers; CPI Inflation Due\",\"id\":142880329,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Dow futures rose with yields falling. Chip-gear giant ASML beat on earnings with the CPI inflation report due.. Meta and AMD are buys.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=29d32ca512a627743b4d5f03423c05375179d4856fe00b0cc9e7e6ddefc79e7a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791977994,\"headline\":\"Nasdaq 100 Drops 1% on Hot CPI, SOXX Falls 7th Day: Stock Market Today\",\"id\":142915760,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Nasdaq-100-way-down.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The Nasdaq 100 fell 1% by midday Wednesday after September CPI topped forecasts, pushing Treasury yields and rate-hike bets higher.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=96ad35f5ef177e04917a658689de84478274bbf6edf6e6f298c9a08636fefbf6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791977694,\"headline\":\"Meta Platforms: Muse Wonder Exposes The AI Trade's Biggest Disconnect\",\"id\":142885012,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1359152239/image_1359152239.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"META\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms, Inc.âs Muse Wonder boosts its personal AI edge and monetization, but rising AI spend may pressure FCF. Click for this META stock update and earnings preview.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8223129919b9534da0fc3ace48a4fe3002b00ee81eb4a35a27d1f88380277718\"}]"
