      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792394405,\"headline\":\"TSLA, SPCX Eye Green Open: Gary Black Predicts $420 SpaceX Buyout Of Tesla — Sees Announcement In ‘Next Few Weeks’\",\"id\":142996645,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Gene Munster also interpreted the Roadster showcase as another sign of Musk’s desire to combine Tesla and SpaceX.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d82a16fbf9f98a70d8af3d1ac840f9292639fb326ae466eedf8f796a01d03038\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792390184,\"headline\":\"NIO Stock Climbs Overnight: EV Firm Outsells German Luxury Rivals In China Sales For First Time — CEO Hails Tesla’s Flying Roadster\",\"id\":142994782,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CEO William Li praised Tesla’s flying Roadster, saying, “So impressive! This one we really don’t have.”\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30219052f707d974d708c989bf6827a28ed22bce18fa21ba37c7bd304ffdb8c4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792386990,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk Says AI And Robots Are The Only Way To Solve America's $40 Trillion Debt Problem — ‘We’re Not Gonna Save Our Way There’\",\"id\":142997627,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Trillionaire Elon Musk reportedly believes that solving the national debt problem from within the confines of the government is difficult, betting instead on AI and robots to help bridge the deficit. Elon Musk Says Lawmakers Were Not Serious About Cutting Spending According to a report published by Axios on Saturday, Musk said his time with the Department of Government Efficiency (DOGE) in the early days of President Donald Trump‘s second term showed how difficult it was to fix the national debt\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5acd642d5fa24b71717f7e2677ee1b01ccdc9c9a89dba2e3c935a8a0eebc5010\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792385682,\"headline\":\"INTC, AMD, MU, SNDK: US Chip Stocks Rebound After Worst Week Since March\",\"id\":142992690,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chipmakers recover as investors brace for major earnings reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=39a3e45fe00cb49aa7b5fb6765d12adce7a0d00e6d079aa5a6ef77cfab9f604b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792382876,\"headline\":\"No ‘Black Monday’? Nasdaq, S\\u0026P 500, Dow Futures Spike As Big Tech Earnings Loom This Week — Retail Stays Cautious\",\"id\":142992351,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"U.S. stock futures rebound after the Nasdaq’s worst week since early June, as investors look ahead to earnings from Netflix, Tesla and Meta.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1a2e701a4b533b333f361b3a63e36f7840c645ceaa6ad5ec7dd99a649e6795af\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792380162,\"headline\":\"Anthropic IPO: Musk Wants AI Firm To Hand Shares Directly To Public, Says 'This Is What I Will Be Doing'\",\"id\":142992166,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Anthropic’s plan to set aside shares for public benefit faced doubts from former White House AI advisor David Sacks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7eb5d4c8f9552435e211e6e99843d0b928148517196a0a636b3d33a50c9714db\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792379220,\"headline\":\"Sam Altman praises the Tesla Roadster he gave up on\",\"id\":142992163,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The two tech titans have fought in court and online. A single post may have just changed the tone.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=84800063563c4c4dedc895a5486fd507c816e97ad69d6b27177bc8bc129ee5a4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792378020,\"headline\":\"Asian stocks start week on back foot, tracking tech-led Wall St losses\",\"id\":142992144,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Asian stocks mostly fell Monday as traders tracked a tech-heavy selloff on Wall Street that was fuelled by growing worries over the AI investment boom.\\\"The US equity sell-off reflected a reassessment of the economics underpinning the AI investment boom rather than a simple downgrade to end-demand,\\\" said National Australia Bank's Rodrigo Catril.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=15eb4bff5e4b1922666d2fe714d2248a58af2c93c734cc56e336294fac9402e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792376363,\"headline\":\"TSLA Stock Rises Overnight: Musk Bets Tesla’s Value On Optimus, Cybercab — Analyst Sees Flying ‘Halo Car’ Luring Buyers\",\"id\":142992164,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Morningstar sees the Roadster attracting buyers to Tesla’s broader lineup, despite forecasting fewer than 2,000 annual deliveries.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2e4a3227c05a3e2c61afbc5fc15e9d0a9d9595a806e92b2c4f99249d87388394\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792375488,\"headline\":\"AAPL, TSLA, NFLX, GME, RKLB: Why Retail Traders Couldn’t Take Their Eyes Off These Stocks Last Week\",\"id\":142992148,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Developments across technology, entertainment, retail investing, and the commercial space industry drew interest last week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=033f4af5f4f91b753316232bf70e79ea449c1cd8db506f803ae8705ec9c6f0fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792372620,\"headline\":\"Meta, Tesla Q3 earnings will be fighting rising AI skepticism\",\"id\":142991445,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The tech giants’ results will be the week’s biggest in a volatile market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fc1c7783b3805d0c84a9fc0df7acd5d0d866570cb349f636026adfe06d7d51a8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792366274,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures Rebound After AI Sell-Off; Meta, SpaceX, Tesla Earnings Key\",\"id\":142989726,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Futures rise after the S\\u0026P 500, Nasdaq and leading stocks broke key support. Can Meta, Tesla, SpaceX earnings and capex revive the AI sector?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7ccf03be8481c9a0b30bc0679d5ff5912cb567bac2d203c032f6082fd7495c79\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792364400,\"headline\":\"Top 4 Earnings Reports This Week: What Tesla, Meta, SpaceX, Netflix Must Show\",\"id\":142989727,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla, Meta, SpaceX, and Netflix earnings land this week. See why forecasts, not profits, could move each stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=088a6f07274d5ef19dcc93ad1ad7eb4642a3200a6147fa16c50c76411525e650\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792363884,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk’s SpaceX Now Controls 80% of the Race to Orbit\",\"id\":142989734,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX mass to orbit reached about 80% of the 2026 global total as Elon Musk called the company an anomaly and tied Tesla's value to robots.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8a2d71736e3703a7f657c0e8162ee7aab1ed612b98bdb0fd21bbdf38067ef95e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792361245,\"headline\":\"US Stock Futures Rise Ahead of Busy Earnings Week: Markets Wrap\",\"id\":142990448,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"US stock futures rose and oil edged lower as traders prepared for a packed week of corporate earnings and Chinese economic data against a backdrop of heightened geopolitical risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5cf55b503c7ce5c1e66ee6cf6e09653df6b5904c808a2eb72d5e4278f1ed7149\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792361160,\"headline\":\"Stock Futures Rise Ahead of Another Busy Earnings Week\",\"id\":142989729,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ukraine launched a drone attack and struck a major oil terminal in Russia, according to reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b7d86d63b4bdb699a2c21477c6b3ab457e6dea6d5b7f51a5d0657d89ad03abc7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792360102,\"headline\":\"Bonds Already Discounted A 3rd Hike, Stocks Have Followed, Stay Long\",\"id\":142991440,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2298720448/image_2298720448.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Stocks sold off sharply after inflation data and a delayed reaction to Social Security COLA news. Read more on the market here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f639953768fbbd69bdc4fa4baffb34746c56adb4a5f8894e3effe2572f294a4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792355403,\"headline\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor Could Partner With Elon Musk’s Terafab, but It Has 1 Condition\",\"id\":142992168,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"TSMC is in discussions with Musk's Terafab, but CEO C.C. Wei says one condition is firm: TSMC must run the fab. Here's what it means for TSM stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9b0f0ab6ce0bab2a08e010355a0d6bbb8af3d1b75f4b118960fe710dc79d41c6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792354980,\"headline\":\"Tesla’s Flying Roadster and the SpaceX Halo\",\"id\":142989178,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla’s impressive flying Roadster isn’t about building cars at all. It’s about this.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5741a7aafc6fb7ec0542ae13b879086e5ed3bc2cc05766af68fa4d40d651b5b7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792353600,\"headline\":\"Tesla: Coolest Technology Is A Negative Distraction\",\"id\":142989891,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2209862850/image_2209862850.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Tesla lacks focus on near-term, high-revenue opportunities like robotaxis and humanoid robots. Read why investors should continue to unload TSLA stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=616a73db61485414c4a200400b90f44c4852514cc7723b05284fe0aedfa5ed46\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792352100,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk’s ex says she turned down a $40M NDA — then her child support was cut to about $5M total. Was it all worth it?\",\"id\":142988568,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"That’s a roughly $35M gap over 21 years — and Ashley St. Clair says she’d make the same call again. In the new documentary ‘Musk,’ she lays out what the original offer included and what happened after she said no. Musk, for his part, has said he paid her $2.5M.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1ead89f8dc4af6b2d3e9b2b8d0af04c3df029e82ea5130ed72c8c81fc443e93c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792349940,\"headline\":\"Oil Futures Likely to React to Ukraine’s Attack on Russian Oil, Lifting of Diesel Sanctions\",\"id\":142989177,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ukraine launched a drone attack and struck a major oil terminal in Russia, according to reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2de825ae32f2e49eeca1610625dd9f49b37f02df626b6cda3d0494161957390c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792347300,\"headline\":\"Tesla’s Roadster and the SpaceX Halo\",\"id\":142988567,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla’s impressive flying Roadster isn’t about building cars at all. It’s about this.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ccb91659615b4275c6e495f29904fb645aa5e402c481efe6277ff115378ba179\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792346400,\"headline\":\"Tesla, Meta, GE Aerospace, GM,  IBM, and More Stocks to Watch This Week\",\"id\":142988565,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"It’s a heavy week for earnings, with reports also coming from Lockheed Martin, Spotify, Abbott, and many more. This week will also bring data on manufacturing, services, and new homes.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3b9b65ee48be8769aa35d4a77ac8d2b59e32c0318a3ffda6a015e232e33f52ae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792344746,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures: More AI Pain After Nasdaq Sell-Off? Meta, SpaceX, Tesla Earnings Key\",\"id\":142987953,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The S\\u0026P 500, Nasdaq and leading stocks broke key support. Can Meta, Tesla, SpaceX earnings and capex revive the AI sector?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4850df8f4a080ebe53120b2937b9c2cb3baeadb35e92705c5c6d9b119de30643\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792344602,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk Admits He Has ‘No Idea’ How to Make Chips. Tesla Investors May Help Pay for Him to Learn.\",\"id\":142989732,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Musk wants Tesla and SpaceX to build their own chips, and Tesla investors may end up funding a big share of the cost.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=240e186e2081627e21cb96a5b0f775f27bb1ae52bd574984a0faeac97b1e1391\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792342802,\"headline\":\"AI Sector Pressure, Earnings and Other Key Things to Watch this Week\",\"id\":142989728,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Markets enter a heavy earnings week with Meta Platforms, Tesla, Netflix and Texas Instruments reporting alongside Wednesday’s crude oil inventories. Semiconductor pressure and AI spending doubts remain front and center.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=97f569da24cbabd679aaa41027d29565b5480a13aa3e0116c143f1eaf038b236\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792337700,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Brunch: SpaceX, Tesla, Meta On The Earnings Card\",\"id\":142988445,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2262209650/image_2262209650.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX, Tesla and Meta earnings put AI spending in focus. Anthropicâs AI oversight plan. Elon Musk promises a âsentientâ Roadster.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=94735cc9488b6d03b181b6d9b142678f324e171f33ae8a31f1c1a4def85acc55\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792336329,\"headline\":\"Intel (INTC) Lands A Major Customer For Its 14A Foundry Process\",\"id\":142987441,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel (NasdaqGS: INTC) said Tesla has agreed to use its upcoming 14A manufacturing process as a foundry customer. The chipmaker reported progress on output from its 18A node, highlighting current production results for the advanced manufacturing technology. Intel announced a US$20b equity raise earmarked for new factory buildouts tied to its foundry expansion plans. The Tesla 14A deal, 18A progress and US$20b raise only capture part of what is changing for Intel today. We have also flagged 1...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bf38862e3ff00e62c969aa6be700ecb30acee5237891c13ab3b2baeec2ca5ea9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792335000,\"headline\":\"Tesla's flying Roadster requires a $50,000 deposit — but even Musk isn't sure it's street-legal\",\"id\":142987439,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla’s new car sounds cool, but you might not be allowed to drive it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bb81054c22168935d82d74e710cdb2ef81a10c24048748b816d4a6a0a5e5a14d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792331896,\"headline\":\"What To Expect In Markets This Week: SPCX, TSLA, META, NFLX, IBM Earnings And More\",\"id\":142986968,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"After a bruising week for technology stocks, investors will be looking for clues on whether corporate results can help steady sentiment, or add to the pressure already building across the market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fe42684d497baae3aaa7a1