d\",\"id\":142952846,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2191725662/image_2191725662.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Nasdaq loses 4% on the week. WTI crude settles over $101 per barrel. Inflation worries climb but FedWatch tool stays steady\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5922d94a3abed12c8a3406d8ca67edcda453c5c0dbf98dc4e8c91e66fad73146\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792180339,\"headline\":\"Tesla staffs up Nevada Semi plant as fleet orders stack up\",\"id\":142950806,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Job boards show Tesla recruiting for Semi assembly, quality and service roles in Sparks as WattEV, IMC and the ZET SCALE alliance line up electric Class 8 orders. The post Tesla staffs up Nevada Semi plant as fleet orders stack up appeared first on FreightWaves.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0c5a66aba0d820f37f8fae97d09a485f665a5630b070f8d9e0f2c5a48d6d7a4e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179840,\"headline\":\"Q3 Earnings Season Preview: Revenue Beats Lag, Multi-Sector Momentum Holds\",\"id\":142950777,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Q3 earnings season has started off a bit mixed, with the growth pace and the revenue-beat percentage tracking lower relative to the recent past. Results so far are heavily weighted to Finance, and these initial mixed trends may shift as we head into the heart of the earnings cycle.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=50cdc27926803ec58ffe2156658a02fb65fb3a3b752854e7091b5f8f65807dc7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179266,\"headline\":\"Apple is Now the Top-Performing Magnificent 7 Stock in 2026. Here’s why it’s Beating NVIDIA, Tesla, and Amazon\",\"id\":142949982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple (NASDAQ: AAPL) has emerged as the best-performing Magnificent Seven stock of 2026, outperforming NVIDIA (NVDA), Microsoft (MSFT), Amazon (AMZN), Alphabet (GOOGL), Meta Platforms (META), and Tesla (TSLA). But what's driving Apple's surprising rally while other AI stocks struggle? In this episode, 24/7 Wall St.'s Eric Bleeker examines why Apple shares have surged more than 27% in 2026, even as concerns about artificial intelligence spending are weighing on some of the market's biggest technology companies. While competitors are committing hundreds of billions of dollars to AI data centers, Apple is taking a different approach. Its strategy emphasizes on-device artificial intelligence, privacy, and integrating AI directly into its ecosystem, avoiding much of the enormous infrastructure spending burden facing its rivals. Eric breaks down Apple's latest earnings, its massive share repurchase program, and why investors are increasingly rewarding the company's capital-efficient AI strategy. He also compares the Magnificent Seven's performance in 2026 against their remarkable returns since the beginning of 2023, revealing a very different picture of the AI investment boom. Has Apple become the market's ultimate AI safe-haven stock? And could its strategy continue outperforming NVIDIA and the rest of Big Tech?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f831231eaab13eb8aeb433db1cbbdbf1fe067161173a318013a30dfc63d8ee53\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792175479,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk Sees ‘Almost All Cars’ Going Electric as Gasoline-Only Vehicles Fall Below Half of Global Sales\",\"id\":142950038,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla Inc. CEO Elon Musk expressed optimism on Wednesday about all future cars being electric after gasoline-only cars dropped below 50% of global new vehicle sales for the first time. Musk Celebrates Milestone “Gasoline-only” means pure internal combustion engines with...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0f7579a0c3e5783094cb85c98c95769a4abb7d7e3bf54b73325d052f1d4466f4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792175026,\"headline\":\"Netflix, Tesla Headline Busy Earnings Calendar; Spending Plans Key To Meta's Report\",\"id\":142950029,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix stock continues to trend lower ahead of its quarterly earnings report amid slowing growth and customer engagement.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2be5562f384d7ba43520a2aae43b1760ae444d2b601bd191268fc3e6c405c2e7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792175025,\"headline\":\"Investing.com’s stocks of the week\",\"id\":142949998,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- An unwind in the AI trade has dominated the week, with debt costs and Chinese competition driving losses across data center and memory names.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3fc33a93810b84dec9793ffc8cd92b77d17fa1c5aba2550d280b56372d483cea\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792174782,\"headline\":\"Tesla's Flying Roadster Sends Delivery Odds Tumbling Despite Spectacular Demo\",\"id\":142950036,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla Inc. (NASDAQ:TSLA) finally sent its long-awaited Roadster flying Thursday night, but prediction market traders grew sharply less confident that customers would receive one anytime soon. On Polymarket, the odds of Tesla delivering a Roadster by the end of 2027...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=518e63d9c15592efb420de08c2faf7d0091e2cef67a