2a87655bcf0b5cf200084d5d6525846\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792172831,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Can’t Stop Sizing Up A Tesla-SpaceX Merger\",\"id\":142950037,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A futuristic car made a Tesla-SpaceX tie-up look all the more real.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e781cdf96b754bf8e77aafe0d53b434bdaf41452b5aa45f35af346e8a16e73fb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792171947,\"headline\":\"SpaceX Earnings Due Amid AI Revenue Surge, Tesla Merger Buzz\",\"id\":142949087,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX earnings are due Tuesday night. Analyst expect a first-ever adjusted profit, while investors focus on a possible Tesla merger.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=376e856a300386272bc1a25087becee7f9ae4db818abfbb2724005e2aac23233\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792171448,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Nasdaq Stung As ServiceNow Dives After Breakout; Tesla Comes Back To Earth (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142949018,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Friday while the Nasdaq struggles with tech losses.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d5cd786ad165f12d775928099bab942a363ca5a483bbbb360408b685c51b9c92\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169027,\"headline\":\"The Tech Trade Needs a Life Raft. Mag 7 Earnings Can’t Come Soon Enough.\",\"id\":142949034,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The stock market isn’t done selling technology stocks, and support can't come soon enough.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e29a8590369372071a38aae8573acc6c3b0d2d0e2c44adadd5c295d5ed2b24e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168899,\"headline\":\"Tesla Retreats After Flying Roadster Demo; Musk Cites SpaceX Collaboration\",\"id\":142949089,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla showcased a new version of the Roadster that could fly using SpaceX-designed thrusters. The stock initially popped but pared gains.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=800ed208735437d1e7d9484c5cec8147dabe45a0836b934a777c3f2650f005e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168566,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk Has a Tesla Problem He Can’t Seem to Fix\",\"id\":142949090,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla (NASDAQ: TSLA) has been one of the most remarkable wealth creators in stock market history. But with Tesla shares falling roughly 20% this year, investors are beginning to ask a difficult question: Has Wall Street finally lost patience with Elon Musk? In this episode, 24/7 Wall St. co-founder Doug McIntyre joins senior writer and editor Lee Jackson to discuss why Tesla is dramatically underperforming many of its Magnificent Seven peers, and whether the company's biggest problem is Elon Musk himself. For years, Musk has argued that Tesla is much more than an electric vehicle manufacturer. He has promised revolutionary advances in artificial intelligence, humanoid robotics, autonomous driving, and robotaxis. Yet many of those promises have taken far longer to materialize than investors expected. Doug explains why Tesla's extraordinary valuation may be increasingly difficult to justify if investors begin treating it primarily as an automotive company rather than an emerging AI powerhouse. The discussion also explores Tesla's electric vehicle sales, its popularity in California, the impact of gasoline prices, growing skepticism surrounding Musk's ambitious timelines, and what upcoming third-quarter earnings could mean for TSLA shareholders. Is Tesla still one of the market's greatest growth stories, or has the Elon Musk premium finally started to disappear?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=68e8a8b4763cc66d4b51fcbc1694e46174aae92e4996655f404da1c5e1cbc452\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168543,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Midday, Oct. 16: Tech Stocks Slide as Investors Rotate Into Defensive Sectors\",\"id\":142949096,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chipmakers face selling pressure while healthcare and financial stocks gain ground, today, Oct. 16, 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=25f1db505b47b9d9b9cec3abda0b8131e3816335c94d15cca84fd132d3d01e02\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168262,\"headline\":\"Tesla Stocks Rise After Elon Musk Reveals Highly Anticipated Flying Roadster: ‘Well, It Worked’\",\"id\":142949091,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Elon Musk must be flying high after Tesla’s Roadster soared to amazing heights this week. The automotive giant’s highly anticipated Roadster was shown Thursday, October 15, at a SpaceX rocket testing facility in Texas. The demonstration started at 7:55 p.m. CT, a wink at 1955, the year the fictional character of Marty McFly travels to […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bfbbbbcc289097b7e5c815e7302d4f6d75b9dfbf264766f93af5fa1439f8bfef\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168200,\"headline\":\"Tesla, SpaceX, CoreWeave, Lam Research, Netflix, Strategy, and More Stocks That Explain Today’s Market\",\"id\":142949020,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla stock falls after the electric-vehicle maker unveils its new Roadster sports car. It can fly.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9535931db153ab9e8b897789d427320a83395b88da07124f45f2f8902ba66be5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167547,\"headline\":\"Tesla Unveils Roadster With a Nod to SpaceX Merger\",\"id\":142949093,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla unveiled its long-delayed Roadster sports car Thursday in Texas, showcasing a prototype that used SpaceX-developed air thrusters to perform aerial flips and accelerate from zero to 60 mph in under one second. Production isn't expected until 2028, while the flying version will be limited to an invite-only package not approved for public roads. Bloomberg Detroit Bureau Chief David Welch breaks it down on Bloomberg Intelligence.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d6c772556dde7fbaecef4861bdb62cee484cc35dd52df311d9ac0397c4f0dbe5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167301,\"headline\":\"Tesla Just Unveiled a Flying Car That Leverages SpaceX Technology. Is This the Next Big Catalyst For the Stock?\",\"id\":142949094,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla CEO Elon Musk recently led a demonstration unveiling the company's next-generation Roadster, which stunned the world.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c0c2a9c0a56869548e620fbdca15f79561f52a282910a517d687cbfacdbbf779\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167275,\"headline\":\"Semis And Bonds At Inflection Points; Bonds Become Correlated With AI Trade; Musk Shows Flying Roadster\",\"id\":142960811,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Elon-Musk.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\\n\\n\\n\\nInflection Points\\n\\n\\n\\nPlease click here for an enlarged chart of Direxion Daily Semiconductor Bull 3X ETF (NYSE:SOXL).\\n\\n\\n\\nNote the following:\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nSemiconductors reflect the AI trade, and SOXL is the momo crowd’s\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1450ce08c9a0c29c619fa4e80bfb0084269b6783cce822fe2cc8adca510e8c54\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792165808,\"headline\":\"Tesla's flying Roadster is more fuel for SpaceX merger rumors than a real car\",\"id\":142947949,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Roadster showcase was a soft-launch of a merger with SpaceX, of engineering, audacious flair, and Musk's ambitions.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=891ef5bd5f53c335b918ee5b4f16171632f81880ae55ac4b224268026b17bbb3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792165614,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Dow Up, Nasdaq Slammed; This Fund Is Beating Semiconductors (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142947903,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Friday while the Nasdaq struggles with tech losses.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cb803c3f115ec71398c92a8d9aa26dfab9377a0a41ce8805f25238959da8b5bb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792165422,\"headline\":\"'There's no point': Tesla Roadster's splashy reveal doesn't mean a merger with SpaceX\",\"id\":142947950,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Tesla Roadster reveal reignited chatter that Elon Musk should finally merge Tesla and SpaceX, but maybe he doesn't need to do it right away, if at all.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e4d3b775a5d35dde6a974025144b772c7f5a2e77ace055b469aa7766b0b4f376\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792164720,\"headline\":\"Tesla’s Flying Roadster Sends Hyperliquid Trading Volume Soaring 1,500%\",\"id\":142947954,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Trading in Tesla-linked (NASDAQ: $TSLA) crypto derivatives surged overnight after Elon Musk unveiled a flying versi...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e6f0aeb164729c138c923e9ae638151811ecbd0a75360bfaa75c1fcf7f85fccf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792163976,\"headline\":\"Tesla Gets Competition From Nvidia In Self Driving Cars\",\"id\":142947882,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia is quietly signing deals with some of the world's biggest automakers, and its self-driving platform looks remarkably like Tesla's most prized technology. The question now is whether Tesla's brand can hold off a rival that plays for the entire industry rather than just one car company.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3fe3fa0ff7478756f442147c3c87a14116f33db1eaae3dea19a96fca55c333e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792163312,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk's flying Tesla Roadster unveiling boosts tokenized TSLA\",\"id\":142947956,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Elon Musk unveiled a flying version of the Tesla Roadster, and with U.S. stock markets closed, traders piled into Hyperliquid's TSLA perpetual, sending hourly volume up roughly 1,580%. It's a sign of how round-the-clock crypto markets are becoming the first place investors react to news about traditional companies. CoinDesk's Jennifer Sanasie hosts \\\"CoinDesk Daily.\\\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=878a05bd59e8f205edce051a6272a70833ebca89f9373f97547f4469d9037bec\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792163050,\"headline\":\"TSLY: Tesla Flies, The Stock Doesn't For Me, The Premiums Do\",\"id\":142949743,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2148167922/image_2148167922.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The YieldMax TSLA Option Income Strategy ETF remains a HOLD, as extreme Tesla valuations and volatility make premium collection attractive. Read more on TSLY.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5870dcdbddc0db89d70d32d8dc06f75a0ab69009a0930a73ddc305f34b12d1ab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792162575,\"headline\":\"Is now the time for Tesla and SpaceX to merge?\",\"id\":142947951,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor and host of Sozzi Unleashed sits down with EMJ Capital Founder and President Eric Jackson to discuss the 'Elon premium' following the announcement of Tesla's (TSLA) updated flying Roadster and whether now is the right time to merge with SpaceX (SPCX).\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b6972a1f17d483d532d128e456a58a4ad45e93aa889da5292d19847bff07b9ce\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792162518,\"headline\":\"Tesla Unveiled its Awaited Roadster Developed With SpaceX. Their Stocks are Little Changed.\",\"id\":142947957,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The car is equipped with SpaceX thrusters and performed a stunt in which it managed to stabilize itself when falling from a curved ramp.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=25b6fb3960ac5cfbe898c94d1e71c05669b84d3f5cee97f595613026b5c0ac77\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161077,\"headline\":\"Meta, Tesla, SpaceX Take Center Stage As Earnings Season Kicks Into High Gear. Everything You Need To Know.\",\"id\":142947905,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms and Tesla earnings will highlight a big week of reports, including Netflix, defense, software and chip names.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bf9fb1c0ef4952970ca4ae5b0c80f0c329f2c12d5608dbaae940002f0252e004\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792160640,\"headline\":\"Roadster Hype Can't Mask TSLA's Margin \\u0026 FCF Woes Before Q3 Earnings\",\"id\":142947958,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla's rocket-powered Roadster stunt dazzled, but margins are sliding, spending is rising and estimates are falling ahead of the Oct. 21 earnings report.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=43cd16fca0fed69b288e34c702c3b9f2df8e7e1805ee808cb066d509728d5cd7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792160249,\"headline\":\"Tesla Q3 Preview: The Trillion-Dollar Robot Dream Hits A 2nm Silicon Bottleneck\",\"id\":142949481,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2286700252/image_2286700252.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Tesla is downgraded to Hold, as near-term catalysts are constrained by hardware limits, not EV sales or margins. Click for more on this TSLA stock update.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=604ad5fc8804c64d48362be66589798919a934e4512984edc2d40f86ad920301\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792160010,\"headline\":\"Tesla Roadster Debut, Tech Sell-Off, and a college alternative for entrepreneurship\",\"id\":142947913,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi digs in to the Tesla (TSLA) Roadster debut and all the \\\"cool\\\" tricks from the SpaceX (SPCX) event Thursday. Sozzi sits down with Eric Jackson, EMJ Capital Founder and President, plus Gagan Biyani, CEO of The Horowitz Andreessen Academy to discuss alternatives to college.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=375d5eeb022588101a13b427d3212e43fbadf939a397e45738e79232bea867f4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159980,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave Drops. Even Jensen Huang and Cathie Wood Can’t Buoy the Stock.\",\"id\":142947962,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave stock was falling again Friday even after Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang expressed confidence in the cloud-computing company.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5eee7a6a4e629bc6c3144fcc8f834fd94d5eb81b69316d1db99dfd316ce07836\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159965,\"headline\":\"Tesla Stock Rises as the Roadster Revives SpaceX Merger Talk\",\"id\":142947959,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla (TSLA:NASDAQ) stock rose about 4% early Friday, to around $377, after the company unveiled its long-delayed Roadster on Thursday night at SpaceX’s test site in McGregor, Texas. The car uses cold-gas thrusters built with SpaceX (SPCX), whose shares rose about 2%, and in the demo it lifted off, flipped and landed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2b26b6300a941d24dc6daf5e5017d357a4d3073c706cd28d3a9e4920705f489b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159560,\"headline\":\"The SpaceX-Ukraine Situation Gets More Confusing\",\"id\":142946077,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Full Starlink—or Starshield—service in Ukraine appears to have been restored.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8918137783b3b680201bc69affaca2fc0a4f409b8fc57672fb17118f452cd4a7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159488,\"headline\":\"Could Tesla’s flying car send sales and shares soaring?\",\"id\":142947960,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla revealed its next-generation Roadster on Thursday in Texas, with one of the three new versions performing a jaw-dropping kickflip and demonstrating flying capabilities. However, analysts contacted by Euronews Business do not expect the model to generate significant revenue.View on euronews\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d2ce4a2c7b1a6c72293954fe41ad72d3222d806a32766f9b9c36242c637b0173\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159100,\"headline\":\"Tesla pops, tech heads for losing week: AlphaCheck\",\"id\":142945450,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Stocks were mixed on Friday, with Tesla popping while the broader Tech market fell.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=825dbbef32818729891374461984755f66f4ee0a485a4487cd76b28b6b64b9d0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159080,\"headline\":\"Tesla takes to the skies, iPhone Duo pre-orders sell out, bond yields take a breather\",\"id\":142945509,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The 8:30 Hosts Julie Hyman and Jake Conley are joined by Bullseye American Ingenuity Fund portfolio manager Adam Johnson to help tackle the day's biggest news stories, including the grand reveal of the Tesla (TSLA) Roadster EV, pre-orders for the Apple (AAPL) iPhone Duo selling out quickly, and the latest reading on Anthropic's (ANTH.PVT) valuation ahead of its planned November IPO.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8523e545bbc8fcb1491dd48f2241739b4616c68641d89083836d4aab948d7905\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159015,\"headline\":\"Gasoline Cars Fall Below 50% of Global Sales: The Trump Contradiction\"