pha\",\"summary\":\"Tesla's flying Roadster is impressive, but its commercial potential remains uncertain and does little to justify a $1.4 trillion valuation. Read more on TSLA.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1a9d767a196a5baaea46611f60760696f2fa34219d19822d8e9299b2d1a78b93\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155624,\"headline\":\"Tesla’s Biggest Opportunity May Have Little to Do With Electric Cars\",\"id\":142945469,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors keep debating Tesla's car margins while a completely different business quietly rewrites the company's growth story. The real question is whether the market is pricing the wrong Tesla entirely.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c3d2f671cfcbeb67ebd44412ccbd3cf2bae9f5a4ea28eabecf68402cd3160eae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155522,\"headline\":\"Happy Friday! We have flying cars now. Here's a closer look at Tesla's SpaceX-powered Roadster.\",\"id\":142945578,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla (TSLA) just debuted its new flying Roadster automobile, powered by SpaceX (SPCX) technology. Bullseye American Ingenuity Fund portfolio manager Adam Johnson sits down with The 8:30 Hosts, Julie Hyman and Jake Conley, to discuss the details.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b4ef1d6f00eecf5115530df79ec3cc9f70f86736d9f644996bce9c5c425ec21b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155286,\"headline\":\"Tesla’s Flying Roadster Fuels SpaceX Merger Speculation, But Analysts Question Earnings Impact\",\"id\":142945582,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Dan Ives pointed to propulsion systems, pressure vessels and control hardware used in the Roadster to reaffirm 