 Revenue, Earnings Expected To Edge Lower Despite Delivery Beat\",\"id\":142934098,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2199484412/image_2199484412.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Tesla's Q3 earnings report will highlight whether stronger-than-expected vehicle deliveries and continued growth in energy storage can offset pressure on its automotive business.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=467dd172f70206c71ee49aa32f7fc38bfcfb8b12a65f2b54abfe6d1fd50ec38f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792119513,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk Opens His Wallet for Ken Paxton, Billionaire Pours $158 Million Into Crucial Texas Senate Race\",\"id\":142946344,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Elon-Musk--The-Ceo-Of-Tesla--Spacex--Pay.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Elon Musk donated $158 million to Republican-aligned groups supporting Ken Paxton’s Texas Senate bid, as per new filing.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a80c9671590f05bfdde761e13e29367e9772288ba90fe5df667ce8e2d64079a9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792117969,\"headline\":\"Tesla Showcases Long-Awaited Roadster With Aerial Tricks\",\"id\":142928558,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla showcased its new Roadster sports car in a demonstration where it drove up a ramp, did a controlled flip, and performed other stunts using air thrusters developed in partnership with SpaceX engineers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4f081080224ac93b7346b68697464db88bd1f7fb42afda96b5fdcdbbf06eddcf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792117448,\"headline\":\"Ross Gerber Says SPCX-TSLA Merger Has 'Become Obvious' After Roadster Reveal, Calls Thruster Tech 'For Show'\",\"id\":142946345,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benz