rs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a7df93222c4ff989d8a1aa22525badffb5b7463b2e5b767b1ad0e407a316b8ad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792106305,\"headline\":\"Tesla Energy Chief Mike Snyder Reportedly Exits As Elon Musk Pushes AI And Robotics Pivot\",\"id\":142922969,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Snyder’s exit comes as CEO Elon Musk attempts to pivot the company away from just EVs and clean energy to robotics and artificial intelligence.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ee67a332fd9afd3c495875459799304ad9486603b007599753ec58418d61aeb0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792105229,\"headline\":\"Europeans Bought More EVs Than Ever Last Month\",\"id\":142922970,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Tesla Model Y crossover is still the No. 1 EV model in Europe.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e765fb2c431ea44d1d3b8fe62691a7a7fdede129cc6c78a4c231841e078a4fde\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792101660,\"headline\":\"Here Are the 3 Magnificent Seven Stocks I'd Buy Today\",\"id\":142922943,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The AI build-out is shifting the leaders in the Magnificent Seven.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=816e187e4a0bf51322ce7f442885bd26ddd1a669648d8506dd56e5233d17de30\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792100880,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures: Disney, Salesforce Lead New Buys After Wild Session; Tesla Roadster On Tap\",\"id\":142922253,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The S\\u0026P 500 and Nasdaq rose at a key level, led by consumer and software stocks like Disney and Salesforce. AI names came off lows.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8c4466a106586c69fcf398599a49c953e5f2d539166ea1ab32b7c897076e25d3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792100233,\"headline\":\"AI could drive a Tesla-SpaceX tie-up as soon as this fall, analysts say\",\"id\":142922254,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla is expected to unveil its Roadster Thursday night, potentially featuring SpaceX-designed thrusters that could literally lift the car off the ground.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0743143e538afc0b94ea46c2f5166960f1becebf55eefaf9b4cc4abc33edb6a3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792100050,\"headline\":\"Tesla Roadster To Come In Three Vehicle Configurations: Performance (2 Seats); Thrust (2 Seats); Rocket (1 Seat) Capable Of Flight\",\"id\":142946350,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://x.com/Tesla/status/2110905588402295283\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0a7c3d53e7fbf113d861f76da3fc4b59568a5bc930609a6dfe00931b3fed2632\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792099413,\"headline\":\"Tesla Launches Roadster; To Enter Production In 2028\",\"id\":142946351,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://x.com/Tesla/status/2110788059008819215?s=20\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ececbfa999e344c38b2ac70902ce40e3efcf2f4958bae189f65e44fe3592da28\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792094920,\"headline\":\"What Would You Have Needed To Notice In GM Stock?\",\"id\":142922258,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"General Motors (GM) stock returned 50.6% in the year to October 14, 2026, outpacing the 17.3% gain for the S\\u0026P 500. The shares climbed even as the underlying business failed to grow. Over its latest twelve reported months, GM sold about as much as it had a year earlier, yet it earned less on it. So what could you have seen at GM before October 13, 2025.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ed5adbca8ffb568e17fc06041fa686ac9bac0f1dedca0f46b025314c5e9a542f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792094009,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk cash infusion helps GOP Senate super PAC raise record $273 million\",\"id\":142948736,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108371236-1790877085104-gettyimages-2298096960-090a3614_9kuitrxk.jpeg?v=1790878219\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Elon Musk gave a record $158 million to the GOP’s Senate Leadership Fund, boosting its war chest as Republicans pour money into Texas to defend Ken Paxton.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=01d0f76660d050811de81948b894a4959ea127a86087e3a64e6de81f5e753ca9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792093740,\"headline\":\"Tesla Roadster Is Coming. How To Watch the Launch Event.\",\"id\":142922255,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla will unveil a new vehicle infused with rocket technology on Thursday evening.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a5d37b47079fcdddeb92633d7e651eb9253a6c04c0e23cf036d72e38ca207180\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792092841,\"headline\":\"These 2 Stocks Have Run Circles Around the Magnificent Seven This Year, and Wall Street Says There Is More Upside Ahead\",\"id\":142921306,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Innovation pays off.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=423a910da1e18e0cf9ae9a1bda7a373012ba8db302e228d6a9de79a43f79a63b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792092669,\"headline\":\"Michael Dell Loses Title of World’s Fourth Richest Person After $36 Billion Drop in Net Worth in Two Days\",\"id\":142921341,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CEO of Dell Technologies Michael Dell is no longer the fourth richest person in the world, dropping two whole spots after a massive dip in his net worth this week. The decline started on Wednesday, October 15, after a Barclays analyst downgraded Dell company stock from overweight to equal-weight, per Forbes. The $20 billion drop […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f3e9b2fbcf581226f98e9929692d04c6337386d847a4ff806c26b26480751a9a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792092300,\"headline\":\"Tesla's Cybercab Robotaxi Fleet Jumped Eightfold in a Month to More Than 300 Vehicles in Austin, With Dallas Up Next. Is Elon Musk's Robotaxi Bet Finally Scaling?\",\"id\":142921310,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla's robotaxi ambitions are finally showing measurable progress.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=67b0782d8034f7c2929f76f450f739ebc8e5270d9f4e9206861338c52627f737\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792092282,\"headline\":\"10-15-2026: Hot CPI and PPI, Yield Reversal, AI Angst + Staples Rally\",\"id\":142922240,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Eric Criscuolo, Market Strategist at the NYSE, reviews a choppy week in which the S\\u0026P 500 slipped about 1% after a hot core CPI print sent yields sharply higher, only for a full reversal to offer equities no relief. Tech led the retreat, down roughly 4% with memory names hit hardest, as AI spending doubts and slowing growth at Anthropic fueled the bear case. A hotter PPI and a core retail sales miss then pushed 10 and 30-year yields down 15-20 basis points. Strong breadth lifted the equal-weight index as investors rotated into Staples and Healthcare, both up about 4%. Looking ahead, Meta, Tesla, IBM, SAP, and Blackstone headline a very busy earnings slate.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=44793e894e62b97e893c764872c6cda53ff27508860eef9e3183b0f3a71a8d05\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792087214,\"headline\":\"Tesla Roadster hype, the Meta-Apple AI deal, and how AI spending is saving the economy\",\"id\":142921330,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Market Hang's panel discusses excitement over the revamped Tesla (TSLA) Roaster event, Meta (META) and Apple (AAPL) announcing a new AI partnership to produce an open-source AI, and whether the economy would be on the verge of a recession amid high inflation if not for AI spendingToday's Market Hang panel consists of Gerber Kawasaki Wealth and Investment Management CEO Ross Gerber, TMX Wall Street Horizon Head of Corporate Event Research Christine Short, Roundhill Investments Chief Investment Strategist Drew Pettit, and Futurum Chief Market Strategist Shay Boloor.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=70c105bd72616bf7985e59189df78a588f898b79cc66520955edcdfb74a5516a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792086660,\"headline\":\"Why Tesla's Roadster won't move the needle, it'll just 'disappoint'\",\"id\":142920345,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Market Hang's panel discusses the upcoming launch of Tesla's (TSLA) revamped Roadster. The first update to the EV sports car since 2017. \\\"The new Tesla Roadster is a candidate for greatest product demo of all time,\\\" said CEO Elon Musk via X.  But is our panel buying it? Today's Market Hang panel consists of Gerber Kawasaki Wealth and Investment Management CEO Ross Gerber, TMX Wall Street Horizon Head of Corporate Event Research Christine Short, Roundhill Investments Chief Investment Strategist Drew Pettit. and Futurum Chief Market Strategist Shay Boloor.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4c968bed53280958712cca6221e11fdbd3ff11eae2d4c0fe09f188c597628c8e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792083554,\"headline\":\"Tesla's long-awaited Roadster gets its moment after years of delays\",\"id\":142922256,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla's redesigned Roadster set to debut at a SpaceX test site in Texas, nearly nine years after Elon Musk first previewed the electric sports car.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=229fc860d40da901df3dbd4b1a21a01cdaadbd3cbea37ffa60e0a7732a35e399\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792081843,\"headline\":\"Can You Buy Stocks With Crypto? Bybit Adds 1,000 US Stocks, but Not Every Version Gives You the Shares\",\"id\":142920301,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bybit now lets you swap crypto for over 1,000 US stocks, but what you actually own depends on which version of the service you use, and the difference matters more than most buyers realize.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4dcfea5756358804c378c15a70e3ee7af97ecfb9a545bcc927fb63d3b617e0b9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792081539,\"headline\":\"Tesla readies flying Roadster reveal in Texas to re-energize car business\",\"id\":142920347,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Tesla Inc (NASDAQ:TSLA) is preparing to unveil its long-delayed Roadster sports car in Texas on Thursday, turning to a high-stakes flight demonstration in a bid to re-energize its core automobile business. The event, scheduled to take place at a SpaceX rocket testing facility near Waco, aims to showcase a prototype equipped with technology designed to briefly lift the vehicle off the ground.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cf424559fc20bc18321c0872c11e377b3089674270843087ccd9947a1d2e7e4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792081403,\"headline\":\"Tesla Is An Incredible Company - Its Valuation Is Another Story\",\"id\":142921798,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2161879179/image_2161879179.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Tesla, Inc.'s integrated software, manufacturing, charging \\u0026 energy may justify a premium, but robotaxi/humanoid risks persist. Click for my TSLA stock update.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7abed961cbbf422057e028b1bb673f0cc0d1c89b2bf498bb5da62f82a78cb090\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792081138,\"headline\":\"MAGS: The Magnificent 7 Could Still Deliver 20% A Year\",\"id\":142921801,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2259148968/image_2259148968.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"MAGS ETF gives equal-weight exposure to the Magnificent Seven with AI tailwinds and high return potential.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5ae6debb122f58e43cfc1e5fa7dfa52e05b608b711543a3776fc5c9eaf6ffae2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792080050,\"headline\":\"Tesla Stock Has a Huge Valuation. Here’s What It Would Take to Justify It\",\"id\":142920348,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla trades at multiples that make traditional automakers look like bargain bins, and whether that premium survives depends on a set of bets that have never been more consequential or more uncertain.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=023149e6d0fbed1b87c68e620f3931dd20be58c2c59bce23a1ba15f29f5e0aca\"},{\"cate