 even the bulls are willing to go.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e2267de6e3181995f45b5dcbae93831a404aa028cfba0a04395a0b1a5329c9f1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062720,\"headline\":\"TSLA's Megapack Order Highlights AI Demand and Future Growth Potential\",\"id\":142914199,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla's 1 GWh Megapack order from Apollo Power highlights rising AI data center storage demand, but undisclosed deal value and pending commitments limit revenue visibility.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3eb1a5fb15f7e5362f3295b3b7ce710b543211603e65b35cf4fab43aafe06b93\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062180,\"headline\":\"A Tesla-SpaceX Merger Could Be Weeks Away\",\"id\":142911843,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Barclays analyst Dan Levy has been taking questions from clients about a potential megamerger.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=da59d5ad77946121a47807006919c21bd5b235b6d61b9d877260559cb47cfad0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792061136,\"headline\":\"TSMC stock sinks despite record profit amid 'extremely robust demand' for AI chips\",\"id\":142916274,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"TSMC stock sank even after the company reported quarterly results that beat Wall Street estimates.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0540de07f7fe2f4d75dcf82af8321a8a0320afd94450f62689370089ac21de14\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792061136,\"headline\":\"TSMC posts record profit amid 'extremely robust demand' for AI chips\",\"id\":142910467,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"T