esults show strong low-NA EUV demand and 2026 memory growth drivers. Click for this ASML earnings update.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=db34f859466ca91f43b1e4cc46f40c70f7a2a4259493f23039cb333b26fab3e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792056769,\"headline\":\"'Tesla Readies Flying Car Demo To Pump Up Sluggish Auto Business; Planning To Unveil Its Long-Promised New Roadster Sports Car Thursday In Texas, Reviving And Refreshing A Model That Tesla Stopped Producing More Than A Decade Ago' - Bloomberg News\",\"id\":142917672,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-15/tesla-readies-flying-car-demo-to-pump-up-sluggish-auto-business\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2419219b0e2f153644644e85db35a086c9a7ec601ce4f3c4dfb7a2f08518cf5d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792054703,\"headline\":\"Why Are Nasdaq Futures Sinking Premarket? CRWV, MU, TSM, SKHY, IBRX, RKLB, TSLA Stocks In Focus\",\"id\":142906452,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On Stocktwits, retail sentiment toward SPY has moderated to ‘neutral,’ but remained ‘bullish’ on QQQ despite the global tech rout.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f119653fe2b3bdb32b238ff642089c10f0b3987690bfe24728542d897532b7ec\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792051442,\"headline\":\"The 1 Thing I'd Want Elon Musk to Answer on Tesla's Oct. 21 Call\",\"id\":142905327,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"TSLA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The EV maker's valuation relies on Robotaxi. But what does a paid trip earn?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4bd65bdcca8afceb8d88ad13c9e0a52de21e8437da97a3323891ce9a84164653\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792050465,\"headline\":\"GLJ Research Reiterates Sell on Tesla, Maintains $2