     "content": {
      "size": 137381,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792320000,\"headline\":\"As borrowing costs spike, Jamie Dimon asks corporate America: 'Are you prepared?' You should ask yourself the same thing\",\"id\":142986251,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The JPMorgan CEO says corporate America isn’t ready for what’s coming in the credit markets, and his warning should put every household on notice.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8e4cf922a5acceaaa22703cf2a15c4d6ea52a3e366937bc857c138e59a2a0eb5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792314938,\"headline\":\"What Does JPMorgan Chase (JPM) Face If Jamie Dimon Is Right On Rates?\",\"id\":142983614,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan Chase (NYSE:JPM) CEO Jamie Dimon warned that prolonged high interest rates could strain U.S. consumers and credit markets. Dimon highlighted risks from persistent inflation, elevated asset prices and geopolitical instability in his latest public comments. He also pointed to tightening credit standards and questions around consumer resilience as policy rates remain elevated. Dimon’s warning on prolonged high rates only captures part of the risk picture for JPMorgan and large U.S...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f2e19f9aabe141ac0471d9ced087148b807c53b016401f99b96903f4054cd78d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792314000,\"headline\":\"Big Banks Outperform Sector, But Risks Shine Bright\",\"id\":142986719,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2211012747/image_2211012747.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Big banks like Citigroup, JPMorgan Chase, Wells Fargo, and Bank of America posted mixed Q3 earnings. Read more on the big banks here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=055f3ee9597222a62dc95d2323f1bb5c5ed39a2c73dcca30af18abc700b7ba1f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792308900,\"headline\":\"Is JPMorgan Chase Stock a Buy 8% Below Its Record High?\",\"id\":142977514,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Viewed as the highest-quality financial services entity, this company seems to always operate from a position of strength.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e8b542ab0544428fc5f3aff8aadbd9a0ddfc270cf20b54e131b948fbfc8c9f7e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792279857,\"headline\":\"Howard Marks: The S\\u0026P 500 isn’t a good bet right now\",\"id\":142964312,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Howard Marks: The S\\u0026P 500 isn’t a good bet right now\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a2e65f788114ee4a4cd9536b2f110b58c76c990b4474ad684c7b50f6fd98f4a4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792275791,\"headline\":\"Chamath Palihapitiya Says 6% Treasury Yield Could ‘Run Over’ AI Businesses\",\"id\":142987113,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/18/A-hand-holding-a-glowing-futuristic-AI-t.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Chamath Palihapitiya warns that rising bond yields could threaten debt-dependent businesses and force Big Tech to step in.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bc29b41dde8b8f074f12e0bc0e0e7460c693a9dc12849c365a556442b523aad8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792271481,\"headline\":\"Schwab and JPMorgan Block Unauthorized AI Agents from Moving Money as Private Ordering Reaches Financial Core\",\"id\":142963821,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On October 16, Charles Schwab CEO Rick Wurster confirmed in a Bloomberg TV interview that the firm is actively blocking unauthorized AI agents, such as Meta Muse, from executing transactions on behalf of clients. Wurster receives a weekly report indicating that Schwab is blocking between ‘tens and twenties’ of attempts by major AI agents to […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=70a7d179f310234a0ab7b73e92523757b92c2e65477e72f98f8ae0391b3291ac\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792242300,\"headline\":\"Bank Earnings Are Mixed—These 2 ETFs Offer Very Different Paths to a Recovery\",\"id\":142986913,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amid mixed bank earnings, KBE and IAT offer distinct ways to invest in banking stocks, differing in weighting, holdings and which conditions could help each ETF outperform.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f513a5adb714ed5bd55291e21e865b66ea2cab62278982cbcb7160dd40860fc5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792233907,\"headline\":\"Jamie Dimon Warns AI Agents That Make Payments on Your Behalf ‘May Not’ Act Properly: AI Revolution Like a ‘Tsunami’ That Must Be Managed\",\"id\":142960005,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan Chase \\u0026 Co. CEO Jamie Dimon cautioned that artificial intelligence agents allowed to make payments for customers would need their bank codes, putting the agents inside the bank with no assurance that they will act in customers’ interests. Agents...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cbff3ad0f3888ce5925cce32f889674e46b7558ca9f8658f29413022cc7abe6c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792221190,\"headline\":\"MSCI Is Moving to Drop Strategy From Its Indexes. Could That Hit Bitcoin?\",\"id\":142959150,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"MSCI is preparing to strip Strategy Inc. from its global indexes, triggering a 9.6% stock drop and raising an urgent question about whether the world's largest corporate Bitcoin holder could be forced to sell its massive crypto stash.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d7456ee981aed8a3b04a81bd3dc0971052929e9bcd47876a85ba5cbf305e9f11\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792197420,\"headline\":\"A kidney transplant milestone has Wall Street excited about Biogen\",\"id\":142954484,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan strongly reset its price target on the company’s attractive 2027 pipeline catalysts.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=566b777de47cf4258a817a60d513bcb7ddc7645f2b14d60abe037a9814ff7172\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792191602,\"headline\":\"Goldman vs. JPMorgan: Both Raised Their Dividends. Which Bank Is the Better Buy?\",\"id\":142958779,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Goldman narrowly edges JPMorgan on growth and income, while JPMorgan counters with greater scale and diversification. But which one is a better bargain today?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=89298c1915ae7dc7ffcf0b78240478d8164a8533fabc920e9cbcd97c1caea630\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792177380,\"headline\":\"Top Analyst Reports for Costco, Walt Disney \\u0026 Marriott\",\"id\":142950829,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Costco, Walt Disney and Marriott lead today's top analyst reports, with strong sales, streaming growth and travel demand offset by key business challenges.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=998d53ea0e8b7bdbebd4794c3c235a3b782d0c968eea656eaf8e68cb9f26ca97\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792172880,\"headline\":\"Why the Diesel Crisis Lifting Inflation Is Here to Stay\",\"id\":142950062,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Diesel prices have hit records around the world in the past few weeks, driven higher by a shortage caused by wars in Russia and Iran, and a decline in exports from China.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4c03f29685af5e112230fd86445bc9efa731a328e7ce6a3790190d8efad65ade\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792172586,\"headline\":\"AI Has Driven Bond Yields Higher, Says JPMorgan's Priya Misra — Sees Bonds As Hedge Against AI Trade\",\"id\":142949107,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Misra says high-quality fixed income offers yields of 6% to 7%, providing investors with an income cushion amid AI-related market volatility.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=18d9c9353151f7f5f64af8c0dd29edbe65c8fdf65e07aeb49c5e046628de2257\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170194,\"headline\":\"JPMorgan Chase: The Place To Be When Storm Clouds Gather\",\"id\":142950547,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2221881148/image_2221881148.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan Chase remains a Strong Buy despite worsening macroeconomic indicators and potential cyclical downturns. Read more on JPM stock here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5a2fcc4b8bdd43908760a75606d67a5ef82421d9eee30ea20b02754f6e6264dd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169516,\"headline\":\"JPMorgan Chase: 3 Key Takeaways for Long-Term Investors\",\"id\":142949108,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Management is shifting capital toward organic growth over buybacks, signaling confidence in long-term returns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1736bea953567f62597befe7bbd2d2d8378742ebf19ab904b907ac23b24c70f2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168645,\"headline\":\"Chase Tower Renovation Costs JPMorgan Over $800M in Chicago\",\"id\":142949054,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan's Chicago Chase Tower overhaul now carries a price tag above $800M, with completion expected in mid- to late 2027.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=65314451b3dfac0dd5ff6efc1425e1614cf1e043482759bef6cdb8e89e270782\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167552,\"headline\":\"Is Rare Earnings Miss Altering The Investment Case For JPMorgan Chase (JPM)?\",\"id\":142949110,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan Chase reported Q3 2026 results that missed earnings and revenue expectations for the first time in nearly three years, weighed by weaker fixed income trading and higher expenses, even as net interest income and consumer activity remained solid. The bank raised its full year net interest income outlook and continues to see strong deposit trends and asset and wealth management inflows. This helps offset trading softness and cost pressure and highlights how its diversified model...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cca081cba01304480d8e8d36e6133b2ec9428e85ef968463ee8e2b52adce179e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166339,\"headline\":\"Banks benefiting from benign credit quality environment, says Argus' Stephen Biggar\",\"id\":142962427,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108421340-17921793491792179345-49042716330-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792179348\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Stephen Biggar, Argus Research director of financial service research, joins 'Closing Bell' to talk the recent slate of Q3 bank reports and what they signal about the health of financials.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d3ddc1ed32235f47adc95ff0947b8f913cf77fb87b36e7a108d4873b4adf557\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792163136,\"headline\":\"JPMorgan Chase: Leverage A Concern To Future Earnings (Downgrade To Hold)\",\"id\":142949740,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1395728828/image_1395728828.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan Chase \\u0026 Co. missed Q3 estimates despite strong loan/deposit growth; rising rates and financing costs may pressure returns. Click for this JPM update.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e1aa9dd3c2ecf2425524df9247111b68b9a6f16c7639d12284c10ac3c6d3e474\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161804,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Swings On AI Fears, Tumbling Yields; Taiwan Semi, ASML, JPMorgan In Focus: Weekly Review\",\"id\":142947981,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The stock market was divided with all the key indexes testing or breaking key levels amid AI financing fears and tumbling Treasury yields.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6f9859d3302961fcbfc6d5d9bc85ab5947acf30e6bc87410ea46a4c0b2203ef1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161780,\"headline\":\"JPMorgan Chase CEO Jamie Dimon Warns That Inflation, Rising Asset Prices, and More \\\"Continue to Shift Under the Surface.\\\"\",\"id\":142947893,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The S\\u0026P 500 is on its way toward closing out its fourth straight year of double-digit gains.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=348ee9a8e984d45f6d330a493a90191d9cc0d14f83f0d19b376e92380ea55939\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792158960,\"headline\":\"TFC Q3 Earnings Miss Estimates as Securities Losses, Higher Costs Hurt\",\"id\":142947982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Truist Financial's Q3 2026 earnings miss estimates as securities losses and rising costs weigh on the results despite higher interest income and deposit growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bc7472f9caf04e7d1c803880e236e977a06b662942ea23f198895adce9a57749\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792156623,\"headline\":\"Final Trades: ServiceNow, JPMorgan Chase, Eaton Corporation and SentinelOne\",\"id\":142948746,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108420668-17921704161792170414-49040464194-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792170415\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"The Investment Committee gives you their top stocks to watch for the second half.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9080117fa6186a3834a82d6a52804a56067549b7b1a49e7894d01bb637484597\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155661,\"headline\":\"Benzinga's Insider Buys of the Week: Sprint, Cheniere Energy Partners And More\",\"id\":139941001,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d59278a269098405aeb2fb66c25d40b08ccdde58bf0f68295ba90519b3682e7e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792151729,\"headline\":\"Here Are Friday’s Top Wall Street Analyst Research Calls: Barrick Mining, Brinker International, Constellation Energy, Equifax, Fox Corporation, JPMorgan Chase, Klaviyo, Toll Brothers, Workday, and More\",\"id\":142944422,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pre-Market Stock Futures: Futures are mixed as we close out the first big week of third-quarter results, with some indices heading toward a losing week. Thursday’s stunning reversal in the debt markets, as semiconductor and other tech stocks got slaughtered, was truly memorable. Short covering and a flight to safety fueled one of the biggest […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6b7ef0528b7a53d040db130a37843195c9ca387aa90dc16c1d375754198d1d90\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792151700,\"headline\":\"3 Stocks to Watch as Wall Street Wealth Fuels Consumer Spending\",\"id\":142960711,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"As stock-fueled wealth props up consumer spending, Visa, American Express and Costco show resilient earnings and analyst support despite rising credit card delinquencies.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0b71ad825285273b2ce063f8494a50d776b1ffc7fde93099ea87ad0dbe148d2f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792148420,\"headline\":\"9 Of 11 Sectors Rise In Friday Trading As Cyclicals Lead\",\"id\":142947639,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Charts-Of-Financial-Instruments-With-Var.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Nine of 11 sectors are higher in Friday’s regular session, with cyclical sectors holding the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with no single gap clearly standing apart from the other breaks across the table.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2849d0ac5038a97fc9e2dc41b2da58d5dbeae2e3c1c739eaab8a464d56a914f3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792142353,\"headline\":\"Trump’s $330 Million White House Ballroom Donor List Reveals Nvidia, Apple and Google Among Top Tech Contributors: Report\",\"id\":142945143,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/President-Donald-J--Trump-Speaks-With-Me.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Trump’s $330 million White House ballroom donor list names major corporate contributors and raises questions over political ties and a pardon.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eb6632d41288a4561578e08e3a42c34515d96df0f4accf9f292c9c7b4fe0e589\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792141797,\"headline\":\"UK bank shares fall on report of potential tax hike in Oct. 28 budget\",\"id\":142939926,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Shares in British lenders fell on Friday after The Guardian reported that finance minister John Healey plans to raise taxes on banks in his Oct. 28 budget, with Lloyds down 2.3% and NatWest down 2.05% as of 04:40 ET (08:40 GMT).\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5809dacb7bbc2a5293336745ee3ee92f8c2faf98bdbeb1f3406222d34308b61e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792132642,\"headline\":\"GameStop CEO Ryan Cohen Warns Humans Could Attack Smarter Robots — ‘Whether That Ends Up Being World War III, I Don’t Know’\",\"id\":142945237,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Gamestop-Logo-Displayed-On-A-Smartphone-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"GameStop CEO Ryan Cohen fears people could grow fed up with smarter machines and attack them, a fight that might even become World War III.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1890f8d62d03f3f6c60e07a12011767b3ef5011af32e7d7adb1dd41a96d59754\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792123260,\"headline\":\"Schwab Shows No Wear from AI Agent Disruption in Robust Third quarter\",\"id\":142949111,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Schwab reported $192.4 billion in net new assets, better than expected an