1080\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Gerard Cassidy, RBC Capital Markets U.S. Bank Equity Strategy head, joins 'Power Lunch' to discuss key banks earnings reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bbb5ca68c002fbc3f3be9f4e202cdefdcfbef0a3fd55af3643acbd5b55c12afc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791901283,\"headline\":\"JPMorgan, Wells Fargo, and Citi earnings show consumers holding up despite high rates\",\"id\":142851159,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"US consumer and business clients remained relatively resilient amid higher borrowing costs, with results from JPMorgan Chase, Wells Fargo, and Citigroup showing that spending and lending continued to grow compared with a year ago, while loan losses remained largely contained.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e8be9d6cf41785c526dc46dc17b98b21ce7419deaf67b1cf020fd103b2db9d9c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791901266,\"headline\":\"US banks post strong earnings but economic risks cloud the sector’s outlook\",\"id\":142851155,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street's biggest banks reported another strong quarter on Tuesday, but they warned that higher rates and inflation could bite.View on euronews\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f7b4a939506ead92f3efb65c4019b82ec2f3f8fc4a9bbf9aa360b70831957faf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791901113,\"headline\":\"Big Bank Earnings Kick Off With Encouraging Consumer Picture\",\"id\":142851160,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"If you're looking for signs of consumer stress, you won't find them in the earnings results of the nation’s largest banks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d6