":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=88d8697d2f1a50ddc8d4409392868d6b467aace73a73419b17b1ec991a74f404\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791889978,\"headline\":\"Dow Gains Fall Back After Bank Earnings Roll In\",\"id\":142847428,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow had been surging higher in Tuesday’s premarket as investors exited tech stocks for banks but its gains pared immediately after JPMorgan and Wells Fargo posted their third-quarter results.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=15c7c1d1e4809b227f53b4a7012c2c8e98c17955ba6b26773cb2d3e0b62866cb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791889680,\"headline\":\"JPMorganChase Reports Third-Quarter 2026 Financial Results\",\"id\":142846051,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NEW YORK, October 13, 2026--JPMorgan Chase \\u0026 Co. has released its third-quarter 2026 financial results. Results can be found at the Firm’s Investor Relations website at jpmorganchase.com/ir/quarterly-earnings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7a4816f091f33bb170d71e70744ccab135fc7d945a2472d747466aa0fc794a5e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791889634,\"headline\":\"JPMorgan's 3Q Fixed-Income Trading Revenue Misses Estimates\",\"id\":142846052,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan Chase \\u0026 Co. reported the first decline in more than two years in fixed income, currency, and commodities sales and trading revenue for the third quarter, falling short of the average analyst estimate at $5.37 billion. Equity trading was the standout for the bank, notching $4.95 billion in the quarter. Kristine Aquino reports on Bloomberg Television.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=64ebbeadfce218e3f5d8f0400465dca1e939bd38f409a75d8a7d6ea914b929d3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791889275,\"headline\":\"JPMorgan Chase (NYSE:JPM) Misses Q3 2026 Sales Expectations\",\"id\":142847431,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Global financial services giant JPMorgan Chase (NYSE:JPM) fell short of the market’s revenue expectations in Q3 2026, but sales rose 6.5% year on year to $50.17 billion. Its GAAP profit of $5.57 per share was 5.8% below analysts’ consensus estimates.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=426fc90eeb730726a9e9ce57b59ea0c04fcd62209bacf840ab1f5e4553a0d442\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791888977,\"headline\":\"JPMorgan profit misses analyst estimates as Jamie Dimon warns economic forces 'shift under the surface'\",\"id\":142847422,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan reported Q3 earnings before the bell Tuesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a1ad8ef5e175a65f5b33a0e1e8e11220773904e76556c3724734e9710ef0ef6d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791888787,\"headline\":\"JPMorgan Profit Rises 6%. What the Market Thinks.\",\"id\":142847432,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan Chase generated $15.3 billion in net income in the third quarter, up 6% from a year earlier, the bank said Tuesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7de3e10446676abbb6968fa8584813192615908379ea0d8184cd166e91e66c3c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791888714,\"headline\":\"JPMorgan Earnings Prediction Market Preview: What Will Jamie Dimon Say?\",\"id\":142846064,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan Chase \\u002