imit AI agents’ access to accounts and personal data, citing risks of unauthorized purchases and sensitive leaks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c4c9c45cecefe4a1583a675b80addd2e62bba7b3282b301349eee8438eb35f3a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791868316,\"headline\":\"Nasdaq Down Over 100 Points as Memory Stocks Decline: Fear \\u0026 Greed Index Remains in ‘Neutral’ Zone\",\"id\":142848296,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/13/Fear-and-Greed.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"CNN Fear \\u0026amp; Greed Index held at 46 in neutral territory as stocks closed mixed, with the Dow rising while tech and memory shares declined.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e5d2ca137a3303ce31b1c26583b3859b54487fec993ad932652a796f5e20e8eb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791852916,\"headline\":\"U.S. stock futures steady as bank earnings, inflation data loom\",\"id\":142828170,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com-- U.S. stock index futures were little changed on Monday night as investors braced for a busy week of corporate earnings and economic data, with quarterly results from major banks and healthcare companies set to test Wall Street's rally to record highs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b6c90b9e140832c3d567dc5f839c662c1baec98d06950b5e9606f8b448679952\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791852225,\"headline\":\"JPMorgan, Goldman Sachs and 3 Stocks to Watch Heading Into Tuesday\",\"id\":142848479,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/13/New-York--Usa--May-31--2023-J-p-morgan-B.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan, J\\u0026amp;J, Goldman Sachs, Wells Fargo and Citi are set to report quarterly earnings before Tuesday’s open; shares edge higher after-hours.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=045a43f19aeec9dbed8d6313331a172b87cfdf824d25ac498c0dd8fc2ba495d5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791849600,\"headline\":\"Earnings from banks and  J\\u0026J and home sales data: What to Watch\",\"id\":142825557,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Market Domination Overtime host Brooke DiPalma takes a closer look at the top stories for investors to watch on Tuesday, October 13, including earnings reports from JPMorgan Chase (JPM), The Goldman Sachs Group (GS), Wells Fargo \\u0026 Company (WFC), and Citigroup (C), Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) delivers its earnings reports, and the release of home sales data for September.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0ed83cae897d5328a440303c15e0d102a8864a028c818d7dfc195d227dedb301\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791839820,\"headline\":\"Don't Overlook These Top Bank Stocks as Q3 Earnings Approach: EQBK, HOMB\",\"id\":142825322,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"With encouraging Q3 expectations, reasonable valuations, and solid dividend yields, Equity Bancshares (EQBK) and Home BancShares (HOMB) are both worth watching as their quarterly results approach on Wednesday, Oct. 14.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=82c2af87be5d1a30858d0947aa9938559683f6993c6e04ede074b5b09e8ee3fe\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791836580,\"headline\":\"NATIONAL PHILANTHROPIC TRUST AND J.P. MORGAN ENABLE NEW PATHWAY FOR DAF GIVING TO CHILDREN'S INVESTMENT ACCOUNTS\",\"id\":142824529,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"National Philanthropic Trust (NPT), one of the nation's largest public charities and a leading independent sponsor of donor-advised funds (DAFs), and the J.P. Morgan Charitable Giving Fund program today announced that, at the request of a donor, it worked with the Treasury Department to offer a new pathway enabling DAF donors to support qualified contributions to Trump Accounts, leveraging philanthropic capital to help young people build assets for their futures.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=99422ea388481756d186c282fe0bd505f800496558c551b808107a9c433d69f8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791836323,\"headline\":\"Bank earnings expectations: 'You can't go from great to great to great'\",\"id\":142824531,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JPM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Hennessy Funds Portfolio Manager David Ellison talks with Market Domination's Brooke DiPalma about what to expect from Q3 earnings season results from banks and why cyber risks could be mentioned on earnings calls.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1cc4306a8c6030e2855233a6c6a55a92e8ba2318d3907e49196fb20f538b2201\"}]"
