     "content": {
      "size": 140761,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792394735,\"headline\":\"These two stocks are BofA’s preferred picks among European SMID chipmakers\",\"id\":142997473,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com-- Bank of America highlighted its top picks among European small and mid-cap semiconductor stocks, picking two companies positioned to benefit from artificial intelligence infrastructure buildout.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c810f56a967ce444e231c2f1a4db91d4cabae4c04a526f49380a5dac131b109b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792314000,\"headline\":\"Big Banks Outperform Sector, But Risks Shine Bright\",\"id\":142986719,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2211012747/image_2211012747.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Big banks like Citigroup, JPMorgan Chase, Wells Fargo, and Bank of America posted mixed Q3 earnings. Read more on the big banks here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=055f3ee9597222a62dc95d2323f1bb5c5ed39a2c73dcca30af18abc700b7ba1f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792304769,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Week Ahead\",\"id\":142985350,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b003098e70a6cdd7a3ab60fb61978bd51c28cff1b3b3250070bf025dbecfc5c3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792270980,\"headline\":\"Bank of America CEO addresses a troubling banking problem\",\"id\":142963839,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Brian Moynihan explains how the bank is tackling a major compliance problem.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ab5f43966dc3d81f925a8a76fdbab7b3d05f41273022efddc0327a94a573332b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792264368,\"headline\":\"3 Undervalued Stocks Trading Up To 40% Below Fair Value\",\"id\":142963232,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Rising fuel costs are feeding into broader inflation, and central banks are preparing tighter policy in 2027. Cash is getting more expensive. That tends to punish companies that depend heavily on borrowing and rewards businesses that already generate solid cash from their operations. This article highlights three stocks where the current share price looks low relative to their future cash flows, based on SWS DCF work on undervaluation. The three stocks in this article are just a small sample,...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=966fb687ad15eaa2c9fd474d4e014ee2ce25bf320a15f692d2b40d0bd7c5a110\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792261681,\"headline\":\"Bank of America: 3 Key Takeaways for Long-Term Investors\",\"id\":142963231,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A $1.2 billion settlement won't derail earnings growth, thanks to a fortress balance sheet that lets management compete on service, not rates.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ea7a85c62e7fb01277fd61328a512bd91b562e57ec90d528e41849893e2de6b1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792246020,\"headline\":\"Bank of America sees 40% upside in AI’s next bottleneck\",\"id\":142961971,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BofA’s $100 call on this stock reflects a change in demand.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f43409aa61fe9dd0115f3f6a37a90f6e32fb52790d4294703977edcc6ac1397b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792244888,\"headline\":\"Bank of America Warns AI Investment Cycle Could Face Pressure From Competition and Falling Prices\",\"id\":142961972,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America has identified similarities between the current artificial intelligence investment cycle and previous periods of large-scale capital spending, citing rising investment expectations, increased competition and declining prices for AI services. In a note to clients on Friday, investment strategist Sebastian Raedler examined whether AI infrastructure spending could follow the pattern of earlier capital investment cycles, in which expanding capacity eventually placed pressure on profi\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d71f0557d2ebd12c3ab2060003f00afb11a856618d4ef556a472c3d549a09dd7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792184400,\"headline\":\"Bank of America warns of a disappointing old pattern\",\"id\":142950865,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Big banks are pouring money into the AI buildout, even as one of their own strategists sees history repeating.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a86fe242e22294e4b9d3bd2696948ece7d1c529be365e441d729b81aa9987eb3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792181700,\"headline\":\"Bank of America Declares Preferred Stock Dividends Payable in November and December 2026\",\"id\":142950866,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America Corporation today announced the Board of Directors has authorized regular cash dividends on the outstanding shares or depositary shares of the following series of preferred stock:\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d2c0be316113ade7859cdb242f7d6331bb52515c055bcea05868096a9dfbe8cf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792181693,\"headline\":\"AML Penalty Could Be A Game Changer For Bank of America Stock (BAC)\",\"id\":142950867,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America reported third quarter 2026 results that missed expectations, as a regulatory penalty of more than US$1.21b related to anti money laundering and sanctions compliance weighed on net income of US$6,933m and diluted EPS of US$0.91. The enforcement orders require Bank of America to overhaul its BSA and sanctions controls, adding ongoing compliance reviews and technology investments that could influence future expense levels and the way the bank runs high risk parts of its...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=32ec64a554d290abb2f51eede920e7cbfa71e33ff82f0638a4c7a73f58268b33\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179420,\"headline\":\"Halloween candy prices surge, along with other holiday grocery costs\",\"id\":142950100,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amid rising prices, consumers are shopping for fewer of the familiar grocery staples ahead of Halloween and Thanksgiving.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b592057d746569f0d033fe1a1761f6522864e14128232d63d1661bc5d4c42845\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173976,\"headline\":\"Most-Active S\\u0026P 500 Stocks in Oct. 16, 2026 US Session\",\"id\":142959210,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"S\\u0026P 500 most-active stocks for Oct. 16, 2026: SMCI, F, BAC, T, PLTR, NKE, ORCL, HPE, MRNA, and PFE saw heavy volume, with sharp declines and modest gains.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b3986a48a3f5afab657ba95ce3d87f80df82d15165f29bb14aad7f91ddb88834\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792172065,\"headline\":\"Fox-Roku Deal Could Drive Substantial Revenue, Cost Synergies for Media Company, BofA Says in Upgrade\",\"id\":142949154,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Fox's (FOX, FOXA) pending acquisition of TV streaming platform Roku (ROKU) has the potential to gene\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77631abb4ef3012de7e11f674f48ee75a2aeebd1c3fb52767070626a4e7b50e9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792171800,\"headline\":\"Bank of America Stock Sell-Off Looks Like a Buying Opportunity\",\"id\":142962641,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America's Q3 revenue missed estimates after a $1.2 billion legal charge, but NII growth, deposits, and buybacks point to a post-earnings buying opportunity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1a6667c03a73c505bd1962c1b443518a0a191ddc30788ca08ad4dae4ac18c035\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166460,\"headline\":\"Fox upgraded to Buy at Bank of America as Roku deal boosts growth outlook\",\"id\":142949152,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America has upgraded Fox Corp (NASDAQ:FOXA) to 'buy' from 'underperform' and raised its price target to $85 from $54. The bank expects Fox’s pending acquisition of Roku Inc (NASDAQ:ROKU) the streaming platform operator, to improve its growth prospects and generate about $700 million...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cc255a8d076793a705fd0a43f5d8ec1820b963fcf3810361e27ecd7cd007d8ff\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792165069,\"headline\":\"Update: Market Chatter: Bank of America Launches Investment-Grade Bond Sale\",\"id\":142948014,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"(Updates with Bank of America's response in the last paragraph.) Bank of America (BAC) has launch\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5fc79a233e4d207f57e7366b761d9ec42d28e07375881d71be7ac552d6b3a33c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792165020,\"headline\":\"Meta expected to beat revenue forecasts as AI boosts advertising, says Bank of America\",\"id\":142949082,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms Inc (NASDAQ:META, XETRA:FB2A, SIX:FB) is expected to beat third-quarter revenue forecasts as artificial intelligence (AI) supports advertising growth, Bank of America has said. The bank forecasts revenue of $63.8 billion for the three months to September, above the $63.3...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=74eaa20fcb6a73fde60bb51a31b4f3e7492ddeb1f530fc076db878540a8ca95e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792160102,\"headline\":\"What Happens to Software Stocks When Nobody Opens Apps Anymore? Microsoft Has a Head Start.\",\"id\":142950868,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BofA sees AI replacing workplace apps, and Copilot puts Microsoft in a strong position to lead.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=257bd45f70cadf84bf8142e126bed7ce87e410f42ec02250a567866472803cf9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792160026,\"headline\":\"Market Chatter: Bank of America Launches Investment-Grade Bond Sale\",\"id\":142948015,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America (BAC) has launched a sale of investment-grade bonds, Bloomberg reported Friday, citi\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b253eb2a59231e3632063cf9d77d345658f83edc12b2497cad6c80937f6a18a1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159620,\"headline\":\"Car owners delay repairs amid affordability challenges\",\"id\":142948016,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The car affordability crisis now goes well beyond buying a new car.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e5b989400d03ed9c1d847fb22e9a6ab07ae41831d642023809b3d59c0bdb79a1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792158960,\"headline\":\"TFC Q3 Earnings Miss Estimates as Securities Losses, Higher Costs Hurt\",\"id\":142947982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Truist Financial's Q3 2026 earnings miss estimates as securities losses and rising costs weigh on the results despite higher interest income and deposit growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bc7472f9caf04e7d1c803880e236e977a06b662942ea23f198895adce9a57749\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792152017,\"headline\":\"BofA's Brian Moynihan Downplays Inflation Concerns on US Economy, Says it is 'Resilient and Growing' — Here’s What Clients Are Doing\",\"id\":142945622,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America Corp. Chief Executive Officer Brian Moynihan called the U.S. a “resilient and growing economy” navigating inflation crosscurrents and interest rate volatility. Consumer and Commercial Health During the company’s earnings call, Moynihan emphasized that the bank’s clients’ daily...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9fbff91daf915d201e8bc53c7cf0390bb70de3234df64ae4365418e2831aef69\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792148420,\"headline\":\"9 Of 11 Sectors Rise In Friday Trading As Cyclicals Lead\",\"id\":142947639,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Charts-Of-Financial-Instruments-With-Var.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Nine of 11 sectors are higher in Friday’s regular session, with cyclical sectors holding the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with no single gap clearly standing apart from the other breaks across the table.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2849d0ac5038a97fc9e2dc41b2da58d5dbeae2e3c1c739eaab8a464d56a914f3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792148211,\"headline\":\"Can AI avoid the boom-and-bust fate of past capital cycles? BofA weighs in\",\"id\":142944253,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Bank of America told clients in a note Friday that the AI investment boom is so far following the classic capital cycle playbook, warning that rising competition and falling prices could push it toward the same disappointing end as past cycles.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ac3e840d9bfcd0d3b52782d7302c054c9a66936f95369edf52ad3e1d567ba966\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792147621,\"headline\":\"BofA’s Hartnett Sees Investors Avoiding Risk on Fed, Midterms\",\"id\":142944254,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Risk aversion is set to dominate markets in coming weeks as investors seek shelter from higher interest rates and volatility around US midterm elections and the AI trade, according to Bank of America Corp.’s Michael Hartnett.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d45a9e89c3bc95b00c457e7dc9debf59c2093de8a829b0f339fdec13f9d7b1fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792146522,\"headline\":\"Baird Upgrades Bank of America Stock Despite a Soft Quarter\",\"id\":142945623,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Bank of America StockPrice change 