.io/api/news?id=e64d84869509ceb0b7fbb8611d9ea5267a90d26c5f196b4a4ebb906485671c3a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792000800,\"headline\":\"These stocks are making the most noise in today's session.\",\"id\":142886904,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Let's dive into the action on the US markets on Wednesday. Here are the most active stocks that are driving the market today.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fb48a704234e8e394891ea3754f654ab4aa8ee2cb193e067c9c89d9e7397675d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792000695,\"headline\":\"BofA (BAC) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript\",\"id\":142887465,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Consumer banking and wealth management offset trading headwinds and regulatory charges.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=60744a74953b38179ff08f4a2553f49798b91418320a11f1342024908afe3199\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792000614,\"headline\":\"Update: Equities Fall Intraday as Traders Parse Inflation Data, Bank of America's Earnings Miss\",\"id\":142887466,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"(Updates with latest market prices and developments.) US benchmark equity indexes declined intrad\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4c23cf9151845822aedfb6536bc0ad0b39faa8184cec7523d1e7343e7becf86d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791999886,\"headline\":\"Bank of America Corporation (BAC) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript\",\"id\":142888257,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/assets/og_image_1200-29b2bfe1a595477db6826bd2126c63ac2091efb7ec76347a8e7f81ba17e3de6c.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America Corporation (BAC) 