regulatory penalty blindsided investors and snapped a six-quarter earnings streak, but the lending numbers underneath tell a very different story about where Bank of America actually stands.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3119c9fea878d0d2a59dbe192129a7656f27112616b7bd813225ae3e3727221f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791981002,\"headline\":\"Here's What Key Metrics Tell Us About Bank of America (BAC) Q3 Earnings\",\"id\":142882679,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Although the revenue and EPS for Bank of America (BAC) give a sense of how its business performed in the quarter ended September 2026, it might be worth considering how some key metrics compare with Wall Street estimates and the year-ago numbers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a9c850c751d51439327644fde9529a9a8bfb388dc7547808832f26bf2bf47e8c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791980856,\"headline\":\"Bank of America Financial Targets Unchanged After $1.2B Fines, Reveals CFO\",\"id\":142882680,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The financial targets that Bank of America outlined during an investor presentation last fall won’t change as a result of the $1.2 billion fine that it must pay for compliance failures, the bank's chief financial officer said Wednesday on a call with reporters.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=471badda5133746a65ce1eb48400aed83b407e752551322924ae371abd83d761\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791980722,\"headline\":\"Trade Tracker: Stephanie Link trims Bank of America and Buys more Wells Fargo\",\"id\":142886023,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108409350-17919947271791994724-48997264455-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1791994726\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Stephanie Link, Hightower chief investment strategist, joins CNBC's 'Halftime Report' to explain her latest portfolio moves.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2df1d6d2faefd12c1f1afb2d7dbd74848795ac0e176fc6284b457dabcc951e8a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791980273,\"headline\":\"Stocks making the biggest moves midday: CoreWeave, Bending Spoons, Bank of America, Dell, Hewlett Packard Enterprise \\u0026 more\",\"id\":142886107,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108303686-1778165290434-gettyimages-2270170699-COREWEAVE_AI.jpeg?v=1778165352\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Here are some of the companies making headlines in midday trading.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77594bdef53af4e9a35df58984da0dfe83fda6b62caa47c39eab9b108d74d611\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791980048,\"headline\":\"Bank of America (BAC) Hit With Record $1.2 Billion AML Fine\",\"id\":142882681,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America (NYSE:BAC) received a record US$1.2b penalty for anti money laundering and sanctions violations announced in October 2026. Regulators cited willful violations of the Bank Secrecy Act and failures to report billions of dollars in suspicious activity. The enforcement order requires Bank of America to overhaul its compliance systems and operate under heightened regulatory oversight. The record US$1.2b AML and sanctions penalty is important, but investors may wish to consider it...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f0fda203a22a0fcda62b78eb91fdf9717471f095733b1d7fc4b915950195c0c6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791979686,\"headline\":\"Big Bank Succession Talk Heats Up as CEOs Stay Firmly in Charge\",\"id\":142915750,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/New-York-City--United-States--Lower-Manh.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Some Wall Street bank CEOs addressed succession plans on earnings calls, while others weren\\u0026#39;t even asked.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5ccf161e004b4e96363671c9f68d1dc3de13d7b0922c64e857fb59398e16de52\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791979431,\"headline\":\"Bank of America fined $1.21bn by US for money laundering lapses\",\"id\":142882682,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The financial giant omitted to submit timely suspicious activity report for more than $5bn in suspicious transactions.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f1cf71ceb435b733752c9e997d75b2991c1ac1fae6e7caa2fca78d4a20d4f9f2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791978634,\"headline\":\"Bank of America Just Got Hit With a $1.2 Billion Fine. It Reports Earnings This Morning\",\"id\":142882683,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Treasury just dropped its third-largest penalty in history on Bank of America hours before the bank steps up to report earnings, and the fine carries a tax twist that makes it sting harder than the headline number suggests.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3501e4c679b18952f67f00fd65a31bbbd9d3a054111bb165d0472b505ec7c90a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791978294,\"headline\":\"Treasury says largest U.S. banks let politics influence who received banking services\",\"id\":142886092,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108408823-1791986922076-gettyimages-2217872224-20250602_dc_fedbuildings_125.jpeg?v=1791986938\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"New Treasury Department findings may lend weight to President Donald Trump’s long-running grievance that major banks have discriminated against conservatives.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b6102962f566e830aa4f604a432395a7fc04b51c31e5a0f88b5f2871f05d7c8c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791978240,\"headline\":\"The Market Is in a Punishing Mood—Chip Stocks and Banks Beware\",\"id\":142881876,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The stock market is in a funk, chip stocks suffer, bank earnings disappoint, and more news to start your day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ea082c4d045aa8853dc1ed8aae47b79119a1981af60831fce8bc4b06127336a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791977994,\"headline\":\"Nasdaq 100 Drops 1% on Hot CPI, SOXX Falls 7th Day: Stock Market Today\",\"id\":142915760,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Nasdaq-100-way-down.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The Nasdaq 100 fell 1% by midday Wednesday after September CPI topped forecasts, pushing Treasury yields and rate-hike bets higher.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=96ad35f5ef177e04917a658689de84478274bbf6edf6e6f298c9a08636fefbf6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791977460,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Lunch: Yields Surge On Hot Core CPI\",\"id\":142885014,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2295937803/image_2295937803.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Hotter core inflation sends Treasury yields climbing again. BofA slumps after disappointing Q3 profit. Netflix plans its biggest round of layoffs in four years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=303b98b281df7fc3239adae668eca5126dd9e11a9e5984924c212abbf30259bd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791977119,\"headline\":\"Bank of America stock falls on earnings miss\",\"id\":142881715,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Bank of America Corp (NYSE: BAC) shares are down more than 3% premarket after the company reported third-quarter adjusted earnings per share of $1.08, missing analyst estimates of $1.10, as the bank took a $1.2 billion regulatory settlement charge that weighed on results.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d19d7fb1618b299f9ffeac7b25c7158227ab32e84e9ee37d0f5ded5ea6a96e56\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791977022,\"headline\":\"Bank of America Results Hit by Weaker Trading, $1.2 Billion Penalty\",\"id\":142881716,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America's stock and fixed-income traders missed estimates in the third quarter, with bond-trading revenue falling 17% to $2.55 billion and equity trading down 10% to $2.51 billion. The bank's results were also hurt by a charge tied to a regulatory penalty over money laundering and sanctions violations. Kristine Aquino reports on Bloomberg Television.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b337c54961464bcf831d3e5f97baf5ec195f3cd2b7b331075c43b39d822c9280\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791976825,\"headline\":\"Bank of America Corp (NYSE:BAC) Slides After Q3 2026 Revenue Miss and $1.2 Billion AML Charge\",\"id\":142880215,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/THUMBNAILS_CHARTMILL_1000_528_16_065e226ebd.webp\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America Q3 2026 earnings miss estimates, revenue down 4.3%, $1.2B AML charge. BAC shares fall as investors weigh compliance costs and weak outlook.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=abe8eb7fd9130c8efedb20f92fed48862bc11797d1e1fee174bc6d70e82439a1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791976704,\"headline\":\"Bank of America Q3 profit tumbles 17% as deals, trading revenue fall\",\"id\":142881714,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America said Wednesday that its third quarter profit fell 17% from a year earlier as $1.2 billion regulatory penalty and a slowdown in its Wall Street machine dented higher lending income.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=495c82c73860066ad2cb83132af3410d831c42a533bb447dbaacd78e417bd6b3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791976493,\"headline\":\"8 Of 11 Sectors Fall Wednesday As Defensives Lead\",\"id\":142915769,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Stock-Market-Trading-Chart-And-Analyzing.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Three sectors are higher and eight are lower in Wednesday\\u0026#39;s regular session, with defensive sectors holding the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with no single sector pulling away from the group.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2b743e7a2c154c563c192ced156b0a277e5f5114d04f6476217f58acbd737cb7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791976443,\"headline\":\"Bank of America (NYSE:BAC) Misses Q3 2026 Revenue Estimates\",\"id\":142881717,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Financial services giant Bank of America (NYSE:BAC) fell short of the market’s revenue expectations in Q3 2026 as sales rose 2.6% year on year to $29.96 billion. Its GAAP profit of $0.91 per share was 17.6% below analysts’ consensus estimates.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=92113e0d207ddcf03b427eeb204c407f8d9aacdcc31dea986099949e7224b141\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791975603,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer Says Most of the Market Is Already in a Bear Market Despite S\\u0026P 500 Rally\",\"id\":142880470,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The S\\u0026P 500 just celebrated a four-year bull run, but Jim Cramer says that headline number is hiding something much uglier beneath it. Bank stocks sit at the center of that tension, and their next earnings reports will either confirm his warning or expose it as noise.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3c0ffba97a93c4e663a1ea59eb6e35977c92f5e5c1ffe1c080d977c2cd23645d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791975235,\"headline\":\"QUICK SPARK: Bank of America Stock Eyes Worst Day Since Trump’s Tariffs Shock\",\"id\":142918102,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Benzinga-Quick-Spark.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America stock slid 7.5% after a $1.2 billion Treasury fine cut third-quarter EPS to 91 cents, setting up its worst day since April 2025.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=706eda95723c6c2f1261ffa449f41b71af065789cd2e7a753ea32c923f6daaae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791975103,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Big Banks Earn Billions, Bumble Soars on Buyout\",\"id\":142879285,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/THUMBNAILS_CHARTMILL_1000_528_19_d704b1b5a8.webp\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan, Goldman, Citi and Wells Fargo earned nearly $32 billion but trading desks sent mixed signals. Bumble jumped 57% on a buyout; ASML beat this morning.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8cb73376d702b0ea1d04a80d3f05facddbcb644066296993edbdbf296a1d3a20\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791975097,\"headline\":\"Bank of America's $1.2B Fine Just Cost Shareholders 25 Times That\",\"id\":142918103,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/2024-11-15-Los-Angeles-Usa-Bank-Of-Ameri.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America stock plunges 8% after a $1.2B compliance fine and weak Q3 results, with investment banking and trading revenue falling.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8c5aeb9b45f9eb2e2d8373d3f7016ed1a2ed9db4a8f1b8979179771daf1959a5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791975020,\"headline\":\"Bank of America CEO on $1.2 billion fine: We're on the right course to remediate everything\",\"id\":142886109,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108408966-1791989186778-1791989097-48995836602-hd.jpg?v=1791989187\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America CEO Brian Moynihan joins 'Squawk on the Street' to discuss the latest earnings report, a $1.2 billion fine for money-laundering violations, and more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a58f58efe931669bebba38922c4a92252a903a7ceb8f7a3af01cf841cb89ad19\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791974700,\"headline\":\"Bank of America Reports Third Quarter 2026 Financial Results\",\"id\":142881718,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America reported its third quarter 2026 financial results today. The news release, supplemental filing and investor presentation can be accessed at Bank of America's Investor Relations website at https://investor.bankofamerica.com/quarterly-earnings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cf0c90c73a03fb4dc78fb359912b9abfb1db684bf603e5e709daab1c9bfa1492\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791972569,\"headline\":\"Bank of America Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript\",\"id\":142918104,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/11/06/movers_2.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America (NYSE:BAC) held its third-quarter earnings conference call on Wednesday. Below is the complete transcript from the call.\\nBenzinga APIs provide re