n-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America stock is down 3% after hours as of 5 p.m. ET following the announcement of a $1.2 billion fine from the U.S. Treasury Department, today, Oct. 13, 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=79d892774f148ba79e2c34d6c083f7517540521b61522bcd22a7334fe3006537\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791927584,\"headline\":\"BofA Fined $1.2B By US Treasury For Violating Anti-Money Laundering Laws Ahead Of Earnings\",\"id\":142854490,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"U.S. regulators fined Bank of America more than $1.21 billion for severe, longstanding anti-money laundering and sanctions compliance failures.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=915d0f836c16ed69d6be4fc163389ab4c1e21cdd8998b59ec426443e0fae131e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791926495,\"headline\":\"Bank of America, Johnson \\u0026 Johnson, Six Flags Entertainment, Citigroup and Applied Materials: Why These 5 Stocks Are on Investors' Radars Today\",\"id\":142882268,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Charts-Of-Financial-Instruments-With-Var.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"BAC, JNJ, FUN, C, AMAT were among the stocks seen trending among investors on Tuesday, Oct. 13, 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=56f323b779743a1311b917fd505da312e5250bede4e155261768b4d5ddf01d59\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791926408,\"headline\":\"US fines Bank of America $1.2 bn for anti-money laundering violations\",\"id\":142854491,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The US Treasury Department said Tuesday that it is imposing penalties of more than $1.2 billion on Bank of America, citing \\\"violations of anti-money laundering and sanctions laws.\\\"Due to Bank of America's \\\"egregious and continued\\\" violations of the Bank Secrecy Act, the OCC imposed its biggest civil money penalty assessed against a bank, said Comptroller of the Currency Jonathan Gould.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2f39fc8fd82d9791c4edbf42b0e10055ecaad394eca272fc7bc4cccefaf2e83b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791924840,\"headline\":\"Bank of America Fined $1.2 Billion for Anti-Money-Laundering Violations\",\"id\":142854492,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The U.S. Treasury Department said it is imposing $1.21 billion in penalties against Bank of America for violating laws designed to prevent financial crimes.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4344339fab7193a51241caa0155b720ffc8540aa0095f0d04a6108d88b2a9d5e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791923220,\"headline\":\"Bank of America hit with $1.2B in penalties over money laundering, sanctions failures\",\"id\":142854488,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Washington Correspondent Jennifer Schonberger joins Market Domination Overtime to share breaking news that the US Treasury is fining Bank of America (BAC) $1.2 billion, accusing the bank of violating numerous sanctions.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b67b5bfd4bf5df11fdb6eb4aefd37d00a76a6200096a7b50d3f2dbf7c4e4390d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791923116,\"headline\":\"BofA fined $1.21B over AML\",\"id\":142854493,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America failed to properly monitor trillions of dollars in transactions, according to the Office of the Comptroller of the Currency.\",\"url\":\"https://f