anks Could Lose Deposit Advantage to Stablecoins, Tether Co-Founder Warns\",\"id\":142882832,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/13/Man-Clicks-On-The-Inscription-Stable-Coi.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Tether co-founder Reeve Collins warns stablecoins could challenge banks\\u0026#39; low-cost deposits as digital wallets expand into everyday finance.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8116b406038e93f6904769db22633c4fe8b7201dfa6aa1e66b320f8c0fa0d7b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791891169,\"headline\":\"BofA poll shows tech overweight hits highest since August 2020\",\"id\":142847472,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Global fund managers have the biggest overweight in technology stocks since August 2020, as investors stay optimistic on the macro and market outlook while running low cash levels, according to Bank of America’s October fund manager survey.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eb4e5c7ceabb1e2c1fe2568685bc4150f1d27b2d8a6e6dc7556632f71a7d16a1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791887050,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Micron, Sandisk Fall on China Memory News\",\"id\":142844688,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/THUMBNAILS_CHARTMILL_1000_528_18_4dd6380574.webp\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Micron, Sandisk and SK Hynix fell after China’s CXMT reported progress on denser memory chips. Meta rallied on Muse Wonder as bank earnings kick off.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ef29d9aa212ac6aeeb8f660273fca1c93daa065808d32fd189ccc501783f66b3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791886400,\"headline\":\"AI Bubble Is Consensus View, BofA Survey Says\",\"id\":142847473,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"More investors think there will be an artificial-intelligence bubble in 2027 than those who don't, according to Bank of America's global fund manager survey for October.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a37ce2354ef4bf236635fbcea77fa4137a8f3ed502dfc35dcbedf23318e8f20f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791883260,\"headline\":\"The Zacks Analyst Blog Highlights JPMorgan Chase, Goldman Sachs, Citigroup, Wells Fargo Morgan Stanley and Bank of America\",\"id\":142844174,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan Chase and other major banks launch Q3 earnings season as investors weigh rising Treasury yields, lending risks and expectations for profit growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ef943e1f93dd867834e337f21774e0904f4889a06bdced2675218aed4f1d6c03\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791879158,\"headline\":\"What Wall Street Expects Goldman Sachs and Other Banks to Report\",\"id\":142840409,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Four of the largest banks in the U.S. were set to release their third-quarter earnings on Tuesday, offering investors a window into consumer finances, corporate lending, investment banking activity, and more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f8460aa629fe08cf02bfb2f15a2ff8375c6a3aec502db5fb6ff8612ddacf78b0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791879134,\"headline\":\"Big Banks Prepare to Report Earnings as They Face Skeptical Investors\",\"id\":142840857,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The largest U.S. lenders are confronting a bruising stretch for shareholders as they prepare to release their latest batch of earnings reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8cc38026618dfe00946ef33a0b30316f86a75180930864cbba4d45e75ed0c52\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791878496,\"headline\":\"BofA Poll Shows Investors Most Exposed to Tech Stocks Since 2020\",\"id\":142843052,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BAC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Global investors chasing the AI-powered equity rally are the most exposed to technology stocks since the rebound from the Covid pandemic six years ago, according to a poll by Bank of America Corp.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=23566af0068b2d9518ee06e43dd52ada11d77eddb4efe696d0e51fd4001608b6\"}]"
