     "content": {
      "size": 146323,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792381315,\"headline\":\"Why Did XOM, V, TEAM Stocks Hit 52-Week Highs Last Week?\",\"id\":142992175,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Refining profits, stablecoin adoption and cloud demand lifted investor optimism.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=68219abe3a3156f9212efd876ef242e5e2006331cdcf231db7b1a96c2deccc03\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792328499,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil Signals Massive Profit Boost From Rising Refining Margins\",\"id\":142986914,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for ExxonMobil StockPrice change for ExxonMobil stock in the last 6 months: 22%$XOM Stock Price as of Oct. 16: $17952-Week High: $179$XOM Stock Price Target: $175What Happened?ExxonMobil (XOM:NYSE) gave investors an early look at its Q3 on Friday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5db434e3c04c051305a642b18d0d141ae21e21c25c52a09bd794ef782975a3de\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792311176,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil (XOM) Stock Fair Value Edges Higher As Analysts Rework Earnings Outlook\",\"id\":142983615,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The fair value price target for ExxonMobil Holdings has shifted from US$170.91 to US$175.41, giving investors an updated anchor point for thinking about upside and downside. Street commentary links these adjustments to recent earnings implications, changing commodity assumptions, and how ExxonMobil is choosing to deploy cash rather than to any single near term catalyst. Read on to see how these moving targets shape the current analyst narrative and how you can track the story from here. Stay...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=93c2861fb8f939027399915c231de603239b1083e07721165b81d215a3f8231d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792288516,\"headline\":\"Venezuela expects $76 billion oil investment boost amid U.S. cooperation\",\"id\":142967277,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Venezuela expects to attract nearly $76 billion in oil investment over the next five years under new agreements, acting President Delcy Rodriguez said Saturday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fcc1812900c549017973141db41d0ec5d8d2798b32e4a4e9d07b6916b2be3333\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792246457,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil Is Up 49% in 2026 With Brent Near $110. Here’s What the Stock Could Be Worth When Oil Cools\",\"id\":142961955,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for ExxonMobil StockCurrent Price: $178. 98Target Price (Mid): ~$163Street Target: ~$175Potential Total Return: ~-9%Annualized IRR: ~-2% / yearWhat Happened?ExxonMobil (XOM) closed at $178.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b6cf70924ea2ce8e3062441cfa1ecd3ef85137e928a898bc57a2c5f41ea4f054\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792241117,\"headline\":\"Oil Topped $110 as Tech Stocks Lost $1 Trillion in a Day\",\"id\":142960712,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"When crude spiked past $110 and wiped a trillion dollars from tech valuations in a single session, the same geopolitical shock that lifted Exxon and Chevron near their 52-week highs also planted the seeds of a rapid reversal.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2548d237b28b100b33c096d31bbbf2cbdafc39449b1f510fd8270b98d7052def\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792234800,\"headline\":\"Meta, Tesla Headline Earnings In Busy Week For Markets\",\"id\":142961762,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/assets/og_image_1200-29b2bfe1a595477db6826bd2126c63ac2091efb7ec76347a8e7f81ba17e3de6c.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street Week Ahead: key earnings (Meta, Tesla, Netflix), IPOs \\u0026 economic data. Read here for more details.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3dcbe5a8689c76a628f51ae4c5084970467aab6b7f0f374e353ded8fe09592d4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792225800,\"headline\":\"Making Of An 8-Fund Retiree Portfolio: $5,000 Monthly Income Potentially\",\"id\":142960333,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2272031788/image_2272031788.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"We expand a simple 3-ETF retirement portfolio into 6- and 8-fund models for higher diversification, income, and decent growth. Click here to read more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=43b8420adfb17b071c2cdb24e23c9ba4931f193e9ac6966138256fd45c80980a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792216107,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil Flags a $4.5 Billion Refining Boost. Is the Stock Already Pricing It In?\",\"id\":142959590,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil (XOM:NYSE) told investors on Friday, October 16, that higher refining margins could add $4. 5 billion to third-quarter profit in its Energy Products business compared with the second quarter, according to a regulatory filing.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=474e7871ef7eb27ca9b9e558f34d540ef30e9ae98fd538196856ce3a1c7db437\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792180854,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Energy Stocks Gain Late Afternoon\",\"id\":142950787,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Energy stocks were higher late Friday afternoon, with the NYSE Energy Sector Index rising 1.9% and t\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=abbdf924b4db0700f27a835fb20a4b692a29f19d5209f0cab9d93df43881a159\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792177501,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil’s Refining Profits Are Set to Jump $4.5 Billion. Here’s What XOM Investors Need to Know.\",\"id\":142949990,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Exxon is benefiting from having an integrated business.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f2c2e353c2e925d060464adaa6ab04bcbfbf446bb72000d65aaf0b55fe0b40d5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792174010,\"headline\":\"XOM Stock Climbs On $4.5B Refining Lift Estimate; Goldman Sees Q3 EPS Exceeding Wall Street Expectations\",\"id\":142950064,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Margin improvement is expected to come mainly from a $4.5 billion rise in the refining and fuels business, the company said in a filing.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bc825332b740a2f1306285a9898425ab7d23dc26452f62f8b38692fdabb33cc9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173976,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Energy Stocks Rise Friday Afternoon\",\"id\":142950015,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Energy stocks were higher Friday afternoon, with the NYSE Energy Sector Index rising 2.2% and the St\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9d3a150c56a1d3e8016810293a0ac11d51f5b40d4d909e4eaca1cfc1b3d8668d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169820,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil Stock Is on Pace for a Record High. Preliminary Earnings Are Both Good and Bad.\",\"id\":142949112,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil stock rises after the energy giant says higher refining margins added $4.5 billion to its third-quarter earnings even as changes in oil prices take a toll on its upstream segment.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=acb882dad00d49c4c19ee6a05f0286668bd85ac95df5debd37d397c192da8132\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155960,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil's Strong Balance Sheet Offers Cushion Against Oil Volatility\",\"id\":142947983,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"XOM's low debt load and strong balance sheet provide a cushion against oil price volatility, supporting operations, acquisitions and shareholder rewards.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=62bf6d8f40a7177858197acb3a53f5dd1808177531180205dfde8f49a0418f1e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155960,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil Stock Rises on Preliminary Earnings That Are Both Good and Bad\",\"id\":142945593,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil stock rises after the energy giant says higher refining margins added $4.5 billion to its third-quarter earnings even as changes in oil prices take a toll on its upstream segment.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a7f509ca105d17883e02044b8dcb78862739124f4ab6b8212240ddda53a896f9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792153623,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil Sees $4.5 Billion Boost from Higher Refining Margins\",\"id\":142961371,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Channahon--Illinois--Usa--June-7-2022-Ex.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil expects higher refining margins to boost third-quarter Energy Products earnings by $4.5 billion compared with the second quarter of 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=40558c8baf2e919f300974451b038a5d3e9bf98b8cdaef98f5b220bfcba63eb8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792153055,\"headline\":\"Production Milestones Could Be A Key Catalyst For ExxonMobil Stock\",\"id\":142945594,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil Holdings is leaning into high return projects in Guyana and the Permian Basin, where recent production milestones and capital recovery have moved key developments into a free cash flow phase. The decision to keep associated Guyanese gas for domestic use rather than LNG exports reshapes the economics of that asset and highlights how host country energy policy can directly influence ExxonMobil’s long term project mix. We will look at how ExxonMobil's investment narrative is shaped...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=42cf3fcca15866f6db222187db479752f5f776f81f0ba524eeee912567d9beb1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792152007,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation (XOM) is Attracting Investor Attention: Here is What You Should Know\",\"id\":142945595,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Exxon (XOM) has been one of the stocks most watched by Zacks.com users lately. So, it is worth exploring what lies ahead for the stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f434423988082bbd4fe939940010055dbe535f835893f3aaf85088f9ab62bab5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792149342,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil Holdings (XOM) Draws Fresh Valuation Focus, Is It Fully Valued Or Still Undervalued?\",\"id\":142944239,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil Holdings (XOM) is back in focus after investors watched S\\u0026P 500 energy stocks keep climbing instead of cooling. The ticker now reflects that broader momentum with fresh attention on valuation. Recent headlines around Guyana output milestones, refined fuels strength and dividend resilience have come alongside a 90 day share price return of 18.54% and a year to date share price gain of 42.42%. The 5 year total shareholder return of 232.02% points to momentum that long term holders...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fe63a007755197512eaa3075cccf935286be23769e7c7d74b8c44c227c6e0a03\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792147530,\"headline\":\"Here’s How Much You Would Have Made Owning ExxonMobil Holdings Stock In The Last 5 Years\",\"id\":142947652,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/07/10/valuestock_3.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil Holdings (NYSE:XOM) has outperformed the market over the past 5 years by 11.21% on an annualized basis producing an average annual return of 22.54%. Currently, ExxonMobil Holdings has a market capitalization\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cd19ff1a5d5302e217c34dc0ee36c221905a5b9c74927250cef4fe0ec3642ece\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792142139,\"headline\":\"3 Profitable Stocks with Open Questions\",\"id\":142939803,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"While profitability is essential, it doesn’t guarantee long-term success. Some companies that rest on their margins will lose ground as competition intensifies — as Jeff Bezos said, “Your margin is my opportunity”.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0f1070eaf7934400611dcfae5f27f40624fb243dcecc898a4351668aae6bdae7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792138359,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil Q3 Adjusting Items Include Estimated Timing Effects Of -$2.50B\",\"id\":142947653,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2115436/000211543626000013/f8k3q991101626.htm\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d0e4f10e81643e98ea6ae78ccad1ec61b59d93cd8cab9c2a327247168e8d266\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792136241,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer: Reddit Is 'Inexpensive' While SiTime Is ‘Expensive’\",\"id\":142946114,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Jim-Cramer.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Jim Cramer favors Reddit, Chevron, EPD and Corning, but calls SiTime expensive and Valero a risky double-or-nothing trade.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ff5ce24e54706e3ff51046e060f1d71dd38a648b8347954672d8e49c86462d02\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792101600,\"headline\":\"Exxon’s Oil Boom Could Keep Guyana’s Gas at Home\",\"id\":142922976,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Guyana may prioritize domestic gas supplies or halve its planned LNG export capacity from 6 million to 3 million tons annually.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9ee7cd8299bf7410e16ea6b9e02c0cd49f4dba14a0a4997afc2dc1f5f43077fb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792095029,\"headline\":\"Lightning Round: Reddit is sitting at a great price, says Jim Cramer\",\"id\":142948748,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/MM-E-101526.jpg?v=1792156299\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"'Mad Money' host Jim Cramer weighs in on stocks including: Reddit, ExxonMobil, RocketLab, Enterprise Product Partners, SiTime, Coherent, and Valero Energy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f1e9e1305d452d08fa34875e0a3da4c0db32c0933608792ec29892a011dff1ed\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792093926,\"headline\":\"Exxon vs. TotalEnergies: Which Dividend Stock Pays You More in 10 Years?\",\"id\":142922276,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysTotalEnergies yields 4. 7% against ExxonMobil’s 2.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=93cd57619f83324beb29a68910d023053fd5ef044c36d03b45135f5e0d7de307\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792085350,\"headline\":\"Energy: We're Seeing Something Very Special Right Now\",\"id\":142922100,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2292327885/image_2292327885.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"XLE is up 50% YTD on the Strait of Hormuz risk and strong demand. Click for a look at the energy sector and see if it is the right place for your funds.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fd0c59b3d77a95d1b94e03af6da568d32769eee41f1b36ecf91617fa2e7bb0ef\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792080812,\"headline\":\"Gasoline Alone Drove More Than Half of September’s Inflation Jump\",\"id\":142920363,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"September's inflation report handed energy stocks a gift, but the same force lifting XLE is already working against the investors chasing it for protection.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=59e55ed5bab314e20e8e13d61c2f1146c752ba6cfc9e8e3107e5a8952d348c14\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792071953,\"headline\":\"Exxon’s Dividend Stays Safe Even if Oil Crashes to $79 a Barrel\",\"id\":142916345,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The EIA sees oil sliding toward $79 a barrel by 2027, and income investors need to know whether Exxon's quarterly check survives the drop before crude gets there.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c521801c60302f191bfba468b5e8d22155e0775f054f