tential earnings beat.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ab629a00c9c36b732be29a0317bcd6f3a3c71327eef79af07cbf7796244e99d2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062572,\"headline\":\"Defensives Lead Sectors In Thursday Trading As Technology Trails\",\"id\":142945157,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Stock-Market-Trading-Chart-And-Analyzing.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Seven sectors are higher and four are lower in Thursday’s regular session, with defensive sectors holding two of the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with Health Care sitting well above the next group.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=294a216817942afe6103c7aa12a4cb1690de64bea2ea80630f7af70f64ef1cda\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792044269,\"headline\":\"BP: Way Ahead Of Schedule\",\"id\":142908812,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2242800108/image_2242800108.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"BP stock analysis: rapid deleveraging and Q3 refining margin spike helped, but upside looks capped.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dce0c7b0a92c3449247e46b0b3610ec418a5477ae79669d6f346ec9ad30e5478\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792041585,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil: The Best Integrated Major Isn't Worth 29x Normalized P/E\",\"id\":142907178,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1170919460/image_1170919460.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil's valuation is stretched, trading at 20.6x P/E and a normalized 27.3x, which is excessive. See why I rate XOM stock a Sell now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0103bf25e8581959718d3a35a72a74df079f943fb6a99ac2614af958d7cec01c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792014600,\"headline\":\"Exxon Wants to Repeat Its Guyana Success in Trinidad. Should You Buy the Stock Now or Wait for the First Well?\",\"id\":142888317,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Trinidad offers upside, but Exxon's existing business remains strong.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=492b0883335b9dace7d7b346a2517d928f9c15982672df0aa6cb303b77250ec1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792013143,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy Occidental Petroleum Stock For Its Cash?\",\"id\":142888396,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Occidental Petroleum (OXY) generates free cash flow equal to 7.8% of its market value per year. That compares with 4.4% for the median S\\u0026P 500 company. A yield this high presents a clear binary. Either the shares are cheap for what the business makes, or the market expects that cash to fall. So can Occidental keep that cash coming while it pays down its debt.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6d9fdad133f9c063298b3c16bd7f84cdc7d257f39f1c64cbc4ccd877f0d8a8c7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792010702,\"headline\":\"Exxon Mobil Holdings (XOM) Rises As Market Takes a Dip: Key Facts\",\"id\":142888395,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Exxon Mobil Holdings (XOM) closed the most recent trading day at $177.01, moving +1.68% from the previous trading session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4fef0e2bcd97d32c40a5fed355544db8804452ee8c139a0d59be0e855a872744\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792004900,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Nasdaq Hit As Inflation Runs Hot; Dell Slumps, But These Biotech Names Gain (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142885210,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"re