\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oil prices crashed 14% last year, yet three energy giants kept raising their dividends anyway. The integrated business model behind that trick also explains why analysts see one of them as the most recession-proof income stock in the sector.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6aa4d597c01f50ab4b4d0d0b6c02ba64376c8bef18a6739bca16844622af1ea5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791986068,\"headline\":\"How To Retire: Hope For 95, Prepare For 105\",\"id\":142886345,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1296348532/image_1296348532.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Want to retire on income? Learn how a dividend portfolio using preferred shares and baby bonds can boost yield on cost and preserve principal.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2eb132da1e00b89ebe033b6e08337f524981d6412c48c58cd5cbcdcc18f6afed\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791985527,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil (XOM): Can Its Chemical Recovery Survive a Smaller Cost Advantage?\",\"id\":142882635,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation (NYSE:XOM) increased chemical earnings from $110 million in the first quarter to $1.13 billion in the second, even as sales volumes fell. Stronger North American feedstock economics helped, but industry chemical margins remained below the company’s historical benchmark. The investment question is whether integration can protect returns when that regional advantage narrows. […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0f4720e9faee9c68227859d3f42a8c37bf46675d16f80e80add5fcfaa944d18e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791976493,\"headline\":\"8 Of 11 Sectors Fall Wednesday As Defensives Lead\",\"id\":142915769,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Stock-Market-Trading-Chart-And-Analyzing.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Three sectors are higher and eight are lower in Wednesday\\u0026#39;s regular session, with defensive sectors holding the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with no single sector pulling away from the group.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2b743e7a2c154c563c192ced156b0a277e5f5114d04f6476217f58acbd737cb7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791922560,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil to Receive Port Houston’s 4th Annual Lone Star Award at HIMC\",\"id\":142854417,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"HOUSTON, October 13, 2026--Port Houston will honor ExxonMobil with the 4th Annual Lone Star Award during the Houston International Maritime Conference (HIMC), taking place November 2–5 at the Hilton Americas in downtown Houston. The award recognizes ExxonMobil’s exceptional partnership with Port Houston and its longstanding role in the energy industry that is integral to the Houston Ship Channel.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5c37efb3fbafe566ad156b443fc614a7fa09be0daefb72b103296019357ae016\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791914143,\"headline\":\"Is Occidental Petroleum Stock A Good Fit For Your Portfolio?\",\"id\":142853453,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors holding Occidental Petroleum (OXY) stock most likely carry it alongside funds tracking the S\\u0026P 500. As an oil and gas producer, Occidental can either amplify existing market risks in a portfolio or provide a counterbalance. So what does Occidental stock do to the rest of your money when the market rises or falls.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=63dbe88f799811fe3138e19a7382d94116d112fc36effdfcb181b6470513c979\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791902161,\"headline\":\"How Has Chevron's Story Changed?\",\"id\":142851165,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chevron (CVX) stock is currently priced at 20.6 times earnings, compared with 21.9 for the S\\u0026P 500. Investors paying that multiple need to understand the company's debt, and executives have recently changed how they frame that burden. During its fiscal 2024 earnings calls, management emphasized the net debt ratio. Today, the company highlights a different measure. So what is the new debt measure.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a49d8f8f4697280507b57619760ac326848943d464a2a762ecdfdd4cc07b922c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791900912,\"headline\":\"Guyana May Scale Back LNG Plans As Exxon Needs More Gas For Its Wells, Sources Say\",\"id\":142882357,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"– Reuters exclusive\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=20f05b594e4a0f8df47f2def9da2e5d442cc339fc6527237823d54fcc750e75f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791900120,\"headline\":\"Will Elevated Crude Prices Enhance ExxonMobil's Cash Flows?\",\"id\":142851164,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"XOM stands to benefit from oil prices above $90 per barrel, with low-cost production in the Permian and Guyana supporting its earnings and cash flow outlook.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e37c2727bb63e93b93ac2e181a9d0e7f67fed3d2ba303d81737ae6552181e6df\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791897191,\"headline\":\"How VYM’s $94.6B Dividend Kings Aided Portfolio Is Beating Treasuries\",\"id\":142848596,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"VYM's trailing yield