ustry in Past 6 Months: Should Investors Stay Bullish?\",\"id\":142822708,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chevron's 10.6% stock gain outpaces the energy sector as strong cash flow, expanding production, cost savings and upbeat 2026 earnings bolster its investment appeal.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cb6158b1d87e6d52aa6101ab04dc8054305a7cccdb354ef26233ec53858bed3e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791815400,\"headline\":\"In Court and on the Record\",\"id\":142821615,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"G\\u0026A's Sustainability Highlights ( 10.2026 )NORTHAMPTON, MA / ACCESS Newswire / October 12, 2026 / This Monday, the U.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0d14b64e04b17c9b240e0639d9a9ca53461403fa331b18f7a7a9a0b03eca8951\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791815060,\"headline\":\"How Has Occidental Petroleum's Story Changed?\",\"id\":142821618,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors are currently weighing a distinct valuation gap: Occidental Petroleum (OXY) stock is priced at 8.3 times earnings, well below the 21.9 multiple for the S\\u0026P 500. Anyone buying at that level is betting on a company that recently shifted its core priorities. In late 2024, executives led with CrownRock, a newly acquired business undergoing integration. They no longer lead with CrownRock. So what does management lead with today.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4d0b670b76adbd8450182ea7c61422d9ebb68bde54e8eda8350e8b3a5a78a7d5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791812685,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: S\\u0026P 500 Futures Pause Near Record Highs as Oil Rises Ahead of Bank Earnings\",\"id\":142819777,\"image\":\"https://s