ance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Energy ETFs are gaining as bond-market turmoil cools, with high oil prices supporting energy stocks while yield stabilization could lift sentiment.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d789edc099ecdd4e66fe7e23a92c3c42ad191d17d9b582b87c40f99b12d81f5c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791375416,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil Targets Nine FlexRobotics Systems to Improve Drilling Safety\",\"id\":142726973,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/07/Channahon--Illinois--Usa--June-7-2022-Ex.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil plans to add seven FlexRobotics systems over 12 months, bringing its total deployment on Helmerich \\u0026amp; Payne rigs to nine.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d9a1aba5df163e8831146cb6b1e3f0a9458dd4b6105239891be6f7ce0f4e8048\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791374400,\"headline\":\"H\\u0026P \\u0026 ExxonMobil Expand Deployment of FlexRobotics® Technology\",\"id\":142694798,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"TULSA, Okla., October 07, 2026--Helmerich \\u0026 Payne, Inc. (NYSE: HP) today announced an expanded deployment of its FlexRobotics® technology with ExxonMobil (NYSE: XOM), marking another milestone in the companies' ongoing collaboration to advance drilling automation, enhance safety and improve operational performance.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ca1f6a06ce82a285a92cf58463d8b5175e1616a81a805404d53e4b6f282039f3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791373847,\"headline\":\"4 Historically Reliable High-Yield Dividend Stocks Ripe for Long-Term Income Seekers\",\"id\":142693882,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Energy has a reputation for