) stock returned 50.7% in the twelve months to October 2, 2026, against 16.4% for the S\\u0026P 500. The latest results in that period were shaped by a Middle East conflict that took fuel supply off the market, and by how much oil ExxonMobil was producing. Nobody could have known in advance when that conflict would come. So was any part of the run visible at ExxonMobil before the stock moved.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d0b63513a0ae30653492643eef87d6f80cb06671a4ae014e323a8d3a52c8050\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791214380,\"headline\":\"Empower Appoints Former ExxonMobil Veteran Andrew Sinclair as Chief Public and Government Affairs Officer\",\"id\":142636801,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"DALLAS, October 05, 2026--Empower, a vertically integrated producer of American-made lithium, today announced the expansion of its senior leadership team with Andrew Sinclair joining as chief public and government affairs officer. Sinclair will be based at Empower’s new Washington, D.C. office. The Dallas-based company will also have a presence in Austin under Sinclair’s leadership.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2192dcd82635cae93510deeec8e149fc41511769d2564f3eb5ca95507481b5b3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791202440,\"headline\":\"The Zacks Analyst Blog Highlights NVIDIA, Micron, Chevron and Exxon\",\"id\":142634990,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI-led tech gains and surging oil prices drove market leadership in 2026, even as higher yields and inflation challenged valuations.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4813fe2f3bcaef0438d6271c69b7e89b4543d7ad6612dcefe06d01588ee480d3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791201609,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation (XOM) Is a Trending Stock: Facts to Kno