/2026/09/28/Channahon--Illinois--Usa--June-7-2022-Ex.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil stock advances as oil prices rebound after Trump rejects an Iranian proposal aimed at resolving the conflict and reopening the Strait of Hormuz.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=192e24f70664ed05eb0f4d6b9281a4666a7db83f09f1f25a440d82a62b1d2f3c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790576280,\"headline\":\"The Zacks Analyst Blog Highlights ExxonMobil, Automatic Data Processing and Cadence Design, BranchOut Food\",\"id\":142459847,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"XOM, ADP, CDNS and BOF feature in Zacks research, with AI, operational efficiency, recurring revenue and growth opportunities shaping their outlooks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d55ebc09f2f73233c338355f26b96c3df1d7d4b22ae820d820236a7e4ca52f79\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790556963,\"headline\":\"Best Dividend Aristocrats For October 2026\",\"id\":142453159,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2260312486/image_2260312486.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The ProShares S\\u0026P 500 Dividend Aristocrats ETF trails SPY YTD, but 20 individual Aristocrats are outperforming the ETF. Check out the Aristocrats list here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a858de7c4755f727def1d938c4a395431e61d53c9193adecc8cfe68e25951e21\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790433016,\"headline\":\"For Retirees Who Want Oil Income: Chevron vs. ExxonMobil\",\"id\":142438714,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chevron and ExxonMobil both carry Dividend Aristocrat status and record cash flows, but for a retiree counting on oil income through the next commodity bust, one of them carries a hidden risk the yield alone does not reveal.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e7a27fd793a99cfdc8c0ff918c6fd02dafcddfd659df16644bc1a821f9034ff0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790417948,\"headline\":\"Why US Diesel Prices Could Stay High Even If Oil Tumbles: A Global Refinery Shortage\",\"id\":142438063,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/26/Oil-Pump-Jacks-And-Refinery-Silhouettes-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"US diesel prices hover near record highs as a global refinery shortage persists. Here\\u0026#39;s why pump prices may stay high even if oil tumbles after Hormuz reopens.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d913ccbfbe201d07e83ac640984196aae6164d61fdaadeed783121e357d6cbcf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790405400,\"headline\":\"With Gas at $4.48 a Gallon, Here's How Much ExxonMobil Stock You Need to Buy to Fill Up Your Tank\",\"id\":142435639,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil dividends could help offset the rising price of fuel.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ec0ec0f2e676031a1b5a7f85674c8e0bb49f1fabc835885226ec0c086b99e29b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790398681,\"headline\":\"Truist Adds Fresh Fuel to Targa’s (TRGP) Growth Story. Is There More Upside Ahead?\",\"id\":142433238,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Targa Resources Corp. (NYSE:TRGP) has been on a strong run this year, posting gains of almost 55% since the beginning of 2026. A primary driver behind the rally is the 20-year fee-based agreement that the company signed with ExxonMobil in August. Despite the stock’s substantial gains and concerns that its rally could be nearing its […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4042845725cb352abf746883b39d7dc3b76f909f503e0ddff1dc6ab0cddbee24\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790367600,\"headline\":\"Top Analyst Reports for ExxonMobil, Automatic Data Processing \\u0026 Cadence\",\"id\":142426096,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil, ADP and Cadence highlight today's analyst reports, with growth drivers, market risks and strategic moves shaping their outlooks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=986aa53c08453e1e1c3c684675dc0e42957c79ff42c9d252c319efb40ba9e572\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790366968,\"headline\":\"What Happens To ExxonMobil Stock If Refining Profits Fade?\",\"id\":142426097,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The worry for ExxonMobil (XOM) holders is that its refineries stop earning high margins. Management said in late July that the Strait closure keeps about 3 million barrels a day of refining capacity off the market. The second quarter alone supplied $14.5 billion of the $32.8 billion ExxonMobil earned over the last twelve months. How much of that profit rests on refining, and what would you lose if its margins fell back.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0b95d17db1c5997d98729e76c483fac0b6c3b35f542b210bd72696570bbdbe62\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790348674,\"headline\":\"The 8:30: Trump-Xi summit takeaways, an interview with Microsoft CEO Satya Nadella\",\"id\":142424635,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The 8:30 Hosts Julie Hyman, Pras Subramanian, and Jake Conley break down the biggest market and business stories driving the day's conversation. From the latest updates from President Trump's summit with Xi Jinping to Costco's (COST) latest earnings, The 8:30 panel delivers the essential headlines and market context you need to start your day informed. Deirdre Bosa also comes on to discuss her recent interview with Microsoft (MSFT) CEO Satya Nadella.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=96faf258040b3f62ee6f5c2eea28efc778e4cd9a8ae7f9227342a08663804108\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790342220,\"headline\":\"Chevron's Cost Discipline: Turning Efficiency Into Lasting Value\",\"id\":142423858,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CVX's cost cuts are reshaping its operations, with efficiency gains, lower capital needs and technology supporting value through commodity cycles.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9a523b27c8e544abb4996339bf826d384b550b28756ceb8ac79f8d73801f2701\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790334584,\"headline\":\"9 Of 11 Sectors Fall In Friday Trading As Cyclicals Lead\",\"id\":142437371,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/25/Stocks--Futures-Slip.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Friday’s regular session has two sectors higher and nine lower, with growth and cyclical sectors split across the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with Technology and Industrials\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b3792a01c3fec00ee82003a3acfe8485dff4940ffce96f59c5ae719dc5ac1e6a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790332872,\"headline\":\"Vietnam’s BSR inks crude oil supply agreement with ExxonMobil\",\"id\":142417002,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The framework agreement, signed in New York City, supports BSR's strategy to diversify crude sources for its Dung Quat Refinery in Vietnam.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6ebc5b3b9918fca3ccbdcde0f2f828465abe6b027b983930f688e4ef6f2992f3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790323376,\"headline\":\"Marjorie Taylor Greene Calls US Refinery Drought Since 1977 'Catastrophic Failure,’ Demands 'All Hands On Deck’ in Washington\",\"id\":142422566,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/25/Washington--Dc---March-22--2024-U-s--Rep.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Marjorie Taylor Greene calls for urgent action to build new U.S. refineries, citing decades without major new refinery capacity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=19bfc1ba7e80ad4d7bb49d22550f38bac841abc7d2735d04a92276ac86765c3a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790284085,\"headline\":\"Could TotalEnergies (TTE)’ LNG Growth Give it an Edge Over ExxonMobil (XOM)?\",\"id\":142386742,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"TotalEnergies SE (NYSE:TTE) announced on September 7, 2026, that the 5.6 Mtpa Papua LNG project achieved critical commercial and contractual milestones toward a Final Investment Decision (FID). Key steps include completing the EPC tendering process and establishing a joint marketing venture with Kumul Petroleum to commercialize 2.4 Mtpa. Most notably, operatorship is transferring to ExxonMobil […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a565b183b3e74ca6cf14871f63e3389298421daf3128ec5d2c564a06429b613e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790266470,\"headline\":\"Did ExxonMobil’s (XOM) 2076 Floating‑Rate Notes Just Quietly Redefine Its Long‑Term Funding Playbook?\",\"id\":142384672,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Earlier this week, ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation completed a US$185.883 million fixed‑income offering of senior unsecured floating rate notes due September 25, 2076, featuring attached guarantees and callable, variable‑coupon terms. This ultra‑long‑dated, floating‑rate issuance adds a flexible funding source that can help match ExxonMobil’s long‑lived upstream and LNG growth ambitions with equally long‑term capital. We’ll now look at how this added long‑term funding, alongside record...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d71d14d1d9982ab0cfac5f8c39ea1ee20cde0f347b5e65019b8ff718e465e858\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790258699,\"headline\":\"8 Of 11 Sectors Fall In Thursday Trading As Leaders Split\",\"id\":142421646,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/24/movers-1.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Three sectors are higher and eight are lower in Thursday’s regular session, with growth, cyclical and defensive sectors each represented among the top three. The leaders are separated rather than\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=00446d0b7eca62e7091fb91a0636311d89b5a340641080559ba21143a2da914a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790256318,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar or Exxon: Which Dividend Has More Room to Grow?\",\"id\":142379050,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar just hit $20 billion in quarterly sales for the first time ever, while Exxon pumped out $23.6 billion in operating cash flow. Both companies raised their dividends, but their very different balance sheets tell a story about which payout has genuine room to run.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b38aedaf5a3ae842055603f34f473450e3c137418add7392d2e31ed0eb91355e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790253816,\"headline\":\"Shale Tycoon Claims Exxon CEO ‘Betrayed’ Him in $60 Billion Deal\",\"id\":142379046,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Scott Sheffield, one of the earliest architects of the US shale oil boom, said he was “betrayed” by ExxonMobil Holdings Corp. after Chief Executive Officer Darren Woods failed to support him in a dispute with the Federal Trade Commission despite a promise to do so.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0bb0a2a7ce449e6777c968d9d53c932d9f556c4d69b94f3ea3f978ecff54c218\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790253658,\"headline\":\"Update: Market Chatter: US Oil Executives Push Back Against Donald Trump's Potential Ban on Diesel Exports\",\"id\":142378630,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"(Updates with Phillips 66's response in the last paragraph.) Chevron (CVX), Phillips 66 (PSX), Ex\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b0721af7d8ff46f57f0c13074185ca59c65e4763767ccd27debd68c17528869e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790248955,\"headline\":\"Market Chatter: US Oil Executives Push Back Against Donald Trump's Potential Ban on Diesel Exports\",\"id\":142374347,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chevron (CVX), Phillips 66 (PSX), ExxonMobil (XOM) and Valero's (VLO) top executives are pushing bac\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a2ed22b539b2661f672f9c6764206410be151f88a507f87d2a5d7f2d1b774b97\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790205300,\"headline\":\"3 Companies With a Strong History of Dividend Growth\",\"id\":142365928,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Several stocks with a strong history of increasing payouts - Broadcom (AVGO), ExxonMobil (XOM), and Caterpillar (CAT) - are strong options for those looking to reap income.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b4cdc5df201ba0248989163a965998cd5a2812824decc8f5b138b82506ac74ad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790189100,\"headline\":\"Lincoln Property to repurpose north Houston eyesore Greenspoint Mall into industrial park\",\"id\":142364131,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Kevin Wyatt, executive vice president at Lincoln Property Company, with 555 Seminar Drive in Houston (Getty, Lincoln Property Company, Google Maps)Lincoln Property Company is stepping up to redevelop the Houston-area Greenspoint Mall at 555 Seminar Drive. Dallas-based Lincoln snapped up all the parcels that make up the 80-acre mall property and plans to redevelop the site into a 1.2 million-square-foot industrial development. The $150 million development will be dubbed CityNorth Industrial Park,\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5f8b1e4487e96d75b484a8d02d33bd9415376f5b28c9d57c4d00a722b6c956aa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790183231,\"headline\":\"Dozens Of U.S. Oil Refining And Business Groups Urge Trump To Reject Any Effort To Impose Ban On Diesel Exports\",\"id\":142421716,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"- Reuters Citing Letter\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d60f4b12b2fdd265be83e5a05c57d1d96252984598618df52b03ad3b947e38f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790178630,\"headline\":\"If Hormuz Stays Shut, How High Can Exxon Go?\",\"id\":142361949,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Strait of Hormuz is closer to closed than open, yet crude just fell and Exxon barely stirred. Understanding that contradiction reveals exactly how much upside the market is leaving on the table.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d26c933aa682d30b5f91ddcbf13e8fa863edf1768a388e8982fb0b2d2027c5b8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790176080,\"headline\":\"How ExxonMobil's Balance Sheet Helps Navigate Oil Volatility\",\"id\":142361950,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"XOM's 13.73% debt-to-capitalization gives balance sheet flexibility to weather oil and gas price swings while funding operations and shareholder rewards.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7bdee30ec8a2726f6d66b346edcfc69b1c91a8a57b351a12bfe48cf9e3d1311e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790175780,\"headline\":\"Can ExxonMobil Keep Rewarding Shareholders While Investing for Growth?\",\"id\":142361951,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"XOM's strong cash generation is funding growth investments and shareholder returns while supporting its 2030 earnings and cash-flow targets.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c6fd4ee7be2add999c4ded1ad3214d3a02104d198e18932b0c51d0b4bbdf9708\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790168409,\"headline\":\"Investors Heavily Search ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation (XOM): Here is What You Need to Know\",\"id\":142359458,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Exxon (XOM) has been one of the stocks most watched by Zacks.com users lately. So, it is worth exploring what lies ahead for the stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dd695d3cda686b744e03ee5ba0eaba65ff8a87ad5dd04129e2f22d155df98d1f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790167920,\"headline\":\"Zacks Industry Outlook Highlights ExxonMobil, Chevron, BP and Eni SpA\",\"id\":142357936,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"XOM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Integrated oil and gas stocks gain from favorable crude prices, sturdy midstream demand and diversification into renewables.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f6043140d1ca7e259912988c21fa227b4efff53909c13ae569116af2c28985f3\"}]"
