      "size": 146180,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792366040,\"headline\":\"The Winners Inside SCHD - October 2026\",\"id\":142992053,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=338e046f3cae53ba7d15e9918dd078db2c4d26bc477673975dbc84454a9e73f7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792360102,\"headline\":\"Bonds Already Discounted A 3rd Hike, Stocks Have Followed, Stay Long\",\"id\":142991440,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2298720448/image_2298720448.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Stocks sold off sharply after inflation data and a delayed reaction to Social Security COLA news. Read more on the market here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f639953768fbbd69bdc4fa4baffb34746c56adb4a5f8894e3effe2572f294a4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792356623,\"headline\":\"Undercovered Dozen: Hess Midstream, Iovance Biotherapeutics, Netlist, And More\",\"id\":142990565,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1314378638/image_1314378638.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Discover Seeking Alpha's Undercovered Stocks: 12 overlooked stocks from the past week to spark new investment ideas.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2f1517d45e1863b9885eeea60185584cd6f6304ec5ae0169cb975bf8e34a6d29\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792288516,\"headline\":\"Venezuela expects $76 billion oil investment boost amid U.S. cooperation\",\"id\":142967277,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Venezuela expects to attract nearly $76 billion in oil investment over the next five years under new agreements, acting President Delcy Rodriguez said Saturday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fcc1812900c549017973141db41d0ec5d8d2798b32e4a4e9d07b6916b2be3333\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792254759,\"headline\":\"Chevron or Realty Income: The One Dividend Stock I’d Hold for the Next 20 Years\",\"id\":142986258,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysChevron generated $18. 1 billion of free cash flow in the second quarter of 2026, and Realty Income announced its 115th consecutive quarterly dividend increase in June 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0f3459a4065659d98113fcba5350f0fa0725aef838512eeeb2755de7ce855bea\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792253261,\"headline\":\"Chevron or PepsiCo: Only One Gets My Dividend Dollars for the Next 20 Years\",\"id\":142962632,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysPepsiCo cut its fiscal 2026 core EPS growth outlook to 2. 5% to 3.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30684bb5f1a67107e068a06b71a4ad12925301bb8ee6ea6759d5ed44778185d0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792241117,\"headline\":\"Oil Topped $110 as Tech Stocks Lost $1 Trillion in a Day\",\"id\":142960712,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"When crude spiked past $110 and wiped a trillion dollars from tech valuations in a single session, the same geopolitical shock that lifted Exxon and Chevron near their 52-week highs also planted the seeds of a rapid reversal.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2548d237b28b100b33c096d31bbbf2cbdafc39449b1f510fd8270b98d7052def\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792225800,\"headline\":\"Making Of An 8-Fund Retiree Portfolio: $5,000 Monthly Income Potentially\",\"id\":142960333,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2272031788/image_2272031788.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"We expand a simple 3-ETF retirement portfolio into 6- and 8-fund models for higher diversification, income, and decent growth. Click here to read more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=43b8420adfb17b071c2cdb24e23c9ba4931f193e9ac6966138256fd45c80980a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792217434,\"headline\":\"Elite Energy Stocks To Own In October 2026\",\"id\":142959154,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oil has pushed back above US$100 after fresh attacks around the Strait of Hormuz disrupted crude flows and rattled energy supply routes. Sudden price shocks like this often refocus attention on large, integrated oil and gas companies that control production, transport, and refining. This article walks through three leading US listed energy stocks from our global hydrocarbons screener and explains why many investors are reassessing their long term role in portfolios. The three stocks below are...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5712fab39fca9cc5915f9c37f3e2ac6059f7cfadff9aa35719f5009cf60ac7e3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179794,\"headline\":\"9 Dow Jones Stocks Make Bullish Moves In A Defensive Market Rotation\",\"id\":142950007,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A week that tested the financial markets showed the resilience of Dow Jones stocks. Apple and Coca-Cola were among nine standouts.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=af9cc9e28f3a10ea2145e9aa2ce346b5f10ea949ca6edd0654727a5baaf6a007\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173180,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola, Visa and Mastercard Hit Records as Investors Rotate Out of Chip Stocks\",\"id\":142950011,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola, Visa and Mastercard are among the stocks hitting records as investors look beyond the AI trade. Earnings could help broaden the rally.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4ad8f758684d92953fbd2de585f964a4e73e883937172f558367ac5c9e40beba\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170480,\"headline\":\"5 Stocks to Buy Using the Relative Price Strength Strategy\",\"id\":142950081,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"HALO, GCT, LIND, PR and CVX stand out as relative strength picks amid market volatility, backed by strong price performance and upbeat earnings estimates.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f84ca18dd64c95f53ce49d6091309e1c5b45bbd09575dc63e0be42fe9f99e3ca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169820,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil Stock Is on Pace for a Record High. Preliminary Earnings Are Both Good and Bad.\",\"id\":142949112,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil stock rises after the energy giant says higher refining margins added $4.5 billion to its third-quarter earnings even as changes in oil prices take a toll on its upstream segment.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=acb882dad00d49c4c19ee6a05f0286668bd85ac95df5debd37d397c192da8132\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167882,\"headline\":\"What Makes Chevron Corporation (CVX) an Investment Bet?\",\"id\":142949133,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Diamond Hill Capital, a First Eagle Investment Management company, issued its Q3 2026 investor letter for its “Large Cap Strategy”. The letter can be downloaded here. The Strategy returned 3.18% (net of fees) in the quarter, outperforming the 2.61% return of the Russell 1000 Value Index. Key positive contributors included stock selection in information technology, an underweight in […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a5ca9882fd8b481af8c89da5a1d44f9c1e3ee3d792e84e5f299d91651b61320e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155960,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil's Strong Balance Sheet Offers Cushion Against Oil Volatility\",\"id\":142947983,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"XOM's low debt load and strong balance sheet provide a cushion against oil price volatility, supporting operations, acquisitions and shareholder rewards.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=62bf6d8f40a7177858197acb3a53f5dd1808177531180205dfde8f49a0418f1e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155960,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil Stock Rises on Preliminary Earnings That Are Both Good and Bad\",\"id\":142945593,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil stock rises after the energy giant says higher refining margins added $4.5 billion to its third-quarter earnings even as changes in oil prices take a toll on its upstream segment.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a7f509ca105d17883e02044b8dcb78862739124f4ab6b8212240ddda53a896f9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792153925,\"headline\":\"Buy The Dip: Sustainable And Growing 10%+ Yields\",\"id\":142948471,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2213698883/image_2213698883.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The article highlights two deeply discounted dividend stocks yielding over 10%, which is believed to offer surprisingly sustainable payouts. Click to read more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8c5d0aa98ad36344bf60f8cd0e9239d67c8188acf2cde70a0c23e50f7c05ad41\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792152008,\"headline\":\"Chevron Corporation (CVX) Is a Trending Stock: Facts to Know Before Betting on It\",\"id\":142945612,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Recently, Zacks.com users have been paying close attention to Chevron (CVX). This makes it worthwhile to examine what the stock has in store.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=47826ef4c3dd3127a30e0efa60fb38ad7c0478b9fdedce9529e0762746ecfae2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792151438,\"headline\":\"Why SCHD’s Income Is Unshakable This Year: 6 Dividend Aristocrats Doing the Heavy Lifting\",\"id\":142944381,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Six Dividend Aristocrats shoulder a big chunk of SCHD's 3.8% yield, but two of them are paying dividends that their earnings barely cover. Here is how close to the edge each one actually sits.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2a602f756776837e1b02d9e1009fde51bd70e47748a803ad4a88e8448803d1f0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792150200,\"headline\":\"Halfway Through October, Diesel Is Setting the Terms for the Entire Energy Market\",\"id\":142944250,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oil Market Daily News Commentary - Global onshore oil inventories are hovering at their lowest levels since at least 2016, according to the International Energy Agency's October Oil Market Report, released on October 14. The agency estimates world oil supply rose 2.5 million barrels per day in September to 102.3 million barrels per day, led by Gulf producers, but described the recovery as fragile and said diesel markets remained under significant strain. Active Companies from around the markets\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ea2caaac9c23a35dc2e43a63e22e1755d8beacb4b4165dc4c6e0408f6878d14d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792149540,\"headline\":\"EQT Raises Quarterly Dividend 3%, Reinforces Shareholder Returns\",\"id\":142945615,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"EQT raises its quarterly dividend 3% to 17 cents per share, lifting its annualized payout to 68 cents and boosting shareholder returns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=be69b9f345b4244b8df98f9dd0216252b8fad6c0f38a9a747c4dc0102f4d28a4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792149226,\"headline\":\"ONEOK And 2 Other Midstream Energy Stocks To Own\",\"id\":142944251,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Energy markets are being reshaped by reports of shrinking global fuel oil supply while demand from shipping stays firm. That kind of squeeze keeps attention on the pipes, storage tanks, and terminals that physically move molecules, not just prices on a screen. For investors, this highlights midstream infrastructure as a specific area to watch. This article walks through three midstream pipeline operators that provide targeted exposure to that infrastructure theme. The pipeline operators...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3900f6096a8ae32f8754d44ea7e6ac13f053af70887f229de68cf45d023494bd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792136241,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer: Reddit Is 'Inexpensive' While SiTime Is ‘Expensive’\",\"id\":142946114,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Jim-Cramer.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Jim Cramer favors Reddit, Chevron, EPD and Corning, but calls SiTime expensive and Valero a risky double-or-nothing trade.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ff5ce24e54706e3ff51046e060f1d71dd38a648b8347954672d8e49c86462d02\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792120555,\"headline\":\"3 Dividend Stocks With Yields Over 3%\",\"id\":142928574,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Rising long term US Treasury yields near 5% are forcing investors to think harder about every dollar put into the market. Cash and bonds now offer visible income, yet many still want the potential upside of equities plus regular cash payouts. That is where reliable dividend payers yielding above 3% come in. This article highlights three stocks from this high income screen that aim to offer that blend. The three stocks highlighted here offer a compelling starting point if you want exposure to...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=379ce45076b878370e046ebc63a09560fd8da882e65b4c5c3904c619e426a547\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792095405,\"headline\":\"Chevron (CVX) Stock Gets Fair Value Bump As Analysts Lift Oil And Project Views\",\"id\":142922298,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chevron’s fair value estimate has shifted from US$222.67 to US$227.71, signaling a modest reset in where analysts now place the stock’s long term worth per share. Recent commentary links these higher targets to updated commodity assumptions, large project updates and balance sheet decisions, which together shape how much valuation room analysts see from here. As you read on, you will see how these moving pieces fit into the broader Chevron story and what to watch as the narrative continues to...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6553ded0b5888c755c00a5f0b934cd5ab7181441e05c138dbccd15b71631a5b2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792093607,\"headline\":\"Better Dividend Stock: Chevron vs. BP\",\"id\":142922299,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysChevron yields 3. 5% and BP yields 4.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0df186cec58fde4c35c652182507a1178e37bbdccb4411fbf9193c3123ef7582\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792091412,\"headline\":\"Discover which dow jones stocks are making waves on Thursday.\",\"id\":142921152,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Let's have a look at the top dow jones gainers and losers one hour before the close of the markets of today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=545db4733871e90a22820d700146d007479454afeb887e72faa3fb5e27048e68\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792091100,\"headline\":\"Meet the Dividend ETF With Big Stakes in These 3 Blue Chip Stocks\",\"id\":142921311,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Schwab U.S. Dividend Equity ETF holds 102 financially strong stocks, including household names like Coca-Cola (KO), Chevron (CVX), and Home Depot (HD).\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aa02178236840ef19456fcf5a76536c6a6ed62ed267311bed25feee08ffed39d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792088721,\"headline\":\"Better Dividend Stock: Chevron vs. TotalEnergies\",\"id\":142921410,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysChevron generated $18. 1 billion of free cash flow in the second quarter of 2026, and TotalEnergies raised its interim dividend 5.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ed00f61b512cdef571d9b4dee08d5a4ea8e66c3a7d8431267c14f6560c07aad6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792085350,\"headline\":\"Energy: We're Seeing Something Very Special Right Now