05015,\"headline\":\"Discover which dow jones stocks are making waves on Wednesday.\",\"id\":142887223,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Uncover the latest developments among dow jones stocks in today's session. Stay tuned to the dow jones index's top gainers and losers on Wednesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0da62e5b5741f2c815f6c9d71ebb7308149769088a6488e233b3825b4510e5a1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791996300,\"headline\":\"How a Hurricane Could Help Some Refineries—and Hurt Others\",\"id\":142920398,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Hurricane Isaias showed how Gulf Coast storms affect energy stocks differently, with Chevron, Phillips 66, and the VanEck Oil Refiners ETF reacting based on asset location and diversification.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e201d1c213c6e0821d2b9136ebb86e950798d8e7597958fabf0423068ffb53ef\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791994407,\"headline\":\"Chevron (CVX) Stock Looks Reasonable With Cash Flow Value Above Price\",\"id\":142886476,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chevron has delivered strong share price gains in recent years, and the question now is whether those returns line up with what its cash flows can justify. With the stock recently closing at US$217.73, investors are increasingly focused on how durable the underlying cash generation really is. Over the past 5 years Chevron has returned 138.2%, which puts a lot of weight on the idea that the business can keep producing cash flows that support this higher footing. Recent moves to reshape its...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=54e0802b5b9a35ed4b83598f1f7c20c9e8358c90af785ad32af82d8815cf8f1c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791992135,\"headline\":\"What Did Valero Stock Investors Miss Before The Run?\",\"id\":142885166,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A $10,000 stake in Valero Energy (VLO) on October 10, 2025, was worth about $29,500 by October 13, 2026. Over that window, the refiner returned to large profits, helped by sturdy fuel demand and tighter supply. So what was Valero itself saying about its refineries before October 10, 2025.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=45542ef98f52712de6811c92df48e7cff137c8370f1f2eddac90d21884ea7339\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791991200,\"headline\":\"BP Unveils Q3'26 Outlook With Lower Debt \\u0026 Stronger Refining Margins\",\"id\":142886477,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BP expects net debt to decline sharply in the third quarter of 2026 as stronger refining margins and gas trading support earnings despite lower oil prices.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1f8233cc335b104d5c17d870de31d1eae597cf1d7f4958e7df5a4c6bbd8aa044\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791991029,\"headline\":\"Has ExxonMobil Stock Become A Different Bet?\",\"id\":142885163,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"At 22.2 times earnings, ExxonMobil (XOM) stock trades near the S\\u0026P 500's 22.5. Shareholders paying that multiple need a clear view of the underlying assets, and the priorities inside the company have shifted. During the fiscal Q3 2024 call, executives promoted Pioneer Natural Resources, a producer ExxonMobil now owns outright. Management no longer emphasizes that deal. So what does management talk up instead.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=47a05529d4d2d42577a0530001eb2dd2f3