 techniques to unlock Beetaloo's tight gas resources. The Beetaloo breakthrough feeds into Australia's liquefied natural gas export system at a time of heightened global supply concerns. The Chevron led fracking know how behind Beetaloo's first commercial gas is worth...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b6e5875c0b05ea1a2c5d17dcd72b5eb6138f9ea002d1ef910d74843ab5878da2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791902161,\"headline\":\"How Has Chevron's Story Changed?\",\"id\":142851165,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chevron (CVX) stock is currently priced at 20.6 times earnings, compared with 21.9 for the S\\u0026P 500. Investors paying that multiple need to understand the company's debt, and executives have recently changed how they frame that burden. During its fiscal 2024 earnings calls, management emphasized the net debt ratio. Today, the company highlights a different measure. So what is the new debt measure.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a49d8f8f4697280507b57619760ac326848943d464a2a762ecdfdd4cc07b922c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791902101,\"headline\":\"Chevron vs. Occidental Petroleum: Which Energy Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142851215,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chevron's fortress balance sheet contrasts sharply with Occidental's higher margins and cheaper valuation, but one carries significantly more financial risk.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4637e9efeda20e7ff5da5310b12fe06911df2e718f66570799609957ff5c9e70\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791901560,\"headline\":\"Eni Signs 2 Deals to Sell Stakes in Indonesian Upstream Assets\",\"id\":142851216,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summar