12c615\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791821345,\"headline\":\"Chevron (CVX) Could Be 5% Undervalued After Hurricane Disruptions Tested The Story\",\"id\":142822728,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chevron (CVX) is juggling two very different storylines right now. Hurricane Isaias is interrupting Gulf of Mexico output, while longer term production growth, Hess integration and overseas gas projects keep the broader investment thesis in focus. Chevron’s recent Gulf of Mexico shutdowns and the CFO transition news are landing against a powerful backdrop, with the share price up 35.97% year to date and supported by a 45.01% 1 year total shareholder return that signals momentum has been...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=112d40801f035ce3ee24ae1c546c4f81367547f63656c3aef316cbe5fb735843\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791817920,\"headline\":\"SLB Secures 15-Year Digital Drilling Agreement With TotalEnergies\",\"id\":142822730,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SLB's 15-year TotalEnergies contract expands DrillPlan adoption, strengthens digital business visibility and supports long-term upstream technology growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=81852ddef72898d6a90e8d10c63c14d6c7dfd115d73c449fb6a64a60b6b54436\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791817440,\"headline\":\"Can AI Drive Refining Efficiency \\u0026 Profits for Phillips 66?\",\"id\":142822731,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PSX is scaling AI to accelerate refinery problem-solving, optimize maintenance and build on cost savings exceeding $1 per barrel.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b356e2ecc34121c33f7113ded1365c4dbb131cee112b91754c9e26b6efb4265e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791816900,\"headline\":\"CVX Outpaces Industry in Past 6 Months: Should Investors Stay Bullish?\",\"id\":142822708,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chevron's 10.6% stock gain outpaces the energy sector as strong cash flow, expanding production, cost savings and upbeat 2026 earnings bolster its investment appeal.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cb6158b1d87e6d52aa6101ab04dc8054305a7cccdb354ef26233ec53858bed3e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791816180,\"headline\":\"BKR Expands Le Creusot Site to Double ICL Production Capacity\",\"id\":142821646,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Baker Hughes is doubling ICL compressor production capacity in France to meet demand for energy-efficient, low-emission technology.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e186d25ae5b9323f63eae785744cdb0c0096e4fab361b37a9eaada7e3d06e1c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791815060,\"headline\":\"How Has Occidental Petroleum's Story Changed?\",\"id\":142821618,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors are currently weighing a distinct valuation gap: Occidental Petroleum (OXY) stock is priced at 8.3 times earnings, well below the 21.9 multiple for the S\\u0026P 500. Anyone buying at that level is betting on a company that recently shifted its core priorities. In late 2024, executives led with CrownRock, a newly acquired business undergoing integration. They no longer lead with CrownRock. So what does management lead with today.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4d0b670b76adbd8450182ea7c61422d9ebb68bde54e8eda8350e8b3a5a78a7d5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791812685,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: S\\u0026P 500 Futures Pause Near Record Highs as Oil Rises Ahead of Bank Earnings\",\"id\":142819777,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oil surging past $100 is lifting energy stocks while high bond yields drag on tech, and underneath a deceptively calm index, a quiet rotation is reshaping portfolios before bank earnings reveal whether the slowdown is finally catching up to borrowers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b52db9957dbcdb5219be516bed820c70e342a1b1b095a52990c0840601d44a3d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791810720,\"headline\":\"Chevron and Egypt Discuss Next Steps for Aphrodite Gas Pipeline\",\"id\":142821644,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CVX advances Cyprus' Aphrodite gas field development as Egypt talks progress toward key agreements, long-lead procurement and a final investment decision.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bbe4095ee0d09d57ed92986f5a90d2303b95ee0712b6433e4a0fdbc695ad238e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791809223,\"headline\":\"1 Safe-and-Steady Stock with Solid Fundamentals and 2 We Question\",\"id\":142819951,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Stability is great, but low-volatility stocks may struggle to deliver market-beating returns over time as they sometimes underperform during bull markets.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0eb1f226381a06c51a8e5917c0f56e6db5d4e1db0d506d9f5ca61dd3d88623f1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791808500,\"headline\":\"Got $500? 2 No-Brainer Energy Dividend Stocks to Buy Right Now, Starting With a Huge 6% Yield.\",\"id\":142819949,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\"