.io/api/news?id=79dcceea9cc1eb958f64e2b1735ad0e28089e02cab0e4dcde51cd19b8d690ccd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791574740,\"headline\":\"Top Research Reports for JPMorgan, ASML \\u0026 Chevron\",\"id\":142767118,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan, ASML and Chevron stand out in today's research, with earnings strength, AI-driven demand and record production shaping their investment outlooks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=181708a4069b6b1d934b21ddf54a53c5069c5b84640b68e4f23345e8d83044b8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791573008,\"headline\":\"Friday's session: top gainers and losers in the dow jones index\",\"id\":142765954,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Uncover the latest developments among dow jones stocks in today's session. Stay tuned to the dow jones index's top gainers and losers on Friday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e8e3b8da2da0d6ae4d9558e72857a3ca0885d2701f5b383c0d396564a0c319c7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791567010,\"headline\":\"Trump EPA Moves To Roll Back Biden-Era Methane Rules, Says Changes Could Save Oil and Gas Producers $45 Billion\",\"id\":142766286,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Trump administration is preparing to weaken key Biden-era methane controls on oil and gas operations, with the Environmental Protection Agency targeting requirements for marginal wells, large-leak detection and associated-gas flaring. EPA Targets Super Emitter Program Rules EPA said it...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5f08373338a4933e82d15e32ea4c68050eca1686070aa196bef8c5a9490b8b41\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791559888,\"headline\":\"Hurricane Isaias could nudge fuel prices higher if Gulf of Mexico refineries lose power\",\"id\":142764079,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Hurricane Isaias is forecast to miss the oil industry's biggest hubs along the Gulf Coast but could still nudge fuel prices higher if it triggers power outages that shut down refineries for processing crude, according to industry experts.An extended shutdown of refineries would put a crimp in fuel supplies that already have taken a hit from the ongoing conflict in the Middle East and Russia's war against Ukraine.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5563ac98a604dd95037fdfe52bafe2aac992786228ce7ed9b8f6266d04cc68a6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791555353,\"headline\":\"Treasury Bills or Dividend Stocks? The Retirement Income Math May Surprise You\",\"id\":142763840,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Three of these six income stocks beat current Treasury bill yields, but a higher number on the label does not settle the argument once taxes, reinvestment risk, and dividend safety enter the picture.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d6ce00c721ad1924f83cd4763ba8a3c72a5f8b8e821088d4602014b0a5ec596\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791554236,\"headline\":\"CFOs On the Move: Week ending Oct. 9\",\"id\":142764081,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"World Bank Group names a new finance chief, Chevron promotes its CFO to head its oil and gas operations and Pinterest hires an Amazon exec as chief financial officer.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5aeacfb76e048843e9a82b53fec3b211f172fc6eed05262d55d77c037bc38b0b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791553313,\"headline\":\"Shell, Chevron, BP Pull Cr