50% Lower Bakken Costs — and a $200 Million Payment\",\"id\":142694968,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/07/Texas-Leads-NYSE-Listings.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Chevron deals DJ Basin assets and Hess Midstream stake to slash Bakken midstream costs by 50% and optimize return on capital.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e0e4e8136ecd0f47294ee0ed38bab9d97a68f678f7c5bb1351a2157acffd3d4d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791352581,\"headline\":\"Robinhood's Investment Chief Says She Prefers Owning Energy Stocks Over ETFs — Should These Stocks Be on Your Radar?\",\"id\":142694430,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/07/Two-Oil-Pumpjacks--Also-Called-Nodding-D.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Robinhood’s Chief Investment Officer Steph Guild favors individual energy stocks over ETFs to invest in the energy sector.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=be1d105770234492314b75771555a7d6571f4364d51efeff0302e47543c86104\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791350774,\"headline\":\"BP p.l.c.: An Oil And Gas Play Primed For Outperformance\",\"id\":142687296,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/458698243/image_458698243.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"BP p.l.c. is set for outperformance as new capacity from high-potential oil and gas projects comes online through 2027. Read why BP stock is a buy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1fc67e641661d717872c7c9c1f0af3e7933d9822740e9ba8814fe189f99cde8d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791348194,\"headline\":\"Chevron CEO: Energy system vulnerable amid 'very serious' low reserves\",\"id\":142698093,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108373841-1791364462968-1791361912-48843423936-hd.jpg?v=1791364465\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Chevron CEO Mike Wirth sounds the alarm on oil supply buffers, telling CNBC exclusively that inventory levels are a wake up call for the global economy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=68fb94bada544b0fef69f7578a403c9df8466a3af592392468a22c19ce290d80\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791346841,\"headline\":\"Chevron CEO warns against 'unwise' diesel export ban, saying it could make things worse\",\"id\":142698094,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108373938-1791375909497-gettyimages-2291635421-AFP_C6KY7DL.jpeg?v=1791375927\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"His comments come as rising Middle East crude exports and an emergency G7 stockpile release appear to have helped to ease supply fears.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1a1a9615557078e944eec9569d262fd7640b0e11df015f4bf1643f71153b680a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791340115,\"headline\":\"CNBC Daily Open: AI rally defies bond market rout\",\"id\":142698087,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108368167-17903510302026-09-25t154126z_116126255_rc2dqnabr23x_rtrmadp_0_usa-stocks.jpeg?v=1790351148\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"AI stocks propel the S\\u0026P 500 to a fresh record high, but the bond market blues keep investors on edge.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=01646fdfba205c0ec4e94b56917b8aed0932268031c5ef5d6a1f2629e43648ae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791322476,\"headline\":\"Chevron to Shed Hess Midstream Stake in Major Bakken Restructuring\",\"id\":142668739,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chevron has agreed to divest its ownership interests in Hess Midstream and its crude oil midstream assets in the DJ Basin as the U.S. supermajor looks to slash transportation and processing costs in the Bakken.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dce2f8e1f83a12c325912b92adf98e457c4fcb20b8f25cf7a7e3598d1a390414\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791321300,\"headline\":\"Chevron to Divest its Ownership Interests in Hess Midstream and DJ Basin Crude Midstream Assets\",\"id\":142668740,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"HOUSTON, October 06, 2026--Chevron Corporation (NYSE: CVX) announced today that several of its subsidiaries have entered into a series of definitive agreements with Hess Midstream LP (NYSE: HESM) to restructure the terms of its Bakken midstream contracts and establish new DJ Basin midstream contracts. The revised agreements extend the Bakken contracts and are expected to reduce Chevron's Bakken unit midstream costs by approximately 50%, enhancing future earnings and return on capital employed. I\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=911de450a8b8c849c99c2f3b31f47ef17a9adc51fe715f1d08e94f7bf654d4b3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791313200,\"headline\":\"Is the West’s 100-Year Venezuela Oil Bet About To Backfire?\",\"id\":142667729,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Washington is positioning Venezuela as a strategic pillar of Western energy security, with the massive NABEP agreement giving U.S.-aligned interests access to 65 billion barrels of proven reserves.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=27dcfc9575d4bf8afe68fbb9a8a3092f6bfcd302dfd02cc0f8a5edf78d57a779\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791311576,\"headline\":\"Chevron names insider CFO amid leadership shifts\",\"id\":142668741,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Long-time Chevron executive Jeff Gustavson will receive a base salary of $1 million when he assumes its top finance seat in January, the oil company said.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a78f7db9273ad67f866aacd39befa39ecfd684b1ece9adb553121494c640a82d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791309658,\"headline\":\"ExxonMobil’s Dividend Story Is Only Part of the Bull Case\",\"id\":142667713,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil has surged more than 38% this year on record Permian output, a 43-year dividend growth streak, and free cash flow that rivals any major oil company on earth, yet one valuation signal suggests the best of the rally may already be priced in.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=12f2fd609769f3e31615967e08d1e8a11a02cb12d4f590690b2a08aeae343d71\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791307056,\"headline\":\"Chevron To Divest Its Ownership Interests In Hess Midstream And DJ Basin Crude Midstream Assets;   Revised Agreements Expected To Reduce Bakken Unit Midstream Costs By About 50%;  To Transfer Hess Midstream Interests And DJ Basin Assets For $200M Cash\",\"id\":142694970,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Chevron Corporation (NYSE:CVX) announced today that several of its subsidiaries have entered into a series of definitive agreements with Hess Midstream LP (NYSE:HESM) to restructure the terms of its Bakken midstream\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fc995b48e5738e550231597cf8985ca425df9760ac58836fbdefa1e13a49ba16\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791297624,\"headline\":\"Chevron (CVX) Is Up 35% This Year. Can Its Exploration Push Keep the Rally Going?\",\"id\":142665580,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Following a 5-year period of soft spending on its conventional exploration and appraisal, Chevron Corp. (NYSE:CVX) is committing a higher budget toward exploration and production initiatives. This includes capital investments across frontier blocks within Egypt, Peru, Suriname, Brazil, Guinea-Bissau, Namibia, and the Gulf of Mexico. The company’s $1.82 billion conventional exploration and appraisal spending between […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d1a9f3835c9fe78ba11a1f8bd38d897d3d1fb01ecad46ba6756964f3ecc5626\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791295500,\"headline\":\"Chevron Strengthens Namibia Position Ahead of Nabba-1X Well\",\"id\":142665577,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CVX increases the PEL 90 stake ahead of Nabba-1X, signaling confidence in the Namibia acreage and its exploration potential.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a5dc0a16f44d574dd8f264a95981f435d31b98afc1a7bd17d9b6d5173364aa1c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791295320,\"headline\":\"CHINESE MANUFACTURER FULLGOOD MOTOR MAKES ITS UNITED STATES DEBUT AT LOS ANGELES AUTO SHOW, SEEKING AMERICAN MANUFACTURING AND DISTRIBUTION PARTNERS\",\"id\":142665578,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Los Angeles Auto Show®, presented this year by Chevron with Techron®, today announced that FullGood Motor, the Beijing manufacturer of retro-styled plug-in hybrid vehicles, will exhibit in the United States for the first time during November's 2026 show. Citing robust sales in the Chinese market, FullGood Motor is coming to AutoMobility LA®, the show's global media and industry day on Thursday, Nov. 19, to meet potential American manufacturing and distribution partners and to talk to investors.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a8bbb2aa8797707bc201e1fcece4c520314958047b4eee0e08307fb6cb8483ee\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791294240,\"headline\":\"3 Energy Stocks Positioned for Extended Iran-War Volatility\",\"id\":142665581,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CVX, LNG and SHEL offer distinct ways to navigate Iran-war volatility through diversified oil, U.S. liquefied natural gas and integrated operations.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4463cec17e3c9c284cdf5b95388cbd5f658beee5856aab73aa8ee8c503c282cb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791293468,\"headline\":\"Oil And Gas: You Ain't Seen Nothing Yet\",\"id\":142666566,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1341830582/image_1341830582.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Petrobras is a top energy pick as Brent premium, Mideast risks, and a flattening oil curve lift upside. Read the full analysis here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=11fbd22fc4bf63a1c0492058288ae75df8a3448150116133741155eea152f804\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791293040,\"headline\":\"Will Cenovus' Athabasca Deal Strengthen Its Oil Sands Growth Story?\",\"id\":142665582,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CVE's $5.7B Athabasca deal adds 45 MBoe/d, strengthens its oil sands footprint and targets 115 MBPD of thermal output by 2032.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=683ada93f5e5608cced7f6a50c6bb5cca33ea726f84a5d65978d3851d6723f19\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791291600,\"headline\":\"Best Momentum Stocks to Buy for October 6th\",\"id\":142665579,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CVX, SNDK and CLMT made it to the Zacks Rank #1 (Strong Buy) momentum stocks list on October 6th, 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=757388b74e027141a7cde463e2f8ea1cd02fb312fcc9a7c064c9f278c74c7aea\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791290978,\"headline\":\"$100,000 in 5 Dividend Kings Will Generate Close to $4,000 Each Year Safely\",\"id\":142662977,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"When paychecks stop, the wrong income strategy forces you to sell shares at the worst possible moment. Five companies have raised their dividends through every recession and rate shock in modern memory, and together they turn a single portfolio into a reliable cash machine.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a94fb58f1bc39299028dfa47644453f08b69879c1aa73aeb3a13ea968279018b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791277924,\"headline\":\"Chevron’s Wirth Warns US Diesel Curbs Could Send Prices Higher\",\"id\":142659904,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A US ban on diesel exports could result in higher prices in some parts of the country as well as causing issues with other nations that rely on American supplies, Chevron Corp. Chief Executive Officer Mike Wirth said on Tuesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9e719e01afda9cf5a83184229f2e53d61a3e764e73ecc676bcf93ff06760a40b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791269340,\"headline\":\"New Strong Buy Stocks for October 6th\",\"id\":142652850,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SNDK, CLMT, CVX, HRB and GSBD have been added to the Zacks Rank #1 (Strong Buy) List on October 6th, 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e06993fc8887278a677d66b753a929c9cbad6678151b91a1e20be42539fc2ce5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791226678,\"headline\":\"How Much Do You Really Need Invested to Replace a $180,000 Salary With Dividends?\",\"id\":142638484,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The yield you chase determines whether you need $1.3 million or over $5 million to walk away from your paycheck, and picking the wrong tier can leave you worse off than someone who started with far less.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5293c1dd946a8ae6302d3ce9142d7a9535a031a5e30000c7719df276e0c459f6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791220808,\"headline\":\"Invest $10K in Each of These 5 Warren Buffett Picks and You Could Earn $130 a Month in Passive Income\",\"id\":142637790,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"See how investing in five Warren Buffett stock picks could generate monthly passive income, and why dividend investors are watching them.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7200e20c976ee98a73f2c998508dbe48a1d4b551ddd8199556c76f89c7939250\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791215665,\"headline\":\"Has The Story Under ExxonMobil Stock Run Out?\",\"id\":142637762,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ExxonMobil (XOM) stock returned 50.7% in the twelve months to October 2, 2026, against 16.4% for the S\\u0026P 500. The latest results in that period were shaped by a Middle East conflict that took fuel supply off the market, and by how much oil ExxonMobil was producing. Nobody could have known in advance when that conflict would come. So was any part of the run visible at ExxonMobil before the stock moved.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d0b63513a0ae30653492643eef87d6f80cb06671a4ae014e323a8d3a52c8050\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791214561,\"headline\":\"Sintana Energy agrees PEL 90 interest transfer to chevron affiliate for $11M upfront\",\"id\":142637789,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Sintana Energy CEO Robert Bose joined Steve Darling from Proactive to discuss a new agreement involving Petroleum Exploration Licence 90 (PEL 90) in Namibia, following an announcement by Trago Energy regarding an agreement with Harmattan Energy Limited, an affiliate of Chevron. Under the agreement, Trago Energy will transfer its entire 10% participating interest in PEL 90 to Harmattan Energy. Sintana Energy maintains an indirect 49% interest in Trago, providing Sintana with continued exposure to the licence and its future exploration and development potential. As part of the transaction, Trago will receive US$11 million in cash upon completion. The agreement also provides for additional contingent consideration tied to the achievement of certain appraisal and production milestones. Importantly, the contingent consideration includes revenues associated with potential commercial production, which is currently estimated to involve between 1.5 million and 2.5 million barrels of oil. Bose said the transaction demonstrates Sintana’s strategy of reducing the capital requirements and downside exposure associated with its exploration portfolio while retaining exposure to potential upside if high-impact exploration projects progress successfully through appraisal and into production. By transferring the participating interest to a major industry participant while securing upfront cash and potential future milestone payments, Sintana believes the arrangement can provide value from PEL 90 without requiring the company to carry the same level of capital commitments associated with maintaining a direct participating interest. Attention now turns to the highly anticipated Nabba 1-X exploration well on PEL 90. The well represents another opportunity to test the prospectivity of the Orange Basin, one of the most closely watched exploration regions along the Atlantic margin. Bose highlighted the significance of maintaining capital-free exposure to PEL 90 and its exploration potential, particularly given the licence’s location within the broader Orange Basin and its proximity to major discoveries including Mopane and Venus. The transaction adds another element to Sintana’s strategy of maintaining exposure to high-impact exploration while seeking to manage capital requirements across its portfolio. The company continues to hold interests across its Atlantic margin assets, with PEL 90 providing exposure to a region that has attracted significant industry attention following major exploration successes. #proactiveinvestors #sintanaenergyinc #tsxv #sei #otcqb #seusf #Namibia #PEL90 #Chevron #OrangeBasin #Nabba #OilExploration #OilAndGas #Energy #Petroleum #Exploration #OffshoreEnergy #OilDiscovery #EnergyInvesting #NaturalResources #AtlanticMargin #OilStocks #ResourceStocks\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=89ae8e429a79c6ca05d397bbc0258cac9bf171b371b87265cce5106bb4f13c71\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791213623,\"headline\":\"Chevron Stock Is Up Nearly 36% in 2026. Here’s Why Its Buyback Guidance Matters on October 30\",\"id\":142636824,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Chevron StockCurrent Price: $206. 69Target Price (Mid): ~$212Street Target: ~$225Potential Total Return: ~2.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=69bf2e2f79146694e6d289cf25026cf6e4abdaa15a31e34967ebc4c0c18ce20e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791208800,\"headline\":\"24th Annual MIT Sloan CFO Summit Features \\\"The Human CFO: Creativity and Judgment\\\" With AT\\u0026T, Chevron, Target, Snowflake, and Southwest Airlines\",\"id\":142635436,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CAMBRIDGE, Mass., October 05, 2026--The MIT Sloan CFO Summit, the nation’s preeminent one-day CFO conference, celebrates its 24th anniversary of keynote speakers, panel discussions, on-topic conversations, and the opportunity to network and learn with best-in-class leaders. To be held Thursday, November 19, 2026, the event attracts 400+ CFOs and senior financial executives from a broad mix of business and sectors.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=90376f063dc5922145da57d680cf2043e4f1eccae89bfef3ffc5f392fee76798\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791206700,\"headline\":\"Oceaneering Lands $154M U.S. Navy Contract for ADTech Segment\",\"id\":142636826,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"OII's $154 million Navy award expands ADTech's defense exposure, reinforces its Dry Deck Shelter role and adds potential revenue visibility.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=14e102749f9c0e3680bcd9dedc5269aef35141e9546d6dde8840e97b18d0da7d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791205200,\"headline\":\"Chevron Announces Senior Leadership Changes\",\"id\":142635073,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"HOUSTON, October 05, 2026--Chevron Corporation (NYSE: CVX) today announced the following senior leadership changes, effective January 1, 2027:\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f6fa8982a8629589d0ff47a90c58c4797912e6651f3116a63c6bd07dbec9c3f3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791204180,\"headline\":\"2 Value Stocks with Solid Fundamentals and 1 We Turn Down\",\"id\":142635074,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The low valuation multiples for value stocks provide a margin of safety that growth stocks rarely offer. However, the challenge lies in determining whether these cheap assets are genuinely undervalued or simply on sale due to their potentially deteriorating business models.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e573edb99f951c723e7448fe2af9916ee4c13e4d3a10873bf426f1eb26d2c9fc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791203700,\"headline\":\"Berkshire vs. Occidental: Who Actually Won the $10 Billion Chemicals Deal?\",\"id\":142635075,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Berkshire Hathaway has a history of thinking long-term, while Occidental Petroleum is focusing more on near-term growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=00b04257822c3ce9e07f9d13b653c9018ca8caf271484327ffd4575d6d0a2536\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791202440,\"headline\":\"The Zacks Analyst Blog Highlights NVIDIA, Micron, Chevron and Exxon\",\"id\":142634990,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI-led tech gains and surging oil prices drove market leadership in 2026, even as higher yields and inflation challenged valuations.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4813fe2f3bcaef0438d6271c69b7e89b4543d7ad6612dcefe06d01588ee480d3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791201610,\"headline\":\"Investors Heavily Search Chevron Corporation (CVX): Here is What You Need to Know\",\"id\":142635076,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chevron (CVX) has been one of the stocks most watched by Zacks.com users lately. So, it is worth exploring what lies ahead for the stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b716cd7c3c18319e7327ba1b0b8b3212c224aa41c509e0f02af7ca94246cef19\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791199832,\"headline\":\"49% Gains Haven’t Stopped Wall Street From Calling Energy Stocks ‘Behind’\",\"id\":142634179,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A prominent fund manager went on live television to call Chevron and ExxonMobil cheap laggards, but the actual performance data from the past year tells a very different story about who is really falling behind.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ce78c0d3fbe1934413c0c23a3749aebe4d570f69faec0c78ad681d7e92a5caa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791194497,\"headline\":\"Chevron (NYSE:CVX) Passes Minervini Trend Template and High-Growth Momentum Screen Ahead of 214.08 Breakout\",\"id\":142632303,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/minervini_news_8825971f4b.webp\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"CVX passes Minervini Trend Template and high-growth momentum screen; ChartMill flags a technical watchlist setup needing a breakout above 214.08.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c746f377edecde7a31c1f57167fcaaf8fa051fb4279f622a65f089ab75430a1a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791193555,\"headline\":\"Chevron: New All-Time Highs In Sight As Oil Surges\",\"id\":142634751,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2208284640/image_2208284640.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Chevron (CVX) Q3 earnings preview: rising oil prices, production growth and positive EPS revisions.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=87015914871d94e80e102e8f7955aa5536ef5cd66a96bd7e2356697835b4b34e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791191030,\"headline\":\"Chevron Appoints President Of New Energies Jeff Gustavson As CFO, Effective Jan. 1, 2027, Succeeding Eimear Bonner\",\"id\":142636487,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Chevron Corporation (NYSE: CVX) today announced the following senior leadership changes, effective January 1, 2027:Mark Nelson, currently vice chairman and executive vice president of Oil, Products \\u0026amp; Gas, will\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=71bc0f254951887d73d5731a5f2337ce6a60316bc4942db5ea24b75530162184\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791187560,\"headline\":\"My 3 Favorite Dividend Stocks to Buy in October\",\"id\":142630892,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pivot away from big tech with these three blue chip dividend stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c93426f7e4089d9c2042a177acbc152375fcd50d2f8f93925b5a4920cc334d6f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791113700,\"headline\":\"Why This Oil Giant Keeps Betting on Countries Everyone Else Avoids\",\"id\":142623110,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chevron's bet on Venezuela looks like it is finally paying off, and now it's investing in the war-torn Middle East.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2631a065f6005593a3eb740951816f7ae57ac2f995270c567a41bca32999c58b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791104570,\"headline\":\"OPEC+ set to hold November oil quotas steady as Middle East conflict hits output\",\"id\":142621751,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Major OPEC+ producers are expected to keep oil production quotas unchanged in November as the Middle East conflict continues to restrict output from several members, Bloomberg reported.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cb71081e7d2ef64a5d91b5fcf5462fec89280a7c5717f5ea752d0ffac33fc6ff\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791058630,\"headline\":\"Why Jim Cramer Calls Chevron (CVX) the King and Enbridge (ENB) the Yield Play\",\"id\":142616489,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Jim Cramer highlighted Chevron Corporation (NYSE:CVX) and Enbridge Inc. (NYSE:ENB) as two energy stocks suited to different priorities, as he said during the September 28 episode of Mad Money: Let’s go back… to the idea of what can work in an environment when oil’s up, interest rates are up, and therefore stocks tend to go […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=96e9d0093bc63fb9b9037f78dd9079a65450d2dca251d6ddd03f5b0298e24718\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791045938,\"headline\":\"5 High-Yield Dividend Stocks to Buy for October Income with Cash Flow to Spare\",\"id\":142615634,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"From a pharma giant rebuilding after a blockbuster patent loss to a pipeline partnership targeting double-digit distribution raises through 2027, these five stocks span wildly different industries yet share one thing: cash flow that keeps covering the check.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7496c1f33c01476aee148b5bcda2e3403de430e63c148d98e44da2e0dc1017e1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790969996,\"headline\":\"How Much Does a 58-Year-Old Need Invested to Replace a $160,000 Salary With Dividends?\",\"id\":142592789,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Replacing a $160,000 salary with dividends at 58 sounds like a single math problem, but the required portfolio swings by millions depending on which yield tier you choose, and the tier that demands the least capital up front carries a hidden cost that grows every year.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ca4d7e53fbbed91317e2344999af050e978e4beb6f546949df13bc82d18582d6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790964000,\"headline\":\"AI and Oil Shape Market Leadership in the First Nine Months of 2026\",\"id\":142592729,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI investment and surging oil prices position Technology and Energy as key market leaders in 2026, despite higher yields and persistent inflation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7c4c3874a60a96923407a06ce526d430149bb57fc8e4d0dfa35f05f7bed728ac\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790962308,\"headline\":\"Berkshire Hathaway: The Abel Era Needs More Than Continuity\",\"id\":142593456,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2185985212/image_2185985212.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Berkshire Hathaway Inc. is a Hold as its $366B cash pile drags returns. Click for more on BRK, it's current opportunities and issue, and see if it is right for you.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=924f1f9f7623ca1477413d9ec2e8033f27e7df445e6a205f5818ac200ed49d63\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790957708,\"headline\":\"4 Big Oil Dividends Ranked by What Matters When Crude Falls\",\"id\":142591877,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Four oil giants all pay dividends, but when crude prices drop, their balance sheets tell very different stories about which payouts survive and which ones get cut to the bone.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a55c3f86e732054cfeef1912fa813c85f37655fe93977004a5cfc72b554c3921\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790953860,\"headline\":\"Frank Talk: Berkshire’s Delta bet shows why quality matters in airline stocks\",\"id\":142590816,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Warren Buffett once said airlines were a \\\"death trap\\\" for capital, yet Berkshire Hathaway has now returned to the sector in the middle of a fuel shock. In this op ed, Frank Holmes, CEO of U.S. Global Investors (NASDAQ:GROW), explains why he sees Berkshire's $5.4 billion Delta Air Lines position...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ac05218036eddb6473d834e3dbca0186cef611410ffeae69185dbbedb159161e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790949600,\"headline\":\"Can Chevron's Growing LNG Network Power Its Next Growth Phase?\",\"id\":142590791,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chevron is linking LNG exports, domestic gas sales and new supply sources across regions to deepen long-term natural-gas commercialization.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=218b1f79e7eff24e4ebdbd123cc85c9eb3c0b3710013f0d0f72bb58f30db0094\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790946000,\"headline\":\"LOS ANGELES AUTO SHOW MORE THAN DOUBLES MEDIA AND SPONSORSHIP COMMITMENTS AS LIFESTYLE, FINANCIAL AND CONSUMER BRANDS TARGET Q4 CONSUMERS\",\"id\":142588450,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Los Angeles Auto Show®, presented by Chevron with Techron®, has evolved beyond a traditional automotive exhibition into a lifestyle platform. Over a decade ago it was the tech industry that began to organically engage in the show which created a new category of participation. Today, diverse brands use it to connect with consumers through experiences, media, content, commerce and culture as the LA Auto Show increasingly becomes a Q4 consumer-marketing platform for companies across the retail\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d70b7a58acd597bc519f7e3e4d8ba1dcdd5550b1d0ecbba57b9e13b1ae0a3791\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790944202,\"headline\":\"Chevron Stock May Attract Value Investors, Especially If It Hikes the Dividend Next Year\",\"id\":142592792,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chevron may raise its quarterly dividend next quarter, sometime in January. That may imply that CVX stock will become undervalued if it drops further. Also, analysts have higher CVX price targets (PTs).\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=617b7b89b74b3ab52d71941957e1f9b03edc2a83c4c73c5ad20396e0200e52d8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790944200,\"headline\":\"Eni's Humanoid Robotics Push Deepens Its Industrial Tech Strategy\",\"id\":142588428,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"E's Generative Bionics deal brings humanoid robots, Physical AI and advanced computing into industrial operations.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aff03fe1338ea8e63aa7de7e43fe8021f5e3f72489152cc81a342c695f0b2739\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790940946,\"headline\":\"Brent Oil Is Back Above $100 as a Third Aircraft Carrier Heads to the Middle East\",\"id\":142587545,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A third US carrier is reportedly heading to the Middle East and China just cut off fuel exports, hitting oil markets with two shocks at once. Whether the price spike holds or collapses depends on what happens before October ends.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2a22f921a922072a4d2cb67fe5f27c7ac9cca92a5493394f708bf363190e6907\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790938892,\"headline\":\"8 Of 11 Sectors Rise Friday As Growth Leads\",\"id\":142590478,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/02/Charts-Of-Financial-Instruments-With-Var.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Friday\\u0026#39;s regular session has eight sectors higher and three lower, with growth sectors holding two of the top three positions. The leaders are clustered, with less than a quarter-point separating the top three sectors.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f3811fb0268670d0a3fadaa1f32444c29b09a67de3d3d33d9abb18b71da84971\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790928567,\"headline\":\"Chevron And 2 Other Top Oil And Gas Dividend Stocks\",\"id\":142580549,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oil prices are back in focus after the US sent a third aircraft carrier group to the Middle East, and traders pushed crude higher on fears of disrupted flows. That kind of supply worry instantly shines a light on the pipes, storage tanks, and export routes that keep energy moving. This article looks at three midstream pipeline operators that sit at the heart of that story right now. The midstream stocks in this article are only a sample, and the full screen surfaced 77 more US pipeline and...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8b0d57a7faf7ad0741b7e5d61829c67405293c4412f5aecd6f8d690aad48b308\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790921321,\"headline\":\"Chevron Stock And 2 Top Energy Stocks\",\"id\":142578007,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CVX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oil and gas prices sit in the spotlight again as bond markets sell off and government borrowing costs climb to multi decade highs, partly linked to energy cost concerns. That pulls investor attention back to the global producers that supply the world’s fuel. This article looks at three large listed oil and gas stocks from the screener and breaks down what makes each one worth a closer look today. The three stocks below are just a starting sample. The full screen surfaced 32 more oil and gas...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d6fedb94a11c369f010bd7504ff1fe21035d0b579ccf921070f5742824b4754\"}]"
