     "cookies": [],
     "content": {
      "size": 150006,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792249921,\"headline\":\"Should You Invest in This Dividend King on the Dip?\",\"id\":142961932,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Looking beyond near-term headwinds paints a fairly bright picture of Johnson \\u0026 Johnson’s outlook.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ef513cc72722e019f46a44d41cce85ab89b5ebf1194606b42bc3f4624d371c29\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792245618,\"headline\":\"Procter \\u0026 Gamble Has Raised Its Dividend for 70 Years. These 2 Stocks Share Its Advantage\",\"id\":142961958,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Raising dividends through two recessions takes more than a good brand name. Three companies with streaks stretching back decades show exactly what separates a payout that survives a crisis from one that quietly disappears.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e87fb12b8e9c1708a4ae403c0de93b2c8c68f0b22f492b70de64be9dd0a3313f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792238420,\"headline\":\"AbbVie’s Dividend Keeps Climbing. Is It Still a Buy for Income Investors?\",\"id\":142960211,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AbbVie's stock has surged nearly 29% this year, but a rising share price compresses the yield even as the dividend keeps growing. Before adding shares for income, consider what the pending Apogee deal and lingering debt load could mean for the payout's future.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3cd6b334dacd22b1da54c95de7946c5985810e696ccdc4478ddbe6dac4398fb7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792236000,\"headline\":\"When the Stock Market Gets Dangerous, These 6 Investments Have a History of Holding Up\",\"id\":142960010,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"These companies generate resilient revenues, which help make their stocks less volatile during market downturns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c3bb8900b1fbc403ac7002346e83167ebd87153a0b81791527a07965c14cc25b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792234800,\"headline\":\"MarketBeat Week in Review – 10/12 - 10/16\",\"id\":142986233,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech stocks fell on inflation fears and AI infrastructure concerns while the Dow rose, as MarketBeat analysts review earnings outlooks, sector rotation, and stock picks from the week's top stories.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=568e63e4c6d4bd104d2b5f3477ca384696dd07bd8f515a2913346504239748cc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792233300,\"headline\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson Just Raised Its Sales Outlook Again. Here's Why the Dividend King Is Still a Buy.\",\"id\":142959986,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The guidance bump doesn't matter nearly as much as investors' response to the company's Q3 report suggests.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=98dbf11664a7e95ce7d8b907a772c2066444e9ac53c83fc391c4f9a1d650e0c2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792205822,\"headline\":\"What Was Eli Lilly Telling You Before Its Stock Ran?\",\"id\":142957851,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"An investor who put $10,000 into Eli Lilly (LLY) stock on October 14, 2025 held about $15,500 by October 15, 2026. Placing that same sum in the S\\u0026P 500 over the identical period would have yielded about $11,790. By mid-2026, two drugs, Zepbound and Mounjaro, accounted for most of the company's sales. How early did those two drugs show up in what Lilly said and filed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7fbbc87921f5eb6aebe1a84de39e7ad8c2e918ec67c718d7d159b99c51415cdb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792199621,\"headline\":\"3 Great Biotech Stocks To Watch In October 2026\",\"id\":142956490,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"High energy costs are pushing inflation concerns back into focus after crude oil moved above US$100, and that kind of pressure often pushes investors toward higher risk, higher potential areas like biotechnology. Volatile times can create pricing gaps where careful stock picking matters more than ever. This article highlights three biotech stocks with comparatively solid finances that could appeal if you are hunting for calculated exposure to breakthrough science. The stocks covered next are...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=32f01879d65f189bc0378db39879d27c143e76f50df0c70eda8c6055ddf5fef4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792199402,\"headline\":\"Bristol-Myers Squibb vs. Johnson \\u0026 Johnson: Which Healthcare Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142956254,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bristol-Myers trades at a significant valuation discount, but its higher leverage and patent risks contrast sharply with Johnson \\u0026 Johnson's diversified stability.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0936d03373bb17e263e876ceb2e2b2190733d790f2fa4fc4d26706b91436d608\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792198389,\"headline\":\"When Amgen's Forecast And Chart Say The Same Thing, Pay Attention\",\"id\":142955409,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amgen (AMGN) raised its revenue forecast for fiscal 2026 on August 4. Since the market close before that release, the stock has gained 15.2%, outpacing the 1.9% return of the S\\u0026P 500. A higher forecast or a climbing share price means little in isolation. When the corporate numbers and the technical chart align, however, the combination warrants closer scrutiny. So how far did management raise its forecast, and why.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ddb56e3c9661675f49062aebfa86d5d29be9a5e9841df1481875ad51a4717ce5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792197478,\"headline\":\"Gilead’s HIV Prevention Business Just Topped $1 Billion A Quarter. What Comes Next?\",\"id\":142954216,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Gilead Sciences (GILD) built its foundation on HIV treatment. Biktarvy alone accounted for $14.3 billion of the company's $29.4 billion in fiscal 2025 revenue. Yet another segment of the HIV business is growing at a much faster pace, and it targets people who do not currently carry the virus. Gilead expects a regulatory decision regarding a new option in this category in early 2027. So what is that business, and how much is it selling today.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4ceb14cf168e6a03b7c306392042043ca662a3e864ad75e2c2967d3eb042758f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792196033,\"headline\":\"Is Amgen Stock Increasing Your Market Risk?\",\"id\":142953213,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors holding shares of Amgen (AMGN), the $234 billion maker of drugs such as Repatha and Prolia, likely pair that position with broad exposure to the S\\u0026P 500. As the broader market rises and falls each day, the pharmaceutical stock's individual performance blends with the rest of that capital. So when the market drops, does Amgen make your losses bigger.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e0d5644bdb1a894b876cd8a527913e2c730f1125e7d0685ae819033f70376096\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792180320,\"headline\":\"Forget AI Stocks: Buy Med-Tech Stock ISRG Now for 40% Upside\",\"id\":142950832,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intuitive Surgical stock earns a Zacks Rank #2 (Buy) and looks poised for a potential technical breakout as it overtakes vital long-term levels heading into its Q3 earnings release on October 20.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4db4de74806b0e5104f5f77118d9ce95cdc886f0252f7f43af6b42e9db72fde1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792174479,\"headline\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson: 3 Key Takeaways for Long-Term Investors\",\"id\":142950069,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"MedTech growth stalled while pharma surged, leaving the company to bet on new product launches and a planned spin-off to restore momentum.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4a4cff3e5e3e5b1618597e7c00b303bf722f44e0e90c942709ab4988337b671d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792156812,\"headline\":\"The Stocks That Will Get Investors Home Safe When Tech Cracks\",\"id\":142945597,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"When tech stocks crack, most investors discover too late that their portfolios were far more concentrated than they realized. Jim Cramer and others are pointing to a handful of quiet winners that keep paying dividends no matter what chip stocks do.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=417b8239ccec864a5ac691231b8f2019ed48186bfc07b59a2d383eda26bb1236\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792152464,\"headline\":\"Wells Fargo Maintains Overweight on Johnson \\u0026 Johnson, Raises Price Target to $287\",\"id\":142960972,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Wells Fargo  analyst Larry Biegelsen   maintains Johnson \\u0026amp; Johnson (NYSE:JNJ) with a Overweight and raises the price target from $275 to $287.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=29037aa047eedc5b98872c652d439977c9ae88de2776d706c687b411e7103793\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792148420,\"headline\":\"9 Of 11 Sectors Rise In Friday Trading As Cyclicals Lead\",\"id\":142947639,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Charts-Of-Financial-Instruments-With-Var.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Nine of 11 sectors are higher in Friday’s regular session, with cyclical sectors holding the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with no single gap clearly standing apart from the other breaks across the table.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2849d0ac5038a97fc9e2dc41b2da58d5dbeae2e3c1c739eaab8a464d56a914f3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792145733,\"headline\":\"Does Raised 2026 Outlook Change The Bull Case For Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ)?\",\"id\":142942274,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson reported third quarter 2026 sales of US$25,399 million and net income of US$210 million, raised its full year outlook, and affirmed a US$1.34 per share fourth quarter dividend payable in December 2026. Strong demand for TREMFYA, early momentum for ICOTYDE, and continued focus on oncology helped offset weaker MedTech performance and international pricing pressure for Johnson \\u0026 Johnson. We will look at how Johnson \\u0026 Johnson's raised 2026 guidance, despite softer MedTech...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5936503ca7e7b095040b9d828adc3e683b6b22cfd534bf0c4eb17952e484aabf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792141077,\"headline\":\"Committee For Medicinal Products For Human Use Recommends Approval Of Indication Extension Of Johnson \\u0026 Johnson's TALVEY To Treat Adults With Relapsed Or Refractory Multiple Myeloma\",\"id\":142945363,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.jnj.com/media-center/press-releases/chmp-recommends-approval-of-johnson-johnsons-talvey-talquetamab-plus-daratumumab-in-earlier-line-treatment-of-relapsed-refractory-multiple-myeloma\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ac87e540373fd353d34b65938382948ae27936b8bda1c6216dae9aed4a6cd821\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792099380,\"headline\":\"3 Companies Raising Guidance This Earnings Season\",\"id\":142922978,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Raised guidance is always a welcome development for investors, reflecting improving business trends and management confidence in the outlook.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=72238688ce9bdd704d54016de9e4138a1127b0155c79e11b90d17d1c81226f29\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792098071,\"headline\":\"Is Medtronic Stock A Buy Now That Sales Growth Has Picked Up?\",\"id\":142922277,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors considering Medtronic (MDT) stock face an immediate concern: the shares returned 1.9% over the past year, trailing the 17.3% gain for the S\\u0026P 500. Yet Medtronic raised its outlook for the year in September, following higher fiscal first-quarter profit and sales. The company is also splitting off MiniMed Group, meaning the business you buy today is changing. So how much faster is Medtronic actually growing.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=98c466238a1dcdfedbdbfd830252eb