ing: Johnson \\u0026 Johnson\",\"id\":142920033,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108414323-17920727101792072707-49016299898-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792072709\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Jim Cramer's gives his insight regarding this healthcare giant.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0bbe7bf9490a7e542414e40c7ebce1ded251c65a0a2b90287b1349b2909b84e0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792028830,\"headline\":\"How Much Downside Is Left In Liquidia Stock?\",\"id\":142894617,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the past month, shares of Liquidia (LQDA) have lost 59%, even as the S\\u0026P 500 gained 2.5%. Reuters reported that the stock dropped nearly 50% on September 30 after a federal judge ruled that Yutrepia, Liquidia's inhaled lung drug, infringes a United Therapeutics patent. Liquidia subsequently settled all pending litigation with United Therapeutics on October 13, stating that Yutrepia will remain available to patients with PAH without disruption. If the wider market sells off from here, how mu\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a15dbaf0ec5913d78ad6dd47f8be522dd0a51efa769661f4a206c2f7086f658e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792011329,\"headline\":\"What Could BSX Stock Be Worth In Three Years?\",\"id\":142888398,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boston Scientific (BSX) stock currently trades at 17.2 times earnings. This compares to an average multiple of 55.9 over the last twelve quarter-ends, excluding readings above a hundred. Investors evaluating the stock must look ahead to model potential returns. So what might a share bought at $43.31 be worth three years from now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ef7c7029bef1f6c640c65a25788aafde6dcff4633ad447