t single decision quietly destroys the income they worked to build. A three-bucket approach solves a tension most dividend strategies ignore entirely.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=931b36566ec23c66fd80f3da2316a383e543e0e0ac72e8c91f17629a91edad8d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791985733,\"headline\":\"Johnson and Johnson Stock Plunges 6% As Medical Device Sales Miss Wall Street Forecasts\",\"id\":142882639,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Johnson and Johnson StockPrice change for Johnson and Johnson stock in the last 6 months: 4%$JNJ Stock Price as of Oct. 13: $24952-Week High: $281$JNJ Stock Price Target: $280What Happened?Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ:NYSE) beat third-quarter estimates on Tuesday, but the stock still fell because sales in its medical devices business, MedTech, were weak.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c3476b369a8d0c3a88271bd66c4dc069d1b08afda1b7dd2e2b7f9b4aa10f4e18\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791985555,\"headline\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson Q3 Sets 'Negative Tone For Broader Pharma Sector': Analysts\",\"id\":142917429,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Johnson--Johnson.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026amp; Johnson posted upbeat Q3 results; analysts stayed bullish, though RBC cut its target and noted mixed product and MedTech trends.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0f3e79f4cd1dacf6485299c4139f3ef056b6f4c065cf8ad0b3e0abcab525f7cd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791984660,\"headline\":\"J\\u0026J earnings set ‘negative tone’; Shkreli vs. the FTC\",\"id\":142885171,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A 6% sell-off in J\\u0026J shares was viewed by one analyst as emblematic of broader market volatility. Elsewhere, Gilead is collaborating with Vir and a biotech’s bid for a product expansion fell short.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c9b08647716d071ec6fe0b839a128a131ee7c33e8c360c3b991b6ae616ec8402\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791984635,\"headline\":\"Kevin O’Leary Warns: ‘Do Not Invest in Your Brother’s Restaurant.’ Here Are His 3 Rules for Retirement Money\",\"id\":142882640,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Kevin O'Leary's retirement playbook starts with a warning that catches most people off guard, and it has nothing to do with stocks or bonds. His three rules draw a hard line between emotional decisions and the money you cannot afford to lose.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ea60693e5047bdf098e1ba9e7d7c0513130590456234d1e7c46588af6ee81a73\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791983161,\"headline\":\"These Analysts Cut Their Forecasts On Johnson \\u0026 Johnson After Q3 Results\",\"id\":142917430,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Johnson--Johnson-Inc--JNJ.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026amp; Johnson beat Q3 estimates and raised full-year guidance; sales rose 5.9%, EPS fell 7.5%. Analysts trimmed price targets.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0ea45205af675539a5b4204e073bfb06d19ce71993b4e574e57d46691cc84072\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791980295,\"headline\":\"The Open Question Under Johnson \\u0026 Johnson Stock's Price\",\"id\":142882629,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) has introduced several new drugs recently, and current buyers of its stock may be betting on their commercial success. The lineup includes ICOTYDE, an oral treatment for plaque psoriasis. The company has yet to disclose sales figures for the medication. How much the drug can ultimately add to J\\u0026J remains an open question. Anyone purchasing shares today takes on that unknown before the answer is in.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e7ee454d06681d6eed59a914146d59e967214b8f3d686043bbcc75da682651e9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791976559,\"headline\":\"J\\u0026J Beat and Raised. The Stock Fell Anyway. Here’s What the Target Says\",\"id\":142881685,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson and Johnson crushed earnings, raised guidance, and still watched its stock crater nearly 6% in a single session. Understanding what spooked investors reveals whether Tuesday's selloff is a trap or a warning.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e763de698418aec47744b120467a490b683d9828a9163494ff75c2b553ce7a01\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791976502,\"headline\":\"Blockbuster Drugs Come and Go. These 5 Pharma Dividend Stocks Keep Paying\",\"id\":142881695,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Every big pharma company eventually watches its best-selling drug go generic, yet some keep raising their dividends anyway. The five names on this list have already replaced their fading blockbusters with something bigger, and the math behind their payouts tells the story.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7fea1d49ce468ac5cda1986cdec52c42bb30275066096747e2bcadca75f062b6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791976320,\"headline\":\"JNJ Q3 Earnings Call Highlights Growth Outlook and MedTech Challenges\",\"id\":142882642,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson raises i