les data for September.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0ed83cae897d5328a440303c15e0d102a8864a028c818d7dfc195d227dedb301\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791835500,\"headline\":\"New TREMFYA® (guselkumab) study shows consistent perianal fistula remission across key Crohn's disease patient subgroups\",\"id\":142824534,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (NYSE: JNJ) today announced new Phase 3 data showing consistent combined fistula remission outcomes with TREMFYA® (guselkumab) across clinically important subgroups of adults with Crohn's disease with perianal fistula.1 The prespecified subgroup analyses from the FUZION study are being presented at the American College of Gastroenterology (ACG) 2026 Annual Scientific Meeting and build on previously reported Week 24 results from the overall study population.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b9d663d4e14ac1ed4d82bfde16d662ad78cb813f058557513759e39941946518\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791835500,\"headline\":\"TREMFYA® (guselkumab) demonstrated sustained clinical and endoscopic remission through 3 years in moderately to severely active Crohn's disease\",\"id\":142824533,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (NYSE: JNJ) today announced new three-year data from the Phase 3 GALAXI 2 and 3 studies showing durable efficacy and a consistent safety profile for TREMFYA® (guselkumab) in adults with moderately to severely active Crohn's disease.1 The Week 144 long-term extension (LTE) results being presented at the American College of Gastroenterology (ACG) 2026 Annual Scientific Meeting reveal long-term clinical and endoscopic outcomes across both TREMFYA maintenance regimens in this chron\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=600278e63fd