e_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"American News Group News Commentary - The S\\u0026P 500 set an all-time high on Tuesday, October 6, and finished the week at 7,811.54 after a Friday gain of 0.6%, with the Dow Jones Industrial Average closing at 51,654.95 and the Nasdaq Composite at 27,366.17. All three finished the week higher, even as the 10-year Treasury yield recently reached its highest level since 2002 and closed Friday at 5.24%. The most active names of the week moved on company news: a satellite spectrum deal that hit wireless\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a0322560b8e7f90c21b9ad6b298aad238f6dff74eb86d9dc9103144495942531\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791803022,\"headline\":\"Earnings Season, Oil, Bonds Pressure Wall Street Pre-Bell; Asia Mixed, Europe Up\",\"id\":142819102,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street futures were mixed and muted pre-bell Monday as traders awaited the start of earnings se\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e212ee45f002682a5b81167a762d407d5a582da310cd6269c53276f8953207c7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791802232,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Dow Rises, Nasdaq Slips to Start Begin Big Week of Earnings; Bond Market Closed Today\",\"id\":142823677,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Major U.S. stock indexes were mixed Monday to begin a big week of bank earnings and inflation reports, while the U.S. bond market was closed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cdfd8873982c444f5a916ef4f201446a81e418562d2775251baf3a6de360a8a3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791771434,\"headline\":\"Stocktwits Pharma Pulse: JNJ Earnings, Cancer Updates And Two FDA Target Dates — The Week’s Biotech Watchlist\",\"id\":142811098,\"image\":\