png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Gilead Sciences (GILD) generated free cash flow equal to 7.1% of its market value over the last twelve months. The median S\\u0026P 500 company yielded just 4.5% over the same period. A yield that high means one of two things: the business is either trading at a steep discount, or the market expects it to shrink. So why are investors paying so little for Gilead's cash.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d7341b07311e0a7aadb936df0d126442fa321eed83f51e517867f131ac1fb044\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791585420,\"headline\":\"Estimates Keep Rising as Q3 Earnings Season Takes Center Stage\",\"id\":142767863,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Upcoming reports from the big banks next week will shift the Q3 earnings season into a higher gear, with a total of 29 S\\u0026P 500 members on the week's reporting docket. Estimates remain positive, with S\\u0026P 500 earnings expected to grow 24.3% YoY on 11.5% higher revenues.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=73b59c6d79519f821571c067bc86a653580406c019b010d3e65a46f0a8aaa077\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791577305,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola (NYSE:KO) \\u0026 Johnson \\u0026 Johson (NYSE:JNJ): Buy Them For The Dividends, Says Jim Cramer\",\"id\":142767120,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola (NYSE:KO) and Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (NYSE:JNJ), while operating in completely different industries, factored into the discussion in Cramer’s October 2nd morning appearance. The CNBC TV host discussed the two as stocks that could be bought on the back of weakness in the economy indicated through the jobs report, which saw the US add a […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8c71c37c6d03c767c8f78cc35c73b0966c71f17a01166df3fea665dc