yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Check out our earnings calendar for this week, as well as our previews and recaps of the more noteworthy reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=216d128b83f71d76e6bce40b8b46e11723d78dea2fbe2da4a9c9e36d4bf5b412\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791556345,\"headline\":\"Boston sues J\\u0026J subsidiary over alleged patent infringement for cardiology device\",\"id\":142764048,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boston is seeking an injunction and damages regarding alleged patent infringement relating to J\\u0026J subsidiary Atraverse's Hotwire system.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6003141fb7f092a9cb6581021fa7c4f6c814d640e9c7bbacebc3f104cc400856\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791554580,\"headline\":\"Cancer Stocks to Consider as Oncology Innovation Accelerates\",\"id\":142764050,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oncology stocks are gaining relevance as cancer care evolves, with Pfizer, Merit Medical Systems and Abbott advancing treatments, diagnostics and screening technologies.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6241482d4670bb6f2d789158b7ebcd3d68f4b48589cd9e9642a3ae4bc086e46c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791553920,\"headline\":\"J\\u0026J Stock Ahead of Q3 Earnings: Should You Buy, Sell or Hold?\",\"id\":142764049,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JNJ heads into Q3 earnings with strong drug sales and new launches, but Stelara biosimilar competition and MedTech challenges could weigh on growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=33ef5177fa0c98f377877068c3a5507f0878cfe0d58604eec85f72d8c6c160e5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791548403,\"headline\":\"4 Dividend Stocks Boomers Can Safely Buy Now and Hold Forever\",\"id\":142761592,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Four Dividend Kings with streaks stretching back decades sit inside millions of retirement portfolios, but one of them is spending every dollar of free cash flow just to keep its streak alive. Here is how each payout holds up under pressure.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=43808c8e98ca54dfa3535432fd3158504395a69f430c5d63bee9715950ef0322\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791543602,\"headline\":\"Reported Earlier: 'Cancer Vaccines Are the N.I.H's Next Big Bet' - The New York Times\",\"id\":142763629,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/09/science/cancer-vaccines-nih-big-bet.html\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=878e8a8319515c43d93f8a05679617ac33f23f6ab80e54cd4feeb14c139564e5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791543600,\"headline\":\"New Johnson \\u0026 Johnson ICOTYDE® (icotrokinra) long-term data demonstrate robust 2-year results in the treatment of adults and adolescents with plaque psoriasis\",\"id\":142759145,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (NYSE: JNJ) today announced new two-year results from the Phase 3 ICONIC-LEADa study evaluating ICOTYDE® (icotrokinra), the first and only targeted oral peptide that precisely blocks the IL-23 receptor1, in adults and pediatric patients 12 years of age and older (adolescents) with moderate-to-severe plaque psoriasis.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d9fdf1b275991a36a5a060bd9ccc4d73c9e3a6e5a653fdc64ee18c35955c90a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791529796,\"headline\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson Announces New Two-year Results From Its Phase 3 ICONIC-LEAD Study Evaluating ICOTYDE In Adults With Moderate-To-Severe Plaque Psoriasis; Data Demonstrated Consistently High Levels Of Skin Clearance And Patient-Reported Symptom Improvement At Week 112, With No New Safety Signals\",\"id\":142763634,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"ICOTYDE clinical data highlights2High levels of skin clearance were observed at Week 112, with ≥72% of ICOTYDE-treated patients achieving a Psoriasis Area and Severity Index score (PASI)c of 90 and ≥70% achieving clear\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=09322e88feaba0cd726bcb1021c87381195de6f4e9b60a4573c9a9635e3cce83\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791507792,\"headline\":\"Bristol Myers Squibb vs. Pfizer: Which Healthcare Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142739710,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Both face patent cliffs and regulatory headwinds, but their balance sheets and cash generation tell starkly different stories.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ff2eadf86d47af8338f0f782fe2d50e7e67c0aa90a27adc58e9343384e4eb3d3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791506167,\"headline\":\"Should You Be Worried About Pfizer Stock?\",\"id\":142738442,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer (PFE) stock has returned 17.5% over the past three months, easily outpacing the 3.7% return for the S\\u0026P 500. The board also just declared its 352nd quarterly dividend in a row. That reliable payout may be why many investors hold the shares, yet on Pfizer's latest earnings call, management was asked what it would take to cut that dividend. So what is Pfizer's management preparing for.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f75e26b0729c5bff9494c60706fdff46e2e8753e7576109a0837be7c38c177d7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791493783,\"headline\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) Is Heading Toward A Major Patent Cliff\",\"id\":142733085,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (NYSE: JNJ) faces upcoming patent expirations on key cancer drugs Imbruvica and Darzalex over the next several years. These expiries are part of a broader pharmaceutical industry patent cliff affecting multiple large drugmakers through the early 2030s. Management has been investing in research pipelines and dealmaking as it prepares for revenue pressure once exclusivity on these therapies ends. The Imbruvica and Darzalex patent overhang is only part of the Johnson \\u0026 Johnson...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3ce32f8a0a3a2d58a40a4ffa8fe4e15f382772c3e7da4651ca269c132bffb70f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791479704,\"headline\":\"Why High-Yield REITs and BDCs Can Be Powerful Income Stocks Inside a Roth IRA\",\"id\":142731003,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A $500,000 portfolio of high-yield REITs and BDCs can quietly hand five figures every year straight to the IRS, and the account type you choose determines whether that loss compounds against you for decades.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9cc5a813f0295c8e2d5c01fc7fa07490d0e8062661c471ec9f2a4186f4d2fcdd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791476149,\"headline\":\"Big Yields Are Easy to Find. These 4 Dividend Stocks Have Something Better\",\"id\":142731001,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A fat yield can vanish overnight, but four dividend stocks on this list show you exactly where the cash comes from before you buy a single share. The difference between a payout that lasts and one that gets cut is hiding in plain sight.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2e70967e8ec7a73b7ce0faaa7135cfbc98c4573ea950dd48e9361ec209a2c7be\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791474360,\"headline\":\"HALO Wins Court Order Blocking Merck's Keytruda SC in Europe\",\"id\":142731004,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Halozyme wins a Dutch court order blocking Merck's Keytruda SC in eight European markets, strengthening its position in the patent dispute.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e801c78fc167d1485bdcb012d8e2dacd04a871eba7ae0a9dad4d30a614e313d4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791472860,\"headline\":\"Bayer Seeks Kerendia Label Expansion in Non-Diabetic CKD\",\"id\":142731005,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BAYRY's Kerendia label expansion moves forward as FDA accepts an application for CKD patients without diabetes.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a03af81e05622affeece7ada4b73724789bfecb2216ca926f6f57869d134b6ee\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791472202,\"headline\":\"Will Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) Beat Estimates Again in Its Next Earnings Report?\",\"id\":142731002,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) has an impressive earnings surprise history and currently possesses the right combination of the two key ingredients for a likely beat in its next quarterly report.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eeda12d4353a9e6cecc79a96719db44023b120900ae3c2e9b36334d98ffd9f36\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791471960,\"headline\":\"Pfizer's Oncology Outlook: Key Drivers to Watch Ahead of Q3 Results\",\"id\":142731006,\"