ing it. Jim Cramer replied: I don’t like that particular business anymore because there’s too many companies that want to be in it, particularly Johnson \\u0026 Johnson. Anything can bounce, […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ff2ed7a5beb73e35243ed3d30aed4bf2f06a4bcf4cb325bc124d29601709cd1e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791407981,\"headline\":\"Pfizer (PFE) Trades Below 10x Earnings. Why Does Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) Command More Than Twice the Multiple?\",\"id\":142700319,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer Inc. (NYSE:PFE) looks cheap based on its forward P/E, but its earnings outlook helps explain the discount. But unlike Johnson \\u0026 Johnson or Eli Lilly, Pfizer’s low earnings multiple is not being driven lower by rapid earnings growth. It is expected to rise because earnings are shrinking. Consensus estimates value Pfizer Inc. (NYSE:PFE) at […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=904768d4646b4c625a90536c16f161ffc15968ceead861754922be31faa62b51\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791407606,\"headline\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) Is Becoming a Growth Stock. Does AbbVie (ABBV) Make JNJ Look Expensive?\",\"id\":142700321,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (NYSE:JNJ) is starting to look less like a defensive healthcare giant and more like a growth story. The harder question is how much investors should pay before that growth fully arrives. The company raised its 2026 outlook after second-quarter sales increased 6.6% to $25.3 billion. Adjusted EPS rose 4.7% to $2.90, while […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77193bfeaac80c353a6ddb698c75fbb72f6b84e78e74bbbfa5d41b7083d85a41\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791404398,\"headline\":\"Moderna, Eli Lilly Lead Healthcare Stoc