es have shifted. In late 2024, management opened its earnings call by detailing how many doses of its weight-loss and diabetes drugs it could manufacture. Today, the primary focus has broadened considerably beyond factory output. So what is it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=24cab9c3b44d655fea5e81162fe16de373b29b91fba1401c2a64dc187a69aaff\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791382737,\"headline\":\"Spyre: Maintain 'Strong Buy' On Additional SPY072 Shots On Goal Q4 2026 And IBD Combination Potential\",\"id\":142698817,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2296849953/image_2296849953.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Spyre Therapeutics maintains a 'Strong Buy' rating, driven by promising IBD pipeline progress and robust cash reserves. Read more on SYRE.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7208167367ffa29cd68c57c44acd78f27a2206a1a7653f4682068fa8a7f1e1e5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791381480,\"headline\":\"HALO Expands ENHANZE Collaboration \\u0026 Licensing Deal With ARGX\",\"id\":142697087,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Halozyme expands its ENHANZE pact with argenx to eight targets, opening the door to new milestones and royalties as revenue growth accelerates.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ba5a29d522bd65efcc6f0e945248af4f98b62200423916146655128036377fb5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791379822,\"headline\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson Has Dividend Royalty Status. Does That Make It a Buy?\",\"id\":142694800,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson just logged its 64th straight year of dividend growth, but biosimilar threats, a MedTech slowdown, and lingering talc litigation raise a real question about whether that streak justifies buying the stock right now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0cb0291528fabe296f8b55180027c24a21f169e5f2f4c1c38d3f4f06a13e3aea\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791376989,\"headline\":\"The Crash-Proof Portfolio: 5 Elite Dividend Stocks Built to Survive a Market Meltdown\",\"id\":142694801,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Market indicators are flashing red heading into October, and investors who wait too long to reposition may regret it. Five elite dividend stocks in healthcare, consumer staples, and utilities have weathered every major crash for decades, and they are still trading at compelling entry points right now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0412e7381eb39cf868ba807db843786d0f628a00cc0f89a8bd2d45e58b3ccaa3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791370938,\"headline\":\"9 Of 11 Sectors Fall Wednesday As Defensives Lead\",\"id\":142696708,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/07/Charts-Of-Financial-Instruments-With-Var.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Two of 11 sectors are higher in Wednesday\\u0026#39;s regular session, with defensive sectors holding the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with Health Care and Consumer Staples above the rest of the table.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6cb13c5c3477671749cc303924dbf8609d973a6c0413b64707490cdc5fb6734c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791363823,\"headline\":\"Guggenheim Reiterates Buy on Johnson \\u0026 Johnson, Maintains $287 Price Target\",\"id\":142696709,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Guggenheim  analyst Vamil Divan   reiterates Johnson \\u0026amp; Johnson (NYSE:JNJ) with a Buy and maintains $287 price target.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=202d626f01775ebdcf3f75b020bcf261f41575bff205a4e7197cbb0ddb9f295c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791357437,\"headline\":\"How ICOTYDE’s Long-Term Psoriasis Data At Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) Has Changed Its Investment Story\",\"id\":142683772,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson recently reported new two-year Phase 3 ICONIC-TOTAL data showing its oral peptide ICOTYDE® (icotrokinra) maintained skin clearance and consistent safety in adults and adolescents with high-impact plaque psoriasis through Week 112. The results highlight ICOTYDE’s potential appeal as a once-daily, targeted oral alternative for difficult-to-treat psoriasis areas such as scalp, genital skin, hands, feet and nails. We’ll now examine how ICOTYDE’s long-term psoriasis data fits...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=552f908d437d3fb1b959e7c642199c5f1b56fb5d2cb5296ceb2cba2e6bc6ca4e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791344599,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer Has Soured on Intuitive Surgical (ISRG). The Reason is Johnson \\u0026 Johnson\",\"id\":142676397,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intuitive Surgical, Inc. (NASDAQ:ISRG) was turned down by Jim Cramer on Mad Money on October 6, when a caller asked whether the robotic surgery company counted as a broken stock rather than a broken company. The shares traded at around $404 on October 6, 7.82% lower over twelve months. His objection was not the company. […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bdf8418f87165d23312194e0e17076b00a74df9674e630b0287ab8ee4385bf67\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791309632,\"headline\":\"Two of America’s Biggest Money Voices Give Opposite Advice on Dividend Stocks\",\"id\":142667714,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Dave Ramsey and Suze Orman have built careers on helping people retire with dignity, yet on one of the most consequential investment decisions a retiree faces, they point in completely opposite directions. For a nest egg of $107,000, that disagreement is not academic.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=05d5bba37e392428849a23e80c7d20dc523749e38bb5faab5ed4a4e5c58cc718\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791304198,\"headline\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson CEO Says AI Has to Be Embraced\",\"id\":142666766,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson Chairman \\u0026 CEO Joaquin Duato says artificial intelligence is a force multiplier and has to be embraced. He's on this week's episode of The David Rubenstein Show: Peer to Peer Conversations. This interview was recorded on June 16 in Washington.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5c77eb2010138e9259f46f50ace844d1630dab2a2652ae12037bc38f04c80e47\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791303338,\"headline\":\"Procter \\u0026 Gamble Has Raised Its Dividend for 70 Years. These 4 Stocks Share Its Reliability\",\"id\":142666767,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yield alone tells you nothing about whether a dividend actually survives a recession or a patent cliff. These five stocks have built long streaks of consecutive raises from businesses that look nothing alike, and the reasons behind that staying power are worth understanding.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=25c5fd40b420dea0f8a388ecd7e0cab953e8946ed0648dfaa9f044c8880127c0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791300074,\"headline\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson's Innovative Medicines Momentum Offsets MedTech Headwinds, RBC Capital Markets Says\",\"id\":142665541,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson's (JNJ) Innovative Medicines segment acceleration is helping overcome persistent h\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5ecf2e1a3c2354049e33bda83c43109a0d5651c687475f1f6cb171403a20b6cc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791297606,\"headline\":\"PFE vs. JNJ: Which Stock Is the Better Value Option?\",\"id\":142665542,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PFE vs. JNJ: Which Stock Is the Better Value Option?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=652de01064e1b48ad113cb16186b0573cc9fcae6ac89cf833807fb80c8c43be9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791297480,\"headline\":\"Can J\\u0026J's MedTech Business Rebound in Q3 After Q2 Slowdown?\",\"id\":142665543,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"J\\u0026J's MedTech faces Abiomed and competitive pressures, but Vision, Orthopedics and Surgery could drive a stronger second half.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=26033296e8f8c1f9b0285d24b34748abb7389a09013343f59aef21dffa614fdf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791295357,\"headline\":\"What Could Lift ISRG Stock?\",\"id\":142665545,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intuitive Surgical (ISRG) stock has lost 8.2% over the past twelve months, while the S\\u0026P 500 returned 17.1%. If you own it, you have watched the market move on without you, and if you do not, the lower price may look tempting. Either way, you are counting on the business behind the da Vinci systems. So what would Intuitive have to sell more of for the stock to climb again.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=28642705afdda98124992b0c52567853c795c00a7ef0ae1ab9907db34012c607\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791291605,\"headline\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) Earnings Expected to Grow: Should You Buy?\",\"id\":142665544,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) doesn't possess the right combination of the two key ingredients for a likely earnings beat in its upcoming report. Get prepared with the key expectations.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a3f8a87f2247a10637941042e5271f6a24617c3f3a272b6c8b7b459dd7c40c30\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791290100,\"headline\":\"Becton Dickinson to Invest $19 Billion in U.S. in Exchange for Tariff Relief\",\"id\":142662851,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The move makes the needle- and medical-device maker the latest company to pledge to expand domestic manufacturing to secure an exemption from the Trump administration’s tariffs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b68a6d632dba45b4a833404704eb36ff38ef23b56e99d5456dc2617b550cd9d2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791289120,\"headline\":\"If The MiniMed Split-Off Stalls, What Happens To Your Medtronic Stock?\",\"id\":142662964,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Medtronic (MDT) is offering its shareholders a swap: hand in Medtronic shares and receive shares of MiniMed, its diabetes business. The offer is worth about $4 billion, and a Barron's report on October 2 said it is losing its allure. If you own Medtronic, you may wonder what a stalled swap would leave you holding. First, where does the swap stand today.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=88e9ab5aabd1b5ea758ed0da36e8174c31ae584da8b1871cec70ef3e2c56d64a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791286410,\"headline\":\"9 Of 11 Sectors Rise In Tuesday Trading As Defensives Lead\",\"id\":142694431,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/06/Stock-Market-Trading-Chart-And-Analyzing.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Nine of 11 sectors are higher in Tuesday’s regular session, with defensive sectors holding two of the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with Utilities well ahead of the next group.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fe085c43d75c231536307af547fccfc999b2c5d528a0fa054c33bffa9ffb8e8b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791286244,\"headline\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson or Procter \\u0026 Gamble: If I Could Only Own 1 Dividend King for 20 Years, This Is It\",\"id\":142661214,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Both Dividend Kings trade at nearly identical valuations, so the real question becomes which one can actually keep raising its payout for two decades without flinching. The answer comes down to three factors most investors overlook entirely.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e5b2c9b287f74f941e14e5f56d60a6a20bc2253301bffbdc6ab72010235cd726\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791285420,\"headline\":\"Botaretigene Sparoparvovec Market Size and Sales Forecast for X-Linked Retinitis Pigmentosa in the 7MM - 2034 | Clinical Momentum and Orphan Incentives Drive Growth\",\"id\":142661215,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Clinical efficacy, manageable safety, high unmet need and expedited regulatory pathways support market potential, while pricing, reimbursement and competition shape ROI.Dublin, Oct. 06, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \\\"Botaretigene Sparoparvovec Sales Forecast and Market Size Analysis - 2034\\\" has been added to ResearchAndMarkets.com's offering. The \\\"Botaretigene sparoparvovec Sales Forecast and Market Size Analysis - 2034\\\" report delivers a comprehensive assessment of the investigational gene therapy's\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2e5a1debf2587531ed862271859e3e0036f6076992261f61d2a495aa61d4c965\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791278109,\"headline\":\"RBC Capital Maintains Outperform on Johnson \\u0026 Johnson, Raises Price Target to $290\",\"id\":142663944,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"RBC Capital  analyst Trung Huynh   maintains Johnson \\u0026amp; Johnson (NYSE:JNJ) with a Outperform and raises the price target from $287 to $290.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=efd1b6bf312f07f06327bd3942229843cb39220f7eaa7f7738c506c9ab3f3951\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791267252,\"headline\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson: The Next Patent Cliff Will Test A Replacement Engine That It Is Already Working On\",\"id\":142658499,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1163587098/image_1163587098.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) stock's 2Q26 sales rose 6.6% despite STELARA drag. Read here for a detailed investment analysis.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a108a4b5510e1c67c8267eabe8c098e96ca7baa707b275c9eb009c4f6f9132bf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791233102,\"headline\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) Stock Drops Despite Market Gains: Important Facts to Note\",\"id\":142639162,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) closed at $252.83 in the latest trading session, marking a -1.25% move from the prior day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0a7cf8979cda3f8dfa8cde0500ac286396b6969aa39f505e4c0baaeda8530073\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791227409,\"headline\":\"Monday's session: top gainers and losers in the dow jones index\",\"id\":142638289,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay informed about the performance of the dow jones index one hour before the close of the markets on Monday. Uncover the top gainers and losers in today's session for valuable insights.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0e88a10f0ad90454a5ff9c1b9d8c6be70f11a0beeaf98797fe4fc38372abaa20\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791213811,\"headline\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson Stock Fell Nearly 6% in 4 Days Before Its October 13 Earnings. Here’s Why a $4 Billion 2027 Patent Cliff Matters More Than Q3 EPS\",\"id\":142636802,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Johnson \\u0026 Johnson StockCurrent Price: $256. 03Target Price (Mid): ~$332Street Target: ~$279Potential Total Return: ~30%Annualized IRR: ~6% / yearWhat Happened?Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ:NYSE) closed at $256.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5f2040b01bde816396e5d820b62b66a8182749dc720b78b9d301ec78b8caedb9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791212100,\"headline\":\"Pfizer vs. J\\u0026J: Comparing Growth, Patent Risks and Valuation\",\"id\":142637759,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"J\\u0026J's diversified portfolio, new drug launches and sales growth give it an edge despite Pfizer's cheaper valuation and higher yield.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=846adfc70469f764803393e2aeceb13e35f17d89500c612fc1053c5a73e21eb5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791210600,\"headline\":\"Disposable Medical Device Market to Reach USD 144.85 Billion by 2030, Growing at a CAGR of 4.9% – MarketsandMarkets™\",\"id\":142636803,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Delray Beach, FL , Oct. 05, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MarketsandMarkets™ projects the global disposable medical devices market to grow from USD 113.95 billion in 2025 to USD 144.85 billion by 2030, at a CAGR of 4.9% during the forecast period. Market growth is driven by the increasing emphasis on infection prevention and cross-contamination control, rising prevalence of chronic diseases, an aging population, growing surgical volumes, and expanding demand for long-term care, outpatient services, a\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dffa9ba00a4611b8858f901f1a866fd56d06d2beaa5eeb4456000feed06ec675\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791209955,\"headline\":\"Has Eli Lilly Stock Peaked?\",\"id\":142636798,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"One thing stands out at Eli Lilly (LLY): how many prescriptions are written for Zepbound and Mounjaro, which may be what buyers are betting on. You may think of them as high-priced drugs, but their U.S. prices are now falling. Yet the stock costs 38.2 times earnings, against 21.5 for the S\\u0026P 500. That is the tension. So, how much are the two drugs actually selling.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=02b55fb819eac16ad9dadcdcb5f78fd4425f22a5be3f5f3a3aaf11e2f425c375\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791205860,\"headline\":\"Looking for a Dividend Stock That Can Weather a Downturn? Start With Johnson \\u0026 Johnson.\",\"id\":142634896,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"JNJ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Even in a recession, there's strong demand for J\\u0026J's myriad of pharmaceutical and healthcare products.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f43a06ff48ede3b7971a5089f0740a9c10e64111694d61759a09b43a5a2aae64\"}]"
