     "content": {
      "size": 151600,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792349520,\"headline\":\"Another BioNTech Cancer Vaccine Just Hit a Major Setback. Is BNTX Stock Still a Buy?\",\"id\":142988608,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"It has been a volatile year for the biotech.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=981c4939bb12dccff9bebb22223c1a799ab1e82b029f1359f5435ffb1584a732\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792335000,\"headline\":\"Here's What $10,000 in Each of These 5 High-Yield Dividend Stocks Could Pay You in a Year\",\"id\":142987483,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"These five high-yield dividend stocks are paying yields of 5.88% to 16.72% -- but beware of a few key risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=42e7d468911e976f80f6212ff5d4374b2d00c1c529f55a2aad659d0fade6032a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792253706,\"headline\":\"Pfizer or Kraft Heinz: Only One Gets My Dividend Dollars for the Next 10 Years\",\"id\":142962658,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysKraft Heinz yields 7. 2%, and Pfizer 6.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=198a6315990d608bfe3725dd1da71c35e788e8162f702a836e622ba94580f1bc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792205822,\"headline\":\"What Was Eli Lilly Telling You Before Its Stock Ran?\",\"id\":142957851,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"An investor who put $10,000 into Eli Lilly (LLY) stock on October 14, 2025 held about $15,500 by October 15, 2026. Placing that same sum in the S\\u0026P 500 over the identical period would have yielded about $11,790. By mid-2026, two drugs, Zepbound and Mounjaro, accounted for most of the company's sales. How early did those two drugs show up in what Lilly said and filed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7fbbc87921f5eb6aebe1a84de39e7ad8c2e918ec67c718d7d159b99c51415cdb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792203743,\"headline\":\"JD Vance Touts TrumpRx Drug Price Push, Trump Accounts as ‘Economic Nationalism’ Wins Ahead Of Midterms\",\"id\":142961354,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Washington-jan-30-2025-Vice-President-J-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"JD Vance touted TrumpRx and Trump Accounts as key economic wins, highlighting prescription drug savings ahead of the midterm elections.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7f53e7e201129acaa174985f4cf5a99b4f5661557e3655f0da6542c22d807f31\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792198389,\"headline\":\"When Amgen's Forecast And Chart Say The Same Thing, Pay Attention\",\"id\":142955409,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amgen (AMGN) raised its revenue forecast for fiscal 2026 on August 4. Since the market close before that release, the stock has gained 15.2%, outpacing the 1.9% return of the S\\u0026P 500. A higher forecast or a climbing share price means little in isolation. When the corporate numbers and the technical chart align, however, the combination warrants closer scrutiny. So how far did management raise its forecast, and why.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ddb56e3c9661675f49062aebfa86d5d29be9a5e9841df1481875ad51a4717ce5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792197478,\"headline\":\"Gilead’s HIV Prevention Business Just Topped $1 Billion A Quarter. What Comes Next?\",\"id\":142954216,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Gilead Sciences (GILD) built its foundation on HIV treatment. Biktarvy alone accounted for $14.3 billion of the company's $29.4 billion in fiscal 2025 revenue. Yet another segment of the HIV business is growing at a much faster pace, and it targets people who do not currently carry the virus. Gilead expects a regulatory decision regarding a new option in this category in early 2027. So what is that business, and how much is it selling today.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4ceb14cf168e6a03b7c306392042043ca662a3e864ad75e2c2967d3eb042758f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792196033,\"headline\":\"Is Amgen Stock Increasing Your Market Risk?\",\"id\":142953213,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors holding shares of Amgen (AMGN), the $234 billion maker of drugs such as Repatha and Prolia, likely pair that position with broad exposure to the S\\u0026P 500. As the broader market rises and falls each day, the pharmaceutical stock's individual performance blends with the rest of that capital. So when the market drops, does Amgen make your losses bigger.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e0d5644bdb1a894b876cd8a527913e2c730f1125e7d0685ae819033f70376096\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792177980,\"headline\":\"Pfizer Just Declared Its 352nd Straight Quarterly Dividend. Is the 6% Yield Safe?\",\"id\":142949994,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer's dividend yield is attractive, but investors need to know if it can maintain it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c04a2244a0a10a4c2d85476e268f0d2dc066fdc841c16620b57e525d6e322ba6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173976,\"headline\":\"Most-Active S\\u0026P 500 Stocks in Oct. 16, 2026 US Session\",\"id\":142959210,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"S\\u0026P 500 most-active stocks for Oct. 16, 2026: SMCI, F, BAC, T, PLTR, NKE, ORCL, HPE, MRNA, and PFE saw heavy volume, with sharp declines and modest gains.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b3986a48a3f5afab657ba95ce3d87f80df82d15165f29bb14aad7f91ddb88834\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792172719,\"headline\":\"Bristol Myers Squibb’s 4.2% Dividend Yield Comes With a Trade-Off Investors Should Know\",\"id\":142949141,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bristol Myers Squibb has raised its dividend for 17 straight years, but a looming patent cliff and $43 billion in debt put the pace of future increases on a collision course with the drugs Wall Street is betting everything on.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7f878e1d7b8e6ca6594ebcc4d0bd6c82c52bece760c60ab0ea552e559d275df8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792172610,\"headline\":\"Pfizer vs. AbbVie: Is the Cheaper Pharma Stock Really the Better Investment?\",\"id\":142949116,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer Inc. (NYSE:PFE) trades at a considerable discount to AbbVie Inc. (NYSE:ABBV), despite both companies reporting growth in important parts of their pharmaceutical portfolios. According to Yahoo Finance’s September 23, 2026 valuation snapshot, Pfizer trades at 9.67 times forward earnings, compared with AbbVie’s 16.39 times. That makes Pfizer cheaper on a forward P/E basis, but […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3ef7e3394222e814a77c1b38975d9ebbbf55e72abf7cf7332ad721955ff8675c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169050,\"headline\":\"Novavax Plunges 12% as Selloff Hits Vaccine Makers; Moderna Tumbles 10%, Pfizer Holds Steady\",\"id\":142949190,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Vaccine stocks are cracking under intense selling pressure, and one small developer with no control over its own commercial fate is bearing the worst of it. Whether its big-pharma partner can change that story is the question every shareholder now faces.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c959e477e65a218a0cad05f9bd494251447e606cfc31fc5528eee170530d7ad3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792164342,\"headline\":\"What to Expect From Pfizer's Q3 2026 Earnings Report\",\"id\":142950896,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer will release its third-quarter earnings next month, and analysts anticipate a double-digit profit dip.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=520998ae67bfdba9099c5ae30f2e78e97d034e9eac14a9babba558891235be0e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792162163,\"headline\":\"Moderna Tumbles 10% as Profit Taking Hits Cancer Vaccine Rally; BioNTech Eases, Pfizer Stays Put\",\"id\":142948003,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Moderna stock is shedding 10% after a blistering cancer vaccine run, and the question now is whether profit takers know something the bulls don't ahead of a critical trial readout later this month.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9dbc95242c8d52265d5c0557a75bf5612f2300b046560659575730db61480277\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161868,\"headline\":\"What Is The Case For Waiting On Moderna Stock?\",\"id\":142948004,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Moderna (MRNA) stock has gained 282.6% over the past three months, outpacing a 4.1% return for the S\\u0026P 500. The shares reached their highest close in a year on October 15, 2026, ending the session at $236.50. Investors paying that premium are betting the drugmaker is ready to grow again. To meet those expectations, its sales, nearly all from COVID vaccines, have to stop shrinking, while its newer vaccines and cancer drugs have to start selling. Has the business caught up with Moderna's share pri\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3baf1ee24e890652fecbebc36de430f14066942b4fdd1616633ea9c823267896\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792125052,\"headline\":\"Tukysa Approval Might Change The Case For Investing In Pfizer Stock (PFE)\",\"id\":142930843,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer recently secured expanded FDA approval for TUKYSA as a chemotherapy free maintenance option in HER2 positive metastatic breast cancer and reported a wide slate of infectious disease vaccine data, including late stage Lyme, pneumococcal and RSV studies. The breadth of vaccine and oncology updates points to Pfizer leaning heavily on late stage pipelines and real world evidence to support future portfolio mix as older products face patent expiry and COVID sales pressure. We will now look...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=429e2a1fa563a7d185d0ec9fa4b1c6774eefa25140f82a3a32e8ccc8285c7ebd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792096980,\"headline\":\"2 High-Yield Dividend Stocks Worth Buying Before 2026 Ends\",\"id\":142922197,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Verizon and Pfizer pay generous dividends, and each has a different path to growth. Here's how income investors can lock in yield before year-end.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c93cda2ba5d80fdc909491fee9ad005cc47ccd0943ec35f3e56e233bbddf67d2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792094396,\"headline\":\"Better Dividend Stock: Pfizer vs. GSK\",\"id\":142922353,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysPfizer yields 6. 3% and GSK yields 4.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2d2ff58faef3e04e177be6aec9db9f4e4425733280d18032d3b23c08e566578f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792093589,\"headline\":\"How Has Merck's Story Changed?\",\"id\":142922269,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors are pricing Merck (MRK) stock at 5.5 times sales, compared with 3.1 for the S\\u0026P 500. Shareholders paying that premium need to understand exactly what they hold, and the drugmaker's priorities have changed. During the fiscal Q4 2024 call in February 2025, executives noted that conditions for the GARDASIL vaccine in China remained challenging. By the August 4, 2026 call, management emphasized something else. So what does management talk up now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c7865f7724923f82ec5f2ffee87e7389c60a2dc5ec98a0c9ffd0eb37e2d969ae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792083305,\"headline\":\"Moderna Rallies 6% as Money Rotates Into Healthcare; BioNTech and Pfizer Edge Higher\",\"id\":142920417,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Money is leaving the AI trade and landing in healthcare, but one mRNA name is surging at a pace that leaves its closest peers far behind, and a clinical story from weeks ago may explain why.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0fcc6a99bb57e8d09d485a37d2e2d7d64a2221923ab8736bdb870d379724be43\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792074965,\"headline\":\"AbbVie vs. Pfizer: Which Healthcare Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142919291,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AbbVie is raising its outlook with Skyrizi and Rinvoq offsetting Humira losses. Pfizer is rebuilding its pipeline around obesity drugs and key readouts expected over the next year.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9b4dc5f84549fc23cc11e827e82d6faa97d78cdf14ce8f97fa48caaeb3957450\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792072942,\"headline\":\"This Company’s Products Kill People, But It Has A 6.2% Yield\",\"id\":142916968,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Altria's cigarettes kill hundreds of thousands of Americans every year, yet its stock is quietly outperforming the S\\u0026P 500 by a wide margin in 2024. The question investors now face says as much about ethics as it does about returns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c672232f64323b461ad93b8e09f73cf097459a27d40f9238ec9a21f5836b394e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792069769,\"headline\":\"Where Could Johnson \\u0026 Johnson's Next Growth Come From?\",\"id\":142915328,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) stock trades at 29.1 times its earnings over the past twelve months, compared with 22.7 for the S\\u0026P 500. Investors paying that premium appear to be counting on more growth. The company raised its 2026 guidance on October 13, and Chief Executive Joaquin Duato pointed to one new product as one of its most transformative MedTech innovations. So which product is it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b3a8c83dcbe2957ee2b7ef5bda75d1c593820e341cd92a0184bdff2f60f5c80b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792065623,\"headline\":\"Pfizer Stock Hits 52-Week High: What's Going On?\",\"id\":142947694,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Logo-Pfizer-Inc--Is-An-American-Multinat.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer Inc (NYSE:PFE) shares are climbing Thursday to a new 52-week high as drugmakers rally broadly. The move comes a week after the FDA approved a Tukysa regimen.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=01ba33f70604ee78de84933b718c33d452f57a1b8b7d81a37f22462ce579ffc7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792050980,\"headline\":\"Pfizer, Thermo Fisher Scientific And More: CNBC’s ‘Final Trades’\",\"id\":142916771,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Franklin---April-21--2024-Pfizer-Site-Ma.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"CNBC Final Trades: Weiss picked 10-year Treasuries, Thomas chose XAR, Firestone favored TMO, and Terranova selected PFE.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5024e7ec675170c0a5a25783ae0feb83a84d769bd02bd60c9b343c091dc26a23\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792036063,\"headline\":\"Why Did GME, BMBL, PFE Stocks Hit 52-Week Highs Today?\",\"id\":142896564,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Insider purchases, a multibillion-dollar acquisition and progress in vaccine research helped drive interest.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=704fe4e236b4403de7ca0be3343215911cb4c95daf902cf7ffa7f7d6cd6fa5aa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792028830,\"headline\":\"How Much Downside Is Left In Liquidia Stock?\",\"id\":142894617,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the past month, shares of Liquidia (LQDA) have lost 59%, even as the S\\u0026P 500 gained 2.5%. Reuters reported that the stock dropped nearly 50% on September 30 after a federal judge ruled that Yutrepia, Liquidia's inhaled lung drug, infringes a United Therapeutics patent. Liquidia subsequently settled all pending litigation with United Therapeutics on October 13, stating that Yutrepia will remain available to patients with PAH without disruption. If the wider market sells off from here, how mu\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a15dbaf0ec5913d78ad6dd47f8be522dd0a51efa769661f4a206c2f7086f658e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792014348,\"headline\":\"What Could Send Regeneron Stock Higher?\",\"id\":142889244,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Regeneron Pharmaceuticals (REGN) may get its next boost from an old deal rather than a new drug. Through the first half of 2026, Regeneron was paying down a balance owed to its partner Sanofi. This obligation reduced the revenue Regeneron reported from the partnership. So what does Regeneron gain now that the balance is paid off.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=434733031d20fe4cdc19bc79cf48d12b65f1d04ad018b78d4055f1173b8c98bb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792010705,\"headline\":\"Pfizer (PFE) Gains As Market Dips: What You Should Know\",\"id\":142888488,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The latest trading day saw Pfizer (PFE) settling at $29.21, representing a +2.96% change from its previous close.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30968c24443e8adac169e6499d5170bb4ec0b066c47f0edd1601090ab47ea410\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792006478,\"headline\":\"Better High-Yield Dividend Stock: Pfizer vs. General Mills\",\"id\":142887524,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysPfizer yields 6. 3% and General Mills 7.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b8ee77232da86a78183d15a561