sent and participate in meetings with institutional investors at upcoming investor conferences in the United States and Europe. In addition to meeting with investors, Valneva will host moderated “fireside chat” presentations to discuss the Company’s key value drivers and upcoming catalysts, primarily the regulatory outlook for the Compa\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5a8727f95f7c77544ee1ddca77ed9062f2b1b2b9cefe45a4640186dcf78ab450\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791990840,\"headline\":\"Verastem Gets a New CEO, $250M, and a Shot at Another Cancer Drug\",\"id\":142885199,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Verastem plans to raise $250 million as it prepares for late-stage testing of its experimental cancer treatment.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8719c4b8e9632570b216f01e32f4bd5f253af404e968afa86404db29c4b76bf5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791988500,\"headline\":\"Forget Treasury Bonds: This 6%-Yielding Pharma Stock Pays You to Wait for Its Pipeline\",\"id\":142885082,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A reliable payout, a growing cancer treatment lineup, and improving guidance make this drugmaker worth a second look right now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9329147cc20b6fa9758aebec595e343d9235bf53905fd06f47e3c49d6852403f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791987161,\"headline\":\"Morningstar’s Dividend ETF Is Kind of Perfect for Retirees Right Now\",\"id\":142885190,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"FDL has handed retirees growing income and strong returns for nearly two decades, but the fund comes with a concentrated bet and a quarterly payout quirk that can wreck a fixed expense budget if you are not prepared for it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5313c7c30a68c51cd37b4545c20a44f5d29631bb3b630b7d2eeedfe04a523c7d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791986664,\"headline\":\"How to Build $9,050 a Month in Dividend Income Without Selling a Single Share\",\"id\":142885296,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The capital required to collect over $108,000 a year in dividends without selling a share swings by more than $2 million depending on one decision you make before buying anything.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1ce6cd3560454fdf14b2b9a8de8b2195008543459e0ddea1762635c2191b81f1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791985560,\"headline\":\"Will Keytruda Continue to Aid Merck's Top Line in Q3 Earnings?\",\"id\":142885198,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"MRK's Keytruda sales growth, earlier-stage launches and expanded indications could boost Q3 results, but biosimilar competition looms in 2028-2029.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8fe4192fca1e3129d408489e0653fb7f18bb59e735badf4ccd9ef4299f943ff5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791984660,\"headline\":\"J\\u0026J earnings set ‘negative tone’; Shkreli vs. the FTC\",\"id\":142885171,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A 6% sell-off in J\\u0026J shares was viewed by one analyst as emblematic of broader market volatility. Elsewhere, Gilead is collaborating with Vir and a biotech’s bid for a product expansion fell short.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c9b08647716d071ec6fe0b839a128a131ee7c33e8c360c3b991b6ae616ec8402\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791984093,\"headline\":\"Final Trades: Thermo Fisher, Pfizer, U.S. 10-year and the XAR\",\"id\":142920081,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108409633-1791998483220-1791998313-48998176874-hd.jpg?v=1791998484\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"The Investment Committee gives you their top stocks to watch for the second half.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=23fab1a99ee8548665e2ee1e0c5506276de75089410bb4618e15ef8b2a4d6712\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791982844,\"headline\":\"Shares of lifesciences and medical equipment stocks are trading higher following strong earnings from Sartorius.\",\"id\":139941991,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e755b73b5b151eaeec8c45b37398c4cbc5c66c071f8442462534f1e6d142644c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791980295,\"headline\":\"The Open Question Under Johnson \\u0026 Johnson Stock's Price\",\"id\":142882629,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) has introduced several new drugs recently, and current buyers of its stock may be betting on their commercial success. The lineup includes ICOTYDE, an oral treatment for plaque psoriasis. The company has yet to disclose sales figures for the medication. How much the drug can ultimately add to J\\u0026J remains an open question. Anyone purchasing shares today takes on that unknown before the answer is in.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e7ee454d06681d6eed59a914146d59e967214b8f3d686043bbcc75da682651e9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791979260,\"headline\":\"MindWalk Holdings Corp. Strengthens Boston-Based Development Leadership as Pipeline Advances Toward Preclinical Efficacy Studies\",\"id\":142882894,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BOSTON, October 14, 2026--MindWalk Holdings Corp. (NASDAQ: HYFT) (\\\"MindWalk\\\" or the \\\"Company\\\"), a Bio-Native AI company, today announced three senior appointments that strengthen its Boston-based development leadership as the Company’s pipeline advances toward preclinical efficacy studies. Zachary Maben, PhD, joins as Director, Antigen Discovery \\u0026 Protein Engineering, from Arbor Biotechnologies and previously Pfizer. Joanne Lim, PhD, joins as Director, Preclinical Development, from Orum Therapeu\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e633f7b2e7801b010b80247fca75c4783c93a59b0ea46e22960e73618dd3c6dc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791978648,\"headline\":\"5 Large-Cap Giants Paying 5% and Bigger Dividends to Be Bought and Held Forever\",\"id\":142881791,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Four of these five large-cap dividend stocks just dropped sharply, pushing their yields above 6%, but a rising yield can signal opportunity or a warning sign depending on what sits beneath the payout.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=36e483eedc44eaab03d78c5c1b35e05f9ee13e2a96eaca7260ffe32dd0e9e468\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791976559,\"headline\":\"J\\u0026J Beat and Raised. The Stock Fell Anyway. Here’s What the Target Says\",\"id\":142881685,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson and Johnson crushed earnings, raised guidance, and still watched its stock crater nearly 6% in a single session. Understanding what spooked investors reveals whether Tuesday's selloff is a trap or a warning.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e763de698418aec47744b120467a490b683d9828a9163494ff75c2b553ce7a01\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791974700,\"headline\":\"Pfizer Showcases Clinical Advancements Across Infectious Diseases at IDWeek 2026\",\"id\":142881771,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NEW YORK, October 14, 2026--Pfizer Inc. (NYSE: PFE) will present data from more than 50 company-sponsored, investigator-sponsored and collaborative research abstracts across its infectious disease pipeline and portfolio at the upcoming IDWeek 2026 congress, held in Washington, D.C., from October 21-24, 2026. Data across 12 oral presentations will showcase the Company’s advancements in the prevention and treatment of infectious diseases.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6ccf6d528dd3146319a13cb3036ac47272d8d5b5185fa9327a697824488b6a43\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791967241,\"headline\":\"Pfizer partners with Enodia Therapeutics in $500m drug deal\",\"id\":142881772,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Enodia Therapeutics will handle initial discovery work to identify, refine, and advance small-molecule candidates directed at multiple targets.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=671c9d1870e02b00e72aba19a1cefbc2aa89841531c55bdc8adc214e3abe8e15\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791935331,\"headline\":\"Is Amgen Stock Worth More Than Its Competitors?\",\"id\":142856069,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amgen (AMGN) competes in a tight peer group of six large drugmakers alongside AbbVie, Johnson \\u0026 Johnson, Merck, Pfizer, and Bristol-Myers Squibb. The company ranks second within this group for both sales growth and operating margin. Its valuation tells a different story. Leaving out Merck and Pfizer, which each reported a loss in at least one of their last four quarters, Amgen has the third highest P/E of the four companies that can be compared. So how far apart are what Amgen delivers and what\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=19ddbf443d05e538002ed8fb8a4b92ac9ed26efb14a4416a1787066e2d586672\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791922855,\"headline\":\"Pfizer or Enbridge: Only One Gets My Dividend Dollars for the Next 10 Years\",\"id\":142854576,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysPfizer yields 6. 3% and Enbridge 6.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8b6f89cacca838bb479e234a1df8c7e1e8bbc048171fa64e03bd1037650b07d5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791921571,\"headline\":\"What Does Bristol-Myers Squibb Offer That Pfizer Does Not?\",\"id\":142854423,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer (PFE) and Bristol-Myers Squibb (BMY) are bought for the same underlying reason: the search for new drugs to replace older ones losing market exclusivity. Both drugmakers point to 2028 as the year that matters. Pfizer is acquiring drugs and cutting costs to bridge the gap, while Bristol Myers still relies on Eliquis, an older drug that continues to grow. So what did each company tell investors at its latest report about how that replacement is going.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5bc081dc70d815ffa88823067c5acd0248f42961683e09e9d61876123ee214f3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791919463,\"headline\":\"What Is Eli Lilly Stock's Biggest Opportunity?\",\"id\":142853444,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors are currently valuing Eli Lilly (LLY) stock at a premium, with shares priced at 39.5 times earnings compared with 21.9 for the S\\u0026P 500. Justifying that multiple may require sustained growth, yet most of Lilly's sales still come from the company's two dominant blockbusters, Zepbound and Mounjaro. T