ks Over 6%\",\"id\":142820026,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Holding high-yield dividend stocks outside a Roth quietly drains thousands of dollars every year, and the losses compound in a way most investors never calculate until it is too late.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=60a00608051592e1bd42c963200dfe98d0e3d1ff585b7d1b523e74914558da47\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791810914,\"headline\":\"4 Blue Chip Giants That May Have to Cut Their Dividends\",\"id\":142820077,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Four household names are paying dividend yields above 5%, but their earnings, cash flow, and balance sheets tell a different story than their press releases. Before you count on those checks arriving, there are some serious warning signs worth understanding.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=83c338dc19e7d70757ae0d10e1dc4e343531b4f837a7c4fd35cb4d713845c54c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791809580,\"headline\":\"Pfizer Moves Past 50-Day SMA: Time to Buy, Hold or Exit the Stock?\",\"id\":142821608,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PFE moves above its 50-day SMA as newer drugs, oncology and obesity treatments fuel growth prospects, but declining COVID sales and patent expirations pose challenges.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ea45af680e879736f052cc3e056d4f3d54a04e72978df2b6c3a14f74a948875f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791781934,\"headline\":\"Stephen King Slams Trump’s New Press Secretary as Past Vaccine Conspiracy Theories, Third-Term Posts Spark Fresh Controversy: 'She Appears to Have Tried to…'\",\"id\":142819668,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/Stephen-King-at