,\"summary\":\"Kraft Heinz, Pfizer, Verizon, and Dow all flash yields above 4%, but behind each payout sits a mix of impairments, rising debt, and shrinking sales that could turn a tempting income stream into a costly trap.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=05d0246e23feb6ea04bc875e21de3fc8bd9e69f3b71307b6021029aab29dbc24\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791714900,\"headline\":\"Buy 9 S\\u0026P500 IDEAL \\\"Safer\\\" October Dividend Dogs\",\"id\":142806035,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2fb2b42086031751c87fed45dcdd2e8f905fa6bb37d0d501d511ce8bbee95970\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791686100,\"headline\":\"How Much Would You Need to Invest in These 5 Pharma Stocks to Earn $1,000 a Month in Dividends?\",\"id\":142797825,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"You'll need to generate $12,000 a year in dividends to average $1k per month from Amgen, Pfizer, J\\u0026J, AbbVie, and Bristol Myers Squibb.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d0e4c844dfa87ed4f53dd4d26660626a03de6fc78fae246c12d12553264f870b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791656049,\"headline\":\"Pfizer And 2 Other Top AI Healthcare Stocks\",\"id\":142794265,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Big Tech is pouring an estimated US$700b into AI infrastructure this year, and healthcare is where that spending will really be tested. Hospitals and drugmakers are under pressure to prove that algorithms can cut costs, reduce burnout, and improve care, not just sound good in pitch decks. This article spotlights three Transformative AI Healthcare screener stocks that show how that shift is already taking shape. The three stocks below are a small sample of what AI in healthcare looks like in...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=20b3ec64a00e8590d74770048a062e3b52c4c2001e38317bd6f31864e59c2ea0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791648400,\"headline\":\"Four Analysts Raised Their Pfizer Targets in One Week Without an Upgrade. Here’s Where the Stock Could Go By 2030\",\"id\":142793598,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Pfizer StockCurrent Price: $28. 28Target Price (Mid): ~$29Street Target: ~$29Potential Total Return: ~4%Annualized IRR: ~1% / yearWhat Happened?Four Wall Street firms raised their Pfizer (PFE) price targets between October 6 and October 9, and none of them changed its rating.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e2c044a3edad802302c5463361bfdb5979a012f165f167acec0090fcb6fc51bf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791641728,\"headline\":\"Is Pfizer (PFE) Overvalued Even After Its Oncology Progress?\",\"id\":142792909,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer has quietly put together a 22.1% one year share price gain, helped by a steady drumbeat of oncology news, and the question for you now is whether that move still lines up with what the business earns. The 22.1% one year return puts more weight on the question of whether Pfizer’s current earnings can support that kind of re-rating in the stock. Fresh approvals such as Tukysa’s expanded use in HER2 positive metastatic breast cancer, alongside a broader oncology pipeline, may support...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=72849dd58b628746f7751b46cb2554c7ebd0f02450f3e12b925fb01281b2eaf8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791640839,\"headline\":\"How Much More Dividend Income a Roth IRA Keeps on a Half-Million-Dollar Portfolio\",\"id\":142791797,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Six dividend stocks in a $500,000 portfolio sound like a solid income plan, but where you hold them decides how much of that income you actually keep, and the difference compounds into a number most investors never calculate.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=97371cf754bec6351a4b79af870a8da732ba9eb407fd85cb89a34a39d5305481\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791637232,\"headline\":\"CDs vs. Dividend Stocks: The Income Gap Could Be Bigger Than Retirees Think\",\"id\":142791143,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Retirees chasing income face a choice that looks simple on paper but hides a tax trap, a reinvestment problem, and a dividend cut risk that most income comparisons never mention.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cb8f75d075716826545a36eb0c4cb1c4d638f20281ad352a52b6f3da268df4bd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791633551,\"headline\":\"$12,300 a Month in Dividends and Not One Bond: Is This Portfolio Too Good to Be True?\",\"id\":142790289,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A portfolio built entirely around stocks and equity funds can generate $12,300 a month, or $147,600 a year, in income. The no-bond design stands out with the 10-year Treasury yielding 5.2%. Using a blended yield of about 7.4% based on trailing distributions and early October 2026 prices, you’d need roughly $1.99 million to generate the […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9d635d8ef3b271a9abb45085bdfba90c4a04689755407997c6a39eb1b4f62fab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791593224,\"headline\":\"Why Is Everyone Ignoring Gilead Stock's High Cash Yield?\",\"id\":142772223,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Gilead Sciences (GILD) generated free cash flow equal to 7.1% of its market value over the last twelve months. The median S\\u0026P 500 company yielded just 4.5% over the same period. A yield that high means one of two things: the business is either trading at a steep discount, or the market expects it to shrink. So why are investors paying so little for Gilead's cash.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d7341b07311e0a7aadb936df0d126442fa321eed83f51e517867f131ac1fb044\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791590964,\"headline\":\"BNTX, NVAX, MRNA Lead Vaccine Rally After Report Of An NIH Cancer-Vaccine Push\",\"id\":142769670,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"National Cancer Institute’s director, Dr. Anthony Letai, wants a national effort behind the vaccines, The New York Times reported on Friday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9d3295f3bb1adffe88e68237811e5227ae5d48cec72684a1c0f63434b017580a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791574740,\"headline\":\"Top Research Reports for JPMorgan, ASML \\u0026 Chevron\",\"id\":142767118,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan, ASML and Chevron stand out in today's research, with earnings strength, AI-driven demand and record production shaping their investment outlooks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=181708a4069b6b1d934b21ddf54a53c5069c5b84640b68e4f23345e8d83044b8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791569538,\"headline\":\"Does The Move In Merck Stock Change Anything?\",\"id\":142766263,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Merck (MRK) stock returned 69.6% over the year to October 8, 2026, against 16.3% for the S\\u0026P 500. The gain built up over a year of drug approvals and clinical trial results, arriving just as the company prepares for the patent loss on Keytruda, its top-selling drug. So what did Merck show investors over those twelve months.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ec035baab86cf7792f8c473ed9d920f88a6b869215a9474bf070dbaea0125ad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791567949,\"headline\":\"Pfizer’s Dividend Yield Is Above 6%. Wall Street May Be Sending a Warning\",\"id\":142765273,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer's dividend yield has climbed well above what most blue-chip drugmakers offer, and the reason behind that gap matters far more than the number itself.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=47173bc504c3fb1af7e77e0a591d37acbd67138829b9392f495a46c5f62f2c37\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791562498,\"headline\":\"Moderna stock hits 4-year high on planned national cancer vaccine effort\",\"id\":142767147,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Moderna stock popped 9% on Friday after the New York Times reported new details about an effort to speed up cancer vaccine development. Investors saw the mRNA biotech company, in particular, as a beneficiary.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=26ef6d462271e20560d857d34bb2b7d1b91d3c0bed8b86406e36dfb355f69c39\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791562498,\"headline\":\"Moderna stock jumps on planned national cancer vaccine effort\",\"id\":142765274,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Moderna stock popped 9% on Friday after the New York Times reported new details about an effort to speed up cancer vaccine development. Investors saw the mRNA biotech company, in particular, as a beneficiary.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/ne