d\":142761744,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Zacks.com users have recently been watching Pfizer (PFE) quite a bit. Thus, it is worth knowing the facts that could determine the stock's prospects.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1ed2ca07c5999096b54aa3eda6960a89753276ac08c505d4afde711efa569ef7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791546059,\"headline\":\"4 Household Name Stocks With Dividends in Danger\",\"id\":142760634,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Four household names are dangling yields above 5% at a moment when their earnings, cash flow, and debt levels raise serious questions about whether those payouts can last. Retirees counting on that income should look carefully before the next dividend announcement.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1a5084106507caaec52a9a5a7a3d996225674d910531b6c335c7daf8f20b788b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791543602,\"headline\":\"Reported Earlier: 'Cancer Vaccines Are the N.I.H's Next Big Bet' - The New York Times\",\"id\":142763629,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/09/science/cancer-vaccines-nih-big-bet.html\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=878e8a8319515c43d93f8a05679617ac33f23f6ab80e54cd4feeb14c139564e5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791530744,\"headline\":\"Pfizer: Previously Bearish, I'm Converting To A Cautious Bull (Rating Upgrade)\",\"id\":142758965,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2244980373/image_2244980373.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer outlook improves beyond COVID as cost cuts target $2.7B by 2029, though patents and pricing pose risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0da536174a6d05ce0f1a81bbb471d82d66a38669eda3ae33afcdd255a4d34d57\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791507792,\"headline\":\"Bristol Myers Squibb vs. Pfizer: Which Healthcare Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142739710,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Both face patent cliffs and regulatory headwinds, but their balance sheets and cash generation tell starkly different stories.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ff2eadf86d47af8338f0f782fe2d50e7e67c0aa90a27adc58e9343384e4eb3d3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791506167,\"headline\":\"Should You Be Worried About Pfizer Stock?\",\"id\":142738442,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer (PFE) stock has returned 17.5% over the past three months, easily outpacing the 3.7% return for the S\\u0026P 500. The board also just declared its 352nd quarterly dividend in a row. That reliable payout may be why many investors hold the shares, yet on Pfizer's latest earnings call, management was asked what it would take to cut that dividend. So what is Pfizer's management preparing for.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f75e26b0729c5bff9494c60706fdff46e2e8753e7576109a0837be7c38c177d7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791505165,\"headline\":\"What Is Going On With Regeneron Stock?\",\"id\":142736104,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Regeneron Pharmaceuticals (REGN) stock currently trades at 17.6 times earnings. That represents a notable discount to the 21.5 multiple of the median S\\u0026P 500 company. The shares have lost 4.1% over the past six months, trailing the 15.7% return of the broader index. Over twelve months, however, the stock returned 27% against the index's 17.1%. A valuation this low suggests investors are either overlooking a sound drug maker or pricing in underlying problems. So how healthy is the business you wo\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bff74f60d6f2160c55eb02e7e452a8c1637af7ee73d80472a98ad1b017bcc0e4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791472740,\"headline\":\"NVS Wins FDA Nod for Label Expansion of Immunology Drug Rhapsido\",\"id\":142731116,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Novartis wins FDA approval for Rhapsido in symptomatic dermographism, expanding its chronic hives opportunity as pipeline setbacks raise pressure for growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=56c4b9df2d8bb52a98b411bb58b15d604819fb7d63348aee66e63ae86e8939c4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791472201,\"headline\":\"Will Pfizer (PFE) Beat Estimates Again in Its Next Earnings Report?\",\"id\":142731117,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer (PFE) has an impressive earnings surprise history and currently possesses the right combination of the two key ingredients for a likely beat in its next quarterly report.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4717a0779f0ec6bcd4992f6a5f6b0817fb039cf492e7720d9d23290be9516d83\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791471960,\"headline\":\"Pfizer's Oncology Outlook: Key Drivers to Watch Ahead of Q3 Results\",\"id\":142731006,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PFE's oncology growth in Q3 hinges on key drug sales, biosimilars and progress across a late-stage pipeline.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5a109b003ce25165ba0d4a6540c1081b50be8c1b4715914995cee70b54b60850\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791470700,\"headline\":\"FDA Backs PFE's Tukysa Combo in Front-Line Maintenance Breast Cancer\",\"id\":142729927,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer's Tukysa combo regimen wins FDA approval for frontline maintenance breast cancer treatment, extending its use beyond the second-line setting.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7698b7b95ae3a302f72e62e7b8383fc656b58d894029684839abc9b3af85888e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791468438,\"headline\":\"Pfizer (PFE) Could Be 3% Below Fair Value After Fresh TUKYSA FDA Approval\",\"id\":142729928,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer (PFE) just picked up a fresh U.S. FDA approval for TUKYSA as a chemotherapy free maintenance option in frontline HER2 positive metastatic breast cancer, putting its oncology portfolio back in focus for investors. The fresh TUKYSA approval lands at a time when Pfizer’s share price has climbed 15.5% over the past 90 days and delivered an 11.2% year to date share price return, while the 1 year total shareholder return of 16.7% points to momentum gradually rebuilding after a weaker multi...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=555bb4ff1a2c4f567c91e6debd300b7636725b08310699c3a9a31a55f09bd064\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791466552,\"headline\":\"PFE, LLY, MRK Stocks In Focus: Cantor Raises Price Targets On Pharma Behemoths, But Flags Growth Concerns For Pfizer\",\"id\":142727185,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The firm said Pfizer’s near-term performance largely depends on results from the Mevpro-1 trial of Mevrometostat, an experimental prostate cancer drug.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=af927b0037b94c74ca80fab6b0dc7f209a30bc876880f655f7ec6f6a5a778891\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791466500,\"headline\":\"Pfizer Trades Under 10 Times Forward Earnings With a Yield Near 6%. Here's What History Says Happens Next.\",\"id\":142727090,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer is deeply unloved, and for good reason, but don't count this drug maker out just yet.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0688d127863f6ca3723014b4be75639b1c3c252c1a66993d6b5a831a7e6f7cb4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791464640,\"headline\":\"Medicus Pharma targets partnerships and clinical milestones as oncology pipeline advances\",\"id\":142727471,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Medicus Pharma (NASDAQ:MDCX) is positioning its precision oncology-led pipeline for a series of clinical and regulatory milestones, with partnerships and licensing deals central to the next phase of development, the company said in a shareholder update marking its third anniversary. The...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=92d898d7bb0b9399c9aa5f8018e4ae2153db23bb51ab84a342484cc157289358\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791464604,\"headline\":\"What Would It Take For Amgen Stock To Move Higher?\",\"id\":142727204,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amgen (AMGN) stock has returned 44% over the past twelve months, easily outpacing the 17.1% gain for the S\\u0026P 500. Investors looking at that rally might question what catalysts remain to push shares higher. One candidate is an experimental therapy that is not yet on the market, and executives say its development is progressing rapidly. So what is that drug, and how far along is it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0777919541fde067a3ae7f2057a4e37174b1a46ec3889aa06a812dc2cfa4d84e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791461740,\"headline\":\"Ready to Retire and Want $7,500 a Year in Passive Income? Invest $25,000 in Each of These 5 Dividend Stocks\",\"id\":142727426,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"When the paycheck stops at retirement, your portfolio has to carry the weight, and one dividend cut can force painful choices between a tighter budget and selling shares at the worst moment. These five stocks were chosen to avoid exactly that fate.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c75087151ebc2857a0c53827a5539de366cadf0f9752f7034a3a22a181aff118\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791460800,\"headline\":\"Medicus Pharma Highlights Three Years of Progress and Outlines Potential Path to Long Term Value\",\"id\":142727473,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Advancing Precision Oncology and Partner-Ready Therapeutic Programs Through Capital-Efficient DevelopmentPHILADELPHIA, Oct. 08, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Medicus Pharma Ltd. (NASDAQ: MDCX) (“Medicus” or the “Company”), a precision guided, biotech/life sciences company focused on advancing novel and potentially disruptive therapeutic assets, today provided a shareholder update celebrating its third anniversary, highlighting three years of progress, focused on execution and capital efficient drug d\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4051c93af0ae03f5010c6b5d6ba875ebbbe34165845887c2b6bbf8c2b3ed22ba\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791458114,\"headline\":\"Pfizer’s Yield Is Three Times Bigger. Johnson \\u0026 Johnson’s Dividend Has Something Pfizer Does Not\",\"id\":142724248,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer's yield towers over Johnson and Johnson's, but a bigger number on paper can hide serious risks underneath. Before you chase that payout, consider what a frozen dividend, rising debt, and a multibillion-dollar write-down actually signal about income reliability.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=52203aa110686a9e40b99c684ab2d4ce268a4ceffc9de4ed7c02f527a1b54468\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791457500,\"headline\":\"How Is Eli Lilly's Oncology Portfolio Poised Ahead of Q3 Earnings?\",\"id\":142727189,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"LLY's oncology portfolio is poised for growth as Jaypirca, Inluriyo and Retevmo may offset slower Verzenio sales and mature-drug declines.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=760fce1518bbb39e0b14474dc1ed7232e38a2ceb9a2cd815abd69688e7ac31b5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791457380,\"headline\":\"Veeva Summit to Showcase AI Innovations and the Leaders Transforming R\\u0026D and Quality\",\"id\":142723545,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"At Veeva R\\u0026D and Quality Summit on October 20-21 in Boston, Veeva Systems (NYSE: VEEV) will bring together leading biopharmas, emerging biotechs, CROs, and sites — including Duke University, Eli Lilly and Company, Pfizer, Sanofi, Tolmar, UCB, and the University of Pennsylvania — to explain how they are driving new ways of working across drug development and quality.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e2acdfe44d61f83193c4c45685f8e11307592adbd3b91b78606875a2d8b3f3ca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791441917,\"headline\":\"Cantor Fitzgerald Maintains Neutral on Pfizer, Raises Price Target to $28\",\"id\":142729234,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Cantor Fitzgerald  analyst Carter Gould   maintains Pfizer (NYSE:PFE) with a Neutral and raises the price target from $27 to $28.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fb16b210e33a6856eeb7e8c23c6234c2f2925424a6be91922c8c4ac741e38ac6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791441332,\"headline\":\"Pharma Lobby Sues Trump Administration Over Medicare Drug Pricing Rule, Calls It ‘Unlawful Overreach’ — ‘The Results Are Preordained’\",\"id\":142728311,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/08/UniQure-N-V.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"PhRMA sued the Trump administration over its Medicare drug pricing rule, arguing CMS exceeded its authority under federal law.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ecc3aa24c04827c09154c3a980ae191c65ad0dc3544291e9e7f3ee41b938ea7d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791414880,\"headline\":\"Is Exelixis Stock Engineered To Make You Money?\",\"id\":142701310,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Exelixis (EXEL) stock has returned 46% over the past twelve months, compared with 17.8% for the S\\u0026P 500. The company has aggressively repurchased its own stock, reducing its total share count by 21% over the last three years. Because fewer shares remain in circulation, each one lays claim to a larger slice of the profit. So how much is that buyback adding to each Exelixis share you own.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=be0a7e3fa760ed5f0a5c52227739c617a8ce6b41a96fbf2c446e8d620797eaa5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791411420,\"headline\":\"Pfizer Stock: Buy, Sell, or Hold?\",\"id\":142701239,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The company is entering what could be a particularly challenging period.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8635cf7d37949658b87073da4024db2959c671efc351a6f074c9c352a14846f0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791407981,\"headline\":\"Pfizer (PFE) Trades Below 10x Earnings. Why Does Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) Command More Than Twice the Multiple?\",\"id\":142700319,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer Inc. (NYSE:PFE) looks cheap based on its forward P/E, but its earnings outlook helps explain the discount. But unlike Johnson \\u0026 Johnson or Eli Lilly, Pfizer’s low earnings multiple is not being driven lower by rapid earnings growth. It is expected to rise because earnings are shrinking. Consensus estimates value Pfizer Inc. (NYSE:PFE) at […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=904768d4646b4c625a90536c16f161ffc15968ceead861754922be31faa62b51\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791407561,\"headline\":\"Is BioNTech (NasdaqGS:BNTX) Overvalued As Sales Face A Reset?\",\"id\":142700461,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BioNTech has seen its share price slide over recent years while the business reshapes itself beyond the COVID-19 vaccine boom, which naturally puts the focus back on what investors are paying for its current and potential sales base. With market sentiment shifting around the restructuring of its manufacturing footprint and the oncology pipeline, the live question is how well the present US$95.73 price lines up with the revenue the company is generating and expects to generate. The stock has...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c12b8f97a6cf32e6e7ceadfa8c6afb657871b51256876afcd4f67c3fb23c1985\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791395343,\"headline\":\"Pfizer (PFE) Trades Below Its Own Average Multiple, Is It Cheap for a Reason?\",\"id\":142698492,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer (NYSE:PFE) raised its revenue guidance in the second quarter of 2026, held its earnings guidance and announced another round of cost cuts. It also reported a loss of $0.04 a share. That split is the story. Pfizer makes prescription medicines and vaccines, including Eliquis, Padcev, Prevnar and Vyndaqel, and sells them to patients, hospitals […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0b246b4888554c1fbd281fd3ed71ee91182275e248aaef5349a07aad90977172\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791395201,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Healthcare Stocks Rise in Afternoon Trading\",\"id\":142698348,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Healthcare stocks rose Wednesday afternoon, with the NYSE Healthcare Index adding 1.6% and the State\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0488066b399180d0528892e018d49d01525df360795c8bbcfccdd7cdf3f2d269\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791392220,\"headline\":\"Pfizer’s TUKYSA Regimen Receives FDA Approval as Front-Line Maintenance Treatment for HER2+ Metastatic Breast Cancer\",\"id\":142698493,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NEW YORK, October 07, 2026--Pfizer Inc. (NYSE: PFE) today announced that the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) has approved TUKYSA® (tucatinib) in combination with trastuzumab and pertuzumab for the maintenance treatment of adults with unresectable locally advanced or metastatic human epidermal growth factor 2-positive (HER2+) breast cancer following induction treatment. The approval expands the use of TUKYSA to frontline, an earlier stage of metastatic disease, offering a new chemotherapy\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=812723fb5c2f184e52585202bd32a7761c65c601b1a01c34a87bf2592b20b2ae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791389636,\"headline\":\"Why You Should Think About Eli Lilly Stock Differently Now\",\"id\":142698403,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Eli Lilly (LLY) stock is priced at 38.7 times earnings, compared with 21.5 for the S\\u0026P 500. Investors evaluating that valuation should weigh what drives it, especially since the company's priorities have shifted. In late 2024, management opened its earnings call by detailing how many doses of its weight-loss and diabetes drugs it could manufacture. Today, the primary focus has broadened considerably beyond factory output. So what is it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=24cab9c3b44d655fea5e81162fe16de373b29b91fba1401c2a64dc187a69aaff\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791386882,\"headline\":\"D-Wave Quantum vs. Rigetti Computing: Which Cutting Edge Quantum Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142697105,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"D-Wave is growing revenue at nearly 180% while Rigetti trades at a lower valuation, but both burn cash heavily and face unproven commercial roadmaps.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cd905f42a77eb7c2affcf4a90ce8a5f420122dd713663641175fe36b08ae4f3a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791384074,\"headline\":\"Pfizer Expands Breast Cancer Drug Reach with New FDA Nod for Metastatic Disease\",\"id\":142729236,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/07/Logo-Pfizer-Inc--Is-An-American-Multinat.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The FDA approved Pfizer\\u0026#39;s TUKYSA combination as a front-line maintenance therapy for advanced HER2-positive breast cancer.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d89fcec57992c04956d53ceef9bf1795606078091aa7980243c4d3133d88a395\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791382200,\"headline\":\"Pfizer (PFE) Posted Positive Phase 3 Vitiligo Results For LITFULO\",\"id\":142697234,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer (NYSE:PFE) reported Phase 3 results for oral LITFULO (ritlecitinib) in nonsegmental vitiligo, showing positive efficacy and safety outcomes. The late stage study found meaningful facial and total body repigmentation in treated patients, alongside a favorable tolerability profile. Pfizer plans to pursue regulatory submissions for LITFULO in vitiligo across multiple regions, as it aims to broaden its immunology portfolio. The Phase 3 LITFULO vitiligo data is important, but it should be...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4339507ac049db1a7c0298c1148c869a9cabbaeeaa3ec6571348f17b64923e37\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791379822,\"headline\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson Has Dividend Royalty Status. Does That Make It a Buy?\",\"id\":142694800,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson just logged its 64th straight year of dividend growth, but biosimilar threats, a MedTech slowdown, and lingering talc litigation raise a real question about whether that streak justifies buying the stock right now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0cb0291528fabe296f8b55180027c24a21f169e5f2f4c1c38d3f4f06a13e3aea\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791378323,\"headline\":\"Pfizer’s TUKYSA Regimen Obtains FDA Approval As Front-Line Maintenance Treatment For HER2+ Metastatic Breast Cancer\",\"id\":142729237,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"TUKYSA in combination with trastuzumab and pertuzumab showed more than 50% improvement in median progression-free survival, supporting approval as a chemotherapy-free maintenance optionPfizer Inc. (NYSE:PFE) today\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=09217180d04888f9afed624c706620e9175aec68638d36c22629b25972429126\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791371707,\"headline\":\"When Dividends Cost More Than Earnings: 6 Stocks in Danger\",\"id\":142693109,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Some of the most recognizable dividend stocks in the market have been paying shareholders with money they do not actually earn, and the accounting trail reveals exactly how far six of them have pushed that math.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d727b3edc93880ce20f7f31e1b63bc8e2a5668502b9e1340a7f6a2b4b93f83f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791363407,\"headline\":\"1 Healthcare Stock with Competitive Advantages and 2 We Find Risky\",\"id\":142688729,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Personal health and wellness is one of the many secular tailwinds for healthcare companies. Players catalyzing medical advancements have benefited from elevated demand, and their momentum is only rising as the industry has posted a 36.4% gain over the past six months, beating the S\\u0026P 500 by 18.9 percentage points.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6ad194d9d894555ed679f056f1d4b5be3ec783555de7f4c6b464f108206a5242\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791329400,\"headline\":\"Astellas Highlights Data Advancing Cancer Care and Innovation for Patients with Hard-to-Treat Cancers at ESMO 2026\",\"id\":142669594,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Astellas Pharma Inc. (TSE: 4503, President and CEO: Naoki Okamura, \\\"Astellas\\\") today announced that 21 abstracts from its oncology portfolio will be presented at the European Society for Medical Oncology Congress 2026 (ESMO 2026), taking place October 23–27 in Madrid, Spain. The presentations span prostate, urothelial, gastric/gastroesophageal junction (GEJ), lung and pancreatic cancers, reflecting Astellas' commitment to advancing standards of care and pursuing new scientific approaches designe\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=92b0bb0c7c777e8591edd7f172cfed5b9a673feb2abaca180a04301207c3904f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791317375,\"headline\":\"Is Pfizer (PFE) a Good or Bad Investment at Today’s Price?\",\"id\":142668818,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer Inc. (NYSE:PFE) was trading at around $27 on October 5, down 1.35% on the day and up 5.18% over twelve months. The shares yield 6.19%. The company paid out 226.32% of its earnings to do it. Those two facts have to be reconciled before anything else about this stock matters. READ ALSO: What is […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f63f0749169ae7ae30a7ec4cf5fb1b30e2114aec83ba9982b7858496e0e0feaa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791313383,\"headline\":\"Moderna Is Up 545% in 2026: Take Profits Now, or Keep Buying?\",\"id\":142667782,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Moderna stock has turned a handful of patient shareholders into believers, but a gain this size forces a choice that most investors never plan for in advance. The pipeline promise is real, and so is the risk of giving it all back.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5be42c579586235957ebe3854c6f16f5170e52eeb4ec0992ee781fdb6d35f2b2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791305402,\"headline\":\"3 of the Best Dividend Stocks to Buy in October 2026\",\"id\":142666674,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A couple of the stocks on this list pay more than 6% in dividends.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0c4a7bb05de5bb5be7e4cf51ffcd5c358bea665c5b24048d350848ac57ef577b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791302684,\"headline\":\"Vaxcyte: 'Strong Buy' On VAX-31 Trial Win IPD VAX-31 And Additional Readouts 1st Half 2027\",\"id\":142667904,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2298029859/image_2298029859.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Vaxcyte stays a Strong Buy after VAX-31 phase 3 OPUS-1 success; broader pneumococcal coverage and 2027 catalysts are ahead. Click for more on PCVX.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a83aaea651b657c3ecdf60984e7097e9cc1703beaa77b846356c44ef1006fa0f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791302343,\"headline\":\"Novavax, Moderna stocks fall after WHO calls plague risk 'low'\",\"id\":142665693,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Novavax stock slid on Tuesday after a World Health Organization (WHO) spokesperson told reporters that there was a \\\"low\\\" risk of a plague epidemic, after a 28-year-old woman who worked in a Russian anti-plague laboratory died last week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6269f2bea8baec5db48921fc0113fe6e796197b632a4784659dc96f9483af9ac\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791297606,\"headline\":\"PFE vs. JNJ: Which Stock Is the Better Value Option?\",\"id\":142665542,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PFE vs. JNJ: Which Stock Is the Better Value Option?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=652de01064e1b48ad113cb16186b0573cc9fcae6ac89cf833807fb80c8c43be9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791296520,\"headline\":\"AbbVie's Epcoritamab Combo Shows PFS Benefit in Frontline DLBCL\",\"id\":142665559,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ABBV's epcoritamab plus R-CHOP cut progression or death risk by 51% in frontline DLBCL, meeting the phase III study's PFS goal.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=49aeda10a9d9d9da0354aae87a8d7042faf8094af6e532d73f6a352de7e18d7b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791295200,\"headline\":\"Pfizer Declares Fourth-Quarter 2026 Dividend\",\"id\":142665691,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NEW YORK, October 06, 2026--Pfizer Inc. (NYSE: PFE) today announced that its board of directors declared a $0.43 fourth-quarter 2026 dividend on the company’s common stock, payable December 7, 2026, to holders of the Common Stock of record at the close of business on November 6, 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=39313d3c47a3a75899edbf94fe4bea1a29d84843833f544ae9747079bddc5755\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791294963,\"headline\":\"Novavax Pulls Back From Plague-Scare Spike as Officials Call Risk Low; Moderna Nudges Higher, Pfizer Inches Higher\",\"id\":142663741,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A plague headline out of Siberia lifted vaccine stocks, and the agencies closest to the case have since described the risk as low. That reversal in sentiment lands hardest on Novavax (NASDAQ:NVAX), since the company’s rally priced a government-purchase scenario that its product line doesn’t address. Novavax stock trades at $12.32, down 2% in morning […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=631504fc4ba1b24349758aad4495c3d34a2c08ba4b66f10e9572c1680c84e8bc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791290648,\"headline\":\"Vaxcyte VAX-31 pneumococcal vaccine phase 3 trial results\",\"id\":142662987,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"VAX-31 matched or beat Pfizer's Prevnar 20 and Merck's Capvaxive on nearly all measured strains in the OPUS-1 trial\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bac971396bdc677b3a7769ad8cff18fad8e03f7b75d5f59895750484d0ce7dee\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791290405,\"headline\":\"Are Investors Undervaluing Pfizer (PFE) Right Now?\",\"id\":142663189,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Here at Zacks, our focus is on the proven Zacks Rank system, which emphasizes earnings estimates and estimate revisions to find great stocks. Nevertheless, we are always paying attention to the latest value, growth, and momentum trends to underscore strong picks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4faa0df7aedfa938ab7c71337b390fd1c2a5366e0a68000ce5065aab3bdb57e3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791283234,\"headline\":\"2 Unpopular Stocks That Should Get More Attention and 1 Facing Challenges\",\"id\":142662034,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street has issued downbeat forecasts for the stocks in this article. These predictions are rare - financial institutions typically hesitate to say bad things about a company because it can jeopardize their other revenue-generating business lines like M\\u0026A advisory.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=92baf4e01a6cc114e359c1d9568a4ba6e164aca65b04b08f10ddcb0fb16f8b8f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791265085,\"headline\":\"Pfizer’s $6.49 Billion Prevnar Franchise Faces a New Challenger\",\"id\":142662035,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysVaxcyte’s VAX-31 matched Pfizer’s Prevnar 20 on all 20 shared serotypes and Merck’s Capvaxive on 17 of 19 in a 4,047-person Phase 3 trial. Prevnar brought in $6.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9481b46988e42ac53af13e068b860e18bbfb1c342506a34519b2a1e37d19ba47\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791230702,\"headline\":\"Why Pfizer Might Be the Most Underrated Dividend Stock to Buy Right Now\",\"id\":142639122,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Many dividend investors may be overlooking Pfizer's stock, and that could be a costly mistake.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8bb94847973785e348cffb4f361c861ff94d0eefa8e49ba9d8860012a1bae4fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791226022,\"headline\":\"Moderna Surges 8% as Full Melanoma Readout Nears; BioNTech Ticks Up, Pfizer Slips\",\"id\":142638488,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Moderna stock has surged nearly 600% this year on a cancer vaccine trial result that almost no one outside the trial has actually seen in full. What happens when Madrid finally puts the complete data in front of the market?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b912328faf2b062f4a6208a16967cb22fa7e13d4e2d406d3f1a441f06bfdc313\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791225445,\"headline\":\"PCVX Stock Hits Fresh 52-Week High On Late-Stage Win In Adult Pneumonia Vaccine Race: Jefferies Says It Hit ‘Blue-Sky’ Case\",\"id\":142638489,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In the OPUS-1 study, Vaxcyte’s VAX-31 matched or beat immune responses from Pfizer’s Prevnar 20 and Merck’s Capvaxive on most strains those vaccines cover.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=75b0bd8242f594950d0b5981d4cc6a0d4cecf283f71ac005bb853e91883c8c2d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791219120,\"headline\":\"Vaxcyte Stock Spikes 27% as Lead Vaccine Candidate Takes Aim at Pfizer and Merck\",\"id\":142637796,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Vaxcyte is poised to capture significant share of a $3 billion to $6 billion market following the latest trial results, Jefferies says.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fc9b3abfa01aa678c25ac5c60cc919be0aa63ebcd06a46aa465cd2f98dd414bb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791212940,\"headline\":\"Vaxcyte Stock Spikes 35% as Lead Vaccine Candidate Takes Aim at Pfizer and Merck\",\"id\":142636830,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Vaxcyte is poised to capture significant share of a $3 billion to $6 billion market following the latest trial results, Jefferies says.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fe851ebbde9421b13e2c41dca244f8ddd15ae8509f691c4bfbc273aa263ab46e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791212152,\"headline\":\"Florida Attorney General Sues Pfizer for 'Misleading' COVID-19 Vaccine Safety Claims\",\"id\":142664610,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/05/JPMorgan-Faces-Trump-Lawsuit.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Florida files a lawsuit against Pfizer and CEO Albert Bourla over alleged deceptive vaccine marketing and undisclosed health risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b15fabb45d50c11b8c0934588ae546dc6b3ba72739fdb24c144b1abb74070500\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791212100,\"headline\":\"Pfizer vs. J\\u0026J: Comparing Growth, Patent Risks and Valuation\",\"id\":142637759,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"J\\u0026J's diversified portfolio, new drug launches and sales growth give it an edge despite Pfizer's cheaper valuation and higher yield.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=846adfc70469f764803393e2aeceb13e35f17d89500c612fc1053c5a73e21eb5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791211396,\"headline\":\"Vaxcyte Soars 36% on Phase 3 Pneumococcal Vaccine Win That “Sets a New Benchmark”\",\"id\":142636833,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysVaxcyte shares are up about 36% after its VAX-31 pneumococcal vaccine met every primary goal in OPUS-1, its pivotal adult Phase 3 trial. VAX-31 cleared a stricter-than-usual bar against Pfizer’s Prevnar 20 on all 20 shared strains, but on only 17 of 19 against Merck’s Capvaxive.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=04ad7948488d41cdc49895e8fe1dac9a9b0585519ec95bcc6771a222157bb5ad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791211159,\"headline\":\"Vaxcyte’s stock up after pneumococcal vaccine proves non-inferiority\",\"id\":142636834,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Vaxcyte’s vaccine was pitted against standard-of-care jabs and proved non-inferior on nearly all serotypes.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d9cdb4ebfa46d35515eaf043f5ff52014a8cfaf52f65b85f5469c2f7de74a21d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791210720,\"headline\":\"Vaxcyte shares surge on late-stage vaccine trial success\",\"id\":142636835,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Vaxcyte (NASDAQ:PCVX) shares surged 57% in morning trading on Monday after the biotechnology company said its experimental pneumococcal vaccine VAX-31 generated immune responses comparable to rival vaccines in a late-stage study. The results strengthened expectations that VAX-31 could compete...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b69847d67de97721bb469c835a3eb53af7c7d84086b6e2d012983d6e64c7084d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791209955,\"headline\":\"Has Eli Lilly Stock Peaked?\",\"id\":142636798,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"One thing stands out at Eli Lilly (LLY): how many prescriptions are written for Zepbound and Mounjaro, which may be what buyers are betting on. You may think of them as high-priced drugs, but their U.S. prices are now falling. Yet the stock costs 38.2 times earnings, against 21.5 for the S\\u0026P 500. That is the tension. So, how much are the two drugs actually selling.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=02b55fb819eac16ad9dadcdcb5f78fd4425f22a5be3f5f3a3aaf11e2f425c375\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791208320,\"headline\":\"Vaxcyte skyrockets on ‘near best-case’ pneumococcal vaccine data\",\"id\":142636837,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The company’s next-generation shot surpassed Wall Street’s expectations by matching the effectiveness of vaccines from Pfizer and Merck on nearly all bacterial strains in the first of three Phase 3 trials.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fd962f68cae7aa4078ea11a3895e70baf7df37b780aaa3d2254b9a5560db3c32\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791207420,\"headline\":\"SMMT Inks Deal With AZN-Daiichi to Study Ivonescimab + Datroway Combos\",\"id\":142636940,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Summit is teaming up with AstraZeneca and Daiichi to test ivonescimab with Datroway across breast and lung cancers, broadening its potential.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=510fb874c9c2cff75b232cbe6ee6ff5d025f79caf3ff8efa57552eba25d2b454\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791206339,\"headline\":\"Vaxcyte Catapults After Going Toe-To-Toe With Pfizer, Merck In Vaccine Study\",\"id\":142635079,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Vaxcyte stock catapulted Monday after its experimental pneumococcal vaccine proved it's not inferior to marketed shots from Pfizer and Merck.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bbd50232421bb8e0197a66b8016f056af60d001a7acb4adc7d6032521fe23ae1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791205457,\"headline\":\"Eli Lilly vs. Pfizer: Which Healthcare Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142635018,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Eli Lilly is dominating the GLP-1 market with nearly 50% revenue growth and a newly approved oral obesity pill. Pfizer is rebuilding its pipeline with obesity drug ambitions and a committed dividend through its transformation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7b958f44eadfb902b355101a14db5ae8da2c37825cb24f4f10c5cfb373ea7fcb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791204917,\"headline\":\"Vaxcyte Stock Hits New 52-Week High - Here’s Why\",\"id\":142636838,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Vaxcyte Inc. (NASDAQ:PCVX) stock is surging on Monday on positive topline results from its pivotal Phase 3 OPUS-1 trial evaluating VAX-31, an investigational 31-valent pneumococcal conjugate vaccine.The trial assessed the safety, tolerability, and immunogenicity of the candidate in adults to prevent invasive pneumococcal disease and pneumococcal pneumonia.These trial findings will form the foundation for an upcoming Biologics License Application submission to the U.S. Food and Drug Administratio\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=44addfb1c4d5eaf25856435029be8695557069d46edca7716c2b738b88372302\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791201446,\"headline\":\"EADV26: Key late-stage readouts from the conference\",\"id\":142635030,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Clinical Trials Arena brings you the highlights from EADV 2026, covering key eczema and psoriasis readouts from notable biotech and pharma players.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7838b04318f21aef8b84114465805015970f8ec7b7895a8f99c98a04afd0ed57\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791198942,\"headline\":\"Pfizer’s Turnaround Could Be Bigger Than Investors Think, Set For 20% Upside\",\"id\":142634275,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ten consecutive earnings beats and a shrinking COVID hangover have Wall Street split on whether Pfizer deserves a breakout or a ceiling, and the answer hinges on a single pipeline deal that could reshape the obesity drug race.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=79e8a4a1c0aeae961e7785bb87893534635e3e9d7ea15bb2d19eaa65fabaa588\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791191040,\"headline\":\"Got $10,000 to Invest in October? These Stocks Could Generate Over $634 in Annual Income.\",\"id\":142632090,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Put your money to work generating dividend income with these stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=783a9185305730d448c3e142ee23ac4d2f80eaef0717e43318b5e6b32fe2c8b6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791149700,\"headline\":\"Better High-Yield Dividend Stock: Pfizer or Novo Nordisk?\",\"id\":142625635,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Novo Nordisk covers its dividend, and Pfizer doesn't, but investors appear increasingly worried about Novo's future.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f05cbd0e70f3fe7b8bb214cdf07615812097ac6e7396c3fe3f63e14d210432e0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791130527,\"headline\":\"Pay Me While I Wait: 3 Turnaround Stocks That Keep Paying Investors Through the Rebuild\",\"id\":142624637,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Three struggling companies keep sending dividend checks while investors wait for their repairs to kick in, but only one of them has a yield that cash flow actually supports without a fight.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=69e46293fa3cb0d1ab3cc9be8a9da6788e5458a715d05f7bb99c69cedb416105\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791123600,\"headline\":\"Here's Exactly Why I'm Not Afraid of Pfizer's 6% Dividend Yield\",\"id\":142624128,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The crowd is looking at the next couple of years. It should be looking five years into the future.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c219c8b82db7e2ac7ff2884194258eeb27d6a3de8a8a4544304ce068e9770189\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791107051,\"headline\":\"BioNTech SE: Moving Past Covid\",\"id\":142623564,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2270977838/image_2270977838.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"BioNTech pivots from Covid windfall to oncology with 33 trials and $19B cash; key pumitamig data post-2028. Click for more on BNTX stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0239c0fdaed29155b6cf30b792945e313c370a2fe0edfe251cd76905a7b7f109\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791038700,\"headline\":\"3 Income Stocks Under $30 That Yield More Than the 10-Year Treasury Note\",\"id\":142624150,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/