e\":\"How Has Pfizer's Story Changed?\",\"id\":142585466,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer's revenue over the past twelve months was 0.2% lower than a year earlier. When sales are flat, look at what management leads with on earnings calls to see where it expects growth. Since early 2025, Pfizer's management has changed what it leads with. It used to lead with the work of absorbing a company it had bought. It now leads with drugs it has not launched. What was that deal.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=67bda7f26ae04d0d3f35078b1e3e515457b65d707cb614ee0369159ab7b04c5e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790929380,\"headline\":\"Pfizer Is Down 34% Over the Last 5 Years. Here's Why Its 6% Dividend Yield Might Finally Be Worth the Risk.\",\"id\":142579893,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer has been going through a period of transition.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30e3dd2662713545406c4b67aa92215d1ae10a14ed24338f3927b64ab2729f6e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790894100,\"headline\":\"Kevin Warsh's Inflation Stance Makes These Cheap Dividend Stocks Look a Lot More Attractive\",\"id\":142563775,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Inflation is running hot, and the Fed is raising interest rates, but consumers aren't likely to pull back on the products these companies sell.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ca5f88c7e555ff5fefae36e1982d93060f3e4476d6c47281ce8009308cc2950c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790887507,\"headline\":\"Pfizer (PFE) Stock Sinks As Market Gains: What You Should Know\",\"id\":142562952,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer (PFE) closed the most recent trading day at $28.1, moving 1.47% from the previous trading session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fcb941df5e17452bc52335d41eedace472ee10dcbc5ceba8fc3310f4d3d5c09d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790884676,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Healthcare Stocks Fall Late Afternoon\",\"id\":142562895,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Healthcare stocks declined late Thursday afternoon, with the NYSE Healthcare Index falling 1% and th\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b067492f9107b2664c44c85336074366ce1a9d7d989d4505446e67daa5e6919f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790880388,\"headline\":\"Pfizer Says Eczema Drug Shows Significant Skin Clearance\",\"id\":142561996,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer Inc. (NYSE:PFE) on Thursday presented detailed Phase 2 results for tilrekimig (PF-07275315) in adults with moderate-to-severe atopic dermatitis. The ongoing trial met its primary endpoint, showing a statistically significant increase in participants achieving EASI-75 at Week 16 across all evaluated doses compared to placebo. Strong Efficacy Across Phase 2 Trial Stages The trial evaluated biologic-naïve adult patients across two distinct stages. Stage 1 tested subcutaneous tilrekimig at 45\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=20493482f3b51466027c9a2ee1289e1650db72b0f1d2e7805f2463c2ea1379b1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790878179,\"headline\":\"Pfizer (PFE) Advances Tilrekimig After Positive Phase 2 Atopic Dermatitis Results\",\"id\":142561997,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer (NYSE:PFE) reported positive Phase 2 results for tilrekimig in moderate to severe atopic dermatitis, meeting its main efficacy goal. The trispecific antibody targets multiple cytokines linked to type 2 inflammation, aiming to address both skin and airway disease biology. Pfizer plans Phase 3 trials of tilrekimig in atopic dermatitis and asthma, expanding its late stage immunology portfolio. These Phase 2 tilrekimig results and the move into Phase 3 are worth weighing against the rest...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6f702dbc5c28314e31c6e6a84fb51840a6bbc3bfe7a70836d4ffc1dea341a2ec\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790875263,\"headline\":\"How Much Do You Need Invested to Collect $8,450 a Month for Life?\",\"id\":142560933,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Turning a monthly paycheck into permanent investment income sounds straightforward until you realize how dramatically the required capital swings based on one variable most people overlook when building their retirement portfolio.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7c98cd4ea426facb05507a6df12cd33f72ebc0f00ceed5527541a6e65f06cbcd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790869272,\"headline\":\"What Is The Options Market Telling Us About Eli Lilly Stock?\",\"id\":142560840,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Eli Lilly (LLY) management said on its second-quarter 2026 call that the price of Zepbound, its obesity drug, will go down. The company's sales growth rests on two drugs whose prices are falling - Zepbound and Mounjaro. That makes it difficult to call the stock's coming twelve months. So how do you really understand the risk you are taking with Eli Lilly stock? Well, you can look at the options market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e1c08e4bbb8e459a2d7b192134c7bdddeb78f099fdf34d930fe361886eba3ba7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790866999,\"headline\":\"Pfizer’s eczema drug clears skin in mid-stage trial\",\"id\":142590895,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Detailed results are competitive with Dupixent and Ebglyss, but the drug lacks differentiation amid an increasingly competitive landscape, one analyst argued.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=beaa73eeaab8ef8710d4cae4c7be1d0069e500e0922f5875a6ae84ed476aff67\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790866811,\"headline\":\"Moderna Climbs 3% Despite Citigroup’s Downgrade to Sell; BioNTech Inches Higher, Pfizer Treads Water\",\"id\":142559760,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Citigroup just told investors to sell Moderna and the stock responded by climbing 3%, raising one pointed question about whether pipeline optimism has fully broken free from Wall Street's valuation warnings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8f361b2eb02af46d7061280f4e60d7ffa0b2f309294d3963a2bdce903cc74845\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790865924,\"headline\":\"6 High-Yield Stocks Where the Market May Be Warning of a Dividend Cut\",\"id\":142559809,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A fat dividend yield can mean a generous payout or a stock the market has already written off, and right now six familiar names are flashing signals that suggest the difference matters more than ever.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a82f41ebdeecaf54d4870c713f32728f56f11affbbcab34d972e0845885150a4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790864105,\"headline\":\"Treasury Yields Are Above 5%. These 4 Dividend Stocks Still Make the Cut\",\"id\":142559810,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A 5% Treasury yield raises the bar for every dividend stock in a retirement portfolio, but four large-cap payers in real estate, telecom, tobacco, and healthcare are generating the cash flow to prove they still belong.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9d784e33eb447f943613f5104b85b194a54fcb01bc40d3c162a6af8d6e79dedf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790858880,\"headline\":\"Lilly vs. Novo: Inside the Milan EASD Showdown and the ETFs Poised to Win\",\"id\":142557733,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"LLY and Novo face off at EASD as new data fuels the GLP-1 market, while ETFs offer diversified exposure to weight loss drug growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=884d4eb42507bdd7297f3abee12f004467d90d4f489091c768d42a4d510f4394\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790855479,\"headline\":\"Florida Attorney General Uthmeier Sues Pfizer Over Alleged Misleading Advertising Of Its COVID Vaccine\",\"id\":142588240,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.myfloridalegal.com/newsrelease/attorney-general-james-uthmeier-files-lawsuit-against-pfizer-and-its-ceo-dr-albert\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=939b2720b8423b6ffd1fd36b08e5b65db5f227043a6ef49bd85983a71c992457\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790836200,\"headline\":\"Pfizer's Tilrekimig Shows Significant Skin Clearance in Phase 2 Atopic Dermatitis Study\",\"id\":142540772,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NEW YORK, October 01, 2026--Pfizer Inc. (NYSE: PFE) today presented detailed results from an ongoing Phase 2 study investigating tilrekimig (PF-07275315) in adults with moderate-to-severe atopic dermatitis (AD). The study met its primary endpoint, demonstrating a statistically significant increase in the percentage of participants achieving EASI-75* (≥75% reduction in the Eczema Area and Severity Index) at Week 16 across all evaluated doses compared to placebo. The findings were shared today in\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=29dea0bdc3f1aff5ace35e9f3a96985793cf083576ab49de7020d3ea98154e5b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790794880,\"headline\":\"Was The Run In JNJ Stock Hiding In Plain Sight?\",\"id\":142522943,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (JNJ) stock returned around 52% in the twelve months, against 17% for the S\\u0026P 500. A $10,000 holding became about $15,220. Over that period, J\\u0026J’s revenue growth accelerated even as the company navigated the anticipated loss of exclusivity and biosimilar erosion for STELARA. If that shift showed up in J\\u0026J's calls and filings first, a reader could have spotted it early. So was J\\u0026J's run in plain sight before it began.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c747aebba32eb636e3b57420d8499423e7bbb2b046a2042871b0d126d296b891\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790785154,\"headline\":\"Invivyd’s Covid-directed mAb hits Phase III safety goals\",\"id\":142522077,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Invivyd’s CEO said the biotech wants to move “as quickly as possible” to bring a new option for Covid protection in the US.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b7716365b00f5e7c59999029d54cdd3b2cf3af329f0c4796017db2eb76ec88b2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790782483,\"headline\":\"PFE vs. BMY: Each Faces a $22 Billion+ Patent Cliff. One Dividend Looks Much Safer\",\"id\":142520938,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysPfizer yields about 6% and Bristol Myers about 4%, and each has more than $22 billion of revenue from drugs losing U. S.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d1eb4315fad523961856dae046c32d7afc414b02c0c8ed1777d096c67b742be6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790782145,\"headline\":\"Are You Overpaying For Pfizer Stock Versus Its Rivals?\",\"id\":142520808,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer's shares cost more than Johnson \\u0026 Johnson's for each dollar of reported profit, even after factoring in a loss quarter over the past year. Investors usually pay more for growth, yet Pfizer (PFE) had the weakest sales growth of the six companies in its peer group. Are you overpaying for Pfizer stock versus its rivals.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=72a16884875e8205de3652d0399aae55c3f3a4b916c99485ad73dc7a499774f3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790780460,\"headline\":\"Moderna vs. BioNTech: Which mRNA Stock Is the Better Buy Now?\",\"id\":142522033,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"MRNA's respiratory vaccine expansion and promising oncology results offer potential growth as COVID-19 demand normalizes.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0c7f11fc2e27afae3e335037102ba549b3d2f5e4fb450b1c5af9210de361c233\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790779413,\"headline\":\"What Is Merck Stock's Biggest Opportunity?\",\"id\":142520809,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Merck (MRK) stock returned 96% in the past twelve months, against 16.8% for the S\\u0026P 500. With the shares 4.0% below their 52-week high, you need a reason Merck can keep growing. In its fiscal Q2 2026 call, management looked past its best-selling drug to newer ones. So what is Merck stock's biggest opportunity from here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=76d46d09777c71c504574fbb4fc04c17977db7ccfaa9d0806d18f0f7f44a6972\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790775737,\"headline\":\"Moderna Sinks 6% on Citi Downgrade; Merck and Pfizer Stay Flat\",\"id\":142517577,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Citigroup just slapped a Sell rating on one of 2026's most explosive biotech stocks, warning that soaring investor hopes around a cancer vaccine partnership with Merck have carried the valuation into dangerous territory.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ce2eba22449a0950f1937137a8d491338f3c95da529f8f44a9d9078f6136566f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790775600,\"headline\":\"Drug Repurposing Market - Global Strategic Business Report: Forecasts Growth to $37.3Billion by 2030, Profiling AbbVie, AstraZeneca, Pfizer, Novartis \\u0026 Johnson \\u0026 Johnson\",\"id\":142516927,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI-driven discovery, streamlined approvals and partnerships are accelerating drug repurposing, creating opportunities in oncology, rare, neurodegenerative and infectious diseases.Dublin, Sept. 30, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \\\"Drug Repurposing Market - Global Strategic Business Report\\\" has been added to ResearchAndMarkets.com's offering. The global drug repurposing market was valued at US$29.4 billion in 2024 and is projected to reach US$37.3 billion by 2030, expanding at a compound annual growth ra\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9867c237e44c2f4997a2ee2fc47bd07c7a171bdeb1f22a933c9a97684c09935e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790775313,\"headline\":\"10 Health Care Stocks With Whale Alerts In Today’s Session\",\"id\":142557534,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzin