 Squibb pair big dividends with growing drug pipelines, a rare combination for income-focused pharma investors.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8d8f4e81edd7b59660f888999a6796d6a5cde9437dc254aefeab9dab2621342\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790699015,\"headline\":\"Management Raised the Bar For Eli Lilly Stock; Does The Chart Agree?\",\"id\":142499376,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Eli Lilly (LLY) raised its revenue forecast for 2026 on August 5, when it reported second-quarter results. Since the close before that release, Eli Lilly stock has gained 6.3%, while the S\\u0026P 500 fell 0.7%. The raise was modest and came with a lower earnings forecast, which is why the price chart is worth a look. So does Eli Lilly's price chart agree with management.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c06ff2c0c822e8896c0b556b2872150995680256580705e1edafdf2fc7709e30\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790696340,\"headline\":\"Summit Shares Jump on $2B Strategic Investment From AstraZeneca\",\"id\":142499460,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SMMT shares jump as AstraZeneca commits $2 billion to accelerate ivonescimab development and expand clinical collaboration.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=81f047f44a1203d3655d354903c36b9dd01308dc39ea27e04d5de3ca1c721d6b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790694239,\"headline\":\"AstraZeneca Digs $2 Billion Out Of Its Coffers For Summit Deal, Taking On Bristol, Pfizer, Merck\",\"id\":142498195,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Summit Therapeutics stock catapulted Tuesday after AstraZeneca made a $2 billion investment in the smaller biotech.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4d50