ttps://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NVO and PFE offer different growth paths, with diversified portfolios, pipelines and near-term challenges shaping their outlooks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=206a741ed098f1ceea55f2648c54714eb3992e05afda3b59751d444f6d002f78\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790686997,\"headline\":\"Why Amgen’s 6% Dividend Raise Masks a Tougher Road Ahead\",\"id\":142495875,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amgen just handed income investors another dividend raise, but a mountain of acquisition debt, crumbling legacy drugs, and a billion-dollar obesity bet are all competing for the same pool of cash.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=37e5d29ddd2e61fae3bd84771e2f392450f958a99706d0476b2e8f2990769b50\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790679600,\"headline\":\"Nurix Therapeutics Announces Achievement of $7 Million Milestone Under Strategic Collaboration with Pfizer\",\"id\":142495017,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Milestone reflects continued progress in collaboration to develop a novel class of degrader antibody conjugates, or DACsBRISBANE, Calif., Sept. 29, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Nurix Therapeutics, Inc. (Nasdaq: NRIX), a clinical-stage biopharmaceutical company focused on the discovery, development and commercialization of targeted protein degradation medicines, today announced the achievement of a $7 million research milestone under its strategic collaboration with Pfizer for the discovery and devel\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bfe0c95b2259687c26ade5c425d94bed4762cc4891e07178812bda3c4df07af5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790673720,\"headline\":\"Small Molecule Drug Discovery - Global Strategic Business Report Forecasts Growth from $61.5B (2024) to $100B by 2030, Profiling AstraZeneca, Gilead Sciences, Merck \\u0026 Pfizer\",\"id\":142489003,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI, computational design and high-throughput screening are accelerating discovery, while targeted therapies, outsourcing and Asia-Pacific expansion create opportunities.Dublin, Sept. 29, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \\\"Small Molecule Drug Discovery - Global Strategic Business Report\\\" has been added to ResearchAndMarkets.com's offering. The global small molecule drug discovery market was valued at US$61.5 billion in 2024 and is projected to reach US$100 billion by 2030, expanding at a compound annual g\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5a4e02a411bac236db5d78e54ee8716b187340eb56fb0a2c23a7c7fcfd2c7fc3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790667020,\"headline\":\"Beam Therapeutics: Ignore The Anthropic Noise And Focus On Clinical Progress\",\"id\":142493778,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2237482641/image_2237482641.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Beam Therapeutics (BEAM) stock analysis: BEAM-302 gene-editing upside for 2028â2029, cash runway/dilution risks, valuation vs peersâread now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0b2f7f810f70395a2cacb2e0d08118903ac1ac743984c1905bf6998b3ab15787\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790649185,\"headline\":\"Pfizer: Growth Portfolio And Cost Cuts Support A Buy Through The LOE Trough\",\"id\":142479811,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2244980373/image_2244980373.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer has a compelling risk-reward profile despite near-term COVID normalization and patent expiry headwinds. Find out why PFE stock is a Buy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0714d67165220c8b178a13db884659ebba3b5e3fa2614bf91c2118312f3effd4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790627605,\"headline\":\"$85 Billion And Counting: JNJ Stock's Steady Cash-Return Habit\",\"id\":142471254,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A healthcare giant sent a torrent of cash back to its owners, but the real story is what that money did, and did not, buy for the stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=47c929dec82b9ba5501949bd80947b155eb253cb6c2388b4e2dbf1ac89103ea6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790618927,\"headline\":\"What Are Merck Stock Investors Overlooking?\",\"id\":142470205,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"If you own Merck (MRK) stock, the number to watch is the sales of one cancer drug family. KEYTRUDA family sales were $8.4 billion in the second quarter of 2026. That was about half of Merck's $16.6 billion in quarterly revenue. Management now expects KEYTRUDA’s U.S. growth to moderate, raising questions about whether the stock's recent run has fully priced in the transition.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=49b660d989fd3bd8c621fd4697d8ecaecc3b5702e8ef6817407f5d2420c581f3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790604564,\"headline\":\"Pfizer (PFE) Heads To ESMO With 45 Oncology Abstracts And Fresh Cancer Data\",\"id\":142468299,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer (NYSE:PFE) is set to feature data from 45 oncology research abstracts at the upcoming ESMO Congress. The company plans multiple oral presentations on late-stage cancer candidates alongside results for established oncology medicines. New clinical readouts at ESMO will spotlight Pfizer's late-stage oncology pipeline and marketed cancer drugs, against a broader backdrop our research has surfaced. Take a look at 4 warning signs we have identified for Pfizer. For investors tracking how...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ec3ff7fdece780503bc51b0924f8303786619033e45756ba31d43eb6ddc95f1e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790604375,\"headline\":\"BioNTech to Close Manufacturing Sites in Germany and Singapore After Sale Process Ends\",\"id\":142468300,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BioNTech (NASDAQ:BNTX) said on Monday that it will close manufacturing facilities in Germany and Singapore after a sales process for the sites did not result in completed transactions. The German vaccine maker had announced in May that it would seek buyers for facilities in Idar-Oberstein, Marburg and Tuebingen in Germany, as well as its Singapore site, with closures planned if purchasers could not be found.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=049be25b95045faa27989fc2293403e9762e5d00473c017bc7203d6b8e8e47eb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790600520,\"headline\":\"Is AstraZeneca's Oncology Portfolio Positioned for Continued Growth?\",\"id\":142468175,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AZN's oncology sales rise 15% in H1 2026 as newer drugs, label expansions and a deep pipeline support continued franchise growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=88a4915258b5dcca9eb009a007f7749d07592faada3c780707107bd82f274295\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790599828,\"headline\":\"What Bavarian Nordic’s next CEO is up against\",\"id\":142465234,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Danish biotech sharpened its global vaccine ambitions by tapping Tarja Stenvall, a Big Pharma vet, to take the helm.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e721a26508c5374c8eb368963ba6796a793ca0b7f18b2c6cbbbe3ec62602536e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790597059,\"headline\":\"Alnylam Pharmaceuticals: More Than Meets The Eye After CARDIO-TTRansform\",\"id\":142468470,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1418324627/image_1418324627.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Alnylam Pharmaceuticals, Inc. is down on ATTR-CM fears. TRITON-CM could still succeed, downside is buffered, and shares look undervalued. Click for an ALNY update.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8e2b67edec17f9348f9a8af8e8975062e504fc8ac7bf90645947a447c1226d5b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790596803,\"headline\":\"Here is What to Know Beyond Why Pfizer Inc. (PFE) is a Trending Stock\",\"id\":142466419,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Zacks.com users have recently been watching Pfizer (PFE) quite a bit. Thus, it is worth knowing the facts that could determine the stock's prospects.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=24c1593aa899a2710e2ca6357cddf14d229f9cbbddf6bfc5e67f9a3230af7cea\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790592300,\"headline\":\"Pfizer Advances Today’s Cancer Care and Tomorrow's Potential Breakthroughs at ESMO\",\"id\":142463840,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NEW YORK, September 28, 2026--Pfizer Inc. (NYSE: PFE) will present data from 45 company-sponsored, investigator-sponsored, and collaborative research abstracts at the European Society for Medical Oncology (ESMO) Congress, taking place October 23-27, 2026 in Madrid, Spain. The presentations include 11 oral presentations spanning Pfizer’s established medicines and late-stage pipeline across its disease areas of focus, including breast cancer, genitourinary cancers, and lung cancer.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bda59c5f181d1494cca9006e3583b681aaf85e714acb849f75ebbd3e25933533\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790586420,\"headline\":\"Global Cyclic Peptide Library Market Outlook and Forecast, 2026-2032 - AI-Enabled Discovery Fuels 16.32% CAGR Toward USD 9.86 Billion as PeptiDream, Bicycle Therapeutics, Pfizer and Roche Advance Competition\",\"id\":142463274,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boost ROI with question-led libraries, reproducible synthesis, validated assays, interoperable data, AI feedback loops, partnerships, and early planning for IP, regulation, supply and talentDublin, Sept. 28, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \\\"Cyclic Peptide Library Market - Global Forecast 2026-2032\\\" has been added to ResearchAndMarkets.com's offering. This market research report examines the global cyclic peptide library market, projected to grow from USD 3.75 billion in 2026 to USD 9.86 billion by 2032\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=648ccda4f53773f7208f863d7fb03d94e2f09fbd753208980a169ab37b4595ff\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790579417,\"headline\":\"Full Transcript: Pfizer Q2 2026 Earnings Call\",\"id\":142467461,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/11/06/movers_4.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer (NYSE:PFE) released second-quarter financial results and hosted an earnings call on Tuesday. Read the complete transcript below.\\nBenzinga APIs provide real-time access to earnings call transcripts and financial\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7bbd42c88ea8eb149cd56ec22ffc546bf6012c18ec2adc053b904e325d0eb2fe\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790550557,\"headline\":\"Gilead’s HIV Concentration or Pfizer’s Patent Cliff: Which Risk is Easier to Own?\",\"id\":142450725,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer Inc. (NYSE:PFE) and Gilead Sciences, Inc. (NASDAQ:GILD) present investors with two very different forms of concentration risk. Pfizer needs newer medicines and its pipeline to offset revenue that will increasingly face generic and biosimilar competition, while Gilead has the opposite problem, where its biggest franchise is performing extremely well, but HIV accounts for roughly […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f47f4366f4cbc9bfecc28c9f8ccfcca3cf9f4e8e007fbfdb13f8a4549845e48a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790549824,\"headline\":\"Pfizer vs. Medtronic: Which Healthcare Turnaround is More Convincing?\",\"id\":142450733,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer Inc. (NYSE:PFE) and Medtronic plc (NYSE:MDT) are both trying to prove that years of portfolio investment can translate into more durable growth, but the two healthcare giants are entering very different stages of their turnarounds. Pfizer is rebuilding around newer medicines as COVID revenue declines and generic and biosimilar competition approaches. Medtronic, meanwhile, is […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=da3c23baf34eb9954e58e74c7cf566902748b0279523b578d5c6b47029a90cf9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790549507,\"headline\":\"Pfizer vs. Thermo Fisher: Which Healthcare Turnaround has More Upside?\",\"id\":142450706,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer Inc. (NYSE:PFE) and Thermo Fisher Scientific Inc. (NYSE:TMO) are both trying to put difficult post-pandemic periods behind them, but their recoveries look very different. Thermo Fisher is benefiting from improving activity across life-sciences markets after a prolonged slowdown in pharmaceutical and biotech spending. Pfizer, meanwhile, is trying to rebuild growth around newer medicines as […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=98183ed4127d9a2e12a18ad666f110ff7df16c469d8fd405ff8e7a89bad14d47\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790540854,\"headline\":\"Pfizer (PFE) Balances Global Pricing Opportunity with New Revenue Sharing\",\"id\":142450083,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer Inc. (NYSE:PFE) has agreed to share a portion of the incremental net revenue it generates from higher drug prices overseas with the U.S. Department of Health and Human Services (HHS), according to newly released documents covering its Most Favored Nation (MFN) pricing agreement. The provision applies to medicines already on the market and runs […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=416f2b32ac21c15572257be23b965aa99f8269a6c271f46ab07bf50fe0286e05\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790502600,\"headline\":\"Kevin Warsh Just Signaled Higher-for-Longer Rates. Here's What That Means for Big Pharma Dividend Stocks.\",\"id\":142445831,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pharmaceutical company share prices may suffer, but probably not by as much as some might fear.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e9c507f01969153830318d3adb02f6e42f9540cb18b55eb73d8243e694c37524\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790432991,\"headline\":\"D-Wave Quantum vs. QuantumScape: Which Moonshot Tech Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142438715,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Both companies are years from commercial scale and burning cash to get there. The difference is in how long each can keep going.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6499bfc7ec7dd90c50f81f1c8ca7770ef34862d91a0d40f5691b75c712d6ff5c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790417596,\"headline\":\"Buy 5 Barron's Better Bets (Than T-Bills) Out Of 11 'Safer' September DiviDogs\",\"id\":142437983,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/87466160/image_87466160.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Long-term bond yields persist, but investors looking for income can still find plenty of attractive opportunities with dividend-paying stocks. Click for more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f99f92cbdd159160feba9c7d4c9c3d12dcfbb7649a368adc49334c44589245cc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790392140,\"headline\":\"Pfizer: Buy Before The Street Catches Up To Its Own Numbers\",\"id\":142435488,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1341266246/image_1341266246.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"PFE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Pfizer's post pandemic earnings quality does not warrant a peer multiple, and from five consecutive years of decline. Learn why PFE stock is a buy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bbf1c8713a5b8da184f586d3430ae1364dd11960d71ea00b792c80cbf83a3eae\"}]"
