     "content": {
      "size": 136839,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792366040,\"headline\":\"The Winners Inside SCHD - October 2026\",\"id\":142992053,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=338e046f3cae53ba7d15e9918dd078db2c4d26bc477673975dbc84454a9e73f7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792348229,\"headline\":\"Nine Companies, Including Broadcom and Verizon, Object to Their Shares Being Tokenized. Can They Stop It?\",\"id\":142988566,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"OKX and Intercontinental Exchange want to tokenize shares from 63 public companies, but nine of them have formally pushed back. Whether corporations can actually block a blockchain exchange from trading digital versions of their stock is now a live legal and financial question.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=57f743c8f642271987dae6f5e86d7fcda59985d7b89227a395e3cb591f5c0007\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792312491,\"headline\":\"Top Wall Street analysts are bullish on the growth potential of these 3 stocks\",\"id\":142987863,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/107389628-17108719542022-11-09t164207z_798327205_rc2eix9j5b73_rtrmadp_0_meta-layoffs.jpeg?v=1737658509\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Amid fear of rate hikes and oil prices, investors can look past volatility and track Street analysts' stock picks with strong long-term growth potential.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1f05a314e8c24c956f20b643bd4454b08b6fe66f623d412b14715e8cccd372b6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792264021,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealth: 3 Key Takeaways for Long-Term Investors\",\"id\":142963224,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Strong commercial client retention heading into 2027 anchors revenue predictability as operational reforms take hold.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ee16e15ed2fc0b2932a806b0049bc00765746f314a92e62051a3b6e02c1a9d0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792196067,\"headline\":\"3 US Dividend Stocks Worth Watching As Treasury Yields Climb\",\"id\":142955841,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bond yields are climbing, Washington is running a roughly $2t deficit on the way to about $40t of federal debt, and the government’s interest bill has crossed $1t a year. Income investors watching this know that higher Treasury payouts can tempt cash away from equities. This article looks at 3 large US dividend and value stocks exposed to these fiscal crosswinds and why they could still matter for your portfolio. The three stocks below are a sample. The full screen surfaced 13 more large US...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=55289d523a3833a386828de25328617e55dad3323026dffd1400574588ee602c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792194900,\"headline\":\"Review \\u0026 Preview: AI Bloodbath\",\"id\":142951552,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech had a brutal week as investors worried about the AI buildout.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6e360dbe8240c530a1b3dea8c6f947726d680634b72fe4083419c677cf26113e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792188301,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealth: Q3 Confirms The Bull Case\",\"id\":142957008,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2279083995/image_2279083995.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth (UNH) Q3 results beat as guidance rises. Learn more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f35f1d95004ea82b1f1d3d3bf3d94c652c7c7596b6a51d56de9c0aa07c0b570a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792175700,\"headline\":\"Companies Are Saying No to Tokenized Stocks—and Testing Wall Street’s Crypto Push\",\"id\":142950023,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nine companies have objected to having their shares trade on OKXICE’s proposed platform, highlighting resistance to a new model of stock trading.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5f5653665d8d4b534ae7288f882c121a1992e1674596b30cf8ee4eaa14117f79\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166460,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealth's Q3 Margins Improve, But Membership Falls: Time to Buy?\",\"id\":142949146,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UNH's Q3 earnings surge and improving margins signal a recovery, but falling membership and elevated utilization raise questions about sustained growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=76895a04b0eef87f6cf0fcf4c9fa4eabd96cc615a0a7b4ae4a0bef09650d22da\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792162441,\"headline\":\"Where Could UnitedHealth's Next Growth Come From?\",\"id\":142948009,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth Group (UNH) could find its next growth engine in the care it delivers. That perspective carries weight right now. During the company's October 13 call, management raised its 2026 outlook to adjusted earnings per share of at least $20.50. Yet executives also warned that medical costs remain stubbornly high across health care. So which part of UnitedHealth's care business still has room to grow.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1dff82e13e499eb42ddf9203860dcb18bf07186f7f1a435fbf60251da9abe8e0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161804,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Swings On AI Fears, Tumbling Yields; Taiwan Semi, ASML, JPMorgan In Focus: Weekly Review\",\"id\":142947981,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The stock market was divided with all the key indexes testing or breaking key levels amid AI financing fears and tumbling Treasury yields.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6f9859d3302961fcbfc6d5d9bc85ab5947acf30e6bc87410ea46a4c0b2203ef1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155926,\"headline\":\"Bernstein Maintains Outperform on UnitedHealth Group, Lowers Price Target to $500\",\"id\":142960927,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Bernstein  analyst Lance Wilkes   maintains UnitedHealth Group (NYSE:UNH) with a Outperform and lowers the price target from $512 to $500.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bdd95ab28ad3393a74ffef0c39de55230307969900d33f879bab6f94ebce76c7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155246,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Wall Street Swaps Chips for Old Reliables as Producer Prices Spike\",\"id\":142946644,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/THUMBNAILS_CHARTMILL_1000_528_22_59555aefc9.webp\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"The Dow rose 1.2% as money moved from chips into old-economy names. Producer prices posted their biggest jump since 2022, and Jensen Huang came to CoreWeave's defense.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ee8449899659de30d7c02cc76597c0fe59b287c7864490302adecf3c9fbd624a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792150245,\"headline\":\"JP Morgan Maintains Overweight on UnitedHealth Group, Raises Price Target to $524\",\"id\":142960928,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"JP Morgan  analyst Lisa Gill   maintains UnitedHealth Group (NYSE:UNH) with a Overweight and raises the price target from $516 to $524.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=56e5c9fd5acb97f06b1bd27d1fe26c00ae3d0b98829802821c72e004d5c873c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792134853,\"headline\":\"Learn Why The Bull Case For UnitedHealth Group Stock Could Change Following Earnings Beat\",\"id\":142936047,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth Group reported third quarter 2026 revenue of US$112.7b with net income of US$4.1b and raised full year 2026 earnings guidance to at least US$19.50 in diluted EPS and more than US$17.65b in net earnings attributable to common shareholders. Alongside the stronger profit picture, UnitedHealth Group continued its long running buyback program, retiring about 3.5m shares in the latest quarter and bringing cumulative repurchases to roughly 737m shares since 2006. This reduces the share...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=649a342195c66694c87aa66271b5365611f80a99441c9356296a9aae709e5b69\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792108980,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealth Fell 51.32%, Then Rose 40.64%. DIA’s Exposure Followed Both Moves by Design\",\"id\":142923834,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth's wild ride inside DIA was not an accident or a manager's call. The weighting rule baked into the Dow determined exactly how much of your money followed the stock up and down, and most investors have never read that single line in the prospectus.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c2ddea21e6bdf6212b81c71004ffa176e29ee1740ab96deb06546e45d5d25cf9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792099380,\"headline\":\"3 Companies Raising Guidance This Earnings Season\",\"id\":142922978,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Raised guidance is always a welcome development for investors, reflecting improving business trends and management confidence in the outlook.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=72238688ce9bdd704d54016de9e4138a1127b0155c79e11b90d17d1c81226f29\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792091412,\"headline\":\"Discover which dow jones stocks are making waves on Thursday.\",\"id\":142921152,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Let's have a look at the top dow jones gainers and losers one hour before the close of the markets of today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=545db4733871e90a22820d700146d007479454afeb887e72faa3fb5e27048e68\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792089120,\"headline\":\"3 Low-Beta Defensive Stocks to Buy as Inflation Continues to Surge\",\"id\":142921431,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"As inflation surges on rising energy costs, CAH, UNH and CORT stand out as low-beta healthcare stocks with strong expected earnings growth and defensive appeal.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=abb5ce5c48a5a67fcbbfc9d5515d0db9a0a3c0bf15d473facce8f6a61f2b43fe\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792086600,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Nasdaq Pares Loss As Yields Dive; Drug Giant Hits All-Time High (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142920282,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Thursday while the Nasdaq slid on further tech weakness.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9470d8afc1c4b5713644076d1029bc7f031d28b7a207c1af6f3465cfcf67eb52\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792082413,\"headline\":\"These dow jones stocks are moving in today's session\",\"id\":142919827,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay updated with the movements of the dow jones index in the middle of the day on Thursday. Discover which stocks are leading as top gainers and losers in today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=18dc9eae377f70c9060ce92d31795980c6c5b9529453a1aa557a7ac15259d50c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792081861,\"headline\":\"$100 Invested In UnitedHealth Group 20 Years Ago Would Be Worth This Much Today\",\"id\":142945486,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/07/10/valuestock_3.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth Group (NYSE:UNH) has outperformed the market over the past 20 years by 2.07% on an annualized basis producing an average annual return of 11.07%. Currently, UnitedHealth Group has a market capitalization of\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a2bad1e409ea85aa4cf85f22800a640ee13a40bafb292f28b36935f00727fbf1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792076460,\"headline\":\"Can UNH's Focus on Special Needs Plans Strengthen Medicare Growth?\",\"id\":142920430,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth's focus on special needs plans, expanded Medicare coverage and improved margins could drive targeted growth in 2027 despite cost challenges.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77958235fb036a80122f5aa237977d8ecc12fd27bff6d9e42510cdf34e0ce158\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792071644,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealth Stock Moves Higher: What's Going On?\",\"id\":142945487,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Jakarta---February-03-2023-Unitedhealthc.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth Group Inc. (NYSE: UNH) shares are climbing Thursday as analysts react to a strong third-quarter report and raised 2026 guidance.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c98d01aba98ab4a38fe11e1c74477db9d2f0c81b4f13e397f76719cc8c0beaa4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792070078,\"headline\":\"What Happened With UnitedHealth Stock This Week?\",\"id\":142916412,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of UnitedHealth Group (UNH) rose 4.5% over the two trading days through Wednesday, October 14, while the S\\u0026P 500 fell 1.1%. The company reported fiscal Q3 2026 results before the market opened on Tuesday. The stock slipped 0.2% that day before posting its gain on Wednesday. Management also raised its forecast for full-year 2026 earnings. So what did the report change for someone who owns the shares.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3ba52a896007a6066cc5044ba229895e436e4c48da36a8d860a7afa599a180e9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792065900,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealth Beats on Earnings, But Investors Question Growth Path\",\"id\":142945630,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth Group topped Q3 2026 revenue and EPS estimates and raised its full-year outlook, but shares erased early gains as investors questioned future growth amid shrinking membership.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6452f768336c2687c8d1180fd697bb0e8247674b3590333f9824678cc9988160\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062572,\"headline\":\"Defensives Lead Sectors In Thursday Trading As Technology Trails\",\"id\":142945157,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Stock-Market-Trading-Chart-And-Analyzing.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Seven sectors are higher and four are lower in Thursday’s regular session, with defensive sectors holding two of the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with Health Care sitting well above the next group.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=294a216817942afe6103c7aa12a4cb1690de64bea2ea80630f7af70f64ef1cda\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062140,\"headline\":\"AI Fears Grip Markets as Tech Rotation Accelerates\",\"id\":142912656,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"As we enter the spooky season markets got an early fright as the tech stocks rotation accelerated alongside the fallout from a hot inflation reading.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d805b7dc131780ee28881ee734acf8fc6197a6217c18c94c705090899557bd20\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062136,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealth Group FQ3 Earnings: Positives Already Priced In\",\"id\":142918907,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1308861166/image_1308861166.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth Group is a Hold, as despite operational progress, profit margins remain well below historical averages and could limit upside. Read more on UNH.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2f4e2f5137855bd2821717e78902e18b1503ba1b55e9497679652295e4b2526b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792057846,\"headline\":\"TD Cowen Reiterates Hold on UnitedHealth Group, Maintains $402 Price Target\",\"id\":142917515,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"TD Cowen  analyst Ryan Langston   reiterates UnitedHealth Group (NYSE:UNH) with a Hold and maintains $402 price target.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=04ea76478128f41b3b07619eae8d8287990962ef5ea595bfdc4ee3f4bbc3ed16\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792055346,\"headline\":\"AI Fears Grip Markets as Scary Tech Rotati