tage profitability and lower valuation give it an edge over HUM.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e5e35a8b3c0ded3348c1b0f24165566586631a0c99a7b4d3b4d36dd1cff38ba8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791559989,\"headline\":\"At 71, She Chose Humana for the Part B Giveback in Her Social Security Check. For 2027, Humana Will Cut or Eliminate It for 62% of Those Members\",\"id\":142764093,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A $0 premium plan sounds like a win until the number that actually pads your Social Security deposit quietly disappears. Here is what Humana changed for 2027 and what a retired person on a fixed income stands to lose each month without realizing it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=20318a2d3e6eee7eee4ab5ca76a3712ed8fe60270659813ee0c755002a3fed89\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791559360,\"headline\":\"Does UnitedHealth (UNH) Present a Case for Patience in a Margin-Repair Story?\",\"id\":142764091,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The investment case for UnitedHealth Group Inc. (NYSE:UNH) rests on how management can restore the company’s profitability margins and reignite its topline expansion to justify an earnings turnaround, which the current forward P/E multiple already assumes. The overall profile for UnitedHealth appears mixed yet highly intriguing. Despite its cash flow strength, flat revenue growth and […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=79084aa210e26e535689ef16226e54f4e61a72d1e8b7b97e652fc6560352153c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791558525,\"headline\":\"Seniors Face an 18% Drop in Highly Rated Medicare Advantage Plans — But Quality Might Not Be the Cause\",\"id\":142764092,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CMS just reshuffled Medicare Advantage star ratings, and the fallout is splitting major insurers into winners and losers almost overnight. Before you assume the quality of senior care is actually improving or collapsing, there is a crucial wrinkle in how the scores were calculated that changes everything.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bb3bb105811cdb2ac3132dd22b20d53692c49bb773491f659a6a1aa3baa87548\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791557910,\"headline\":\"Delta Slides on FY Outlook; Humana Surges on Quality Ratings | Stock Movers\",\"id\":142763984,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On this episode of Stock Movers: - Delta (DAL) shares are sliding after the company reduced its full-year earnings outlook due to high jet fuel prices stemming from the war in the Middle East. - Humana (HUM) is surging as the company improved its performance on crucial Medicare Advantage quality ratings that will boost future revenue. Shares of CVS meanwhile fell as ratings for some of its largest plans deteriorated, while UnitedHealth shares were little changed in premarket trading. - Apple (AAPL) shares are slipping after a report that the company cut component orders for the iPhone 18 Pro and iPhone 18 Pro Max following weaker-than-expected demand.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7943a40a53d00db88dfcbab83cac62ba2c53e417ec30daf248aba4fa14449e6e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791556922,\"headline\":\"Clover Health Investments shares are trading higher after the company reported a year-over-year increase in Membership Growth in its Medicare Advantage PPO plans. The company expects to achieve its first-ever FY GAAP net income profitability.\",\"id\":140051998,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b65d92b30dc8bcb64c42e6a9ac02633199b4afcddbe7d040ef199608517343ef\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791551639,\"headline\":\"Is Clover Health Stock Too Dependent On One Group Of Members?\",\"id\":142761648,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"During an August 5, 2026 call, management at Clover Health Investments (CLOV) noted that nearly half of its Medicare Advantage members joined the company in 2025 or 2026. That matters because Clover typically earns less gross profit on a member in the first year than in the second, and the 2026 cohort is still navigating that initial period. Even so, the stock has returned 70% over the past twelve months, compared to 17.0% for the S\\u0026P 500. So where are all these new members coming from.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f579421557b632f0a8b76ca9e5870d86d7bccecb8743bbf252acc2dd567927f6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791551461,\"headline\":\"Final Trades: Hewlett Packard, Wells Fargo, Arista Networks and UnitedHealth\",\"id\":142764887,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108382372-17915652401791565238-48893104530-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1791565239\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"The Investment Committee gives you their top stocks to watch for the second half.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=332c12d6feea9c49edce0058b29892c6e74f564c522db44463ca304da4ff2455\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791550858,\"headline\":\"Shares of companies within the broader tech sector are trading higher amid market strength and may be in reaction to Microsoft's plan to invest approximately $80 billion into AI data center development in FY25.\",\"id\":139934220,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c39216bcce8a6a799fa149f0f116e47bb5edd530c8873ec9014bf245dd059465\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791549722,\"headline\":\"Humana Soars 16% on Improved Medicare Advantage Star Ratings; CVS Slides 3%, UnitedHealth Holds Steady\",\"id\":142761647,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A single Medicare quality ratings release sent one major insurer soaring while dragging a rival into the red, and the gap between winners and losers points to something deeper than a routine scoring update.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=71d042b9ca9a3a4f155550a980d49c6070304e06cfb993f6d63bf0d3f75833c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791546994,\"headline\":\"TD Cowen Maintains Hold on UnitedHealth Group, Lowers Price Target to $402\",\"id\":142792142,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"TD Cowen  analyst Ryan Langston   maintains UnitedHealth Group (NYSE:UNH) with a Hold and lowers the price target from $430 to $402.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=78cd2afbc35e254635c5a597d18b9ff6521fa88403dac70b98028ade80c5d304\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791539460,\"headline\":\"Humana Stock Surges After Key Medicare Advantage Plan Gets Higher Rating\",\"id\":142734200,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Improving Medicare Advantage ratings isn’t easy. Stars are based on 40-some criteria that encompass patient experience surveys and a range of care metrics.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=91359177dfccf1e2b3bbae1bcdc4917dc32471cc46cb1ef7551d3fc1badd2671\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791539052,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealth: A Beat Is Priced In, But There's Room For Surprise\",\"id\":142761330,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2b30647c883fe5d3a23744487f45d1c4957af11e18b77a953c01eb585a7ae99b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791526284,\"headline\":\"Humana Reaffirms FY26 Adjusted EPS Guidance Of At Least $9; Exceeding Goal Of Top Quartile Results In 2027 Medicare Advantage Star Ratings; Expects 2028 Benefit For One-Time Investments And Return To Shareholders\",\"id\":142761400,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Humana affirms its guidance of at least $9.00 in adjusted earnings per common share (\\u0026#34;Adjusted EPS\\u0026#34;), for the year ending December 31, 2026 (\\u0026#34;FY 2026\\u0026#34;). This guidance is consistent with the guidance\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cb9edbedbe00537d122d9c8d40a8e7a359b839c23611f997b461d95140f4b065\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791492605,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealth Group (UNH) Registers a Bigger Fall Than the Market: Important Facts to Note\",\"id\":142733109,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In the closing of the recent trading day, UnitedHealth Group (UNH) stood at $370.63, denoting a -1.42% move from the preceding trading day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=89048fc969ed2a6da0664f87e98fc89cfbebf93514c4c1c651b16c2b9369cc9f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791486615,\"headline\":\"Exploring the top movers within the dow jones index during today's session.\",\"id\":142731799,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay updated with the movement of dow jones stocks in today's session. Discover which dow jones stocks are making waves on Thursday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d02e79ecef043a92ebba46248d20db4281c6aa7162d4da8ddbe12ca8c3b04577\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791477785,\"headline\":\"CMS Releases 2027 Medicare Advantage And Part D Star Ratings, With 37% Of MA-PD Contracts Earning Four Or More Stars And 71% Of Enrollees In High-Rated Plans\",\"id\":142761328,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.cms.gov/newsroom/fact-sheets/2027-medicare-advantage-part-d-star-ratings\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=29098ce11cff3483148b86b2789c84cb137159693a8e1c850d8db3067b527e99\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791476460,\"headline\":\"CVS Health Trades at a Discount to Industry: How to Play the Stock?\",\"id\":142731051,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CVS trades below industry peers as Aetna margins recover, pharmacy trends improve and Health Services gains momentum, but 340B headwinds persist.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=86c548386c1e9658dae6b65e60f304fb0d0316c7418352549369d25f7d8bc55d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791474441,\"headline\":\"Dear UnitedHealth Stock Fans, Mark Your Calendars for October 13\",\"id\":142733110,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth is set to report its third-quarter results on Oct. 13.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c38b8393e22e98b3c4842781e6be1923f0ca7abc0ece9c955052feff3ac8e598\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791473482,\"headline\":\"At 73, UnitedHealthcare Will End Her Medicare Advantage Plan for 2027. If She Ignores the Letter, She’ll Wake Up January 1 With Original Medicare, No Drug Plan and No Medigap\",\"id\":142729860,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A non-renewal letter from UnitedHealthcare sits unopened on her counter, and the clock ticking behind it leads somewhere most 73-year-olds never see coming until the bills arrive.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fc24f3ece0ee30efcef4ed6451fe34b9935b6de6ff83