d3d49634836e4f362570ea8cc937b427dc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791461719,\"headline\":\"Stay Ahead of the Game With UnitedHealth (UNH) Q3 Earnings: Wall Street's Insights on Key Metrics\",\"id\":142727253,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Looking beyond Wall Street's top-and-bottom-line estimate forecasts for UnitedHealth (UNH), delve into some of its key metrics to gain a deeper insight into the company's potential performance for the quarter ended September 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1e06d6c67d8dc2ff5ee1dfc0f2d83142932d85b31b0783c8051fb5f150dc1dbf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791460803,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealth Group Incorporated (UNH) is Attracting Investor Attention: Here is What You Should Know\",\"id\":142727254,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth (UNH) has been one of the stocks most watched by Zacks.com users lately. So, it is worth exploring what lies ahead for the stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=765d2d6010030fe3f7516f05440bd87af0362a408eff7e13c09d94e82f64f82b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791443075,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealth’s P/E Has Reset. Is the Stock Finally Undervalued?\",\"id\":142715388,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth Group Incorporated (NYSE:UNH) is a very different valuation story than it was a few years ago. The stock used to command the kind of premium multiple investors were willing to pay for a high-quality healthcare compounder. That premium has largely disappeared after a difficult stretch of higher medical costs and pressure across parts of […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e541589702ef1b634810e533388b48c17458e45fd8