365. 20Target Price (Mid): ~$586Street Target: ~$482Potential Total Return: ~61%Annualized IRR: ~12% / yearWhat Happened?UnitedHealth Group (UNH:NYSE) is shutting Medicare Advantage plans that cover about 390,000 people for 2027, a company spokesperson told Bloomberg on October 1.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9115cffdd0f5bac173da39794cc5c9f299323af696eb8ae7bfd68296ddb6f1a6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790929464,\"headline\":\"How Much Downside Is Left In CVS Health Stock?\",\"id\":142581267,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CVS Health (CVS) stock lost 12.7% in the past month without company news, and peers UnitedHealth, Cigna and Elevance Health fell too. The S\\u0026P 500 rose 0.6% over the same month. The shares now trade 22.5% below their 52-week high. How much further could CVS stock fall if the market itself turns down.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8c783d54f798f8baba878d1a33d3bd74c4603a700c35efe48cef11b208f1c6a7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790886407,\"headline\":\"Raymond James Updates Healthcare Top Picks for October\",\"id\":142562923,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Raymond James has updated its Healthcare Top Picks list for October, adding three new stocks while removing others from the monthly selection. The firm added Xencor, Calyxt, and UnitedHealth Group to replace Relay Therapeutics, Tyra Biosciences, and Oscar Health.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8ce3c29ae810f04d9bd929e7f17e262f95ca8d7d98fd38c265e53f8504c1a72\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790852400,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealthcare 2027 Medicare Plans Focus on Affordability, Simplicity and a More Connected Healthcare Experience\",\"id\":142556652,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"October 01, 2026--UnitedHealthcare today introduced its 2027 Medicare Advantage plans, designed to bring affordability, simplicity and a more connected care experience to a growing and increasingly diverse population of beneficiaries. As America’s most chosen Medicare brand for 18 years in a row1, the company's Medicare portfolio continues to focus on delivering the benefits members value most while advancing new ways to make healthcare more accessible, personalized and easier to use.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=29f604db34829663708b62c3c416be35aaae0b69629cd46e2f1f42ebef19bf8b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790846683,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealthcare Rolls Out 2027 Medicare Plans With $0 Premiums, Drug Copays And Broader Benefits\",\"id\":142558995,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/01/Jakarta---February-03-2023-Unitedhealthc.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealthcare unveils 2027 Medicare Advantage plans with lower costs, $0 premiums, and updated UCard perks amid lawsuit fallout.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=88e2198d009e6a61469b58ebcceb08f667129012be79471fa8fa6dd87fb0659d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790838680,\"headline\":\"Unitedhealthcare 2027 Introduces Medicare Plans, Including Access To $0 Premium Plans, $0 Primary Care Visits And Affordable Prescription Drug Coverage\",\"id\":142558996,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealthcare today introduced its 2027 Medicare Advantage plans, designed to bring affordability, simplicity and a more connected care experience to a growing and increasingly diverse population of beneficiaries. As\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=916e15fb0590522c0bfafd2ef0f75c05726d6aa12fdfeff32bacd57f231626ed\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790801406,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealth Group (UNH) Dips More Than Broader Market: What You Should Know\",\"id\":142524893,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In the closing of the recent trading day, UnitedHealth Group (UNH) stood at $367.08, denoting a -2.1% move from the preceding trading day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3c6078939e822db987874d461ebe7bf81428e36d48dd1190d855bd1195bf4bd1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790795413,\"headline\":\"Stay informed with the top movers within the dow jones index on Wednesday.\",\"id\":142522688,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Join us in exploring the top gainers and losers within the dow jones index one hour before the close of the markets on Wednesday as we examine the latest happenings in today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0093b0cd464267ac6c1513a5f23552a3363364456c7f26595de3332df4bb8e51\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790792699,\"headline\":\"Judge Denies In Part UnitedHealth's Motion to Dismiss CalPERS Suit\",\"id\":142522982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A federal judge in Minnesota granted in part and denied in part UnitedHealth's (UNH) motion to dismi\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ac9559a0cda7a599962af6eff8a93ae40e9348cd4165fd0be97e32750f6211a7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790785886,\"headline\":\"Her Surgery Is Set for January. Her Broker Learned in August That UnitedHealthcare May Leave Her County in 2027\",\"id\":142522040,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Her surgeon is scheduled, her prior authorization is approved, and her surgery date is locked in for January. What her insurer has not told her could unravel all three.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8bfc41c4492a6076cfe155721860b7744ce2b285b5d78695ba157b9a16cf370e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790782980,\"headline\":\"Cigna Investor Day Spotlights Specialty Drugs\",\"id\":142522041,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Cigna Group investors will be looking for more detail on the growth of its specialty pharmacy business under new CEO Brian Evanko.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7db66a181637c5f9e4faf88dd689329269a26821d0e5da9773847e661cef69cf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790766673,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealth Group (UNH) Puts Robert Hunter At The Center Of Its Leadership Reset\",\"id\":142513203,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth Group (NYSE:UNH) has appointed Robert Hunter as president of UnitedHealthcare as part of a leadership realignment. The new UnitedHealthcare chief is expected to help advance a multi-year plan focused on margin recovery and modernization of operations. Hunter’s remit includes restoring confidence among regulators and customers while sharpening the business’s digital experience across key insurance offerings. The Robert Hunter appointment at UnitedHealthcare is important, but...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f083654affe2e9c1c5a06659c6074750532a9f102bea557b6c9141f33b894c98\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790766000,\"headline\":\"Hatteras Venture Partners Names Sir Andrew Witty as Chairman and Ned Sharpless, M.D., as Managing Director of Hatteras Discovery Innovation, Expanding Proven Investment Strategies\",\"id\":142513204,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"– Hatteras holds first closing of Hatteras Opportunity Fund II (HOF II) – – HOF II closing brings capital under management to over $1 billion – DURHAM, N.C., Sept. 30, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Hatteras Venture Partners, a venture capital firm focused on transformative healthcare innovation, has appointed two longtime healthcare leaders to senior roles as it builds its next generation of companies and expands support for later-stage portfolio businesses. Sir Andrew Witty, former Chief Executive O\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=136dc5bb68cb86b908d1d0be43b866ca7d2c869a58884749d05abe90dd3b6dda\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790765401,\"headline\":\"SCHD's Top Sector Bet Is Healthcare at 20.7%. I'm Not Sure What's More Surprising: What It Doesn't Hold, or What It Does.\",\"id\":142513047,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SHCD is missing some of the healthiest dividend stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ba80e6b6a456360c65d18842a093d154f3e547670481bb8a3e14a8d0b26cebd6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790751326,\"headline\":\"Robert Hunter Named UnitedHealth (UNH) Insurance President\",\"id\":142512118,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth Group Incorporated (NYSE:UNH) is getting a new head of its insurance division, with executive Robert Hunter disclosing on September 28 that he will take the role. Hunter announced it himself in a post on LinkedIn, and the firm has issued no comments on the reasoning. The division he is taking over is the one […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8da575a24e42f9c67ee9760ef53942054b8a640b4ac98d83fd534bff973beb05\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790741754,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealth: The Recovery Is Working, The Stock Isn't\",\"id\":142512206,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2287254153/image_2287254153.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth is demonstrating tangible margin recovery, especially in Medicare and Optum Health. Check out why UNH stock is a buy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=025d01f660c12fe1a5cd60aac5b79c0a87fbd04bc034ff66e7d49bc1d9204df0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790709009,\"headline\":\"Which dow jones stocks are moving on Tuesday?\",\"id\":142499987,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Let's have a look at the top dow jones gainers and losers one hour before the close of the markets of today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d86a89f12f7a3769625ba57f71398b516023a72b2444d33a1d6a23ea31e36d7c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790706345,\"headline\":\"What Are UNH Stock Investors Betting On?\",\"id\":142500417,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth (UNH) stock trades at 22.5 times its past year's adjusted earnings, which are normalized net income with stock-based pay added back. That multiple leaves little room for error after three years of shrinking operating margins, sitting near the stock's 10-year median despite fundamentally weaker profitability. But the price looks different against the profit expected for fiscal 2026 and fiscal 2027. So what are UnitedHealth investors betting on.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=235745f2ec56182ee07c85a38d1c9a880f6d5ddce34e70ce68a6175f09891376\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790705719,\"headline\":\"Here's How Much $100 Invested In UnitedHealth Group 15 Years Ago Would Be Worth Today\",\"id\":142519869,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/07/10/valuestock_1.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"UNH\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth Group (NYSE:UNH) has outperformed the market over the past 15 years by 1.78% on an annualized basis producing an average annual return of 15.28%. Currently, UnitedHealth Group has a market capitalization of\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=835bec3b7d55d0f1b91493aa27b901aa6a7942d47e71eff7055ee44fd86267d8\"}]"
