      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792380002,\"headline\":\"Amazon.com vs. Walmart: Which Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142992150,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon operates more as a tech company, while Walmart is more of a traditional retailer.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8b19d1717a0d909f6363222d686863c3f4fb2b1cff6f51dc036eeabdb9f7537c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792377013,\"headline\":\"OpenAI, Anthropic’s AI Lead Is ‘Very Perishable,’ IMD Professor Says: ‘You Don’t Need to Drive a Ferrari to Go to Walmart’\",\"id\":142992153,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"OpenAI and Anthropic may remain ahead of Chinese rivals in artificial intelligence and still find that technological lead worth less than expected, according to Howard Yu, LEGO Professor of Management and Innovation at IMD Business School. Asked about a roughly...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f3c21b9b15ab6d2c2155514d5e7ca74b19ec648f08be4dc979726c2bf9a4b8bb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792334550,\"headline\":\"Costco (COST) vs. Walmart (WMT): Which Retailing Giant Has a Wider Moat?\",\"id\":142987443,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Costco Wholesale Corporation (NASDAQ:COST) and Walmart Inc. (NASDAQ:WMT) have returned -0.71% and -5.38%, respectively, during the last six months, as of October 15. This compares to a 21.5% return for the Insider Monkey Billionaire Index and 15.74% for the State Street SPDR S\\u0026P 500 ETF Trust. Costco and Walmart have been ahead of the competition […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f62f319634271df24eb48ae2b11f1c81449727934b56e92b0bb9be8805596ebb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792259814,\"headline\":\"Discount grocery chain closing all stores as bargain grocers struggle\",\"id\":142962600,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Best Bargains has entered a Chapter-7 bankruptcy style receivership and its not alone in closing locations.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c92b0ec586b198d340fba90990d47fcae50d8995f1f9da9129b96e5b8b147a62\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792242180,\"headline\":\"Walmart takes aim at Costco with a new shopping perk\",\"id\":142960715,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Consumers now have yet another reason to choose Walmart over Costco.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5b41114e7c70c12f2b9217080b3093e72d984c2943fd0af935f583a4e00ee9d1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792228500,\"headline\":\"FTC mails $9.8 million to 65,000 Walmart wire transfer customers — here's how to check if you're owed a refund\",\"id\":142959591,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Back in 2022, the FTC sued Walmart for allegedly failing to prevent wire fraud. It’s one of the easiest ways for scammers to run away with your money — find out how they do it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f5ee1470a8bb0ccdef1af70c37350b4e1a7a0c81c5c6c44f22f25da14761bb66\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792225571,\"headline\":\"In 2008, The “Walmart Recession Signal” Neared A Record As The Market Collapsed. One Economist Says It Is Starting To Rise Again\",\"id\":142959592,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A market signal that peaked as the financial system collapsed in 2008 is climbing again, and one economist says it points directly at what the Federal Reserve does next.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0ab8e2917bd37b532aef98b6df9be271e8a581c0154098c1e51400db5a1c0a37\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792196489,\"headline\":\"Should You Pick Walmart Stock Over Its Competitors?\",\"id\":142953914,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart (WMT) stock trades at 42.5 times earnings. Among the six retailers in its peer group, only Costco Wholesale is priced higher. Walmart ranks lower on business performance than on price. Over the latest four fiscal quarters, Walmart sits third out of six on revenue growth and fourth on operating margin. So how does Walmart's price look beside the rival that grows fastest.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=328d5a8c17fd1df2c3c22ac9ef81688ac17e27d6e362a1d20b16def1d23772d9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792181622,\"headline\":\"How Benefit Expansion At Walmart (WMT) Has Changed Its Investment Story\",\"id\":142950833,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In October 2026, Deutsche Bank upgraded Walmart after the retailer expanded employee healthcare benefits, including more than 250 free prescription drugs and up to 12 weeks of paid NICU leave, while highlighting growth in higher margin areas such as advertising, marketplace services, and membership income. The combination of richer worker benefits and a heavier mix of fee based businesses points to Walmart leaning on people and higher margin profit pools rather than pure price cuts to...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b1930a183a2513fad2c5a813e18c5cab934196fb51904396e60516b89be67575\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179794,\"headline\":\"9 Dow Jones Stocks Make Bullish Moves In A Defensive Market Rotation\",\"id\":142950007,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A week that tested the financial markets showed the resilience of Dow Jones stocks. Apple and Coca-Cola were among nine standouts.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=af9cc9e28f3a10ea2145e9aa2ce346b5f10ea949ca6edd0654727a5baaf6a007\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792174068,\"headline\":\"Final Trade: C, LLY, WMT, SMH\",\"id\":142962423,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108422008-17921882241792188222-49044995562-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792188223\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"The final trades of the day with CNBC's Melissa Lee and the 'Fast Money' traders.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8af390d8fc02bc1c650408bdf0eef2061adb7634af04187dca85fc5838646805\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169470,\"headline\":\"Walmart wins in a high-inflation environment, says D.A. Davidson's Michael Baker\",\"id\":142962430,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108421490-17921824401792182437-49043490433-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792182439\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Michael Baker, Managing Director and Senior Research Analyst at D.A. Davidson, joins 'Closing Bell Overtime' to talk Walmart's recent expansion areas, its valuation compared to other retailers, risks to the stock, and more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dfc6fe36d766b3d5013c50b22d35169ccb7f8d43e0e39f0d496f8fee42c56378\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167601,\"headline\":\"Home Depot vs. Walmart: Which Consumer Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142949114,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Home Depot trades at a lower forward earnings multiple and carries more debt relative to equity than Walmart, which has grown revenue faster and raised its fiscal 2027 earnings outlook.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=04dbd62fd11f5e9fc1967d6ba5c29adf227b47a953d8faf52b789ea4c11dde38\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792162560,\"headline\":\"Is COST a Buy as Strong Growth Meets a Premium Earnings Valuation?\",\"id\":142949115,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Costco's strong sales growth, loyal membership base and digital gains support its outlook, but a premium valuation and margin pressures call for patience.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=21f23e28e5c3c875bc592e9a02125b3f79114aaefdf70ec579f51abc3604251b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792156440,\"headline\":\"What the Latest Fed Decision Means for Costco, Walmart, Target, and Home Depot\",\"id\":142945602,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Higher interest rates bring different risks and opportunities for four leading retail stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=13d5102f50b104f7a5282db9a9b24f975e076527ffee19237a3e4a3ce8a00bf6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154756,\"headline\":\"Amazon Ads: The E-Commerce Search Monolith vs. Walmart Connect: The In-Store Data Goldmine\",\"id\":142945521,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon and Walmart both run booming ad businesses, but they are selling completely different things to advertisers and the gap between them is widening fast. Which model survives the next wave of retail competition?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=85c41d04f1047b34a444a903bc516b01f848b6209e37d3690882465d16442eb6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154736,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Agrees on Amazon and Can’t Agree on Tesla. The Targets Show Why\",\"id\":142945522,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Analysts have nearly united behind one mega-cap while remaining deeply split on the other, and the price targets reveal exactly why these two stocks belong in completely different conversations.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eb960e8c6c8b91492bb10227fe4b1968c39fa9b979da23fc86c5705d9721b807\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792152049,\"headline\":\"Here’s How Much You Would Have Made Owning Walmart Stock In The Last 20 Years\",\"id\":142961336,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/07/10/valuestock_3.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Walmart (NASDAQ:WMT) has outperformed the market over the past 20 years by 1.2% on an annualized basis producing an average annual return of 10.17%. Currently, Walmart has a market capitalization of $921.58 billion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7352e05aef74f3993f6c080d4094039ad152b85478eeea2103766daddd04dfd2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792151752,\"headline\":\"Walmart’s Total Return From 5 Milestones: Jet.com to the All-Time High\",\"id\":142944751,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Five Walmart milestones generated five very different outcomes for investors who bought on the headline. Which entry turned $1,000 into nearly $6,000, and which one left buyers underwater despite years of patience?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=54a53e9510795e2a973309a0803f7e1069c6bd7c4224bacf48edc3e4332453c4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792148580,\"headline\":\"Walmart, Target face a new price problem as costs surge\",\"id\":142944242,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Keeping bargains alive may become much harder.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1261ef0d20b2a232b6203a8d4bf024c05fbb2a6d48a762c59ac4f877cb5aa52a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792146656,\"headline\":\"Walmart Stock Pops Following Deutsche Bank Upgrade\",\"id\":142945604,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Walmart StockPrice change for Walmart stock in the last 6 months: -6%$WMT Stock Price as of Oct. 15: $11852-Week High: $135$WMT Stock Price Target: $127What Happened?Walmart (WMT:NASDAQ) is getting a lift after Deutsche Bank upgraded it from Neutral to Buy on Thursday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4116fb5eb3626e0dc6450f9fca18d2a7877b48a9d6b21f5937a1b805404cce9a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792146600,\"headline\":\"Sam's Club beats Costco, Walmart and Target on Halloween candy prices — here's the full breakdown\",\"id\":142944243,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Keeping trick-or-treaters happy this Halloween could be downright terrifying for your budget.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8d06b12cb332ed9f973eea873f923c656b51016b3f8264f4822784bbc3038073\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792123800,\"headline\":\"Our BJ’s Wholesale Club Pick Is Playing Out. The Stock Has More Upside.\",\"id\":142929240,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BJ’s has outperformed rivals Costco and Walmart since Barron’s picked it in January.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2518e7af15a83b840440661d18de918c58502f8b805a73f026694a6f4c03db78\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792119002,\"headline\":\"Kraft Heinz vs. Monster Beverage: Which Consumer Goods Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142928566,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"One trades at 11x forward earnings with $4.6 billion in operating cash flow; the other is nearly debt-free with 23% net margins.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6eb74a5a7589acb131ff0c49cfec02516e584c5d09b7a7660cc8c4fa4dfb916d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792113289,\"headline\":\"Walmart (WMT) Gains On Deutsche Bank Upgrade, Is The Stock Fully Priced?\",\"id\":142927177,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart (WMT) drew fresh attention after a Deutsche Bank upgrade coincided with the retailer announcing broader free prescription coverage and new paid leave benefits for U.S. workers, sharpening investor focus on its defensive role. The upgrade landed on top of an already strong run, with a 7-day share price return of 6.61% and a 30-day share price return of 9.05% pushing Walmart to US$117.87. A 1-year total shareholder return of 11.64% and multi year double digit total returns indicate...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f51113a0e7a4fa2dd2e0f101b7198ba2f6702a9d5f08b94be4425d622cc11c62\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792108980,\"headline\":\"Walmart, Target, and Kroger face troubling shoplifting trend\",\"id\":142924817,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Home Depot is also in the crosshairs as new data raises questions about what actually stops theft.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1882007920f4b71d7a330cb635e64bfdfe34c121cf3d5bcc660ee5c60a214a2a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792097460,\"headline\":\"This week in 5 numbers: Workers would spend up to $2,500 on their own training\",\"id\":142922280,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Here’s a roundup of numbers from the last week — including how many jobs robots physically can complete on a cost-competitive basis.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c03ca8d071dc7d8f1ab5828985f93037a8d1436beeea57661f8e9aa4abf79187\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792093698,\"headline\":\"These Consumer Stocks Are Getting a Lift as Investors Rotate Out of Tech\",\"id\":142922224,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Some beaten-down consumer names are getting a boost as investors pull back from tech stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1b90389409d496dcbfedd82b3f1231a66ec9b755d2ebe8e5724fc573338f0b54\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792092916,\"headline\":\"Walmart Stock Climbs as Deutsche Bank Says It’s Time to Buy\",\"id\":142922281,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart shares are on the rise after a fresh vote of confidence from Deutsche Bank.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e591b1bad671ee9d545a0d026d83a8152c26fdc343095992e83165c26a659b7e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792092273,\"headline\":\"What Changed In eBay's Story?\",\"id\":142921342,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors are paying a premium for eBay (EBAY). The stock currently trades at 4.3 times its sales over the past twelve months, compared to 3.1 for the S\\u0026P 500. Justifying that valuation requires tracking a recent shift in corporate messaging. Back in April 2025, during the fiscal Q1 2025 call, management emphasized the uncertainty that tariffs and trade policy changes created for eBay's sellers and buyers. That rhetoric has faded. So what has management been talking up instead.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5e02a069dcd2f702eb8b64b54a9f0fb855b4d5cd1bae221b430d595d2a8d7907\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792090080,\"headline\":\"Why This Analyst Thinks Walmart Stock Is a Buy After Its Worst Day in 5 Years\",\"id\":142921711,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart’s growing marketplace, advertising, and membership businesses could lift margins and help drive shares higher, Deutsche Bank says.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d6892f6b11ac6a383a9c610ff1d1c1bf320db0f0e66966ee1613f5dd8e29b7c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792088996,\"headline\":\"Am I getting an FTC refund this month? Here's where to look\",\"id\":142921395,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Federal Trade Commission issues refunds for consumers in certain cases. Are you receiving any of these October payments?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5339b7110b3ae44edb9dd9af7d8b4382eeb57880aa76442973eb4f578adfc60f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792088403,\"headline\":\"What Would Flat Store Sales Do To Home Depot Stock?\",\"id\":142921343,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors who own Home Depot (HD) worry that sales at existing stores will stop growing. That worry is hardly far-fetched. On August 18, the home improvement retailer reported that comparable sales, its measure for existing stores, rose 1.7% in the quarter, with just 1.3% growth in its U.S. stores. That same day, management reaffirmed its forecast for fiscal 2026, which puts comparable sales growth at 0% to 2%. A flat year sits at the bottom of that range. What would a flat year actually cost Ho\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5ef9ec66c096a85b44a196db67c47c3acc1e3d73958a0e2051d5c11a7be81835\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792086310,\"headline\":\"Target, Walmart, Other Discounters Make Bullish Moves Amid Plunging Yields, AI Exodus\",\"id\":142920374,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Target, Walmart and other discount retailers are flashing buy signals or other bullish moves as Treasury yields and AI plays dive.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0b874b0cdc1af4fd0c03d986e6895dae9e247c90a8da64b4c43120f61cbf9016\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792085894,\"headline\":\"Call of the Day: Deutsche Bank upgrades Walmart\",\"id\":142948750,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108416437-17920999671792099964-49023278083-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792099966\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"The 'Fast Money' traders talk Deutsche Bank upgrading Walmart to a 'buy'.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7e45a5657a253660e69018cf349ec718ca4840b36e4dd4a39b711fa15bd3dd63\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792084827,\"headline\":\"Why Walmart (WMT) Stock Is Up Today\",\"id\":142920375,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of retail behemoth Walmart (NASDAQ:WMT) jumped 2.7% in the morning session after Deutsche Bank upgraded the company to Buy from Hold and raised its price target to $136 from $113.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=37507ab052af0f7f140ba4545ddb96e53672ea40c52a230fff1da34dd6e9c948\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792084342,\"headline\":\"Is Costco Stock Increasing Your Market Risk?\",\"id\":142920315,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Costco Wholesale (COST) is a $436 billion retailer. Anyone buying the stock likely already holds a portfolio built around the S\\u0026P 500. A share that sinks alongside the broader market only multiplies a bad day, while one charting its own course can cushion the blow. So when the market has a bad day, what does Costco do to your money.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a1918d073e8b505ffa9b6d42a676dfc52dcc9e9787e1af5f0ed47670d51eb07d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792082413,\"headline\":\"These dow jones stocks are moving in today's session\",\"id\":142919827,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay updated with the movements of the dow jones index in the middle of the day on Thursday. Discover which stocks are leading as top gainers and losers in today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=18dc9eae377f70c9060ce92d31795980c6c5b9529453a1aa557a7ac15259d50c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792082160,\"headline\":\"Walmart plans to offer employees free prescriptions, paid NICU leave\",\"id\":142920371,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The news comes as employers prepare for nearly double-digit health insurance price increases and many plan to shift some of those costs to workers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=890a72558eafdc9b5f64572006a0ef841072b6358f6cc7943ea843b429eb62df\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792081559,\"headline\":\"Walmart expands health benefits with free GLP-1 drugs\",\"id\":142920372,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart is expanding employee health benefits with 250-plus free medications, including GLP-1 drugs for eligible workers with Type 2 diabetes.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d2df7ebfc8bedfffe207d85edee6bfba8843f8cdcab4e39fe8bf949ab872fc2b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792081117,\"headline\":\"Has Target Stock Become A Different Bet?\",\"id\":142920317,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Target (TGT) stock trades at 16.1 times earnings, representing a discount to the S\\u0026P 500 at 22.7. Yet evaluating that valuation requires a clear understanding of the retailer's shifting priorities. During the first-quarter call in May 2025, executives talked about navigating an ever-changing tariff landscape. By the latest call in August 2026, tariffs had turned from headwind to windfall, and management spent much of the call on traffic and technology. So how much of that new emphasis do the num\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=479a071d21f6dfe114aafe3533d4eb9311d3f52771a712df7aed62c3e8374bdb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792077720,\"headline\":\"Walmart Stock Gets an Upgrade as Analyst Sees More Room to Run\",\"id\":142920319,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart’s growing marketplace, advertising, and membership businesses could lift margins and help drive shares higher, Deutsche Bank says.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b6ea6ccd222c153158706d9d909f20a64a9eed0288a418f03bc80054942da8da\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792074903,\"headline\":\"These S\\u0026P500 stocks are gapping in today's session\",\"id\":142918338,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Gap_Stocks_Small_free_ad767b11cf.webp\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Wondering what's happening in today's session regarding gap up and gap down stocks? Explore the S\\u0026P500 index on Thursday to uncover th