ps://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Steve Shee stepped into a vice president role in the division around the same time as the retail media arm’s leader departed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aaf59da3143883311da0b5765fcceea09f0d276dbca7aa5b00466b8926251bc2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792072380,\"headline\":\"Can Walmart's Faster Shopping Options Boost Holiday Sales Growth?\",\"id\":142919287,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart's faster pickup, flexible deliveries and digital innovations are likely to drive holiday sales growth, supported by rising e-commerce demand and Walmart+ engagement.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5986c9edcfee00bb004a1fe3103f8c0b500a660dd14d07163dfb31c3cd5e1594\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792072227,\"headline\":\"Walmart is winning consumers with its low price strategy\",\"id\":142916351,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The 8:30 Hosts Julie Hyman, Pras Subramanian, and Jake Conley discuss Walmart as a stock to watch for investors as the company wins over consumers with a low-price strategy and new investments in its workforce benefits.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=87e5464ec2d4399d984d263243c5180689a7afce0d87d665bdbc187f142adeb8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792072090,\"headline\":\"Walmart stock moves higher after Deutsche Bank upgrades to Buy, raises price target\",\"id\":142916352,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Higher inflation bodes well for America's biggest retailer.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=571605b906d65f05a3980466fa140abd487adb9c6a0dbd490d7d