ub Serves Up Its Largest-Ever Thanksgiving Meal, Feeding 16 for Less Than $10 a Person*\",\"id\":142912657,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BENTONVILLE, Ark., October 15, 2026--Sam’s Club, a leading membership retail club, today unveiled its largest Thanksgiving holiday meal ever, designed to feed 16 people for less than $10 per person. Even while holding the per-person price to last year’s, the 2026 Thanksgiving meal adds more items and is curated to be prepared in about two hours.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0eaf3567fda3e3aea2751620bab56d5c2483ec06b1517626d167a5915a830f95\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792061818,\"headline\":\"Walmart Gets Deutsche Bank Upgrade – Analyst Sees More Favorable Setup Heading Into 2027\",\"id\":142912644,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"According to The Fly, Deutsche Bank expects inflation to strengthen Walmart’s value proposition and support further market-share gains.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=117dbdc8b0b2f578a6c2bb58ef7f0eaa15a6f5761aad356e388085dea08b56b9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792059543,\"headline\":\"Premarket Movers: AAPL Gains On China AI Approval Report — Why WMT, NFLX Stocks Are Also Rising\",\"id\":142912369,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple has been preparing to introduce its AI platform in mainland China following a lengthy regulatory delay.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d8141f3a09a78cb40928b8f365eaeaaba4af64c1f7ef29e740a525d6c45dcf0e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792058400,\"headline\":\"Serena Williams’ Venture Fund-Backed Trace Launches App\",\"id\":142909084,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_