on cost and preserve principal.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2eb132da1e00b89ebe033b6e08337f524981d6412c48c58cd5cbcdcc18f6afed\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791985144,\"headline\":\"Walmart Stock Moves Higher: What's Happening?\",\"id\":142917956,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Walmart-Beats-Estimates.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Walmart shares are rising Wednesday. Investors appear to favor consumer staples and other non-AI names while most of the market falls.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3098a7240f1d6b7f34560d747d4a1f5fd82a8c03da5d8665289e85462a8059a1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791984900,\"headline\":\"OLLI's New $500M Buyback Authorization Signals Cash Flow Confidence\",\"id\":142885174,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"OLLI's new $500M buyback authorization reflects strong cash flow and financial flexibility as shares outperform the industry and trade at a discount.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f5d778e21276c804247c1dff7aa21556389c81a15be1796905c4344ee33d97a9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791976493,\"headline\":\"8 Of 11 Sectors Fall Wednesday As Defensives Lead\",\"id\":142915769,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Stock-Market-Trading-Chart-And-Analyzing.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Three sectors are higher and eight are lower in Wednesday\\u0026#39;s regular session, with defensive sectors holding the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with no single sector pulling away from the group.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2b743e7a2c154c563c192ced156b0a277e5f5114d04f6476217f58acbd737cb7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791975060,\"headli