ory\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791950460,\"headline\":\"Walmart Adds GLP-1 Coverage for Some Employees\",\"id\":142886459,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"America’s largest private sector employer told workers that it plans to expand free insurance coverage to more than 250 prescription drugs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8d94539c151844819129a4691ff1315712444da3bad6e794ad07686f4965c862\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791948000,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Industrial Average Monitor Update - A Look At 30 U.S. Large-Caps\",\"id\":142869843,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1196086989/image_1196086989.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Visible Alpha consensus expects the Dow Jones Industrial Average to deliver an 18.7% weighted price return in the medium term. Read more here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=310ef25895cc39730bc02d53261c2e29cfcc1b7eb4f0498474d0e9c56b8614e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791946800,\"headline\":\"Rotation Away From AI Lately\",\"id\":142869036,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2258806445/image_2258806445.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"There's been a big divergence between large caps and small caps lately.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=163e2d3002b77bf45cc2b11b0d0cea2616186f17f76a7f3662022b311546fe52\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791944220,\"headline\":\"Walmart, Target, Dollar General make noticeable changes to stores\",\"id\":142863176,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"From revamping stores to introducing new technology, retailers are doing it all to attract customers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f17bf95ae5cfb561d5b5d8b758e0bd1f205bc8a51777d6943f0e410a76a29026\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791929101,\"headline\":\"Home Depot vs. Walmart: Comparing Scale and Revenue Seasonality\",\"id\":142855349,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart's revenue runs 4-5x larger, but Home Depot's seasonal swings tell a different story about business cycles and investor opportunity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0e380073ce40b597ac06afc5902614e87f5692404ad2fc996a2326453edbe3f7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791921675,\"headline\":\"Investors Are Paying More for Walmart Than Amazon. Here’s Why That Doesn’t Add Up.\",\"id\":142854343,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart Inc. (NASDAQ:WMT) has opened a fulfillment center of more than 900,000 square feet in Stockton, California. The site uses automation and machine learning to cut the usual 12-step order process down to five. It will also employ about 1,000 people. The company says its next-generation fulfillment centers, of which Stockton is the fifth, will […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d5833004d7cd7aaa4733e999550228cc1b8c3aff811ae6827d3ad5c5a30297d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791921359,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Consumer Stocks Mixed Late Afternoon\",\"id\":142853805,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Consumer stocks were mixed late Tuesday afternoon with the State Street Consumer Staples Select Sect\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9facc16aee4d077951240eb797c85956524cc928ec51e653db637ddf317b746d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791920280,\"headline\":\"Top Analyst Reports for Walmart, Visa \\u0026 Novo Nordisk\",\"id\":142854418,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart, Visa and Novo Nordisk headline today's analyst reports, with digital growth, payment innovation and obesity-drug demand offset by rising costs and competition.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=550075e6dfb15dd128f757f65ee436bf0a160f8f818e3674390e48b9539c76ad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791918000,\"headline\":\"The Five Largest Holdings in the RANK ETF After Its Latest Rebalance\",\"id\":142853215,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Defiance KSM TipRanks Analyst ETF (RANK) has completed its latest quarterly reconstitution and rebalance, which took effect after the close on September 21, 2026 with notable changes among its largest holdings. RANK seeks to track the performance, before fees and expenses, of the TipRanks US Momentum Analysts iNDEX. The index is calculated and administered by VettaFi LLC (a TMX Group company) or its affiliates and is constructed utilizing proprietary data provided by TipRanks Ltd. The index\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=567de157dc5959bc72fbaf24453fcb5b90c56837a4b89a235c014dfebf7272d6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791917220,\"headline\":\"Car Parts, Farm Goods Offer Latest Read on Consumers\",\"id\":142854428,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Americans, despite sour outlooks, haven’t slowed their spending.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c822a5ed9dd4dbea98ad12e544db73b998ca2dd5761624f786573625eaa7be83\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791914402,\"headline\":\"The Surprising Way Artificial Intelligence (AI) Chatbots Are Giving Walmart's Business a Boost\",\"id\":142853465,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chatbots appear to really like Walmart.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0f590eadb11b10b773d0c766f7f567bad6d461c1600763e5e613a03767f1f964\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791914171,\"headline\":\"Big bank earnings, who's using Meta’s Muse, and dealing with elevated mortgage rates\",\"id\":142852397,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Market Hang panel discusses the latest round of big bank earnings, who's using Meta’s (META) Muse, and how to deal with the pressures of elevated mortgage rates. Today's panel includes host Gerber Kawasaki Wealth \\u0026 Investment Management CEO Ross Gerber, iCapital chief investment strategist Sonali Basak, Politico senior reporter Sam Sutton, and Futurum CEO Daniel Newman.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d10ae88748389f47f3c6198c49a208a79e09e6bf8617f21a4ef2ed4f287552d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791911521,\"headline\":\"Why JPMorgan can 'do well' in any rate environment\",\"id\":142852426,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Gerber Kawasaki Wealth \\u0026 Investment Management CEO Ross Gerber and his panel of experts weigh in on the first wave of Big Bank earnings, especially JPMorgan's (JPM).Today's panel includes iCapital chief investment strategist Sonali Basak, Politico senior reporter Sam Sutton, and Futurum CEO Daniel Newman.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5d3981645e5a727d333f51c47c6638412095a3d504d129f05e3317e40009877d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791905819,\"headline\":\"Walmart to cover GLP-1s, insulin at no cost for workers in benefits push - report\",\"id\":142851150,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Walmart Inc (NASDAQ:WMT) plans to cover more than 250 prescription medications at no cost for its workforce, according to a staff memo from Chief People Officer Donna Morris reported by Bloomberg. The expansion includes popular diabetes treatments like Novo Nordisk’s Ozempic and Eli Lilly’s Mounjaro for employees with Type 2 diabetes, subject to prior approval.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2ff4753f6076df55fb644a028f9dfaca3053e50f1086a97994376eefb51d31a1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791904084,\"headline\":\"Kroger to lay off 3,000 corporate employees over 3 years as it leans into artificial intelligence\",\"id\":142851187,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Grocery store chain Kroger said it will lay off 3,000 corporate employees over the next three years as it ramps up its use of artificial intelligence to streamline operations.“Technology is reshaping what’s possible,” CEO Greg Foran wrote in a memo to employees on Monday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=103d776b7584b566262ba36bb0a96cf633176b708bee18d79fe10f69fe7f1631\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791902963,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy Target Stock For Its Cash?\",\"id\":142851071,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the last twelve months, Target (TGT) generated free cash flow equal to 6.4% of its market value, against 4.4% for the median S\\u0026P 500 company. A cash yield sitting that far above the median signals one of two things: a fundamentally sound business priced cheaply, or a company investors expect to shrink. So what are you actually getting when you buy Target for its cash.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=89483903f3a4522bcb1db26b6f12850ee32b6f94599ff88b97e67919fbfe0788\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791902639,\"headline\":\"Albertsons demands over $9bn from Kroger following merger collapse\",\"id\":142851072,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A two-week court hearing is set to start later this month to establish legal responsibility for the collapse of the $24.6bn buyout.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e832354ec9f0e69442574416b750496f1be17674f9c07f4c134cf3daac2f08db\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791900872,\"headline\":\"Kroger To Cut 37% Of Corporate Jobs–Another AI Win\",\"id\":142851186,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Kroger just announced sweeping corporate layoffs, and the company is pointing directly at AI as the reason. The question now is whether this marks a turning point for white-collar work across every major American industry.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7df831737a0f17cf6be592ea4779b8fc4148636077d27b2eb624866ab0382caf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791898501,\"headline\":\"Kraft Heinz vs. Coca-Cola: Which Consumer Goods Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142848706,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Kraft Heinz trades at a steep discount but carries turnaround risks; Coca-Cola commands a premium for its 27% net margins and consistent cash generation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1ef40912dd33bb6d8389c90a2c01bfc1d3cb63d00cb20321188eef72aba03191\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791896839,\"headline\":\"Walmart to cover some GLP-1s, inhalers and insulin for employees at no cost as it expands benefits\",\"id\":142852031,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108348728-1786564871002-gettyimages-2289555028-golba-dailylif260803_npx6m.jpeg?v=1787168903\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Walmart will offer Novo's Ozempic and Lilly's Mounjaro without charge for people with Type 2 diabetes after a new prior authorization. \",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f0b7c5e365616fd2529d4164ac5efcb8f7acdbbb996cad677ed640843182ce7e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791896400,\"headline\":\"Atomic Names Chad Brinton General Manager to Help Enterprise Planning Teams Turn Supply Plans into Results\",\"id\":142848704,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Atomic, the AI-native supply chain planning platform, today announced that Chad Brinton has joined the company as General Manager, Strategic Accounts. Brinton brings more than 15 years of supply chain and operations leadership, spanning management consulting, e-commerce analytics at Walmart, and operations for some of the fastest-growing direct-to-consumer brands of the last decade.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f6a89caa1de6b78937b64170a8cb72ae0cf816f57b5048c8cb3889860eb15bde\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791896340,\"headline\":\"Walmart Trading at 36.32X Forward P/E: How to Play WMT Stock?\",\"id\":142851184,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart's 36.32X forward P/E reflects strong digital growth and market share gains, but rising costs and margin pressures raise questions about WMT stock's upside.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dccb32607c83e7b1f7fbba7c25ae1fef2123039705218965007534079fa5e0b8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791896328,\"headline\":\"Amazon, Walmart Face New AI Shopping Test: Will Chatbots Recommend Them?\",\"id\":142882314,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/13/Christmas-Online-Shopping-Top-View--Fema.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Semrush\\u0026#39;s AI Visibility Index highlights how AI recommendations could reshape product discovery for Amazon and Walmart investors.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9109fd49c04b10079b8d6e50eec57c1fe741c0cf498fbbe93ccc3939cc8802ea\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791895510,\"headline\":\"Two Reasons Keep Me Buying Amazon Without Fear\",\"id\":142848563,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AWS is accelerating while spending $200 billion, and the math behind it either makes this the most confident buy of the decade or a very expensive lesson in timing.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=963c3915c3a0212b98fe55722862f25d3afb1c7dbdcd508f02eae8895192c606\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791894166,\"headline\":\"Walmart’s ‘Next-Gen’ CA Fulfillment Center to Boost Shipping Speed and Volume\",\"id\":142848705,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart has opened a 900,000-square-foot facility in Stockton, Calif. that it says represents the latest step in the total transformation of its supply chain.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=81be8c5f274501b8197b0bd4836afc56d017d9b6a23ef85853794d5833f0498c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791886453,\"headline\":\"e.l.f. Beauty vs. Monster Beverage: Which Consumer Goods Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142844807,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Monster posted record quarterly revenue in Q2 2026 with growth across every region. e.l.f. Beauty delivered its 30th consecutive quarter of sales growth but faces rising costs and margin pressure.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6afa99142a6b9a1b2019e85fb94241248c320ae1cfddc7a3246d452cd66eebc6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791884158,\"headline\":\"'Walmart to Cover Some GLP-1s, Insulin at No Cost for Workers' - Bloomberg\",\"id\":142848353,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-13/walmart-to-cover-some-glp-1s-insulin-at-no-cost-for-workers\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=555826c5242344f5f0fe5ab12dd0a21c5bdd7a69ba9ec09878d547ef21f88f58\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791846830,\"headline\":\"Kroger To Reportedly Eliminate 37% Of Corporate Workforce In Operations Overhaul\",\"id\":142825326,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Kroger Co. plans to eliminate roughly 3,000 corporate positions over the next three years to streamline operations, cut costs, and redirect investments toward store-level pricing and service.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5341b8df92c053ac7373acfbaddf756a1a2209bb452be8294e218e39933335e1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791844720,\"headline\":\"Is Meta's Next Big Thing Already Here?\",\"id\":142825284,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms (META) stock returned 10.4% over the past month, outperforming the 1.8% return for the S\\u0026P 500. Investors have been optimistic about the company following the release of a new app on September 8, 2026. Nearly all of Meta's revenue still comes from ads, but this recent launch may signal the start of a broader business model. So what did Meta launch, and how far has it gotten.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=43af6a05122dda33755ff1e245f9e8d3f98bd5b9a2e834efad4024ff57ba4d82\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791843771,\"headline\":\"Kroger to cut 3K corporate jobs over the next 3 years\",\"id\":142825287,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The grocer has “more layers, more handoffs and more overhead than we need,” CEO Greg Foran wrote in an internal memo.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8a522d896a912dae34dd0aade5bb246a2c485f7b23f74e31da38bd4919f3d687\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791839814,\"headline\":\"Kroger to cut over one-third of corporate workforce in major restructuring\",\"id\":142824538,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- The Kroger Co. (NYSE: KR) has announced plans to eliminate approximately 3,000 corporate positions over the next three years. The sweeping reduction is part of a broader strategic initiative led by Chief Executive Officer Greg Foran to streamline the grocery chain’s operations and enhance organizational agility.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f60e72e6e096383b84fe0c2e4e660eeecec01c2fa4f74d008bf383521e32454b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791839345,\"headline\":\"Is Walmart Stock Increasing Your Market Risk?\",\"id\":142824487,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors often hold Walmart (WMT) stock alongside funds that already track the S\\u0026P 500. Walmart is a retailer of groceries and everyday essentials worth about $886 billion. A stock that moves in lockstep with the broader index simply compounds existing bets, while one that charts its own course helps spread risk. So what does Walmart stock do on the market's good days and bad days.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=341981556baa45defaad2499685c52f7bc1c52fa27a1f8317a9c01e46efd92cd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791838459,\"headline\":\"What Is The One Risk Every Home Depot Investor Should Know?\",\"id\":142824488,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Home Depot (HD) have lost 22% over the past twelve months, significantly lagging the 17.0% return of the S\\u0026P 500. Total sales are still growing, up 5.7% in the fiscal second quarter. Yet during Home Depot’s August 18, 2026 earnings call, executives described a sector-wide pressure that remains out of their hands. So what is that pressure, and where does it come from.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6d46c94f1085d978dfc1cf3692f7c5dc22d0032430e14f39480141c76ca0ae5c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791837906,\"headline\":\"Walmart (WMT) Rises As Market Takes a Dip: Key Facts\",\"id\":142824537,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In the most recent trading session, Walmart (WMT) closed at $113.08, indicating a +1.55% shift from the previous trading day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c4f5ca4944d6cc1aa39235a6683d2e678e8916128bf8870aaa7b5d9101b86bc0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791837151,\"headline\":\"Kroger Plans to Slash 37% of Corporate Jobs in Next Three Years\",\"id\":142825327,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Kroger Co. plans to cut more than one-third of its corporate headcount as the grocer seeks to simplify operations and compete more effectively under new Chief Executive Officer Greg Foran.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cb5595db4b8085a6cdb803e3d0d1e986ca2242bd62d8f9f99c11078d36ec96ae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791833337,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy Target Stock At This Price?\",\"id\":142823632,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Target (TGT) currently trade at 15.9 times earnings, below the 21.9 multiple for the median S\\u0026P 500 company, though one-time tariff refunds flatter that figure. This valuation gap persists even after the stock returned 80% over the past twelve months. The disconnect suggests one of two scenarios: either a fundamentally sound retailer remains on sale, or the broader market doubts Target can sustain its recent results. So what does a buyer actually get at this price.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f0ed77ab805a7c8e1eab98efece0d8cb00ca29f19ee6a87a9f5ddc5374d7aa8e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791832213,\"headline\":\"Uncover the latest developments among dow jones stocks in today's session.\",\"id\":142823404,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Curious about the top performers within the dow jones index one hour before the close of the markets on Monday? Dive into the list of today's session's top gainers and losers for a comprehensive overview.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=02ccc14928cac6b07e502b3a1349a262b04aa03aacb6c39874473bea74c00ca6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791830820,\"headline\":\"Walmart's billion-dollar robot push runs into trouble\",\"id\":142832184,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart is counting on warehouse robots to keep shelves stocked and orders moving, but technical problems and rising costs are complicating its plans.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=534fc7d8e743d2b73621b6787ffe978d3c7e52ae35e146f540d14be3d60fe360\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791828773,\"headline\":\"The bull market’s four-year run, EV demand, and interest rates threaten earnings\",\"id\":142823625,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Market Hang's panel discusses what comes next after the bull market's four-year run, how gas prices are impacting EV demand, and if interest rates are going to affect this quarter's earnings.Today's Market Hang panel consists of Gerber Kawasaki Wealth \\u0026 Investment Management CEO Ross Gerber, Yahoo Finance's Pras Subramanian, Kelly Intelligence founder Kevin Kelly, and Cleo Capital Managing Director Sarah Kunst.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8cb5fd11bb4ae12914c588b87c2df09bb0737fecb4a99ebf5d0bc186c1f71f40\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791828436,\"headline\":\"Final Trade: UNH, MCD, JPM, WMT\",\"id\":142852054,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108400288-17918427111791842708-48960464473-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1791842710\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"The final trades of the day with CNBC's Melissa Lee and the 'Fast Money' traders.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a0d2d45a1ead861a359bab71d98de2ae976916c813f13da2357882849dbda962\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791820800,\"headline\":\"Walmart and the Walmart Foundation Commit $1 Million to Support Communities Impacted by Hurricane Isaias\",\"id\":142822717,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BENTONVILLE, Ark., October 12, 2026--Walmart and the Walmart Foundation commit $1 million to Hurricane Isaias relief, providing meals, essential supplies and resources across Florida.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5acfbfd7a729b8f4c2fe2316bab274e918d8ed4d2e4935d8af96ed35db0c04ee\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791817740,\"headline\":\"Walmart's Fulfillment Center to Boost West Coast Delivery Reach\",\"id\":142822718,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart's new automated fulfillment center in California aims to accelerate West Coast deliveries, boost e-commerce efficiency and support growing online demand.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bcc52e384c72f235305b61c67a96f9b84ee8bb837646492310ec21a295d17b51\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791817645,\"headline\":\"What Cheaper Gas Would Mean For Costco’s Sales And Margins\",\"id\":142821537,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Costco Wholesale (COST) stock currently trades at 45.6 times earnings, compared with 21.9 for the S\\u0026P 500. Investors paying that price may be counting on growth. That growth has materialized, as September net sales rose 13.0% from a year earlier. However, gas hit $4.32 a gallon in mid-September, and those higher fuel costs add to Costco's sales. So how much of that growth would go if gas prices came back down.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f4f3146c04caa5ae01beec6607c141f094da0b920e5a40abcddd849b04a2685f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791817140,\"headline\":\"Costco's 19% September Digital Sales Growth Signals Strong Momentum\",\"id\":142822719,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Costco's digital sales surge 19% in September 2026, extending strong fiscal 2026 momentum as expanded delivery options and personalization fuel growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b2e926f9d72f7e3ba64dc40e011f7ce9a14ee4bc326a9c0effa598bbc6d4fab4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791815820,\"headline\":\"Vizio ramps up creator-led programming in bid for CTV ad dollars\",\"id\":142821630,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Walmart-owned connected TV platform is also expanding premium programming partnerships and releasing an original film sponsored by Geico.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c383fb4bea2c5a5567f6c74a3dba531746d9509ba4d9d5ccbec5ae4642bb7b29\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791815560,\"headline\":\"Walmart opens ‘next gen’ California facility to boost West Coast fulfillment\",\"id\":142821628,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The 900,000-square-foot site is equipped with an automated storage and retrieval system to help increase order capacity to enable faster shipping.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1734a7856d4b0420f496e4cc9ef78d1ed4c48ec2672b890664f5c9c051ca7050\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791810042,\"headline\":\"58 Analysts, Zero Sells, 28% Upside: Amazon’s Setup Right Now\",\"id\":142819804,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street's analyst community has reached something close to a verdict on Amazon, and the bears are nowhere to be found. But the real question is whether AWS's $496 billion backlog and surging AI revenue can overcome a troubling free cash flow swing.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=712fdf8e61455769afdf7b956313c32f95a080023c176d029a4c8b2dfbb557e5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791808553,\"headline\":\"Can Ads and Subscriptions Justify Walmart’s (WMT) Premium Valuation?\",\"id\":142819928,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart’s shoppers come for low prices. Its shareholders are paying anything but. Investors now hand over about 38.59 times expected earnings for Walmart (NASDAQ:WMT), a higher price than the stock has averaged over the past five years and far above what the broader consumer staples sector commands. The business itself needs little introduction. Walmart sells […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d8241e93486e6158cbb759fcd22d675a2bd3368a16898de01bd421dc38b71f2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791804607,\"headline\":\"The $90 Social Security Payment Is a Tiny Stimulus. The Retiree Economy Is a Market Giant\",\"id\":142819930,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The viral $90 payment showing up for millions of Medicare beneficiaries is not large enough to move the U.S. economy. But the frenzy around it is revealing something investors should pay more attention to: older Americans are an enormous consumer...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1ea03bc84ab9d6cd41ab94828efbdf0f2de216171db9688aa1e406ac4cab7d78\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791803546,\"headline\":\"Walmart denies plans to use surveillance pricing patents\",\"id\":142818301,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The retailer holds patents describing personalized pricing based on customer data, but says it has no plans to deploy them\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6f759581e91b2a70cf939eb7e7d283916b37f92437dd2b7097dcc9225383c3a0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791802800,\"headline\":\"From Brooklyn to Home Depot, Walmart and Amazon: Mitch Gould's Retail Journey\",\"id\":142819037,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The third-generation retail distribution veteran reflects on a career helping consumer brands reach America's largest retailers and bringing products from manufacturers to consumers nationwide.BOCA RATON, FL / ACCESS Newswire / October 12, 2026 / From the home improvement aisles of Home Depot to the shelves of Walmart and the online marketplace of Amazon, Mitch Gould has spent decades helping consumer product companies navigate the American retail industry.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7236ca2e62050d6d09a64f4d69524934757f8221193b554985ab06e51f9ed9a5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791731220,\"headline\":\"T-Mobile plans to limit customer discounts with new phone plans\",\"id\":142806457,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"T-Mobile is reportedly planning a new approach to phone plans that changes how customers access some of its most valuable offers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=935413af5fc80fece46ed1e3a336cdbec5983f6d1e5d12e2f300de5c40b4acd7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791718200,\"headline\":\"The Grocery Shelf Battle Is Changing—Who Comes Out Ahead?\",\"id\":142819106,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Store brands are gaining unit share over national labels like McCormick as shoppers seek value, while Kroger and Walmart expand private-label lines to capture margin growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7795bd7d1ce0a13e1f0fd78e1e939bfb5a00238a799d5d7e0616ba7fd44a3eb3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791692328,\"headline\":\"Is Walmart (WMT) Taking Too Long To Make Supply Chain Automation Pay Off?\",\"id\":142798983,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart (NasdaqGS:WMT) is encountering major operational and financial hurdles in its supply chain automation rollout, including unreliable robotics. The retailer is committing significant capital to re engineer distribution centers around automated systems, pushing warehouse project costs higher. Automation related complexity is contributing to increased overhead, with added technical staff and training needs for warehouse operations. The setbacks in Walmart's supply chain automation...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=83c5e5eafd3c84ebd55c1fae2bf1c80aee03890e214511928f280c7d510d4538\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791680401,\"headline\":\"AI may change the price of your Big Mac and groceries — what this means for shoppers\",\"id\":142806836,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108369883-1790716626733-gettyimages-2297775464-mcdonaldsusesartificialintelligencetorecommendmenuprices008.jpeg?v=1791542053\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"As retailers turn to AI tools to streamline operations, experts warn that collecting more detailed consumer data increases the risk of personalized pricing.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=511790cd6f29761d2e728c081fa749a35ade6c2fca7d05c71a25df9f69012262\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791673620,\"headline\":\"Sam's Club is letting its 200,000 members decide what it sells\",\"id\":142795823,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart-owned warehouse chain is giving shoppers a say in its products, including some holiday favorites.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0e14049b21dbbeb2f0a5e023657effa3be6268095ce0e41101bce49a993054e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791667980,\"headline\":\"Walmart CEO pledges to avoid shady pricing practice\",\"id\":142795134,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The company promises to use its technology solely for good.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=308025ea61a82cbd46116e0b937a90d750a70bf6d242216adfeecb60d0804a0f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791648220,\"headline\":\"Walmart Stock Rose 7% in Seven Trading Days. Here’s What the WSJ’s Robot Report Means for the Stock by 2031\",\"id\":142793593,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Walmart StockCurrent Price: $111. 35Target Price (Mid): ~$152Street Target: ~$127Potential Total Return: ~36%Annualized IRR: ~7.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a7303cade58d197cf54a4bf80100e182c1a2e27475b55dc5897da8af85e0575d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791645060,\"headline\":\"Consumer AI agents could upend online shopping - but who really wins?\",\"id\":142792834,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bernstein sees payments as a potential winner - more online transactions, including smaller purchases, could benefit Visa, Mastercard and processors Stripe, Adyen and Checkout.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=05108653561dbb7e61e7f252c5f616d34ee8973bdeb6604db127b8d61c84894e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791641183,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Week Ahead: Gathering Election, Earnings Momentum\",\"id\":142792856,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A news-driven stock market will receive plenty of input in the coming week, as earnings season and election maneuvering gather momentum.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=52d496ae164b8e30604ca8969c4e7d6651bd2e60dfcf9b64032c4b9535fcf79e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791637232,\"headline\":\"CDs vs. Dividend Stocks: The Income Gap Could Be Bigger Than Retirees Think\",\"id\":142791143,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Retirees chasing income face a choice that looks simple on paper but hides a tax trap, a reinvestment problem, and a dividend cut risk that most income comparisons never mention.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cb8f75d075716826545a36eb0c4cb1c4d638f20281ad352a52b6f3da268df4bd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791596220,\"headline\":\"Procter \\u0026 Gamble could face new cost problem\",\"id\":142772368,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Evercore ISI flagged pressures facing the Tide and Pampers maker, which now must decide who absorbs the hit.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=575415760fe38b6fb3d4adc54245984efb07fad7755b7290365b6c03a9c06d87\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791587460,\"headline\":\"Why AI Loves Walmart\",\"id\":142767876,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI has its favorite shopping spots.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=99cba1dcb9eb4a24b5d0e209489618f82af3acecf8c859a718e491850ca5d541\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791587412,\"headline\":\"3 Consumer Staples Stocks With Pricing Power as Households Feel the Squeeze\",\"id\":142767877,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Households are feeling the squeeze as debt stress builds, yet spending on everyday essentials still shapes much of corporate America’s cash flow. That mix of pressure and resilience can create openings for investors who pay attention to how consumers actually live, not just what confidence surveys say. This article unpacks that story and then spotlights 3 Consumer Staples stocks exposed to these trends from our screener. The three Consumer Staples stocks below are just a short sample. The...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5bc5a177c9c7439318417ce2b2ce8832fed6ebbdac28ff54760394cdef640caf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791580716,\"headline\":\"Walmart vs. Costco: Why the Cheaper Earnings Stock Costs More for Cash Flow\",\"id\":142767121,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart Inc. (NASDAQ:WMT) and Costco Wholesale Corporation (NASDAQ:COST) compete for household spending through different models. Walmart combines stores, delivery, marketplaces and advertising. Costco relies on low merchandise markups and a paid membership relationship. Both can be resilient without being inexpensive. Trailing earnings cost investors about 39 times for Walmart and 45 times for Costco at […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2a303ac12a0a27d2e85b93eb39bb70544b176568c1e2018aafa954687f8c71f4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791577621,\"headline\":\"'Surveillance Pricing' Comes Under Scrutiny\",\"id\":142767122,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bloomberg's Max Chafkin, David Gura, and Jessica Karl join Scarlet Fu and Tom Keene on \\\"Bloomberg Money.\\\" They discuss the ongoing fight over 'surveillance pricing,' the use of consumer data to set prices by retailers, grocers and others. Walmart strenuously denies engaging in this tactic.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bd480759557826b0b068751068a265d5b81b4f856bf07b6b23294fe43867232c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791572411,\"headline\":\"Richest Americans Gained 19% in Wealth as Poorest Lost 56% Since 2022\",\"id\":142766272,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"America’s wealthiest households gained nearly $800,000 in median net worth over three years, while median wealth among the poorest quarter fell by more than half, new Federal Reserve data showed Friday. Between 2022 and 2025, inflation-adjusted median wealth among the...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e41ef7b7842e6b81d28197601b1a2f3ff2916488439418e8d4e549b4bea4d4fe\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791553309,\"headline\":\"Walmart activates automated e-commerce logistics center in California\",\"id\":142764052,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart is heavily investing in next-generation, automated fulfillment centers. The post Walmart activates automated e-commerce logistics center in California appeared first on FreightWaves.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a5e8033971684c106ff0ea6adad5b1577de082b8d1985edccdbb04d0b31e5efb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791547205,\"headline\":\"Here is What to Know Beyond Why Walmart Inc. (WMT) is a Trending Stock\",\"id\":142761597,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Zacks.com users have recently been watching Walmart (WMT) quite a bit. Thus, it is worth knowing the facts that could determine the stock's prospects.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d1de7c7af59bdbda62ce60053f59e5cfef8e2bd934849d47853eb20a1ef4876d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791546327,\"headline\":\"America’s Biggest Retailer Is About to Pass America’s Biggest Bank\",\"id\":142760413,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A gap of less than $4 billion separates America's biggest retailer from its biggest bank, and a single trading day can flip which one leads. The catalyst that decides the next month arrives Tuesday morning.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c1c3e74d24c4d113e33fecfba91d7ced065e2c17118a1e876f0d38cb24ae5edf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791546175,\"headline\":\"Walmart warehouse automation robots costs complexity\",\"id\":142760577,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A decadelong, multibillion-dollar push to replace warehouse workers with robots has hit repeated kinks, from cardboard boxes to frozen turkeys\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a1a10b88f620388b9d177015961e3c495bed8df0eca008013c8c9fa7a43cf77a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791544663,\"headline\":\"9 Of 11 Sectors Rise Friday As Real Estate Leads\",\"id\":142791219,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Technical-analysis.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Nine of 11 sectors are higher in Friday\\u0026#39;s regular session, with the top three split across defensive, growth and cyclical groups. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with no single gap clearly standing apart from the other breaks across the table.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8e49b5050ab59076c68ff77ba7cac7d3785b5016c63b1ee1049019718c167f81\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791540805,\"headline\":\"Walmart, Scan Launch Co-Cranded Medicare Advantage Plans Designed To Deliver More Personalized Health Support For Older Adults\",\"id\":142791650,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://corporate.walmart.com/news/2026/10/walmart-scan-lauch-co-branded-medicare-plan\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fc1787b4e7778d0c25e1bc09c60f45946e36a9e841e38a952f373d815812654c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791534965,\"headline\":\"‘I Just Filled My Truck Up Yesterday and It Put Me in Such a Bad Mood’: Delony Urges $40K Walmart Worker to Drive Rideshare\",\"id\":142754580,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Dr. John Delony's rideshare advice sounds like a solid wealth-building sprint for a 43-year-old Walmart worker with no investments, but the math on what each mile actually costs changes the picture fast.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e3edbcd3b1e9e7f75e71628f27670a741756777c37ca2ab755ca666273fa4689\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791511763,\"headline\":\"Walmart (WMT) Stock May Be Fully Priced Despite New Fulfillment News\",\"id\":142741728,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart shares have climbed over recent years, supported by steady execution in core retail and a growing push into higher margin digital services. This leaves investors asking whether the current price is still supported by what the business earns. Over the past 5 years the stock has returned 152.4%, which puts a lot of weight on the question of how its current earnings stack up against that share price. Recent moves such as new fulfillment and distribution centers, faster pickup options...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e1bed298e4d9419d439eaeb3edef3b3973fb3f5d37814f608eeea546bca07833\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791499813,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer Said It Was “Suddenly” A Market For Walmart (WMT) But Made A Big Prediction For Target (TGT)\",\"id\":142733913,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Cramer has frequently discussed Walmart Inc. (NASDAQ:WMT) and Target Corporation (NYSE:TGT) in a group over the past month or so. The CNBC TV host has been clear that Target has been performing well. He has also fluctuated between advising viewers to hold off on Walmart to wondering whether the firm was worth buying in a […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e89d9f997bf89cd045d00ee9a981dccf4fc6414d4c971b424c9845181e36df61\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791491656,\"headline\":\"Where Could Walmart's Next Growth Come From?\",\"id\":142733051,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart (WMT) stock currently trades at 39.0 times earnings, well above the 21.5 multiple for the S\\u0026P 500. Investors typically assign that kind of premium to rapid growth, yet Walmart reported a modest 5.9% revenue increase in its latest quarter. This valuation suggests the market expects profit to outpace sales by a wide margin, and selling more groceries alone may not be enough to justify it. So what does Walmart have that can grow faster than its stores.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f9f5f36e2d46a569cc995c2ca01944721e1b0f58135637465ad8c75ffe422ef9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791489031,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Consumer Stocks Rise Late Afternoon\",\"id\":142732160,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Consumer stocks rose late Thursday afternoon with the State Street Consumer Staples Select Sector SP\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fb0f7f9f11e7e7b35254ef9e08b82f9c79e1882e2654a9152922db910e8d213f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791486615,\"headline\":\"Exploring the top movers within the dow jones index during today's session.\",\"id\":142731799,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay updated with the movement of dow jones stocks in today's session. Discover which dow jones stocks are making waves on Thursday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d02e79ecef043a92ebba46248d20db4281c6aa7162d4da8ddbe12ca8c3b04577\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791484998,\"headline\":\"Was The Run In Target Stock Hiding In Plain Sight?\",\"id\":142732105,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Target (TGT) stock returned 76.5% in the twelve months to October 7, 2026. By comparison, the S\\u0026P 500 returned 17.1%. During this stretch, shoppers returned to the retailer, and its sales grew again after a long decline. Yet when the run began, Target had posted falling sales in its three most recent financial reports. So what was there to see in those reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6998d5ebbf1191720a53a0ecafdfaf8420981807afd7344d78e26a5aa1aada5d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791482953,\"headline\":\"What Are Costco Investors Betting On?\",\"id\":142732106,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Costco Wholesale (COST) stock currently trades at 45.3 times its earnings of the past twelve months. At first glance, that valuation looks steep for a retailer that keeps about 3% of its sales as net profit. Investors, however, are buying the years ahead rather than a single past year of performance. So how much growth is a buyer at this price paying for.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=34045d124769cb9170aad222e84c7eaf1ca4b6843fcc12e163b344cb7f489e0a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791480600,\"headline\":\"Walmart Opens Next-Generation Fulfillment Center in Stockton, Expanding Faster Delivery Across the West Coast\",\"id\":142731012,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"STOCKTON, Calif., October 08, 2026--Walmart today opened its fifth next-generation fulfillment center, a more than 900,000-square-foot facility in Stockton that will create more than 1,000 jobs and expand the retailer’s ability to provide faster shipping and delivery to customers across California and the West Coast.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cce45e5acaaaa73815b2ddf0fd0642b2a4d7c6f11638d5411434e202c429d938\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791478962,\"headline\":\"Stitch Fix Conference: AI, Client Retention Fuel Growth Ambitions\",\"id\":142731014,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Stitch Fix (NASDAQ:SFIX) Chief Executive Officer Matt Baer said the online personal styling company’s transformation efforts helped drive fiscal-year revenue growth, higher client retention and record revenue per active client, while positioning the business to invest in future customer growth and a\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e8e88d695892fbef22d46c8e8678df39d67e2f7bb928d9d34a858aca5b3c7c09\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791477000,\"headline\":\"Founders Spend Years Trying to Meet the Right People. This Exclusive Malibu Event Puts Them Face-to-Face in One Day.\",\"id\":142732163,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"At Founderland, a “Coachella for founders,” entrepreneurs trade the convention hall for a Malibu ranch with access to retailers and investors.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cb5dac4c071a4a311e07cd1384cbc3af2265380c54a5890249de2eb3d376fc94\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791475380,\"headline\":\"Is Walmart open on Columbus Day?\",\"id\":142731013,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart stays open for most holidays, but shoppers may want to check their local store before heading out.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=82af8f962300f92dfe7c1f971a8c3da91a69b1d16cb14f5f248a758553c7a70e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791475086,\"headline\":\"The AI pricing trap\",\"id\":142731015,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"McDonald's and Walmart are in defense mode over allegations about how they use AI and customer data to set prices.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6d5e7b15ebd54f256308d8d50c792d12b57ebb7c8bdb7e424353bf6db75f53c0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791469740,\"headline\":\"Walmart debuts 1-hour express pickup, ASL service ahead of holidays\",\"id\":142729807,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The mass retailer will expand the new pickup option nationwide in the upcoming weeks and is using Sorenson for in-store American Sign Language interpretation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=55f5940f3aa5e0c51dbba56972e59700de606f6b6dcf1e024a4528b61e332af2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791466359,\"headline\":\"Walmart Opens Fulfillment Center In Stockton, CA, Creating 1,000+ Jobs\",\"id\":142761460,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"New facility will create 1,000+ jobs and use advanced automation and technology to increase fulfillment capacityWalmart today opened its fifth next-generation fulfillment center, a more than 900,000-square-foot facility\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5de49d64c4b97fb67835ee15d8e185beccbc1c84e5cc7bc463fd86949b173ba6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791465301,\"headline\":\"5 Monthly Dividend Stocks That Could Turn Your Portfolio Into a Second Paycheck\",\"id\":142727213,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Some dividends are backed by nothing more than last quarter's earnings, but a handful of companies collect rent, regulated utility bills, and trash pickup fees under contracts that make next year's cash flow visible before the year even begins.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=752eef944684bea1a51ce40305ad5633e6903c94e28298711c82d432673eb6ad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791464449,\"headline\":\"Amazon Stock Has Another Growth Story Investors May Be Missing\",\"id\":142727098,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Everyone knows the AWS story, but three faster-growing businesses quietly running alongside it could change how investors value Amazon entirely.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a4048993ab130e4ab159a9f4fe878168300831ec7db1aed5b9f072de541fdcf6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791458624,\"headline\":\"What barriers and opportunities face functional beverage makers?\",\"id\":142724909,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Functionality in drinks was a theme that thread itself through several talks and panels at the Non-Alcoholic Beverages conference in London last month.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c73e391d18214e6cd5f28b545f0f1eca252b7f8b5f5a7435d2ea6c806725f61f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791457745,\"headline\":\"8 Of 11 Sectors Fall In Thursday Trading As Energy Leads\",\"id\":142761278,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/08/Stock-Market-Trading-Chart-And-Analyzing.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Three sectors are higher and eight are lower in Thursday\\u0026#39;s regular session, with the top three split across cyclical, defensive and growth groups. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with Energy clearly ahead of the next sectors in the ranking.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7ba3ed272714de30d8449468da93c18b22f4812734ad8a9471a40b76efa0b11b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791450863,\"headline\":\"Walmart’s One‑Hour Express Pickup Push Could Be A Game Changer For Walmart (WMT)\",\"id\":142720448,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart recently introduced Express Pickup, allowing Walmart+ members to get eligible orders ready for curbside collection in as little as one hour, alongside the new in‑store “Shop to Light” guidance feature. By tightening the link between its app, rapid pickup, and in‑aisle navigation, Walmart is deepening digital engagement right at the start of the peak holiday shopping period. We’ll now look at how Express Pickup’s one-hour curbside promise could influence Walmart’s investment narrative...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7b75315e9e9be2548badcc7683dbd99da068ebbf56540b71924a753bd8c002d6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791443438,\"headline\":\"Best Buy Gives Investors a Reason to Take a Second Look\",\"id\":142715110,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Best Buy Co., Inc. (NYSE:BBY) isn’t the kind of retailer that immediately comes to mind when you think about companies with a wide economic moat. After all, consumers can buy the same electronics from Amazon, Walmart, or directly from manufacturers. Still, Best Buy has managed to carve out a fairly durable position in the consumer […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e414c2c0bde84e5224c8fdc9cc4b78a93992fcac825d47e787715c37aeb6eadb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791414900,\"headline\":\"Company behind Walmart's favorite toy shuts down major project\",\"id\":142701299,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pudgy Penguins conquered Walmart’s toy aisle.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6b65b5feb0b15185fd5fd847f3fc9e98641ad4ec3ed7d1ef86263cea6a62b6f2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791406933,\"headline\":\"Walmart gives holiday shoppers a new way to save time\",\"id\":142700334,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The retailer is expanding a service that could change how shoppers approach the busiest time of year.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=74b3940259d7c59dae40f8db8c09da9806ac26f21e12818136385de8ae30c310\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791400214,\"headline\":\"Top dow jones movers in Wednesday's session\",\"id\":142699052,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay updated with the movements of the dow jones index one hour before the close of the markets on Wednesday. Discover which stocks are leading as top gainers and losers in today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=79cbbb6a9394d74f43ed5875e5d2b638c156a24824ea95997addfce18685ce40\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791397020,\"headline\":\"Albertsons, Dollar General can't match Walmart's grocery prices\",\"id\":142699345,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A new survey shows Walmart’s price advantage against top rivals is expanding.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9dd840c16abc2cf00a888649b125218deb7e2e94905fa9380f357bd8650c2bf1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791394215,\"headline\":\"Costco Stock Could Surprise Investors Over the Next Several Years\",\"id\":142698415,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Costco parking lots are packed, yet the stock sits well below its 52-week high while tariff headwinds and margin pressure cloud the outlook. Whether those forces are temporary noise or a real warning sign shapes everything about where shares go from here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cb461aa04ec02e4a02340958b607c01828f091226e85009d040a3bad859b4e30\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791393343,\"headline\":\"Better Dividend Stock for 2026: NNN or ADC? One Clearly Wins on Yield and Growth\",\"id\":142698416,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Both NNN and Agree Realty cut identical deals with tenants, raised guidance the same summer, and dropped nearly the same amount in price last month, yet one of them suits a retiree's portfolio far better than the other.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a6c796995b97022d50aa2bb8a6dd1b7e6a9949ad0b3fa227a478acf341d1cae7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791391212,\"headline\":\"Which dow jones stocks are moving on Wednesday?\",\"id\":142697832,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Wondering what's happening in today's session for the dow jones index? Stay informed with the top movers within the dow jones index on Wednesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7035659f7d8a2a0d5730ed16bd3bcb7683148f81f5fe35ce66fb9682da838018\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791387001,\"headline\":\"Amazon Turned $10,000 Into More Than $230,000. Can It Happen Again?\",\"id\":142696959,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AWS just posted its fastest growth in four and a half years, yet Amazon shares sit 12% below their peak and capex is climbing at a pace that worries even the bulls. Whether that spending becomes a trap or a launchpad depends on one number.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1a6de1ce671c88e9150d2af0cd235a439a5e1b6b02cda36d7ba1b71703f2820a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791386544,\"headline\":\"America Got Addicted to Cheap Money — Now the Economy Is Cracking as Rates Exceed 5%\",\"id\":142696963,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Fifteen years of near-zero borrowing rates quietly built businesses, housing markets, and government budgets that only work when money is cheap. Now that the 10-year Treasury has hit levels unseen since 2002, the bill is arriving for everyone at once.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=793824044529a96ffd299714168933d210c6db264bbeb65f31108659d955fd88\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791385200,\"headline\":\"New Ways to Shop, Holiday Traditions to Keep: Walmart is Ready for the Season\",\"id\":142697099,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BENTONVILLE, Ark., October 07, 2026--The holidays bring a mix of big and small moments: finding the perfect gift, gathering around the table, keeping up with traditions and the occasional \\\"we forgot the batteries\\\" moment.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=51a09ee9cc1864b9631d5e352cefdaedad29bbd8144231686cc09e737532b4d0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791379816,\"headline\":\"Walmart drones are flying into Denver and Seattle\",\"id\":142694812,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The companies currently offer drone delivery within five U.S. markets and have a dozen more marked as “coming soon” within the next year.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=45bcfaf4fbfc0428be8691bf3f8e6ed867e846c8e7c61d2f002033bfb6cc267c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791379800,\"headline\":\"State Affairs Convenes Inaugural Customer Advisory Board of Government Affairs Leaders From Walmart, Carvana, and Other Major Enterprises\",\"id\":142694813,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"State Affairs, the technology company combining daily exclusive reporting, original data gathering and AI, hosted its inaugural Customer Advisory Board (CAB) on September 16 in Washington, D.C. The board brings together 11 government affairs and public policy leaders from Carvana, Churchill Downs, Fiserv, Home Builders Institute, Mastercard, Siemens, UKG, Walmart, and others.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=533a26123f8531b1258380774eb8fe75c82896d1ef3bf202c4af82b033b713b5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791379587,\"headline\":\"Meta Joins Industry Alliance to Launch Personal AI Agent Standard\",\"id\":142694767,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Meta StockPrice change for Meta stock in the last 6 months: 28%$META Stock Price as of Oct. 6: $73952-Week High: $780$META Stock Price Target: $795What Happened?Meta (META:NASDAQ) is teaming up with Walmart, Stripe, and a few other companies.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7b0ac8ba29636266394361d2ec1aa6e9659a4af7eb4c4ea5d2d816177044f7df\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791379320,\"headline\":\"Target's Same-Day and Next-Day Units Rise Nearly 30% as Speed Improves\",\"id\":142697102,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Target's same-day and next-day units increase nearly 30% in fiscal Q2 2026 as store-based fulfillment and stronger inventory reliability improve speed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2267243d3fce4ade65fbbce4cb03536f3aaeda410bf48345eef718f8094a4f9f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791375327,\"headline\":\"What's Going On With Meta Platforms Stock Wednesday?\",\"id\":142727001,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/07/Ljubljana--Slovenia---21-January-2023-Me.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Meta falls 2% amid broader tech sell-off, higher yields, and energy pressure. Technicals stay bullish despite cooling momentum.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e1947d9eafb3cb318e4bfeeae6d0405411f554479f14dc0fbc43bb178210f4ae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791374400,\"headline\":\"AI adoption, consumer health, margins, \\u0026 guidance: Themes to watch this earnings season\",\"id\":142694815,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Business Insider executive editor and anchor Dan DeFrancesco chats with the Market Hang panel about their expectations for this upcoming earnings season. Today's panel includes Siebert Financial chief investment officer Mark Malek, Advisors Capital Management senior portfolio manager Gus Scacco, Laffer Tengler Investments CEO and CIO Nancy Tengler, and Aptus Capital Advisors portfolio manager and head of equity David Wagner.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ac1cb30c1d29eed21091f664e8b55da231a482aa3781be86dbf5c6db115ac311\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791372720,\"headline\":\"Ghirardelli brings 174-year-old chocolate brand to packaged cookies\",\"id\":142693891,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The brand will immediately be pitted against other premium offerings such as Mondelēz’s Tate’s and Ferrero’s Famous Amos.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c0f255c0f266ae8d17e1d948208ed00ec973a98a67c446a70dc60592582377ec\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791370938,\"headline\":\"9 Of 11 Sectors Fall Wednesday As Defensives Lead\",\"id\":142696708,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2