ts to Consider\",\"id\":142668724,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The latest trading day saw Walmart (WMT) settling at $107.2, representing a +2.03% change from its previous close.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=735f6d7e0c9fbe70e08e87f00b9022d6c292a7a5f0e50e3ec340a3ca686afdca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791319389,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Dow, S\\u0026P 500 Rally; Cathie Wood Buys This Stock Amid 56% Dive\",\"id\":142668669,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises on the stock market today amid a flurry of breakouts. Seagate falls on a report. Cathie Wood snaps up a plunging stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ecd0a449183cc5b59536653b5886a95168da8c11b0fdfe02872d15c9a08989fd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791313811,\"headline\":\"Stay informed with the top movers within the dow jones index on Tuesday.\",\"id\":142667426,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Curious about the top performers within the dow jones index one hour before the close of the markets on Tuesday? Dive into the list of today's session's top gainers and losers for a comprehensive overview.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d746261ff29e9cc44ef27036fcaea7bc30f5ad242ea1e6c22ec443fb552f4afd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791312165,\"headline\":\"Why Is Everyone Ignoring Home Depot Stock's High Cash Yield?\",\"id\":142667655,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Home Depot (HD) stock offers a free cash flow yield of 5.4%, against 4.5% for the median S\\u0026P 500 company. A yield that high usually means one of two things: a sound business on sale, or one the market expects to shrink. So why is the market paying so little for Home Depot's cash.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aeeaadd031fc38cbb71d627950cf7adef1d6ad2aa1471680f94c8bfbf44cf16d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791310740,\"headline\":\"Which Retailers Do AI Agents Cite the Most? Yeah, you guessed it, Walmart and Costco.\",\"id\":142667717,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"But there is still AI market share up for grabs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c47c52799daf6a53cf3b13c027a9e0f2b8d366c74fa06427b45fdd14203f7e43\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791308171,\"headline\":\"Update: Equity Markets Rise Intraday as Yields Fall\",\"id\":142666712,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"(Updates with latest market prices and developments.) US benchmark equity indexes were higher int\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c68d75a6e4c6f700b513d5ebf1f57b067642460e1855e8dc5890033b5ed3e511\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791305040,\"headline\":\"Walmart defends pricing practices, again\",\"id\":142666771,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The retailer says it won't renew a key patent that could leverage scan-and-go tech to personalize prices. It's one of several that has drawn the attention of activists.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=61182f015493862d30e0586c5b9eb77ccefae71c6a316f17f7e108646ec883d4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791304603,\"headline\":\"Walmart Connect Expands Audiences, CTV Measurement\",\"id\":142666772,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The expanded services with WBD, Spotify and Yahoo DSP are intended to give Walmart's media arm a larger piece of TV ad dollars through the partnership by giving advertisers a longer reach to Walmart shoppers on linear TV networks like TBS.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3883430d1bab6a787c521698765883c540b13c24ff7f48a88a2f529072215e0b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791301146,\"headline\":\"Is surging CEO pay out of touch with the average worker?\",\"id\":142668726,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Conference Board CEO and president Steve Odland sits down with Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi to discuss whether rising executive pay packages are becoming increasingly out of touch with the average US worker, especially as inflation runs rampant and continues to put the squeeze on consumers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=33e941c88d7b3e4c1d62f2a95907848d7fd2e85a3f3cdfd3fafe485d8ab20636\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791300351,\"headline\":\"Service Prices Just Hit a 4-Year High While Wage Growth Hit a 5-Year Low\",\"id\":142665553,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shipping costs are soaring and wages are stalling, leaving households caught between rising prices and shrinking paychecks. The companies best positioned to survive this squeeze may not be the ones you expect.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c060d5052b4f68cc7012e7b0fe920760f91a06a689c3d01930f5e176f6d96262\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791298529,\"headline\":\"What Has Changed About Owning Amazon Stock?\",\"id\":142665414,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"If you own Amazon (AMZN) stock, you probably bought it for growth, and you may now wonder what that growth is costing. Management gave you a reason to ask on its July 30, 2026 earnings call, when it raised its spending plan for the year. So how different is the Amazon you own today from the one you bought.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c28c633e5f98953af20cd7c01013e9e4f0be1bf41967f67509f04c584469a1cd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791296489,\"headline\":\"Meta, Walmart, Stripe, and Sierra partner to establish rules for personal AI agents\",\"id\":142698044,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108373517-17913107581791310755-48831182271-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1791310757\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC's Kate Rooney reports on companies teaming up to create a new rulebook for AI agents.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f55bdfb319a498f47273aa32ea692ff597b8683b468da3b07feda37410eb29d6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791291780,\"headline\":\"Costco's Digital Sales Top $33 Billion: Can E-commerce Keep Scaling?\",\"id\":142665556,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Costco's digital sales top $33 billion in fiscal 2026 as faster delivery, personalization and AI search strengthen online shopping.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dd6e4848f8f260f8941b7dceb2bb971c0b6ecdc99519cd74f0038c825cbbdeb5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791291600,\"headline\":\"Avia and Bimma Williams Bring Together Four Creative Voices for \\\"Collab Camp,\\\" Available Exclusively at Walmart\",\"id\":142662972,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BENTONVILLE, Ark., October 06, 2026--Avia, the American heritage brand that has recently surged in viral popularity for its accessible retro sneakers and activewear, is introducing Collab Camp, a new creator-led sneaker and apparel collection. Developed with Bimma Williams, his strategy and creative firm Bimma \\u0026 Co., and four multidisciplinary creatives, the capsule will launch exclusively at Walmart in early Q1 2027. Known as one of the leading voices on collaborations in fashion and footwear,\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ea1a491cc7a905bf6f93f05c07803b16fb04ba8392ae4eaf2c66bd7ac5ccc28e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791291600,\"headline\":\"ShipStation® Launches Ship with Walmart, Bringing Discounted Rates and Seller Protections Directly In the Platform\",\"id\":142662971,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AUSTIN, Texas, October 06, 2026--ShipStation launches Ship with Walmart, giving Walmart Marketplace sellers discounted rates and seller protections inside ShipStation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8d238100fc19ac3bd7a8450e635ae696575c484faced3cd6730c827c3b2f07a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791291540,\"headline\":\"Can Walmart Connect Keep Powering WMT's Digital Profit Growth?\",\"id\":142665554,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart's 43% Connect growth and expanding e-commerce strengthen digital economics as ads, membership and delivery gains lift margins.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=943bcccb3aa2baf7efe9d66508fe5912483ccc32709c147f839c92f983746d35\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791290280,\"headline\":\"What Propelled Northwest Arkansas (NWA) to be America's Best-Performing Economy?\",\"id\":142662973,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Today Emeraude and Encore Economics published, \\\"Northwest Arkansas is America's Best-Performing Economy: What is Driving it?\\\" This report provides deep and rich analysis of how Northwest Arkansas (Fayetteville-Springdale-Rogers, AR Metropolitan Statistical Area) rose to become \\\"America's Best-Performing City,\\\" and lays out what it must do to retain this position.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e13f0195f0b9306f3421d1489ddd7fcade0ed7b2ae84bf729f00b0b60708c2c0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791286260,\"headline\":\"BP highlighted as Zacks Bull and MasterCraft Boat Bear of the Day\",\"id\":142662974,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BP highlighted as Zacks Bull and MasterCraft Boat Bear of the Day\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a7cef029a2d5f1157ed684a8985fcd77310b3cfaae086dacda5b8064793abd84\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791285420,\"headline\":\"Edible Garden Awarded New Walmart Fresh Herb Program for Peak Holiday Season\",\"id\":142662019,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"New Holiday Program Builds on Three Recent Distribution Center Wins and Expands Edible Garden’s Strategic Presence Across the Midwest, Mid-Atlantic and NortheastBELVIDERE, NJ, Oct. 06, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Edible Garden AG Incorporated (“Edible Garden” or the “Company”) (Nasdaq: EDBL, EDBLW), a leader in controlled environment agriculture (CEA), organic and sustainable produce, and developer of the Zero-Waste Inspired® mission and Farm-to-Formula® platform, today announced that it has been a\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eb160e16f28eff8f989ede8dd411dba6322a1e49473ad23ff7b07912d5cc587f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791279300,\"headline\":\"Costco Is Down 10% in 6 Months While the S\\u0026P 500 Is Up 17%. Is Costco Too Cheap to Pass Up Under $900 a Share?\",\"id\":142657666,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"This \\\"bargain price\\\" may not be such a bargain after all.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7464d85a3aeb06f37f15440c23ae3ea16c21afc0c7b52d2a9a165e4bd4f6de97\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791255179,\"headline\":\"NYSE’s Parent Just Filed to Tokenize 63 US Stocks on a Crypto-Native Exchange — And the SEC Already Gave It Permission\",\"id\":142645982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The most conservative institution in US market infrastructure just filed to tokenize 63 of America’s most recognizable stocks on a crypto-native exchange. Intercontinental Exchange, the parent company of the New York Stock Exchange, and OKX announced OKXICE, a 50/50 joint venture that will offer tokenized versions of Nvidia, Tesla, Apple, Microsoft, Amazon, JPMorgan, Walmart, Coca-Cola, […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=747b93a1b9acffd07c7522220fe485f0df8eb6b27635895298dcfe6662071794\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791231752,\"headline\":\"How Christina Zhu turned Sam’s Club into Walmart’s unlikely growth engine in China\",\"id\":142639735,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart China’s first native Chinese CEO is leaning on Sam’s Club, smaller portion sizes, and an ultrafast delivery network to drive growth in a strained consumer economy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=80ca19a694874255059a9bdc7639f2f09ba976606006a3e76766648a85fbd641\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791231644,\"headline\":\"How HallPass is bringing lapsed consumers back to the candy aisle\",\"id\":142639167,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"HallPass co-founder Michael Tierney joins Yahoo Finance's Brooke DiPalma to discuss building the brand for calorically conscious consumers, leveraging lessons from his previous venture Stuffed Puffs, and competing against broadline candy giants like The Hershey Company (HSY). HallPass is a low-calorie, low-sugar confectionery brand that aims to offer classic-tasting chocolates and treats at mainstream, accessible price points.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f6f0cde6df001298854a76aa39a927a7b065d4acfb7435306e7a0063fcf7134d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791224520,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Might Be Wrong to Hate Consumer Stocks\",\"id\":142638472,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"It might not be all doom and gloom for the retail sector.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=293e4f1f4c9263a63ee79099880cd4961e3bb1ee435619007d4f0226178189e7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791222236,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Consumer Stocks Advance in Afternoon Trading\",\"id\":142637694,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Consumer stocks were higher Monday afternoon, with the State Street Consumer Staples Select Sector S\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e63c89cc5d8ba3a9e8cd7cd757cbe585c1e1085229a33a821356e959ebf74b6c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791222000,\"headline\":\"ComEd Energizes State-of-the-Art Grocery Distribution Center in Illinois\",\"id\":142637773,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BELVIDERE, Ill., October 05, 2026--ComEd today joined local officials to energize the high-voltage substation and electric infrastructure that will power a new Walmart perishable grocery distribution center in Belvidere, slated to open in 2027. This state-of-the-art center will process and distribute fresh and frozen products to Walmart stores across the Great Lakes region, relying on 24/7 electric service to support its operations.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=446d3b62063276764152f5b76822f300ed37b97c0c507307a1697c08edf7b2dc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791218758,\"headline\":\"Walmart Remains In The Red in 2026: 49% Gains Await Investors Who Act Now According to This Wall Street Pro\",\"id\":142637774,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart shares have shed nearly a quarter of their value from the 52-week high, yet one Wall Street strategist sees a path to gains that would dwarf the average analyst target. Here is what the bull case rests on and where it could break down.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=304f3c1d8ff891b0203300c31a05e94ea424cc1f2ceed437a65437f6daa6f0f9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791214263,\"headline\":\"Amazon Readies Prime Big Deal Days. Can E-Commerce Growth Continue To Surprise?\",\"id\":142636719,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon stock is trading in a flat base pattern as the tech giant kicks off holiday shopping with Prime Big Deals Days.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=446884d2c52972b43fa5a4fb83f8c0ebd3c729635d4c9c65eaf4bdf3f935c6ca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791213929,\"headline\":\"Walmart (WMT) Is Becoming More Than a Retailer — But Is the Stock Too Expensive?\",\"id\":142636816,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart Inc.’s (NASDAQ:WMT) growth narrative is moving away from reliance on low-margin sales volume. The company delivered 24% year-over-year growth in its U.S. e-commerce sales during the second quarter of fiscal 2027. It saw the Connect’s ad segment revenues increase by 43% excluding VIZIO numbers, while the U.S. membership segment exhibited double-digit growth. Strength across […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=19790c589a90033aeeefe89206e824111b9756c81409f2d27fa44c6a8d894338\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791213660,\"headline\":\"Target's $5 Billion Capex Plan Puts Stores and Technology in Focus\",\"id\":142637775,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Target ramps up capital spending to expand stores, modernize technology and strengthen fulfillment, inventory reliability and guest service.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=769b927ccdbc0ca8f713ca54e8424cc0b69fa548a4501e3e6be735f6ae5b45aa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791212429,\"headline\":\"Nasdaq 100 Records Have Rarely Been This Narrow, 55 Stocks Are Still Below 50-Day Average\",\"id\":142662618,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/05/Nasdaq-Inscription-Next-To-Us-Dollars--T.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The Nasdaq 100 trades at records Monday, yet 55 of its 101 stocks sit below their 50-day average. QQQ has beaten equal-weight QQQE by 8% since late July.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d78ffd39021735e4739cfbbd4e7ce2c89bcdbad94ff4f003fc44637d8d221831\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791211805,\"headline\":\"Rogers Kniffen CEO: AI in retail already matters and it will continue to matter even more\",\"id\":142666447,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108372780-17912259691791225966-48810682577-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1791225968\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Jan Kniffen, J. Rogers Kniffen CEO, joins 'Power Lunch' to discuss how AI is impacting retail and how AI will continue impacting retail in the future.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4198315e9c64187b3055ec2ab05ca8bcd35df9c780c4a89e2ac049d91f8ca2f8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791205200,\"headline\":\"JAKKS Pacific to Debut Doll Haus of Dread™ at New York Comic Con; Horror's Most Iconic Fiends Dressed to Kill\",\"id\":142635048,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ghost Face, Billy the Puppet, Jason Voorhees, and Pinhead get a fashion-forward makeover this spooky season SANTA MONICA, Calif., Oct. 05, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- JAKKS Pacific, Inc. (NASDAQ: JAKK), a leading global designer, manufacturer and marketer of toys and consumer products, is debuting Doll Haus of Dread™, a bold new collector fashion doll line that transforms horror’s most feared figures into high-style, display-worthy collectibles. Launching exclusively at Walmart and Walmart.com in F\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=797fd5b1850038422856c69f9a5ebaa15854c6775566c984d55e14470a81b6c3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791204333,\"headline\":\"There’s a Better AI Picks-and-Shovels Choice Between GE Vernova and Constellation Energy\",\"id\":142635050,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Vernova and Constellation both feed the AI power boom, but their Q2 results reveal a widening gap in momentum, valuation, and regulatory risk that points toward one clearer opportunity for investors right now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=15bd6fb036eff6b5d738a1458993a1bb721c38c465e4b5738a67c35ed33f175e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791200040,\"headline\":\"Abercrombie \\u0026 Fitch highlighted as Zacks Bull and Blue Bird Bear of the Day\",\"id\":142635051,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Abercrombie \\u0026 Fitch highlighted as Zacks Bull and Blue Bird Bear of the Day\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d5012600d2f4341903c67ee993e459ebccbd3623b24fd2b5c10d786cd0cbc789\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791198136,\"headline\":\"8 Of 11 Sectors Rise In Monday Trading As Leaders Split\",\"id\":142662620,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/05/Technical-analysis.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Eight sectors are higher and three are lower in Monday\\u0026#39;s regular session, with growth, cyclical and defensive sectors split across the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9b99f160d0e43a3fbf1e99dbf628b2d476cc0c04d5292e521e81f816b5d747e0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791183600,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Breakfast Podcast: October's Retail Harvest\",\"id\":142633287,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2249831261/image_2249831261.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Retailers are racing to cash in on the holiday season before Halloween. Huawei and Qualcomm strike a deal. Redwire lands another piece of Axiom's space station puzzle.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=035694136145d5f5bb3cfe03aea6d424a42478efde0213255b029fc487c3bd0d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791172860,\"headline\":\"The Bots Are Ready to Shop But Are the Humans?\",\"id\":142637776,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"WMT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon has tried to put up a hard wall around its shopping experience over the past year, most recently blocking Meta's Muse.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a05dc5b14e058bfd66c50108b39bbe89977d20c68aa45a595f69720205f55d3b\"}]"
