 investment bank described the change as unexpected, particularly as it follows Marriott’s decision several months earlier to move to Coca-Cola after maintaining a relationship with Pepsi for approximately 30 years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c2702785d63f1e71ccaa795f40e281367cc8c69fe7c4dabcb546b1358fd7509e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792142470,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo just lost KFC to Coca-Cola. Here's how much it could sting financially.\",\"id\":142945629,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"This has shaped up to be a year of big losses for beverage and snack giant PepsiCo.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0cb52ab14e380424e5881a2c5643514b63371642a6da7cf56c61b4fc43c8a7ea\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792142470,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo just lost the KFC US business—here's how much it could sting financially\",\"id\":142940165,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Another loss for PEP.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6fce9f68d19b5caaa7de33f0c6474bddb7b2abfff5f571df4e3979ce2315c5fb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792136391,\"headline\":\"KFC Had Pepsi for Nearly 40 Years. Coca-Cola Stock Is Trending After Winning It Over\",\"id\":142946652,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Coca-Cola-Delivery-Truck.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The Coca-Cola Company is trending Friday after KFC said Thursday that its U.S. restaurants will replace PepsiCo beverages next year.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=52af7513125af8d65779fa82fe3bc7bb1635c263da9d81287615ed15b30f14ee\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792135413,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola Deals Pepsi a Stinging Blow, Snatches KFC After Nearly 40 Years\",\"id\"