vidend Kings are popular for good reason, but their impressive track records can create a dangerous false sense of security.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e78dc583ae84fcd0893ea6e05db8e4597c5370b14ff10c0ed039b866b7ed0385\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791844129,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola Consolidated: Strong Growth, But A Weaker Yield (Rating Downgrade)\",\"id\":142831774,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2197735910/image_2197735910.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola Consolidated (COKE) shows strong volume growth and brand share gains, but higher aluminum/fuel costs pressure margins. See more details here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=68d3ce6e171f567856095fa13328852fc19138d99d2171e3c28a12c7880c0349\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791832213,\"headline\":\"Uncover the latest developments among dow jones stocks in today's session.\",\"id\":142823404,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Curious about the top performers within the dow jones index one hour before the close of the markets on Monday? Dive into the list of today's session's top gainers and losers for a comprehensive overview.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=02ccc14928cac6b07e502b3a1349a262b04aa03aacb6c39874473bea74c00ca6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791826996,\"headline\":\"Is Coca-Cola Stock Worth More Than Its Competitors?\",\"id\":142822927,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola (KO) retains more of each sales dollar as operating profit than any of its five designated peers, a group ranging from PepsiCo to Monster Beverage. The company has also delivered the highest stock return among these six companies over the past y