l beverages, protein-rich snacks and zero-sugar offerings to tap wellness demand and unlock new growth opportunities.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f0c7eed6bc7064adcec9b267cf85ce03721063945c3dd773fc83b8a4308ffb38\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791814538,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola (KO) Shows Why Strong Brands Can Build Lasting Competitive Moats\",\"id\":142821657,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"St. James Investment Company recently released its “Value Investors” third-quarter 2026 investor letter. A copy of the letter can be downloaded here. The fund is operating in an increasingly challenging value-investing environment marked by rising interest rates and energy prices, record government debt, elevated stock-market valuations, and ongoing geopolitical conflicts, even as the S\\u0026P 500 […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fa56b0c115f1544a8fa8f8b1f082446565a2af22d66c3f9d345058dc47ba6c64\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791802800,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Lunch: Hall, Woodford Win Nobel Economics Prize For Macroeconomic Research\",\"id\":142821296,\"image\":\"https://static3.seekingalpha.com/assets/podcasts/wsb-d57bf915fd82bac19817953c2e226c7610de9fc3a36c166d7c276e18e86311ea.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Robert Hall and Michael Woodford have won the Nobel Economics Prize 2026 on Monday for \\\"for microeconomic foundations of macroeconomic stabilization.\\\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9040d3f3da4e472e66bd369d5bce7ad6bccca2135f81973c83bec57838e3b9d9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791794160,\"headline\":\"2 International Microcaps for Your Watchlist\",\"id\":142816391,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SSII and IVDA have sales predominantly in India and Taiwan