eadline\":\"Warren Buffett said 'nobody gets paid' to give this easy investing advice — how it’s still helping your portfolio today\",\"id\":142805685,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Buffett’s advice for everyday investors is simpler than you might expect, and lately it’s been generating great returns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=831ecac18d39e7da404f333199d534915584d6939743eb95c193044428e32032\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791722512,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola Has a Dividend Investors Love. Its Valuation is Another Story\",\"id\":142805766,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Coca-Cola Company (NYSE:KO) is a fixture in many dividend portfolios, and for good reason. Its lineup of household names and dependable demand has supported a remarkable track record of dividend hikes. But with shares trading at a premium, it’s fair to ask if the company’s growth and cash flow can keep up with its […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=88d7d7970188e8599e2122b766d4044f51127a94ba014a5cb0edb6288254d5c5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791714009,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola: Pure Cash Flows Ahead With One Potential Drain\",\"id\":142806003,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/517187207/image_517187207.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola's cash flows have been volatile from refranchising, acquisitions, and large tax payments. See why I rate KO stock a Hold right now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e7865f69f45bfd500ac45fbf09290fd4623a7d8a1fea6c085f659d3d9046106e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791713875,\"headline\":\"By 1995, A Retired IRS Auditor Had Turned $5,000 Into $22 Million Using A Surprisingly Boring Investing Strategy.\",\"id\":142804268,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A federal auditor who never earned more than $4,000 a year died alone in a Manhattan studio, and the fortune she quietly assembled stunned everyone who thought they knew how wealth was built.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=858c0da4122825017f1b779ea1a6b5a0463b9671b6f4e79140ebb4521a4456c5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791646500,\"headline\":\"Want to Retire on Dividends? Here Are 4 Stocks to Buy Now and Never Sell.\",\"id\":142792824,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"These consumer staples sell everyday brands that have funded decades of consistent dividends.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c9995f0defe7ece7bc1618ac35d01683a0c3080daa039d6b10b00ce98dadeb0f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791640839,\"headline\":\"How Much More Dividend Income a Roth IRA Keeps on a Half-Million-Dollar Portfolio\",\"id\":142791797,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Six dividend stocks in a $500,000 portfolio sound like a solid income plan, but where you hold them decides how much of that income you actually keep, and the difference compounds into a number most investors never calculate.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=97371cf754bec6351a4b79af870a8da732ba9eb407fd85cb89a34a39d5305481\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791638074,\"headline\":\"Coca Cola HBC And 2 British Dividend Stocks To Own\",\"id\":142791129,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Government bond markets in Europe and the UK have become far less forgiving, with rising yields putting public finances under the microscope. That spotlight pushes many investors to look harder at company cash flows that do not depend on cheap money. Growing UK dividend payers with moderate 2% to 5% yields offer one way to seek that. This article highlights three stocks from this group that merit a closer look. The three stocks below are only a small sample of this theme, and the full screen...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b60cc3366ad2cc4065a7e16fa1829648e523536941b68cba7808d9aac1768f02\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791617400,\"headline\":\"Pepsi: Near 5% Yield And 15x P/E Compelling, But North America Concerns Me\",\"id\":142789974,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/486120619/image_486120619.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo remains rated a hold despite an attractive 5% yield and 15x forward P/E, as near-term headwinds persist. Click for more on PEP.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bab450545540d7d2a645f94fd8f4d8591d09d9ba66e963e451ecc70d4eba94af\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791580378,\"headline\":\"Should Coca-Cola’s Upgraded Outlook and Prebiotic Push Require Action From Coca-Cola (KO) Investors?\",\"id\":142767151,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola recently reported strong quarterly revenue and volume growth, raised its full-year outlook, and continued simplifying its portfolio while advancing new zero-sugar and prebiotic beverage pilots in select US markets. Alongside these moves, the company is refreshing its leadership bench in North America and Central and Eastern Europe, signaling a sharper focus on execution in both core sodas and emerging functional drink categories. We’ll now examine how Coca-Cola’s raised full-year...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=848dc9c8042a046c30b42078486eac48a44b667ae2eb3d88b8e31a2063492611\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791577305,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola (NYSE:KO) \\u0026 Johnson \\u0026 Johson (NYSE:JNJ): Buy Them For The Dividends, Says Jim Cramer\",\"id\":142767120,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola (NYSE:KO) and Johnson \\u0026 Johnson (NYSE:JNJ), while operating in completely different industries, factored into the discussion in Cramer’s October 2nd morning appearance. The CNBC TV host discussed the two as stocks that could be bought on the back of weakness in the economy indicated through the jobs report, which saw the US add a […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8c71c37c6d03c767c8f78cc35c73b0966c71f17a01166df3fea665dc7f4fed3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791576600,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola Consolidated, Inc. Announces Fourth Quarter Dividend\",\"id\":142767153,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CHARLOTTE, N.C., Oct. 09, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Coca-Cola Consolidated, Inc. (NASDAQ: COKE) announced that its Board of Directors has declared a dividend for the fourth quarter of 2026 of $0.25 per share on shares of the Company's Common Stock and Class B Common Stock payable on November 6, 2026, to stockholders of record as of the close of business on October 23, 2026. CONTACTS: Brian K. Little (Media)Matt Blickley (Investors)Vice President, Corporate Communications OfficerChief Financial Of\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=26b72531f7c89ae5cc62a1f64fc2d7d61aacaf401f12f3dd9b6fba5e47ae28df\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791571550,\"headline\":\"Forget Chasing the Biggest Yield. These 5 Dividend Stocks Have Something Better\",\"id\":142766267,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"One of these five blue chips has sent shareholders a dividend check every single quarter since 1916, and that kind of staying power changes how you think about building retirement income from scratch.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c631beddb8e54fab195a40e1314bac30245aaccf8b679d9912b8c9b958d2ad30\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791557460,\"headline\":\"5%, Really? The Stock Market’s Sudden High-Yielders.\",\"id\":142765174,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The S\\u0026P 500’s yield is pathetic, at about 1%. But there are plenty of new members in its high-dividend-yielders club.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=67309b47a17adf5381af781bf351b62ba49f977687a852bec325ce328dea96da\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791556680,\"headline\":\"Can Monaco's Expanding Footprint Drive Molson Coors' Revenues?\",\"id\":142764095,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"TAP is expanding Monaco Cocktails' reach beyond five key states, tapping into RTD spirits demand and new distribution channels to drive revenue growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2e1c5ccd44e80bd630dafbafb360fc846626d7ec891207925d7c057979d624f1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791551126,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola Seeks to Unwind $5 Billion Costa Coffee Acquisition\",\"id\":142761649,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Coca-Cola StockPrice change for Coca-Cola stock in last 6 months: 12%$KO Stock Price as of Oct. 8: $8852-Week High: $92$KO Stock Price Target: $94What Happened?Coca-Cola (KO:NYSE) is looking to unwind its $5 billion purchase of British coffeehouse Costa Coffee, Semafor reported on Thursday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=141aea126b9d01c988daa46511d609237411a87de3d432b8a052373a8c0f0f1b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791550237,\"headline\":\"Micron Is Now Worth More Than Coca-Cola, PepsiCo, McDonald’s, Disney, Starbucks, Nike and Chipotle Combined\",\"id\":142761558,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Most Americans can name a Coca-Cola before they can name a single Micron product, yet Wall Street just handed the obscure memory chip maker a valuation that leaves seven of the world's most recognized consumer brands in the dust.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c7f6e3804de728fe3e8bef0a8aa80cae68a688d8632fec207846315df7c9ca01\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791549935,\"headline\":\"Pepsi Cratered in 2026: Goldman Sachs Says It’s Going Up 40% Soon\",\"id\":142761652,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo has cratered while every major beverage rival rallied, and now Goldman Sachs sees a 40% rebound ahead. But that call rests on three pillars, and one is already showing serious cracks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d724eb8803473646c25967840653fbe3840bff82d2da32f6af1c527232b32873\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791549930,\"headline\":\"Intel Is Worth More Than Coca-Cola and PepsiCo Put Together\",\"id\":142761569,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A chipmaker that lost billions last year now commands a valuation that dwarfs two of the world's most profitable consumer giants, and the math holding that together is razor thin.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7c0df84702b3bed557b6d543c172e55edc3f04cd7f00cd03ec6ce03166ba8302\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791548403,\"headline\":\"4 Dividend Stocks Boomers Can Safely Buy Now and Hold Forever\",\"id\":142761592,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Four Dividend Kings with streaks stretching back decades sit inside millions of retirement portfolios, but one of them is spending every dollar of free cash flow just to keep its streak alive. Here is how each payout holds up under pressure.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=43808c8e98ca54dfa3535432fd3158504395a69f430c5d63bee9715950ef0322\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791543959,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola Is The Ultimate Compounder: Why I'm Continuing To Consume It\",\"id\":142763776,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/499925476/image_499925476.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The Coca-Cola Company earns a buy rating, supported by a robust economic moat, premium margins, and unrivaled brand equity. Click for more on KO.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cf4b3bbf1e85a403b345506290523dde25769948dac39dd5d28decb11b895d4c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791531421,\"headline\":\"Prediction: Earnings Growth Will Push Coca-Cola Stock to $100 Before 2028\",\"id\":142749394,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares have to rise about 14% over the next 15 months or so. Can earnings growth get them there?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8308827adb045473506a461389a6b4363099ff0f48c24ef53c3f051196dac1e9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791529930,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola Wants Out: Is the $5.1 Billion Costa Coffee Experiment Over?\",\"id\":142761827,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Minsk--Belarus--July-13--2023---Electron.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola is reportedly exploring a sale of Costa Coffee after struggling to achieve growth following its $5.1B deal.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f3ba056165f11713c14c7705a94e07505551f0918007f18087ae806c7f05dbca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791495802,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola Reopens A Costa Sale It Abandoned Earlier This Year, Says Report\",\"id\":142733943,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola bought Costa Coffee from Whitbread in 2018 for $5.1 billion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=87b1b62347dccf2139bbb331cb0407955f244ecbed98501b3835c0e32c4e3f23\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791493380,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo vs. Coca-Cola: Can PEP Stock Catch Up to KO After Its Q3 Earnings Beat?\",\"id\":142733944,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo's Q3 earnings beat and attractive valuation offer some encouragement, but its reduced guidance suggests catching up to Coca-Cola may take time.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=406c29d53d41cabe0443ffa5d51116b1235862c8f9910d2d1c4f24dd1ca0b346\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791492603,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola (KO) Advances While Market Declines: Some Information for Investors\",\"id\":142733111,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola (KO) closed the most recent trading day at $87.77, moving +2.27% from the previous trading session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30f13ce52c9b02f2c93e8553f6c73f84f2e17fad68d3618946096648af8484ae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791486903,\"headline\":\"Coca Cola (KO) Stock Trades Near Fair Value On Cash Flow\",\"id\":142732183,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola has rewarded patient shareholders. With the stock near US$85, the key question is whether that price still lines up with the cash it is expected to generate over time. A strong track record is on the table, but the market now needs those cash flows to carry more of the load. Over the past 5 years the share price has gained 83.2%, which puts a spotlight on whether today’s valuation can be supported by the company’s future cash flows rather than past share-price strength...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=da22056f0076f280b8216724a7ec19053a42277f8364a91b55841acf97b27300\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791486676,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola (KO) Posted 5% Volume Growth in Q2, Does Its Multiple Already Price It In?\",\"id\":142732184,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A while ago Coca-Cola (NYSE:KO) reported a quarter where everything moved the right way at once: more cases sold, slightly higher prices, and a wider operating margin. The stock still trades above its own five-year average multiple. The company doesn’t bottle most of what it sells. It makes concentrates and syrups, ships them to bottling […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3202e1f466ab5093a8a050ff58c7528ebd08750d8d937f92a68daa416e1e9819\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791486615,\"headline\":\"Exploring the top movers within the dow jones index during today's session.\",\"id\":142731799,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay updated with the movement of dow jones stocks in today's session. Discover which dow jones stocks are making waves on Thursday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d02e79ecef043a92ebba46248d20db4281c6aa7162d4da8ddbe12ca8c3b04577\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791483353,\"headline\":\"Three Soda Giants Pay Dividends. One Has a Much Stronger Income Story\",\"id\":142732185,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola, PepsiCo, and Keurig Dr Pepper all pass the basic dividend screen, but their business models tell three very different stories about how safe those payouts actually are and which one can keep growing.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d5ef1f5b0552d21fbe3492719bb30feabf7edfad3d16f68a6170fdc702167e1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791480780,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola adds a 'healthy' version of Coke and Sprite\",\"id\":142731052,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola is betting that consumers want more from the soda they already know, following Pepsi into a growing market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1aa5d81b32e49c582095697a2802fc66e5a3c21b65b17dcd7aab2f2b05f9e17a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791480000,\"headline\":\"Looking to Generate Passive Income From Stocks? 3 Unstoppable Dividend Stocks to Buy Now.\",\"id\":142730887,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"These all have attractive yields and long track records of reliability.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b473f58bb840b5c6b0bedebd60fa0c228e66fa5bc26927857e8b8c0fd7d2ae1e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791476580,\"headline\":\"Primo Brands' Spring Water Sales Increase 4.1%: What's Driving Growth?\",\"id\":142731053,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PRMB's regional spring water sales rise 4.1% as broad retail growth, share gains and brand building support expansion opportunities.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=91174189a0bf3e08412eee1b8497c4d2b5f76c04b05bd051e15b7b3ed72b968a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791475614,\"headline\":\"Why Is Everyone Ignoring Celsius Stock's High Cash Yield?\",\"id\":142731054,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Celsius (CELH) currently trade 58.5% below their two-year high, offering a compelling reason to examine the company. At that price, its free cash flow yield sits at 6.8%, compared with 4.5% for the median S\\u0026P 500 company. Such an elevated yield typically signals either a deeply discounted business or one facing anticipated contraction. So why are investors paying so little for Celsius's cash.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ab910f8d05873bbb3db0d700cb526afa642cae2b4829256552128b0d5f8df112\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791475399,\"headline\":\"What could trigger a US debt crisis? Sozzi discusses with economist Kenneth Rogoff\",\"id\":142730897,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi takes a look at the biggest stories as the trading day kicks off, weighing in on PepsiCo's (PEP) latest earnings results, General Motors' (GM) latest update, and more. Sozzi also sits down with Kenneth Rogoff, the International Monetary Fund's (IMF) former chief economist and Harvard University's current Maurits C. Boas chair and professor of international economics. The two discuss various looming risks to the US economy, including the deficit, the specter of a debt crisis, the AI economy's growing wealth divide, and more. Rogoff is also a chess grandmaster and former chess champion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ba7dba3492558ae45a4c107b3c7791a564e600f8ffb29d9f44734d43b6103ca1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791474715,\"headline\":\"'Coca-Cola looks to sell Costa Coffee; Seeking To Unwind Its $5B Acquisition Of A British Coffeehouse' - Semafor Exclusive\",\"id\":142763377,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.semafor.com/article/10/08/2026/coca-cola-looks-to-sell-costa-coffee\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=85bda6e3f278a2464dd31a9d04208829f0b2b180e616ff00483b55c4fbee7bea\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791468438,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo cuts guidance: What these red flags are telling investors\",\"id\":142729861,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo (PEP) stock is getting some lift on Thursday after the snack company cut its forward guidance. On the company's earnings call, CEO Ramón Laguarta said: \\\"We don't feel good about the beverage business.\\\" Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi examines PepsiCo's reaction to quarterly results.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a1f070bb92b382403aa7ddfc5075f06343238820208f2c21fb9878311ea616df\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791466012,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Is Handing Market Share to Coca-Cola, Analyst Warns\",\"id\":142762147,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/08/Minsk--Belarus--July-13--2023---Electron.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola stock gains as investors flock to defensive stocks and PepsiCo\\u0026#39;s beverage struggles fuel hopes of market-share gains\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=771555004ec02a83f891e6ee22aeb9050a5e719a533b484200c99b1cc2c64c34\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791464100,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Q3 Earnings \\u0026 Revenues Beat Estimates on International Growth\",\"id\":142729862,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PEP's Q3'26 earnings and revenues beat estimates, fueled by robust international growth and pricing gains, even as North American pressures persist.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f20e098b3af1525bec8f4599e35dda4e3440e795ea3fdc8baf6b9b77c6d9c6c2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791463547,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola or PepsiCo: If I Had to Hand One to My Grandkids, It Would Be This One\",\"id\":142727368,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Both Coca-Cola and PepsiCo have raised dividends for decades, but one carries structural cracks that could quietly erode a portfolio meant to outlast its owner. The choice between them comes down to a risk most investors overlook.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=245d62a0e038ffc2a3b74f498f011a5fc7cb70e669a9d249e1d6c939762148aa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791460234,\"headline\":\"These 5 Dividend Stocks Are Americas Favorite Companies\",\"id\":142726044,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Procter and Gamble has raised its dividend every year for seven decades, and it is not even the highest-yielding name on this list. These five household giants reveal just how differently income investors can play the same dividend-safety game.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c685c60093078bb7ae0fbbdb88c164e3a827d4e82ea2171405cec72f08698c1a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791458624,\"headline\":\"What barriers and opportunities face functional beverage makers?\",\"id\":142724909,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Functionality in drinks was a theme that thread itself through several talks and panels at the Non-Alcoholic Beverages conference in London last month.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c73e391d18214e6cd5f28b545f0f1eca252b7f8b5f5a7435d2ea6c806725f61f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791458145,\"headline\":\"Is Coca-Cola’s Safety Premium Getting Too Expensive?\",\"id\":142724384,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola just posted its best volume growth in nearly two decades, raised guidance twice, and beat earnings six quarters straight. So why do the numbers suggest investors may already be paying too much for that track record?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b67b7a971284f5b87d8dbc89482ebb3c57770e18f38ac83eef4ce28ccc92ddb0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791457745,\"headline\":\"8 Of 11 Sectors Fall In Thursday Trading As Energy Leads\",\"id\":142761278,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/08/Stock-Market-Trading-Chart-And-Analyzing.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Three sectors are higher and eight are lower in Thursday\\u0026#39;s regular session, with the top three split across cyclical, defensive and growth groups. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with Energy clearly ahead of the next sectors in the ranking.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7ba3ed272714de30d8449468da93c18b22f4812734ad8a9471a40b76efa0b11b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791457200,\"headline\":\"Olipop Founder won by being a 'functional lunatic': Early Investor\",\"id\":142733112,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Barrel Ventures Partner Nate Cooper explains to Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi why he specifically looks to invest in \\\"functional lunatics,\\\" why the best startup ideas are fiercely non-consensus, and how ignoring the naysayers is required to build an incredible organization.\",\"u