to decelerate from Q2 levels. Click here to find out why KO stock is a Sell.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6cc0be9004f9e0988f10663245a1f1468c8ae3705bfc4b530eed4542cec1b8dd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791425426,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola (KO) Raises Its Outlook, Is The Stock Still Undervalued?\",\"id\":142708252,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola (KO) reported strong quarterly revenue and volume gains and raised its full-year outlook, as it focuses on zero sugar and prebiotic drinks while appointing Rob Gehring to lead its North America unit. Coca-Cola’s recent updates on volume growth, zero sugar offerings and prebiotic launches come as the share price sits at US$85.82, with year to date share price return of 24.16% and a 1 year total shareholder return of 33.24%, pointing to firm momentum rather than a short burst of...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=622d05a3ecfd1dc4b8d583b8da47da60cf05a8beec9310a252ed84062d97143b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791421802,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola vs. Monster Beverage: Which Consumer Goods Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142704921,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola has a 28.5% profit margin and massive global brand recognition, while Monster owns a virtually debt-free balance sheet and 19.6% quarterly earnings growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=df2becee913f29096dc09204588c8d55cdb178cbac142a91d0c4048ce00b054a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791403473,\"headline\":\"Coke's prebiotic soda, Starbucks-Chipotle tie-up, Modelo sales: Food roundup\",\"id\":142700379,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Market Domination Host Brooke DiPalma reports on the latest headlines out of the food industry, including Coca-Cola's (KO) new zero-sugar prebiotic soda, murmurs of a tie-up between Starbucks (SBUX) and Chipotle Mexican Grill (CMG), and Constellation Brands' (STZ) sales of Modelo.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e6b72528840513dd02f3091e384ec1052791f5d38337422d0990d382cf81a149\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791384084,\"headline\":\"My Only Dividend Buy This October Has Raised Its Payout Every Year for Decades\",\"id\":142697134,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo sits near a 52-week low while its dividend check keeps climbing, and one specific combination of warning signs would make this buyer walk away entirely.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9d6baca672714cbcee103a92cce0b61da7701513c44b18a2344a10dccd163a31\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791382260,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola steps into better-for-you soda market with prebiotics\",\"id\":142697133,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The soda giant is entering the buzzy category and will compete with Olipop and PepsiCo-owned Poppi.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bcc77b00f55e2dccd572bd5fb90dc77a944f17e4ec05378651c6b03549c7251d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791380022,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Q3 Preview: Stock At Lowest Since 2020, Market Expert Sees 19% Downside On Weak Report\",\"id\":142726969,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/07/Moscow--Russia-april-4--2014-Can-Of-Peps.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Pepsi stock hit new multi-year lows ahead of Q3 earnings. Here\\u0026#39;s the key items to watch to move shares higher.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=409ebb3ef2a54b43b279a8b208ffa82e2496bfa96b243e9640af34ff19ffb3fb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791376989,\"headline\":\"The Crash-Proof Portfolio: 5 Elite Dividend Stocks Built to Survive a Market Meltdown\",\"id\":142694801,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Market indicators are flashing red heading into October, and investors who wait too long to reposition may regret it. Five elite dividend stocks in healthcare, consumer staples, and utilities have weathered every major crash for decades, and they are still trading at compelling entry points right now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0412e7381eb39cf868ba807db843786d0f628a00cc0f89a8bd2d45e58b3ccaa3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791372708,\"headline\":\"October Dogs Of The Dow: No Buys But 10 Are Worth Watching\",\"id\":142696865,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1749214597/image_1749214597.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"October 2026 finds 21 of 30 Dow stocks with sufficient free cash flow to support dividends, but none are ideally fair-priced by yield standards.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f5cc9877b0d6b56d9f45c7b5926b6c81bc5d7a245f22a4efe3e081f0f0ea3d56\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791364500,\"headline\":\"2 Dividend Machines With 20+ Years Of Payouts, Now On Sale\",\"id\":142694330,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2263839906/image_2263839906.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Higher rates have created a rare chance to buy quality dividend payers at yields not seen in years. Check out the two dividend machines here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2fe022b373226f0a6d97e05ab8592387075d0525c78250bf4cbe62a93fd9952f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791320551,\"headline\":\"Better Dividend Stock: Coca-Cola vs. Realty Income\",\"id\":142668758,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysRealty Income yields about 6%, compared with about 2. 5% for Coca-Cola.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a6f3e547caa1868cb14e66f4e04ef31e715725ecd80b8560d0c13229c02f17c3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791318180,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola refreshes soda lineup amid GLP-1 consumer shift\",\"id\":142668759,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A familiar drinks giant is betting on changing appetites.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8a5e4ee60c236a916de2acb83619c27a85e9016b2aae45b018ab0e66b187947a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791315972,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer Finds More Than a Stock Price Gap Between PepsiCo (PEP) and Coca-Cola (KO)\",\"id\":142667734,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"During the October 2 episode of Mad Money, Jim Cramer discussed the widening gap between PepsiCo, Inc. (NASDAQ:PEP) and The Coca-Cola Company (NYSE:KO) ahead of PepsiCo’s earnings report. He said: Speaking of burdens, on Thursday morning, we have one of the most problematic earnings reports imaginable: that of PepsiCo. For years, this company was running […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1df8439e5f9b77a9e9662532aafe1ce85f8a7fe3461d15a0fbf8c53ca183c848\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791308714,\"headline\":\"Bond Yields Are Soaring: These 5 Fortress Dividend Stocks Offer Shelter for Income Investors\",\"id\":142666804,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bond yields are rising fast enough to rattle stocks. The 10-year Treasury yield now stands at 5.24%. When rates rise and valuations wobble, the most reliable income comes from companies that sell things people buy in any economy: soda, snacks, detergent, diapers and toothpaste. The five consumer staples giants below pair global brands with decades […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=74ed456716b6f44abb2aaf18ffa490dd9e11572f563a79060f0b41e55ff021a3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791308355,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo's Next Earnings Report on Oct. 8 2026 Could Send the Stock Plunging. Here's Why.\",\"id\":142666676,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pepsico is trading near a five-year low, but that's for a good reason.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=becc29b896a0892df58326399ed59ba96c7663e0ae7696b170f14d8a095478e0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791303338,\"headline\":\"Procter \\u0026 Gamble Has Raised Its Dividend for 70 Years. These 4 Stocks Share Its Reliability\",\"id\":142666767,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yield alone tells you nothing about whether a dividend actually survives a recession or a patent cliff. These five stocks have built long streaks of consecutive raises from businesses that look nothing alike, and the reasons behind that staying power are worth understanding.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=25c5fd40b420dea0f8a388ecd7e0cab953e8946ed0648dfaa9f044c8880127c0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791293100,\"headline\":\"Crypto Heavyweights Back OKX at $25B Valuation\",\"id\":142662847,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"OKX raised new funding at a $25 billion valuation, with Circle (NYSE: $CRCL), Ripple and Standard Chartered's i...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c3d7659d63342b047715263415be4a6c34591f6c8df42e9255d0ed252d054a10\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791291840,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Sharpens Price-Pack Strategy: Can Affordability Pay Off?\",\"id\":142665594,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PEP sharpens its price-pack strategy to boost affordability and volumes as North American demand softens and cost pressures persist.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9ed96b9329478c676c2d40780840008004a22c0c8f9aa16f3cc59e731d9ea972\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791290978,\"headline\":\"$100,000 in 5 Dividend Kings Will Generate Close to $4,000 Each Year Safely\",\"id\":142662977,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"When paychecks stop, the wrong income strategy forces you to sell shares at the worst possible moment. Five companies have raised their dividends through every recession and rate shock in modern memory, and together they turn a single portfolio into a reliable cash machine.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a94fb58f1bc39299028dfa47644453f08b69879c1aa73aeb3a13ea968279018b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791290766,\"headline\":\"Has Coca-Cola Stock Become A Different Bet?\",\"id\":142662992,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola (KO) stock is priced at 26.0 times earnings, against 21.5 for the S\\u0026P 500. Shareholders paying that premium need to know what they are buying, and that has changed. In October 2024, on its fiscal Q3 2024 call, management was talking about steep price increases in a handful of markets with high inflation. Now it leads with something else. So what is it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c2103f29220007cf1bb7204ad0f11a8575a577169743c71d756019e9b2eab755\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791288012,\"headline\":\"NFL Legend Rob Gronkowski Didn't Want Stock For His Drink Endorsement — Years Later It Paid A 'Huge Check'\",\"id\":142662995,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Rob Gronkowski played 11 seasons in the NFL and was able to make millions playing and from endorsement deals. Similar to some other athletes, he used his endorsement money to live off of and tried not to dip into his...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0f25cac7d420923a9a1fdf227542d31ecb2925721e2e81f7d2257f72c6b9ef2d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791284700,\"headline\":\"These 5 Dividend Stocks Are Money-Printing Machines\",\"id\":142661925,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"These five consumer dividend payers aren't just collecting checks. They're actively reshaping their businesses to keep the cash coming.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ab54887632a3361500c823469c8fa72b3dfd2de50f18d6c1f7ad775c6d5c7249\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791255179,\"headline\":\"NYSE’s Parent Just Filed to Tokenize 63 US Stocks on a Crypto-Native Exchange — And the SEC Already Gave It Permission\",\"id\":142645982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The most conservative institution in US market infrastructure just filed to tokenize 63 of America’s most recognizable stocks on a crypto-native exchange. Intercontinental Exchange, the parent company of the New York Stock Exchange, and OKX announced OKXICE, a 50/50 joint venture that will offer tokenized versions of Nvidia, Tesla, Apple, Microsoft, Amazon, JPMorgan, Walmart, Coca-Cola, […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=747b93a1b9acffd07c7