nt, though, particularly if you're new. Getting started on a firm footing allows you to be selectively aggressive in the future.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d87da75990da13c02fd387c258313324b149327acb2af33786fe4207795bc702\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791098700,\"headline\":\"Greg Abel-Led Berkshire Hathaway Owns 3 Consumer Stocks. Here's the One I'd Buy First.\",\"id\":142620467,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"And it's not the one you're probably thinking of.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f9ded6632a34fb3bc2522c6fde2c07bb888461cb9a051e2d28d39060e4dd3c47\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791063781,\"headline\":\"History Says Coca-Cola Stock Holds Up When the S\\u0026P 500 Falls\",\"id\":142616464,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The drinks giant beat the index in seven of the market's eight losing years since 1980. But is this record worth around 26 times earnings?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=323b34923195133a26af37257e6b26e48ff50058975d954f035b36dfb474f88c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791041400,\"headline\":\"Thinking About Buying 10-Year Treasury Notes Yielding 5.3% Instead of Dividend Stocks Like Coca-Cola? Consider These 3 Factors First.\",\"id\":142614974,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Many dividend stocks can't compete with Treasury notes on yield alone in today's elevated interest rate environment.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=65107b2b4dd5d78aeea04a8cfc78fab674af8143c64576674fcf76249fae108c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791028200,\"headline\":\"Breakfast News: The 20-Year Stock Challenge\",\"id\":142613262,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yah