e_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Buffett's wisdom is priceless.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=88266cc2832909759629af885fc70660bca769f0d01cca320b9ea53a2129e160\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790949300,\"headline\":\"Can Keurig Dr Pepper's Innovation Pipeline Reignite Coffee Growth?\",\"id\":142590821,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"KDP is betting on brewer and pod innovation, precision marketing and JDE Peet's integration to improve U.S. Coffee trends in the second half of 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d0cb75de3056b1acc15b272338ef010e465473987ea8e1b66e1a3966839e917c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790945447,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola Investors Get Another Sip of Its Sparkling Dividend\",\"id\":142588460,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola just cut another quarterly check to shareholders, but the real story is what the payout reveals about the company's financial strength, its ongoing IRS battle, and whether 64 consecutive years of dividend raises are in jeopardy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2faabeac51d485b632861a06bba7301cb1fe123c2d509ebc62cc2c74d5a8427e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790938892,\"headline\":\"8 Of 11 Sectors Rise Friday As Growth Leads\",\"id\":142590478,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/02/Charts-Of-Financial-Instruments-With-Var.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Friday\\u0026#39;s regular session has eight sectors higher and three lower, with growth sectors holding two of the top three positions. The leaders are clustered, with less than a quarter-point separating the top three sectors.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f3811fb0268670d0a3fadaa1f32444c29b09a67de3d3d33d9abb18b71da84971\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790885781,\"headline\":\"KO vs. PEP: 64 and 54 Straight Years of Raises. Which Dividend King Will Crush the Other Over the Next Decade?\",\"id\":142562924,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysPepsiCo yields 4. 6% compared with Coca-Cola’s 2.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=210df040b09d1d66d6bb950f75d0721592ea4a6f121254d0c8fbc11da86383c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790869260,\"headline\":\"Momentum has been named the Sponsorship Marketing Association’s  Agency of the Year\",\"id\":142559731,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NEW YORK, Oct. 01, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Momentum has been named Agency of the Year by the Sponsorship Marketing Association (SMA), marking a first for the agency. The SMA cited Momentum for delivering its biggest year yet, executing disruptive activations in 2025 at the FIFA Club World Cup, Super Bowl and F1 for brands including Anheuser-Busch, Coca-Cola, GEICO, Verizon and Walmart. “We are proud to be recognized as the SMA’s Agency of the Year,” said Momentum Global President \\u0026 CMO Kevin Mc\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b889d2bef02c59092f9d6989a498d9e27cd95e4d96bbe312c225e43a0ec20484\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790867403,\"headline\":\"Why Coca-Cola (KO) is Poised to Beat Earnings Estimates Again\",\"id\":142560888,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola (KO) has an impressive earnings surprise history and currently possesses the right combination of the two key ingredients for a likely beat in its next quarterly report.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=50be76046582d57c25e9b1ef62c8154da4ba0d540115eee182cd97a2c294fa2b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790866981,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Q3 Earnings Preview: Operational Tailwinds Might Not Be Enough To Appease Investors\",\"id\":142561488,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2263677619/image_2263677619.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo's upcoming quarterly report next could hit the pause button on the recent sell-off. Read the latest analysis on the PEP stock here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cce7a1aa09fefbd1084540ae6b5071eacdf95bcca301deddbd6cf8a0aa8ada75\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790864160,\"headline\":\"Constellation Brands' Pre-Q2 Earnings: Is It Poised to Beat Estimates?\",\"id\":142559766,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"STZ heads into Q2'26 with revenue growth expected, beer strength in focus and cost pressures threatening margin expansion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f274002b1c5f59cd24dbf686e8872c01163911d1b7683b5fd5f19b4d7b7ecf8c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790863507,\"headline\":\"2 Consumer Stocks with Promising Prospects and 1 We Turn Down\",\"id\":142558357,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Regarded as defensive investments, consumer staples stocks are generally safe bets in choppy markets. The flip side is that they frequently fall behind growth industries when times are good, and this perception became a reality over the past six months as the sector was down 3.3% while the S\\u0026P 500 was up 16.6%.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5b6096bb5a06c070b5076f8b8a17195f02ea74ebddc607203dd4cae3924482ea\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790863200,\"headline\":\"My Top 10 High-Yield Picks For October 2026: Two Yielding Above 10%\",\"id\":142561116,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/485734009/image_485734009.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Ten dividend-paying companies offer attractive valuations, strong financial health, and dividend growth potential. Check out the list here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=96bcff2ce07a30010a00cfd8e24a898ad48c59b99138052e497dca610a6c908e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790860740,\"headline\":\"5 Solid Dividend Stocks to Buy Now\",\"id\":142557735,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Five dividend payers across four sectors promise to keep raising payouts through the next downturn, but one of them carries a GAAP payout ratio above 100% and a negative book value that would alarm most income investors at first glance.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d5ff87426f42ed66416c92785b6f8227551d76c891ddf7e7cceb550be11ba136\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790824466,\"headline\":\"Coca Cola (KO) Keeps Raising Its Outlook After Consecutive Earnings Beats\",\"id\":142530182,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola (NYSE:KO) regained a long term Marriott hotel beverage contract in 2026 after several decades without the agreement. The group is advancing an African bottling refranchising program in 2026, shifting more local production and distribution to regional partners. Management has reported consecutive earnings beats in recent quarters and has raised earnings guidance for the current financial year. The Marriott win, African bottling refranchising and upgraded earnings guidance together...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=04ded74bf58be35a09e0a87837ccb00685d1b3c1d155f7920ec2a4511f4277fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790819937,\"headline\":\"Popular energy drink brand discontinues 12 flavors\",\"id\":142530183,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"If you grab the same can every afternoon, check the list before stores stop restocking it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3452f63bb3f469343e1cefd1173ec8628fc4231316d25024f6971a1e5b9321f1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790781433,\"headline\":\"2 Reasons to Watch KO and 1 to Stay Cautious\",\"id\":142520867,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"While the S\\u0026P 500 is up 21.1% since March 2026, Coca-Cola (currently trading at $87.00 per share) has lagged behind, posting a return of 14.1%. This may have investors wondering how to approach the situation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a9dcd654793b80d15021a2652a0f064001ddc00648e7442532dcf59669900ac6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790776860,\"headline\":\"Can Innovation Help PepsiCo Outpace Industry Headwinds?\",\"id\":142520868,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PEP is betting on hydration, zero-sugar, functional products and better-for-you foods to fuel growth amid inflation and softer North American demand.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f9a6c2af34b3e0d8dba381aa38eda2e2600d27ba1b60441cd825bcbc23847286\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790772344,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola’s Secret Weapon Isn’t Its Soda\",\"id\":142517216,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola has beaten earnings five straight quarters and raised its guidance, yet a pending IRS ruling and a price-to-free-cash-flow ratio of 71 hang over the stock like a storm cloud. Here is what the bulls are betting the bears have wrong.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5be639e8f3c5c7baed8878b41c8bef9941b47107b4b5f37a7d219601d75de317\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790771250,\"headline\":\"Here's What to Expect From Coca-Cola’s Next Earnings Report\",\"id\":142522983,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola is set to report its Q3 earnings next month, with analysts expecting single-digit year-over-year EPS growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=102fbd4b13575fc63114d9559fba4c15b9689484fb93a2a04e67cd2f1de64ba3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790769904,\"headline\":\"Billionaires Love These 2 Dividend Kings\",\"id\":142514426,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amid inflation worries and concerns about an AI bubble, investors are looking for safe and reliable dividend plays. An analysis of Insider Monkey’s proprietary database of billionaire-held stocks shows S\\u0026P Global (NYSE:SPGI) and Coca-Cola (NYSE:KO) are among the top favorite Dividend Kings of billionaires. A Dividend King is a company that has raised its dividend […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=47e4b4f208ea41744d2cba987c7e75261d580c5d6e06fdd176ecb062f61f902a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790769605,\"headline\":\"CocaCola Company (The) (KO) is Attracting Investor Attention: Here is What You Should Know\",\"id\":142517583,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Recently, Zacks.com users have been paying close attention to Coca-Cola (KO). This makes it worthwhile to examine what the stock has in store.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7af93939b4fe05298351d4a9fb2ee7b2f3fe8e66b6fedfd8583b95670fdd6418\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790766942,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Walks a Tightrope: Dividend Growth Meets Operating Cash Flow Squeeze\",\"id\":142513189,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo just handed shareholders another dividend raise even as profits fell sharply, and the real question is not whether the payout is safe today but whether the cash engine behind it can survive what comes next.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=16e6f3c37492b25005ba9f1ad3b1f98f96d4678eeced056262ddc94d75d82756\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790750760,\"headline\":\"The Zacks Analyst Blog Highlights Coca-Cola, Philip Morris, Mondelez and Dole\",\"id\":142512116,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"KO, PM, MDLZ and DOLE stand out as defensive consumer staples amid falling sentiment, rising inflation and renewed rate-hike concerns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=342de438618df84931ef50a56b60b2cc8607a9cdbe9e8c59bd675f4164286372\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790708220,\"headline\":\"Defensive Dividends: 3 Companies Investors Can Rely On\",\"id\":142501459,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Several members of the elite Dividend Kings club, including JNJ, KO, and ABBV, are known for dividend reliability, each with a long, consistent history of increasing payouts. The trio boasts a strong defensive nature given consumers' needs for their products no matter the backdrop.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4f09ab652b0ab864739c65ee5f41a756c9bf610f027aaffe5c97b8d2fd8c1c80\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790706893,\"headline\":\"Pepsi vs. Coke: This Is How Much You Could Make by 2031\",\"id\":142500408,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coke is outpacing Pepsi by a wide margin this year, but one projected scenario shows the losing stock actually protecting your money better by 2031. The answer depends entirely on how much downside you can afford.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=abed3b6378a69591e4a4fa8c9e2a4d7702d1724f03053dca5deabd0f3dc7af98\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790695200,\"headline\":\"I'd Put $1,000 Into Each of These 3 Dividend Stocks and Lose the Password\",\"id\":142498025,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On a $3,000 combined investment, these Dividend Kings would pay $79 in income over the next year.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4d2b664551be13ea8bc19f7bb6ee3d5ecd814ca0365e92ebe683d0f8ef728eb3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790690400,\"headline\":\"The Coca-Cola Company Announces Timing of Third Quarter 2026 Earnings Release\",\"id\":142498197,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ATLANTA, September 29, 2026--The Coca-Cola Company today announced it will release third quarter 2026 financial results Oct. 27 before the New York Stock Exchange opens. The release will be followed by an investor conference call at 8:30 a.m. ET to discuss the results.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d3c0d449456fd03f7cbb5626492b98a90049e5fc08250a53148233cacc49229e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790687700,\"headline\":\"Here's Exactly How Much $10,000 Invested in Coca-Cola Has Paid Out in Dividends Since 1988\",\"id\":142495914,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Reliable annual dividend hikes can compound more rapidly than you might expect.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=be58945d81dae186ad6234eaf5fa64878a63b8dcdadbde0eee748e279c05c59f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790685420,\"headline\":\"KO vs. MNST: Which Beverage Stock Has the Stronger Growth Story?\",\"id\":142495916,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola pairs global scale, portfolio breadth and improving margins with stronger stock gains, while Monster Beverage delivers rapid energy-drink growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4aca4fbfb330784a21ebb92658a6c5cd807c3a1d380c36949ee7e458547f188d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790683227,\"headline\":\"Living Off Dividends at 65: 3 Stocks That Raised Payouts for Longer Than 30 Years\",\"id\":142495873,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Three stocks have raised their dividends for over 30 consecutive years through recessions, wars, and market crashes, and one has paid shareholders without interruption for 136 years straight. Find out which name a 65-year-old retiree should anchor their income portfolio around.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=79d7e142be5f678ac76be78db4d961fead5fa68184148e38f905a73e237edc9c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790682660,\"headline\":\"McCormick Readies for Q3 Earnings: What to Expect From MKC Stock?\",\"id\":142495917,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"McCormick heads into Q3 earnings with expected revenue growth, improving Consumer trends and Flavor Solutions momentum, while cost pressures remain.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b3d3a82da73f02356c9724e9302650e4ec824e22c101e50a8247fa52f5286b4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1