oca-Cola, Lowers Price Target to $95\",\"id\":142496657,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"JP Morgan  analyst Andrea Teixeira   maintains Coca-Cola (NYSE:KO) with a Overweight and lowers the price target from $96 to $95.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=56778d530849edd934f0d4c476dc9175a3117f56de8fe681558ae67b88ca6aa7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790602320,\"headline\":\"What's Driving Coca-Cola's Broad-Based Global Volume Growth?\",\"id\":142468214,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"KO's global volume rises 5% y/y in Q2'26 as stronger execution, portfolio breadth, innovation and revenue growth management support demand.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4951b6797ddeb42d5af0eca776c55ee975d8774eaa5490549e4723d8e377eb64\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790602039,\"headline\":\"Monster exec returns to Coca-Cola as North America president\",\"id\":142466312,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Rob Gehring will return to Coca-Cola after working as CEO of Americas at Monster Energy Company.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3fa6274f6e25932c41ac89334e02741a8afac4d4967f5ef78fc523273bea994a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790601339,\"headline\":\"Be Careful With Coca-Cola Right Now\",\"id\":142466114,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"KO\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola has beaten earnings estimates ten quarters in a row, raised its dividend for the 63rd straight year, and outpaced the S\\u0026P 500 by a wide margin. So why might right now be exactly the wrong moment to buy?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5d02edd3fe1bc703c2f11d834c5363aaeba6ce7100eebfda8a2a12c03701c213\"}]"
