      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792366040,\"headline\":\"The Winners Inside SCHD - October 2026\",\"id\":142992053,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=338e046f3cae53ba7d15e9918dd078db2c4d26bc477673975dbc84454a9e73f7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792345800,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy Costco Stock Before Oct. 30? Here's the Clear Answer.\",\"id\":142987976,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors who plan to hold Costco shares for the long term can reap the benefits of its stock price appreciation, special dividends, and quarterly dividend payouts.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bf6c343ab978a09279c2ee8caa5b2419d7797e5da5df61c5d15d1dc73e2455da\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792304769,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Week Ahead\",\"id\":142985350,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b003098e70a6cdd7a3ab60fb61978bd51c28cff1b3b3250070bf025dbecfc5c3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792301807,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola Stock Is Up 39% in a Year. Here’s What’s Driving the Rally\",\"id\":142984390,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysCoca-Cola stock is up 39% over the past year to a $94 close on October 16, after KFC picked Coke as its beverage partner for 3,718 US restaurants. The Street’s $95 mean target sits only 1% above the close.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=feae6a8327e5f3ee8c8203d9ef1004cdb58189647bf848756a226e5ad42bf3f0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792255167,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo or Philip Morris: The One Dividend Stock I’d Hold for the Next 20 Years\",\"id\":142987986,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysPhilip Morris International raised its quarterly dividend 8. 8% on Sept.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b6d02aca1bbf6322075443155df417d89592c0772d8a40cf60ceafc57a63828a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792254082,\"headline\":\"Verizon or PepsiCo: The One Dividend Stock I’d Hold for the Next 20 Years\",\"id\":142983465,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysOn Oct. 8, PepsiCo cut its fiscal 2026 core EPS growth outlook to 2.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6a6d9fd77b1060143ef6b3f14633ad284025a809d2860b33935f6dd107094180\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792253261,\"headline\":\"Chevron or PepsiCo: Only One Gets My Dividend Dollars for the Next 20 Years\",\"id\":142962632,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysPepsiCo cut its fiscal 2026 core EPS growth outlook to 2. 5% to 3.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30684bb5f1a67107e068a06b71a4ad12925301bb8ee6ea6759d5ed44778185d0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792245618,\"headline\":\"Procter \\u0026 Gamble Has Raised Its Dividend for 70 Years. These 2 Stocks Share Its Advantage\",\"id\":142961958,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Raising dividends through two recessions takes more than a good brand name. Three companies with streaks stretching back decades show exactly what separates a payout that survives a crisis from one that quietly disappears.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e87fb12b8e9c1708a4ae403c0de93b2c8c68f0b22f492b70de64be9dd0a3313f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792227053,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo (NASDAQ:PEP): A Quality Stock With Mixed Growth and Cash Metrics\",\"id\":142959379,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/thumbnail_article_luc_kroeze_c1f44c837d.webp\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo quality analysis: strong ROIC, cash conversion and EBIT growth offset softer revenue and leverage, making PEP a deeper-research candidate.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4c81a94236495ad5bb748f5781081c2b08e55cc334138e4f586af71224af0010\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792217274,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola (KO) Will Supply Drinks At KFC U.S. Starting In 2027\",\"id\":142959156,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"KFC U.S. has selected Coca-Cola (NYSE:KO) as its exclusive beverage supplier, replacing PepsiCo across its U.S. restaurants. The new U.S. fountain partnership is set to begin in 2027, ending a multi decade relationship between KFC and PepsiCo. The agreement gives Coca-Cola expanded brand exposure within a major U.S. quick service chain as KFC refreshes its menu and drink lineup. The KFC U.S. switch to Coca-Cola fits into a wider set of shifts in foodservice partnerships that recent research...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fa9039af345745ede41b1f07fca6c047cc830aeca7dd7e9393c8de8e03c4819c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792180362,\"headline\":\"PEP Stock Alert: KFC Just Dealt PepsiCo a Blow With New Coca-Cola Deal\",\"id\":142957860,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"KFC’s U.S. business is switching from Pepsi to Coca-Cola beginning in January. Here’s what the announcement means for PEP shares.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fd1920e3c5f02f0728d248487562a1bc2225d60e8bca5777647166a652146dcc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792180339,\"headline\":\"Tesla staffs up Nevada Semi plant as fleet orders stack up\",\"id\":142950806,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Job boards show Tesla recruiting for Semi assembly, quality and service roles in Sparks as WattEV, IMC and the ZET SCALE alliance line up electric Class 8 orders. The post Tesla staffs up Nevada Semi plant as fleet orders stack up appeared first on FreightWaves.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0c5a66aba0d820f37f8fae97d09a485f665a5630b070f8d9e0f2c5a48d6d7a4e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179933,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Is Down 25% From Its 52-Week High and Losing KFC to Coke. Here’s Where the Stock Could Go by 2030\",\"id\":142950856,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for PepsiCo StockCurrent Price: $128. 38Target Price (Mid): ~$181Street Target: ~$142Potential Total Return: ~41%Annualized IRR: ~8.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9d678a0ffa84bde60f6c3b240c8917d98f2bb92e2396f23d644e5b9327b23790\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792175905,\"headline\":\"Target or PepsiCo: Only One Gets My Dividend Dollars for the Next 10 Years\",\"id\":142950129,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysPepsiCo cut its 2026 core EPS growth outlook to 2. 5% to 3.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=85ba5936baa33654440a450a8caef6da323d1a8875b3d0691f04f83940c39a8d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169360,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola Tops Buy Point After Landing A Whale. Four Other Top Stocks In Buy Zones.\",\"id\":142949143,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola rose above the 92.49 buy point of a flat base. It was among the actionable stocks Friday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e0a48e2e6def1f2fc47bda657b08ade7c7349141194884aa1667e412ada09923\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167427,\"headline\":\"What Is Going On With PepsiCo Stock?\",\"id\":142949145,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo (PEP) stock trades at 16.1 times earnings. The median S\\u0026P 500 company, by contrast, trades at 22.8 times earnings. Over the past year, PepsiCo shares lost 11.9%, while the S\\u0026P 500 returned 17.9%. This underperformance occurred even as the company posted higher sales, margins, and cash flow in the twelve months to September 5, 2026. The market is either overlooking an improving business, or accurately pricing a company with stalled growth. What does a buyer get at this price.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a6df16beffc601dd6f4b7d21b67062f4f10e72ccb790ee3030e036ea6329dd95\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161660,\"headline\":\"Leftovers: Ghirardelli bites into Dubai chocolate | PepsiCo’s Flamin’ Hot spices up Pilgrim’s chicken\",\"id\":142948064,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The chocolatier is the latest to jump into the TikTok-inspired craze, while California Pizza Kitchen expands its CPG lineup with prepackaged salads.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8041071c0763346f1ae4501e815e61005f8c1d5ab53ca22db168361b63d56c93\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159584,\"headline\":\"KFC breaks up with Pepsi, signing Coke as its new drink provider\",\"id\":142948007,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Kentucky Fried Chicken — a subsidiary of Yum! Brands (YUM) — just signed a deal for Coca-Cola (KO) to be its new beverage provider in the US, replacing PepsiCo (PEP). Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi outlines the loss this represents for the US drink manufacturer.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2f2c99d0354c0229d934afba5d5df49b3f20d0ee32c62a3deefa2623aa939c13\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159542,\"headline\":\"KFC Signs Deal With New Soda Supplier in a Blow for PepsiCo\",\"id\":142948006,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"KFC has teamed up with Coca-Cola to be its new soda supplier in America — ditching longtime friend Pepsi in the process. The fast-food chain inked a deal with The Coca-Cola Company to be its new beverage partner for U.S. stores beginning in January 2027, according to a news release issued Thursday, October 15. Coca-Cola […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=320e25922bf495503e3ab4690971c2599a1a5f334798587df9701564135714a2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792156216,\"headline\":\"KFC Is Dumping Pepsi for Coca-Cola After 40 Years\",\"id\":142945627,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"After 40 years of pouring Pepsi, KFC chose Coke, and the move says something bigger about where each beverage giant stands heading into earnings season.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d3313e49ddae83754727fb506e5bed223a5fc2583543b71ca6c7aac7b712119\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155600,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo, PepsiCo Foundation and Feed the Children Mark 2 Million Meals Through School-Based Hunger Relief Program\",\"id\":142945690,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo (NASDAQ: PEP), PepsiCo Foundation and Feed the Children today announced that the Feed the Children Food \\u0026 Essentials Hub program has provided over 2 million meals served this year, marking a significant milestone in their longstanding work to help address childhood hunger. Through school-based hubs, the program connects students and families with nutritious food, household essentials and educational resources, helping bring critical support directly into the communities where families li\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d447859283771408d899b08bdbea4d562b6a200699c0d2f9c70ae665e6abeb1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154922,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola Wins KFC Contract, Ending Decades-Long PepsiCo Partnership\",\"id\":142945628,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Coca-Cola StockPrice change for Coca-Cola stock in last 6 months: 22%$KO Stock Price as of Oct. 15: $9252-Week High: $94$KO Stock Price Target: $95What Happened?Coca-Cola (KO:NYSE) signed a deal on Thursday to become the beverage partner for KFC’s U.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bd44b112d60893428592edb35cdd222b813a1076fdd7faef627b3ab42731066c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792144892,\"headline\":\"Jefferies Maintains Coca-Cola Buy Rating as KFC Switches US Beverage Supply From PepsiCo\",\"id\":142944271,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Jefferies has maintained its Buy rating on Coca-Cola (NYSE:KO) and Hold rating on PepsiCo (NASDAQ:PEP) following KFC’s decision to replace Pepsi with Coca-Cola as its beverage supplier in the United States. The investment bank described the change as unexpected, particularly as it follows Marriott’s decision several months earlier to move to Coca-Cola after maintaining a relationship with Pepsi for approximately 30 years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c2702785d63f1e71ccaa795f40e281367cc8c69fe7c4dabcb546b1358f