expanding services business stoked investor interest.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eafe019c62ce64669af4574e6e975ab26ea081c2dd6074fd2f03985d0eaf7773\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792108383,\"headline\":\"Dow Sees Best Day In Over A Month As Investors Rotate Out Of AI Trade On Overspending Concerns — CRWV, META, SPCX, PEP In Focus\",\"id\":142922964,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"U.S. producer prices came in hot, growing at 6.3% in September, the highest since 2022, following heightened CPI data in the previous session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d6c6b903fe0eda3749e591b2e495d2395c52b212a3cf0e044cd6bc577fb18337\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792101717,\"headline\":\"KFC Dumps Pepsi For Coke In US Restaurants Starting 2027 — PEP Stock Drops\",\"id\":142922999,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"KFC said the transition to Coca-Cola products will begin in January 2027, with full availability expected across all U.S. locations by spring of that year.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3038f6a9e7ce8d357818ece0bfa0a1c220dd6f6fa442bcf79ba0fddb063bd530\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792101300,\"headline\":\"KFC Is ditching Pepsi. Why It Fell Flat With Investors.\",\"id\":142923000,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pepsi gets only a small part of its sales from KFC, but the loss still stings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3d32ecdf3efed406e729774cf5eda3b1b14e6ff189a0fce8cc83ade727dc5188\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792095367,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo (PEP) Warns India Energy Drink Stocks Could Run Out Within Two Months\",\"id\":142922344,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/