,\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola has handed income investors a bigger check every year for six decades, but last year its dividend bill outpaced its free cash flow by billions. Whether that gap signals trouble or a one-time blip could define the next ten years of raises.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cf9032210ab709e373aee8eb3349c74442c158043016578e611627a7909aaa17\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791914702,\"headline\":\"The Market Is Flashing Warning Signals Not Seen in Years. Here’s Why I Just Bought 3 of SCHD’s Dividend Kings.\",\"id\":142853333,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The market's warning signs are driving me to shift my portfolio towards high-quality holdings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9e3a9d5059477fa73d09ff98b5c5f62910957b8221b686b77a184b0b0873a7ce\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791908402,\"headline\":\"Is PepsiCo's Dividend in Danger of Being Cut?\",\"id\":142852537,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The beverage and snack company recently cut its guidance, and its shares have been nosediving this year.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cfec01df50e2ae58fb51155f0f1b6ba04d5b172140200971bc21787579150390\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791905820,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Trades Near 52-Week Low: Should You Buy Now or Wait?\",\"id\":142852481,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PEP trades near its 52-week low as North American weakness, margin pressures and reduced earnings expectations raise questions about its recovery prospects.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e88463bc06738ac761470ae4c36c5555ba6109f9adb7178e719476337d56c775\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791895513,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Stock Has Fallen Out of Favor. That Could Create an Opportunity\",\"id\":142848745,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo sits near a 52-week low after a brutal guidance cut, yet its international business keeps firing on all cylinders while the stock trades at a steep discount to its closest rivals. The question is whether Wall Street has already priced in the pain or is just getting started.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=37205dcfd32b0c42db60825ca6ae417142b57de87c3a9c46f19a93128b87f8b1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791894901,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola vs. PepsiCo: Which Consumer Goods Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142848744,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola boasts a 27% net margin but trades at a steep premium, while PepsiCo's diversified snacks portfolio commands a fraction of the valuation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77f28ded9a227de2db36c1a27ed1ffab03929460c44b5d03d7cb59cf91997355\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791893100,\"headline\":\"3 Top Dividend Stocks Yielding 4% or More to Buy Right Now for Passive Income\",\"id\":142847682,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"These grocery stocks pay yields from 4.3% to 5.2%, funded by brands people buy every week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cf898b10414e10776a92308aa49a3a8fa49169e9f24785e478d32c43f9352ce2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791892800,\"headline\":\"More Than 125 Technology Leaders Registered for HMG Strategy's 19th Annual Greenwich C-Level Technology Leadership Summit on October 15\",\"id\":142848709,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"With Just Two Days Remaining, Qualified Technology Executives Are Encouraged to Register in AdvanceFAIRFIELD, Conn., Oct. 13, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- With only two days remaining before HMG Strategy's 19th Annual Greenwich C-Level Technology Leadership Summit, more than 125 CIOs, CISOs, CTOs, Chief Digital Officers and senior technology executives from leading organizations across Connecticut, Westchester County, New York City and the Northeast have registered to attend the event on October 15\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b0ef2a06f8b01d293983da938d732d1beef04ee585352e83aefb422ae6bb40f7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791890146,\"headline\":\"4 Dividend Kings Retirees Can Buy and Hold Forever: Safe Income for the Next 60 Years\",\"id\":142847065,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Four Dividend Kings have raised their payouts for decades, but a closer look at their cash flows reveals one payout hanging by a thread while another faces a looming tax battle that could shake retiree income.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=097c3dc1cbe8fd0f8242e78c2cfb4ce3729c30536a1a976b8017597485cc95d8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791869213,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo: 15x Earnings And A 4.6% Yield Still Aren't Cheap Enough\",\"id\":142841837,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=039e8c0f197c464c45415a737fe55e6a5b0fd207c7bc14e7023e9bf4f205fee2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791859102,\"headline\":\"Amazon.com vs. Alibaba: Which Consumer Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142832161,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon trades at a premium valuation despite stronger free cash flow, while Alibaba offers a cheaper entry point but faces regulatory headwinds in China.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=48064109132f58a040e930be8cd887eecbf5682e9e48558ac5c1be87580d5f18\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791840174,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo slashes valuation of Poppi bonus payouts as growth slows\",\"id\":142824588,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- PepsiCo Inc (NASDAQ:PEP) has significantly lowered its valuation of potential bonus payments associated with its acquisition of prebiotic soda brand Poppi, signaling that the unit is missing the growth benchmarks required to trigger the earnout.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9e1d7a09f8badce599aa4268419c652d0233884bbadf09ae05d44d9390d8116f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791826996,\"headline\":\"Is Coca-Cola Stock Worth More Than Its Competitors?\",\"id\":142822927,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola (KO) retains more of each sales dollar as operating profit than any of its five designated peers, a group ranging from PepsiCo to Monster Beverage. The company has also delivered the highest stock return among these six companies over the past year. Yet investors currently pay more per dollar of earnings for three of those peers. So what do those three rivals offer that Coca-Cola does not.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5ebc8ae3ecc3f06a09e23d91a1160ce4e166ee9983a85ac98014b1aef69a3db9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791822601,\"headline\":\"'PepsiCo Cuts Estimates for Poppi Payout While Soda Sales Slump' - Bloomberg News\",\"id\":142850680,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-12/pepsico-cuts-estimates-for-poppi-payout-while-soda-sales-slump\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eb1ce35512b8e8c348ccccd03c9bf98c8417b254622b24939a21bb058544c511\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791822306,\"headline\":\"Trading this earnings season may be 'high-risk, high-reward': Barclays strategist\",\"id\":142822805,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Trading this earnings season won't be for the faint of heart.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b0bb228cda5ffb242e89c77ef0fc830321c1d2855b14954fed8a676e9055bd09\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791821478,\"headline\":\"Is PepsiCo’s Euro Bond Raise and Outlook Cut Altering The Investment Case For PepsiCo (PEP)?\",\"id\":142822804,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In early October 2026, PepsiCo completed two euro-denominated fixed-rate bond offerings totaling about €998.89 million, issued as callable, senior unsecured notes with coupons of 3.750% due October 16, 2029, and 4.250% due October 16, 2035, alongside reporting higher third-quarter and nine‑month sales and earnings versus a year earlier. These financings and results came as PepsiCo faced pressure from Elliott Investment Management over slower progress toward margin targets, shifting consumer...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f66c908a5413f171300cbc43457717c20127b742bb968e61c230a0bb8ba4c293\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791819790,\"headline\":\"Barclays Maintains Equal-Weight on PepsiCo, Lowers Price Target to $126\",\"id\":142850681,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Barclays  analyst Lauren Lieberman   maintains PepsiCo (NASDAQ:PEP) with a Equal-Weight and lowers the price target from $133 to $126.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2088a8aa67cdf72c421f53ba9f43ea9556389dd372986fa9c1b19598940aa9