816060,\"headline\":\"Can Coca-Cola's Marketing Investments Keep Improving Returns?\",\"id\":142821656,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"KO's AI-powered marketing and FIFA World Cup campaigns are driving volume growth and margin gains, but can disciplined spending sustain stronger returns?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=28640350645a7916811acd6d6be4a5bc6530a74e68d58245a27db461bff1b964\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791815760,\"headline\":\"Can PepsiCo's Functional Portfolio Capture Wellness Demand?\",\"id\":142821658,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PEP is expanding its functional beverages, protein-rich snacks and zero-sugar offerings to tap wellness demand and unlock new growth opportunities.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f0c7eed6bc7064adcec9b267cf85ce03721063945c3dd773fc83b8a4308ffb38\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791815400,\"headline\":\"The 3 biggest alarm bells going off for the US consumer\",\"id\":142822803,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi breaks down three pieces of data that are raising alarm bells for the US consumer\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=92abc5bfb162e5468f7ef69916ba0ef825652ae3f6ac64ee9784b6c6ccfde2c4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791812100,\"headline\":\"3 Dividend Stocks Worth Holding for the Next 5 Years\",\"id\":142819783,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Dividend stocks are getting hit by rising rates, but this trio of high-yielders is still worth buying and holding.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cb5d2220a3