ar due to poor visual merchandising, according to a recent report.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5651126e16a1297b3d68b81eb1d98f560d18d01626c5512893e6e83c3a828da8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791734444,\"headline\":\"5 Dividend Stocks for Retirees Who Want More Than Just a Big Yield\",\"id\":142807098,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A 5% Treasury yield raises the bar for every dividend stock in a retirement portfolio, and not every high-yielder clears it. These five names span telecom, real estate, consumer staples, utilities, and pharma, and safety comes before yield in every case.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b5477af582e703213b9d7e38c403cb77159443130daf402eac041f3c05debced\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791723780,\"headline\":\"Goldman resets PepsiCo stock target amid inflation and cost pressures\",\"id\":142805777,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pepsi’s CEO said the company’s results came from more than the obvious one-off factors.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3c023ca1155cdbbd1657d1e6c8413976f701ebd547aaac2201d3637cadad102b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791722589,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Just Cut its Earnings Forecast. Is the Stock Still Worth Buying?\",\"id\":142805778,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo, Inc. (NASDAQ:PEP) is a familiar name for investors who want steady income. With a dividend yield close to 4.7%, supported by well-loved brands found in grocery aisles worldwide, it’s easy to see the appeal. Still, the company’s recent earnings outlook is a reminder that even the biggest consumer staples aren’t immune to rising costs […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/n