ings Looking Dirt Cheap\",\"id\":142789291,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1345341921/image_1345341921.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Dividend Kings are among the very best dividend growth stocks in the market, and there are two in particular that have gotten quite cheap. Click to read more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=04591c77ec499e13ab89efa1cc8b9b11e138f1ddf74bdd97558ad5d5be1ab021\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791585420,\"headline\":\"Estimates Keep Rising as Q3 Earnings Season Takes Center Stage\",\"id\":142767863,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Upcoming reports from the big banks next week will shift the Q3 earnings season into a higher gear, with a total of 29 S\\u0026P 500 members on the week's reporting docket. Estimates remain positive, with S\\u0026P 500 earnings expected to grow 24.3% YoY on 11.5% higher revenues.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=73b59c6d79519f821571c067bc86a653580406c019b010d3e65a46f0a8aaa077\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791573110,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo CFO touts cost discipline, slashes guidance\",\"id\":142767179,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The beverage giant is focused on cutting costs as it navigates rising food prices and changing consumer habits which have impacted its North American business.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b8e12ae452e4cbe67ebcfcb1ffa2262d55931119402926d2d3bdc0b7857308e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791572280,\"headline\":\"Pepsi offers attractive risk-reward despite lowered 2026 outlook, says UBS\",\"id\":142766334,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo Inc (NASDAQ:PEP, XETRA:PEP)'s slower-than-expected North America recovery warrants a valuation discount, but UBS says the size of that discount is hard to justify. The food and beverage giant’s quarter gave both bulls and bears something to work with. Pepsi beat expectations on...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ccb531ed8e4a4b4e113871f3fd49bb01e9390ecf0f2c8585312731e3ae9b397f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791571550,\"headline\":\"Forget Chasing the Biggest Yield. These 5 Dividend Stocks Have Something Better\",\"id\":142766267,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"One of these five blue chips has sent shareholders a dividend check every single quarter since 1916, and that kind of staying power changes how you think about building retirement income from scratch.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c631beddb8e54fab195a40e1314bac30245aaccf8b679d9912b8c9b958d2ad30\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791563070,\"headline\":\"Citigroup Maintains Neutral on PepsiCo, Lowers Price Target to $135\",\"id\":142792240,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Citigroup  analyst Filippo Falorni   maintains PepsiCo (NASDAQ:PEP) with a Neutral and lowers the price target from $142 to $135.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=68213dcc1ed972b97b90eb7fb71bdbdb0a96c93a4c2559f9eb1d95fe58f2ff77\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791562521,\"headline\":\"McDonalds Stock And 2 Other Great Dividend Stocks\",\"id\":142765340,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bond investors are demanding higher compensation for risk, and the surge in the term premium on 10 year Treasuries has pushed yields to multi decade highs. That puts fresh pressure on companies that rely on cheap debt and on stocks that pay little or no income. Growing dividend payers with moderate 2% to 5% yields can offer a different balance by blending income growth with discipline. This article highlights three such candidates. The three stocks below are just a small sample, and the full...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1031157dab671890081d1eb4187fefc25932ff3386bbce3b00d1f5af0a6d2e85\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791562121,\"headline\":\"JP Morgan Maintains Neutral on PepsiCo, Lowers Price Target to $137\",\"id\":142792241,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"JP Morgan  analyst Andrea Teixeira   maintains PepsiCo (NASDAQ:PEP) with a Neutral and lowers the price target from $138 to $137.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e3e76505f829b0b27b1c00713ddcbe18631f6521dc76de1fcdc8fd27049216e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791557184,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Just Reported Earnings. Here's What Investors Need to Know.\",\"id\":142763966,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pepsi gained on its third-quarter report in spite of a cut in guidance.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1a36a899fdf13bda0e7c0cf56c2a34f2693ce43063943f7bc4e313c148a2cf90\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791556684,\"headline\":\"A closer look at Delta's Q3 earnings bust, a potential Starbucks–Chipotle deal, \\u0026 more\",\"id\":142766322,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi takes a look at the biggest stories as the trading day kicks off, weighing in on SpaceX's (SPCX) new spectrum deal, Delta's (DAL) third quarter earnings results, and more. Sozzi also sits down with Citi restaurant analyst Jon Tower for a conversation about Chipotle's (CMG) potential buyout by Starbucks (SBUX).\",\"url\":\"https