94523a144ea93c7a653dad35ea30a4ffae428ebf3e798d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791551659,\"headline\":\"Piper Sandler Maintains Overweight on PepsiCo, Lowers Price Target to $140\",\"id\":142792243,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Piper Sandler  analyst Michael Lavery   maintains PepsiCo (NASDAQ:PEP) with a Overweight and lowers the price target from $176 to $140.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3f96ae50fd1491967516b47e4fb0b3aa953c41204807b6a38fb4a1ed47870ec2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791550800,\"headline\":\"PEP Q3 Earnings Call Highlights Margin Pressure and Growth Plans\",\"id\":142764174,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo cuts its 2026 earnings outlook amid rising costs and margin pressure, despite strong international growth and improving North American snack volumes.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4e3f2e9f7e6dc5b6f2ae73f063fc041a1542b78f14dcd00605c9cc5f80e31daa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791550237,\"headline\":\"Micron Is Now Worth More Than Coca-Cola, PepsiCo, McDonald’s, Disney, Starbucks, Nike and Chipotle Combined\",\"id\":142761558,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Most Americans can name a Coca-Cola before they can name a single Micron product, yet Wall Street just handed the obscure memory chip maker a valuation that leaves seven of the world's most recognized consumer brands in the dust.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c7f6e3804de728fe3e8bef0a8aa80cae68a688d8632fec207846315df7c9ca01\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791549935,\"headline\":\"Pepsi Cratered in 2026: Goldman Sachs Says It’s Going Up 40% Soon\",\"id\":142761652,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo has cratered while every major beverage rival rallied, and now Goldman Sachs sees a 40% rebound ahead. But that call rests on three pillars, and one is already showing serious cracks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d724eb8803473646c25967840653fbe3840bff82d2da32f6af1c527232b32873\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791549930,\"headline\":\"Intel Is Worth More Than Coca-Cola and PepsiCo Put Together\",\"id\":142761569,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A chipmaker that lost billions last year now commands a valuation that dwarfs two of the world's most profitable consumer giants, and the math holding that together is razor thin.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7c0df84702b3bed557b6d543c172e55edc3f04cd7f00cd03ec6ce03166ba8302\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791549000,\"headline\":\"Company News for Oct 9, 2026\",\"id\":142761563,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Companies in The News Are: TLRY,PEP,LEVI,MU\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dc7876d3ba0a29c23737cc47306964b7268e31300fc5b03098a34c4fcf07c328\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791548774,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Stock Rallies After Beating Q3 Revenue Expectations\",\"id\":142761722,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for PepsiCo StockPrice change for PepsiCo stock in last 6 months: -19%$PEP Stock Price as of Oct. 8: $12852-Week High: $171$PEP Stock Price Target: $149What Happened?PepsiCo (PEP:NASDAQ) reported Q3 results that beat Wall Street’s estimates.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ddc89d2977f19b7338c5eae248307cdffc443f5e3e97bb313e606d2702b2c418\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetim