"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Nine of 11 sectors are higher in Friday\\u0026#39;s regular session, with the top three split across defensive, growth and cyclical groups. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with no single gap clearly standing apart from the other breaks across the table.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8e49b5050ab59076c68ff77ba7cac7d3785b5016c63b1ee1049019718c167f81\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791544471,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo's Ongoing North America Weakness Drives Guidance Cut, Says Analyst\",\"id\":142792245,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Moscow--Russia-april-4--2014-Can-Of-Peps.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo shares fall after upbeat Q3 results as lower 2026 guidance highlights North American weakness, rising costs and 2027 volume risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fd9e005a35f8ab8d59d175129e8ac23a8febe82e0cec27d47872ea1e6aea55a2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791544200,\"headline\":\"Can Tesla's IMC Deal Accelerate Semi Growth and Zero-Emission Freight?\",\"id\":142761501,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"TSLA's 50-truck IMC Logistics order adds to growing Semi demand, while its new Nevada factory targets annual production capacity of 50,000 trucks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f90bc5f2f3a7c7b6df8e88d7e4d62f77905965925c964d7ca91b6c17a6760d43\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791542819,\"headline\":\"RBC Capital Reiterates Sector Perform on PepsiCo, Maintains $150 Price Target\",\"id\":142792246,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"RBC Capital  analyst Nik Modi   reiterates PepsiCo (NASDAQ:PEP) with a Sector Perform and maintains $150 price target.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8136d1ac4ae375a1691d913652cfb4e454c