ional Growth Offsets North American Beverage Weakness, Margin Pressures Persist\",\"id\":142752062,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Food and beverage company PepsiCo (NASDAQ:PEP) reported Q3 2026 results topping the market’s revenue expectations, with sales up 5.6% year on year to $25.27 billion. Its non-GAAP profit of $2.34 per share was 1.9% above analysts’ consensus estimates.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=00a9d35c956358faaa7be7d7a24ac52f78eeabbf480d7537a70403740319b91d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791529930,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola Wants Out: Is the $5.1 Billion Costa Coffee Experiment Over?\",\"id\":142761827,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Minsk--Belarus--July-13--2023---Electron.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola is reportedly exploring a sale of Costa Coffee after struggling to achieve growth following its $5.1B deal.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f3ba056165f11713c14c7705a94e07505551f0918007f18087ae806c7f05dbca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791518460,\"headline\":\"Consumer Sentiment in the Spotlight as Michigan Survey Set for Release\",\"id\":142766285,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Consumer pessimism is in the spotlight as a the key University of Michigan survey releases today, but Costco earnings paint a rosier picture.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=abcc5e7640cf7aaf2d0645513fbfcb497f7c4f365d7d809fcf23d451d0aa8167\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791517929,\"headline\":\"Nasdaq Falls Over 300 Points as Oil Prices Surge: Investor Sentiment Weakens, Fear \\u0026 Greed Index Remains in ‘Fear’ Zone\",\"id\":142762146,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Market-sentiment---Fear-and-Greed.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Markets stayed fearful as index fell to 38; Dow gained, S\\u0026amp;P/Nasdaq slipped amid oil surge and Iran tensions. PepsiCo and Pacira shares rose.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9591f13b580de3a60cf748c43870790201ed5a9de221d6b4f9dbc73c422c89ec\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791513805,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo (PEP) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript\",\"id\":142741751,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Input costs and mix headwinds force PepsiCo to cut full-year earnings guidance.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6a2f36018b5a5b182c4621e99c2c6d867a39cbc98a2047c2e7abf4e24abf0bbb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791511321,\"headline\":\"PEP Stock Looks To Snap 6-Week Losing Streak: Goldman Sachs Trims Price Target But Sees ‘Decade Of Growth’ For PepsiCo\",\"id\":142741738,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo faces near-term margin pressures from rising costs and beverage challenges, but Goldman Sachs maintains a ‘Buy’ rating.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=90cec8579e326ba16cbe6c0ef3a05253806f320f63450f144498fd01802f66b7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791501345,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo (PEP) Stock Sees Modest Fair Value Cut As Analysts Turn More Cautious\",\"id\":142734021,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo just saw the Fair Value in one widely used model adjusted from US$152.65 to US$148.64, a trim of roughly 2.6% that signals a slightly more cautious stance on the stock. That shift lines up with recent analyst commentary, where firms are reassessing expectations