market share, says Jim Cramer\",\"id\":142764911,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108378748-5ED3-MM-C-100826-short.jpg?v=1791500436\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"'Mad Money' host Jim Cramer digs into PepsiCo stock to see what is driving the price action right now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b05d42b1eb0fd46b02151854223d6f3dff4b1fce735a8e843d1e7c61fb181738\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791487243,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer talks what is moving PepsiCo's stock\",\"id\":142764912,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108378723-5ED3-MM-C-100826.jpg?v=1791500406\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"'Mad Money' host Jim Cramer digs into Pepsico stock to see what is driving the price action right now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=078d4026e6b924cd53a6a2ad9636e76b222752d423d6c98fc821c5f1a10ac027\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791485436,\"headline\":\"Pepsi shares rallied despite cutting profit guidance. Where Cramer stands on the stock now\",\"id\":142806903,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108332292-1783536060412-gettyimages-2284663645-PEPSICO_EARNS.jpeg?v=1783536134\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC's Jim Cramer said improving sales growth and investments to revive demand are encouraging signs, though PepsiCo still faces significant challenges.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fa3c9a0e96d92fb8867f1d841b54611d06b68f9d5f503fc23c5261520a1a5860\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791483353,\"headline\":\"Three Soda Giants Pay Dividends. One Has a Much Stronger Income Story\",\"id\":142732185,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola, PepsiCo, and Keurig Dr Pepper all pass the basic dividend screen, but their business models tell three very different stories about how safe those payouts actually are and which one can keep growing.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d5ef1f5b0552d21fbe3492719bb30feabf7edfad3d16f68a6170fdc702167e1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791482650,\"headline\":\"Is Pepsi earnings setting off alarm bells? Putting in the extra work to be AI literate\",\"id\":142731249,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Is PepsiCo's (PEP) earnings and cut forecasts indicative of any systemic risks? Is a tie-up between Starbucks (SBUX) and Chipotle (CMG) imminent? And what does your consumer profile on Amazon (AMZN) say about your spending habits? The Market Hang panel discusses these questions and more. Today's panel consists of Business Insider Today executive editor Dan DeFrancesco, Yahoo Finance's Julie Hyman, StockBrokers.com director of investor research Jessica Inskip, and Argent Capital Management portfolio manager Jed Ellerbroek.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=267e8b70f6909c538dd040d8319facf24a4fa676c9306cb730b544dcf5048a64\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791480728,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Consumer Stocks Mixed Thursday Afternoon\",\"id\":142731101,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Consumer stocks were mixed Thursday afternoon, with the State Street Consumer Staples Select Sector\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30a26e7ef9edd11d04499bbf757ff2b4029b5ce16aaab7fea5050a9f70d81378\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791478279,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo, Inc. Q3 2026 Earnings Call Summary\",\"id\":142730876,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Moby summary of PepsiCo, Inc.'s Q3 2026 earnings call\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=45157eca642947c2be898893f12e15d01f7e7e87d52d2df5323c686b7c0aa62b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791477480,\"headline\":\"Chipotle, Starbucks, Palantir, Intel, SpaceX, Wolfspeed, and More Stocks That Explain Today’s Market\",\"id\":142730969,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chipotle trades higher following a report that Starbucks had looked into a possible takeover of the burrito chain.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2b8797c240c040153f37eb29a69a6ef97c497a4fd948366170ac851986f840c2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791475724,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Nasdaq Slumps On War Worries; Oils Surges As Chevron Gains (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142731032,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index declines Thursday after Trump's latest Iran comments. Treasury yields and oil prices surge.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c6e8938492f430dbf56d728a1664e1abca21bd46eabc46fad2978c48a1c24b30\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791475614,\"headline\":\"Why Is Everyone Ignoring Celsius Stock's High Cash Yield?\",\"id\":142731054,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Celsius (CELH) currently trade 58.5% below their two-year high, offering a compelling reason to examine the company. At that price, its free cash flow yield sits at 6.8%, compared with 4.5% for the median S\\u0026P 500 company. Such an elevated yield typically signals either a deeply discounted business or one facing anticipated contraction. So why are investors paying so little for Celsius's cash.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ab910f8d05873bbb3db0d700cb526afa642cae2b4829256552128b0d5f8df112\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791475399,\"headline\":\"What could trigger a US debt crisis? Sozzi discusses with economist Kenneth Rogoff\",\"id\":142730897,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi takes a look at the biggest stories as the trading day kicks off, weighing in on PepsiCo's (PEP) latest earnings results, General Motors' (GM) latest update, and more. Sozzi also sits down with Kenneth Rogoff, the International Monetary Fund's (IMF) former chief economist and Harvard University's current Maurits C. Boas chair and professor of international economics. The two discuss various looming risks to the US economy, including the deficit, the specter of a debt crisis, the AI economy's growing wealth divide, and more. Rogoff is also a chess grandmaster and former chess champion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ba7dba3492558ae45a4c107b3c7791a564e600f8ffb29d9f44734d43b6103ca1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791473313,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Faces Increasing Pressure as Weight Loss Drugs and Inflation Weigh On Sales\",\"id\":142731103,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for PepsiCo StockPrice change for PepsiCo stock in the last 6 months: -20%$PEP Stock Price as of Oct. 7: $12452-Week High: $172$PEP Stock Price Target: $149What Happened?PepsiCo (PEP:NASDAQ) is under pressure ahead of its quarterly earnings report on Thursday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1e27aa8cb5199560b746d413edf4275e0a89191ba27a8624acd63cca94dda98d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791472360,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Lowers Guidance; Levi Strauss Sales Growth Disappoints | Stock Movers\",\"id\":142729713,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On this episode of Stock Movers: - PepsiCo (PEP) shares are lower after the company decreased its profit outlook, with its recovery in North America taking longer than expected. PepsiCo faces higher costs in North America that are weighing on margins, and will be raising some prices in the coming months after cutting prices on some marquee brands earlier this year. - Microsoft (MSFT) shares are following news the company's Xbox unit is formalizing its film and TV foray with a new division called XP to expand its franchises into other media. - Levi Strauss (LEVI) is lower after it posted the slowest growth in its direct-to-consumer channels since late 2022, in part due to a marketing misstep. The company expects direct-to-consumer growth for the current quarter to increase by a mid-single digit, after changing its marketing to focus on low-rise jeans.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0306fa774b1f99d173ff7b2c979e077dd95cc905063b937cbaf2f62c2318130f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791471776,\"headline\":\"What PepsiCo (PEP) Said on Its Q3 Earnings Call\",\"id\":142729909,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo (NASDAQ:PEP) executives said third-quarter organic revenue growth accelerated while international operations delivered broad-based gains, but higher input costs, unfavorable mix and weaker-than-expected North American beverage performance prompted the company to lower its earnings outlook fo\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2ff22ff26838cdfdb70ef97d8cfaeba0d21e835ee42e0bda8f93bd8c63670c72\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791471600,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo eyes cost cuts as North American struggles persist\",\"id\":142729910,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CEO Ramon Laguarta said the company plans to 