news?id=7b0745775c2b747056f880d0825f4178b0e99f00c2f02264a13d8c01b50bb11c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791439220,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Q3 Adj. EPS $2.34 Beats $2.29 Estimate, Sales $25.274B Beat $24.962B Estimate\",\"id\":142728876,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo (NASDAQ:PEP) reported quarterly earnings of $2.34 per share which beat the analyst consensus estimate of $2.29 by 1.74 percent. This is a 2.18 percent increase over earnings of $2.29 per share from the same\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b4be30a0e7445940e0fb0a2e99ad0db2709f32f52b228c60da14bb5b4bdf768e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791432580,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo, Levi Strauss And 3 Stocks To Watch Heading Into Thursday\",\"id\":142726814,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/08/Pepsi.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Stocks in focus: Applied Digital beat Q1 estimates; Levi posted mixed results. Investors await earnings from Helen of Troy, PepsiCo and Tilray.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6082a110e0c10a2a2af63fa9ec9ee15295d33bd9340dfb5a66dac934712608e2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791431409,\"headline\":\"Dow Falls Over 300 Points As Treasury Yields Surge: Investor Sentiment Weakens, Fear \\u0026 Greed Index Remains In ‘Neutral’ Zone\",\"id\":142726815,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/08/Fear-and-Greed.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Market sentiment slipped but stayed neutral as U.S. stocks fell amid rising Treasury yields; mortgage applications declined for a fifth week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2a4da7cdf9bebe44d11dda3cc658b4dcb48986b2de5b9bc9720b9ee2bc2af792\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791425555,\"headline\":\"Stock Market: Will S\\u0026P 500 Open Up or Down Today?\",\"id\":142726816,\