ts are coming out on Thursday before markets open. RBC Capital Markets managing director, Nik Modi, sits down with Yahoo Finance Senior Reporter Brooke DiPalma to share his thoughts on the upcoming results and where he sees the company going moving forward.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2ab0b4d6c7e115b8f310ed89c01a21cd0a2dd95938ce8a5a97134135934ae00a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791403168,\"headline\":\"Ahead of PepsiCo Earnings, Here's What Barchart Data Says Comes Next for PEP Stock\",\"id\":142708275,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo is set to report its fiscal Q3 earnings on Oct. 8. Options sentiment suggests PEP shares will rally on the back of the earnings event.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f997da7c51cc52d40a6f9223c205547e4abfc0012e7dbc0af1866ee925239d2f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791399855,\"headline\":\"Thursday's big stock stories: What’s likely to move the market in the next trading session\",\"id\":142730675,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108292750-1776364942734-gettyimages-2271655425-ms002920_mpeut9xx.jpeg?v=1791414187\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"The S\\u0026P 500 slid from its record on Wednesday as elevated yields weighed on stocks. Tune into CNBC Thursday morning for Skydance's David Ellison and Ynon Kreiz.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=89243717190cdc4826e056bcd9c5a003ddd6385ef154962acaae44dac46ab143\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791385503,\"headline\":\"Can PepsiCo Regain Its Growth Stock Status With the Q3 Report?\",\"id\":142697202,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Jim Cramer just stripped PepsiCo of its growth stock label, and on October 8 the company gets one shot to prove him wrong. The numbers management must hit are narrower than most investors realize.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0571bee056f4561c978f2794980358e96ee674581400ba6fd31b3d5633f6c5ba\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791384084,\"headline\":\"My Only Dividend Buy This October Has Raised Its Payout Every Year for Decades\",\"id\":142697134,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo sits near a 52-week low while its dividend check keeps climbing, and one specific combination of warning signs would make this buyer walk away entirely.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9d6baca672714cbcee103a92cce0b61da7701513c44b18a2344a10dccd163a31\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791382260,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola steps into better-for-you soda market with prebiotics\",\"id\":142697133,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The soda giant is entering the buzzy category and will compete with Olipop and PepsiCo-owned Poppi.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bcc77b00f55e2dccd572bd5fb90dc77a944f17e4ec05378651c6b03549c7251d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791380022,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Q3 Preview: Stock At Lowest Since 2020, Market Expert Sees 19% Downside On Weak Report\",\"id\":142726969,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/07/Moscow--Russia-april-4--2014-Can-Of-Peps.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Pepsi stock hit new multi-year lows ahead of Q3 earnings. Here\\u0026#39;s the key items to watch to move shares higher.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=409ebb3ef2a54b43b279a8b208ffa82e2496bfa96b243e9640af34ff19ffb3fb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791377820,\"headline\":\"Is PepsiCo (PEP) a 'Buy' Ahead of Earnings?\",\"id\":142697204,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Higher input costs continue to pressure margins.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b4169cc021aee7dcff765ed34e5ffe444db375d552f29bcc5fa301945510151f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791374928,\"headline\":\"Dear Pepsi Stock Fans, Mark Your Calendars for October 8\",\"id\":142700445,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo reports fiscal third-quarter earnings on October 8, with analysts looking for adjusted earnings of about $2.30 after a July miss and a 2% drop in North American food sales.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5d1957538df60b961770c143cf649ea666226523bac6ca71040265e6017602ca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791353404,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo (PEP) Expanded Its Bottling Reach To 17 Markets\",\"id\":142681247,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo (NasdaqGS:PEP) expanded its bottling reach as Carlsberg moved to add Georgia and Armenia to their partnership coverage. The extension comes through new Carlsberg acquisitions, taking its PepsiCo bottling footprint to 17 markets across Eastern Europe and Central Asia. The enlarged Carlsberg partnership deepens PepsiCo’s use of regional bottlers for soft drink distribution outside its home market. The Carlsberg move into Georgia and Armenia with PepsiCo bottling rights fits into a...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=423f84fa5fd3cb9a18675c6e4c6638162e6492766dbdf811b45af3215193f645\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791342049,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo (PEP) Q3 Earnings Report Preview: What To Look For\",\"id\":142676426,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Food and beverage company PepsiCo (NASDAQ:PEP) will be reporting results this Thursday before market open. Here’s what to look for.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=84e06e70511b8441f0f9052f5582963e94d1a1868ea89978995842635f21d053\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791329402,\"headline\":\"A Juicy Dividend Means Investors Should Stay Patient with Pepsi Stock Before October 8\",\"id\":142678686,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo heads into October 8 earnings with improving volumes, strong international growth, and a U.S. turnaround that still has something to prove.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=791b6fba052dbfe6309bfec7537048e705793ae801321103f103121514f90ec7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791315972,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer Finds More Than a Stock Price Gap Between PepsiCo (PEP) and Coca-Cola (KO)\",\"id\":142667734,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"During the October 2 episode of Mad Money, Jim Cramer discussed the widening gap between PepsiCo, Inc. (NASDAQ:PEP) and The Coca-Cola Company (NYSE:KO) ahead of PepsiCo’s earnings report. He said: Speaking of burdens, on Thursday morning, we have one of the most problematic earnings reports imaginable: that of PepsiCo. For years, this company was running […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1df8439e5f9b77a9e9662532aafe1ce85f8a7fe3461d15a0fbf8c53ca183c848\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791309632,\"headline\":\"Two of America’s Biggest Money Voices Give Opposite Advice on Dividend Stocks\",\"id\":142667714,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Dave Ramsey and Suze Orman have built careers on helping people retire with dignity, yet on one of the most consequential investment decisions a retiree faces, they point in completely opposite directions. For a nest egg of $107,000, that disagreement is not academic.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=05d5bba37e392428849a23e80c7d20dc523749e38bb5faab5ed4a4e5c58cc718\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791308714,\"headline\":\"Bond Yields Are Soaring: These 5 Fortress Dividend Stocks Offer Shelter for Income Investors\",\"id\":142666804,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bond yields are rising fast enough to rattle stocks. The 10-year Treasury yield now stands at 5.24%. When rates rise and valuations wobble, the most reliable income comes from companies that sell things people buy in any economy: soda, snacks, detergent, diapers and toothpaste. The five consumer staples giants below pair global brands with decades […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=74ed456716b6f44abb2aaf18ffa490dd9e11572f563a79060f0b41e55ff021a3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791308355,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo's Next Earnings Report on Oct. 8 2026 Could Send the Stock Plunging. Here's Why.\",\"id\":142666676,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pepsico is trading near a five-year low, but that's for a good reason.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=becc29b896a0892df58326399ed59ba96c7663e0ae7696b170f14d8a095478e0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791302436,\"headline\":\"Dividend Income vs a Guaranteed Rate: Which One Belongs in Your Retirement Plan\",\"id\":142666873,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Treasury yields just hit levels not seen since 2002, and suddenly a government-backed rate competes directly with popular dividend stocks. Before you pick a side, three factors will decide which one actually keeps more money in your pocket.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c878317b70143d4f209006facbc18fcda0451488c04f981c8c31671e0e7725cb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791298618,\"headline\":\"PEP Q3 Preview: RBC Sees 'Soft' September Quarter, Cuts Price Target To $150\",\"id\":142665667,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"RBC sees minimal room for upside for PepsiCo's top line amid persistent consumer and macro pressures, while higher freight and logistics costs are creating inflationary pressure and pressuring numbers in the December quarter and into early 2027, according to TheFly.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0a753460078a1dfa1f61a02c27b3cd7eea4269cac7ff4cb9594a429ff61ad23b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791294840,\"headline\":\"Premarket in Green\",\"id\":142665668,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Premarket in Green\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d1afd14ccc8d1dc07d9f677a684ae58cea14177b53fce802001ed7bd83e38afb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791293400,\"headline\":\"Pre-Markets Up Following Record Nasdaq Close\",\"id\":142665669,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The anticipation of tech earnings are helping unlock positive sentiment ahead of Q4 report releases, including the attention-grabbing headline of NVIDIA (NVDA) approaching an awe-inspiring $6 trillion market cap.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5baab455c5b8e096f49fc0d8e925658c5ef75adbdae96d7abc87c9ad5bfbfaf8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791291840,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo Sharpens Price-Pack Strategy: Can Affordability Pay Off?\",\"id\":142665594,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PEP sharpens its price-pack strategy to boost affordability and volumes as North American demand softens and cost pressures persist.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9ed96b9329478c676c2d40780840008004a22c0c8f9aa16f3cc59e731d9ea972\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791291824,\"headline\":\"Options Action: Pepsi gears up to report earnings\",\"id\":142666469,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108373468-17913056681791305666-48829871423-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1791305667\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC's Oliver Renick joins ‘Halftime Report’ to discuss the latest Options Action.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=59089656e697e77cafc2e4702ec1bd78fdec44595c567979b09b13e7820c6424\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791290766,\"headline\":\"Has Coca-Cola Stock Become A Different Bet?\",\"id\":142662992,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola (KO) stock is priced at 26.0 times earnings, against 21.5 for the S\\u0026P 500. Shareholders paying that premium need to know what they are buying, and that has changed. In October 2024, on its fiscal Q3 2024 call, management was talking about steep price increases in a handful of markets with high inflation. Now it leads with something else. So what is it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c2103f29220007cf1bb7204ad0f11a8575a577169743c71d756019e9b2eab755\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791277872,\"headline\":\"RBC Capital Maintains Sector Perform on PepsiCo, Lowers Price Target to $150\",\"id\":142662781,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"RBC Capital  analyst Nik Modi   maintains PepsiCo (NASDAQ:PEP) with a Sector Perform and lowers the price target from $161 to $150.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=72a54e8e45e2652c9780098d6fd05828e85ecb507a8994a27260f8a39c78182a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791276826,\"headline\":\"Reported Earlier: 'PepsiCo, Monster, Reliance win reprieve on 'energy drink' label ban in India' - Reuters\",\"id\":142662782,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.reuters.com/business/healthcare-pharmaceuticals/reliance-sue-indias-food-regulator-over-energy-drink-label-ban-2026-10-06/\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c4036411fa246bf77a3f84f009372814da9ab1c3c85108a6eb2c2bf20c3e59a6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791276300,\"headline\":\"3 Monster Consumer Stocks to Hold for the Next 20 Years\",\"id\":142657673,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Strong brands and high dividend returns should make these stocks long-term winners.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7af0782059b2cdc64f59b67d268ef1853828272a120866e824545063dae36e38\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791274766,\"headline\":\"Nasdaq Hits a Fresh Record While the 10-Year Climbs to 5.31%\",\"id\":142655554,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/THUMBNAILS_CHARTMILL_1000_528_10_b3d3b546c2.webp\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"The Nasdaq closed at a record on Monday even as long-term Treasury yields hit multi-year highs. Brazilian stocks soared after the first round of the presidential election, Schneider Electric agreed to buy PTC for $22.6 billion, and Microsoft got a double upgrade from Melius.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cf7d02a17a97c293cb3d48d6293c22a01187ab427091a00190a1bacf4496ab2e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791268127,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo: Turnaround Accelerates Ahead Of Earnings (Preview)\",\"id\":142659099,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/487787092/image_487787092.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo faces near-term headwinds, but operational improvements and international growth are accelerating. I rate PEP stock as a Buy. Read my complete report.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b97e89ab640cd510dec95b5c5391566e2d667d6a776e38f9ead0433dcf34415f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791266005,\"headline\":\"Asian shares are mixed after Wall Street gains, oil price steadies\",\"id\":142649029,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"HONG KONG (AP) — Asian shares were mixed on Tuesday and U. futures advanced after shares rose to near a record close on Wall Street.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c6c08ab342f51eff1c7f5c6743903de751d9cb4582b4cc5a5925940f40193740\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791261180,\"headline\":\"Zacks Investment Ideas feature highlights: PepsiCo, Levi and Constellation Brands\",\"id\":142647643,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo, Levi and Constellation Brands have been highlighted in this Investment Ideas article.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=017d57cfa65402b9ba698b4d9e0da7f3317027a8d32b9d3085b0fe2f7dcf64a4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791258415,\"headline\":\"Why Did JOBY, FRVO, PEP Stocks Plunge To 52-Week Lows Today?\",\"id\":142646054,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Joby Aviation, Fervo Energy, and PepsiCo stocks slumped to annual lows on Monday amid cash burn issues, macroeconomic challenges and other company-specific troubles.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fce02acec4c74febd100f0142c68a25bf97234b4e88b77207a0a53304a15f1ca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791244500,\"headline\":\"Review \\u0026 Preview: Artificial Highs?\",\"id\":142639782,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Nasdaq hit its 23rd record close of the year, as AI once again dominated trading.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c86c90d3af6efd02fe3348229021c2310693f5c5c427ff903a04d88e58fe7c82\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791236895,\"headline\":\"Here’s How Much Traders See PepsiCo Stock Moving After Earnings\",\"id\":142639781,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PepsiCo is set to report earnings Thursday morning, with traders expecting a move that could take the stock to a six-year low.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=569ce1eee869cd917e7fe9dea2566f2bd30a0afbf6e8bf5b41f15ec6d0adc7d6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791232680,\"headline\":\"3 Consumer-Facing Stocks Reporting This Week\",\"id\":142639196,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Q3 earnings cycle is heating up, with several notable consumer-facing companies set to unveil quarterly results this week, including PEP, LEVI, and STZ.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=658932927da2aad8eb1741fcd3e8bcd32fc25efdbe1a9c22a763a153686efd77\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791221040,\"headline\":\"Pepsi vs. Coca-Cola: Wall Street has clearly chosen its favorite soda stock\",\"id\":142637802,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street has decided which beverage giant will win the year, if not for all of 2027.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1f61b14d5c24e795306401fe1d7b510e6fc4d2393f693dbbe3b82e736123256a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791213853,\"headline\":\"Why Wall Street is choosing Coca-Cola stock over PepsiCo ahead of earnings\",\"id\":142636848,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi breaks down the growing market divergence between Coca-Cola (KO) and PepsiCo (PEP), highlighting how surging Diet Coke sales, GLP-1 weight-loss drugs, and rising competition from brands like OLIPOP are impacting PepsiCo's snack and beverage business.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cf0160e037637487af03e9eff11ef3b369f0127ed1eff5aebedd15b800378489\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791213132,\"headline\":\"Sozzi talks with Zscaler CEO about AI cybersecurity, while Nvidia \\u0026 AMD stocks rip higher\",\"id\":142637724,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi takes a look at the biggest stories as the trading day kicks off, weighing in on the upcoming earnings season, Nvidia's (NVDA) and AMD's (AMD) stock rallies, and more.Sozzi also sits down with Zscaler (ZS) CEO Jay Chaudhry for a conversation about cybersecurity in the age of AI agents.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=551974b98e5d5fd3af4ee67951134981184d0882c6391aef8dd99484b70d51c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791212429,\"headline\":\"Nasdaq 100 Records Have Rarely Been This Narrow, 55 Stocks Are Still Below 50-Day Average\",\"id\":142662618,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/05/Nasdaq-Inscription-Next-To-Us-Dollars--T.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The Nasdaq 100 trades at records Monday, yet 55 of its 101 stocks sit below their 50-day average. QQQ has beaten equal-weight QQQE by 8% since late July.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d78ffd39021735e4739cfbbd4e7ce2c89bcdbad94ff4f003fc44637d8d221831\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791209700,\"headline\":\"What to expect from these stocks this earnings season\",\"id\":142637831,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"As earnings season gets ready to kick off, Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi has his sights set on these major stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3c7715618319d8313268ebd689ffd5ec681c5d6ae0b3e381d380738d5b398d50\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791209460,\"headline\":\"Should You Add PepsiCo Stock to Your Portfolio Ahead of Q3 Earnings?\",\"id\":142636850,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PEP heads into the Q3 earnings release with expected revenue growth, strong international momentum, and persistent North America and margin pressures.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5907d9e2020981495c63a7909d98a7e7e9d59b6634a68f17abd96014551fc044\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791208380,\"headline\":\"Geopolitical Risks Keep Oil Prices in Focus\",\"id\":142636916,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Geopolitical Risks Keep Oil Prices in Focus\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2142bfe28c468062dcbfdaaa3ba556ae5efaf2dfb3e75ff2b1de7fe264c17096\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791208109,\"headline\":\"Carlsberg uses M\\u0026A to extend PepsiCo tie-up\",\"id\":142636914,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PEP\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Danish brewer will purchase Iberia Refreshments in Georgia and JI Pepsi Cola Bottler Armenia.\",\"url\":\"https:/