     "content": {
      "size": 137356,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792351007,\"headline\":\"AI Hiring Push Might Change The Case For Investing In Disney (DIS)\",\"id\":142988605,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walt Disney has moved to license intellectual property from bankrupt chatbot startup Character.AI and plans to hire most of its roughly 60 person workforce on about US$60 million in annual compensation, aiming to bring conversational AI capabilities in house for use across streaming and park experiences. The long running royalty deal for Jason Weaver’s young Simba role in The Lion King highlights how Disney’s intellectual property can keep generating inheritable payments for talent. This...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=87c0ab10556e24dbd1e10591986ce58b6d2be88bb5426d21caa84a09b2d54c0e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792341000,\"headline\":\"Disney agrees to hire the majority of Character.AI’s workforce\",\"id\":142988010,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"After chatbot startup Character.AI filed for bankruptcy earlier this week, many of its employees will have the opportunity to take jobs at Disney. Character.AI’s former CEO Karandeep Anand recently became the entertainment giant’s first CTO, and the startup previously said that Disney had agreed to acquire some of its assets for $20 million. A legal […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=49d173b00573f1b830056abfb2c1c73d6256bbb197f8ace3120172cf6f0e7ff4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792332006,\"headline\":\"Netflix Stock Has Been on a Roll. Here’s Where It Could Go Next.\",\"id\":142987457,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix just posted a rare one-week bounce after a brutal slide from its highs, and with earnings on the horizon, analysts are split on whether the rebound holds or breaks down from here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bdac7ab9fd8603da68c24f0456476a0bbbb79fc7749821ccd400fd5ddf583cfb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792233000,\"headline\":\"Disney offered a 13-year-old $2M to sing in ‘The Lion King’ — 25x his last paycheck. His mom said no\",\"id\":142960047,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Jason Weaver's mom rejected Disney's $2M upfront offer for “The Lion King” in the early '90s — negotiating royalties instead. More than 30 years later, the checks are still coming.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=39c10ad816bcd24aed1862f5ddcf627087131eca2fe8be0a1d35b86f402719b0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792230300,\"headline\":\"Disney offers $20M to AI company facing bankruptcy, lawsuits claiming its chatbot encouraged kids to hurt themselves\",\"id\":142960048,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Character.AI has settled teen suicide lawsuits and faces a Kentucky AG suit alleging its chatbots encouraged self-harm — now Disney wants its IP for $20 million.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=45cd044cce51773670bfce3d94619ff0fb556319e4295291d17e3754e2db0ef7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792215217,\"headline\":\"Disney to Spend $60 Million a Year on Character.AI Talent After Its Own Layoffs as AI Startup Faces Bankruptcy\",\"id\":142960643,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Dhaka-bangladesh-02-July-2024smartphone-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Disney plans to spend $60 million annually on 66 Character.AI employees despite recent layoffs as its AI strategy expands.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2e9875559648ee0b4286af7a1686cdc4caa144e82596c4ecbc3e34b14a8a9570\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792214400,\"headline\":\"1 Stat That Makes Walt Disney (DIS) Hard to Ignore This October\",\"id\":142958768,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Strategic pivots and leadership changes over the past few years have pressured this consumer discretionary stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=086645abb6819da9bbcd7823069903734ec42f42d851cbed2232a8cf53ac9d3f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792177380,\"headline\":\"Top Analyst Reports for Costco, Walt Disney \\u0026 Marriott\",\"id\":142950829,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Costco, Walt Disney and Marriott lead today's top analyst reports, with strong sales, streaming growth and travel demand offset by key business challenges.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=998d53ea0e8b7bdbebd4794c3c235a3b782d0c968eea656eaf8e68cb9f26ca97\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168614,\"headline\":\"Citigroup Maintains Buy on Walt Disney, Raises Price Target to $140\",\"id\":142961132,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Citigroup  analyst Jason Bazinet   maintains Walt Disney (NYSE:DIS) with a Buy and raises the price target from $135 to $140.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7b9a41e4467e87a9047bf6996257ab02db876d5fca67e9f9a265ee8ac135e7d9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161517,\"headline\":\"Disney Could Buy Character.ai. What That Means for DIS Stock.\",\"id\":142950891,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Disney has become a stalking horse bidder for Character.ai.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dcc6a793b83c6ad2a523f98272a41e8e7f0eca420aa5dc402d9bf583a146db8a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154280,\"headline\":\"Netflix Hires Former Disney Exec to Fix Content Problem. Why the Stock Is Falling.\",\"id\":142945534,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The streamer is changing up its leadership team—but that’s only drawing more attention to its biggest problem.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=74eaafc10b9f4274a899acceb1131230ca328826317f6be7f32e3bc32d925d47\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792153551,\"headline\":\"Netflix Falls 3% as Peter Rice Takes Over Content After Layoffs; Disney and Spotify Hold Steady\",\"id\":142945640,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A leadership shake-up in Netflix's most critical division is rattling investors, but whether the new content chief can reverse a steep year-to-date slide or deepen the pain remains an open question.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1b5b9d320c42db32f180319e6e1d76cc410def90ec468e2f60cbcdd2bd971cca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792152960,\"headline\":\"Netflix Gears Up to Report Q3 Earnings: Buy, Sell or Hold the Stock?\",\"id\":142945507,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NFLX heads into Q3 earnings with expanding margins, rising ad commitments and pricing gains, but slowing viewership growth and a premium valuation cloud its outlook.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8927eeb663cbc975aea5c8e4c6877c5a1d86bbf390e2c2ba7fc941e0e7cf35ff\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792149335,\"headline\":\"Netflix Floundered by 20% This Year: One Analyst Says Its Streaming Monopoly WIll Net 88% Gains Within a Year\",\"id\":142944274,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix keeps posting double-digit revenue growth while its stock craters toward a 52-week low, and the gap between Wall Street's most bearish and most bullish analysts has rarely been this wide. Something has to give, and the next earnings report could force a verdict.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dccc556d6c9c115248d4037fd229d3e1b62925684b0ac66939b4499b40532e17\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792149270,\"headline\":\"'Disney agreed to pay $60 million to 66 employees from an AI startup that filed for bankruptcy, weeks after tech layoffs' - Business Insider\",\"id\":142961133,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.businessinsider.com/disney-pays-60-million-characterai-employees-tech-layoffs-karandeep-anand-2026-10?utm_campaign=business-link-post\\u0026amp;utm_medium=social\\u0026amp;utm_source=twitter\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=53ba35d78e6f04d5fb5daef1399c7bb12afbdd90d3fe6369db95cfdf7d11bb39\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792148400,\"headline\":\"Successful entrepreneurs set their own boundaries: Victoria Hagan\",\"id\":142944316,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Interior design icon Victoria Hagan discusses the power of standing your ground as a creative entrepreneur and why refusing to negotiate your prices is the key to earning clients' respect and building a lasting business.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0a246a5bff44fb4115c697951c38431b0b3d91ed997e5132baac6d9106afa382\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792144800,\"headline\":\"The brutal truth of designing celebrity homes: Victoria Hagan\",\"id\":142944317,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Interior design icon Victoria Hagan discusses how to scale a highly personalized creative business and the critical role of trust when working with high-profile clients.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dfccae86e032b5e6981aed6201094a8abf0d85f0d393e88de883d1a3e64da654\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792142737,\"headline\":\"Netflix Q3 Preview: Everyone Is Watching The Wrong Numbers\",\"id\":142945080,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2257981718/image_2257981718.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Netflix, Inc. Q3 preview: live sports, pricing power and monetization upside could lift earnings and FCF despite slowing engagement. Click for this NFLX update.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4819f4f80f8c4a0ecdab471ebc41956a262e7b67db0cafabf5fb3594fd1aa29c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792141956,\"headline\":\"Netflix Needs Another 'Squid Game' Moment As Growth Pressure Mounts\",\"id\":142945236,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Netflix.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Netflix cuts 1,000 jobs and brings in former Disney executive Peter Rice to revamp content, boost engagement, and drive growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=af43890e3a3df1281ef898250ab09941991ef856873157fc1357242672b413ef\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792110361,\"headline\":\"Netflix Replaces Content Chief Bela Bajaria With Ex-Disney Exec Peter Rice, a Day After Announcing 6% Layoffs\",\"id\":142946415,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Los-Angeles---July-20--2025-Netflix-Sign.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Netflix tapped industry veteran Peter Rice to replace content chief Bela Bajaria, a day after announcing about 1,000 layoffs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=814b6b5bf5f22371dae80bdc9a2a12790fd349c39620d2bcd85724cc135233b3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792102946,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy Comcast Stock At Under Seven Times Earnings?\",\"id\":142923026,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Comcast (CMCSA) currently trade at 6.7 times earnings. That multiple sits at less than a third of the 22.7 times commanded by the median S\\u0026P 500 company. Over the past twelve months, the shares fell 19.7%, dividends included. The broader S\\u0026P 500 returned 17.3% over that same period. That could signal a sound business on sale, or it might just reflect a fair price for an operation that has stopped growing. So what does a buyer actually get for that price.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e7a6452ee552cf19c4824d17bde5f82b9120c16626a08093d8115a85b03e79a8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792102695,\"headline\":\"Walt Disney (DIS) Lands $20 Million AI Asset Deal With Perpetual IP Rights\",\"id\":142923024,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walt Disney (NYSE:DIS) agreed to acquire select Character.ai assets through U.S. Chapter 11 bankruptcy proceedings, including certain IP and technology. The transaction gives Disney a perpetual license to use Character.ai intellectual property for future conversational and interactive products. Former Character.ai employees are expected to join Disney as part of the deal, expanding its internal AI and chatbot expertise. Disney's move to secure Character.ai assets and a perpetual IP license...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=295171077a0453f2f62430ade47d4b1bb51e51ce5e0e7f1b34771e335e957625\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792097105,\"headline\":\"Walt Disney (DIS) Rises Higher Than Market: Key Facts\",\"id\":142923025,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In the most recent trading session, Walt Disney (DIS) closed at $110.66, indicating a +1.53% shift from the previous trading day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=093b5b2c4c886f0ea4b50d72dd928cd2310a88ec2183ca3fd0302521a72fce2a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792091412,\"headline\":\"Discover which dow jones stocks are making waves on Thursday.\",\"id\":142921152,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Let's have a look at the top dow jones gainers and losers one hour before the close of the markets of today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=545db4733871e90a22820d700146d007479454afeb887e72faa3fb5e27048e68\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792080103,\"headline\":\"Skydance Rebounds 5% as Warrant Adjustment Selloff Fades; Netflix Rises 3%, Disney Advances 2%\",\"id\":142919554,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Skydance Corporation (NYSE:SKYD) stock is regaining ground as a selloff tied to a warrant adjustment blows over. Skydance stock is up 5% to $7.42, recovering part of the drop that hit when warrant value separated from the share price. Meanwhile, Netflix (NASDAQ:NFLX) stock is up 3% to $72.60, a smaller gain than the one in […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9471ff56e2e580df09a67b50908e2f084307e5768141b7712a7f46a644675ad0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792059290,\"headline\":\"Disney Can Leverage Its Hard-Won Financial Strength To Fend Off Competition\",\"id\":142917739,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2226091437/image_2226091437.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Disney (DIS) looks undervalued with upside from cost cuts, cruise expansion \\u0026 AI strategy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0d5f43ed7a24a47d802f8bcb11c62938b25fca312541811221d954ebdc32549a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792047600,\"headline\":\"The Biggest ‘Schumps’: From Amazon to SpaceX, We Scored the Disruptors\",\"id\":142919352,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Corporate insurgencies hit a fever pitch this month—and October is only half over. We break down, and size up, five of the biggest dramas.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=21aa2476d52484d768589d1fd9303447323674fdf3b85ae26bb8df6d00b1b431\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792047600,\"headline\":\"The Biggest ‘Schumps:’ From SpaceX to IMAX, We Scored the Disruptors\",\"id\":142903580,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Corporate insurgencies hit a fever pitch this month—and October is only half over. We break down, and size up, five of the biggest dramas.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=84acc18f7b658829f82aa2f2fd0bfed792596fca9c5f66ec363b7350770a9c6c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792037580,\"headline\":\"Disney seeks to buy Character AI assets in Chapter 11 bankruptcy\",\"id\":142899194,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Google previously reached a $2.7 billion deal with Character.ai in 2024.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6460b1838f9ed5b3db0b691aabf49b406adf8b36f766ee27269e1b24e09e598e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792027150,\"headline\":\"Is Netflix Stock Worth More Than Its Competitors?\",\"id\":142894495,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the past twelve months, Netflix (NFLX) increased its revenue faster than Disney, Amazon, Comcast, or Apple. Within that group, only Apple produced a wider operating margin. Yet Netflix shares lost 42.2% over the past year, marking the steepest decline among the five companies. The stock now trades in the middle of the pack at an earnings multiple near Disney's. So what does Netflix give you, for about the same price, that Disney does not.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1df829088dd1a95746f0b9036b58cd0b8019971d8aa73e19df8926f164f7ed8a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792013299,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today, Oct. 14: Skydance Warrants Begin Separate Trading Today: SKYD Stock Drops 24%\",\"id\":142888468,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On Oct. 14, 2026, 470.7 million warrants split from Class B shares, triggering a technical price reset rather than fundamental business news.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=16da96dd2d14508199637c35ff11b679309afe6270aa9377d4a65d75a35c5219\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792010249,\"headline\":\"Is There A Risk Hiding In Comcast Stock's Latest Results?\",\"id\":142888469,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"For a Comcast (CMCSA) holder, the average revenue per broadband customer is a troubling metric. That figure fell 3.8% in the second quarter of 2026. During the same period, Comcast lost 167,000 broadband customers. This leaves the company with a shrinking internet base where each remaining user generates less revenue on average. So why is Comcast collecting less from each broadband customer.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=421ab9ffc0692dfa0a844d6e7fdaa96ad875220fcaeb07280548bfb483d5be79\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791989022,\"headline\":\"Netflix Hasn't Cut This Many Jobs Since Its Subscriber Scare. So Why Now?\",\"id\":142918286,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Netflix.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Netflix plans to cut 1,000 jobs as growth and viewing slow. The company is set to report Q3 earnings next Tuesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=29a0baa3124e2ee8947c925ca3ac3d01c799fcb8dc7ee8bea8636aaadc9aae62\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791983287,\"headline\":\"Disney (DIS): Buy, Sell, or Hold Post Q2 Earnings?\",\"id\":142882767,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Although Disney (currently trading at $108.21 per share) has gained 5.5% over the last six months, it has trailed the S\\u0026P 500’s 12% return during that period. This may have investors wondering how to approach the situation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d2a8caf157027460d5e8d759a14203f7bb7a8d9d5692670b4d111df280e1fba2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791981408,\"headline\":\"Skydance Falls 16% as Shares Begin Trading Without Warrant Entitlement; Netflix and Disney Tick Up\",\"id\":142882701,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Skydance stock cratered at the open, but the reason has nothing to do with bad news. A warrant distribution and an $78.9 billion debt load are competing to tell very different stories about where this newly combined media giant goes from here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c6aca207a20cc42b5d6d37dcd45c2ffff129af175bb993067a58178948c26a0a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791969463,\"headline\":\"Disney: Cruise Expansion, Strong Live Event Schedule, And Retention Support Good FY 2027 Growth\",\"id\":142882172,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2226091437/image_2226091437.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Disney is rated buy, supported by improving operational trends, FY27 growth drivers, and an attractive valuation. Read more on DIS stock here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=830b8b43ee9fb213b236fe3e5eb862c65f51ae52de45abbc1bbee993b6e7e6f9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791948000,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Industrial Average Monitor Update - A Look At 30 U.S. Large-Caps\",\"id\":142869843,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1196086989/image_1196086989.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Visible Alpha consensus expects the Dow Jones Industrial Average to deliver an 18.7% weighted price return in the medium term. Read more here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=310ef25895cc39730bc02d53261c2e29cfcc1b7eb4f0498474d0e9c56b8614e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791924165,\"headline\":\"The One Number Comcast Stock Investors Should Watch\",\"id\":142854557,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The wireless phone service stands out at Comcast (CMCSA), and it may be what buyers of the stock are betting on. While Comcast is widely viewed as a cable company, wireless is where it is adding customers. Yet the stock has lost 23% over the past twelve months, while the S\\u0026P 500 returned 17.3%. That divergence presents a contradiction. So, how big has Comcast's wireless business become.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=02d609f849e0ad49b2719a012b62d2b00def5823f71b947641bc2b3b856fc649\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791923570,\"headline\":\"Epic Games’ Disney Game Faces Delays and An AI Overhaul After $1.5 Billion Investment\",\"id\":142854555,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Epic Games Inc. is pausing the release of its upcoming video game collaboration with Walt Disney Co., (NYSE:DIS) and has told its developers to use artificial intelligence tools to help complete the game. The game, which was slated to debut...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5e72834957818f15b2309c2fffa19c81dbe5fc2f279e8c320279e36ed1bc4f4c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791922497,\"headline\":\"Are You Overpaying For Disney Stock Versus Its Rivals?\",\"id\":142854516,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors are currently paying 21.9 times trailing twelve-month earnings for shares of Walt Disney (DIS). That valuation is the highest multiple in a group of four major media and entertainment companies: Disney, Netflix, Comcast, and Fox. Despite carrying the premium multiple, Disney ranks third among these peers in both sales growth and operating margin. So what does the same money buy at Disney's closest-priced rival.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=64f55401a4167d724360a4ab7cfc4019e0115c19d330f540b354c6a67149b074\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791920990,\"headline\":\"Can You Make Money Off Netflix Stock Now?\",\"id\":142854333,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix (NFLX) stock has dropped 12% since mid-September, retreating from a recent high of $80.32. When a familiar company discounts this quickly, investors often look for an entry point before the price rebounds. Yet this selloff has a reason behind it, and Netflix has navigated sharp declines before. So what pushed the stock down, and has buying Netflix after its sharp falls paid before.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0d0badd83ba3f3a760eb27dcfc404b41c82c4cd93009b793044fd870a4b7496a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791916502,\"headline\":\"Walt Disney vs. Netflix: Which Media Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142853509,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix commands a 24.3% net margin versus Disney's 13.1%, but Disney trades at a fraction of the valuation multiple, a classic growth-versus-value standoff.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aaae07d59e04b2d00933a1fd55c48b5d90ce1688a50e51d78ce343bda90df783\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791914281,\"headline\":\"Disney on 8-day win streak\",\"id\":142886148,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108405357-17919284781791928475-48981228946-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1791928477\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"The 'Fast Money' traders talk what is driving Disney's stock boost.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f7f77f6e4e9256f062190e79edef604c5ef456c56dc3f614b68d3320dafdf10e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791909615,\"headline\":\"Discover which dow jones stocks are making waves on Tuesday.\",\"id\":142851845,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Curious about the dow jones stocks that are in motion on Tuesday? Join us as we explore the top movers within the dow jones index during today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=40d2c5297662fe6576264f21cdd4db7fc189e73028158a4128a0960d9c568eed\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791900000,\"headline\":\"TEGNA and Disney Entertainment Television Renew ABC Affiliation Agreements in 13 Markets\",\"id\":142849435,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The multi-year deal covers stations across the U.S.MCLEAN, Va. and BURBANK, Calif., Oct. 13, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TEGNA Inc. (NASDAQ: NXST) and Disney Entertainment Television (NYSE: DIS) today announced that they have entered into a comprehensive, multi-year deal that renews station affiliation agreements for all of TEGNA’s ABC-affiliated stations. “Our partnership with Disney Entertainment Television offers viewers an incredible programming lineup that includes the NFL, NBA, SEC football a\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6d1e2b3315a6e3fd9cb0b0e5b79abe8a306153910c008f48f8cb8cbb74d7c4a5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791895560,\"headline\":\"Character.ai has filed for Chapter 11 bankruptcy protection as it moves to sell assets to Disney\",\"id\":142885290,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The controversial companion chatbot platform cites legal challenges, regulatory obstacles, and runaway operating costs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=38ed52d1192860ea679dab8f1496da9ec66841f9864027f118fe38287250eaff\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791894222,\"headline\":\"Just 5 years in, interactive chatbot platform Character.AI files for bankruptcy\",\"id\":142848841,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The startup will sell some of its assets to Disney for $20 million.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3e2bec13bf3d9a6b58902107dbfa6b4bee1b05e2cd7d3f4196b1eee7c7615129\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791890736,\"headline\":\"Six Flags Stock Drops 10% After Hours Following a Fatal Roller Coaster Incident in Georgia\",\"id\":142847551,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A fatal incident at Six Flags Over Georgia sent the stock tumbling after hours, but the ride closure spreading to parks nationwide may matter far more to investors than the tragedy itself, and the company has no financial cushion to absorb what comes next.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5d4eb7635e7ef4e43c7b054663d08437befac9a2cc687e2c4b50af61ca781640\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791887345,\"headline\":\"TEGNA, Disney Entertainment Television Ink Multi-Year Agreement To Renew Station Affiliation Deals For All ABC-Affiliated Stations\",\"id\":142850054,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"TEGNA Inc. (NASDAQ: NXST) and Disney Entertainment Television (NYSE:DIS) today announced that they have entered into a comprehensive, multi-year deal that renews station affiliation agreements for all of TEGNA’s\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dce6ee652434fc4307f870e187d531c370946b6ce8f8d744eaf9e0a299260259\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791873900,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Breakfast Podcast: Six Flags Shares Plunge Premarket\",\"id\":142844691,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2224861243/image_2224861243.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"FUN stock plunges as fatal incident shakes Six Flags. Disney steps in as Character.AI files chapter 11. Micron unleashes a record buyback.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e3f4441d944eea682c76d64f545c7d2dde3efacf24443159e08046ca9d8f9ae9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791865694,\"headline\":\"From Google Deal to Bankruptcy: Character.AI Files for Chapter 11, Puts Disney In Driver’s Seat With $20 Million Deal for Key Assets\",\"id\":142849211,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/13/Vancouver--Canada---Feb-6-2024--Characte.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Character.AI files for Chapter 11 bankruptcy and agrees to sell select assets to Disney for $20 million, pending court approval.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=df50d853f728c9db53f881d2c96ce5233b7f690fdc45b2e786fe6fd682f89f76\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791863400,\"headline\":\"Character.ai Initiates Voluntary Chapter 11 Proceeding to Facilitate Value-Maximizing Sale Process\",\"id\":142832210,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"MENLO PARK, Calif., October 13, 2026--Character Technologies Inc. (\\\"Character.ai\\\" or the \\\"Company\\\"), a pioneering artificial intelligence entertainment platform, today announced that it has commenced a voluntary Chapter 11 case in the U.S. Bankruptcy Court for the District of Delaware (the \\\"Court\\\") to facilitate a value-maximizing sale of all or substantially all of its assets (the \\\"Sale Process\\\"). The Company intends to continue operating its platform as it conducts the Sale Process.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2e5383b167237ab1f465129000b581be1aafe4518f16fb50eedf97703a2b4fd2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791839379,\"headline\":\"Walt Disney (DIS) Took On Abu Dhabi Risk With A Capital Light Resort\",\"id\":142824582,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walt Disney (NYSE:DIS) agreed to a new capital-light resort on Abu Dhabi’s Yas Island, partnering with Miral Asset Management. Under the arrangement, Miral is expected to fund and operate the attraction while Disney supplies creative direction and branded content. The park’s Abu Dhabi location introduces security and geopolitical exposure that sits outside Disney’s traditional financial risk profile. The Abu Dhabi Yas Island resort structure deserves to be weighed alongside the rest of the...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5c11d1cfff9a557a5962bd39e4a0253963c8904aa8c406c0ed9b71b9be7cef68\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791836746,\"headline\":\"Epic Games delays Disney title as studio shifts to AI-first model - Bloomberg\",\"id\":142824583,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Epic Games Inc. has delayed the release of its upcoming video-game collaboration with Walt Disney Company (NYSE:DIS) and instructed developers to pivot toward a primary reliance on artificial intelligence tools to complete the title, Bloomberg reported, citing people familiar with the project. The decision marks an unprecedented shift for a major gaming studio, as Epic attempts to pioneer an \\\"AI first\\\" production model for a high-profile release.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2ea22f4b2eb3597672bc9a03f2f0ea413c47bc8113c998b4a9ea5e8269591809\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791831463,\"headline\":\"What Could Netflix Stock Be Worth In Three Years?\",\"id\":142823619,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the past twelve months, Netflix (NFLX) stock has lost 40%, trailing the 17.0% return of the S\\u0026P 500. The shares now trade at 21.6 times earnings. That multiple sits well below what investors used to pay for them. Excluding readings above 100, the company's P/E averaged 39.7 at the last twelve quarter-ends. Yet the company's sales are still growing. So if Netflix keeps selling more, what would a share you buy today be worth three years from now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=35dbb6e5ea1790d14bcc8fe50eae814a50bc94068819bc4c1cb3bce02b7a6bbd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791829481,\"headline\":\"Epic Games Delays Disney Project, Asks Developers to Use More AI\",\"id\":142823749,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary