 is whether Disney’s current market value lines up with the cash flows its businesses can realistically produce. Over the past 5 years, Disney shareholders...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=117401036e9790bbbd09f714a9226b7a855380bb3d641b02232d9e00e05effe3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791406440,\"headline\":\"Why Disney’s Super Bowl Streaming Plan Is a Bigger Deal Than It Seems\",\"id\":142700440,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"It’s a data gold mine.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bee4e187db231456afaa70eab3b63184d09dcb0af0d2b795e358abc5af3b07cc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791405885,\"headline\":\"Disney Is Slashing Jobs Again. Here’s What DIS Investors Need to Know.\",\"id\":142708274,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Disney is trying to balance restructuring with long-term growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=91e7166269ebf0729323d7fb60540dffd6ecd4b63b4995745b102fb963d411ef\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791400214,\"headline\":\"Top dow jones movers in Wednesday's session\",\"id\":142699052,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay updated with the movements of the dow jones index one hour before the close of the markets on Wednesday. Discover which stocks are leading as top gainers and losers in today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=79cbbb6a9394d74f43ed5875e5d2b638c156a24824ea95997addfce18685ce40\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791393201,\"headline\":\"Disney Confirms That Disney+ Will Stream The 2027 Super Bowl\",\"id\":142698473,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"sour