 loads, streaming bets, and cost cuts start to bite. In this article you will see 3 large cap Media \\u0026 Entertainment stocks that screens suggest could be meaningfully exposed to this Skydance story. The three stocks highlighted below are simply a starting...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6f65b7763c9b74438650baf2b02498a27b3ed95f8136d6ce2e8b47318c1dd2cf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791050040,\"headline\":\"$1,000 Invested in Walt Disney (DIS) at Its 52-Week Low Is Worth This Much Today\",\"id\":142615616,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Despite being such an inimitable business, shares in this industry leader are well off their peak.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=764bf28449cb8c1ae666c61bdda1865edd8348c2f058ee64ead9bff304d6e954\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791046530,\"headline\":\"'Like I didn't exist': Former Disney CEO explains why he doesn't visit the theme parks anymore\",\"id\":142615671,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Former Disney CEO Bob Chapek said he hasn't been back to Disney since he was ousted in November 2022.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=398e57ec3cf15ccca6a81ca32a7dd706155c9469a9bc6cc90e9038a8bb58b0a0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791001091,\"headline\":\"Comcast (CMCSA) vs. Disney (DIS): Both Stocks Are Struggling. Is There Light at the End of the Tunnel?\",\"id\":142602339,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Comcast Corporation (NASDAQ:CMCSA) and The Walt Disney Company (NYSE:DIS) have both had a rough few years. Comcast is down about 62% over the past five years, while Disney has roughly halved from its March 2021 level. Neither decline is particularly surprising