ttps://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix (NFLX) describes itself to investors differently than it did two years ago. Live events and games were side initiatives in its pitch then; together with video podcasts, they now take a much larger place on its earnings calls. Netflix stock has lost 42% in the twelve months to September 30, 2026, while the S\\u0026P 500 rose 14.4%. You need to know which business you own when a stock falls that far. So what was Netflix's pitch to investors two years ago.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5684675f6adf12f850c12fe8bf4347016145f10a6dac9edcb30f429eaa39b707\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790952000,\"headline\":\"Why Disney is planning yet another round of layoffs\",\"id\":142590874,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor and host of Sozzi Unleashed, Brian Sozzi, breaks down Disney's (DIS) latest cost-cutting push under CEO Josh D’Amaro. With the company’s third round of layoffs this year and a broader television restructuring now in the works, Sozzi examines Disney’s familiar playbook of consolidating operations, cutting headcount, and streamlining the business as it looks to reshape the company for the streaming era.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bd68ebc3456ea16d9dc6964ac95b405eb9826be802a147d40f3b166f3692ab3c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790951695,\"headline\":\"Disney Stock Is 13% Below Its High as It Reportedly Merges Its TV Divisions. Here’s Where the Stock Could Go by 2030\",\"id\":142590875,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Disney StockCurrent Price: $101. 33Target Price (Mid): ~$145Street Target: ~$127Potential Total Return: ~43%Annualized IRR: ~9% / yearWhat Happened?The Walt Disney Company (DIS:NYSE) closed at $101.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=69b7264203b32723d8c6cc2d4c635a328924025ab515c461256ff3b693c2016e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790951681,\"headline\":\"Comcast vs. Walt Disney: Which Media Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142590876,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Comcast's cash generation and lower valuation contrast sharply with Disney's streaming momentum and brand power, but one carries notably higher leverage.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=10f5ede12a8651da83a80b6acc71f3345bf9890d8de0821bf019f438db382f1f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790949600,\"headline\":\"DISNEY BRINGS THE MAGIC OF DISNEY'S LAKESHORE LODGE TO NEW YORK CITY\",\"id\":142590878,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Disney Experiences is inviting New Yorkers to discover the magic of Disney's Lakeshore Lodge through an expansive 3D street mural in Flatiron Plaza.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bf706ea2ba452e36cea6b0731e9965f2e63a7790703a8f689bd4aac75a6689ba\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790943151,\"headline\":\"Disney president Dana Walden defends ongoing company layoffs\",\"id\":142588514,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Dana Walden said restructuring was necessary to move away from a siloed structure toward a more centralized television business\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=035d7804e2138fafafdcda5199b0b959efb65f77f7cf647849393f1d8f1c80c0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790939772,\"headline\":\"'Disney Licenses Slew of Titles to Netflix, Including All Five ‘Ice Age’ Movies, ‘Percy Jackson and the Olympians,’ ‘Felicity,’