 massive debt package for its pending purchase of Warner Bros. Discovery (NASDAQ:WBD) to credit investors, and the buyer and the target are trading on very different terms. Warner Bros. Discovery stock is at $30.86, down 0.1%, […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7dc19d787ab5b8bd56b1830b6760ef5d8551eaed0056bc64c9041a902a44c4be\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790696308,\"headline\":\"Walt Disney Fiscal Q4 Set for Boost From Parks, Cruises, Additional Week, BofA Says\",\"id\":142498267,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walt Disney's (DIS) fiscal Q4 is expected to benefit from strong parks, cruise trends and an additio\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ca0754eec09e5ac96c3b4123b3f74d98e7ec2a908d6dc4520f7cba921638d433\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790691504,\"headline\":\"Disney needs a 'growth vehicle,' and it might not be streaming: Fmr. Disney CEO\",\"id\":142499453,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi previews his interview with Disney's (DIS) former CEO, Bob Chapek, in which they discuss Chapek's ousting, Disney's future, and more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6677976f9a563f11804e6b3254f4d7428fce11a362a1d79be04633c040b6b4bd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790691327,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer Says Netflix “Too Cheap” To Overlook As Deutsche Bank Upgrades Stock To Buy\",\"id\":142498208,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Jim Cramer and Steve Eisman are staring at the same Netflix data and reaching opposite conclusions, and with Q3 results approaching, one of them is about to look very wrong.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=49cbc50cb6b06898743855a1052875e1edc2bdcfff48f8d3cac04844823abda8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790689475,\"headline\":\"What Does Weaker Viewing Actually Cost Netflix Stock?\",\"id\":142498042,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix (NFLX) investors worry that YouTube is pulling viewers away and that weaker viewing will eat into profit. Analysts at Wells Fargo cut their rating on Netflix on September 18, 2026, warning that weaker engagement and content could pressure margins. Netflix's 30% operating margin over the past year is its highest in ten years, so the margin has room to fall. If weaker viewing pulled that margin back to its three-year average, how much operating profit would Netflix still make.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=84869a9a538c090a18bac4a770a0ba632e211777b742bfc8d3c4691596470fc4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790689239,\"headline\":\"Disney Is Laying Off A Few Hundred Employees In Human Resources And Tech Departments\",\"id\":142519239,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"-Reuters Citing Source. \",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b97199f2376d600bf607720bb3f1ba4d8baf120ed07f5573ebc2513ae2ee4893\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790688973,\"headline\":\"Disney laying off around 300 employees in latest cuts under new CEO Josh D'Amaro\",\"id\":142521655,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108154127-1748981657081-gettyimages-2218490142-_a7a2358_2oboazym.jpeg?v=1756911238\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Disney warned about the most recent round of cuts in its August earnings report as one of the levers it was evaluating to reduce costs at the company.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=97792cef4a657e0f1f5061f5958265dd9f70bb78e45c63cf163eb6bea36b85da\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790685817,\"headline\":\"Disney's Q4 Should Look Healthy. Its 2027 Film Slate Is the Harder Setup, Analyst Says\",\"id\":142519240,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/29/Disney-Plus--Disney--Entertainment-Subsc.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Disney reports Q4 FY26 Nov. 12; BofA expects positive trends from parks, cruises and a 53rd week, despite weak entertainment. Buy rating.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8d2977be42b62f23fd622ab99bd02fa17bc57e98e2e923e389053225b9e65213\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790685625,\"headline\":\"'Disney Makes More Job Cuts, Laying Off Several Hundred Employees' - Variety\",\"id\":142519241,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://variety.com/2026/film/news/disney-layoffs-hr-tech-employees-1236878176/\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f84a441be2acc7c72d8544f60134c04cf094b10000e42378462131bb6cc0d24c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790679600,\"headline\":\"Former Disney CEO Bob Chapek on being blindsided by Bob Iger\",\"id\":142495003,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Former Disney CEO Bob Chapek sits down with Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi to reveal the shocking behind-the-scenes leadership drama that defined his tumultuous tenure.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c2679a63f13e2229fadcc0f282c91419c3df1bc3641713aa61126b0ab21e7885\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790665560,\"headline\":\"He was Disney’s most junior employee when he rewrote the CEO’s op-ed. Now he’s a CEO, with advice for Gen Z: ‘Don’t really ask for permission’\",\"id\":142495004,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Funko CEO Josh Simon’s first job was working under Disney’s Michael Eisner, where