summary\":\"Guggenheim  analyst Michael Morris   reiterates Walt Disney (NYSE:DIS) with a Buy and maintains $120 price target.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8f7192ed1772ef73bc62c26497b320c46572d6f927a0b00aa878ae0ce713be6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790583026,\"headline\":\"Former Disney CEO Bob Chapek on why he wrote his new memoir: 'I had to get the truth out there'\",\"id\":142468931,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108368680-17905972491790597245-48660130614-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1790597248\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Former Disney CEO Bob Chapek joins CNBC’s 'Squawk Box' to discuss why he wrote his memoir, 'Behind the Castle Walls: My Thirty Years at the Happiest Place on Earth,' his relationship with Bob Iger, and more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5594705be8fb6f3b0ce3d7945f663ca64a13b8665e9648efa1d1e22e7f5282a2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790502077,\"headline\":\"Disney Raised Ad-Free Disney+ Prices 13%. Its CFO Says Streaming Profit Dollars Now Beat Margins\",\"id\":142446305,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Disney StockCurrent Price: $106. 16Target Price (Mid): ~$152Street Target: ~$127Potential Total Return: ~43%Annualized IRR: ~9% / yearWhat Happened?The Walt Disney Company (DIS) raised standalone ad-free Disney+ and Hulu by 13% to $21.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fd90c8b341927118a41953491d18fa868bbe73472ed823a4dda3ce676b079eac\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790424575,\"headline\":\"Disney’s New CTO and Streaming Price Hikes Might Change The Case For Investing In Walt Disney (DIS)\",\"id\":142436926,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In recent days, The Walt Disney Company appointed Karandeep Anand as its first-ever Chief Technology Officer and named Adam Smith Chairman of Direct-to-Consumer, while also implementing further price increases for Disney+ and Hulu’s ad-free tiers and bundles. Together, these leadership and pricing moves highlight Disney’s push to tighten its technology backbone and extract more value from its streaming audience. We’ll now examine how Anand’s appointment as CTO could influence Disney’s...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=23f73dc01b575b415ffc9643f6c8bc8617c4457ae7404f3ac08e0e4ce20e444d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790381584,\"headline\":\"Disney (DIS) Names its First Technology Chief. Can AI Investment Deliver Returns?\",\"id\":142429256,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On September 18, 2026, Reuters reported that The Walt Disney Company (NYSE:DIS) named Karandeep Anand, the outgoing CEO of generative AI chatbot service Character.AI, as its first-ever chief technology officer, effective October 2. Anand will report directly to CEO Josh D’Amaro. He will oversee enterprise technology, AI platforms, and engineering across Disney’s business segments, with […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e2dc2ecd7f5105615798de2cfafd400e0d152e395a20688aef30a9784458193a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790372633,\"headline\":\"Walt Disney vs. Netflix: Which Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142426132,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"One entertainment giant is setting records across its biggest businesses at the same time. The other just guided below expectations and watched its stock drop sharply.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d7f435e3f4c8e3ec45f4b116b4dfce8adf1cd9bc03121b640effba91797c9f11\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790372155,\"headline\":\"Comcast vs. Walt Disney: Comparing Recent Revenue Trends Between These Media Companies\",\"id\":142426171,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Comcast holds a revenue lead, but Disney's steady growth is narrowing the gap — a shift that could reshape the competitive dynamics between these media giants.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ec62af16519cbebc212dce6650d5365447f7df381d75beca55b3dfec8eb0cfe6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790343877,\"headline\":\"3 Consumer Stocks That Concern Us\",\"id\":142422184,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The performance of consumer discretionary businesses is closely linked to economic cycles. This sensitive demand profile can cause the industry to underperform when macro uncertainty enters the fray, and over the past six months, its returns were flat while the S\\u0026P 500 climbed by 16.9%.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e7a431c3e69dcb9d4d1e9c8ec47b71ee3cafb0d36ac10c6de7cfa06698ca379c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790334584,\"headline\":\"9 Of 11 Sectors Fall In Friday Trading As Cyclicals Lead\",\"id\":142437371,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/25/Stocks--Futures-Slip.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Friday’s regular session has two sectors higher and nine lower, with growth and cyclical sectors split across the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with Technology and Industrials\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b3792a01c3fec00ee82003a3acfe8485dff4940ffce96f59c5ae719dc5ac1e6a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790282703,\"headline\":\"Walt Disney (DIS) Gains As Market Dips: What You Should Know\",\"id\":142386796,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walt Disney (DIS) reached $105.57 at the closing of the latest trading day, reflecting a +2.03% change compared to its last close.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=22f8bf7ae72bfbed78f015fa6d75c6457a7f24f3eb27bdd4c4f105799989617b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790277010,\"headline\":\"Stay informed with the top movers within the dow jones index on Thursday.\",\"id\":142385318,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Curious about the top performers within the dow jones index one hour before the close of the markets on Thursday? Dive into the list of today's session's top gainers and losers for a comprehensive overview.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=39315ae599bd174ef47d4654149a800f3939b9271d7fc496d8612dfacb99059d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790273822,\"headline\":\"Streamers are getting expensive–but parents will keep paying\",\"id\":142385705,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"\\\"Market Hang's panel discusses Disney (DIS) upping its Disney+ ad-free streaming plan to almost $21.50 a month, and whether the company can hold parents with young kids in a bind forever. Today's Market Hang panel consists of Host Turney Duff, Business Insider Today executive editor Dan DeFrancesco, The Wall Street Skinny co-founders Jen Saarbach and Kristen Kelly, and author Armando Pantoja.\\\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e64f9d75f22b20e8ff77b02b19e020d04f44da7cd650c01206cc6de62faac29f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790273249,\"headline\":\"Disney Just Raised Prices Across Multiple Streaming Tiers. Here’s How It Compares to Netflix and Paramount.\",\"id\":142385556,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"After years of false starts, Disney's streaming business could finally make real profits.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=95efc49a2561a75d7b16c6ed477487e4723e0953aa4608cf8dca8d53071ccf68\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790268008,\"headline\":\"Thursday's session: top gainers and losers in the dow jones index\",\"id\":142384124,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay updated with the movement of dow jones stocks in today's session. Discover which dow jones stocks are making waves on Thursday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=02c4b765a7909f85d828a4369f84da529f6b95b03fb016534212b10ece87605c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790266620,\"headline\":\"Disney World's peak Magic Kingdom ticket jumps $10 to $219 for 2027\",\"id\":142384774,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Disney World tickets break the $200 psychological barrier for 2027, with EPCOT crossing the line for the first time.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3b74da798fa626c07a327e458b385351214dcd883e3c3ca387f1cb8e60f75feb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790263138,\"headline\":\"Is Comcast Broken, Or Just Paying To Defend Its Broadband?\",\"id\":142383655,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Comcast (CMCSA) shares sit about 43% below their two-year high, a price that looks like a bet the business is shrinking. Yet over the past twelve months Comcast generated nearly $18 billion of free cash flow, a yield of 22.2% on its market value against 4.5% for the median S\\u0026P 500 company. Which reading is right? It turns on a choice Comcast made more than a year ago: lower broadband prices to hold customers against new rivals.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=07d386a84346c29ee46e90d5a5dce1b056e97383d9b97550719616763d8a809d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790263020,\"headline\":\"Disney World ends a free perk that helps visitors save money\",\"id\":142383659,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Disney visitors are already facing higher costs, making the loss of this benefit especially notable.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9686d1f09a5f2aae1b0a6992534289524a266f1d04b2034aaf304ee6cc641125\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790260020,\"headline\":\"Is Disney's New Price Hike a Genius Move, or Did It Go Too Far This Time?\",\"id\":142383660,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"You'll pay more now for Disney+ and Hulu. There's a good reason you will keep paying.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e028b3d2feff840b8c8129600e8083e8cc71e8479240410555caedaccbaab7dc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790258699,\"headline\":\"8 Of 11 Sectors Fall In Thursday Trading As Leaders Split\",\"id\":142421646,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/24/movers-1.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Three sectors are higher and eight are lower in Thursday’s regular session, with growth, cyclical and defensive sectors each represented among the top three. The leaders are separated rather than\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=00446d0b7eca62e7091fb91a0636311d89b5a340641080559ba21143a2da914a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790250675,\"headline\":\"What Would A Real Market Crash Do To Netflix Stock After This Fall?\",\"id\":142375121,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix (NFLX) stock trades near $71, about 43% below its high of the past year, and it lost 6.6% in the past week. The market did not fall with it: The S\\u0026P 500 returned 16.5% over the past twelve months. So without any shock at all, Netflix is already down more than its average fall in past market shocks. What would a real crash add.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e51cb41f092bd6b24ed20b6afec8c3896268e1a0d8b8c040337c7d8c33d27cb3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790250240,\"headline\":\"Bond Yields Are Flashing Red for Stocks. What Happens Next.\",\"id\":142379211,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Surging bond yields send a shiver through markets; Trump, Xi, and the battle for AI; and more news to start your day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=54d5d7d9352278ea79c3a9ee9415b0985ccf83e0bc40a4bedf0f50e5d0aa97fc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790243767,\"headline\":\"CNN, MS Now, Politico Request Immediate Court Hearing After Being Blocked From White House Grounds On Thursday\",\"id\":142381629,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"- Reuters Citing Filing\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d76d7d5e632855c2321960ff26da3092531bdf42178d6bf68d50ccf764b61597\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790234281,\"headline\":\"Disney+ Subscription Prices Nearly Doubled Since 2023 as Company Raises Ad-Free Plan Again to $21.49 a Month\",\"id\":142373838,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walt Disney Co.’s (NYSE:DIS) Disney+ and Hulu subscribers in the U.S. face another round of price increases as Disney raises ad-free plans and several bundles and continues to push customers toward multi-service subscriptions. Disney+ and Hulu Raise Ad-Free Subscription Prices Disney+ Premium and Hulu Premium, both of which offer ad-free streaming, are increasing 13% to $21.49 per month, up $2.50 from $18.99, Variety reported on Wednesday. The latest increases took effect Sept. 23 for new subscr\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7391f5fde6ebb48fc86f7cf4796cdfe7254fcd8ce21e32785c8cb4a7d187099e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790233948,\"headline\":\"Is Walt Disney (DIS) Cheap Following Its Second 13% Streaming Price Hike?\",\"id\":142373839,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walt Disney (DIS) is raising prices on its ad-free Disney+ and Hulu plans by 13%, the second increase in a year, as it pushes its direct-to-consumer streaming business toward stronger profitability. The price move comes after a mixed year for Walt Disney investors, with the share price down 7.5% year to date and the 1-year total shareholder return declining 7.5%, even as the 3-year total shareholder return is up 33.6%. Recent 90-day share price gains of 5.5% hint at rebuilding momentum around...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=158710508a931fc800d9c4073ce9fb39febab93847358c2d5ea6ed9293604a41\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790195220,\"headline\":\"Why Disney Is Raising Streaming Prices—Again\",\"id\":142365169,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walt Disney  is raising its streaming subscription prices for the second time in a year as it looks to focus on investing in content.  The move comes at a notable time: The popularity of Meta Platform’s Muse has raised concerns that artificial-intelligence agents pose risks to companies that rely on recurring payments s if they help consumers cancel those payments from simple prompts.  A  Disney  spokesperson confirmed the price changes to Barron’s on Wednesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=34733c97e401f29f279e49952aa2ad157d78db8caf4cea075786509115e10028\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790195142,\"headline\":\"Tracking Ole Andreas Halvorsen's Viking Global Portfolio - Q2 2026 Update\",\"id\":142366269,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/128139629/image_128139629.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Viking Globalâs Q2 2026 13F: top holdings, new Ferrari/MSCI stakes, and exits from Apple/Alphabet. See more details here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=805ed7f92f05fcd51d42bbe553f9e1bd952d980a27499fb4389f16268e6e486a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790191227,\"headline\":\"Disney's Price Hike Makes the Bundle the Obvious Buy\",\"id\":142364166,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The ad-free Disney+ and Hulu bundle now costs just 50 cents more than either service alone\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d00033f00c6dcd2c1e2120c64d9b01813e67e496a51ba1286aff321dde1c8e60\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790189156,\"headline\":\"Entertainment in the AI Era: Music, Games and Film​: 2nd LA CorpGov Forum\",\"id\":142365334,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CorpGov hosted the second LA CorpGov Forum on Sept. 18, 2026, at The Huntington Library in San Marino, California. This event brought together members of the financial community from both LA and beyond in panels focused on the finance of entertainment and media, sports, along with capital markets and shareholder activism. Panel: Entertainment in the […] The post Entertainment in the AI Era: Music, Games and Film​: 2nd LA CorpGov Forum appeared first on CorpGov.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0242c534b58cab3adbeb8e3f6c7aa8c71f20a63569ecf052abe31477e6dfb7fc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790188401,\"headline\":\"Disney Is Raising Streaming Prices Again, Following Hikes by Netflix, Apple TV, and Peacock\",\"id\":142364203,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Disney’s streaming services are getting more expensive, again.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=031e822d863dc8af3bb2f81e9e60f29ab07d0dbbc7f6cf12b7f605c83574f9bf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790186787,\"headline\":\"Disney+ and Hulu add to the growing trend of streaming inflation\",\"id\":142364204,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"At the same time, Disney appears to be exploring new ways to expand its streaming business beyond simply raising subscription prices.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=56d342d7f86546747a3d8b7d6148368f82d4bd96f455258cfe547285370d9599\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790186403,\"headline\":\"Six Flags Could Go Private. Disney Shareholders Should Pay Attention.\",\"id\":142364205,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"An activist investor is pushing Six Flags toward a sale, and the price a buyer agrees to pay could quietly reshape how Wall Street values the most profitable corner of Disney's empire.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=501ccab39ce99585791e93a59fc519a57ac1738fe0db7f6024438719466f4804\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790182506,\"headline\":\"Disney set to elevate streaming prices, Bloomberg reports\",\"id\":142363228,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Walt Disney Company (NYSE:DIS) is preparing to raise prices across several of its streaming services as early as Wednesday, according to a report from Bloomberg. The flagship ad-free Disney+ tier will see a 13% increase, rising $2.50 to $21.49 per month, while standalone ad-free Hulu will undergo an identical price hike. The strategic adjustment narrows the price gap between Disney’s primary service and key rival Netflix Inc., which charges $26.99 monthly for its top-tier plan.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b476ccda15f52fac93ca05ed117969f4ef364165a8f400343ef83e3a8926221b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790180734,\"headline\":\"U.S. Judge Deciding Case Over Media Ban At The White House Ends Hearing Without Saying When He Would Rule\",\"id\":142379985,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"- Reuters \",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3ae6cb7c4b3bbcf315caf8362a9dd2f27a4a15997fc2699dcd865820e08d8412\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790176707,\"headline\":\"WBD Stock Is Running. Is There Fuel Left?\",\"id\":142361865,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"After a powerful run to new highs, this media giant's stock is asking every investor the same question: is the turnaround in streaming enough to carry the whole company higher.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=86640ea3005a06594c09cb28a573365f7299b4fbdcffed963059ab3b31efc3c2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790171280,\"headline\":\"Can Disney's International Streaming Expansion Challenge NFLX \\u0026 AMZN?\",\"id\":142359377,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"DIS is scaling local originals, cutting churn and improving SVOD profitability as it builds an international streaming challenge to Netflix and Amazon.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3f20578224861606069636654d7c5d2dffb4192ae8068c1f7a5f4af366b435bf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790169809,\"headline\":\"What Are Disney Stock Bulls Not Worried About?\",\"id\":142358900,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"DIS\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walt Disney (DIS) owns theme parks and streaming services. The stock costs 21.8 times its earnings of the past year. The S\\u0026P 500 is at 22.6 times. So you pay less than the market for these businesses. That case only pays off if two things are both true. Disney's latest earnings call gave a reason to doubt the first. What did management say about ad prices.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=92159d0a47d18282e150da2571b1085bc5777583854d04a44c4085f1a5d3ef16\"}]"
