     "content": {
      "size": 140808,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792385657,\"headline\":\"Netflix (NFLX) To Report Earnings Tomorrow: Here Is What To Expect\",\"id\":142992750,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Streaming video giant Netflix (NASDAQ: NFLX) will be reporting earnings this Tuesday after market close. Here’s what to look for.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ef5c647cd9aa1c74645c8f68b43f497c64d1cde28bedf6f16b7acba081985867\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792375488,\"headline\":\"AAPL, TSLA, NFLX, GME, RKLB: Why Retail Traders Couldn’t Take Their Eyes Off These Stocks Last Week\",\"id\":142992148,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Developments across technology, entertainment, retail investing, and the commercial space industry drew interest last week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=033f4af5f4f91b753316232bf70e79ea449c1cd8db506f803ae8705ec9c6f0fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792364400,\"headline\":\"Top 4 Earnings Reports This Week: What Tesla, Meta, SpaceX, Netflix Must Show\",\"id\":142989727,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla, Meta, SpaceX, and Netflix earnings land this week. See why forecasts, not profits, could move each stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=088a6f07274d5ef19dcc93ad1ad7eb4642a3200a6147fa16c50c76411525e650\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792351802,\"headline\":\"Jefferies Makes a Bold $85 Call on Netflix Stock\",\"id\":142991469,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Jefferies starts Netflix coverage with a “Buy” rating and an $85 target. See the pricing, ads, and live sports drivers behind its 20% upside call.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f85012bfedbd581773ee2d875c4f3f63646d565ea4524d6dde3f744401676c02\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792350780,\"headline\":\"Netflix's content calendar, layoffs prompt harsh response from fund manager\",\"id\":142988597,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix membership churn, a lackluster content calendar, and an employee shake-up have Chris Versace selling shares.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0430c67140c596c8987f82916060ccdb3d1073f4b1805c51dd876a4e49cf89af\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792340220,\"headline\":\"Netflix cut 1,000 jobs. Here' why and how it impacts your subscription\",\"id\":142987987,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"One memo. 1,000 people. A lot of unanswered questions.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=33cc53c89ad368192b527322d784db66f87e733a6e2b0dbcaec908ef4ee55ad8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792332006,\"headline\":\"Netflix Stock Has Been on a Roll. Here’s Where It Could Go Next.\",\"id\":142987457,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix just posted a rare one-week bounce after a brutal slide from its highs, and with earnings on the horizon, analysts are split on whether the rebound holds or breaks down from here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bdac7ab9fd8603da68c24f0456476a0bbbb79fc7749821ccd400fd5ddf583cfb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792331896,\"headline\":\"What To Expect In Markets This Week: SPCX, TSLA, META, NFLX, IBM Earnings And More\",\"id\":142986968,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"After a bruising week for technology stocks, investors will be looking for clues on whether corporate results can help steady sentiment, or add to the pressure already building across the market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fe42684d497baae3aaa7a1e0479172e0b96dc0a4986224d8f5f570d83db2b753\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792320317,\"headline\":\"Netflix Needs Another 'Squid Game' Moment As Growth Pressure Mounts\",\"id\":142986265,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix Inc. is under growing pressure to reignite growth and boost viewer engagement as it cuts 1,000 jobs, overhauls its content leadership and bets on YouTube creators to win back audiences. With the stock down more than 22% in 2026,...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8f1d66700fab0bbbe657b5d44e52ba441929e8633e356e37056a01c6409a67ce\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792318307,\"headline\":\"3 Cash Flow Stocks To Watch In October 2026\",\"id\":142985479,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Inflation in the US just hit 3.7% in September, driven hard by energy costs, and that puts reliable cash generation in the spotlight. When prices for essentials feel jumpy, investors tend to care more about what money actually comes in the door rather than just headline stories. This article walks through three stocks that screen as attractively priced on future cash flows and explains why that matters for you now. The three stocks below are just a sample. The full cash flow screen surfaced...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4426b4cfdc3e8ca9cab9314c511bda73d20d05614c496b90d220e747bd179ab4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792318082,\"headline\":\"Netflix Stock Has Gained in the Fourth Quarter in 17 of the Last 24 Years\",\"id\":142986223,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Last year's 22% fourth-quarter fall began with one rough day in October.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ec2fe43cc8f9d77c2c4af374d5ecb3e42a83cced057fa215d02fb00e2ee037c4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792304769,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Week Ahead\",\"id\":142985350,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b003098e70a6cdd7a3ab60fb61978bd51c28cff1b3b3250070bf025dbecfc5c3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792264468,\"headline\":\"Netflix (NFLX) Replaces Bela Bajaria With Peter Rice As Content Chief\",\"id\":142963233,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix (NasdaqGS:NFLX) has replaced chief content officer Bela Bajaria with former Disney and Fox executive Peter Rice. The leadership change coincides with Netflix undertaking its largest workforce reduction to date across global operations. Rice previously oversaw a broad slate of scripted and unscripted hits spanning broadcast TV, cable networks, and streaming platforms. The shakeup that moves content control from Bela Bajaria to Peter Rice is only one piece of the Netflix story. We have...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bf380ef280f27817f412b3fa49568c5895f07fd8ef67a41f2dd0549ccf4090d2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792261802,\"headline\":\"How to Play NFLX Stock as Netflix Wipes Out Another 1,000 Jobs in Its Latest Round of Layoffs\",\"id\":142965233,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix trims 6% of its workforce, its biggest cut in four years, as viewer attention drifts elsewhere.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=732d7d3b452efce4bb66a23e47fa339856ae11e4b25e73417cf870206e9a28b9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792234800,\"headline\":\"Meta, Tesla Headline Earnings In Busy Week For Markets\",\"id\":142961762,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/assets/og_image_1200-29b2bfe1a595477db6826bd2126c63ac2091efb7ec76347a8e7f81ba17e3de6c.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street Week Ahead: key earnings (Meta, Tesla, Netflix), IPOs \\u0026 economic data. Read here for more details.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3dcbe5a8689c76a628f51ae4c5084970467aab6b7f0f374e353ded8fe09592d4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792187050,\"headline\":\"The Dealmaking 3: DoorDash \\u0026 Australian Open, AEG \\u0026 NFL/AWS\",\"id\":142951519,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"This week of The Dealmaking 3 with “The Sports Professor” Rick Horrow features DoorDash, Inc. (Nasdaq: DASH) partnering with the Australian Open starting in 2027 and combining venue branding with food delivery at the Golden Hour Bar, AEG bringing Fundamental’s AI technology to LA Galaxy and L.A. LIVE pairing enterprise AI adoption with sponsorship rights, and […] The post The Dealmaking 3: DoorDash \\u0026 Australian Open, AEG \\u0026 NFL/AWS appeared first on CorpGov.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ef1c627ae2d556c5ebd12ad2c650bf8211be83b38ac38cac6ca12745822893ad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792184150,\"headline\":\"Here’s How Much Traders See Netflix Stock Moving After Earnings\",\"id\":142951562,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix is set to report earnings Tuesday afternoon, with traders anticipating a move that could send the stock to a two-year low.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=191ff9359f71653775ce83eee0ad1554c1fd61a476ab6e1b9b5b6206a60a3fbe\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792182000,\"headline\":\"Tough Trading Leaves Indices In The Red\",\"id\":142952846,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2191725662/image_2191725662.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Nasdaq loses 4% on the week. WTI crude settles over $101 per barrel. Inflation worries climb but FedWatch tool stays steady\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5922d94a3abed12c8a3406d8ca67edcda453c5c0dbf98dc4e8c91e66fad73146\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792175026,\"headline\":\"Netflix, Tesla Headline Busy Earnings Calendar; Spending Plans Key To Meta's Report\",\"id\":142950029,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix stock continues to trend lower ahead of its quarterly earnings report amid slowing growth and customer engagement.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2be5562f384d7ba43520a2aae43b1760ae444d2b601bd191268fc3e6c405c2e7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173620,\"headline\":\"Options Action: Calls outpacing puts in Netflix\",\"id\":142962433,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108421888-17921874041792187401-49044783948-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792187403\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Mike Khouw, OpenInterest.pro chief strategist, joins 'Fast Money' to talk options moves around Netflix ahead of earnings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5ab7f1483bfead6ca060c8b1268a42f9e1bc4c2541d935415fae14b7e4e6f57e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173526,\"headline\":\"'Fast Money' traders talk executive changes at Netflix ahead of earnings\",\"id\":142962434,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108421886-17921873401792187337-49044767463-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792187339\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=108