 before the opening bell on Friday?\",\"id\":142944878,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Premarket_Movers_Small_free_90289f6b81.webp\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Wondering what's happening in today's pre-market session? Stay tuned for the latest updates on S\\u0026P500 stock movements.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1be597016230dcc6ba391c3113a096c01eebf1818b2bfa757921088a17d36176\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792153620,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy Netflix Stock Before Oct. 20? History Has a Clear Answer.\",\"id\":142945639,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"If you're a Netflix shareholder, like me, I have a chart that might scare you.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8259f623fa3b97baef146236d1b51673643203a6d26f6c57501dc0e4b7fe4d65\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792153551,\"headline\":\"Netflix Falls 3% as Peter Rice Takes Over Content After Layoffs; Disney and Spotify Hold Steady\",\"id\":142945640,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A leadership shake-up in Netflix's most critical division is rattling investors, but whether the new content chief can reverse a steep year-to-date slide or deepen the pain remains an open question.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1b5b9d320c42db32f180319e6e1d76cc410def90ec468e2f60cbcdd2bd971cca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792152960,\"headline\":\"Netflix Gears Up to Report Q3 Earnings: Buy, Sell or Hold the Stock?\",\"id\":142945507,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NFLX heads into Q3 earnings with expanding margins, rising ad commitments and pricing gains, but slowing viewership growth and a premium valuation cloud its outlook.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8927eeb663cbc975aea5c8e4c6877c5a1d86bbf390e2c2ba7fc941e0e7cf35ff\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792152776,\"headline\":\"Netflix’s big executive shakeup: Here’s what you need to know\",\"id\":142948767,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108420411-17921669611792166959-49039610920-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792166960\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC’s Julia Boorstin reports on Netflix’s big executive shakeup.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=06d05e825cd762b9f7fba4d66f2deca1d93ab659b5ac09517e55f2769a0b2462\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792150179,\"headline\":\"Stock market today: Dow, S\\u0026P 500, Nasdaq futures mixed amid volatile week\",\"id\":142944174,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Stocks futures were mixed on Friday, with the S\\u0026P 500 and Nasdaq on track for weekly losses, capping a volatile week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=094d32a33af2c2d95c7904d0b7c47bb49da96ae271642ecdfc80b0c5669b8801\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792149335,\"headline\":\"Netflix Floundered by 20% This Year: One Analyst Says Its Streaming Monopoly WIll Net 88% Gains Within a Year\",\"id\":142944274,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix keeps posting double-digit revenue growth while its stock craters toward a 52-week low, and the gap between Wall Street's most bearish and most bullish analysts has rarely been this wide. Something has to give, and the next earnings report could force a verdict.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dccc556d6c9c115248d4037fd229d3e1b62925684b0ac66939b4499b40532e17\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792148420,\"headline\":\"9 Of 11 Sectors Rise 