(NFLX)'s 1,000 Job Cuts Mean For Shareholders\",\"id\":142928583,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix has announced its largest layoffs since 2022, cutting about 1,000 roles, or 6% of staff, mainly across product, technology, legal and HR, while stating that the business remains financially strong and focused on high impact areas. The cuts reshape Netflix’s cost base at the same time as it leans into advertising, live events, sports and gaming, so investors are watching how lower overhead might interact with heavy content and ad tech spending commitments. We will now look at how...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=17d4744d649f5d05dc6bfc2ddc191d995cd9711226570808d640b866f9a7f857\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792110361,\"headline\":\"Netflix Replaces Content Chief Bela Bajaria With Ex-Disney Exec Peter Rice, a Day After Announcing 6% Layoffs\",\"id\":142946415,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Los-Angeles---July-20--2025-Netflix-Sign.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Netflix tapped industry veteran Peter Rice to replace content chief Bela Bajaria, a day after announcing about 1,000 layoffs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=814b6b5bf5f22371dae80bdc9a2a12790fd349c39620d2bcd85724cc135233b3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792108755,\"headline\":\"NFLX Stock Gains After-Hours After Disney’s Peter Rice Takes Reins As Chief Of Content\",\"id\":142927190,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix has appointed veteran television and film executive Peter Rice as its new chief content officer, succeeding Bela Bajaria.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ddf97a836b49dee6f01a28aae592dfdfebc12f7ad6be16d5a18a96e0e2240cdc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792097103,\"headline\":\"Why Netflix (NFLX) Outpaced the Stock Market Today\",\"id\":142923004,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The latest trading day saw Netflix (NFLX) settling at $72.61, representing a +2.89% change from its previous close.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0c6cbdfe4b87f3bac40df7f45e7e0a2a07f0b1e54abfe7c318e7b8cc63d44a48\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792095017,\"headline\":\"Netflix is dealing with a generational streaming shift away from the living room\",\"id\":142922316,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix (NFLX) will be cutting 6% of its workforce — or 1,000 jobs — keeping in trend with other media giants who have also reduced their headcount. Piper Sandler director and senior research analyst Tom Champion comes on Market Domination to speak more on how Netflix is dealing with the generational streaming and content shift away from the living room, especially as creator content dominates viewership.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c5d82321470a9885cb40e0aec3eb073c2763d8a27c176af334b2acca531be686\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792087504,\"headline\":\"Stay informed about the most active stocks in the S\\u0026P500 index on Thursday's session.\",\"id\":142920841,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Explore the S\\u0026P500 index on Thursday and find out which stocks are the most active in today's session. Stay updated with the stocks that are capturing market interest.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dd86a0c2e65b0e975dd45ee39418b1734f57cb7dac809bde94735e179281157c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792087028,\"headline