 than Disney, Amazon, Comcast, or Apple. Within that group, only Apple produced a wider operating margin. Yet Netflix shares lost 42.2% over the past year, marking the steepest decline among the five companies. The stock now trades in the middle of the pack at an earnings multiple near Disney's. So what does Netflix give you, for about the same price, that Disney does not.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1df829088dd1a95746f0b9036b58cd0b8019971d8aa73e19df8926f164f7ed8a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792013753,\"headline\":\"CNBC Daily Open: A Singapore ship goes down as Hormuz risks rise\",\"id\":142920059,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108411257-1792020365600-gettyimages-2297669670-AA_02102026_2976962.jpeg?v=1792020378\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Tensions in the Strait of Hormuz have taken a major step up after a Singapore registered ship was sunk in the critical waterway.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5d62647bceb6b597db5e6d7e633a6cfcfc028e595237d57d07822df123b9d87c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792009653,\"headline\":\"Netflix Stock Flatlines On Job Cuts, Subscriber Churn Data\",\"id\":142888441,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix stock fell as investors reacted to the company’s larger-than-expected job cuts and a report showing heavy subscriber churn in the U.S.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=593c1ca1f4f60b5c68300cfa6e103a669dda0e58a7779fef4fd116d824b6208f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792009070,\"headline\":\"NFLX Stock Layoffs: What to Know About the Latest Netflix Job Cuts\",\"id\":142896540,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix announced plans of laying off about 6% of its global workforce. Here’s wha