 1,000 employees, in an effort to better position itself for future investments, its co-CEOs told employees Wednesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=727e1a7e4fffc0dc9765546976b7fcfcaf0d6e2e4c4e7142b8e916f09f0486cd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792001102,\"headline\":\"Most active S\\u0026P500 stocks in Wednesday's session\",\"id\":142886905,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Looking for the most active S\\u0026P500 stocks in today's session? Join us as we dive into the US markets on Wednesday and discover the stocks that are dominating the trading activity and setting the pace for the market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4a188658206b81a14d2781a8560ffb791badea88fc7af0c4f67ced56d4798879\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792000498,\"headline\":\"Netflix Is Cutting 6% of Staff Amid Slowing Growth, Stock Slump\",\"id\":142887481,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix is making the biggest cuts to its workforce in four years .\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6a108f63daefbe83a72696b99c6aa5a011c3e114b0f22841387eaeb758df01e4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791999938,\"headline\":\"Netflix Cuts 1,000 Employees\",\"id\":142886350,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The streamer says business is “strong and growing.” YouTube and Wall Street disagree.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77f656b7854ae32ce7a0d3efd469049081baa8774d855724fe45a17b38b05c08\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791997874,\"headline\":\"Netflix (NFLX) Plans To Cut About 6% Of Its Workforce\",\"id\":142886508,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\