X\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix (NFLX:NASDAQ) is cutting about 6% of its workforce, or roughly 1,000 jobs, its deepest reduction since 2022. The cuts announced on Wednesday, October 14 land mostly on product, technology, legal and HR teams, and they’re larger than the 5% Puck reported on October 9.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3d63185bd66a3c4066827e0361759095f6e740f0c646d325f85a6e0660d9a66f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791994147,\"headline\":\"Netflix Stock Sinks On Job Cuts, Subscriber Churn Data\",\"id\":142886505,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix stock fell as investors reacted to the company’s larger-than-expected job cuts and a report showing heavy subscriber churn in the U.S.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e051f5b94f61322385b7dcab8dcb1be49cf52dc7d0f6b66b8a24c18cefa766dd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791993762,\"headline\":\"Netflix to Lay Off Nearly 1,000 Employees Despite Global Expansion. Its Stock is Falling.\",\"id\":142886506,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The layoffs will primarily affect the company's product, technology, legal, and human resources departments.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f2ab44c455b80630a2d57440f32c2954327f6b0897d98a3664e1573d8166cd91\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791993748,\"headline\":\"Netflix is laying off 6% of its workforce, in biggest round of job cuts at streaming giant in years\",\"id\":142886507,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CHICAGO (AP) — Netflix plans to lay off about 6% of its workforce, amounting to nearly 1,000 positions, as the streaming giant makes wider “organizational changes.”Co-CEOs Greg Peters and T