ntially below their previous highs. Sirmium reported an average client […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=07718ff4d8c4764b73a986bf38f81591797e46341484c2a23fe250d1a0ffe9b3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791985898,\"headline\":\"Netflix cuts 1,000 jobs as streaming giant seeks to boost engagement\",\"id\":142885229,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Netflix is eliminating about 1,000 jobs, or 6% of its global workforce, as the streaming company reassesses staffing priorities while seeking new ways to keep subscribers engaged.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=451b80d645b00f228bff346cef03f8f1d8b0b34860e24c38df1a8f3c9335d052\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791985432,\"headline\":\"Netflix lays off 6% of staff in biggest job cuts since 2022\",\"id\":142882551,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Executive Editor Brian Sozzi discusses Netflix (NFLX) eliminating roughly 6% of its workforce in its largest round of job cuts since 2022 to rein in costs amid mounting competition and slowing top-line growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=952f4e55000b67c8c637b1fe323f70b7a57def06d00d1cedf38d7e82f8d4f1ca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791984911,\"headline\":\"10 Communication Services Stocks Whale Activity In Today’s Session\",\"id\":142916151,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/11/06/aggregated_options_1.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"This whale alert can help traders discover the next big trading opportunities.\\nWhales are entities with large sums of money and we track their transactions here at Benzinga on our options activity scanner.\\nTraders often\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6e9d2b6a3cbdcb8645a9ca27188f8e62a61b3f8c345da2e7edfc07976436e2c6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791981408,\"headline\":\"Skydance Falls 16% as Shares Begin Trading Without Warrant Entitlement; Netflix and Disney Tick Up\",\"id\":142882701,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Skydance stock cratered at the open, but the reason has nothing to do with bad news. A warrant distribution and an $78.9 billion debt load are competing to tell very different stories about where this newly combined media giant goes from here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c6aca207a20cc42b5d6d37dcd45c2ffff129af175bb993067a58178948c26a0a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791977460,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Lunch: Yields Surge On Hot Core CPI\",\"id\":142885014,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2295937803/image_2295937803.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Hotter core inflation sends Treasury yields climbing again. BofA slumps after disappointing Q3 profit. Netflix plans its biggest round of layoffs in four years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=303b98b281df7fc3239adae668eca5126dd9e11a9e5984924c212abbf30259bd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791972049,\"headline\":\"Netflix to Cut About 1,000 Jobs, Its Biggest Layoffs Since 2022, Ahead of Earnings\",\"id\":142883704,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Who-Gets-The-Netflix-Password-In-A-Divor.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Netflix is trending Wednesday after announcing plans to cut about 1,000 jobs, roughly 6% of its workforce, ahead of its Oct. 20 earnings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5a8bea32956efeabcd6a629c9506e68569f2b06da1e4d6eaa29bcd49e56b46c2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791971111,\"headline\":\"Netflix to lay off roughly 1,000 employees, or 6% of workforce \",\"id\":142886124,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108306019-1791986005855-108306019-1778624129986-gettyimages-2275885101-_75a3419_jgkilhym.jpg?v=1791986064\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Netflix will lay off roughly 6% of its workforce, according to a memo obtained by CNBC.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fa1457e7b00631c126b738b9ec8ee2d13feaf80629bda649751c402fe63ae04f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791968984,\"headline\":\"'Netflix Eliminates About 6% of Staff in Biggest Cuts Since 2022' - WSJ Exclusive\",\"id\":142883705,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.wsj.com/business/media/netflix-eliminates-about-6-of-staff-in-biggest-cuts-since-2022-0a2d8ec3?mod=hp_lead_pos2\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=df0f52e79830043394670c3c23f6224d4d608f6c5c823e1b5fbc9de3b9b8bfd5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791965505,\"headline\":\"Netflix (NFLX) Could Be 14% Undervalued As Content Reset Comes Into Focus\",\"id\":142876377,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix (NFLX) has reshaped its content buying bench by promoting Craig Ferguson to director of content acquisition in Los Angeles, following a year on the team and a long tenure cutting licensing deals across Hollywood. Netflix shares have slipped around 9% on a 30 day share price return and are down about 23% year to date, while the 1 year total shareholder return has dropped roughly 42% despite a near doubling over three years. This pattern reflects cooling near term enthusiasm even as...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=104843f64abdd1b0691260d7d4eaa393e29f6b7b9b4331f69cd800452e6cdfec\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791958695,\"headline\":\"NFLX Stock Dips Overnight: Netflix Faces Analyst Downgrade As Margin Concerns Persist Ahead Of Earnings\",\"id\":142871014,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix is facing slowing viewership, rising content costs, and growth concerns ahead of third-quarter earnings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e2ee6ce32d802bb35c7f43d7dc6bb450641c1cb17c02755a8408b3f2c65e20e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791953111,\"headline\":\"Forget Selling Netflix: NFLX Is the Streaming Stock I'm Buying More Of\",\"id\":142863878,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix shares have lost 42% in a year. Here's why I'm not selling a single share.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=36f347ff76d4bcb8454af1c32b6b396de98681dba3997905241a3412a4d9a04b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791941636,\"headline\":\"Here's Where Netflix and 3 Other Streaming and Media Stocks Could Be by 2030\",\"id\":142860877,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Here's what the streaming landscape holds over the coming years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f206449bf7a3db5b808b78b4f8d1b579d7fd85532ab46ed57233d33978bb6eca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791932580,\"headline\":\"Netflix faces unexpected challenge as streaming prices soar, customer interest shifts\",\"id\":142855372,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix is expanding its dramas and reality shows and adding classics, but changing viewing habits adds to the drama.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e686891764b873c621749cc7ecd71f64ff64d5367ccf524f166b822ec974b5c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791922497,\"headline\":\"Are You Overpaying For Disney Stock Versus Its Rivals?\",\"id\":142854516,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors are currently paying 21.9 times trailing twelve-month earnings for shares of Walt Disney (DIS). That valuation is the highest multiple in a group of four major media and entertainment companies: Disney, Netflix, Comcast, and Fox. Despite carrying the premium multiple, Disney ranks third among these peers in both sales growth and operating margin. So what does the same money buy at Disney's closest-priced rival.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=64f55401a4167d724360a4ab7cfc4019e0115c19d330f540b354c6a67149b074\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791920990,\"headline\":\"Can You Make Money Off Netflix Stock Now?\",\"id\":142854333,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix (NFLX) stock has dropped 12% since mid-September, retreating from a recent high of $80.32. When a familiar company discounts this quickly, investors often look for an entry point before the price rebounds. Yet this selloff has a reason behind it, and Netflix has navigated sharp declines before. So what pushed the stock down, and has buying Netflix after its sharp falls paid before.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0d0badd83ba3f3a760eb27dcfc404b41c82c4cd93009b793044fd870a4b7496a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791916502,\"headline\":\"Walt Disney vs. Netflix: Which Media Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142853509,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix commands a 24.3% net margin versus Disney's 13.1%, but Disney trades at a fraction of the valuation multiple, a classic growth-versus-value standoff.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aaae07d59e04b2d00933a1fd55c48b5d90ce1688a50e51d78ce343bda90df783\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791915388,\"headline\":\"Netflix Stock Downgraded To Sell Before Q3 Report\",\"id\":142853510,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street analysts continue to sour on Netflix stock ahead of the streaming video leader's third-quarter earnings report next week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d814450d27c99dceedf497be7facbfbcbde55fd0a438b551bc0b10f3d4ece73b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791913867,\"headline\":\"Netflix Stock Is Trending: What's Going On?\",\"id\":142853511,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix Inc (NASDAQ:NFLX) shares are trending Tuesday. The company secured exclusive rights to the 2030 FIFA World Cup in Spain and Andorra. Here’s what you should know. Netflix stock is trading at depressed levels. What’s ahead for NFLX stock? Netflix Wins Exclusive 2030 FIFA World Cup Rights in Spain and Andorra Netflix struck a major sports deal for the 2030 FIFA World Cup. The agreement gives the company live coverage of all 104 matches in Spain and Andorra. The 2030 edition marks the tourna\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5b0d6f82a13387a14b67f7fff58a2d5eafc1af36122ae358ce2ca6986b74191b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791912826,\"headline\":\"Netflix double downgraded at Huber Research amid engagement, pricing concerns\",\"id\":142852490,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Huber Research double-downgraded Netflix (NASDAQ: NFLX) to Underweight from Overweight on Tuesday, telling investors that the stock is now fairly valued. The firm cut its 12-month price target to $70 from $85.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e394e9c0350652c2d38b3bfe683d51392eb7c2d1984e0d777b594ab5c8e272f8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791904800,\"headline\":\"My Netflix Stock Prediction for 2027: Why I'm Not Selling a Single Share\",\"id\":142851033,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix stock has tumbled, but its underlying economics remain resilient.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ae94f749b9a7eb7f7328f6f0321c04ed0671d689d7f934bce64a510fa98c613c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791902345,\"headline\":\"What the Street wants to hear from the next Netflix earnings call\",\"id\":142851233,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi goes in on Netflix (NFLX) ahead of its earnings call on Oct. 20, with its stock down about 25% year over year, and the specifics Wall Street wants from the streaming company's executives .\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=392b9cfb0ec46a3da2e38df468fdb40143aa3578aecf2d49a9071b3d86d0c81c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791900670,\"headline\":\"October 2026s Top Cash Flow Stocks To Own\",\"id\":142851087,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The IMF has warned that the global economy could soon test its limits as high debt and energy costs strain government budgets. When public finances look stretched, investors often pay closer attention to companies that generate solid cash and trade at a discount to the cash they can produce. This article highlights three such stocks that screen as potentially undervalued based on their future cash flow profiles. The three stocks below are only a sample of what screens as potentially...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b3c49b407cb7fece04c834ac0d6ccc424a17358f3b5dc6d34114cb2ac636943a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791897107,\"headline\":\"Ben Affleck Says Holding AI Companies Accountable Is Simple. 'If You Have A Company That Hurts People, You're Liable For That'\",\"id\":142883707,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/13/Ben-Affleck-At-The-Amazon-Studios-World-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Oscar-winning actor, director and producer Ben Affleck has made a fortune from artificial intelligence, but that doesn’t mean he thinks tech companies should be allowed to develop increasingly powerful systems without\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c272d72f3d7f74c702290524657cdf1f20b56fbda522cd73a73dea45ca39ddbb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791896707,\"headline\":\"Netflix could stop its stock free-fall with these 4 actions: KeyBanc analyst\",\"id\":142848579,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Changes need to come to Netflix.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8a9b2d9219d87e528c9daf46c9f0a4c7ada85ef3ea59e30aaaa35cd79794b427\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791896415,\"headline\":\"Netflix (NFLX) Earnings Expected to Grow: What to Know Ahead of Next Week's Release\",\"id\":142851237,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix (NFLX) doesn't possess the right combination of the two key ingredients for a likely earnings beat in its upcoming report. Get prepared with the key expectations.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c065567a231d2bef290b9933701f777b974fe8737bff2d4a7bc94c04ffce2c64\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791894602,\"headline\":\"Netflix Is Set to Release Earnings on Oct. 20 - Will Its Free Cash Flow Hold Up?\",\"id\":142853512,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"All eyes will be on Netflix's free cash flow (FCF) generation when it reports earnings next week on Oct. 20. Last quarter, FCF dipped along with operating cash flow. Will this repeat?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1bd5c750685dac7b76444039be547de5821f817d41a9f44d57aaddf7b3b809bf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791889260,\"headline\":\"Cyclicals Lead Sectors In Tuesday Trading As Health Care Trails\",\"id\":142850826,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/13/Charts-Of-Financial-Instruments-With-Var.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Four sectors are higher and seven are lower in Tuesday’s regular session, with cyclical sectors holding two of the top three positions. Materials sits well clear of the lower group, separated by a margin several times wider than any other gap in the table.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b28ee841bb547fcc26557c569a6277ea410bc5cb494ceea2f398caae2601e85a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791889214,\"headline\":\"Google, Amazon and Apple Are in AI's Inner Circle. These 15 Domains Made the Cut\",\"id\":142882318,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/13/Creative-Ai-Background-With-Forex-Chart-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Semrush\\u0026#39;s 2026 AI Visibility Index identifies 15 domains consistently appearing across major AI platforms in the U.S. and U.K.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8a3d86ef7187f7c649ba5874d3026b79222567268ad1584f98c6bdf206b3ff65\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791880134,\"headline\":\"Keybanc Maintains Overweight on Netflix, Lowers Price Target to $85\",\"id\":142850701,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Keybanc  analyst Justin Patterson   maintains Netflix (NASDAQ:NFLX) with a Overweight and lowers the price target from $92 to $85.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c298e7ecb696e08cfe350ef621469af720f3845e12b6cb264f2e548d8780006f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791878584,\"headline\":\"1 Profitable Stock for Long-Term Investors and 2 Facing Headwinds\",\"id\":142839138,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Not all profitable companies are built to last - some rely on outdated models or unsustainable advantages. Just because a business is in the green today doesn’t mean it will thrive tomorrow.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e2b063bad7c2760edf3d0cff5c25e5fb5aaea8771033821f72e7746045b1a6db\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791876841,\"headline\":\"Netflix's Regions Abroad Are All Growing Faster Than Its Home Market. I Don't Think That Makes the Stock a Bargain.\",\"id\":142838625,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Growth in the streaming giant's home region slid from 18% to 10% over just two quarters. Can the rest of the world make up for that?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fba153bc5ff4d3807becabd139b45f070e49fe3eefd3026488cc18930232a0cb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791876606,\"headline\":\"Netflix Secures Exclusive Rights In Spain And Andorra To 2030 FIFA World Cup\",\"id\":142850702,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://about.netflix.com/en/news/netflix-secures-exclusive-rights-in-spain-and-andorra-to-\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e7b52df6da7b798a50f768a5c0bb53fb319cfa1c7288a490d976a9aa3da49c1a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791876538,\"headline\":\"Netflix, DocuSign And A Health Care Stock On CNBC’s ‘Final Trades’\",\"id\":142850010,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/13/Netflix-Logo-On-A-Building-Exterior-With.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"CNBC traders picked Netflix, AbbVie and DocuSign, citing analyst support, strong momentum, breakthrough designations and a 10% FCF yield.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3b7793eabc8c0371b36650af6d33e14320c4e81a5861a4c366f199ab36b3e34e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791863709,\"headline\":\"Hold Netflix Through Earnings, But Be Aware Of Upcoming November Tax Loss Selling Season\",\"id\":142838629,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1393651026/image_1393651026.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Netflix faces significant price declines, underperforming the S\\u0026P 500 and its peers year-to-date. Learn why NFLX stock is a hold.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=287207c2272d0fd1ee7a85a48f93665da25b78372c8ee8ac76c7b97c7a55eae6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791849654,\"headline\":\"Podcasts Are Becoming Living-Room Entertainment, and the Polished Studio Is Dying\",\"id\":142854518,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Podcasts aren't just for the commute anymore. Some have become something families watch together on the big screen, something that competes with Netflix for attention after dinner, and something that increasingly rewards creators who ditch the expensive studio in favor of a couch and a smartphone. The medium's evolution is reshaping how creators build audiences, how advertisers craft messages, and how platforms like YouTube think about the medium. Viewers watched more than 700 million hours of podcasts on living-room devices\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=699b2c5dd6f123890572e0ca71a3fbc31a2273ef94d76f5b8ed0871b60bb341a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791831463,\"headline\":\"What Could Netflix Stock Be Worth In Three Years?\",\"id\":142823619,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the past twelve months, Netflix (NFLX) stock has lost 40%, trailing the 17.0% return of the S\\u0026P 500. The shares now trade at 21.6 times earnings. That multiple sits well below what investors used to pay for them. Excluding readings above 100, the company's P/E averaged 39.7 at the last twelve quarter-ends. Yet the company's sales are still growing. So if Netflix keeps selling more, what would a share you buy today be worth three years from now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=35dbb6e5ea1790d14bcc8fe50eae814a50bc94068819bc4c1cb3bce02b7a6bbd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791822416,\"headline\":\"Skydance: The Next Netflix? Not So Fast\",\"id\":142824064,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2254004225/image_2254004225.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Skydance Corporation post-merger outlook: big IP, $6B synergy target and $10B+ FCF potential by 2030âyet execution risk is high. Click for this SKYD update.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0abf86f0f2c498ebe646a1abf0c6cf381a3f4a3864f16963c2d18a18009bf0e7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791819240,\"headline\":\"Skydance Shareholders Get Free Warrants Tuesday. Index Selling Could Hurt the Price.\",\"id\":142822742,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Skydance decided to issue the warrants to let public holders participate alongside the control investors and others who bought stock at $12 a share last week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cb5bc97432ad31a4da15b5f412e6b89e1d44081ff52439d5a9938e3541e5f63a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791811308,\"headline\":\"Final Trades: Netflix, AbbVie and Docusign\",\"id\":142852057,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108399173-17918250391791825037-48956096490-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1791825038\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"The Investment Committee gives you their top stocks to watch for the second half.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5cdcc57b88459383195882250c7b979168134becfc71ef3cf104c9671ec7e723\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791807360,\"headline\":\"Netflix layoffs loom as stock performance struggles, growth slows, and investors cool in 2026: reports\",\"id\":142851235,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The streaming giant, once known for its unstoppable subscriber growth, is reportedly planning what could be its biggest job cuts in four years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=af722367a1576b85e7f89a6ccdb53d886212fe632b850c5087cacecf72f058c8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791806403,\"headline\":\"Netflix, Inc. (NFLX) Is a Trending Stock: Facts to Know Before Betting on It\",\"id\":142819977,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Recently, Zacks.com users have been paying close attention to Netflix (NFLX). This makes it worthwhile to examine what the stock has in store.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=53384cfc6dce3a376e893c6bf00f2fd2407c5159d94fb25524d0b1414e28d2e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791803057,\"headline\":\"9 Of 11 Sectors Rise Monday As Cyclicals Lead\",\"id\":142848323,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/Charts-Of-Financial-Instruments-With-Var.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Nine of 11 sectors are higher in Monday’s regular session, with cyclical sectors holding two of the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with Energy, Communication Services and Financials setting a varied pace across the top of the table.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e1653d7aeda60f7ea34359a76d5b1d0fd246b68d4a28466a7e6e006123c1e812\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791796800,\"headline\":\"President Trump Just Dropped Over $1 Million Into 3 Tech Stocks -- Should You Buy Them Too?\",\"id\":142816233,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"President Trump's investment team was buying shares of Meta Platforms, Microsoft, and Netflix in August.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=23fad4fbd4fdc86d8c237921f08ebc057e053233f0048b4a0c937fe2dcc59522\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791796278,\"headline\":\"Netflix’s Q3 Guidance Calls for About 12% Revenue Growth. Here’s the Bar for Oct. 20\",\"id\":142821219,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/Los-Angeles---July-20--2025-Netflix-Sign.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Netflix is in focus Monday ahead of earnings, with ad performance, revenue growth, analyst activity and key technicals in the spotlight.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c901bd7bca2cb2f03edbabbb6f8aa520238a178dd25236bbf57eb2731c2ba21c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791774420,\"headline\":\"Why Goldman Sachs still backs Netflix despite falling viewership\",\"id\":142811114,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Goldman Sachs cut its price target but kept its Buy rating, pointing out a real growth engine for Netflix.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e189ff0ed9c29e2ccecc14d97825bae9818b41f820a344b5e0037ecc80d6495b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791768846,\"headline\":\"Disney: Skydance Is A Bullish Catalyst\",\"id\":142811865,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/458971009/image_458971009.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Disney's valuable IP portfolio, improving results, and streaming industry tailwinds create an attractive margin of safety. Check out the bullish thesis of DIS stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dc0ddd1b2a13c7571a099adc4b3495f5da5f24bbba6ebd983c2c0bacef741990\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791731402,\"headline\":\"What Is Netflix (NFLX) Signaling With Its New Content Acquisition Chief?\",\"id\":142806478,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix (NasdaqGS:NFLX) has appointed Craig Ferguson as director of content acquisition, effective early October 2026. Ferguson brings experience from senior content roles across major Hollywood studios, large tech platforms and digital distributors. His background includes leading content licensing and development teams focused on streaming, digital rights and multi platform distribution deals. Craig Ferguson's appointment to lead content acquisition is only one part of the Netflix story...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=96792aae40a9202995fbc998c8b6691f45eb248161f6edbd542801ddd4c51ceb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791721200,\"headline\":\"Paramount and Warner Bros. Discovery Are Now Skydance. Here's Why I'd Rather Own Netflix.\",\"id\":142805349,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The new massive media conglomerate has a lot to prove.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bba4676c5d7fa78e58d6a050ed1d3af363ce689f52f5cde561350c4da704f985\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791716402,\"headline\":\"Dear Netflix Stock Fans, Mark Your Calendars for October 20\",\"id\":142807117,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix’s third-quarter performance is likely to show a moderation in growth as the company faces challenging year-over-year comparisons.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a9c6f1d0007589f9606f5dff680625c529fe53c3d3e1e903abcd5e444c6e35f1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791696704,\"headline\":\"Netflix Plans 5% Workforce Reduction Starting Next Week\",\"id\":142805768,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Netflix StockPrice change for Netflix stock in last 6 months: -32%$NFLX Stock Price as of Oct. 9: $7052-Week High: $125$NFLX Stock Price Target: $93What Happened?Netflix (NFLX:NASDAQ) plans to cut about 5% of its workforce, Puck News reported Friday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9ff465cafaee35b539a5ccca2c974e9307cb6b4ed7c77c23bd4961008082df36\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791657720,\"headline\":\"Skydance Stock Is a Dicey Bet. 2 Better Plays.\",\"id\":142794215,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The newly merged company has high debt, aggressive financial targets, and integration challenges.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=203bd7ee4a0243d17842b4d1b0f7b2101024e589a0debdf892c625697e60a871\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791633900,\"headline\":\"Netflix Is Treading Water Around a 2-Year Low. Is It the Most Obvious Growth Stock to Buy in October?\",\"id\":142790335,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix is intriguing at these levels, but investors need to keep its challenges in mind.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=72c0e1b9abd6b1a75b4299050522513b429b9a50ca9d3d71da0578cfbceca3af\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791630000,\"headline\":\"MarketBeat Week in Review – 10/05 - 10/09\",\"id\":142804693,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A weekly roundup of MarketBeat analysis covering earnings, AI-driven stocks, insider trading, and analyst calls on Nike, Nvidia, Amazon, Apple, Tesla, Meta, and more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ee85d267fc41aa4007e7b70fa392249c3f250740282973465c48448d1e780777\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791586391,\"headline\":\"S\\u0026P 500, Nasdaq 100, Dow End Week Higher With Traders Eyeing Earnings Season — MSFT, NFLX, SPCX, ASTS In Focus\",\"id\":142767853,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street’s biggest banks, including JPMorgan, Morgan Stanley, and Wells Fargo, will report earnings next week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5c4e446abd334f8092f8ee0a0068885b5977f2f5175ab4b843013a4fece9ea30\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791582182,\"headline\":\"Netflix Is Reportedly Cutting 5% of Its Staff. Its 2022 Layoffs Came Days After the Stock Bottomed.\",\"id\":142767069,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The company's spending outside content is growing faster than its sales again. Does 2022 say anything about the stock?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=11baf85dd4aad7c871114ee37abf59d73de56d714ba83f79b2cced423615a6bc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791580341,\"headline\":\"Is Netflix’s (NFLX) 5% Job Cut a Margin Play or a Bet on New Growth Engines?\",\"id\":142767157,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Earlier this week, reports indicated that Netflix plans to cut about 5% of its roughly 16,000-strong global workforce, or around 800 jobs, marking its largest staff reduction since 2022 as it responds to a maturing streaming market and intense competition. The move highlights Netflix’s focus on protecting its targeted operating margins while it broadens into advertising, live programming and gaming to support future growth. We’ll now examine how this planned 5% workforce reduction could...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7faa1d11b24fe5b9491932770161f82d7f2e1cdc7c39478f3200eabdf2d80d82\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791578276,\"headline\":\"Netflix plans substantial layoffs, sources say\",\"id\":142767156,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix plans to lay off employees, according to sources familiar with the streaming company's plans. The cuts come after investors have expressed concerns over user engagement. The stock has declined 43% compared to a year ago.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ec4b5d19828fddb7dda9506d0de1cf448af9b03928a8aa720f4de87b30f1a581\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791572350,\"headline\":\"2 Nasdaq 100 Stocks to Own for Decades and 1 We Question\",\"id\":142766198,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Nasdaq 100 (^NDX) is home to some of the biggest success stories in tech and growth investing. However, certain stocks in the index face challenges like profitability concerns, rising costs, or shifts in market trends.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=65c0d216677029f69b39ae03fcade21b4a110468623573609c837a4e3752a28f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791569572,\"headline\":\"Netflix Is Reportedly Preparing to Lay Off 5% Of Workforce Amid Growth Slowdown\",\"id\":142766294,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix is reportedly preparing to reduce its global workforce by roughly 5% as it navigates decelerating revenue growth, subscriber engagement challenges, and an unsuccessful acquisition bid.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c3689b25c3409d07af7168059654b7d9dc95ceaedf694825c4106e12aba31909\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791554691,\"headline\":\"Netflix’s $2.8 Billion Windfall Complicates Its Cash-Flow Story\",\"id\":142764099,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix, Inc. (NASDAQ:NFLX) received a $2.8 billion termination fee in the first quarter of 2026. That cash was real, but investors should separate it from the streaming business’s capacity to finance content and generate recurring earnings. The distinction also matters when using trailing valuation multiples. The June-quarter filing records the fee in interest and other […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c2b0860975bc51f7cf5cd89410a04d04a6f63ad143416f3488ed9609fd735c72\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791554304,\"headline\":\"Netflix Layoffs Report: What 800 Job Cuts Mean With Margins Near 30%\",\"id\":142764009,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix (NFLX:NASDAQ) is planning to cut about 5% of its workforce, with an announcement possibly coming as early as next week, Reuters reported on Friday, citing Puck News. Netflix declined to comment, so these are reported plans, not confirmed layoffs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4c362e1372a683e2b2b165ffb054aa464933fcd1b87ac33db280f1c794d8be4e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791552603,\"headline\":\"Is Alphabet Stock Priced Right Against Its Peers?\",\"id\":142761484,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Measured against five other large companies: Microsoft, Amazon, Meta Platforms, Apple, and Netflix, Alphabet (GOOGL) looks like an anomaly. In a group of this caliber, investors typically expect the fastest-growing businesses to command the highest valuations. Yet Alphabet carries the lowest P/E of the six, even though its sales are growing second fastest. So how much less are you paying for Alphabet than for its peers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4142f7953cea56dfa30170f132a4b9ae58227495c68f8928e3a03f711b8df5b2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791551861,\"headline\":\"Netflix layoffs: company planning to cut 5% of workforce\",\"id\":142761654,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"An announcement could come as early as next week, according to Puck News, which cited people familiar with the matter\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=838d3dcc4bf7150f3997e7b89828eb060c5da88f2695ab2a0676bd71f8620db0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791544663,\"headline\":\"9 Of 11 Sectors Rise Friday As Real Estate Leads\",\"id\":142791219,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Technical-analysis.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Nine of 11 sectors are higher in Friday\\u0026#39;s regular session, with the top three split across defensive, growth and cyclical groups. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with no single gap clearly standing apart from the other breaks across the table.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8e49b5050ab59076c68ff77ba7cac7d3785b5016c63b1ee1049019718c167f81\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791544544,\"headline\":\"Netflix Keeps Frustrating Bullish Buyers Who Can’t See The Reality of Its Situation\",\"id\":142760600,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix bulls keep pointing to a cheap multiple and record buybacks, but the real question is whether those arguments can survive two more quarters of rising content costs and slipping viewer engagement.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7ee2185669dd75bb6c548d70d8a338847b4d890063530f68a8f00ba1ad0d3841\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791541163,\"headline\":\"Disney, Netflix, Visa And More: CNBC’s ‘Final Trades’\",\"id\":142762929,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Experts-Condemn-Tax-Data-Sharing.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"CNBC Final Trades featured IYJ, Disney, Visa and Netflix; analysts cited targets and earnings, while all four gained Thursday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0074ac03532b666efd01dbb07d3ebf17d6760181c35d79ebb2a0385a97ef0bb6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791531522,\"headline\":\"'Netflix Is Sharpening the Layoff Axe; Facing pressure over weakened engagement and a depressed stock price, the streamer is prepping for a round of layoffs in the near future, per sources' - Puck\",\"id\":142762490,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://puck.news/netflix-is-sharpening-the-layoff-axe/\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=519d35d3286bbaaecfddc4884c3e39767b9fb51c8d08903f0675548cff5adca0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791531000,\"headline\":\"Your Stock Picks, My Verdict: What I'd Buy Right Now\",\"id\":142759480,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1706263959/image_1706263