x's Newest Rival Has Nearly $70 Billion in Annual Sales. It Also Carries About $82 Billion of Debt.\",\"id\":142699376,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The merged Paramount and Warner Bros. now outsells the top streamer by around a third. Should shareholders worry?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=725dfc52798b356f363c9ba6442e0e13cf041311d88bfd9286a8fd98397fc182\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791389100,\"headline\":\"Disney Is Opening the Door to Netflix—and Changing the Streaming Playbook\",\"id\":142731060,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Disney (NYSE: DIS) licensed titles like \\\"Percy Jackson\\\" and \\\"Ice Age\\\" to Netflix (NASDAQ: NFLX) amid linear TV decline and heavy debt, highlighting Netflix's cash flow and margin advantages.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=56c15289cace688766f07c52a866b290bc3e6555ff420bca27f0b3de6cd9e6ca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791389005,\"headline\":\"Skydance Sinks 8% a Day After Completing Warner Bros. Discovery Acquisition; Netflix Holds Flat, Walt Disney Slips\",\"id\":142697656,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Skydance just closed the deal everyone was watching, and the market responded by punishing the buyer. Whether that selloff reflects a debt problem or a passing reaction depends on what happens next with the integration.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0144f82a2f8920f4da0025e7df514dbaa1078b977404ef04d8e324b0df3f02a4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791381300,\"headline\":\"Netflix Stock Plunges 26.8% Year to Date: 3 Key Reasons to Stay Away\",\"id\":142696952,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"rel