ets Ambitious Financial Targets. What It Must Overcome.\",\"id\":142666822,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Skydance faces a tough task achieving its goals against a tough media and entertainment industry backdrop. Wall Street is taking a wait-and-see approach.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b59e1f357dcd5d7ae8d4fd06a53883629ddee53cc6eecce9a730fb91e4170a4d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791298529,\"headline\":\"What Has Changed About Owning Amazon Stock?\",\"id\":142665414,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"If you own Amazon (AMZN) stock, you probably bought it for growth, and you may now wonder what that growth is costing. Management gave you a reason to ask on its July 30, 2026 earnings call, when it raised its spending plan for the year. So how different is the Amazon you own today from the one you bought.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c28c633e5f98953af20cd7c01013e9e4f0be1bf41967f67509f04c584469a1cd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791295920,\"headline\":\"Are Rising Live Sports Costs a Margin Threat to Netflix Stockholders?\",\"id\":142665425,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NFLX's rising live sports costs are testing margin expansion as rights spending outpaces amortization and sports deliver limited viewing hours.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e58c209b725dd586f0f1a2835f933f971653532237c3d81b6734e4032a3b40e5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791295838,\"headline\":\"How Much Upside Is Left In Google Stock?\",\"id\":142665393,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Alphabet (GOOGL) stock returned 41% over the past twelve months, against 17.1% for the S\\u0026P 500. After a run like that, you may assume most of the gain is behind you, but the business has sped up as the stock climbed. Revenue grew 24.2% in the latest quarter from a year earlier, up from 15.9% three quarters before. So what could three more years of owning Alphabet return.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7c0237b0cc5337182a4d4e307ae917a99a0eded0c4b5c6989b9384efb7db2fe4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791295440,\"headline\":\"3 Things Investors Need to Know Before Buying Skydance\",\"id\":142654813,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The newly formed media giant has an enviable IP catalog but it also faces a challenging streaming environment and other headwinds.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=866d0fa854f208d42683c5d46aee77d02afbaf3e18968c761c05fd9eab12a5b3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791292183,\"headline\":\"NFLX Price Predictions 2027: How Netflix Stock Could Hit $100 Next Year\",\"id\":142667747,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BMO Capital Markets expects Netflix to double over the next year, while Wells Fargo sees it dropping another 15%. While NFLX might not double next year, it has the potential to rise to $100 given its reasonable valuation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=75b54f30c1de1bff7c071d6fd8302655326a525ef547a5c2d713208af2ab0de7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791288240,\"headline\":\"Paramount-Warner Merger Closes: Why Disney and Netflix Are Better Stocks\",\"id\":142662999,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Paramount will have a lot of debt and is counting on aggressive cost-cutting to make the deal work.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=90d85eb0be79de7a046ec65626311df78ad3796a26f979c89c9bac223a67589b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791266400,\"headline\":\"Paramount Will Be Risky After Warner Deal; Disney, Netflix Look Like Better Bets\",\"id\":142650146,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Paramount will have a lot of debt and is counting on aggressive cost-cutting to make the deal work.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b95154b642883f1266e074b661545ee62103ae0dce3006bd990793c4c0f1e716\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791259260,\"headline\":\"Skydance Faces One Box Office Bust After Another\",\"id\":142666824,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the weekend, “Digger” earned an abysmal $8 million across 3,300 screens with a budget that reportedly ran close to $180 million.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=96b3d9813b6859c02f9eb99cfaf4201930f2dad87c4ecc3bf24de0d91884ed3c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791227731,\"headline\":\"If You Invested $100 In Netflix Stock 15 Years Ago, You Would Have This Much Today\",\"id\":142663607,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/07/10/valuestock_2.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Netflix (NASDAQ:NFLX) has outperformed the market over the past 15 years by 15.34% on an annualized basis producing an average annual return of 28.59%. Currently, Netflix has a market capitalization of $281.19 billion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4a04e0cc446a332d4feed03667139cc5e330316810aa04bd7dd4cbc01a6ddf29\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791224955,\"headline\":\"Congressman Who Loves Magnificent Seven Stocks Buys 3 Mag 7 Names in September\",\"id\":142662801,\"image\":\"https://