2636860,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Former White House Communications Director and SkyBridge Capital Founder Anthony Scaramucci sits down with Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi to unpack the pivotal political and economic missteps that brought America to its current breaking point.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d2431d6688839d25682d341819da0803807d82948ba816e821ffb73cbfebbf05\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791191700,\"headline\":\"2 Cash-Producing Stocks Worth Investigating and 1 That Underwhelm\",\"id\":142631667,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Generating cash is essential for any business, but not all cash-rich companies are great investments. Some produce plenty of cash but fail to allocate it effectively, leading to missed opportunities.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b2f1c5e379f392571fd3cb5938c18bf8c85506acef8ce97ec75366a793c02abd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791187648,\"headline\":\"Netflix’s Co-CEO Says Growth Is Too Slow. Here’s Why the Disney Deal Matters for the Stock\",\"id\":142631978,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Netflix StockCurrent Price: $67. 06Target Price (Mid): ~$135Street Target: ~$93Potential Total Return: ~101%Annualized IRR: ~18% / yearWhat Happened?“Overall, we’re not growing as fast as I want us to, and we’re working on making that move faster,” Netflix (NFLX:NASDAQ) co-CEO Ted Sarandos said at Bloomberg’s Screentime conference on Sept.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1eedfd9cc33bd757044539783b3b783f715da4a8c14be6424d14ee4ce967d64e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791183066,\"headline\":\"Meta And Alphabet Will Beat OpenAI And Anthropic\",\"id\":142633102,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2296815389/image_2296815389.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Meta and Alphabet offer structurally advantaged AI exposure vs. OpenAI/Anthropic, with cash flows, data, and an infra edge. Learn more about META and GOOG stocks here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dd57e1974d3811293fcde416d83a551972624f1a00a16ad6c647f9fbfa68b99a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791156900,\"headline\":\"Don't Sell Netflix: NFLX Is the One Streaming Pick I'd Add to Today\",\"id\":142626139,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix may be a market laggard lately, but that should not make you lose sight of the long-term opportunity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0b644f4ec01552679d9afde4858efb6e8b9c1404d1cae1ee41ec42c7b8932a31\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791141900,\"headline\":\"Is Netflix (NFLX) Stock a Buy?\",\"id\":142625154,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix has been a phenomenal performer over 20-plus years. But its growth is slowing.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=65535319e5c80c42efbbaaf91db99628448227a94ad098ca5f0e4466109642d6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791118115,\"headline\":\"Netflix’s Own Co-CEO Just Warned of Slowing Growth\",\"id\":142625200,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix shares were down following co-CEO Sarandos admitting slower growth and a rating cut from an analyst.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1b6149550bcaf47148e6748ac8c1ff416f0242b9b0ba836667f2a04701580a59\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791071882,\"headline\":\"YouTube's Lead Over Netflix in TV Viewing Keeps Growing. Is Netflix Stock a Sell?\",\"id\":142617812,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The streamer's share of TV time keeps slipping. Is its revenue next?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5af7b5ff62d7cb94bdd1c32fb032e10187d1d7391f3f1e75422498c6d260cf81\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791025200,\"headline\":\"MarketBeat Week in Review – 09/28 - 10/02\",\"id\":142622542,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Stocks rallied as a weak jobs report cut October rate-hike odds to 20%. MarketBeat analysts recap the week's top stories on CarMax, Netflix, Apple, Starbucks, Boeing, and more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6067384e01c9dba75b78ac0e7c68eb7a0e4ba602e99b8fbef786d6564eaea72c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791004259,\"headline\":\"Ben Affleck Pushes Back on AI Job-Loss Fears: ‘I Don’t Worry About Skynet’\",\"id\":142614109,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/03/Los-Angeles---Mar-27-Ben-Affleck-Arrives.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Ben Affleck says AI fears are overblown, arguing Hollywood can use technology to improve filmmaking without replacing workers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9e4cb276c420904b47a3f6f8f75d669a05f43d8bd5e452342f28fca7c9dba165\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790985232,\"headline\":\"Netflix Stock Lost Nearly 50% of Its Value in a Year. Will It Keep Falling?\",\"id\":142598727,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix stock tests its 2021 peak near $68 after Ted Sarandos admits growth is slowing ahead of October 20 earnings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=84453fc5f5410d94d3f199ca267c0084d0e952639bef95acc74335f8fa10d5fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790982720,\"headline\":\"Ignore the Netflix Funk\",\"id\":142595734,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"As of last Monday, Netflix shares were down 26% for the year.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=52cdbd2844e74211b68b1d89b0cb64601cff14f702a6f376fa80519b0410c131\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790966760,\"headline\":\"Disney Could be Making Big Changes to its TV Business. Why It’s Necessary.\",\"id\":142593647,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Disney is reportedly planning a restructuring of its TV operations to better align with the demands of streaming.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7001393c93e5264edc06b5603f6803521aba3ccfeff96914f8344217c6f8778d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790964301,\"headline\":\"These S\\u0026P500 stocks are the most active in today's session\",\"id\":142592139,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Explore the S\\u0026P500 index on Friday and find out which stocks are the most active in today's session. Stay updated with the stocks that are capturing market interest and driving market movements.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4f3a474aab8b20fad6b594cf065b688d4888cc556908714137d7bfa6cc6f9dcb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790956069,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy Netflix On The Dip?\",\"id\":142590826,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix (NASDAQ:NFLX) fell in September and co-CEO Ted Sarandos admitted growth is running slower than he wants. Viewership rose just 2% in the first half of 2026. For a company built on pulling people in, that is the number the stock is now trading on. Downgrades, Emmys Misses and a YouTube Problem The slide came […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f81ecacc6477ccf7b48ce8ed4f0adc1b0d7d3dacc12fe13e6e5ec2fc8cdf6ca6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790953080,\"headline\":\"Why You Should Think About Netflix Differently Now\",\"id\":142590682,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netflix (NFLX) describes itself to investors differently than it did two years ago. Live events and games were side initiatives in its pitch then; together with video podcasts, they now take a much larger place on its earnings calls. Netflix stock has lost 42% in the twelve months to September 30, 2026, while the S\\u0026P 500 rose 14.4%. You need to know which business you own when a stock falls that far. So what was Netflix's pitch to investors two years ago.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5684675f6adf12f850c12fe8bf4347016145f10a6dac9edcb30f429eaa39b707\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790951831,\"headline\":\"Can Pricier AI Chip Rentals Accelerate Amazon's AWS Revenue Growth?\",\"id\":142590688,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon is raising the prices it charges customers to rent AI chips through its cloud business. Management said in July that Amazon would lack the data center capacity to meet demand in 2026, and probably in 2027. Will the higher prices reach AWS revenue soon, when most of its AI capacity is already sold on multi-year contracts.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=29393ae152dbfc325167c1126f4ba2770b56a6df26c1dd6770d7b099fb3afdac\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790945087,\"headline\":\"Netflix Leans on Live TV as YouTube Competition Threatens Growth, Analysts Weigh In\",\"id\":142614110,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/02/Top-10-Netflix-Movies-To-Watch-This-Week.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"NFLX\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Netflix leans into live programming and ad-tier scaling to reverse engagement slumps and counter intense competition from YouTube ahead of Q3 earnings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=04607453d1f6a70904655b486c37e63cbff978b2599ab4ef967f721204abc619\"}]"
     },
