      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792385682,\"headline\":\"INTC, AMD, MU, SNDK: US Chip Stocks Rebound After Worst Week Since March\",\"id\":142992690,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chipmakers recover as investors brace for major earnings reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=39a3e45fe00cb49aa7b5fb6765d12adce7a0d00e6d079aa5a6ef77cfab9f604b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792356386,\"headline\":\"Intel vs. AMD: The CPU Comeback Has Become a 2-Stock Fight, But 1 Is the Better Buy\",\"id\":142992147,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The CPU market is heating up again, and one looks better positioned to turn rising demand into earnings growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1c5493f31d7a8440cb57020dd3d892c227f46315cab9124903f86b99cdf53f63\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792355403,\"headline\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor Could Partner With Elon Musk’s Terafab, but It Has 1 Condition\",\"id\":142992168,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"TSMC is in discussions with Musk's Terafab, but CEO C.C. Wei says one condition is firm: TSMC must run the fab. Here's what it means for TSM stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9b0f0ab6ce0bab2a08e010355a0d6bbb8af3d1b75f4b118960fe710dc79d41c6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792336329,\"headline\":\"Intel (INTC) Lands A Major Customer For Its 14A Foundry Process\",\"id\":142987441,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel (NasdaqGS: INTC) said Tesla has agreed to use its upcoming 14A manufacturing process as a foundry customer. The chipmaker reported progress on output from its 18A node, highlighting current production results for the advanced manufacturing technology. Intel announced a US$20b equity raise earmarked for new factory buildouts tied to its foundry expansion plans. The Tesla 14A deal, 18A progress and US$20b raise only capture part of what is changing for Intel today. We have also flagged 1...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bf38862e3ff00e62c969aa6be700ecb30acee5237891c13ab3b2baeec2ca5ea9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792263204,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer On Micron (MU) \\u0026 Intel (INTC): Nothing Is Working Despite Good Businesses \\u0026 Strong Quarters\",\"id\":142963207,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Semiconductor giants Intel Corporation (NASDAQ:INTC) and Micron Technology, Inc. (NASDAQ:MU)’s shares have ended the week as part of yet another historic bloodbath for the semiconductor sector. Both have lost roughly 12% over the past five days amidst a painful rout for the semiconductor industry that saw the close 9.9% lower during the same day. Cramer, […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=88136d4215634bd483ccf099695ebbd38de8fd8c117fd71b25c4a7dd9b84a634\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792257998,\"headline\":\"Intel Stock Fell Nearly 6% as TSMC Took Aim at Its Packaging Business. Here’s What It Means for Intel’s Margins\",\"id\":142962616,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Intel StockCurrent Price: $89. 85Target Price (Mid): ~$390Street Target: ~$118Potential Total Return: ~336%Annualized IRR: ~42% / yearWhat Happened?Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (TSM) CEO C.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ca2bf16f5b630348dcff0278e595af4431925ee990afbac5440c39d89b96268b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792235715,\"headline\":\"Nvidia’s CEO Says “All of This Is Going to Pass” After Tech Lost $1 Trillion in a Day\",\"id\":142959983,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech stocks shed over a trillion dollars in a single session while oil and Treasury yields climbed, yet Nvidia's CEO stood in Berlin projecting calm certainty about AI's future. Whether his confidence addresses the forces that actually triggered the selloff is the question every chip investor now faces.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1bfea888cc709b0e748fdc8e86dfb642734641995b777747e1d4bb25e0edade8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792235100,\"headline\":\"1 Reason Intel Stock Could Outperform in 2027\",\"id\":142959991,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel's surging data center business could power another strong year in 2027, and its valuation leaves room to run.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6d3eb98515db56d4fb455607cd7bafdd2fa74cc15aaa70875ee350015077ce43\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792206181,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy Qualcomm Stock For Its Cash?\",\"id\":142957831,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the last twelve months, Qualcomm (QCOM) generated free cash flow equal to 5.5% of its market value. That outpaces the 4.4% yield for the median S\\u0026P 500 company. A yield above the median can mean a business that is either on sale or expected to shrink. Qualcomm's revenue fell in each of its last two quarters. So is that cash the sign of a business on sale, or of one that is shrinking.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5d97d563f196004769529b8a8a462a6f30d90e791071af12927b2fe71d204873\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792197000,\"headline\":\"The AI Supercycle, Asia, And Why This Time Is Different\",\"id\":142958070,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2209095196/image_2209095196.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The AI race is about more than who builds the best model. Click here to read more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=38742d1d5916af83c5350ce68f0ddd46c425ebcdfad5d8e9debba1de9eaf54f6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792185520,\"headline\":\"The Moment Jensen Huang Realized Nvidia 'Won't Have to Die' Came After a Call From This CEO: 'For the Whole Time, 30 Years…'\",\"id\":142961094,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Jensen-Huang-Nvidias-Founder--President-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang reveals how repeated calls and a personal letter to TSMC founder Morris Chang forged a decades-long partnership.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1e10cf403c338f6294260d60b1a647984d82a7730fee804a746bc89a7908f5c7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792181842,\"headline\":\"How major US stock indexes fared Friday 10/16/2026\",\"id\":142950811,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Stocks closed lower on Wall Street as more drops for big tech companies weighed on the market.1% Friday, and the Nasdaq composite sank 2.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ce844532be2a52e7448ae4b0eb3262f136ec84181030dec2a0b9614d38173ce0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792181499,\"headline\":\"Intel, Lam Research, Amkor, and Kulicke and Soffa Shares Are Falling, What You Need To Know\",\"id\":142950836,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A number of stocks fell in the afternoon session after investors weighed escalating borrowing costs and Federal Reserve remarks emphasizing price stability over rate cut signals.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2f1060b0a9a66e1667b8fa3b6ae9dbc37418694a3bc7eea16dabdbd8dc837b73\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173641,\"headline\":\"Most Active Stocks by Volume on October 16, 2026\",\"id\":142959209,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Most active stocks by volume on October 16, 2026 included HODO, SXTC, ZTG, DKI, INTC, WFF, CCC, NVDA, CRWV and RUBI, with low-priced and large-cap tech names among the busiest.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=540e7b42b3571c93245f0a8e93a84b0f8942259fa009a5a2bdfb843b28477367\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170120,\"headline\":\"Should You Hold on to Cerebras Stock Despite Its 25% One-Month Dip?\",\"id\":142950060,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CBRS stock plunges 25.3% in a month, but surging AI demand, a $25.4 billion backlog, and capacity expansion support growth despite margin pressures.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9c7e51957523a532fc77b9cc6d20075dfda98ebfe723d534a813be40a42ccb48\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170092,\"headline\":\"Chip Stocks Continue Downward Streak, 'Pricing In A Crash'\",\"id\":142949121,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chip stocks continued their weeklong-plus decline on Friday, posting their longest losing streak in eight years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4f62aae326fdbaa73ae9154cd100c614d6c0d8d8504b00adaf692f864c5df78c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792163404,\"headline\":\"Will Intel (INTC) Beat Estimates Again in Its Next Earnings Report?\",\"id\":142949120,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel (INTC) has an impressive earnings surprise history and currently possesses the right combination of the two key ingredients for a likely beat in its next quarterly report.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=56654c063736dce0f354bbfd28dec9bf4380ad3a631220f5de70792bce6d6123\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792162800,\"headline\":\"Is the AI Bubble Cracking? Chip Stocks Fall for 8 Straight Days\",\"id\":142947979,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chip stocks fell 8 days straight as AI doubts and rate fears hit SOXX. See what drove it and the levels to watch next.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cea39c73d0b65eb7699b8a0e34f9757e5dca3e662b018533955cda92acf5b5af\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792162442,\"headline\":\"Intel and AMD Drop 3% as Rotation Out of AI Chip Stocks Continues; NVIDIA Holds Steady\",\"id\":142947885,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors are bailing on AI chip stocks, but not all of them equally, and the gap between winners and losers reveals something important about how Wall Street is rethinking the cost of building out artificial intelligence infrastructure.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=57f08d280b9c80838e49201efbb36200d116dc03b8f8ba2b2a82870f97a899f8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792162200,\"headline\":\"Palantir's Potential Next Catalyst After Retail Profit-Taking\",\"id\":142961960,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"While retail investors trimmed Palantir shares in August, analyst upgrades and low institutional ownership suggest Wall Street may be driving PLTR's next move ahead of Q3 earnings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=837723ea7741f1bf86599e26b2d52fd4f77a28bfaae243f1c84ee146446645b6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161946,\"headline\":\"The AI Supercycle Isn’t Slowing Down, and Nvidia’s Compute Moat Just Got Deeper.\",\"id\":142947886,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia shares dropped nearly 6% this week on AI funding fears, yet the company's own financing web stretches to hundreds of billions in commitments that even its CEO calls circular. Here is why that tension shapes every bet on the AI supercycle.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=51f03781c75f00d4d2e60a83dbb6048ffeffacbefc16a825836c6db5b090c383\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161017,\"headline\":\"BC-Most Active Stocks\",\"id\":142947992,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NEW YORK (AP) — prices for the Nasdaq composite, NYSE and NYSE American listed most active stocks. Nasdaq most active stocks:Stock Name Volume High Low Last Change  House Of Doge Inc.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0437c6da84cac75a9ce630aa4b2a9ca35ca47d7739dbd71679cb0292af8a0a89\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159670,\"headline\":\"How Much Upside Is Left In Micron Stock?\",\"id\":142947964,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Micron Technology (MU) returned 398.4% in the year to October 15, 2026. The S\\u0026P 500 returned 17.9% over the same period. Investors holding the stock after that run want to know if the easy money is gone. Those watching from the sidelines wonder if they are too late. So what could three more years of owning Micron still make you.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d766fca5ed92a73a9ef01760e567eb2a8558d2ffb1424423a50ca257159ea0a3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159202,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk Has ‘No Idea How to Make Microchips’ But He’s Confident Tesla Could Supercharge the Chip Design Process\",\"id\":142950838,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla’s ambitious Terafab project could give Elon Musk’s companies greater control over AI chips. Does that make Tesla stock attractive now?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=882d7d56ab859e63ac1307b08bc28670e2002e532494d47f49215811a357aa59\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792158579,\"headline\":\"Is AMD Stock Safer Or Riskier Than A Year Ago?\",\"id\":142947929,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors holding Advanced Micro Devices (AMD) stock have enjoyed a very good year: shares returned 157.8% over the past year, compared with a 17.9% gain for the S\\u0026P 500. A return of that magnitude prompts a closer look at the underlying business, and the company's financial report for the quarter ended June 27, 2026, provides the latest view into its accounts. Has the company taken on more risk to get there.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a52cbda5770ba2323bed9acd926856c76c47ba0cf8a9ad7743b86d650c90397e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155246,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Wall Street Swaps Chips for Old Reliables as Producer Prices Spike\",\"id\":142946644,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/THUMBNAILS_CHARTMILL_1000_528_22_59555aefc9.webp\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"The Dow rose 1.2% as money moved from chips into old-economy names. Producer prices posted their biggest jump since 2022, and Jensen Huang came to CoreWeave's defense.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ee8449899659de30d7c02cc76597c0fe59b287c7864490302adecf3c9fbd624a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154880,\"headline\":\"Why Nvidia Stock Can Defy the Broader Chip Sector Slump\",\"id\":142945454,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The AI chip leader was defying the ongoing sector slump early Friday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4a4f06e14c2d837bae88336a453658abaadc24af46c4955924390ba3ebc518ac\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154702,\"headline\":\"Intel Cratered Over The Last 90 Days: This Prominent Analyst Says It’s Going to Double\",\"id\":142945585,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel just lost a third of its value while rivals AMD and NVIDIA kept climbing, yet one prominent analyst sees a path that leaves the consensus in the dust. The bull case rests on a single unproven bet.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=76c477547848ffa679d6696d5d6b2f4dc2ce29713a6d7b9b6b763264357ea9e3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792152961,\"headline\":\"Got $1,000? 1 Top Stock to Buy Amid the Semiconductor Sell-Off Before It Triples by 2030\",\"id\":142945545,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Marvell Technology's long-term guidance suggests that the stock could become a multibagger.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7249b6071cef3f9995ef6f55031744c6b81d35260c36d9051baba993357f0edc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792152153,\"headline\":\"Cerebras Systems shares are trading higher following its IPO debut.\",\"id\":140305041,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=10aeab1ebbd088b227b6aa2413aa397f3afab471fc8810ac1cd13619555055a6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792150200,\"headline\":\"It's All About Interest Rates\",\"id\":142947821,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2175876380/image_2175876380.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Inflation concerns, elevated oil prices and uncertainty over the Iran conflict are driving interest rates higher. Higher rates raise the bar for investing in broad data center expansion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7cbbdda2668a72e3341de4ba6f7dab3c0da73b31f8719d004f1e635d4cdb57cb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792149303,\"headline\":\"Why AMD’s CUDA-Challenging AI Playbook Makes It the Ultimate Asymmetric Buy.\",\"id\":142944184,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AMD just absorbed a brutal sell-off and an $800 million export hit, yet its biggest customers keep signing billion-dollar commitments. Here is why the pain might be the point.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3c441d36f8645e0e3f02947bebfd5bffd7ca41a1169fd6d94bcf91da78d88be0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792144260,\"headline\":\"Why Nvidia Stock Is Rising While the Broader Chip Sector Keeps Falling\",\"id\":142940502,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The AI chip leader was defying the ongoing sector slump early Friday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=10cfc4497529722d01337ad8737b428adc2f1ce1226d4b39b72c12591433892a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792141409,\"headline\":\"NVDA Bucks Selloff As MU, INTC, AMD Slide Premarket Amid Chip Rout\",\"id\":142939191,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI infrastructure demand remains in focus as investors reassess chip valuations.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=85dcc4a699c9c7fb15a18938090c05f00eec0deba13a2b3b4ce83f5b0684a6d3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792130897,\"headline\":\"Stocks rebound after tech sell-off and Indonesia shares sink on market downgrade warning\",\"id\":142932797,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"HONG KONG (AP) — Asian shares mostly advanced on Friday, a day after a tech sell-off dragged stocks lower, while Indonesia’s stock market plunged following a downgrade warning.Index provider MSCI warned it would downgrade Indonesia from its “emerging market” status, triggering growing concerns of a capital flight.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c20a4309eacd4030341ea62f4cd027990914378d3461294c76dc167a23ec2f1c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792128915,\"headline\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor Holds the Cards As NVIDIA, Apple and AMD Battle for Limited AI Chip Capacity\",\"id\":142945150,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/TSMC.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor (TSMC) capacity battles heat up as NVIDIA, Apple, and AMD scramble for AI chips. Q3 revenue reaches $46.7 billion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=159a7a3f28742526243f576da475d8bb2e471f146975f56460dc76f83cc0dd7b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792116818,\"headline\":\"SOXX Extends Selloff After 8-Day Decline, KOSPI Rebounds: Jim Cramer Calls SK Hynix ‘Epicenter Of Fear’\",\"id\":142928546,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"South Korea’s KOSPI rebounded on Friday, giving investors some respite.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ad55ce4c5f197c90a742