rowing data-center demand. For investors who missed the initial rally, the lower price can look like a second chance. Should you take it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cd357f699bba8f3af8a7829fa988e11aa1a5a242af45f948d6d975e9d0ad31df\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792087504,\"headline\":\"Stay informed about the most active stocks in the S\\u0026P500 index on Thursday's session.\",\"id\":142920841,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Explore the S\\u0026P500 index on Thursday and find out which stocks are the most active in today's session. Stay updated with the stocks that are capturing market interest.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dd86a0c2e65b0e975dd45ee39418b1734f57cb7dac809bde94735e179281157c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792087200,\"headline\":\"Which stocks are most active on Thursday?\",\"id\":142920840,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Discover the most active stocks in Thursday's session. Stay informed about the stocks that are generating the most trading volume!\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c9939ea66ca5deeb21671000072f6abc39b5e3c15aaab59347db8d3aff4bf394\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792085787,\"headline\":\"FormFactor, Teradyne, Applied Materials, AMD, and Intel Shares Plummet, What You Need To Know\",\"id\":142920352,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A number of stocks fell in the morning session after hotter-than-expected inflation data compounded fears that elevated borrowing costs will curb artificial intelligence infrastructure spending.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6cc178efc4c11fa0f16b6115ba0fcae460e042ec5b5ad7607f5abb0cfee00528\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792081834,\"headline\":\"The Real AMD Catalyst Investors Are Sleeping On Isn’t What You Think\",\"id\":142920333,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Everyone is watching AMD's GPU ramp, but a quieter force inside the data center may be the one that actually drives the stock through 2027. Here is why most investors have their eyes on the wrong product line.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2bc79d7392b75c577716d8fabce0cb52de56c6f534efd2787c189ff04d371ae0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792077551,\"headline\":\"TSMC CEO Hints Company Could Back Up Customers If Intel’s Advanced Packaging Ramp-Up Falls Short\",\"id\":142919282,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"During TSMC’s earnings call, CEO C.C. Wei said TSMC’s advanced assembly and packaging technologies remain “very, very competitive.”\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d8769948bf75b9817a259e0dd09c5e1abdb2520858ec8c6492318b769b1b7595\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792076039,\"headline\":\"Intel Shares Rise Over 3% After Key Trading Signal\",\"id\":142947574,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/image.png?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"A key trading signal flashed for Intel shares at a price of $91.75, after which INTC more than 3% to an intraday high.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=205e63272027b46b5f6a53767ac99867e5a09ba09b592681900b4e323fa53bc5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792072920,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave, TSMC, FMC, Rocket Lab, Schwab, and More Stocks That Explain Today’s Market\",\"id\":142919166,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave shares fall as concerns mounted about the company’s debt.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=769e52d4408cc6b96549f5b78c400db895ad911a2dc3324c4a3507cf0d7a72f3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792071757,\"headline\":\"Nvidia stock trims losses as chip sell-off eases amid AI financing concerns\",\"id\":142922259,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia and other big chip stocks pared losses as AI jitters eased on Thursday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fdcdebe2a7c43f733b358f82400ce57c3f253b002b237da2dc70fe0dfcc5d7f1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792071757,\"headline\":\"Nvidia stock falls amid concerns over AI financing\",\"id\":142919245,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia and other big chip names fell as sentiment over the AI trade soured.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9e94c32856b6d32c62bafa4c58e24268c3090e303695c7a70d8c264a60147b6a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792071757,\"headline\":\"Nvidia stock sinks amid concerns over AI financing\",\"id\":142916209,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia and other big chip names fell as sentiment over the AI trade soured.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d5be29c761ac0bcb296d825f58282366bc77da18b2bd25aa281ae44156417351\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792071756,\"headline\":\"The Case For NVIDIA Stock Rests On One Thing\",\"id\":142919214,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NVIDIA (NVDA) has translated demand for its AI platform into rapid sales growth. NVIDIA can only sell the hardware its partners build, leaving the open risk for shareholders with component manufacturers. The company has yet to prove these suppliers can keep pace with customer appetite. This issue matters today because NVIDIA has guided to another round of higher sales for the quarter it reports next.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2d342578d6183d046286db0556c5a7d54e388b5289b536326ace31f7022cbb98\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792071092,\"headline\":\"Is There A Risk Hiding In AMD Stock's Big Run?\",\"id\":142916222,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"For investors holding Advanced Micro Devices (AMD), the pressing concern is how much of each sale actually translates into profit. AMD's operating margin, the share of sales left after all running costs, stood at 17.3% in the quarter to June 2026. Shareholders currently pay 22.6 times sales for AMD stock, compared with 3.1 times for the S\\u0026P 500. At that valuation, the margin matters immensely. So has that margin been climbing steadily.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b5432c12af84db0d530927a8e2f13a7b844fd1e4866db9d14d3bf7eca0617a78\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792070550,\"headline\":\"AI Trade Takes Another Hit Thursday as Tech Sell-Off Continues\",\"id\":142919213,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Memory chip and data storage stocks fell Thursday, extending the sector’s recent losses.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=74a9647275ff483ba6e9f2e9b7d36fcd4b49b3d68f963dfc192737ab1c4e0fcb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792069727,\"headline\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor Falls 3% Despite Record Quarterly Profit; Intel Drops 4%, AMD Slides 3%\",\"id\":142914998,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (NYSE:TSM) stock trades at $418.90, down 3% even after the chipmaker posted a sixth consecutive quarter of record profit. A record report from the world’s largest dedicated semiconductor foundry isn’t stopping the selling, and the weakness is spreading across chip names. Meanwhile, Intel (NASDAQ:INTC) stock is at $94.33, down 4% and sliding […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4cd73645d6f56b4d48529c06bdfaa6645dfa79677c6dc211dcc1765065b2c7df\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792069021,\"headline\":\"Intel vs. Qualcomm: Which Tech Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142916361,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel's foundry turnaround has resulted in heavy losses and negative free cash flow, while Qualcomm generates robust cash with half the valuation multiple.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3e0712e49701ffb6f6e4f65116bcb2cf5e2d0bdf86c39da13bf571fd5eafa440\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792068840,\"headline\":\"TXN to Report Q3 Earnings: Should You Buy, Hold or Sell the Stock?\",\"id\":142919286,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Texas Instruments gears up for Q3 earnings, with strong analog and embedded chip demand fueling growth, while geopolitical tensions pose risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=60d04dce03752a3a08df1b616575ce30cf879ea88c9f856a2f5b73ea17691a6c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792066481,\"headline\":\"Premarket movers: CoreWeave tumbles; Penske Automotive surges\",\"id\":142913889,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com - Global semiconductor stocks fell sharply on Thursday, extending the previous session’s selloff after fresh U.S. inflation data fueled concerns that the Federal Reserve could raise interest rates further. AI-linked stocks remained under pressure as investors reassessed the sustainability of data center spending and the growing role of debt in financing the industry’s expansion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ac38e590f869fab33b168f93f7f3e6b440fd66d938849b10e7e207e09266aa5b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792065600,\"headline\":\"Netlist Introduces Next-Generation LIGHTNING™ ULL DDR5 RDIMMs for Agentic AI\",\"id\":142914577,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netlist, Inc. (OTCQB: NLST), a leading innovator in advanced memory and storage solutions, today announced the expansion of its LIGHTNING Ultra-Low Latency (ULL) DDR5 RDIMM family for Agentic AI workstations and servers. Built on Netlist's proven ULL architecture, the next-generation DDR5-6000 and DDR5-6400 products are designed to improve responsiveness in memory-sensitive AI and enterprise workloads that continuously access memory-resident data.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=38d9d8cd397edf7edf857735fd9a798fc7fc0474f3db813920738a7df89fa767\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792064709,\"headline\":\"OpenAI, Anthropic’s AI Lead Is ‘Very Perishable,’ IMD Professor Says: ‘You Don’t Need to Drive a Ferrari to Go to Walmart’\",\"id\":142945247,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Ferrari.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"IMD professor Howard Yu says many businesses may not need frontier AI models, making OpenAI and Anthropic’s lead easier to erode.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ca0379c9d653e508b0be56d16ac139f31ae3b6b7c0541c3109b0a80a93bef8cc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792064093,\"headline\":\"QUICK SPARK: Meet the 15 Worst-Performing Chip Stocks in the Last 7 Sessions\",\"id\":142945173,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Benzinga-Quick-Spark.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The worst 15 chip stocks in the last 7 sessions, led by SK Hynix and Arm, as the iShares Semiconductor ETF (SOXX) logs a rare seven-day losing streak.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5ddcd5356551b6ba4f6316963514d404a144133b6885b539b879d82e7cb11050\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062741,\"headline\":\"AMD: TSMC Just Fired A $175 Billion Warning Shot\",\"id\":142918991,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2279241831/image_2279241831.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.'s pullback may be a buy: agentic AI boosts EPYC/Instinct demand, TSMC N2 ramp improves supply and margins. Click for this AMD update.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4c743e8cb264e7e7dc95edeac1c35100c01a67a4fa22d85149ac6a9747e8d3c2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062074,\"headline\":\"Applied Optoelectronics Stock Fell 12% on Hot Inflation. Opportunity or Falling Knife?\",\"id\":142912822,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Takeaways for Applied OptoelectronicsFunding Scare: Applied Optoelectronics stock fell 11. 82% to $86.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3f6b6dff5d59677c587ac63b11415be955e4b7cd26dc4a9781d796b849309b20\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792061182,\"headline\":\"Global tech selloff deepens as enthusiasm for AI stocks wobbles\",\"id\":142912130,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Global technology stocks sold off sharply Thursday, as a growing list of worries, including rising borrowing costs and tougher competition from China, caused traders to sour on AI investments.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8d0293504851f4976d0f18b1d72e37b3325ef610336d1d93015ed23f57860734\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792060788,\"headline\":\"Penguin Solutions shares are trading higher after the company reported better-than-expected Q2 financial results and raised its FY26 guidance. Also, Needham maintained its Buy rating on the stock and raised its price target from $25 to $27.\",\"id\":139960332,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9d9c822bcb1834c9b38e026f50f9e56f536ff484a94ca974826ab31a4e35d4c6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792060560,\"headline\":\"Intel, Marvell, CoreWeave, TSMC, Apple, and More Stocks That Explain Today’s Market\",\"id\":142912368,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI stocks tumble as a hot inflation reading and Anthropic’s slowing revenue growth extend the tech selloff.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=71cfe2135e8ab4e784459e25cfcf142b2d658af8c100a0915bf9f50a609c4f05\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792059540,\"headline\":\"Nvidia, Apple, Broadcom in 'fierce' battle to get chip manufacturing space at TSMC\",\"id\":142919949,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108411127-1792020231674-TSMC_Katie.jpg?v=1792020295\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Soaring AI demand is constraining capacity at Taiwan Semiconductor, threatening to slow the AI buildout. Tech giants Nvidia, Apple, AMD and Broadcom are locked in an \\\"extremely fierce\\\" battle for space on TSMC factory lines. That's made the one man in charge of TSMC wafer allocation \\\"the most popular person on the planet” and created a rich opportunity for Intel, as customers look to the foundry arm of the U.S. chip manufacturer for an alternate source. CNBC visited a TSMC event to learn more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a515f3ccbb74dc13bedde904e79843ec262d0e66440a17247819619c3ffa2bb9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792057212,\"headline\":\"FTC Spokesman Says President Trump Task Force On AI To Meet Thursday\",\"id\":142915717,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"- Reuters \",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1c1346f1f73cfa3923d8f59764d8b65d2f5eef29a8ddf71fa03cec63c978e8cb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792054020,\"headline\":\"TSMC Stock Falls After Blowout Earnings. Musk Talks Could Offset AI Chip Fears.\",\"id\":142908332,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing reported booming profit but the real intrigue comes in its talks with Elon Musk over his Terafab project.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d53d5bee90a1f93e10d6e0a3e5819816bb2dc28deb02a241b4c68571074fe1d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792053731,\"headline\":\"Capital Over Chips: Broadcom CEO Warns Financing Costs Could Slow AI Expansion\",\"id\":142915733,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Broadcom-Irvine-Campus-Interior-Hallway-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Broadcom stock falls as CEO Hock Tan warns that capital access and rising interest rates could limit AI growth more than semiconductor supply bottlenecks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=425f0e04ab9837ccd6d21749fcb1901e5f32e04b04fa9f66e656ef756c3586ac\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792052562,\"headline\":\"Global chipmakers sink as inflation data fuels rate-hike fears, AI rout\",\"id\":142908107,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\"