aking Wall Street fret an October rate hike could be on its way.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d4a8b78df9371f14af0b97179b374fa85c504a67f77d237ec823b21afd456440\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792017578,\"headline\":\"SK Hynix Stock Plunges 11% in Seoul, Slips After Hours in New York as Hot CPI, Fed Hike Bets and AI Funding Worries Weigh\",\"id\":142915737,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Paris--France---May-14--2026-The-Sk-Hyni.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"SK Hynix tumbled more than 11% in Seoul Thursday, deepening a global chip selloff tied to hot U.S. CPI, Fed hike bets and AI funding doubts.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a61a0c82ef52f26de8598f7ee16e94ab301e9b9efc9d05144a6f2407694650b2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792010550,\"headline\":\"Nvidia, AMD, Dell sell-off in global tech rout on AI funding worries\",\"id\":142919952,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108200103-1758128892343-gettyimages-2235931727-mms22238_h8d8ldva.jpeg?v=1759781045\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"A sell-off in global technology hardware stocks deepened Thursday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5893aaa1676e0692a92028e7e602a49606d4e720d3ac026f78c7186d78925386\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792010444,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave, Intel, Micron, \\u0026 other tech stocks are plummeting. Here's why.\",\"id\":142888370,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Baird tech strategist, Ted Mortonson, sits down with Yahoo Finance Senior Reporter Brooke DiPalma to explain what's going on in the markets with tech names like CoreWeave (CRWV), ASML (ASML), Micron (MU), and Intel (INTC).\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9a972fc3dfa397990af772db13828e08a255962c3dcea4be101de858b338f981\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792007981,\"headline\":\"Can Marvell Stock Drop From Here?\",\"id\":142888357,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the past twelve months, Marvell Technology (MRVL) stock has returned 216%, easily outpacing a roughly 18% return for the S\\u0026P 500. On October 6, management set a fiscal 2031 revenue target of $70 billion to $90 billion, and the shares closed up about 6% that day. Yet that target remains a forecast rather than a result. Today's buyers carry the risk if Marvell falls short. So what are you paying for Marvell's growth today.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d375696a458186d7e68421673a7de0988cde2108a608d9d99e62f21bef4dd037\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792007521,\"headline\":\"Is Micron Still The Business You Bought?\",\"id\":142888373,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors who own Micron Technology (MU) likely bought into a memory chip maker whose sales and profits rise and fall with the broader chip cycle. The company released its fiscal Q4 2026 report on September 30, 2026, completing a full year of new results that provide enough data to test this long-held thesis. So, is the company you hold still that chip maker.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0f48c2f78de55fa64f266f59656d1840e54928178f731ec4b37281fbe15aad43\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792006779,\"headline\":\"GlobalFoundries to open 2 new chip plants in New York with $21 billion in financing from Japan\",\"id\":142887447,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"(AP) — Computer chip company GlobalFoundries Inc. said Wednesday it plans to open two factories in Malta, New York, financed by an investment of up to $21 billion from Japan.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5287957cda859a9c71b745efdac87885508b374cdde920a04022f818c01c7b7e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792002772,\"headline\":\"Why Intel Stock Hit the Skids on Wednesday\",\"id\":142887379,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"An explosion at the chipmaker's facility in Israel gave investors pause.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=97ecc7585f00446c30cb687f5baeb01beda437215cc5c939229d9edca11de5ff\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792001544,\"headline\":\"Is Intel's Record Sales Growth Still Improving?\",\"id\":142887427,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel Corporation (INTC) sold 25.4% more in the three months to June than it did in the same quarter a year earlier. The chipmaker has not grown faster in any quarter of the last ten years. To judge that record properly requires looking at what is normal for the company. So take a guess: in a typical quarter, how much more does Intel sell than a year earlier.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2fe070f8faf7b04f250dae80895a0259c59b791d08b50392f11d51d6f71e4a58\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792001102,\"headline\":\"Most active S\\u0026P500 stocks in Wednesday's session\",\"id\":142886905,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Looking for the most active S\\u0026P500 stocks in today's session? Join us as we dive into the US markets on Wednesday and discover the stocks that are dominating the trading activity and setting the pace for the market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4a188658206b81a14d2781a8560ffb791badea88fc7af0c4f67ced56d4798879\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792000800,\"headline\":\"TSM Earnings Tomorrow: Can Strong AI Demand Boost Q3 Results?\",\"id\":142887411,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"TSMC heads into Q3 earnings with surging AI demand and advanced chip growth. Can strong sales offset margin pressures and high capital spending?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=58628f64fcde2bbc075557a107d63d015efd2f40174ce566d161c785ce5e5298\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791999805,\"headline\":\"SOXX Heads For 7th Straight Losing Session As Inflation, AI Spending Fears Deepen — Chip Stocks Face $1 Trillion Wipeout\",\"id\":142886364,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UBS described the decline as ‘more of a recalibration of expectations than a fundamental break in the AI investment story’ and said earnings season should matter more for chip sentiment than competition and financing concerns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1402301955c8c5fe793cd9673d129f71e1fb6f4960aa15fa1b748fb75ddaa480\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791998220,\"headline\":\"Intel CEO says ‘good enough’ Chinese models are winning on price\",\"id\":142886460,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Lip-Bu Tan’s remarks point to cheaper AI spreading across more servers, a shift that could lift demand for Intel’s own processors.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=309804b43f36531e69d4c331a238aa92d16422b8feb89aef1498fa84bb0f2acb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791997380,\"headline\":\"3 Reasons to Buy Intel Stock Before 2027\",\"id\":142886360,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":