at outpaces capacity through mid-2027.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=405e0bf2467d0f5c8354ba12268c0e6364e75009e3569490781e86560ef649fd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791989152,\"headline\":\"Qualcomm Vs. Intel: The Market is Refuting Both AI Rebrand Attempts\",\"id\":142885091,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel and Qualcomm both showed up to earnings with a fresh AI identity, but investors have been voting with their feet ever since. One company is already cashing AI checks while the other is asking you to fund a roadmap that has yet to book its first dollar.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4d2b4c06379e3ead5f76623ada846e19b84e347076c89ef1ce3dc79a77342f8b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791988789,\"headline\":\"Why Is AMD Stock Falling on Wednesday?\",\"id\":142915738,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Jakarta-May-02-2024-Advanced-Micro-Devic.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"A hotter September inflation report, AI financing concerns and an OpenAI revenue reset are weighing on tech stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a8ff7771ed09776627b6553aae14b98a62b09e9de2a71e496e12c7c935e87d00\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791985020,\"headline\":\"Advanced Micro Devices Stock Surges 183% YTD: Time to Hold or Exit?\",\"id\":142885118,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AMD stock surges 182.8% YTD, fueled by AI demand, data center growth, and strategic partnerships. Yet premium valuation and supply constraints raise concerns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=884e5768a7ca52db241134ed633a61e8c30c3ae20c4bc1f738be22d772ec6daa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791984911,\"headline\":\"10 Informatio