 Buyers appear unsure that profits made during a memory shortage will last, and the company has been working on exactly that problem. So what is Micron doing to make those profits last.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c7dd6f08d6d026874fc81826252e7aa9b277727048eb00a7affc82507f0fa670\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791918261,\"headline\":\"Trump Says US Still Sharing Intelligence With Ukraine\",\"id\":142853462,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Kelly Grieco, a senior fellow at global research firm the Stimson Center, said a ceasefire on attacking energy infrastructure between Russia and Ukraine benefits the Russians more as the country is able to sell oil to fund the war. Grieco said that even if Ukraine is not able to hit Russian energy infrastructure there are still ways to inflict damage including hitting at travel hubs like airports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8a7117dfbc22c7769f68cb8ee8440f2bcd43ef48241ac99d8ab4ee9e79204422\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791915581,\"headline\":\"INTC Stock: What to Watch Before Earnings on October 22\",\"id\":142858978,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel’s Oct. 22 earnings will hinge on whether improving chip supply drives stronger fourth-quarter growth and whether its foundry business can attract major external customers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e8a64abeba6e0dced6ff79a0bb0ef91dadc5e574fcbca4dab282a3778851ce52\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791914703,\"headline\":\"What's going on in today's session: S\\u0026P500 most active stocks\",\"id\":142852829,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Explore the S\\u0026P500 index on Tuesday and find out which stocks are the most active in today's session. Stay updated with the stocks that are capturing market interest and driving market movements.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cf4b193290ba2707875c570cb7a6fa40447e3a4c1a0e281b98a05971f3058df9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791914400,\"headline\":\"MSI Showcases Open Data Center and AI Infrastructure at 2026 OCP Global Summit\",\"id\":142853433,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"MSI showcases its open data center and AI infrastructure at the 2026 OCP Global Summit (Booth #A49), led by new 21-inch ORv3 systems and DC-MHS modular building blocks, alongside NVIDIA MGX rack and GPU server platforms and the XpertStation WS300 desktop AI supercomputer on NVIDIA DGX Station architecture. The ORv3 systems address higher-density air- and liquid-cooled deployments, while the DC-MHS HPM portfolio extends modular platform options across AMD and Intel architectures. NVIDIA MGX rack\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=20823944e69e23d44b550c658735baaddd853aab078f7df638aca80ea069757b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791914400,\"headline\":\"Which stocks are most active on Tuesday?\",\"id\":142852828,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"These stocks are making the most noise in today's session. Stay tuned for the latest updates!\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a17ad523b84dd67056cf3f54c8b26ba43420d2dffa3a07b672a313f3a42b6b65\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791910560,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk Says ‘No Crying in the Casino’ After Broadcom CEO Warns AI Frenzy Is Getting Out of Hand\",\"id\":142853397,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summ