c6859823a65899ac9e27df1cdde163b1ca47fa9a18581f0ab569a6f1f2d8fc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791898440,\"headline\":\"Can Intel's New GPU and Xeon Technologies Enhance its AI Capabilities?\",\"id\":142851139,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"INTC is advancing its AI infrastructure with Xeon systems exceeding 46,000 cores per rack, powerful Crescent Island GPUs and open software to scale agentic AI workloads.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a76fdad4066ecc592f9447896955732858e10d46f16db179ed8d6996c28f4d05\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791898148,\"headline\":\"Chip stocks falling after sell-off in Korea's KOSPI\",\"id\":142848599,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"South Korea's KOSPI index (^KS11) experienced a sell-off sparked by a new chip rout, which then fed into US markets. The 8:30 Hosts Julie Hyman, Jake Conley, and Pras Subramanian take a closer look at how US chip stocks are reacting.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4bd8e7af1aff4e070aae648a4eb8954d3b62a590a0d4225bac1cc5db4233a276\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791897360,\"headline\":\"Intel vs. Sanmina: Which AI Infrastructure Stock is a Better Buy Now?\",\"id\":142851140,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"INTC and SANM are expanding their AI infrastructure presence, but differences in stock performance, growth prospects and valuation make one a better pick.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=af052e75f66113d009c12f2bf2fcb24ddc3a5f65ba67376d594ba82ac5f9ec48\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791896400,\"headline\":\"XCENA Names Steve Fingerhut as Chief Business Officer to Lead Commercialization of MX1 Computational Memory\",\"id\":1