CEO Just Compared AI Investors to Gamblers\",\"id\":142848597,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Broadcom's CEO stood before a room of investors and called them casino gamblers, then turned around and raised his own AI revenue guidance. The contradiction points to three separate warnings buried in one panel appearance, and the most dangerous one has nothing to do with chips.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=15367cbb651b066703d00d44875125b1b62060c69281f5d8e35b867cda00106e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791893451,\"headline\":\"Applied Materials (AMAT) Trades at 39.66 Times Earnings. Can 2027 Growth Carry It?\",\"id\":142848700,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Applied Materials (NASDAQ:AMAT) keeps adding heavyweight partners. Intel recently agreed to work with the company on next-generation transistors, interconnects, and chip packaging, just days after packaging specialist Besi expanded its own long-running collaboration. Yet the stock has spent recent weeks absorbing a very different message: worry that AI spending can’t climb forever. The business is […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b5e8b2d976c0663ff4189c6998ce7dfb166a24eb176576355889190f96f31492\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791892487,\"headline\":\"Qnity Bets On Local Production To Win More AI Chip Business From Nvidia, TSMC – CEO Touts ‘Local-For-Local’ Strategy\",\"id\":142848701,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Qnity is reportedly using a local-for-local sourcing strategy to strengthen supply chains, respond faster to customers, and compete for more business from major chipmakers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=07f7e1293bfceff350b21c3c2a931d44