mmary\":\"AI spending concerns rattle optical stocks after strong year-to-date gains amid robust demand for high-speed connectivity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=135979aeff99ad364c027b25218b0fc7cdd62e58e59471b65c1f43c1e358537d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791859591,\"headline\":\"Intel CEO Calls Chinese AI Models “Good Enough”: Here’s What It Means for Intel Stock\",\"id\":142838668,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel (INTC:NASDAQ) CEO Lip-Bu Tan said on Monday, October 12, that Chinese frontier AI models are being adopted “very fast” because their token costs are lower. Speaking at a DBS panel in Singapore, Reuters reported, he named DeepSeek, Kimi and GLM and called their performance “good enough.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0af320ea9aab35570a41ecd22f5e8bc0d915b815832b9372ae327c42d3d647a8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791855748,\"headline\":\"SNDK, MU, INTC, AMD, SKHY: Chip Stocks Extend Slide As AI Funding Concerns, China Competition Weigh On Sector\",\"id\":142830416,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Financing concerns and China’s push into advanced memory technology deepen pressure on semiconductor stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4da3ace9fd7e6c35d1f9538b6e30923a81a5306ec3d5a4fcb00fc2f2264beb9d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791851943,\"headline\":\"Entegris, Intel, KLA Corporation, Lam Research, and Microchip Technology Shares Are Falling, What You Need To Know\",\"id\":142827143,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A number of stocks fell in the afternoon session after worries weighed on memory chipmakers and sparked selling pressure across the broader semiconductor sector, following news of domestic Chinese technological advancements and looming labor strikes in Taiwan.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bdee110d585b385d2f845c881ee95975ac306c38bf349e9eb4208961879d8492\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791842611,\"headline\":\"Microsoft's AI chief on whether Maia 300 cuts its Nvidia dependence: 'Competition is good'\",\"id\":142825265,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Deirdre Bosa sat down with Microsoft's (MSFT) Executive Vice President of the Cloud and AI group, Scott Guthrie, to discuss its new Maia 300 AI chip, which he says can deliver about 40% more tokens per megawatt or per dollar. Guthrie said the company would deploy programs from Nvidia (NVDA), AMD (AMD), and Intel (INTC) within its cloud.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2e694d9f84f8b8ca1b5bab1a4a47e16f6c9f9aff8d66f78c383149c0c3de070c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791842137,\"headline\":\"What Changed In Qualcomm's Story?\",\"id\":142825266,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Qualcomm (QCOM) stock is currently priced at 20.0 times earnings, trading below the 21.9 multiple of the S\\u0026P 500. Investors paying that price need a clear understanding of what they are buying, particularly as the company shifts its public priorities. Back in July 2025, executives anchored their presentations on sales targets for automotive and IoT chips, which power connected consumer and industrial devices. By the latest call, those figures had taken a back seat. So what does Qualcomm lead wit\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6afe84101ea0e1efed23e9ffd5218fc023196c0032534d0b301d9c440c428be9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791837904,\"headline\":\"Intel (INTC) Sees a More Significant Dip Than Broader Market: Some Facts to Know\",\"id\":142824535,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel (INTC) concluded the recent trading session at $101.4, signifying a -3.15% move from its prior day's close.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4ca7409a737898f1248e5f7d135431941f1df7d32b068afc913b68fe5b792bd4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791834281,\"headline\":\"Is ASML Holding NV's Stock a Buy Ahead of Its Q3 Earnings Report Wednesday?\",\"id\":142823591,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ASML is set to report Q3 earnings. Here's what to expect.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fa73c65e185f744d28d2d9b85b923c92475b509ecac999e84c223e97d3ed59a3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791833520,\"headline\":\"Intel Accelerates Open Infrastructure for the Agentic AI Era\",\"id\":142823679,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SANTA CLARA, Calif., October 12, 2026--Intel® GPU D-series, Xeon CPUs, open software and ecosystem innovations help customers scale agentic AI.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2bcdbbe36c4c0cae26c8e38cd4c6143336325b92d7a787ea8be60ab8150388e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791833356,\"headline\":\"Intel aims to boost AI turnaround with new GPU chips to take on Nvidia\",\"id\":142823589,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel is diving further into the AI GPU market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2f0da72ebcd2f7b29e7c6d4fdd1b32bc6acbbfe215a75c53663762e9d027bab1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791832299,\"headline\":\"What Does NVIDIA Offer That Marvell Does Not?\",\"id\":142823593,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors buy Marvell Technology (MRVL) and NVIDIA (NVDA) to capture spending on artificial intelligence data centers, but the two companies generate revenue differently. NVIDIA sells the full AI system, while Marvell supplies custom chips for individual cloud customers and the components that connect chips inside a data center. Marvell has been the much stronger stock. It returned 222% over the past twelve months, compared with 25% for NVIDIA. What has each company told investors to expect from\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=71af332cd766ac84194a598e771bbea846f054fac024ac252deee52203b02464\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791831933,\"headline\":\"Intel Is Up 174% in 2026 and AMD Is Up 175%: Take Profits, or Hold On for the Ride?\",\"id\":142823600,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel and AMD have each tripled their value in a matter of months, leaving shareholders staring down a decision that cuts both ways. The case for staying in is compelling, and so is the case for walking away.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=73eb85c73e6a6b84c87e1f8039ae25ff9cc12d45589027142da64cad6ed9ee8b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791828303,\"headline\":\"Looking for the most active stocks in the S\\u0026P500 index on Monday?\",\"id\":142823078,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay informed about the most active S\\u0026P500 stocks in today's session as we take a closer look at what's happening on the US markets on Monday. Discover the stocks that are generating the highest trading volume and driving market activity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=653996be3c58cbc3ec3ee1f6f71a72e9d6b502aab53f246