illion chip funding plan offer clues to AI spending's staying power.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2b32edb09e61822e1df182f7d813ab3b9a0b6ff19bb137bb5cda166ece4db10d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791806314,\"headline\":\"Intel and Broadcom CEOs warn capital may bottleneck AI growth\",\"id\":142819847,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Both executives said financing costs and the need to demonstrate returns on AI investment pose a greater risk than chip or power shortages\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dfd7732e22f118a90abbc47a628020a3864ce7bc8fad29b37e73656e01dde9ff\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791803083,\"headline\":\"TSMC: Beyond The Revenue Beat (Earnings Preview)\",\"id\":142821291,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2200526433/image_2200526433.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"TSMC rides AI tailwinds, but risks and expectations complicate the upside. Click for this look at TSM stock before its earnings release and what it may portend.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4f121f63bc94a3a53083810eb4eaf4d5ba53808d313519083d89231ef94c2fae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791801325,\"headline\":\"Intel CEO Highlights Rapid Adoption of Chinese AI Models and Potential for Quantum Computing\",\"id\":142818526,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel (NASDAQ:INTC) Chief Executive Officer Lip-Bu Tan said on Monday that Chinese artificial intelligence models are gaining users rapidly, supported by lower operating costs and performance that meets the requirements of a range of applications. Speaking at a panel discussion organised by Singapore-based lender DBS, Tan said Chinese frontier AI models, including DeepSeek, Kimi and GLM, had benefited from lower costs per token, making them competitive alternatives in the expanding market for AI\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0b27739658227590cf3b5b9bbff8bce5bed32cfc8021fd962d332b3c346cefbc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791799581,\"headline\":\"AMD Makes Big Agentic AI Push With Helion\",\"id\":142820519,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/Chipmakers-Rally-on-Clearance.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"AMD unveils Helion, an open rack-scale AI platform with EPYC CPUs and Instinct GPUs to power enterprise and hyperscale agentic AI.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e2348859c42c11acda96bbe074b91fd0e9661f2d6b0ec79388c4459d85a763dc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791796307,\"headline\":\"3 Australian Stocks Trading Up To 43% Below Fair Value\",\"id\":142816343,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Artificial intelligence is drawing huge investment worldwide, and Intel and Broadcom now flag that access to capital is becoming a real bottleneck for this boom. When money gets more selective, companies that already produce solid cash and trade below what detailed cash flow models suggest can look especially interesting. This article highlights three Australian stocks that fit that profile and shows how their cash generation supports today’s discounted prices. The three stocks below are just...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=51bb64bf7bb30646ef47b3541a273e37cec90a6af2d962c42fd156852877b032\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791796295,\"headline\":\"Elite AI Stocks To Own In October 2026\",\"id\":142816305,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI is soaking up capital worldwide and even Intel and Broadcom now flag funding as a bigger constraint than chips or electricity. That kind of scramble can leave some investors paying premium prices. It can also leave quieter opportunities mispriced. This piece focuses on those under the radar players powering the AI boom and highlights three stocks from our undervalued AI shortlist that merit a closer look now. The stocks below are just a small sample of the undervalued AI opportunities on...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dcde6cf6281b44d8bc8e14106234853a9ed23da1df948fb8b68a6264f35ee5bd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791795335,\"headline\":\"INTC, AMD, NVDA, MU: Chip Stocks Open Mixed Premarket After Worst Week In A Month\",\"id\":142816307,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI spending concerns and intensifying memory-chip competition pressure semiconductor stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f162837042780ff68cc2553a3fbba919f404df2acd023205126071f503566037\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791793337,\"headline\":\"Starlink Goes Mobile, and Wall Street Rewrites the Telecom Map Overnight\",\"id\":142815584,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/THUMBNAILS_CHARTMILL_1000_528_16_733ebd5e0f.webp\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX’s spectrum deal wiped double digits off T-Mobile, AT\\u0026T and Verizon while tower stocks soared. Stocks still closed a volatile week higher, despite 24-year highs in long-term yields, weaker consumer sentiment, Apple’s iPhone order cuts and a hurricane shutting in Gulf oil output.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=92f35ca77b3b4365a34648301d4adb104b1a0e13ec54e6107426ad61520ac1a5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791790457,\"headline\":\"Forget Chip Shortages: Intel, Broadcom CEOs Warn AI's Next Big Crisis Could Be Cash\",\"id\":142820563,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/Financial-Technology--Artificial-Intelli.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Intel \\u0026amp; Broadcom CEOs warn capital bottlenecks could stall AI growth despite record tech demand as global AI debt issuance slows.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a4404037bd8d361053be1d32989bc50a39655765c6712479d0a0fe49798ae7db\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791787684,\"headline\":\"Broadcom, Intel CEOs Flag Capital Crunch, ROI as Bigger AI Bottlenecks Than Chip Shortages: 'The Biggest Constraint...'\",\"id\":142820961,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/A-Data-Center-With-Rows-Of-Server-Racks-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Broadcom and Intel CEOs warn that capital constraints and ROI concerns could become major bottlenecks for AI infrastructure growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5d4f556ddf7d22782b5600e2bf0a7349f41ee60c67424db6262bb2157e510719\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791785357,\"headline\":\"AMD Stock And Two AI Infrastructure Names Facing A Big Margin Test\",\"id\":142813999,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI spending, expensive energy and stubborn inflation are pulling markets in different directions, yet capital is still flooding toward companies that keep the digital world running. That tension creates both excitement and risk for anyone deciding where to put fresh cash to work. This article walks through three stocks from our Artificial Intelligence and Cloud Infrastructure Leaders screener that appear especially exposed to today’s macro crosswinds. The three examples below are just a...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cf73c06ee25de8a132b3c90942cd5c97ca9fa69cc0221746c578fa414e1d56f5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791779272,\"headline\":\"Intel, Broadcom CEOs warn capital crunch could become AI's biggest bottleneck\",\"id\":142822378,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108315138-17804039612026-06-02t070118z_913331550_rc2jllarvolb_rtrmadp_0_computex-intel.jpeg?v=1780403995\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"The CEOs of Intel and Broadcom warned that access to capital could emerge as a major constraint on the artificial intelligence boom.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c30510cd4ab0fbb3339d3d9ae0c5d1a2d67c80237ccbec12c9130bdbcb41b34a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791750780,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk just handed Intel a new problem Wall Street can't ignore\",\"id\":142808514,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The chipmaker’s latest opportunity may come with a complication no one saw coming.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7bac0d84d8d335b2a85a6d26c4f1d3ede45477161d5ac112cc0665ae2f948efe\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791727895,\"headline\":\"Intel (INTC) Reaches 500 Million AI Tool Downloads As Edge Integrations Expand\",\"id\":142806455,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel (NasdaqGS:INTC) expanded its collaboration with Anaconda to distribute Intel optimized AI, ML, and Python tools through the conda ecosystem. Anaconda reported that Intel tuned packages available via conda have now surpassed 500 million cumulative downloads by developers and data scientists. ConnX launched a new integration that uses Intel edge computing technology to power real time shared intelligence in transportation and manufacturing settings. The Anaconda conda distribution...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e639412bffa79f9817318a92846764217e4c9bba8a716b37944cc524d4affce9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791727216,\"headline\":\"KLA Turned $1,000 Into $31,595 in a Decade, Crushing the S\\u0026P 500 by 8.7x\",\"id\":142805945,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"KLA builds the machines that catch chip defects before they become costly scrap, and that narrow specialty turned one quiet semiconductor stock into one of the market's most surprising long-term compounders. Here is what powered the run and whether the conditions that drove it still exist.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=31e91335b5d3345ef66746347569706cc2d48db4fc2d8f35f542678aeab6ca64\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791724200,\"headline\":\"Q3 Earnings Could Blow Past Consensus—Be Ready for What Comes Next\",\"id\":142819902,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI-driven demand is lifting earnings estimates and price targets across cybersecurity, semiconductor, and CPU stocks, including PANW, MRVL, AMD, and INTC, ahead of Q3 results.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7801f245bf4bde190b8b8f17e40e982954a732bf5879a131da5d021bc310c642\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791720969,\"headline\":\"Intel and Applied Materials Just Deepened Their AI Partnership. Which Stock Looks Better Positioned?\",\"id\":142805761,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Applied Materials Inc. (NASDAQ:AMAT) and Intel Corporation (NASDAQ:INTC) announced on October 6 that they are expanding their partnership on next-generation AI chipmaking. The two will work together on transistors, the wiring that connects them, and advanced packaging. That includes Intel’s Foveros technology for stacking chips in 3D. Teams will work out of Applied’s EPIC Center […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=860a5fa8f9682ba9f80e461021c7bd9682efdc6e1222887688c4aff6831ed60d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791652763,\"headline\":\"SpaceX’s Terafab Probably Won’t Deliver Very High Profits, Despite Taiwan Semiconductor’s Limited Role\",\"id\":142795817,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX will have to pay its partners on the facility, along with very high capital expenditures.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=923b2654fc0b5e80c14ee5893ef7af4e41ed30c152c26e19c97ac24414fe22ca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791650280,\"headline\":\"AI Revenue Questions Pull Semiconductor Stocks Off October Highs\",\"id\":142793558,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Stock Preachers News Commentary - Semiconductor equities began October on firm footing, with the iShares Semiconductor ETF advancing for five consecutive sessions and the sector's largest company reaching a record high, before retreating through the week ended October 9. Sentiment shifted on Thursday, when the Financial Times reported that OpenAI had told investors its annualized revenue was nearing $50 billion at the end of September, below the approximately $70 billion figure that had been cit\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6150fb96297e262cba0e2316a2789ed59e3f0684cba4a0302e86cc77125ea5c6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791646502,\"headline\":\"Broadcom vs. Intel: Which Chip Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142792830,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Broadcom's 36% net margin and dominant AI accelerator position contrast sharply with Intel's foundry turnaround and negative free cash flow.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a07a1f0cae3dbe4e693111a1dd0253e8b8fdfe5e60cb9b6055d1b42fe8cbe862\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791633900,\"headline\":\"Is Synopsys Back from the Dead? EDA Leader Inks Deals With Amazon and OpenAI\",\"id\":142805041,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Synopsys has rallied after a $1 billion Amazon IP deal and an OpenAI chip-design partnership, prompting the company to raise its long-term revenue and margin guidance through fiscal 2030.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d99d51a9d818f1c6d29622d598de8ab21827243ce17202fee0c147ece4dcedf9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791622801,\"headline\":\"How Supreme Court justices are leaning in major 401(k) case over private funds and underperformance\",\"id\":142793314,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108145983-17473124852025-05-13t090246z_1804573252_rc2py8a5uc89_rtrmadp_0_usa-court-trump-birthright.jpeg?v=1758569831\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"The Supreme Court is weighing an Intel 401(k) case as employers await new Labor Department rules on private investments in retirement plans.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fec0e528421ba9b394c1e13b49e352e0549457b1a825da9c620682e753f58699\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791596314,\"headline\":\"Sequoia-backed Nuvacore seeks $2.5bn valuation in funding round - Reuters\",\"id\":142772486,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Nuvacore, a six-month-old semiconductor startup backed by Sequoia Capital, is seeking to raise hundreds of millions of dollars at a valuation of approximately $2.5 billion, Reuters reported exclusively on Friday, citing two people familiar with the fundraising.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e0c40469aa99413f9198c1a720dac2e33bff539c097a51854e87e9132d9986a4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791587589,\"headline\":\"Should Qualcomm Stock Holders Look At First Solar Instead?\",\"id\":142767844,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Qualcomm (QCOM) and First Solar (FSLR) are both filed under semiconductors, and each holds patents that competitors want to use. On October 5, 2026, Huawei announced it had agreed to a multi-year patent licensing deal with Qualcomm. Meanwhile, the U.S. solar panel maker First Solar is actively suing rivals over its own patent rights. Yet when these two companies released their latest financial reports, they delivered completely different messages to shareholders. So which way does Qualcomm's out\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5de2651aeb015a26a295c6b9a5242dc5ef7c0541a0e16b987a63ea95aac8b2d7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791570131,\"headline\":\"Management Raised the Bar For NVIDIA Stock; Does The Chart Agree?\",\"id\":142766186,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Since management forecast higher sales for its fiscal third quarter on August 26, 2026, NVIDIA (NVDA) stock has gained 8.3%, compared with 1.1% for the S\\u0026P 500. A forecast is simply an expectation from executives, but trading charts reveal whether buyers are actually backing that outlook six weeks later. So is the uptrend in the stock still in place, or has it begun to fade.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b82eadbdd4bf3444c8b21203cfdcc96ac7f6f8489c199a743de1a1a0ffb4b378\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791569499,\"headline\":\"Super Micro Computer (SMCI) Appoints 35 Year Intel Veteran To Its Board\",\"id\":142766270,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Super Micro Computer (NasdaqGS:SMCI) has appointed Shesha Krishnapura, a 35 year Intel veteran, as an independent Board member. Krishnapura, known for high performance computing and AI infrastructure work, replaces departing director Judy Lin on the Board. The appointment follows recent Super Micro Computer partnerships such as its AI focused collaboration with NetApp on data infrastructure solutions. This Board refresh through Shesha Krishnapura's appointment is worth weighing alongside our...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=28ae91865bec5ef15f48f02d658d454c0399c913f633bb1cacb9b043225ca314\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791569102,\"headline\":\"Explore the S\\u0026P500 index on Friday and find out which stocks are the most active in today's session.\",\"id\":142765621,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay informed about the most active stocks in the S\\u0026P500 index on Friday's session. Discover the stocks that are generating the highest trading volume and driving market activity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1fa9f1c674574e0933237001e1e66d77711e406a331cd57995c1136d4894f80d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791565217,\"headline\":\"Intel Stock Is Still a Turnaround Bet. Here’s What I See Ahead\",\"id\":142765149,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel shares have already surged more than 200% this year, but Wall Street still calls the stock a hold. Here is what bulls and skeptics are each missing about where INTC goes from here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=db71244b3f144b7d977ad9c31aabe3a787aa31cf4007a12364913a0485b443a5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791564359,\"headline\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor Vs. ASML: If I Had to Choose One For the Next 5 Years, It’s This One\",\"id\":142765255,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"TSMC prints the chips and ASML prints the machines that make them possible, but five years from now only one of these AI supply chain giants looks positioned to justify its valuation and absorb its biggest risk.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b2b1f684858bda722eaa564dd873690dacca6466bf55c00ed88cb8d5f8e1d5c0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791563252,\"headline\":\"Arm Holdings Stock Fell 6% in a Day as an OpenAI Revenue Report Hit Chip Stocks. Here’s Where OpenAI Touches Arm’s Business\",\"id\":142765256,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Arm Holdings StockCurrent Price: $275. 29Target Price (Mid): ~$1,375Street Target: ~$291Potential Total Return: ~400%Annualized IRR: ~43% / yearWhat Happened?Arm Holdings (ARM) closed at $275.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2f18d9f8df816da4b94bc6d9b4c2bb21a9df8ad1fa4e69bca529594bd8c462aa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791561637,\"headline\":\"One of the Most Important AI Stocks Isn’t Nvidia. It’s TSMC\",\"id\":142765211,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia grabs the AI headlines, but every leading-edge chip it sells has to pass through one company's factories first, and that company trades at a fraction of its biggest customer's valuation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cc0782b9a5d1b03e4ca2c18392abb3068d6b64b78481d311699d2f0b2f122929\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791558898,\"headline\":\"What Investors Should Do After Lenovo Shares Dipped\",\"id\":142765919,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1659520848/image_1659520848.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Lenovo stock looks attractive after a sharp drop; AI momentum, strong revenue beats, and analyst upgrades support the bull case. Click for more on LNVGY.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a80e25b8b36006ee65689550629b625695e91381b9c787cb06ed7375d972fd38\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791550810,\"headline\":\"How Low Can Intel Stock Go?\",\"id\":142761477,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Intel (INTC) have fallen 10.8% in a week. The slide began on October 5 following a report that TSMC might join Terafab, a chip plant project Intel is part of. While the report raised concerns that TSMC could displace Intel, the company maintains it is staying in the project. Broadly, AI stocks also struggled over yields and oil prices. This points to a rough week rather than a market shock. How much has Intel stock lost in full market shocks, and how long did it stay down.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=953b0dd4ff17d9e0b02e5ecf50fc2adc9b13ea49966d80704995aa0883c00c86\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791549930,\"headline\":\"Intel Is Worth More Than Coca-Cola and PepsiCo Put Together\",\"id\":142761569,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A chipmaker that lost billions last year now commands a valuation that dwarfs two of the world's most profitable consumer giants, and the math holding that together is razor thin.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7c0df84702b3bed557b6d543c172e55edc3f04cd7f00cd03ec6ce03166ba8302\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791548580,\"headline\":\"Record Profits at Samsung and TSMC Say the AI Trade is Intact\",\"id\":142761491,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Recent news from Samsung, TSMC, and SpaceX suggests record CAPEX spending will continue.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3b293e07820878b1cc65b6dea375799c0ac3bf437eff9ec60b6c00836341849c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791548220,\"headline\":\"Tesla Stock Rises as Elon Musk Asserts Control Over Terafab Chip Project\",\"id\":142761565,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla and SpaceX will own and operate their chip making facility, says Musk, no matter who helps with the mega-project.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e05ab00861df12ec3c88ac66b784ad361e9141cc1c50b6b4b8daf2642379144d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791541924,\"headline\":\"Nasdaq Futures Climb as Chip Stocks Rebound on New OpenAI Revenue Report\",\"id\":142765258,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"December Nasdaq 100 E-Mini futures (NQZ26) are up +0.81% this morning as chipmakers staged a partial rebound from yesterday’s selloff following a new report on OpenAI’s estimated revenue.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1dfc13bb0f84f3f250a4be508194e1f75f49c62c8cb186e21a9082d69f957ed1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791540023,\"headline\":\"OpenAI's $20 Billion Revenue Gap Sends Chip Stocks Tumbling\",\"id\":142757494,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/THUMBNAILS_CHARTMILL_1000_528_15_6573496dd1.webp\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Chip stocks slid after reports put OpenAI's annual revenue near $50 billion, well below earlier estimates. Debt-heavy AI names took the hardest hit, SpaceX moved deeper into mobile with new spectrum, Chipotle jumped on Starbucks takeover talk, PepsiCo rallied despite a guidance cut, and oil climbed above $91.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=557033d381aadccfe976abc5e7e0ac7ac2483c91237e84c6093fb91093fef475\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791536151,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer Calls Kulicke \\u0026 Soffa ‘Terrific,’ But Prefers These 2 Chip Equipment Stocks\",\"id\":142762285,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Jim-Cramer-At-The-Cable-Show-2010-An-Eve.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Cramer favors Lam Research and Applied Materials over Kulicke \\u0026amp; Soffa, urges moving on from Flagstar, and recommends Intel over STMicroelectronics.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ff424626cb084fd6dcd8b65ab52bd21f54bbbc9285c3a62c23d5c057b7e1a05\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791529316,\"headline\":\"Intel: The Turnaround Is Real, But Valuation Leaves Little Margin For Error\",\"id\":142757989,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1002010996/image_1002010996.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Intel (INTC) rated Hold: $112.50 price bakes in CPU recovery \\u0026 Foundry upside, with limited margin of safety.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a304e6bd3c0603a21ed7894a602dd8f5794082caeca7e00b51e2efb52c4fac22\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791525437,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Still Treats Micron Like a Commodity Stock — Analyst Says That's a Costly Mistake\",\"id\":142761420,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Paris--France---June-09--20-micronogo-Of.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Micron (MU) stock gains in premarket trading. D.A. Davidson highlights a massive valuation gap vs. AMD and Intel amid AI expansion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6965fcc7bdb47adc7e2f8ab9f572313baf1fc3e5053f4c4e5cc23bcf82e69ae2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791523795,\"headline\":\"Intel Has A $100 Billion Problem\",\"id\":142753681,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/458660127/image_458660127.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Intel's turnaround has gained substantial credibility through stronger capitalization of server CPU momentum. Read why INTC stock is a hold.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fe54b67e9016402cd871d6f1426476195f42abae3b9a4846799c20126a4d539c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791522829,\"headline\":\"Ross Gerber Expects Micron to Buy Back 'Tons of Stock' in December — 'A Big Buyer Is Coming Soon'\",\"id\":142762613,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Micron.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Investor Ross Gerber expects Micron to buy back large amounts of its own stock in December, when CHIPS Act restrictions expire.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=28f4db88c4d7f41ffdd6e4914ab574b8b92ef675c305646ac59eb62c9bbbd13c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791518460,\"headline\":\"Supreme Court May Decide the Future of 401(k) Investment Benchmarks\",\"id\":142766269,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Plaintiffs in some jurisdictions could soon face a more demanding pleading standard for fiduciary imprudence claims.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2b111af20723954e6c3abf5fb1c9cad35f6a25be86ad6c17331bc54c96ea5c94\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791514235,\"headline\":\"Intel Stock Fell 5% in a Day as Chip Stocks Sold Off Ahead of Its October 29 Report. Here’s Where the Stock Could Go\",\"id\":142754579,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Intel StockCurrent Price: $107. 08Target Price (Mid): ~$437Street Target: ~$118Potential Total Return: ~308%Annualized IRR: ~39% / yearWhat Happened?Intel Corporation (INTC) closed at $107.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cf2131b05aad99607beea059cfef8cea50ddb595b0d910e17741e65b06cfed9b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791512538,\"headline\":\"Chip, Cloud Stocks Edge Up Overnight After OpenAI’s $50B Revenue Figure Sparks Selloff: Analyst Calls Reaction ‘Overblown’\",\"id\":142741701,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nearly half of the retail traders who voted in a Stocktwits poll said they plan to buy the AI-linked stocks after the dip.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=772ca8270e25d5a3af391cb685fb19d2d36b019c1852c779dacfca5a4ce02655\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791507780,\"headline\":\"AMD CEO delivers stark warning on chip market’s future\",\"id\":142738318,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AMD CEO plans to substantially increase supply in 2027 after meetings with TSMC and suppliers in Taiwan.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dd4e4eee517fc2d9be85a0f25db35c688051272177d74e18221311d5363a8be8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791502219,\"headline\":\"Intel CEO Lip-Bu Tan Says Company Will Keep Working on Terafab — Elon Musk Confirms TSMC May Only Sublease Part of the Fab, Not Own It\",\"id\":142736455,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel Corp.‘s CEO Lip-Bu Tan said the company will continue working with Elon Musk on Terafab, according to a report. Tan told Bloomberg, ahead of an event in Tokyo commemorating the U.S. company’s 50th year of operations in Japan, that...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3f70d28b25c16753650c7a678e13c97982c72ae6ce99d5f25f0ef9d9bc5f47c2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791502020,\"headline\":\"Prediction: This Will Happen to Intel Stock in 2027\",\"id\":142733844,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel stock has rallied as the market has re-evaluated its growing foundry capabilities. Now, it will have to deliver.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d86469372b65f857abcfdce35ad6dfa75cd8288054ea643ead328937d0c166c8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791499568,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer On GE Vernova (GEV) \\u0026 Vertiv (VRT): Two Stocks To Buy Due To The Jobs\",\"id\":142733912,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Vernova Inc. (NYSE:GEV) and Vertiv Holdings Co (NYSE:VRT) made it on Jim Cramer’s radar on October 2nd due to their exposure to the data center industry. Cramer has frequently discussed both firms due to their presence in the data center buildout. For instance, in May, the CNBC TV host remarked that Vertiv had ” […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ceab0525b47d0122cc58f70d3da4522dfd967560149f96a7ea8a76a82c22dd4f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791488537,\"headline\":\"Lightning Round: Buy Intel here, says Jim Cramer\",\"id\":142764879,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108378813-5ED3-MM-E-100826.jpg?v=1791500911\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"'Mad Money' host Jim Cramer weighs in on stocks including: Intel, Flagstar Bank, STMicroelectronics,\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9c0aee0765ff43454238dbc81fec87c034a0fa81e8cfc0b5d2a88713944da287\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791488382,\"headline\":\"Update: US Equity Indexes Drop as Sharp Sell-Off in Semiconductor Heavyweights Sinks Technology While Crude Oil Surges\",\"id\":142732154,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"(Updates with index/price moves and geopolitical news from the first paragraph.) US equity indexe\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3da8e451874c5e6e84ea51668d565b96ab7c6fa8b37110a9ce5d4cdfca165594\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791486301,\"headline\":\"Top S\\u0026P500 movers in Thursday's session\",\"id\":142731798,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Curious about the S\\u0026P500 stocks that are in motion on Thursday? Join us as we explore the top movers within the S\\u0026P500 index during today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=00e3f6f428848d7b5f56e2fc7a444b52168551d6bb7094884d5ba564cf35c7c7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791486000,\"headline\":\"Anaconda Expands Collaboration with Intel to Give Enterprises a Secure Path to Production AI\",\"id\":142732153,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AUSTIN, Texas, October 08, 2026--Anaconda, Inc., the trusted foundation for AI-native development, today announced expansion of its collaboration with Intel to make Intel-optimized software even easier for developers to access, install and keep current through the conda ecosystem. The announcement comes as the companies mark a milestone of more than 500 million downloads of Intel-optimized AI, ML, and Python packages, increasing speed and accessibility for builders worldwide.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e214c7e91ae9f9d7541f2d7469416a7497b80923ae2759d9c714c2a06e46666e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791484200,\"headline\":\"Stock Futures Fall on Higher Oil Prices, AI Pullback\",\"id\":142727133,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Futures for the Dow led a sharp selloff in U.S. stocks, as still higher Treasury yields, rising oil prices and a fresh artificial-intelligence wobble combined to weigh on sentiment.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0339efaf463ca730737c481749c5eb50be99eb982fa138fed277a764d352fc96\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791483180,\"headline\":\"The AI Trade Is Alive and Well as Bond Yields Keep Rising\",\"id\":142730972,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The spike in the 10-Year Treasury is alarming. But investors can take solace in the fact that AI spending will lead to strong earnings for chips and other tech companies.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b33cd4c45f87f79dfa6fbcba907be06a03b2243abe80c16cd7006fa3ffb701e0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791482776,\"headline\":\"Stocks Sink After OpenAI Report Sours AI Trade\",\"id\":142731159,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Nasdaq Composite took a sharp dive on Thursday afternoon after a report on OpenAI's recurring revenue rattled the AI trade.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=da8154472d3bc6c344e7ce1d613acdb4acbcbf4c89cc4ed527ddb5d345b5066f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791482704,\"headline\":\"Looking for the most active stocks in the S\\u0026P500 index on Thursday?\",\"id\":142731429,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay informed about the most active stocks in the S\\u0026P500 index on Thursday's session. Discover the stocks that are generating the highest trading volume and driving market activity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e8f0d85eb95a24026ef2036ad49410e7fd9a4f34d744d8ecfa17937b899da51a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791482400,\"headline\":\"These stocks are making the most noise in today's session.\",\"id\":142731428,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay updated with the latest market activity on Thursday. Explore the most active stocks in today's session and stay informed about the stocks that are in the spotlight.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=486ec9b62192404986b037c11f7a81fd99615022a57cd4f009110a968bcde536\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791482319,\"headline\":\"Is Marvell Stock Priced Right Against Its Peers?\",\"id\":142732119,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"INTC\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors in Marvell Technology (MRVL) have seen the stock return 220.8% over the past twelve months, making it the top performer in a group of five chipmakers. That peer group includes NVIDIA, Broadcom, Advanced Micro Devices and Qualcomm. Yet the underlying financials reveal a different hierarchy, with the company ranking only fourth of the five on revenue growth, and fourth on operating margin. So how much are buyers now paying for Marvell's earnings, next to those peers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ad1203e9d7e840ed67a3a8fc16415cdf88a8a9774531117658b9c1415b893fb9\"}]"
