     "content": {
      "size": 143085,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792385682,\"headline\":\"INTC, AMD, MU, SNDK: US Chip Stocks Rebound After Worst Week Since March\",\"id\":142992690,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chipmakers recover as investors brace for major earnings reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=39a3e45fe00cb49aa7b5fb6765d12adce7a0d00e6d079aa5a6ef77cfab9f604b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792374806,\"headline\":\"What Would Stop The AI Selloff\",\"id\":142994131,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f81e56ca69a5fcfaacd77d3a9630d96359897268651205c32cb90015cce769d2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792372800,\"headline\":\"This Is AMD's Biggest Hurdle in an AI Sell-Off (and No, It's Not Nvidia)\",\"id\":142991437,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The problem is more with AMD stock than with AMD as a company.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=133dc0ce0e3c9886a3f4e58edf4e4dc399bb12645a4a3eeb6b39bba129ac9ecd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792361375,\"headline\":\"NVIDIA And 2 Other Fast Growing Stocks To Own\",\"id\":142989720,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Inflation in the US hit 3.7% in September, driven by sharp jumps in energy costs, which puts profitable, financially sound growth stories in sharper focus for many investors. Companies that analysts expect to grow earnings quickly while still keeping their balance sheets in decent shape can look attractive when everyday costs feel higher. This article highlights three such high potential stocks from our screener and explains what sets each apart. The three stocks highlighted here offer a...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d4f5cdc81992b38e1862d2e092f72df7789b09ff547bd58e5f6db7dd1e302840\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792357858,\"headline\":\"3 AI Stocks With Earnings Growth Over 33% To Watch\",\"id\":142989187,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"America’s huge AI infrastructure boom is now showing cracks, with delayed projects and tougher financing starting to bite. That kind of stress can punish weaker balance sheets while leaving room for financially sound, earnings-driven growers to step forward. This is where a basket of companies expected to lift profits quickly while keeping their finances in decent shape comes in. The rest of this article highlights three standouts from that group. The three stocks highlighted here offer a...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=25704e9a724310db5702ce3b1bb9a8086125778b5ea303adc55f6f97a3721e53\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792356386,\"headline\":\"Intel vs. AMD: The CPU Comeback Has Become a 2-Stock Fight, But 1 Is the Better Buy\",\"id\":142992147,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The CPU market is heating up again, and one looks better positioned to turn rising demand into earnings growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1c5493f31d7a8440cb57020dd3d892c227f46315cab9124903f86b99cdf53f63\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792339440,\"headline\":\"Better AI Chip Stock: Taiwan Semiconductor vs. Micron\",\"id\":142987945,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Micron has far greater upside because the market is still treating it like a cyclical commodity business.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c50b526733f247c51b3031e8462745d3a9eb45b1eb0ef720b2b660772353952e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792315800,\"headline\":\"Prediction: $1,000 Invested in Taiwan Semiconductor Today Will Be Worth This Much by 2030\",\"id\":142983554,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"TSMC benefits from the successes of Nvidia, AMD, and others.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=120603e54b7c2c2256b9ed841e5824c4926b361609f543e59cf083051a357b16\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792310400,\"headline\":\"The Data Center Doomsday Scenario\",\"id\":142986379,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d733269d580b8f457fbc381c431850ac865267f6f47bd6dfb7175a21c0285369\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792303200,\"headline\":\"AI Investment Impact Understated In U.S. 'It' Market: Texas Reveals\",\"id\":142984221,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/913582626/image_913582626.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Texas leads the AI infrastructure boom with data centers and chips boosting GDP and jobs. Check out this look at the tech sector and its prospects.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=03fd4bc2999d901f5bc2e52183f24910137f24e6e0bdaed3e6c5c60e0fd0eeab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792300501,\"headline\":\"Why Is Advanced Micro Devices (AMD) Gaining Ground In AI Infrastructure?\",\"id\":142971162,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Advanced Micro Devices (NasdaqGS:AMD) is part of a new partnership where Sterling will use BitRipple's LT3 GPU transport on AMD and NVIDIA GPUs. The collaboration focuses on improving efficiency in large AI GPU clusters without requiring fresh hardware spending. Sterling plans to deploy BitRipple's LT3 software on AMD GPU platforms for federal, public sector, and enterprise AI Factory offerings. The exclusive LT3 use on AMD GPUs in Sterling's AI Factory setups tells only part of how AMD's...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b086747e728a52679cf7cc08a6b1bbc971d5746191d836be3f0359c25cbf173f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792297068,\"headline\":\"What Advanced Micro Devices Buyers Were Betting On Before A 137% Rally\",\"id\":142971111,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"If you only skimmed the headlines about AMD’s MI450 accelerators landing multi-gigawatt deals with Anthropic and Meta, the real surprise sat in the share chart. Holding Advanced Micro Devices from the start of the year would have returned 136.6%, including dividends. If you were deciding on 1 January 2026, before trillion dollar market caps and raised AI forecasts, what would you realistically have needed to believe about AMD’s data center push to press “buy”? The useful thing about a...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7933df750d27fb77e04277f98065d79c5276b89efa60f93be67d55f618bf3195\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792276030,\"headline\":\"What to Expect From Advanced Micro Devices’ Q3 2026 Earnings Report\",\"id\":142971236,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Advanced Micro Devices is ready to release its third-quarter early next month, and analysts project its bottom line to rise in double digits.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=10a536d70582d8da448e7dd1cb4a1b7873372f6ba967ca7a98ff444141f63bce\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792275065,\"headline\":\"Nvidia vs. AMD: Which AI Business Has More Room for Margins to Fall?\",\"id\":142964286,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"What separates earnings resilience between NVIDIA Corporation (NASDAQ:NVDA) and Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. (NASDAQ:AMD)? Both sell AI compute, but a dollar of lost margin has a very different effect on their current profits. The stocks rank first and fifth in our 10 Best AI Infrastructure Stocks to Buy for the Long Term, respectively. See which […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5f80d0d5c736e575027be4c5fdf16572215d218633e965c691fbafbde7f2bc50\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792275027,\"headline\":\"Nvidia vs. AMD: Which Business Is More Exposed to a Data-Center Slowdown?\",\"id\":142964290,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NVIDIA Corporation (NASDAQ:NVDA) depends far more heavily on data centers than Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. (NASDAQ:AMD). That makes AMD more diversified by reported sales, although diversification alone cannot establish which stock is safer. The two AI stocks made it to our list of Best AI Infrastructure Stocks to Buy for the Long Term, but their revenue […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2c564ce92a7b2a7e3523d957c6a214ac5d36520f50523c7007fa6b2649264dae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792257998,\"headline\":\"Intel Stock Fell Nearly 6% as TSMC Took Aim at Its Packaging Business. Here’s What It Means for Intel’s Margins\",\"id\":142962616,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Intel StockCurrent Price: $89. 85Target Price (Mid): ~$390Street Target: ~$118Potential Total Return: ~336%Annualized IRR: ~42% / yearWhat Happened?Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (TSM) CEO C.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ca2bf16f5b630348dcff0278e595af4431925ee990afbac5440c39d89b96268b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792255800,\"headline\":\"1 Red Flag That AMD Investors Should Be Aware Of Now\",\"id\":142962585,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Advanced Micro Devices' stock has gotten ahead of its business.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b33100c8f52e473b17e76d0e867f9d81245deeb78553cf7d8e19b157387ecb5d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792253720,\"headline\":\"Chip Stocks Just Fell 8 Days in a Row, Their Longest Losing Streak Since 2008\",\"id\":142962592,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Semiconductor stocks just logged their longest losing streak in nearly two decades, and the cause this time has nothing to do with a credit crisis. What is actually driving the selloff puts every link in the chip supply chain at risk.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b0308c55fd23bc832f262feec8d6517334c5036b1d4acba500cbd84b186e5b08\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792253280,\"headline\":\"Here's What $10,000 Invested in Broadcom Will Be Worth by 2028\",\"id\":142962589,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Broadcom's AI chip business will rapidly expand in the next few years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=45a3448716324098d8e591a655907a4334752a37a76b822f4a93cfd1075a0b82\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792235715,\"headline\":\"Nvidia’s CEO Says “All of This Is Going to Pass” After Tech Lost $1 Trillion in a Day\",\"id\":142959983,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech stocks shed over a trillion dollars in a single session while oil and Treasury yields climbed, yet Nvidia's CEO stood in Berlin projecting calm certainty about AI's future. Whether his confidence addresses the forces that actually triggered the selloff is the question every chip investor now faces.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1bfea888cc709b0e748fdc8e86dfb642734641995b777747e1d4bb25e0edade8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792226700,\"headline\":\"The Correction Is Healthy; The Next Move Is Yours\",\"id\":142960363,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2291479836/image_2291479836.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The article analyzes recent corrections in AI and suggests being highly selective on U.S. equities amid macro uncertainty. Click to read more details.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=17bd471ebe532927fd54ba02b3174315468a676bb8365e8c83c5e1ee26657da6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792206181,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy Qualcomm Stock For Its Cash?\",\"id\":142957831,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the last twelve months, Qualcomm (QCOM) generated free cash flow equal to 5.5% of its market value. That outpaces the 4.4% yield for the median S\\u0026P 500 company. A yield above the median can mean a business that is either on sale or expected to shrink. Qualcomm's revenue fell in each of its last two quarters. So is that cash the sign of a business on sale, or of one that is shrinking.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5d97d563f196004769529b8a8a462a6f30d90e791071af12927b2fe71d204873\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792197000,\"headline\":\"The AI Supercycle, Asia, And Why This Time Is Different\",\"id\":142958070,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2209095196/image_2209095196.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The AI race is about more than who builds the best model. Click here to read more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=38742d1d5916af83c5350ce68f0ddd46c425ebcdfad5d8e9debba1de9eaf54f6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792192369,\"headline\":\"How much AMD stock does CEO Lisa Su actually own?\",\"id\":142951535,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Lisa Su helped grow AMD’s revenue by pivoting toward artificial intelligence. Here’s how many AMD shares Su owns and how she accumulated her stake in the chipmaker.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e15bbefa05b266b2f6b95e48740f4ce56f9f94249e75c193a4a6fff3b05677cd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792190160,\"headline\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor Posts Record Q3 Results: Time to Buy the Dip?\",\"id\":142951501,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"With strong earnings momentum and a favorable growth outlook, TSM may be an attractive stock to consider following the recent market pullback.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=05c0647d23b323f4b13b3204299f611d6eb57e324c0e9a18dd0b9382e33ed6c9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792185900,\"headline\":\"Prediction: $1,000 Invested in Taiwan Semi (TSMC) Today Will Be Worth This Much by 2030.\",\"id\":142950766,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"An investment in TSMC today could easily triple in value over the next four years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=45cf95aa85b6bf142a5da067c064ed5cf2ee71ff367ca6787f927b9e9fe1301d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792184095,\"headline\":\"Update: Nasdaq Falls to End Four-Week Winning Streak Amid Tech Sell-Off\",\"id\":142950775,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"(Updates with market mov