riday, with Tesla popping while the broader Tech market fell.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=825dbbef32818729891374461984755f66f4ee0a485a4487cd76b28b6b64b9d0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792158579,\"headline\":\"Is AMD Stock Safer Or Riskier Than A Year Ago?\",\"id\":142947929,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors holding Advanced Micro Devices (AMD) stock have enjoyed a very good year: shares returned 157.8% over the past year, compared with a 17.9% gain for the S\\u0026P 500. A return of that magnitude prompts a closer look at the underlying business, and the company's financial report for the quarter ended June 27, 2026, provides the latest view into its accounts. Has the company taken on more risk to get there.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a52cbda5770ba2323bed9acd926856c76c47ba0cf8a9ad7743b86d650c90397e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155246,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Wall Street Swaps Chips for Old Reliables as Producer Prices Spike\",\"id\":142946644,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/THUMBNAILS_CHARTMILL_1000_528_22_59555aefc9.webp\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"The Dow rose 1.2% as money moved from chips into old-economy names. Producer prices posted their biggest jump since 2022, and Jensen Huang came to CoreWeave's defense.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ee8449899659de30d7c02cc76597c0fe59b287c7864490302adecf3c9fbd624a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154880,\"headline\":\"Why Nvidia Stock Can Defy the Broader Chip Sector Slump\",\"id\":142945454,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The AI chip leader was defying the ongoing sector slump early Friday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4a4f06e14c2d837bae88336a45