ry\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792128915,\"headline\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor Holds the Cards As NVIDIA, Apple and AMD Battle for Limited AI Chip Capacity\",\"id\":142945150,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/TSMC.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor (TSMC) capacity battles heat up as NVIDIA, Apple, and AMD scramble for AI chips. Q3 revenue reaches $46.7 billion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=159a7a3f28742526243f576da475d8bb2e471f146975f56460dc76f83cc0dd7b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792116818,\"headline\":\"SOXX Extends Selloff After 8-Day Decline, KOSPI Rebounds: Jim Cramer Calls SK Hynix ‘Epicenter Of Fear’\",\"id\":142928546,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"South Korea’s KOSPI rebounded on Friday, giving investors some respite.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ad55ce4c5f197c90a742bc700d65b23bae1c563411348b885cb7a1c49fa6c60\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792096216,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Dow Pops 550 Points As Yields Sink; Dell Sets Off Sell Signals\",\"id\":142922205,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index finishes higher Thursday while the Nasdaq erased its loss.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=10a374b3c92d1e6fef3af0ea64d1ec7bdfd1b116a291f2d8a91a3e4fa5ac45de\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792093320,\"headline\":\"Why This Market Washout Will Spark a Year-End Rally\",\"id\":142922238,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"After this weeks washout, the stage is set for bulls to regain control.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ca49237ab740f594cd4681a2c