787c189ff04d371ae0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792078106,\"headline\":\"AMD, NVDA, Other Chip Stocks Extend Rout Amid AI Debt Concerns — Saxo Says Financing Squeeze Could Hit Supply Chain\",\"id\":142919141,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Saxo Bank’s Charu Chanana said there is insufficient evidence of a systemic AI credit crisis, even as investors question the sustainability of the financing model behind AI infrastructure.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=05e054f1736c6802273c6bfe1802c5547f07ffe852b61efe5e07020c241a9196\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792076652,\"headline\":\"As AI stocks plunge, Apple is riding high\",\"id\":142919153,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple is avoiding the worst of the AI sell off.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77b679a321f12d215e49147206dd889d827dc9103a60ee38a30cf50be01887f1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792076400,\"headline\":\"Sterling and BitRipple Partner to Deliver Super Intelligence Efficiency and Communication Acceleration\",\"id\":142919266,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NORTH SIOUX CITY, S.D. \\u0026 BERKELEY, Calif., October 15, 2026--Sterling and BitRipple Partner to Deliver Super Intelligence Efficiency and Communication Acceleration on NVIDIA and AMD platforms.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9c540a53e995612e4a2db8a74e1ad16372baa00c8c8411525d778190d79d045b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792075521,\"headline\":\"Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang will speak about CoreWeave's business when he wants to: Analyst\",\"id\":142919267,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"When he thinks the time is right, Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang is likely to speak about what's happening at key partner and fallen AI stock darling CoreWeave.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b56f7690f5e9e7a74989161a53744b60100dd05cd65b20ad778b67d35036c6d3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792073708,\"headline\":\"Prediction: Broadcom Could Be the AI Winner After Nvidia\",\"id\":142919203,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia dominates AI compute, but hyperscalers are quietly shifting billions toward a rival chip architecture that costs less than half as much per workload. One semiconductor giant is positioned to capture that spending, and its valuation still hasn't caught up to what the numbers suggest.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=881215397f9a673e33148a56a154cec9603f744905189c9a9635b69dec532797\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792073435,\"headline\":\"What's going on with CoreWeave?\",\"id\":142917071,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi takes a look at the biggest stories as the trading day kicks off, weighing in on CoreWeave's (CRWV) stock rout and more. Sozzi also previews his Power Players interview with legendary actor Sylvester Stallone, in which the two discuss what's wrong with Hollywood.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7fef7a6bb5986fa9af5179e104001fe2fb345e6aca0267847d52acaaabc13d5e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792072968,\"headline\":\"Tech slumps as AI financing worries grow, investors flock to bonds: AlphaCheck\",\"id\":142917051,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Stocks were mixed on Thursday as chip names sold off.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a6c2ffe5059f41542439888a4dee74f8419186b6c493846ca585151a5c516cc6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792072560,\"headline\":\"Tech sell-off rolls on as hot inflation data stokes rate worries\",\"id\":142916210,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Asian stocks plunged and the sell-off in tech stocks continued on Wall Street on Thursday as investors worried that forecast-topping US inflation data would force the Federal Reserve to raise interest rates again.\\\"The tech sell-off has continued with pace, exacerbated by US inflation data which increased expectations for US interest rate hikes this month,\\\" said Dan Coatsworth, head of markets at AJ Bell.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f8b294e6d18f356efc40baa54dde4452be97b702142572abcfb815edb1a6fcc5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792072300,\"headline\":\"SMH: The AI Capex Boom Is Far From Over, And Chips Are On Sale\",\"id\":142920289,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2247792891/image_2247792891.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"VanEck Semiconductor ETF is rated a Buy, citing robust AI-driven capex growth and attractive entry following recent sector correction. Click for more on SMH.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f888a84d259a537124e16c5b19ead667f497084495ffe2b25994381efac853a4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792071757,\"headline\":\"Nvidia stock trims losses as chip sell-off eases amid AI financing concerns\",\"id\":142922259,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia and other big chip stocks pared losses as AI jitters eased on Thursday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fdcdebe2a7c43f733b358f82400ce57c3f253b002b237da2dc70fe0dfcc5d7f1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792071757,\"headline\":\"Nvidia stock falls amid concerns over AI financing\",\"id\":142919245,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia and other big chip names fell as sentiment over the AI trade soured.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9e94c32856b6d32c62bafa4c58e24268c3090e303695c7a70d8c264a60147b6a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792071757,\"headline\":\"Nvidia stock sinks amid concerns over AI financing\",\"id\":142916209,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia and other big chip names fell as sentiment over the AI trade soured.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d5be29c761ac0bcb296d825f58282366bc77da18b2bd25aa281ae44156417351\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792071756,\"headline\":\"The Case For NVIDIA Stock Rests On One Thing\",\"id\":142919214,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NVIDIA (NVDA) has translated demand for its AI platform into rapid sales growth. NVIDIA can only sell the hardware its partners build, leaving the open risk for shareholders with component manufacturers. The company has yet to prove these suppliers can keep pace with customer appetite. This issue matters today because NVIDIA has guided to another round of higher sales for the quarter it reports next.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2d342578d6183d046286db0556c5a7d54e388b5289b536326ace31f7022cbb98\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792071092,\"headline\":\"Is There A Risk Hiding In AMD Stock's Big Run?\",\"id\":142916222,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"For investors holding Advanced Micro Devices (AMD), the pressing concern is how much of each sale actually translates into profit. AMD's operating margin, the share of sales left after all running costs, stood at 17.3% in the quarter to June 2026. Shareholders currently pay 22.6 times sales for AMD stock, compared with 3.1 times for the S\\u0026P 500. At that valuation, the margin matters immensely. So has that margin been climbing steadily.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b5432c12af84db0d530927a8e2f13a7b844fd1e4866db9d14d3bf7eca0617a78\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792070550,\"headline\":\"AI Trade Takes Another Hit Thursday as Tech Sell-Off Continues\",\"id\":142919213,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Memory chip and data storage stocks fell Thursday, extending the sector’s recent losses.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=74a9647275ff483ba6e9f2e9b7d36fcd4b49b3d68f963dfc192737ab1c4e0fcb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792069937,\"headline\":\"Rate Pressure vs. AI Demand: Rising Treasury Yields Trigger Nvidia, AMD Slump\",\"id\":142946454,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/AMD-vs-Nvidia.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia and AMD shares slide as rising interest rates and AI funding concerns trigger a broad semiconductor sell-off, while analysts highlight strong demand.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0508274ce47b19cc0c72393894311ae11a0ec3be9b1702bfa7c77de5c4a89baf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792069727,\"headline\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor Falls 3% Despite Record Quarterly Profit; Intel Drops 4%, AMD Slides 3%\",\"id\":142914998,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (NYSE:TSM) stock trades at $418.90, down 3% even after the chipmaker posted a sixth consecutive quarter of record profit. A record report from the world’s largest dedicated semiconductor foundry isn’t stopping the selling, and the weakness is spreading across chip names. Meanwhile, Intel (NASDAQ:INTC) stock is at $94.33, down 4% and sliding […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4cd73645d6f56b4d48529c06bdfaa6645dfa79677c6dc211dcc1765065b2c7df\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792068475,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Dow Rises, Nasdaq Tumbles As AI Worries Hit Major Players (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142913914,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Thursday ahead of more inflation data. Nvidia, Micron and AMD sell off on AI fears.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6ad409edc5845d99345332cecd4ac0d247cc7396d902bc4aa044842c2de7fcee\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792068215,\"headline\":\"Jensen Huang Is Giving $250 Million to AI Safety and Says He’d Cut Off Reckless Customers\",\"id\":142915006,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Jensen Huang just pledged a quarter-billion dollars to AI safety research and said he would cut off a customer building dangerous AI, but his own statements reveal how much wiggle room that threat actually contains.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c40a076b623561c45fcf4a3ada50fdb87ef213fb3f58d5913f06385121b0de1a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792068182,\"headline\":\"Advanced Micro Devices vs. Arm: Which Tech Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142914999,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AMD's 34% revenue surge outpaces Arm's 23% growth, yet Arm trades at a premium valuation, a rare disconnect that reshapes the investment case.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8843986cf47e5d49d0a0f71a8182599f02067ea11e716ac290e3c5f27e662ab5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792066932,\"headline\":\"AI Financing Fears Hammer Chip Stocks: These 2 ETFs Are Cashing In on the Sell-Off\",\"id\":142946093,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Semiconductor-Or-Microchip-Concepts-tech.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"SOXS and TSXD ETFs surge as AI financing fears hit Nvidia, AMD and Micron. Explore key technical levels as semiconductor stocks slide.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=269832bd1dadca27b55bd064ea810aca4c8107d6865d2ab276f80498e42964a8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792066481,\"headline\":\"Premarket movers: CoreWeave tumbles; Penske Automotive surges\",\"id\":142913889,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com - Global semiconductor stocks fell sharply on Thursday, extending the previous session’s selloff after fresh U.S. inflation data fueled concerns that the Federal Reserve could raise interest rates further. AI-linked stocks remained under pressure as investors reassessed the sustainability of data center spending and the growing role of debt in financing the industry’s expansion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ac38e590f869fab33b168f93f7f3e6b440fd66d938849b10e7e207e09266aa5b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792066355,\"headline\":\"Wall Street is 'tiring of the Bank of Nvidia, the Bank of AMD and the Bank of Broadcom': Baird's Mortonson\",\"id\":142914146,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The sell-off in AI-related stocks, according to Baird tech strategist Ted Mortonson, is increasingly about who needs financing and what that financing costs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3d29a48eed767f2dafcfa258c4a7cadb2cf84c8537fc6ee03e070de0f413573c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792065600,\"headline\":\"Netlist Introduces Next-Generation LIGHTNING™ ULL DDR5 RDIMMs for Agentic AI\",\"id\":142914577,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Netlist, Inc. (OTCQB: NLST), a leading innovator in advanced memory and storage solutions, today announced the expansion of its LIGHTNING Ultra-Low Latency (ULL) DDR5 RDIMM family for Agentic AI workstations and servers. Built on Netlist's proven ULL architecture, the next-generation DDR5-6000 and DDR5-6400 products are designed to improve responsiveness in memory-sensitive AI and enterprise workloads that continuously access memory-resident data.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=38d9d8cd397edf7edf857735fd9a798fc7fc0474f3db813920738a7df89fa767\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792065155,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures Rise, But AI Sell-Off Continues On Anthropic News; Taiwan Semiconductor Earnings Strong\",\"id\":142910479,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Dow Jones futures rose but the AI sell-off continues following Anthropic revenue figures. Taiwan Semiconductor earnings beat.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7bd625a98ecd006df283abd676950d910f0b8ff67434299ef1236ee5fdcd9f1a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062741,\"headline\":\"AMD: TSMC Just Fired A $175 Billion Warning Shot\",\"id\":142918991,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2279241831/image_2279241831.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.'s pullback may be a buy: agentic AI boosts EPYC/Instinct demand, TSMC N2 ramp improves supply and margins. Click for this AMD update.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4c743e8cb264e7e7dc95edeac1c35100c01a67a4fa22d85149ac6a9747e8d3c2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062000,\"headline\":\"Micron Gets Musk Boost: Buy the Stock on a Dip With ETFs?\",\"id\":142913854,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Micron's strong results, tight memory supply, and Musk's praise boost its outlook. Explore four ETFs with significant MU exposure amid rising competition and rate risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b573331c1e5bb2af92c30b209193c73ee7f4aeb464e4733f7b47f643dcc4ba3d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792061136,\"headline\":\"TSMC stock sinks despite record profit amid 'extremely robust demand' for AI chips\",\"id\":142916274,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"TSMC stock sank even after the company reported quarterly results that beat Wall Street estimates.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0540de07f7fe2f4d75dcf82af8321a8a0320afd94450f62689370089ac21de14\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792061136,\"headline\":\"TSMC posts record profit amid 'extremely robust demand' for AI chips\",\"id\":142910467,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"TSMC reported quarterly revenue as investors look for clues about the health of the AI trade.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b20cce203c0a79e129301d68fe17e5a9e291149e672e549a4bbf0150a5c738f3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792060788,\"headline\":\"Penguin Solutions shares are trading higher after the company reported better-than-expected Q2 financial results and raised its FY26 guidance. Also, Needham maintained its Buy rating on the stock and raised its price target from $25 to $27.\",\"id\":139960332,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9d9c822bcb1834c9b38e026f50f9e56f536ff484a94ca974826ab31a4e35d4c6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792059540,\"headline\":\"Nvidia, Apple, Broadcom in 'fierce' battle to get chip manufacturing space at TSMC\",\"id\":142919949,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108411127-1792020231674-TSMC_Katie.jpg?v=1792020295\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Soaring AI demand is constraining capacity at Taiwan Semiconductor, threatening to slow the AI buildout. Tech giants Nvidia, Apple, AMD and Broadcom are locked in an \\\"extremely fierce\\\" battle for space on TSMC factory lines. That's made the one man in charge of TSMC wafer allocation \\\"the most popular person on the planet” and created a rich opportunity for Intel, as customers look to the foundry arm of the U.S. chip manufacturer for an alternate source. CNBC visited a TSMC event to learn more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a515f3ccbb74dc13bedde904e79843ec262d0e66440a17247819619c3ffa2bb9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792058865,\"headline\":\"Can robust TSMC earnings help settle AI jitters?\",\"id\":142910483,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com - TSMC posted a $23.59 billion net profit for the third quarter of 2026, a 68.7% year-over-year surge that marked its sixth consecutive record quarter, yet the earnings beat has done little to arrest a deepening selloff across AI-linked semiconductor stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e1aef95b751339fd4df5655ddf5aef11c7465d0d0f9bbe2d5306ccc398f9a8bd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792057800,\"headline\":\"Anthropic Just Made the AI Stock Rout Even Worse\",\"id\":142912456,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Claude developer’s revenue is growing fast—but perhaps not fast enough for a company targeting a $2 trillion valuation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3803677962e3c56e9aa6426caa09444a41b8a1e4073541ba706c78e761fc6f2b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792057800,\"headline\":\"Agentic AI Could Push This Trillion-Dollar Chipmaker to New Heights, According to Wall Street Analysts\",\"id\":142908650,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"This company has the right combination of chips to meet agentic AI's processing needs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7e1f17e1f2846a403e5abec284cbe9881dc4ae9fe9e0ae3d534126ea71dc128d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792054020,\"headline\":\"TSMC Stock Falls After Blowout Earnings. Musk Talks Could Offset AI Chip Fears.\",\"id\":142908332,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing reported booming profit but the real intrigue comes in its talks with Elon Musk over his Terafab project.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d53d5bee90a1f93e10d6e0a3e5819816bb2dc28deb02a241b4c68571074fe1d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792053922,\"headline\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor: Excellent Growth, Buy The Sell-Off\",\"id\":142914649,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2216425295/image_2216425295.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company Limited beat revenue and earnings again as AI demand surges. Click for this updated look at TSM stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aa98e1243f1ceb3ad2cb6aa3275beca644084b1db7e47753a7c34b7ff15efd57\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792052562,\"headline\":\"Global chipmakers sink as inflation data fuels rate-hike fears, AI rout\",\"id\":142908107,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Global semiconductor stocks fell sharply Thursday, extending a rout from a day earlier after fresh U.S. inflation data stoked fears of further Federal Reserve interest-rate increases.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bf60ed8cd5068c99bb15d4d60ce536825a6da8ada0fc6a8097547fa91f59daa0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792050932,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Hot Inflation and a Neocloud Shakeout Sink the Nasdaq\",\"id\":142904852,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/THUMBNAILS_CHARTMILL_1000_528_20_d1d9e6697d.webp\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Hotter September inflation revived Fed hike bets and a Gartner warning crushed AI neoclouds. Pharma caught a bid, BlackRock hit a record, BofA got fined.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2207e6c4cebd8214810f97bad4d72147d15d8cfb1d750d8531729e492dec4984\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792034113,\"headline\":\"What Does Advanced Micro Devices (AMD) Helion Mean For Its AI Ambitions?\",\"id\":142896519,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Advanced Micro Devices (NasdaqGS:AMD) introduced its open Helion rack-scale AI architecture for agentic AI infrastructure, contributing the specification to the Open Compute Project. The Helion blueprint is designed to let customers assemble highly modular rack-scale systems tailored to different AI workloads and deployment needs. AMD and nVent announced an advanced rack-scale cooling solution that targets heat management for dense AI servers using the Helion approach. The Helion launch and...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f5f6ac0291f546194d4fc4e6991c551e7c18d29611148ee785999d23944ae4ba\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792032567,\"headline\":\"Global chip sell-off deepens as South Korean market plunges\",\"id\":142896505,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Samsung and SK Hynix shares led the South Korean KOSPI lower as a global chip stock sell-off deepened.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e56a8c2cad748fd085266c7951e3285fe36e038feed9a9a519584f5d5d6216fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792022100,\"headline\":\"Review \\u0026 Preview: Blistering in the Sun\",\"id\":142891359,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A hot September inflation report is making Wall Street fret an October rate hike could be on its way.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d4a8b78df9371f14af0b97179b374fa85c504a67f77d237ec823b21afd456440\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792021725,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures: Techs Fall On Anthropic News After Dell, AMD, CoreWeave Dive In AI-Led Sell-Off\",\"id\":142889195,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech futures fall as Anthropic revenue jumps, but not enough? The stock market tested key levels on AI fears. Taiwan Semiconductor earnings loom.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c916de8f26e003f3576188a0c28503750d3cfca0fe7a9deb77caeb67b8ef9bdf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792012165,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures: Dell, AMD, CoreWeave Lead Market Sell-Off On AI Fears; Taiwan Semiconductor Due\",\"id\":142888326,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The stock market tested key levels on Fed and AI fears. Dell, AMD, CoreWeave were big losers. Taiwan Semiconductor earnings loom.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e1a55a659c9fcf8681b74636abc17536f30cfc993dedc919509f215b84e95fb8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792010760,\"headline\":\"AMD Stock Takes a Bigger Hit as Cracks Emerge in the AI Trade\",\"id\":142888328,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AMD shares fell 5.7% as CoreWeave’s bond selloff raised concerns about AI spending and demand for chips.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dc86ed6fe678ecbe3187d90ec1623a282f92c6f9fa75e9939787cab24e87c400\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792007981,\"headline\":\"Can Marvell Stock Drop From Here?\",\"id\":142888357,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the past twelve months, Marvell Technology (MRVL) stock has returned 216%, easily outpacing a roughly 18% return for the S\\u0026P 500. On October 6, management set a fiscal 2031 revenue target of $70 billion to $90 billion, and the shares closed up about 6% that day. Yet that target remains a forecast rather than a result. Today's buyers carry the risk if Marvell falls short. So what are you paying for Marvell's growth today.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d375696a458186d7e68421673a7de0988cde2108a608d9d99e62f21bef4dd037\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792007521,\"headline\":\"Is Micron Still The Business You Bought?\",\"id\":142888373,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors who own Micron Technology (MU) likely bought into a memory chip maker whose sales and profits rise and fall with the broader chip cycle. The company released its fiscal Q4 2026 report on September 30, 2026, completing a full year of new results that provide enough data to test this long-held thesis. So, is the company you hold still that chip maker.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0f48c2f78de55fa64f266f59656d1840e54928178f731ec4b37281fbe15aad43\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792001940,\"headline\":\"Stocks Turn Lower as AI, Tech Shares Slump\",\"id\":142887426,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"U.S. stocks were lower, with the Nasdaq bearing the brunt of the declines, as a hotter-than-expected September inflation report put a dampener on the mood in markets .\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c4ac89ae3e1b6a15510ed4520b6865987f4d95c5a40087242656c5dc11b3d0a9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792001544,\"headline\":\"Is Intel's Record Sales Growth Still Improving?\",\"id\":142887427,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel Corporation (INTC) sold 25.4% more in the three months to June than it did in the same quarter a year earlier. The chipmaker has not grown faster in any quarter of the last ten years. To judge that record properly requires looking at what is normal for the company. So take a guess: in a typical quarter, how much more does Intel sell than a year earlier.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2fe070f8faf7b04f250dae80895a0259c59b791d08b50392f11d51d6f71e4a58\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791999805,\"headline\":\"SOXX Heads For 7th Straight Losing Session As Inflation, AI Spending Fears Deepen — Chip Stocks Face $1 Trillion Wipeout\",\"id\":142886364,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UBS described the decline as ‘more of a recalibration of expectations than a fundamental break in t