ts stock sat nearly flat for a year, and that gap keeps widening every quarter. Before dismissing this as a broken trade, consider what the market may be missing about where this cash machine is actually headed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=71268d67dfa2714a9ef00b773b27546cde22038d6528d1ffda49d1979f7e024e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791996318,\"headline\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor’s Top Line Growth is Starting to Raise Eyebrows\",\"id\":142886366,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor keeps raising its own growth targets while its share price moves in the opposite direction, and third-quarter results will determine whether that gap closes in investors' favor or widens into something more troubling.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e72889fe88a2890cb3aa3f35e37725c81fc8d4705602fe6fbf82e70deda9f573\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791996117,\"headline\":\"KBW keeps Core Scientific at outperform, says AMD’s 1.9 GW reservation is overlooked\",\"id\":142886789,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"KBW says Core Scientific already trades at the value of its existing leases. In its view, investors are fixated on CoreWeave's credit and assigning nothing to AMD's option on another…\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5763e1350c8dc9343f9ae75d72af55b6f3a17563b41063ec50935ad700007ab8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791995533,\"headline\":\"Michael Burry Says Stocks Could Peak Within 9 Months — and He’s Betting Against the Nasdaq and Chip Stocks\",\"id\":142886444,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Michael Burry just collapsed his bearish bets into two concentrated positions, set a nine-month window for a