":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Micron Technology (MU) have returned 415% over the past twelve months, easily outpacing the 17.3% return for the S\\u0026P 500. Yet the stock trades at just 13.2 times earnings, well below the 21.9 multiple of the broader index. Buyers appear unsure that profits made during a memory shortage will last, and the company has been working on exactly that problem. So what is Micron doing to make those profits last.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c7dd6f08d6d026874fc81826252e7aa9b277727048eb00a7affc82507f0fa670\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791917760,\"headline\":\"Marvell Stock Is on a Bad Run, but Microsoft’s New AI Chips Can Revive It\",\"id\":142854335,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The chips and networking company has got caught up in a broader AI chip selloff, but Microsoft’s Maia 300 program can change that.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f6bfc430a417008aa966e198c5f5dd4813021f07fba2be0dd694a8a063e5202b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791917160,\"headline\":\"Fermi Stock Soars 20% on AMD Deal. Why Analysts See Hurdles Ahead.\",\"id\":142854383,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Advanced Micro Devices will help advance Fermi’s data center plans.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=797de9d7cc2de4babff6afd650ca758ac71f2da5001c047d40d84153d882128d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791917044,\"headline\":\"How to Play Microsoft Stock Ahead of an Upcoming Maia 300 Launch\",\"id\":142859035,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The software major claims 40% more token output.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1e4473ab06450232838c15799367ad6f693a8d