etime\":1791896361,\"headline\":\"Chip Stocks Slide as South Korea's KOSPI Plunges, J\\u0026J Sinks 6%: Stock Market Today\",\"id\":142882264,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/13/National-Flag-Of-South-Korea-On-Satin--D.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Chip stocks sold off after a 5% KOSPI plunge, with Micron and Applied Materials sinking, while J\\u0026amp;J fell despite a guidance raise.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=87996aeb9140c87eebdff207bb0e9a303700c7fad94716a315ca0dc338a1f6a5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791895159,\"headline\":\"Fermi Secures AMD Backing For Texas AI Project\",\"id\":142882265,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/13/Big-Data-Center-Server-Racks-Hardware-Da.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Fermi (FRMI) stock surged 18% after partnering with AMD for credit support on its 222 MW Project Matador AI power campus in Texas.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6130b9ed2c990e881f8e5edb7d8b630b408c2a1f3fe24bb033babf379cb37cf3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791895080,\"headline\":\"NVIDIA Begins Vera Rubin Production: Can It Extend NVDA's AI Lead?\",\"id\":142848529,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NVDA's Vera Rubin production ramp-up promises major AI performance gains and revenue growth, but supply constraints and rising memory costs pose challenges.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ab1b8fb85f28823bfea4cb674069187eb130d6a31cd170dcec2ff2845267f9a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791893340,\"headline\":\"Marvell Stock Is on a Bad Run but Microsoft’s New AI Chips Can Revive It\",\"id\":142848560,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The chips and networking company has got caught up in a broader AI chip selloff, but Microsoft’s Maia 300 program can change that.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6a3ba976bd2465e9992ce3843ca1937a93b1d4d481ddee298d67264107df5f76\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791892800,\"headline\":\"Fermi Signs Credit Support Agreement with AMD and Announces Partnership\",\"id\":142848651,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"DALLAS, TX / ACCESS Newswire / October 13, 2026 / (Nasdaq:FRMI)(LSE:FRMI), operating as Fermi America™ (\\\"Fermi\\\" or the \\\"Company\\\"), today announced that it has signed a credit support agreement with AMD, the high performance and adaptive computing leader, supporting a lease for phase one of Fermi's Project Matador energy and AI buildout in Carson County, Texas, with 222 megawatts (MW) of gross power capacity in line with Fermi's first customer lease as announced on August 10, 2026. The agreement\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f1c8f0122558ca66c27a3cd631c00c1cdc3aa140d0809a7beaea8b2d9039428d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791892800,\"headline\":\"nVent and AMD Collaborate on Cooling for AMD Helios Rackscale Solution\",\"id\":142847710,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"nVent will add liquid and air cooling solution to AMD rack-scale AI platform to create a fully integrated system for large AI workloads The companies will unveil a first look of the open-source solution at the OCP Global Summit LONDON, Oct. 13, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- nVent (NYSE: NVT) and AMD today announced a collaboration to bring rack-level cooling to the AMD Helios™ Rackscale solution. The joint effort pairs nVent's data center cooling expertise with AMD Helios to help operators deploy AI\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b8d8ac012d1636c3a4a321b2c308ebbde26b086f05b361e1b80dd9d2eee6b040\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791892586,\"headline\":\"Advanced Micro Devices vs. SK Hynix: Which Semiconductor Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142848564,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SK Hynix trades at a fraction of AMD's valuation, but one company faces cyclical headwinds while the other wrestles with intense competition and supply chain risk.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=64a6d7ed79a39a77eba84257d6d4030d1183c1a80bcf50604f04e02e4a002aa6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791890667,\"headline\":\"Applied Materials vs. Advanced Micro Devices: Which Semiconductor Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142846859,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"One makes the chips, the other designs them. But their valuations and risk profiles diverge sharply.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=364a9e1c94912a840d682870299c077db04bd253d0d99e776a0779198daa8bd4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791887420,\"headline\":\"Calm Down, The AI Bubble Won't Burst Just Yet\",\"id\":142850155,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2183146598/image_2183146598.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"AI trade rotation hits semis as cash shifts to reflation. CEOs flag capital limits; HBM stays tight. Click for this look at the current sector trends.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f6503a5cb4bc6512606e24e9ff0ef80f1ac4ac3cf0b16de33d8debc8d1c015c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791887050,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Micron, Sandisk Fall on China Memory News\",\"id\":142844688,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/THUMBNAILS_CHARTMILL_1000_528_1