:\"Microsoft's AI chief on whether Maia 300 cuts its Nvidia dependence: 'Competition is good'\",\"id\":142825265,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Deirdre Bosa sat down with Microsoft's (MSFT) Executive Vice President of the Cloud and AI group, Scott Guthrie, to discuss its new Maia 300 AI chip, which he says can deliver about 40% more tokens per megawatt or per dollar. Guthrie said the company would deploy programs from Nvidia (NVDA), AMD (AMD), and Intel (INTC) within its cloud.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2e694d9f84f8b8ca1b5bab1a4a47e16f6c9f9aff8d66f78c383149c0c3de070c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791842137,\"headline\":\"What Changed In Qualcomm's Story?\",\"id\":142825266,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Qualcomm (QCOM) stock is currently priced at 20.0 times earnings, trading below the 21.9 multiple of the S\\u0026P 500. Investors paying that price need a clear understanding of what they are buying, particularly as the company shifts its public priorities. Back in July 2025, executives anchored their presentations on sales targets for automotive and IoT chips, which power connected consumer and industrial devices. By the latest call, those figures had taken a back seat. So what does Qualcomm lead wit\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6afe84101ea0e1efed23e9ffd5218fc023196c0032534d0b301d9c440c428be9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791837902,\"headline\":\"Why Advanced Micro Devices (AMD) Dipped More Than Broader Market Today\",\"id\":142824520,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Advanced Micro Devices (AMD) closed the most recent trading day at $594.24, moving 2.28% from the previous trading session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c31feea85548ce604b0597b80c6aae5dffa1e1eb3ef4d4c30962b2900e439e1c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791837300,\"headline\":\"It’s a High-Stakes Earnings Season, Especially for AI Stocks\",\"id\":142825312,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AMD, Marvell, Corning, and Bloom Energy were among the priciest stocks hit by valuation declines, according to Trivariate Research.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=532dc6ef41c9b3f5bbeebe68e2eae21e0cdf41f8a2a0c74f7aeab65b0b469f88\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791835200,\"headline\":\"AMD: CPU Boom Lifts Target To $1,200\",\"id\":142825817,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2258999353/image_2258999353.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Advanced Micro Devices is experiencing explosive growth in both AI GPU and premium server CPU markets, now leading in high-end server CPUs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8d2523e77cd3590a79940e8f60ed19b97f714d8c91beb9c7af7abe29d99a4088\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791834600,\"headline\":\"Nvidia and AMD Reached a Historic Valuation Split. 1 Stock Is Far Safer.\",\"id\":142823590,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia and AMD traded closely for a long time, but that's no longer the case.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=068095887c8426938a4fdf11badd0e8523f0e84de80265de53f9a29842441c92\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791834428,\"headline\":\"Microsoft just reclaimed its $4T market cap, thanks to its Maia 300 AI chip\",\"id\":142823595,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft (MSFT) returned to its $4 trillion market cap after unveiling its new Maia 300 AI chip. Yahoo Finance Technology Editor Dan Howley outlines the details.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=64c51f3f54e043b957468f170adb603ea220a9fee2556ac022c6f50494cea199\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791832299,\"headline\":\"What Does NVIDIA Offer That Marvell Does Not?\",\"id\":142823593,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors buy Marvell Technology (MRVL) and NVIDIA (NVDA) to capture spending on artificial intelligence data centers, but the two companies generate revenue differently. NVIDIA sells the full AI system, while Marvell supplies custom chips for individual cloud customers and the components that connect chips inside a data center. Marvell has been the much stronger stock. It returned 222% over the past twelve months, compared with 25% for NVIDIA. What has each company told investors to expect from\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=71af332cd766ac84194a598e771bbea846f054fac024ac252deee52203b02464\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791831933,\"headline\":\"Intel Is Up 174% in 2026 and AMD Is Up 175%: Take Profits, or Hold On for the Ride?\",\"id\":142823600,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Intel and AMD have each tripled their value in a matter of months, leaving shareholders staring down a decision that cuts both ways. The case for staying in is compelling, and so is the case for walking away.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=73eb85c73e6a6b84c87e1f8039ae25ff9cc12d45589027142da64cad6ed9ee8b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791828300,\"headline\":\"Not Sandisk, Not Intel. This Stock Will Lead the S\\u0026P 500 Next Year\",\"id\":142823666,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia has the potential to lead the S\\u0026P 500 in performance next year.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c98bbd74e6852deaa352698ee49dcc768ca4253664ba4e8cfa5b2be53428748a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791827199,\"headline\":\"Which AI stocks' valuations are outrunning reality?\",\"id\":142822622,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Market Hang's panel discusses which AI stocks' valuations are reasonable and which are being hyped on speculative grounds. Today's Market Hang panel consists of Gerber Kawasaki Wealth \\u0026 Investment Management CEO Ross Gerber, Yahoo Finance's Pras Subramanian, Kelly Intelligence founder Kevin Kelly, and Cleo Capital Managing Director Sarah Kunst.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d3be78de2a426521c5a1720230d87915f7e6d1a0b32e54019d1a3e21ee010997\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791826503,\"headline\":\"2 Reasons to Like AMD (and 1 Not So Much)\",\"id\":142822690,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"What a fantastic six months it’s been for AMD. Shares of the company have skyrocketed 146%, hitting $608.15. This was partly thanks to its solid quarterly results, and the performance may have investors wondering how to approach the situation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6f0d582816bb1c8ff4e59e1c8aafcc78be943cfd44aed4445e962e01b9ca2d5e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791826227,\"headline\":\"Broadcom Is Building an AI Business Unlike Nvidia’s. Here’s My Price Prediction\",\"id\":142822615,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Broadcom competes with Nvidia without selling a single GPU to the general market, and that unusual strategy has locked in hyperscaler contracts stretching years into the future. Whether the stock has already priced in that advantage is the question worth answering.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0a26ce5cb2a02367879a1ab1d12bd53d8ab50899bcf85d0801ab934b64ac4cae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791823920,\"headline\":\"Once Wall Street’s Darling, Cerebras Stock Is Struggling\",\"id\":142822626,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The chip maker’s financial outlook is closely tied to OpenAI’s.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d14e6392ec59daba0170ca77b611a37eaa34a617a4b177f9b1812f6280c375e1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791823553,\"headline\":\"AMD Vs. Nvidia: If You Can Only Own One to Finish 2026, It’s This One\",\"id\":142822619,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Both AMD and NVIDIA just posted record Data Center quarters, and their next platforms are shipping months apart. That timing gap could decide which stock wins the rest of 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a7075f412176c6eb64425ff10e89043ed7a48eaf4b036178c80839d92e62954c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791822837,\"headline\":\"What Was Micron Telling You Before Its Stock Ran?\",\"id\":142822680,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Micron Technology (MU) stock returned 424.1% in the twelve months to October 9, 2026. That performance ultimately rested on a shortage of memory chips. Executives note that supply is tight and prices have been heading higher, with servers running artificial intelligence workloads serving as a big source of demand. How early could you have seen that demand coming.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=daac595687363e091fd7b91b73ca643f4