sions After Its Record Close. Here’s What OpenAI’s $20 Billion Revenue Gap Means for the Stock\",\"id\":142806430,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Advanced Micro Devices StockCurrent Price: $608. 10Target Price (Mid): ~$2,320Street Target: ~$636Potential Total Return: ~281%Annualized IRR: ~37% / yearWhat Happened?Advanced Micro Devices (AMD) closed at $608.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7a414154675b2576e865ecd91245f684364cc37f2e9826ffc703b577a05663a0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791724200,\"headline\":\"Q3 Earnings Could Blow Past Consensus—Be Ready for What Comes Next\",\"id\":142819902,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI-driven demand is lifting earnings estimates and price targets across cybersecurity, semiconductor, and CPU stocks, including PANW, MRVL, AMD, and INTC, ahead of Q3 results.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7801f245bf4bde190b8b8f17e40e982954a732bf5879a131da5d021bc310c642\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791722100,\"headline\":\"Not Anthropic. Not AMD. Here's My Top AI Stock for 2027.\",\"id\":142805358,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia will have a monster comeback in 2027.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2a5cabfc85b30d885e004254203592417f511f29f6aeedf50324259fa3385ba0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791721814,\"headline\":\"AMD’s Biggest Problem Is No Longer Demand. Lisa Su Is in Asia to Fix the Real One\",\"id\":142805304,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Advanced Micro Devices Inc. (NASDAQ:AMD) CEO Lisa Su expects chip demand to stay “very high” for the next several years. On October 6, speaking to reporters in Taipei, she said demand is still running ahead of supply, even as AMD ramps up output. Su said AMD increased supply through 2026 and plans a much bigger […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=088c1983dea2bec663629990c67d42f2f58e0b0a92687186ef0c209e41a9eb19\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791710389,\"headline\":\"This Week in TSLA: FSD's Europe Rebrand, Elon Musk Receives Medal From Trump and More\",\"id\":142806091,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/11/Kaunas--Lithuania-2022---April-14-Tesla-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Tesla renames European FSD, Musk receives a national medal, Q3 deliveries beat estimates and more; Here are this week\\u0026#39;s headlines.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fa60a08c99d45454894baf3f6900beb58154c963f1dcdee7918650bc5474dea8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791651781,\"headline\":\"Advanced Micro Devices vs. Qualcomm: Which Technology Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142793572,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AMD's net margin doubled while Qualcomm trades at a fraction of its rival's valuation, but customer concentration and competitive threats complicate both bets.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=69387e00bf52429c8086050e82ee46db0171cd604077c4444f00839259e64b9e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791646202,\"headline\":\"AMD Stock Is Set to Benefit From Both Physical and Agentic AI\",\"id\":142795126,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AMD is well-positioned to benefit from the proliferation of both agentic AI and physical AI.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4f119ecfb2fba158d8af146ab0ecc80b520583c6e5ecbe2499366b64141f200a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791642657,\"headline\":\"The Next Wave of AI Demand Could Send Broadcom, Marvell, and AMD Soaring\",\"id\":142792838,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Broadcom management called Q3 demand simply hot, and Marvell and AMD have already tripled in 2026 alone. The question now is whether three bold price targets for 2027 are ambitious or just the beginning.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f8f561ef84e3f719593cfc42dcd9d54da13246e2a9d11165b0479a57a97e02e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791635400,\"headline\":\"Why Nvidia’s stock is dodging the AI credit scare that is crushing Broadcom and Oracle\",\"id\":142805207,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The P/E ratios have contracted and the CDS spreads have widened in all three cases, but Nvidia appears unscathed\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ae5c23e11e55189b8ff7f9626c96e99e7f2c86283f348fa9aed5797d5e488eac\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791631501,\"headline\":\"Prediction: This Will Be the Next Big AI Gold Rush and This Company Will Be the Winner.\",\"id\":142790076,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"This particular market may be worth $100 billion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=692c79a463889d4c2a5d351152d508f81b1461df34e06aa088e3d1462ca3c9f7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791622704,\"headline\":\"SpaceX, Micron, AMD and More: 5 Stocks Investors Couldn't Stop Buzzing About This Week\",\"id\":142791698,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/10/New-York--Ny--Usa---11-05-2024-Wall-Stre.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Retail investors talked up five hot stocks during the week (Oct. 5 to Oct. 9) on X and Reddit\\u0026#39;s r/WallStreetBets: SPCX, MU, APLD, AMD, ASTS\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7e99434658a86958a1acd15f437ab3c2a7b7b5f6e69f115e3cbaf9de5bc631eb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791612152,\"headline\":\"Cathie Wood-Led Ark Invest Sells AMD, SPCX, GOOG Stocks — But Loads Up On CMPS, NTLA, CRSP And Other Healthcare Firms\",\"id\":142777647,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AMD\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The trades put some of Ark's better-known holdings on the sell side, including AMD, Alphabet, and SpaceX, while its genomics-focused ARK Genomic Revolution ETF continued to add to biotech companies.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=35c31d32c5cef3edbb11bcd2a91ba841cc85bdbde509b3d2f9df13d64db91ae9\"}]"
