     "content": {
      "size": 147481,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792309684,\"headline\":\"5 big analyst AI moves: Meta gets Street-high PT; Salesforce double upgraded\",\"id\":142977538,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Here are the biggest analyst moves in the area of artificial intelligence (AI) for this week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=57bf291475092f86514e0eb14cf08ad5493c706b6a585e097027015ebf6118f4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792263354,\"headline\":\"Salesforce (CRM) Is ‘Sticky’ In The AI Era, Jim Cramer Said \\u0026 Remarked That Amateurs Can Beat Adobe\",\"id\":142963249,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce, Inc. (NYSE:CRM) and Adobe Inc. (NASDAQ:ADBE) are two stocks that Jim Cramer frequently discusses. For both, most of his remarks are about AI and the role that the firms are playing in the sector. The CNBC TV host has frequently defended Salesforce CEO Marc Benioff and his artificial intelligence initiatives and discussed the impact […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c980b06d863e69c37825ba35012644a7175b501fc7b58d25e892683aeebf7dfc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792238451,\"headline\":\"Apple, Salesforce Lead Five Stocks Near Buy Points\",\"id\":142960253,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple and Salesforce are doing well while the AI buildout sector reels. Consumer and healthcare names are coming to the fore.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=53a55220f905a01a13aebe28c0e17e961ca5baaea49729d0b827fa8c8a3a40eb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792234800,\"headline\":\"MarketBeat Week in Review – 10/12 - 10/16\",\"id\":142986233,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech stocks fell on inflation fears and AI infrastructure concerns while the Dow rose, as MarketBeat analysts review earnings outlooks, sector rotation, and stock picks from the week's top stories.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=568e63e4c6d4bd104d2b5f3477ca384696dd07bd8f515a2913346504239748cc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792184095,\"headline\":\"Update: Nasdaq Falls to End Four-Week Winning Streak Amid Tech Sell-Off\",\"id\":142950775,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"(Updates with market moves at the end of the day, and other changes, if any.) The Nasdaq Composit\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b61eb09fa533acc7c06e9bdfac5f27f1a4c0545ec3b68e4d3c126ea59190d8c7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792183506,\"headline\":\"Salesforce (CRM) Suffers a Larger Drop Than the General Market: Key Insights\",\"id\":142950887,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce (CRM) reached $241.05 at the closing of the latest trading day, reflecting a -2.31% change compared to its last close.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=487d47b50e54451aec986fc4b7ccf753b4e9eef13158adba7f2f29e55bec74a1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792182453,\"headline\":\"Agent Monetization Shift: Per-Seat Pricing Is Dying\",\"id\":142950890,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The plumbing for agentic commerce is settling into place. Following the Chain of Trust demonstration and Stripe’s claim that activity went vertical in September, the checkout map has matured. The pipes exist to move value between autonomous entities. Yet the monetization map — how vendors extract value when software agents replace human seats — remains […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c12f4a0d957f8aa463cb6513e3bfc7f672d5a6ebdc60619c4513f513d483e625\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792181385,\"headline\":\"Salesforce Stock Is Up About 30% Since July 31. Here’s Where It Could Go by 2031\",\"id\":142950888,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Salesforce StockCurrent Price: $246. 74Target Price (Mid): ~$445Street Target: ~$286Potential Total Return: ~81%Annualized IRR: ~15% / yearWhat Happened?Salesforce (CRM:NYSE) closed at $246.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3410a96c165c672dbd1b43a5740ec783e7eeb4397c3307fe9e54c1e5771d4d8f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179794,\"headline\":\"9 Dow Jones Stocks Make Bullish Moves In A Defensive Market Rotation\",\"id\":142950007,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A week that tested the financial markets showed the resilience of Dow Jones stocks. Apple and Coca-Cola were among nine standouts.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=af9cc9e28f3a10ea2145e9aa2ce346b5f10ea949ca6edd0654727a5baaf6a007\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792178088,\"headline\":\"Salesforce (CRM) Faces A Fresh Valuation Test After AI Integration Deals\",\"id\":142950123,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce (CRM) is back in focus after partners ZoomInfo, Demandbase and Docusign deepened their integrations with Hunter and Agentforce, pulling more sales and contract workflows into Salesforce’s AI driven environment. Recent moves in Salesforce’s share price tell a mixed story. The stock has gained 4.57% on a 1 day share price return and 8.31% over 7 days, yet it is down 3.49% on a 30 day share price return and 2.71% year to date. At the same time, the 44.49% 90 day share price return and...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d86067bc76712814afae725d1701573bc2b320a9632765ec27e9e1ea958fe62\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792177878,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Losers: GOOGL, CRM, MSFT, AMZN, CSCO in Today's US Session\",\"id\":142959213,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Dow Jones decliners in today's US session: Alphabet, Salesforce, Microsoft, Amazon, and Cisco fell, with GOOGL down 2.76% and CRM down 2.59%.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9bf954ed3d68f0415a8a21c3fb37453861ad6deccaac5526628104a7171ae838\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173460,\"headline\":\"Equity Indexes Slide Intraday Amid Tech Sell-Off\",\"id\":142950016,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"US benchmark equity indexes slid intraday as several major technology names sold off. The Nasdaq\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=29d4097f4b5eaad4bf8a0f925ae3ffff98d666fc8bfa96a7a4e407a5cf701c06\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792171448,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Nasdaq Stung As ServiceNow Dives After Breakout; Tesla Comes Back To Earth (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142949018,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Friday while the Nasdaq struggles with tech losses.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d5cd786ad165f12d775928099bab942a363ca5a483bbbb360408b685c51b9c92\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169027,\"headline\":\"The Tech Trade Needs a Life Raft. Mag 7 Earnings Can’t Come Soon Enough.\",\"id\":142949034,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The stock market isn’t done selling technology stocks, and support can't come soon enough.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e29a8590369372071a38aae8573acc6c3b0d2d0e2c44adadd5c295d5ed2b24e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167549,\"headline\":\"Strong 2027 Guidance and Generative AI Drive Salesforce’s (CRM) Revenue Reacceleration\",\"id\":142949176,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Diamond Hill Capital, a First Eagle Investment Management company, issued its Q3 2026 investor letter for its “Large Cap Strategy”. The letter can be downloaded here. The Strategy returned 3.18% (net of fees) in the quarter, outperforming the 2.61% return of the Russell 1000 Value Index. Key positive contributors included stock selection in information technology, an underweight in […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aa18549b7af10c43a9b21f440d881f336db1f5e97c600ef8c2a0fc56cbe4da97\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166529,\"headline\":\"Is Adobe A Better Way Than Salesforce To Own AI Software Growth?\",\"id\":142949035,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors hold Salesforce (CRM) and Adobe (ADBE) on the same premise: artificial intelligence will make their subscription software grow faster again. The two companies part ways on how they charge for it. Salesforce gets 60% to 80% more for its premium editions than for its lower ones, and it wants customers to upgrade. Adobe has held off on price rises to win users. So which approach is paying off so far.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8292d4dd142df40aadb9a9d0927d6b91c10d3fd10116b52d9a52556a582a98f2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792165407,\"headline\":\"What Is The Biggest Threat To Microsoft Stock?\",\"id\":142949023,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Buyers are paying for growth, and Microsoft (MSFT) is delivering it. The stock returned 37.2% between July 17 and October 15, 2026, against 4.1% for the S\\u0026P 500. Revenue climbed 17.7% in fiscal Q4 2026 from a year earlier. Yet on a July 29 earnings call, executives described a cost to that growth that is still rising. What is that cost, and who is raising it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=42d7abc2a9bb8e2f782d69ddbea13cf4f72d18dd4d868def556145e1f6ea4c86\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161900,\"headline\":\"How the AI Gods Plan to Give Their Money Away\",\"id\":142947921,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Many of the new generation of billionaires are turning to philanthropic organizations tied to the sometimes controversial philosophy known as effective altruism.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=24eff3fa639a2d16bce21a255f84e96f1e9b39d3239bc7e9a186bab2af00bd39\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161077,\"headline\":\"Meta, Tesla, SpaceX Take Center Stage As Earnings Season Kicks Into High Gear. Everything You Need To Know.\",\"id\":142947905,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms and Tesla earnings will highlight a big week of reports, including Netflix, defense, software and chip names.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bf9fb1c0ef4952970ca4ae5b0c80f0c329f2c12d5608dbaae940002f0252e004\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159202,\"headline\":\"Could Palantir Stock Create Life-Changing Wealth for Patient Investors?\",\"id\":142947998,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Palantir shares have already turned patient holders into winners, but the next five years look nothing like the last five. The question is whether the growth engine running at full throttle today can justify a valuation that leaves almost no margin for error.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6e825503a088e048cca64f9a6065d98c99f2341a34bf7887f588459ecb6ddb37\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159020,\"headline\":\"From AI laggard to $5 Trillion: Apple's winning strategy\",\"id\":142947895,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Just weeks ago, Apple (AAPL) faced criticism for lagging behind Big Tech rivals in AI infrastructure spending. Now, the company has reportedly surpassed a $5 trillion market valuation. The 8:30 panel examines how CEO Tim Cook helped drive Apple's rise through its booming services business, disciplined capital spending, and relationships with political and global leaders, even as questions remain about its AI strategy. Bullseye American Ingenuity Fund portfolio manager Adam Johnson sits down with The 8:30 Hosts, Julie Hyman and Jake Conley, to discuss the details.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2ed0835ed96c0bed8345f4af77b00a13a5dd5f3787744fdaa3b2ad94d55acb7c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154739,\"headline\":\"Trading Halt: Halt status updated at 10:10:00 AM ET: Quotation Resumption: IPO security released for quotation\",\"id\":141044493,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7042819f9e418abdd4277182cc456c9eac16a176d29a0bf54767394806b237ae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792152044,\"headline\":\"Can Meta AI Break Into The Enterprise? Why Zuckerberg Thinks So\",\"id\":142945519,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta stock is back in Wall Street's graces on its breakout hit Muse app. Now Meta hopes its AI can crack a huge market that has long eluded it: the enterprise.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3ef4cbe75ce8789ff5cf0a125d2bbd9d866c11712f00e6e48d9a9f966a63d8a5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792152007,\"headline\":\"Investors Heavily Search Salesforce, Inc. (CRM): Here is What You Need to Know\",\"id\":142945675,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce (CRM) has received quite a bit of attention from Zacks.com users lately. Therefore, it is wise to be aware of the facts that can impact the stock's prospects.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=61491625e20299387cba2f9152b14d6bb2b6128b5f3daefcc2cbdf25cb913669\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792151751,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures: Tesla Flies On Roadster As Investors Question Anthropic Valuation\",\"id\":142944221,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech futures fell on $2 trillion Anthropic valuation doubts after a wild, positive session. Tesla revealed a flying Roadster.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d78d1fa5be9c22396cee977372dab78a6f60e643ed111a4de35a5d38bab6327f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792149341,\"headline\":\"ServiceNow Is Betting Big on AI. Investors Need to Watch These Growth Drivers\",\"id\":142944314,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ServiceNow's AI business just crossed a milestone that most enterprise software companies spend years chasing, yet the stock still sits well below where the numbers say it should trade. Here is what the gap reveals about where shares could go next.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f0985dc99f1cdfd764efe9ec4aeb507174b6059b8d9c17a2f13977f133d23489\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792142078,\"headline\":\"Palantir: The Growth Investor's Case For Buying At A Premium\",\"id\":142945032,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1313497440/image_1313497440.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Palantir Technologies has delivered accelerating revenue growth and expanding operating margins, driving a 29.37% stock surge since March. I rate the PLTR stock as a buy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d74eb2fe97b4af82fbeaf69e7d10b8e1d0aaafd59670a5cf1257b3bafc441675\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792134000,\"headline\":\"Look How Much Money the AI Gods Are Giving Away\",\"id\":142939544,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Many of the new generation of billionaires are turning to philanthropic organizations tied to the sometimes controversial philosophy known as effective altruism.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=83f25f420cd730a87af99d81cff8b74394e84fdaac3538812b615ed46d038c7c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792127834,\"headline\":\"Hunter Launch Might Change The Case For Investing In Salesforce Stock (CRM)\",\"id\":142931314,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In October 2026, partners including Demandbase, ZoomInfo and Docusign announced deeper integrations with Salesforce’s new AI-powered outbound agent Hunter and Agentforce, bringing third-party data, engagement signals and agreement workflows directly into Salesforce, Slack and Agentforce interfaces. These moves push more of Salesforce customers’ sales and contract work into AI-driven, in-app agents. This can concentrate usage in higher value workflows and tighten Salesforce’s role in...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d323df367cf10c39e6154bc13473ccd260264d45ec4d6d67ee64f62ed9dafd8f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792124819,\"headline\":\"Salesforce (CRM) Unveils Hunter For AI Powered Outbound Sales\",\"id\":142931315,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce (NYSE:CRM) introduced an AI outbound sales agent called Hunter, built on its Agentforce platform, on 16 October 2026. Hunter launches with ZoomInfo and Demandbase as core data providers, giving users in-platform access to prospect and account intelligence. Salesforce expanded its Docusign partnership so users can manage, generate, and track agreements natively inside Agentforce and Slack. These Hunter data partnerships and deeper Docusign workflows only tell part of the story for...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2f58780631c32ea81654739251e5f0345cb89fb434cff349a476047faed3b49d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792120317,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures Rise; Anthropic Valuation Report, Flying Tesla Roadster In Focus\",\"id\":142928556,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech futures fell on $2 trillion Anthropic valuation doubts after a wild, positive session. Tesla revealed a flying Roadster.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5a3901a5c8c9cd38d1ff5b442fae2be315fcddadd1c4983cea8191af9b03307c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792112634,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures: Techs Slide On Anthropic Valuation Doubts; Tesla Roadster On Tap\",\"id\":142923490,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech futures fell on $2 trillion Anthropic valuation doubts after a while, positive session. A Tesla Roadster event looms.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=09b1845b75974887144b8bd0a95f4e3361a620741cbe4de76488ef54fdd2f8e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792111712,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy Adobe Stock For Its Cash?\",\"id\":142925591,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the last twelve months, Adobe (ADBE) produced free cash flow equal to 11.1% of its market value. By comparison, the median S\\u0026P 500 company sits at 4.4%. A yield that high usually signals one of two things: the business is on sale, or buyers expect it to shrink. Is that cash really yours, and how solid is it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c81a82ce23251632b994d0dddc4d22e700e88d7e6492cf55d5f751a01c607e0e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792108677,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures Fall: Disney, Salesforce Lead 12 Buys After Wild Session; Tesla Roadster On Tap\",\"id\":142922968,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The S\\u0026P 500 and Nasdaq rose at a key level, led by consumer and software stocks like Disney and Salesforce. AI names came off lows.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4102a0515c79206bd032c8e8ea3932c5d4f124d14fa08a496c3bdc104e3ddb12\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792103572,\"headline\":\"How to Play CRM Stock as Salesforce Buys the Loops AI Platform\",\"id\":142931316,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"As Salesforce doubles down on AI with its Loops acquisition, can the deal help turn market skepticism into sustained growth for CRM stock?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b03e197837bbab1eb99d2d6e1cfa22db8164616107cfb20c429ae1f6b0f122bf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792100880,\"headline\":\"Do