"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ac8a9ccaa7f80e40746a3f41976ec980453f998a53749afba56456ea3e221c53\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792089300,\"headline\":\"3 Reasons ServiceNow Stock Is Climbing When Tech Is Selling Off\",\"id\":142922335,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ServiceNow rises after receiving new price target raises, announcing new AI advances, and saying it wouldn’t acquire a start-up.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3857f40043e989d4407138fbfe4e86f4e9a2c120f03ced8ae9ddc40a60626885\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792086600,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Nasdaq Pares Loss As Yields Dive; Drug Giant Hits All-Time High (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142920282,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Thursday while the Nasdaq slid on further tech weakness.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9470d8afc1c4b5713644076d1029bc7f031d28b7a207c1af6f3465cfcf67eb52\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792083480,\"headline\":\"ServiceNow Climbs 5% After Denying Decagon Acquisition Interest; Salesforce Rises 4%, Palantir Dips\",\"id\":142920389,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A flat denial from ServiceNow's president sent the stock surging, but the real question is whether shutting down acquisition rumors actually strengthens the company's position in a market crowded with AI rivals building the exact tools it claims not to need.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=24a08430a1903e9c68e61d678fa56845d62e2c080e5e8c8927cd09f54fbcaf4e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792083290,\"headline\":\"The Measurement Gap in Agentic AI Is Not a Reporting Problem. It Is the ROI Barrier.\",\"id\":142920472,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The deployment bill for agentic AI is not a single invoice. It is a stack of costs that most enterprises cannot see, let alone measure. According to a CIO.com synthesis of vendor TCO research, AI service bills account for roughly 30 percent of total cost. The remaining 70 percent is the hidden AI stack: infrastructure, […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=80a3916819226e739cbd1742d0dcfd9a77d2f2992c59ebce115cf1c36aac7992\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792082700,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave, International Paper, Dell, FMC, Bloom Energy, Rocket Lab, and More Stocks That Explain Today’s Market\",\"id\":142921333,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave shares fall as concerns continue to mount about the company’s debt.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9a4469d4ebbd49905fa089eaa777fa273303692dee565fb036ca7651edcb4e7f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792082413,\"headline\":\"These dow jones stocks are moving in today's session\",\"id\":142919827,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay updated with the movements of the dow jones index in the middle of the day on Thursday. Discover which stocks are leading as top gainers and losers in today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=18dc9eae377f70c9060ce92d31795980c6c5b9529453a1aa557a7ac15259d50c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792077181,\"headline\":\"Is ZoomInfo (GTM) Quietly Evolving Into Essential AI Sales Infrastructure Inside Enterprise Workflows?\",\"id\":142919350,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the past two weeks, ZoomInfo confirmed its data powers Salesforce’s new outbound agent Hunter, launched AI Agent Teams in GTM Studio, expanded GTM.AI with its Workbounce acquisition, and rolled out native integrations with ClickUp and n8n that stream live go-to-market intelligence into customer workflows. Taken together, these moves push ZoomInfo further into the role of underlying AI sales infrastructure, embedding its go-to-market graph and agent orchestration directly inside widely...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=167135513ff9e9855337d8c4798600e0f6e4790e0a247eb4b68cf37cdea532f3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792074112,\"headline\":\"Why Is Salesforce Stock Gaining Thursday?\",\"id\":142946676,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Salesforce.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce Inc. (NYSE: CRM) stock climbs amid enterprise software strength, bullish technical setup, and major UK deal.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=719a6c1c85219e1b8378d818734a36c8eca7ee3bd1d74fddbf727a85283edfcf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792073604,\"headline\":\"Salesforce (CRM): AI Integration Enhances Core Enterprise Software Platform Value\",\"id\":142919349,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Harris Oakmark recently released its third-quarter 2026 investor letter for the “Oakmark Fund”. The objective of the fund is to deliver capital appreciation by investing in a diverse set of large-cap US companies. The letter can be downloaded here. The Fund (Investor Class) outperformed the S\\u0026P 500 Index for the quarter, driven by strong gains in […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=577bcb621142aa77232bcebc9dd4ec16f644a63cab46d8c41c5f058bc02f9ec7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792069200,\"headline\":\"Demandbase Named Flagship Data Partner for Hunter, Salesforce’s New Outbound Sales Agent\",\"id\":142916470,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SAN FRANCISCO, October 15, 2026--Demandbase, the AI GTM leader defining the next era of agentic marketing, today announced that it has been named a launch partner for Salesforce’s Hunter, a new AI-powered outbound sales agent. This announcement builds on Demandbase’s broader work with Salesforce to bring its account intelligence into AI-powered revenue workflows. Demandbase is also a featured MCP partner on AgentExchange, enabling Salesforce agents to access Demandbase insights within the enviro\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d6c9581fab4805f840a8f61412392bfafe76ef1d959e969e70f8cc216a633fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792067400,\"headline\":\"ZoomInfo Named a Flagship Data Partner for Hunter, Salesforce's New Outbound Sales Agent\",\"id\":142914111,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"VANCOUVER, Wash., October 15, 2026--ZoomInfo (NASDAQ: GTM), the all-in-one AI GTM platform, has confirmed it is one of the flagship data partners for Hunter, Salesforce's new outbound sales agent built for Sales Cloud. Hunter combines a seller's CRM and sales context with live ZoomInfo intelligence to prioritize accounts, identify relevant prospects, and inform next actions inside the workflow sellers already use.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c849df013e915f2c06d14f580342b8f39733282f5a58a8b3446974a4dff45a5e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792066107,\"headline\":\"2 of Wall Street’s Favorite Stocks Worth Your Attention and 1 We Ignore\",\"id\":142914528,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street is overwhelmingly bullish on the stocks in this article, with price targets suggesting significant upside potential. However, it’s worth remembering that analysts rarely issue sell ratings, partly because their firms often seek other business from the same companies they cover.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7e5c9773b44ccd719cb54d09dda6f31aa7572fb1486075b2bca3db74e70f6417\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792063252,\"headline\":\"Salesforce Inks 15-Year, £2B Agreement With HM Revenue \\u0026 Customs To Upgrade Its Services For U.K. Tax Payers\",\"id\":142946677,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.salesforce.com/uk/news/press-releases/2026/10/15/salesforce-selected-by-hmrc-to-modernise-tax-services-for-uk-citizens-and-businesses/\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=49dafffd2d78d79665fb1bda0b1cee84ae0a5c09d14e991dc42b3de0c1b879cd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062540,\"headline\":\"Klient Launches Klient Insights: Live PSA Dashboards Inside Salesforce\",\"id\":142912545,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Klient today launched Klient Insights, a dashboard workspace built into Klient PSA, the Salesforce PSA for professional-services firms. Klient Insights puts margin, capacity, unbilled time and client health on one live screen, inside Salesforce, with no export and no spreadsheet.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eb8e481f1717d9fb361acbe0184d88ef17fb1ba4a5a74a7e3fbceb0e437e61dd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792061047,\"headline\":\"Markets News, Oct. 15, 2026: Dow Ends Up 550 Points as Investors Rotate Out of Tech Stocks; Wholesale Prices Top Expectations\",\"id\":142922318,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Major U.S. stock indexes closed higher Thursday, led by the blue-chip Dow Jones Industrial Average, as investors rotated out of tech stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=39c7f8b9d44a654c2e13f26ce8998f03eccba9333819addcac44223c0f346322\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792045881,\"headline\":\"Salesforce vs. ServiceNow: Here's What Revenue Trends Tell Investors About These Software Giants and Their Move to AI\",\"id\":142902368,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce commands roughly 2.8x the quarterly revenue, but ServiceNow has grown its top line faster over the past two years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=16797728368862c64f33789b46ecf5167b125231f319d827892c8bbe1335aba2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792045433,\"headline\":\"Is DocuSign (DOCU) Undervalued Following Its Expanded Salesforce Partnership?\",\"id\":142903660,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"DocuSign (DOCU) just reset the conversation around its stock with an expanded Salesforce partnership that embeds its Intelligent Agreement Management platform directly into Salesforce, Agentforce, and Slack, tying agreements tightly to AI driven enterprise workflows. For DocuSign, that Salesforce news is landing on top of a strong run in the stock, with a 1-day share price return of 4.04%, a 7-day move of 9.19%, and a 90-day gain of 40.93% pointing to building momentum. The latest share price...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=569ddb6294b772166cb9078031eabcc080cf9aaf891321c0a2fcccb65a283330\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792030618,\"headline\":\"DocuSign (DOCU) Stock Could Be Above Fair Value On New IAM Launch\",\"id\":142896556,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"DocuSign has delivered a 3 year return that would have materially changed the experience for long term shareholders, yet the real story for anyone looking at the stock today is whether its current price around US$75 is supported by the earnings behind the business. With new product launches and fresh partnerships in play, the question now is how much of that activity is already captured in the valuation. The share price has gained 80.6% over the past 3 years, which puts real pressure on...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=11681aaacd45666ff905d0a9a0e161fa75313d80cf3189012b6c8b27b033c7ca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792029137,\"headline\":\"Why Is Everyone Ignoring Zoom Stock's High Cash Yield?\",\"id\":142896510,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the last twelve months, Zoom Communications (ZM) generated free cash flow equal to 6.7% of its market value. The median S\\u0026P 500 company sits at 4.4%. A yield that high means one of two things: a heavily discounted business or a company the market expects to shrink. So why are investors paying so little for Zoom's cash.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4b35211b634c7acc9c12cc2bd291c8e8600f923cd94d7f999b55d858ae279399\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792016220,\"headline\":\"Exalate launches Australian hosting for Exalate Cloud, giving organisations the option to run integrations in-country\",\"id\":142889323,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Local hosting on Google Cloud in Sydney is available now, across every Exalate connector.ANTWERP, Belgium, Oct. 15, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Exalate, the integration solution for synchronising work across Jira, ServiceNow, Azure DevOps, Salesforce, Freshdesk and other platforms, announced Australian hosting for Exalate Cloud. Companies in Australia can now run their integrations on Google Cloud infrastructure in Sydney, with all Exalate connectors supported. For many Australian businesses, parti\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f8978bdcf8e3c25881b01850b5895b5b70a798a7f447119d94a6b7a3fa99ed64\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792014454,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk takes aim at the customer service industry\",\"id\":142888466,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The rollout targets an industry already cutting thousands of support roles.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5ff6f80d44795269f9a4fc0d9960ad6ec5cc2d8feb2637b80c61b757cc43f1a9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792012366,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today, Oct. 14: Oracle Tumbles on Hotter CPI Data Lifting Treasury Yields\",\"id\":142888449,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Today, Oct. 14, 2026, hotter-than-expected inflation data revived rate-hike bets, pressuring the enterprise software giant alongside lingering AI cloud expansion concerns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f9a52c478fc8d81991719f1c120d8597e5bc6a2991b749bdc134870a2a92ae22\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792004437,\"headline\":\"Palantir Is Up 16% in a Month but It’s Falling Today: Take Profits, or Buy More?\",\"id\":142887450,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Palantir has outpaced every major software peer over the past month, and a sudden pullback is forcing investors to make a call that depends entirely on what is driving the stock higher in the first place.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6cfe77f903eb9f3975b3aa3eb8062e787cb7dd96b13ebc2cea4f0135cb67d93d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791999057,\"headline\":\"Salesforce vs. Palantir Technologies: Which Technology Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142886469,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce trades at 13.7x forward earnings with $14.4B in free cash flow, while Palantir commands a 130.8x multiple on 56% revenue growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=544f5ad5536dbc2297c615d80d46068d941f08f3ca7aaf8de52aa90520cf320b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791996319,\"headline\":\"Adobe (ADBE) vs. ADSK and CRM: Can Firefly and GenStudio Turn AI Into Sustained Growth?\",\"id\":142886549,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Is ADBE a good stock to buy? We came across a bullish thesis on Adobe Inc. on Astute Optics – US’s Substack. In this article, we will summarize the bulls’ thesis on ADBE. The thesis was published on September 11th when the stock was trading at $252.23. ADBE corrected 7.71% since then. The decline appears to reflect […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fc9aaffd49703bf81dd4a88a6613e68f1f97113e79540ae05b850e0e1b0940a2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791989154,\"headline\":\"Agentic AI Skepticism: Apple and Salesforce Face a Common Issue\",\"id\":142885089,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple and Salesforce both crushed earnings estimates, but investors keep asking the same uncomfortable question about whether agentic AI can actually move the needle on profit. The answer depends on a holiday iPhone cycle and a stubborn Salesforce upgrade gap that neither company has fully solved.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eddde38745b573dc82d6244449870335d979d0f2f218efbd845bb633cc8df711\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791988259,\"headline\":\"Palantir’s AI Opportunity Could Be Bigger Than Investors Think\",\"id\":142885182,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Palantir just posted revenue growth that left Wall Street estimates in the dust, yet the valuation debate raging around the stock suggests the real story is only beginning to take shape.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2db0ac2d17e4b9c668472c454c0ad65a847f2010f49fc1b9e3e4f5d6d7de99f5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791985800,\"headline\":\"Salesforce vs. ServiceNow: Which AI Software Stock Has the Edge?\",\"id\":142885288,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CRM and NOW expand their AI businesses, but stronger earnings estimate revisions, rapid AI growth and a lower valuation give Salesforce the edge.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1e4e1601b58a8976d4204d576553cbf65d4622e4183486d14f0a13c566af17d7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791982800,\"headline\":\"Duvo Raises $32 Million Series A to Become the One Platform Enterprises Run Their Operations On\",\"id\":142882764,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Duvo today announced a $32 million Series A led by Balderton Capital, with participation from existing investors Index Ventures, Northzone and Credo Ventures. The round brings Duvo's total funding to $48 million and will fund its expansion, starting with retailers and CPG companies. Two executives lead the expansion. Michael Green joins from Databricks as Chief Commercial Officer. He previously served as a Senior Vice President at Salesforce. Spencer Insolia recently joined as Managing Director,\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b3cf9648ff80ccac12e1a4f20bd8f2f1e7a7c2bffd05632de9219e61700ad53f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791979587,\"headline\":\"AI Trade Rotation: Software and Cloud Stocks Outpace Chipmakers Ahead of Nvidia Earnings\",\"id\":142881949,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/ai_theme_747dfce439.webp\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"AI stocks are rotating, not retreating. Software and cloud names lead while chip giants cool. See key valuations, growth, and risks across Nvidia, Palantir, and more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d7f3da997e09184ffeb64870a1ae539dcb9a965e65271c2358d573922cddcc42\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791975861,\"headline\":\"Docusign embeds agreement platform directly into Salesforce\",\"id\":142881759,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Docusign’s IAM platform will be embedded within Salesforce apps, aiming to simplify agreement workflows for sales teams.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7354708d337c387dc36429e938bbd408e2ac484c318d1eb19456f6f31a339c99\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791975286,\"headline\":\"What's Going On With Docusign Stock Wednesday?\",\"id\":142884760,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Portland--Or--Usa---Sep-3--2024-Docusign.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Docusign (DOCU) stock jumped 2%+, approaching its $75 52-week high despite broader tech declines. Expanded Salesforce deal boosts momentum.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6489999f095eb93cc37fc418791febd88dee03c3367fcd1737f37d23706ff98f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791966080,\"headline\":\"This Albemarle Analyst Turns Bullish; Here Are Top 4 Upgrades For Wednesday\",\"id\":142882496,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Albemarle-Stuttgart--Germany---06-12-202.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Analysts upgraded ALB, LQDA, WY, RAL, setting or revising price targets to $130, $70, $25, $88.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dd68fa40f141917b4293d5afa967622dd9bb0d294f4e68ae4237b3f209595d4a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791948000,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Industrial Average Monitor Update - A Look At 30 U.S. Large-Caps\",\"id\":142869843,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1196086989/image_1196086989.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Visible Alpha consensus expects the Dow Jones Industrial Average to deliver an 18.7% weighted price return in the medium term. Read more here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=310ef25895cc39730bc02d53261c2e29cfcc1b7eb4f0498474d0e9c56b8614e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791946800,\"headline\":\"Rotation Away From AI Lately\",\"id\":142869036,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2258806445/image_2258806445.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"There's been a big divergence between large caps and small caps lately.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=163e2d3002b77bf45cc2b11b0d0cea2616186f17f76a7f3662022b311546fe52\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791927880,\"headline\":\"ServiceNow: I'm Buying Ahead Of Q3 Despite Premium Valuation\",\"id\":142860401,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2175204764/image_2175204764.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"ServiceNow (NOW) rated Strong Buy: Flow AI service desk and Q3 growth/margin guidance support the thesis. Read here for a detailed analysis.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=efa2a3db0fbcbba4b2498b5f56dfa9a61ef00d032e35c034b945aeb0119cdd37\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791925390,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Dow Rallies On Bank Results; Micron, Sandisk, SK Hynix Sell Off (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142848534,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Tuesday as JPMorgan and Goldman report earnings. Micron, Sandisk and SK Hynix sell off.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d0ee787dfc6275f3170cb3f896417fe01932316ae6b58e14e38a15871ad5481\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791923368,\"headline\":\"What Is Adobe No Longer Telling You?\",\"id\":142854340,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Adobe (ADBE) stock is priced at 12.9 times earnings, compared to a 21.9 multiple for the S\\u0026P 500. Yet even at that valuation, investors need to understand exactly what they hold as corporate priorities shift. Just a year ago, executives highlighted how much of the company's subscription revenue was influenced by AI. They no longer emphasize that measure. So what does Adobe point to now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eeb6f4dde5f6817b278bc483feb73404e64ec1d7408c6466c4f0a1540a54379e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791919072,\"headline\":\"What Would It Take For Salesforce Stock To Move Higher?\",\"id\":142853382,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce (CRM) stock has lost 3.8% over the past twelve months, trailing the 17.3% return of the S\\u0026P 500. Executives say their job with artificial intelligence is to deliver new value to customers. During the fiscal Q2 2027 earnings call on August 26, 2026, management described an upgrade that most of its users have not made yet.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3dacdfe782bca306fed6c64e79d6862be0f4b2c18a72a2dc6c487e206d96ccc9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791918616,\"headline\":\"Explore the top gainers and losers within the dow jones index in today's session.\",\"id\":142853114,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Uncover the latest developments among dow jones stocks in today's session. Stay tuned to the dow jones index's top gainers and losers on Tuesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=239f1ec0bd6003c75b83346777ebb77ec584c75f68f4c78fd3f43f5a7e2d2574\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791918312,\"headline\":\"SoundHound AI Just Dropped 22% in a Month While Enterprise Software Rallied: Is It Time to Sell?\",\"id\":142853540,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Enterprise software stocks climbed while SoundHound shares collapsed, a split that points to something specific happening inside this company rather than across the sector. The real question is whether that something is temporary or a sign of deeper trouble ahead.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=458d007c54535c5d7762755f5282bba47f6c169797375da954ac73a3d321b60e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791912600,\"headline\":\"Bank of America Warns of Growing Market Risks — Here Are 2 Stocks It Still Likes\",\"id\":142852475,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The bull market has continued its impressive run, but Bank of America is warning investors that the road ahead could become considerably more difficult. While corporate earnings remain strong and AI spending continues to support growth, the bank sees mounting risks that could make it harder for stocks to maintain their upward momentum. And with expectations already running high, even strong earnings results might not be enough to keep investors happy. Heading into the third-quarter earnings seas\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1e9cd1bc1bd9b290d96b571825c54fc7750bbd545239f4e139d7f741e8ce451c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791910744,\"headline\":\"Q2 Earnings Highs And Lows: Salesforce (NYSE:CRM) Vs The Rest Of The Sales Software Stocks\",\"id\":142852521,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Looking back on sales software stocks’ Q2 earnings, we examine this quarter’s best and worst performers, including Salesforce (NYSE:CRM) and its peers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=38c41fd3e89a71c1ae48cfa4d9acdb52b62df6043e1e6e174c7050832690cb99\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791909732,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Nasdaq-100, Small Caps Lead Dip; Apple Retakes Entry, Meta Near Pivot Point (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142852346,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Tuesday as JPMorgan and Goldman report earnings. Micron, Sandisk and SK Hynix sell off.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=71f4482e777541ac9de4b34e7bed4a040fe0ba601df0cf1a5e17fc04358b6031\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791909615,\"headline\":\"Discover which dow jones stocks are making waves on Tuesday.\",\"id\":142851845,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Curious about the dow jones stocks that are in motion on Tuesday? Join us as we explore the top movers within the dow jones index during today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=40d2c5297662fe6576264f21cdd4db7fc189e73028158a4128a0960d9c568eed\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791909407,\"headline\":\"Dan Ives Says AI Stock Selloff ‘Opportunity to Own the Winners’: Here Are 7 Companies He Named\",\"id\":142882338,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/13/Saas-Software-As-A-Service-Concept-With-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"In a recent interview, Dan Ives names seven stocks for investors to consider buying with the market pulling back.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0ecdcb49dff585a6c57a61c7e7b3d8e6fb71035937218b713020f7ae9a52fcb0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791906484,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Dow's Losses Start To Multiply; Meta Approaches New Entry (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142851058,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Tuesday as JPMorgan and Goldman report earnings. Micron, Sandisk and SK Hynix sell off.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=86053c9cc156f0e9c968ed50a5151d32f30ed539f8d83b68c4ac690df716c5d8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791903646,\"headline\":\"Prediction: ServiceNow Could Be Building Its Next Billion-Dollar Growth Engine\",\"id\":142851192,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ServiceNow's AI business just crossed a milestone that has analysts arguing over whether the stock's recent selloff is a gift or a warning sign. The answer depends on one number management has promised to hit before year-end.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ca5e14000927113f0a179012e33d5af7e6b1a51e044724cbc933c7766afd2b5e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791903600,\"headline\":\"Docusign and Salesforce Launch Intelligent Agreement Management Natively Across Salesforce to Power Agentic Agreement Workflows\",\"id\":142851306,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Docusign (Nasdaq: DOCU) today announced the next chapter in its more than 20-year partnership with Salesforce (NYSE: CRM). The expanded partnership brings the Docusign Intelligent Agreement Management (IAM) platform natively into Salesforce, Agentforce, and Slack, helping revenue teams move agreements forward without ever leaving the tools they already work in.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=92296c1837452263a6c03533f3032aa5ff1ecbaa937090f79b1053386ac53eca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791902040,\"headline\":\"Salesforce’s biggest risk now is customers who never log in\",\"id\":142851307,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI assistants like Claude are becoming the front door to work software. That shift may hurt Salesforce less than investors fear.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d30aac4f8bfae752f8b54c7fb92b20219dc1c202a669dcff049b7ac51b6a5898\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791898200,\"headline\":\"Argano Advances Salesforce and AI Capabilities with Acquisition of Oktana\",\"id\":142848838,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PLANO, Texas, October 13, 2026--Argano, the world’s first and largest Global Specialist Consultancy exclusively focused on the design and delivery of High-Performance Business Operations with an AI-forward approach to transformation, today announced the acquisition of Oktana Corporation (\\\"Oktana\\\"), a Salesforce Summit Partner specializing in Data \\u0026 AI and digital engineering. Oktana’s expertise across Salesforce Agentforce, Data Cloud, Snowflake, MuleSoft, and the broader Salesforce ecosystem wi\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=95080fa9b9e62bb25179db982b26ffaffd1bab7315f75554ecc52e8bf797874f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791896400,\"headline\":\"FUNDINGO Recognized in Salesforce 2027 Partner of the Year Awards\",\"id\":142848840,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"FUNDINGO announced that it has been named a recipient of the Salesforce Partner of the Year Award in System of Work (Customer 360) for helping Lyon Financial transform its lending operations through a connected, Salesforce-native platform. Lyon Financial, a specialty consumer finance company that helps homeowners finance swimming pools and home improvement projects through its lending partners, cut the time from final approval to funding by 74%, from 54 days to 14 days, while maintaining delinqu\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d65a9b118c63f3eb2d6ad107171e19aceeb619a9de6ffbd6d0475f90948959bd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791896400,\"headline\":\"Blackthorn launches Forge, ending the choice between Salesforce-native and easy-to-use event technology\",\"id\":142848839,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Blackthorn, the leading event management platform built natively on Salesforce, today announced the general availability of Forge: a single workspace where event teams can build and run events end-to-end, from setup and registration to attendee management, budget, and reporting. The announcement lands on the opening day of IMEX America in Las Vegas, where Blackthorn is running live Forge demos at its booth all week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9f316bbb9afc102e21aff98845a226cff83124346fd7353ddfec84ccdd63e815\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791890115,\"headline\":\"AI Cannibalization Is Hitting Salesforce and Adobe In Very Different Ways\",\"id\":142847549,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Both Adobe and Salesforce beat earnings and both call AI a growth engine, yet one stock has shed nearly a third of its value this year while the other holds up. The reason comes down to where AI feeds on each company versus where it has to rely on them.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=58c4f1ca5bf2b5204195ac6294dbdf9e2b6bc3d5c59246ea79d30a04be451ff1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791889463,\"headline\":\"Docusign Expands Salesforce Partnership, Making IAM Platform Natively Available To All AI Agents Across Salesforce And Slack\",\"id\":142850828,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Docusign (NASDAQ:DOCU) today announced the next chapter in its more than 20-year partnership with Salesforce (NYSE:CRM). The expanded partnership brings the Docusign Intelligent Agreement Management (IAM) platform\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3967a71d2f638ebe2e19a8cd20a7970d3891de66925fc8ccabd3e00732599be4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791889200,\"headline\":\"Appficiency Announces Strategic Growth Investment in RedPoint Solutions\",\"id\":142847538,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"TORONTO, October 13, 2026--Appficiency Inc. (\\\"Appficiency\\\"), a global IT consulting firm and software business delivering enterprise digital transformation services, today announced a strategic growth investment in RedPoint Solutions (\\\"RedPoint\\\"), a technology consulting firm specializing in Salesforce, integration and Field Service solutions for the construction, manufacturing, transportation \\u0026 logistics, and energy industries.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=086740652fb1ce7a1edb248dc58fabec15e521b2b4387776ec5019202f305851\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791887050,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Micron, Sandisk Fall on China Memory News\",\"id\":142844688,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/THUMBNAILS_CHARTMILL_1000_528_18_4dd6380574.webp\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Chart