source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Monday amid Trump's \\\"energy ceasefire.\\\" Salesforce stock jumps on an upgrade.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=02a91d8d57413bac153f2c177c76254d91962690701203993415ffdd01dedf4f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791812522,\"headline\":\"Tech slumps as oil prices rise, focus turns to earnings season kickoff: AlphaCheck\",\"id\":142819797,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Stocks were little changed on Monday ahead of a big earnings week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=da93845afd3b4bf11846e0e74f24619b7acfd2d2516cd5d52ffd7d3f8a522f5b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791812513,\"headline\":\"Spotify upgraded, Alibaba initiated: Wall Street's top analyst calls\",\"id\":139933529,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Spotify upgraded, Alibaba initiated: Wall Street's top analyst calls\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3f89e8879d586e5cd629005d198da398df5b90ad7a78af13079c92adb0c779d5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791812101,\"headline\":\"Salesforce vs. ServiceNow: Which Technology Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142820045,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce's 18% net margin and fortress balance sheet contrast sharply with ServiceNow's 21% revenue growth and AI-driven momentum, a classic growth-versus-value showdown.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=96d4d08d0fbf191a28f57bf6c5ea41875ee51c785d685e1f90e1f1214d6f6cec\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791812015,\"headline\":\"Salesforce Advances 3% on Bank of America Double Upgrade to Buy With $285 Target; ServiceNow Climbs 3%, Palantir Holds Steady\",\"id\":142819934,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America just flipped its Salesforce call from Underperform to Buy in a single move, arguing the AI threat that spooked investors was overblown. Whether the upgrade holds up depends on one quarter that could prove or bury the whole thesis.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a258d7684a16d146f726c3422d6110584e763e61f4a30988757bee7b2ebe0156\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791811967,\"headline\":\"CRM Stock Gains After Salesforce Acquires AI Startup Loops, BofA Double Upgrade\",\"id\":142820047,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BofA analyst Tal Liani upgraded Salesforce to ‘Buy’ from ‘Underperform’, and lifted the price target to $285 from $160.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=24e49343cbc230f90b6562db3f7e442c57970778796bbb86b522c0255d56ea39\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791810738,\"headline\":\"What Does Salesforce (CRM) Agent Allowlist Mean For AI Commerce Control?\",\"id\":142820048,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce (NYSE:CRM) introduced an Agent Allowlist in its Winter '27 CRM release to control AI agent access to commerce APIs. The launch adds native agent skills, plug-in support, and cloud-based agent connections for AI-assisted customer and shopping journeys. Salesforce now tracks agent-driven shopping behavior and outcomes inside its CRM stack to quantify AI agent impact on commerce. The new Agent Allowlist and AI skills framework only captures part of how this Winter '27 update could...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b48fe261549593242a93005a6d0340c7a2732c88cc66b1bfa4bd72588c2f7ba1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791810000,\"headline\":\"Ciena Appoints Monika Fahlbusch as Chief People Officer\",\"id\":142820054,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"FULTON, Md., October 12, 2026--Ciena Corporation (NYSE: CIEN) today announced the appointment of Monika Fahlbusch as Executive Vice President and Chief People Officer, effective today. She will report to President and CEO Gary Smith and lead the company’s global People \\u0026 Culture organization.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8aa98c3f80531f840ae9bc0e7d84229303035238e3436f6feec25a4ac190b1ba\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791809940,\"headline\":\"Salesforce Stock Is Double-Upgraded to Buy. The AI Overhang Is Over, Say Analysts.\",\"id\":142820049,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce stock rises as Bank of America double upgrades the software stock with AI disruption unlikely to occur.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4aae0d893e8f64207e34dff4463f77657dbad63977ae6339de9885ca30dc4701\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791809115,\"headline\":\"Salesforce at $229: One Of The Most Unpredictable AI Plays There Is\",\"id\":142820050,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce just delivered a massive earnings beat, sent analyst targets soaring, and still managed to lose ground against the broader market. Something about the AI story is not adding up, and the next two quarters will force a reckoning.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5d8b339b4577e3892fb6e1c7c9fb26cc82eaee6812a2520767ad003dd342baeb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791808790,\"headline\":\"BofA double upgrades Salesforce to Buy on AI strategy\",\"id\":142820051,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Bank of America double-upgraded Salesforce to Buy from Underperform on Monday and raised its price target to $285 from $160, about 24% above the current price of $229.13.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6cffacba4a19648ceeeb32588783d1ee31a7b10c847faacb03a47ca2402c61db\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791808501,\"headline\":\"Stay updated with the S\\u0026P500 stocks that are on the move in today's pre-market session.\",\"id\":142819368,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Premarket_Movers_Small_free_90289f6b81.webp\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Get insights into the top gainers and losers in the S\\u0026P500 index of Monday's pre-market session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=07790595272c5552eeb9761d5fde2990c182b228c2dfe7de944815e11443ca2d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791807288,\"headline\":\"Here Are Monday’s Top Wall Street Analyst Research Calls: Adobe, Biogen, First Solar, GoDaddy, Hubspot, Palantir Technologies, Robinhood Markets, Snowflake, TeraWulf, T-Mobile US and More\",\"id\":142819942,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Big banks kick off third-quarter earnings season tomorrow, and Wall Street analysts are already reshuffling their bets with a wave of surprise upgrades, downgrades, and fresh initiations across some of the market's most closely watched names.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=07f905e4227277833637cc9692fb32fd055a9623d4c589916ec427d9029892db\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791805228,\"headline\":\"Salesforce Gets Rare Double Upgrade From Bank of America: ‘AI Should Deepen Dependence,’ Analyst Says\",\"id\":142850738,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/Salesforce-Inc.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America double-upgrades Salesforce stock to Buy with a $285 price target, saying AI should deepen reliance on its platform.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=311df7bcc3983c332b7c0f5b3721617de7e5ca2556ab19ead5c92a39141e540d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791804810,\"headline\":\"Salesforce Just Turned the Agent Allowlist Into a CRM Product\",\"id\":142818926,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"For months, the merchant-side gate in agentic commerce was a line in a robots.txt file. Shopify blocked AI crawlers from its checkout and cart paths, Amazon blocked Meta’s Muse agent outright, and the control merchants had over agent traffic was reactive and blunt: the picture mapped in The Fragmenting Gate. Salesforce’s Winter ’27 announcement, dated […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=54a19565c2ac70a5de2a1b859e88466eddbda6abac3b22575f935acb9e23b223\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791803705,\"headline\":\"Adobe Keeps Cratering: One Wall Street Pro’s Thesis Projects 50% Gains in the Next Year\",\"id\":142818461,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Adobe keeps beating earnings estimates and raising guidance, yet the stock has cratered 30% this year while peers held up far better. One Bernstein analyst sees a massive mispricing that the rest of Wall Street is not ready to believe.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e2cc0548e64cbce5755a79f0946e618bb34b40b3f39e3104f58541988ce43f63\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791802883,\"headline\":\"Salesforce Climbs Amid Bank Of America Upgrade To Buy On Improved AI Trends\",\"id\":142818462,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce stock climbed amid Bank of America's double upgrade based on improving trends for the monetization of artificial intelligence products.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2ed7f2bd52f0db17e4c45c91af3f40634cdd1b9d2e0721e1253f435e0c5e12f2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791798407,\"headline\":\"ServiceNow Stock Rose 42% Since June 30 While Forward Earnings Rose 4%. Here’s Where It Could Go by 2030\",\"id\":142817289,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for ServiceNow StockCurrent Price: $140. 86Target Price (Mid): ~$302Street Target: ~$147Potential Total Return: ~114%Annualized IRR: ~20% / yearWhat Happened?ServiceNow (NOW:NYSE) closed at $140.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=98d7661bce0fab3f919dd5bc000fa8e7f52ef610b9e3d302745f9fff2f4b870a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791797308,\"headline\":\"Cramer's Mad Dash: Salesforce and Adobe\",\"id\":142822416,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108398229-17918115731791811570-48952711597-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1791811572\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC’s Jim Cramer delivers his daily Mad Dash.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3f86e854977c789616c3af4c925aa43f0a1291ab4f57bba7ac6df9714d6bc36f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791793175,\"headline\":\"Salesforce Agrees To Acquire AI-Powered Analytics Platforms Loops; Financial Terms Undisclosed\",\"id\":142820509,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.salesforce.com/news/stories/salesforce-signs-definitive-agreement-to-acquire-loops/\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ab13a07825f92bc48cb3bb88ccfe9b8511ee253291dd0abf5d1b45267ba96027\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791793164,\"headline\":\"Amazon To $310? Here Are 10 Top Analyst Forecasts For Monday\",\"id\":142819692,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/Kolbaskowo--Poland---May-3--2026-Amazon-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Analysts raised targets for CRBG, MTN, CRM and FSLR, while cutting targets for PVLA, SPOT and AMZN; CRM and FSLR were upgraded.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f389101aa4c1f3ce5a1e056dd6abe2c42740272aa5c798e83d3cd32e7df70d89\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791792607,\"headline\":\"This Salesforce Analyst Turns Bullish; Here Are Top 5 Upgrades For Monday\",\"id\":142819738,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/Salesforce.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Analysts upgraded Hub Group, Hexcel, T-Mobile, First Solar and Salesforce, raising price targets for FSLR and CRM.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=39edf6f87d55a1d594025ef6c69290f0a924c4b9963e13ca9b2fea6bac02c98b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791790494,\"headline\":\"Stocks making the biggest moves premarket: Salesforce, First Solar, Biogen \\u0026 more\",\"id\":142822417,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108353411-1787591101647-gettyimages-2271704570-US_STOCKS.jpeg?v=1791803914\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"These are the stocks posting the largest moves in early trading.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a47529ceee0ab307e354aa282be6ff31574e4c12c718fdc96327ce61026e1cee\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791787234,\"headline\":\"B of A Securities Upgrades Salesforce to Buy, Raises Price Target to $285\",\"id\":142820512,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"B of A Securities  analyst Tal Liani   upgrades Salesforce (NYSE:CRM) from Underperform to Buy and raises the price target from $160 to $285.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=00b268565fabc5c1401c1bb392b30b53b353b3157c2ccdd877f24609ecc4016c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791644737,\"headline\":\"Investor Predicts Anthropic Could Be “the First” $10 Trillion Company. Cue the Amazon + Google Payday\",\"id\":142792835,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysSemiAnalysis founder Dylan Patel said on the Big Technology Podcast that Anthropic could become the first company valued at $10 trillion. Patel puts Anthropic’s inference gross margins at about 75%, in line with Salesforce.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=00b29d357e8dc8444cd964cf863dfef2da6fbc2297da88a442cc145cf2612d50\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791570784,\"headline\":\"Is Adobe Stock Ready For Slower Subscription Growth?\",\"id\":142766225,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Adobe (ADBE) stock has lost 31% over the past twelve months, significantly underperforming the S\\u0026P 500 and its 17.0% return. Investors appear to be worried about slower subscription growth, and the concern is justified. Weaker new subscription sales were a main topic of the question-and-answer session during the company's September 10 call for fiscal Q3 2026. Slower growth could compress the multiple investors are willing to pay for Adobe's earnings. So how close is Adobe to a real slowdown.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d833349bc012a3f34bb740c1f0829ef0af390514946d0f48d04d10df024f11ad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791565848,\"headline\":\"Are You Overpaying For Microsoft Stock Versus Its Rivals?\",\"id\":142765172,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors are paying a premium for Microsoft (MSFT), as the stock currently costs 29 times its earnings. That valuation sits higher than Alphabet, Amazon, or Salesforce, and of the four peers compared here, only Apple costs more. A premium price typically suggests the fastest growth in the group. Yet Alphabet trades at a much cheaper multiple while expanding its sales at a faster rate. So what are you paying the extra for at Microsoft, if not the fastest growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d43f1ddef215c790aa3c296cc12a0c81865a274945ee96b0a16f98327aef0075\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791564011,\"headline\":\"Top dow jones movers in Friday's session\",\"id\":142764645,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Join us in exploring the top gainers and losers within the dow jones index in the middle of the day on Friday as we examine the latest happenings in today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=017ffc0a54b8f782db50580fa23a16d185b394840ad8991564195fa4ddb45199\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791563700,\"headline\":\"Alphabet Introduces Gemini Agent—Can It Trigger a Breakout?\",\"id\":142793622,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Alphabet unveiled its Gemini agent for enterprise AI, prompting a TD Cowen price target hike to $485, as GOOGL trades near $348, still within its multi-month range below its 52-week high.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fd409719c5f572a1aae5eb2bfd6786dd2037bc5aca03f9d1fc9c2b32009c0e0a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791563421,\"headline\":\"The AI SaaSpocalypse was supposed to crush software stocks — but this happened instead\",\"id\":142765180,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Time to put this overused 2026 market slang to bed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0065d42a65a2cd13043c2d702732dbf9190309b104fc92fb2e5412ef93d1c110\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791561892,\"headline\":\"ServiceNow vs. Palantir: Can Faster AI Growth Justify Paying More Than Four Times as Much for Cash Flow?\",\"id\":142765265,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ServiceNow, Inc. (NYSE:NOW) and Palantir Technologies Inc. (NASDAQ:PLTR) sell different routes to enterprise automation. ServiceNow coordinates established workflows; Palantir connects data, decisions and operational actions. They are alternatives for an investor seeking software exposure to AI adoption, even though their products are not interchangeable. October 7 closing prices valued ServiceNow at about 31 times trailing […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=19e794227bb890d16bae2ec401eb303aefa69815ae5c4588bdb420760573a194\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791556740,\"headline\":\"Palantir's Growth Story Gets a Goldman Boost: ETFs to Consider\",\"id\":142763990,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Palantir's rally gains steam as Goldman Sachs turns bullish and Dan Ives names it a top tech pick for 2027. Here we present some ETFs that offer exposure to PLTR.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=35b9fee1783540a4f1fbed3968baabfd5579e45f6e1a5cf8508603e710fefcda\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791555540,\"headline\":\"The SaaSpocalypse is dead: Software stocks make a comeback\",\"id\":142766325,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi declares the so-called \\\"SaaSpocalypse\\\" dead and buried as software stocks stage a comeback. After months of pressure and fears that AI could disrupt the software industry, many beaten-down names have reversed course and rallied since June\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a3fa150f665c3be5b0368fad8a887ed1456408a7329ededa3634ca976e77a20c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791553260,\"headline\":\"Beyond Chips: The 3 Layers Of The AI Value Chain\",\"id\":142765096,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2258999353/image_2258999353.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"For most of this AI cycle, the surprises came from chips. This year, we are seeing more also come from higher up the chain: the model companies, and a new wave of AI applications.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9e2b85f1eed83a8f84bded34028ed16567c80869864ca968b3d0b40a66d370e7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791551643,\"headline\":\"What's Going On With Snap Stock Friday?\",\"id\":142791646,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/New-York-City--Ny--March-2--2017-Snapcha.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Snap stock jumped 7% amid technical momentum and growing AR interest. Explore key support levels, earnings forecasts, and analysis.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5842ff257ba89783389e1faa1cd83c2253ceead238d5d1510b1950544cde41c9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791549002,\"headline\":\"Brokers Suggest Investing in Salesforce (CRM): Read This Before Placing a Bet\",\"id\":142761713,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"According to the average brokerage recommendation (ABR), one should invest in Salesforce (CRM). It is debatable whether this highly sought-after metric is effective because Wall Street analysts' recommendations tend to be overly optimistic. Would it be worth investing in the stock?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=44ceddeb3ae27c06690e8c0b4f4f0e5453ef47964c999b4fa7f7b67311315551\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791549000,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Left Software for Dead: 4 Stocks Institutions Are Buying Back\",\"id\":142790741,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce, CrowdStrike, Palo Alto Networks and Veeva Systems are rebounding as institutions buy software stocks that own the customer data AI now depends on.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=59abac120fd1b405896dd06fb202b0eb1e067d1805f0f6c21897aa2dd6ae8316\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791548702,\"headline\":\"3 Chip and Software Giants Paid Dividends on the Same Day. 1 Hasn’t Raised Its Payout Since 2023.\",\"id\":142761480,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Three chip and software giants sent dividend checks to shareholders on the same day, but their records tell very different stories about which boards are sharing their growth and which are quietly holding out.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9c5c56592986937166ca76a6d9dd3f16f831e1bfcdf61878b397e9ddbea577f6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791547863,\"headline\":\"How Salesforce’s New Missionforce CMO Hire (CRM) Shapes Its Public-Sector AI Ambitions\",\"id\":142761523,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In September 2026, Salesforce appointed Virginia Sharma as chief marketing officer of its Missionforce public sector business, bringing more than 25 years of global technology marketing and sales experience across IBM, LinkedIn, JioSaavn and Google to lead its worldwide government-focused marketing from McLean, Virginia. Her background in scaling public sector cloud adoption and AI-focused campaigns at Google and other large enterprises could strengthen Salesforce’s push to position...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=875aa519caabb73555ebe9a47b6d977f2431dd00cc2722174ebe1fb575cec4bb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791546882,\"headline\":\"Goldman Sachs Upgrades Palantir Stock to Buy on Sovereign AI Demand\",\"id\":142761500,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Palantir StockPrice change for Palantir stock in the last 6 months: 52%$PLTR Stock Price as of Oct. 8: $19952-Week High: $208$PLTR Stock Price Target: $203What Happened?Palantir (PLTR:NASDAQ) rose about 2% on Thursday after Goldman Sachs upgraded the stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c876d1d5cf6091b5a60120b4ae902cbd9f73cfd8fab678f16d97910d7487bc88\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791543040,\"headline\":\"BMO is bullish on this Magnificent 7 stock after enterprise AI agent launch\",\"id\":142758418,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- BMO Capital Markets reiterated an Outperform rating and Top Pick status on a tech giant after it launched an enterprise AI agent, entering what the broker calls \\\"the next frontier of the AI war.\\\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=501ec9ac25fa55433456ea20db6386d2761a45d9271705ddfe650fd0e6a82278\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791539868,\"headline\":\"Google’s New Gemini Agent Works Inside Microsoft 365. Can It Add to Google Cloud’s Growth?\",\"id\":142760273,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Alphabet (GOOGL:NASDAQ) is taking an unusual route into AI agents for work. At its Gemini at Work 2026 event on Thursday, October 8, Google Cloud introduced the Gemini agent, a single agent that plans tasks, connects to business systems, creates content and writes code.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=88d75c3b4b18fbb8e3b318aeb863d38aa5fe14877976c594f844455d8566c3a9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791492304,\"headline\":\"Salesforce (CRM) Advances While Market Declines: Some Information for Investors\",\"id\":142733133,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce (CRM) closed at $227.8 in the latest trading session, marking a +1.44% move from the prior day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c758fe67b347fbc9eec4a0605af380b9c4ddd6aff77ce622c468cf4b0e6fc881\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791487560,\"headline\":\"Google Workspace Gets AI Agents. What It Means for Alphabet Stock.\",\"id\":142732093,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Google’s new Gemini agent can complete tasks across workplace apps, intensifying competition with OpenAI and Microsoft for business customers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=18a6e4f3fd83a2148005016c7c660e9c2e3f004463b2b722b67b304b5f82b05b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791479520,\"headline\":\"Work4Flow Launches 90-Day Program to Accelerate Salesforce-to-ServiceNow CRM Migration\",\"id\":142731090,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Work4Flow today announced a structured 90-day program that moves enterprises from Salesforce to ServiceNow CRM, carrying data and schema with the business logic and customers lifecycles processes that run on them. The program uses agentic intelligence to understand enterprise CRM end to end, assess migration readiness, interpret the intent behind Flows, Apex triggers, validation rules and approvals, rebuild that logic in ServiceNow CRM, and migrate data, relationships and custom objects through\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c5301a70e40f0f6cdf469fdf90924d4393487d3fa42bbdc488dbb6fe86385d08\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791476700,\"headline\":\"NOW is Overvalued at 28.92X P/E: Buy, Sell or Hold the Stock?\",\"id\":142730915,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ServiceNow shares have fallen 24.6% YTD amid AI competition and valuation concerns, but rising AI adoption and cybersecurity expansion support growth prospects.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a9514f596cd2b205a5e16ba0e6d9ce626d296431e2f2ab6b97064a5314e5e479\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791475260,\"headline\":\"Google Escalates the AI Agent Wars With Its New Gemini Agent\",\"id\":142730918,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Google’s new Gemini agent can complete tasks across workplace apps, intensifying competition with OpenAI and Microsoft for business customers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9f047a00a86a3aaeb668fb4c47eebfa780abf6c3d5784a1c1795c400738f7d22\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791468596,\"headline\":\"AI Agents Don't Clock Out, So Cloud Software Keeps Billing\",\"id\":142731436,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2286810723/image_2286810723.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Agentic AI tools are shifting software pricing models from per-seat to consumption-based, increasing billable usage and benefiting certain vendors. Read what investors need to know.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c7832e2dd445d00b3c34ef4a528dc3f06c9719fd0086d071ab085774b958ad88\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791466124,\"headline\":\"Palantir Advances 3% as Goldman Sachs Upgrades to Buy With $230 Target; Salesforce and ServiceNow Hold Steady\",\"id\":142727228,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Goldman Sachs just broke ranks on Palantir with a bold upgrade that draws a sharp line between two kinds of enterprise software, and the market is already picking sides.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bae5dac33524acfd76938a35b6896f8de23f2cc85d2aebf802816883e9eb4a97\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791453600,\"headline\":\"Zenkraft Launches New Multi-Carrier Shipping Commerce App for Salesforce's Storefront Next\",\"id\":142722418,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CHICAGO, October 08, 2026--Zenkraft today announced the launch of Zenkraft Shipping for Agentic Commerce, a new Commerce App available for Salesforce B2C Commerce's Storefront Next. Commerce Apps are the new extensibility framework for B2C Commerce that enable merchants to install plug-and-play third-party apps directly in Business Manager, cutting implementation time and cost. Zenkraft Shipping for Agentic Commerce is available now in the Commerce App Registry, giving merchants a turnkey way to\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aad4ee4432cf772a54e725d32b127e452bda50bc8687c02ce5d7a5ab9d3a2bb8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791431132,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer Has Reservations About One of These Software Comebacks\",\"id\":142708273,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On October 1, Jim Cramer discussed Veeva Systems Inc. (NYSE:VEEV) while reviewing the third-quarter recovery in software stocks. He mentioned that he prefers Salesforce, Inc. (NYSE:CRM), as he said: On the first day of a brand new quarter, October 1, you need a compass. You know what provides you the best compass? What can navigate […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dabcf3eff4d67d254f8fe7ab6eb2f31df0c30c720b5ac4a5c55b36e8516e5dff\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791415469,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy Salesforce Stock For Its Cash?\",\"id\":142701263,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the last twelve months, Salesforce (CRM) generated free cash flow equal to 8.2% of its market value. That figure compares with 4.5% for the median S\\u0026P 500 company. A yield sitting that far above the norm usually points to one of two scenarios. Either the stock is cheap, or investors expect the cash to dwindle. Before sorting out which, what do you actually get as a shareholder from that cash.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9a9885449e1f28a1d44f9fb7f78874375f20e726085814bc247789778aab04e5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791407181,\"headline\":\"Salesforce (CRM) Trails the Market in 2026: What Could Fuel a Re-Rating?\",\"id\":142700434,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce Inc. (NYSE:CRM) is an enterprise software giant that offers an attractive mix of high profitability margins, solid cash flows, and depressed valuation, which are offset by the company’s high leverage and a lagging share price. The stock appears cheap based on its forward earnings, but a re-rating after a bearish run in 2026 rests […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=554224f8cca1acd16aba3dfe00266bed5d087a03da14278a426806f51f0ae5c6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791400214,\"headline\":\"Top dow jones movers in Wednesday's session\",\"id\":142699052,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay updated with the movements of the dow jones index one hour before the close of the markets on Wednesday. Discover which stocks are leading as top gainers and losers in today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=79cbbb6a9394d74f43ed5875e5d2b638c156a24824ea95997addfce18685ce40\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791393121,\"headline\":\"Salesforce (CRM) Names A Launch Partner For Storefront Next\",\"id\":142698464,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce (NYSE:CRM) named fraud prevention specialist Forter a launch partner for its new Storefront Next commerce offering. Forter extended its trust intelligence and fraud protection tools to Salesforce Loyalty Management as part of the collaboration. Salesforce recognized Forter as its 2027 Partner of the Year for Transform \\u0026 Scale, highlighting the joint focus on commerce security. The Forter launch partnership for Storefront Next and Loyalty Management should sit alongside other...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4429b3548b28a33bbeb1420696c471e0a03ec2300adca08a789680ed209d5cf1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791385200,\"headline\":\"OptiSigns Expands Secure TV Dashboard Apps for Power BI, Salesforce, Tableau, Grafana, Databricks and More\",\"id\":142696955,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"OptiSigns, a digital signage company powering more than 200,000 screens worldwide, today announced expanded and enhanced dashboard apps, which now work with Microsoft Power BI, Salesforce, Tableau, Grafana, Databricks and more. Businesses can now show automatically updating live dashboards on TV screens in offices, factories and operations centers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=41c40f73f8551f97c080376ebeacc43a5b5d6e5b94ac3d49ed79258f79f2dd16\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791384420,\"headline\":\"Salesforce Stock Falls 15% YTD: Should Investors Keep