dbdf984acc756da331e92076e6fc53f1d371\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791297022,\"headline\":\"Prediction: This AI Stock Could Be Much Bigger by 2028\",\"id\":142665659,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ServiceNow's AI business is accelerating while its stock sits near a 52-week low, and that disconnect has our model flagging an opportunity most investors are pricing wrong.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=57b8e864f63061cbf8889ef53d4b5807e3be2d3e034eb0652dfb4f88ea9b0f59\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791293722,\"headline\":\"10 Information Technology Stocks Whale Activity In Today’s Session\",\"id\":142694428,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/11/06/aggregated_options_2.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"This whale alert can help traders discover the next big trading opportunities.\\nWhales are entities with large sums of money and we track their transactions here at Benzinga on our options activity scanner.\\nTraders will\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=53ce9b0a0133c52c607a57158b181353260d6c2c2ff91faff9eb1f9666de986b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791292940,\"headline\":\"Salesforce shares sit at the epicenter of AI confusion. Here's how to trade it\",\"id\":142806850,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108363592-1789562853937-gettyimages-2294958190-train0827.jpeg?v=1789668448\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"If ever there was a stock that personified the promise and peril of the AI trade, it's Salesforce.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fe602fff4e8e86b170ea8a79168d3c11259475cbe90fb95944583f9cba2e0d95\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791292928,\"headline\":\"Why a neutral strategy might be the right move for options traders looking to play Salesforce\",\"id\":142698118,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108353412-1787591104242-gettyimages-2274356264-33a6094_esb07_04302026.jpeg?v=1787591265\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Julia Spina of IG U.S. Holdings breaks down a potential options trade for investors looking to play Salesforce.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5bc271c61be4b6dd4db40aa7d7bbf71c9a78f6f1027c2a0c5722bc1b1e0d2ab5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791291600,\"headline\":\"Forter Named Launch Partner for Salesforce's AI-First Storefront Next, Extends Protection to Salesforce Loyalty Management\",\"id\":142663051,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Forter, the Trust Intelligence Platform for the future of commerce, announced it is giving Salesforce merchants more ways to protect revenue and customer trust across commerce, service and loyalty programs. As shoppers increasingly arrive through AI agents, the expanded collaboration extends Forter's built-in trust intelligence from the first order, through the long-term relationship that follows.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9f81012c47ed9b54caca762b0a1b33a1986e0637b998386bc4681107f174053a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791290753,\"headline\":\"ServiceNow Crashed 25% In One Year: Generative AI Will Catalyze 80% Gains According to One Wall Street Guru\",\"id\":142663052,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ServiceNow has shed a quarter of its value while software stocks bleed out across the sector, yet one Wall Street analyst just slapped an outlier target on it that implies an 82% surge from here. The bull case and the bear case could not be further apart.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30461d8397c4ff58b4d7dbe82e93dc97dbd64c76d1d5a1b5ddddcaa4910e323d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791288168,\"headline\":\"How Much Downside Is Left In Adobe Stock?\",\"id\":142662871,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Adobe (ADBE) stock has lost 16.4% over the past month, while the S\\u0026P 500 gained 0.4%. The month included Adobe's fiscal Q3 2026 report on September 10, which MarketWatch said left Wall Street wanting more. For current shareholders, the stock's recent decline reflects an immediate mark-to-market drawdown, and any broader market correction could add further downward pressure. So how hard has Adobe been hit in past sell-offs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4e810fe84e6a7c5b4a040b90980a37dc12d63fd0551402aaf2552c9e96ac884f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791284400,\"headline\":\"Yocale.ai unites software, payments and AI for medspas, salons and spas\",\"id\":142661830,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Most medspas, salons and spas are run by practitioners, from injectors and aestheticians to stylists, who got into the industry to work with clients. As the business grows, so does the admin, and scheduling, intake forms, invoicing and follow-ups start taking time away from them.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=415b167a757122b6908a21078fd864ec998bdc64b8a39a06afc15e81ad0297c6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791280834,\"headline\":\"Here's How Much $100 Invested In Salesforce 20 Years Ago Would Be Worth Today\",\"id\":142663921,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/07/10/valuestock_4.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce (NYSE:CRM) has outperformed the market over the past 20 years by 7.7% on an annualized basis producing an average annual return of 16.79%. Currently, Salesforce has a market capitalization of $187.94 billion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fe8a58c2fe1922d2768a2231e1536b0ae944ffafb24bb8cf1a84dffb2044498a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791273600,\"headline\":\"Rare Stock Picks In September 2026 - From 21 Discerning Analysts\",\"id\":142662208,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/uploads/2026/10/4/saupload_needle_in_haystack.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"In our monthly Rare Stock Picks series, we're highlighting September 2026 investment picks. Click here for the list of September 2026 Buy recommendations.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=17dd429d423e0a7cc54685abed73252a2c704b9d2624f2650c57a37afcd780f1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791272123,\"headline\":\"Think NVIDIA's AI Boom Is Priced In? Analyst Says Wall Street Is Underestimating the Next 6 to 8 Quarters\",\"id\":142663645,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/06/Nvidia-Logo-Displayed-On-A-Smartphone-Sc.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"NVIDIA nears $6T valuation as Dan Ives suggests Wall Street is underestimating growth by up to 30%. Get the latest NVDA breakdown.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2d678c2913dcc85406e42a19b2c64a5d3b0c950ce47f2f59bbf48451c5c3a767\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791263015,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer Says Software Was the Story of Q3. The Numbers Agree\",\"id\":142647431,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce, Inc. (NYSE:CRM) rose 46% over the third quarter, and Microsoft Corporation (NASDAQ:MSFT) rose 37%. Jim Cramer told CNBC on October 1 that the quarter will be remembered as the moment software bounced back while some data center plays gave ground to profit-taking. The accounts behind those two moves say the rally was not sentiment. […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d8c38b68c9401cee7fa4bdbee5dfecc1ff6e5638c8b020206a0bc8d21c97aaa6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791227409,\"headline\":\"Monday's session: top gainers and losers in the dow jones index\",\"id\":142638289,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay informed about the performance of the dow jones index one hour before the close of the markets on Monday. Uncover the top gainers and losers in today's session for valuable insights.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0e88a10f0ad90454a5ff9c1b9d8c6be70f11a0beeaf98797fe4fc38372abaa20\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791224061,\"headline\":\"Are companies truly getting an ROI from their AI budgets?\",\"id\":142668800,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Corporate America has woken up to the reality of how much it costs for AI to boost workplace productivity, but are companies getting an ROI on the solutions they are paying for? Today's Market Hang panel consists of Business Insider Today executive editor Dan DeFrancesco, Futurum chief market strategist Shay Boloor, Sherwood News head of markets Luke Kawa, and former NYSE trader and author Lauren Simmons.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2e1ef2c887d0a9c4b1cf4d7e3ff1553406abfa2fb3f725c216794511a3adc97f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791221434,\"headline\":\"Top Economist Warns AI Could Triple Unemployment Within a Decade — ‘What We Are Living Through…Is Unprecedented’\",\"id\":142638521,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI-driven job disruption is moving faster than any technological shift in history, and Nobel Prize-winning economist Daron Acemoglu warns unemployment could triple within a decade if nothing changes. “What we are living through with AI is unprecedented,” Acemoglu said in...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=82a6b75d918167168def24f15269ecbcb7bf41337729379c3c7103b7ae9bd33b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791218101,\"headline\":\"Which S\\u0026P500 stocks are moving on Monday?\",\"id\":142637485,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Uncover the latest developments among S\\u0026P500 stocks in today's session. Stay tuned to the S\\u0026P500 index's top gainers and losers on Monday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=67961b010b1f3caecc8f221b133dc532a01b4d12e570aa9d8e37f37167ccb5a0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791210031,\"headline\":\"Do You Like Cash? Consider Salesforce Stock\",\"id\":142636715,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce (CRM) stock is 36.2% below its two-year high, set on December 4, 2024. At that price, free cash flow over the last twelve months equals 7.8% of Salesforce's market value, against 4.5% for the median S\\u0026P 500 company. A yield that high means the business is either on sale or expected to shrink. So is Salesforce's cash growing or shrinking.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c2f2794046bd275e5695c2eacd7594602b0feea73c4af7c580dd12d98c3d30f8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791210000,\"headline\":\"Follow the Money: 5 AI Stocks Buying Back Shares by the Billions\",\"id\":142665566,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NVIDIA, Salesforce, Adobe, Qualcomm, and Jabil are backing AI-era investment with reliable share buybacks, supported by strong cash flow and solid balance sheets, as the tech sector shifts toward heavier infrastructure spending.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=54066155e2c5833bf509b946b055cdb3d6baa997e8501d093c855373e9eeb75a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791205200,\"headline\":\"Insight Partners Launches Forward Deployed Practice, Anchored by the Industry's First FDE Advisory Council\",\"id\":142634924,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Insight Partners has launched its Forward Deployed Practice, a dedicated advisory program that helps portfolio companies evaluate whether a Forward Deployed Engineering (FDE) motion is right for them and, for those that are ready, build the strategy to execute it. Anchoring the practice is the FDE Advisory Council, the industry's first council dedicated to Forward Deployed Engineering, whose founding members include senior leaders from Databricks, ServiceNow, Microsoft, SAP, and Salesforce.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a7789f429f76d45a757e1feac8b30650acb208ef25f885c6e393f86dea98af33\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791201608,\"headline\":\"Here is What to Know Beyond Why Salesforce, Inc. (CRM) is a Trending Stock\",\"id\":142635145,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Zacks.com users have recently been watching Salesforce (CRM) quite a bit. Thus, it is worth knowing the facts that could determine the stock's prospects.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=911bd9b0b39c9ef1375de8063303a0e26af7c96bd16dab1e19160f837334856c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791156411,\"headline\":\"Salesforce vs. UiPath: Which AI Automation Stock Gives Investors More for Their Money?\",\"id\":142626169,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UiPath costs about $13 a share. Salesforce costs more than $230. Investors looking for affordable exposure to enterprise AI could easily reach for the wrong shortcut: the smaller share price says nothing about how much cash-generating power they are buying. Salesforce, Inc. (NYSE:CRM) and UiPath, Inc. (NYSE:PATH) approach automation from different starting points. Salesforce can […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d9a484a08a508872f73a94b22d8155b1cca4ea26fc3c59a88e94ac1a760570d0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791086843,\"headline\":\"Salesforce (CRM) Is Buying Back $50 Billion of Stock. What Does That Say About Growth?\",\"id\":142619196,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce, Inc. (NYSE:CRM) authorized a $50 billion share repurchase program in February 2026, then executed half of it within weeks through the largest accelerated share repurchase in corporate history. Buying back stock is what companies do when they have more cash than ideas. A commitment that size, from a company whose entire market value is […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aeb69a4dbf8c7124aabcb1d2dae5dd76445e5335075c04ebcfa69a423ffc0d41\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791081189,\"headline\":\"Roblox (RBLX) Has Lost Two Thirds of Its Value. Is the User Growth Still Real?\",\"id\":142618548,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Roblox Corporation (NYSE:RBLX) closed at $44.12 on October 2, down about two-thirds over twelve months. A fall that steep normally means something broke. Users left, growth stalled, a competitor took the category. None of that happened. Roblox is still adding players and still collecting their money. What the market repriced was not the business but […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=44ee472661ec67589f713737dfddb96b4b45a1b887dbf77e96e85b130d6896a6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790999148,\"headline\":\"Salesforce vs. CrowdStrike: What Revenue Growth Trends for These Software Giants Tell Investors\",\"id\":142600024,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce commands a 7-to-1 revenue advantage, yet CrowdStrike has posted uninterrupted quarter-over-quarter growth while Salesforce stumbled occasionally.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0936fdb58fc27941ba4dc22d2207f768475ac231b3059bf31dfd52008a176e42\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790968216,\"headline\":\"Friday's session: top gainers and losers in the dow jones index\",\"id\":142592463,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Let's have a look at the top dow jones gainers and losers one hour before the close of the markets of today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d3c7a24ec996d4e6f3ea43028242317d0d3e49cd31ec72a434e469e2479a6725\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790962929,\"headline\":\"Walmart and McDonald’s go in very different pricing directions\",\"id\":142591880,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Walmart’s CEO says two customers won’t pay different prices for the same item. McDonald’s hasn’t promised that.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=825dff7b3f71da01c6b70d1f82a56cb31a1682edb7d49158831d6aa313f69b92\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790962248,\"headline\":\"The Adobe Stock Debate Is About to Get Interesting\",\"id\":142591912,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Adobe beat earnings for the fifth straight quarter, yet the stock sits 31% in the hole for the year while a generative AI rival just torched its retail sentiment. Something has to give, and the answer depends on a bet most investors are getting wrong.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b664b7b766b5fef15d5ae97422f713cc32174ccbaa8889babf3e70602a054f2e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790959214,\"headline\":\"What's going on in today's session: dow jones movers\",\"id\":142591361,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Curious about the top performers within the dow jones index in the middle of the day on Friday? Dive into the list of today's session's top gainers and losers for a comprehensive overview.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=95613688eae498627faf1e9092765e34d9fd7c907f05ffb6d9f5ff73e0147392\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790955901,\"headline\":\"Salesforce vs. Palantir: Which AI Software Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142590805,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce's low earnings multiple and heavy cash generation stand against Palantir's far faster growth and much higher valuation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ca5f1498dd9e6e0fe41ea247f0824a8d131e4a55ba16176bcb9837a3c7a2446b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790952542,\"headline\":\"Salesforce vs. CrowdStrike: Which Tech Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142590833,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce commands profitability and a fortress balance sheet, while CrowdStrike trades at a steep valuation despite lingering trust issues from its 2024 outage.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ede0dc907ee9506308902a57eb8942e3e6a1dec5c127c2dbf2df90b5d97f1633\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790939322,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer says software stocks were the story of Q3 2026\",\"id\":142587609,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The iShares Expanded Tech-Software Sector ETF rose 17% in the third quarter, while the iShares Semiconductor ETF fell 11%\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=97d9b3d4aa1407ee7f251de6f52d5f5376e058ca2ae3cc6e91333198db1fff4e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790934834,\"headline\":\"Is Microsoft Stock Paying You Enough For The Swings?\",\"id\":142583997,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"You may hold Microsoft (MSFT) stock, or be about to, after its shares jumped more than a third from July through September. If you also hold funds that follow the market, you feel every Microsoft swing on top of theirs. Did five years of holding Microsoft beat simply owning the S\\u0026P 500 index.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9f49e02e47f528c09320c0328ef16a418480db3fb0a9be7cb4f22dae2912173a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790934300,\"headline\":\"Salesforce Expands AI Bundles: Will Higher Adoption Boost ARR?\",\"id\":142586786,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CRM's expanding AI bundles drive stronger Agentforce adoption and ARR growth, as customers move from trials toward broader AI purchases.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=257fca7301e30e6b705f7be0ced08ce7f8e8c2108595fd60ce4baa797d2c809d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790917627,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer Says Investors Who Bet AI Would Destroy Software Stocks ‘Blew Up’ — Salesforce, Veeva and Palantir Led Q3 Comeback: Stocks to Watch Ahead\",\"id\":142588944,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/02/Jim-Cramer-At-The-Cable-Show-2010-An-Eve.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Enterprise software\\u0026#39;s resurgence was a defining stock market story of the third quarter despite fears of AI negatively impacting their business, according to Jim Cramer.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2f939832588711846e52291728853bfc335697ba1020503bd25cce3b42ae8479\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790899899,\"headline\":\"Salesforce (CRM) Adds Fresh AI Deals, Is The Stock Still A Bargain?\",\"id\":142568826,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Conference spotlight and fresh AI deals put Salesforce stock back in focus Salesforce (CRM) stepped into the spotlight at the 2026 North American Marketing Leadership Summit on September 28, just as a string of AI focused partnerships and an acquisition reshaped the story around its shares. Recent trading paints a mixed picture for Salesforce, with a 1 day share price return of 3.10% to US$236.69 sitting against a 30 day share price decline of 8.30%. At the same time, the 90 day share price...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=12ea4e382e2316fb17dcbdef5effeb2fb910c08ea30f0a1efe55fe4d4dc3fb68\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790894707,\"headline\":\"EPAM, DXC, Everforth, EXL, and Grid Dynamics Stocks Trade Up, What You Need To Know\",\"id\":142563760,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A number of stocks jumped in the afternoon session after Accenture’s stronger-than-expected results and above-consensus fiscal 2027 outlook lifted IT consulting and business-services peers, while IBM separately announced a self-hosted deployment option for IBM Bob aimed at enterprise AI sovereignty and governance. Accenture guided fiscal 2027 revenue growth of 3%–6% after a Q4 revenue beat (~$18.7B), easing fears that AI would hollow out traditional consulting and outsourcing demand and sparking\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4a61948c8c7071895701d9a2e9ee15258fa9dabb22c4f5f99910bdcfe6568c1d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790893747,\"headline\":\"Concentrix, Huron, and TaskUs Shares Skyrocket, What You Need To Know\",\"id\":142563761,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A number of stocks jumped in the afternoon session after Accenture’s stronger-than-expected results and above-consensus fiscal 2027 outlook lifted IT consulting and business-services peers, while IBM separately announced a self-hosted deployment option for IBM Bob aimed at enterprise AI sovereignty and governance. Accenture guided fiscal 2027 revenue growth of 3%–6% after a Q4 revenue beat (~$18.7B), easing fears that AI would hollow out traditional consulting and outsourcing demand and sparking\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=18370b61610030eee0cd0a34ddca30400aec7da87278e73342037e7a7e184e3a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790878681,\"headline\":\"Software roared back last quarter. Cramer says these stocks can keep climbing\",\"id\":142806845,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/107113452-NUP_198430_00216r.jpg?v=1697496575\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Software stocks bounced back from their AI-driven sell-off, while chip stocks cooled after a massive first-half run.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=295211bb59df879f42547d1feaa884d06f887627e49a3eeb7ab3432f18f600c2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790875964,\"headline\":\"Is Adobe Stock A Real Bargain?\",\"id\":142560743,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Adobe (ADBE) stock trades at 13 times its earnings over the last twelve months, against 21.4 for the median S\\u0026P 500 company. The stock has lost 33% in twelve months, while the S\\u0026P 500 returned 16.2%. A price that low can mean investors have turned too gloomy, or that the business is getting weaker. So is Adobe stock a real bargain at this low price.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ec0e16d3f4ab8736c321f92c68e53e0aef41de8544a472460e92792ce1bff695\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790875186,\"headline\":\"Can You Make Money Off Salesforce Stock Now?\",\"id\":142560926,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce (CRM) stock has dropped 13% from its early September high of about $264. You make money from here only if the stock recovers and Salesforce keeps customers paying for Agentforce and Slack. Should you buy Salesforce stock after this drop? To assess that, we have to look at Salesforce's history of dips and how it subsequently recovered.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=01859798ef3e827e8917db0c15e392fc26656077224556ca020d4a00834780c5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790868600,\"headline\":\"Down 50% and Climbing Again: 3 AI Stocks Rebuilding After Brutal Pullbacks\",\"id\":142590797,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Palantir, ServiceNow and AMD each suffered sharp selloffs before rebuilding uptrends, and analyst Marc Chaikin says these reset AI names may offer more upside than stocks already at new highs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cbc49b4785c69834e85900b4069d6762419e21a2a89febf64b796de66be19f0d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790868444,\"headline\":\"How Has Microsoft's Story Changed In A Year?\",\"id\":142559626,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft's management stressed Copilot and AI agents on its fiscal Q4 2026 call. The stock has returned 34% in three months, against 2.5% for the S\\u0026P 500. Microsoft (MSFT) needs fast Azure growth and revenue from Copilot's paid seats to justify that gain. A year ago management led with a different topic, tied to a large part of Microsoft. What was it exactly.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5a5986f25f64b803b9a08fadf94072c7bbf430a64c082281012b1c9c6afb9202\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790867807,\"headline\":\"Which Dates Could Move Microsoft Stock Most?\",\"id\":142559627,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft (MSFT) stock has gained about 34% in three months, and you may wonder whether it can hold that gain. Management expects about $175 billion of capital spending in calendar 2026 and has said the spending may lower operating margins. A few dated events will show whether that spending is paying off. Below are the earnings reports and other dates most likely to move Microsoft stock over the next six months.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1ae3c28c5ec20eeb048befda771504bd5f36e2dcc083d7911189c603e391eef3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790861023,\"headline\":\"IBM Jumps 5% as Bob Coding Agent Gains Self-Hosted Deployment; Salesforce Rises 3%, Palantir Inches Higher\",\"id\":142557758,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"IBM stock surged far ahead of the broader software sector after quietly extending its Bob coding agent into a corner of the market most AI platforms cannot reach. Whether the move signals a lasting repricing or a one-day pop depends on details IBM has not yet disclosed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c73f12d1b8236f045daa64eb17a4e6e06969d9e0dbe728e4141e73235930ff25\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790859600,\"headline\":\"Why ServiceNow built a startup inside itself to take on AI-native rivals\",\"id\":142591913,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CEO Bill McDermott explains how Flow, the company’s new conversational AI service desk, is designed to be faster to deploy—and harder for AI-native challengers to undercut.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=289e310536d8dc0f9ccc1fb83ecff7b09b302b4dbac2b53ac4b25731e76f4917\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790856060,\"headline\":\"AI Will Revolutionize Medicine. This Company Provides the Plumbing.\",\"id\":142557833,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Veeva Systems  is making that transformation happen.  The Pleasanton, Calif.–based company develops software for biotechnology and pharmaceutical customers to manage everything from research and development and regulatory submissions to day-to-day commercial operations.  Its software was originally built atop  Salesforce  but has since expanded to stand-alone applications.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5f66164e6b7523f6b8ea164a46c31767f27fa0d19c4e71aab63a2da13386fb64\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790855240,\"headline\":\"Accenture Earnings Lift Software and IT Services Stocks: Cognizant, IBM, Wipro Rise on Thursday\",\"id\":142588243,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/01/Warsaw--Poland---May-2020-Accenture-Comp.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Accenture\\u0026#39;s Q4 earnings beat estimates on Oct. 1, 2026. See how Cognizant, IBM, Salesforce, ServiceNow, Infosys and Wipro stocks moved.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=524e2696e30c73fdbe7aa9552ead479c9b8df3a3e3d571a1c86b0d5c3f74bdd0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790851858,\"headline\":\"EPAM Systems Initiates $300M Accelerated Share Repurchase Program With Morgan Stanley, Gets Initial 1,703,336 Shares Worth $240M At March 4 Closing Price\",\"id\":139942650,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5bc222bc7dd17458216dd1b52c690b1888f41dd9cc3c6b2a33f691a22b0e8391\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790847840,\"headline\":\"Threekit Launches AI-Native CPQ for Manufacturing: Built for the Web, Built for Dealers, Built for the AI Age\",\"id\":142549215,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CRM\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Threekit today announced the launch of Threekit AI-Native CPQ, a configure-price-quote platform built from the ground up for AI and the way manufacturers and B2B companies sell today.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0b137b67f1a960623c1f969a4e17ce206b749373e17db37aa78c2b72bf2df52e\"}]"
     },
