      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792391363,\"headline\":\"Stocktwits Tech Watch: Netflix And Meta Report Earnings As Nvidia, Oracle Product Events Loom\",\"id\":142994993,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors are bracing for a busy week as Q3 earnings season enters key period.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1274b49925fcbd514117dddc5e4b133bcf658a84a1802f7b4e0a68cd5e6c68f0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792378020,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave, Oracle have an interest rate problem\",\"id\":142992151,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave and Oracle are borrowing billions for AI just as rates rise. See what the interest bills, bond yields and credit ratings reveal about the risk.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c17003935bf1124cabd573194be1f91c91ed2b180d26b06a704951188042e8b6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792374806,\"headline\":\"What Would Stop The AI Selloff\",\"id\":142994131,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f81e56ca69a5fcfaacd77d3a9630d96359897268651205c32cb90015cce769d2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792360102,\"headline\":\"Bonds Already Discounted A 3rd Hike, Stocks Have Followed, Stay Long\",\"id\":142991440,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2298720448/image_2298720448.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Stocks sold off sharply after inflation data and a delayed reaction to Social Security COLA news. Read more on the market here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f639953768fbbd69bdc4fa4baffb34746c56adb4a5f8894e3effe2572f294a4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792339170,\"headline\":\"'Just another scare': Wall Street sees the AI trade strong despite tech's latest rout\",\"id\":142987469,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street still sees more gains for stocks heading into the end of the year.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0a7b9431157c59fa5b5bfac25a9b209924188eda32b58fa542a2c381998cb22a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792333838,\"headline\":\"Oracle (ORCL) Has Fallen 54% and 80% of Analysts Still Say Buy. Why?\",\"id\":142987468,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle Corporation (NYSE:ORCL) closed at $134.47 on October 15. The stock returned -24.60% over the last 6 months, compared with a 15.4% return for the Insider Monkey Billionaire Index and 11.4% for the State Street SPDR S\\u0026P 500 ETF Trust. Oracle sells database software and, increasingly, the computing power that runs other companies’ artificial intelligence work. The second […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4e04df5a1d1f40127070f75dc9475e1ee75fc478ef09c7470d4acd8309ad8903\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792314900,\"headline\":\"2 Covered Call ETFs To Shield Your Income From An AI Crash\",\"id\":142986749,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2153653956/image_2153653956.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Discover how income investors may be unknowingly exposed to the AI trade. Read the full analysis here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=490ecfb77e80f0b6a9fc7e90750ee8ce6a540d8f986965fa546a38279b896807\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792310400,\"headline\":\"The Data Center Doomsday Scenario\",\"id\":142986379,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d733269d580b8f457fbc381c431850ac865267f6f47bd6dfb7175a21c0285369\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792303200,\"headline\":\"AI Investment Impact Understated In U.S. 'It' Market: Texas Reveals\",\"id\":142984221,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/913582626/image_913582626.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Texas leads the AI infrastructure boom with data centers and chips boosting GDP and jobs. Check out this look at the tech sector and its prospects.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=03fd4bc2999d901f5bc2e52183f24910137f24e6e0bdaed3e6c5c60e0fd0eeab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792289703,\"headline\":\"Micron Just Broke Support, So Buy MUU Into Strength\",\"id\":142972298,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9b85bdde1b8bb9591982fea157fcf43892c679cb8645cd86a2d115a5fd5f0fac\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792283885,\"headline\":\"Mark Zuckerberg’s Second Act?\",\"id\":142965251,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta had a big week as Muse continues to be the hottest product in AI. But is this another flash in the pan or a fundamental change in how the world uses technology?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=374c1472c062ceebe544aa24972c758ff477c607044d1b84ca42980b223435e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792281962,\"headline\":\"Prediction: Oracle Stock Trails the S\\u0026P 500 Through 2030\",\"id\":142964863,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The cloud giant's stock looks cheap on earnings. So why would an index fund beat it?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=93aa3759b7ee963363cc4cc54dd8390a92402604886547ed78517901e80d40f6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792262943,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer Warned US Would “Rue” SK hynix’s (SKHY)’s Market Entry – The Selloff Might Have Proven Him Right\",\"id\":142963247,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"As the outgoing week demonstrated, SK hynix Inc. (NASDAQ:SKHY) is one of the most important stocks in the market. The shares are down by more than 16% over the past five days as investors reacted rather violently to a slate of worrying news regarding the ongoing AI buildout. One major report came in the form […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d30e64527a060e4a87c191cafbb2833478ce8dc79c761332bee310ab854845ca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792261200,\"headline\":\"Oracle's Real Growth Story Is Hiding in Its $664 Billion Backlog\",\"id\":142963189,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle's backlog has increased by $209 billion over the last year.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3bf160a07b0efddd7ca2c23af90823ea07e2c4e7790c02d2ebcc1feb29badd16\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792228500,\"headline\":\"PDO: Why Retirees Should Consider This 12.8% Yielding Machine\",\"id\":142960459,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/174748958/image_174748958.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"PDO price fell as yields rose and credit spreads widenedânot fundamentals. Credit quality and distribution coverage stay solid.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9b213b01bc60ebc99c41bd67bc954e64bb3b5bd273313344b39f8be3095e6895\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792219587,\"headline\":\"AI Stocks Are The Next Dividend Growers\",\"id\":142959766,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5722824035d1917292ff4d4e40f7308d3a403a43dc80ec4cb139fb94982c7c30\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792213774,\"headline\":\"What would superintelligence look and feel like?\",\"id\":142958772,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Superintelligent AI could outperform human experts across virtually every cognitive task by 2030, potentially transforming business competition and the global economy, according to Deutsche Bank Research.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e9b36ad7b535c38963db1ffb3ab69538562babd642d313766cbe2ccfb3b252fc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792188901,\"headline\":\"AI Debt Warning Signs Are Piling Up: Why Bond Markets Are Getting Nervous About AI Infrastructure Spending\",\"id\":142951502,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The AI build-out needs enormous amounts of borrowed money. Bond investors are getting more nervous about who will pay it back.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=453cedf1a424bc3023295f51dca97f0b003680102f54ff746b0e7709d5cefa61\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792188732,\"headline\":\"Learn Why The Bull Case For Oracle (ORCL) Could Change Following AI Data Center Delays\",\"id\":142951584,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle is pushing ahead with heavy AI infrastructure spending, backed by a US$664b cloud backlog and strong Oracle Cloud Infrastructure growth, while funding a large portion through customer prepayments, supplier financing and planned debt raises. Rising credit default swap spreads, record borrowing costs and delays around Project Jupiter and related power infrastructure put Oracle’s execution risk and free cash flow strain in sharp focus, even as it rolls out AI-first offerings like...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a053e4ad1efb1151985842335790135bacf7cca7e5a0a4d125a4dd66f97c4f25\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792186980,\"headline\":\"Not Alphabet. Not Microsoft. This Is the Cloud Stock I'd Buy With $5,000 Right Now.\",\"id\":142950771,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle's cloud backlog has swelled to $664 billion, and the stock has pulled back. Here's why long-term investors may want to take a closer look.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4973c9150d7ec782eb02c031b24fa855ea2e437ec9c65b2ec3d74d4711f5faa8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792183503,\"headline\":\"Why Oracle (ORCL) Dipped More Than Broader Market Today\",\"id\":142950882,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle (ORCL) closed at $128.51 in the latest trading session, marking a -4.43% move from the prior day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=faa22a53ccd08c0d1eabd4f372250595409fac04297f7a7e8c5622e261f0cda3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792177401,\"headline\":\"Bloom Energy Is Up 157% in 2026: Take Profits, or Hold On for the Ride?\",\"id\":142950117,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bloom Energy has left every hydrogen rival in the dust this year, fueled by a contract that puts its technology at the heart of Oracle's AI data center ambitions. But with next week's earnings report looming, the real question is whether the stock's extraordinary run has already priced in perfection.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=21e44647a5a42f3833257a79477785813221d9f4554e5d536ac603ff0c785a81\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792176742,\"headline\":\"Investors Are Questioning the Entire AI Thesis\",\"id\":142950875,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The selling is getting more aggressive as we head into the close, with the Nasdaq now down 2.2%, as investors question the core principles behind the AI trade.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aaf5cdf751ba60bf10b617f798f2e92c6e1efa981c1fbca1a36257a71f3368b2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173976,\"headline\":\"Most-Active S\\u0026P 500 Stocks in Oct. 16, 2026 US Session\",\"id\":142959210,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"S\\u0026P 500 most-active stocks for Oct. 16, 2026: SMCI, F, BAC, T, PLTR, NKE, ORCL, HPE, MRNA, and PFE saw heavy volume, with sharp declines and modest gains.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b3986a48a3f5afab657ba95ce3d87f80df82d15165f29bb14aad7f91ddb88834\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173679,\"headline\":\"Dividend Champion, Contender, And Challenger Highlights: Week Of October 18\",\"id\":142950979,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1072593728/image_1072593728.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"A weekly summary of dividend activity for Dividend Champions, Contenders, and Challengers. Read full analysis here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d55d2020ea3d6a37407105110c898f3380c2e49b3449b0a523fc8c044b02dc97\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170689,\"headline\":\"AI Bubble Just Became The Fed's Inflation Problem\",\"id\":142950625,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2238010796/image_2238010796.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"AI boom is fueling persistent inflation, compelling the Fed to maintain a hawkish stance and likely hike rates into 2027. Read full analysis here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f93e49345d4ef1569067ef7a30f1c16baab90a45bdf30e4247783f56dcf9296e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170240,\"headline\":\"What Can’t Be Denied About the AI Trade. CoreWeave and Anthropic Are Clues.\",\"id\":142950032,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Worries over ballooning debt, slowing growth, and risks of commodification wreaked havoc on AI and chip stocks this week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0fd5c3555f29ecf5107d96ff8153e8ddf1abee256f387bca3da29566f32574ce\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166529,\"headline\":\"Is Adobe A Better Way Than Salesforce To Own AI Software Growth?\",\"id\":142949035,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors hold Salesforce (CRM) and Adobe (ADBE) on the same premise: artificial intelligence will make their subscription software grow faster again. The two companies part ways on how they charge for it. Salesforce gets 60% to 80% more for its premium editions than for its lower ones, and it wants customers to upgrade. Adobe has held off on price rises to win users. So which approach is paying off so far.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8292d4dd142df40aadb9a9d0927d6b91c10d3fd10116b52d9a52556a582a98f2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166047,\"headline\":\"Does The Move In Snowflake Stock Change Anything?\",\"id\":142949036,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Snowflake (SNOW) stock rose 59.3% from January 18 to October 15, 2026, against 12.5% for the S\\u0026P 500. The company reported quarterly results three times along the way, on February 25, May 27 and September 2. Buyers appear to be betting that customers using AI on Snowflake's data platform will keep its sales growth climbing while its losses shrink. So how much faster is Snowflake growing than it was in January.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fbd14ade6214cff0bbe86e260a9fd8d09e3391e0aa545d56f49dfb17e0b1f19f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792165407,\"headline\":\"What Is The Biggest Threat To Microsoft Stock?\",\"id\":142949023,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Buyers are paying for growth, and Microsoft (MSFT) is delivering it. The stock returned 37.2% between July 17 and October 15, 2026, against 4.1% for the S\\u0026P 500. Revenue climbed 17.7% in fiscal Q4 2026 from a year earlier. Yet on a July 29 earnings call, executives described a cost to that growth that is still rising. What is that cost, and who is raising it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=42d7abc2a9bb8e2f782d69ddbea13cf4f72d18dd4d868def556145e1f6ea4c86\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792164660,\"headline\":\"AI Cloud Spending Is Splitting Companies Into the Funded and the Stretched\",\"id\":142947888,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Every AI infrastructure company is pointing to a massive backlog, but how each one financed the gap between signing the contract and collecting the cash reveals very different bets.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=efdd822162465656f95768242cfbb68e867e07dab0f80694bd7ee6225e8401d5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159980,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave Drops. Even Jensen Huang and Cathie Wood Can’t Buoy the Stock.\",\"id\":142947962,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave stock was falling again Friday even after Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang expressed confidence in the cloud-computing company.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5eee7a6a4e629bc6c3144fcc8f834fd94d5eb81b69316d1db99dfd316ce07836\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159020,\"headline\":\"From AI laggard to $5 Trillion: Apple's winning strategy\",\"id\":142947895,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Just weeks ago, Apple (AAPL) faced criticism for lagging behind Big Tech rivals in AI infrastructure spending. Now, the company has reportedly surpassed a $5 trillion market valuation. The 8:30 panel examines how CEO Tim Cook helped drive Apple's rise through its booming services business, disciplined capital spending, and relationships with political and global leaders, even as questions remain about its AI strategy. Bullseye American Ingenuity Fund portfolio manager Adam Johnson sits down with The 8:30 Hosts, Julie Hyman and Jake Conley, to discuss the details.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2ed0835ed96c0bed8345f4af77b00a13a5dd5f3787744fdaa3b2ad94d55acb7c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792158082,\"headline\":\"How Oracle Corporation (ORCL) Captures Mission-Critical Hyperscaler Workloads?\",\"id\":142945650,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Emerald Wealth Partners, an independent asset and wealth management firm based in Zurich, released its Q3 2026 investor letter for the “Growth Equity Strategy”. The letter can be downloaded here. In Q3 2026, market performance was defined by pronounced sector rotations, as a rebound in software equities contrasted with a sharp correction in semiconductors, particularly […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8505502f3dd049225f8c53d893b36eb8b4bfc6d0a0317ab2be8f6d813a12f1c2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792157707,\"headline\":\"10 Information Technology Stocks Whale Activity In Today’s Session\",\"id\":142960610,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/11/06/aggregated_options_3.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"This whale alert can help traders discover the next big trading opportunities.\\nWhales are entities with large sums of money and we track their transactions here at Benzinga on our options activity scanner.\\nTraders will\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f23b8a8c3151a4a27b490571809625d7b27df19fdaa85dca3dd0a73e2f165c43\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792156742,\"headline\":\"We're in pullback for AI again, but fundamentals are strong: Silvant's Sansoterra\",\"id\":142948704,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108420670-17921705601792170557-49040498716-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792170559\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC’s Kelly Evans discusses the tech trade amid the market rotation out of tech and artificial intelligence-related names with Michael Sansoterra of Silvant Capital Management.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=05e9a18f9c68e2752d3d48e459c9f93f3225c4a15d2400d2ecce884c5e2f9fef\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155246,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Wall Street Swaps Chips for Old Reliables as Producer Prices Spike\",\"id\":142946644,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/THUMBNAILS_CHARTMILL_1000_528_22_59555aefc9.webp\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"The Dow rose 1.2% as money moved from chips into old-economy names. Producer prices posted their biggest jump since 2022, and Jensen Huang came to CoreWeave's defense.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ee8449899659de30d7c02cc76597c0fe59b287c7864490302adecf3c9fbd624a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155050,\"headline\":\"Who’s Really Paying for the AI Boom? The Bond Market Is Starting to Ask\",\"id\":142945453,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bond investors are quietly repricing the debt that funds AI's massive buildout, and some of the numbers coming out of quarterly filings suggest the easy money phase may already be over.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d4e8b305896f41e46b077238a45a75a2d3062a91e2fa8fd9a96e90766f50b89e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154739,\"headline\":\"Trading Halt: Halt status updated at 10:10:00 AM ET: Quotation Resumption: IPO security released for quotation\",\"id\":141044493,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7042819f9e418abdd4277182cc456c9eac16a176d29a0bf54767394806b237ae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154272,\"headline\":\"This Week In Cloud AI - Akamai Technologies Boosts Global Cloud Service Adoption\",\"id\":142945515,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Akamai Technologies has observed a significant increase in customer adoption of its cloud computing services, largely driven by the growing demand for high-performance computing across AI and enterprise SaaS workloads. The company reported that this trend is evident from model training to low-latency inference, with enterprise clients utilizing its services for a range of applications, including cloud disaster recovery and core-to-edge application hosting. Akamai's momentum is supported by...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9bb9cbf4a984087c6b956308e6aff4aa9a3123c06789c31aa94718359a9b82a7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792153288,\"headline\":\"Prologis Analyst Touts ‘Ample Defenses’ Against Data Center Challenges\",\"id\":142960985,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Prologis-Sign--Logo-On-Business-Facade-O.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"BTIG reiterates Buy on Prologis, calling the selloff a compelling entry point despite cautious guidance and data-center concerns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d3fe64505f150b63ba5e4337980a19549f4880430ab54fbbdfaeabd0db843bf5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792152044,\"headline\":\"Can Meta AI Break Into The Enterprise? Why Zuckerberg Thinks So\",\"id\":142945519,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta stock is back in Wall Street's graces on its breakout hit Muse app. Now Meta hopes its AI can crack a huge market that has long eluded it: the enterprise.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3ef4cbe75ce8789ff5cf0a125d2bbd9d866c11712f00e6e48d9a9f966a63d8a5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792150500,\"headline\":\"Oracle's Cloud Backlog Just Hit $664 Billion. Here's What a $1,000 Investment Could Be Worth If It Converts to Revenue on Schedule.\",\"id\":142944178,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A record backlog and accelerating cloud growth could be enough to more than double the stock by 2029.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b53aafbc8eac5514b5937c825f7bab75e9609e8f1db92827cdf33b8f33730070\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792149671,\"headline\":\"Why Is Applied Digital Stock Falling Friday?\",\"id\":142960647,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/The-Applied-Digital-Corporation-Logo-Is-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Applied Digital stock drops as AI debt concerns \\u0026amp; surging CoreWeave bond yields trigger a sector-wide sell-off. G