993ee62d5eb68f873b11aa5c70ee2c9ca2f0ab9d2d3c2c7653c6ebb739b87a78\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792144020,\"headline\":\"Oracle Data Center Energy Profile - 2026 Sustainability and Emissions Analysis | 24% Energy CAGR and Stargate Expansion Drive Renewable Investment and Carbon Risk\",\"id\":142940383,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle's asset-light OCI strategy prioritizes compute hardware, while renewable energy use and emissions decoupling strengthen sustainability amid Stargate risks.Dublin, Oct. 16, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \\\"Data Center Energy Profile - Oracle: Energy Use Up 24% CAGR since 2019, Emissions Stable Thanks to Renewables, Stargate May Explode its Carbon Footprint, Though\\\" has been added to ResearchAndMarkets.com's offering. Oracle Energy Use, Data Center Investment and Environmental Sustainability Analy\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=058fcf9a2aabfddaa1f9140390b8f1d234afd0c4aeeb299feb8a08b1e2c92634\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792143000,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave Stock Drops. Why AI Debt Fears Aren’t Over Despite Nvidia’s Confidence.\",\"id\":142940512,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave stock was falling again Friday even after Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang expressed confidence in the cloud-computing company.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=768bc63fb8c44c79a048a1665bef62f21383e3a1f8e31776be3ffa64b351ed8e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792138441,\"headline\":\"3 Growth Stocks With Revenue Growth Over 20%\",\"id\":142940391,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"G7 finance chiefs just agreed to rehearse how they would handle AI driven cyber attacks on banks and markets, which puts technology and security squarely on the agenda for policymakers and investors alike. When rules and risks change this quickly, businesses that can grow fast and still sound confident about the road ahead tend to attract attention. This article highlights three such high conviction growth stocks from the current screener. The stocks covered below are just a small sample, and...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6e0a3d600b075f5f1d880587ceb65c6b084bb34a4230b6b2109a855bbee3b62b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792120995,\"headline\":\"AI's Credit Scare Is Sorting The Strong From The Borrowed\",\"id\":142934849,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2247451196/image_2247451196.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Wednesdayâs selloff differentiated AI stocks by how they pay for their buildout, and the ones leaning hardest on debt. Read more here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cc582dc588d77ba745ed9e84bb3ef3f6a31bb26326c16f2ef27ef44dfad08b06\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792111712,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy Adobe Stock For Its Cash?\",\"id\":142925591,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the last twelve months, Adobe (ADBE) produced free cash flow equal to 11.1% of its market value. By comparison, the median S\\u0026P 500 company sits at 4.4%. A yield that high usually signals one of two things: the business is on sale, or buyers expect it to shrink. Is that cash really yours, and how solid is it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c81a82ce23251632b994d0dddc4d22e700e88d7e6492cf55d5f751a01c607e0e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792102409,\"headline\":\"Top 3 Tech Stocks To Watch In October 2026\",\"id\":142923008,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Artificial intelligence spending has turned into an arms race, from Blackstone funding data centers to tech groups racing to secure chips and power. When big money pours into new infrastructure, pricing glitches can appear in companies that build, supply or service it. That is where underpriced technology stocks can matter. This article walks through three candidates from our undervalued tech screen that may merit a closer look. The three undervalued tech stocks in the article are just a...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=56be639d070b449f633337b75dcedd55a0cf82adc3224864ee828639ceefff6b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792096263,\"headline\":\"Don't See Canary in Coal Mine For AI: Khoda\",\"id\":142922321,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Neha Khoda, head of US credit strategy at BofA Securities, and Stephanie Doyle, fixed income portfolio manager at JPMorgan Investment Management, join Scarlet Fu on \\\"Bloomberg Real Yield.\\\" A measure of CoreWeave's credit risk climbed to an all-time high Thursday as some of its high-yield bonds extended declines, rattled by the AI cloud-computing company's talk of tapping vast pools of capital from insurers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dd0d02dc9fdfac0624d0d1e2379c841e7d4f6a5733b0d34e84237418d0e523a9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792094435,\"headline\":\"Could OpenAI Go Bankrupt While AI Takes Over the World?\",\"id\":142922322,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"OpenAI faces reporting of a $20B revenue gap. Austin Campbell and Chris Perkins ask whether frontier labs ever build a moat, or if compute wins.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8c9f2c87be7ab75c4037b673eedb96682c9b1ea10aa23ea5ef5fc73be112c1c6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792093585,\"headline\":\"As chip stocks fall, investors are turning elsewhere in the market: Chart of the Day\",\"id\":142921387,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Markets and Data Editor Jared Blikre takes a closer look at the latest market and sector action, highlighting what the sell-off in CoreWeave (CRWV) and chip stocks means for the rest of the market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d354ceae5bd17c60de9d2be01a6d7f7ab88d2948dad79a1837d27e89a76c5d33\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792093524,\"headline\":\"IBM Has Paid Dividends Since 1916. Here’s Why Retirees Should Pay Attention Now\",\"id\":142921409,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"IBM has raised its dividend every year since 1916, but the raises have shrunk to a single penny while debt climbs and a weak quarter rattles investors. Whether the cash machine can satisfy retirees and fund IBM's AI ambitions at the same time is no longer a simple question.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8302f47da73fa6f9202ca317dbe2ae7ae851074ec687a6ae73c472c7932178c7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792083617,\"headline\":\"DTE Energy Is Becoming More Interesting as America’s Power Needs Soar\",\"id\":142920321,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Data centers are reshaping which utility stocks deserve a second look, and one Michigan company just signed agreements with Oracle and Google that could quietly supercharge its earnings growth for years to come.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a89f40a9450e3f5bdedd347ca2b12f2e94cbb12fb9db1549e0427eeac70de757\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792081200,\"headline\":\"Nvidia’s Huang Says CoreWeave Doesn’t Need a Backstop\",\"id\":142920446,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave stock is dropping again Thursday but backer Nvidia say it doesn't have to step in to stem the bleeding.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=04248b2f30107716d6f68c89de0af125501fab743fac2d3842d5e0e6e533fc04\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792079518,\"headline\":\"Nvidia's CEO Just Came to the Market's Rescue\",\"id\":142920448,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The AI stock selloff abated a bit after Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang told Bloomberg that CoreWeave doesn’t need a backstop from the chip maker.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e725e061deae64596ee8bce1e9c65961142cc7f10d0e576252d70d7fa9051927\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792077926,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave: Why Credit Markets See A 54% Chance Of Default\",\"id\":142921154,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2273999217/image_2273999217.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave, Inc. gets a Sell rating as funding costs exceed rental yields and bond markets signal default risk. Click here for more on CRWV stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=33bf7f6ccb233e7a7e937455fb08df57ee75172bb34c47bdec8f3a0960c3c588\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792077550,\"headline\":\"Cramer Says “People Are Terrified” As CoreWeave Insiders Dump Shares\",\"id\":142919156,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave's CEO sold tens of millions in shares the same day he told CNBC everything was fine, and now Jim Cramer says shareholders are terrified while the company's bonds flash a warning signal few are talking about.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dd4f462196eeb0653686067fc71229ba8a270445d19c51f3b8bd93ed965e1109\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792076899,\"headline\":\"Oracle Fell Nearly 9% as CoreWeave’s Bond Scare Spread\",\"id\":142919173,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave's bond market flashed a warning that spread far beyond one AI startup, and Oracle shareholders absorbed a nearly 9% loss before the trading day even ended. What happens to Oracle's $664 billion backlog if the cost of AI debt keeps climbing?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bc629b477d002cfda898bf225d9dcc6969b476f0e3ed118c418bc68551d0aad2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792074121,\"headline\":\"3 reasons why CoreWeave is still 'relatively safe' from the AI rout\",\"id\":142919322,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave (CRWV) stock has sunk over the last week as a new AI rout finds its way into the market. Nonetheless, Bank of America analysts are still maintaining their Buy rating and $140 per share price target on CoreWeave. Bank of America Merrill Lynch managing director of the equity research group, Tal Liani, sits down with Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi to discuss why he is still a fan of CoreWeave's fundamental business.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c5365a65c4d18f32a2a0f38bb03211af0684f7e031b8e2d926453e5577b99311\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792073470,\"headline\":\"Why Is Oracle (ORCL) Reworking Project Jupiter As It Launches AI Startup Tools?\",\"id\":142919319,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle (NYSE:ORCL) introduced an AI first NetSuite QuickStart financial platform for startups, offering no cost access for early users. The NetSuite QuickStart product connects with third party AI assistants including Claude and ChatGPT for embedded finance workflows. Oracle executives halted a planned power agreement with El Paso Electric for the proposed Project Jupiter data center after county level objections. Together, the NetSuite QuickStart launch and Project Jupiter power rethink sit...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2343190f97e3b23d737da25c8fdfea9165d383398d0f53c0f6d867e700d446c2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792073435,\"headline\":\"What's going on with CoreWeave?\",\"id\":142917071,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi takes a look at the biggest stories as the trading day kicks off, weighing in on CoreWeave's (CRWV) stock rout and more. Sozzi also previews his Power Players interview with legendary actor Sylvester Stallone, in which the two discuss what's wrong with Hollywood.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7fef7a6bb5986fa9af5179e104001fe2fb345e6aca0267847d52acaaabc13d5e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792073247,\"headline\":\"AI Credit Default Insurance Costs Surge as Investors Assess Data Centre Debt Risks\",\"id\":142919320,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The cost of protecting against defaults by major US technology companies has risen sharply, reflecting growing investor concerns about debt levels, financing requirements and the potential returns from large-scale artificial intelligence infrastructure investments. Credit default swap (CDS) spreads for several companies involved in AI development and data centre expansion have reached record levels, according to data from S\\u0026P Global Market Intelligence and LSEG.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=18be7ec70f7786c113b9117eac18fd7a38ec71e3038dea657720848d5436ae7b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792070768,\"headline\":\"Investors dump data centre bonds as AI borrowers face ‘Darwin moment’\",\"id\":142920449,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors are losing confidence that revenues from the AI boom will be sufficient to support the vast debt piles financing data centres, pushing...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d3733ace9c9c6e4d75f4d25eefbde8ef388a4fd38b96258471b1147fb3985ce3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792068611,\"headline\":\"Bloom Energy Got Good News From Oracle and Fell Anyway. Is It Time to Buy?\",\"id\":142916437,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle just named Bloom Energy the primary power source for a massive AI campus, yet the stock keeps falling. With shares trading at stratospheric multiples and the next earnings report days away, the real question is how much good news the price has already consumed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=314d1f1f2882bd533812625ed3e61d7abad82a4cc086c72b8f89b0804acfd6ea\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792068466,\"headline\":\"Apple Hits $5 Trillion Market Cap as Nvidia's Lead Shrinks\",\"id\":142945156,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Pune--India---February-19--2024--Apple-i.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Apple topped $5 trillion as Nvidia’s market-cap lead shrank and traders sharply raised Apple’s odds of finishing October No. 1.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=13ec81ecd8879dc9763c92ed86f2345a7374cc5aefd7657a6b543dae967ee3ca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792068160,\"headline\":\"Treasury Yields Dive For Wrong Reason As Neocloud Bonds Blow Up\",\"id\":142914587,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A blow-out in bond yields for neocloud companies could eventually slow the AI buildout.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2ca411aaae3cfb3cbd946191e3472b0dc0aeca388301318b5b7f989431e42209\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792066551,\"headline\":\"What Sent CoreWeave Stock Lower?\",\"id\":142914144,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of CoreWeave (CRWV) fell 15.5% on October 14, 2026, during a session where the S\\u0026P 500 lost 1.1%. The drop came as yields on CoreWeave's unsecured bonds rose toward 15%. A venture capitalist had drawn attention to them on X late on Tuesday, October 13. Reports tied the stock decline to concern about the company's debt burden. Investors have reason to share that worry if borrowing at the company has outrun its business. So how big has CoreWeave's debt become next to what it sells.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ee4e4ea01aeeadc75abfee7118509e3d0a5d47a52ab98a08e915fe890e98ceb7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792065960,\"headline\":\"How Nvidia Could Stop the CoreWeave Panic\",\"id\":142915364,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave stock is dropping again Thursday. It might need backer Nvidia to stem the bleeding.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4257102b9ad995b97d1df14a13a3dd8fe02f0839c106638f8f5d2548e1de3882\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792065600,\"headline\":\"Vertex Delivers Enhanced Value to Customers with Vertex O Series Tax Engine for Oracle Deployed on Oracle Cloud\",\"id\":142913647,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Vertex O Series Tax Engine achieves Oracle Validated: Oracle Cloud Infrastructure Expertise and is now available in the Oracle MarketplaceKING OF PRUSSIA, Pa., Oct. 15, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Vertex, Inc. (NASDAQ:VERX) (“Vertex” or the “Company”), the Decision-to-Defense™ global indirect tax and compliance company and an Oracle partner, today announced that its enterprise tax determination engine, Vertex O Series Tax Engine for Oracle, has achieved Oracle Validated: Oracle Cloud Infrastructure\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5aa06de25685d7791c57a1bee67837c56803b0afd82b55e2d999b759a118ad3f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062916,\"headline\":\"Apple Needs Just a 7% Gain to Become the World’s Most Valuable Company\",\"id\":142912133,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple and NVIDIA now sit within striking distance of each other at the top of the market cap rankings, but the reason one trades near its all-time high while the other lags tells a more complicated story about which giant investors actually trust.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fbb350064c370c9ed4bbebac782d2627634a4bc563192054e4e95d808852f0e0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792061182,\"headline\":\"Global tech selloff deepens as enthusiasm for AI stocks wobbles\",\"id\":142912130,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Global technology stocks sold off sharply Thursday, as a growing list of worries, including rising borrowing costs and tougher competition from China, caused traders to sour on AI investments.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8d0293504851f4976d0f18b1d72e37b3325ef610336d1d93015ed23f57860734\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792059577,\"headline\":\"$80 Billion Gone From AI In A Single Day: Brace Yourself, It's Not Over\",\"id\":142917973,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1217582554/image_1217582554.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"AI stock selloff hits Micron and neoclouds as CPI and Anthropic growth spark demand fears. Click for a view of the tech landscape and where it may be headed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cd92dcfa5c2b4f8787cc911d63e83a4f24af91c74f6801f5da064b4c3699e71a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792058889,\"headline\":\"Oracle's AI Selloff Is Creating A Rare Setup\",\"id\":142917741,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2269513579/image_2269513579.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Oracle revenue jumped 30% as OCI accelerated 121% on AI demand. Click for more on ORCL stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=162f706d75c33d60ce9fe1499f55b10478e4c338fc89b4ef67fe7776c1f82054\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792058640,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave Stock Sinks Again as AI Debt Panic Spreads. Will Nvidia Come to the Rescue?\",\"id\":142912134,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave stock was dropping again Thursday. It might need backer Nvidia to stem the bleeding.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b6a438e24410f0ac9db8eb62136a9ecb508e562510a4d4cbb465c2611902a946\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792058209,\"headline\":\"Why Is Applied Digital Stock Falling on Thursday?\",\"id\":142916765,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Applied-Digital-Corporation.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Applied Digital Corp (NASDAQ: APLD) stock declined Thursday amid broader worries about AI financing costs and sticky CPI inflation data.\",