pi/news?id=2207e6c4cebd8214810f97bad4d72147d15d8cfb1d750d8531729e492dec4984\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792040509,\"headline\":\"Will OpenAI Go Public? One VC Says ‘Not Really Sure They Mean It’ But Bets On ‘Blockbuster’ Anthropic Listing\",\"id\":142898778,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Anthropic’s Q3 financials disappointed some investors and contributed to Nasdaq’s drag, CNBC’s Jim Cramer said.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d9d23e8fb75c742dbdf30fb46afdd3876f5d648219b5b2f22a6af8159e4f402\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792029023,\"headline\":\"South Korea’s benchmark Kospi index sinks more than 7% as tech sell-off deepens\",\"id\":142894910,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"HONG KONG (AP) — South Korea’s benchmark Kospi index sank more than 7% on Thursday as a sell-off of technology shares deepened after U. stocks fell on hotter-than-expected inflation data.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5998d6a73c14a3ca64b0f508dd16264c86ecf20dec8849f02cb860d31fa193b4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792028881,\"headline\":\"Oracle Sinks 9% on Hot Inflation Data: “Rates Now Reach Its Earnings”\",\"id\":142903640,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle (ORCL) stock fell 8. 8% on Wednesday, October 14, closing at $130.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=58f6115cbd91190901d76a8320fd1955d6de6fbdc27db3f2281b1fc42bc69420\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792028202,\"headline\":\"AI Debt Glut May Be Pushing Up US Government Borrowing Costs, BondCliQ CEO Says\",\"id\":142895086,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BondCliQ's Chris White says new AI bonds trade wider and the AI debt glut may lift US government borrowing costs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b9818e6ba8ed8c60b66eb779aabafa14a7aea14ab46f0e602e9ce47fdf85e295\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792014516,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today, Oct. 14: CoreWeave Plummets on Gartner Neocloud Warning and Bond Yield Surge\",\"id\":142888451,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Gartner's prediction that 80% of neoclouds could vanish by 2030 intensified investor concerns about the company's long-term viability, today, Oct. 14, 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=96acfc4efc21c8673a198f4601ee41b44756fb4fabd29527c25caea7afb1fec2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792012366,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today, Oct. 14: Oracle Tumbles on Hotter CPI Data Lifting Treasury Yields\",\"id\":142888449,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Today, Oct. 14, 2026, hotter-than-expected inflation data revived rate-hike bets, pressuring the enterprise software giant alongside lingering AI cloud expansion concerns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f9a52c478fc8d81991719f1c120d8597e5bc6a2991b749bdc134870a2a92ae22\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792010444,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave, Intel, Micron, \\u0026 other tech stocks are plummeting. Here's why.\",\"id\":142888370,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Baird tech strategist, Ted Mortonson, sits down with Yahoo Finance Senior Reporter Brooke DiPalma to explain what's going on in the markets with tech names like CoreWeave (CRWV), ASML (ASML), Micron (MU), and Intel (INTC).\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9a972fc3dfa397990af772db13828e08a255962c3dcea4be101de858b338f981\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792009409,\"headline\":\"Nvidia stock sinks as chip sell-off deepens on hot inflation data\",\"id\":142888371,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia closed the session down more than 3% Wednesday amid mounting worries over the AI trade and rising bond yields.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2304aea6b3ab6fe1e212ce75b00f7bc326cfa7d16155ee99518d6aa474593e7d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792008737,\"headline\":\"AI stocks drop after hot inflation report bolsters bets for Fed rate hikes\",\"id\":142888452,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"High-flying technology stocks are taking a bruising this week, as investors grow more skeptical about whether the AI boom will live up to expectations.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a509cbf387dca42fa426cdfbd5774c50a3ce5ea0250f336c18706a6ee9e76732\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792005349,\"headline\":\"Open Cloud Security And Testing Partnerships Could Be A Game Changer For Oracle (ORCL)\",\"id\":142887397,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In recent days, Marvell Technology, Microsoft and Oracle, working through the Open Compute Project, formed a new security working group to define open NIST FIPS 140-3 Level 3 integrated HSM specifications for cloud and hyperscale data centers, while UiPath Test Cloud also became available on Oracle Marketplace for AI-powered testing of Oracle applications. This combination of open-standards security collaboration and expanded partner solutions highlights Oracle’s push to enhance the...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d6eac8efc98beb843e9a60d3152ddbb0873cdff79ff9ba9b9df3ff87a45f597\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792004701,\"headline\":\"Top S\\u0026P500 movers in Wednesday's session\",\"id\":142887222,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Wondering what's happening in today's session for the S\\u0026P500 index? Stay informed with the top movers within the S\\u0026P500 index on Wednesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0b7c292179b56ca652306005b9567d0a0523eab678139849606472987ea2e20f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792001940,\"headline\":\"Stocks Turn Lower as AI, Tech Shares Slump\",\"id\":142887426,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"U.S. stocks were lower, with the Nasdaq bearing the brunt of the declines, as a hotter-than-expected September inflation report put a dampener on the mood in markets .\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c4ac89ae3e1b6a15510ed4520b6865987f4d95c5a40087242656c5dc11b3d0a9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792001863,\"headline\":\"Marvell Technology (MRVL) Forms Security Group And Unveils Six Channel AI Memory\",\"id\":142887398,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Marvell Technology (NasdaqGS:MRVL) formed an Open Compute Project working group with Microsoft and Oracle to define server-level silicon security standards. The collaboration targets a common hardware security model for data center servers, aiming to align chip vendors and major cloud operators. Marvell introduced industry-first six-channel CXL-based memory expansion solutions designed to feed data hungry AI accelerators in large-scale data centers. The firm also announced new 224G per lane...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f57e3468d6bdb9381b4627b1985f42085e33dc0e61140d779083d3aae0877217\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792001102,\"headline\":\"Most active S\\u0026P500 stocks in Wednesday's session\",\"id\":142886905,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Looking for the most active S\\u0026P500 stocks in today's session? Join us as we dive into the US markets on Wednesday and discover the stocks that are dominating the trading activity and setting the pace for the market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4a188658206b81a14d2781a8560ffb791badea88fc7af0c4f67ced56d4798879\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792000869,\"headline\":\"Why CoreWeave Stock Tumbled Today\",\"id\":142887495,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave's bond yield on one of its loans hit 15%, sparking a scare.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9ff815aed28cf2f98dad859da06e5a6257d71327372101be8e76f09b6370662c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791999589,\"headline\":\"'Fast Money' traders talk selling in AI-related names on debt concerns\",\"id\":142920075,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108410860-17920136561792013652-49002101522-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792013655\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"The 'Fast Money' traders talk selling in AI-related names on debt concerns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a46e10792da1cb770eae3c4694211f3542f851a4c22b5a82a41b6d68c825715d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791999564,\"headline\":\"Bond investors starting to doubt long-term prospects of some AI hyperscalers: BondCliQ's Chris White\",\"id\":142920076,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108410863-17920137141792013711-49002117665-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792013713\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Chris White, BondCliQ CEO, joins 'Fast Money' to talk what the bond market is signaling about the AI trade and why it had an impact on equities.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b1aa0e5345a8827871ffe600cc5dbc94ca826253949d1d4230e35e4f4b66f72e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791999491,\"headline\":\"Evan Goldberg on NetSuite Quick Start and AI-Powered Startup Finance\",\"id\":142887496,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In this NYSE Live interview, Evan Goldberg, Co-Founder and Executive Vice President of Oracle NetSuite, discusses the introduction of NetSuite Quick Start and how artificial intelligence is helping reshape financial management for early-stage technology companies. Goldberg explains that while startup formation has accelerated in recent years, founders continue to face significant challenges when building the financial infrastructure needed to support long-term growth. Quick Start was created to help entrepreneurs establish a stronger operational and financial foundation from the beginning while minimizing complexity. A significant portion of the conversation focuses on AI-powered finance. Goldberg discusses how automation and intelligent financial tools can provide founders with improved visibility into key business metrics, including revenue trends, recurring revenue, cash management, profitability, and spending patterns. He explains how these insights can help startups make better-informed decisions as they grow. The interview also explores the relationship between Quick Start and the broader NetSuite platform. Goldberg describes how companies can begin with a streamlined financial solution and transition seamlessly to more sophisticated enterprise resource planning capabilities as operational requirements increase. This approach is designed to help organizations avoid disruptive financial system migrations during periods of growth. Another major theme is startup scalability. Goldberg discusses how milestones such as international expansion, multiple product offerings, and increasingly complex business operations typically drive the need for enhanced financial management systems. He explains why planning for growth early can help organizations remain agile and efficient as they expand. The conversation further examines lessons learned from supporting thousands of growing businesses. Goldberg highlights the importance of enabling founders to spend more time building products, serving customers, and driving growth rather than managing financial administration and back-office processes. Additionally, the interview discusses NetSuite's decision to offer Quick Start at no cost to qualified startups. Goldberg explains how reducing barriers to adoption can help entrepreneurs access financial tools and AI capabilities that may otherwise be difficult to implement at an early stage. Throughout the discussion, Goldberg provides perspectives on startup finance, artificial intelligence, financial automation, entrepreneurship, SaaS businesses, operational efficiency, business scalability, and technology-driven innovation. Disclaimer: Informational content only. NYSE does not endorse or recommend investments, strategies, companies, products, or services discussed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ddaf915db414baf9e73c287142a0298c9f8e80164d4badb92df0c7e487eb7e10\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791996598,\"headline\":\"OpenAI infrastructure lead Sachin Katti to depart next month, WSJ reports\",\"id\":142886531,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- OpenAI's (NASDAQ:OAI) head of computing capacity, Sachin Katti, is set to step down next month after roughly a year in the role, according to a report from The Wall Street Journal. The departure marks the latest high-profile management shift within a critical unit tasked with overseeing hundreds of billions of dollars in infrastructure investments over the coming years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=596b63aa7e468ca38a4b58411a056b37860eae4bd7f2207f318e5a1d369e3323\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791995703,\"headline\":\"Exploring the top movers within the S\\u0026P500 index during today's session.\",\"id\":142885916,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Wondering what's happening in today's session for the S\\u0026P500 index? Stay informed with the top movers within the S\\u0026P500 index on Wednesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b622cb959cbffaf6a3f606c989db14bb104d90fd68454f6db70586c3daa7cf5d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791995533,\"headline\":\"Michael Burry Says Stocks Could Peak Within 9 Months — and He’s Betting Against the Nasdaq and Chip Stocks\",\"id\":142886444,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Michael Burry just collapsed his bearish bets into two concentrated positions, set a nine-month window for a possible market peak, and left a critical question unanswered: did he actually get more bearish, or just louder about it?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e84f30289117e203c06e6af8dcee96c91c728e9bddb75854efd40e821ef905a9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791995479,\"headline\":\"Oracle trading more like a neo-cloud than a software company, says KeyBanc's Jackson Ader\",\"id\":142920077,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108410469-17920091031792009100-49000925506-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792009102\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Jackson Ader, KeyBanc Capital Markets, joins 'Closing Bell Overtime' to talk the market moving on AI debt concerns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=88ce721ad4281a3a08c6db6be46efe9ea0fdde11c8ac728c9954fae86515cd31\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791989467,\"headline\":\"Why Did Oracle Stock Drop Today?\",\"id\":142885080,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street reiterates a buy call on Oracle, but investors aren't convinced.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=315655de51559b89f169e732b84480f539f338be94daa60936e58b2a1d3e0b68\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791988781,\"headline\":\"Oracle executive walks back El Paso Electric proposal after county pushback: Report\",\"id\":142887492,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle EVP Mahesh Thiagarajan offered to undo a proposed El Paso Electric power deal and bill-credit plan after commissioners said a utility tie-in conflicts with Project Jupiter's onsite power commitments.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5306e1f155d6d0baa8bc71028c2b05edd10b7fe2b7c209c85222ee6bbd3a376d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791988681,\"headline\":\"'Yikes': CoreWeave stock tanks after its bond yield touched 15%\",\"id\":142886533,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave stock fell as much as 15% in morning trading on Wednesday, a day after a chart of its rising borrowing costs drew a one-word reply from Elon Musk: \\\"Yikes.\\\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b5222e388d3763b1e0fb951389da24ba92b2c481084e7647948cba9519708f49\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791988681,\"headline\":\"'Yikes': CoreWeave stock sinks after its bond yield touched 15%\",\"id\":142885086,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave stock fell as much as 15% in morning trading on Wednesday, a day after a chart of its rising borrowing costs drew a one-word reply from Elon Musk: \\\"Yikes.\\\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9f5c52103d0a5311f3a31423b2df64265840cb0d2f2cca45194c4fe0b19a3802\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791988501,\"headline\":\"These S\\u0026P500 stocks are gapping in today's session\",\"id\":142884233,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Gap_Stocks_Small_free_ad767b11cf.webp\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Wednesday's session is showcasing interesting market movements in the S\\u0026P500 index, with notable gap up and gap down stocks. Stay updated with the gapping S\\u0026P500 stocks in today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a78342fabdb99b41234efe2b802c0c5151f1ccfe807efcaaede744a50c74596b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791984820,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave Falls 10% as Bond Yield Touches 15% and Elon Musk Says ‘Yikes’; Nebius Drops 6%, Oracle Slips\",\"id\":142882527,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave's bond yield just touched a level that made Elon Musk say 'Yikes,' and now investors are questioning whether the company's massive chip-backed debt machine can survive its own success.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0662c412d01a130a511c64c1d4d47419d86e5d62afced52a0af376d36c795860\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791982920,\"headline\":\"Will Rising Capex Weigh on Oracle's Free Cash Flow Outlook?\",\"id\":142885095,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"ORCL's AI infrastructure spending pushes free cash flow into negative territory, but surging cloud demand and $664 billion in remaining performance obligations offer support.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=55971594ebeb06ab61b7837997042cf22b47d76fb6e77534dc2f8a82c5ff1325\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791982500,\"headline\":\"Oracle NetSuite Announces Launch of AI-first QuickStart: NYSE Content Update\",\"id\":142882725,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The New York Stock Exchange (NYSE) provides a daily pre-market update directly from the NYSE Trading Floor. Access today's NYSE Pre-market update for market insights before trading begins.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e5a00e7955925b846376508c2540cfda1c0f5316ebf6c2e14667a9f4ddfc09ef\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791980980,\"headline\":\"Shares of software companies are trading lower, possibly in response to escalating tensions in the Middle East and renewed inflation concerns that may shift the Fed towards a rate hike. Concerns about key economic data due later this week may prompt traders to rotate out of growth stocks.\",\"id\":141953822,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c69408f6b2e2de87abefeb217619a19db915930e139f14fc71586990a574b37b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791980691,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave shares tumble as bond yields near 15% on concern about AI borrowing binge\",\"id\":142886130,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108222325-1762436340924-gettyimages-2215390071-vcg111567793339.jpeg?v=1791993243\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Shares of CoreWeave sank 15%, while yields in its bonds blew out further.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2d1bcdff5647aba0b9e85ecfbbe9b764801813a74c8b2155d88778a11e1caa38\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791979206,\"headline\":\"Is Trending Stock