94c38a60709d4e669c0ec386c32df9defc21054c492309d8c002a485\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791928357,\"headline\":\"Oracle urges FERC to expedite New Mexico gas pipeline for Project Jupiter\",\"id\":142855392,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Oracle Corporation (NYSE:ORCL) has renewed its push for federal regulators to expedite approval of a crucial natural gas pipeline, warning that regulatory friction threatens to delay the startup of its massive Project Jupiter data center campus in New Mexico. The software giant urged the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission to grant swift authorization for the 17.8-mile Green Chile pipeline, which is designed to transport approximately 400 million cubic feet of natural gas daily\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=006c4769db8ba10cffe627273b2263a0f186872e643d787870e6eaffde556869\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791925815,\"headline\":\"Is NetApp’s (NTAP) AI-Optimized Storage Push Quietly Redefining Its Role in Enterprise Data Infrastructure?\",\"id\":142854536,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In recent weeks, NetApp has rolled out AI-optimized storage (Novus), new hybrid multi-cloud and sovereignty features, and deeper collaborations with Oracle, SAP, Supermicro, and Diskover Data to enhance performance, governance, and cloud integration for large-scale, data-intensive workloads. Taken together, these launches and partnerships position NetApp even more clearly as an infrastructure backbone for AI factories, regulated European data workloads, and enterprises standardizing on...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0e46771e5eda0d8d1cfad74359b1ded621c0d7b9aa7f5348231cc01f6e0b30a6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791923706,\"headline\":\"Has IBM Stock Become A Different Bet?\",\"id\":142854339,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of IBM (IBM) currently trade at 19.9 times earnings, while the S\\u0026P 500 sits at 21.9. Investors buying at that multiple need to understand the underlying assets, and the company has recently changed its messaging. During the fiscal Q2 2025 call, executives focused on a running total of generative AI business that they defined as their book of business. The most recent presentation offered a different focal point. So what is management talking up instead.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7a60e94db7d4232b90f6724f2239f5bf44333ccb2643e04f5658315d3100a673\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791923368,\"headline\":\"What Is Adobe No Longer Telling You?\",\"id\":142854340,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Adobe (ADBE) stock is priced at 12.9 times earnings, compared to a 21.9 multiple for the S\\u0026P 500. Yet even at that valuation, investors need to understand exactly what they hold as corporate priorities shift. Just a year ago, executives highlighted how much of the company's subscription revenue was influenced by AI. They no longer emphasize that measure. So what does Adobe point to now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eeb6f4dde5f6817b278bc483feb73404e64ec1d7408c6466c4f0a1540a54379e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791919072,\"headline\":\"What Would It Take For Salesforce Stock To Move Higher?\",\"id\":142853382,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce (CRM) stock has lost 3.8% over the past twelve months, trailing the 17.3% return of the S\\u0026P 500. Executives say their job with artificial intelligence is to deliver new value to customers. During the fiscal Q2 2027 earnings call on August 26, 2026, management described an upgrade that most of its users have not made yet.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3dacdfe782bca306fed6c64e79d6862be0f4b2c18a72a2dc6c487e206d96ccc9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791918746,\"headline\":\"Is Snowflake Stock Riskier Than It Looks?\",\"id\":142853214,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Snowflake (SNOW) stock has returned 169% over the past six months, against 14.0% for the S\\u0026P 500. Investors appear to believe artificial intelligence has put the company on a faster growth track, and the latest quarter supports that view. Yet on the most recent earnings call, executives pointed out a catch in the AI business. So what is the catch.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8cbac5682ddf94c74e3bb1ed5204b3fba5b0e217fbc754b361211c319b8f7e5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791918301,\"headline\":\"These S\\u0026P500 stocks are moving in today's session\",\"id\":142853113,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Join us in exploring the top gainers and losers within the S\\u0026P500 index one hour before the close of the markets on Tuesday as we examine the latest happenings in today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3a18440b38bccb051232c611a647e6916b791c40ac5821e8ef45ae23e92a6764\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791914171,\"headline\":\"Big bank earnings, who's using Meta’s Muse, and dealing with elevated mortgage rates\",\"id\":142852397,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Market Hang panel discusses the latest round of big bank earnings, who's using Meta’s (META) Muse, and how to deal with the pressures of elevated mortgage rates. Today's panel includes host Gerber Kawasaki Wealth \\u0026 Investment Management CEO Ross Gerber, iCapital chief investment strategist Sonali Basak, Politico senior reporter Sam Sutton, and Futurum CEO Daniel Newman.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d10ae88748389f47f3c6198c49a208a79e09e6bf8617f21a4ef2ed4f287552d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791905122,\"headline\":\"Oracle Proposes Up To $55M In Annual Power Bill Credits, Reaffirms Bloom Energy's Role At Project Jupiter\",\"id\":142851267,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The proposed agreement with El Paso Electric would require Oracle to pay $10 million annually for 10 years, even if electricity usage falls below contracted levels.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a9ac98d760c90fb96b959ede450f8fd1e367ecb7fee336a03ca6099c13b12c53\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791904440,\"headline\":\"Nucleus Research Releases 2026 Transportation Management System Technology Value Matrix\",\"id\":142851268,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nucleus Research has published its 2026 Transportation Management System (TMS) Technology Value Matrix, examining how organizations are investing in continuous optimization, freight procurement, and AI-enabled execution to control rising transportation costs and improve financial performance amid shifting trade policies, capacity constraints, and supply chain complexity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0418efb147bbb3e0f2c74a564de233335e996e010d6ce26ae44c18bd477a3d6f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791903119,\"headline\":\"MSFT Stock Gets A Thumbs Up From Barclays – Firm Expects Quarter To Start Showing ‘More Differentiation’ In Software\",\"id\":142851061,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/s