trades at a cheaper valuation, while Oracle's revenue is accelerating due to demand for AI cloud infrastructure.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5c54a1486ffbaec44322f5cf0ec9f749f92bda6288c612246dd3d567e31071b4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791896400,\"headline\":\"Years of Proven Results Drive Continued Partnership Between Pyung Hwa Holdings and Rimini Street\",\"id\":142851270,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"LAS VEGAS, October 13, 2026--Rimini Street, Inc. (Nasdaq: RMNI), the Software Support and Agentic AI ERP Company™ and the leading third-party support provider for Oracle, SAP and VMware software, today announced continued success in its long-standing relationship with Pyung Hwa Holdings, a leading Korean automotive parts holding company.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8b3d92588bc4a452f831394394cf039c78f13d66b3487c20e8f88b4c6d3bd510\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791896400,\"headline\":\"Marvell, Microsoft and Oracle Establish OCP Working Group to Standardize Data Center Hardware Security\",\"id\":142851065,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SANTA CLARA, Calif., October 13, 2026--Marvell Technology, Inc. (NASDAQ: MRVL), Microsoft Corporation and Oracle today announced a collaborative effort aligned with the Open Compute Project (OCP) aimed at standardizing a NIST FIPS 140-3 Level 3 integrated HSM for cloud and hyperscale data center infrastructure.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d856701c46a501cd36297e7c09cebc3fdcb50e60a7b2ba8bb83f6984d30d0e36\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791895860,\"headline\":\"Investors Are Split on AI Bubble Risks but Still Piling In to the Stocks\",\"id\":142848568,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL