ource\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Oracle Corp (NYSE:ORCL) shares are climbing Tuesday. The company revealed a power plan for its Project Jupiter data center and joined Marvell and Microsoft to set a new server security standard.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=08789b8816a360f41b54f2ef657e343ab957bafe18ae45240650ff21e90bb32f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791889500,\"headline\":\"Ledger Run Welcomes Anne Pelz as Vice President of Product\",\"id\":142847535,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ledger Run, a leader in clinical trial financial management solutions, today announced the hiring of former Cytel and Oracle product executive Anne Pelz as Vice President of Product as the company strengthens its commitment to developing its AI-powered, end-to-end financial platform. Pelz brings more than two decades of life sciences technology experience to the company.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=787b6e69c96f3539dd23e32bfa82b960773874f4ac969a6d6dc5fbed1da6934e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791889260,\"headline\":\"Cyclicals Lead Sectors In Tuesday Trading As Health Care Trails\",\"id\":142850826,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/13/Charts-Of-Financial-Instruments-With-Var.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Four sectors are higher and seven are lower in Tuesday’s regular session, with cyclical sectors holding two of the top three positions. Materials sits well clear of the lower group, separated by a margin several times wider than any other gap in the table.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b28ee841bb547fcc26557c569a6277ea410bc5cb494ceea2f398caae2601e85a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791889200,\"headline\":\"Appficiency Announces Strategic Growth Investment in RedPoint Solutions\",\"id\":142847538,\"image\":\"https:/