 Highlights Oracle, American Express and The Progressive\",\"id\":142845552,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle, American Express and Progressive face distinct challenges and growth opportunities, from AI-driven cloud expansion and rising card spending to auto insurance pressures.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4bd9fc9e6c47e3c8b63181aef49a9eef935b3c895786c6a6a2741fad49e31e86\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791882444,\"headline\":\"Marvell Technology, Microsoft, Oracle Collaborate For Open Compute Project To Standardize NIST FIPS 140-3 Integrated HSM For Cloud, Hyperscale Data Center Infrastructure\",\"id\":142849307,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Marvell Technology, Inc. (NASDAQ: MRVL), Microsoft Corporation and Oracle today announced a collaborative effort aligned with the Open Compute Project (OCP) aimed at standardizing a NIST FIPS 140-3 Level 3 integrated\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9c12bb37719097f7c0b2fc7483e2631cd0d34bde01f579597636963ed5f7fed6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791881921,\"headline\":\"AMD CEO Lisa Su Sees AI Inference Boom Fueling $1.5T Demand By 2030: 'About 60% Of The Market Going Forward'\",\"id\":142841346,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AMD is scaling its AI hardware business as inference and AI agents boost computing needs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=31a02d0f7626662553f9442b1c9134d124fe0d2d6f2986ff0d370c20800417f9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791881374,\"headline\":\"TSMC Earnings Preview: High Growth Likely, But Mind The CapEx (Downgrade)\",\"id\":142847983,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1828680032/image_1828680032.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source