Formula 1 race decisions, but the team says human judgment remains essential.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d35b2d13df01ea6dd379b9510f6c3c5fc3f8fd7f72b747dcb1e95fe9e5e3ab99\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791840660,\"headline\":\"Is Salesforce Still The Business You Bought?\",\"id\":142824480,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"If you hold Salesforce (CRM), you likely bought into a subscription software provider known for steady growth and reliable cash generation. During its fiscal Q2 2027 earnings call in August, management noted that a $25 billion accelerated share repurchase was still under way. Has a buyback of that size changed the company behind your shares.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=90b117705e595cda0d31b662c8d0827b5e622598c18a564d15f3d376174a2beb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791833040,\"headline\":\"Top Stock Reports for Oracle, American Express \\u0026 Progressive\",\"id\":142824572,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle, American Express and Progressive face contrasting challenges and growth drivers, from underperformance to rising expenses, premium growth and strategic investments.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=33c988e24ebf256bca0c2016b2520a14247162e0ebfde420670533ad839f93fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791828590,\"headline\":\"3 Founder Led Stocks With Revenue Growth Up To 43%\",\"id\":142823730,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Goldman Sachs recently upgraded its near term outlook on global equities, pointing to earnings resilience even as rates and energy costs stay in focus. When short term sentiment swings, investors who back founders with meaningful skin in the game often care most about long run value creation. This article highlights three founder led US stocks where insiders are heavily invested alongside you and financial quality screens tightly. The three founder led stocks covered below are a small sample...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7f2075512fb1a6e25829178aa0249902a3c39a6ad451fd0fa9e200e7017f956e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791827199,\"headline\":\"Which AI stocks' valuations are outrunning reality?\",\"id\":142822622,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Market Hang's panel discusses which AI stocks' valuations are reasonable and which are being hyped on speculative grounds. Today's Market Hang panel consists of Gerber Kawasaki Wealth \\u0026 Investment Management CEO Ross Gerber, Yahoo Finance's Pras Subramanian, Kelly Intelligence founder Kevin Kelly, and Cleo Capital Managing Director Sarah Kunst.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d3be78de2a426521c5a1720230d87915f7e6d1a0b32e54019d1a3e21ee010997\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791822409,\"headline\":\"One $180 Billion Family Now Controls Every Voting Share of the Company That Owns CNN, CBS, and HBO. It Only Cost About 9% of Their Fortune.\",\"id\":142825372,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Some of the top names in U.S. media are now owned by just one family.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=65809d79e3e7ab5fa7a96bec836be0c24b8fe3d9a665be0588d03c7d6c6f9665\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791822261,\"headline\":\"Management Raised the Bar For Salesforce Stock; Does The Chart Agree?\",\"id\":142822641,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Salesforce (CRM) stock has gained 10.9% since the day before the company raised its fiscal 2027 profit forecast on August 26, 2026, outpacing a 1.1% return for the S\\u0026P 500. Yet a raised forecast is merely a projection of future performance. Investors must ask if the market is still buying into that promise today. Is that gain still building, or did it all come in the first two days.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=49c2275422241bb5d5b7f8735354f335526898f841ad1eb81b7b4faab8154786\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791816346,\"headline\":\"I’m Making a Contrarian Bet on Oracle at What Seems Like The Worst Moment Possible\",\"id\":142821526,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle shares have shed half their value while the company quietly signed a backlog so large it dwarfs what most investors think the business is worth. Here is why the selloff looks less like a warning and more like a setup.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a37dd4da76a30ddf654063466b980983c3a0b619289780401b3f6db4bc42fa64\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791815899,\"headline\":\"Trading Halt: Halt status updated at 11:00:00 AM ET: Quotation Resumption: IPO security released for quotation\",\"id\":140920734,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=05691d8d1acdd7ba90509777915d28e8d7e9c0446c6d1dfe2f443e5503d9fd9a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791815899,\"headline\":\"Wellchange Holdings shares are trading higher after the company announced the testing of its AI-based bookkeeping and bank statement intelligence platform.\",\"id\":139957806,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1ef5b3bf488512437e5e0fb98194cc444e7ad6b502a56e117288c633d76e039b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791810828,\"headline\":\"Oracle (ORCL) Faces AI Balance Sheet Risk Warning\",\"id\":142820007,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle (NYSE:ORCL) was called out by venture capitalist Paul Kedrosky as financially exposed to an AI downturn in early October 2026. Kedrosky highlighted Oracle’s shrinking legacy database operations alongside heavier borrowing to fund its push into AI-focused cloud infrastructure. Recent credit market moves, including debt downgrades and higher Oracle bond yields, have reinforced questions about its balance sheet resilience. Kedrosky’s warning about Oracle’s AI infrastructure borrowing...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=41b7b68dab0b12725163b836e359d7167b4933f85f2e7532693f3a5a9cb285ae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791810597,\"headline\":\"Why Is Oracle Stock Falling on Monday?\",\"id\":142848445,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/Oracle-Corp.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Why is Oracle (ORCL) stock falling on Monday? Profit-taking and pressure on AI stocks follow a report that OpenAI’s annualized revenue is near $50 billion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=758131f14e5b541b6d6d030e504cf46214d78534e3ed64a0b692fdf796170670\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791809624,\"headline\":\"Nvidia Nears $6 Trillion Market Cap as Relentless AI Chip Demand Powers Record Growth\",\"id\":142819813,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Nvidia StockPrice change for Nvidia stock in the last 6 months: 21%$NVDA Stock Price as of Oct. 9: $22952-Week High: $243$NVDA Stock Price Target: $329What Happened?Nvidia (NVDA:NASDAQ) shares hit another record this week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a6ede21583961a6a03eccda63905f7b088e97507f1cb61b278dc1b3540f7418c\"},{\"categor