rs on Schedule\",\"id\":142819806,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle's AI data centers are running behind on pipelines and permits, so the company found an unusual workaround to keep construction on schedule and avoid penalties on hundreds of billions in signed contracts.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fc42b78cf586d78624a58ae238c7d850e87ee0dc8f717312e7b1b509d63ec4d3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791803713,\"headline\":\"Adding Nvidia During The Current Uncertainty is How Fortunes Are Made\",\"id\":142818877,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Every time the market panics about AI and hammers Nvidia shares, one investor reaches for the buy button instead of the exit. Here is the specific case he makes for why this moment looks less like a warning and more like an opportunity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4f9348bc043986474195c4e78c200db24f7c3e035ddeda08ee67eef43da0922a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791803057,\"headline\":\"9 Of 11 Sectors Rise Monday As Cyclicals Lead\",\"id\":142848323,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/Charts-Of-Financial-Instruments-With-Var.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Nine of 11 sectors are higher in Monday’s regular session, with cyclical sectors holding two of the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with Energy, Communication Services and Financials setting a varied pace across the top of the table.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e1653d7aeda60f7ea34359a76d5b1d0fd246b68d4a28466a7e6e006123c1e812\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791793351,\"headline\":\"Michael Burry Shifts Bearish Bets To Nasdaq, Semiconductor ETF Puts — Sees Market Top 