multi year run, which puts a spotlight on whether the current share price still lines up with what its earnings can reasonably support. With the stock recently closing at €0.73, the key issue is how that market value stacks up against the profit power of the underlying real estate business. Over the past 3 years CPI FIM has delivered a total return of 73.8%. This raises the question of whether earnings now fully reflect that recovery or...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=19b5472604006d367f5329a7942e849755adbee7a3f9287a7066c8143f12ef2c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791594088,\"headline\":\"How much ORCL stock does Oracle founder \\u0026 CTO Larry Ellison actually own?\",\"id\":142773178,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Larry Ellison has built a significant stake in Oracle, a database software company. Here’s how many Oracle shares Ellison owns and how he accumulated such a large stake.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b6c37aa35d764c2a1b999dac96d624948a4811a50413088db0d4e61363c3a242\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791591617,\"headline\":\"CPI FIM (BDL:ORCL) Slides to €0.73 As Fair Value Questions Come Into Focus\",\"id\":142770091,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CPI FIM (BDL:ORCL) has drawn attention after recent trading left the share price at €0.73, with the real estate investor showing mixed return patterns over the past month and over the past 3 months. Recent trading tells a mixed story for CPI FIM, with the 30 day share price return down 12.05% even as the 90 day share price return is up 3.55%. The 3 year total shareholder return of 73.81% is still well ahead of the 23.56% decline over the past year. Pressure test CPI FIM against other real...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6f666b4075c78b1ae0fefc129869cfee45064a7335de2eeb0397aafebfebaa55\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791590590,\"headline\":\"C3.ai, Dynatrace, Amplitude, and Oracle Shares Skyrocket, What You Need To Know\",\"id\":142768630,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A number of stocks jumped in the morning session after technology equities rebounded from a sharp sell-off sparked by concerns over artificial intelligence revenue expansion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=67fd47ceb92692db17ddc1a24c931d3d8f07bdbda366c65419367d24215d7708\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791590100,\"headline\":\"Review \\u0026 Preview: Panic Retracted\",\"id\":142772355,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"After a brief AI-related selloff, stocks were back in rally mode on Friday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4dd900b34af87934833941250e998d334f8e13436eeef2e726f45520b7df9d95\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791586802,\"headline\":\"Oracle vs. Cisco: The Dividend Battle Wall Street Didn’t See Coming\",\"id\":142777261,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Cisco is up 49%, and Oracle is down 30%, but the dividend math tells a different story. See which stock gets my slight edge for dividend investors.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ec5a6581d9fa33c4730a9b0138a602237b4c65b83969f997e631655c6c1d5482\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791579607,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer Just Made the Case for the Dividend Stocks You Are Bored Of\",\"id\":142767098,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Jim Cramer built his reputation chasing momentum, so when AI stocks cratered and he credited a stock he openly hates for saving his portfolio, it raised a question worth sitting with: what exactly do you owe the boring names you keep ignoring?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cd22a1c4d44b7615225455526e0f659ac5193aacf121d4f0da492bfad834a48e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791574896,\"headline\":\"What Could Surprise CoreWeave Stock Investors On The Upside?\",\"id\":142766195,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave (CRWV) stock has lost 37% over the past twelve months, trailing the 17.0% return of the S\\u0026P 500. A September 23 news report linked the stock's fall since May to investor anxiety over the company's debt load. While the market focuses on what the cloud computing company owes, its upside may lie in the money customers have already committed to pay. So how much work has CoreWeave signed up that it has not yet delivered.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7a66c1ae291228008e867b66f618835d7689b935959909a9860572fe7fffb98f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791573992,\"headline\":\"How to Play Unusual Options Activity in Oracle Stock\",\"id\":142773180,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle shares fell 5.5% as options activity surged, including heavy volume in October $145 calls. Large multi-leg trades suggest vertical spreads, but their direction is unclear. Comparing the bullish and bearish call spreads, the trading activity favors a bearish outlook for Oracle.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6e8dca63a6d5115742a4f83205358c7930c37216563891cf7659ca9c175c303a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791570784,\"headline\":\"Is Adobe Stock Ready For Slower Subscription Growth?\",\"id\":142766225,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Adobe (ADBE) stock has lost 31% over the past twelve months, significantly underperforming the S\\u0026P 500 and its 17.0% return. Investors appear to be worried about slower subscription growth, and the concern is justified. Weaker new subscription sales were a main topic of the question-and-answer session during the company's September 10 call for fiscal Q3 2026. Slower growth could compress the multiple investors are willing to pay for Adobe's earnings. So how close is Adobe to a real slowdown.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d833349bc012a3f34bb740c1f0829ef0af390514946d0f48d04d10df024f11ad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791570660,\"headline\":\"Stocks Are at Record Highs for All the Right Reasons. Investors Are Still Biting Their Nails.\",\"id\":142767124,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"“The cone of possibilities for where AI can end up in five years is very wide. That is just going to create a lot of volatility.”\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=35d149b62794c8c7139e7ccd52862075a84f8a245ee37063f027aeca0c2133a8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791569440,\"headline\":\"Update: US Equity Indexes Rise Amid Strong Gains in Mega-Cap Technology\",\"id\":142766307,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"(Updates with index/price moves, macroeconomic data, and company/geopolitical news from the first pa\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7c10e505d1f3c76b35a587d6f68169bd1bc259457917c801aa0b91e198b140e1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791568305,\"headline\":\"Oracle Trucking Gas to Keep Data Centers on Track\",\"id\":142765306,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle is using a new power strategy to keep many of its data centers on track: trucking natural gas directly to the server farms. The company is considering using this approach to speed up a build in New Mexico, where a gas pipeline needed to help power one of its crucial data centers is delayed. He joins Ed Ludlow on \\\"Bloomberg Tech.\\\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=12a851871c58cea3a3863e6749309a13827f32ee42ab67f2493d5301c7429cc3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791565848,\"headline\":\"Are You Overpaying For Microsoft Stock Versus Its Rivals?\",\"id\":142765172,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors are paying a premium for Microsoft (MSFT), as the stock currently costs 29 times its earnings. That valuation sits higher than Alphabet, Amazon, or Salesforce, and of the four peers compared here, only Apple costs more. A premium price typically suggests the fastest growth in the group. Yet Alphabet trades at a much cheaper multiple while expanding its sales at a faster rate. So what are you paying the extra for at Microsoft, if not the fastest growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d43f1ddef215c790aa3c296cc12a0c81865a274945ee96b0a16f98327aef0075\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791565093,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave Stock Fell Nearly 8% in a Day on an OpenAI Revenue Report. Here’s Why Its Borrowing Model Raises the Stakes\",\"id\":142765150,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for CoreWeave StockCurrent Price: $81. 58Street Target: ~$141LTM Net Debt/EBITDA: 8.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=38b3cef99524cba9ed89948b6b6d9cbc98e8a39c4aa0d99e1994dfccf964f143\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791564310,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave’s Debt is Substantiated By Clear Demand So I Keep Adding\",\"id\":142765153,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave carries $35.6 billion in debt, negative free cash flow, and a stock down sharply from its highs, yet one investor keeps buying more shares after every dip. Here is the case that makes the numbers look completely different.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e81c4140e75323c092a113f1b0f5f432b98dc1547d9211b4802e06f867f45cc6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791563701,\"headline\":\"Discover which S\\u0026P500 stocks are making waves on Friday.\",\"id\":142764644,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Let's have a look at the top S\\u0026P500 gainers and losers in the middle of the day of today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2c26afd337be6e602cbe11e05f522a939e135512c9b2693786c6f1c96eb7fa0c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791561272,\"headline\":\"Channel 5 pays out £215m to US owner Paramount\",\"id\":142764114,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Channel 5’s US parent company Paramount has extracted £215m from the British broadcaster even as it suffered a sharp drop in profits.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dde2dccd8355d91e322b456a2b5ec4b118d60dc59e810b577c354f402cbc0399\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791558524,\"headline\":\"Oracle trucks natural gas to data centers to bridge pipeline delays: Bloomberg\",\"id\":142766304,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle hauled compressed gas to sites in Utah and Texas while pipelines were built, and is weighing the same stopgap for Project Jupiter in New Mexico. One analyst estima