\":\"Nvidia and Micron stocks bounce on OpenAI $70B revenue target\",\"id\":142761464,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"OpenAI told investors it expects annualized revenue to reach or exceed $70 billion by end of 2026, easing concerns that had hit chip stocks Thursday\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8253185edee1d2f57d397d2c3cc97ea31b2ee4f7bb44b46cc9bdd6890bf0662b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791551190,\"headline\":\"Oracle trucks natural gas to AI data centers amid pipeline delays\",\"id\":142761674,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The company used the approach at a Utah facility for over a year and is now weighing it for a stalled New Mexico project with a 2.45-gigawatt target\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=54124368e10690d27a49855b142c79512b55a9e47520f60bbd699ac57026601e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791550873,\"headline\":\"Oracle Stock Reverses: What's Going On?\",\"id\":142791470,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Oracle Corp (NYSE:ORCL) shares are moving higher Friday, bouncing after a Thursday selloff tied to OpenAI\\u0026#39;s revenue.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fe4a5cde2c71a21715ac8b8eeebf6bf7283d3f64b3d677f3988f27bab5442235\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791550620,\"headline\":\"The OpenAI Revenue Scare Was Overblown. The AI Trade’s Real Risk Isn’t.\",\"id\":142761478,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave stock, Oracle and Coherent among other AI-related companies were recovering as investors digest the details of OpenAI's accounting.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=047b365a9cd355c97527b9d562c98cd8acb3715abd2a67904d9b98f74c377a4c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791549466,\"headline\":\"This Week In Cloud AI - Enterprises Gain Control With Scality's AI Inference Factory\",\"id\":142761504,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Scality has introduced the AI Inference Factory, an open-code software stack aimed at enabling enterprises to run AI inference on their own infrastructure. This development offers an alternative to cloud-based AI services, providing organizations with more predictable costs, enhanced control over AI model management, and data sovereignty. The AI Inference Factory brings various components together to manage AI workloads, offering flexibility across models, hardware, and software. This...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ae3463dc47535a22b6d76c773eb2744b20f2f49bf017e270d7086a5d5e3869b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791548705,\"headline\":\"OpenAI Is Too Big To Save? The AI Selloff Was A Warning\",\"id\":142764574,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2254323354/image_2254323354.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"OpenAI's $20B revenue scare rattled AI stocks, but differences in reporting methodologyânot demand weaknessâexplain much of the discrepancy. Read more here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=57e3b2cfb03e3219837adbd1702b048b4e2024d5447ebce0d5aaf11354c28b72\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791546495,\"headline\":\"Stocks Rise Pre-Bell Following Tech Selloff\",\"id\":142760485,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The benchmark US stock measures pointed higher before the open Friday following a selloff in technol\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=36f6ea1ba332ad35e33d2bf0e32eba666f0f901384af73cdc6c7352876847e45\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791544534,\"headline\":\"OpenAI’s Revenue Is Reportedly $20 Billion Lower Than Thought. Nvidia Just Lost $170 Billion\",\"id\":142760488,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A $20 billion accounting gap in OpenAI's revenue figures sent shockwaves through chip stocks on October 8, wiping out billions in market value across Nvidia, CoreWeave, Oracle, and others. The twist is that no sales were actually lost.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=02d1180e33cad0a44d1e137920f4df3ccf8373dc16eae441792ce9b7f44d8401\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791544509,\"headline\":\"Prediction: Oracle Has 49% Upside as Cloud Backlog Signals Major Growth Shift\",\"id\":142760278,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle's cloud backlog keeps growing and its quarterly results keep beating estimates, yet the stock sits near a 52-week low. Something in that gap is either a serious warning sign or the biggest mispricing in megacap tech right now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7f5bd24e5f8dbfabe9bca71be89b972a324c3896d0394436713ba3f99f0092d7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791540275,\"headline\":\"OpenAI’s Revenue Appears $20 Billion Lighter Than Reported — and the Gap Is Accounting, Not Demand\",\"id\":142755081,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"OpenAI’s annualized revenue is running at roughly $50 billion — about $20 billion less than the $68 billion figure that circulated in September after multiple outlets reported it as fact. The gap is not a demand shortfall. It is a measurement difference. But the market reaction — Oracle down 5%, CoreWeave down 8%, Nvidia down […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c998b593c567bcde20b7e2ed1b8c6eb2943105d31a4cb3801213722b8a4ae65c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791540023,\"headline\":\"OpenAI's $20 Billion Revenue Gap Sends Chip Stocks Tumbling\",\"id\":142757494,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/THUMBNAILS_CHARTMILL_1000_528_15_6573496dd1.webp\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Chip stocks slid after reports put OpenAI's annual revenue near $50 billion, well below earlier estimates. Debt-heavy AI names took the hardest hit, SpaceX moved deeper into mobile with new spectrum, Chipotle jumped on Starbucks takeover talk, PepsiCo rallied despite a guidance cut, and oil climbed above $91.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=557033d381aadccfe976abc5e7e0ac7ac2483c91237e84c6093fb91093fef475\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791540000,\"headline\":\"Is AI the new China Shock?\",\"id\":142761516,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"When China joined the WTO in 2001, that one move set off the largest capital spending boom the world had ever seen. Twenty-five years later, here we are.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=727d93928867eb256565af8319a237f979a52f73e01ec213cfd1d35641684d7d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791534851,\"headline\":\"Stock of the Day: Where is the Bottom for Oracle?\",\"id\":142762871,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Konskie--Poland---November-13--2024-Orac.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Oracle shares are approaching key $120 support. Past rebounds suggest a potential trend reversal and rally if buyers return.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30885def1edb4547b75f574efeaa347fca609f0b349d424fb2a0f7dacf048a10\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791534000,\"headline\":\"CGDV Has Been A Winner In My Portfolio, And I Think It Continues, Here's Why\",\"id\":142760840,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bd314959f8d64da519d098419b9d00b84ad9847ad11f5e4a37678077bb460a77\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791532444,\"headline\":\"Kalshi traders see high odds that more than 5,100 data centers will be planned or operating before 2027\",\"id\":142764895,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108372637-1791214004973-gettyimages-2298703473-mms22918_t6qdvpdy.jpeg?v=1791214175\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Despite the growing backlash against data centers, Kalshi odds show the buildout will continue to expand.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f1267c583f771199bb48d0fd04c9d76f7b80d01b42382330d34eea927c1363f7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791529776,\"headline\":\"LDP: Sustainable Distribution, But Rising Yields And Inflation Could Pressure Returns\",\"id\":142758482,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2269570595/image_2269570595.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The Cohen \\u0026 Steers Limited Duration Preferred and Income Fund offers an 8.32% yield and trades at a 10.88% discount to NAV. I rate LDP fund a hold. Read my full explanation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2e04f11dad90982745fc9dd741d1a2e874a6c2bf9512a9b13757b0c7823412e5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791527009,\"headline\":\"Oracle: Doomsday Fears Are Far Overblown\",\"id\":142755990,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2269513579/image_2269513579.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Oracle is reaffirmed as a buy, driven by multiyear-high revenue growth and robust demand for its cloud infrastructure services.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c0de7458e7398cf0d56523ac0a6a9a4744c7ace0dcc3a0cc23aa910a93b6ae83\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791525600,\"headline\":\"Skydance Faces a Tough Lift. Netflix and Disney Are Better Bets.\",\"id\":142745212,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The newly merged company has high debt, aggressive financial targets, and integration challenges.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9f86627074d8916b46204007a5ebbf469a2a1607a6f8c2beca6e7b8858dff86c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791518310,\"headline\":\"Dan Ives Updates AI 30: Adds DELL, SPCX While Dropping ORCL and PEGA Ahead of IVES Rebalance\",\"id\":142761307,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Dell-Technologies-Inc.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Dan Ives updates his AI 30 \\u0026#39;Winner List\\u0026#39; ahead of the IVES ETF rebalance, adding Dell and SpaceX while dropping Oracle and Pegasystems.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e978ca685be0edd6f3fd72986b5f649e8e0287a0b3d5419b87d8e7752ea2d03d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791515040,\"headline\":\"Nvidia Stock Faces Critical Warning Sign. Is the AI Trade Breaking?\",\"id\":142741700,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia stock fell 2.94% to $230.48 as OpenAI's $50 billion revenue figure rattled AI stocks. Is the AI trade breaking?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=38010474edec4ef2a31dddff4e57ae568a2c1734550c6fce851285c001a24823\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791512538,\"headline\":\"Chip, Cloud Stocks Edge Up Overnight After OpenAI’s $50B Revenue Figure Sparks Selloff: Analyst Calls Reaction ‘Overblown’\",\"id\":142741701,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nearly half of the retail traders who voted in a Stocktwits poll said they plan to buy the AI-linked stocks after the dip.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=772ca8270e25d5a3af391cb685fb19d2d36b019c1852c779dacfca5a4ce02655\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791511813,\"headline\":\"Meta Draws a Line With TikTok, Bans ByteDance Ads Across Facebook and Instagram: Their Goal Is to ‘Pull People off Our Apps’\",\"id\":142762769,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Smartphone-Showing-Meta-Logo-On-Surface-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"ORCL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Meta has banned ByteDance ads across Facebook and Instagram in seven countries, escalating its rivalry with TikTok.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=91209083a622a730c1eaf35b46ce7886e57cabfae32a35944f9aa9571dbdee79\"}]"
