     "content": {
      "size": 140122,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792343904,\"headline\":\"Should FAA Approval Nears Require Action From Boeing (BA) Investors?\",\"id\":142988028,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boeing reported third quarter 2026 deliveries of 161 commercial jets and 33 defense, space and security programs, with year to date totals of 475 commercial aircraft and 98 defense and space units. The 737 MAX 10 is nearing FAA approval after a key safety review. This matters because this variant represents roughly 30% of Boeing's 737 backlog and ties directly to cash generation potential from that order book. We will look at how Boeing's investment narrative is shaped by the anticipated 737...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c7421ae62679ba844aec910bfb89e1a4f08941745dd4ef72e7323844ba2a7498\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792329957,\"headline\":\"FAA Prepares Final Approval For Long Delayed Boeing 737 MAX 10\",\"id\":142986937,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Boeing StockPrice change for Boeing stock in last 6 months: -15%$BA Stock Price as of Oct. 16: $19052-Week High: $254$BA Stock Price Target: $267What Happened?The FAA is set to approve the Boeing (BA:NYSE) 737 MAX 10 as soon as next week, Reuters reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c0e5da4fbeaff7d2695e04138ce5cd00aa8900d4f5ef253343f3b8bfa7cc6872\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792328329,\"headline\":\"Boeing Sales Chief Brad McMullen Retires Following Commercial Recovery Effort\",\"id\":142986938,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Boeing StockPrice change for Boeing stock in the last 6 months: -15%$BA Stock Price as of Oct. 16: $19052-Week High: $254$BA Stock Price Target: $267What Happened?Boeing’s (BA:NYSE) top jetliner sales executive is stepping down.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8d39fefc799803c0bed305b8f4b7f85d9b141d217d8dcea5644acc4e03717c4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792248135,\"headline\":\"Boeing’s Sales Chief Is Retiring. The Harder Job Is Turning $27.5 Billion of Built-Up Jet Costs Into Cash\",\"id\":142961999,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Boeing StockCurrent Price: $190. 21Target Price (Mid): ~$2,010Street Target: ~$267Potential Total Return: ~955%Annualized IRR: ~75% / yearWhat Happened?The Boeing Company’s (BA) global sales chief, Brad McMullen, will retire in December, with North America sales head Ryan Weir taking over, Reuters reported on October 16, citing an internal memo rather than a company announcement.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=862cb256bff33f2b7edaba6b6b5254137ed37254aa5f2b6e0223806ef770b45b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792243740,\"headline\":\"USAF Doesn't Want Northrop Grumman's Stealth Drone\",\"id\":142960685,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Will Northrop Grumman make Textron's mistake, spending too much to develop an aircraft that no one wants to buy?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0d84e15c1eedb9f962a1e871b5d2220fa672020e5b44c4d07883c10b068102a1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792234980,\"headline\":\"Boeing lands key role in future of U.S. air power\",\"id\":142960051,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America says BA has rarely offered this kind of setup for patient shareholders.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a991f25a2b8dfc4871e31ddab388600444921b79e48b467fb11b817d73aa572c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792219613,\"headline\":\"Boeing: The Real Test Of Its Recovery Begins Now\",\"id\":142959765,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2140577427/image_2140577427.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Boeing saw a modest share decline despite strong September orders and imminent 737 MAX 10 certification. Learn why BA stock is a buy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b38ade9a76a3598ebba0f63cee8d3abecb74f6d29d55e096ca2d7180d1e43d0c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792210547,\"headline\":\"Stocktwits Defense Watch: RTX Continues Deal Momentum, Ondas-Palantir Launch AI Firm As AeroVironment Strike Four International Deals\",\"id\":142958781,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"U.S.-listed defense companies continued to rack up fresh orders and partnerships, with counter-drone technology and military AI taking center stage.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ead569efd6a103b273cbe81d64cfaef7ed7045d1d2a900173c6b4a13ff05779\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792204965,\"headline\":\"Should You Trim Or Add To Your Joby Aviation Position Now?\",\"id\":142957881,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Joby Aviation (JOBY) stock has lost around 70% over the past year. The S\\u0026P 500 returned 17% during that same period. The worry for shareholders is whether paying passengers will board the company's air taxis before its funding dries up. Joby is not short of money yet, ending June 2026 with about $2.3 billion in cash and short-term investments. So what does Joby sell today, and what is it spending the cash on.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=80780a973fb2b44754fff0e7258d46a6ef348886db7e4ef80a058