d6003c75b83346777ebb77ec584c75f68f4c78fd3f43f5a7e2d2574\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791915540,\"headline\":\"4 Reasons Boeing Stock Can’t Catch a Break\",\"id\":142853567,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boeing’s jet deliveries are rising, but high oil prices, defense-sector concerns, a 737 MAX glitch, and pending regulatory approvals are weighing on its stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=430af09b33a2ef6f9f5d1e6083a6f8f4d95e6a4a216b8737172853fe4ec4c324\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791915114,\"headline\":\"Government‑Backed Prestwick Expansion Might Change The Case For Investing In General Electric (GE)\",\"id\":142853506,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"General Electric recently secured up to £33 million from UK, Scottish and local governments, alongside £27 million of its own investment, to expand its Prestwick jet‑engine maintenance facility, protecting 850 jobs and adding 150 new roles. This government-backed expansion underlines the importance of GE’s UK maintenance hub, which services roughly half of all GE engines on Boeing’s 787, to its broader aerospace operations. We’ll now explore how securing UK government support for Prestwick’s...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77047ec90f3ae25351bdefdf4bc993eda4e516f5a3681ec433d6cefa76149b52\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791913295,\"headline\":\"Here’s What’s Dragging Down the Dow\",\"id\":142853459,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A decent day for the Dow has completely flipped on its head.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f00b1416751b9b599ae572eb41364da8c22e0580d73153052166dba042a60169\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791909615