urbulence Could Finally Be Fading, Presenting a Huge Options Trade\",\"id\":142854587,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"With so much negativity already baked in, BA stock may be due for a contrarian recovery.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=21dce6f2fee7a34bc6b66831e2594a38ae763a02a99cf5fe9caae083db29d423\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791897939,\"headline\":\"United Continues Starlink Rollout With Installations Underway On Boeing 737 Max 8 Fleet On Guam\",\"id\":142884134,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.united.com/en/us/newsroom/announcements/cision-125486\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4c3c00c7550ce7d699eab7c26cce8d153b0030d5aeacffdbe42fcc74a8f3df9a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791889340,\"headline\":\"Boeing Delivers 161 Commercial Jets In Q3\",\"id\":142884135,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The Boeing Company (NYSE:BA) announced today major program deliveries across its commercial and defense operations for the third quarter of 2026 as follows:Major Programs3rd Quarter 2026 Year-to-Date\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=66c1bfd03cc92cacede3a799ca7ea5cf39772b6f3f9a8db4ac0ae2f7f9721748\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791870300,\"headline\":\"Jet engine jobs to stay in UK after taxpayers hand factory £33m\",\"id\":142839178,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"General Electric (GE) will receive up to £33m of taxpayer funding to stop the US aerospace giant moving jet-engine maintenance jobs out of the UK.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=31b6c0136a32c25d9bbc49e309aa0550b0cf52a1f018f912f271a8d18a9f9b9b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791846859,\"headline\":\"How Much Downside Is Left In GE Aerospace Stock?\",\"id\":142825355,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of GE Aerospace (GE) have lost 14.8% over the past three months, while the S\\u0026P 500 gained 2.8%. Part of that drop materialized over the past month as RTX and Boeing shares fell as well, showing that the weakness was not isolated to GE. The broader market, however, did not drop with the aerospace sector. So how far has GE stock fallen when the market itself sold off.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e0bddaa332b165e107a008720f6e5d6d5113e3e7d36396aa313fd6a5bfbe8a03\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791832213,\"headline\":\"Uncover the latest developments among dow jones stocks in today's session.\",\"id\":142823404,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Curious about the top performers within the dow jones index one hour before the close of the markets on Monday? Dive into the list of today's session's top gainers and losers for a comprehensive overview.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=02ccc14928cac6b07e502b3a1349a262b04aa03aacb6c39874473bea74c00ca6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791828002,\"headline\":\"Boeing vs. GE Aerospace: Which U.S. Industrial Giant's Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142823714,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace generates a 19% net margin and $7.3B in free cash flow, while Boeing struggles with negative cash flow and a 10x debt-to-equity ratio.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=560df1f6e134d481ebf3a79e455bbae8a398abfc27336c1db2cf286b351a1e19\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791827234,\"headline\":\"Bernstein Cuts Boeing Price Target To $278, Flags No Clear Visibility On Cash Flow\",\"id\":142822825,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"According to The Fly, Bernstein noted that Boeing has been recovering from a difficult 2018–2023 period marked by 737 MAX accidents, 787 structural nonconformities, certification delays and significant defense charges.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4bd82f28c993016504b20571571164110b2a0487a61f208b1ae1eb8a5d787d79\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791827040,\"headline\":\"Vertiv Stock and 5 More Industrial Picks Ahead Of Earnings\",\"id\":142823769,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Citi analyst Andrew Kaplowitz has some thoughts for industrial investors heading into third-quarter earnings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ba6a6f0603f9904efda4569e92a95189bbbcf1b311338a343a03018d9670567d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791821340,\"headline\":\"Howmet Gains From Strength in Commercial Aerospace: Will the Momentum Last?\",\"id\":142822741,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"HWM's commercial aerospace revenues surge 28% in the second quarter of 2026, fueling segment growth. Can rising aircraft production sustain its momentum?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c333721990fdead31e249ccaab2ca728d26f0c39083ee0943b8cfd31449b7bbf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791813847,\"headline\":\"'The Pentagon And The Small Business Administration Signed A New Agreement On Monday That Will Expand Access To Strategic Capital For Small Businesses In The U.S. Defense Industrial Base' - The Hill\",\"id\":142848217,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://thehill.com/policy/defense/6143284-smaller-war-plants-commission-agreement/https://legacy.sba.gov/article/2026/08/25/sba-dow-establish-smaller-war-plants-commission-historic-effort-strengthen-defense-industrial-b\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1b52d712825c87ce45c55abd849c49664fbe4cf7a2b2e4c62068e8b50b4ab8b1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791811144,\"headline\":\"Bernstein Maintains Outperform on Boeing, Lowers Price Target to $278\",\"id\":142848218,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Bernstein  analyst Douglas Harned   maintains Boeing (NYSE:BA) with a Outperform and lowers the price target from $298 to $278.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f03abb8e43088b3523de28ffc89f9354ba9a5f05c0ee5d2741d8a20c547d8db0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791810000,\"headline\":\"BAE Systems unveils next-generation directed energy and kinetic defense systems at AUSA\",\"id\":142820086,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BAE Systems (LON: BA) unveiled two breakthrough defense technologies at AUSA 2026: the Multi-Domain Artillery Cannon System (MDACS) and the High Power Microwave (HPM). Both products provide key layered counter-unmanned aircraft systems (C-UAS) and counter-missile capabilities built to protect critical installations and maneuverer forces against saturation drone attacks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4cbd8184ac0c21cc7fa6c2e30ffc8a2248c7940c917248c61554fb08f7d6b958\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791808203,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Analysts Think Boeing (BA) Is a Good Investment: Is It?\",\"id\":142820085,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Based on the average brokerage recommendation (ABR), Boeing (BA) should be added to one's portfolio. Wall Street analysts' overly optimistic recommendations cast doubt on the effectiveness of this highly sought-after metric. So, is the stock worth buying?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a851da423b84e5f81f8dd9dc228552a55fabde0aada2a9ef01bd394405a8af14\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791805053,\"headline\":\"Boeing ‘Holds the Keys to the Future of US Tactical Aircraft,’ Says Bullish Analyst\",\"id\":142848219,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/Boeing-airplane.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"BofA reiterates Buy on Boeing, citing F-47 and F/A-XX wins worth over $200B and expecting shares to outperform through 2027.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2d5a8d7e06c1fcfaa45da2651bc776b7a853925adc0a961d559c0239de15e436\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791802023,\"headline\":\"1 Profitable Stock with Exciting Potential and 2 We Turn Down\",\"id\":142819162,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"While profitability is essential, it doesn’t guarantee long-term success. Some companies that rest on their margins will lose ground as competition intensifies — as Jeff Bezos said, “Your margin is my opportunity”.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7b2f4774c3722d18a3b16952579bffa6714ec2e934d125fa6b0d6d8af22d6a4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791741780,\"headline\":\"Lockheed bets on 'revolutionary' Patriot to stop faster missiles\",\"id\":142807869,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The defense giant says its new interceptor beats older models on speed and reach. The price tag tells investors more than the specs do.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=996401578b72bc0bdab20599f8fda9d80477a9f629569ce74822bc283d95e389\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791724177,\"headline\":\"BAE Systems (LSE:BA.) Stock May Be 27% Undervalued Following IFF Certification\",\"id\":142805717,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BAE Systems has delivered a very strong 5 year share price run, which puts a sharper focus on whether the current valuation is still grounded in the cash the business is expected to generate. With the stock now off its recent highs over shorter time frames, the key issue is whether today’s price still lines up with the cash flow profile implied by that performance. Over the past 5 years the share price has gained 253.6%, which raises the question of how much future cash generation is already...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=42d3be86726ed1ec72f458822aac450dab266a8c837983570914112c9c683b43\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791696862,\"headline\":\"Avolon Places Massive Aircraft Order With Boeing and Airbus To Expand Fleet\",\"id\":142805309,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Boeing StockPrice change for Boeing stock in last 6 months: -13%$BA Stock Price as of Oct. 9: $19052-Week High: $254$BA Stock Price Target: $272What Happened?Avolon, the world’s third-biggest aircraft lessor, placed a large order on Friday, Reuters reported.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d8cc1c32d1f4ff34d8a0202996dabef6c7deff4c89e7a861af6ed858ea1e578e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791646031,\"headline\":\"Boeing Stock Is Down 12% in 2026 Even as Avolon Orders 140 More MAX Jets. Time to Sell or Load Up?\",\"id\":142792911,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Boeing StockCurrent Price: $190. 37Target Price (Mid): ~$1,730Street Target: ~$272Potential Total Return: ~808%Annualized IRR: ~69% / yearWhat Happened?Lessor Avolon agreed on October 9 to a firm order for 140 737 MAX jets from The Boeing Company (BA), pending approval from its majority owner.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=af3fde23aa730cd6786aef44d2e2e2539adabcaa00fb94a0274d5eb255231bcb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791597622,\"headline\":\"Stocktwits Defense Watch: U.S. Missile Spending Drives $21B In Boeing, RTX Deals, Ondas Adds $270M In Orders\",\"id\":142774673,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Major defense contractors secured new missile-production agreements this week, while Ondas reported growing demand for its precision-strike technology.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aac701fb053a2e48fe293c5ff0aff1dd99fdf5506208e03c897236775ecd2000\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791590174,\"headline\":\"What Could Derail Boeing Stock?\",\"id\":142768653,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Boeing (BA) have lost 15.4% over the past twelve months, trailing the 17.0% returned by the S\\u0026P 500. A lack of customer demand is not the issue, as the aerospace company has a backlog of more than 6,200 airplanes that it has yet to deliver. Instead, the real challenge sits inside Boeing's own factories, a reality management has already acknowledged. So what is holding Boeing back.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=80355831a3faa5b78e71f0a1e5d4d2d2fe9bda0c7b866d93ed1038119c77bdf2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791573008,\"headline\":\"Friday's session: top gainers and losers in the dow jones index\",\"id\":142765954,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Uncover the latest developments among dow jones stocks in today's session. Stay tuned to the dow jones index's top gainers and losers on Friday.