\"headline\":\"Can Rising IRST Demand Support Boeing's Defense Growth Outlook?\",\"id\":142761753,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BA could benefit from rising IRST demand as U.S. and allied forces invest in passive sensing to improve threat detection and situational awareness.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e68b90d236fb95e292f1620cbed885a408183d9db5dbcb48c30c8cd26ff621e1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791544570,\"headline\":\"TD Cowen Maintains Buy on Boeing, Lowers Price Target to $240\",\"id\":142792289,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"TD Cowen  analyst Gautam Khanna   maintains Boeing (NYSE:BA) with a Buy and lowers the price target from $250 to $240.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9470b03d0144792ffd40a5fc0356787c5ae2527091ab2a66d2878b4f6bb68972\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791544560,\"headline\":\"Two Reasons SpaceX Stock Is Jumping Higher Today\",\"id\":142759432,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Barclays analyst Anthony Valentini launched coverage of SpaceX stock with a Buy-rating and $254 price target.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=789bae69d2bcc699f8a2948d339e90e31f20b9f345e0618131881778f03b52ad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791543600,\"headline\":\"Avolon Orders 250 Airbus and Boeing Aircraft\",\"id\":142759417,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"DUBLIN, October 09, 2026--Avolon, a leading global aviation finance company, today announced firm orders for 250 new-technology aircraft from Boeing and Airbus and issued an update for the third quarter (‘Q3’) 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=365668fd7739f6d87bacfe78e37ba863b409db3ef37134f3c32d52b13e9aa73e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791540961,\"headline\":\"Boeing (BA) Faces A Debt Wall As Big Repayments Draw Closer\",\"id\":142757452,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boeing (NYSE:BA) is under scrutiny over a rising \\\"debt wall\\\" as large borrowings approach maturity in coming years. Recent coverage highlights substantial upcoming bond and loan repayments that could test Boeing's financial flexibility and cash planning. Analysts are questioning how these looming obligations might influence Boeing's capital allocation, refinancing choices, and operational priorities. The focus on Boeing's looming debt wall sits alongside wider balance sheet pressures our...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f07d86ba90a86cce07b1304f93365e43fa03ce44173420c21b23221278b5d67d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791538917,\"headline\":\"Barclays Initiates Coverage On Boeing with Overweight Rating, Announces Price Target of $300\",\"id\":142763427,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Barclays  analyst Anthony Valentini   initiates coverage on Boeing (NYSE:BA) with a Overweight rating and announces Price Target of $300.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2d4823a4de970a437cb0a02fc24476598c81299e7e9d6dc9f63836d0c54b029b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791533425,\"headline\":\"Boeing (BA) Stock Trades Near Fair Value As Navy Fighter Win Lands\",\"id\":142750513,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boeing shares have retreated in 2026, and with the stock down year to date, the key question for investors is whether the current price still lines up with what the business is earning. The share price has fallen 17.6% year to date, which puts the focus squarely on whether that move has brought the valuation closer to what its earnings can justify. A fresh multi billion dollar U.S. Navy contract for the F/A XX fighter and a new labor deal that lifts engineer pay both feed into future profit...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=51711dba6daf6008e2a1cac9204b4a3d9edc5dc1520645d414b112d2fbf65117\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791530252,\"headline\":\"Boeing Receives Order From Avolon For 140 737 MAX Aircraft\",\"id\":142761445,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.avolon.aero/news/q3-2026-update\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c674d3b0d5fa45c0a5d5447292e4e43c2c36d8f92df02664c2402d686463cc49\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791526608,\"headline\":\"ACHR Stock Rises Overnight: Archer Aviation’s Defense Ambitions Have Barclays Turning Bullish With 69% Upside\",\"id\":142746650,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Barclays upgraded Archer Aviation to ‘Overweight’ from ‘Equal Weight’.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6e00f4d5d24fa5f7516648b0ef99c035a329a3233666f75939e89d93dd7b998a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791508151,\"headline\":\"Is The Market Underpricing Lockheed Martin Stock?\",\"id\":142738918,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Lockheed Martin (LMT) have fallen 19.6% over the past six months, trailing a 15.7% gain for the S\\u0026P 500. That decline leaves the stock trading at 18.2 times trailing earnings, a multiple that sits below the 20.7 average it held at quarter-ends over the past three years. Yet management used its fiscal Q2 2026 call to report a record backlog and raise the company's outlook for the year. So is Lockheed worth more than the market is paying for it today.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8d0add0186ec2498074ce55d6a0779b0b812125797781d00bdb2d836a5687fb2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791504951,\"headline\":\"BA, SPCX, RKLB, RTX, PLTR Stock In Focus: Why Barclays Is Overweight On Aerospace And Defense Stocks?\",\"id\":142736626,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Barclays initiates coverage on the aerospace and defense sector with a bullish outlook, declaring the U.S. to be in the early stages of a modern industrial transformation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cb92fd5bc719d64e8c00e22304e91e0dda90aa2585072381a2030d6768615576\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791504137,\"headline\":\"What Park Aerospace (PKE) Said on Its Q2 Earnings Call\",\"id\":142737285,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Park Aerospace (NYSE:PKE) reported fiscal 2027 second-quarter sales of $20.8 million, adjusted EBITDA of $5.3 million and a 34.3% gross margin, with results landing near the upper end of its prior sales outlook and exceeding its adjusted EBITDA forecast range. Chairman and CEO Brian Shore said the\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2a516032d47fdc1f78e621ce781355725e180f742c073c905822787ca7b70441\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791483137,\"headline\":\"'Southwest Airlines weighs Boeing 787 for long-haul international push, sources say'- Reuters Exclusive\",\"id\":142763429,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.reuters.com/business/aerospace-defense/southwest-airlines-weighs-boeing-787-long-haul-international-push-sources-say-2026-10-08/\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fab995a8da6fe08202812ffe8645cd595dbef33b3bb738bb46d18b347dcfdc77\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791479522,\"headline\":\"American Airlines to equip over 1,000 aircraft with SpaceX’s Starlink Wi-Fi\",\"id\":1427