d. Building on a long-standing alliance with Lockheed Martin and the F-35 Joint Program Office, BAE Systems continues production at scale for the global F-35 fleet.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b135678d143e24311162e6774b3ff0121343a3aa2fa18b8a7865cb68fb6a28b0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791292946,\"headline\":\"Boeing Wins Massive $14.7 Billion Contract From Lockheed Martin For Missile Seekers\",\"id\":142663192,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Boeing StockPrice change for Boeing stock in last 6 months: -9%$BA Stock Price as of Oct. 6: $19352-Week High: $254$BA Stock Price Target: $273What Happened?Boeing (BA:NYSE) said on Monday that Lockheed Martin awarded it a seven-year contract worth about $14.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9ff28004f4a5c391c50186e1985cc754de12021185d5bc8ca2a6120ebc75086e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791289859,\"headline\":\"Boeing, Ford and Warner Bros. Discovery Have Billions in Debt Coming Due as Yields Hit 5.3%\",\"id\":142695189,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/06/Bonds.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Boeing, Ford and Warner Bros. Discovery face billions in debt maturities as the 10-year Treasury yield climbs above 5.3%.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7768066762beb085b7ac11aa5a4b7d0c8b3e1e8998b65d0d3c54876428b19c1b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791286838,\"headline\":\"Boeing’s Turnaround Week: A Fighter Jet Win, a $14.7 Billion Missile Deal and an FAA All-Clear\",\"id\":142662002,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boeing just landed a Navy fighter contract, a multibillion-dollar missile deal, and an FAA all-clear in a single week, yet analysts still see the 