pany\",\"datetime\":1791245463,\"headline\":\"Trump Says Iran Was Behind Foiled Flydubai Attack, But JD Vance Isn’t Convinced — ‘I Wouldn’t Say I’ve Seen Anything Conclusive Just Yet’\",\"id\":142662581,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/06/Former-President-Donald-J--Trump-Arrives.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Trump alleges Iran may be behind foiled Flydubai attack, but Vice President Vance pointed to CIA Director John Ratcliffe\\u0026#39;s investigation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f79c570d93978de2e903f3c2c3b0b104768bbc762f869565ba5c6a2e19c6c944\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791227409,\"headline\":\"Monday's session: top gainers and losers in the dow jones index\",\"id\":142638289,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay informed about the performance of the dow jones index one hour before the close of the markets on Monday. Uncover the top gainers and losers in today's session for valuable insights.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0e88a10f0ad90454a5ff9c1b9d8c6be70f11a0beeaf98797fe4fc38372abaa20\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791223200,\"headline\":\"Boeing receives seven-year contract to accelerate PAC-3 MSE seeker output\",\"id\":142638541,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boeing [NYSE:BA] was awarded an undefinitized contract action worth approximately $14.7 billion by Lockheed Martin [NYSE: LMT] to scale production and deliver PAC-3® Missile Segment Enhancement (MSE) seekers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=125c0d2886c6760b3d97e2f2f1f61d889c45cc566a5712ea4bc63f88fb32ec92\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791214560,\"headline\":\"Final Opportunity to Join More Than 155 Technology Leaders Tomorrow at HMG Strategy's 18th Annual Silicon Valley C-Level Technology Leadership Summit\",\"id\":142636704,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Final complimentary executive passes remain available for qualified technology leadersFAIRFIELD, Conn., Oct. 05, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- More than 155 CIOs, CISOs, CTOs, Chief AI Officers, Chief Data Officers and senior technology leaders have registered for HMG Strategy's 18th Annual Silicon Valley C-Level Technology Leadership Summit, taking place tomorrow, October 6, at the Hyatt Centric Mountain View. Technology leaders representing organizations including Microsoft, Intel, IBM, GE HealthCa\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e782d0cbf27e558b4b650af512093a0a42beb5018f34dd5a19601349993be6de\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791210456,\"headline\":\"Should You Be Worried About Joby Stock?\",\"id\":142636944,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Joby Aviation (JOBY) stock has lost 63% over the past twelve months, while the S\\u0026P 500 returned 16.0%. Sales are not the worry, because management raised its 2026 revenue forecast on the August 5, 2026 call. But revenue in fiscal Q2 2026 came primarily from Blade, the helicopter passenger business Joby acquired, and not from Joby's own electric air taxi. So what does Joby still have to do before its air taxi enters commercial service.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ade57e59d6f9526c06b44eab6eab1ade8df74b1a46c49f29bd38a1d806d67ce3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791208937,\"headline\":\"Boeing Awarded Seven-Year, ~$14.7B Lockheed Martin Contract For Production, Delivery Of PAC-3 Missile Segment Enhancement Seekers\",\"id\":142662582,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Boeing (NYSE:BA) was awarded an undefinitized contract action worth approximately $14.7 billion by Lockheed Martin (NYSE:LMT) to scale production and deliver PAC-3® Missile Segment Enhancement (MSE) seekers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6987c507815347b4cb34189eaa9c595901353d048de17355de37cd76e9c1e2d3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791205740,\"headline\":\"Lockheed Martin Stock Falls 3.8% in 3 Months: How to Play?\",\"id\":142636876,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"LMT's backlog, munitions investments and new production agreements support growth, but debt and execution risks remain key concerns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77bcbe0ba69bf4cdf51f57a4e594d96042a3864b9bca7f16d7ecef0626593552\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791205620,\"headline\":\"2 Volatile Stocks to Consider Right Now and 1 We Find Risky\",\"id\":142635174,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Volatility cuts both ways - while it creates opportunities, it also increases risk, making sharp declines just as likely as big gains. This unpredictability can shake out even the most experienced investors.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=309e39ced8683fbbaf7266081ace5e0747264bb70597b7d8146d9e026f922aa9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791204840,\"headline\":\"Why Boeing Stock Isn’t Up More After Good FAA 737 MAX News\",\"id\":142635172,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boeing investors breathed a sigh of relief on Friday after the FAA said the latest 737 MAX software issue wasn’t a safety concern.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e114b39d2be33a2342f588dc08fb843e892cdfe26c7d352211d65c576c82d75b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791203937,\"headline\":\"FAA Clears N