",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=82adca8575e53712391d770a3680ce4465b71a80a38c05305c2af5d5755baae9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790758620,\"headline\":\"Boeing, GameStop, Robinhood, Micron, and More Stocks That Explain Today’s Market\",\"id\":142512559,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boeing rises after the plane maker wins a multibillion-dollar Navy contract, while Robinhood gets a boost from its rollout of AI agents.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7c80f963b803ede5d0e82e8a6e5de508c12f32dcbe87e9429e6da6d913678a8f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790753934,\"headline\":\"Stocks making the biggest moves premarket: Robinhood, Boeing, Moderna \\u0026 more\",\"id\":142521663,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108274141-17727164112026-03-05t033804z_1624129463_rc2zxjae4cms_rtrmadp_0_robinhood-usa.jpeg?v=1772716459\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"These are the stocks posting the largest moves premarket.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=01bfe801d7580298ca5c7ee91797dd6f51c3f4caef7770efd83e123d3afa2b9b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790751600,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Breakfast Podcast: Target Extends Value Drive\",\"id\":142512869,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2235688834/image_2235688834.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Can lower prices drive higher profits? Target is testing the theory. A $20 billion Navy contract for Boeing. New York's new pied-Ã -terre tax faces a setback.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a3263d96645d11832dacd4cc5ad77ee0271ebb2dbedaf20760af3b33f16514bb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790739750,\"headline\":\"BA Stock Climbs After Boeing Secures $20 Billion Contract as Pentagon Pushes Next-Generation Carrier Fighter Program After Years of Delays\",\"id\":142517057,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/30/Boeing.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Boeing wins $20B+ Navy F/A-XX sixth-generation fighter contract, defeating Northrop and adding to its Air Force F-47 win.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f58ee017b7d14ca7b895b046448808670471fcaf0d37c0d024ff9db9b6e89466\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790726891,\"headline\":\"BA stock up 2% After-Hours: Boeing Secures Major $20B Navy Contract for Next-Gen Fighter Jet\",\"id\":142503163,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boeing Co. has been awarded a massive contract exceeding $20 billion to develop the U.S. Navy's next-generation F/A-XX stealth fighter, beating out competitor Northrop Grumman Corp.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e8c48577918a683f0823c7ed9eaceb9697ad57b23125071aaf08cc8b0e2f6ed7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790721360,\"headline\":\"Boeing Wins Navy Contract For 6th Generation Fire\",\"id\":142502279,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tuesday, the Navy awarded Boeing a multi-billion-dollar contract to make its F/A-XX sixth-generation fighter jet.  Boeing stock rose 2.4% in after-hours trading to $192.17.  Shares gained 1.8% in regular trading, recovering some of Monday’s loss following the discovery of a software glitch impacting 737 MAX jets.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c07dc97e245f79211a78e188fe887cd84953d62b4121fb60ef2e4afa1b355889\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790720689,\"headline\":\"Boeing wins $20 billion Navy award for next-generation fighter jet; shares rise\",\"id\":142502280,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Boeing Co (NYSE:BA) shares advanced late Tuesday after the U.S. Navy selected the aerospace defense contractor to lead full-scale development of its next-generation carrier-based strike fighter.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6c7d54d957f84918eaaf127c08559f9dde134cae8e1e99594848eddd208f3592\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790719560,\"headline\":\"6 Ways to Protect Yourself From an AI Blowup—Without Giving Up Gains\",\"id\":142502156,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI is the engine of this stock market, but Anthropic’s own IPO registration document raises the possibility that AI could, well, wipe out humanity.  Or should they go all in on AI, fatalistically believing there is little they can do about how AI will develop or impact the global economy?  Selling can seem like the right choice, or even the moral choice, but there is a cost to underperforming the stock market, especially if this time is not different and a more benign AI outcome, with relatively safe AI agents enhancing productivity, becomes reality.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c316f23de08d71e23fbfeb074ccfa0992648d27f0119ebe4edbd4f376f6e9d27\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790719140,\"headline\":\"U.S. Navy Selects Boeing for F/A-XX Program\",\"id\":142501522,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The U.S. Navy announced Boeing (NYSE: BA) has been awarded a multi-billion-dollar contract to produce its F/A-XX aircraft. The fighter will revolutionize advancements in open mission systems architecture, advanced mission systems and operational reach and capacity. F/A-XX is intended to replace the service's fleet of F/A-18 Super Hornets.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=96b13b4341f2df50b056384cf34c51b69f00c0988bfd993c3f51e999595839d1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790714942,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Dow, Nasdaq Finish In The Red; AI Play Offers Entry\",\"id\":142501378,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Stock Market Today: The Dow Jones index drops Tuesday as oil prices slide and Treasury yields rise. Nvidia and an AI stock test buy points.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=79c7a893ec5daed7c98543b5c5124ecded32b84776e595d9a6c888023d0cd856\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790712540,\"headline\":\"6 Ways to Protect Your Portfolio From AI Concentration Risk—Without Giving Up Gains\",\"id\":142501391,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI is the engine of this stock market, but Anthropic’s own IPO registration document raises the possibility that AI could, well, wipe out humanity.  Or should they go all in on AI, fatalistically believing there is little they can do about how AI will develop or impact the global economy?  Selling can seem like the right choice, or even the moral choice, but there is a cost to underperforming the stock market, especially if this time is not different and a more benign AI outcome, with relatively safe AI agents enhancing productivity, becomes reality.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9a217f099d9f1c7ead6fc6d2b76c6f31e63ebc9fa6677f0ff709ae7079a9f7fd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790709739,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Dow Dips, But Nasdaq Turns Green; AI Stock, Energy Play Test These Entries (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142500233,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Stock Market Today: The Dow Jones index drops Tuesday as oil prices slide and Treasury yields rise. Nvidia and an AI stock test buy points.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e570742dde964085813a411711a0c25d2345706adb3681f6d551833a5e85778d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790709120,\"headline\":\"Is GE Stock Riskier Than It Looks?\",\"id\":142500416,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) stock trades at an earnings multiple of 36.9, compared to 22.1 for the S\\u0026P 500. That's steep for a company like GE and needs justification. While management highlights that adjusted revenue has grown at least 20% in each of the last five quarters, that the high valuation assumes uninterrupted expansion. Yet in July, management acknowledged that demand is no longer the main driver of services growth. And that raises the question: Is GE Aerospace stock riskier than it looks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e8bcac73b68e71a4880b4b5605165ebae8be8ee6d48cf5114bd37c1db1bd771a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790709009,\"headline\":\"Which dow jones stocks are moving on Tuesday?\",\"id\":142499987,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Let's have a look at the top dow jones gainers and losers one hour before the close of the markets of today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d86a89f12f7a3769625ba57f71398b516023a72b2444d33a1d6a23ea31e36d7c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790705785,\"headline\":\"Boeing secures U.S. Navy deal to develop next-generation fighter jet \",\"id\":142521664,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108226723-1763384980852-gettyimages-2246569382-UAE_AIRSHOW.jpeg?v=1774464861\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"The Department of War and the U.S. Navy said Tuesday that it's chosen aircraft manufacturer Boeing to develop its next generation of fighter jets.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=be040f1b93027a321436cc3557728d1fa6e29cbc4822e351a8b4b64293e63760\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790705291,\"headline\":\"NASA Gives Boeing Starliner $359 Million Lifeline\",\"id\":142499626,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The spacecraft still faces a long road back\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=29deba6ad4384a64f4acae3d4535dad3f31c60ab3251745d7d573187ccf5add7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790705040,\"headline\":\"Silicon Valley's Leading CIOs, CISOs and Technology Executives to Gather October 6 for HMG Strategy's 18th Annual Silicon Valley C-Level Technology Leadership Summit; More Than 115 Technology Leaders Already Registered\",\"id\":142500268,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"BA\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Complimentary executive passes remain available for qualified technology leadersFAIRFIELD, Conn., Sept. 29, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- More than 115 CIOs, CISOs, CTOs, Chief Data Officers, Chief AI Officers and senior technology leaders from many of Silicon Valley's leading organizations have already registered for HMG Strategy's 18th Annual Silicon Valley C-Level Technology Leadership Summit, taking place October 6 at the Hyatt Centric Mountain View. Designed exclusively for qualified senior IT a\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=047a591575eb6453346455cc06cbb9ebf5a0e03645aaa11c53538de820bb22a0\"}]"
