      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792306200,\"headline\":\"GE Vernova vs. Caterpillar: Which Has More Exposure to the AI Power Build-Out?\",\"id\":142975623,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Vernova and Caterpillar are both powering the data center build-out, but one of them offers investors significantly more exposure.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fb315b60fac64fe998dee02007bd398672104f959d881e80ed41b202fd507664\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792295940,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar announces $10 million workforce investment in North Carolina\",\"id\":142986263,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar is investing up to $10 million in workforce development across North Carolina, including partnerships with Central Carolina Community College and the Sanford Area Growth Alliance, as the manufacturing giant prepares for future growth and increasingly technology-driven production. The announcement Thursday at Caterpillar’s Sanford manufacturing facility is part of the company’s ...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=31f718af1601ae8134a8c09be0c50581a460c4e2950687f11b11f19a48673d1d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792246192,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar (CAT) Turns To Derrick York For Resource Industries Leadership\",\"id\":142961970,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar (NYSE:CAT) announced that Denise Johnson will retire as group president of Resource Industries, effective early 2025. The firm has appointed Derrick York, currently a senior Caterpillar executive, to succeed Johnson as head of Resource Industries. Johnson, who has led the Resource Industries segment, is credited internally with helping drive Caterpillar's mining business to record performance. York brings experience in power generation and finance inside Caterpillar, pointing to...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ad6bb41a1e5435de9d5ddd9ad802a6ddc5a758fd7eb6e5fba4be7cd33eac5de3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792202913,\"headline\":\"How Much Higher Can Caterpillar Stock Go From Here?\",\"id\":142957862,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Caterpillar (CAT) have fallen 14.8% since reaching a one-month high on October 6, 2026. The decline includes a 5.7% loss on October 7. A Barron's report that day tied the drop in Caterpillar and Deere shares to regulatory pressure, noting the Federal Trade Commission and the Department of Agriculture seek public information on the farm equipment market. The stock closed at $735.64 on October 15, resting 31% below its 12-month closing high of $1,062.93 on June 30. A drop of that speed c\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a64277ad2e1490750038ffe37725c3e3583fd7d2b3ef1a01b04c2f2b2d1810c0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792151280,\"headline\":\"Generac vs. Caterpillar: Which Power Stock Is the Better Buy?\",\"id\":142945620,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GNRC and CAT are capitalizing on AI-driven data center power demand, but differences in backlog, valuation and financial strength favor one stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e0e0347132bda344a60127f3351a70a72fb1cce3d0d6a5be6eb5f4e7b96e0c74\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792150680,\"headline\":\"Can CAT's North Carolina Investments Support Sustainable Growth?\",\"id\":142945621,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar is investing $10 million in North Carolina workforce development in addition to its $1 billion investment in a facility to boost compact equipment production in the region.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f6dd7528049f5d8b912b9fdbc8ad541b593bcdc62f80da5e0496cb121cd954b8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792108980,\"headline\":\"UnitedHealth Fell 51.32%, Then Rose 40.64%. DIA’s Exposure Followed Both Moves by Design\",\"id\":142923834,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UnitedHealth's wild ride inside DIA was not an accident or a manager's call. The weighting rule baked into the Dow determined exactly how much of your money followed the stock up and down, and most investors have never read that single line in the prospectus.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c2ddea21e6bdf6212b81c71004ffa176e29ee1740ab96deb06546e45d5d25cf9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792097105,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar (CAT) Stock Sinks As Market Gains: What You Should Know\",\"id\":142922991,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar (CAT) closed at $739.57 in the latest trading session, marking a -1.26% move from the prior day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=422c34a23ace4ead34abc96b1811ba40edbb694b900065a45b6f0aecb89fe090\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792091412,\"headline\":\"Discover which dow jones stocks are making waves on Thursday.\",\"id\":142921152,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Let's have a look at the top dow jones gainers and losers one hour before the close of the markets of today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=545db4733871e90a22820d700146d007479454afeb887e72faa3fb5e27048e68\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792086465,\"headline\":\"Bloom Energy Retreats 4% as AI Power Trade Unwinds; Caterpillar Slides 3%, Generac Slips\",\"id\":142920409,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The AI power trade that sent Bloom Energy surging 165% this year is now reversing hard, and whether the selloff is a brief pause or a warning signal depends on one uncomfortable question about data center spending.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b583541c4ceae0523240a5b03ef102ce69aeecf07a6751357bb92d7cc6dc0c74\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792083300,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Midday, Oct. 15: Markets Mixed as AI Sell-Off Continues\",\"id\":142920408,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Today, Oct. 15, 2026, mounting debt concerns led to a sharp pullback in semiconductor stocks and AI-related names, as further inflation data added to an already cautious mood.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9b35d26b442ee35059d2c3fa712ee52cbd9adc92a44de669e58aeee9c8567621\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792082413,\"headline\":\"These dow jones stocks are moving in today's session\",\"id\":142919827,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay updated with the movements of the dow jones index in the middle of the day on Thursday. Discover which stocks are leading as top gainers and losers in today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=18dc9eae377f70c9060ce92d31795980c6c5b9529453a1aa557a7ac15259d50c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792076400,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar Invests in North Carolina's Future Manufacturing Workforce\",\"id\":142919305,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar Inc. (NYSE: CAT) expanded its workforce commitment to North Carolina, the most recent investment for its five-year, $100 million Building the Future Workforce Initiative. With an allocation of up to $10 million, the funding aims to prepare current and future workers for jobs in modern manufacturing and industry technician roles.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b49ea38208b3431813555acc11551a20859ecd3504715bcfe60e0bd376c46437\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792073849,\"headline\":\"3 Utilities Stocks Moving In Wednesday's Pre-Market Session\",\"id\":139946065,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c71a1ac7041b38942da7d0e9933153e3af4c693c985fcf340e44791b8176495c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792071626,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Dow Rises, Nasdaq Tumbles As AI Worries Hit Major Players (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142913914,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Thursday ahead of more inflation data. Nvidia, Micron and AMD sell off on AI fears.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6ad409edc5845d99345332cecd4ac0d247cc7396d902bc4aa044842c2de7fcee\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792070100,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar Announces Leadership Transition in Resource Industries\",\"id\":142915218,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar Inc. (NYSE: CAT) today announced Denise Johnson, group president of Resource Industries, has elected to retire effective Feb. 1, 2027. Derrick York, who currently serves as president of Solar Turbines and Caterpillar senior vice president, has been appointed group president of Resource Industries, effective Nov. 1, 2026, at which time Johnson will assume an advisory role to ensure a seamless leadership transition.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e73fefa9ded1e3b5d538514f9910f55bf96ff2cd75037a409e89d12e3b89feb4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792065600,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar Inc. to Announce Third-Quarter 2026 Financial Results on October 29\",\"id\":142915219,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar Inc. (NYSE: CAT) will release third-quarter financial results at 5:30 a.m. CDT on Thursday, Oct. 29. The full text of the release will be available at investors.caterpillar.com/financials/quarterly-results and on PR Newswire. The release will be furnished to the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) via a Current Report on Form 8-K in compliance with applicable SEC rules.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a2f24c905b643f3dccd50c41bd5a29bb1b71fab0a210153f885b5e7d76c73688\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062112,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar Investing $10M In Its North Carolina Operations\",\"id\":142918726,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar Inc. (NYSE:CAT) expanded its workforce commitment to North Carolina, the most recent investment for its five-year, $100 million Building the Future Workforce Initiative. With an allocation of up to $10\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f24f33abaa95c987575eb201e1c9c166b7064b669915d1b262240e90dbd8ee67\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792023162,\"headline\":\"Applied Aerospace Defense And 2 Other EV Stocks To Watch\",\"id\":142891785,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Gas prices have stayed above $4 a gallon for a record stretch in 2026 as conflict in the Middle East disrupts oil flows and squeezes drivers. That kind of pain at the pump keeps attention on electric and self driving transport companies that do not rely on crude in the same way. This article walks through three US listed electric and autonomous vehicle stocks from our screener that may merit a closer look. The three electric and autonomous vehicle stocks below are just a sample from a broader...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=45b825f8052bf71b2a197eb2dd5b39da41341b9d25f5c2eb1c64d9bd4c0a676c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792008240,\"headline\":\"CoreWeave’s Bond Scare Is Spreading to AI-Linked Industrial Stocks\",\"id\":142888422,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave’s rising bond yields are rattling AI infrastructure stocks, including GE Vernova, Vertiv and Eaton.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=49c96866d06b603b748c149e756443fe0dbf50963b9189759d829ff17e9342ce\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792005015,\"headline\":\"Discover which dow jones stocks are making waves on Wednesday.\",\"id\":142887223,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Uncover the latest developments among dow jones stocks in today's session. Stay tuned to the dow jones index's top gainers and losers on Wednesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0da62e5b5741f2c815f6c9d71ebb7308149769088a6488e233b3825b4510e5a1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791993360,\"headline\":\"The Real Reason Defense Stocks Are Tanking\",\"id\":142886482,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The defense declines came despite a major effort to expand U.S. missile production, providing a sales benefit to most of the sector for years to come.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=97c8e4a46564b206702a82a260a7cfcdb73e6c03e10d9c056699a7fd886d624a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791985385,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Dow Wavers On Surprise CPI Inflation Data; Bank Of America Sinks On Results (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142882530,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index wavers Wednesday on a surprise CPI inflation report. Bank of America plunges on earnings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=652a71e1ecdfc844e780cdd085b28a5d9f1147ac86cbc380879d3edc06dec046\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791984960,\"headline\":\"Will Generac's Free Cash Flow Outpace Its Rising Capital Needs?\",\"id\":142885197,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GNRC expects $350 million in 2026 free cash flow despite higher capital spending, as a $1.6 billion data center backlog fuels capacity expansion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d820dc6b57d0eb99b1a9092a6d55397263f6b80127f229170fa179281198496f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791983700,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar Inc. Maintains Dividend\",\"id\":142882667,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Board of Directors of Caterpillar Inc. (NYSE: CAT) voted to maintain the quarterly dividend of one dollar and sixty-three cents ($1.63) per share of common stock payable Nov. 19 to shareholders of record at the close of business Oct. 19.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=58ab0291598e4354e9e8565cb49f8842c4966906a9892fa0d41f1f80f15636ae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791982938,\"headline\":\"Oppenheimer Maintains Outperform on Caterpillar, Lowers Price Target to $1009\",\"id\":142918727,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Oppenheimer  analyst Kristen Owen   maintains Caterpillar (NYSE:CAT) with a Outperform and lowers the price target from $1118 to $1009.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eb8577221f4867a7bc98811609ca92f935bc1fed544f713e45df3527b5aa4949\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791981188,\"headline\":\"Trading Halt: Halt status updated at 8:55:00 AM ET: Quotation Resumption: News and Resumption Times\",\"id\":140108504,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=699523801bb94e09fc3e005144b10c38696e4a3e830ba8c18914c07785fb751d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791979206,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar Inc. (CAT) is Attracting Investor Attention: Here is What You Should Know\",\"id\":142882668,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar (CAT) has been one of the stocks most watched by Zacks.com users lately. So, it is worth exploring what lies ahead for the stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ea1587dbbe82cb118f07c6c73a93d5d0407508b4181b3da12afe380d9bf39b42\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791977994,\"headline\":\"Nasdaq 100 Drops 1% on Hot CPI, SOXX Falls 7th Day: Stock Market Today\",\"id\":142915760,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Nasdaq-100-way-down.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The Nasdaq 100 fell 1% by midday Wednesday after September CPI topped forecasts, pushing Treasury yields and rate-hike bets higher.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=96ad35f5ef177e04917a658689de84478274bbf6edf6e6f298c9a08636fefbf6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791970147,\"headline\":\"What's Going On With Caterpillar Stock Wednesday?\",\"id\":142883258,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Lafayette---Circa-May-2020-Caterpillar-L.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Citigroup \\u0026amp; Truist trim CAT target prices despite maintaining Buy ratings. Key takeaways on Caterpillar\\u0026#39;s Q3 preview.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dd795a4d1047422879df227b68b47ffd58cb377c9717784b3949504c55be73b3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791969293,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar (CAT) Stock May Be 13% Undervalued On FTC Inquiry\",\"id\":142876366,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar has pulled back in recent weeks after a long run, which puts a fresh spotlight on whether the current share price lines up with the cash the business is expected to generate over time. The stock has returned about 318.7% over the past 5 years, which raises the question of how much future cash flow is already reflected in that gain. A new US$1b manufacturing investment in North Carolina and the planned Fabick Cat acquisition may support future revenue and operating cash...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=78eaf7f68e8ffedba6d5700c0b311e28b28fa8ae73a2a969d1c13b8bed775352\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791948000,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Industrial Average Monitor Update - A Look At 30 U.S. Large-Caps\",\"id\":142869843,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1196086989/image_1196086989.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Visible Alpha consensus expects the Dow Jones Industrial Average to deliver an 18.7% weighted price return in the medium term. Read more here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=310ef25895cc39730bc02d53261c2e29cfcc1b7eb4f0498474d0e9c56b8614e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791929978,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar (CAT): A Cyclical Machine Maker Meets a Growth-Stock Valuation\",\"id\":142855360,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"For most of its history, Caterpillar (NYSE:CAT) has traded like a cyclical machine maker, with profits that rise and fall with construction and mining. Lately, investors have been paying for it like a growth stock instead, at more than 29 times expected earnings. The business explains part of that. Caterpillar builds the bulldozers, excavators, and […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d10269a4506751aa9cdcd4a26249245d25d2c9338885522a2166f28dc8dc266c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791929119,\"headline\":\"What Could Derail Caterpillar Stock?\",\"id\":142855361,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors holding Caterpillar (CAT) stock are paying 33.9 times earnings, compared with 21.9 for the S\\u0026P 500. Sustaining that premium requires durable growth, and a rapidly expanding part of Caterpillar's business is selling into a single type of project. During the company's latest earnings call, a concern was raised about how long those projects will keep arriving. So what exactly is the concern.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=45107dac2ec7796c7ea37c5e75f4033b0b6dad41ed49398ca5c1a387b301f2a9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791926700,\"headline\":\"Which Industrials Stock Do Analysts Like Better: Deere or Caterpillar?\",\"id\":142854307,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Narratives about the two heavy equipment makers have diverged, leaving one a Wall Street favorite.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=78886dc6c77910524e644e1889e59f753eec885d0ddea8b88a49300eac8805e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791925390,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Dow Rallies On Bank Results; Micron, Sandisk, SK Hynix Sell Off (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142848534,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Tuesday as JPMorgan and Goldman report earnings. Micron, Sandisk and SK Hynix sell off.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d0ee787dfc6275f3170cb3f896417fe01932316ae6b58e14e38a15871ad5481\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791918616,\"headline\":\"Explore the top gainers and losers within the dow jones index in today's session.\",\"id\":142853114,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Uncover the latest developments among dow jones stocks in today's session. Stay tuned to the dow jones index's top gainers and losers on Tuesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=239f1ec0bd6003c75b83346777ebb77ec584c75f68f4c78fd3f43f5a7e2d2574\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791918301,\"headline\":\"These S\\u0026P500 stocks are moving in today's session\",\"id\":142853113,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Join us in exploring the top gainers and losers within the S\\u0026P500 index one hour before the close of the markets on Tuesday as we examine the latest happenings in today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3a18440b38bccb051232c611a647e6916b791c40ac5821e8ef45ae23e92a6764\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791915073,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Nasdaq-100, Small Caps Lead Dip; Apple Retakes Entry, Meta Near Pivot Point (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142852346,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Tuesday as JPMorgan and Goldman report earnings. Micron, Sandis