{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790257500,\"headline\":\"Barron's 400 ETF (BFOR) Adds Energy and Materials, Reduces Utilities and Consumer Discretionary in Fall Rebalance\",\"id\":142380268,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"DENVER, September 24, 2026--The Barron’s 400 ETF (NYSE Arca: BFOR, the \\\"Fund\\\"), a smart beta exchange-traded fund, has completed its semi-annual rebalance following the reconstitution and equal weighting of its underlying benchmark, the Barron’s 400 Index (B400, the \\\"Index\\\"). The rebalance, effective September 18, 2026, replaced 191 of the Index's 400 constituents based on a decline in their fundamentals-based scores from the Index's last rebalance in March 2026. This represents a turnover rate\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=de7a7fb8877f3fae14b4e4a574480c5812b0f81795adb3ef7270a6faf7b57bc1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790257245,\"headline\":\"UBS sees rising reliance on AI capex as a key growth risk\",\"id\":142380398,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- The pickup in U.S. business investment and manufacturing is more dependent on the artificial intelligence boom than many investors realize, according to UBS in a note on Thursday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7ad96fc29a5c6f093dae42283774de3bdbcc35b558d8cd7e8fd8411d231e4e0e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790256318,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar or Exxon: Which Dividend Has More Room to Grow?\",\"id\":142379050,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar just hit $20 billion in quarterly sales for the first time ever, while Exxon pumped out $23.6 billion in operating cash flow. Both companies raised their dividends, but their very different balance sheets tell a story about which payout has genuine room to run.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b38aedaf5a3ae842055603f34f473450e3c137418add7392d2e31ed0eb91355e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790212504,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar (CAT), What Is Behind The Fresh Attention?\",\"id\":142366628,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Why Caterpillar stock is back in focus Caterpillar (CAT) is drawing fresh attention after reporting robust results, updating its 2026 outlook, and expanding its autonomous hauling technology with quarry operator Luck Stone in Virginia. Caterpillar’s recent autonomous hauling update and conference appearances arrive after a sharp pullback over the past quarter, with the 90 day share price return down 23.18%. Even so, the year to date share price return is 35.70% and the 1 year total...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b5a1aa3c79e997686cdb21fee1ccfa995327fbd529c1849b8e563e28bbb52b0c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790205300,\"headline\":\"3 Companies With a Strong History of Dividend Growth\",\"id\":142365928,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Several stocks with a strong history of increasing payouts - Broadcom (AVGO), ExxonMobil (XOM), and Caterpillar (CAT) - are strong options for those looking to reap income.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b4cdc5df201ba0248989163a965998cd5a2812824decc8f5b138b82506ac74ad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790190609,\"headline\":\"Wednesday's session: top gainers and losers in the dow jones index\",\"id\":142363780,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay updated with the movement of dow jones stocks in today's session. Discover which dow jones stocks are making waves on Wednesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bb4171ba2315271ffac02d3155801d13d6e8d838f8d2b0f43020c3b412215389\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790178900,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar vs. Komatsu: Which Heavy Equipment Stock is the Better Buy?\",\"id\":142363176,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CAT's record backlog, earnings growth and stronger 2026 outlook contrast with KMTUY's tariff costs and profit pressures.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cc7301555d78c2bbf30539fc924527ae84686057edd2bf175a339f2cf749dfce\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790174400,\"headline\":\"XRX Stock Rises 11.5% in 3 Months: Here's What You Should Know\",\"id\":142361984,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Xerox shares jump 11.5% in three months as the Lexmark deal, stronger cash flow, debt reduction and a raised 2026 outlook improve its growth profile.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4574565e0c284b0be894314cd84bf1690e4442f4782b343e17b5b51246239a27\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790104206,\"headline\":\"Tuesday's session: top gainers and losers in the dow jones index\",\"id\":142341737,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Uncover the latest developments among dow jones stocks in today's session. Stay tuned to the dow jones index's top gainers and losers on Tuesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d1a0fa717a3205c82feb1b910304a2237ef6e5907fe442d635e0bf4fae4efbd3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790084520,\"headline\":\"Apogee Expands Performance Surfaces Segment With Groglass Buyout\",\"id\":142337731,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"APOG's $71.8M Groglass acquisition expands its Performance Surfaces capabilities, product offerings and geographic footprint.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e33f99ffd80bbc3339690fd0c43bfe1c18c283b6f6bd3cbdc2ad3738a6c89846\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790034623,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar’s CEO Says Demand Runs Past Its $72B Backlog. Here’s What That Means for the Stock\",\"id\":142318451,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Caterpillar StockCurrent Price: $808. 99Target Price (Mid): ~$1,050Street Target: ~$980Potential Total Return: ~30%Annualized IRR: ~6% / yearWhat Happened?Caterpillar (CAT) supplies the engines and turbines increasingly running data centers as permanent power plants, not backup, and its CEO just told investors that the shift is the durable one.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eadfd1cac9fef6478e6132bc0c8559e64f1141c15e656d3a6424b7b31faf42b4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790033880,\"headline\":\"3 Stocks That Pay Dividends and Offer AI Exposure\",\"id\":142315703,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"For those interested in getting paid with some AI exposure, Broadcom (AVGO), Vertiv (VRT), and Caterpillar (CAT) all fit the criteria.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4decf81b3c2a217cfdef2a361dc181ed864db9e18be85fbf8f944217d1987c6a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790008805,\"headline\":\"Discover which dow jones stocks are making waves on Monday.\",\"id\":142314740,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Uncover the latest developments among dow jones stocks in today's session. Stay tuned to the dow jones index's top gainers and losers on Monday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=14e4cf65769e673f42a4d4281a5372e23d98a76970930436984c66e0099204fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790006220,\"headline\":\"Natural Gas ETFs in Focus as El Nino Gets Upgraded to \\\"Super\\\" Status\",\"id\":142314866,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Natural gas ETFs face shifting winter demand as a Super El Nino could suppress heating needs and weigh on gas prices.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=35fffbdeebfa31d07080e8567eef6d97abec24747a5a35925eb8bc16e4bfa12f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789986151,\"headline\":\"SpaceX Finds Way Around Data Center Moratorium As 300-Plus Restrictions Delay 3 Projects\",\"id\":142313856,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/21/SpaceX-Falcon-Heavy-rocket-during-liftof.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX sidestepped Brownsville restrictions as SemiAnalysis says 300+ data-center rules have delayed just three U.S. projects.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=69a797021a6d33e3d55f37d8d2ec56d21e41a7555ebc46e9e03ee5637f55be57\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789980900,\"headline\":\"What Higher Interest Rates Mean for Caterpillar, GE Vernova, and Vertiv\",\"id\":142307561,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"It's important not to panic over the impact of rising rates on industrial stocks, not least because they are likely to affect different stocks in varied ways.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a6d1e5cdc9837aeb762ca6f65b3cc38feef8426fbfa16289cf62e1273014792d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789917600,\"headline\":\"The Caterpillar Correction Shouldn't Last Much Longer\",\"id\":142288938,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar is in an excellent position as hyperscalers rush to spend capital on their AI build-outs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f357b3f400b242453e6aa616f239abc44a8f816e3b0413e32831ab68b2116598\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789863600,\"headline\":\"Oracle Has Committed Hundreds of Billions to AI Data Centers. These 2 Industrial Stocks Will Power Them.\",\"id\":142276884,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Oracle's AI spending spree needs power and cooling to match. Two industrial stocks are already cashing in on that demand.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=755a800258640b6a9416ef74f735a7e011acba52f61f342363808c0c65d6d329\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789787886,\"headline\":\"Is Caterpillar’s Growing Quarry Autonomy Footprint Quietly Reshaping Its Competitive Edge (CAT)?\",\"id\":142267316,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In mid-September 2026, Luck Stone announced it had expanded its collaboration with Caterpillar to roll out autonomous hauling technology to two additional Virginia quarries, building on a site where autonomous Cat trucks have already moved more than 3.50 billion tons without reported injuries. This expansion, including the first-ever deployment of Caterpillar’s autonomous haulage on Cat 775 trucks, highlights how the company is pairing automation with workforce skill development to address...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=abfe0a72238aeb5dc55df15f9edbf82a417c394f5b163e1c814809523d6ffa5f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789763745,\"headline\":\"Should Caterpillar's Tariff Bill Worry You More Than Its Backlog?\",\"id\":142261619,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar (CAT) delivered the biggest quarter in its history, with a $72 billion order book behind it—59% of which it expects to ship over the next twelve months. The stock has gained 82.8% on a price basis over the past twelve months against 15.6% for the S\\u0026P 500, and still sits about 25% below its 52-week high. Neither the record nor the backlog is the number to watch. That would be the roughly $2.2 billion of tariff costs, before the second-quarter recoveries, that Caterpillar expects to ca\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ad0ee5fb392587a1c9ef2bb148a8b21d90d41a42752c69e27ddfd22e58c26ab3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789758920,\"headline\":\"If You Invested $1000 In Caterpillar Stock 10 Years Ago, You Would Have This Much Today\",\"id\":142271228,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/07/10/valuestock_1.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar (NYSE:CAT) has outperformed the market over the past 10 years by 12.13% on an annualized basis producing an average annual return of 25.49%. Currently, Caterpillar has a market capitalization of $380.43\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=08abef06b60c3a8dc4b1efc8289be53259f0194f2a8e604a97e3b6b457840a6d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789749606,\"headline\":\"Which dow jones stocks are moving on Friday?\",\"id\":142257813,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Curious about the dow jones stocks that are in motion on Friday? Join us as we explore the top movers within the dow jones index during today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=998b7fb86800193462b3eb80f7221c5994067abd591695b8f964263732a61396\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789742003,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar’s Robot Trucks Are Heading to Two More Quarries. Should You Buy the Dip Under $800?\",\"id\":142259571,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar just sent its self-driving trucks to two more quarries, but the autonomous milestone tells almost nothing about what is actually moving the stock. Understanding the real driver changes how you read the dip.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b268dd3ba7fc6b70e043220aed41bd55a6278a40d410426c23c3cc1c2b4b46d4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789740900,\"headline\":\"One of These Dividend Aristocrats Pays More. The Other Compounds Faster. Which Is Roth Ready?\",\"id\":142259572,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola and Caterpillar have both raised dividends for decades, but inside a Roth IRA the two stocks serve completely different investors, and picking the wrong one could cost you years of compounding.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a406adfdd4f2c9776cfad1b2e9d2695b1383fb966d8f6994c02044bbdeefd588\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789729920,\"headline\":\"Buy AI-Led EME, PWR and CAT for Long-Term to Gain From Recent Softness\",\"id\":142251861,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"EME, PWR and CAT are benefiting from the AI data center boom, with strong backlogs and growth plans.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=676c2456e8b2ce44559ce38bcb184e6e9d36d5ac43145441d41c563840caf19c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789716000,\"headline\":\"Zacks Industry Outlook Caterpillar, Komatsu and Terex\",\"id\":142242612,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar, Komatsu and Terex have been highlighted in this Industry Outlook article.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0b7c25be82da99d2e537c10419a174e950e09214fb8ed612a7fa5dfeac56e95e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789681508,\"headline\":\"Caterpillar (CAT) Outpaces Stock Market Gains: What You Should Know\",\"id\":142232317,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In the closing of the recent trading day, Caterpillar (CAT) stood at $798.57, denoting a +2.02% move from the preceding trading day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7b8710d53d290818ae1eedf43c611060bf37e7934d2e2e226a7451cc9747bf14\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789680064,\"headline\":\"AI Power Stocks Rally After Generac's Deal For Amazon Data Centers\",\"id\":142231748,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Generac's Amazon agreement spotlighted an emerging growth lever as the rapid buildout of data centers offsets sluggish demand for home standby generators. The news also lifted several of Generac stock's electrical equipment and power management peers on Thursday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=47b8ffbd43b1348fb8a614f37c0b76734d89a30aa3f202ddb2328352dbe1e2c2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789675207,\"headline\":\"Even With $262,000 in VYM, You Wouldn’t Get a $500 Check Every Month\",\"id\":142231828,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Retirees chasing a simple $500 monthly check from VYM run straight into a gap between how yields are calculated and how cash actually lands in your account, and the math gets uncomfortable fast.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=93fbcb15edd0fd79063b3d9fa08ef66e2dc58d1187511d3677207c9d6ad560c4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789659801,\"headline\":\"Generac Surges 16% on $2.4B Amazon Data Center Generator Deal; Caterpillar Ticks Up, Cummins Sits Out the Rally\",\"id\":142232319,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Amazon just handed Generac a contract that sent shares surging, but buried inside the deal is a warrant arrangement that could let the customer claw back the very gains it created. Here is what the peer group silence from Cummins reveals about who actually wins.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5800f8740a3803b74a1d9ce77f47c0c323cd875ef1b1bbb9a26705964a686db4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789657560,\"headline\":\"3 Stocks to Watch in the Promising Construction \\u0026 Mining Equipment Industry\",\"id\":142232232,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The prospects of the Zacks Manufacturing - Construction and Mining industry look good. Stocks like CAT, KMTUY and TEX are worth a look.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3395f473ff4314709ac831052d066083d0cb2c2820baa25a786cdbf0e3358070\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789654320,\"headline\":\"Generac Stock Surges on Amazon Data Center Deal. Why It’s a Game-Changer.\",\"id\":142231849,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The backup power company disclosed a long-term deal to provide Amazon generators for its data centers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=398b5a659e32043b25bd2901f78fb36bad54a7cbbb815ccab2c9750fed3efb32\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789653452,\"headline\":\"Dow gains 250 points as oil prices and yields fall after Fed hike\",\"id\":142225936,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Stocks climbed Thursday as the 10-year Treasury yield fell below 5% and oil prices eased, partially reversing Wednesday's Fed-driven losses\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5914612d431fa1746f5c4fe5fe95cca3c0dde0cbda6feb67dfbc24a41ba2c541\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789651260,\"headline\":\"Generac Signs Amazon Generator Deal With $2.4B of Initial Deliveries\",\"id\":142225378,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GNRC lands a long-term Amazon generator deal with $2.4B of initial 2027-2028 deliveries, expanding its data center power business.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=66e2124bcb0b22b545f0787da53cd204b1fd98b4a95f4469ab0666ad4e2b9a6f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789643760,\"headline\":\"Generac Stock Surges 35% on Amazon Data Center Deal. Why It’s a Game-Changer.\",\"id\":142223128,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The backup power company disclosed a long-term deal to provide Amazon generators for its data centers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=84897bf1bae338c87456a9ecff87679c12046ca66a5e7248ecbd5e894716a234\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789614910,\"headline\":\"What Does Caterpillar (CAT) Mean For Quarry Automation With Its New Truck Rollout?\",\"id\":142207831,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Caterpillar (NYSE:CAT) expanded its autonomous hauling partnership with Luck Stone to additional quarry sites in the United States. The rollout includes the first use of autonomous haulage on Cat 775 trucks specifically configured for quarry operations. The partners are targeting gains in safety, production consistency and workforce development through wider use of automation across these quarries. The expanded Caterpillar and Luck Stone autonomous hauling rollout on Cat 775 trucks builds on...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=392a73808c7480ab1ab8c96a59399b2789cab48c1494f36aae870d58f9914d3e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789597020,\"headline\":\"Michael Burry reveals his verdict on the ongoing AI bubble\",\"id\":142201331,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"CAT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A rare moment of agreement among AI’s biggest names has caught Burry’s attention, and his interpretation of what is happening is striking.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f46394469a52bec18f5d042023230334c31c16b57d79810305f7cca62e1cd805\"}]"
