      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792382297,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) Q3 Earnings Report Preview: What To Look For\",\"id\":142993975,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Industrial conglomerate GE Aerospace (NYSE:GE) will be reporting results this Tuesday morning. Here’s what you need to know.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0481ea42de2e4b623ffa754eb9ed6c2ab2b5931c53be482787084a916a594090\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792371600,\"headline\":\"America Needs 48,000 Tons of Rare Earth Magnets. It Only Makes 300\",\"id\":142991468,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On January 1, the Pentagon’s new rule on Chinese magnet supply chains takes effect. Nine days later, the truce keeping China’s toughest rare earth rules on hold is set to expire. REalloys has been building a heavy rare earth supply chain outside of China to supply those contractors.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=37f722067c89a46054d2ea50f5cd00b4e1b652d1d3dce9125d84f2bf55138bb1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792346400,\"headline\":\"Tesla, Meta, GE Aerospace, GM,  IBM, and More Stocks to Watch This Week\",\"id\":142988565,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"It’s a heavy week for earnings, with reports also coming from Lockheed Martin, Spotify, Abbott, and many more. This week will also bring data on manufacturing, services, and new homes.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3b9b65ee48be8769aa35d4a77ac8d2b59e32c0318a3ffda6a015e232e33f52ae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792304769,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Week Ahead\",\"id\":142985350,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b003098e70a6cdd7a3ab60fb61978bd51c28cff1b3b3250070bf025dbecfc5c3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792259551,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Stock Is Up 5% in One Year. Should You Buy GE Now?\",\"id\":142986264,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysGE Aerospace stock is up 5% over the past year, closing at $313. 83 on October 16, 2026, though that sits 20% below the $389 intraday record it set on August 6.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=46410232933eaa5fc036434cd848721adc88c103ab114033f354fe3bde4187be\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792234800,\"headline\":\"Meta, Tesla Headline Earnings In Busy Week For Markets\",\"id\":142961762,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/assets/og_image_1200-29b2bfe1a595477db6826bd2126c63ac2091efb7ec76347a8e7f81ba17e3de6c.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street Week Ahead: key earnings (Meta, Tesla, Netflix), IPOs \\u0026 economic data. Read here for more details.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3dcbe5a8689c76a628f51ae4c5084970467aab6b7f0f374e353ded8fe09592d4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792185508,\"headline\":\"What GE Aerospace's Earnings Outlook Means For Shareholders\",\"id\":142950870,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace has secured a large CFM International deal to supply and service more than 300 LEAP-1B engines for Turkish Airlines' Boeing 737 MAX fleet, and is also expanding castings capacity through the planned acquisition of Consolidated Precision Products. The Turkish Airlines engine and long term services agreement increases GE Aerospace's recurring maintenance revenue base and supports potential future MRO activity through a new engine facility in Türkiye. Next, the focus turns to how...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8be0ed55128545d15cef25a6d0c2094932e5bb83119266817875a6e72f51f29\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179028,\"headline\":\"Aerospace, Defense Demand Intact Heading Into Earnings Despite Sentiment Softness, Morgan Stanley Says\",\"id\":142950104,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"US aerospace and defense companies' upcoming financial results are likely to reflect continued deman\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6581fb2bba7d4988fd4eb66eee251162b79d18a0d4fd92cda1cb31d4d04c35e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792174620,\"headline\":\"How to Approach GE Aerospace Stock Ahead of Its Q3 Earnings Release?\",\"id\":142950102,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE's Q3 earnings outlook points to strong growth, fueled by commercial and defense demand, but its premium valuation and rising costs warrant attention.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cd17f45bf00e6dfdcb759da96865734ef1c07fa93d5e4ef6fecf90278cc55685\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792163154,\"headline\":\"Aerospace, Defense Stocks' Demand Intact Despite Softer Sentiment, Morgan Stanley Says\",\"id\":142948018,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Aerospace and defense stocks face softer sentiment, but demand is still intact, Morgan Stanley said\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9ab5a562cee0df5998b9de7480c84c5c0f0c7d45a9e0223bbb8e0db071006366\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792157642,\"headline\":\"Ahead of GE Aerospace Earnings, Here's What Barchart Data Says Comes Next for GE Stock\",\"id\":142950103,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace is set to report its Q3 earnings on October 20. Options market believes GE shares will slip further after the quarterly print.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bcf7581610dc4ab192d6788ed3d42979688454cf4600ab4541d86c7a1ca4817b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792149180,\"headline\":\"Defense ETFs in Spotlight Ahead of Q3 Earnings Season\",\"id\":142945611,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Defense ETFs draw attention ahead of Q3 earnings as rising Treasury yields pressure valuations, while strong demand may support growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=767d69adc47751c464710f09e6300e200ab63e75306193f66eeacbf44c07f227\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792147620,\"headline\":\"Turkish Airlines and CFM sign MOU for more than 600 LEAP-1B engines\",\"id\":142944272,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Includes 300 LEAP-1B engines to power up to 150 new 737 MAX aircraft; long-term services for entire fleet of 600+ LEAP-1B engines; and material services agreement to support the airline’s future engine MRO shop Turkish Airlines and CFM sign MOU for more than 600 LEAP-1B engines The MoU was signed during a ceremony in Istanbul by Prof. Murat Şeker, Chairman of the Board and the Executive Committee of Turkish Airlines (center), Mikail Akbulut, CEO and Board Member of Turkish Technic (left), and Ol\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eda8b1c08840ac206e83c1cd4afe9deddf921edf11711738c929d755c256bdd4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792133464,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace JV CFM International Signs MoU With Turkish Airlines To Purchase 300+ LEAP-1B Engines, Including Spares\",\"id\":142945375,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\" The long-term services agreement will cover airline’s entire LEAP-1B engine fleet, including previously ordered and delivered engines, spares, and engines associated with leased aircraft and potential options.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3633a72cf05323d814d34b8910ea38bdb9d8a18aefa778aea33464156bcffeac\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792104602,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace vs. Lockheed Martin: Which Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142923002,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Commercial aviation is booming and GE Aerospace keeps raising guidance. Lockheed Martin’s record backlog reflects a world spending more on defense than ever.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d98aaaed9a75676a0f6188409e0f8bd4eff4f4d7d3da04be26b26665bc77bbd1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792097101,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) Exceeds Market Returns: Some Facts to Consider\",\"id\":142923003,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In the closing of the recent trading day, GE Aerospace (GE) stood at $311.81, denoting a +1.56% move from the preceding trading day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d69af9184f049b40de0f46aa82adfb1ee5772f0cd635d832ede836a68b753f4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792071339,\"headline\":\"Why It’s Time To Load Up on GE Aerospace Stock\",\"id\":142921432,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace could deliver solid third-quarter results despite the broader market concerns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ce68cab6b8fbfbc13b8d33d96918110aa9a77d9c724295a144c14e378c95fa1b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792066521,\"headline\":\"GE (GE) Q3 Earnings on the Horizon: Analysts' Insights on Key Performance Measures\",\"id\":142916414,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Get a deeper insight into the potential performance of GE (GE) for the quarter ended September 2026 by going beyond Wall Street's top-and-bottom-line estimates and examining the estimates for some of its key metrics.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=65925d9e91191a7d9ada1bfffcb77d4e6110688ea5104b5f7ad90edfd443b238\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792065607,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) Is a Trending Stock: Facts to Know Before Betting on It\",\"id\":142916415,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE (GE) has been one of the stocks most watched by Zacks.com users lately. So, it is worth exploring what lies ahead for the stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4ff00bd870338e31db10f55e20363bcab49d86924c8a1f32b95f3597900f486b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792024808,\"headline\":\"Is GE Vernova Stock Still Telling You The Same Thing?\",\"id\":142892204,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of GE Vernova (GEV) returned 66.5% in the twelve months to October 13, 2026, outpacing the 20.5% return for the S\\u0026P 500. During that period, orders consistently increased at the company's Power and Electrification businesses, and management raised its 2026 revenue forecast twice. Those orders appear to be what investors were paying for. So what could you have seen of those orders before the twelve months began, on October 10, 2025.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6558f2aa9e08d4b412cbf7f52ca5ffbdd66101ec4c68891d1fbb52afbc46c055\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791915114,\"headline\":\"Government‑Backed Prestwick Expansion Might Change The Case For Investing In General Electric (GE)\",\"id\":142853506,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"General Electric recently secured up to £33 million from UK, Scottish and local governments, alongside £27 million of its own investment, to expand its Prestwick jet‑engine maintenance facility, protecting 850 jobs and adding 150 new roles. This government-backed expansion underlines the importance of GE’s UK maintenance hub, which services roughly half of all GE engines on Boeing’s 787, to its broader aerospace operations. We’ll now explore how securing UK government support for Prestwick’s...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77047ec90f3ae25351bdefdf4bc993eda4e516f5a3681ec433d6cefa76149b52\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791911777,\"headline\":\"General Electric (GE) Wins UK Backing To Expand Prestwick Jet Engine Jobs\",\"id\":142852488,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"General Electric (NYSE:GE) secured multi tier UK government funding to protect and expand jet engine maintenance work at its Prestwick site. UK, Scottish and local authorities are committing significant public capital to support jobs tied to GE engines used on Boeing 787 aircraft. GE plans to invest substantial funds to modernize and grow the Prestwick facility as part of a longer term UK footprint. The new government backed Prestwick expansion is only one part of the wider investment story...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0e640c4c0ae680cd563937f773f3f2cd6d5c9caf7186e3b1dc27facdeb4d275d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791907020,\"headline\":\"Stock-Split Watch: Is GE Vernova Next?\",\"id\":142852489,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Vernova stock has skyrocketed since its debut two and a half years ago.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=447c233e2d3f047253c5206e08870fd9e74295adeab73bc24f50d99413e13f4f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791898264,\"headline\":\"3 Big Reasons to Love GE Aerospace (GE)\",\"id\":142848758,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace has been treading water for the past six months, recording a small loss of 1.1% while holding steady at $308.37. The stock also fell short of the S\\u0026P 500’s 13.5% gain during that period.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a7c7aea43109e2784ab617d41494e88232254ed55f30e6f5dffc96ae85ee26dc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791894473,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace (GE): Can an $11.75B Foundry Deal Defend Its Premium?\",\"id\":142848759,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Most companies go shopping when growth starts to fade. GE Aerospace (NYSE:GE) went shopping with revenue still climbing more than 20%. Last month, the jet-engine maker agreed to buy Consolidated Precision Products/CPP, a Cleveland-based maker of superalloy and titanium castings, for $11.75 billion. GE has been a CPP customer for more than 15 years. Now […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aae4dac7e89aff2e9618cac8e749236af6210f96bb67928c7028def1d1dd79b9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791876066,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Earnings Are Imminent; These Most Accurate Analysts Revise Forecasts Ahead Of Earnings Call\",\"id\":142849677,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/13/Beavercreek---May-31--2024-Ge-Aerospace-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace reports Q3 earnings Oct. 20; analysts expect $1.99 EPS and $12.84B revenue. analysts remain bullish.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f6b2ab777cf71a3291ecc2e6238a696e9577bba0868afd6ed138aa4d5bd58072\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791870300,\"headline\":\"Jet engine jobs to stay in UK after taxpayers hand factory £33m\",\"id\":142839178,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"General Electric (GE) will receive up to £33m of taxpayer funding to stop the US aerospace giant moving jet-engine maintenance jobs out of the UK.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=31b6c0136a32c25d9bbc49e309aa0550b0cf52a1f018f912f271a8d18a9f9b9b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791865443,\"headline\":\"Rolls-Royce: Down 8% Since My Downgrade, Now What?\",\"id\":142839656,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2230382835/image_2230382835.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Rolls-Royce offers a more attractive entry after an 8% pullback, with a maintained buy rating despite heightened risks. Learn why RYCEF is a buy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=20b9cab83343d257757cc2f36dae3f01728c95e72be00564a05f11c772b7d882\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791846859,\"headline\":\"How Much Downside Is Left In GE Aerospace Stock?\",\"id\":142825355,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of GE Aerospace (GE) have lost 14.8% over the past three months, while the S\\u0026P 500 gained 2.8%. Part of that drop materialized over the past month as RTX and Boeing shares fell as well, showing that the weakness was not isolated to GE. The broader market, however, did not drop with the aerospace sector. So how far has GE stock fallen when the market itself sold off.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e0bddaa332b165e107a008720f6e5d6d5113e3e7d36396aa313fd6a5bfbe8a03\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791828002,\"headline\":\"Boeing vs. GE Aerospace: Which U.S. Industrial Giant's Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142823714,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace generates a 19% net margin and $7.3B in free cash flow, while Boeing struggles with negative cash flow and a 10x debt-to-equity ratio.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=560df1f6e134d481ebf3a79e455bbae8a398abfc27336c1db2cf286b351a1e19\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791821340,\"headline\":\"Howmet Gains From Strength in Commercial Aerospace: Will the Momentum Last?\",\"id\":142822741,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"HWM's commercial aerospace revenues surge 28% in the second quarter of 2026, fueling segment growth. Can rising aircraft production sustain its momentum?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c333721990fdead31e249ccaab2ca728d26f0c39083ee0943b8cfd31449b7bbf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791816067,\"headline\":\"Shield AI Is Taking GE Aerospace Deeper into AI's Most Unusual Battleground\",\"id\":142849678,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/GEAerospace-10-12-2026-F110-xbat-poland-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace is exploring engine maintenance support for Shield AI’s autonomous X-BAT fighter, opening a potential defense growth opportunity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dd10cd4255fe8254a0bde2fb677781bd3db0228a43668a69c2eb9e0afd433612\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791812466,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace, Shield AI, And Poland's WZL-2 Sign MOU To Advance F110 Engine MRO Support In Poland\",\"id\":142849679,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.geaerospace.com/news/press-releases/ge-aerospace-shield-ai-and-polands-wzl-2-sign-mou-advance-f110-engine-mro-support\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6febb40044df116e2517636ecb12b200d7d94e96462eb4efa5c80f4f1047ae08\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791809161,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Announces Plans To Nearly Double Supplier Spend In-Country To Help Meet India’s Aviation Industry Growth\",\"id\":142849680,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.geaerospace.com/news/press-releases/india/ge-aerospace-announces-plans-nearly-double-supplier-spend-country-help-meet-indias\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1df24f0a0e2316f5ddeb2af59f36c44d8de7ba77455f567f2ccf2ef82e770e8c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791590322,\"headline\":\"What Is Driving The Move In GE Vernova Stock?\",\"id\":142768652,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of GE Vernova (GEV) returned 60.1% over the year to October 8, 2026, easily outpacing the 16.3% return for the S\\u0026P 500. Customers spent those twelve months placing steady orders for gas turbines and power equipment for data centers. During that timeframe, on July 22, 2026, management raised its 2026 revenue and free cash flow guidance. What has that changed at GE Vernova, and what has it not.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5a2c856cfb266801ed7a18a56bd60ed065be4b9782c818c1c15bb82b462420bf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791590174,\"headline\":\"What Could Derail Boeing Stock?\",\"id\":142768653,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Boeing (BA) have lost 15.4% over the past twelve months, trailing the 17.0% returned by the S\\u0026P 500. A lack of customer demand is not the issue, as the aerospace company has a backlog of more than 6,200 airplanes that i