l\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=17856fbdee6abc38dd3d13aee0d3da86b46aebe72f6327f927d347ccaef4ab8c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791046796,\"headline\":\"In 1959, A Vermont Gas Station Attendant Spent $2,380 On His First 39 Shares Of Stock. Over The Next 5 Decades, He Built A 95+ Stock Portfolio Of Blue Chip Dividend Payers. By 2014, Ronald Read’s Portfolio Was Worth Nearly $8 Million\",\"id\":142615632,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A gas station attendant and part-time janitor from Vermont quietly accumulated over 95 stocks across five decades, and what his neighbors discovered after his death in 2014 stunned an entire community.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e10efde8de5725ad57bee2d73b943cd84ad941c80fd1c823302e206665d2f01c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791025200,\"headline\":\"PepsiCo, Delta Lead Upcoming Earnings Slate; Fed Minutes In Focus\",\"id\":142614749,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/assets/og_image_1200-29b2bfe1a595477db6826bd2126c63ac2091efb7ec76347a8e7f81ba17e3de6c.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Preview next weekâs key market eventsâPMI, Fed minutes, jobless claimsâand top earnings (PepsiCo, Delta). Read here for more details.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=319ce212849a2fa489c5fdd6b8418455dd7c6852f1f296e3785c3b434806100b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790935391,\"headline\":\"Should You Think About GE Aerospace Stock Differently Now?\",\"id\":142585450,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) management describes the company differently than it did a year ago. Management has changed its one-line summary of how the business earns its money. The stock is priced at 36.2 times earnings, against 21.4 for the S\\u0026P 500. Sha