IRE) -- KBR (NYSE: KBR) announced today the appointment of Rami Qasem to its board of directors effective October 1, 2026. Mr. Qasem, 59, is a global energy, technology, and industrial executive with nearly 30 years of international leadership experience across oil and gas, industrial technology, digital transformation, artificial intelligence, and government partnerships. He served as Chief Executive Officer of APEX Industrial Services from 2025 to February 20\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e6aa9b1010f5f2a52b10c3d9956aa006ccf1d92fd9ddb05f10c1aee283958621\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790879975,\"headline\":\"Is GE Aerospace (GE) Outperforming Other Aerospace Stocks This Year?\",\"id\":142561956,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Here is how GE Aerospace (GE) and Rolls-Royce Holdings PLC (RYCEY) have performed compared to their sector so far this year.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4be4be9bd8b4aa0676af1b928ca764ca97035c8e41820e59aaaadd33799142c4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790871044,\"headline\":\"Top 3 Space Stocks To Watch In October 2026\",\"id\":142560889,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The recent surge in US Treasury yields, with the 10 year rate at levels last seen in the early 2000s, is forcing investors to rethink where they want long term exposure. Expensive borrowing can pressure many sectors, yet it also pushes more attention toward businesses building hard infrastructure for the new space age. This article walks through three stocks from our global space infrastructure list that may warrant a closer look. The three examples in this piece are only a starting sample...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2cc64298825db5a3c380dba358a69bdb454f8c4954fd71de4a65701ac3e4952f\"},{\"category\":\"company\"