ry\":\"GE Aerospace is set to release its third-quarter results next month, with analysts predicting a double-digit increase in the company's earnings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1b714c0af138f9faf7e62190a2576911da8c59bf966df4344a4395b25b9eedd8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790788681,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace vs. Lockheed Martin: Which Industrials Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142522042,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace trades at a steep valuation premium despite stronger margins, while Lockheed Martin's defense dominance comes with heavy government concentration risk.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eeff06eb834c32680303b195cf6dbd28a663fdba061c3e72bd651c35b39f90c6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790785081,\"headline\":\"Boeing vs. GE Aerospace: Which Aerospace Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142522043,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boeing is rebuilding on massive debt, while GE Aerospace generates cash with a 19% net margin, a stark contrast in financial health.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=34a9f64f6495e10bc60a66d844ba90c6b0af29d08882e4b5d2079c88637173e0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790782801,\"headline\":\"AST SpaceMobile vs. GE Aerospace: Which Industrials Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142520869,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"One trades at a 357x price-to-sales multiple while burning $1.1 billion in free cash flow; the other generates $7.3 billion annually with a 19% net margin.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d2dcc1c7a8473d3be984fbf40708c41f0b6a2fff48051ccfd834f1f6d51667a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790781033,\"