",\"id\":142559075,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Wells Fargo  analyst David Strauss   maintains GE Aerospace (NYSE:GE) with a Overweight and lowers the price target from $390 to $380.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=251ea50d6d4e6d7b8a2b50879d984d33ec36a57b4ca26423d8b05753b21a18c8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790763078,\"headline\":\"General Electric (GE), What Is Behind The Fresh Attention Now?\",\"id\":142513202,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"General Electric (GE) is back in focus after GE Aerospace and Kratos Defense successfully ignited the GEK800 turbofan cruise missile engine, providing a fresh data point for investors watching the defense story. Recent moves in General Electric’s share price tell a more mixed story than the headlines. Over the past month, the stock has retreated, with a 30 day share price return of 7.21% and a 90 day share price return of 15.22%. This hints that enthusiasm has cooled after a strong multi year...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e8961170eaf5ebfa3ade9565cecd70b804887657976b900c85be8314b539b62b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790749440,\"headline\":\"Zacks Industry Outlook Highlights GE Aerospace, RTX and Howmet Aerospace\",\"id\":142512117,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Defense modernization and air-travel demand support GE, RTX and HWM as aerospace faces supply-chain and labor challenges.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9388fa590f96729c5322d236c8710983a4f852254a487c308695d60a63f6e12d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790741568,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) vs. RTX (RTX): Which Is the Better Stock to Buy?\",\"id\":142510039,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Aircraft engines are about as far from a typical technology stock as you can get, but that is part of what makes GE Aerospace (NYSE:GE) and RTX Corporation (NYSE:RTX) interesting. Both companies operate in markets where products take years to develop, require extensive certification, and stay in service for decades. Once an engine is installed […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bf57e4dcb2be2d447632b2831bde041d97cd2ab520b2624a47dc485e2453cd57\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790715603,\"headline\":\"GE Vernova (GEV) Gains As Market Dips: What You Should Know\",\"id\":142502228,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In the closing of the recent trading day, GE Vernova (GEV) stood at $962.49, denoting a +1.34% move from the preceding trading day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1546650fa9af1ef90864249d89c34d65151a51d67851e118e1c67d1a6e304efd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790709120,\"headline\":\"Is GE Stock Riskier Than It Looks?\",\"id\":142500416,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) stock trades at an earnings multiple of 36.9, compared to 22.1 for the S\\u0026P 500. That's steep for a company like GE and needs justification. While management highlights that adjusted revenue has grown at least 20% in each of the last five quarters, that the high valuation assumes uninterrupted expansion. Yet in July, management acknowledged that demand is no longer the main driver of services growth. And that raises the question: Is GE Aerospace stock riskier than it looks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e8bcac73b68e71a4880b4b5605165ebae8be8ee6d48cf5114bd37c1db1bd771a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790689380,\"headline\":\"GE vs. TXT: Which Aerospace \\u0026 Defense Stock Should You Invest in Now?\",\"id\":142498202,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace and Textron show differing growth drivers, with GE gaining from engine demand while Textron benefits from defense programs and backlogs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0fd67addf74c3fa11eb06f0ad0785cd1a1ec3f99d224c0c15bf190fbfc3a7cda\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790685185,\"headline\":\"What Is Driving The Move In Boeing Stock?\",\"id\":142495920,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A $10,000 holding in Boeing (BA) at Friday's close was worth about $9,310 after trading on Monday, September 28, 2026—a drop of roughly 6.9%. The S\\u0026P 500 slipped 0.8% that day, so the news was Boeing’s, even if the fallout is limited to Commercial Airplanes. So what sent Boeing stock down on Monday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=44cef64bb1b9827a81807a682f4e2fe37a4539229a2862dac3440fa09254a34f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790684040,\"headline\":\"3 Aerospace-Defense Stocks Poised for Growth on Defense Modernization\",\"id\":142495921,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE, RTX and HWM benefit from defense modernization and air-travel demand, while supply-chain issues remain a key industry headwind.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9b16013d5c8a29f69d7184bbdc27c8342a79e43e7ce561c0550f371eb075ec7d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790637472,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) and Kratos Defense \\u0026 Security (KTOS) are Expanding Their Defense Footprint. What Comes Next?\",\"id\":142472013,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Kratos Defense \\u0026 Security Solutions, Inc. (NASDAQ:KTOS) and GE Aerospace (NYSE:GE) announced a major program milestone on September 21, with the successful first ignition of the GEK800 Serial Number 1 turbofan engine. Conducted at Kratos’ X-58 test facility, the trial launched a new testing campaign while achieving a 100% success rate for this development phase. […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=03a3227be8b6f5a1cd2ea5fe18bdd3b214fbbb4e8ee8e66f198bd1ad1da87c0a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790622027,\"headline\":\"If You Invested $1000 In GE Aerospace Stock 5 Years Ago, You Would Have This Much Today\",\"id\":142495730,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/07/10/valuestock_1.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace (NYSE:GE) has outperformed the market over the past 5 years by 25.03% on an annualized basis producing an average annual return of 37.03%. Currently, GE Aerospace has a market capitalization of $330.57\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3fefe1ac9d723f294e630653f6a489d71568cc2869d6c0857e73487238b75337\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790620947,\"headline\":\"What Would A Stalled MAX Line Do To Boeing Stock?\",\"id\":142470242,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boeing (BA) has been lifting 737 MAX output to 47 jets a month. On September 16, its chief executive said steadying that pace was taking longer than expected. The 737 MAX program serves as Boeing’s primary commercial cash driver, making line stability essential to meeting company-wide cash flow targets. If the MAX line cannot steady at 47 a month, what does that mean for Boeing’s financial recovery and stock valuation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5fcbda90bd2f877854ad8028a003b51bf5f040a862e3f2f0053dad778d59618f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790619456,\"headline\":\"Is GE Aerospace Giving Up Margin for Growth?\",\"id\":142470241,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) holders should watch one number: the profit margin of its commercial engine business. Profit margin is the share of sales kept as profit. That margin fell to 27.3% in the second quarter of 2026 from 28.9% a year earlier. This unit made $2.7 billion in profit that quarter, about the same amount as the company's total operating profit. Should a holder worry that this margin is slipping as GE Aerospace grows.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a9390be63384e1ac55de2659a19d3a29c615051a4fdf1fb4b66830e04f8c4923\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790615385,\"headline\":\"Top 3 Defense Stocks With Revenue Growth Up To 18%\",\"id\":142469213,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Russia’s hybrid attacks in Europe have pushed security back to the top of the political agenda, and that keeps attention on companies that build and support aircraft, satellites, missiles, and military systems. Investors care because governments often prioritize this spending even when budgets are tight. This article looks at three stocks from our aerospace and defense supply chain screener that offer different ways to tap into that theme. The three aerospace and defense stocks covered next...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4ed27a4039e11ab1c70733c25ac05a6f501b13c9b05c07ac3e851afae64df2c8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790613360,\"headline\":\"Can Howmet Continue Its Strong Capital Returns to Shareholders?\",\"id\":142469214,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"HWM's robust cash generation and liquidity are supporting higher dividends and sizable buybacks, with strong free cash flow expected in 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ede95e44780c1acfe942f5323173b1558457677af1d2f8a9b4499f5acdaebba7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790610455,\"headline\":\"Trading Halt: Halt status updated at 11:00:00 AM ET: Quotation Resumption: IPO security released for quotation\",\"id\":141264044,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1be70d81992a0dc7d0e1ce94e0eef393c7770e501b8e04e2722a38a9cd09d4fd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790609297,\"headline\":\"Kirsten Harmon Joins Vinson \\u0026 Elkins as NY-Based Corporate Partner\",\"id\":142468164,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"By Karen Roman Vinson \\u0026 Elkins said Kirsten Harmon is the firm’s latest New York-based partner in its Corporate practice, having previously served at as partner at Simpson Thacher \\u0026 Bartlett. Ms. Harmon has experience on a broad range of capital markets transactions, including initial public offerings, high-yield debt, and equity and equity-linked securities offerings, […] The post Kirsten Harmon Joins Vinson \\u0026 Elkins as NY-Based Corporate Partner appeared first on ExecEdge.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8d664df2182f1603b97916326190d67f5b9f107421a4e240a414a71193b29599\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790600755,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Secures Polish Defense Deal, But Broad Industrial Pullback Weighs on Shares\",\"id\":142495568,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/28/GE-Aerospace-Facility-Sign-Displayed.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace Poland expansion adds local military engine support as industrial weakness and valuation pressure shares.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e03246065b5615bfe82a766e0b70f059c0b664a209bf824cfbcc33123ed4149d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790600700,\"headline\":\"Will a New 737 MAX Software Glitch Delay Boeing’s Turnaround?\",\"id\":142465133,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boeing  stock dropped early Monday after a new 737 MAX software problem emerged.  The move came after a weekend report from The Wall Street Journal about a MAX software glitch that can affect landing after an initial missed approach.  Boeing notified airlines of the problem in late August.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6f899b787f356378f78dbea7a74b33fff43c2af3c393c69b52b7700d87170dfa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790600409,\"headline\":\"Boeing Drops 3% as 737 MAX Landing Software Glitch Draws Regulator Review; GE Aerospace Eases, RTX Treads Water\",\"id\":142465214,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A software glitch buried in the 737 MAX cockpit just drew regulator attention, and the timing could not be worse for a company already fighting to prove its recovery is real.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4532ba5582f784ec04a22f79d5808d7e383b5df537bf50486fb7962514701f2d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790588651,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace and Military Aviation Works No. 1 (WZL-1) Finalize T700 Localization Agreement\",\"id\":142467317,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.geaerospace.com/news/press-releases/ge-aerospace-and-military-aviation-works-no-1-wzl-1-finalize-t700-localization\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77db12e8c9b94b6d23acd80983f44439efd159310976fb6ad0fab0afcece465b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790588556,\"headline\":\"3 Market-Beating Stocks Worth Your Attention\",\"id\":142463202,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The best-performing stocks typically have robust sales growth, increasing margins, and rising returns on capital, and those that can maintain this trifecta year in and year out often become the legends of the investing world.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=efb867eb86b941c02c004294de7b682273490471cf3c08441af367df6fef70c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790573400,\"headline\":\"Burckhardt Compression selected for MTU gas turbine test facility in Germany\",\"id\":142455140,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Fully balanced high-speed compressors Fully balanced high-speed compressors Winterthur, Switzerland, 28. September 2026 – Burckhardt Compression has secured an order from MTU Maintenance Berlin-Brandenburg for the supply of two high-speed compressor solutions at the company’s gas turbine test facility in Ludwigsfelde, Germany. The compressor solution has been specifically designed to meet the demanding reliability requirements of the application. As part of its maintenance, repair and overhaul (\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6b6e5cef4affd1ebb86546d17f5472954cccc4f0bf93aa96d7005dcf4ec84739\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790569438,\"headline\":\"3 Defense Stocks With Market Caps Up To $339 Billion\",\"id\":142453638,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Rising geopolitical risks around key energy routes, including the latest concerns over shipping through the Strait of Hormuz, are pulling global defense spending back into sharp focus. When governments worry about supply lines and security, they often reassess budgets. That puts companies tied to aircraft, satellites and military technology on more investor watchlists. This article walks through three stocks from the US Aerospace and Defense universe that may warrant a closer look from...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a0818b3f0bad2e855320beba9fc1c03b8e501358b6e89fe90f7129a0d4b0d48b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790565013,\"headline\":\"Is Itron’s (ITRI) High-Margin Software Transition Built to Last?\",\"id\":142452845,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Supported by solid historical multi-year revenue growth, expanding annual operating cash flow generation exceeding $150 million, a rock-solid balance sheet featuring over $200 million in cash liquidity, strong return on invested capital above 15%, and efficient free cash flow conversion, converting over 80% of net income into cash, Itron (NASDAQ:ITRI) has established a robust financial […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=83a1341f1ef9edbff94efa6953c8bedede5154c574c8d01f9c38fc7fa3721022\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790556492,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) Ships Redesigned Engines to Boeing (BA). Can it Keep the 777X on Track?\",\"id\":142452027,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On September 17, 2026, Reuters reported that GE Aerospace (NYSE:GE) Chief Financial Officer Rahul Ghai expressed confidence that a durability issue with the GE9X engine’s mid-seal will not delay The Boeing Company (NYSE:BA)’s Boeing 777X’s planned 2027 entry into service. Speaking at a Morgan Stanley conference, Ghai said GE began shipping GE9X engines with a […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e7da5419a587336b9077e27ec454ded547ea735f13063b33d232210ba56dc930\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790542200,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Is Spending $12 Billion on an Acquisition. Is It Still the Best Aerospace Stock to Own?\",\"id\":142450005,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"This pending purchase could result in both cost savings and supply chain advantages.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6f2d496af82d9835f3f4b5a3d7312d5b28752891e8a83eca084672b0bde3e8e5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790539586,\"headline\":\"General Electric (GE) Reaches GEK800 Cruise Missile Engine Ignition Milestone\",\"id\":142450071,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"General Electric (NYSE:GE) unit GE Aerospace and Kratos completed a successful ignition test of the new GEK800 cruise missile engine. The GEK800 test marks a key step toward propulsion systems designed for long range cruise missiles in support of Department of War programs. The new engine program highlights fresh engineering and manufacturing capabilities within GE Aerospace focused on high performance, cost focused defense propulsion. The successful GEK800 cruise missile engine ignition is...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=704ba7f44e106576b3ffda619fa9ee5485f24109654a51817552bf754c5898e0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790441400,\"headline\":\"3 Defense Stocks Riding Nuclear, Missile, and Aerospace Demand\",\"id\":142448541,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BWX Technologies, Mercury Systems, and Howmet Aerospace show strong backlog, revenue growth, and raised guidance as defense spending rises, though their stock performances vary widely.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=51c5259fe2279688db7c6592f94869f96491f3da7fd2176b47bba0bf76ccc25a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790431816,\"headline\":\"How Syracuse's Semiconductor Gamble May Help Save the Rust Belt\",\"id\":142438711,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"What does it actually take to bring a Rust Belt city back to life? Micron is building one of the largest semiconductor factories in US history in Syracuse, a city that experienced major job loss after companies including GE, Carrier and General Motors left the area. Rob Simpson of CenterState CEO explains what attracted Micron to the city, local business owner Darin Price talks about what the investment means on the ground, and Brookings economist Joseph Parilla makes the case that Syracuse could be a model for reindustrialization across America.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=33d35428d9dc834b198a52d7d489f7e5b8231202c3e6b32669ee47126614aec1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790369106,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) Surpasses Market Returns: Some Facts Worth Knowing\",\"id\":142426129,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) reached $327.02 at the closing of the latest trading day, reflecting a +2.26% change compared to its last close.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=96443b1dcab2271cfe83eb3ea000bfab7ed98f6b431f014a50ac03818dbf87fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790360909,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Stock Gains as $225 Million Funds Physical AI\",\"id\":142425573,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Two-thirds of the program targets infrastructure before research equipment produces commercial returns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8d1e678d90345f963f46ca2f17a59c926f17da6e2edd81eb5f570c0371b93d09\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790347632,\"headline\":\"PPA Is a One-Ticker Bet on Rising Defense Spending. Nearly 30% of Holdings Are in Just Four Stocks\",\"id\":142423903,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Defense budgets are soaring on both sides of the Atlantic, and one ETF promises to capture the entire boom in a single trade. But a closer look at what you actually own when you buy it reveals a far more concentrated story than the 63-stock lineup suggests.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=481f4a76ebb444be54ceda763088230634b2a6a651f5e2428262e49a1c170c04\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790334584,\"headline\":\"9 Of 11 Sectors Fall In Friday Trading As Cyclicals Lead\",\"id\":142437371,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/25/Stocks--Futures-Slip.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Friday’s regular session has two sectors higher and nine lower, with growth and cyclical sectors split across the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with Technology and Industrials\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b3792a01c3fec00ee82003a3acfe8485dff4940ffce96f59c5ae719dc5ac1e6a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790277906,\"headline\":\"Is GE Aerospace's Lead Already In Its Stock Price?\",\"id\":142385673,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) earns the widest operating margin in a group of six peer companies, and it grows revenue faster than all but one of them. The market already charges for that lead. Yet over the past twelve months the stock has returned far less than RTX, a slower-growing rival. The quality is real. The question is how much of it you are already paying for.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=af61d08d872b184b49711b716d226289308ae26b3a2d333ed4879f3af6daf89c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790270281,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace is Spending $11.75 Billion to Fix a Supply-Chain Bottleneck. Will it Pay Off?\",\"id\":142384723,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace (NYSE:GE) has plenty of demand. Getting enough engines and parts out the door has been the harder part. That helps explain why the company is willing to spend $11.75 billion on Consolidated Precision Products (CPP), one of the world’s largest makers of precision sand castings. The acquisition, GE Aerospace’s biggest since becoming a […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8b5c494c20f41476518963ca559ee11b0e8935425716a6db9a53ea141f95e91\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790259000,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Faces Margin Pressure From Rising Costs: Can It Recover?\",\"id\":142383611,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE's margin slips despite higher profit as rising costs weighed, while stronger guidance and LEAP demand support the 2026 outlook.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2e0c8c4c1608dabc51b70987e7be760bd109010e6268825de4916795fbbb9591\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790256304,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Stock Faces Pressure As Jefferies Cuts Price Target\",\"id\":142421795,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/24/Beavercreek---May-31--2024-Ge-Aerospace-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace stock rebounds after Jefferies trims its target; strong services backlog and engine demand support the longer-term outlook.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=644d0a01a243fc1d71623f48f884747fcdb13592a9c493613fbc81679a8878f8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790253003,\"headline\":\"Is It Worth Investing in GE (GE) Based on Wall Street's Bullish Views?\",\"id\":142380415,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"According to the average brokerage recommendation (ABR), one should invest in GE (GE). It is debatable whether this highly sought-after metric is effective because Wall Street analysts' recommendations tend to be overly optimistic. Would it be worth investing in the stock?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9128d5b35db66f75eb83f3d3f504b017543f1ac2c069d81108486cce696759e4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790252719,\"headline\":\"The S\\u0026P 500 has never been this concentrated in just 2 stocks\",\"id\":142378391,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple and Nvidia have truly become the straws that stir the stock market's drink.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=254c8abb6b696735a33bd5450eed9733428edd41089ae78bbb3cea50a6eab293\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790248612,\"headline\":\"Our Pick Of The Best Defense Stocks In September 2026\",\"id\":142374398,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Global government bond yields are hovering near 4%, a level last seen in 2007, and that shift in borrowing costs is reshaping how investors think about risk and resilience. Aerospace and defense suppliers sit at the intersection of security priorities and long-term government spending, which keeps this corner of the market on many watchlists. This article highlights three stocks from this group that merit a closer look now. The three stocks below are just a sample, and the full screen...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=10627dea7caae689d2a0ac8542bf4ed8d008aec3c6adaed4ff80303e03e860b3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790194317,\"headline\":\"GE HealthCare (GEHC) is Down 28% and Wall Street is Starting to Buy. Is the Selloff Finally Over?\",\"id\":142365223,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE HealthCare Technologies Inc. (NASDAQ:GEHC) specializes in hospital imaging, including MRI, CT, and ultrasound machines, and the contrast agents required to interpret scans. Spun out of General Electric in early 2023, GE HealthCare traded near its 52-week low of $58.75 and 28% below its high of $89.77, at a closing price of $64.81 on September […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=31edc61f1c05b17bf0031f7915b11aeeb0117be9f45f8c26f0c40eec1a2576e5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790177700,\"headline\":\"Full Throttle: Kratos and GE Fire Up a Next-Gen Defense Engine\",\"id\":142383612,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Kratos Defense and GE Aerospace ignited their jointly developed GEK800 turbofan engine on Sept. 21, 2026, a milestone for scalable, low-cost drone and cruise missile propulsion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=216a3a8e167cb9c510f2e9961ee0ecae87ef1026c4acf9776bf5b6712f87e2e7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790172292,\"headline\":\"Jefferies Maintains Buy on GE Aerospace, Lowers Price Target to $435\",\"id\":142382489,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Jefferies  analyst Sheila Kahyaoglu   maintains GE Aerospace (NYSE:GE) with a Buy and lowers the price target from $455 to $435.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a0d38c3c515d056e820f39171a78e31ec8a328e05777043324027f5ec6218033\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790167380,\"headline\":\"The Zacks Analyst Blog Highlights NVIDIA, Berkshire Hathaway and GE Aerospace\",\"id\":142358440,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NVIDIA, Berkshire Hathaway and GE Aerospace face distinct growth drivers and risks, from AI infrastructure demand to insurance exposure and supply-chain challenges.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f376fe2f24ab82e71367453674f905ea2d838855a33f23b683011a0a36eca854\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790161946,\"headline\":\"General Electric (GE) Stock Looks Fairly Valued on Cash Flow\",\"id\":142356655,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"General Electric has delivered a very large 396.5% return over the past 5 years, which naturally raises the question of whether the current US$319.22 share price is still grounded in the cash the business can generate. With that kind of long run move now meeting a softer patch in recent months, the key issue is how the stock lines up against the cash flow it is expected to produce over time. A roughly fourfold gain over 5 years puts a lot of faith into the future cash flows investors expect...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=924e7b25ae9c98eba977986f8498ee2bdf4d2bdda3cbf495369bb37199cd4b86\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790108640,\"headline\":\"Top Analyst Reports for NVIDIA, Berkshire Hathaway \\u0026 GE Aerospace\",\"id\":142342938,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NVIDIA's AI demand, Berkshire's diversified earnings and GE Aerospace's commercial and defense strength drive today's research focus.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=529d51ca192a19aae5f1c7eb4e7fab4a45c8e8abc22fcae43b70d8b2879ae89e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790099175,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace: Why $100 Oil Doesn't Break The Bull Case\",\"id\":142342831,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1760043012/image_1760043012.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace remains a Buy despite share price correction and market fears over oil-driven aftermarket moderation. Click here to read my analysis.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=858111e9b2b5bbbd8a212fe443ae4c2c659de579ad0feda14ffc233f7933933a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790095494,\"headline\":\"GE Vernova is The AI Energy Bottleneck Player I Won’t Stop Buying\",\"id\":142341124,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Vernova's backlog keeps exploding and its CEO says the company will be mostly sold out through 2030, yet most AI power investors are looking at entirely the wrong part of the supply chain.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cba85b88c7d7aa2696ece184418a8bf93842bde032e0af3fbdab94d19d70edfe\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790091601,\"headline\":\"GD vs. GE: Which Stock Is the Better Value Option?\",\"id\":142339934,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GD vs. GE: Which Stock Is the Better Value Option?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f49b5ff898ec8053be96898e1c2846dd19795872c0ff377979153e14943f2a5c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790082473,\"headline\":\"Should Boeing Stock Investors Worry About Its Money-Losing Jet Business?\",\"id\":142337742,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"If you own Boeing (BA), the worry is whether its commercial airplane business can earn money on the jets it sells. In the second quarter of fiscal 2026, that business lost money. Its operating margin was negative 2.7%, meaning costs ran above sales. The jet business brought in nearly half of Boeing's revenue for the quarter. That makes its margin the number that matters most for Boeing's profits.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eae02e92a471f2f9f8f2edd9f4d7f