on. Read why GE stock is a buy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5144baf1cb9de228fdcbb96a2dc98b3d7ef456f6efc735ac481766d6b087390d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790024880,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Board of Directors Authorizes Quarterly Dividend\",\"id\":142315543,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Board of Directors of GE Aerospace (NYSE: GE) today declared a $0.47 per share dividend on the outstanding common stock of the Company. The dividend is payable October 26, 2026, to shareholders of record at the close of business on October 5, 2026. The ex-dividend date is October 5, 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cf14a14258715cfc49d7f135e0307ced7988d1777c0d7e07e5c19cee34473649\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790015813,\"headline\":\"General Electric vs. Joby Aviation: Which Industrials Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142315251,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"One generates $7.3B in free cash flow with a 19% net margin; the other burns $564M annually while chasing FAA certification.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dc83d504ca7a70945b8031de3bea7202ba140ea28c487090af225b8d7517e163\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790004799,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Slips as GE9X Fix Enters Certification\",\"id\":142314346,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Redesigned seals are shipping, but production approval still depends on a separate FAA process.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=facee997a3bafe55eabd1033c9128ea276a43eaff33ae6dd154f16bccd22b114\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789995745,\"headline\":\"1 Cash-Producing Stock on Our Buy List and 2 That Underwhelm\",\"id\":142312002,\"ima