rl\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5a23f9376755d251d9974d95bc2092ac45c3c9b1e369d4898a76540be068264b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789748640,\"headline\":\"Boeing selloff overdone despite CEO's production comments, BofA says\",\"id\":142259605,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boeing Co (NYSE:BA, XETRA:BCO) is on track to end the week down 6% after CEO Kelly Ortberg flagged continued headwinds on the 737 and 787 production ramps, along with a further delay to 777X certification. But Bank of America called the market reaction overdone, noting that Boeing's...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7b9a7c4d478cb9e8b4fc0e4bd411d6b92d6c51db6564dc0b30889e3f98c3b260\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789737480,\"headline\":\"Is Boeing's Recovery Creating a New Multi-Year Growth Opportunity?\",\"id\":142254931,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BA's rising production, new aircraft programs and defense wins support growth as backlog conversion and cash generation improve.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bfd4d55a8f82cf2aee841a06f584ab55f41b42801219c7454c214dcdd0974e1c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789733456,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Delivers Crucial News for Boeing 777X Investors\",\"id\":142253644,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace Issues Reassuring Outlook on Critical 777X Engine Fix\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a622e57cc18f1ac3224bb698e224b7faca9e6dbd0de8324d10e7ebec9750e312\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789730538,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Sees No Airline Fleet Plan Changes Amid Air Traffic Recovery\",\"id\":142271853,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/18/Beavercreek---May-31--2024-Ge-Aerospace-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace began shipping GE9X engines with improved mid-seals to Boeing in the third quarter as confidence grows around the 777X timeline.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4deb1c72a70b5ae357c075604398da9166878d2efc208c5ce1ab9724549bd447\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789691088,\"headline\":\"Why GE Vernova Stock Bumped Higher Today\",\"id\":142233091,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"It reached a legal settlement with a business partner.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b7f7e1e460f625e454eb88943828e792dfa4837e3884208309225326ade7a925\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789684813,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace’s $11.75 Billion CPP Deal Won’t Close Until 2027. Here’s What That Could Mean For the Stock.\",\"id\":142233088,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysGE Aerospace’s $11. 75 billion purchase of Consolidated Precision Products, announced September 8, is billed as fixing the castings bottleneck behind the company’s $170 billion services backlog and a spare-parts delinquency rate that grew 20% sequentially in the second quarter.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=df8148fdcc63bab7c8c01b480636137821ecc473ffcf83e9d6cf967a6e02feff\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789682335,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) Pays $12 Billion to Own the ‘Black Art’ Behind its Jet Engines\",\"id\":142233089,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On September 9, 2026, Reuters reported that GE Aerospace (NYSE:GE) agreed to buy castings maker Consolidated Precision Products for $11.75 billion. It is its largest acquisition since becoming a standalone company in 2024, to secure the supply of the precision metal turbine-blade components that have been a persistent bottleneck across the jet engine industry. CPP […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=393b3b1200849a7a895ee2ec5b5415c96ddb305e2ad73558cfe3e56833c00f47\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789668134,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Sees Soaring Engine Demand, $170B Services Backlog at Morgan Stanley Conference\",\"id\":142233090,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace (NYSE:GE) CFO Rahul Ghai said the company continues to see strong demand across commercial services, original equipment and defense programs, despite recent volatility in air traffic growth and persistent aerospace supply-chain constraints. Speaking at a Morgan Stanley conference, Ghai\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=002ffc9e738bf4293b60f8fc8a02af12cce020d91b1723002d4bac639a871e38\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789665257,\"headline\":\"Genpact (G): Buy, Sell, or Hold Post Q2 Earnings?\",\"id\":142231865,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Over the last six months, Genpact’s shares have sunk to $35.20, producing a disappointing 8.2% loss - a stark contrast to the S\\u0026P 500’s 12.9% gain. This may have investors wondering how to approach the situation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a946e7b37412f69f6fc4eb423321754e5800fe112d613a9dd6c60cc37d1397ce\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789662527,\"headline\":\"General Electric Company (GE) Presents at Morgan Stanley's 14th Annual Laguna Conference Transcript\",\"id\":142230077,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/assets/og_image_1200-29b2bfe1a595477db6826bd2126c63ac2091efb7ec76347a8e7f81ba17e3de6c.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"General Electric Company (GE) Morgan Stanley's 14th Annual Laguna Conference September 17, 2026 11:30 AM EDTCompany ParticipantsRahul Ghai - Senior VP \\u0026...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b1dafda4540a79091c2db80f9c03b791ef28d01177df4c210193529a7ae0992d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789661700,\"headline\":\"Strength in Defense Aerospace Market Drives Howmet: Can It Sustain?\",\"id\":142233072,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"HWM's defense aerospace revenues are rising on strong demand for F-35 and legacy fighter jet spares, while new initiatives could support further growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3112e04c20cdb11f5bac8813ba160080ff0e61dc5d475ac703f65b2d13e116ce\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789647036,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace CFO Says At Morgan Stanley Conference He Is Confident GE9X Mid-Seal Issue Won't Hold Up 777X Entry Into Service Next Year; Company Started Shipping GE9X Engines With Improved Mid-Seal To Boeing In Q3; Says Aircraft Retirements Down Year-Over-Year\",\"id\":142256849,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://event.webcasts.com/starthere.jsp?ei=1776140\\u0026amp;tp_key=25de4a7e44\\u0026amp;tp_special=8\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fc151d4067cb971a049426e881494ab3864ee058d6f9efbe40923c126a7f5429\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789645094,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace CFO At Morgan Stanley Conference Says Not Seeing Any Change In Airline Fleet Plans, Parked Aircraft Remain Really Low\",\"id\":142256850,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://event.webcasts.com/starthere.jsp?ei=1776140\\u0026amp;tp_key=25de4a7e44\\u0026amp;tp_special=8\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a57148496b2958b58f5c9b30a4d8749e63009c29b92d7224712e35e88c5c0c1d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789635864,\"headline\":\"Honeywell Aerospace: Strong Buy As Headwinds Should Be Temporary\",\"id\":142224475,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2178547413/image_2178547413.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Honeywell Aerospace is down 50% on supply chain issues and a guidance cut. Click for more on HONA stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e8b1dcd65572b908d4aa54787d1d68a99bf891ccb388dbdfd7ed7f25ef4ec149\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789627503,\"headline\":\"Boeing CEO Tempers China Order Hopes: ‘We Didn’t Get an Order for 200’\",\"id\":142226007,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/17/Air-Force-One-Is-Modified-Boeing-747.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Boeing stock faces pressure as CEO Kelly Ortberg flags 737 wing bottlenecks, engine delays, and certification hurdles.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a123df44b780d1ddcb2fa7b085b1802aa25af6e78d13a8cb6caa3505b79e8b49\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789595106,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) Advances While Market Declines: Some Information for Investors\",\"id\":142204997,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) closed at $312.9 in the latest trading session, marking a +1.91% move from the prior day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=88dceaeb4f276f17e5f760e4a02a23f3694a2ee1d58feff543656a3fd78f86e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789584412,\"headline\":\"VF Corporation Cut Its Dividend 82%. Five Historical Cases Show What Could Happen Next\",\"id\":142199699,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"When VF Corporation slashed its dividend by 82%, it joined a club of corporate giants whose payout cuts either marked a painful floor or the start of a longer collapse. Five historical cases reveal the two metrics that actually separated the recoveries from the disasters.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=320ebef318a6cf4b1da7bb80972cf8b4996249b8f194d8bce517e51e074066a8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789581370,\"headline\":\"GE Vernova Climbs 5% as CEO Sees Backlog Hitting $200B Early; Eaton and Quanta Services Edge Higher\",\"id\":142198313,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Vernova's CEO just told a Morgan Stanley conference that the company's most-watched backlog milestone arrives sooner than Wall Street assumed, and the ripple through Eaton and Quanta Services reveals how much of the grid trade hangs on a single demand signal.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=74d1234e529abb3b8888f6d71ea0e0e22e7717d4ba2ce88fc4ab49f6d9f3f25f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789579287,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Gains Over 3.1% as a Rival Validates Its $11.75 Billion Bet\",\"id\":142198239,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Honeywell's industry endorsement supports GE's supply-chain logic without resolving the acquisition's demanding financial hurdle.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5a0aeae828355e8e852477b56e064d4298d0d06e598c108318f32d63609106fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789577594,\"headline\":\"How Far Can GE Stock Move When The Work Is Already Booked?\",\"id\":142198241,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) has more engine work booked than it can currently perform, and that visibility is much of why people own the shares. The option chain does not treat the stock as settled. At about $307, contracts running twelve months out carry a band from near $216.93 to near $434.6, with roughly a two-in-three chance the stock finishes inside it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=171ab3e5dfb48541317bb06cc3e51f7525331d5c219693dffa8225a5095a24e1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789576740,\"headline\":\"Can GE Aerospace Continue Its Strong Capital Returns to Shareholders?\",\"id\":142198240,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GEs higher dividend, $20B buyback authorization and raised 2026 free cash flow outlook support its strong shareholder returns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d0f33510dc9fbab8eb90aef701ae16d1c7dae8a1b7fb33d8fab0070115c8a403\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789571580,\"headline\":\"GE Trades Below 50-Day and 200-Day SMA: How to Play the Stock?\",\"id\":142197102,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace stock trades below key moving averages as strong engine demand and orders face cost pressures, debt concerns and a high valuation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d6fee8856abb8573f9d0b4a36c2c13e5ea64d693497b5c4ebc90c325859669b2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789570366,\"headline\":\"Boeing CEO Speaking At Morgan Stanley Conference Says It Is Still Waiting On Engine Seal Fix From GE Aerospace For 777X, Required For Final Certification\",\"id\":142227480,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://event.webcasts.com/starthere.jsp?ei=1773763\\u0026amp;tp_key=5762dc8c7f\\u0026amp;tp_special=8\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e24e86480c1320e1c3a8c212d2b66aafd4299aedf6fefd0b3e7acd5b884f0e13\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789569053,\"headline\":\"GE Vernova Gave Back Its Gains Since July: One Wall Street Pro Says 65% Gains Will Materialize Soon\",\"id\":142197103,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Vernova's blowout earnings sent shares soaring, then September erased every gain in days. Now one Wall Street analyst sees a path to 65% upside, and the order book behind that call is harder to dismiss than the selloff suggests.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=297f8dca86ec42aa32e8d9c0990ff5da2b6cbf017a2a3baf4ca2e627be078807\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789563604,\"headline\":\"Is Trending Stock GE Vernova Inc. (GEV) a Buy Now?\",\"id\":142195145,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Zacks.com users have recently been watching GE Vernova (GEV) quite a bit. Thus, it is worth knowing the facts that could determine the stock's prospects.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6d2ccd41ddfdc1fb0634ffd4c9d8a8e2c214a6251d9b01acb39574e7d64e746c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789549226,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Freezes Up as Oil Tops $108 and the Ten-Year Clears 5% Ahead of Warsh's First Hike Test\",\"id\":142186339,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/THUMBNAILS_CHARTMILL_1000_528_484636d9e2.webp\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"US stocks closed lower on Tuesday as Brent crude pushed above $108 on a shuttered Saudi pipeline and the ten-year Treasury yield broke above 5% for the first time since 2007, with the market now pricing a 93% probability that Fed Chair Kevin Warsh delivers a rate hike on Wednesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5b9afc6a2765be4dcb459f4d7e3bc28535769faef01e43c7ae1224ee6dd76560\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789509004,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) Suffers a Larger Drop Than the General Market: Key Insights\",\"id\":142168544,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The latest trading day saw GE Aerospace (GE) settling at $306.96, representing a -3.34% change from its previous close.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1544ce545e284a910259bb7f0081d3942574d0fc36d067fa8bf3bc50dc02b291\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789493945,\"headline\":\"Why Is Boeing Stock Falling While Revenue Soars Past Peers?\",\"id\":142165621,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Boeing (BA) grew revenue faster over the past twelve months than any of its aerospace and defense peers, GE Aerospace included, and its stock still fell. It is also the only one in that group running an operating loss. The growth has come with rising airplane deliveries, and the market is waiting to see whether those airplanes earn a margin.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=98419fb6f7256a5bfc6c4ff03336e19f553560dc7cc5ce8f8f5b3cb31405bad0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789492706,\"headline\":\"What Has To Go Right For GE Stock To Keep Climbing?\",\"id\":142165622,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) trades near $318, up 13.4% over the past twelve months. Behind that price sits a commercial services backlog of roughly $170 billion, work on engines already flying. The easy read is that the good news is in the price, and the coming three years just work that backlog off. A three-year scenario on the company's own numbers puts a size on what is left.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e5a7fc85604416779acf959d89d3ba76d9f7387e9ba893e449264d900a215f16\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789491720,\"headline\":\"Can 3M Continue Its Strong Capital Returns to Shareholders?\",\"id\":142165623,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"MMM's dividends, buybacks, remaining repurchase capacity and strong cash-flow outlook support continued shareholder returns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=257a561522953262322699ceac4a1edabe08cc80a120bf108b6b1e91fd451b6a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789481002,\"headline\":\"Why Wall Street Could Be Pricing This GE Stock Option Spread Incorrectly\",\"id\":142168274,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"While the odds of the 330/340 October bull spread for GE stock may be disastrously low, that’s not an exclusive forecast.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fff4c41837c22aacdf520bc2d14d20ec7cd3afb896ae370afa4d0b3283d10aa3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789463790,\"headline\":\"1 Profitable Stock Worth Your Attention and 2 Facing Challenges\",\"id\":142158508,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Even if a company is profitable, it doesn’t always mean it’s a great investment. Some struggle to maintain growth, face looming threats, or fail to reinvest wisely, limiting their future potential.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e2ec002d538e48a783f9bea7ffe41a84ff7c69af18c221b573eb6dd387bdaa82\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789414200,\"headline\":\"Why Today’s GE Downgrade Wasn’t Just a Downgrade\",\"id\":142141478,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The aerospace business has been a shining light for industrials, but Melius analyst Scott Mikus says the good times may be ending.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8d940ada7a921e3930f90d263870f07a7cb09217a5ff470dfaaeb0ea9b154e7f\"},{\"categ