in Focus\",\"id\":142063337,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace's $11.75 billion deal for Consolidated Precision Products sent Howmet Aerospace shares down 10%, but strong casting demand suggests both stocks remain well-positioned.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a6a98ade3441a072c55f8c97d86660211691b923fbd5a57a606d96444525b02b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788976061,\"headline\":\"Cramer: GE Aerospace’s $12 Billion Acquisition Is ‘Going to Send This Stock Up’\",\"id\":142027391,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Jim Cramer says GE Aerospace just made a move that flips its entire post-Culp playbook on its head, and he thinks the market is only beginning to price in what a defense-focused supply chain overhaul actually means for the stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b3bd600bcc64814480984f8f8ed828ce5aaa6ed24341b343b8ddfb0faa727a31\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788969300,\"headline\":\"FLNC Stock Trades at a Discount: Should You Buy, Sell or Hold?\",\"id\":142027394,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"FLNC trades at a steep discount, but weaker fiscal 2026 guidance, project delays and execution risks make the valuation look like a potential trap.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=136bf957245e0bb8621954b9986afad024704eaf7a70411ef2f6cbfed0b7fc7e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788968340,\"headline\":\"GE Expands Mission-Critical Castings Capacity Through CPP Acquisition\",\"id\":142025962,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace is acquiring CPP to expand its mission-critical aircraft e