 SpaceX. These Stocks Could Benefit.\",\"id\":142024748,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Competition in the turbine blade manufacturing industry is heating up.  In that battle,  GE Aerospace  has seemingly gotten the edge on  SpaceX  leaving SpaceX CEO Elon Musk with an interesting choice.  Musk made waves in the aerospace industry recently when he suggested that his rocket and AI firm could get into the business of casting turbine blades.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9b7b1624da580aa96f9f2662e069f5c6225094753fe3633eb2e29f44020db636\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788953359,\"headline\":\"A $12 Billion Reason to Buy GE Stock Today\",\"id\":142027392,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace stock gains on an $11.75 billion acquisition of CPP. Here’s why the deal is bullish for GE shares.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f1dcbdcec869f7ef86c78f1f4b93630f3337583e4a4ad5e789be15bbe39e3a94\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788950601,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk Spooked Howmet. GE Just Validated the Bull Case\",\"id\":142027106,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/09/Elon-Musk-Technology-Entrepreneur-And-In.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Elon Musk\\u0026#39;s SpaceX plans and GE\\u0026#39;s $11.75B deal suggest turbine blade shortages remain one of aerospace\\u0026#39;s biggest bottlenecks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a353d7922bf1c8ae30ab1b64389fd8416d4d68db9ccd4d2c5b3740ea9c1a014b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788945373,\"headline\":\"Cognition AI valued at $48bn after $2bn Series E financing\",\"id\":142006649,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Cognition AI created its autonomous coding agent Devin to help developer teams automate incident investigations and security vulnerability triage.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=789fdaa91cfeac4e0133f283046199ee9448e26820b3bd2605905f01e098ca49\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788926460,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Makes $12B Play in Clogged Market for Cast Metal Parts\",\"id\":142027393,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"For GE Aerospace the acquisition represents a critical chance to it expand its own production capacity amid booming demand.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=014912369bd8e7c8091a291140ce1a719a618987844b69c8b37a2a9715d17490\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788915660,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace makes $11.75B Ohio acquisition\",\"id\":141959833,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace, which employs thousands of employees in the region, is acquiring a large Ohio manufacturer in a a nearly $12 billion dollar deal. GE Aerospace said it has signed an agreement to acquire Consolidated Precision Products, a Cleveland-based manufacturer of castings. The purchase will be from private investment firms Warburg Pincus and Berkshire Partners. “Investing in ...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0c7e5ee56a9ce4a72891b0e6df8fbd20fa9adb9ff1efa9d0ce6733b3bdf13c35\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788901140,\"headline\":\"GE Deal Highlights Value of Berkshire’s Precision Castparts. It Could Be Worth $100 Billion.\",\"id\":141956238,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"General Electric’s pricey purchase of Consolidated Precision Products for $11.75 billion from two private-equity firms highlights the value in  Berkshire Hathaway’s  Precision Castparts unit.  Both companies are suppliers to the aircraft industry, providing complex castings and other parts.  Based on the valuation of Consolidated Precision Castparts of 26 times projected 2027 earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization (Ebitda), the Berkshire unit could be worth close to $100 billion, more than an estimate of $60 billion to $75 billion that Barron’s made in an August article. A multiple of 26 times Ebitda probably is consistent with a price/earnings multiple of close to 40.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=684c2a3a56482b226039d4ff2e92d2ae51306e7e483676edc3ec351cf48daa03\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788896761,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Gains After Paying 26 Times Profit for a Bottleneck\",\"id\":141953772,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The $11.75 billion purchase buys scarce casting capacity at a price demanding substantial integration benefits.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=20d85fd522331fab1df986475bb6434f89cd7d2fb2b1944efa1ffcf3f9505a7b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788895440,\"headline\":\"There's more to investing than the data centers, says Jim Cramer\",\"id\":142026909,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108360114-3ED3-MM-A-BLOCK-short-090826.jpg?v=1788908914\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"'Mad Money' host Jim Cramer talks investing opportunities beyond AI.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5a025d0b6cf40d033b447fc2256cd5a936f50f0956227e22d5b836ac3d6a38e5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788895437,\"headline\":\"There are some tremendous healthcare companies in bull market mode, says Jim Cramer\",\"id\":142026910,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108360113-3ED3-MM-A-BLOCK-090826.jpg?v=1788908666\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"'Mad Money' host Jim Cramer talks investing opportunities beyond AI.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2a920681ba408366468e1e64a1fbb427e9a5a4400f0cea6a543341672e31401e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788894918,\"headline\":\"If You Invested $100 In GE Aerospace Stock 5 Years Ago, You Would Have This Much Today\",\"id\":142025212,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/07/10/valuestock_1.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace (NYSE:GE) has outperformed the market over the past 5 years by 27.41% on an annualized basis producing an average annual return of 38.8%. Currently, GE Aerospace has a market capitalization of $347.49\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=51214798da9f5281de467c91da2d45b7a4dcd80c81351ca7bd0fb2ca9aa6f4a6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788891923,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer says investors are too focused on AI stocks. Here’s where he says to look instead\",\"id\":142026842,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/107109969-NUP_198430_00200r.jpg?v=1694042675\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC's Jim Cramer said investors should look beyond the AI data-center trade as compelling opportunities emerge in other areas of the market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=353e41071404e292d04dc9fab87834376f315cbb4f3ea08282ab5f50eb7d0500\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788888390,\"headline\":\"GE's CPP Deal Isn't About EPS Accretion, Says Jefferies — It's 'An Impactful Move In The Blades \\u0026 Vanes War Games'\",\"id\":141952613,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace is acquiring casting supplier Consolidated Precision Products for $11.75 billion, the largest deal since its 2024 spinoff.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d07b63d4f383d047d5de48278bafe4e02009ffc6d405c672f68dd09c3cb587e1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788886260,\"headline\":\"Howmet Rises 26.5% Year to Date: Should Investors Buy the Stock Now?\",\"id\":141952615,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"HWM's 26.5% year-to-date rally is backed by aerospace demand and raised 2026 guidance, though rich valuation and SpaceX competition pose risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=608bc20b0135bad2fda90b412c43d2a69366635ecd474f7ec9f53f68f40d983b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788885520,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace's Big Move Is Risky\",\"id\":141954437,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2151884197/image_2151884197.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospaceâs $11.75B CPP deal boosts airfoil tech and synergies but adds leverage at 26x EV/EBITDAâclick to see EPS impact, risks, and why GE is Hold.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cd4f0d75218c89d970e2309ba19a0d9c57659a7d43260ff699720a8cd2d5b52a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788883008,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Strikes $11.75 Billion Deal to Buy Consolidated Precision Products\",\"id\":141952614,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace (GE) agreed to acquire castings manufacturer Consolidated Precision Products in a deal\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eb2bf358b44ab79696fb35bb33d53d3a8b91c8cd0242bd63cf69647ed887331f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788882330,\"headline\":\"Top Midday Stories: GE Aerospace to Acquire Consolidated Precision Products; Qualcomm Issues Share Warrant to Amazon\",\"id\":141949831,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"All three major US stock indexes fell in late-morning trading Tuesday as oil prices climbed and inve\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2ae8a832851f7b2f5438b8a6af3fee6b2b8bd035b6bc97e978a449770023779d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788881102,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace To Buy Key Industry Castings Supplier CPP For Nearly $12 Billion\",\"id\":141950182,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace announces deal to purchase CPP for nearly $12 billion in an effort to bolster castings production, supply chain. GE stock rises.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=10f99af3715cacb04f59e59620910bcab0d1ad549cfe67eeeb59739b36b3cb9f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788879003,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy GE Aerospace Stock On Cash That Came Early?\",\"id\":141950189,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"At $337 a share, GE Aerospace (GE) trades at 39 times trailing earnings, which is not typically where an investment thesis begins. The bullish case here centers on cash generation instead. Management has raised 2026 free cash flow guidance to $8.9 billion to $9.2 billion, and on the CFO's own account that is more cash than the company expected to generate in 2028 when it framed that year in July 2025.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a5da5d10c5a417aaf0ba90b5c996445eca816f038e1e9abfd7dcbdb2b859cb73\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788877920,\"headline\":\"GE’s $12 Billion Bet on the Unsexy Industry SpaceX Is Trying to Disrupt\",\"id\":141950183,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace is buying Consolidate Precision Products for almost $12 billion. It’s a big deal for the jet engine maker.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0ee2dffd753b340bdef2d0cbbff5eeda27f5bd8f7ee40a91c993f6ee1960f808\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788876884,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Makes $11.75 Billion Supply Chain Bet With CPP Acquisition\",\"id\":142025213,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/08/GE-Aerospace-Facility-Sign-Displayed.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace to buy Consolidated Precision Products for $11.75B to boost casting capacity and meet commercial and defense demand.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=82997711b48c19f9c8423a01556373427c4c3077abdf7efe05415def32b9ed00\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788872986,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace acquires Consolidated Precision Products for $11.75B\",\"id\":141950184,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The deal gives GE Aerospace direct ownership of a key castings supplier serving commercial, defense, and aftermarket engine programs\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9285c473c23daaf1413ffccaa821275230fff4cbf227fa71f4ac40d54cf09eac\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788872400,\"headline\":\"Avianca secures first of its kind financing from the Brazilian Agency for the Management of Guarantee Funds and Guarantees (ABGF) for Maintenance, Repair and Overhaul (MRO) services at GE Aerospace's MRO shop in Brazil\",\"id\":141950185,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Avianca -part of Abra Group along with Gol and Wamos-, GE Aerospace, and the Brazilian Agency for Management of Guarantee Funds and Guarantees (ABGF) today announced a financing agreement supporting maintenance, repair and overhaul (MRO) services for Avianca's CFM56 aircraft engines at GE Aerospace's Celma MRO shop in Brazil\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0812d0d4701e2225e052f32fcca2cce6e139aa96ad432c7e4603f41751ec5771\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788871859,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Agrees $11.75 Billion Acquisition of Consolidated Precision Products\",\"id\":141950186,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace (NYSE:GE) said on Tuesday that it has agreed to acquire Consolidated Precision Products from private investment firms Warburg Pincus and Berkshire Partners for $11. 75 billion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5f467c25e3848781d565b7bde4bdb1cd5d60d744a13ec38007fa196590a82d8f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788869870,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace to acquire Consolidated Precision in $11.75b deal\",\"id\":141950190,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- GE Aerospace announced Tuesday it signed an agreement to purchase Consolidated Precision Products from private investment firms Warburg Pincus and Berkshire Partners for $11.75 billion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=63c7f168a273c2abafccdcde4b950ee72984ff6b341a3853bc3f11d80f2f0f61\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788867145,\"headline\":\"The Late Morning Rundown: September 8, 2026\",\"id\":142498956,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108359823-3ED1-REQ-090826-NewsLM.jpg?v=1788881353\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC brings you fast, accurate, and actionable business news and market updates.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a9b70c56882672aec549c79df53c75b47a0dcbd922c5450dcabc254bbfb42283\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788867000,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace to Acquire Consolidated Precision Products (CPP), Expanding Mission-Critical Castings Capacity\",\"id\":141950187,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CINCINNATI, Sept. 08, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Investing in castings capacity to support strong demand across commercial engines, aftermarket and defense$11.75 billion transaction, expected to be accretive-a) to adjusted EPS* and free cash flow* in the first yearStrong near and long-term value creation for customers and shareholders GE Aerospace (NYSE:GE) announced today that it has signed an agreement to acquire Consolidated Precision Products (CPP), a leading manufacturer of highly engineered\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8d284b114bc3bfc219bc7773181471f5892ca6ae0affb748b71fb1bf3d242216\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788859671,\"headline\":\"Cramer’s Mad Dash: GE Aerospace\",\"id\":141952199,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108359749-17888739271788873925-48251084629-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1788873926\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC’s Jim Cramer delivers his daily Mad Dash.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8076f688867d7928777faecd0a40cb827f239d33b138409e759233290084e565\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788853447,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace to buy Consolidated Precision Products for $11.75B\",\"id\":141952200,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108359682-17888673821788867379-48249613174-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1788867381\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC's Phil LeBeau reports on the latest news on GE Aerospace.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b96b385e9dc028731d957ead6b50d5f8e501dffdc0e5b8c96924a627c81cd386\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788852846,\"headline\":\"GE Aerospace Inks $11.75B Deal To Acquire Consolidated Precision Products\",\"id\":141952324,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace (NYSE:GE) announced today that it has signed an agreement to acquire Consolidated Precision Products (CPP), a leading manufacturer of highly engineered castings, from private investment firms Warburg Pincus\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=99183aaa6173b109c27302330e6615b40d0fb0a2651bcd2fcec0b846c539fc84\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788839100,\"headline\":\"StandardAero: The Growth Is Real, But The Cash Still Needs To Land\",\"id\":141847367,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1442424534/image_1442424534.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"StandardAero is the largest independent engine MRO in the world, and it trades at the cheapest multiple. See why I rate SARO stock a Buy now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eb890086986597f485c2f9c790bbdf94d078daff9d4344573b55d281d7d631c2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788804180,\"headline\":\"Nike just got kicked out of an elite club\",\"id\":141771322,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The sneaker giant’s stock collapse has real consequences.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=966c22a30e4c7faaa41dbf4f573fc79c2d17843efb2e7ab42e536aa159ac21bf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788705013,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk Cheers Heart Aerospace’s $5 Electric Aircraft Flight — Says ‘An Important Next Step Is Making It Autonomous’\",\"id\":141593677,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Elon Musk applauded Heart Aerospace’s first flight of its X1 battery-electric demonstrator on Thursday, which the company says flew for 27 minutes using roughly $5 worth of electricity, while arguing autonomy should come next. X1 Flight Proves Electric Aviation Scale...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cdfdcb0412c924fbc61d6d061162833b14f7f51fabad46040f737533161bce44\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788581937,\"headline\":\"Top 3 Defense Stocks To Watch In September 2026\",\"id\":141496043,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Energy price pressures and Middle East risks are contributing to higher borrowing costs and persistent inflation expectations. This type of backdrop often keeps governments focused on security and supply chains, which directs long term attention to companies linked to aircraft, satellites and defense systems. This article discusses three stocks from the aerospace and defense supply chain that many investors monitor when evaluating resilience and contract-driven cash flows. The three stocks...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6efd8d32a50117cf61c09c7eca2b389a6d447589bd0c24cd8040483dd196ba7e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788568200,\"headline\":\"Nike: Just Not Doing It\",\"id\":141491619,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1391545555/image_1391545555.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"With the lagging performance aside, there have been some notable big winners among the index's 30 components. Read more here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c3748497894521a11c661f28144f376bd12e723c1080964e7ff112ad03c70ae4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788556294,\"headline\":\"Does GE’s New Navy Engine Deal Deepen Its Recurring Defense Revenue Story (GE)?\",\"id\":141460785,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"GE\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GE Aerospace recently secured a five-year US$2.87 billion U.S. Navy contract to support 17 F414 engine components and advanced its HyCAT hypersonic test vehicle program through a new Defense Innovation Unit award, while also adding to its F404 engine deliveries for India’s Tejas Mark-1A fighter jets. These defense wins, alongside continued momentum in commercial engine orders and services, highlight how GE Aerospace is deepening long-term, recurring revenue ties with both military and...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3962bc2875c32a1591d6fba6ba5cf69054102d7bf71203328b37aeb2cdfcc74b\"}]"
