     "content": {
      "size": 144186,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792354980,\"headline\":\"Tesla’s Flying Roadster and the SpaceX Halo\",\"id\":142989178,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla’s impressive flying Roadster isn’t about building cars at all. It’s about this.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5741a7aafc6fb7ec0542ae13b879086e5ed3bc2cc05766af68fa4d40d651b5b7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792347300,\"headline\":\"Tesla’s Roadster and the SpaceX Halo\",\"id\":142988567,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla’s impressive flying Roadster isn’t about building cars at all. It’s about this.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ccb91659615b4275c6e495f29904fb645aa5e402c481efe6277ff115378ba179\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792256700,\"headline\":\"Rivian's Key to Success May Not Be Its Vehicles\",\"id\":142962581,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Rivian is a minority owner of the AI-enabled industrial company Mind Robotics.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cc50a7ab727393691fbce38c0e91327fb56bf422610c3701ce7c9e127b335934\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792243020,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy Ford Stock Under $15 in October? Here's Why Investors Should Pump the Brakes.\",\"id\":142960689,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The company's shares have generated a total return of just 6% in the past five years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1143657b14009320b21315b5931a6dc2a96897a00e467e3f06b44982f3380384\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792224677,\"headline\":\"Our Pick Of The Best EV Stocks In October 2026\",\"id\":142959628,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"U.S. crude oil pushing back above US$100 a barrel has put energy costs back on center stage and sharpened attention on technologies that use less fuel. Electric vehicles and their key parts sit squarely in that conversation. Higher pump prices can nudge drivers and regulators toward alternatives. This piece runs through three stocks linked to electric cars and batteries from the screener and what makes each one interesting now. The three stocks covered next are just a starter pack, and the...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=189c2e272ea8b1e131ee4bce7bf0fb59aef4f2e70bfb647874a25678e16fdf46\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792188588,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today, Oct. 16: Tech Stocks Plunge as AI Software Valuations Reverse\",\"id\":142951550,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI-focused software shed $260 billion in value as Goldman Sachs raised alarms about debt financing, triggering sharp momentum reversal, today, Oct. 16, 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b6a892fb9e493f325dc0fbe3ddace35eb966cbc8ac5b88fa7779f90ce2fa2987\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792188360,\"headline\":\"Brian Kesseler Named CEO of TekniPlex\",\"id\":142951668,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Veteran industrial leader and former Tenneco CEO to lead global materials science company. Brian Kesseler, CEO, TekniPlex Brian Kesseler, CEO, TekniPlex Wayne, PA, Oct. 16, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TekniPlex, a global leader in materials science serving customers in the healthcare and consumer products markets, announced that its Board of Directors has appointed Brian Kesseler as Chief Executive Officer, effective October 13, 2026. Kesseler succeeds Brenda Chamulak, who has stepped down. Kessele\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d2ad82224d3ac525c6961be49396803f87d0bcc74861410244d510334fcc9cb8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173995,\"headline\":\"Ford Rises 2%, General Motors and Stellantis Edge Higher While the Stock Market Sells Off\",\"id\":142949477,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"While the broader market slides and AI darlings lose ground, Ford and GM are bucking the trend in afternoon trading, and the reason behind the rotation tells a bigger story about where investors think profits are hiding right now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a25430bda6864de9953fb1f88ddb64420d6857228955498a992c68d6c800d2ab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173976,\"headline\":\"Most-Active S\\u0026P 500 Stocks in Oct. 16, 2026 US Session\",\"id\":142959210,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"S\\u0026P 500 most-active stocks for Oct. 16, 2026: SMCI, F, BAC, T, PLTR, NKE, ORCL, HPE, MRNA, and PFE saw heavy volume, with sharp declines and modest gains.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b3986a48a3f5afab657ba95ce3d87f80df82d15165f29bb14aad7f91ddb88834\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792163438,\"headline\":\"3 EV Stocks With Revenue Growth Up To 33%\",\"id\":142948172,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Electric vehicles are not just about cleaner transport anymore. The World Bank now wants to multiply financing for critical minerals, which are essential for EV batteries, and that raises the stakes for companies tied to this supply chain. If you care about where that money could flow next, this is a theme to watch closely. This article breaks down three EV related stocks from our screener that may warrant a closer look. The stocks covered below are just a small sample of the EV theme, and...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ebb2aa22dabe71963f91e67b2e9447737f604860449ba8c45f3a485fac481f8d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792160940,\"headline\":\"Q3 Auto Earnings Preview: 4 Stocks Set to Beat Estimates\",\"id\":142948145,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GM, PCAR, F and RIVN are poised to beat Q3 earnings estimates as resilient auto demand, strategic pricing and higher deliveries offer support.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4453756b16897059b38f129a6718983fcaec64da690a6ec82925914eb4e7f3e9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159015,\"headline\":\"Gasoline Cars Fall Below 50% of Global Sales: The Trump Contradiction\",\"id\":142960813,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Cars-In-A-Row.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Gasoline-only cars fell below half of global sales as Trump\\u0026#39;s fossil-fuel agenda diverges from the auto industry\\u0026#39;s electrification shift.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3175dd05d793521c6de0818191f0f699710a4c7da5464a984d1cb4091457f597\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792135057,\"headline\":\"Ford's Ability To Easily Shift Between EV And Conventional Production Provides Flexibility\",\"id\":142944083,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2287625339/image_2287625339.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Ford Motor Company is re-rated from Hold to a cautious Buy, leveraging its flexibility between EVs and conventional vehicles amid market volatility. Learn more about F stock here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=804c538ef5f6334fe8d608f0d599ee726af1a6611eb90b23dacad7b1424c1a0e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792094920,\"headline\":\"What Would You Have Needed To Notice In GM Stock?\",\"id\":142922258,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"General Motors (GM) stock returned 50.6% in the year to October 14, 2026, outpacing the 17.3% gain for the S\\u0026P 500. The shares climbed even as the underlying business failed to grow. Over its latest twelve reported months, GM sold about as much as it had a year earlier, yet it earned less on it. So what could you have seen at GM before October 13, 2025.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ed5adbca8ffb568e17fc06041fa686ac9bac0f1dedca0f46b025314c5e9a542f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792082666,\"headline\":\"VW Wants to Take On Wrangler and Bronco on Their US Home Turf\",\"id\":142920558,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Volkswagen AG is investing heavily in the US market, which Chief Executive Officer Oliver Blume says is \\\"one big growth opportunity\\\" for the company. The company plans to enter the US market for light trucks and offroad sport utility vehicles, with projects including a software venture with Rivian Automotive Inc. and the revival of heritage brand Scout. Volkswagen aims to field a midsize pickup and an offroad SUV to compete with established US franchises such as General Motors Co.'s Chevrolet Colorado and Ford Motor Co.'s Bronco. Bloomberg's Gabrielle Coppola breaks it all down on Bloomberg Intelligence\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9a159022fc41f602b17b8655e95ec37ab85b59db690599e3ae18d3fed653f09a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792080050,\"headline\":\"Tesla Stock Has a Huge Valuation. Here’s What It Would Take to Justify It\",\"id\":142920348,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla trades at multiples that make traditional automakers look like bargain bins, and whether that premium survives depends on a set of bets that have never been more consequential or more uncertain.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=023149e6d0fbed1b87c68e620f3931dd20be58c2c59bce23a1ba15f29f5e0aca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792067100,\"headline\":\"2 Revolutionary Developments That Should Change Your Investing Thesis on Ford and General Motors\",\"id\":142914138,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Here's exactly what investors need to know about Ford and GM's path ahead with software-like margins and a rapidly growing overseas threat.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4e17d2af3c02a67873db3b5b52f841b68284204164f6e09fa15693f2ff49cbfd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792065600,\"headline\":\"Catalyst IQ Earns FordDirect AdVantage Tier 3 Certification\",\"id\":142916723,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GRAND RAPIDS, Mich., October 15, 2026--Catalyst IQ today announced its Tier 3 certification with FordDirect’s AdVantage digital advertising solution.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0ffde9983d3f0f6e12cf7656906a374ec620955ae547eb621c420b4dbc033c07\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792065118,\"headline\":\"Ford's Baby Bonds And OTC Debt Present A Unique Arbitrage Opportunity\",\"id\":142919273,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2255289456/image_2255289456.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Ford (F) debt trade idea: baby bonds yield 8.82%â1.3 pts above comparable OTC bondsâsignaling undervaluation. Read the full analysis here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=680bf5a5ab7653f740944ca99d87adb7dc21b144f60fa03b457c30a8189535fb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792049401,\"headline\":\"Why fuel economy rule rollbacks will spur a boom in pickup trucks and V-8 engines\",\"id\":142920123,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108309860-1779290520902-RM027_117FN.jpg?v=1779308539\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Lowered compliance costs, greater control over products, more big engines, more pickup trucks: These are just some of the changes investors expect from the rollback of fuel economy rules and the elimination of fines. Data indicates pent-up demand for pickup trucks, and many automakers are bringing back V-8 engines. At the same time, hybrid vehicles are surging, and electric vehicles have longer-term structural demand in their favor.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2b36535a442a1fd6336b6c27e07b1595d757395ac7be36057c20702c25de12bf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792035170,\"headline\":\"How Laptops Brought EVs Back From The Dead\",\"id\":142896518,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Think electric cars are a shiny new innovation? Think again.*What Other Tech Might Reshape Transportation Forever? Read here:* 🔗 https://clickhubspot.com/711830Your great-great-grandma might’ve been rolling around in an EV over 120 years ago. In fact, by 1900, a third of all U.S. cars were electric. So why did they vanish for nearly a century — and what brought them roaring back?In this video, we rewind the EV timeline: from Robert Anderson’s 1830s battery-powered carriage… to London’s electric taxis… to Tesla stuffing 6,831 laptop batteries into its first Roadster. This isn't the birth of EVs. It's the EV renaissance.The Everything Everywhere podcast was super helpful in researching this story. For more about the history of EVs, check out this episode from them: https://everything-everywhere.com/the-history-of-electric-cars/Subscribe to The Hustle:🔗 https://clickhubspot.com/vu3lGet the 5-minute newsletter keeping 2M+ innovators in the loop🔗 https://clickhubspot.com/3klnAbout HubSpot: HubSpot is a customer platform that provides education, software, and support to help businesses grow better. The platform includes marketing, sales, service, commerce, operations, and website management products that start free and scale to meet our customers’ needs at any stage of growth. Today, thousands of customers around the world use HubSpot’s powerful and easy-to-use tools and apps to attract, engage, and delight customers.#TheHustle #HubSpot\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9a9cae06600c96c953b8c103ac6c11996782d16a28392897a60ac1d558d0d8ae\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792013934,\"headline\":\"What Is Rivian Building That Investors Should Watch?\",\"id\":142888379,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Rivian Automotive (RIVN) have fallen 25% over the past three months, while the S\\u0026P 500 gained 3.4%. The company is currently ramping up a cheaper new SUV at its plant in Normal, Illinois, and that launch may be what bullish investors are betting on. So what is the new vehicle, and are buyers taking to it.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bd03130d6026f20be1376268b33ff6e2a692c77273efd8d49670d116ea817e19\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792003587,\"headline\":\"Ford (F) Is Freeing Itself From EV Overhangs. Is the Stock a Buy at 6x Earnings?\",\"id\":142887620,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ford (NYSE:F) has spent the past year cutting loose the costliest pieces of its electric-vehicle bet, and the payoff is already showing up in its gas, hybrid, and commercial businesses. The stock, though, still trades like the recovery might be a mirage. According to Bloomberg, a selloff in recent weeks has tested Wall Street’s faith […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0b509c586202a0f169f15f5f2a9ffbe55c9237a90ee91f6dbce0baa97e3f1ce5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791991212,\"headline\":\"Ford: The Market Is Worried And You Should Be Too\",\"id\":142887226,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2255289456/image_2255289456.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Ford stock analysis: volatile share price, strong 1H 2026 results vs. long-term issues, fair-value P/E, and rising macro risksâread the full analysis before investing.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30cf05ebe6c073b2cb54486aa1bb33f51227096a5344871564a569f7d430cb03\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791985320,\"headline\":\"Is BWXT a Buy as Nuclear Growth Meets Execution and Valuation Risk?\",\"id\":142885472,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BWX Technologies' nuclear growth, $1.4 billion in naval contracts and raised 2026 guidance bolster its outlook, but valuation, margin pressure and execution risks warrant caution.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a1dd8a77b93bfd13a21c5c1deeff14cb47e2c52ddcce7366c83754b633c370bf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791979205,\"headline\":\"Ford Motor Company (F) Is a Trending Stock: Facts to Know Before Betting on It\",\"id\":142883045,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ford Motor (F) has received quite a bit of attention from Zacks.com users lately. Therefore, it is wise to be aware of the facts that can impact the stock's prospects.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?