ps in 6.7L Power Stroke diesel trucks and certified classes in five U.S. states, setting the case on a path toward trial. This legal step heightens Ford’s potential exposure to repair and compensation costs, while also challenging its efforts to improve perceived product quality and reliability. We’ll...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=92c42bf443ae8cd47adec9e54948bda33e323eccbc5259905abf2b80779fef2c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791914703,\"headline\":\"What's going on in today's session: S\\u0026P500 most active stocks\",\"id\":142852829,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Explore the S\\u0026P500 index on Tuesday and find out which stocks are the most active in today's session. Stay updated with the stocks that are capturing market interest and driving market movements.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cf4b193290ba2707875c570cb7a6fa40447e3a4c1a0e281b98a05971f3058df9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791904201,\"headline\":\"Will Ford Motor (F) Beat Estimates Again in Its Next Earnings Report?\",\"id\":142852645,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ford Motor (F) has an impressive earnings surprise history and currently possesses the right combination of the two key ingredients for a likely beat in its next quarterly report.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5835e802f956c30db808547155da65d88ed3cb7a6546bf08f840cd4d8180fd12\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791900090,\"headline\":\"Tesla Completes Comeback, Paving Way For 30% Upside\",\"id\":142851133,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla's core EV business just posted numbers that stunned Wall Street, and the path back to its all-time stock peak is clearer than it has been in years. Here is what is driving the turnaround and what still stands in the way.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a08500a5cb538a15c92b1c714b4c89479af2c5832513910c877781a9f0ff5d28\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791898686,\"headline\":\"GM's Plans To Rival Tesla's Self-Driving On Track For 2028, CEO Says\",\"id\":142848640,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"CEO Mary Barra said General Motors is working on a self-driving system that won't require drivers keep their eyes on the road.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=75c7e177ad68e3e2eb92692169ca01c4a7959e11bf249b05832527e0d2018603\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791897328,\"headline\":\"These 6 Dividend Stocks Look Like Income Bargains. Their Payout Ratios Say Otherwise\",\"id\":142848861,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Six stocks are flashing high yields that look like income bargains, but a closer look at their payout ratios tells a very different story about which ones can actually keep the checks coming.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f40f45fbfb8b715c6acc28c83d077c4986aa1a5aa140fa11f9999f5b7e8bc603\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791896400,\"headline\":\"Appian builds out critical minerals platform with senior appointments and Washington, D.C. expansion\",\"id\":142849051,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Aerial image of Atlantic Strategic Minerals Aerial image of Atlantic Strategic Minerals WASHINGTON, Oct. 13, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Appian Capital Advisory Limited (“Appian”), the investment advisor to long-term value-focused private capital funds investing in companies in metals, mining and adjacent industries,