ting category for years, but a quirk in Q3 2026 finally cracked it open, and what analysts found raises serious questions about the truck's future.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8884695272e6794772564c30e2606e31b69272bf5752faed8a512c047f265697\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791837903,\"headline\":\"Ford Motor Company (F) Sees a More Significant Dip Than Broader Market: Some Facts to Know\",\"id\":142824643,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The latest trading day saw Ford Motor Company (F) settling at $12, representing a -1.4% change from its previous close.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=65a75c72ada7e1d203c4256ee841bd3d8b4678bce0372bf734914c2810ad1f8d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791828303,\"headline\":\"Looking for the most active stocks in the S\\u0026P500 index on Monday?\",\"id\":142823078,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay informed about the most active S\\u0026P500 stocks in today's session as we take a closer look at what's happening on the US markets on Monday. Discover the stocks that are generating the highest trading volume and driving market activity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=653996be3c58cbc3ec3ee1f6f71a72e9d6b502aab53f2465dbc050acfb4f3b30\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791826780,\"headline\":\"Rivian Automotive (RIVN) vs. TSLA and F: Can Improving Margins and Its R2 Midsize SUV Unlock Profitable Growth?\",\"id\":142822688,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Is RIVN a good stock to buy? We came across a bullish thesis on Rivian Automotive, Inc. on Astute Optics – US’s Substack. In this article, we will summarize the bulls’ thesis on RIVN. Rivian Automotive, Inc.’s share was trading at $13.96 as of October 9th 2026. This isn’t the first time we see an automaker pitched […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=15f94f4eef8c61ff82a9a777ff41d26b19d7e63f842eae997ac4f53d80ae2b25\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791818408,\"headline\":\"Tesla, General Motors, Other US Automakers Expected to Benefit From Resilient SAAR, RBC Says\",\"id\":142821581,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla (TSLA) and other US auto original equipment manufacturers, excluding Rivian Automotive (RIVN)\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7f0f04b8b40445b45d18ff5fe7e6bec94b85b33a76fcfe70f5d37d12f3c96f68\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791810914,\"headline\":\"4 Blue Chip Giants That May Have to Cut Their Dividends\",\"id\":142820077,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Four household names are paying dividend yields above 5%, but their earnings, cash flow, and balance sheets tell a different story than their press releases. Before you count on those checks arriving, there are some serious warning signs worth understanding.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=83c338dc19e7d70757ae0d10e1dc4e343531b4f837a7c4fd35cb4d713845c54c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791808597,\"headline\":\"JP Morgan Maintains Overweight on Ford Motor, Lowers Price Target to $16\",\"id\":142849619,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"JP Morgan  analyst Rajat Gupta   maintains Ford Motor (NYSE:F) with a Overweight and lowers the price target from $17 to $16.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6da0ff9a88dd6d41f00d9305bc2745a7573e8ec689ee9710e60947c70759c0ee\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791802983,\"headline\":\"3 Unprofitable Stocks We Find Risky\",\"id\":142819201,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Unprofitable companies can burn through cash quickly, leaving investors exposed if they fail to turn things around. Without a clear path to profitability, these businesses risk running out of capital or relying on dilutive fundraising.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=14c092caf1eb2f85c8d679e775ff1abe23c01ce3178b08babf0609b88113923c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791714900,\"headline\":\"Buy 9 S\\u0026P500 IDEAL \\\"Safer\\\" October Dividend Dogs\",\"id\":142806035,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2fb2b42086031751c87fed45dcdd2e8f905fa6bb37d0d501d511ce8bbee95970\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791624567,\"headline\":\"A Ford GT Just Sold for $968,000. Social Security Can Treat the Same Classic-Car Sale as $0 in Earnings or Business Income\",\"id\":142786901,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A six-figure car sale can register as zero earnings for Social Security purposes, or it can trigger enough withholding to wipe out your checks for the rest of the year. The difference comes down to one question most sellers never think to ask.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=962d5170cc8b2a5ea398dd4a79c8e94716802f839e32051f0a956b62c4c928de\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791598416,\"headline\":\"What Does Goodyear Tire \\u0026 Rubber (GT) Naming Joe Hinrichs Chairman Mean?\",\"id\":142774699,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Goodyear Tire \\u0026 Rubber (NasdaqGS:GT) elected Joe Hinrichs as chairman of its Board of Directors, replacing Laurette Koellner. Hinrichs previously served as CEO of CSX Corporation and held senior executive roles at Ford Motor Company. Koellner, who had been chair, is succeeded as the board refreshes its leadership structure around Hinrichs. The move to install Joe Hinrichs as Goodyear's new board chair is only one part of the wider story. Our analysis turns up 1 warning sign for Goodyear Tire...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4990f1e3f7bdd8fdbab5368acd2c3726352264096d9c2a964ff453637147a5e9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791583205,\"headline\":\"Jim Farley Says Ford's Next-Gen EVs Will Check Themselves for Assembly Defects: 'The Vehicle Diagnoses Itself'\",\"id\":142768096,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ford Motor Co. CEO Jim Farley said that the automaker’s Universal EV Platform will use their onboard computers to verify key assembly connections during production, as the automaker works to improve quality after a high number of recalls. Universal EV...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3288118b4f71f963458d1b96d3fc64a196475d21259d3e058e5ccafa2b75d572\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791576900,\"headline\":\"Joe Hinrichs Elected Goodyear's Board Chairman\",\"id\":142767217,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Goodyear Tire \\u0026 Rubber Company (NASDAQ: GT) today announced the election of Joe Hinrichs as chairman of its Board of Directors, effective Oct. 7, 2026. Hinrichs, who will also chair the board's Governance and Executive Committees, was elected to the company's board in 2023. He succeeds LauretteKoellner, who will retire in accordance with Goodyear's Corporate Governance Guidelines at the company's 2027 annual meeting.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=720abcb26bc5faa62bea15c8faf58817ef5ab7d6cf15c32c5a184c0cf552c43b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791567873,\"headline\":\"RTX Wins $6 Billion Pentagon Contract For Interceptor Missiles\",\"id\":142765308,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"RTX stock rose about 1% on Friday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=835dd5220579e6f2c912f3ae02f074e888e547f6b5c1b2632390885e0e06b339\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791556807,\"headline\":\"Ford’s Terrible Five-Year Stock Performance\",\"id\":142764268,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"While the S\\u0026P 500 soared and rival GM recovered, Ford kept finding new ways to stumble under CEO Jim Farley, and the reasons behind its five-year slide reveal a company struggling to hold its ground in almost every market it touches.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ae1848f02a1ac4ef4e534dd1fb669110f9c1e62f66b59133653f3e9a10c2417e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791546059,\"headline\":\"4 Household Name Stocks With Dividends in Danger\",\"id\":142760634,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Four household names are dangling yields above 5% at a moment when their earnings, cash flow, and debt levels raise serious questions about whether those payouts can last. Retirees counting on that income should look carefully before the next dividend announcement.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1a5084106507caaec52a9a5a7a3d996225674d910531b6c335c7daf8f20b788b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791544551,\"headline\":\"6 Dividend Stocks Where the Yield Is Getting Bigger for All the Wrong Reasons\",\"id\":142759356,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A yield topping 20% sounds like a windfall until you see what drove the price low enough to produce it. Six stocks are flashing warning signs that most income investors never check before buying.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=85969a8b5a9e62d56962b511e0cc52d556b0450cd34fa400bfecacf3be7e1405\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791529200,\"headline\":\"Performance Brokerage Services Advises on the Sale of Jack Kain Ford in Versailles, Kentucky, from Bob Kain, Vickie Kain Fister, and Pat Kain to O'Brien Auto Team\",\"id\":142748685,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Performance Brokerage Services, North America's highest volume dealership brokerage firm, is pleased to announce the sale of Jack Kain Ford in Versailles, Kentucky, from Bob Kain, Vickie Kain Fister, and Pat Kain to O'Brien Auto Team.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=27b4a18a2912d0a115a70d30dc7a750a79dbcaf9e1a5a1b4f33a16d41b9165fb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791505825,\"headline\":\"Why Should General Motors Stock Holders Watch This Number?\",\"id\":142737369,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"General Motors (GM) posted a 5.5% decline in U.S. new vehicle sales for the third quarter of 2026. This metric matters to investors because North America generated $3.4 billion of the automaker's $3.9 billion adjusted operating profit in the second quarter. The company had also raised its 2026 profit forecast in July, before this latest sales figure was released. But why did GM's U.S. sales fall.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bedb23aa60c2fe19d2b61e8a17d173c16071b9be359c9a4d59be34e49eb5aade\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791500340,\"headline\":\"Micron (MU) Is A Stock Jim Cramer Thinks Could Go From ~$1,000 To ~$2,000 Per Share\",\"id\":142733886,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Micron Technology Inc.’s (NASDAQ:MU) and SK Hynix Inc. (NASDAQ:SKHY) are two of the hottest stocks on the market courtesy of the ongoing shortage in the memory chip industry. The former is up by more than 200% year-to-date, as the ongoing data center buildout creates strong demand for its products. As if these gains weren’t enough, […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=75b41f162a7df9dd438c474d4be40ec2e5f292d8a8e4126971c02547986393e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791490020,\"headline\":\"GM stock will see major benefit from latest redesign, analyst says\",\"id\":142733232,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"It’s been seven years since GM redesigned these popular pickup trucks, but analysts believe shares could see a bump from the new look.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0e6930b1e4c002e01f065b41edb4cd757a41c2bf103720562d90c2a62b4ce9cb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791478039,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk’s 250,000 Cybertruck Goal Falls Well Short: New Data Shows Only 13% of Goal Sold Annually\",\"id\":142762856,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/08/Cybertruck-Shutterstock.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The Cybertruck is selling less than Elon Musk originally hoped. Here\\u0026#39;s a look at the potential quarterly figure.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=520a2dc968619e71fe18a136fd60158215675dfb903e27066dcd2014dbf65d85\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791475399,\"headline\":\"What could trigger a US debt crisis? Sozzi discusses with economist Kenneth Rogoff\",\"id\":142730897,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi takes a look at the biggest stories as the trading day kicks off, weighing in on PepsiCo's (PEP) latest earnings results, General Motors' (GM) latest update, and more. Sozzi also sits down with Kenneth Rogoff, the International Monetary Fund's (IMF) former chief economist and Harvard University's current Maurits C. Boas chair and professor of international economics. The two discuss various looming risks to the US economy, including the deficit, the specter of a debt crisis, the AI economy's growing wealth divide, and more. Rogoff is also a chess grandmaster and former chess champion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ba7dba3492558ae45a4c107b3c7791a564e600f8ffb29d9f44734d43b6103ca1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791470580,\"headline\":\"Why Bank of America is bullish on GM's truck overhaul\",\"id\":142731188,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi takes a look at General Motors (GM) overhaul of its workhorse trucks and breaks down a bullish note from Bank of America (BAC), which suggests the redesigns could help the automaker protect its market share and strengthen its competitive position.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=46bb5214d565cd5f4d3c8c942f97b5b64356c1c88b09635c1445555532947b8d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791470100,\"headline\":\"AI stocks are flying. These big names are falling behind\",\"id\":142730988,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"As tech giants like Marvell (MRVL), Nvidia (NVDA) and AMD (AMD) climb to new highs, Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi takes a look at the other side of the equation. Big-name companies like (NKE), McDonald's (MCD) and PayPa (PYPL) face an uphill battle to regain momentum and get back on track.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3ed10583ce9c2e10832e7c683414de2ae6e9a42794ee6ee6366a68d69679feea\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791463943,\"headline\":\"BYD Exec Rules Out U.S. Expansion Because Market Lacks 'Stability'\",\"id\":142727093,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Geopolitics are the biggest issue limiting BYD's global expansion, according to BYD executive vice president Stella Li.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f43386d84ada8d9fcf55996a41a8ff9411d606bfcd8042f6b3a14f9079958189\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791463140,\"headline\":\"myKaarma Offers New AI Lead Management Solutions to Ford and Lincoln Dealerships\",\"id\":142727623,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"myKaarma, the leading customer interaction and payments platform for automotive dealerships, today announced the availability of its AI Lead Management solutions for Ford and Lincoln dealers. myKaarma's selection as an AI Lead Management provider for both brands expands its role across Ford and Lincoln dealership service operations.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fc3fdd9ddfde525190a69cd0749ebc4a255663fab5c409895f4ae5b1a461f0c3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791454122,\"headline\":\"Forget the AI Bubble: Jordi Visser Says the 'Bankpocalypse' Has Begun\",\"id\":142727986,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/08/Wall-Street.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Jordi Visser says rising yields are no dot-com replay. Instead, AI agents demanding instant payments could squeeze banks, Visa and Mastercard.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b7c0e4a3a56f9f0f6ad8cb655aeea1c4f016568329e6a0049803c963cc60721f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791449400,\"headline\":\"Finally, Ford Is Free of the Overhang That Caused It to Lose Billions\",\"id\":142720375,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Many investors forget that the Novelis aluminum supplier factory fire hindered Ford's most profitable product. Now, finally, there's good news, and the automaker can start regaining lost production.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9bdaddd65589235b5dd124d76c217f8c20cdff09201778e26306d0552c7e59de\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791446400,\"headline\":\"What Investors Might Expect From September's Inflation Report\",\"id\":142726257,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1900634584/image_1900634584.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"U.S. bond yields surged to multi-decade highs ahead of the October 2026 CPI report. Read more on the US economy here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ab1b1a32a85fa00bd1e0a239e6c664b7a40ee1b134688d75c63d2b07240e92fd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791436503,\"headline\":\"Does Gentherm's (THRM) Special Dividend and Board Shuffle Hint at a Shifting Strategic Focus?\",\"id\":142710693,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In October 2026, Gentherm declared a US$63,500,492 special cash dividend, appointed former Ford Chief Technical Officer Paul Mascarenas to its Board and Technology Committee, and named Katrin Schatz as Interim President of Modine Performance Technologies. This mix of capital return, added automotive and technology expertise, and continuity in the Modine division’s leadership could meaningfully influence Gentherm’s longer-term direction. Next, we’ll examine how Gentherm’s one-time US$2.07...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e896a48406623d91cfab20d2cdc06c15221371af40d609d4f75291852299530a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791429600,\"headline\":\"Here's Where Tesla and 4 Rival Automakers Could Be by 2030\",\"id\":142727177,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla's rivals are taking very different paths toward 2030, and some may succeed without copying its EV strategy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=99295b56db1805543221b25cd3aedc72320a174aead7868de6619668b6c93cef\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791405781,\"headline\":\"Which Dates Could Move Tesla Stock Most?\",\"id\":142700305,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla (TSLA) stock has lost 11.4% over the past twelve months while the S\\u0026P 500 returned 17.8%, leaving investors wondering what could change that. Management expects more than $25 billion of capital spending in 2026, and upcoming financial reports will clarify how the company is paying for it. Below are the events most likely to move Tesla stock over the next six months.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=92831818d606451890f09c80dd834074a20b5efc9420e79ef07e31b61e1deb3d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791392402,\"headline\":\"UBS Maintains Buy on Ford Motor, Lowers Price Target to $15\",\"id\":142727988,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"UBS  analyst Joseph Spak   maintains Ford Motor (NYSE:F) with a Buy and lowers the price target from $17 to $15.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=00aaadb5bcd29876ff01dcb8a58c806ed6dc8312e327304e3e8f8cc8ce8c9974\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791390900,\"headline\":\"General Motors’ measured truck redesign should support pricing in 2027, says Bank of America\",\"id\":142698427,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"General Motors Company (NYSE:GM)'s measured redesign