ttps://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3dd78a37ab7a45e2b006bf7647157c6d9507e32646c5fba5765e3c5db8de3538\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790939517,\"headline\":\"3 EV Stocks To Own In October 2026\",\"id\":142587534,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Energy inflation in the euro area is running hot, with eurozone prices rising 3.8% and energy costs jumping 18.8%, which keeps a harsh spotlight on fuel and emissions. That pushes more attention onto transport that depends less on diesel, including electric vehicles and the companies that supply their batteries and components. This piece highlights three EV stocks from our screener that may help you position around that shift. The three EV stocks in focus here are only a small sample, since...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cebe053087ea35ba16fc77d2c32b7ff04b08bc0165bb8bc7ad4761cd25010533\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790936841,\"headline\":\"How Bad Would A Cash Shortfall Be For Tesla Stock?\",\"id\":142586022,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On its July 22, 2026 call, management said Tesla (TSLA) spent more than it took in during the second quarter. On September 29, 2026, Reuters reported that Tesla had lined up $30 billion in credit lines. If spending keeps rising, you could end up owning a company that borrows to build. How far short of that spending would the cash from Tesla's operations fall.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f28bd9288ade180f472369ebaeec40fcce89ab657bcbcd36b692388b1d18129b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790932505,\"headline\":\"Ford fends off Hyundai to retain No. 3 U.S. sales position in third quarter\",\"id\":142591623,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108249039-1767735279750-gettyimages-2254968033-dji_20260106114613_0557_d_iywbkfqk.jpeg?v=1790956803\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Ford on Friday reported a year-over-year sales decline of 6.6% during the third quarter to 507,395 light-duty vehicles.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b690a2c82fce2fec644da50b94b8b7937e5deba58c1cf285dafadc7ce1c2934d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790930427,\"headline\":\"Clark Howard Warned GM Would Rather Sell Fewer Cars for More Money, and Then GM Reported Its Quarter\",\"id\":142581290,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Consumer advocate Clark Howard called out Ford and GM for choosing profit over sales volume, and then GM released numbers that seemed to prove his point. Here is what that strategy costs a buyer who walks into a showroom without knowing it is happening.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f409b76c9f826000fedcd2fd0f6ff9e0ce1725e70ea052023964549e1a7409aa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790890696,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today, Oct. 1: Stellantis Surges Off Record Low on Ram Pickup Sales Jump\",\"id\":142562994,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On Oct. 1, 2026, the automaker's U.S. truck demand strength drove shares higher as investors eyed results from its turnaround plan.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=46480b9fbb18d3f1d1f1059172b610b48d138155242ab968bc24cff39327e3d4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790878792,\"headline\":\"How Much Downside Is Left In Ford Stock?\",\"id\":142561907,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"If you own Ford Motor (F), you may be wondering whether the worst has passed. The stock lost 13.5% in the past month, while the S\\u0026P 500 slipped 0.3%. A loss that fast can feel like the bad news is already in the price. So how much downside is left in Ford stock if the market turns as well.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5ba2792c61bc6194462d07abac81dde05604f3cd9dde2e2ba3fb095b172111e7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790870400,\"headline\":\"DTE Energy completes construction on Cold Creek Solar Park, driving local economic benefits\",\"id\":142559965,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"DTE Energy, the state's largest producer of and investor in renewable energy, has completed construction on the 100-megawatt Cold Creek Solar Park near Coldwater, MI. This park is a key milestone toward Ford Motor Company's decarbonization goals.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6c6a63887a061c5d826a6f8fe235fb3d40f05727833be4784c8fe996ffc3ec5b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790863680,\"headline\":\"Breakthrough T1D Walks Bring Communities Together and Raise Funds for Type 1 Diabetes Research\",\"id\":142559966,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Breakthrough T1D, formerly JDRF, the leading global type 1 diabetes (T1D) research and advocacy organization, is proud to continue its Breakthrough T1D Walks throughout the fall, bringing the community together to raise awareness and funds for critical T1D research. Breakthrough T1D Walk is a nationwide movement where thousands rally to transform the future for those with T1D. It is the largest global event for the T1D community, driving research, advocacy, and support to improve lives while fun\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1ffbea4e988fb23ba807e3069c0df77cbe40a262f80fb09d54252723014894d3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790855640,\"headline\":\"Why October Promises More of a Winning Streak for Markets\",\"id\":142557718,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Strong earnings from memory chip maker  Micron  are also helping sentiment—the stand out figure for me is its gross margin of 87%—compare that with the likes of old school manufacturers like  Ford  which hovers around 8%.  For those hooked on a little bit of gloom to kick off the morning, the  10-year Treasury  yield reached its highest level since 2002 on a cocktail of macro concerns.  You can subscribe to the Barron’s Daily newsletter here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0193527c68ba2d1864f68f3393aeccd1b22d7e06bc49a1cdf517dc0080f742fb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790853600,\"headline\":\"Tesla Trades at 350 Times Earnings. Here's What Has to Be True for That to Make Sense.\",\"id\":142555312,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla shares trade at a huge premium to other EV stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=082b1c3ff0fd11f6b719264621ea3aa5c5d4de16f42d8a038dbc89bf437dc98e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790852340,\"headline\":\"Why Micron’s 87% Gross Margin Is a Problem\",\"id\":142555323,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Micron stock wasn't getting much of a boost from its blowout earnings. Its margin guidance was an issue.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ddcfba723f5a7188e1acc1976677d50ae9ced54b839ddd52c352b9d109386679\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790850686,\"headline\":\"Jim Farley says Ford is expanding as others press pause on new hires\",\"id\":142553397,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Ford CEO shared the news at a media scrum during an auto conference and as Ford faces F-150 product