g\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi takes a look at the biggest stories as the trading day kicks off, weighing in on Micron (MU), SanDisk (SNDK), Jensen Huang's big third quarter, and more.Rubrik (RBRK) CEO Bipul Sinha sits down with Sozzi for a conversation about the state of tech and cybersecurity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b893d677f030512da2871f18273dbd6dc059e1ded675b6e35a41f2a43dd8570a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790780728,\"headline\":\"Former Ford CEO Mark Fields: U.S. automakers have to be competitive enough to beat Chinese automakers anywhere\",\"id\":142560565,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108370543-17907949371790794933-48707528612-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1790794935\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Mark Fields, former Ford CEO, joins 'Power Lunch' to discuss current Ford CEO Jim Farley sounding the alarm on Chinese automakers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fe8b56be9a4fbf0ecb7a5be09cea823356d822423a3616c5aebf233f565ffbd8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790779140,\"headline\":\"Ford Is Worried About a Labor Shortage and What That Means for Manufacturing\",\"id\":142522086,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The auto maker is bringing together business leaders from across the country to discuss the shortage of skilled trade workers that is coming.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=040509b552411dd3cda40b3afdecec1b03ae44faa7ab9d8d40b7f4dbbccd05fe\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790778265,\"headline\":\"Micron is crushing it, but so is SanDisk. So why are they still underestimated?\",\"id\":142525978,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi takes a closer look at the strong market performances of Micron (MU) and SanDisk (SNDK) stocks ahead of Micron's earnings results.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bdd98da3a175692148d1a49095ad7be747ee5b0ab7f6178c92bbd543024ef9a5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790773269,\"headline\":\"Ford CEO Jim Farley warns U.S. on Chinese automakers\",\"id\":142516877,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Jim Farley said Europe failed to act deliberately enough as Chinese brands' market share there climbed to 12% by August\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fc54c01bbb1e08339ec9c7bf2f80b19a0e9c750a77c9d802e9ab2bacaaaebf27\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790772049,\"headline\":\"Ford Stock Slips Following F-150 Supply Disruption\",\"id\":142557490,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/30/Sunnyvale--Ca--Usa---Nov-22--2023-Ford-L.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Ford are falling Wednesday afternoon after Chief Executive Jim Farley cautioned that a temporary supplier disruption would impact third-quarter wholesale deliveries, compounding downside pressure from a fresh vehicle recall. \",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c2762bfc572d9be8956ed8071ef568ee50139ad90cf6666df4640caa4f9b0e3e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790767259,\"headline\":\"Ford participates in ‘Michigan LIFT’ to boost US automotive supply chains\",\"id\":142513475,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ford and JPMorganChase are among the partners in a Michigan public-private initiative to help innovative automotive suppliers win business.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=df22abc86e60adf3828a8fe3aeea16b1f24a9d1402220c7c4a34f68df5a2d9e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790766426,\"headline\":\"Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang: AI data center build-out could create 1 million jobs and reshape the US economy\",\"id\":142513041,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia (NVDA) CEO Jensen Huang, sitting next to SpaceX (SPCX) and Tesla (TSLA) CEO Elon Musk, said the AI data center buildout will create \\\"probably about a million jobs.\\\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=55b92248f3b7ddcb83acc800231305d7469e90dc34de4314f1786a6e1c05139b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790763382,\"headline\":\"Ford CEO Jim Farley Says F-150 Supplier Disruption Impacting Q3 Wholesales, But Issue Resolved\",\"id\":142520176,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\" - Reuters\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d364a426a42f3bae6a36e65aa9bd19346889ab542ef7fb75aba12408ce883a24\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790762927,\"headline\":\"AI in America has a huge 1.7 million job shortage problem\",\"id\":142513101,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Got skilled workers?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=850daf5a30871df0216aeacc228c972f4606806b7fdf905eca76563e1c26e47b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790762700,\"headline\":\"Stellantis' Turnaround Continues to Gain Traction -- Here's 1 Overlooked Reason to Buy the Hype\",\"id\":142513404,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Stellantis' stock could pop once it proves to Wall Street that its makeover is real.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f18e939a99bad9269a6cc4953c569169efdb3384630dc223aace754ae6de2316\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790762400,\"headline\":\"Alliance for America's Skilled Trades Expands with New Companies, Unveils New Research - The State of America’s Skilled Trades: A National Report\",\"id\":142513099,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"DETROIT, September 30, 2026--A new report released today by the Alliance for America's Skilled Trades finds the U.S. will need to fill an estimated 1.7 million skilled trades openings each year through 2035, while training programs produce just 55 workers for every 100 needed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=504f29613b31eb5f5f053d73107da800e77c5ac364e56badbf5e345d82ec1414\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790758800,\"headline\":\"Ford, GM and Stellantis invest under $400 per vehicle in EVs — Chinese rivals spend up to $2,750, analyst warns\",\"id\":142512634,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Here are all the numbers that suggest we can’t ever catch up to Chinese brands.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=67bc5faf4fea6ed560635b3e8311de9a271fca3ba283835d3d05201bb5c8bb05\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790755687,\"headline\":\"Ford CEO: We have to 'change the image' of skilled-trade jobs as less valuable than college degrees\",\"id\":142521746,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108370133-17907697581790769755-48701271046-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1790769756\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Ford CEO Jim Farley and Dycom CEO Dan Peyovich join 'Squawk Box' to discuss the second annual Ford Pro Accelerate: The Essential Economy summit in Detroit, the impact of AI on the skilled workforce, and more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9bd9d121d10377a53d3b3d8dddcd460b662be7b9e9feb1b5192688a39c7d0b24\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790742337,\"headline\":\"Ford Recalls 41,748 Expedition, F-250 SD, F-350 SD, F-450 SD And F-550 SD Vehicles Over Contaminated Headlight LED Chip Risking Lighting Loss\",\"id\":142520177,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"-National Highway Traffic Safety Administration\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=105b75659e32d69484a48f482feff7300154cfeab16fcd228ce4aed04c1e863a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790737690,\"headline\":\"Ford (F) Stock Looks Fairly Valued Despite Its 23% Run\",\"id\":142509308,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ford Motor shares have been choppy lately, yet over the past three years the stock has still delivered a 23.1% gain. That puts fresh attention on whether the current US$12.30 price is properly backed by the cash the business can generate. Recent headlines on F-150 production, policy shifts on fuel standards and battery supply moves have added more moving parts to that question for anyone trying to link Ford’s share price to its underlying cash flows. Over the last three years, Ford Motor has...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ecfdae00da1321648b5f116ed6d29fbb0d8e81d2b1b94c8f7fc5724c858eb631\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790723357,\"headline\":\"What Does Ford Motor (F) Michigan Battery Lead Mean For Its EV Supply Chain?\",\"id\":142502381,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ford Motor (NYSE:F) is under political fire over its use of Chinese battery technology at a Michigan plant that is already operating. General Motors is pushing sodium-ion battery research to build U.S. battery capacity and limit reliance on Chinese suppliers. The two Detroit automakers are intensifying efforts to secure domestic battery supply chains for future electric vehicle production. The race between Ford’s Michigan battery plant and GM’s sodium-ion push captures only one slice of this...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=685c48b688727571b26e37d743f7a019bdad9e327e7691e288402889e1f7b6f8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790705102,\"headline\":\"Most active S\\u0026P500 stocks in Tuesday's session\",\"id\":142499745,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Curious about the most active S\\u0026P500 stocks in today's session? Get insights into the stocks that are leading the way in terms of trading volume and market attention.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=57da3c33a98b6dff9df75407d1dc4d7cc57eb8111eda3462d1f025924b5a269f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790698015,\"headline\":\"Stellantis Falls 4% With Canadian Labor Standoff Unresolved; Ford and General Motors Dip\",\"id\":142498589,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A Canadian labor standoff remains unresolved at Stellantis N.V. (NYSE:STLA), and Stellantis stock is taking a far heavier hit than shares of its Detroit rivals. Stellantis stock is down 5% to $4.44 in morning trading, a move that leaves the shares down 60% year to date (YTD). For Stellantis, the drop adds fresh strain to […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c48f20b25c677f7496db69a8a565af8aa381202f0710ec840624c632b582f81e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790694848,\"headline\":\"Ford CEO says it's 'too late' for Europe to fend off Chinese automakers, but not for U.S.\",\"id\":142807055,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108369758-1790709686991-gettyimages-2297232145-_c3a4940.jpeg?v=1790715823\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CEO Jim Farley's warning comes on the heels of a high-profile visit last week by Chinese President Xi Jinping with President Donald Trump\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=85f37562518becf27b264cb19f1e341fe72734a44c08ef83cb792b3fc1c45fc3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790676044,\"headline\":\"Ford says Ontario willing to bankroll 'nation-building' pipeline from Alberta to Sarnia\",\"id\":142493751,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ontario's premier later said he expects outside investors to help finance the proposed Northern Shield pipeline which would move up to 500,000 barrels per day\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b3d7b35997ff26d91445589f08ed6a144ab620660a9e264d5959270bb71a4f94\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790627917,\"headline\":\"Ford and GM Just Got More Breathing Room on Their EV Plans\",\"id\":142471378,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"New U.S. fuel economy rules ease the pressure on automakers to move their lineups toward electric vehicles as quickly.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8a39be11f661d1387d591ebd1faddb6cb345deb6657687dbf762f4efbc74088\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790605660,\"headline\":\"Can This Number Push Tesla Stock Higher?\",\"id\":142468155,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nearly 1.5 million Tesla (TSLA) customers have paid for Full Self-Driving (FSD), the company's driver-assistance software. You might expect the Cybercab or the new Semi truck to matter more for the stock. FSD already reaches the cars Tesla sells. Yet the stock has lost ground: a $10,000 holding bought a year ago is worth about $8,400 today. How many new Tesla buyers now start with this software.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6d21c53d5fe410a0168c59b2a32f40a55b38d21ec2d0c6730eb9f92e5ca3a2c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790605514,\"headline\":\"Ford Stock Drops Monday: What's Happening?\",\"id\":142497489,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/28/Sunnyvale--Ca--Usa---Nov-22--2023-A-Ford.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Ford shares are falling Monday afternoon, sliding alongside the broader automotive sector as spiking crude oil prices and surging Treasury yields threaten both consumer auto financing and corporate capital expenditures.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=03a86528a583cea9cb64dc96f1244da5e30ba98ed6ec8301daa2a68482b09f3a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790605019,\"headline\":\"Is Rivian Stock Riskier Than It Looks?\",\"id\":142468157,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Rivian Automotive (RIVN) shares trade at 3.5 times the company's revenue, above the S\\u0026P 500's 3.1. Investors pay that premium for a carmaker that lost $3.2 billion over the past twelve months. The price appears to assume the new R2 SUV ramps up on time and lets Rivian sell cars above their cost. If the R2 stalls, that valuation is what you have at risk. So what could stall the R2.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=da2a6cda41518aa70391dc76b047f0c61681d3578e9a90b667d79a4848313832\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790604024,\"headline\":\"Before September Ends, $150,000 in These 2 Dividend Stocks Could Set Up $500 a Month\",\"id\":142466541,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Two household-name stocks with very different business models happen to share one trait right now: yields high enough that a combined $150,000 stake clears a specific monthly income threshold with room to spare.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1e58dce882d0d4e2787ab0261b351667ead41609f0f3a47b73cc920ef05e5040\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790602939,\"headline\":\"China EVs Could Destroy Ford And GM\",\"id\":142466506,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ford's CEO once warned that Chinese EVs pose an existential threat to American automakers, and now GM's CFO is quietly signaling the same fear. The tariff wall protecting Detroit may not hold forever, and what comes next could reshape the entire US auto industry.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6fa6b6533afe0d949dd945e2c143cbef17f08b7b098357949718578238f5f900\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790602496,\"headline\":\"Trump administration planning to cut back on Biden-era fuel mandates\",\"id\":142466507,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The 8:30 Hosts Julie Hyman, Jake Conley, and Pras Subramanian discuss the Trump administration's plan to cut back on fuel economy standards set by former President Biden, where automakers would have to increase car gas mileage to 50 miles per gallon by 2031.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=140e7e32e4fd4e48c172efeafc618013e44c33b7b40c9aec177bb7caf51e3440\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790586574,\"headline\":\"Trump Administration Ends Fuel Economy Credit Trading In 2028\",\"id\":142466869,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"- Reuters Citing Document\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7a0a4eac5f745426c62578ebac3757fac2887ad8481ca015f014ce293f7d5669\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790585837,\"headline\":\"The U.S. Transportation Department Finalizes New Lower Fuel Economy Standards\",\"id\":142466922,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"- Reuters \",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=60ec05680ef3fda882b888548fcbfad6da7706156f3360c1addd2cb2df9a22dd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790563043,\"headline\":\"STLA, F, GM Climb Overnight As Trump Clears Fuel Economy Rollback — Says Auto Plants Are ‘Coming Back’\",\"id\":142452862,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The final rule is expected on Monday. The December proposal targeted 34.5 mpg by 2031, down from 50.4 mpg.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dde9baeaa5015f0327033f0d9bbc3ed7fc511657de33cc03bd0594658c198519\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790557817,\"headline\":\"Can General Motors’ (GM) New V-8s Protect Truck Profits without Derailing its EV Strategy?\",\"id\":142452062,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The pickup truck market is having a gas-engine moment just as EV demand cools nationwide. General Motors Company (NYSE:GM) recently unveiled new V-8 engines for its redesigned 2027 Chevrolet Silverado and GMC Sierra pickups, reigniting a truck wars rivalry with Ford and Ram at a moment when EV sales have cooled. The new 6.6-liter V-8 […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=42eed88169757b19a9ef656c2a74beb312366018fb3960d3f5454f3a50a1996c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790553400,\"headline\":\"GM (GM) Looks to Sodium-Ion Batteries to Gain an Edge Over Ford (F)\",\"id\":142451475,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On September 12, 2026, CNBC reported that General Motors Company (NYSE:GM) is in the early stages of developing next-generation battery cells that it says can reduce U.S. dependence on China, days after Ford Motor Company (NYSE:F) faced Trump administration criticism over its own Chinese battery-technology ties. GM has partnered with Denver-based startup Peak Energy to […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c2916cdcdc8350a4e1e924d141eec83bc60c6839f5cd3fbd0504bf9a51a9b999\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790540098,\"headline\":\"GM’s Diesel Push Could Protect Margins, but the Market is Shifting\",\"id\":142450092,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"General Motors Company (NYSE:GM) is sticking with diesel engines for the redesigned Chevrolet Silverado and GMC Sierra, which are scheduled to launch in the fourth quarter. The trucks will receive an upgraded 3.0-liter diesel engine and an optional larger fuel tank capable of delivering more than 900 miles of highway range. The strategy differs from […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=66af6d8ec3427b7beb38c639a7810d9a900cd11cf85ba2da884f40f6481345d8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790536484,\"headline\":\"Ford (F) Halts F-150 Production at Dearborn Over a Supplier Problem\",\"id\":142449298,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ford Motor Company (NYSE:F) has stopped building the F-150 at its Dearborn Truck Plant, according to a company memo. All crews were canceled from Thursday through Tuesday, September 29. Some shifts at the Kansas City Assembly plant were affected as well. The cause is a supplier problem rather than weak demand. The shares rose 0.87% […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=70a097bb3fcf6c5a1080dd519dba32792e82dbbeabd678b4b8ce8ac464f87aa9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790534576,\"headline\":\"Ford Motor vs. Tesla: What Revenue Trends Reveal About These Automotive Titans\",\"id\":142449249,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ford's revenue remains roughly double Tesla's, yet the gap has narrowed noticeably over eight quarters as Tesla's growth accelerates.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ee7799f66a164974142d1ff58a1d798442d1e41dfda177e5c66963c7f0f15502\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790522041,\"headline\":\"Ford Motor Company vs. General Motors: A Close Revenue Race\",\"id\":142447913,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ford edges out GM in five of the last eight quarters, but the gap remains razor-thin—a pattern that could shift either way.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ba6d7fe3467e78fbebf485c80efcb14d2d96944ddb2a4942e77dd9fbd170a81e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790501878,\"headline\":\"Ford Halted F-150 Output at Dearborn in Q3’s Final Week. Here’s What 7x Forward Earnings Already Prices In\",\"id\":142446340,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Ford StockCurrent Price: $12. 71Target Price (Mid): ~$19Street Target: ~$16Potential Total Return: ~50%Annualized IRR: ~10% / yearWhat Happened?Ford Motor Company (F) canceled every production crew at its Dearborn Truck Plant from Sept.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ab2b7d54c2cc0f644f5dfdb8f3f4e47019b410f8114777221c93da3ac860d6fc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790471493,\"headline\":\"GM And Ford Stock Look Different After Easier US Fuel Economy Rules\",\"id\":142442327,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Washington just dialed back fuel economy rules, and that shift lands right in the wheelhouse of U.S. legacy automakers with big truck and SUV lineups. Less regulatory heat on gas-powered workhorses could reshape profit pools and investor expectations before the market fully prices it in. This piece walks through three stocks tied to that policy shock and explains why their exposure to the news deserves a closer look now. The three tickers covered below are just a starting sample, since the...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=84f88e274afb141957637dfc09753796e79cee9263b518d826a5bc6a17f848c6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790461406,\"headline\":\"Trump Declares ‘America Is Back’ as New Fuel Economy Standards ‘Terminate’ Biden-Era ‘EV Mandate’: ‘Big Day for American Auto Workers’\",\"id\":142447587,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/27/United-States-President-Donald-Trump-mee.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Trump says new fuel economy standards end Biden-era EV mandates, lower car costs and boost U.S. auto production and jobs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=827c471f74606c1ebd0e98824297a38619a32af8afaaef7703bd3d735cf46f85\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790425440,\"headline\":\"Is Ford Stock a Buy for Its Dividend?\",\"id\":142436867,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Despite a well-covered 4.7% forward yield, Ford's dividend history suggests caution.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7b095f844f28120333bbbe4cc8558e4d71069c8d613c5ec3bbf4c245de4d0135\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790414880,\"headline\":\"Prediction: Ferrari Is a Better Buy Than Ford for the Next Decade\",\"id\":142436036,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Long-term investors seeking to own a high-quality company should look more closely at the Italian purveyor of supercars.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c4e8c90b527765d5e1237fa880bda8b71baabbd0342bd79671d4ffe531a21563\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790413225,\"headline\":\"This Week in TSLA: Elon Musk Teases Tesla Roadster, FSD's Brussels Speed Limit Violations, And More\",\"id\":142437429,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/26/Tesla-Company-Logo-Seen-On-Smarphone-Pla.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Tesla teases its Roadster, starts Semi production, faces Brussels FSD scrutiny, highlights Cybercab’s local battery.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7fea632b7ce7436e02ab1bf877304c8ff3eb9e6e50ec34b4d053534c8fc4deba\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790386250,\"headline\":\"The Auto Weekly: Tesla's Semi Play, Rivian's Cheaper Model Promise And Detroit's Market Share Threat\",\"id\":142431185,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla said high-volume Semi production is underway in Nevada, Rivian patched a camera-software defect across most of its fleet, and Ford cut F-150 shifts while Cox projected Hyundai Group to outsell Ford in Q3.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=803230eeb27db46c5aa0d000e44b60bea0111c49a58669a879f1357ace55c1c3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790381562,\"headline\":\"Hyundai’s Hybrid Surge and Expected U.S. Sales Lead Over Ford Might Change The Case For Investing In Ford Motor (F)\",\"id\":142431400,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In recent weeks, Cox Automotive reported that Ford’s U.S. vehicle sales are expected to decline in the third quarter, while Hyundai Motor is projected to outsell Ford in the U.S. for the first time, reflecting softer demand for some major Detroit automakers. This potential reshuffling of the U.S. sales rankings underscores how rapidly growing demand for hybrids is benefiting Asian manufacturers and pressuring Ford’s traditional market position. We’ll now consider how Ford’s anticipated U.S...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6c4824f76f594988d10ba4141f105b134e30e8305ce480278a88f82ad08cfb7b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790380057,\"headline\":\"Tesla (TSLA), Ford (F), and GM (GM) Face a Weaker EV Market. Who Can Protect Profits?\",\"id\":142426675,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On September 16, 2026, Reuters published an investigation showing that Trump administration policies, chiefly the elimination of the $7,500 federal EV tax credit, have derailed a wave of American EV and battery manufacturing investment. Roughly 87% of announced EV-related investments concentrated in states Trump won in 2024. General Motors Company (NYSE:GM)’s Ultium Cells battery joint […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1473c9165311d5cac1f3546604e784c405d3241df5f7ad6155dd6a92cbb77f38\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790373000,\"headline\":\"Higher Rates Crush Dividend Stocks\",\"id\":142431164,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2258806445/image_2258806445.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The higher the yields on \\\"risk-free\\\" investments like Treasury bonds, the less attractive stocks with higher dividend yields become.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=229c7e949458374255871fbceee8a94b1ddc2352db3d35c7681ccf30f1a9039b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790360241,\"headline\":\"American Drivers Are Turning Away From Ford and GM\",\"id\":142438746,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Detroit is losing ground in a rapidly shifting auto market\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9801c8240910d723a56c3c41aef6cecf0e7f8f744b15bb7ff6fa55fe130c30a4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790359982,\"headline\":\"Ford Is Expected to Lose Market Share in Q3. Don’t Panic-Sell F Stock on the News.\",\"id\":142429638,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Cox Automotive expects Hyundai-Kia to sell more vehicles in the U.S. in Q3. The forecast sent Ford lower yesterday, but don't panic sell the stock on the report.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a102547591450a6d3ddf3c88a099a37980f8481e765975a697de21bafdec0fab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790359502,\"headline\":\"Most active S\\u0026P500 stocks in Friday's session\",\"id\":142425127,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Curious about the most active S\\u0026P500 stocks in today's session? Get insights into the stocks that are leading the way in terms of trading volume and market attention.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=05bab3b9b2fcb41175871378adc80d9d2b6f43067350ad7207724a3c97045a4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790359126,\"headline\":\"Ford halts F-150 production at 2 factories. Here's why\",\"id\":142425631,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ford Motor has halted production of its big moneymaker, the F-150, at two factories due to a supplier issue. Here's what it means.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b1c0b3a40374db92d783eb240f07be4c8b1df3bfddd21090c7c457b12c3c2024\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790349651,\"headline\":\"GM and Ford Just Got a Troubling New Signal From U.S. Car Buyers\",\"id\":142424728,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GM and Ford are projected to post the steepest U.S. market-share declines among automakers in 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=54faca3eea60bce86d2de08c15607017db6bc8f73367fe4846312bfe8e2827ab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790343431,\"headline\":\"What Would It Take For Tesla Stock To Move Higher?\",\"id\":142422065,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla's clearest route to a higher share price runs through driverless rides, not through selling more cars. That matters now because the stock has trailed the market. Tesla (TSLA) shares lost 11.3% over the past year, while the S\\u0026P 500 returned 17.1%. Cybercab rides started in Austin in September, and regulators are already asking questions. How far along is Tesla's robotaxi service today.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=feb93593dd06a072f6f3fbdc1c1dd5f121748aa403b94a0fab96dace171af934\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790340118,\"headline\":\"Why Is Everyone Ignoring Ford Motor Stock's High Cash Yield?\",\"id\":142424933,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ford Motor's free cash flow over the last twelve months equals 14.5% of its market value. The median S\\u0026P 500 company offers 4.5%. Free cash flow is the cash left after paying for plants and equipment. Measured against the whole company's value, debt included, the yield is 3.8%. A 14.5% yield means one of two things: the stock is a bargain, or investors expect its cash to fall. Why does Ford's share price give this cash so little credit.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b130fcad25325b853f7a0a40810e3a8f45e49921afb4109fc054a4a1d286a249\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790335996,\"headline\":\"'F-150 Truck Production At Michigan Plant Down For Nearly One Week'\",\"id\":142438218,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"- Reuters Exclusive \",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=41c79c19b70e5dd2009c1d699dd62abb9ba6cffa0c849e7fdbf2dc6252430899\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790328994,\"headline\":\"GM, Ford Q3 US New Vehicle Sales Seen Dropping YOY, Cox Says\",\"id\":142413590,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"General Motors' (GM) new US vehicle sales are expected to drop 5.2% year over year in Q3, while Ford\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=736893538897aafb2daafe837232723ba3753a71a02886176058f980496ffab1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790317800,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Breakfast Podcast: Costco Checks Out Strong\",\"id\":142416217,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2246449357/image_2246449357.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Costco posts another earnings beat. Ford and GM are seeing their grip on U.S. market share slip. Starbucks is trimming its footprint.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=be5eed4c162f03e14b8019887d4a2c19f61469b6675fb02a1f7d8d40ddfc6349\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790279301,\"headline\":\"Soaring Gas Prices Could Put Korean Automaker's Sales Ahead Of Ford\",\"id\":142385759,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Demand for hybrid cars has become so significant it could reorder the scoreboard for automakers in the U.S. A new U.S. sales forecast shows Ford giving up its no. 3 spot, while Hyundai stands to steal Ford's place for the third quarter. Cox Automotive predicts the South Korean automaker will sell 511,421 vehicles during the July-September period, a 6.5% bump...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=11bca25e39326f2ce0c19d75ee229be4a6d4869374094c94c04fe06b48aeb0ac\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790270178,\"headline\":\"Ford Set To Lose Ground To Hyundai In Q3 Sales, Says Cox Automotive — ‘Detroit 3’ Market Share Seen Hitting Record Low\",\"id\":142384651,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Cox expects Ford’s Q3 sales to decline 7.1% and Hyundai’s to rise 6.5%.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=971100c9ed1c48d0c8cc832251ea0a654afcff62db53f22889a147b5b667ef9f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790269020,\"headline\":\"Ford Stock Falls as Hyundai Is Set to Outsell Them for the First Time Ever\",\"id\":142384853,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of  Ford Motor  Company fell nearly 2% Thursday following a report from Cox Automotive forecasting that South Korea’s Hyundai will outsell the American car company in the U.S. for the first time ever in the third quarter.  The automotive research firm projects that Hyundai will sell 511,421 new vehicles during the three months ending on Sept. 30, versus Ford’s 504,172.  The fastest growth area for Hyundai in the U.S. has been for its hybrid vehicles, specifically its Santa Fe crossover sport-utility vehicle, Sonata sedan, and Tucson crossover SUV.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=74351fbb80eeb5955b5578aa09e12477fcb591da0ab24461f77a73875c3867cd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790267100,\"headline\":\"Rivian vs. the S\\u0026P 500: Which Investment Wins Through 2030?\",\"id\":142384582,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The electric vehicle maker looks undervalued, but it has a lot to prove.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=595307288663f652c3b2e2c9dd653024a025ffe97d2e9ebee609d3ce5f8d5639\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790247844,\"headline\":\"'Hyundai expected to outsell Ford in third quarter as Detroit automakers lack hybrids' - CNBC\",\"id\":142422534,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/24/hyundai-set-to-outsell-ford-in-q3-as-detroit-automakers-lack-hybrids.html\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1cde470e8c6c0aa6d42e508c7297d671d97bd741ef761e71ed0c55802d309e84\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790247619,\"headline\":\"Hyundai expected to outsell Ford in third quarter as Detroit automakers lack hybrids\",\"id\":142384357,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108287670-1775515626092-NYIAS_04022026_DeVries-238.jpg?v=1775515991\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Cox analysts said Ford and General Motors are seeing sales lag because they don't have many hybrid vehicles.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6dc5173b44171ce0b738de0ec8a6f8358f126a09cbb3d24fc6611da73fc425f7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790243250,\"headline\":\"European Union Car Registrations Rise 4.5% in August; Tesla's Figures Up 53% Year Over Year\",\"id\":142373794,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"European Union new car registrations jumped 4.5% year-over-year to 708,211 in August amid rising ene\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bdf0549221f243a4fc5469daf4eca53cede97c53540b7703d3c3889424b6a505\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790230802,\"headline\":\"New Patent Shows You May Be Able to Put a TV in the Hood of Ford's $30,000 Tesla Cybertruck Rival\",\"id\":142382371,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/24/Sunnyvale--Ca--Usa---Nov-22--2023-A-Ford.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"New patent suggests Ford’s sub-$30,000 Fathom EV pickup may feature a front tailgate with fold-down that could stow a TV.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6e41a0f54d3798a3a7cd73a5b0cb4717d541625500aa1c7fd4995499a39a349d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790219272,\"headline\":\"Trump Says He’d Welcome Chinese Car Factories — Bipartisan Senate Push Says Not So Fast\",\"id\":142379637,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/24/President-Donald-J--Trump-Delivers-Remar.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Bipartisan senators seek to ban Chinese vehicles, software and components in the U.S., clashing with Trump’s openness to Chinese factories.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7a815d164f879302d5259b20e3414b041bf65a317e2ea014194b8f4ebb426d81\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790217009,\"headline\":\"Tesla Cybercab Goes Made in Texas as Elon Musk Highlights Locally Manufactured Nickel Cathode: ‘From the First Cathode Plant in the Americas’\",\"id\":142381537,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/24/Tesla-Cybercab.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Tesla’s Cybercab uses locally sourced nickel cathode made at Gigafactory Texas amid Trump\\u0026#39;s tariffs on the auto industry.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=feb59d8eec99a1118fb71beafad5d61d8568c8bf353cd4178428164ce27a1ff1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790178780,\"headline\":\"Did Trump Snub Ford? The Stock Dips Ahead of Dinner With Xi.\",\"id\":142363140,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GM and Tesla CEOs are expected to attend a dinner with President Trump and President Xi. Ford, apparently, wasn’t invited.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=38346cecf5193ebb81e52fda2e8e5856a1480e7db1b1acda7cb95fed418471af\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790174171,\"headline\":\"As Trump and Xi meet, Chinese automakers could be a Pandora's box for U.S. auto industry\",\"id\":142384298,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108306886-17787594972026-05-14t051409z_67000638_rc2q8laxia4h_rtrmadp_0_china-usa.jpeg?v=1778759519\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Trump’s meeting with Xi comes as U.S. automakers and lawmakers push to keep restrictions on Chinese vehicles and manufacturers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c4ba6e4bab509a094071f6ca8f03c0ff3797d1115e7bbfb317e0a681530c5500\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790172009,\"headline\":\"Ford (F) Answers Washington’s China Criticism with a $1 Billion Kentucky Bet\",\"id\":142362209,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On September 10, 2026, CNBC reported that Ford Motor Company (NYSE:F) announced a $1 billion investment to build a new paint shop at its Kentucky Truck Plant in Louisville, two days after Transportation Secretary Sean Duffy publicly raised “profound concern” about the automaker’s ties to Chinese companies. The plant, which Ford calls its most important […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3ce3bf2d744bd39701cda0ac83ac71cbbcdd5f508f7c2b1adcb58ccc3ea96099\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790170981,\"headline\":\"Are US automakers' concerns of domestic Chinese competition overblown?\",\"id\":142359570,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ahead of President Trump's meeting with China's Xi Jinping this week, US auto groups signaled their concerns about growing competition from Chinese automakers in a new letter to the administration. The 8:30 Hosts Julie Hyman, Jake Conley, and Pras Subramanian examine automakers' worries of Chinese competition penetrating into the US market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=df9cacbcce7b6ad50143d301b641ada4546191ca14e2cff133e13d47235352b6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790164740,\"headline\":\"Trump’s State Dinner Makes Strange Bedfellows of Tesla CEO Elon Musk and GM’s Mary Barra\",\"id\":142358095,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chinese President Xi is coming to America to visit U.S. President Donald Trump.  The two men will dine at the White House on Thursday evening with many U.S. business leaders in attendance, including  General Motors  CEO Mary Barra and  Tesla  CEO Elon Musk, according to Reuters.  GM and Tesla didn’t immediately respond to a request for comment about the dinner.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0c1aabae963775ebae8dc5dcf94bba9575fc8dd6d5c29a115d733276b2e13e50\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790140308,\"headline\":\"Gary Black Says Legacy Automakers Will Not License Tesla FSD, Instead Bet on In-House Self-Driving Efforts: ‘Inclined to Build’\",\"id\":142355022,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investor Gary Black says that legacy automakers such as General Motors Co. (NYSE:GM), Ford Motor Co. (NYSE:F) and others will not license Tesla Inc.‘s (NASDAQ:TSLA) Full Self-Driving (FSD) technology. Legacy Automakers Will Bet on In-House Self-Driving Efforts Responding to a post by Tesla investor and influencer Sawyer Merritt, the Future Fund LLC co-founder said that he had “predicted for years that no legacy auto makers would license $TSLA ‘s FSD technology from them.” The investor added that\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=390a133c943ecb6828f373e76a906c89e0387b43096a5a4499f38df875d7f424\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790123100,\"headline\":\"Why This Top Automaker's Gamble on V-8 Engines During a Hybrid Boom Actually Makes Sense\",\"id\":142346313,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GM's unveiling more hunky V8 engines amid a boom in hybrid demand seems like a mistake, but here are some things for investors to consider.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e546e51c2556d435ce77608d5abe0a1a03e1bd5402520f1648465c76b5eb0c03\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790115900,\"headline\":\"Detroit Automakers Turn Back the Clock on the Arsenal of Democracy -- Investors Should Cheer\",\"id\":142343764,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The move to go after more incremental revenue through the defense business is encouraging, but there's more for investors to cheer about.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=365e8f2227e5c089b356c18cb976aa690ed3b395c46a5f57229900b876c5834f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790103996,\"headline\":\"5 Tips for Using Stock Screeners to Build Your Portfolio\",\"id\":142343147,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"There's no magic formula to fit all cases, but these tips for using stock screeners can help you identify risks and rewards on your terms.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2ecb253dac679f892977431a41eb5338a7a2e8e2d740c9300f11d2972ff0e474\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790095216,\"headline\":\"As Trump and Xi meet, TD Cowen says the auto stock sell-off on Chinese car fears is 'overdone'\",\"id\":142341053,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Wall Street thinks the odds of Chinese automakers breaking into the US market is low, but the US auto industry is taking no chances.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=972a812fa339ba1ffb993c423421b640afcdaeaab39ddc0f8485682d0a9cc79b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790094960,\"headline\":\"Nate Neibauer Joins Academy Asset Management as Managing Director, Head of Portfolio Management\",\"id\":142336809,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"NEW YORK, September 22, 2026--Academy Asset Management, a veteran-owned institutional asset manager and affiliate of Academy Securities, the nation’s first Post-9/11 veteran owned and operated investment bank, today announced that Nate Neibauer has joined the firm as Managing Director, Head of Portfolio Management.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fa4a71d73310fcc0f400e33378d4836ae6b78e068589451a881b307ae86486e8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790082890,\"headline\":\"GM Wins $700 Million Pentagon Contract; Shares Gain\",\"id\":142337847,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Pentagon expanded General Motors' contract to build lightweight troop carriers. Shares of GM rose about 1% on Tuesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dc803a5c45687e54a6722706c25b6d89adf2172812949ae86ec6e0a9df5db9f0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790031508,\"headline\":\"Ford Stock Is Down 24% From Its Peak. Here’s Why the Services Business Could Be Worth More Than the Cars.\",\"id\":142315832,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Ford StockCurrent Price: $13. 21Target Price (Mid): ~$20Street Target: ~$16Potential Total Return: ~49%Annualized IRR: ~10% / yearWhat Happened?Ford Motor Company (F) closed at $13.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e404560b5c3776139fc99fcc53bd058e420e1a7e82014a3914555005c609e7ca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790012880,\"headline\":\"A Race Against Blindness Launches “Ultimate Ford Garage” Fundraiser With Two Ford Vehicles Plus $40,000 Cash\",\"id\":142314959,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Unexpected second chance brings the custom F-150 Raptor and Ford Explorer ST together in one $165,000 prize package supporting research for inherited retinal diseasesGILBERT, Ariz., Sept. 21, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- A Race Against Blindness charity has launched a new fundraiser with an unexpected story behind it. The Ultimate Ford Garage gives one winner a custom Ford F-150 Raptor, Ford Explorer ST, and $40,000 cash, a combined prize package valued at approximately $165,000. Learn more and ente\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=05c7c82a1645786b72edb48bc5f5c069bfefac88f04e2f849cb1d2b7f35ee486\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790004480,\"headline\":\"4 Dividend-Friendly Auto Stocks to Weather the Industry Challenges\",\"id\":142314497,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GPC, MGA, TM and F offer dividend yields above 2%, backed by payout ratios below 60% and varied growth drivers amid auto-sector risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c7eec9d2cbfad622734149d78623047a118b8a24812201d04d647bd0b9cde1ea\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789997274,\"headline\":\"Should You Pay Up For Tesla's Narrow Lead Over Its Peers?\",\"id\":142312704,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla (TSLA) earns a better operating margin than General Motors and Sunrun, its two peers here, and trades at 310 times earnings, the highest of the three. General Motors' 37.8 times rests on trailing earnings that include a loss quarter, so it is not comparable to a clean year. The lead is real but narrow: it is a margin lead, and a thin one. The price rests on a robotaxi, robot, and chip build-out whose capital spending management expects to keep growing for two to three more years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0941fde2394eaa34d5b04f486bcffd62e012cca4b0cc74796d673c16d8166ec5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789991124,\"headline\":\"CATL develops US-specific battery despite trade restrictions – report\",\"id\":142310801,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Chinese battery maker CATL has developed a “tall” battery design for the US pick-up truck market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ae04d31075195e437dc9931df94b66e1211122276e6fe5b0ad8c08f548122491\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789900200,\"headline\":\"Honda's Largest Recall In Recent History Cost Millions\",\"id\":142289008,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Despite this recall first coming to light over a decade ago, Honda might have known about the issue a decade before that, but is still paying the price today.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2e3b78bf10f325fe5b014e5853af3e7330d66007bc9342bdfa82742978121458\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789896621,\"headline\":\"EXCLUSIVE: Tesla Vehicles Maintain Nearly 19% Junk Title Rate Across Age Groups, VIN Analysis Shows\",\"id\":142288680,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/20/Tesla-EV-electric-vehicle-Service-Center.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"EpicVIN data shows Tesla has the highest EV junk-title rate at 18.5%, versus 1%-9.5% for leading legacy automaker EVs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eae097a43c89929061ffb1d44100fd97458fbc15b6e0a8db12c6e487f193b538\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789819847,\"headline\":\"GM brings back Apple CarPlay as buyers demand it\",\"id\":142270323,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"GM is bringing Apple CarPlay and Android Auto back to its vehicles, reversing one of the more unpopular decisions in the automaker's recent history.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0d63aa930713a025b946ec2280318c2aad45547e8c84f547dc5a612e045c4451\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789796507,\"headline\":\"General Motors Unveils New Engine Lineup for 2027 Pickup Trucks\",\"id\":142277807,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for General Motors StockPrice change for General Motors stock in last 6 months: 18%$GM Stock Price as of Sep. 17: $8752-Week High: $92$GM Stock Price Target: $104What Happened?General Motors (GM) stock is in the news after the company unveiled its new engine lineup for the 2027 Chevrolet Silverado 1500 and GMC Sierra 1500 pickup trucks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=df15b4850bd6334939feb8bf3c9dd6f038b43471108500fa7396c6bf2c8190d9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789777800,\"headline\":\"Another Domino Falls\",\"id\":142267454,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2278919600/image_2278919600.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"As oil prices have spiked in the last few weeks, several consumer-related groups fell like dominoes. Yesterday, the legacy auto stocks have had their number called.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c32d4a8889ebdcf99676930793e41dc96ebf3c1df0f6f2b5757ebf75d38e9ec0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789763700,\"headline\":\"GM is re-downloading Apple CarPlay, Android Auto to its cars\",\"id\":142261557,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"General Motors (GM) will reinstall Apple's (AAPL) CarPlay and Android Auto in its vehicles after initially planning to remove the software from new cars. Yahoo Finance Senior Autos Reporter Pras Subramanian explains the consumer reaction that led to this decision.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e2a11418050a909bee1794c2740a93d44ebeb2362de049f5537898beec3cde42\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789754700,\"headline\":\"Explore the S\\u0026P500 index on Friday and find out which stocks are the most active in today's session.\",\"id\":142258520,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Looking for the most active S\\u0026P500 stocks in today's session? Join us as we dive into the US markets on Friday and discover the stocks that are dominating the trading activity and setting the pace for the market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4ac00e1b4de60d09d4acbd32e9f56adbe79b0efb09edf3ad06a8332151385298\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789751466,\"headline\":\"Market Chatter: Toyota, General Motors, Ford Join Coalition Asking Trump to Maintain Bar on Chinese Carmakers in US\",\"id\":142260035,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Toyota Motor (TM), General Motors (GM), and Ford Motor (F) have joined a coalition of automobile mak\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=85705116312e86ff694171388ef8d300adf09f5fe1548b0f2452c2da1dbe51b1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789749698,\"headline\":\"What's Going On With Tesla Stock Friday\",\"id\":142259423,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla Stock Rises as Automaker Rally and New Charging Deal Lift Shares\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4a8cdb950f87a93a62e6cc051d5cff3ea5d4038ebd59397ea546e509c140028f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789749301,\"headline\":\"Discover which S\\u0026P500 stocks are making waves on Friday.\",\"id\":142257812,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Wondering what's happening in today's session for the S\\u0026P500 index? Stay informed with the top movers within the S\\u0026P500 index on Friday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9fdb3c27ac169cdd6b58e3629306e42ff535174dae598cf9c8d5f8e1750d3a19\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789747909,\"headline\":\"Fed Raises Rates, Yields Hit 2007 Highs as Fuel Costs Set Records: This Week On Wall Street\",\"id\":142270772,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/18/Diesel-Prices-Cross-6.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The Fed hiked for the first time since 2023; the 10-year yield touched 5.04%, and record diesel prices hit truckers and automakers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2fbac1a765a47bf212e99e40ad93c0b49a5ff423030f1a4db735d13f67e98fb2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789743081,\"headline\":\"Automaker Stocks Reverse as Rotation Trade Unwinds: General Motors and Stellantis Fall 4%, Ford Pulls Back\",\"id\":142260037,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Thursday's rotation rally handed automakers a one-day reprieve from months of pressure, but Friday morning that same trade ran straight into reverse, and the order in which Stellantis, GM, and Ford are falling tells the whole story.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4fe69fe91dd37dc60711584e5518d13fe0776ff580dd6a7180879ab8e58b38b4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789737975,\"headline\":\"Ford’s Yield Is One of the Loudest in the Market. Is the Payout Actually Safe?\",\"id\":142260040,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ford's dividend yield screams louder than almost anything else on the market right now, but trailing yield screens are hiding something important about what investors are actually collecting. Before you buy for income, there are two numbers that determine whether this payout survives 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4ced0a8275fe85f6d3f3814d003358f5f9508d0eb1ee0e9ec6e60e9be3c553e0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789737254,\"headline\":\"Ford Stock Is Falling: What's Happening Today?\",\"id\":142271238,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/18/Sunnyvale--Ca--Usa---Nov-22--2023-A-Ford.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Ford shares are trading lower as record diesel prices and the highest Treasury yields since 2007 squeeze demand for the trucks and SUVs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cc8863ab45f7d7f7e902e5b4787e9c7b04d97c699d2df2d63a871249c43a7de0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789735551,\"headline\":\"The Moneymaxxing Crowd Will Love 5 High-Yield Dividend Stocks Under $20\",\"id\":142254495,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Younger investors are rewriting the rules of wealth building, and five overlooked dividend stocks under $20 sit right at the center of that shift. The real question is whether these picks can hold up long enough to matter.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2968e781ef36c47fd1685678cb002f168d05a2c883586a6f3d95e9c60532df39\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789733889,\"headline\":\"QUICK SPARK: General Motors Stock Sinks Over 5%, Eyeing Worst Day Since July 2025\",\"id\":142271025,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/18/Benzinga-Quick-Spark.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"GM fell 5.2% Friday to $82.20, its steepest drop since July 2025, as record diesel and 2007-high yields squeeze Detroit.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1510bbb1a86bdb8c43ea49d81dd7c741568c98d00a6a7001683f6c69ec713e19\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789730794,\"headline\":\"'Auto Industry Urges Trump To Keep Chinese Carmakers Out Of U.S.' - Bloomberg News\",\"id\":142271005,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\" https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-18/auto-industry-urges-trump-to-keep-chinese-carmakers-out-of-us?utm_source=latest\\u0026amp;utm_medium=share\\u0026amp;utm_campaign=copy\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f7866750fd7150d19d461424f2b551ae1a6eab00511573563187584e1ef456fd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789719100,\"headline\":\"Ford Motor (F) Cuts F 150 Prices As Undervalued Narrative Faces A Fresh Test\",\"id\":142244780,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"F\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ford Motor (F) just put its 2027 F-150 lineup in the spotlight with updated styling, new tech features, and lower prices on several high-end trims to address truck affordability concerns. Ford Motor shares trade at US$13.61 after a 1-day share price return of 1.95%, with the 30-day share price return down 2.30% and the 90-day share price return down 3.20%. At the same time, the 1-year total shareholder return of 21.33% and 3-year total shareholder return of 34.72% point to longer term gains...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a7559561b03a4446247f15f6232e9a092d5048390012d96f3b6b4e713e5cfde7\"}]"
