      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792348229,\"headline\":\"Nine Companies, Including Broadcom and Verizon, Object to Their Shares Being Tokenized. Can They Stop It?\",\"id\":142988566,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"OKX and Intercontinental Exchange want to tokenize shares from 63 public companies, but nine of them have formally pushed back. Whether corporations can actually block a blockchain exchange from trading digital versions of their stock is now a live legal and financial question.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=57f743c8f642271987dae6f5e86d7fcda59985d7b89227a395e3cb591f5c0007\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792337580,\"headline\":\"Verizon launches generous customer perks after raising prices\",\"id\":142987425,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Verizon is offering customers new benefits that extend beyond its core service as wireless competition intensifies.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d5ae848f6317f89a74e9831a13be514ef02e6d4f447d230f5092a6f02b3ff018\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792334581,\"headline\":\"SpaceX Is Buying Airwaves to Take On the Wireless Carriers. Is the Stock a Buy?\",\"id\":142987417,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A reported $8 billion deal might take Starlink Mobile indoors. Does it change what the stock costs?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=32e7df69acfaee61384de29c2a5f2766c832ff0a80a1e543771ce17af61e42d2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792329764,\"headline\":\"SpaceX Faces Major Challenges Building Mobile Network After Spectrum Purchase\",\"id\":142986932,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for SpaceX StockPrice change for SpaceX stock in last 1 month: -4%$SPCX Stock Price as of Oct. 16: $14652-Week High: $226$SPCX Stock Price Target: $223What Happened?SpaceX (SPCX:NASDAQ) has bought 800 MHz of spectrum licenses from Grain, and a source put the price at nearly $8 billion.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=89302f2e3583ff5a79a22a29351455f37df4e5b1bc03e9e2e1e240248ed32d6f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792310400,\"headline\":\"The Data Center Doomsday Scenario\",\"id\":142986379,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d733269d580b8f457fbc381c431850ac865267f6f47bd6dfb7175a21c0285369\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792273900,\"headline\":\"T-Mobile: A Major Profit Boost May Be Coming\",\"id\":142966412,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2151884960/image_2151884960.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"TMUS stock update: T-Mobileâs TâMix price hikes show pricing power, lower handset subsidies, and 5G edge vs rivals.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6d49e425eff3bd905ad8cbed4448e9d068c7ef7e6d92288fbc919dbe43200c34\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792262886,\"headline\":\"Top US Grocery Chains' Websites Remain Offline After a Major Cybersecurity Incident\",\"id\":142987107,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/New-Cybersecurity-Grants-Proposed.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"A top US grocery chains\\u0026#39; websites remains offline after a major cybersecurity incident happened earlier this week\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=22ca59360e51f1b8ae798eb61ef65d122ff80a46e2ac9a91511913914d306b9f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792254082,\"headline\":\"Verizon or PepsiCo: The One Dividend Stock I’d Hold for the Next 20 Years\",\"id\":142983465,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysOn Oct. 8, PepsiCo cut its fiscal 2026 core EPS growth outlook to 2.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6a6d9fd77b1060143ef6b3f14633ad284025a809d2860b33935f6dd107094180\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792203588,\"headline\":\"Can Trade Desk Stock Bounce Off Its Old Support Again?\",\"id\":142957837,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors holding Trade Desk (TTD) have seen the stock lose 74.1% of its value over the past year, compared with a 17.9% return for the S\\u0026P 500. The immediate question is how much further shares might drop. One certainty is the current level: at $13.13 on October 15, the stock sits above the prices where it turned and rallied three times in 2018. How did the stock fare at this price then, and how has it fared in 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=71cf5d711ba3ba1bcbbf6c79f1f0a241d3a628524717e03107fe3ae492d959bc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792175036,\"headline\":\"Verizon (VZ): Can Fixed Wireless Grow Without Squeezing Mobile Network Returns?\",\"id\":142950127,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Verizon Communications Inc. (NYSE:VZ) earns mobile and broadband service fees from consumers and businesses. Fixed wireless delivers internet over its mobile network, adding 193,000 net connections in Q2 2026. With its nationwide network and recurring service revenue, Verizon Communications Inc. (NYSE:VZ) is among the 10 Most Active Blue Chip Stocks to Buy Right Now. At […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a756a4779762ec7b5b16143c56efa969a4b1b326c35308e7b35757b49a608124\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170883,\"headline\":\"Does SpaceX Mobile Entry Change The Bull Case For Verizon Stock (VZ)?\",\"id\":142949180,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX recently agreed to acquire nationwide low band spectrum in the 800 MHz range, positioning its Starlink unit to offer cellular service that could compete directly with established U.S. carriers such as Verizon Communications once regulatory approvals and network build out are addressed. Investors are now weighing how a potential SpaceX mobile offering, combining satellite reach with terrestrial coverage, might affect Verizon Communications market share, pricing power, and long term...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6d11227397f5394f8dd6d255fcce98d2ee5624e27bcb1a56f9ca18c94461664e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168500,\"headline\":\"AST SpaceMobile Is Down 67%—Could SpaceX's Mobile Push Deepen the Selloff?\",\"id\":142962655,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AST SpaceMobile stock hit a one-year low this week amid SpaceX's Starlink spectrum expansion, a Piper Sandler downgrade, a securities lawsuit, and ongoing earnings misses.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e962cca202bdb34639359e58f7e15bd128cae648ef8f78417bc417d9beb71989\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167344,\"headline\":\"These 6 Dividend Stocks Generate $7,273 a Year. Here’s What Taxes Could Cost You\",\"id\":142949181,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A $200,000 dividend portfolio sounds straightforward until the IRS takes its annual cut, and the bracket you sit in determines how much of that income quietly disappears before you ever reinvest a dollar.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dc0e116618b2063965f95d2e104bcd2511ab2b68819cc7ad928da326b08ddd63\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159247,\"headline\":\"What Could T-Mobile Stock Be Worth In Three Years?\",\"id\":142948050,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"T-Mobile US (TMUS) stock lost 30.1% over the year to October 15, 2026, dividends included. During the same period, the S\\u0026P 500 gained 17.9%. The decline has left a company still growing its sales priced below its own historical baseline: the shares currently trade at 16.2 times earnings, against an average of 21.9 across its last twelve fiscal quarter-ends. So how much of that lost ground could T-Mobile win back over the next three years.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=17f46ec13f02bc68175175c16a6cc40691dc1559a0ab2d67c90c8eec020f1091\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792157831,\"headline\":\"SpaceX Will Target Rural America Before Big Cities, Telecom Analyst Predicts\",\"id\":142961282,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Starlink-is-a-satellite-internet-constel.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Telecom analyst Roger Entner predicts SpaceX will build its mobile network from rural America toward major cities.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3eebc8ea12b891cb4e5ec022ec9cea949c40fe13c7897ea1c478259f1d3c4be6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792155324,\"headline\":\"Generate $50,000 in Passive Income With the 5 Highest Yielding S\\u0026P 500 Stocks\",\"id\":142945633,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"When paychecks stop, a portfolio has to pull its own weight, and the 10-year Treasury now sets a brutally high bar for any dividend stock trying to justify its place in a retirement account.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=064a17b792043e0243d820db7b3f00e963c8230d7d8b42042601a1cd1976c1f4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792149300,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk vs America’s Big 3 phone giants: AT\\u0026T, Verizon, T-Mobile down $50B. Will Starlink slash your wireless bill?\",\"id\":142944319,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX is one step closer to becoming a major wireless carrier. While the competition heats up, here are 3 ways to lower your household expenses now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=10b901563f65b3fb2de2ee2f7b52dbb8aac716d38689872c63b906211bd4f004\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792143719,\"headline\":\"Space Stock Watch: SpaceX Spectrum Deal, Rocket Lab Delays, Tesla Merger Chatter\",\"id\":142945373,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Space-Shuttle-On-Orbit-Of-Moon--Spaceshi.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Space stocks fall as SpaceX pursued an $8B wireless push, Rocket Lab delays Neutron to 2027, and Tesla’s Roadster revives merger speculation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b7486b264721380a1d9d6f11e6d5826acf7cab5628cc25d210df3d65f9a5ba44\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792139928,\"headline\":\"Apple’s $1,999 iPhone Duo Preorders Begin Today: Trade-Ins, Monthly Payments and Deals to Cut the Hefty Price\",\"id\":142945146,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Bangkok-Thailand-Sep-19-2026-Apple-Iphon.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Apple opens iPhone Duo preorders at $1,999, offering trade-in credits up to $885, carrier deals up to $1,200 and 0% financing.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7fbd847e8212769bc71d0e55287ea76938a942171d01605de30efbe7f16cb946\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792135686,\"headline\":\"Wall Street's Most Accurate Analysts Spotlight On 3 Tech And Telecom Stocks Delivering High-Dividend Yields\",\"id\":142945883,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/16/Verizon-Communications-Inc.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Benzinga highlights high-yield communication stocks Verizon (6.37%), BCE (6.23%) and Rogers (4.55%), with recent analyst updates.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=180d666965f6dad03fc05273d6b6dd75234755639b0828623fcc7d60bf5999a2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792102946,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy Comcast Stock At Under Seven Times Earnings?\",\"id\":142923026,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of Comcast (CMCSA) currently trade at 6.7 times earnings. That multiple sits at less than a third of the 22.7 times commanded by the median S\\u0026P 500 company. Over the past twelve months, the shares fell 19.7%, dividends included. The broader S\\u0026P 500 returned 17.3% over that same period. That could signal a sound business on sale, or it might just reflect a fair price for an operation that has stopped growing. So what does a buyer actually get for that price.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e7a6452ee552cf19c4824d17bde5f82b9120c16626a08093d8115a85b03e79a8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792096980,\"headline\":\"2 High-Yield Dividend Stocks Worth Buying Before 2026 Ends\",\"id\":142922197,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Verizon and Pfizer pay generous dividends, and each has a different path to growth. Here's how income investors can lock in yield before year-end.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c93cda2ba5d80fdc909491fee9ad005cc47ccd0943ec35f3e56e233bbddf67d2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792087660,\"headline\":\"Better High-Yield Dividend Stock: Verizon vs. Energy Transfer\",\"id\":142921461,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysVerizon yields 6. 8% and Energy Transfer 6.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f41f791875b70e212bde1ba0afaf16bf7a20799573b413ec4c651cebe4357504\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792087394,\"headline\":\"Better High-Yield Dividend Stock: Verizon vs. General Mills\",\"id\":142921462,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysGeneral Mills yields 7. 7% and Verizon yields 6.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fc9322fb783fc1471f77a9af3f453fbf0fbe7ac93455a507c9c483267d3041eb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792087119,\"headline\":\"Better High-Yield Dividend Stock: Verizon vs. Kraft Heinz\",\"id\":142921463,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysVerizon yields 6. 8% after an 8.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6b257c285b66504e99d047f78e39465766f6b43d043b2b75193f19b4301db3d4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792086879,\"headline\":\"Better High-Yield Dividend Stock: Verizon vs. British American Tobacco\",\"id\":142921464,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysVerizon yields 6. 8% after an 8.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3a91ca3ee70f37687be2fcb3eb20aa0184377874e7aefb451640d5353d00607e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792086547,\"headline\":\"Better High-Yield Dividend Stock: Verizon vs. Crown Castle\",\"id\":142920646,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysVerizon yields 6. 8% and Crown Castle 5.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9ea8db638faa5c63da6be84c7276289ef0ed93b1baba19fa1ff228d905515b24\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792086257,\"headline\":\"Better High-Yield Dividend Stock: Verizon vs. Edison International\",\"id\":142920475,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysVerizon yields 6. 8% after an 8.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c238a5fffbff7c4a5a5ea52660fd0bd50d10a6e1d269338695b9da4a051a34e5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792080445,\"headline\":\"AT\\u0026T: 3 Big Threats That Could Crush Its Dividend Growth And Buyback Potential\",\"id\":142921749,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2186489098/image_2186489098.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"AT\\u0026T Inc. delivered strong growth in Q2 and has several positive things going for them, but 3 big threats continue to loom. Click for this T stock update.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5fcf213b6230b36035953f3f4d0531955fa8bfdba8e247355e3fa1bc677851c9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792077843,\"headline\":\"Better High-Yield Dividend Stock: Verizon vs. Enterprise Products\",\"id\":142919354,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysVerizon raised its dividend 2. 5% in January, and Enterprise Products Partners is on track for its 28th straight year of distribution growth in 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ce133d2af66cf8c205085c27ca9eba426c621a60486e81fcd7745ed6ffdd1fdb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792074461,\"headline\":\"Why Are Ericsson Shares Surging on Thursday?\",\"id\":142945884,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Stockholm--Sweden---October-8--2021-An-O.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Ericsson reports third-quarter revenue of $6.17 billion, up 6% year over year, and earnings of 18 cents per share, above consensus.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=47031df36547210996e9911f0b7e77892ff9eb5b6101a83bfa0745ea02806179\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792073405,\"headline\":\"Pivotal Research Expects Starlink to Take 13% of the U.S. Telecom Market By 2036\",\"id\":142922342,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The firm reiterated its \\\"Buy\\\" rating on SpaceX for this.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ebf21017a8867bf06de3c657771105fd4a848be108417e05dcf01fc3f2949cf8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792072800,\"headline\":\"How To Build A $100,000 Dividend Portfolio With 10 High-Yield Picks\",\"id\":142920722,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/508666716/image_508666716.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Looking for a diversified dividend portfolio emphasizing risk-adjusted returns and sustainable dividend profiles? Click here to read about one approach.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ce4ed1cf425921fd1fc13d7da32e2b6b2b0acfe822c6cab16cf46c1cecaad817\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792065600,\"headline\":\"Verizon and Ericsson Accelerate 6G Development with World's First Outdoor 6G Field Call\",\"id\":142914714,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Verizon (NYSE: VZ) and Ericsson (NASDAQ: ERIC) today announced a global first: successfully completing the first pre-standard 6G field call in the 7 GHz from a Verizon commercial network site in Concord, California. The Ericsson 6G proof-of-concept kit was fully deployed at the site, and test validation was completed, moving 6G from lab integration into a real-world environment where performance can be assessed both outdoors and as signals move from outside in through buildings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=763ea56af71ff3b7d6b28deb3bef8aa8a46d36d1383e7a8bb0999490837836d7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792063002,\"headline\":\"The IRS Hates This $500,000 Roth High-Yield Dividend Strategy\",\"id\":142912539,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Holding high-yield dividend stocks in the wrong account quietly hands thousands of dollars to the IRS every single year, and the damage compounds into six figures over time. Five popular income stocks reveal just how much bracket placement actually costs you.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9bd8a12d634e75273ce2a5b5ac0aa15e4f06c458a828a4a1934ad6108e5c7ecd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792055414,\"headline\":\"SpaceX’s Spectrum Purchase Exposes Risks for Big Telecom Stocks\",\"id\":142911847,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Telecom stocks have long been considered a relatively safe bet for investors, offering predictable growth, limited downside and healthy dividends. But a combination of competition from SpaceX and rising Treasury yields is threatening to upend that equation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30a6da14f348b0f8e3819575b66a7d3336f025c5165b2d1eaa5f443e58bbd3a9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792051764,\"headline\":\"Verizon And Ericsson Successfully Complete World's First Pre-Standard 6G Field Call In 7 GHz From A Verizon Commercial Network Site In California\",\"id\":142918401,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The Ericsson 6G proof-of-concept kit was fully deployed at the site, and test validation was completed, moving 6G from lab integration into a real-world environment where performance can be assessed both outdoors and as\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ff7d728993766da71b0d9b2bbd94ff3935a4cff59da0098f6c8e76dabcf50c7c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792049400,\"headline\":\"T-Mobile: The Overblown SpaceX Fear Is A Generational Buying Opportunity (Rating Upgrade)\",\"id\":142912335,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1213370681/image_1213370681.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"T-Mobile trades at a forward P/E below 14x, offers a nearly 3% yield, and management targets 50% long-term upside potential. Click to read more on TMUS.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cf681d639e3a2745f05d097bf3378c234782f4f072e7b3331c252fcd1ace649b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792045055,\"headline\":\"ASTS Stock Heads For Worst Year Since Listing — Analyst Says 60-Satellite Milestone Could Slip To 2028\",\"id\":142900230,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tim Farrar said reaching 60 satellites could take until 2028, based on an assumed eight remaining New Glenn launches and two Falcon 9 missions.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=175bd9d1e04b8f7498388eb672a5de05a94d032ec03c90ebdf5f583c6df9fc81\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792020510,\"headline\":\"13 Graham Value Dividend All-Stars (GVAS) Shine In October\",\"id\":142896409,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1138851310/image_1138851310.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Read here for a detailed analysis of Octoberâs top GVAS dividend stocks with projected 27%â68% gains by 2027.\",\"url\":\"https://f