alking up instead.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=20ca03bf05f7a2d8c7747704d49f179468472361826221fa78cc48fb21ac7708\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792004948,\"headline\":\"What Changed For Trade Desk Stock, And What Did Not?\",\"id\":142887405,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Trade Desk (TTD) shares fell 76.3% in the year to October 13, 2026, while the S\\u0026P 500 returned about 18%. The advertising technology company reported slower revenue growth in each of the past four quarters. In the August 6, 2026 report, growth had fallen short of management's own expectations. How far did Trade Desk's growth fall, and what reasons did management give.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=de2b34e86f818a07f93565eda570064b6b7df5d237c15fa3cbdb5bb51fe185ce\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791998400,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk's SpaceX Just Announced Good (and Bad) News to Apple Shareholders\",\"id\":142886351,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX has its eyes on disrupting the telecommunications market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1b2fd7ec367619802325f08377faa051cd95739e88d952b6f8fbf339e80d4e62\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791996580,\"headline\":\"Did Verizon's Dividends Make Up For Its Weak Stock Price?\",\"id\":142886555,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors who hold Verizon Communications (VZ) typically do so for the dividend paid by its wireless and broadband business. Over the past year, that payout contributed about 7 percentage points to the stock's return. Even so, the share price has lagged behind the S\\u0026P 500 over a period of five years. So take a guess: with every dividend counted, what did a five-year holder make, and how close did it come to the market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=60569641c210118ce460cf4d09cd76a0f462fc0931815c8181c16a7e0f4d5869\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791995269,\"headline\":\"EXCLUSIVE: SpaceX’s Mobile Push to Pay Off, 73% of Benzinga Viewers Would Consider Switching\",\"id\":142886557,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX recently acquired the spectrum it needs to continue its push to offer mobile phone service to consumers. The news sent mobile carrier stocks down. Benzinga asked viewers whether they were ready to switch. Benzinga Viewers Chime In on SpaceX...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ea010ab565a296a5a639b29e1f6e0067ec21ddbb2e9b85607003152db995b1a5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791990000,\"headline\":\"Verizon delivers extra value with free safety, family and AI perks\",\"id\":142885295,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"At a glance: Family safety \\u0026 protection: Complimentary tools including Verizon Digital Secure, Verizon Family with Safe Walk, and spam-blocking Call Filter.AI productivity: Six months of Google AI Pro on us for eligible subscribers to streamline daily routines and boost personal productivity.Verizon Loyalty: Waived activation and upgrade fees, 3% back in Verizon Dollars and exclusive weekly and daily drops and experiences with Verizon Shine. NEW YORK, Oct. 14, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Verizon cu\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7692517266f0f377384f5a2f7d40ca23618640e705eabd427a195da15bf5d9eb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791987985,\"headline\":\"Why this billionaire investor says SpaceX could reach a $50 trillion valuation someday\",\"id\":142885144,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_fi