2873754,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0b4e41fcfbeae774c19fafe7d3624e25f98eb52aba098e7ba967c62e4d7f69bd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791935808,\"headline\":\"How Much Could You Lose In T-Mobile Stock?\",\"id\":142855912,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"T-Mobile US (TMUS) stock fell 16.7% over the past month, diverging from a 2.0% gain for the S\\u0026P 500. News reports tied a sharp drop on October 9 to a SpaceX spectrum deal, and AT\\u0026T, Verizon and Comcast each lost more than 12% over the same month. You may still think of a wireless carrier as a stock that holds up in a selloff. So how far has T-Mobile stock fallen in past market selloffs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=865e61a5ab4adc80a12deb87068d8ffab0e225e239ac669031f5b2b2f20970e3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791932915,\"headline\":\"Ron Baron Sees SpaceX Hitting $50 Trillion in a Decade, Up From $2 Trillion — Says Elon Musk Thinks His Estimate Is ‘Way Low’\",\"id\":142883108,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Elon-Musk-Is-The-Founder--Ceo--And-Chief.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Ron Baron believes SpaceX could be worth between $20 trillion and $50 trillion in a decade, led by Starlink and data centers in space.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=935f7f04bb616d64afdbd158bdc93d447b28344af4d1a979c7ea6266f139d71a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791927642,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy AT\\u0026T Stock At This Price?\",\"id\":142854567,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of AT\\u0026T (T) trade at just 7.2 times earnings, compared with 22.3 for the median S\\u0026P 500 company. The stock lost 8.8% over the past twelve months, trailing a broader S\\u0026P 500 that returned 17.3%. Investors are looking at either a deeply discounted business or a fair valuation for a stagnant operation. So what does AT\\u0026T earn behind that low price.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=637dc2d5f5d41670a8606e0c93d06a6f833ce4fd19acb591f15ab805523142a5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791927301,\"headline\":\"3 Absurdly Cheap Stocks to Buy Before the End of 2026\",\"id\":142854315,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"These stocks are priced incredibly low and possess significant upside.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0225fafa16770b8f902cb98304082528787d231134534da56943ba525d6461e1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791925380,\"headline\":\"Verizon responds to customer backlash over a service it's ending\",\"id\":142854564,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Verizon is clarifying how it plans to handle the discontinuation of a legacy phone service in several states amid growing concerns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d951a2a921f98564e2b31d60e7c904515b81e4c9554fb435599ff9ec1df6b76d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791924300,\"headline\":\"Bain Capital and Tillman Global Holdings Complete $1.5 Billion Investment in Eaton Fiber and Acquisition of Ripple Fiber\",\"id\":142854565,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"BOSTON \\u0026 NEW YORK, October 13, 2026--Bain Capital and Tillman Global Holdings (\\\"Tillman\\\") today announced the completion of their previously announced $1.5 billion investment in Eaton Fiber, an affiliate of Tillman, and Eaton Fiber’s acquisition of Ripple Fiber.\",\"url\":\"http