nd shares of AT\\u0026T (NYSE:T), Verizon, and T-Mobile all took a beating as investors pictured satellites beaming service straight to phones. AT\\u0026T makes money two ways most […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=80ea36a33fd83b4caa20dfe8b11b02d6ec61be001615bfa8793cd84bb4f0d6ad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791808360,\"headline\":\"AST SpaceMobile upgraded to buy at Deutsche Bank as selloff called misread\",\"id\":142820035,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Deutsche Bank upgraded AST SpaceMobile (NASDAQ: ASTS) from Hold to Buy, maintaining a $93 price target and arguing that last Friday’s sharp selloff was a market misread. The price target implies substantial upside from Friday’s close of $50.97.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=70a017e814c028cd8937ab6f504a321f7fce462bd37769244cdd9157d4c3fd63\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791807120,\"headline\":\"T-Mobile Pushes Back After SpaceX Spectrum Deal Triggers Telecom Selloff\",\"id\":142820036,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"T-Mobile, AT\\u0026T, and Verizon stocks were up early on Monday after a painful Friday trading session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e5f7cc7fe4950878a6dc50338432148902d24e7443be0838f081332fe0a19f95\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791806823,\"headline\":\"AST SpaceMobile Stock Upgraded: Is it Time to Buy the Dip?\",\"id\":142848290,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/Ast-Spacemobile-5g-Cellular-Broadband-Co.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Deutsche Bank upgrades ASTS to Buy with a $93 price target. Analyst sees last Friday\\u0026#39;s SpaceX-driven sell-off as overdone.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=49abb937