urce\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX’s spectrum deal wiped double digits off T-Mobile, AT\\u0026T and Verizon while tower stocks soared. Stocks still closed a volatile week higher, despite 24-year highs in long-term yields, weaker consumer sentiment, Apple’s iPhone order cuts and a hurricane shutting in Gulf oil output.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=92f35ca77b3b4365a34648301d4adb104b1a0e13ec54e6107426ad61520ac1a5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791787254,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk's SpaceX Could Shake Up US Wireless Market — And Wall Street Sees a Surprise Winner\",\"id\":142819665,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/Hawthorne--United-States---Jul-22--2022-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX\\u0026#39;s $8B spectrum deal boosts Starlink direct-to-cell, positions it as a major carrier player, and creates big upside for U.S. towers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=df36f6e34f1bcf27de797175b9d510ad61f8111c6e97785b4094f55a76934016\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791784463,\"headline\":\"SpaceX: Winning 1% Of The Phone War Is All It Needs\",\"id\":142816301,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2127747623/image_2127747623.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX is leveraging Starlink's profitability and a strategic move into direct wireless service via major spectrum acquisitions. See why I rate SPCX stock a Buy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ee9ba9f116ec51945f5e9acf11fc49e613e05acdd9fc068758cd49aad70c0a75\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791749760,\"headline\":\"AST SpaceMobile Shipped 3 More BlueBird Satellites to Cape Canaveral. Here's How Many It Needs in Orbit Before Revenue Shows Up.\",\"id\":142808499,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The LEO satellite producer still isn't generating recurring commercial revenue yet.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=794b79c7ccdeb07003137095e656147e1eb66f79aea851ea26fb53bdf19d4a29\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791741000,\"headline\":\"SpaceX, Telecom Sell-Off, Micron's A Grades, Steve Cress Origin Story\",\"id\":142808502,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1400737975/image_1400737975.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"SpaceXâs $8B deal sparked selloff in major telecom stocks - but is it warranted? Why Micron Technology deserves its strong buy status. Steve Cress' origin story.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c9a6f34ceccc5d3a3671098211168d4c8a87b81d898473c269c65300a40fb421\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791738885,\"headline\":\"SpaceX Takes Aim at AT\\u0026T as Its CEO Insists “Nothing Beats” Fiber\",\"id\":142807137,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysScotiabank cut its price targets on AT\\u0026T, Verizon, T-Mobile and Comcast, citing competition from SpaceX and talk of AI disruption, and lowered AT\\u0026T’s to $27. 50 from $29.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3caf1ea93874dbf3fb9bfa8544ebdbf60c5732e0429e79e5dacf22e54eea7e03\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791734444,\"headline\":\"5 Dividend Stocks for Retirees Who Want More Than Just a Big Yield\",\"id\":142807098,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A 5% Treasury yield raises the bar for every dividend stock in a retirement portfolio, and not every high-yielder clears it. These five names span telecom, real estate, consumer staples, utilities, and pharma, and safety comes before yield in every case.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b5477af582e703213b9d7e38c403cb77159443130daf402eac041f3c05debced\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791723657,\"headline\":\"These 4 Dividend Stocks Offer Tempting Yields. But the Warning Signs Are Getting Harder to Ignore\",\"id\":142805471,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Kraft Heinz, Pfizer, Verizon, and Dow all flash yields above 4%, but behind each payout sits a mix of impairments, rising debt, and shrinking sales that could turn a tempting income stream into a costly trap.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=05d0246e23feb6ea04bc875e21de3fc8bd9e69f3b71307b6021029aab29dbc24\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791719237,\"headline\":\"The 3-Stock Strategy a 67-Year-Old Used to Generate $4,800 in Monthly Dividends\",\"id\":142805007,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Turning a nest egg into $4,800 a month sounds like a math problem, but the real challenge is knowing which yield tier to trust with your retirement and what it costs when you pick wrong.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6d1e754f53c62fe41238826ebebcec6ba526c04d86e2cc8b264e392dabf1f617\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791714900,\"headline\":\"Buy 9 S\\u0026P500 IDEAL \\\"Safer\\\" October Dividend Dogs\",\"id\":142806035,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2fb2b42086031751c87fed45dcdd2e8f905fa6bb37d0d501d511ce8bbee95970\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791712800,\"headline\":\"Verizon: Starlink Mobile Threat Gets Real\",\"id\":142805892,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2171775458/image_2171775458.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Verizon Communications faces a mounting existential threat from SpaceX's Starlink Mobile. Read what makes VZ stock a bearish long-term proposition.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=39d7cecdd4c2be78ba4866ad5a1eb051b27c103cad3bd7974fa2ecdf2c3f8f40\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791695648,\"headline\":\"Telecommunications Stocks Plunge Following Massive SpaceX Spectrum Acquisition\",\"id\":142805188,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Verizon StockPrice change for Verizon stock: -9%$VZ Stock Price as of Oct. 9: $4252-Week High: $52$VZ Stock Price Target: $51What Happened?Verizon (VZ:NYSE) fell 8.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d3a7cbae5aa1c62c63ac4ddf3c77fa594e8a0cb0bb76c1899b95c33bbf2ffa8c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791678618,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk Says SpaceX Can Outgrow Earth. The First Victim May Be Your Phone Bill\",\"id\":142797141,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Space Exploration Technologies Corp sees its next major growth opportunity in monthly phone bills. With Starlink moving toward a nationwide mobile network, the Elon Musk-led rocket and satellite company is positioning itself to challenge the carriers that connect millions of...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5320e3408182544fb471ccb76a649d0424714755e29d44df0422dc0dd4cbb3dc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791666180,\"headline\":\"AT\\u0026T CEO holds firm stance on Elon Musk's SpaceX phone strategy\",\"id\":142795156,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AT\\u0026T’s CEO has seen this kind of disruption story before. This time, he’s sticking to his guns.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=66795aa5ed1d60f692f06e3a2dfc4e83e30ef56271d5a04ce15205825a9e17f7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791654410,\"headline\":\"SpaceX wants starlink to be your next phone carrier\",\"id\":142795841,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX is preparing to challenge traditional wireless carriers following FCC approval to launch 15,000 next-generation Starlink mobile satellites and operate cellular services without requiring a telecommunications partner.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=14a7c7479efb145e328d01d947436284aa9f0e411ad810c5d8cc7e2fef1ea406\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791652220,\"headline\":\"Verizon (VZ) Stock Could Be Undervalued On Satellite Competition News\",\"id\":142793619,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Verizon Communications has seen its share price move sharply in recent years, and the latest swings are pushing investors to ask a simple question: Is the current valuation of the stock still in line with the earnings power of the business? Verizon Communications has delivered a 65.1% return over the past 3 years, which now puts a lot of weight on whether those gains are properly backed by its profit stream. SpaceX's push into nationwide wireless and Verizon's own satellite-focused joint...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aab181721dd20b453489a7fca75f271cfefa367b42efd8ac7efcc6ea270f9b11\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791647434,\"headline\":\"Verizon Stock Fell 10% in a Day After SpaceX’s Spectrum Deal. Here’s What Its CEO Said About Starlink in September\",\"id\":142793620,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Verizon StockCurrent Price: $41. 65Target Price (Mid): ~$70Street Target: ~$51Potential Total Return: ~67%Annualized IRR: ~13% / yearWhat Happened?“I do not see it as a viable competitor in the medium and even longer term,” Verizon Communications (VZ) CEO Dan Schulman said of satellite on September 9.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f18a9ed1e2c05893f124dde412167e1c9bf7486f3c262058c85ef915fd34f687\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791626053,\"headline\":\"Why AT\\u0026T, Verizon, And T-Mobile May Be In Trouble After SpaceX Deal\",\"id\":142791364,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2279097943/image_2279097943.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"SpaceXâs acquisition of 800MHz spectrum signals its intent to compete directly with US wireless carriers. Read why SPCX stock is a hold.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3845ebf8af236954f234a4df975eee73bebf3002f4ae5912686520f6604ea218\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791616391,\"headline\":\"SpaceX’s Wireless Ambitions Could Be A Windfall For CCI — Bernstein Analyst Calls It the ‘Best Beneficiary’\",\"id\":142780738,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"During an interview with CNBC, Bernstein’s Madison Rezaei highlighted a potentially unexpected group of winners, which are the companies that own the towers supporting America's cellular networks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bf7c985c9c6a2582ddf42fe84d6f69977331a605d907b460ab3cabea6b8ac67a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791586995,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy T-Mobile Stock For Its Cash?\",\"id\":142767953,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"T-Mobile (TMUS) stock offers a free cash flow yield of 8.2%, nearly double the 4.5% median for companies in the S\\u0026P 500. Yields at that level generally signal one of two conditions: investors either see a shrinking business, or they are overlooking a bargain. The stock has lost 23% in twelve months, signaling genuine market apprehension. So how much cash does T-Mobile make for its shareholders, and how steady has it been.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=76c77e3d2c1bd697c953b57eeebfae813beb822fec77323032ff00f9a72560c5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791586750,\"headline\":\"Why Verizon (VZ) Shares Are Trading Lower Today\",\"id\":142767951,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of telecommunications giant Verizon (NYSE:VZ) fell 6% in the pre-market session after SpaceX agreed to acquire private equity firm Grain Management’s nationwide 800 MHz spectrum portfolio, stoking investor concerns over emerging satellite-to-cellular competition.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7078eaae16a199a1d1af22d2a892ab04e8cd7991e31d7be8f4bd3da1ee5cb535\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791583118,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today, Oct. 9: Verizon Slides on SpaceX Spectrum Deal and Scotiabank Target Cut\",\"id\":142767298,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Today, Oct. 9, 2026, SpaceX's low-band spectrum acquisition sparked a wireless sector rout, with Verizon down 10% and peers tumbling even steeper.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c5f4c59d9a8e9fd4e2bcf3319acfc645cf61382fd332620f94dfc901e334cb62\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791582001,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today, Oct. 9: AT\\u0026T Slides on SpaceX Spectrum Deal Threat\",\"id\":142767174,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX's acquisition of 800 MHz low-band spectrum fueled wireless competition fears, sending AT\\u0026T, Verizon, and T-Mobile sharply lower, today, Oct. 9, 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7925ae14d168597f35c80a32deafd144ab9caaa9d25c6a0a765c3f6b1f09e9b3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791581396,\"headline\":\"SpaceX's Wireless Threat Rises With Spectrum Deal\",\"id\":142767307,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX investors are finally getting some reprieve after months of being whipsawed by volatility as the Elon Musk-led company's stock breaks above the level it's been stuck below since July. SpaceX is closing in on a crucial swath of spectrum needed to turn the rocket, satellite and AI company into a \\\"major mobile carrier,\\\" setting the stage for a clash with stalwarts like T-Mobile US Inc., Verizon Communications Inc. and AT\\u0026T Inc. Once the company receives approval from the Federal Communications Commission, it will combine its satellite-to-cell services with a terrestrial network that can connect devices everywhere. For more, we speak with Loren Grush, Bloomberg News Global Space Reporter.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=df5e94a31d56736ac039b7b2f885ac8dcedcd0e5c821a8b227a80719ee92199b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791579600,\"headline\":\"SpaceX snaps up the 800 MHz spectrum T-Mobile dumped for $2.9 billion — and T-Mobile, Verizon, AT\\u0026T stocks are sliding\",\"id\":142767173,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX says it plans to ‘become a major mobile carrier in the US’ — here’s why it needs walkie-talking frequencies to succeed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=372441654dee68ac62ea0e6e706ac7285c6213eaf12659efdd843cc431daed57\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791577468,\"headline\":\"Telecom CEOs have been 'downplaying' the competitive risk of SpaceX's Starlink for years\",\"id\":142767175,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"LightShed Partners TMT analyst and partner, Walter Piecyk, sits down with Yahoo Finance Senior Reporter Brooke DiPalma to discuss SpaceX's (SPCX) move into telecom and to share his predictions.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9a127bbfe6bf6375da9c1d777236b9c0b047fb90754b792787ef19783161847c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791575943,\"headline\":\"Your Verizon Stock Thesis Has One Loose End\",\"id\":142767172,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Verizon (VZ) is fundamentally rethinking how it competes for wireless customers. Since mid-June 2026, the company has stopped charging activation or upgrade fees and removed phone subsidies from the price of its wireless plans. That shift sacrifices fee income in the division that generates most of Verizon's revenue. Now, the company has yet to show it can keep adding wireless customers while moving away from phone subsidies.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e56c54dbe694348654ef39f49129de1f4849907e92c4a8767cfbe132e6f35f3f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791572701,\"headline\":\"Discover which S\\u0026P500 stocks are making waves on Friday.\",\"id\":142765953,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Top_Movers_Small_free_2b4ff2fc22.webp\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay updated with the movements of the S\\u0026P500 index one hour before the close of the markets on Friday. Discover which stocks are leading as top gainers and losers in today's session.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fa69fc8000049deee244f45ce89b56b001c6c1c2df31ee60616bdbf8d43bd682\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791572268,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Dow Pops 500 Points As Big Bank Earnings Loom; JPMorgan Chase In A Base (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142766217,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Friday even as Apple stock sells off in morning trading. SpaceX jumps on a Starlink move.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8df387dc5becb03b94ef0f8c61c8b9d02a89c480c1329752e1e7b3d92c7fb395\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791572053,\"headline\":\"An $8 Billion Reason Why SpaceX Stock Is Up Today\",\"id\":142771222,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX stock gains on an $8 billion spectrum deal with Grain Management. Here’s why the announcement triggered a rally in SPCX shares today.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=38b0ed4cfb2279d0f797b554e4de26d064d2dd8078a956955f1a1ec5b67ca1b1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791571376,\"headline\":\"Musk: Starlink Mobile V2 Brings “100 Times the Bandwidth,” Raising the Stakes for Verizon and AT\\u0026T\",\"id\":142766318,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysOn Oct. 7, the FCC approved SpaceX to launch up to 15,000 satellites that connect straight to phones, and Elon Musk says they’ll have more than 100 times the bandwidth of SpaceX’s current system.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=689e2d94b733aac5cfc7f703901eb0b6752b2ca4b63f08292e25cfe6b722ef01\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791569102,\"headline\":\"Explore the S\\u0026P500 index on Friday and find out which stocks are the most active in today's session.\",\"id\":142765621,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Stay informed about the most active stocks in the S\\u0026P500 index on Friday's session. Discover the stocks that are generating the 