 Grain Management's 800 MHz spectrum could boost Starlink Mobile's coverage, strengthen its wireless ambitions and unlock growth opportunities.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fc0371f74856d0e1d606f3c2eaac233c0779ac8939911fb05f6a4553728d5a86\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791555109,\"headline\":\"MoffettNathanson’s Craig Moffett: The market is overreacting to SpaceX's spectrum deal\",\"id\":142793321,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108382622-17915692881791569285-48894148962-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1791569287\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Craig Moffett, MoffettNathanson analyst, joins 'Power Lunch' to discuss Elon Musk and SpaceX's plan to disrupt telecommunications.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2d1d478116ce1072eb93823e19afafb6e1992197541fa7804b1884235f9f71bf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791554803,\"headline\":\"SpaceX's spectrum deal shakes up telecom stocks\",\"id\":142764152,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Telecom stocks are facing some pressure after SpaceX (SPCX) closed a low-band spectrum deal for its Starlink satellite. Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi hypothesizes what could come next from SpaceX and its competitors in the wireless telecom space.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d8ff390432f6ab32585078c56cacb9b20190e377de885b0dc82d74a868fd6482\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791554700,\"headline\":\"Why SpaceX's spectrum deal has mobile carriers on edge\",\"id\":142766321,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AT\\u0026T (T), Verizon (VZ), and T-Mobile (TMUS) all move lower on news that Elon Musk's SpaceX (SPCX) struck a deal for low-band spectrum, signaling a move into the telecom business. The 8:30 hosts Julie Hyman, P