ocks tumbling. Meta is cutting off ByteDance ads. Apple reportedly cuts component orders.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c3ce1b4f3bf458755844ac444d39f3ebcf9487d357ac3bf7bae253364331cdab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791522598,\"headline\":\"Is SpaceX’s Starlink About To Change The Telecom Game? Experts Weigh In\",\"id\":142744464,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Market commentator The Kobeissi Letter said in a post on X that SpaceX’s telecom portfolio acquisition would bring “one of the biggest disruptions in the history” for the industry.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ccaf829e4aac620fe91b160b1a36c65186a5c2a37f42eca48dc8ee86a2c580a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791520328,\"headline\":\"Why Veea Shares Are Trading Higher By Around 34%; Here Are 20 Stocks Moving Premarket\",\"id\":142761247,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/The-Real-Villains-No-Longer-Hide.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Veea jumps 34% after regaining Nasdaq compliance; Freight Technologies leads gainers, while Alignment Healthcare plunges 24% among premarket losers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aba370274d7078cb51e31849577996130a06b21cb5520bf5a1c2579ad8d06a25\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791513637,\"headline\":\"Verizon, AT\\u0026T and T-Mobile Slide 6% as SpaceX Challenges US Mobile Carriers\",\"id\":142741747,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX challenges US mobile carriers with a nationwide spectrum deal, and Verizon, AT\\u0026T and T-Mobile shares fall about 6%.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c8ade11089cfcc4c4accc0667f1bc39b878a5caf83ee5efef7deb1cfcd6728fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791510000,\