49d9a64cd29b8ac1ab0ce1c2dc9b552432018837dcd6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791507740,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk Calls SpaceX's 800 MHz Spectrum Deal 'An Earthquake' as Starlink Takes Aim at US Carriers\",\"id\":142762522,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Paris--France---February-3--2026-A-Horiz.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Elon Musk says SpaceX’s 800 MHz spectrum acquisition will enable nationwide Starlink satellite phone coverage.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d2fd115af5bb8e73373908561df59c5fc0089381e1cde7d922495ba5c8c100f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791506211,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer Calls Elon Musk Acquiring Lower Frequency Spectrum 'HUGE' for SpaceX; Chamath Palihapitiya Says It's A 'Very Big Deal'\",\"id\":142762523,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Jim-Cramer-Says-He-Envies-AMD--Dell-Shar.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Gene Munster sees SpaceX’s spectrum deal paving the way for a smartphone that threatens Samsung more than Apple.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e3e00e0f17e9b7c125bbb049ef191df61ae2d6fea3adc53a13aa9929a239c37a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791505318,\"headline\":\"SpaceX’s Hybrid Starlink Mobile Spectrum Deal Might Change The Case For Investing In Verizon (VZ)\",\"id\":142738959,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Recently, SpaceX agreed to acquire a nationwide low‑band 800 MHz spectrum portfolio from Grain Management to build a hybrid Starlink Mobile network that can compete directly with established U.S. carriers such as Verizon by combining satellite and terrestrial coverage for continuous indoor and outdoor connectivity, pending final FCC approval. This move introduces a new kind of rival that blends satellite reach with ground networks, potentially pressuring how Verizon positions its core...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ff032293796ef123d93292e29b976c927f7649befb701c8a231a14df8a930d8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791504383,\"headline\":\"Is T-Mobile Stock Worth More Than Its Competitors?\",\"id\":142735176,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors are paying a premium for T-Mobile US (TMUS). The stock currently trades at 17.2 times earnings, representing the highest P/E multiple among its telecom and cable peers. Buyers are clearly betting on top-line expansion, as T-Mobile is generating faster revenue growth than its competitors. This advantage has not translated to industry-leading profitability, however, because its operating margin ranks only fourth of the six. So how wide is T-Mobile's growth lead over its rivals.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d750845386137f0196d6cb2d53a34584f28c312c7282724add6a7cfd1deac04d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791500807,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk's SpaceX just made a huge play to challenge the phone industry and stocks like AT\\u0026T, T-Mobile and Verizon are getting crushed\",\"id\":142733997,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Big move for Starlink!\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=188bba76967be590e50075fcc48728b389a960837debc60ec59478084c24fbce\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791499753,\"headline\":\"T, TMUS, VZ Stocks Plunge After-Hours As SpaceX Buys 800 MHz Spectrum For Starlink Mobile\",\"id\":142734000,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In an update posted Thursday, SpaceX said it had agreed to acquire up to 14 megahertz of paired spectrum in the 800 MHz band.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=425c72fc7f5ca7b56fc79b3df04198964917eb246aa5aee6946e4521d7ba507a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791499373,\"headline\":\"Telecom stocks sink after SpaceX's Starlink picks up spectrum assets\",\"id\":142733998,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shares of mobile phone service carriers fell in after-hours trading on Thursday after SpaceX (SPCX) announced it reached an agreement to acquire a nationwide low-band spectrum license portfolio.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0b82d41f267a55cae70411db7aa29ef10697fac2ad172421334173b669cda3e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791496380,\"headline\":\"SpaceX Is Crashing the Wireless Party. Telecom Stocks Are Paying the Price.\",\"id\":142733999,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SpaceX dropped a wireless industry bombshell late Thursday that sent shares of AT\\u0026T, Verizon and T-Mobile lower in after-hours trading.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f11452bf1605df90de2fa525a8a198792bd5a32abd15be8898dcd438f618a1a1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791496293,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk Will ‘Eventually’ Make a Phone, Says Gene Munster: Starlink Device Will Be a ‘Bigger Problem’ for Apple, Samsung\",\"id\":142762525,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Toronto--Canada---November-16-2024-Starl.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Gene Munster thinks SpaceX will eventually build a phone after its spectrum deal, though CEO Elon Musk has said he doesn’t want to.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e73f62cb2ed856c14bf3b2f4caa007fa7d6968f899dfd02263eb491595adc138\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791494417,\"headline\":\"Dow Jones Futures: AI Stocks Tumble On OpenAI News; SpaceX Move Slams Verizon, AT\\u0026T Late\",\"id\":142733043,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI stocks sold off on OpenAI but much of the market was fine. Apple flashed a buy signal. A SpaceX spectrum buy hit Verizon, AT\\u0026T and T-Mobile late.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=db27a31d71702d5f39c39bdaed003b59e01afc829d84da18e78128c5167c268e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791494254,\"headline\":\"Oracle, Chipotle, Verizon, GameStop and Securitize Corp: Why These 5 Stocks Are on Investors' Radars Today\",\"id\":142761448,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/09/Stock-Market-Trading-Chart-And-Analyzing.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Major Indices closed mixed, with the Nasdaq dropping 1.25% to 27,193.34 and the S\\u0026amp;P 500 slipping 0.47% to 7,765.36.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a0fd5009d1d3b66cef98f2a3f29fb7245fdf00f50eebf85c8a1f942a9f9cd92f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791494232,\"headline\":\"SpaceX Buys Wireless Spectrum For Starlink; Verizon, AT\\u0026T, T-Mobile Tumble\",\"id\":142733130,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Elon Musk's SpaceX will buy more wireless spectrum as its Starlink mobile service expands. Verizon, AT\\u0026T and T-Mobile shares tumbled late.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=44d64454b3abafe22a41a18f79ec02559f9874fb6499bbc36e1f100e782a32f8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791493504,\"headline\":\"Thursday's after hours session: top gainers and losers in the S\\u0026P500 index\",\"id\":142732768,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Aftermarket_Movers_Small_free_e077945a19.webp\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"After the conclusion of the US market's regular session on Thursday, let's examine the after-hours session and unveil the notable S\\u0026P500 performers among the top gainers and losers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=91bb2f144153db291e08f0e8b62325451831430a63c33b7cc0965aebf4cb7dcd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791493404,\"headline\":\"Telecom stocks tumble on SpaceX spectrum acquisition news\",\"id\":142733131,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Shares of major U.S. telecommunications companies took a sharp hit in after-hours trading Thursday after SpaceX announced a definitive agreement to acquire a nationwide 800 MHz spectrum portfolio from Grain Management.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aec5c8d0ed658fbc3761315d231fcfda7d614029183a96fff9c0c62d8efa60ab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791493200,\"headline\":\"What's going on in today's after hours session\",\"id\":142732767,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Aftermarket_Movers_Small_free_e077945a19.webp\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Wondering what's happening in today's after-hours session? Stay tuned for the latest updates on stock movements.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a8e2b08d61211646a2d92bbcc25db08a9a29b8e32ed0c3781887edf9d4fcf438\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791487653,\"headline\":\"ASTS, SPCX And NN Stocks Slide: Clear Street Calls FCC Meeting Agenda Mixed For AST SpaceMobile\",\"id\":142732210,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Clear Street called the FCC’s October 29 agenda a mixed signal for AST SpaceMobile, favoring its carrier partnerships while flagging a real but narrow auction risk, and kept its ‘Buy’ rating.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a5c9b06e1ffa59b3dec66caea402180bbb923b7309e41284e8d73a72c251c537\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791481770,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk Gets 'Very Big Deal' for SpaceX: Why AT\\u0026T, Verizon, T-Mobile Stocks are Falling\",\"id\":142762653,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/08/Ryanairs-CEO-Thanks-Musk-For-The-Publici.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"News from SpaceX has shares of AT\\u0026amp;T, T-Mobile and Verizon trading lower. Here\\u0026#39;s why.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=00c57f8687e637dda1bad6285ac856eaccef2048ba9e46bb7d5ded6bdd8a6244\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791479153,\"headline\":\"12 Communication Services Stocks Moving In Thursday's After-Market Session\",\"id\":142762138,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2025/11/06/movers_4.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Gainers\\n\\nMediaCo Holding (NASDAQ:MDIA) stock moved upwards by 9.6% to $1.14 during Thursday\\u0026#39;s after-market session. The market value of their outstanding shares is at $87.3 million. \\nYimutian (NASDAQ:YMT) shares\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ebc0ed156fd891f2d7de4650abcea3151a371bc67e65d75ce23513785f759300\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791468000,\"headline\":\"If I Could Only Buy 2 Dividend Stocks In October: One Yields 6%+\",\"id\":142731313,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1160839858/image_1160839858.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"There are several high-yield dividend-paying companies available for attractive valuations. Read why BLK and VZ stocks are excellent additions to a dividend portfolio.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=298cb9fc676c37ede299b43324df6092aeeb8e5f3bb363b3cadc94b9922ab4ca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791466980,\"headline\":\"Former Verizon Chairman and CEO Hans Vestberg Joins Humanitas as Senior Advisor and Investor\",\"id\":142727421,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Humanitas AI (www.humanitas.ai), a human-centric AI infrastructure company, today announced the appointment of Hans Vestberg, former Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of Verizon Communications, as Senior Advisor. Vestberg, also an investor in the company, will support its expansion across the United States and internationally, advising on institutional partnerships, global distribution and growth strategy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ce1398d4e8a12c23f595bab611b629415c9afccbf87253b5750b259611e53ab6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791466209,\"headline\":\"Want Lifetime Passive Income? Put $100,000 Into These Dividend Stocks\",\"id\":142727194,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Five dividend stocks spanning tobacco, pipelines, telecom, real estate, and oil each fund their payouts from real cash flow and decades of raise records, and together they could transform a single investment into something that pays you every month for life.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=877885f2a30607f07d673a7a6c76d7dde0bdb410a268d5c4f9944b1d4cd96a8d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791464400,\"headline\":\"Zayo Names Mariana Agathoklis Schlock Executive Vice President, Chief Communications \\u0026 Marketing Officer\",\"id\":142727423,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"DENVER, October 08, 2026--Zayo appoints Mariana Agathoklis Schlock as its first EVP and Chief Communications \\u0026 Marketing Officer to support its next phase of growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=29b01b776f48ecb44861195e40f658e09b084bb4233b13d37fa1ea0c30b8dbba\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791461740,\"headline\":\"Ready to Retire and Want $7,500 a Year in Passive Income? Invest $25,000 in Each of These 5 Dividend Stocks\",\"id\":142727426,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"When the paycheck stops at retirement, your portfolio has to carry the weight, and one dividend cut can force painful choices between a tighter budget and selling shares at the worst moment. These five stocks were chosen to avoid exactly that fate.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c75087151ebc2857a0c53827a5539de366cadf0f9752f7034a3a22a181aff118\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791461416,\"headline\":\"Interest Rates Punished These 5 High-Yield Stocks: Smart Money Is Buying the Dip\",\"id\":142727424,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Soaring Treasury yields have battered utility, real estate, and telecom stocks into multi-year lows, but five Wall Street favorites now sit at entry points that income investors rarely see. The question is whether this selloff is a value trap or a generational buying opportunity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c72c0ee4990e6c4422321c0ae7ed281645dda5128610cbbae908a50c6c202c85\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791460800,\"headline\":\"JD Power: Internet Provider Satisfaction Now Goes Beyond Network Quality\",\"id\":142727425,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"TROY, Mich., October 08, 2026--JD Power: Wireless Internet continues to outperform wired internet in customer satisfaction\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=eea6f57d0fdf697a3af45eef6a5c4300ea47a1c52e7b963aab01c84350f048ab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791458143,\"headline\":\"SpaceX Just Got Permission to Compete With AT\\u0026T and Verizon From Orbit\",\"id\":142725271,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The FCC just handed SpaceX a path to reach your phone without asking AT\\u0026T or Verizon for permission, and the carriers are already scrambling to respond before the first satellite even launches.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4f236a92d1092a99b4540376a87aad2779e87be9d9020fcc98ec263d0cfb54d1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791457200,\"headline\":\"Meta Muse, Grok Bot, OpenAI Dots: Which AI agent should you use?\",\"id\":142733128,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In The Loop host Ejaaz Ahamadeen ranks the AI agents everyone's talking about by what they cost, what they do, and which one is worth your time.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=999f5c71b0fd081734064bf1a97c70027ba71cc06dd97349df0aedddc0b55fc8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791454196,\"headline\":\"3 US Dividend Stocks For Higher Rates Including Verizon Stock\",\"id\":142725273,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Fed Governor Waller’s message is clear: higher rates may stick around longer, and that reshapes where steady income and reasonable valuations matter most. Investors who only chased high growth during the easy money years risk missing potential value in solid cash payers that might hold up differently when borrowing stays expensive. This article unpacks three large cap dividend stocks from our US Value \\u0026 Dividend screener that are especially exposed to this rate story, showing how each could...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a48354093a3a164c99f89e23a68e4a28f1f8d2d2edc8ebec41808714489beeba\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791406980,\"headline\":\"Verizon readies network for Tropical Storm Isaias\",\"id\":142700432,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"VZ\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"At a glance Network Response: Verizon teams are actively staging mobile assets while monitoring conditions 24/7. Ahead of the storm, crews are topping off generators with fuel.On-the-ground Support: Members from our Dedicated Impact Response Team (DIRT) are on the ground in Florida and Alabama. The Verizon Frontline Crisis Response Team is also on standby in the area to provide mission-critical communications support to public safety agencies.Customer Resources: Verizon offers preparedness tips\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c3d1c4c8d8cde456e9b29db0abcb012526651b546ae5749fbbc3be5c46e77c0a\"}]"
     },
