     "content": {
      "size": 142204,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792395237,\"headline\":\"Palantir Stock Fell 7% on Friday. Here’s Where Shares Could Go in 2026\",\"id\":142997631,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Palantir Technologies StockLatest Trading-Day Performance: -7%52-Week Range: $106 to $213Valuation Model Target Price: $172Implied Downside: 8%What Happened?Wall Street’s growing concerns about expensive AI stocks have put Palantir’s premium valuation under pressure, even as its business continues delivering exceptional growth. Palantir Technologies (NASDAQ: PLTR) stock fell 7% on Friday, October 16, closing near $186 per share, as a broad technology selloff overshadowed positive a\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9c31e84fb5e40676a069f538394ce0ce260c2dd88bdda124d8e979895ee1ee6a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792380611,\"headline\":\"Trump’s $330 Million White House Ballroom Donor List Reveals Nvidia, Apple and Google Among Top Tech Contributors: Report (UPDATED)\",\"id\":142992629,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Editor’s note: The story has been updated to include a comment from Nvidia. President Donald Trump’s White House ballroom project donor list reportedly reveals companies and individuals linked to federal contracts, policy decisions, and a presidential pardon. NVIDIA Corp. and...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=833bc80d9748fdde323eb686e9f8065372b20c6efd59e1202148bb04a26a5e57\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792374806,\"headline\":\"What Would Stop The AI Selloff\",\"id\":142994131,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f81e56ca69a5fcfaacd77d3a9630d96359897268651205c32cb90015cce769d2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792361910,\"headline\":\"Palantir: AI In Production While Everyone Else Is Still Piloting\",\"id\":142991720,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2247553960/image_2247553960.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Palantir Technologies' model should benefit when AI infrastructure costs fall. Click here to read why PLTR stock is a Strong Buy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=093fead59c64559fd047c0ea0f240135e3bdc1f1a67905dd044b7a59c8b57436\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792357858,\"headline\":\"3 AI Stocks With Earnings Growth Over 33% To Watch\",\"id\":142989187,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"America’s huge AI infrastructure boom is now showing cracks, with delayed projects and tougher financing starting to bite. That kind of stress can punish weaker balance sheets while leaving room for financially sound, earnings-driven growers to step forward. This is where a basket of companies expected to lift profits quickly while keeping their finances in decent shape comes in. The rest of this article highlights three standouts from that group. The three stocks highlighted here offer a...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=25704e9a724310db5702ce3b1bb9a8086125778b5ea303adc55f6f97a3721e53\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792318505,\"headline\":\"Innodata (INOD) Stock Looks Overvalued Despite Strong AI Expectations\",\"id\":142986256,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Innodata has given shareholders a wild ride in recent years, and the question now is whether a valuation built on its earnings still supports where the stock trades today. After a very large gain over the past three years and sharper moves more recently, the link between the current share price and the underlying profit stream deserves a closer look. Over the past three years, Innodata has delivered a return of roughly 7x, which puts a lot of weight on whether its earnings can justify such a...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2b1689f78a51755e21e3e8d7d600f91fd9201525eda98cf1dc9103e61e63de80\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792314900,\"headline\":\"2 Covered Call ETFs To Shield Your Income From An AI Crash\",\"id\":142986749,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2153653956/image_2153653956.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Discover how income investors may be unknowingly exposed to the AI trade. Read the full analysis here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=490ecfb77e80f0b6a9fc7e90750ee8ce6a540d8f986965fa546a38279b896807\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792312020,\"headline\":\"Here's What $10,000 Split Across SpaceX, Palantir, and 3 AI Chip Stocks Could Be Worth in 2035\",\"id\":142980543,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing in Space Exploration Technologies, Palantir, Broadcom, AMD, and TSMC spreads your AI and space bets across businesses with very different roles in the sectors.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3d75b776d3f17b6fce08676dc1e20e199859cb2f0dc6c36d18b54393123aa869\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792266356,\"headline\":\"Can Palantir’s (PLTR) Growth Justify Its Valuation?\",\"id\":142963222,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Palantir (NASDAQ:PLTR) took a hit from two directions late last week. Software stocks sold off together, and Bloomberg reported that Democrats, who are favored to win at least one chamber of Congress in the midterms, could aim more oversight at big tech companies, Palantir among them. The company sells software that pulls an organization’s scattered […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a56f563a01b3ff40808ded9ce9e9761a1a8fd09b8d1a75b87fcdbeb568c87f7a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792262819,\"headline\":\"Jim Cramer Set A $250 Palantir (PLTR) Share Price Target – Then The Shares Closed 11% Lower During The AI Selloff\",\"id\":142963223,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"As the year heads to a close, Palantir Technologies Inc. (NASDAQ:PLTR) has started to once again appear regularly on Jim Cramer’s radar. Throughout the first half of 2025 the CNBC TV host repeatedly praised the firm for its ability to help businesses reduce costs and its potential to help the Trump administration with its cost […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2bb3b063e3d88b108b6d5fc3727601fb4284b2fab37d3f8faae781107d533951\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792258380,\"headline\":\"History of Palantir: Company timeline, facts \\u0026 milestones\",\"id\":142962628,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Palantir’s CEO says the company is here to disrupt and ‘when it’s necessary, to scare enemies and on occasion kill them.’ Here’s the story of how it grew to become one of the country’s most controversial (and successful) companies.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c2fc98ba649cb211a3c397d28b0d2e320f0dc429bc30715dfa0229389f1177ab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792258216,\"headline\":\"Palantir Stock Fell 7% in a Day and Slipped Into a Correction. Here’s Where It Could Go by 2030\",\"id\":142962629,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Palantir StockCurrent Price: $186. 03Target Price (Mid): ~$1,330Street Target: ~$206Potential Total Return: ~613%Annualized IRR: ~59% / yearWhat Happened?Palantir Technologies (PLTR) closed at $186.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=221cac8e51e028b0f1977f44f60b92b5d31daee03faba5fcf2e7d4a9912e1549\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792257900,\"headline\":\"Is Palantir Stock a Buy Right Now?\",\"id\":142962584,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The data-aggregating company has a bright future, but it's trading at a premium valuation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=387365ff981c7c4470704ae86cf2295b8748bb408c24ac1ed11d9dd50b0b2b87\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792242300,\"headline\":\"The Nasdaq-100's 6 Best Stocks This Year, and Whether They Can Keep Going\",\"id\":142960686,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Momentum is only half the battle. Their underlying companies still need to justify the continued bullishness of their stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c1f98b01367483e9a8140f90137077ae1fb7a0ab7da2093bae4df8425a2ff0b9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792225773,\"headline\":\"Cathie Wood-Led Ark Invest's Biggest Q3 Winners And Losers — PLTR, NVDA, TXG Led While TSLA, RKLB Dragged\",\"id\":142959566,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ark's latest quarterly report shows that several stocks made meaningful contributions across multiple ETFs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7e54566e336417dca1bb4cc41e90b7b0d73f38e161c17548f99dafe7f67cb646\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792224010,\"headline\":\"Benzinga Bulls and Bears: Palantir, Apple, Six Flags\",\"id\":142960594,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Bulls-and-Bears-1.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Benzinga examined the prospects for many investors’ favorite stocks over the last week — here’s a look at some of our top stories.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2d872d2287cd5b5895c057cb900e541682ebd568ca3462d53df99b35d1a2cbab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792216200,\"headline\":\"Missed Out On Micron and Sandisk? Make Sure You Don't Miss Out On This Memory Stock.\",\"id\":142959140,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Micron and Sandisk crushed the market because of the memory boom, and Penguin Solutions may join them.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=910d4a121a7ae0884eef5028d8b66ce2bfc3980ce3e450190fc50363e729dad0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792210547,\"headline\":\"Stocktwits Defense Watch: RTX Continues Deal Momentum, Ondas-Palantir Launch AI Firm As AeroVironment Strike Four International Deals\",\"id\":142958781,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"U.S.-listed defense companies continued to rack up fresh orders and partnerships, with counter-drone technology and military AI taking center stage.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ead569efd6a103b273cbe81d64cfaef7ed7045d1d2a900173c6b4a13ff05779\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792205436,\"headline\":\"Why You Should Think About Palantir Differently Now\",\"id\":142957833,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Palantir Technologies (PLTR) stock trades at 78.2 times sales, compared to 3.1 for the S\\u0026P 500. Investors paying that premium need to know exactly what they are buying, and the case Palantir makes has evolved. During the f