rce\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Palantir has beaten earnings estimates nine times running, and its stock has surged 24% in a single month, but that kind of momentum cuts both ways when the next report lands on November 2.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b9a48edbe1b1c1bdb0124ef0fbeea19b5464098e4019073f95084e31cc6cdb4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791981000,\"headline\":\"Thrive Advances NextGen 3.0 Platform with Vero AI Fabric to Power Intelligent, Integrated Service Delivery\",\"id\":142882653,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Powered by Palantir, Vero brings an intelligent business context layer across Thrive’s cybersecurity, IT operations, and digital experience ecosystemBOSTON, Oct. 14, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Thrive, a global technology outsourcing provider for cybersecurity, Cloud and IT managed services, today announced the latest advancements to NextGen 3.0, the next evolution of its managed services platform and service delivery model, bringing AI, cybersecurity, IT operations and digital employee experience\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cbbd434ce9b647346882b3ec8c7fd23c3bda698fdb9c483e6fb8250f3601a2b7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791979587,\"headline\":\"AI Trade Rotation: Software and Cloud Stocks Outpace Chipmakers Ahead of Nvidia Earnings\",\"id\":142881949,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/ai_theme_747dfce439.webp\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"AI stocks are rotating, not retreating. Software and cloud names lead while chip giants cool. See key valuations, growth, and risks across Nvidia, Palantir, and more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d7f3da997e09184ffeb64870a1ae539dcb9a965e65271c2358d573922cddcc42\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791979207,\"headline\":\"Palantir, Mayor Of London Reach Settlement Over Alleged Allegations Regar