rding in autonomous defense right now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=02fd3b102bc7000823d841adc31c35545249e564e27feb9ccad2e31a2a30d502\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791811320,\"headline\":\"3 Mid-Cap AI-Driven Stocks at Deep Discount With Huge Near-Term Upside\",\"id\":142821638,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"INOD, CALX and AAOI are mid-cap AI stocks trading more than 45% below their 52-week highs, with brokerage price targets signaling massive near-term upside.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1e31de17a1c1da979b0c440d62198226777e15a8501a785c03bf40abbca8dde9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791810764,\"headline\":\"Ondas (ONDS) Launches Regna AI As It Pushes Into Sovereign Mission Systems\",\"id\":142819941,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ondas (NasdaqCM:ONDS) and Palantir have created Regna AI, a new private company focused on sovereign artificial intelligence systems. Regna AI is designed to develop mission-focused AI models for government, defense and industrial customers that require operational sovereignty. The partnership targets advanced autonomous mission orchestration across critical infrastructure, including public sector and industrial operations that use Ondas platforms. The launch of Regna AI only captures part...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0fc19fb7e6e173165d7bfcec2570d2c0b3382a64cf6d56aa3570195163108fd4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791810725,\"headline\":\"Palantir Technologies (PLTR) Launches Regna AI For Sovereign Defense Operations\",\"id\":142819936,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Palantir Technologies (NasdaqGS:PLTR) and Ondas have formed Regna AI to deliver mission-focused sovereign AI for defense and critical operations. Regna AI will deploy fine-tuned, use-case specific AI models on edge hardware for intelligence and surveillance in degraded connectivity environments. Palantir supplies the underlying software and modular infrastructure, while Ondas provides backing and operational support for the new private entity. The launch of Regna AI expands Palantir's...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=07e798a5822da723a21af340882f61f6b686dbe29c0abc301628037e1236ebe7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791808765,\"headline\":\"Palantir: Outstanding Execution, But The Current Valuation Demands Exceptional Growth\",\"id\":142822229,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1873240980/image_1873240980.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Palantir (PLTR) hits all-time highs, but a $500B valuation demands huge profit and revenue growth. Click here to read my most recent analysis.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2b3be20f8a257a5e54308a46d8c0a76a69ce9efe0c3aa873c522e92bc7fbc32e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791808371,\"headline\":\"Ondas and Palantir Launch Regna AI to Develop Sovereign Artificial Intelligence for Defence Operations\",\"id\":142819937,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ondas Inc. (NASDAQ:ONDS) and Palantir Technologies Inc.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f40b2c61671d124fad6e3c20e77ca646e95e4f1b683039ac02a45984a05a3520\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791807530,\"headline\":\"Ondas Wants to Run Pentagon AI with Palantir-Powered Regna AI\",\"id\":142849182,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/Nyc--New-York---June-22-2026-Ondas-Holdi.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Ondas and Palantir launch Re