’s bets on IONQ and RGTI.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=20a8ed89045cadbab77b4c91a509b465dd5754ed272ece642754695282c8f538\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791803463,\"headline\":\"3 Momentum  Stocks to Target This Week\",\"id\":142819117,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Each stock in this article is trading near its 52-week high. These elevated prices usually indicate some degree of investor confidence, business improvements, or favorable market conditions.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b7d310c02badcba6b5491cdf01827cd87d65bc4f68e94038d857b7107ee5ec73\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791801701,\"headline\":\"Palantir Stock Hits New Record High, Wipes Out Its Nearly 50% Drawdown\",\"id\":142821027,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/12/New-York-City--New-York---July-14-2025-P.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Palantir stock hits new record highs after the surveillance tech company reported 93% second-quarter revenue growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bdbfeef887eda68bc0bcb5cbf2113b57853f84300cf606405979e40e2c8d2337\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791800876,\"headline\":\"Palantir: At 129x Earnings, I'm Still A Buyer\",\"id\":142820768,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2297745539/image_2297745539.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Palantir (PLTR) hits new highs as Wall Street buys its AI growth story.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1540a9132742d87acbbb7a28e1f66296b93c56aae855cbc1a853025524058934\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791796500,\"headline\":\"2 Battle-Tested Retirement Income Compounders To Buy Now\",\"id\":142819502,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/220