ipotle Mexican Grill (CMG) is up after a report that Starbucks (SBUX) has explored a takeover of the chain.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c018240ef167e2a959907fdaead23ba01ffa70435f7bfd5f13ecac9ddddaa4da\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791461457,\"headline\":\"PLTR Stock Is Just $8 Away From Making Another Record High, Goldman Sees A ‘Step Function Change’ In Palantir’s AI Opportunity\",\"id\":142727230,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Goldman expects Palantir could enter another phase of outperformance into 2027 and said the stock trades at a discount to its growth peers following its year-to-date underperformance.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4bbfc30c3cfcc3ea6e40ecee3c18ff5c710f5cb8f9ee2e323123a1d5b1b452e5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791461443,\"headline\":\"Premarket movers: Palantir gains on bullish call, NXP tumbles on downgrade\",\"id\":142727132,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com - U.S. stock index futures fell on Thursday as rising oil prices and Treasury yields fueled fresh inflation concerns, while chipmakers faced renewed scrutiny despite a strong profit forecast from South Korea’s Samsung Electronics.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0ebbd012874387b57b4fadecc35ddf9543b1245434b147f8d39d306444d374bf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791460846,\"headline\":\"Goldman Sachs sees 18% upside for Palantir on sovereign AI growth\",\"id\":142727232,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Goldman Sachs has upgraded Palantir Technologies (NASDAQ: PLTR) from Neutral to Buy, establishing a 12-month price target of $230.00 that implies an 18% upside. Shares of the enterprise software giant closed yesterday at $194.12 and were indicated to open up 2.5% at $199.05 following the note.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=24efc1b8bff0dd2a5c522fa540d0b464fc68f45b69ac2e9ed62248f1761611cc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791460472,\"headline\":\"Here Are Thursday’s Top Wall Street Analyst Research Calls: CAVA Group, Constellation Brands, Goldman Sachs Group, Hub Spot, Hut 8, Paladin Technologies, NXP Semiconductor, Spotify Technology, Tyler Technologies, and More\",\"id\":142726060,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Pre-Market Stock Futures: Futures are tumbling this morning as yields surge higher and oil rises again. After two solid days to start the first full trading week of the 4th quarter, the same issues that have weighed on stocks for months returned as rising interest rates and oil prices took center stage again on Wednesday. […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5c55bf15f9ef789ef0c822e8e4fd0dc0516256d32a7a60461bab66f0ace0a3d5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791460117,\"headline\":\"What Is Going on With Palantir Tech Stock on Thursday?\",\"id\":142727233,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Palantir Technologies Inc. (NASDAQ:PLTR) is drawing fresh investor attention as bullish AI spending expectations, accelerating U.S. commercial demand and continued government work reinforce its position across enterprise and public-sector technology. The stock gained more than 2% in Thursday premarket trading even as S\\u0026P 500 futures fell about 0.4%. UK Contract Extension Adds Public-Sector Revenue Palantir expanded the value of its U.K. government work after the Ministry of Housing, Communities\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=53fd289e45184700f9b2b12cdf4b94582e170be510e24bfa5a6a2391f4740027\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791459933,\"headline\":\"Palantir: Why The Upgrades Keep Coming Ahead Of The Q3 Earnings Report\",\"id\":142729631,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1426101020/image_1426101020.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Palantir Technologies is reiterated as a buy, with a fundamental target in the mid-$200s and strong technical momentum. Click to read more on the PLTR stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c4f5d8be7815b688f0015efa8b599b80444d19b82965d6517efe723a3b7461e2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791458880,\"headline\":\"Prediction: These 2 Stocks Will Be Worth More Than Palantir 5 Years From Now\",\"id\":142725565,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Under-the-radar AI suppliers Celestica and Marvell are posting explosive growth, and their valuations still have plenty of room to run.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a38f39d2012130da6c61f1940a77a5c2b75cbd23b801af326403d561e42d1d18\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791451829,\"headline\":\"Cramer's Mad Dash: Palantir\",\"id\":142730647,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108376703-17914660281791466025-48868501144-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1791466027\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC’s Jim Cramer delivers his daily Mad Dash.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f15201d83a70bdfeac9b62dabdce397f2dc027d400170b333df29c63aa0d8933\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791451550,\"headline\":\"97 Billion Nvidia Partners Just Got a Strong Buy Endorsement (Hint: It's Not Palantir or Micron)\",\"id\":142720115,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"This under-the-radar chip design software company just landed a multibillion-dollar vote of confidence from Nvidia, TSMC, and OpenAI.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ccf6ab80bb16ba63f4622e7ed7104893c570abe3dc68ce5b598f6094a9e8c8f2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791451087,\"headline\":\"Palantir Gets Goldman Sachs Upgrade as Sovereign AI Opens New Market\",\"id\":142726993,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/08/Palantir-Technologies.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Goldman Sachs upgraded Palantir to Buy, citing sovereign AI and custom applications as growth drivers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=24d83edd6b0817ee7fecdcbb4d618f4fb0e5fa3b921beb167aba824c94e272a0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791450656,\"headline\":\"Nvidia Vs. CrowdStrike: How ETFs Are Positioned for Dan Ives’ $4T Tech Spending Wave\",\"id\":142727278,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/08/Los-Angeles--California---July-6-2025-Nv.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Dan Ives sees a $4 trillion tech spending wave ahead. NVDA dominates major ETFs. Here’s how XLK, QQQ, and AIQ stack up against his top tech picks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=933be80c7b7fc439ea5c4d33efb2d305a7ae1d0b87c6a9a507bb9cb44cfaef52\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791448153,\"headline\":\"This Palantir Analyst Turns Bullish; Here Are Top 5 Upgrades For Thursday\",\"id\":142726780,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/08/Palantir-Technologies-Big-Data-Company.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"PLTR\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Analysts upgraded Rocket Pharma, Generac, Palantir, Global Payments and Unity Software, with new or raised price targets.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a2497949fc3319485a6165994aaad06de0a9e86a01cb08dc7e87186f23e49701\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"da