      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792224010,\"headline\":\"Benzinga Bulls and Bears: Palantir, Apple, Six Flags\",\"id\":142960594,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Bulls-and-Bears-1.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Benzinga examined the prospects for many investors’ favorite stocks over the last week — here’s a look at some of our top stories.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2d872d2287cd5b5895c057cb900e541682ebd568ca3462d53df99b35d1a2cbab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792197643,\"headline\":\"Stocktwits Fintech Pulse: US Fintech Weekly Briefing \\u0026 Market Drivers\",\"id\":142955148,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Payment infrastructure providers and retail brokerages face analyst guidance resets, and U.S. regulators target “debanking” this week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b34b3133074cbf96496ece022eac4f819ecfd0103e9ed8b720afdea33788ec81\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792192530,\"headline\":\"Is PayPal's Next Big Thing Already Here?\",\"id\":142951537,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A reported $60.50-a-share offer from Stripe and Advent in July lifted PayPal (PYPL) stock, but the bidders walked away in late August without a deal, according to Bloomberg. Without a buyer, investors need a catalyst from the business itself, and that is difficult to find given that branded checkout, where shoppers pay with PayPal online, recorded just 2% growth in payment volume during fiscal Q2 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4c7f191593ee22bf9bf39dc252a31259c803e36b60aa7f239d423107dfdc8a6e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792183674,\"headline\":\"SoFi Stock Hit a 52-Week Low on October 15. Here’s What the October 27 Report Has to Settle\",\"id\":142952630,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for SoFi Technologies StockCurrent Price: $15. 09Target Price (Mid): ~$34Street Target: ~$20Potential Total Return: ~128%Annualized IRR: ~22% / yearWhat Happened?Two analysts looked at SoFi Technologies (SOFI) on Monday, October 12, and came away $10 apart.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=46643c6ee9b887c4e7412d272dc18fab1e522376d80f8ebcc6ac2a01695af050\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170017,\"headline\":\"SoFi Stock Is Down 46% Over the Past Year. Buy Now or Wait for Q3?\",\"id\":142952631,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysSoFi stock is down 46% over the past year, closing at $15 on October 15, 2026, after peaking near $32 in November 2025. Q2 adjusted revenue rose 40% YoY to a record $1.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9983a1766b02ef65ccc150a899ba49859c88e7f17d67c282f9b310ec28477042\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792149336,\"headline\":\"Rising Rate Pressure Tests The Case For SoFi Stock\",\"id\":142952634,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies is contending with pressure from persistent inflation, higher rate expectations and a weaker banking sector backdrop, which have weighed on sentiment toward its lending centric business model. Even as SoFi pushes into areas like stablecoins and a crypto-linked card program with Orbi and Mastercard, investors remain focused on profit growth headwinds from higher funding costs and heavier marketing spend. We will now look at how SoFi Technologies' investment narrative...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=66ecc9c9d0f13af947e1d211048bf1a165be96d0638e57af44d371c48c6f8a97\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792142933,\"headline\":\"SoFi: The Market Will Wake Up From Its Hangover Eventually\",\"id\":142945112,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2254344026/image_2254344026.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies has been consolidating very robustly and interest rate headwinds priced in as valuations tumble to below 20x. Read more on SOFI stock here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=75fcc19f439e8f22b7aa876ced53438b038ff4330679e3cdee381cd3e32d0c0e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792124128,\"headline\":\"Why Did CRWV, OPEN, SOFI Stocks Tumble To 52-Week Lows Today?\",\"id\":142929083,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors grew cautious about rising borrowing costs, a weak housing market and slowing profit growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a555bc08ba49d1f92144677b678e7ab51c73c4ba6dcd1f5868740e5fac6d0bc6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792087231,\"headline\":\"SOFI Rally Could Be a Dead Cat Bounce, Per Signal\",\"id\":142925624,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Whenever there's a call bias with SOFI, the stock tends to struggle\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d952428a596b224ec242c3005d3821a1c871b93a95aadf7d734f02ffd81506ce\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792076174,\"headline\":\"This Crypto Has the Easiest Path to 10X by 2030\",\"id\":142925634,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bitcoin, Ethereum, XRP, and Solana all need a 10X by 2030 to satisfy their loudest fans, but the math behind each target reveals one coin faces a dramatically shorter climb than the others.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f443206bdf49450a6c7d0291991f778e24f8a70a925a0d5a2a1dd16d0ca1aa95\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792075856,\"headline\":\"Polkadot Held Flat This Week as Ethereum Fell 8% and Solana 10%. Is It Finally Bottoming?\",\"id\":142925631,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"While Ethereum and Solana cratered last week, Polkadot barely moved, raising a question that has haunted this coin for years: is the bleeding finally stopping, or is something else entirely going on?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=613dafb0c77a147851f923b269752e95f9dd72884cdce4e0644ccfdb6d69fef9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792075566,\"headline\":\"Ripple’s Stablecoin Is Moving Into Stock Trading. What Does XRP Get Out of It?\",\"id\":142925626,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"DriveWealth just chose Ripple's stablecoin to settle stock trades and manage client collateral across borders, but the partnership raises a pointed question about who actually benefits when XRP sits at the center of a deal that nobody needs to buy XRP to use.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cfefd639b466fd0b908cd5236870d48c3a0042bf1bc6b51a064798e2f079b4f4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792075522,\"headline\":\"SoFi  Technologies Imploded in 2026: A Wall Street Pro Predicts It Will Double in 2027\",\"id\":142925625,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi just posted record loan originations, deposits, and member growth, yet the stock cratered nearly 46% this year while the broader market surged. One Wall Street analyst sees a setup that could double the shares, but the path there runs through a minefield of real risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d61844e55b1e8f055da21b0436e2842e229db77df7ab343abba09b0ca22ecf28\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792075178,\"headline\":\"Bitcoin Fell 2% This Week. These 5 Altcoins Fell Up to 13.5%.\",\"id\":142925632,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A 2% Bitcoin dip turned into double-digit carnage for five altcoins, and the reasons why reveal something surprising about which coin is quietly attracting fresh money while the others bleed out.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=64f76093bca8d1be122edc3056080873951d8703e8f1a0f050e5d8182926991e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792074656,\"headline\":\"Bhutan Mined 13,000 Bitcoin. Nearly All of It Is Gone.\",\"id\":142925627,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bhutan quietly built a billion-dollar Bitcoin reserve by mining it with hydroelectric power, never spending a dime on the open market. Now blockchain data shows most of those coins have vanished from known wallets, and the government's explanation raises more questions than it answers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7ef0e275cbac0db7b01c475d9f46cb2e2f16718c324d32738a05903703c7f9dd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792074643,\"headline\":\"BayFirst Financial shares are trading higher. The company reported Q4 financial results.\",\"id\":139978428,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aeda637e1e5f6ebbd512046afacaf2e49af9fa669708b7395b47f11fb2b1deb9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792073898,\"headline\":\"Bitcoin and Ethereum ETFs Lost $391 Million in a Day. Only XRP ETFs Took Money In.\",\"id\":142924288,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"When Bitcoin ETFs and Ethereum ETFs both bled hundreds of millions in a single session, one unlikely crypto fund quietly moved in the opposite direction, raising a question investors cannot easily dismiss.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0a8283db0cb2d8493b7ab4fa97fd5afd9f1e7e6d290ace924d5ec522b045c0bb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792073667,\"headline\":\"AI Price Prediction: We Asked Grok AI Which Recovers First From the October Selloff: Bitcoin, Ethereum, XRP or Solana\",\"id\":142925629,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A brutal October selloff wiped out nearly $1 billion in leveraged crypto positions, and Grok AI has a definitive ranking for which of the four biggest coins claws its way back first and which one faces the steepest road to recovery.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9a7a2653191741d01c07df60cc9fa4f71e22e905124eeccf621260c426a24e14\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792073507,\"headline\":\"Ethereum Fell 5% as Its ETF Comeback Lasted One Day. Is $2,000 Next?\",\"id\":142925630,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ethereum ETFs snapped a brutal losing streak with one promising day of inflows, then hemorrhaged five times that amount the very next session. With Ether sliding below key levels and its biggest corporate buyer nearly tapped out, a drop toward $2,000 looks less like speculation and more like a real scenario.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=efb6a2549739145cf666a71c3a81b5378c25199032aef875e51e4182990b3d4c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792072931,\"headline\":\"Zcash Dropped 10.7%, Twice Ethereum’s Fall and Three Times XRP’s. Can Its Upgrade Turn It Around?\",\"id\":142925633,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Zcash just suffered the worst crash among major cryptocurrencies, and a looming network upgrade is forcing certain holders to act before their coins become permanently unspendable. Whether the selloff was a fluke or a warning sign depends on what happens next.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e79cf40ec9e454847f97b7de7ef694f0a887d10510a0777286500abe8b22c15a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792069119,\"headline\":\"Why Is SoFi Stock Climbing on Thursday?\",\"id\":142945227,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/SoFi-Technologies-Inc.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies (NASDAQ: SOFI) stock rose 2.43% to $14.57 Thursday after a Wednesday low of $13.86. See the bank earnings, rate and analyst details.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cf8ea3601c297afdf64cffcc2469e3184953fef8176199984a85c0bae3812c9b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792065342,\"headline\":\"SoFi Stock—Is The Steep Sell-Off Overdone?\",\"id\":142946059,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/SoFi.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"It’s been a miserable year for the fintech stock, but could recent losses for SoFi present a buying opportunity for investors? \\n\\n\\n\\nOn the surface of things, there appears to be little to get excited about for the\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=beff0dc908086a28f2734b73b0007b81339fed75db34055d569dc21d9efec39b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792043578,\"headline\":\"Peter Schiff Warns Trump’s ‘Booming’ Stock Market Boast Is a Mirage: 479 Stocks Hit 52-Week Lows on Wednesday, While Only 60 Set Highs\",\"id\":142917184,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/In-The-Background-A-Stock-Market-Graphic.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Investor Peter Schiff challenged Trump’s booming stock market claim, pointing to a wave of stocks hitting 52-week lows Wednesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ac37bb01dbb5658e534eb3da82467918d00121e28c95b1ea2039e81f2062837f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792038368,\"headline\":\"Why Did SOFI, PLUG, ASTS Stocks Plunge To 52-Week Lows?\",\"id\":142900192,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies, Plug Power and AST SpaceMobile declined to annual lows on Wednesday amid growing Wall Street worries about the companies.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8c5608454eddda123062f43902a23d4967da8dbdf1ba3b46bff78b627d81b9b5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792015097,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today, Oct. 14: SoFi Technologies Falls on Banking Weakness\",\"id\":142889413,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On Oct. 14, 2026, the fintech platform slid as sector-wide selling pressure weighed on banks and fintechs.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1f276b1cf9e0eed02163ee1cbb3d4f671da8c99edcbd0b026d2a645f07f74a44\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792008760,\"headline\":\"SoFi Technologies (SOFI) Faces Inflation Pressure, Is It Still 10% Below Fair Value?\",\"id\":142888404,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies (SOFI) is being pulled in two directions right now. Hotter inflation data has pressured the stock, while a new crypto-linked card partnership with Orbi and Mastercard in Mexico highlights its broader fintech ambitions. Short term, SoFi Technologies has been under pressure, with the share price down 12.0% over 30 days and 44.5% year to date, even as the 3 year total shareholder return is up 84.7%. This signals fading near term momentum despite earlier strong compounding. Scan...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=462b0a03696ab45e9f1a9cc8b0201f81644867c83b562737a1e7059287c2d513\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792004887,\"headline\":\"SoFi, BNY, Bread Financial, Perella Weinberg, and Morgan Stanley Shares Plummet, What You Need To Know\",\"id\":142887503,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A number of stocks fell in the afternoon session after September consumer price inflation accelerated to 3.7% and core inflation topped estimates, reigniting concerns over Federal Reserve interest rate hikes.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0d25b940cd9c5ed8374d172cde1f0ee0c5d82376f6375d2fcef50653501ff8e4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792004577,\"headline\":\"SoFi, Figure co-founder raises $19M for newest venture\",\"id\":142892239,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"“The problem that we've created in blockchain,” Navra co-founder Mike Cagney said, “is we've been building for this native crypto audience, but not for the real world.”\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f45edfe208db2042903c6ff4ee431fac4644cc2a1fdd419595dc4e9eafb76818\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792000800,\"headline\":\"These stocks are making the most noise in today's session.\",\"id\":142886904,\"image\":\"https://www.chartmill.com/images/uploads/CM_Most_Active_Stocks_Small_free_fec0650b7f.webp\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"ChartMill\",\"summary\":\"Let's dive into the action on the US markets on Wednesday. Here are the most active stocks that are driving the market today.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fb48a704234e