ney, closed an over...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=238a8e04206cdc08c9edecd2a357d9c6a92ded35593d5d824677c38352b9d466\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791307807,\"headline\":\"SoFi’s Next Growth Engine Could Surprise Wall Street\",\"id\":142666779,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi shares have collapsed nearly 40% this year even as the company keeps beating forecasts and adding members at a record pace. The path to a dramatic recovery exists, but it depends on a few catalysts Wall Street has not fully priced in yet.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=357a20bea23f8066891ead0c4a13555b53a7aed09079178f3203ca33f8cb06c4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791296400,\"headline\":\"Applied Digital to Post Q1 Earnings: Is It Time to Hold or Fold?\",\"id\":142669778,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"APLD heads into fiscal Q1 with surging revenue expectations, but rising debt, heavy AI spending and execution risks cloud the outlook.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2344189f982a35886bbcecca3523d20c5a05ebb57d69d642bcc6372854beb571\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791284378,\"headline\":\"TD Cowen Maintains Hold on SoFi Technologies, Lowers Price Target to $17.5\",\"id\":142696391,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"TD Cowen  analyst Moshe Orenbuch   maintains SoFi Technologies (NASDAQ:SOFI) with a Hold and lowers the price target from $18 to $17.5.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8b1910e59eb782ff45094bea7ad38d025b42cd253b8ace35e1bedb47c03fa99e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791225820,\"headline\":\"SoFi (SOFI) Grew Revenue 40%, Does That Justify a Premium to Its Sector?\",\"id\":142643267,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"For the first time, SoFi Technologies (NASDAQ:SOFI) added twice as many products as members in a single quarter, according to its second-quarter results. Existing customers, in other words, are coming back for more. SoFi is an app-based bank and lender. Its 15.8 million members borrow through personal, student, and home loans, and also hold cash, […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=cc6ae5bce5ed0fb328f35bb12b8c53fa51cd30cd9be2fb3b07f801d7ca3e0f50\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791204325,\"headline\":\"Nu Holdings Spikes 12% as Brazil Election Upset Drives Rally in Brazilian Assets; Robinhood Edges Higher, SoFi Stays Put\",\"id\":142635219,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A surprise first-round result in Brazil's presidential election sent one Latin American digital bank surging while its U.S. fintech rivals barely flinched, and the outcome of next month's runoff vote could flip the trade entirely.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9698d0789eb9556d3150e65e87efc0a527b5a3aa9f7bd5b62d623e715e4bb29f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791203850,\"headline\":\"This Week In Digital Payment - Enhancing Security Through Strategic Payment Partnerships\",\"id\":142635035,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Entersekt and SEB Baltic have reinforced their partnership to enhance digital payment security, focusing on the evolving authentication needs across the Baltic region. This collaboration involves the use of Entersekt's 3-D Secure Access Control Server to support various authentication methods, ensuring a balance between robust security and smooth customer experience. The partnership highlights the importance of addressing technical, regulatory, and operational challenges in payment...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=53a4c88af3f4087e58978f32c4eddf69f1b6d1619933bfa92d4ee864105074ba\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791195841,\"headline\":\"Why SoFi Stock Dropped 12% in September\",\"id\":142633340,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"This time, it's moving lower with other bank stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=99c8f84997d8cec334e34c92e412edd19b4325eed6d84a77aec352f8f06fa4f6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791162588,\"headline\":\"SOFI Stock Is Down More Than 40% In 2026, But This Analyst Sees Attractive Growth Opportunity In Loan Platform Business\",\"id\":142629218,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In the second quarter of 2026, SoFi Technologies posted a record personal loan origination of $10.7 billion, a growth of nearly 53% from the prior year’s comparable quarter.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f74b007bd5e47255a49edb9310f7eba3a0369410affc7c93fdb5ae91a5e61183\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791079730,\"headline\":\"SoFi’s US$25 Billion Card Portfolio Shift To Bank-Issued Stablecoin Might Change The Case For Investing In SoFi Technologies (SOFI)\",\"id\":142618516,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In September 2026, SoFi Technologies and Mastercard announced that stablecoin settlement went live across SoFi Bank, N.A.’s debit and credit card program, migrating its entire US$25.00 billion card portfolio to SoFiUSD, the first stablecoin issued by a nationally chartered bank on Mastercard’s global network. This move positions bank-issued stablecoins as an operational bridge between traditional payment rails and blockchain infrastructure, potentially reshaping how issuers, acquirers and...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1eed8d883aadce9d9a710e9a50a66d931429a9d8cf03f55a4745fcd50877271f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791055802,\"headline\":\"SoFi Stock: Why the Opportunity May Be Too Good to Ignore\",\"id\":142618132,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The sharp correction in SOFI stock has created a more attractive risk-reward setup as the company is shifting toward a capital-light revenue model.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e977f8767d7a117e8dd3c64836d8f14b9b880f6d49c2d0616ee503d3a6109cc2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791011988,\"headline\":\"SoFi Stock Is Down 43% in 2026. Should You Buy the Dip Before November?\",\"id\":142618133,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key TakeawaysSoFi stock has fallen 43% since early January, from a $29 high to $16, while Q2 revenue grew 40% YoY. SoFi lifted 2026 revenue guidance to $4.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=764ae35d5a09f0e578ea79443609c781b0f5cb3333b411b9d21a81181ab2a736\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790955243,\"headline\":\"1 Oversold Stock Ready to Bounce Back and 2 We Avoid\",\"id\":142591196,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Hitting a new 52-week low can be a pivotal moment for any stock. These floors often mark either the beginning of a turnaround story or confirmation that a company faces serious headwinds.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3c3370f3ded9863ebdde25a0ae550f27dc3444ca8b9004bf752f378cd0e22627\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790910623,\"headline\":\"SoFi (SOFI) Is Becoming an “Everything App.” Does It Finally Have a Moat?\",\"id\":142574400,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies, Inc. (NASDAQ:SOFI) is trying to do something most financial companies have struggled to pull off: get customers to use one platform for almost everything involving their money. The company now offers banking, investing, credit cards, loans, crypto, financial planning, and more. But the number of products alone does not create a moat. The […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=027549322fee3c6f5be261cb2d352bb5543e66a22631ae901399f6a5c26ef6a8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790882160,\"headline\":\"What Could Derail PayPal Stock?\",\"id\":142561927,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PayPal (PYPL) stock has lost 24% in the twelve months to September 30, 2026, while the S\\u0026P 500 rose 14.4%. Investors are worried, and you need to know if that worry is overdone. PayPal needs its faster-growing businesses, such as Venmo, to earn more. PayPal also needs shoppers to keep choosing it at online checkout, where trouble could start. So what could go wrong for PayPal at online checkout.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bcaffa970b35e3c3eb94cba6b85732bae941f3783b0036a88e4bc3e1498cea50\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790863689,\"headline\":\"Nu Holdings Jumps 3% After Ruling Out Monzo Deal; SoFi and Robinhood Sit Out the Rally\",\"id\":142558495,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nu Holdings stock surged while SoFi and Robinhood barely flinched, and the reason comes down to a single statement the Brazilian fintech issued about a deal it never confirmed in the first place.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d39dd8bdbf75742161a3170cc65bcaeae05b039a7153aa21713eae098b133098\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790850840,\"headline\":\"1 Reason Now Is a Great Time to Buy SoFi Technologies Stock\",\"id\":142553667,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"As they trade 50% off their peak, the online bank's shares present investors with a more compelling opportunity.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1f507c73444e04fda772024061a971a36744bfb622bc508f1e9e9e6efe8bf48b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790796931,\"headline\":\"Big Pharma Got Its Tariff Exemption. The Biotech ETF Barely Blinked\",\"id\":142523241,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A 100% tariff on imported drugs just expanded to cover every drugmaker in the country, yet the biotech market's most closely watched fund treated it like a non-event. The reason says everything about who actually pays.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=93b0d8b63e1795d34e2a1b4d6cf704dddb3ecaae094db1996a2413fd24bebadb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790795759,\"headline\":\"BTI vs. PM: Which Tobacco Dividend Will Actually Survive the Industry’s Decline?\",\"id\":142522986,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Both BTI and PM fund generous dividends from a shrinking cigarette business, but one company's smoke-free pivot has already changed what its payout is built on, and that gap matters far more than the headline yield difference.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a78b4c06b7f3fe13801e883c5b9752506d9becae546b4ea7c18d97397f611b10\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790794530,\"headline\":\"Consumer Confidence Fell to Its Lowest Level Since 2014 and Consumer Stocks Are Already Paying for It\",\"id\":142522888,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Consumer confidence just hit its worst level in over a decade, yet the stocks that depend on American shoppers are barely flinching. Understanding why that calm exists, and how long it can last, matters far more than the headline number.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=717d483d70d0e88fa9fb19c210926d8468a11dc0436c545c6c0da6d19e122abc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790792143,\"headline\":\"JPM vs. BAC: The Bank Built to Sustain Dividend Growth When Markets Turn\",\"id\":142522944,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"JPMorgan and Bank of America both just raised their dividends and both stocks just slid, but only one has the capital cushion and crisis track record to keep paying through a downturn. Three measures separate a reliable retirement income stream from a fragile one.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=144dd0610d3477b5ecc774e0bdc52dca04238bbdfa1fc58f86dab3e26bf1151a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790791922,\"headline\":\"Unity Software Surges 5% as Traders Weigh Meta Platforms VR Glasses Support; Adobe Rises 3%, Intuit Adds 2%\",\"id\":142522920,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Unity Software jumped after announcing day-one support for Meta's next-generation VR headset, but a timely product catalyst and a struggling business are not the same thing, and traders now face the harder question of which one matters more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a571eadbd7b858c4a9ca351a9362202b5572279496a1a79e459f15b7ec16c8e0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790791789,\"headline\":\"Heating Oil Bills Expected To Jump 31.3% This Winter, With Northeast Households Averaging Nearly $2,300. Natural Gas Users Could Catch A Break\",\"id\":142524968,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A war thousands of miles away is about to show up at the doors of millions of Northeast homes this winter, and the timing could not be worse for families already stretching their budgets. Not everyone, though, is bracing for the same kind of pain.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f876fcf5831d652803066e6d9b193f8cd74809fe8cce00ece2fce0fac04d3a0b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790790307,\"headline\":\"Edison International’s Dividend Holds Steady Despite 23% Stock Plunge\",\"id\":142522176,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Edison International's stock shed nearly a quarter of its value in a month, yet the quarterly dividend arrived unchanged and management confirmed guidance. Whether that income stream survives depends on one question Sacramento has not answered.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fe97661032877a5676d8be66ee9964c77e8a20984b1ee38035fd16af01ddc47e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790788557,\"headline\":\"Treasury Bills Pay You Without Owning a Single Stock. Here Is What Dividend Investors Give Up.\",\"id\":142524973,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Treasury bills near 4.5% sound like a no-brainer alternative to dividend stocks, but two overlooked risks quietly eat into that advantage in ways most retirees never calculate before locking in their income strategy.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8c75800aa004d829d0b777299de707ac80ef349cb6016be489586c0e059d77ac\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790787166,\"headline\":\"“SoundHound AI Jumps 5% on India Product Launch; BigBear.ai Rises 3%, Pony AI Stays Flat\",\"id\":142522368,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stag