tutional clients will be able to accept payments in stablecoin, which Coinbase’s blockchain will convert to government-issued currency.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aac8331d3ef05c24d77a0531e8abe468ac361fa7eb427f7619efcc2cf5e48ffa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790602329,\"headline\":\"SoFi Stock Nears Critical Support: What to Know\",\"id\":142497075,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/28/Sofi-Technology.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies Inc (NASDAQ:SOFI) shares are sliding Monday, continuing a decline that\\u0026#39;s pushed the stock into the lower third of a wide trading range it\\u0026#39;s cycled through repeatedly over the past six months. Here\\u0026#39;s what you should know.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0210b17b251b25ee73dd70b2d6bd57c5de1a67aa509af8e5612db95e58095dd8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790599060,\"headline\":\"Latest News In Digital Payment - Customizable Payment Solutions Enhance In-Person Customer Experience\",\"id\":142464762,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Finix has introduced a significant enhancement to digital payment processing by allowing businesses to deploy custom Android applications on supported payment terminals. This development enables companies to combine their unique workflows with integrated payment processing on a single device, offering a seamless and branded in-person experience for customers. By embedding payment functions directly into business-specific applications, this innovation streamlines operations and aligns the...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5ebedc6f78580538ba3e819eaa8f9b685d2f618a04fc8f46d7728449d90faff6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790529679,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Giant Warns AI Agents Could Trigger a New Kind of Bank Run\",\"id\":142448506,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apollo warns AI agents like Meta's Muse could move cash from 0.1% bank accounts into 5% yields. Here's what it means for you.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=69b30eab945c26616610e1f84d09136aadbf402a82e7076020a032fa85a92c2a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790442619,\"headline\":\"Is SoFi Technologies (SOFI) Cheap On Its Stablecoin Rollout And Growth Push?\",\"id\":142439356,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies (SOFI) has become a talking point after SoFi Bank and Mastercard activated stablecoin settlement for the bank’s debit and credit cards, using SoFiUSD across a reported US$25b card program. For all the excitement around SoFi Technologies' stablecoin rollout with Mastercard, the share price has been under pressure, with a 30 day share price return that is down 12% and a year to date move that is down 39.62% at a recent US$16.58, even though the 3 year total shareholder return...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d93c1264cfa56d3324fdbe23fa689fe5a7bf82dbc6a792f9c7201b44d9c80f9d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790437200,\"headline\":\"SoFi Is Bypassing the Banking Bottleneck With Stablecoin Settlement\",\"id\":142447933,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies is using its national bank charter to settle roughly $25 billion in annualized Mastercard transaction volume via its SoFiUSD stablecoin, cutting costs and drawing commercial deposits.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d6c9eb17cd0e1eb0bb713242d3f3fb5053e63daa5f01817a44a274d2f6daa400\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790369155,\"headline\":\"How Much Upside Does PayPal Stock Have Without A Buyer?\",\"id\":142426101,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PayPal (PYPL) stock has gained about 24% over the past three months (as of Sept. 24, 2026), but it is still down 21% over the past year. In late August, the shares fell 13% in premarket trading after Bloomberg News reported that a consortium of Advent International and Stripe had abandoned its pursuit of PayPal.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2a60480d04013e9987e94901bc1601ddf9e4635e36496625af539619dbd1798e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790368078,\"headline\":\"The UK Just Ran the World’s First Interbank Tokenized Deposit Transactions. The Same Platform Is Headed to 25 US Banks.\",\"id\":142426100,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"For the past few years, the financial industry has been obsessed with the settlement layer. We watched as Visa settled $20B in stablecoins annually and eventually became a founding validator on Circle’s Arc L1. We saw SoFi launch the first bank-issued stablecoin on Mastercard, signaling that traditional finance was ready to move value at the […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=52b04016b4c847789b746afd65716cbddd2dd4c9e2c4e6f7b4fe6e958824325d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790355214,\"headline\":\"Mastercard Stock Holds Flat as $25 Billion Stablecoin Settlement Goes Live\",\"id\":142424761,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The program is moving onto SoFiUSD, but actual blockchain-settled volume remains undisclosed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=613d3e978e69b48f508cca34cc96765f4311ec2ea885c80fc71ee8728bcaf6ec\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790354760,\"headline\":\"Robinhood and Coinbase Are Changing How Investors Buy IPO Stocks\",\"id\":142425019,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coinbase customers can request shares in Oura’s IPO, while Robinhood has joined the offering as an underwriter. Neither role guarantees investors an allocation.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1d5e984f779110b6a23c6fa9f9d1f456bb350895d2ae3ba7d11f9784d6fdc06b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790336884,\"headline\":\"SoFi, Mastercard activate stablecoin settlement for SoFi Bank card programme\",\"id\":142421172,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"As part of the rollout, SoFi Bank is moving its entire $25bn card programme to stablecoin-based transaction settlement using SoFiUSD.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=51926eedac990bb234bdc8771e35d4102b7fb6e3c78a92500de0b43376e4a9b1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790335800,\"headline\":\"Dave’s Success Has Investors Split\",\"id\":142436793,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Dave's stock fell on GAAP earnings despite strong revenue growth and margins, as analysts turn bullish while legal challenges over its fee structure remain unresolved.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=853dc6c1132659d7747b2f476cd87e0b0aefb1acd454c6d950bdc323cf8f05d0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790260525,\"headline\":\"SoFi Built a Bank, a Card Program, and a Stablecoin, but the Stock Struggles to Budge\",\"id\":142383585,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi launched a bank, a credit card empire, and a stablecoin on Mastercard's network, yet the stock sits nearly where it started five years ago. One operating metric suggests the everything-app thesis is actually working, so what keeps the chart pinned?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=845fa3987e318a36959d7520718005bf1f711b92dc4fd9f08b4cf665bc45cc90\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790259600,\"headline\":\"Is the Market Right or Wrong About These 4 High Short Interest Stocks?\",\"id\":142424191,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"HIMS, ONDS, COIN, and SOFI show elevated short interest, but days-to-cover ratios, institutional ownership, and upcoming earnings reports suggest differing outlooks for short sellers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=db800540a009d8ea9318aad2fcae688dc7ebbb5a7c28dfd878905333258b37eb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790250208,\"headline\":\"Why SoFi Stock Is a Good Buy Now\",\"id\":142390164,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi’s efforts to scale its non-lending, capital-light businesses augur well for growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bf76f0bda5eccf41971e5d93594ebc1b44e0c6f34f0bfa8e50b8d1300bf25876\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790215885,\"headline\":\"Mastercard (MA) Stock Still Looks Undervalued Following Its 63% Five Year Run\",\"id\":142367223,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Mastercard has delivered a strong multi year gain for shareholders, yet the recent soft patch in the share price puts the focus squarely on whether that long run is supported by the returns it earns on its capital. Over the past 5 years, Mastercard has returned 63.3%, which puts real weight on the question of whether the underlying economics of the business are rich enough to support that kind of compounding. New projects such as stablecoin settlement with SoFi and AI enabled payment and...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4bc4bb86d0be9b37e0e6ae06706f8d5d7da15365c98113b48896d0ff111f1567\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790209469,\"headline\":\"Meta’s Agent-Commerce Layer Just Went Live. The Settlement Rails Were Built for This.\",\"id\":142366606,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"We used to think of the internet as a place where humans clicked buttons to buy things. Now, it is becoming a place where software agents do the clicking for us, and the plumbing underneath is finally starting to look like it was built for the job. For the past few years, the financial industry […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=85a7ddbd59660ac386d2a1b5dfc29949633c98963ddc747fb8f571ef18db07a2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790194920,\"headline\":\"Gen Z Is Getting an Early Start on Investing. Here’s How Early.\",\"id\":142365282,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"New U.S. Bank survey underscores key differences in how younger investors approach investing compared with Gen X and Millennials.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=368d14d0852a00acd364e05d677eb7f7f27268b7283f32a98a2acc68fe72fe22\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790192209,\"headline\":\"PYPL Showered Owners With Cash. The Stock Still Lagged The Market\",\"id\":142364133,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The payments giant sent a fortune back to its owners, yet the stock stumbled. Here’s the paradox of what that cash really bought, and what has to happen next.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5fc7cad7b70aa990d725a168fab1b3abaab8f155abfa265eeb07abb600a5eeee\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790186853,\"headline\":\"Consumer Lending Stocks Slide While Financials Barely Budge: Upstart and Affirm Drop 4%, SoFi Eases\",\"id\":142363475,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Upstart, Affirm, and SoFi are sliding in tandem on Wednesday while the broader financials sector sits nearly unchanged, and that gap between consumer lenders and everything else tells a story that goes beyond any single company's news.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=70cb171633a3160be1ca377b00461e4947d4aad42c6f82dc99f743c8dc702bf7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790184754,\"headline\":\"Mastercard Goes Live With SoFiUSD Settlement for $25 Billion Card Program\",\"id\":142363158,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi is migrating its debit and credit card program to stablecoin settlement on Mastercard's network, with transactions already live.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a23e27f815e0939938543991f108673ae85ee545b3589cc58f35a0daebdd6f7e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790182800,\"headline\":\"SoFi and Mastercard's new stablecoin partnership is a big deal. Here's why.\",\"id\":142363157,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Mastercard (MA) and SoFi (SOFI) have a new stablecoin partnership. Scott Melker outlines the details in the video above. \\\"The Daily Wolf with Scott Melker\\\" airs every day at 12:00 p.m. Tune in for your daily dose of all things crypto. Make sure to also check out Yahoo Finance's new crypto hub to find the latest crypto-related news.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f0af49bbf846df940ce5bc74e1811851534e6d718b71d01a03a1b30e880d355a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790179425,\"headline\":\"Bitcoin ETFs rakes in the dough\",\"id\":142363159,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In this episode of the Daily Wolf, Scott Melker discusses Mastercard (MA) and SoFi's (SOFI) new stablecoin partnership, Binance investing $100 million into Circle's (CRCL) global USDC expansion, and a strong two-day run for bitcoin (BTC-USD) ETFs which raked in $1.7 billion in inflows.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5fe4cec92fd5caf4413730b8a200edc1c28bf2cd5c6f2c2645702afbfec993b3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790178060,\"headline\":\"Nu's Global Strategy Takes Shape: Can Cross-Border Banking Add Growth?\",\"id\":142362225,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nu Holdings' cross-border push spans 35+ countries, pairing fee-free transfers with dollar and euro accounts as it expands beyond core markets.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=243bdd9ba30d345c4d9a768dd10d25c5b5b2b8f4556c97a962ca45d4691af23e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790177640,\"headline\":\"SoFi Brings SoFiUSD to Mastercard: Can It Unlock a New Growth Engine?\",\"id\":142361964,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi is moving more than $25 billion in annualized card volume to SoFiUSD via Mastercard as fee-based revenues become a larger part of its mix.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1ab225b527992f6147b2b1d6e7dd1d362298dfb3a435c89020570c72d4c04822\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790176980,\"headline\":\"Here's How Mastercard's SoFi Deal Expands Its Stablecoin Opportunity\",\"id\":142361953,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Mastercard expands stablecoin settlement with SoFi, moving its blockchain-based settlement efforts into a live, large-scale card program.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=aef6047e7bf6f367f431757c0b1e5e64ac1ed73de076214de0b0e0798a82627d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790172884,\"headline\":\"Why Is SoFi Technologies (SOFI) Putting Its Entire Card Program On Stablecoin Rails?\",\"id\":142361965,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies (NasdaqGS:SOFI) introduced SoFiUSD as the settlement asset for its entire card program on Mastercard's network on 21 September 2026. The move marks the first use of a U.S. bank issued stablecoin by a nationally chartered bank to settle a major card program. SoFi Bank is using SoFiUSD for real world payment settlements, connecting its regulated banking operations directly with blockchain based infrastructure. This full card migration to SoFiUSD settlement on Mastercard's...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e5a0f242c455c8f204dcdce3246ae38e1e05b469d50de1b75f0228d7d7e16701\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790166880,\"headline\":\"SoFi Stock Rises After Launching Stablecoin Settlement Across Card Program\",\"id\":142359471,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for SoFi StockPrice change for SoFi stock in the last 1 year: -41%$SOFI Stock Price as of Sep. 22: $1752-Week High: $33$SOFI Stock Price Target: $20What Happened?SoFi Technologies (SOFI) stock rose 3% on Tuesday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c14cab9ec03ac4f07c0a95a3522a21b1fb438d0a5d9febaae9c54cee45e055ac\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790153175,\"headline\":\"Lufax: Trading At 0.1x Tangible Book After China's Consumer Lending Shock\",\"id\":142357933,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2273337259/image_2273337259.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Lufax Holdings looks deeply undervalued despite regulatory tightening and liquidity shocks. Click for more on LU stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6c6e3c5efabfe5d10bed15f0f16f3f12bd5874d9d5bf49a153183fa75cfc9a06\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790114707,\"headline\":\"SoFi's Stablecoin Goes Live Across Mastercard's Network\",\"id\":142343822,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFiUSD is the first stablecoin issued by a nationally chartered US bank\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b8edec102089d85193370fa5172f6d08c2c288e24ea948da007ff2a37bbe7572\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790113504,\"headline\":\"SoFi Technologies, Inc. (SOFI) Stock Moves 1.12%: What You Should Know\",\"id\":142345904,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In the latest trading session, SoFi Technologies, Inc. (SOFI) closed at $17.16, marking a +1.12% move from the previous day.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6fec58a66af34e943cba12dd4f1e055d8a8a7b3c559cc3e8d7c56e0ec1b6eee3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790103253,\"headline\":\"Circle and Binance Trade Transactional Friction for Long-Term Alignment\",\"id\":142342041,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The stablecoin distribution model just changed its fundamental terms. On September 17, 2026, Binance purchased a $100 million equity stake in Circle – approximately 1,237,011 Class A shares at $80.84 per share in a private placement at a 5% discount to the prevailing market price – and paired it with a five-year commercial agreement that […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=89441d01e7b3abdf0ec876e422d8ad0d4385f14ae5848fe714fdcefce9dd36a4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790102179,\"headline\":\"A $25 Billion Reason Why SoFi Stock In Focus\",\"id\":142342051,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Stock Gets Big Crypto Boost as Mastercard Settlement Goes Live\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e7920924964de9fa5c5d964cd68d103aaca855b0a4d8cc2ebc2d15671b603bc2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790096820,\"headline\":\"SoFi Technologies Maintains Strong Credit Quality: Can It Persist?\",\"id\":142341419,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SOFI's record loan originations are testing its credit resilience, with charge-offs and delinquencies improving despite rapid lending growth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e0f0d9bbdaaabf4b5969fd335c97e16d52a9143421dfe8a1a7ff380ab814ea82\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790094180,\"headline\":\"SoFi Becomes First U.S. Bank to Settle Card Payments on Stablecoin\",\"id\":142341091,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies  started settling card transactions using its own stablecoin on Tuesday, a program the company says is the first of its kind for a U.S. bank.  All debit- and credit-card transactions will be settled using  SoFi  USD, its dollar-backed stablecoin, over  Mastercard  payments network, SoFi said.  The company said the shift will showcase how bank-issued stablecoins—a type of cryptocurrency pegged to the U.S. dollar and backed by assets like bank deposits or Treasury bills—can coexist with existing payment infrastructure by “helping bridge traditional financial systems and blockchain-based networks.”\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d2cb27de8e9263e79232c423c9bd96860d889177a376449acb30a6967405321f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790092866,\"headline\":\"SoFi Just Went Live With Stablecoin Settlement on Mastercard. That’s the First Bank-Issued Stablecoin on a Major Card Network.\",\"id\":142341088,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The short version is that a nationally chartered bank just started settling card transactions in its own stablecoin, and the interesting part is not that it happened but what it reveals about the shape of the competition to come. On September 22, SoFi Bank N.A. and Mastercard announced that live stablecoin settlement is now running […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5ce878bfc3afd0bf274920df35fcbf299659840849ac19fa4515414c65f632dc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790090412,\"headline\":\"‘Crypto Hurdle’ Solved: SoFi Is First Bank Deploying Stablecoin Settlement Across Mastercard Network\",\"id\":142339913,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi just quietly moved its entire card program onto a blockchain that merchants never have to touch, and the four obstacles that killed crypto payments at retail for a decade may have all vanished at once.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=017f207a58daf494d644cc8fbd54f42b78a5bf6bfec38d1d1a326bbf49775b0c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790087371,\"headline\":\"How SoFi Is Turning Its Consumer App Into A Stablecoin Proving Ground\",\"id\":142339917,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies (SOFI) and Mastercard on Tuesday said their stablecoin partnership is fully operational and handling real transactions. SoFi stock climbed on the news. Under the partnership, SoFi's debit and credit card program with more than $25 billion in annualized volume has shifted to Mastercard's payment network using its bank-issued stablecoin. The companies announced the partnership in March. With the...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=98ef3a654d9535c3564e61a53f439251859bb03e2877ffa37b0dde792dfa1b4d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790086519,\"headline\":\"3 Crypto Stocks To Watch In September 2026\",\"id\":142345915,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI-fuelled enthusiasm has swung global markets back toward high growth stories, and crypto and blockchain are sharing that spotlight as investors look for the next big infrastructure plays behind digital assets. With capital chasing clear business models instead of pure speculation, listed companies building the rails and plumbing of this ecosystem are drawing fresh attention. This article walks through three stocks from our curated crypto and blockchain basket. The stocks covered below are...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b1049f0b76e6e084fd2b94e4a618ff63079c0128d993f3cca9437a2f6f59eb0f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790085259,\"headline\":\"SoFi Shares Rise 3% as Bank Launches Stablecoin Settlement on Mastercard Network\",\"id\":142339916,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies (NASDAQ:SOFI) shares gained 3% on Tuesday after the company announced that SoFi Bank had become the first nationally chartered US bank to introduce live stablecoin settlement across Mastercard’s global payments network. The bank is migrating its entire debit and credit card programme to blockchain-based settlement using SoFiUSD, its US dollar-backed stablecoin.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8b0268cecc95a3126a682e608060b7e811f5574fd8e7098ace4cb01c6a217855\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790085001,\"headline\":\"SoFi, Mastercard Launch Stablecoin Settlement Across $25 Billion Card Program\",\"id\":142360575,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/22/SoFi-Technologies-Inc.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"SoFi shares trade higher as Mastercard enables stablecoin settlement across SoFi Bank’s $25 billion debit and credit card program using SoFiUSD.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f4ab281a5df6bfaa3b74eab3911ba7534c8b15cab867b5f486b5b7f0684650c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790084814,\"headline\":\"SoFi Rises 5% After Getting Cut in Half: Is SOFI Stock Set to Double From Here?\",\"id\":142337876,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies (NASDAQ:SOFI) shares are climbing in Tuesday morning trading, offering a rare green session for a stock that has spent most of the year sliding. With strong momentum, SoFi stock trended on social media and jumped 5% to $17.75 in the early hours. This begs the question of whether SOFI can double from here […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c1e2e0b0d47a3e122b803bb24211b6edeb13103e0575c7f64a041c663329b0c6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790084553,\"headline\":\"SOFI Stock Rises After $25B Card Program Moves To Stablecoin Settlement On Mastercard Network\",\"id\":142337720,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi and Mastercard are exploring additional SoFiUSD use cases, including cross-border payments and remittances.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=12fbf85c135fc0e499955ab375267e158434ea8454ea3b7bca57021aeb763a61\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790066708,\"headline\":\"Buying SOFI Is Like Buying 'AMD or Nvidia' at the Bottom: Strategists Highlight Bold Bull Case for SoFi Technologies\",\"id\":142337430,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/22/Los-Angeles--California---July-6-2025-So.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Strategists compare buying SoFi stock to \\u0026#39;Nvidia at the bottom,\\u0026#39; citing 30% revenue growth, a 40% EPS target, and strong banking moats.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=757ddc1745ac45bb495cdff52b4994d4ec255801aa1a2b25e08150dcd213fb20\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790064279,\"headline\":\"SoFi Technologies And Mastercard Announce Launch Of Stablecoin Settlement With SoFiUSD On Mastercard’s Global Payments Network\",\"id\":142338456,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"As part of the launch, SoFi Bank is migrating its entire $25 billion card program to stablecoin settlement of transactions using SoFiUSD, the first stablecoin issued by a nationally chartered bank. Transactions are live\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6eb9d636fdb1eb5aca7ae9eda0dd23fc9bf2493b1d678d2e1596245d912693a1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1790015073,\"headline\":\"How Far Could PayPal Stock Fall While Its Turnaround Plays Out?\",\"id\":142315223,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PayPal (PYPL) stock has fallen 14.2% over the past month to about $52, and it is still up 23.6% over three months. The bigger question is how far PayPal falls when a real market shock arrives, and how long it stays down. Its record says further than the market. Its turnaround asks for a long wait.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5f4e9c8548c01280ea6c4b8f8a070db5dc26a479557972f9fa73dba9229b8a46\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789994256,\"headline\":\"Digital Payment Today - FMPay Revolutionizes Payments With New Acquiring Model\",\"id\":142312217,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"FMPay, a payment institution authorized by the FCA, has unveiled its card acquiring and payout model designed for mid-sized digital businesses and B2B fintechs. The two-layered operating model features an API-led processing stack focused on settlement and compliance, coupled with a human layer comprising dedicated risk experts who manage client outcomes and address problems in real time. This direct acquiring approach enables FMPay to handle pay-ins and payouts across Visa, Mastercard, and...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9bbdbd06ac6f65aabb518e313d29ef6e243561c2926b217fbc44c31a9b85c4d5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789985600,\"headline\":\"Bitcoin Hit $85,000 Today — SoFi Stock Barely Moved\",\"id\":142314174,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/21/xrdDAE9HpS4rJc11383-j9208019443350942158.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies Inc. (NASDAQ: SOFI) shares are roughly flat Monday after paring earlier gains, even as Bitcoin trades around $85,000.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b85ea29eea1aa28f228bf7f2f36b3f2b3a81dc8ec013cdc33ef7ab3610d8f511\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789919400,\"headline\":\"Prediction: The Best-Performing Big Bank Stock of the Next 2 Years Is Not JPMorgan Chase\",\"id\":142288935,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"These fast-growing bank stocks offer incredible opportunities for investors.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d05b6cf153b6e3ee0a9fe4b2b5ca380add3e2c469c5774c4787e1374de86b856\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789834305,\"headline\":\"What SoFi Technologies (SOFI)'s Record Q2 2026 Cr