er than most investors realize.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d260101898f7cb55b601b8290b6bf9180027d46d2ce1fbc58df4cb5b79030eb6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789642828,\"headline\":\"You Don't Have To Beat The Market To Retire In Style\",\"id\":142223851,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Placing big bets on hot stocks isn't required to retire in comfort. An index fund can do the job very well.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=897253b6d503929cd92a30083c21467ff05f49b5667581ca8506b93396429514\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789612818,\"headline\":\"SOFI Stock Rises Overnight Despite Rate Cut: Retail Sentiment Improves As Investors Argue Rate Hike Already Priced In\",\"id\":142211542,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Federal Reserve on Wednesday hiked key interest rates to a target range of 3.75% to 4.00%, in line with market expectations.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2587d9c195fab2ec970776c4e47b85b82df6bc7ec1ea071d8d0aa540428b4bd6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789605709,\"headline\":\"Should You Buy PayPal Stock For Its Credit Business?\",\"id\":142203872,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PayPal (PYPL) has gained 27% over the past three months while the S\\u0026P 500 returned 0.7%. Over the trailing twelve months, the stock is still down 18.7%, so the whole gain is recent. A gain that recent still needs an operating reason to hold, and management points to what PayPal lends, not to the checkout button.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7d2572c39ccc1df4443e8373728ecff86a040ef10d9167072c2cf94e4f6a7135\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1789563604,\"headline\":\"Is Trending 