ast three years, yet the current market price screens as expensive compared with its intrinsic value estimate and broader valuation checks. Recent weakness in the share price adds another layer of complexity as investors weigh the growth story against signals that the stock may be pricing in a lot of good news already. Over the past three years, SoFi Technologies has returned 116.0%, which puts more focus on whether the...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=399d8d51278ff7332daa7512a4ad08d0951f9cc8c7516dd5c64298e3de7d168f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788545744,\"headline\":\"Does SoFi–Kraken Stablecoin And Liquidity Partnership Change The Bull Case For SoFi Technologies (SOFI)?\",\"id\":141566810,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"In early September 2026, SoFi Technologies and Payward, parent of the Kraken exchange, announced a partnership linking SoFi’s Big Business Banking and real-time SoFi Exchange Network with Kraken’s trading infrastructure, while adding SoFiUSD as a redeemable one-to-one US dollar stablecoin on Kraken and using Kraken Prime to deepen crypto liquidity for SoFi app users. This collaboration effectively plugs Kraken’s global digital-asset client base into SoFi’s 24/7 US dollar settlement rails,...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b9b3710cbe20a6c3918a2a83cc150e26e7b05fe12287a782bc881516bc9192c5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788542520,\"headline\":\"SoFi Technologies Teams Up With Payward: Will SoFiUSD Gain Traction?\",\"id\":141446598,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SOFI's Payward tie-up expands SoFiUSD's reach through Kraken while adding digital-asset liquidity and 24/7 dollar clearing.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=187fb8f5b4ee885a5427d022fdd1c732823020c1ce604b80494c307278221051\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788489078,\"headline\":\"SoFi, WisdomTree, Ridgepost Capital, Ares, and S\\u0026P Global Shares Are Soaring, What You Need To Know\",\"id\":141407461,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A number of stocks jumped in the afternoon session after Federal Reserve Governor Christopher Waller signaled support for holding interest rates steady amid emerging signs of disinflation. During a Reuters NEXT Newsmaker interview, Governor Waller stated that if the positive economic trends seen over the last few months continue in the data due over the next two weeks, he would be inclined to support holding the federal funds target rate at its current setting. Waller pointed out that the three-\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=45a96e37fc9db792ab644ae3be4d9bc0267219381078dceca0ae08009489729a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788487712,\"headline\":\"SoFi's Kraken Deal Grows Its Stablecoin Reach — Analyst Calls It 'Another Positive Development' But Still Sees 13% Downside\",\"id\":141566812,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies on Thursday announced a partnership with Payward to boost its banking, payments, liquidity, and digital asset markets.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e0acad65127d8a4bb4e984e78247eb1c58d7e234492b1a7b395953ea8919a4bf\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788471200,\"headline\":\"SoFi Pushes SoFiUSD Onto Kraken in Payward Partnership\",\"id\":141566813,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Payward joins the SoFi Exchange Network and will supply crypto liquidity through Kraken Prime\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=633ba8cdde1dfd447d03730e8d7385ecff52a540793c9f9ef87816d25c2e5a5b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788470831,\"headline\":\"What Are You Actually Buying In PayPal Stock?\",\"id\":141405262,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PayPal (PYPL) trades at 9.8 times earnings while the S\\u0026P 500 trades at 23.2. The profitability underneath is ordinary: an 18.4% operating margin against 18.5% for the market. The discount is not about whether the company makes money. It is about what each dollar it moves is worth.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6b41497b722a723a87cb986d3f5993b59884d0fe7bba26c7e9900c880654bc16\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788450008,\"headline\":\"SoFi Links Banking Network and Stablecoin to Kraken in New Deal\",\"id\":141566814,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Kraken will list SoFiUSD and gain access to SoFi’s round-the-clock dollar settlement network, while Kraken Prime will execute trades for SoFi’s crypto customers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0e6f9f90d0ff80c48718c190249e1fd96f85d6bae6d909e71faea30f798c3f9d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788440446,\"headline\":\"Price Prediction: SoFi’s Price Target For 2027 May Surprise Investors\",\"id\":141566815,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi shares have shed nearly a third of their value in 2026 even as the fintech keeps posting record numbers, and that gap between price and fundamentals points to a scenario Wall Street has not fully priced in yet.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f52e74b4aecf491b106a3e07a436e3acf872c91c0ebee2c47df056f19874d8e2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788436200,\"headline\":\"SoFi Just Posted Another Quarter of Fast Growth. What Has to Happen Next for the Stock to Follow?\",\"id\":141397259,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"This fintech stock trades 45% below its record high reached in November 2025.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bfe1bd0a58e94d943e1fcde75defa135419376beefcf659f08c9368ee37d8ac8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788433249,\"headline\":\"Financial Coach? How A Money Mentor Can Help You Live Large\",\"id\":141407456,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Jannik Sinner, the world's top-ranked tennis player, has a coach. So does No. 1 golfer Scottie Scheffler. But do you need a financial coach?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ac1ad83e499c84613c129dd93bfb452fbfaf3fd45ca8b42ab458dabfede4e1b7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788422655,\"headline\":\"SOFI Stock Rises Premarket: Why This Analyst Sees 40% Upside From Here\",\"id\":141562680,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Scotiabank initiated coverage of SoFi Technologies with an ‘Outperform’ rating and a price target of $25.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=12b5b532f8ac5454dfcdb256e68c4f65db250b03a1aa9984840787f99db1dff5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788413404,\"headline\":\"SoFi Technologies: Shares Are Flat So I'm Accumulating More\",\"id\":141396522,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2254343937/image_2254343937.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"SOFI's cross-selling strategy has driven a record product-per-member, with new customers adopting over 2 products on average. Read more on SOFI stock here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bb70fb7f6c2b2fd1ede589ebaaad08b7042aa242465b9a54e306dfe51942ff81\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788361878,\"headline\":\"Scotiabank Initiates Coverage On SoFi Technologies with Sector Outperform Rating, Announces Price Target of $25\",\"id\":141401166,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Scotiabank  analyst Lance Jessurun   initiates coverage on SoFi Technologies (NASDAQ:SOFI) with a Sector Outperform rating and announces Price Target of $25.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1a9c1e4ab3aa17d4f2f0f53f819e46ec2c38f4b5cefe5e6d1c5eb344858d4e4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788341826,\"headline\":\"What's Happening With SoFi Stock?\",\"id\":141379149,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/02/San-Francisco--Ca--Usa---May-1--2022-Sof.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"SoFi shares are edging higher Wednesday as it navigates a turbulent macro backdrop, with rising Treasury yields pressuring fintech lenders.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a7ead7d3149d211e27286c59363b6ea21b9c31f28d9508cf3bf85785db2d45c3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788310845,\"headline\":\"SOFI’s Decline Has Retail Looking Elsewhere — Here’s The Rival Fintech Traders Prefer Right Now\",\"id\":141372976,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Multiple retail investors on Stocktwits named Robinhood as a better bet compared to SoFi Technologies.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77fae99dc72b3d384c6583a247aeada03249eea7dc0834ac91a1a1f79d3500be\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788281814,\"headline\":\"SoFi Drops 4%, Affirm Falls 5% as Yields Hit Balance-Sheet Lenders, Robinhood Holds Steady\",\"id\":141370091,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A global bond selloff is carving a precise line through fintech, punishing two lenders while leaving one brokerage almost untouched, and the reason why reveals exactly how rate exposure separates winners from losers in this sector.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=809e8d2c78bdf8079e0d16602e4261eac73ad2a16114d3a997675032f84ef5cb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788259704,\"headline\":\"SoFi's Deposits Aren't A Moat: They're A Rate Hedge\",\"id\":141368303,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2186243573/image_2186243573.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies, Inc. is a Buy as fee-based revenue hits 39% and guidance rises. Read to see SOFI's growth catalysts, deposit hedge benefits, and risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1e11cb670e9a562a8d235519aad6d71707bf7c65b0c9c4660d25ce27c461d5da\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788243340,\"headline\":\"3 Crypto Stocks To Watch With Up To 47% Revenue Growth\",\"id\":141361392,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Central banks are talking tougher on inflation, and higher interest rates can keep pressure on traditional risk assets. At the same time, investor interest in digital assets and the technology behind them has not disappeared. That mix of tighter money and ongoing curiosity about crypto creates a very specific opportunity. This article walks through three stocks linked to cryptocurrencies and blockchain that many investors are watching closely right now. The stocks covered below are just a...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c56ed76487097068ab986d39d666c1cde57974ea8f1215f20a2f4b52c9ad9d3c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788243103,\"headline\":\"Trump Accounts Get Major Corporate Boost: American Airlines Offers $1,000 Match, Dell Starts $250 Payments\",\"id\":141368347,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/01/Flight-Cancelations--SNAP-Delays-Add-Pre.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Trump Accounts gain fresh private support as American Airlines offers $1,000 matches and Dell begins $250 grants for eligible children.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=150fba8d2f77e4a6727153cdbdced0a7eaa60ec10edef10f4aa7c2eeebbb75c0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788219857,\"headline\":\"PayPal Stock's Real Risk Is Not How Far It Falls\",\"id\":141360900,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"PayPal has survived every market crash on its record, but it still sits below two pre-shock highs it has never reclaimed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=265a2ea40bae4d952278dbeb257e2577d12aed1c9c423bb850979b5392302155\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788200280,\"headline\":\"Is SoFi's Product Flywheel Gaining Enough Traction to Lift SOFI Stock?\",\"id\":141430721,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SoFi's product flywheel gains traction as cross-buy rises, non-lending products expand, and fee-based growth broadens its financial-services model.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=337ace216a295b3430a75b4cdccd59a8e192c8aef78862f37459264348bc29d3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1788168947,\"headline\":\"SoFi Stock Edges Lower Monday as Geopolitical Tensions and Interest Rate Uncertainty Hit Fintech\",\"id\":141355737,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/08/31/San-Francisco--Ca--Usa---May-1--2022-Sof.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"SOFI\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"SoFi Technologies is trading marginally lower Monday morning, extending Friday\\u0026#39;s weakness amid market headwinds and lending margin