_FALSE_INFO.png?v=1791990809\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"You may never a co-worker as enigmatic as Elizabeth Holmes. But you might have one who doesn't deliver or misrepresents situations. Try these strategies.\",\"url\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/make-it/2026/10/15/how-to-handle-coworker-giving-false-information-expert.html\"},{\"category\":\"business\",\"datetime\":1792067743,\"headline\":\"US Treasury pushes global partners to rename AI as 'super intelligence' - Reuters\",\"id\":8624870,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/finnhub/logo/reuters_logo.jpeg\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Reuters\",\"summary\":\"US Treasury pushes global partners to rename AI as 'super intelligence'  Reuters\",\"url\":\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNNDhRZ0FsM05ZWGFISWtLaXVIam1VcVlxWUY0YlF6NUR1SF9FSnFKQnJwMU5pa2hZUG1ZalVtb1RmY19adW5LSnZhQ1pmNzhtX2tTeE9Lal9LX29iRkZsbHVlcWlLWEw2NW9iaGlrS19odFpadHRSak5VYXFfTWRaaUpjUVp0SEVlb0ZvdTBZLThVcVB0V0JSdEZyZnBrQk05dzgzWUR4Yi0?oc=5\"}]"
