ypto\",\"datetime\":1792328400,\"headline\":\"Bitcoin’s $100,000 year-end hope divides analysts as inflation clouds outlook\",\"id\":8639103,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/5b3e22f79db7d662674f6627620b8e945757ba94-1280x702.jpg?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/10/18/bitcoin-s-usd100-000-year-end-hope-divides-analysts-as-inflation-clouds-outlook\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792324800,\"headline\":\"Crypto exchanges Binance, Coinbase join West Africa scam sweep that flagged $11 million\",\"id\":8638688,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/c8cf7352fab13d07a5ac302d8ec45c4e0964687d-3072x2048.jpg?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/14/crypto-exchanges-binance-coinbase-join-west-africa-scam-sweep-that-flagged-usd11-million\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792320192,\"headline\":\"Cysic crypto bridge halted after unauthorized mint of 10M CYS\",\"id\":8638282,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Cysic said the incident was limited to bridge message processing and minting and did not affect the mainnet or other operational systems.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/cysic-crypto-bridge-halted-after-unauthorized-mint-of-10m-cys?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792314866,\"headline\":\"Chinese suspect in $75M international crime network arrested in Bangkok\",\"id\":8638081,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Police alleged the suspect was involved in cryptocurrency and foreign-currency exchanges for criminal groups across more than 133 accounts.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/chinese-suspect-in-75m-international-crime-network-arrested-in-bangkok?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792307612,\"headline\":\"Chip-stock bets lost $52 million in 10 minutes with Wall Street shut\",\"id\":8638080,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/286577a8289b83ce1529d6d1d4853747c94ebd18-1444x796.png?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/10/18/chip-stock-bets-lost-usd52-million-in-10-minutes-with-wall-street-shut\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792304813,\"headline\":\"Tether backs AIsa as strategic investor, completing seed extension round\",\"id\":8637579,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"The round brings AIsa’s total funding to more than $9 million.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/tether-backs-aisa-as-strategic-investor-completing-seed-extension-round?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792285595,\"headline\":\"Circle defends USDC economics as stablecoin rivals court its partners with bigger cut\",\"id\":8636574,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/0738e13835f743ba2e3a2f26f7579b27661d1eac-4608x2592.jpg?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/17/circle-defends-usdc-economics-as-stablecoin-rival