elegraph\",\"summary\":\"Solana has had no reported mainnet outages in two years, but concentrations in stake, hosting and client software should be monitored, according to a report.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-shows-resilience-but-some-areas-need-continued-observation-fidelity-says?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792238400,\"headline\":\"Banks could slow stablecoin growth by paying savers more, BIS paper finds\",\"id\":8633950,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/1f36f4b6075554c7a225b5bdef6b7d0bb9142a62-1920x1280.jpg?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/14/banks-could-slow-stablecoin-growth-by-paying-savers-more-bis-paper-finds\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792231207,\"headline\":\"Circle’s Allaire says stablecoin issuer looking to enter 40 developing markets: Report\",\"id\":8633545,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Markets in Southeast Asia, Latin America, Africa and the Middle East see increasing demand for stablecoins.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/circles-allaire-says-stablecoin-issuer-looking-to-enter-40-developing-markets-report?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792225931,\"headline\":\"Lagarde says euro-area economy is resilient, digital euro imminent\",\"id\":8633244,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"“The digital euro will further stimulate innovation and competition in retail payments,” according to the ECB president.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/lagarde-says-euro-area-economy-is-resilient-digital-euro-imminent?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792222017,\"headline\":\"Bitget to discontinue services for some users in one-off exercise\",\"id\":8633042,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Bitget says user funds are safe and exchange will continue to operate during the change.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitget-to-discontinue-services-for-some-users-in-one-off-exercise?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792219188,\"headline\":\"‘Wow, it’s a real discovery’: Claude cracks a 25-year NSA number mystery\",\"id\":8633143,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/2297ea2e470af647418127b13e7a3275fed8827a-1920x1200.jpg?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/10/17/wow-it-s-a-real-discovery-claude-cracks-a-25-year-nsa-number-mystery\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792204200,\"headline\":\"Satoshi-era bitcoin faces a bigger quantum threat after Google’s new Willow breakthrough\",\"id\":8632338,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/9f051c877190174f3a7cbc53e53d11e1620cee92-2560x1707.jpg?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/10/16/satoshi-era-bitcoin-faces-a-bigger-quantum-threat-after-google-s-new-willow-breakthrough\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792171809,\"headline\":\"Crypto PACs escalate spending against Sherrod Brown in Ohio Senate race\",\"id\":8630311,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"At least two industry-aligned PACs have poured more than $52 million into opposing Sherrod Brown’s return to the Senate.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-pac-fairshake-spending-ohio-senate-race-sherrod-brown?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792171305,\"headline\":\"Stablecoin remittances cost 84% less than traditional transfers, report finds\",\"id\":8630312,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Borderless.xyz data shows major savings on cross-border business payments, with stablecoin transfers also settling faster than traditional international bank wires.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/stablecoin-remittances-cost-savings-traditional-transfers?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792165948,\"headline\":\"Crypto Biz: Wall Street closes at 4. Tokenized stocks keep trading\",\"id\":8629992,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Tokenized stocks are drawing trading activity beyond Wall Street hours, while Bitcoin miners confront costly AI expansion and new accounting rules could benefit stablecoins.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/tokenized-stocks-after-hours-trading-crypto-biz?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792165543,\"headline\":\"Bitcoin price steadies around $82K after Fed’s Warsh avoids rate-hike hints\",\"id\":8629989,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Bitcoin held above $80,000 as South Korean tech stocks recovered from a sell-off and traders lowered their expectations for a Federal Reserve interest-rate hike.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-price-steadies-82k-fed-warsh-avoids-rate-hike-hints?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792162702,\"headline\":\"Big Tech's AI auditors will only see what they're shown\",\"id\":8630102,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/a42d79475bce40ccdb1888645ca72a438ad5a97f-5769x3752.jpg?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/opinion/2026/10/16/big-tech-s-ai-auditors-will-only-see-what-they-re-shown\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792159926,\"headline\":\"Bitcoin is little changed on the day, and pushing against a key crossroad.  What next?\",\"id\":8629988,\"image\":\"https://investinglive.com/cms/media/2026-10-16_07-10-16.jpg?width=960\\u0026format=webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Forexlive\",\"summary\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eBitcoin has spent the early part of the week moving back and forth across its 100- and 200-hour moving averages (they are near converged near $82,500). Each modest break above offered an opportunity for the buyers to take control. However, sellers prevailed.  The price moved away from those moving averages and lower, but similarly to the buyers at the high resistance, sellers reached support and found momentum faded as well. And true to form, the price pushed higher. \\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eNow the price is back at those converged moving averages near $82,500, putting traders at the same key crossroad at the 100 and 200 hour moving averages.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eA week of missed opportunities\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBitcoin started the week above its 100-hour moving average and testing its higher 200-hour moving average—the green line on the chart below. Monday’s push briefly cleared that level, but the rally stalled at $84,178. Buyers could not keep the momentum going, and the price reversed below the 100-hour moving average toward swing support between $80,106 and $81,183.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAfter finding support in that area on Tuesday, buyers took another run to the upside. The rebound carried the price back above both moving averages, shifting the short-term bias in their favor. However, the rally failed to take out Monday’s high at $84,178.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe buyers had their shot. They could not finish the job.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThat failure kept sellers in play and they pushed lower. On Wednesday, the price broke below the then-converged moving averages near $83,100, and downside momentum accelerated. By Thursday, bitcoin had fallen through the bottom of the $80,106–$81,183 swing area.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThat should have opened the door for further selling. Instead, the break quickly ran out of steam, and the price snapped back above the support zone.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis time, the sellers had their shot. They missed.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBack at the moving-average crossroads\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe recovery has now brought bitcoin back to its converged 100- and 200-hour moving averages near $82,500. Those levels are being tested today, and the next move needs follow-through.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFor buyers, the job is to get above those moving averages—and stay above them. A sustained break would shift the short-term bias higher and put the following targets in play:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e$84,178: Monday’s high and the ceiling buyers failed to clear earlier this week.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e$85,578–$87,374: The higher resistance area containing the September and October cycle highs.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFor sellers, the job is to keep a lid on the price at the moving averages. If they can do that and push the price lower, the focus returns to:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e$81,183–$80,106: The swing support area that has been central to this week’s trading.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e$76,052: The 38.2% retracement of the rally from the July low to the September high, if support gives way and sellers sustain the break.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe trading lesson: A break needs staying power\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis week is a reminder that trading through a technical level is only the first step. What happens after the break matters.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBuyers moved above the moving averages but failed to clear the weekly high. Sellers broke below swing support but could not keep the price down. Both failures led to reversals.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eNow bitcoin is back at the crossing. Get and stay above $82,500, and buyers have another opportunity to take control. Stay below, and sellers retain the advantage at resistance.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe levels define the risk. The follow-through will tell us who is taking control.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n                            This article was written by Greg Michalowski at investinglive.com.\",\"url\":\"https://investinglive.com/cryptocurrency/bitcoin-is-little-changed-on-the-day-and-pushing-against-a-key-crossroad-what-next/\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792159863,\"headline\":\"Strategy conditionally declares daily dividends as STRC hovers below $100\",\"id\":8629676,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Strategy conditionally declared daily dividends on STRC, which continued to hover below its $100 par value.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/strategy-daily-dividends-strc-hovers-below-100?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792158695,\"headline\":\"Ledger’s early implant warnings deserved more action, Karpelès says\",\"id\":8629671,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Ledger was contacted about tampered hardware wallets risks months before its latest security crisis, with former Mt. Gox CEO Mark Karpelès questioning its response.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/ledger-early-implant-warnings-mark-karpeles?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792157620,\"headline\":\"Deutsche Bank prepares German crypto custody launch, eyes Asia: Report\",\"id\":8629672,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Germany’s largest bank reportedly plans to expand its digital asset custody services to Asian financial centers due to the growth of the digital asset economy.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/deutsche-bank-crypto-custody-expansion-asia-2027?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792149767,\"headline\":\"Solana’s Liu says Shanghai event postponed over registration surge\",\"id\":8629152,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Solana Foundation President Lily Liu said registrations quadrupled overnight, exce