28.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/australia-releases-draft-bill-to-adopt-oecd-crypto-tax-reporting-framework?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792104178,\"headline\":\"Scammer loses $4.8M stored on tampered Ledgers: Asia Express\",\"id\":8626566,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"A scammer reportedly lost $4.8M of stolen money after storing the funds on tampered Ledgers. Bitcoin and Ether ETFs launch trading in Thailand and South Korea blocks 27 exchanges.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/scammer-loses-48m-stored-on-tampered-ledgers-asia-express?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792095671,\"headline\":\"Binance.US seeks $1B valuation in potential $100M funding round: Report\",\"id\":8626052,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"The crypto exchange was reportedly looking to use the additional funding to regain market share following Binance’s 2023 settlement with US authorities.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-us-funding-valuation-billion?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792090082,\"headline\":\"At the White House, crypto policy vacancy looms large\",\"id\":8625725,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/a557d00cbe2a4f9b6f42b53082f2cd587490332b-4031x2267.jpg?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026fp-x=0.6796\\u0026fp-y=0.3524\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/news-analysis/2026/10/15/at-the-white-house-crypto-poli