7044,\"headline\":\"Bitcoin slips under $80K after US PPI gains most in four years\",\"id\":8624974,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"BTC buyers attempted to defend $80,000 support after September US producer inflation overshot expectations by 100 basis points for the largest monthly gain since March 2022\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-price-breaks-under-80k-after-us-ppi-gains-most-in-over-4-years?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792076400,\"headline\":\"Crypto for Advisors: Wall Street is done waiting on Congress for crypto rules\",\"id\":8625085,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/5ddf1efa5bb12b3aa1345b8718beec9eb6ab01db-2560x1440.jpg?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/coindesk-indices/2026/10/15/crypto-for-advisors-wall-street-is-done-waiting-on-congress-for-crypto-rules\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792074163,\"headline\":\"Russia to ban direct peer-to-peer crypto trades starting July 2027\",\"id\":8624867,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Russia plans to ban direct P2P crypto trades from July 1, 2027, while separate rules already prohibit transfers from digital accounts to self-custody wallets.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/russia-ban-p2p-crypto-trades-july-2027?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792073815,\"headline\":\"Nasdaq-listed Tron sets up $200M ATM share offering to fuel TRX acquisitions\",\"id\":8624756,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"The Nasdaq-listed treasury company holds about $237 million in TRX tokens and plans to raise additional capital to fund its purchases, alongside its daily accumulation.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/nasdaq-tron-200m-atm-offering-fuel-trx-acquisitions?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792071000,\"headline\":\"Can the SEC and CFTC’s pro-crypto rules be overturned? Legal opinion\",\"id\":8624647,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"The SEC and the CFTC have issued a raft of pro-crypto rules recently. But will the rules hold up in court, and can they be easily rolled back by the “anti-crypto army”?\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/can-the-sec-and-cftcs-pro-crypto-rules-be-overturned-legal-opinion?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792067724,\"headline\":\"How Brooklyn prosecutors and the FBI took down a massive crypto fraud network targeting Russian speakers\",\"id\":8624752,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/46896a614298dcf705810c12a113e9dab6ce84fb-4416x2488.jpg?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/15/how-brooklyn-prosecutors-and-the-fbi-took-down-a-massive-crypto-fraud-network-targeting-russian-speakers\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792066377,\"headline\":\"HEX token sellers erase $160M following reports of founder Richard Schueler arrest\",\"id\":8624316,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"The HEX token’s price declined by 30% following local media reports of the Istanbul arrest of founder Richard Schueler, nearly two years after Interpol issued a “Red Notice.”\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/hex-token-erases-160m-reports-founder-schuelers-arrest?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792065600,\"headline\":\"Under pressure, Ledger unveils plan to turn its crypto hardware wallet into a smartphone\",\"id\":8624753,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/676f925af521e6704a1edcb3121c14c17f83eb6a-4032x3024.jpg?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/10/15/under-pressure-ledger-unveils-plan-to-turn-its-crypto-hardware-wallet-into-a-smartphone\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792065600,\"headline\":\"Ledger’s answer to wallet tampering costs $849 and ships next year\",\"id\":8624317,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Ledger’s new Atom combines crypto wallet security with everyday apps and is expected to ship in summer 2027 as the company investigates tampered wallets sold in Asia.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/ledger-new-hardware-device-asia-wallet-tampering?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792062900,\"headline\":\"Bitcoin, copper, stocks, yields all fall; gold rises\",\"id\":8624754,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/2f8437e589e595529cc560ac6a76355d8b08defb-5184x3456.jpg?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/daybook-us/2026/10/15/bitcoin-copper-stocks-yields-all-fall-gold-rises\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792061531,\"headline\":\"Altcoins lead crypto declines as Asian stocks drop; bitcoin little changed since midnight\",\"id\":8624755,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/5ac927ec281513c4179cc6fd9f1dbb52289fbeb4-1920x1080.png?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/10/15/bitcoin-holds-above-usd80-000-as-an-asian-stock-rout-drags-altcoins-lower\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792060869,\"headline\":\"White House crypto council chief Patrick Witt steps down\",\"id\":8623999,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Witt’s departure leaves a leadership gap at the White House Crypto Council and marks the fourth high-profile exit from the advisory group.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/white-house-crypto-council-director-steps-down?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792059561,\"headline\":\"Starknet opens vote on potential Ethereum L2 exit over quantum risks\",\"id\":8623889,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Starknet is asking STRK holders whether to explore becoming an independent layer-1 blockchain to reduce its dependence on Ethereum’s quantum-security upgrade timeline.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/starknet-vote-ethereum-l2-exit-post-quantum-l1?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792059375,\"headline\":\"Live updates: Bitcoin back under $81,000 as AI selloff worsens\",\"id\":8623995,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/369d76d050eecf9efecb8e1dc7767756f908070f-1508x844.png?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/15/live-updates-bitcoin-back-under-usd81-000-as-ai-selloff-worsens\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792058456,\"headline\":\"Hyperliquid founder wants U.S. oversight of trading platforms, not his blockchain\",\"id\":8623996,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/2bd4417e83546ed86774ac8307c343cb1c9e17c0-3495x1966.jpg?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/10/15/hyperliquid-founder-wants-u-s-oversight-of-trading-platforms-not-his-blockchain\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792058400,\"headline\":\"Bitget, Liquid exploits push Q3 crypto hacks toward $1.2B\",\"id\":8623890,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Compromised suppliers, developer tools and infrastructure components outside security audits drove about 77% of the quarter’s total losses, according to Hacken.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitget-liquid-exploits-push-crypto-hacks-near-12b-q3?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792058017,\"headline\":\"Australia’s financial watchdog seeks stiffer rules for crypto exchanges ahead of licensing deadline\",\"id\":8623997,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/725e54466a506d18ddd589c3163082c4f09cc8f6-2704x1544.png?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/10/15/australia-s-financial-watchdog-seeks-stiffer-rules-for-crypto-exchanges-ahead-of-licensing-deadline\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792057687,\"headline\":\"Bitcoin dips to $80.1K as KOSPI closes at its lowest since April\",\"id\":8623891,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Bitcoin price action continued to see contagion from a Korean tech sell-off after the KOSPI Index fell 7.5% on Thursday.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-dips-korea-kospi-lowest-close-since-april?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792056980,\"headline\":\"Thailand crypto ETFs may see slow start despite new rules: CoinShares\",\"id\":8623781,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Thailand’s new Bitcoin and Ether ETF rules take effect Friday, but CoinShares expects modest initial inflows as existing investment options compete for demand.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/thailand-crypto-etfs-slow-start-new-rules-coinshares?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792056057,\"headline\":\"Hex founder Richard Heart arrested in Istanbul, Turkish media report\",\"id\":8623998,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/03e37489ed1eae296cbd07f255ddf7baed72214e-2826x1554.png?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/10/15/hex-founder-richard-heart-arrested-in-istanbul-turkish-media-report\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792055668,\"headline\":\"Babylon advances native Bitcoin lending proposal on Aave V4\",\"id\":8623676,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Babylon’s proposal to bring native Bitcoin collateral to Aave V4 has entered a new governance stage, but further votes and security reviews remain before launch.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/babylon-native-bitcoin-collateral-aave-v4-proposal?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792049023,\"headline\":\"Bitcoin ETFs shed $261M as XRP funds buck weekly outflow trend\",\"id\":8623366,\"image\":\"https://static2.finnhub.io/file/publicdatany/hmpimage/cointelegraph.webp\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"Cointelegraph\",\"summary\":\"Bitcoin ETFs have recorded $151 million in net outflows since Monday, after investors withdrew $681 million the previous week.\",\"url\":\"https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-etf-outflow-btc-below-82k?utm_source=rss_feed\\u0026utm_medium=rss\\u0026utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"},{\"category\":\"crypto\",\"datetime\":1792045078,\"headline\":\"BlackRock's Fink names a U.S. recession trigger, sounds alarm over $40 trillion national debt\",\"id\":8623262,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/7ac986e95de8943f9daaadd64fd86aee424071d3-2937x1693.png?auto=format\\u0026fit=crop\\u0026crop=focalpoint\\u0026w=1200\\u0026h=675\\u0026q=75\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CoinDesk\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/10/15/blackrock-s-larry-fink-names-a-u-s-recession-trigger-and-its-tied-to-ai\"}]"
