https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=40a90eb8be7fcc452d6ec74720c5efb069afe41511556d14dd762915ce768719\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161451,\"headline\":\"Apple Called Top Defensive Play With AI Stocks Under Pressure\",\"id\":142947896,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A Wall Street analyst called Apple stock a top defensive name amid the sell-off in stocks tied to the artificial intelligence megatrend.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3830abe89d2cfba9b980daae9be321c9c2ba945e2392dbfa881ae1c750481055\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161236,\"headline\":\"Apple’s $1,999 Foldable Is Backordered to 2027. Here’s What That Does and Doesn’t Mean\",\"id\":142947897,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple (AAPL:NASDAQ) opened preorders for its first foldable, the $1,999 iPhone Duo, on Friday, October 16, and shipping estimates slipped into January within minutes. By about 8:30 a.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3f7007c67c01e73b4079850c2441e3d87779c5be06e5f29d7be5599cbd898b80\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792161077,\"headline\":\"Meta, Tesla, SpaceX Take Center Stage As Earnings Season Kicks Into High Gear. Everything You Need To Know.\",\"id\":142947905,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Meta Platforms and Tesla earnings will highlight a big week of reports, including Netflix, defense, software and chip names.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bf9fb1c0ef4952970ca4ae5b0c80f0c329f2c12d5608dbaae940002f0252e004\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159448,\"headline\":\"AAPL Stock Gains As Strong Demand Reportedly Pushes iPhone Duo Delivery To December\",\"id\":142947898,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple opened preorders for the iPhone Duo at 8 a.m. ET Friday through its online store and Apple Store app.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=272b57adbebf8697794cf6c1ea94534fb725e1dba707ea8c84f0ca827de7a878\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159080,\"headline\":\"Tesla takes to the skies, iPhone Duo pre-orders sell out, bond yields take a breather\",\"id\":142945509,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The 8:30 Hosts Julie Hyman and Jake Conley are joined by Bullseye American Ingenuity Fund portfolio manager Adam Johnson to help tackle the day's biggest news stories, including the grand reveal of the Tesla (TSLA) Roadster EV, pre-orders for the Apple (AAPL) iPhone Duo selling out quickly, and the latest reading on Anthropic's (ANTH.PVT) valuation ahead of its planned November IPO.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8523e545bbc8fcb1491dd48f2241739b4616c68641d89083836d4aab948d7905\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159041,\"headline\":\"I think Apple, Meta's Muse AI model is great product, says Slow Ventures' Lessin\",\"id\":142962395,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108420805-17921728531792172850-49041088824-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792172851\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC’s Kelly Evans discusses Apple and Meta teaming up to offer Muse AI model with Sam Lessin of Slow Ventures.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a9de8789688b8f6be09c14b8da6bf1bc782d181f772e563315f3bf6ce2a60cca\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159039,\"headline\":\"Meta Releases Open-Weight Muse Spark Model for Developers and Coding Agents\",\"id\":142947902,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Meta StockPrice change for Meta stock in last 6 months: 9%$META Stock Price as of Oct. 15: $73752-Week High: $780$META Stock Price Target: $814What Happened?Meta Platforms (META:NASDAQ) released an open-weight version of its Muse Spark AI model on Thursday, which is built for coding and AI agents.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2c3ddee396ca73ece53c06638144cbdec296799e252e416469b8a5f3556544e9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792159020,\"headline\":\"From AI laggard to $5 Trillion: Apple's winning strategy\",\"id\":142947895,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Just weeks ago, Apple (AAPL) faced criticism for lagging behind Big Tech rivals in AI infrastructure spending. Now, the company has reportedly surpassed a $5 trillion market valuation. The 8:30 panel examines how CEO Tim Cook helped drive Apple's rise through its booming services business, disciplined capital spending, and relationships with political and global leaders, even as questions remain about its AI strategy. Bullseye American Ingenuity Fund portfolio manager Adam Johnson sits down with The 8:30 Hosts, Julie Hyman and Jake Conley, to discuss the details.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2ed0835ed96c0bed8345f4af77b00a13a5dd5f3787744fdaa3b2ad94d55acb7c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792158945,\"headline\":\"Nvidia and Apple Donate Millions for Planned White House Project\",\"id\":142947906,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Nvidia StockPrice change for Nvidia stock in last 6 months: 10%$NVDA Stock Price as of Oct. 15: $21752-Week High: $243$NVDA Stock Price Target: $329What Happened?Nvidia (NVDA:NASDAQ) and Apple each committed $25 million to President Donald Trump’s planned White House ballroom, according to a Washington Post report on Thursday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b354df6406bed59454b8c60d549dd4ff5a50db9b2ac5ce94b2024da871d1a657\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792158707,\"headline\":\"Apple opens preorders for iPhone Duo, testing demand for foldables\",\"id\":142962397,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108420800-17921724211792172418-49040978483-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792172420\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC's MacKenzie Sigalos reports on consumer demand for Apple's iPhone Duo, the company's first foldable phone, as preorders open.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e1ba74416aa7f4ad65841b596d2897ab1fb2ed677012c4e3b2aa98a6feeb9916\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792158601,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Dow Rises As Yields Rebound; Apple, Tesla Stock Gain Ground (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142945470,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Friday as Treasury yields rebound. Tesla stock jumps on its flying Roadster.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f5c8df322095b909f8e9008542fb604072afd5a9d765813c66e9d45087a3aeac\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792157901,\"headline\":\"How Much Of Apple Stock Rides On One Product?\",\"id\":142945981,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investors in Apple (AAPL) know the iPhone drives the business, but its sheer scale remains striking. The company generated $54.3 billion from iPhone sales during fiscal Q3 2026, the June quarter. That figure accounted for roughly half of its total $109.4 billion in revenue. Furthermore, iPhone sales climbed 22% from a year earlier. This outpaced the overall company, which grew 16%. So what has been pushing iPhone sales up this fast.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9c6a7b93cb149358c00aabc16ed9037ecde38c812d559b4bd8e623985fce2ee4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792157057,\"headline\":\"Apple's iPhone Duo sells out immediately. But is demand durable?\",\"id\":142945502,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Preorders for Apple's (AAPL) foldable iPhone Duo has sold out nearly immediately on Friday, placing the new device on backorder until early 2027. The 8:30 Hosts Julie Hyman and Jake Conley are joined by Bullseye American Ingenuity Fund portfolio manager Adam Johnson to discuss the consumer demand driving Apple's latest upgrade cycle.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=60eb4fb31d8f7601726e7ced613e4008dc479822e414fc414c125fc23a25572c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792156648,\"headline\":\"Apple’s first foldable iPhone sells out within minutes as preorders begin\",\"id\":142945503,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Apple shares rose 2% in premarket trading Friday after the company’s first foldable iPhone sold out shortly after preorders opened, with delivery estimates now extending to January 25 as orders continue.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=df83b5302457f3e523b0b982a573b6113d427cee6c9f823249f3edce40397336\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792154831,\"headline\":\"iPhone Duo: Apple opens pre-orders for new folding phone – and has already run out\",\"id\":142945504,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Customers will have to wait for months for the new device to arrive\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=69f7202f9dbf033051b438381d2dacb0a3ffae8ab2201959c757142ed7fa4bbb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792153080,\"headlin