      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792380611,\"headline\":\"Trump’s $330 Million White House Ballroom Donor List Reveals Nvidia, Apple and Google Among Top Tech Contributors: Report (UPDATED)\",\"id\":142992629,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Editor’s note: The story has been updated to include a comment from Nvidia. President Donald Trump’s White House ballroom project donor list reportedly reveals companies and individuals linked to federal contracts, policy decisions, and a presidential pardon. NVIDIA Corp. and...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=833bc80d9748fdde323eb686e9f8065372b20c6efd59e1202148bb04a26a5e57\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792380076,\"headline\":\"Starboard sees big upside in Skyworks after Qorvo merger, Bloomberg reports\",\"id\":142992149,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com-- Starboard Value sees significant upside in Skyworks Solutions (NASDAQ:SWKS) if the wireless chipmaker delivers on the cost savings and margin targets of its merger with Qorvo, Bloomberg News reported on Monday, citing people familiar with the matter.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e0db64bd2e9fe68b45156e9dbb2034df9a1d0fc7ee0119050ab3277262f8e3da\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792375488,\"headline\":\"AAPL, TSLA, NFLX, GME, RKLB: Why Retail Traders Couldn’t Take Their Eyes Off These Stocks Last Week\",\"id\":142992148,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Developments across technology, entertainment, retail investing, and the commercial space industry drew interest last week.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=033f4af5f4f91b753316232bf70e79ea449c1cd8db506f803ae8705ec9c6f0fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792374420,\"headline\":\"Apple’s $1,999 iPhone bet just got its first answer\",\"id\":142991441,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"iPhone Duo orders slipped into 2027 within minutes of preorders opening.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6d350d3a1c5bb185f31b310406e3583f21b061b926629db31bdc881cd2a5ad69\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792354800,\"headline\":\"The $5 Trillion Club: Which Is the Better Stock to Own, Apple or Nvidia?\",\"id\":142989165,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple and Nvidia have become the world's first $5 trillion stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=769385ceb353c54b90a8735023a78969bb89f2c26a7ee7ff8327ce04c8c4327e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792347572,\"headline\":\"Apple’s Home Segment Is Down 14% Since 2022, and It Just Got a Robot HomeView Plan. Here’s What It Means for AAPL Stock\",\"id\":142997583,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple (AAPL:NASDAQ) is already working on what comes after HomeView. In his Power On newsletter on Sunday, October 18, Bloomberg’s Mark Gurman reported that Apple plans a higher-end HomeView with a roughly 9-inch screen on a motorized arm that turns a full 360 degrees, targeted for 2027 or 2028.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ee5494857de198f27f19289ad735ec8cb471f8859347d98ba08bcc395b8a2bea\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792346402,\"headline\":\"Apple Keeps Hitting Record Highs. Bitcoin Hasn’t Set One All Year. Which Is the Better Buy?\",\"id\":142988562,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple keeps setting records while Bitcoin slides further from its peak, but the real question for retirement investors goes beyond recent performance. The winner of this comparison might surprise anyone who assumes crypto always wins the long game.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bab24ab8f21a50cc207ec710b9ea3fd9f547c88a8c55a44c4730bfcf930fe6e2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792339773,\"headline\":\"What Does Broadcom (AVGO) Face As AI Chip Supply Turns Into A Bottleneck?\",\"id\":142987948,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Broadcom (NasdaqGS:AVGO) is competing with other AI chip clients for Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Co.'s expanding advanced capacity in 2026. TSMC is reporting record profits as it scales cutting edge manufacturing for AI focused customers including Broadcom, Nvidia, and Apple. The foundry is extending its global footprint to support sustained demand for high performance computing chips used in data center AI workloads. TSMC's push to grow AI chip supply for Broadcom and peers is an...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=99ada1d69d367f1bd75eb62c3b665b465fed7b42122097d0c519a376c3167313\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792334061,\"headline\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor’s (TSM) Profit Rose 69% Last Quarter. Is the Stock Still Cheap?\",\"id\":142987420,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company Limited (NYSE:TSM) closed at $422.25 on October 15. The stock has returned 16.21% over the last six months, compared to a 15.4% return for the Insider Monkey Billionaire Index and 11.4% for the State Street SPDR S\\u0026P 500 ETF Trust. Taiwan Semiconductor does not design chips. It builds them for the […]\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=95ffac3e554a60ea084b112a2ab80b6599dc625942d23a70c55c3cabc1479544\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792330080,\"headline\":\"Own VGT? Here's How Much of It Is Really Nvidia, Apple, Microsoft, and Broadcom.\",\"id\":142986890,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"This Vanguard tech ETF has beaten the Nasdaq-100 for the past 10 years -- but its portfolio is surprisingly top-heavy with just four big names.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=997c82bec29b639e1cac57a3bdc3156b75a04e58d14b2b935bca4a0e3da0bab0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792329132,\"headline\":\"iPhone Duo Preorders Sell Out Rapidly As Delivery Estimates Slip Into January\",\"id\":142986901,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Apple StockPrice change for Apple stock in the last 6 months: 27%$AAPL Stock Price as of Oct. 16: $34352-Week High: $348$AAPL Stock Price Target: $329What Happened?Apple’s (AAPL:NASDAQ) iPhone Duo went up for preorder on Friday, and launch-day pickup inventory sold out fast.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=974f038e97f444c73d442da0b4160a9e6b37b958d3fd1e76ca6b6d6b6dfd1cf1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792314900,\"headline\":\"2 Covered Call ETFs To Shield Your Income From An AI Crash\",\"id\":142986749,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2153653956/image_2153653956.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Discover how income investors may be unknowingly exposed to the AI trade. Read the full analysis here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=490ecfb77e80f0b6a9fc7e90750ee8ce6a540d8f986965fa546a38279b896807\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792314000,\"headline\":\"What to Expect in Markets This Week: Meta, Tesla Report; Airlines, Streaming Giants’ Results Due\",\"id\":142985480,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The tech giants’ results could set the tone for other Magnificent 7 members as third-quarter earnings season picks up speed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8522880567ed0bba6d5d8b0f3acb9b39a3e40fb07418a5a1d7341721efa72a22\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792310401,\"headline\":\"Always on, always listening: New AI devices are pushing legal limits and could put users in jeopardy\",\"id\":142987859,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108359190-1788549720120-gettyimages-2293551294-6k4a4846_8nlxjv2u.jpeg?v=1788549853\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"AI always-listening wearables from Apple, Amazon, Meta and other startups are getting creative with privacy rules and fueling concerns about covert recordings.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7e2b0937b27bee019f942ad8c025e6800b66f24381cab2d9911dcc1076244abd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792306817,\"headline\":\"iPhone Duo Preorders, AAPL Crosses $5 Trillion and More: This Week in Appleverse\",\"id\":142987131,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/18/Cupertino--California--September-25--202.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Apple dominates headlines as iPhone Duo preorders surge, shares rise, market value tops $5 trillion and China AI launch plans emerge.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=27d43126d7249b1afbd2f4baa62c81e21c49fa2964c4b26097f135e575dbacab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792303200,\"headline\":\"AI Investment Impact Understated In U.S. 'It' Market: Texas Reveals\",\"id\":142984221,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/913582626/image_913582626.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Texas leads the AI infrastructure boom with data centers and chips boosting GDP and jobs. Check out this look at the tech sector and its prospects.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=03fd4bc2999d901f5bc2e52183f24910137f24e6e0bdaed3e6c5c60e0fd0eeab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792267620,\"headline\":\"Apple's Market Value Grew From $350 Billion to $5 Trillion During Tim Cook's 15 Years as CEO. Here's What That Growth Curve Means for Apple's Next Chapter Under John Ternus.\",\"id\":142963805,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Ternus has presided over several new launches in his first few weeks as CEO.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=28c149039cb32b2d3b53aa6fe40be2dfe7dae25ec8983aee0a1eb10b69911a1b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792261800,\"headline\":\"Apple bets on the same Siri AI technology with new HomeView device that led to a $250M settlement for iPhone users\",\"id\":142963202,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple just unveiled Apple HomeView — powered by Apple Intelligence with Siri AI — after agreeing to pay customers for delayed AI features on its iPhones.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d468c955d087b3ff2a500f952e4bccaa8871731585dbfc98973e958b9982f049\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792253820,\"headline\":\"Apple's new CEO just teamed up with Tim Cook's old rival\",\"id\":142962598,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"One public thank-you from Mark Zuckerberg broke a decade-long business grudge, and it raises a hard question for anyone who owns Apple stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ff17425c1eb869e9765d122e3d99e5ae144a6e1a4a420749cbcd8f39cff88ff8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792252142,\"headline\":\"$10,000 Invested in Apple Could Be Worth This Much by 2031\",\"id\":142961931,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple’s best days might be behind it, but that doesn’t mean it’s no longer a stock worth buying.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30839aa7fc60dc069948cc37c5e8fe24fa644d372c234e8f2f901824d19ec307\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792249200,\"headline\":\"Apple, Nvidia each gave $25M to Trump's White House ballroom — but the president's own name is nowhere on the donor list\",\"id\":142961930,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The controversial ballroom faces fresh scrutiny over potential conflicts of interest with big money ballroom donors and how much Trump has personally contributed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0101be04f4d3d00f158af9390b8fde359db489ad795d52554e6754356b35fa4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792248618,\"headline\":\"Apple’s $1,999 Foldable iPhone Sold Out in Minutes. Deliveries Now Slip to January\",\"id\":142961934,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple's first foldable phone sold out before most people finished their morning coffee, and the backlog stretching into late January could quietly reshape two consecutive earnings reports in ways investors may not see coming.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=567452fb05a2ff503bcd20329465fd544bbbf2144c406ec1a3acb3eeb9902fba\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792248492,\"headline\":\"Apple Hit a Record Close Ahead of Its November 2 Report. Here’s What Charging for Extra Siri AI Could Mean for the Stock\",\"id\":142961944,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Key Stats for Apple StockCurrent Price: $343. 46Target Price (Mid): ~$485Street Target: ~$329Potential Total Return: ~41%Annualized IRR: ~9% / yearWhat Happened?Apple (AAPL) closed at a record $343.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b0269afa4b5713de437e32b503c7576d3e444d305ed05da18cb901c1df9304de\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792244100,\"headline\":\"Apple's New Home Collection Gives Investors Another Reason to Remain Bullish\",\"id\":142960688,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The move into smart home products deepens Apple's customer relationship and ecosystem.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=291b467d16a547c748b48477a99782431713c2480489a92322aa14c774e9671e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792239237,\"headline\":\"What Happens When You Replace SCHD With JEPQ in a $945,000 Income Portfolio\",\"id\":142960698,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Swapping one popular income ETF for another inside a $945,000 retirement portfolio sounds simple, but the gap in annual cash flow, tax treatment, and long-term growth between these two funds is far larger than most investors expect.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ea6e107b4fc0dfdef88e1b6ea9a79fb2acdb445850440d3f3aae9891e8d6712e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792238451,\"headline\":\"Apple, Salesforce Lead Five Stocks Near Buy Points\",\"id\":142960253,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple and Salesforce are doing well while the AI buildout sector reels. Consumer and healthcare names are coming to the fore.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=53a55220f905a01a13aebe28c0e17e961ca5baaea49729d0b827fa8c8a3a40eb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792234800,\"headline\":\"China Is Paying People to Shop. It’s a Boom for Tech.\",\"id\":142959995,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Beijing’s $37 billion subsidy program is steering consumers toward smart gadgets and green technology. But the broader spending picture is getting worse.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=63fec9375b0a635f7dcf1046a08d8a10256492baa433e15b3027be571bc3f162\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792231320,\"headline\":\"Meet Warren Buffett Successor Greg Abel's Newest Investment: Bending Spoons. Should Investors Follow Suit and Buy the Stock?\",\"id\":142959994,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Greg Abel and Berkshire have been scooping up shares of the digital technology holding company.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a6ede7841f528ce1823d33414b2fe9d908b85683eb4481a07274f8a399836b70\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792228265,\"headline\":\"Apple's iPhone Duo Demand Tracking 'Solidly Out Of The Gate', Says Analyst As AAPL Stock Caps Off Best Week Since September Launch\",\"id\":142959574,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"According to TheFly, Evercore ISI said iPhone Duo delivery dates quickly pushed out to late January, or roughly 100 days, across all regions and configurations it tracks, after pre-orders began Friday.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b08a02d7f66e067f3387a4f48207c5709c1126cb667e0be2c796e3a4b3d3ce4e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792224976,\"headline\":\"Apple Is Ready to Fight Britain Over iPhone Tap-to-Pay. The Fee Is What Matters\",\"id\":142959575,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple (AAPL) is preparing to fight a UK push to open iPhone tap-to-pay to rival wallets, the Financial Times reported on Friday, October 16. The Competition and Markets Authority (CMA) is set to publish consultation proposals that would let iPhone users choose a wallet other than Apple Pay for contactless payments.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=03b86736052856794855bd2192c4d1b13f43f99979a973367a24e9dc4f80bcad\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792224010,\"headline\":\"Benzinga Bulls and Bears: Palantir, Apple, Six Flags\",\"id\":142960594,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Bulls-and-Bears-1.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Benzinga examined the prospects for many investors’ favorite stocks over the last week — here’s a look at some of our top stories.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2d872d2287cd5b5895c057cb900e541682ebd568ca3462d53df99b35d1a2cbab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792219587,\"headline\":\"AI Stocks Are The Next Dividend Growers\",\"id\":142959766,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5722824035d1917292ff4d4e40f7308d3a403a43dc80ec4cb139fb94982c7c30\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792205205,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk’s Roadster, Nvidia’s Space AI Push, Nadella’s Security Warning: Mag 7 Voices This Week\",\"id\":142957830,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Elon Musk said Tesla’s long-awaited Roadster will enter production in 2028, though he has acknowledged that the car is unlikely to materially affect the company’s revenue.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a6168d913bbf8963671ca3b4041506abaf86c19aad935a92b69cdcc5e92c9e2e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792199379,\"headline\":\"Will Starlink Mobile matter for Apple?\",\"id\":142955129,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Starlink Mobile could challenge Apple’s (NASDAQ) iPhone sales model by disrupting US carrier subsidies, although the near-term earnings impact appears limited, according to Bank of America.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=391c7089e250a9d43931937833afac2380198e6ac2026e6c4f90c6b1266d9187\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792197000,\"headline\":\"The AI Supercycle, Asia, And Why This Time Is Different\",\"id\":142958070,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2209095196/image_2209095196.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The AI race is about more than who builds the best model. Click here to read more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=38742d1d5916af83c5350ce68f0ddd46c425ebcdfad5d8e9debba1de9eaf54f6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792196076,\"headline\":\"What Apple Holders Bought Into\",\"id\":142956188,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The story of Apple over the past year now includes a foldable iPhone launch, a new CEO on stage, and fresh legal fire directed at a high profile AI rival. Holding Apple over the past year would have returned 36.6%, including dividends. If you had been deciding back on 16 October 2025, what would you have needed to believe about AI, pricing power, and hardware reinvention before any of that news hit the tape? The move put Apple in the middle of this trade. Scan 55 AI infrastructure stocks for...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=707820418ec412ad09b2035b72edf2677aaaef801de7e0f039f6b78f3918dc8b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792193340,\"headline\":\"Berkshire’s Mind-Bender\",\"id\":142951514,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Why is Berkshire Hathaway betting on richly valued Bending Spoons?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c6a9b17f60c29c9d3068cbf922fc36c67cd93fe26e3f548df2dda19426184833\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792193340,\"headline\":\"Prediction: Alphabet Will Be a Larger Company Than Apple by the End of 2027\",\"id\":142951497,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"If Alphabet keeps doing what it has been doing, it could claim the title of the world's second-largest company.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=dff21cdd71a1021e2d7bbc55f3d41fe78fdffb41bda1c9e790f30bb28163a3e6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792190160,\"headline\":\"Taiwan Semiconductor Posts Record Q3 Results: Time to Buy the Dip?\",\"id\":142951501,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"With strong earnings momentum and a favorable growth outlook, TSM may be an attractive stock to consider following the recent market pullback.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=05c0647d23b323f4b13b3204299f611d6eb57e324c0e9a18dd0b9382e33ed6c9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792188934,\"headline\":\"Nasdaq 100 Records Worst Week In 18 Months As Investors Steer Clear Of Chipmakers — AAPL, MSTR, UBER, SOXX In Focus\",\"id\":142951516,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Philadelphia Semiconductor Index fell for an eighth straight day, the longest slide since 2008.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2af2d3960e50359a62f9486b8f577a4ffa6f892290f3d2f757a0c9e96c1bb9fc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792187374,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today, Oct. 16: Apple Edges Higher on iPhone Duo Preorder Surge\",\"id\":142950783,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"On Oct. 16, 2026, preorders for the new iPhone Duo sold out quickly, stretching delivery estimates into January.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8760fa2b760ec495891c243172b61d8880f629c24c105b7efeb44c945884b3b7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792184820,\"headline\":\"This is the Cheapest Mag 7 Stock Right Now\",\"id\":142951517,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Mag 7 is back. Several of the stocks are hitting new highs but there are still deals.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d47c4473ccaa3d5c01009cab96d98d9228e66494094fd44fe3410b0702fd9bb9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792180146,\"headline\":\"Sector Update: Tech Stocks Fall Late Afternoon\",\"id\":142950013,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tech stocks were lower late Friday afternoon, with the State Street Technology Select Sector SPDR ET\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=1229d4787c40b7b8f11a55216fdc1bf6ac0d2db8b66023404a67249f422305a0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179932,\"headline\":\"Can Apple's Duo hype offset soft iPhone 18 demand?\",\"id\":142950006,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Preorders for Apple's (AAPL) foldable iPhone Duo sold out within minutes on Friday. Creative Strategies president and principal analyst Carolina Milanesi sits down with Ines Ferré to talk about what the demand for the Duo model means for the iPhone 18 lineup.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b4c5f229f006c0df5387b67c3da6c8cfdbf80359c9a1dd7ecdd2a8172420a8a1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179794,\"headline\":\"9 Dow Jones Stocks Make Bullish Moves In A Defensive Market Rotation\",\"id\":142950007,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A week that tested the financial markets showed the resilience of Dow Jones stocks. Apple and Coca-Cola were among nine standouts.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=af9cc9e28f3a10ea2145e9aa2ce346b5f10ea949ca6edd0654727a5baaf6a007\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179277,\"headline\":\"iPhone Duo already backordered until 2027 as pre-order sales soar\",\"id\":142950008,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Consumer demand for Apple's first foldable phone is strong despite the device's hefty $1,999 price tag.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=16603b60e699bd57c649c912acc2158f422bfb4534474401ad98179157cdc37b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792179266,\"headline\":\"Apple is Now the Top-Performing Magnificent 7 Stock in 2026. Here’s why it’s Beating NVIDIA, Tesla, and Amazon\",\"id\":142949982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple (NASDAQ: AAPL) has emerged as the best-performing Magnificent Seven stock of 2026, outperforming NVIDIA (NVDA), Microsoft (MSFT), Amazon (AMZN), Alphabet (GOOGL), Meta Platforms (META), and Tesla (TSLA). But what's driving Apple's surprising rally while other AI stocks struggle? In this episode, 24/7 Wall St.'s Eric Bleeker examines why Apple shares have surged more than 27% in 2026, even as concerns about artificial intelligence spending are weighing on some of the market's biggest technology companies. While competitors are committing hundreds of billions of dollars to AI data centers, Apple is taking a different approach. Its strategy emphasizes on-device artificial intelligence, privacy, and integrating AI directly into its ecosystem, avoiding much of the enormous infrastructure spending burden facing its rivals. Eric breaks down Apple's latest earnings, its massive share repurchase program, and why investors are increasingly rewarding the company's capital-efficient AI strategy. He also compares the Magnificent Seven's performance in 2026 against their remarkable returns since the beginning of 2023, revealing a very different picture of the AI investment boom. Has Apple become the market's ultimate AI safe-haven stock? And could its strategy continue outperforming NVIDIA and the rest of Big Tech?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f831231eaab13eb8aeb433db1cbbdbf1fe067161173a318013a30dfc63d8ee53\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792174800,\"headline\":\"From 2009 to 2026 and Beyond, Apple Has Remained 1 of the Most Valuable Companies in the World: Here's the Most Important Takeaway for Investors\",\"id\":142949992,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"At a market capitalization of $5 trillion right now, Apple trails only Nvidia.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d557ff6507f195ad47983bbf2a3abc6d8c98c53f6ba49967408044cb766e201a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792174412,\"headline\":\"iPhone Duo preorder frenzy pushes waits into 2027, and Apple won’t say if stores will have stock next week\",\"id\":142962390,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108422013-1792188930047-1792188598-49045092209-hd.jpg?v=1792188928\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC’s MacKenzie Sigalos reports on the early rush for Apple’s $1,999 foldable and the unanswered question around launch-day supply.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=84d5ee674a008cf5b600596d38d85e84e02483a0f8d6a1ac58a110b85e7fc72d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792173180,\"headline\":\"Coca-Cola, Visa and Mastercard Hit Records as Investors Rotate Out of Chip Stocks\",\"id\":142950011,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Coca-Cola, Visa and Mastercard are among the stocks hitting records as investors look beyond the AI trade. Earnings could help broaden the rally.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4ad8f758684d92953fbd2de585f964a4e73e883937172f558367ac5c9e40beba\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792171448,\"headline\":\"Stock Market Today: Nasdaq Stung As ServiceNow Dives After Breakout; Tesla Comes Back To Earth (Live Coverage)\",\"id\":142949018,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The Dow Jones index rises Friday while the Nasdaq struggles with tech losses.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d5cd786ad165f12d775928099bab942a363ca5a483bbbb360408b685c51b9c92\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170388,\"headline\":\"The Next Stock Market Crash Could Start With Just 3 Companies\",\"id\":142948989,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Just three companies now account for approximately 21% of the S\\u0026P 500's total market capitalization. NVIDIA (NVDA), Apple (AAPL), and Microsoft (MSFT) have become so dominant that their performance could determine the direction of the entire stock market. But what happens if these technology giants stumble? In this episode, 24/7 Wall St. co-founder Doug McIntyre and senior writer Lee Jackson discuss the extraordinary concentration of the S\\u0026P 500 and why millions of investors may be taking on more risk than they realize. Much of today's market enthusiasm is driven by artificial intelligence. Companies like NVIDIA, Microsoft, Alphabet (GOOGL), Amazon (AMZN), and Meta Platforms (META) have benefited from enormous expectations for AI growth. But Doug and Lee identify several potential threats to that optimism. They explore how cheaper open-source AI models could challenge industry leaders, why opposition to AI data center construction threatens expansion plans, and how growing electricity demand is driving renewed interest in nuclear power. Most importantly, they discuss what could happen to popular index funds like the SPDR S\\u0026P 500 ETF (SPY) if the market's largest technology stocks suffer a major sell-off. They also examine whether equal-weight S\\u0026P 500 funds could provide investors with better diversification. Is your S\\u0026P 500 investment more vulnerable than you think?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ab98f35bc89dbdfbba2d5bb3c55f635e436e1332b1ab7a49092a897f1a8ae3f7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170383,\"headline\":\"Nvidia and Apple Each Gave $25 Million to Trump’s White House Ballroom\",\"id\":142948990,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Confidential documents reveal that two of the world's most valuable tech companies quietly wrote identical checks to fund a new White House ballroom, and neither one sent out a press release. The real question is what each company expects to get back.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d21c891d39bf5dd2d3275dffe290c7ddcf2c56f5c8b90274001eb50985dd3df5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170029,\"headline\":\"Apple Is Up Nearly 12X in 10 Years. Can It Repeat That Run?\",\"id\":142949011,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple turned $10,000 into $127,753 over the last decade, but a $5 trillion market cap changes the math in ways most investors overlook. Here is what the model says your money could realistically become by 2031, and which risks could derail even the bull case.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3dd0e7396d09a0088c52ac9bc78c86c60d50e0a1a77e3456da2d7d95080b9d55\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792170000,\"headline\":\"How Does Apple’s Siri Compete in an Agentic World?\",\"id\":142950012,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Is Apple’s dedication to privacy holding Siri AI back? Cybersecurity reporter Bob McMillan, personal tech columnist Nicole Nguyen and Apple reporter Rolfe Winkler debate the tradeoffs of giving agents access to your personal accounts and information.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=092262d3aea6d79fbe832625a21270b393c26f141de42a87d112dad0f2252310\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169688,\"headline\":\"CNBC TechCheck Evening Edition: October 16, 2026\",\"id\":142962391,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108421623-TC-Clean-101626.jpg?v=1792183926\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC's TechCheck brings you the latest in tech news from CNBC's 1 Market in the heart of San Francisco.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=530a6bac4cd931436f37191c2cf18170a5e7650170c8f36af8cbb7fd96f70b9f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792169127,\"headline\":\"Apple and Alphabet Are Especially Scared of a Blue Wave\",\"id\":142949012,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple and Alphabet just posted record quarters, but a single election outcome could gut the profit streams funding their biggest bets. Here is why the political calendar may matter more than the earnings beat.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=072f9363aa886b1e7ccf544f8191da043de475f755afc301fa8ac3716b61d897\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168465,\"headline\":\"AAPL Stock Adds 1% As It Prepares To Tackle UK Regulators Over Apple Pay Dominance\",\"id\":142949013,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The U.K.’s Competition and Markets Authority is set to push Apple to open its contact-free payment infrastructure to third-party providers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=84a9d6ecbc556a3dbf3dee6390e000c2054c7eafa69a85eaace773b2aec8403b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168200,\"headline\":\"Tesla, SpaceX, CoreWeave, Lam Research, Netflix, Strategy, and More Stocks That Explain Today’s Market\",\"id\":142949020,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Tesla stock falls after the electric-vehicle maker unveils its new Roadster sports car. It can fly.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9535931db153ab9e8b897789d427320a83395b88da07124f45f2f8902ba66be5\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792168020,\"headline\":\"Apple faces growing iPhone demand concerns as delivery wait times shrink, UBS warns\",\"id\":142949014,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UBS has warned that shortening delivery times for Apple Inc (NASDAQ:AAPL, XETRA:APC)’s latest iPhones could signal weaker demand and put its revenue forecasts at risk, despite resilient sales across key markets. The bank found that average waiting times for the iPhone 18 Pro fell by about...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5284d83acfab055117cb5c08fe542f94bcccc90459a7f3c8e7230d6b04d698bb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167910,\"headline\":\"iPhone Duo in Short Supply After Shipments Slip Into 2027\",\"id\":142949015,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Shipping estimates for Apple Inc.'s first folding phone slipped into January within minutes of the company taking preorders on Friday, suggesting that strong demand and short supply will make the $1,999 device challenging to purchase on its Oct. 23 release date or in the near future. Bloomberg's Anurag Rana joins Bloomberg Intelligence to discuss.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0611cb57202bfe4bbfaf025c950c14bccaed8fe3cfec6075f3d9413cbe88cb2a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167660,\"headline\":\"Why Fox Can Finally Breathe a Sigh of Relief With the Roku Deal—and Why the NFL Can’t\",\"id\":142949021,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Fox’s acquisition gives the media titan a way to deliver its programming directly to views, a huge plus for its Sunday NFL games.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f80eb47cadd807f125a1b361bc27f5c5a5d8a15516c88adc9c5e5172f66b1199\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167490,\"headline\":\"We are Only 'Third Inning Relative to this AI Game,' Says Dan Ives\",\"id\":142949024,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Three CoreWeave Inc. co-founders have sold $3.3 billion in company shares since last year's initial public offering, taking money off the table as rising credit risks and investor wariness around AI spending spark volatility in the stock. Dan Ives, Partner at Yorkville \\u0026 Ives, discusses volatility relative to the AI trade and the outlook for stocks like Coreweave and Apple in particular.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=205aaef6621a0b3549418a80043887764e8070b786e87486f719f6b3f4c1c10f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167480,\"headline\":\"Big Tech Earnings Suddenly Matter for the Bond Market\",\"id\":142949022,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Falling Treasury yields suggest growing concern about the AI boom, putting pressure on Big Tech’s coming earnings reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5f18c901a76fa366ab22d6cd3ce50431f7996cafba44d6ba35446f24bc6e76c1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792167019,\"headline\":\"Apple and Samsung Are Nearly Tied as Global Phone Shipments Collapse\",\"id\":142949016,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"A memory shortage has sent smartphone shipments into historic freefall, but Apple and Samsung are locked in a near-dead heat at the top while smaller rivals collapse. The question is whether Apple's premium armor can hold as costs keep climbing into 2027.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=95579c740ea0ecd8c33a7a73c916ed6c7b69373bfa178010ee293b6fe36442d1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166361,\"headline\":\"Apple calls iPhone Duo demand ‘nothing short of extraordinary’\",\"id\":142962392,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108421483-1792181764314-1792180547-49043015263-hd.jpg?v=1792181761\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC’s MacKenzie Sigalos reports on Apple’s claim of extraordinary preorder demand as launch-day inventory disappears and delivery dates slip into late January.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4ac0d664169347135d8b07d4ac5ff51a6ba8a4977b13a1f96b05f553a27b6940\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792166251,\"headline\":\"Apple Could Face Downside Risk From Declining Wait Times for New iPhone Models, UBS Says\",\"id\":142949017,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",