DA) as the only other company to cross the milestone.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=988ec279059a9eda4724021dd792515ac9cd681cd49641ce70896953f790d0f0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792070205,\"headline\":\"Apple and Meta team up to make Muse AI model run on Mac computers\",\"id\":142919960,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108415212-17920844381792084435-49019339027-1080pnbcnews.jpg?v=1792084437\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Apple and Meta are collaborating to let developers run Meta’s massive Muse Spark Open AI model locally on high-end Mac computers. CNBC's MacKenzie Sigalos reports.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=3213ecbdc943104ddc5d731742e13c74aca3324e82410fc87000eab0cccadf6d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792069484,\"headline\":\"'Apple and Meta team up to make Muse AI model run on Mac computers' - CNBC\",\"id\":142945155,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/15/apple-meta-partner-ai.html\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=be3bcb708650c7097da30653a93f4fbde7596761d3997e6fde3daef2af76c4f3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792069239,\"headline\":\"If You Invest $1,000 in Apple Today, Here’s What It Could Be Worth by 2030\",\"id\":142916230,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple just posted its ninth straight earnings beat and sits near all-time highs, but whether that momentum carries through 2030 depends on forces the market is already starting to question.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d85047dd0e4f9c14075cb7b98ea9e25256d641c5a75ed77889408cc9ceb5012a\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792069201,\"headline\":\"Apple and Meta team up to make Muse AI model run on Mac computers \",\"id\":142919961,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/10