90/image_2264776790.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Apple faces soft iPhone demand, rising chip costs, and a 39x P/E despite a modest growth outlook. Click here to read my most recent analysis on AAPL stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=16cc651ffc01321370ed2142c52d429666026d3443b2988b4e996c7367de1a99\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792065520,\"headline\":\"KeyBanc downgrades Cirrus Logic after Asia trip, sees memory and analog strength\",\"id\":142913376,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- KeyBanc Capital Markets downgraded Cirrus Logic to Sector Weight from Overweight following a research trip to Asia, while raising estimates across memory and analog chipmakers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=030121eaf064637cb0b97535e7062ccf1f0b232daa44301e341f2b02c4ce21bb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792064840,\"headline\":\"Apple Intelligence Gets a China Launch Date, but Apple’s China Sales Were Already Up 22%\",\"id\":142913090,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple (AAPL:NASDAQ) chairman Tim Cook said on Thursday, October 15, that a test version of Apple Intelligence will reach users in China later this month, Reuters reported. He said it in an interview with state-backed outlet The Paper in Shanghai.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=412f00e4e2777aa001836b58b98a1e640bcd1ee28bc0bde49ab03387f65b07fe\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792063202,\"headline\":\"Broadcom vs. SK Hynix: Which Technology Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?\",\"id\":142912373,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"SK Hynix trades at a fraction of Broadcom's valuation despite stronger profit margins, but faces steeper cyclical risks in the memory market.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=7f34d406ecfeb55b9024dd67e7734cba92536b11355ff86b5ccd6df3d4894f96\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062916,\"headline\":\"Apple Needs Just a 7% Gain to Become the World’s Most Valuable Company\",\"id\":142912133,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple and NVIDIA now sit within striking distance of each other at the top of the market cap rankings, but the reason one trades near its all-time high while the other lags tells a more complicated story about which giant investors actually trust.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fbb350064c370c9ed4bbebac782d2627634a4bc563192054e4e95d808852f0e0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062741,\"headline\":\"AMD: TSMC Just Fired A $175 Billion Warning Shot\",\"id\":142918991,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2279241831/image_2279241831.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.'s pullback may be a buy: agentic AI boosts EPYC/Instinct demand, TSMC N2 ramp improves supply and margins. Click for this AMD update.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4c743e8cb264e7e7dc95edeac1c35100c01a67a4fa22d85149ac6a9747e8d3c2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792062572,\"headline\":\"Defensives Lead Sectors In Thursday Trading As Technology Trails\",\"id\":142945157,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Stock-Market-Trading-Chart-And-Analyzing.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Seven sectors are higher and four are lower in Thursday’s regular session, with defensive sectors holding two of the top three positions. The leaders are separated rather than clustered, with Health Care sitting well above the next group.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=294a216817942afe6103c7aa12a4cb1690de64bea2ea80630f7af70f64ef1cda\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792060560,\"headline\":\"Intel, Marvell, CoreWeave, TSMC, Apple, and More Stocks That Explain Today’s Market\",\"id\":142912368,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"AI stocks tumble as a hot inflation reading and Anthropic’s slowing revenue growth extend the tech selloff.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=71cfe2135e8ab4e784459e25cfcf142b2d658af8c100a0915bf9f50a609c4f05\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792059543,\"headline\":\"Premarket Movers: AAPL Gains On China AI Approval Report — Why WMT, NFLX Stocks Are Also Rising\",\"id\":142912369,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple has been preparing to introduce its AI platform in mainland China following a lengthy regulatory delay.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d8141f3a09a78cb40928b8f365eaeaaba4af64c1f7ef29e740a525d6c45dcf0e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792059540,\"headline\":\"Nvidia, Apple, Broadcom in 'fierce' battle to get chip manufacturing space at TSMC\",\"id\":142919949,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108411127-1792020231674-TSMC_Katie.jpg?v=1792020295\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Soaring AI demand is constraining capacity at Taiwan Semiconductor, threatening to slow the AI buildout. Tech giants Nvidia, Apple, AMD and Broadcom are locked in an \\\"extremely fierce\\\" battle for space on TSMC factory lines. That's made the one man in charge of TSMC wafer allocation \\\"the most popular person on the planet” and created a rich opportunity for Intel, as customers look to the foundry arm of the U.S. chip manufacturer for an alternate source. CNBC visited a TSMC event to learn more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a515f3ccbb74dc13bedde904e79843ec262d0e66440a17247819619c3ffa2bb9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792059393,\"headline\":\"Taiwan chipmaker TSMC explores Texas investment to expand production in the US\",\"id\":142910472,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"HONG KONG (AP) — Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Co. is exploring potential investments in Texas to expand its chip production in the United States, the advanced chipmaker said after posting another record profit on strong artificial intelligence demand.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=49634ca1d7a3e06682c8b61a7627b87d5a1c6f77c5f54af54bfc37a4ecf855eb\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792058865,\"headline\":\"Can robust TSMC earnings help settle AI jitters?\",\"id\":142910483,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com - TSMC posted a $23.59 billion net profit for the third quarter of 2026, a 68.7% year-over-year surge that marked its sixth consecutive record quarter, yet the earnings beat has done little to arrest a deepening selloff across AI-linked semiconductor stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e1aef95b751339fd4df5655ddf5aef11c7465d0d0f9bbe2d5306ccc398f9a8bd\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792056996,\"headline\":\"Apple Now Faces Its Own Trade-Secret Claims From OpenAI.\",\"id\":142908363,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple (AAPL:NASDAQ) is now on the receiving end of trade-secret claims in its own fight with OpenAI. In a filing in federal court in San Jose on Tuesday, OpenAI alleged that an employee who left for Apple sent more than 100 files about an unreleased OpenAI device to a personal account.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=94e4a6a66735bbdf4a0e14fa67f08750bcbcf583ecfe6bdd26078ef9954bde9b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792055466,\"headline\":\"Apple Wins The AI Ecosystem Story As It Retests 2026 Peaks\",\"id\":142915042,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1486989073/image_1486989073.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Apple (AAPL) hold outlook: asset-light iOS/AI ecosystem and buybacks support cash flow, but supply/inflation risks and a stretched P/E signal consolidation. See more.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=956355a06373edbf32c86d06a171840f617b78b6c8b8b0237a3824ecb823ba48\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792055100,\"headline\":\"Apple Could Dominate the Agentic AI Market With Siri. Just Not This Siri.\",\"id\":142906878,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The latest Siri competitor leaves Apple's agent behind.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e7012a66f7e04be10e33bd92bd9b6f389c076f610b5d8bece642265ec738c96b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792053000,\"headline\":\"Omdia: Global Smartphone Market Shrinks 20% in 3Q26 as Memory Crisis Reshapes Competition\",\"id\":142908365,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"LONDON, October 15, 2026--According to Omdia’s preliminary estimates, global smartphone shipments fell 20% year on year in 3Q26, a sharp acceleration from the 6% decline recorded in the previous quarter. Shipments also declined sequentially despite new flagship launches and channel preparations for the year-end festive season. Persistent memory and storage cost pressures have constrained pricing flexibility and prompted vendors to scale back shipments of low-margin devices.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fe8a4ed6b4f965ad6db1eb742549d0e3235ca3a3824471f2472db525857b687e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792050600,\"headline\":\"Can Apple Overtake Nvidia as the World's Largest Company in 2027?\",\"id\":142903568,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Nvidia is growing at a much faster pace than Apple.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=b805a0e53c2ba9ff2bd76090af52e8d1dc22c42a1c022150e1ec0581dcabf2a2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792049176,\"headline\":\"Apple Intelligence Reportedly Nears China Debut After Delays. What to Expect\",\"id\":142916153,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/15/Basel--Switzerland---December-23--2024-A.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Apple is trending Thursday after a Bloomberg report that it plans to release Apple Intelligence in mainland China in December.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=07dd5b2a2e6bf04d705842c292602520f63a2a829467eccb23e5169e14937af1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792045800,\"headline\":\"Wall Street Breakfast Podcast: CoreWeave CEO Defends The Math\",\"id\":142910112,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1645923179/image_1645923179.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"CoreWeave's CEO blames an irrational market. Apple joins Nvidia in the $5T club. Wrangler is getting the spotlight.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=c877ce5b2ea0db70ba83b928cf6403d0cdc01c39f0b3fde3b358e01a6d31f86d\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792045740,\"headline\":\"Wedgewood Partners Q3 2026 Portfolio Activity\",\"id\":142910113,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2266615986/image_2266615986.jpg?io=g