id=96ad35f5ef177e04917a658689de84478274bbf6edf6e6f298c9a08636fefbf6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791977705,\"headline\":\"Apple Has Found No Evidence To Support OpenAI's Allegations; Says Apple Has Searched For The One File That OpenAI Has Identified, But Has Not Found It On Any Apple System; Co Has Strict Policies \\u0026 Procedures In Place To Help Ensure That New Employees Don't Use Any Confidential Information From Prior Employer; Says OpenAI Has Failed To Respond To Apple’s Request For More Information That Would Aid In Its Investigation\",\"id\":142916162,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"- Reuters\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=584a9179b71e565acf2c8d6d58bb44de4f63056b63bc98472131259126f66e89\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791976858,\"headline\":\"OpenAI Brief In Apple Vs OpenAI Lawsuit Say Files Leaked Include Detailed Unreleased Device Images, Engineering Data, Supplier Info; Says Apple Has Not Assured It Is Not In Possession Of \\u0026 Has Not Used OpenAI Confidential Data; Files Leaked By Employee Also Include Manufacturing Data About Devices\",\"id\":142916163,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"- Reuters\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=393c570a034f1bff7ded6845c27d3a9832f27631725c146bcea05519d4f0941b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791976537,\"headline\":\"Qualcomm at $175: The Narrative Shift Sending Capital Out The Door\",\"id\":142880292,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Qualcomm is betting its future on AI and data center chips while its smartphone business bleeds, and the December quarter will prove whether that bet pays off or exposes a company caught between two worlds.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=08714d8106490160a7244c7a21ec26acc30f2912cc96dde1e0a366424123e8fa\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"date