uation risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4dec8b5b5720f7e9056d00404af5ebee7f0305f36229ce5fdd892bc8f42ff9dc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791973683,\"headline\":\"Jamie Dimon Warns Of Forces That “Continue To Shift Under The Surface,” As Half Of Russell 3000 Stocks Sit In A Bear Market With The S\\u0026P 500 Near Records\",\"id\":142877705,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Jamie Dimon says dangerous forces are shifting beneath a seemingly calm surface, and the stock market tells a strikingly similar story. The index near record highs conceals a hidden collapse spreading quietly across hundreds of stocks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=30e0f2baff4fab7928045e56b1a5a768cbb6b86bebe30ac8154d0a2fb211212e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791973390,\"headline\":\"Apple makes its biggest smart-home push yet under CEO John Ternus\",\"id\":142886024,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108408831-1791987349281-1791985578392-davidlivingstonesocials.jpg?v=1791987347\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"CNBC’s MacKenzie Sigalos reports on Apple’s new HomeView display, expanded home hardware lineup, and why the launch is a major test of its rebuilt Siri AI.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=09d559d8c994fa92754bd4bfa4c4adf2a80a325822ba67fa81cf2371330b3432\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791972000,\"headline\":\"Apple's new hardware strategy capitalizes on trust — just in time for the AI era\",\"id\":142881633,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Apple's smart home strategy is about selling more hardware. But it's also about more tightly binding iPhone customers to its ecosystem.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=16dadb061ad8534d1d06dd8d04f1703ec51312c7435878e4aca78a336ae4f574\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791971893,\"headline\":\"Mexico President Says She Will Sign Decree On Wednesday To Order Digital Platforms To Protect Minors From Violent And Sexual Content; Mexico To Give Platforms One Month To Come Into Compliance With Decree\",\"id\":142883670,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"- Reuters \",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4545724b67107e0883f11d5bfa3f292fac112b677671629d5973a0afd32f476b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791969032,\"headline\":\"Micron: China Just Broke The Memory Supercycle Story\",\"id\":142882179,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2236033593/image_2236033593.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Micron faces rising China DRAM competition, cyclical memory pricing, rich valuation, and AI demand risks. Click for more on MU stock.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8ecd4d7dd3938859ecf6f9116d464f66415b1c1c7f6edef4c6849204228e92b9\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1791968899,\"headline\":\"Wall Street’s ‘Last Men Standing’: The Mag 7 Are Propping Up the S\\u0026P 500, Then Why Are Your ETFs at Risk?\",\"id\":142882440,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/14/Los-Angeles--California---21-April-2024-.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"AAPL\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The Mag 7 are propping up the S\\u0026amp;P 500 as market breadth weakens. Here’s why SPY and QQQ investors may face hidden concentration risks.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=60c43cae72d440860589299178050fac116d435b1f33204fe618c9f650dac9fc\"}]"
