     "content": {
      "size": 17526,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "[{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792392731,\"headline\":\"Microsoft Walks Away From Nscale’s UK Data Center as the Grid Runs Out of Power\",\"id\":142997609,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft (MSFT:NASDAQ) has pulled out of a planned AI data center in Loughton, Essex, that British cloud provider Nscale was building for it, Reuters reported on October 18, citing the Telegraph. Microsoft is one of Nscale’s two largest customers.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=77d9d8bfb9bee72de133f0d26ae9f7d6aa81123f76e39ea4a330dd955bb47c59\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792390194,\"headline\":\"The Bet Behind Tieto's Rally\",\"id\":142994906,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"One concrete shift for Tieto in this period was its deepening AI partnership with Microsoft, aimed at integrating new tools into long standing client contracts rather than chasing one off projects. For Tieto shareholders, the return over the past year was 20.4%, including dividends. If you had been deciding on 16 October 2025 whether to buy, what would you have needed to believe about those AI efforts and cost cuts before the later earnings headlines arrived? The easy part of this move is...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9270c233430bc08500f18b366a067338ce46e76dc7533200b4d27d2c32a53bdc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792380611,\"headline\":\"Trump’s $330 Million White House Ballroom Donor List Reveals Nvidia, Apple and Google Among Top Tech Contributors: Report (UPDATED)\",\"id\":142992629,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Editor’s note: The story has been updated to include a comment from Nvidia. President Donald Trump’s White House ballroom project donor list reportedly reveals companies and individuals linked to federal contracts, policy decisions, and a presidential pardon. NVIDIA Corp. and...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=833bc80d9748fdde323eb686e9f8065372b20c6efd59e1202148bb04a26a5e57\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792374806,\"headline\":\"What Would Stop The AI Selloff\",\"id\":142994131,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=f81e56ca69a5fcfaacd77d3a9630d96359897268651205c32cb90015cce769d2\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792357500,\"headline\":\"Some Investors Are Questioning the AI Trade. Microsoft Is Bucking the Trend\",\"id\":142989167,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Azure's growth and Copilot's position in enterprise AI make Microsoft a smart AI play.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=ff35a4a3386611f185444efefec578170d0e502541a8bd27f6b93751b1fc61b7\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792330080,\"headline\":\"Own VGT? Here's How Much of It Is Really Nvidia, Apple, Microsoft, and Broadcom.\",\"id\":142986890,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"This Vanguard tech ETF has beaten the Nasdaq-100 for the past 10 years -- but its portfolio is surprisingly top-heavy with just four big names.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=997c82bec29b639e1cac57a3bdc3156b75a04e58d14b2b935bca4a0e3da0bab0\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792329011,\"headline\":\"Top 3 British Penny Stocks To Watch In October 2026\",\"id\":142986902,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"UK investors are watching the AI boom run into funding roadblocks, as seen with Microsoft walking away from a major British data centre deal. Big projects can stall when debt markets get tougher. Yet smaller listed businesses with cleaner balance sheets still have room to move. This article picks out three financially solid low priced UK stocks that aim to give you exposure without relying on heavy borrowing. The three stocks highlighted here offer a compelling starting point if you want...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a01205eafd5fba1b3d6846ac6bd3d4e6f1b040800b43ca7cbf9bfdd804e7f01f\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792318285,\"headline\":\"3 UK Grid Stocks Retail Investors Are Watching for AI Data Centre Power\",\"id\":142984629,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft’s decision to pull the plug on its anchor AI data centre deal with Nscale has thrown fresh light on a less glamorous but critical piece of the story: the UK’s power grid. While neocloud operators fight for funding and contracts, electricity networks and equipment providers still control the literal on switch for AI. This piece walks through three UK Power and Grid Infrastructure Enablers exposed to that shift and why they deserve a closer look right now. The stocks covered below are...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=6b6c1704734a29d752cd6a9c72ca62e5bfcc3f298beb11af374bd4a1f9263af3\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792317173,\"headline\":\"Microsoft pulls out of UK data centre deal with Nscale, Telegraph reports\",\"id\":142984198,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Microsoft (NASDAQ) has withdrawn from a planned UK data centre agreement with artificial intelligence infrastructure provider Nscale, potentially complicating the British company’s initial public offering plans, according to the Telegraph.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=853494d3498dd63d09406def43814b44a1cf00dada6b2eac44b47d63a106b801\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792312981,\"headline\":\"Where Will Microsoft Stock Be in 2030?\",\"id\":142983253,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Earnings rose 22% last fiscal year. What's the stock worth if growth cools to 13%?\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2c6fb008f942f29ba72f6dac65494eff81cf93c36b5ffc0bf565ea99ee4ba5c8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792312270,\"headline\":\"Microsoft Scraps UK Data Center Deal With Nscale, Telegraph Says\",\"id\":142986229,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft Corp. has pulled out of a UK data center deal with British neocloud Nscale at a critical time for the startup’s initial public offering hopes, the Telegraph reported.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0404698d37ae0470876a3d08c806c15c45ff75be24b431f9bcc70a82954b7a1c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792310940,\"headline\":\"Haleon And 2 British AI Healthcare Stocks To Watch\",\"id\":142979144,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"America’s vast AI infrastructure build is starting to look more fragile, and that matters for UK investors watching where the real value sits in artificial intelligence. Hardware projects can stall when financing or public support weakens. Software that helps doctors work faster and make better calls in hospitals can keep scaling with fewer physical bottlenecks. This article highlights three UK listed AI driven healthcare stocks from our screener. The three stocks in this article are just a...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=9c6c08bc21ed5f9f3b22c3198b90eb8a49e3377212afc05a513811f2a382a344\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792303801,\"headline\":\"3 Quality Stocks With ROE Over 30%\",\"id\":142975766,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Interest payments on US government debt now cost about US$3b a day, which concentrates attention on balance sheet strength wherever you invest. When public finances look stretched, investors often care more about companies that generate solid returns on shareholder capital and keep their own debt under control. This article highlights three stocks that combine high return on equity, resilient historic execution and clean finances from our strong balance sheet screen. The three examples in...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bad6913cf1ee0c0dabbae09aebd6a4f7f5bef9d8366b58aaa1a1b83c2fe7700c\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792303200,\"headline\":\"AI Investment Impact Understated In U.S. 'It' Market: Texas Reveals\",\"id\":142984221,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/913582626/image_913582626.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Texas leads the AI infrastructure boom with data centers and chips boosting GDP and jobs. Check out this look at the tech sector and its prospects.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=03fd4bc2999d901f5bc2e52183f24910137f24e6e0bdaed3e6c5c60e0fd0eeab\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792275791,\"headline\":\"Chamath Palihapitiya Says 6% Treasury Yield Could ‘Run Over’ AI Businesses\",\"id\":142987113,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/18/A-hand-holding-a-glowing-futuristic-AI-t.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Chamath Palihapitiya warns that rising bond yields could threaten debt-dependent businesses and force Big Tech to step in.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=bc29b41dde8b8f074f12e0bc0e0e7460c693a9dc12849c365a556442b523aad8\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792264284,\"headline\":\"Microsoft (MSFT) Is Facing Fresh Regulatory Pressure\",\"id\":142963203,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft (NasdaqGS:MSFT) agreed a 1,100 MW, 20 year power supply deal with NiSource to serve its expanding AI data centers. The UK Competition and Markets Authority is preparing to label parts of Microsoft's business software as having strategic market status. Microsoft, Apple and Palantir are preparing for potential new US Congressional oversight and hearings on their partnerships and operations. Beyond the NiSource power agreement, UK market status review and potential hearings, Microsoft...\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2b566dbbc0522f8a0edae255100bcfa6d0fbc745f623c43c289e3eb8a1c74d25\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792251027,\"headline\":\"Riot Platforms, IREN, and MARA Drop Further as Bitcoin Miners Wrestle With the AI Headwinds\",\"id\":142987110,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/IREN.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Top Bitcoin mining companies pivoting to the AI industry are facing substantial challenges as investors warn about the AI bubble.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=469c2bcbc7124246588ad6174c8dcf1b254f376ed52f38bac567d57d298bd5b1\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792249200,\"headline\":\"Apple, Nvidia each gave $25M to Trump's White House ballroom — but the president's own name is nowhere on the donor list\",\"id\":142961930,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The controversial ballroom faces fresh scrutiny over potential conflicts of interest with big money ballroom donors and how much Trump has personally contributed.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=0101be04f4d3d00f158af9390b8fde359db489ad795d52554e6754356b35fa4b\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792247820,\"headline\":\"UBS resets Microsoft stock price target for investors\",\"id\":142961945,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"The biggest question about Microsoft may not be what investors expect.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=fcf9012d7a22606465f07017e6a04f8ec3f45d0d1dc571ffe242d562be5bb359\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792247760,\"headline\":\"Here's How Microsoft's $175 Billion in Capital Expenditures Is Hurting Its Business\",\"id\":142961936,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft cloud computing business may not be as profitable as its other segments.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=d4d83602fd58cd6a1fe8f8cc93aa5c2b25ec00d9348ffbe67cb17b8903d01078\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792240221,\"headline\":\"Nebius Stock Falls After Key Gartner Warning as Short Interest Nears 20%\",\"id\":142987118,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Konskie--Poland---May-03--2025-Nebius-Gr.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"Nebius Group extended its steep sell-off as investors dumped neocloud stocks amid ongoing jitters in the artificial intelligence industry.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=962b1fb2eb09bc2a10ec30640faa64f4de052377e1810be8dd8ae416714fdc55\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792237451,\"headline\":\"BofA Warns AI Investors Could Lose Even If the Technology Works\",\"id\":142959982,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Bank of America just invoked the ghost of the 1990s fiber optic collapse to explain why AI's biggest winners could still leave investors with nothing, even if the technology reshapes the world exactly as promised.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a4b2445fe3477280ba24144fe07b88715c87dc437e74e18d377a33b9c0cd50d6\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792219587,\"headline\":\"AI Stocks Are The Next Dividend Growers\",\"id\":142959766,\"image\":\"\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5722824035d1917292ff4d4e40f7308d3a403a43dc80ec4cb139fb94982c7c30\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792213774,\"headline\":\"What would superintelligence look and feel like?\",\"id\":142958772,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Investing.com -- Superintelligent AI could outperform human experts across virtually every cognitive task by 2030, potentially transforming business competition and the global economy, according to Deutsche Bank Research.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=e9b36ad7b535c38963db1ffb3ab69538562babd642d313766cbe2ccfb3b252fc\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792206600,\"headline\":\"GAMR Video Game ETF Momentum Continues Into Q4\",\"id\":142959020,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2186585249/image_2186585249.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"The VettaFi Video Game Leaders Index gained nearly 1% in early October (through October 14), following a 10.7% return in Q3 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=5bf14f22f7439c0096d4cf9d989b75e465c8148c4175d6d47c398090318ebbde\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792205436,\"headline\":\"Why You Should Think About Palantir Differently Now\",\"id\":142957833,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Palantir Technologies (PLTR) stock trades at 78.2 times sales, compared to 3.1 for the S\\u0026P 500. Investors paying that premium need to know exactly what they are buying, and the case Palantir makes has evolved. During the fiscal Q3 2024 earnings call, executives highlighted the fast-growing number of U.S. businesses signing on as customers. By the latest call in fiscal Q2 2026, the focus had shifted. So what does management talk up now.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=8955bf2fa5497edc3de33641e5dbc142262fc3cc80628d15432815560870baa4\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792205205,\"headline\":\"Elon Musk’s Roadster, Nvidia’s Space AI Push, Nadella’s Security Warning: Mag 7 Voices This Week\",\"id\":142957830,\"image\":\"https://s.yimg.com/rz/stage/p/yahoo_finance_en-US_h_p_finance_2.png\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Yahoo\",\"summary\":\"Elon Musk said Tesla’s long-awaited Roadster will enter production in 2028, though he has acknowledged that the car is unlikely to materially affect the company’s revenue.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=a6168d913bbf8963671ca3b4041506abaf86c19aad935a92b69cdcc5e92c9e2e\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792201800,\"headline\":\"ClearBridge Large Cap Growth ESG Strategy Q3 2026 Portfolio Update\",\"id\":142958805,\"image\":\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2228443483/image_2228443483.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"SeekingAlpha\",\"summary\":\"Microsoft, a holding in several ClearBridge portfolios, offers a good example of how hyperscalers are responding. Read more here.\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=4263c4d4f9a2b1ba91f9c7a8164e61cee7c7a448eafee5c99b9dee3175b7bcec\"},{\"category\":\"company\",\"datetime\":1792199406,\"headline\":\"UK Watchdog Proposes Strategic Market Tag for Microsoft, Puts Excel and Copilot AI Under Competition Scrutiny\",\"id\":142960644,\"image\":\"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/10/17/Madrid--Spain-05-15-2025-Close-up-Of-Lap.jpg?width=2048\\u0026height=1536\",\"related\":\"MSFT\",\"source\":\"Benzinga\",\"summary\":\"The U.K.\\u0026#39;s competition regulator has proposed designating Microsoft as having a Strategic Market Status (SMS).\",\"url\":\"https://finnhub.io/api/news?id=2db6e325d956f17f2ea32e7621fce9621ab539e987f5dfdcb065e87bb93b602a\"}]"
     },
