s\",\"datetime\":1792173050,\"headline\":\"NBA tightens betting rules, develops AI to flag suspicious wagers\",\"id\":8630413,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/108420547-1792169925516-gettyimages-2269662093-2026_nba_0331_pistonsvsraptors_05.jpeg?v=1792169966\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"The NBA is tightening restrictions on bets and deploying AI to help identify suspicious wagering, according to two documents obtained by CNBC.\",\"url\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/16/nba-tightens-betting-rules-develops-ai-to-flag-suspicious-wagers.html\"},{\"category\":\"business\",\"datetime\":1792170170,\"headline\":\"Here's who Netflix just brought in to run content — and what it means for the streamer\",\"id\":8630204,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/107073528-1654800231246-rice.jpg?v=1711475524\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Peter Rice brings a wealth of experience in TV and film, including scripted and unscripted shows, live sports, prestige television and theatrical distribution.\",\"url\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/16/netflix-peter-rice-chief-content-officer.html\"},{\"category\":\"top news\",\"datetime\":1792167674,\"headline\":\"Schwab to create 'tax-aware' strategy that's been attracting billions from wealthy investors\",\"id\":8630203,\"image\":\"https://image.cnbcfm.com/api/v1/image/106161310-1570051395592charles.jpg?v=1571084910\\u0026w=1920\\u0026h=1080\",\"related\":\"\",\"source\":\"CNBC\",\"summary\":\"Wealthy investors are flocking to tax-aware long short strategies, adding billions into these super-powered versions of tax-loss harvesting accounts.\",\"url\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/16/tax-strategies-capital-gains-wealthy-investors-schwab.html\"},{\"category\":\"top news\",\"datetime\":1792166789,\"headline\":\"What we want to see when Capital One and Meta report earnings next week\",\"id\":8629990,\"image\":\"https://imag